{"uuid":"b43f70eb-cce8-4e60-8ad6-34dbc95747eb","identifier":"11146003","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["nec","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"NEC MultiSync EA273WM"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The 27\u201d NEC MultiSync EA273WM is a widescreen model for high-performance enterprise users that require advanced technologies and full feature sets. LED backlight technology, which not only reduces power by up to 52% compared to select previous generation EA Series models, leads to a 30% thinner and 25% lighter redesigned chassis. This model also boasts a height-adjustable stand (130mm) and full connectivity with DisplayPort, HDMI, DVI-D and VGA inputs. The EA273WM includes touch-sensitive On Screen Display (OSD\u00ae) controls, streamlined cable management and ControlSync\u2122 technology, which allows users to control up to six units in a multi-monitor configuration.\\n\\n- LED backlight technology provides for industry-leading low power consumption and less hazardous materials.\\n- Fully adjustable quick-release stand, including height-adjust (130mm), pivot, tilt and swivel capabilities, adds flexibility and comfort to your viewing preferences.\\n- Full connectivity, including DisplayPort, HDMI, DVI-D and VGA inputs.\\n- Touch-sensitive OSD\u00ae controls are integrated into the bezel, making display adjustments easier than ever.\\n- Human and ambient light sensors automatically detect your work conditions to determine the proper display brightness, thereby conserving power.\\n- ECO Mode\u2122 allows for up to 56% more power conservation (vs. typical power settings), reducing your energy costs.\\n- ENERGY STAR 5.0 and TCO 5.1.\\n- EPEAT Gold compliance."}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":27,"unit":"INCH"}}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"40a9d6f0-88a3-4f85-8a23-427c7124d0a7","identifier":"11146453","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark Pro715"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Lexmark Pro715. Print technology: Inkjet, Printing: Colour, Copying: Colour. Print resolution (colour, normal quality): 4800 x 1200, Print resolution (black, normal quality): 2400 x 1200. Copier resize: 25 - 400. Optical scanning resolution: 1200 x 1200, Scan type: Flatbed & ADF, Scan technology: CIS. ISO A-series sizes (A0...A9): A4, A5, A6, Maximum print size: Legal (216 x 356 mm), ISO B-series sizes (B0...B9): B5"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Impression \u00e0 moindre co\u00fbt<\/b>\\nImpression \u00e9conomique : faible co\u00fbt de l'encre noire\u00b9 et cartouches couleur \u00e0 un prix attractif.\\n\\n<b>Productivit\u00e9 et efficacit\u00e9<\/b>\\nAm\u00e9liorez l'efficacit\u00e9 et la productivit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au chargeur automatique de documents de 50 pages et aux touches de raccourcis incluant notamment les fonctions de Num\u00e9risation vers le r\u00e9seau, Num\u00e9risation vers e-mail et Num\u00e9risation au format PDF.\\n\\n<b>Fonctionnalit\u00e9s \u00e9co-responsables<\/b>\\nR\u00e9duisez votre consommation de papier jusqu'\u00e0 50% gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction recto-verso.\\n\\n<b>Impression \u00e0 partir d'un r\u00e9seau, d'un smartphone ou d'une tablette<\/b>\\nImprimez d'o\u00f9 vous voulez gr\u00e2ce au r\u00e9seau Ethernet ou Wi-Fi n.\u00b2 Vous pouvez \u00e9galement imprimer \u00e0 partir de votre terminal Android ou Apple par le biais de votre r\u00e9seau Wi-Fi.\\n\\n<b>Prise en charge de multiples supports<\/b>\\nChargez facilement diff\u00e9rents types de papier gr\u00e2ce au tiroir de 550 feuilles en option qui porte la capacit\u00e9 de papier ordinaire jusqu'\u00e0 700 feuilles."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"96b88cd3-72bf-4625-a9a8-dc1c4928170d","identifier":"11146454","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark Pro915"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Print. Copy. Scan. Fax. Web<\/b>\\n\\nThe Lexmark Pro915, with its intuitive design and optional second tray, offers the flexibility you need to be efficient and productive in one easy-to use package."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Impression \u00e0 moindre co\u00fbt<\/b>\\nImpression \u00e9conomique : faible co\u00fbt de l'encre noire\u00b9 et cartouches couleur \u00e0 un prix attractif.\\n\\n<b>Navigation conviviale<\/b>\\nL'\u00e9cran tactile couleur intuitif de 10,9 cm offre une interface conviviale qui vous signale en temps voulu ce dont vous avez besoin.\\n\\n<b>Productivit\u00e9 et efficacit\u00e9<\/b>\\nAm\u00e9liorez l'efficacit\u00e9 et la productivit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au chargeur automatique de documents de 50 pages et \u00e0 des applications faciles \u00e0 t\u00e9l\u00e9charger incluant notamment la Num\u00e9risation vers le r\u00e9seau, la Num\u00e9risation vers e-mail et la Num\u00e9risation au format PDF.\\n\\n<b>Impression \u00e0 partir d'un r\u00e9seau, d'un smartphone ou d'une tablette<\/b>\\nImprimez d'o\u00f9 vous voulez gr\u00e2ce au r\u00e9seau Ethernet ou Wi-Fi n.\u00b2 Vous pouvez \u00e9galement imprimer \u00e0 partir de votre terminal Android ou Apple par le biais de votre r\u00e9seau Wi-Fi.\\n\\n<b>Prise en charge de supports multiples<\/b>\\nChargez facilement diff\u00e9rents types de papier gr\u00e2ce au tiroir de 550 feuilles en option qui porte la capacit\u00e9 de papier ordinaire jusqu'\u00e0 700 feuilles."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a557fc95-cf10-46d2-acfc-c71995e25915","identifier":"11164822","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"9\/9\/f\/5\/99f52e45c4b402f6b74ffbb8e05fef21e90eac5b_11164822_Philips.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/9\/9\/f\/5\/99f52e45c4b402f6b74ffbb8e05fef21e90eac5b_11164822_Philips.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips AD7000W"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Eleganz und erstklassige Audio-Qualit\u00e4t, kabellos dank AirPlay<\/b>\\nBegeistert von Sound\\n\\nDieser kabellose Philips Fidelio-Lautsprecher erm\u00f6glicht es Ihnen, Titel direkt von Ihrem iPod\/iPhone\/iPad und \u00fcber iTunes auf Ihrem Computer abzuspielen, und das ganze kabellos dank AirPlay. Dieser elegante und kompakte Lautsprecher erf\u00fcllt Ihr Zuhause mit gro\u00dfartiger Musik ganz ohne Kabelgewirr.\\n\\nKristallklarer Klang\\n- SoundAvia f\u00fcr eine ausgewogene Klangleistung\\n- 10 W RMS Gesamtausgangsleistung\\n\\nElegant und kompakt\\n- Kompaktes Design mit minimalem Platzbedarf f\u00fcr jeden Lebensstil\\n\\nNoch vielseitiger\\n- Musik\u00fcbertragung mit kabelloser AirPlay-Technologie\\n- Gleichzeitiges Wiedergeben und Aufladen Ihres iPods\/iPhones\/iPads\\n- AUX-Eingang f\u00fcr einfaches Anschlie\u00dfen an nahezu jedes elektronische Ger\u00e4t\\n- Entdecken Sie Musik und weitere Funktionen, und teilen Sie diese \u00fcber die kostenlose Fidelio\\nApp"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Elegance and superb audio, wirelessly with AirPlay<\/b>\\nObsessed with sound\\n\\nThis Philips Fidelio wireless speaker gives you the freedom to play songs directly from\\nyour iPod\/iPhone\/iPad, and from your computer\u2019s iTunes - wirelessly via AirPlay. Elegant\\nand compact, it fills your home with great music, not clutter.\\n\\n<b>Crystal clear sound<\/b>\\n- SoundAvia for well-balanced sound performance\\n- 10 W RMS total output power\\n\\n<b>Elegant and compact<\/b>\\n- Compact design for any space, any lifestyle\\n\\n<b>Advanced versatility<\/b>\\n- Stream music with AirPlay wireless technology\\n- Play and charge your iPod\/iPhone\/iPad simultaneously\\n- AUX-in for easy connection to almost any electronic device\\n- Discover, share music and more features via free Fidelio app"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>\u00c9l\u00e9gance et qualit\u00e9 audio exceptionnelle, sans fil avec AirPlay<\/b>\\nL'obsession du son\\n\\nCette enceinte sans fil Philips Fidelio vous laisse la libert\u00e9 d'\u00e9couter des morceaux directement \u00e0 partir de votre iPod\/iPhone\/iPad ou depuis iTunes sur votre ordinateur, tout cela sans fil gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 AirPlay. \u00c9l\u00e9gante et compacte, elle emplit votre maison d'un son haute qualit\u00e9, sans l'encombrer inutilement.\\n\\nSon limpide\\n- SoundAvia pour des performances sonores \u00e9quilibr\u00e9es\\n- Puissance de sortie totale de 10 W RMS\\n\\n\u00c9l\u00e9gante et compacte\\n- Design compact pour tous les int\u00e9rieurs et tous les modes de vie\\n\\nPolyvalence accrue\\n- Technologie de diffusion de la musique sans fil AirPlay\\n- \u00c9coutez et chargez simultan\u00e9ment votre iPod\/iPhone\/iPad\\n- Entr\u00e9e AUX, pour une connexion facile \u00e0 la plupart des p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques \u00e9lectroniques\\n- D\u00e9couvrez et partagez de la musique et bien plus via l'appli Fidelio gratuite"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-09T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ee1c2339-259d-48a9-bff0-7ef1c4107046","identifier":"11179791","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot S100"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sleek and Serious.<\/b>\\nThe PowerShot S100 is a sophisticated pocket-friendly point-and-shoot digital camera that has the power advanced users and enthusiasts need to create standout images. As with other PowerShot cameras, the compact PowerShot S100 incorporates all of the advanced Canon technologies that make capturing superb photos and video as easy as pressing a button. Yet, when it's time to get creative, the very same camera in the hands of a skilled photographer can produce stunning images that would be at home in a gallery. As automatic or manual as you need it to be, the PowerShot S100 is, at once, a pocket camera and a serious photographic tool, impressing even demanding pros. It incorporates the Canon HS SYSTEM, now featuring the new DIGIC 5 Image Processor for enhanced image quality and amazing low-light performance. The fast f\/2.0 lens helps you tackle unfavorable lighting and capture breathtaking portraits with beautiful, shallow depth-of-field. 12.1 Megapixels ensure crisp, richly detailed images, and a 5x Optical Zoom provides an excellent all-around range to shoot near or far."}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7c8f3e7f-210c-476d-8c62-5804e5b4ee11","identifier":"11180066","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_letter_216_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet Enterprise 500 color M551xh"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der benutzerfreundliche und einfach zu verwaltende HP LaserJet erm\u00f6glicht den kosteng\u00fcnstigen Farbdruck. Erstellen Sie professionelle Marketingmaterialien in qualitativ hochwertigen Farben und vieles mehr. Optimieren Sie Ihre Investitionen mit Erweiterungsoptionen. HP ist der richtige Ansprechpartner in puncto energiesparender Funktionen.\\n\\n<b>Merkmale<\/b>\\n\\n<b>ENERGY STAR\u00ae-zertifiziert<\/b>\\n- Sparen Sie Energie \u2013 Die HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off-Technologie schaltet Ihren Drucker nach Bedarf ein oder aus.\\n- Niedrigerer Energieverbrauch dank Instant-on-Technologie.\\n- Kostenloses, bequemes Recycling von Druckkassetten in 53 L\u00e4ndern.\\n\\n<b>Mit qualitativ hochwertigen Farben erreichen Sie eine optimale Darstellung.<\/b>\\n- Mit HP Easy Color und PANTONE\u00ae-Farben lassen sich Marketingmaterialien mit naturgetreuen Farben und gestochen scharfen Details erstellen.\\n- Mit HP ImageREt 3600 und der HP ColorSphere-Tonertechnologie erh\u00f6hen Sie die Farbtreue.\\n- Mit einem vollst\u00e4ndigen Druckkassetten-Satz erzielen Sie sofort hochwertige Druckergebnisse zum kleinen Preis. Im Durchschnitt erhalten Sie im Vergleich zu f\u00fchrenden Mitbewerbern die nahezu doppelte Menge an schwarzem Toner und die mehr als doppelte Menge an farbigem Toner.\\n- Mit einer optionalen Druckkassette mit hoher Kapazit\u00e4t l\u00e4sst sich schwarzer Text kosteng\u00fcnstig drucken.\\n\\n<b>Investieren Sie in einen Drucker, der nicht nur benutzerfreundlich ist, sondern sich auch einfach verwalten l\u00e4sst.<\/b>\\n- \u00dcber das vierzeilige Farbdisplay lassen sich Druckauftr\u00e4ge direkt verwalten und \u00fcber ein USB-Flashlaufwerk problemlos ausdrucken.\\n- Mit HP ePrint wird das Drucken so mobil wie Sie es sind \u2013 von nun an k\u00f6nnen Sie von praktisch \u00fcberall aus drucken.\\n- Sch\u00fctzen Sie vertrauliche Daten mit einem PIN zum Abrufen von Druckauftr\u00e4gen, und sch\u00fctzen Sie Ihre Daten mit der HP sicheren Hochleistungsfestplatte.\\n- Mit HP Color Access Control l\u00e4sst sich der Farbverbrauch m\u00fchelos \u00fcberwachen. Die branchenf\u00fchrende HP Web Jetadmin Software sorgt f\u00fcr die proaktive Verwaltung von Druckumgebungen.\\n\\n<b>Profitieren Sie von innovativen Erweiterungsoptionen.<\/b>\\n- Druckerfunktionen lassen sich mit der HP FutureSmart-Firmware problemlos aktualisieren, verwalten und erweitern.\\n- Nutzen Sie das HP Solutions Business Partners-Programm, das Ihnen den Zugriff auf HP zertifizierte L\u00f6sungen branchenf\u00fchrender Partner erm\u00f6glicht.\\n- Optionale Produktivit\u00e4ts- und Sicherheitsl\u00f6sungen lassen sich mit dem Hardware Integration Pocket integrieren.\\n- Noch mehr Produktivit\u00e4t: dieser bew\u00e4hrte Allround-Farblaserdrucker bietet Platz f\u00fcr bis zu 1.100 Blatt Papier \u2013 das spart Zeit und gro\u00dfe Druckauftr\u00e4ge werden ohne Nachlegen ausgef\u00fchrt.\\n\\n<b>Erhebliche Energie- und Papiereinsparungen.<\/b>\\n- Verringern Sie den Energieverbrauch um 19 bis 66 %, indem Sie in den Auto-On\/Auto-Off-Modus wechseln9. Sparen Sie noch mehr Energie mit der Instant-on-Technologie10, die Aufw\u00e4rm- und Abk\u00fchlzeiten verk\u00fcrzt.\\n- Mit der HP EcoSMART-Produktpalette k\u00f6nnen Sie Daten sammeln, Einstellungen \u00fcberpr\u00fcfen und aussagekr\u00e4ftige Berichte erstellen.\\n- Sparen Sie Zeit mit der praktischen Installation von Druckkassetten und profitieren Sie von kostenfreiem und einfachem Recycling von Druckkassetten.\\n- Dank automatischem beidseitigen Druck schonen Sie die Umwelt und sparen bis zu 50 % Papier."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Affordable, business-enhancing colour from an HP LaserJet that's easy to manage and use. Produce professional-quality colour marketing materials and more. Maximise your investment with expandability options. Count on HP for energy-saving features.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n<b>ENERGY STAR\u00ae qualified<\/b>\\n- Save energy \u2013 HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technology turns your printer on when you need it and off when you don\u2019t.\\n- Reduce energy use with Instant-on Technology.\\n- Free, convenient cartridge recycling in 53 countries.\\n\\n<b>Make your business look its best with high-performance colour.<\/b>\\n- Create marketing materials with realistic colour and crisp detail thanks to HP Easy Color.\\n- Increase colour accuracy with HP ImageREt 3600 and HP ColorSphere toner technology.\\n- Achieve low-cost, high-quality printing right out of the box, with a complete set of cartridges \u2013 on average, nearly two times more black toner and more than two times the colour toner of leading competitors.\\n- Print black text affordably, using an optional high-capacity black print cartridge.\\n\\n<b>Invest in a printer that's as easy to use as it is to manage.<\/b>\\n- Manage jobs directly from the printer\u2019s four-line colour control panel, and easily print from a USB flash drive.\\n- Make printing as mobile as you are with HP ePrint \u2013 now you can print from virtually anywhere.\\n- Keep confidential information secure by requiring a PIN to retrieve print jobs and protect data with the HP High-Performance Secure Hard Disk.\\n- Easily control colour usage with HP Color Access Control, and proactively manage printing environments with industry-leading HP Web Jetadmin.\\n\\n<b>Take advantage of inventive expandability options.<\/b>\\n- Easily update, manage and extend printer capabilities, using HP FutureSmart Firmware.\\n- Take advantage of the HP Solutions Business Partners programme, enabling you to access HP certified solutions from industry-leading partners.\\n- Incorporate optional productivity and security solutions easily, using the hardware integration pocket.\\n- Improve productivity: this workhorse colour laser printer gives you up to 1,100-sheet capacity to save time and complete large print jobs without reloading.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy outstanding energy and paper savings.<\/b>\\n- Reduce energy use by 19% to 66% by setting the Auto-On\/Auto-Off mode. Save even more energy with Instant-on Technology which speeds warm-up and cool-down times.\\n- Collect data, control settings and create useful reports using HP EcoSMART Fleet.\\n- Save time with convenient cartridge installation, and get free, easy cartridge recycling.\\n- Conserve resources and get up to 50% paper-savings using automatic two-sided printing."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Couleur abordable, un plus pour l'entreprise, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une imprimante HP LaserJet simple \u00e0 g\u00e9rer et \u00e0 utiliser. Production de supports marketing couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle, et bien plus encore. Optimisation de l'investissement gr\u00e2ce aux options d'extensibilit\u00e9. Fonctions d'\u00e9conomie d'\u00e9nergie HP.\\n\\n<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Certifi\u00e9 ENERGY STAR\u00ae<\/b>\\n- \u00c9conomies d'\u00e9nergie - La technologie HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off met l'imprimante sous tension lorsque vous en avez besoin et l'\u00e9teint lorsque vous n'en avez plus besoin.\\n- R\u00e9duisez votre consommation d'\u00e9nergie gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie Instant-on.\\n- Recyclage de cartouches gratuit et pratique dans 53 pays.\\n\\n<b>Optimisez la vitrine de votre entreprise gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la couleur hautes performances.<\/b>\\n- Cr\u00e9ation de supports marketing aux couleurs r\u00e9alistes et aux d\u00e9tails nets gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 HP Easy Color et aux couleurs PANTONE\u00ae.\\n- Meilleure pr\u00e9cision des couleurs avec HP ImageREt 3600 et la technologie de toner HP ColorSphere.\\n- Impression \u00e9conomique et de grande qualit\u00e9 pr\u00eate \u00e0 l'emploi, avec un ensemble complet de cartouches (en moyenne pr\u00e8s de deux fois plus toner noir et plus de deux fois plus de toner couleur par rapport \u00e0 la concurrence.\\n- Impression en noir abordable \u00e0 l'aide d'une cartouche d'impression noire haute capacit\u00e9 en option.\\n\\n<b>Investissement dans une imprimante aussi facile \u00e0 utiliser qu'\u00e0 g\u00e9rer.<\/b>\\n- Gestion des travaux directement \u00e0 partir du panneau de commande couleur quatre lignes de l'imprimante et impression facile \u00e0 partir d'un lecteur flash USB.\\n- D\u00e9couvrez la libert\u00e9 de l'impression mobile HP ePrint et imprimez de presque n'importe o\u00f9.\\n- S\u00e9curisation des informations confidentielles gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un code PIN pour r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer les travaux d'impression et protection des donn\u00e9es gr\u00e2ce au disque dur HP s\u00e9curis\u00e9 hautes performances.\\n- Simplicit\u00e9 de contr\u00f4le de l'usage de la couleur gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 HP Color Access Control et gestion proactive des environnements d'impression avec HP Web Jetadmin, leader du march\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Options d'extensibilit\u00e9 innovantes.<\/b>\\n- Simplicit\u00e9 de mise \u00e0 jour, de gestion et d'extension des capacit\u00e9s de l'imprimante gr\u00e2ce au micrologiciel HP FutureSmart.\\n- Profitez du programme HP Solutions Business Partners et d'un acc\u00e8s \u00e0 des solutions HP certifi\u00e9es de partenaires en t\u00eate du march\u00e9.\\n- Simplicit\u00e9 d'incorporation de solutions de productivit\u00e9 et de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 (en option) gr\u00e2ce au logement d'int\u00e9gration mat\u00e9rielle.\\n- Am\u00e9lioration de la productivit\u00e9 : cette imprimante laser couleur performante offre une capacit\u00e9 allant jusqu'\u00e0 1 100 feuilles et permet d'\u00e9conomiser du temps et d'ex\u00e9cuter des t\u00e2ches d'impression volumineuses sans rechargement.\\n\\n<b>\u00c9conomies exceptionnelles d'\u00e9nergie et de papier.<\/b>\\n- R\u00e9duction de la consommation d'\u00e9nergie de 19 % \u00e0 66 % gr\u00e2ce au mode Auto-On\/Auto-Off. \u00c9conomisez encore plus d'\u00e9nergie gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie Instant-on qui acc\u00e9l\u00e8re le pr\u00e9chauffage et le refroidissement.\\n- Collecte de donn\u00e9es, contr\u00f4le des param\u00e8tres et cr\u00e9ation de rapports gr\u00e2ce au parc HP EcoSMART.\\n- Gain de temps gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'installation pratique des cartouches et \u00e0 leur recyclage simple et gratuit.\\n- Pr\u00e9servation des ressources et jusqu'\u00e0 50 % d'\u00e9conomies de papier gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression recto verso automatique."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-11T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e67e3257-d2ba-405b-8277-6a223d578d41","identifier":"11180816","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_letter_216_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet Enterprise 600 M603n"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Der schnellste HP Laserdrucker f\u00fcr Arbeitsgruppen bew\u00e4ltigt problemlos Druckauftr\u00e4ge mit hohen Volumen.  Verwalten Sie Druckrichtlinien, um Kosten zu senken und von erstklassiger Erweiterbarkeit zu profitieren. Verbessern Sie die Sicherheit, und passen Sie sich schnell an Ver\u00e4nderungen in der verwalteten Druckumgebung an.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Sie erhalten Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit und bahnbrechende Geschwindigkeit auch unter starker Belastung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Steigern Sie Ihre Produktivit\u00e4t mit hohen Druckgeschwindigkeiten von bis zu 60 S.\/Min.<SUP>1<\/SUP> und dem schnellen Drucken aus dem Ruhemodus, dank Instant-on Technologie<SUP>2<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Herausragende Einsparungen beim Energie- und Papierverbrauch.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Steuern Sie den Energieverbrauch mit Funktionen f\u00fcr mehr Umweltschutz.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Sicheres Drucken mit minimalen Eingriffen.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Sch\u00fctzen Sie die vertraulichen Daten auf Ihrem Drucker mit der HP Hochleistungs-Sicherheitsfestplatte<SUP>3<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Optimierte Druckm\u00f6glichkeiten, um mit dem wachsenden Unternehmen Schritt zu halten.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;M\u00fcheloses Aktualisieren, Verwalten und Erweitern der Funktionen der Netzwerkdrucker mit HP FutureSmart Firmware.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Gemessen nach ISO\/IEC 24734, ausgenommen der ersten Testdokumente. Weitere Informationen unter www.hp.com\/go\/printerclaims. Die genaue Druckgeschwindigkeit h\u00e4ngt von der Systemkonfiguration, der Software, dem Treiber und der Komplexit\u00e4t des jeweiligen Dokuments ab.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Im Vergleich zu Produkten mit traditionellen Einbrennverfahren.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Die HP Hochleistungs-Sicherheitsfestplatte ist nur mit dem HP LaserJet Enterprise 600 M603xh Drucker standardm\u00e4ssig verf\u00fcgbar.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>HP LaserJet Enterprise 600 M603<\/b>\\nTackle large-volume print jobs with ease, and enable printing policies with top-flight expandability. Improve security and quickly adapt to changes within your managed printing environment with a host of manageability features.\\n\\n<b>Heavy-duty reliability and breakthrough speed.<\/b>\\n- Print at rapid speeds on a variety of paper types.\\n- Manage workflow with intuitive features right on the printer, and get quick prints from a flash drive.\\n- Produce high print volumes with low maintenance.\\n- Replace toner cartridges easily, and enjoy quiet, clean performance.\\n\\n<b>Outstanding energy and paper savings.<\/b>\\n- Cut energy use as much as 45%, compared to a majority of competing laser printers.\\n- Get centralized access to custom energy-saving options and printer settings with the HP EcoSMART Console.\\n- Trim paper use by up to 50% with automatic two-sided printing.\\n- Pre-installed Original HP toner cartridges reduce waste. Recycle them for free through HP Planet Partners.\\n\\n<b>Secure printing with minimal intervention<\/b>\\n- Protect confidential data stored on your printer, with the installed HP High-Performance Secure Hard Disk.\\n- Expand your network without compromising security.\\n- Take control of printing practices and enforce security policies, using HP Access Control.\\n- Control costs, manage IT resources, and reduce environmental impact.\\n\\n<b>Extend capabilities and print from mobile devices.<\/b>\\n- Easily update, manage, and expand the capabilities of networked printers, and do more with your investment.\\n- Make printing as mobile as you are with HP ePrint.\\n- Extend your investment by adding functionality using the hardware integration pocket."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>La plus rapide des imprimantes laser HP pour groupes de travail, g\u00e9rant ais\u00e9ment des travaux \u00e0 grand volume d'impression.  Gestion des politiques d'impression en vue de r\u00e9duire les co\u00fbts, et extensibilit\u00e9 de pointe. S\u00e9curit\u00e9 renforc\u00e9e et adaptation rapide aux changements au sein de votre environnement d'impression g\u00e9r\u00e9.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Obtenez une fiabilit\u00e9 et une vitesse de production r\u00e9volutionnaires.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Boostez votre productivit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des vitesses d'impression rapides allant jusqu'\u00e0 60 ppm<SUP>1<\/SUP>, et imprimez rapidement \u00e0 partir du mode veille gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie Instant-on<SUP>2<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>R\u00e9alisez des \u00e9conomies consid\u00e9rables de papier et d'\u00e9nergie.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Utilisez les fonctions d'\u00e9conomies d'\u00e9nergie.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>D\u00e9couvrez l'impression s\u00e9curis\u00e9e avec une intervention minimale.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Prot\u00e9gez les donn\u00e9es confidentielles stock\u00e9es sur votre imprimante gr\u00e2ce au disque dur s\u00e9curis\u00e9 hautes performances HP<SUP>3<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Etendez vos capacit\u00e9s d'impression pour suivre le rythme de d\u00e9veloppement de votre entreprise.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Mettez \u00e0 jour, g\u00e9rez et d\u00e9veloppez facilement les capacit\u00e9s des imprimantes r\u00e9seau \u00e0 l'aide du micrologiciel HP FutureSmart.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Mesur\u00e9 selon la norme ISO\/IEC 24734, exclut le premier jeu de documents tests. Pour plus d'informations, consultez http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/printerclaims. La vitesse exacte d\u00e9pend de la configuration du syst\u00e8me, de l'application logicielle, du pilote et de la complexit\u00e9 du document.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i>\u00a0En comparaison avec des produits utilisant une technologie d'alimentation classique.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Le disque dur s\u00e9curis\u00e9 hautes performances HP est uniquement disponible sur l'imprimante HP LaserJet Enterprise 600 M603xh.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"24.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a182503b-d6f7-4f91-972e-77ec614644db","identifier":"11180864","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_letter_216_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet TopShot Pro M275"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Der erste HP Color MFP mit TopShot Scanning zum einfachen Scannen, Kopieren und Drucken. HP TopShot Scanning zum Erfassen von Bildern von 3D-Objekten und anschlie\u00dfendes Verwenden von Gesch\u00e4ftsanwendungen f\u00fcr den Direktversand zum Web.<SUP>1<\/SUP> Drucken Sie mit HP ePrint<SUP>2<\/SUP> von praktisch \u00fcberall aus.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Erfassen von Bildern von 3D-Objekten und Scannen allt\u00e4glicher Dokumente.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;HP Scansoftware zum bequemen Erfassen hochwertiger Bilder von 3D-Objekten - ohne aufwendige Einstellungen oder Belichtungskorrekturen und zum einfachenen Entfernen verzerrter Hintergr\u00fcnde.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Innovativer Druck \u00fcber Internetverbindung, um stets in Kontakt zu bleiben.<SUP>1<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;N\u00fctzliche Workflow-Apps f\u00fcr vereinfachte Gesch\u00e4ftsabl\u00e4ufe<SUP>1<\/SUP> \u2013 Scannen von Dokumenten und Bildern direkt auf Online-Speicher-Sites.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Stets hohe Produktivit\u00e4t \u2013 unterwegs und im B\u00fcro.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Drucken Sie mit HP ePrint<SUP>2<\/SUP> von praktisch \u00fcberall aus. Direktes Drucken auf dem HP Drucker mit einem Smartphone, Notebook oder einem anderen mobilen Endger\u00e4t<SUP>2<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erweiterte benutzerfreundliche Funktionen zum schnellen Einrichten und Inbetriebnehmen.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Installieren des MFP in wenigen Minuten \u2013 dank HP Smart Install ist keine CD erforderlich.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Erfordert eine Internetverbindung zum Drucker. Einige Services erfordern ggf. eine Registrierung. Die Verf\u00fcgbarkeit von Apps variiert je nach Land, Sprache und Vereinbarungen. Ausf\u00fchrliche Infos finden Sie unter www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Erfordert eine Internetverbindung zum Drucker. Die Funktion ist bei allen internet- und e-mail-f\u00e4higen Ger\u00e4ten verwendbar. Die Druckdauer kann variieren. Einige HP LaserJets ben\u00f6tigen m\u00f6glicherweise ein Firmware-Upgrade. Eine Liste der unterst\u00fctzten Dokumente und Bildtypen steht Ihnen unter www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter zur Verf\u00fcgung. Wenn Sie Informationen \u00fcber weitere L\u00f6sungen ben\u00f6tigen, besuchen Sie uns unter www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> HP Smart Install funktioniert nur unter Windows\u00ae.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"HP's first color MFP with TopShot Scanning lets you scan, copy, and print with ease. Use HP TopShot Scanning to capture images of 3D objects, then use business apps to send directly to the Web. Print from virtually anywhere with HP ePrint.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\nCapture images of 3D objects and scan everyday documents.\\n- Scan images of 3D objects and post directly to the Web. And easily remove background via HP Scan Software.\\n- Enjoy color multifunction performance with convenient, reliable printing and copying.\\n- Take advantage of one-step operation and easily scan a variety of objects, documents, and images.\\n\\n<b>Stay connected with innovative Web-connected printing.<\/b>\\n- Capture images of 3D objects, then use an app to post directly to the Web.\\n- Stay connected and in touch by scanning business cards directly to address books.\\n- Access the Web directly without a PC and get a wide range of business apps.\\n\\n<b>Stay productive\u2014both on the go and in the office.<\/b>\\n- HP ePrint\u2014now you can print from virtually anywhere.\\n- Stay connected\u2014share on a wireless network, or even print from a mobile device without using a network.\\n- Now with AirPrint\u2122. Simply print wirelessly from your iPad\u2122, iPhone\u00ae, and iPod touch\u00ae.\\n\\n<b>Set up quickly, stay up and running easily.<\/b>\\n- Access, store, and print with the tap of a finger, using the 3.5-in. (8.9 cm) color touchscreen display.\\n- Install in just a few minutes\u2014there's no CD required with HP Smart Install.\\n- Print from anywhere in the office with wireless networking and share resources using built-in Ethernet."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le HP MFP premi\u00e8re couleur avec num\u00e9risation TopShot vous permet de num\u00e9riser, copier et imprimer avec facilit\u00e9. Utilisez la num\u00e9risation HP TopShot pour capturer des images d'objets 3D, puis utilisez des applications commerciales pour envoyer directement sur le Web.7 Imprimez \u00e0 partir de n'importe quel endroit avec HP ePrint.\\n\\n<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Capturez des images d'objets 3D et num\u00e9risez chaque jour des documents.<\/b>\\n- Num\u00e9risez des images d'objets 3D et postez-les directement sur le Web. Et supprimez facilement l'arri\u00e8re-plan via le logiciel de num\u00e9risation HP.\\n- Profitez de la performance \"multifonctions\" couleur avec des impressions et copies pratiques et fiables.\\n- Tirez profit d'une op\u00e9ration unique et num\u00e9risez facilement un grand nombre d'objets, de documents et d'images.\\n\\n<b>Restez connect\u00e9 avec l'impression connect\u00e9e au Web innovante.<\/b>\\n- Utilisez des applications Web pratiques pour num\u00e9riser des documents et des images directement vers des sites de stockage en ligne.\\n- Restez connect\u00e9 et en contact en num\u00e9risant directement des cartes de visite vers des carnets d'adresses.\\n- Acc\u00e9dez au Web directement,, sans PC et disposez d'une large gamme d'applications commerciales.\\n\\n<b>Restez productif - tant en d\u00e9placement qu'au bureau.<\/b>\\n- HP ePrint : vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais imprimer \u00e0 partir de n'importe quel endroit.\\n- Restez connect\u00e9 - partagez sur un r\u00e9seau sans fil,2, voire imprimez \u00e0 partir d'un appareil mobile sans utiliser un r\u00e9seau.\\n- Maintenant avec AirPrint\u2122. Imprimez facilement en mode sans fil \u00e0 partir de votre iPad\u2122, iPhone\u00ae et iPod touch\u00ae.\\n\\n<b>Mise en place rapide, fonctionnement facile.<\/b>\\n- Acc\u00e9dez, stockez et imprimez d'une simple pression du doigt, en utilisant l'\u00e9cran tactile couleur de 8,9 cm.\\n- S'installe en quelques minutes seulement - il n'y a aucun CD requis avec HP Smart Install.\\n- Imprimez o\u00f9 que vous soyez dans votre bureau gr\u00e2ce au r\u00e9seau sans fil. et partagez vos ressources gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'Ethernet int\u00e9gr\u00e9.\\n- Economisez l'\u00e9nergie : la fonction HP Auto-Off \u00e9teint votre imprimante lorsque vous n'en avez pas besoin.\\n- R\u00e9duisez votre consommation d'\u00e9nergie gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie Instant-on.\\n- Recyclage gratuit et pratique des cartouches dans 54 pays."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fa9f55db-11a6-4670-add3-412111e2b531","identifier":"11181190","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["asus","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ASUS VS229H-P"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>178\u00b0 Ultra Wide View Meets Classic Elegant Design<\/b>\\nDelicate touches make a monitor truly great, VS229H Full HD LED monitor, with 50,000,000:1 high contrast ratio and HDMI interface, is optimized for the finest image and color quality. This approach extends to the sturdy stand and slim profile without compromising style in ensuring stability and durability.\\nASUS exclusive QuickFit Virtual Scale instantly boosts design efficiency by providing real-size photo and grid on screen.\\n\\n<b>Superior Image Quality Meets Classic Elegant Design<\/b>\\nDelicate touches make a monitor truly great, VS229H Full HD LED monitor, embedded the wide-viewing-angle IPS panel with 50,000,000:1 high contrast ratio and HDMI interface, is optimized for the finest image and color quality. This approach extends to the sturdy stand and slim profile without compromising style in ensuring stability and durability.\\n\\n<b>True-to-life Pictures Powered by LED<\/b>\\n<b>50,000,000:1 ASUS Smart Contrast Ratio<\/b>\\nDynamically enhances the display\u2019s contrast by adjusting the luminance\\nof the backlight to achieve the darkest black and brightest white \u2013 delivering lifelike images.\\n\\n<b>Full HD with HDMI<\/b>\\nEnter a spectacular world of colors with Full HD 1080p (1920x1080) support and HDMI port.\\n\\n<b>178\u02daUltra Wide Viewing Angle<\/b>\\nVS229H adopts 178\u02da(H) \/ 178\u02da(V) ultra wide viewing angle IPS panel that eliminates color shift on your screen no matter where and how you look at it.\\n\\n<b>Aspect Control function<\/b>\\nAspect Control function allows users to select a preferred display mode among Full and 4:3 for true-to-life gaming or movie watching without any data loss or image distortion.\\n\\n<b>QuickFit Virtual Scale<\/b>\\nThe ASUS-exclusive QuickFit built in the monitor provides real-size photo and grid mode on top of the operating windows on the screen. It can activated via a hotkey on monitor and used as a guide to accurately view and edit photos.\\n\\n<b>Splendid\u2122 Video Intelligence Technology<\/b>\\nThe exclusive Splendid Video Intelligence Technology optimizes video performance and image fidelity by enhancing color, brightness, contrast, and sharpness. 6 preset video modes (Scenery, Theater, Game, Night View, sRGB and Standard) can be selected via a hotkey."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7b0175eb-97f9-4ea4-8a72-f687f547eb56","identifier":"111836","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["fax"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP officejet 4105 printer\/fax\/scanner\/copier"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"dc59df77-b530-4792-993b-684bf124cca9","identifier":"11207645","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["asus","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ASUS VE198S"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>True-to-life Pictures Powered by LED<\/b>\\n\\n<b>10,000,000:1 ASUS Smart Contrast Ratio<\/b>\\n\\nDynamically enhances the display\u2019s contrast by adjusting the luminance of the backlight to achieve the darkest black and brightest white \u2013 delivering lifelike images.\\n\\n<b>Excellent Visual Performance<\/b>\\n- Indulge your visual senses with 1440x900 resolution and 5ms quick response time for work and entertainment.\\n- The best dual-display companion with your widescreen notebook enlarges the visual space for multi-tasking efficiency.\\n- Aspect Control function allows users to select a preferred display mode among Full and 4:3 for true-to-life gaming or movie watching without any data loss or image distortion.\\n\\n<b>Splendid\u2122 Video Intelligence Technology<\/b>\\n\\nThe exclusive Splendid Video Intelligence Technology optimizes video performance and image fidelity by enhancing color, brightness, contrast, and sharpness. 5 preset video modes (Scenery, Theater, Game, Night View, and Standard) can be selected via a hotkey.\\n\\n<b>Stylish and User-friendly Design for Modern Sophistication<\/b>\\n\\n- Glare black frame and smooth base design create a fresh new look of LCD monitors.\\n- Built-in hidden stereo speakers enable audio enjoyment together with true-to-life visual.\\n- Convenient key controls for functional set-up in the multi-language OSD.\\n- Cable manager gets rid of tangling cables and wires.\\n- VESA Wall Mount Standard (100 x 100 mm ).\\n- 25\u00b0 ( forward 5\u00b0, backwards 20\u00b0 )Tilting Angle.\\n- KENSINGTON Security Lock.\\n\\n<b>Complete After-Sale Service<\/b>\\n- 3-year system warranty\\n- 3-year panel warranty\\n- Free pick-up service (in specific countries)"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Des images plus r\u00e9alistes gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie LED<\/b>\\n\\n<b>ASUS Smart Contrast Ratio<\/b>\\n\\nLa technologie ASUS Smart Contrast Ratio (ASCR) porte le rapport de contraste des images \u00e0 un impressionnant niveau de 10 000 000:1. Laissez-vous \u00e9blouir par la qualit\u00e9 des images, plus r\u00e9alistes et pr\u00e9cises, notamment lors de sc\u00e8nes nocturnes.\\n\\n<b>Excellentes performances visuelles<\/b>\\n\\n- Un \u00e9cran 19 pouces \u00e0 r\u00e9solution 1440 x 900 et un temps de r\u00e9ponse de 5ms pour vous offrir des images parfaites, que ce soit pour votre travail ou vos divertissements.\\n- Le compagnon id\u00e9al de votre ordinateur portable pour un double affichage et donc pour un meilleur travail multit\u00e2che.\\n- Fonction Aspect Control permettant de choisir entre un affichage Full HD et un affichage 4:3 pour un rendu visuel sans distorsion de l\u00b4image ni pertes de donn\u00e9es.\\n\\n<b>Technologie Splendid\u2122 Video Intelligence<\/b>\\nLa technologie Splendid\u2122 Video Intelligence optimise les performances vid\u00e9o et la qualit\u00e9 de fid\u00e9lit\u00e9 des images en am\u00e9liorant les niveaux de couleur, de luminosit\u00e9, de contraste et de nettet\u00e9. Elle propose 5 modes pr\u00e9d\u00e9finis (Paysage, Th\u00e9\u00e2tre, Gaming, Nocturne et Standard) qui peuvent \u00eatre lanc\u00e9s directement avec les touches de raccourcis.\\n\\n<b>Un design \u00e9l\u00e9gant, convivial et moderne<\/b>\\n\\n- Couleur noire brillante et nouveau design du support pour une allure innovante.\\n- Haut-parleurs st\u00e9r\u00e9o int\u00e9gr\u00e9s pour une excellente immersion audio.\\n- Acc\u00e8s aux r\u00e9glages OSD multilingue par des touches raccourcis.\\n- Dispositif de gestion des c\u00e2bles et des fils.\\n- Support mural standard VESA (100 mm x 100 mm).\\n- Angle d\u00b4inclinaison de 25\u00b0 (5\u00b0 vers l\u00b4avant, 20\u00b0 vers l\u00b4arri\u00e8re).\\n- C\u00e2ble de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 KENSINGTON.\\n\\n<b>Service apr\u00e8s-vente complet<\/b>\\n- Garantie syst\u00e8me de 3 ans\\n- Garantie de la dalle de 3 ans\\n- Enl\u00e8vement sur site et retour gratuit (en fonction des pays)"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-16T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2af7167d-f045-4e7b-9766-b62533d87eb6","identifier":"11209331","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lenovo","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenovo ThinkVision LT1952p"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"For enterprises that need a green, fully functional display screen, with unparalleled visual quality, the ThinkVision LT1952p is the best choice.Compatible with virtually any hardware platform, the LT1952p offers VGA, DVI-D, and DisplayPort connections. The LT1952p is a breeze to use with exceptional LED performance, swivel, tilt, and lift options, 5 milliseconds response time, and a 1000:1 contrast ratio. The LT1952p delivers high energy cost savings, through compliance with go green certifications. The monitors are mercury-free, contain reduced toxic chemicals."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"45d0cb23-2695-4285-995a-6fd041698d1e","identifier":"11227291","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 241S4LSS"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der Philips LED-Monitor verwendet 25\u00a0% recycelte Materialien. Mit seinem ohne PVC und bromierte Flammschutzmittel hergestellten Geh\u00e4use ist er somit umweltfreundlich und produktiv zugleich."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sustainable productivity<\/b>\\n\\n<b>with energy efficient ergonomic LED display<\/b>\\n\\nThe Philips ergonomic LED display using 25% recycled materials and PVC, BFR free housing is ideal for eco-friendly productivity\\n\\n<b>Sustainable Eco-design<\/b>\\n\\n- 25% recycled material with EPEAT Gold\\n- PVC-BFR free housing\\n- 100% recyclable packaging\\n- Zero mercury content\\n- SmartPower: Up to 50% power saving\\n- 0.1 watt Soft-Off mode\\n\\n<b>Great performance<\/b>\\n\\n- LED technology ensures natural colors\\n- SmartContrast gives enhanced rich black details\\n- TrueVision ensures lab quality images\\n\\n<b>Easy to experience<\/b>\\n\\n- Modern Touch controls\\n- SmartImage presets for easy optimized image settings\\n- SmartControl for easy performance tuning"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Utilisant 25\u00a0% de mat\u00e9riaux recycl\u00e9s et ne contenant ni PVC ni BFR, cet \u00e9cran LED Philips est la solution id\u00e9ale pour combiner productivit\u00e9 et respect de l'environnement"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"db1b765b-efaa-46eb-a8a8-3ec636e6abe6","identifier":"11227627","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox Phaser 7800V_GX"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Phaser 7800 Dank den unschlagbaren hochmodernen Technologien des Phaser 7800 Farbdruckers kann jetzt jedes Unternehmen, das hochaufl\u00f6sende Dokumente in gro\u00dfer Anzahl erzeugt \u2013 zum Beispiel Werbeagenturen, Grafikdesign-Shops, Marketing- und Kommunikationsunternehmen, Fotostudios, Benutzer von medizinischen Bildgebungsanwendungen und viele andere \u2013 mehr gesch\u00e4ftskritische Druckauftr\u00e4ge intern erledigen.  Mit seiner gelungenen Kombination aus konstant \u00fcberragender Bildqualit\u00e4t und professionellen Farbabgleichtechnologien ist er der einzige A3-Farbdrucker, der kreativen Profis die Freiheit gibt, mehr Kundenmaterialien im eigenen Haus zu erzeugen.  Die Fakten auf einen Blick  <ul> <li>Farbe: bis zu 45 Seiten\/Min. in DIN A4<\/li> <li>Schwarzwei\u00df: bis zu 45 Seiten\/Min. in DIN A4<\/li> <li>Echte 1.200 x 2.400 dpi Aufl\u00f6sung<\/li> <li>Ausgabe der ersten Seite \u2013 Farbe und Schwarzwei\u00df \u2013 in nur 9 Sekunden<\/li> <li>Maximales Papierformat: 330 x 450 mm\/SRA3<\/li> <li>Automatischer Duplexdruck als Standard<\/li> <li>Au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnlich flexible Druckmaterialverarbeitung<\/li> <li>Gro\u00dfe Auswahl an Endverarbeitungsoptionen<\/li> <li>Maximales technisches Druckvolumen bis zu 225.000 Seiten pro Monat<\/li> <li>Mindestabmessungen (B x T x H): 641 x 699 x 578 mm<\/li> <li>Elektrische Anschlusswerte: 230 V, 50\/60 Hz<\/li> <li>Lieferumfang<\/li> Farbe Tonerkartuschen (Kapazit\u00e4t: Je 6.000 Seiten<sup>1<\/sup>)<\/li> Schwarze Tonerkartusche (Kapazit\u00e4t: 24.000 Seiten<sup>1<\/sup>)<\/li> Bildtrommel (Kapazit\u00e4t: 145.000 Seiten<sup>2<\/sup>)<\/li> Netzkabel<\/li> Software und Dokumentation<\/li> <\/ul>  Erweiterte Farbdruckfunktionalit\u00e4t  <ul> <li>Echte 1.200 x 2.400 dpi sorgen zuverl\u00e4ssig f\u00fcr \u00e4u\u00dferst realistische Bilder, Fotos und Grafiken sowie f\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Texte und Linien<\/li> <li>PANTONE\u00ae-zertifizierte Farbfl\u00e4chensimulationen und Xerox-Farbkorrekturtechnologie stellen sicher, dass die Druckausgabe Ihre Erwartungen erf\u00fcllt, und echtes Adobe\u00ae PostScript\u00ae 3\u2122 gew\u00e4hrleistet zuverl\u00e4ssige Pr\u00e4zision<\/li> <li>PhaserMatch\u00ae 5.0 Software f\u00fcr Farbverwaltung und Kalibrierung, einschlie\u00dflich PhaserMeter Farbmessger\u00e4t von X-Rite, erlaubt eine professionelle Farbsteuerung und sorgt zuverl\u00e4ssig f\u00fcr einheitliche, ger\u00e4teunabh\u00e4ngige Farbpr\u00e4zision.<\/li> <li>Fortschrittliche Trapping-Technologie sorgt f\u00fcr pr\u00e4zise R\u00e4nder und verhindert L\u00fccken zwischen angrenzenden Farbfl\u00e4chen. Au\u00dferdem wird Schwarztext auf farbigem Hintergrund und farbiger Text auf schwarzem Hintergrund immer scharf und fehlerfrei ausgegeben.<\/li> <li>Xerox Hi-Q LED Druckkopf sorgt f\u00fcr bessere Punkt-zu-Punkt-Intensit\u00e4t und genaue Farbregisterhaltigkeit<\/li> <\/ul>  Produktivit\u00e4tsmerkmale <ul> <li>\u00dcberragende Geschwindigkeit von 45 Seiten\/Min. in Schwarzwei\u00df und Farbe<\/li> <li>Mehr Leistung durch 1,33-GB-Prozessor, 2 GB Arbeitsspeicher und serienm\u00e4\u00dfige 160-GB-Festplatte<\/li> <li>Maximales technisches Druckvolumen von 225.000 Seiten\/Monat meistert selbst h\u00f6chste Druckaufkommen<\/li> <li>Automatischer Duplexdruck in der Grundausstattung bietet mehr Flexibilit\u00e4t und senkt den Papierverbrauch. Und da der Duplexdruck ebenso schnell ist wie der einseitige Druck, m\u00fcssen keine Kompromisse zugunsten der Effizienz eingegangen werden.<\/li> <li>Optionales Zusatzpaket f\u00fcr schweres Druckmaterial erlaubt das beidseitige Bedrucken von Materialien in Standard- und Benutzerformaten mit einem Gewicht von bis zu 300 g\/m\u00b2<\/li> <li>Endverarbeitungsoptionen bieten Funktionen zum Stapeln und Heften sowie zum Lochen, Falzen und zur Brosch\u00fcrenerstellung<\/li> <\/ul>  Bedienerfreundliche Merkmale  <ul> <li>Der gro\u00dfe 109-mm-Farbtouchscreen bietet gro\u00dfe Symbole und \u00fcbersichtliche Men\u00fcs, mit denen die lokale Bedienung schneller und einfacher ist als je zuvor<\/li> <li>Integrierte Hilfevideos helfen bei der Problembehebung direkt am Bedienfeld<\/li> <li>Integrierter Webserver von CentreWare\u2122 Internet Services erlaubt die Anzeige des Auftragsstatus sowie das Beheben von Problemen \u00fcber den Webbrowser<\/li> <li>Bequemer Zugriff \u00fcber die Vorderseite erm\u00f6glicht die Durchf\u00fchrung von Routineaufgaben, wie das Auff\u00fcllen von Toner und Papier, ohne den Drucker drehen oder verschieben zu m\u00fcssen<\/li> <li>Bidirektionale Kommunikation \u00fcbermittelt Informationen zu Auftragsstatus sowie Toner- und Papierstand an den Arbeitsplatz oder sogar \u00fcber das Internet. Popup-Hinweise informieren umgehend \u00fcber aufgetretene Druckprobleme und entsprechende Ma\u00dfnahmen<\/li> <\/ul>  Merkmale zur Schonung von Ressourcen  <ul> <li>Duplexdruck in Standardausf\u00fchrung reduziert Papierverbrauch<\/li> <li>Innovativer EA-Toner mit niedrigem Schmelzpunkt erm\u00f6glicht im Vergleich zu herk\u00f6mmlichem Toner eine Fixierung bei geringerer Temperatur und erzeugt dabei hochwertigen B\u00fcro-Grafikdruck mit gl\u00e4nzender Oberfl\u00e4che<\/li> <li>Das Hi-Q LED-Drucksystem verbraucht weniger Energie, spart Platz und ist ger\u00e4uscharm.<\/li> <li>W\u00e4rmeeffiziente IH-Fixieranlage verbraucht deutlich weniger Energie im Bereitschaftsmodus und ist in weniger als 15 Sekunden betriebsbereit<\/li> <li>Die innovative Earth Smart-Funktionalit\u00e4t macht es ganz einfach, \u00fcber den Druckertreiber die umweltfreundlichsten Optionen f\u00fcr Druckauftr\u00e4ge auszuw\u00e4hlen<\/li> <\/ul>  <sup>1<\/sup> Durchschnittliche Standardseiten. Angegebener Ertrag gem\u00e4\u00df ISO\/IEC 19798. Ertrag variiert aufgrund von Druckbild, Seitendeckung und Druckmodus. <sup>2<\/sup> Ungef\u00e4hre Anzahl Seiten. Angegebener Ertrag der Trommeln basiert auf einer durchschnittlichen Auftragsgr\u00f6\u00dfe von 3 Seiten im Format A4\/Letter. Angegebener Ertrag des Fixierers basiert auf Seiten von 75 g\/m\u00b2 im Format A4\/Letter. Ergiebigkeit von Trommel und Fixiereinheit variieren je nach Auftragsumfang, Nutzungsmustern sowie Art, Gr\u00f6\u00dfe, Grammatur und Ausrichtung des Materials."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Phaser 7800  Now any business that produces large volumes of high-resolution output, such as advertising agencies, graphic design shops, marketing communications firms, photography studios, medical imaging applications and countless others, can keep more of their business-critical print jobs in-house thanks to the Phaser 7800 colour printer\u2019s unbeatable state-of-the-art technologies.  With the winning combination of consistently superior image quality and professional-level colour-matching technologies, no other A3 paper size colour printer gives creative professionals the freedom to produce more customer-facing collaterals in-house.  Quick Facts  <ul> <li>Colour: up to 45 ppm<\/li> <li>Black: up to 45 ppm<\/li> <li>True 1200 x 2400 dpi resolution<\/li> <li>First-page-out time as fast as 9 seconds for colour and black-and-white<\/li> <li>Maximum paper size: 330 x 450 mm\/SRA3<\/li> <li>Automatic two-sided output standard<\/li> <li>Exceptional media-handling flexibility<\/li> <li>Wide range of finishing options available<\/li> <li>Maximum duty cycle of up to 225,000 pages per month<\/li> <li>Minimum dimensions (w x d x h): 641 x 699 x 578 mm<\/li> <li>Power requirements: 240 V, 50\/60 Hz<\/li> <li>What comes in the box<\/li> Colour toner cartridges (capacity: 6,000 pages each<sup>1<\/sup>)<\/li> Black toner cartridge (capacity: 24,000 pages<sup>1<\/sup>)<\/li> Imaging unit (capacity: 145,000 pages<sup>2<\/sup>)<\/li> Power cord<\/li> Software and documentation<\/li> <\/ul>  Advanced Colour Printing Features  <ul> <li>True 1200 x 2400 dpi consistently produces the most realistic images, photos and graphics, plus the sharpest text and fine-line detail<\/li> <li>PANTONE\u00ae approved solid-colour simulations and Xerox colour correction technology deliver results that always match your expectations, while true Adobe\u00ae PostScript\u00ae 3\u2122 ensures accuracy you can count on<\/li> <li>PhaserMatch\u00ae 5.0 colour management and calibration software, including the PhaserMeter Colour Measurement Device powered by X-Rite, adds a professional level of colour control and helps maintain colour accuracy print after print, and across all output devices.<\/li> <li>Advanced trapping technology ensures clean edges and prevents gaps between adjacent colours. Plus, black text on coloured backgrounds and coloured text on black backgrounds always prints sharp and clear.<\/li> <li>Xerox Hi-Q LED print head provides better dot-to-dot intensity and timing control, and produces more precise colour registration<\/li> <\/ul>  Productivity Features  <ul> <li>Superior performance, with black-and-white and colour output as fast as 45 ppm<\/li> <li>More power, with a 1.33 GB processor, 2 GB of memory and a standard 160 GB hard drive<\/li> <li>The 225,000-page monthly duty cycle supports the heaviest office print volumes<\/li> <li>Automatic two-sided printing comes standard, providing more flexibility and helping reduce paper consumption. Plus, duplexing is just as fast as single-side printing, so there\u2019s no sacrificing efficiency for conservation<\/li> <li>Optional Extra Heavy Duty Media Kit lets you print two-sided output on standard and custom-size media in weights up to 300 gsm<\/li> <li>Finishing options range from stacking and stapling with the flexibility to add separate hole punching, creasing, v-folding and booklet-making capabilities<\/li> <\/ul>  Ease-of-use Features  <ul> <li>The large, 109 mm colour touch screen interface features big, bright icons and intuitive menus that make walk-up operation faster and easier than ever<\/li> <li>Embedded help videos provide quick troubleshooting assistance right on the front panel<\/li> <li>CentreWare\u2122 Internet Services embedded web server lets you view job status and troubleshoot right from your web browser<\/li> <li>Easy, front-side access no rotating or moving the printer to perform routine maintenance like changing toner and adding paper<\/li> <li>Bi-directional communication sends print-job updates, along with toner and paper supply levels, to your desktop or even over the web. Pop-up alerts immediately notify you of any print problems \u2014 and how to fix them<\/li> <\/ul>  Resource-conserving Features  <ul> <li>Standard duplexing helps you reduce paper consumption<\/li> <li>Innovative EA Toner with low-melt technology requires a lower fusing temperature than traditional toner while offering glossy, beautiful office graphics<\/li> <li>Hi-Q LED Print engine technology consumes minimal energy and space, and operates quietly<\/li> <li>The heat-efficient IH fuser consumes substantially less power in standby mode and achieves a start-up time of less than 15 seconds<\/li> <li>The innovative Earth Smart feature allows you to choose via the print driver the most environmentally sensitive options for your job<\/li> <\/ul>  <sup>1<\/sup> Average standard pages. Declared Yield in accordance with ISO\/IEC 19798. Yield will vary based on image, area coverage and print mode. <sup>2<\/sup> Approximate pages. Declared Yield on Drums based on an average job size of 3 pages A4\/letter size. Declared Yield on Fusers based on A4\/letter size 20 lb (75 gsm) pages. Drum and Fuser Yields will vary based on job run length, media type, size, weight, orientation, and usage patterns."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Phaser 7800 D\u00e9sormais, toutes les entit\u00e9s produisant des volumes importants de sorties haute r\u00e9solution, comme les agences de publicit\u00e9, les ateliers d\u2019arts graphiques, les entreprises de communication commerciale, les studios photo, les applications d\u2019imagerie m\u00e9dicale et beaucoup d\u2019autres, peuvent conserver plus de travaux d\u2019impression strat\u00e9giques en interne gr\u00e2ce aux technologies de pointe in\u00e9gal\u00e9es de l\u2019imprimante couleur Phaser 7800.  Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la combinaison gagnante de qualit\u00e9 d\u2019image sup\u00e9rieure homog\u00e8ne et de technologies de correspondance des couleurs de niveau professionnel, elle fait mieux que toutes les autres imprimantes couleur A3 en offrant aux professionnels de la cr\u00e9ation la libert\u00e9 de produire en interne encore plus de supports destin\u00e9s \u00e0 la client\u00e8le.  Pr\u00e9sentation g\u00e9n\u00e9rale <ul> <li>Couleur: jusqu'\u00e0 45 ppm<\/li> <li>Noir et Blanc : jusqu'\u00e0 45 ppm<\/li> <li>V\u00e9ritable r\u00e9solution 1200 x 2400 ppp<\/li> <li>D\u00e9lai d'impression de la premi\u00e8re page : 9 secondes en mode couleur et en mode noir et blanc<\/li> <li>Format papier maximum : 330 x 450 mm\/SRA3<\/li> <li>Recto verso automatique en standard<\/li> <li>Gestion des supports remarquablement flexible<\/li> <li>Large \u00e9ventail d'options de finition<\/li> <li>Volume maximum de 225 000 pages par mois<\/li> <li>Dimensions minimum (L x P x H): 641 x 699 x 578 mm<\/li> <li>Alimentation \u00e9lectrique: 230 V, 50\/60 Hz<\/li> <li>Contenu de l'emballage<\/li> Cartouches de toner de couleur (capacit\u00e9 : 6 000 pages (de chaque)<sup>1<\/sup>)<\/li> Cartouche de toner noire (capacit\u00e9 : 24 000 pages<sup>1<\/sup>)<\/li> Module d\u2019imagerie (capacit\u00e9 : 145 000 pages<sup>2<\/sup>)<\/li> Cordon d'alimentation<\/li> Logiciel et documentation<\/li> <\/ul>  Fonctions d'impression couleur avanc\u00e9es <ul> <li>1200 x 2400 ppp v\u00e9ritable pour des images, photos et graphiques des plus r\u00e9alistes, et du texte et des d\u00e9tails d'une finesse et d'une pr\u00e9cision optimales<\/li> <li>Simulations couleur homologu\u00e9es PANTONE\u00ae et technologie de correction des couleurs Xerox donnant des r\u00e9sultats toujours conformes \u00e0 vos attentes et une v\u00e9ritable compatibilit\u00e9 Adobe\u00ae PostScript\u00ae 3\u2122 assurant une pr\u00e9cision fiable<\/li> <li>Logiciel d'\u00e9talonnage et de gestion des couleurs PhaserMatch\u00ae 5.0, qui inclut l'appareil de mesure des couleurs PhaserMeter d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 par X-Rite, pour un contr\u00f4le des couleurs de niveau professionnel et une pr\u00e9cision des couleurs maintenue d'une impression \u00e0 l'autre et d'un p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique \u00e0 l'autre<\/li> <li>Technologie de surimpression avanc\u00e9e qui assure des contours nets et \u00e9limine les espaces entre couleurs adjacentes. De plus, texte noir sur fonds couleur et texte couleur sur fonds noirs sont toujours imprim\u00e9s de fa\u00e7on nette et pr\u00e9cise.<\/li> <li>T\u00eate d'impression LED Xerox Hi-Q proposant une meilleure intensit\u00e9 point \u00e0 point et un meilleur contr\u00f4le de la synchronisation, ainsi qu'un rep\u00e9rage des couleurs plus pr\u00e9cis<\/li> <\/ul>  Fonctions de productivit\u00e9 <ul> <li>Performances sup\u00e9rieures, avec sortie noir et blanc et couleur rapide \u00e0 45 ppm<\/li> <li>Plus de puissance, avec un processeur 1,33 Go, 2 Go de m\u00e9moire et un disque dur 160 Go standard<\/li> <li>Volume mensuel de 225 000-pages pour la prise en charge des volumes d'impression de bureau les plus \u00e9lev\u00e9s<\/li> <li>Impression recto verso automatique disponible en standard, pour une plus grande flexibilit\u00e9 et une r\u00e9duction de la consommation de papier. De plus, le recto verso est aussi rapide que le recto, donc pas besoin de sacrifier l'efficacit\u00e9 aux consid\u00e9rations environnementales.<\/li> <li>Kit supports haute r\u00e9sistance en option pour imprimer en recto verso sur des supports de formats standard et personnalis\u00e9s dans des grammages allant jusqu'\u00e0 300 g\/m\u00b2<\/li> <li>Options de finition avec empilage et agrafage mais aussi la flexibilit\u00e9 d'ajouter des fonctions de perforation, rainurage, pliage et cr\u00e9ation de cahiers<\/li> <\/ul>  Fonctions simples <ul> <li>Interface \u00e0 \u00e9cran tactile couleur de grande taille (109 mm) comportant de grandes ic\u00f4nes de couleurs vives ainsi que des menus intuitifs pour une utilisation rapide et facile<\/li> <li>Afficher l'interface utilisateur<\/li> <li>Vid\u00e9os d'aide incorpor\u00e9es proposant une assistance au d\u00e9pannage rapide sur le panneau de commande<\/li> <li>Serveur Web incorpor\u00e9 CentreWare\u2122 Internet Services vous permettant d'afficher l'\u00e9tat des travaux et de r\u00e9soudre les probl\u00e8mes depuis votre navigateur Web<\/li> <li>Acc\u00e8s facile sur la face avant \u00e9vitant d'avoir \u00e0 tourner ou d\u00e9placer l'imprimante pour effectuer la maintenance de base comme le changement de toner et l'ajout de papier<\/li> <li>Communication bidirectionnelle envoyant des mises \u00e0 jour sur les travaux d'impression, ainsi que les niveaux de toner et de papier, vers le bureau de votre ordinateur ou sur Internet. Des alertes s'affichent imm\u00e9diatement pour vous informer de tout probl\u00e8me d'impression et fournir des instructions pour leur r\u00e9solution.<\/li> <\/ul>  Des fonctions qui pr\u00e9servent les ressources <ul> <li>Recto verso standard aidant \u00e0 r\u00e9duire la consommation de papier<\/li> <li>Toner EA innovant \u00e0 point de fusion faible n\u00e9cessitant une temp\u00e9rature de fusion moins \u00e9lev\u00e9e que le toner traditionnel tout en produisant des graphiques professionnels de qualit\u00e9<\/li> <li>Technologie de moteur d'impression Hi-Q LED consommant un minimum d'\u00e9nergie et d'espace et fonctionnant sans bruit<\/li> <li>Four IH \u00e9conomique consommant beaucoup moins d'\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 en mode veille mais avec un d\u00e9lai de d\u00e9marrage inf\u00e9rieur \u00e0 15 secondes<\/li> <li>Fonction Earth Smart innovante permettant de choisir sur le pilote d'imprimante les options les plus favorables \u00e0 l'environnement pour votre travail<\/li> <\/ul>  <sup>1<\/sup> Pages standard moyennes. Rendement d\u00e9clar\u00e9 conform\u00e9ment \u00e0 la norme ISO\/IEC 19798. Le rendement varie en fonction de l'image, de la couverture et du mode d'impression. <sup>2<\/sup> Pages approximatives. Rendement d\u00e9clar\u00e9 des tambours bas\u00e9 sur un travail moyen de 3 pages au format A4. Rendement d\u00e9clar\u00e9 des unit\u00e9s de fusion bas\u00e9 sur des pages au format A4 et de grammage de 75 gm\u00b2. Les rendements des modules photor\u00e9cepteur et four d\u00e9pendent dela longueur des tirages, des supports utilis\u00e9s - type, format, grammage, orientation - et des modes d'utilisation du syst\u00e8me."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-19T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"00969d44-c393-47d5-a89d-0ec3cc67d1e5","identifier":"1123988","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["3m","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3M MicroTouch\u2122 Chassis"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"12V DC"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The 3M MicroTouch\u2122 ChassisTouch 17\" LCD monitor combines a thin profile with multiple mounting options supporting space constrained enclosures designs. Back-mounted display controls are accessible even with the monitor sitting flush with the face of the enclosure, improving the aesthetics of your integration. The optional user installable bezel is available for applications requiring a more finished appearance.\\n\\nThe ChassisTouch 17\" LCD\u2019s rugged metal enclosure provides mounting stability and protects the LCD from damage. Combined with 3M\u2019s MicroTouch ClearTek II technology the ChassisTouch 17\" LCD is a winning combination for all public access environments concerned with durability.\\n\\n- Slim design is conducive to sleek kiosk design trends.\\n- Robust metal enclosure provides mounting stability and protection for the LCD display.\\n- VESA-mounting hole pattern on the back allows for arm mount capability or bracket-mounting within the enclosure.\\n- Optional bezel available.\\n- Bright 300 nit chassis solution.\\n- High-contrast 17\" TFT LCD panel delivers crisp, vibrant images.\\n\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":17,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":13}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"efdd6816-00c8-459d-9202-8eb31cbb0154","identifier":"11260731","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark E462dtn"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"17.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A Compact Laser Workhorse<\/b>\\nTremendous value that offers speed, and best-in-series standard input capacity and cartridge yield.\\n\\n<b>Compact Yet Commanding<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark E462dtn is ultra-compact yet provides the largest standard input capacity and toner capacity in the E460 Series. With two 250-sheet paper inputs plus a 50-sheet multipurpose feeder, you\u2019ll have plenty of paper for your busiest workdays.\\n\\n<b>Exclusive Savings<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark E462dtn offers the highest yield replacement cartridge in the E460 Series: 18,000* pages. Choose this Lexmark Extra High Yield Toner Cartridge at replacement time and see just how low your cost per page can go. (*Declared yield in accordance with ISO\/IEC 19752.)\\n\\n<b>Easy to Perform and Save<\/b>\\nTrue 1200 x 1200 dpi print quality and performance features like a time-to-first-page as fast as 6.5 seconds help you perform at your best. Built-in networking lets you share the Lexmark E462dtn with others, and built-in duplexing makes it easy to save paper.\\n\\n<b>Fuss Less, Focus More<\/b>\\nBrings hassle-free printing to your fingertips. Experience enhanced security and time savings with a range of high-end features you typically wouldn't expect to find on such an attractively priced printer, like a numeric pad for confidential printing, early-warning alerts for low toner, and customizable operator panel messaging.\\n\\n<b>Print Black, Think Green<\/b>\\nDesigned with eco-conscious features like Eco-Mode and an instant warm-up fuser to help you save paper and energy. Recycle your empty cartridges free of charge through the Lexmark Cartridge Collection Program. Printing responsibly means everyone wins\u2014your business, your budget and the environment!\\n\\n<b>Lexmark Guarantee<\/b>\\nLexmark's warranty options on the Lexmark E Series provide sound peace of mind. To optimize your printer's performance and investment value, always use genuine Lexmark supplies, service and parts."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Compacte mais ultra-puissante<\/b>\\nBien qu'ultra-compacte, la Lexmark E462dtn offre la capacit\u00e9 d'alimentation standard et la capacit\u00e9 de toner la plus grande de la s\u00e9rie E460. Gr\u00e2ce aux deux tiroirs papier de 250 feuilles et au chargeur multifonction de 50 feuilles, vous ne serez jamais \u00e0 court de papier pour vos charges de travail les plus intensives.\\n\\n<b>D'importantes r\u00e9ductions des co\u00fbts<\/b>\\nLa Lexmark E462dtn offre les cartouches de rechange \u00e0 plus haut rendement de toute la s\u00e9rie E460 : 18 000* pages. Choisissez cette cartouche de toner \u00e0 tr\u00e8s haut rendement Lexmark et laissez-vous surprendre par le niveau de r\u00e9duction du co\u00fbt par page. (*rendement d\u00e9clar\u00e9 en conformit\u00e9 avec la norme ISO\/IEC 19752.)\\n\\n<b>Performances et \u00e9conomies<\/b>\\nOptimisez votre productivit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une qualit\u00e9 d'impression r\u00e9elle de 1200 x 1200 ppp et des fonctions de performance telles qu'un temps de sortie de la premi\u00e8re page de 6,5 secondes seulement. La mise en r\u00e9seau int\u00e9gr\u00e9e vous permet de partager la Lexmark E462dtn avec d'autres utilisateurs, et l'impression recto verso int\u00e9gr\u00e9e fait de l'\u00e9conomie de papier un jeu d'enfant.\\n\\n<b>Finis, les p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques compliqu\u00e9s !<\/b>\\nL'impression rapide \u00e0 port\u00e9e de la main. Renforcez votre s\u00e9curit\u00e9 et gagnez du temps avec des fonctions haut de gamme rarement propos\u00e9es par une imprimante \u00e0 un prix si attractif : pav\u00e9 num\u00e9rique pour les impressions confidentielles, avertissements de toner bas et messages personnalisables sur le panneau de commandes.\\n\\n<b>Pensez vert<\/b>\\nCon\u00e7ue avec des fonctions \u00e9co-responsables telles que le mode Eco et une unit\u00e9 de fusion \u00e0 pr\u00e9chauffage instantan\u00e9 pour des \u00e9conomies de papier et d'\u00e9nergie. Recyclez gratuitement vos cartouches vides gr\u00e2ce au programme de collecte et de recyclage de cartouches Lexmark. L'impression responsable est dans l'int\u00e9r\u00eat de tous : votre entreprise, votre budget et l'environnement.\\n\\n<b>Garantie Lexmark<\/b>\\nLes options de garantie de la s\u00e9rie Lexmark E assurent votre tranquillit\u00e9 d'esprit. Optimisez les performances de votre imprimante et rentabilisez votre investissement en utilisant des fournitures, services et pi\u00e8ces Lexmark authentiques."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-20T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4b11d816-32a5-4b3b-8a5b-96d57c23c99f","identifier":"112612","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["iiyama","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"iiyama E431S-B 17 INCH TFT VGA\/DVI 16SM ZWART"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 90 - 132 \/ 198 - 264 V, 50 \/ 60 Hz"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":17,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"iiyama E431S-B 17 INCH TFT VGA\/DVI 16SM ZWART. Display resolution: 1280 x 1024, Display: LCD, Contrast ratio (typical): 450:1. Width: 368.5, Depth: 188.5. Certification: TCO 99, T\u00dcV ERGO (ISO 13406-2), MPR III. Power requirements: AC 90 - 132 \/ 198 - 264 V, 50 \/ 60 Hz, Security features: Kensington-lock"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":16}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ec14c10a-ca3d-4d15-a378-bc403d971ca2","identifier":"112614","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["iiyama","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"iiyama 20.1 INCH TFT MONITOR ZWART"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 100 - 240 V, 50 \/ 60 Hz"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":20,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Exceptionally priced 20.1\u201d LCD with a solid performance and sleek design.  This model includes integrated speakers, economy modes and can be wall\/arm mounted for complete flexibility.  Dual inputs offer VGA and DVI connectivity.  Available in black or ivory."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":16}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"892f0da2-cf73-4f15-b456-dc1f41f5487a","identifier":"11273391","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["brother","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Brother HL-2230"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Designed with home and home office users in mind, the HL-2230 offers excellent value and reliable performance. It features a sleek space saving design with fast printing at up to 24 pages per minute and high-quality output up to 2400 x 600 dpi.\\n\\n<b>FEATURES: HL-2230<\/b>\\n- Monochrome laser printer\\n- Compact, fits almost anywhere\\n- High quality output even at top speed\\n- User-friendly software with easy installation\\n- Interactive help software\\n- Cost effective, with high-capacity replacement toner cartridges\\n- Machine-lifetime toll-free technical support"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-25T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e627151a-0977-46fb-88fa-eec809cb6cd6","identifier":"11275331","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales","viewsonic"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Viewsonic Value Series VA2703"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":27,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"ViewSonic\u2019s VA2703 is a 27\" large format LCD display with Full HD 1080p resolution. With wide viewing angles, 15,000:1 Dynamic Contrast Ratio, DVI \/ VGA dual inputs, and VESA mount option, VA2703 offers crystal crisp images and flexible set up. The display\u2019s large viewing area greatly enhances productivity when users work on large spreadsheets or use multiple applications. Ergonomic tilt adjusts screen angle for comfortable productivity or collaboration and presentations. 3 year warranty, the industry\u2019s best pixel performance policy, and energy saving Eco mode make the VA2703 the best value for corporations, home and education.\\n\\n<b>Key Features<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Full 27\" Widescreen With 1920x1080 Native Resolution<\/b>\\nThe widescreen aspect ratio allows you to view HD content in its native format with no stretching or distortion.\\n\\n<b>15,000:1 Dynamic Contrast Ratio<\/b>\\nProvides darker black levels and better overall front-of-screen performance.\\n\\n<b>ClearMotiv\u00ae 3ms Video Response Time<\/b>\\nFast 3ms video response enables digital HD broadcast-quality video and blur-free gaming.\\n\\n<b>OptiSync\u00ae Digital \/ Analog Inputs Expand Your Connectivity<\/b>\\nMulti-mode input technology supports both digital (DVI) and analog (VGA) signals for ultimate compatibility and configuration flexibility.\\n\\n<b>Eco-Mode<\/b>\\nEnvironmentally-friendly Eco-mode reduces power consumption by up to 50% and extends backlight life.\\n\\n<b>Stylish Slim-Bezel Design<\/b>\\nThe thin bezel lets you see more without taking up valuable desktop real estate."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":3}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"abdbf3af-a389-4779-bfe8-6d0bfe70df47","identifier":"112806","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","sony","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony SDM-HS74PS 17IN XBLACK TFT"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":17,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The large viewing area of Sony's HS74P\/S and XBRITE LCD Technology provide you with brilliantly crisp images and unmatched picture quality. The images are sharp whether you are working, playing games or browsing the Web. And with the unique style of Sony, the innovative floating frame design complements any office or room. It's so simple to set up, you can just plug in and get going."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-06-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":16}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"63ef788f-5eeb-41ed-ab42-9d9b09d07e65","identifier":"11285974","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon EOS 550D"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>EOS Digital SLR Camera<\/b>\\nCapture your story in stunning detail with the EOS 550D. With the creative freedom to capture the decisive shot, see all the detail of your holiday sunset or follow action in the local football match.\\n\\n- 18 MP APS-C CMOS sensor.\\n- DIGIC 4.\\n- ISO 100-6400, H:12800.\\n- Up to 3.7fps shooting.\\n- Full HD movies.\\n- 7.7cm (3.0\u201d) 3:2 Clear View LCD with 1,040k dots.\\n- iFCL metering.\\n- Quick Control screen.\\n- Ext. Mic socket.\\n- Movie crop.\\n\\n<b>18 MP CMOS sensor<\/b>\\nIdeal for those who want to create large, poster-size prints \u2013 or crop images without losing any of the detail necessary for printing \u2013 EOS 550D\u2019s 18MP CMOS sensor is outstanding in low light, and produces images with incredibly low noise.\\n\\n<b>DIGIC 4<\/b>\\nCanon\u2019s DIGIC 4 processor works with the CMOS sensor to deliver 14-bit image processing, for smooth gradations and natural looking colours. DIGIC 4 also powers advanced Noise Reduction when shooting at higher ISO speeds, plus split-second start-up times and near-instant image review after shooting.\\n\\n<b>High ISO for low light<\/b>\\nWhen light levels fall, the EOS 550D offers an ISO range of up to 6400 \u2013 expandable to 12800 for those environments where using flash is undesirable.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movie recording<\/b>\\nThe EOS 550D combines exceptional still shooting with the ability to shoot Full HD (1080p) video. To satisfy your creativity the EOS 550D features full manual control and selectable frame rates. You can also shoot high speed 50\/60fps movies at 720P for when the action is really fast. An HDMI connection allows High Definition playback of footage and images on any HDTV. Also with compatible TVs playback can be controlled using the TV\u2019s remote control.\\n\\n<b>7.7cm (3.0\u201d) 3:2 Clear View LCD<\/b>\\nDetailed checks on images and video are possible with a 7.7cm (3.0\u201d) 3:2 Clear View LCD screen, which features an ultra-high 1,040,000 dots for increased clarity. Switch to Live View mode and use the real-time visual feed to shoot from awkward angles.\\n\\n<b>iFCL metering system<\/b>\\nA new 63-zone dual layer metering sensor analyses Focus, Colour and Luminance information, providing accurate and consistent metering.\\n\\n<b>Quick Control screen<\/b>\\nAccessible using a dedicated button it provides easy access to commonly used functions, ensuring that you are ready to take the shot as it happens.\\n\\n<b>External Microphone Socket<\/b>\\nAdd an additional microphone for better quality sound using the 3.5mm stereo jack socket.\\n\\n<b>Movie Crop<\/b>\\nShoot VGA movies with an effective zoom of 7x. Movie crop uses only the centre part of the sensor and allows long distance shooting without having to change lenses.\\n\\n<b>Create a shooting system as unique as you are<\/b>\\nThe EOS 550D is compatible with Canon\u2019s full range of EF and EF-S lenses and EX-series Speedlites."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-28T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0573dd50-e938-49bd-b89c-2d00b0afad63","identifier":"11292447","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["hp","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Compaq LA2206xc"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>F\u00fcr kleine Unternehmen wie f\u00fcr gro\u00dfe Konzerne ist die unmittelbare Kommunikation mit Teammitgliedern und Kunden von entscheidender Bedeutung. Erweitern Sie die Kommunikationsm\u00f6glichkeiten Ihres Unternehmens und sparen Sie Zeit und Geld mit dem HP CompaqLA2206xc 54,6 cm (21,5 \") LCD-Monitor mit integrierter Webcam.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Vernetzung und Zusammenarbeit<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Virtuell anwesend sein. Der LA2206xc Monitor bietet eine integrierte 720p HD-Webcam, zwei Mikrofone und integrierte Lautsprecher f\u00fcr Videokonferenzen. Arbeiten Sie mit Kollegen und Kunden so zusammen, als ob sie mit ihnen im selben Raum s\u00e4\u00dfen.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Softwarel\u00f6sungen f\u00fcr virtuelle Meetings<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Software f\u00fcr die Durchf\u00fchrung virtueller Meetings (im Lieferumfang des Monitors) st\u00e4rkt Arbeitsbeziehungen online, steigert die Produktivit\u00e4t und spart Zeit und Geld. HP Myroom und YouCam 4 erm\u00f6glichen sicher und einfach Interaktion und gemeinsame Datennutzung.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Zukunftsweisendes Design<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Der schlanke Monitor mit dem eleganten Design und der hohen Anzeigeleistung beansprucht \u00e4u\u00dferst wenig Platz auf dem Schreibtisch, \u00fcberzeugt mit Ergonomiefunktionen f\u00fcr hohen Sichtkomfort und wurde umweltbewusst entwickelt.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erf\u00fcllung der strengsten Standards<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Der HP Compaq LA2206xc ist mit ENERGY STAR\u00ae 5.0 und TCO Displays zertifiziert sowie mit EPEAT\u00ae Gold registriert<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> EPEAT\u00ae Gold f\u00fcr registrierte kommerzielle HP Monitorprodukte. Siehe www.epeat.net f\u00fcr den Registrierungsstatus im jeweiligen Land<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"From small businesses to large corporations, communicating face-to-face with team members and customers is essential. Change the way your company connects, while saving time and money with the HP Compaq LA2206xc 54,6 cm (21.5\") diagonal Webcam LCD monitor.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Connect and Collaborate<\/b>\\n- Be there virtually. The LA2206xc monitor delivers a built-in 720p HD webcam, dual microphones and integrated speakers for video conferencing. Work with colleagues and clients as though they are in the same room.\\n\\n<b>Virtual Meeting Software Solutions<\/b>\\n- Strengthen work relationships online, amplify productivity, and save time and money with virtual meeting software (included with the monitor). HP MyRoom and YouCam 4 are safe and easy for real-time sharing and interaction.\\n\\n<b>Forward-thinking Design<\/b>\\n- Beyond the sleek appearance and high screen performance, stands a slender monitor that utilizes minimal desktop space, includes ergonomic features for a comfortable view and is designed with the environment in mind.\\n\\n<b>Meet the Toughest Standards<\/b>\\n- The HP Compaq LA2206xc is ENERGY STAR\u00ae 5.0 qualified, EPEAT\u00ae Gold registered, and TCO Displays certified."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Des petites entreprises aux tr\u00e8s grands groupes, la communication directe avec les membres des \u00e9quipes et les clients joue un r\u00f4le essentiel. Modifiez le mode de communication de votre entreprise, tout en gagnant du temps et en \u00e9conomisant de l'argent avec l'\u00e9cran HP Compaq LA2206xc LCD Webcam d'une diagonale de 54,6 cm (21,5\u00a0pouces).<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Connexion et collaboration<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Soyez l\u00e0 en personne virtuellement. L'\u00e9cran LA2206xc est \u00e9quip\u00e9 d'une webcam int\u00e9gr\u00e9e HD 720p, de microphones doubles et de haut-parleurs int\u00e9gr\u00e9s pour la vid\u00e9oconf\u00e9rence. Travaillez avec vos coll\u00e8gues et clients comme s'ils \u00e9taient dans la m\u00eame pi\u00e8ce.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Solutions logicielles de r\u00e9union virtuelle<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Renforcez les relations de travail en ligne, amplifiez la productivit\u00e9, gagner du temps et \u00e9conomiser de l'argent avec un logiciel de r\u00e9union virtuelle (inclus avec le moniteur). HP MyRoom et YouCam 4 permettent un partage et une interaction en temps r\u00e9el \u00e0 la fois simples et s\u00e9curis\u00e9s.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Un design avant-gardiste<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Au-del\u00e0 de l'apparence \u00e9l\u00e9gante et des hautes performances d'affichage, ce superbe moniteur occupe un espace restreint sur le bureau, inclut des fonctionnalit\u00e9s ergonomiques pour une utilisation confortable, et est con\u00e7u dans un souci de respect de l'environnement.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Respectez les standards les plus exigeants<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Le mod\u00e8le HP Compaq LA2206xc est qualifi\u00e9 ENERGY STAR\u00ae 5.0, enregistr\u00e9 EPEAT\u00ae Gold<SUP>1<\/SUP> et certifi\u00e9 TCO Displays.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> EPEAT\u00ae Gold l\u00e0 o\u00f9 HP enregistre les \u00e9crans professionnels. Consultez le site www.epeat.net pour conna\u00eetre l'\u00e9tat d'enregistrement dans votre pays<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-29T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"51e1e542-9018-4301-81fe-d80e2b2866ea","identifier":"11309326","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["n"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon imageRUNNER 2420"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Kompakte, kosteneffiziente Schwarzwei\u00dfkopierer mit lokalen Druckfunktionen<\/b>\\nDiese neue Serie Platz sparender Kopierer erm\u00f6glicht hochwertige Schwarzwei\u00dfkopien sowie lokalen USB-Druck. Als produktive L\u00f6sung mit niedrigen Betriebskosten eignen sie sich besonders f\u00fcr kleine Arbeitsgruppen mit hohem Arbeitsaufkommen.\\n\\n<b>Werden Sie produktiver<\/b>\\nDank des einfach zu bedienenden und intuitiven LC-Displays mit 5 Zeilen und Hintergrundbeleuchtung k\u00f6nnen Benutzer mehr Arbeit in k\u00fcrzerer Zeit erledigen. Aufgrund seiner Ausgabegeschwindigkeit von 20 A4-Seiten pro Minute in erstklassiger Qualit\u00e4t und seiner herausragenden Reaktionszeit \u2013 Ausgabe der ersten Seite nach nur 7,9 Sekunden \u2013 k\u00f6nnen Sie mit dem imageRUNNER 2420 viel Zeit einsparen.\\n\\n<b>Nach Ihren Anforderungen skalierbar<\/b>\\nDiese kompakten Modelle k\u00f6nnen auch f\u00fcr gro\u00dfe Herausforderungen konfiguriert werden. Sie k\u00f6nnen das System mit zus\u00e4tzlichen Papierf\u00e4chern erweitern und so die beste Kapazit\u00e4t f\u00fcr Ihre Anspr\u00fcche selbst bestimmen. Das System fasst bis zu 1.080 Blatt und Papierformate bis A3. Zu den weiteren Optionen z\u00e4hlen Netzwerkscan und Netzwerkdruck, doppelseitige Drucke und Heftung. Welche Anforderungen Sie also auch immer haben, mit diesen Kompaktger\u00e4ten k\u00f6nnen Sie auf professionelle Leistung und \u00fcberragende Ergebnisse vertrauen.\\n\\n<b>Ausgezeichnete Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit und un\u00fcbertroffener Support<\/b>\\nDie verbesserte Lebensdauer und Betriebsf\u00e4higkeit garantieren dauerhaft hochwertige Ausdrucke und ein sorgloses Arbeiten. Nutzen Sie das herausragende Service- und Supportangebot von Canon mit fachkundiger Installation, Schulung und Vor-Ort-Service sowie festgelegten SLAs (Service Level Agreements). \u00dcber die Abrechnung per Klick zahlen Sie nur f\u00fcr tats\u00e4chlich gedruckte Seiten, sodass Sie immer die volle Kontrolle \u00fcber Ihre Kosten haben. Herausragender Kundenservice von A bis Z ist unsere oberste Priorit\u00e4t, daher sind 93 %* unserer Kunden mit der Reparaturzeit f\u00fcr ihre B\u00fcrosysteme zufrieden.\\n\\n<b>Geringere Umweltbelastung<\/b>\\nDiese ENERGY STAR\u00ae-Modelle bieten eine beeindruckende Energieeffizienz mit einem Energieverbrauch von nur 4,5 Watt im Schlaf-Modus. Damit sparen Sie Energie und Kosten. Die Fixier-Technologie ohne Vorw\u00e4rmzeiten von Canon erm\u00f6glicht ein sofortiges Aufw\u00e4rmen aus dem Ruhezustand, sodass die Produktivit\u00e4t von den Energiesparfunktionen nicht beeintr\u00e4chtigt wird.\\n\\n* Laut einer Umfrage zur Servicezufriedenheit von TNS NIPO. Stand der Daten: Januar bis Juli 2009. An der Umfrage nahmen 16.059 Kunden teil.\\nDie Abbildung oben zeigt das Ger\u00e4t mit optionalen Papierkassetten."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Compact, cost-effective black and white copiers with local printing\\nThe new space-saving range of copiers provides highly efficient copying plus local printing via USB. They are ideal for busy, small workgroups looking for a productive solution with low cost of ownership.\\n\\n<b>Be more productive<\/b>\\nUsers can do more, faster, with the simple and intuitive to use backlit 5-line LCD. With high-quality copies at 20ppm and exceptional responsiveness \u2013 7.9 seconds first copy out time \u2013 the imageRUNNER 2420 saves you time.\\n\\n<b>Scalable to suit your requirements<\/b>\\nThese compact models can be configured to cope with big challenges. With a choice of additional paper drawers, you can select the capacity that best suits your needs \u2013 up to 1,080 sheets, in a variety of paper sizes up to A3. Other options include network printing and scanning, double-sided output and stapling. So whatever your needs, you can expect professional performance and the superb results you require.\\n\\n<b>Excellent reliability and support<\/b>\\nContinuous high-quality output and peace of mind are provided with improved durability and serviceability. Canon\u2019s world class service and support provides expert installation, training and on-site services, plus pre-determined Service Level Agreements. With click charging you only pay for what you actually print, which helps you gain a greater control of costs. Excellent total customer service is our priority \u2013 93%* of customers are satisfied with the time it took to repair their equipment.\\n\\n<b>Lower environmental impact<\/b>\\nThese ENERGY STAR\u00ae qualified models offer impressive energy efficiency, as low as 4.5 watts power consumption in sleep mode, to save energy and cost. With Canon\u2019s On-Demand fixing technology there is rapid recovery from sleep mode, so you can save energy without affecting productivity.\\n\\n*Based on TNS NIPO, post service visit survey. Data from January to July 2009. 16,059 customers took part.\\nThe image shown above is the device with optional paper cassettes."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Copieurs noir et blanc compacts et rentables avec possibilit\u00e9 d'imprimer en local<\/b>\\nLa nouvelle gamme de copieurs peu encombrants offre une copie extr\u00eamement efficace et la possibilit\u00e9 d'imprimer en local via une connexion USB. Ils conviennent parfaitement aux petits groupes de travail \u00e0 forte activit\u00e9 qui recherchent une solution productive pour un prix avantageux.\\n\\n<b>Soyez plus productif<\/b>\\nL'\u00e9cran LCD de 5 lignes, r\u00e9tro\u00e9clair\u00e9, intuitif et simple \u00e0 utiliser, permet aux utilisateurs d'en faire plus, et plus vite. Avec des copies de haute qualit\u00e9 \u00e0 20 ppm et une r\u00e9activit\u00e9 exceptionnelle (un temps de sortie de la premi\u00e8re copie de 7,9 secondes), l'imageRUNNER 2420 vous permet de gagner du temps.\\n\\n<b>Modulable, il s'adapte \u00e0 vos exigences<\/b>\\nCes mod\u00e8les compacts peuvent \u00eatre configur\u00e9s pour faire face \u00e0 de nombreux d\u00e9fis. Vous pouvez augmenter sa capacit\u00e9 en lui ajoutant des tiroirs d'alimentation papier, jusqu'\u00e0 une capacit\u00e9 de 1 080 feuilles, avec des formats variables jusqu'\u00e0 A3. Parmi les autres options, citons l'impression et la num\u00e9risation r\u00e9seau, l'impression recto verso et l'agrafage. Quels que soient vos besoins, vous obtiendrez des performances de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle et les r\u00e9sultats magnifiques que vous souhaitez.\\n\\n<b>Une fiabilit\u00e9 et une assistance de qualit\u00e9 sup\u00e9rieure<\/b>\\nDes r\u00e9sultats de haute qualit\u00e9 en continu et une tranquillit\u00e9 d'esprit assur\u00e9e gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une durabilit\u00e9 et une facilit\u00e9 d'entretien accrues. Le service et la maintenance de niveau international de Canon garantissent l'installation par des experts, la formation et les interventions sur site, ainsi que des contrats de niveau de service pr\u00e9d\u00e9termin\u00e9s. Gr\u00e2ce au calcul forfaitaire du co\u00fbt par page, vous ne payez que ce que vous imprimez. Ainsi, vous contr\u00f4lez mieux les co\u00fbts. La satisfaction du client est notre priorit\u00e9 : 93 %* de nos clients sont satisfaits de la dur\u00e9e de r\u00e9paration de leur \u00e9quipement.\\n\\n<b>Impact \u00e9cologique r\u00e9duit<\/b>\\nCes mod\u00e8les certifi\u00e9s ENERGY STAR\u00ae offrent des \u00e9conomies d'\u00e9nergie exceptionnelles : ils ne consomment que 4,5 watts en mode veille afin d'\u00e9conomiser sur l'\u00e9nergie et sur les co\u00fbts. Avec la technologie de fixation \u00e0 la demande de Canon, la r\u00e9cup\u00e9ration est rapide apr\u00e8s le mode veille : ainsi, vous pouvez \u00e9conomiser l'\u00e9nergie sans affecter la productivit\u00e9.\\n\\n*D'apr\u00e8s une enqu\u00eate post-visite d'entretien TNS NIPO. Donn\u00e9es de janvier \u00e0 juillet 2009. 16 059 clients ont particip\u00e9.\\nL'illustration ci-dessus pr\u00e9sente l'appareil avec les cassettes papier en option."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-30T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"68f3d1e9-43b4-411f-a3e4-68d95f9a74aa","identifier":"11311106","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lenovo","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenovo ThinkVision LT1952p"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"For enterprises that need a green, fully functional display screen, with unparalleled visual quality, the ThinkVision LT1952p is the best choice. Compatible with virtually any hardware platform, the LT1952p offers VGA, DVI-D, and DisplayPort connections. The LT1952p is a breeze to use with exceptional LED performance, swivel, tilt, and lift options, 5 milliseconds response time, and a 1000:1 contrast ratio. The LT1952p delivers high energy cost savings, through compliance with go green certifications. The monitors are mercury-free, contain reduced toxic chemicals. The LT1952p delivers the best value on investment for large enterprises."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-10-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5aa50c3c-b7e4-41fe-86cd-86ca0cde29f7","identifier":"11321899","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 241B4LPCB"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sustainable eco design display<\/b>\\n\\n<b>with PowerSensor saves energy bills<\/b>\\n\\nThe Philips PowerSensor LED display using 65% post-consumer recycled plastics and PVC, BFR free housing is ideal for eco-friendly productivity.\\n\\n<b>Sustainable Eco-design<\/b>\\n\\n- PowerSensor saves up to 80% energy costs\\n- Zero power consumption with 0 watt hard switch\\n- 65% post consumer recycled plastics with TCO Edge\\n- PVC-BFR free housing\\n\\n<b>Excellent performance<\/b>\\n\\n- LED technology ensures natural colours\\n- TrueVision ensures lab quality images\\n- Built-in stereo speakers for multimedia\\n\\n<b>Designed for people<\/b>\\n\\n- SmartErgoBase enables user-friendly ergonomic adjustments\\n- Low bezel-to-table height for maximum reading comfort\\n\\n<b>Easy to experience<\/b>\\n\\n- SmartImage presets for easy optimised image settings\\n- USB Hub with 2 ports for easy connections"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Utilisant 65\u00a0% de plastiques issus d'un recyclage post-consommation et ne contenant ni PVC ni BFR, cet \u00e9cran LED Philips PowerSensor est la solution id\u00e9ale pour combiner productivit\u00e9 et respect de l'environnement"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-01T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bfb45c29-50ee-4e1c-9fd5-428be3d6c659","identifier":"11325078","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox Phaser 6700"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"With the winning combination of exceptional image quality and blazing fast print speed, the Xerox Phaser 6700 takes your business or large workgroup to a new level of high-volume productivity. You get unbeatable colour accuracy on every business-critical document you print, with the added benefits of superior ease-of-use and renowned reliability that only come from Xerox.\\n\\n- Superior print quality thanks to true 2400 x 1200 dpi print resolution and true Adobe\u00ae PostScript\u00ae 3\u2122\\n- Incredible performance, with a colour and black-and-white print speed of up to 47 ppm\\n- The 120,000-page monthly duty cycle supports the heaviest office print volumes\\n- 1.25 GHz processor and standard 1 GB system memory handle a steady stream of complex jobs with ease\\n- The Print Around feature eliminates extended printing delays by holding a job in need of resources (such as a different paper size) and printing the next job in the queue\\n- Finisher option allows you to add 1000-sheet stacking and 50-sheet stapling."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9a7a3542-9d0e-498f-9ac7-0e5435b69e22","identifier":"11332477","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","salora","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"e\/a\/5\/8\/ea58b1bd4a72b529b64b083761d79accbd62ded9_11332477_5781.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/e\/a\/5\/8\/ea58b1bd4a72b529b64b083761d79accbd62ded9_11332477_5781.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Salora 26LED7100C LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Salora 26LED7100C. HD type: HD-Ready, Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: A2 Nicam. HDMI version: 1.3. Optical disc player type: Not included"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6b3ee119-a871-4216-96de-e421b4573026","identifier":"11332479","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","salora","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"f\/f\/a\/5\/ffa548eea46dd9d49d558dfd658938b1eb38407e_11332479_2858.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/f\/f\/a\/5\/ffa548eea46dd9d49d558dfd658938b1eb38407e_11332479_2858.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Salora 26LED7115CDW LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Salora 26LED7115CDW. HD type: HD-Ready, Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: A2 Nicam. HDMI version: 1.3. Optical disc player type: DVD player, Disc types supported: CD, CD-R, CD-RW, DVD, DVD+R, DVD+RW, DVD-R, DVD-RW"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"da1e72b6-8342-45ae-b049-f63991d38aa8","identifier":"11342012","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung TC180"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Kristallklarer LCD-Bildschirm<\/b>\\nIm Gegensatz zu anderen Thin Clients ist der Samsung TC190 und TC240 sofort einsatzbereit. Dank ihrer leistungsstarken und hochwertigen LCD-Bildschirme stellen sie eine komplette serverbasierte Netzwerkl\u00f6sung dar. Mit den hohen Werten f\u00fcr Helligkeit und Kontrastverh\u00e4ltnis k\u00f6nnen sie Bilder mit echter Farbtiefe, Sch\u00e4rfe und Detailtreue anzeigen und die Reaktionszeit von 5 ms l\u00e4sst viele herk\u00f6mmliche PC-Monitore sehr langsam aussehen. Die Ger\u00e4te Samsung TC190 und TC240 k\u00f6nnen Bilder mit hoher Aufl\u00f6sung mit unantastbarer Integrit\u00e4t darstellen und sind das Tor zu einer neuen Welt der M\u00f6glichkeiten f\u00fcr viele Benutzer, da sie Standbilder und sehr schnelle Videos mit Perfektion darstellen.\\n\\n<b>Umfassendes Archiv f\u00fcr Ressourcen<\/b>\\nWerden Informationen auf einem zentralen Server abgelegt, hat das den Vorteil, dass Ressourcen effizienter und effektiver gespeichert und f\u00fcr andere bereitgestellt werden k\u00f6nnen. Werden Daten auf den Server \u00fcbertragen, sind sie besser vor Verlust und Besch\u00e4digungen gesch\u00fctzt als auf einem PC eines Mitarbeiters. Au\u00dferdem k\u00f6nnen die Daten mehr Benutzern zur Verf\u00fcgung gestellt werden. Davon profitieren nicht nur die derzeitigen Benutzer, sondern auch zuk\u00fcnftige Benutzer, die auf dieses wertvolle Ressourcenarchiv zugreifen k\u00f6nnen. Die Suche nach Informationen, die auf einem zentralen Server gespeichert sind, ist schnell, einfach und intuitiv. Die Informationen k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr andere freigegeben und Themen k\u00f6nnen zukunftsbezogen vermittelt werden."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung TC180. Display diagonal: 18.5, Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Display: LED. Processor family: Intel Atom, Processor model: N270, Processor clock speed: 1.5. Ethernet LAN data transfer rates: 10, 100, 1000. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 100 x 100. Power consumption (standby): 2.7"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cf0729e2-f2de-404c-8bc2-f8ce00b25aa9","identifier":"11410","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C750fn Color Laser Printer + finishing + networking"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The value of one single unit for both colour and monochrome requirements\\nAn affordable colour cost per page and a mono cost per page competitive with traditional mono laser printers ! \\n\\nSingle-element, high-yield cartridges and large paper capacity ensure a low intervention rate and great maintenance savings.\\n\\nWith print-and-hold features, you can proof the job at the machine and then press a button to continue printing, avoiding wastes.\\n\\nIT managers can set mono\/colour restrictions based on the different printing needs of each employee or workgroup.\\n\\n3 automatic toner-saver levels save you up to 50% on toner cartridges and let you optimise your output when needed.\\n\\nUp to 5 input sources that can hold up to 3100 sheets to keep the work flow moving.\\n\\nOptional mailbox and output stackers.\\nOptional finisher for hole punching and stapling.\\nOptional automatic duplex printing (standard on C750dn model).\\n\\nOne-pass printing, transferring all four colours to the document at the same time, enabling 20 ppm printing in colour or monochrome.\\n\\nTrue 1200x1200 dpi and\/or 2400 IQ modes ensure perfect quality documents for all your needs, whether in colour or monochrome.\\n\\n350 MHz processor, offering top speed for even the most complex jobs.\\n\\nNear-photo-quality output, thanks to brand new colour tables and automatic belt registration for complete accuracy in process printing.\\n\\nVery quick 20-second time to first colour page!"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-06-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3582045e-95ca-49d8-b22a-c4eb7ce33028","identifier":"11677735","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung ML-2950NDR"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Dieser kompakte Monolaser-Drucker von Samsung unterst\u00fctzt seine Anwender mit bester Leistung und einer umfassenden Ausstattung f\u00fcr professionelle Anforderungen. Mit seiner Top-Druckgeschwindigkeit von 28 S.\/Min. und 64 MB Arbeitsspeicher erledigt der ML-2950ND alle Aufgaben im Eiltempo \u2013 und in bester Druckqualit\u00e4t dank 1.200 x 1.200 dpi Aufl\u00f6sung. Sein integrierter Netzwerkanschluss, die standardm\u00e4\u00dfige Duplexeinheit sowie Toner-, Papier- und Energiesparfunktionen auf Knopfdruck machen ihn zum idealen Partner f\u00fcr das Heimb\u00fcro und kleine Arbeitsgruppen.\\n\\n<b>Holen Sie mehr aus jeder Seite heraus mit Duplex-Druck<\/b>\\nGerade bei hohen Druckaufkommen und umfangreichen Druckauftr\u00e4gen lohnt es sich, die Duplex-Funktion des ML-2950NDR zu nutzen. Das beidseitige Bedrucken reduziert Ihren Papierverbrauch um die H\u00e4lfte \u2013 und schont damit nicht nur Ihr Budget, sondern auch die Umwelt. Man kann also mit Duplex-Druck nur gewinnen.\\n\\n<b>Ihr Beitrag zum Umweltschutz<\/b>\\nDank Samsungs innovativem Eco-Modus kann jetzt jeder m\u00fchelos etwas zum Umweltschutz beitragen. Mit einem einfachen Knopfdruck auf dem Bediendisplay aktivieren Sie die One-Touch-Eco-Funktion und k\u00f6nnen jeweils zwei Seiten zu einer Druckseite zusammenfassen. In Kombination mit der Toner-Spareinstellung spart das Zeit, Papier, Toner und letztendlich bares Geld. Ein Ergebnissimulator zeigt Ihnen dabei genau an, wie hoch aktuell die CO2-Emission sowie der Strom- und Papierverbrauch des Ger\u00e4ts sind. So ist Ihr Beitrag f\u00fcr die Umwelt jederzeit messbar \u2013 und das verleiht Ihnen einfach ein gutes Gef\u00fchl.\\n\\n<b>Besser arbeiten mit Schnelldruck<\/b>\\nDrucken Sie kleine oder gro\u00dfe Dokumente schneller als mit anderen Druckern: ein 533-MHz-Prozessor und eine Speicherkapazit\u00e4t von 64 MB machen es m\u00f6glich. Verbessern Sie Produktivit\u00e4t und Workflow in Ihrem B\u00fcro und drucken Sie wichtige Dokumente in hoher Qualit\u00e4t und v\u00f6llig stressfrei.\\n\\n<b>Mit Ihren Kollegen immer in Verbindung<\/b>\\nWenn jeder Mitarbeiter im B\u00fcro mit seinen Kollegen vernetzt ist, geht die Arbeit viel leichter von der Hand. Alle Angestellten k\u00f6nnen sich einen Drucker teilen, sodass Sie keine Zeit darauf verschwenden m\u00fcssen, mehrere Ger\u00e4te zu warten. Mit der Ethernet-Schnittstelle k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihre Produktivit\u00e4t steigern, indem Sie den Drucker einfach an Ihr Netzwerk anschlie\u00dfen. Verbessern Sie mit dem Samsung Multifunktionsger\u00e4t Ihre Kommunikationsf\u00e4higkeit und bleiben Sie immer in Verbindung.\\n\\n<b>Ein Spitzendrucker ohne st\u00f6rende Ger\u00e4usche<\/b>\\nSelbst wenn der neue Samsung Monolaser-Drucker ML-2950NDR auf Hochtouren l\u00e4uft, ist er nicht lauter als 50 Dezibel \u2013 eine \u00e4u\u00dferst b\u00fcrofreundliche Lautst\u00e4rke. Mit einer Stand-by-Lautst\u00e4rke von 30 dBA macht dieser Drucker Schluss mit l\u00e4rmenden Ger\u00e4uschen. B\u00fcrot\u00fcren k\u00f6nnen endlich wieder offen bleiben, w\u00e4hrend der ML-2950NDR eine Seite nach der anderen ausgibt und andere Drucker seiner Klasse dabei spielend \u00fcbertrifft.\\n\\n<b>Ein Drucker mit Intelligenz und Sch\u00f6nheit<\/b>\\nEndlich kann Ihr Schreibtisch dank und nicht trotz Ihres Druckers stylisch aussehen. Der Samsung Laserdrucker ML-2950NDR passt mit seinem eleganten \u00c4u\u00dferen garantiert zu jedem Arbeitsplatz und in jedes B\u00fcro. Seine gl\u00e4nzende obere Abdeckung im schicken polierten Design bietet einen staubfreien Schutz. Versch\u00f6nern Sie Ihr Umfeld mit einem Desktop-Accessoire, das Ihnen die Arbeit erleichtert.\\n\\n<b>Erfassen Sie, was Ihr Auge erfasst!<\/b>\\nSamsung Anyweb Print macht das Ausdrucken von Webseiten aus dem Internet Explorer jetzt flexibler und einfacher: W\u00e4hlen Sie die gew\u00fcnschten Teile einer Webseite \u2013 einzelne Bilder, Textpassagen oder ganze Frames \u2013 per Drag & Drop \u00fcber eine Werkzeugleiste im Browser aus und bearbeiten Sie diese Teile nach Ihren Anforderungen. Drucken Sie nur das, was Sie wirklich ben\u00f6tigen!"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Respectez l'environnement plus facilement<\/b>\\nLe mode \u00e9co est activ\u00e9 par simple pression sur la touche \"Eco\" et agit comme mode par d\u00e9faut une fois activ\u00e9. Il vous permet de r\u00e9duire votre consommation de papier gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression recto verso, \u00e0 l'impression recto 2 ou 4 pages par feuille et au param\u00e8tre d'\u00e9conomie de toner. En outre, le simulateur de r\u00e9sultats vous permet d'\u00e9valuer pr\u00e9cis\u00e9ment vos progr\u00e8s. La simulation vous montre votre niveau d\u2019\u00e9missions de CO\u00b2, ainsi que votre consommation d\u2019\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 et de papier. Le mode \u00e9co est une mani\u00e8re facile et pratique de surveiller la consommation de votre imprimante. Un avantage pour vous et pour la plan\u00e8te !\\n\\n<b>Faites-en plus sur chaque page avec l'impression recto verso<\/b>\\nDoublez votre rendement ou r\u00e9duisez de moiti\u00e9 vos co\u00fbts en papier. L'impression recto verso est une caract\u00e9ristique essentielle, tant pour l'impression professionnelle que personnelle. Elle offre de nombreuses possibilit\u00e9s cr\u00e9atives comme pour faire des livrets par exemple. L\u2019impression double face vous permet \u00e9galement de r\u00e9duire nettement vos co\u00fbts et de faire durer vos r\u00e9serves de papier plus longtemps. En plus de faire des \u00e9conomies, vous minimisez votre impact sur l\u2019environnement. Avec l\u2019impression recto verso, vous serez gagnant \u00e0 tous les coups !\\n\\n<b>Optimisez vos impressions avec le pilote d'impression Easy Eco<\/b>\\nFaites des \u00e9conomies \u00e0 chaque impression gr\u00e2ce au pilote d'impression Easy Eco de Samsung. Ce logiciel pratique vous permet de pr\u00e9visualiser vos documents avant de les imprimer et d'en ajuster la qualit\u00e9, la couleur et d'autres param\u00e8tres. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement supprimer le texte, les images ou d'autres \u00e9l\u00e9ments dont vous n'avez pas besoin. Vous pouvez m\u00eame contr\u00f4ler les \u00e9conomies r\u00e9alis\u00e9es (papier, encre, \u00e9lectricit\u00e9 et co\u00fbt). D\u00e9couvrez une fa\u00e7on plus efficace et plus \u00e9conomique d'imprimer.\\n\\n<b>Travaillez mieux gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression efficace<\/b>\\nImprimez rapidement des documents (petits et grands) gr\u00e2ce au processeur 533 MHz et \u00e0 la m\u00e9moire de 64 Mo. Id\u00e9ale pour imprimer des volumes soutenus de documents de travail, la vitesse d'impression de 28 pages par minute vous aidera \u00e0 augmenter votre productivit\u00e9. Une imprimante fiable et efficace comme celle-ci deviendra tr\u00e8s vite un outil indispensable pour votre bureau. Vous vous demanderez m\u00eame comment vous avez pu vous en passer.\\n\\n<b>Soignez les d\u00e9tails de vos impressions<\/b>\\nAvec une r\u00e9solution d'impression de 1200 x 1200 dpi, l'imprimante laser Samsung ML-2950NDR vous garantit une impression professionnelle et de haute qualit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Restez connect\u00e9 avec vos coll\u00e8gues!<\/b>\\nConnectez tout le monde dans votre bureau \u00e0 un seul r\u00e9seau sans probl\u00e8me. Ils partageront la m\u00eame imprimante et vous gagnerez du temps en g\u00e9rant une seule machine. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son port Ethernet embarqu\u00e9, l'imprimante laser ML-2950NDR vous permet de connecter plusieurs utilisateurs sur la m\u00eame imprimante.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez les nuisances sonores<\/b>\\nCon\u00e7ue par une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 qui conna\u00eet bien son domaine, la nouvelle imprimante ML-2950NDR de Samsung peut travailler \u00e0 plein r\u00e9gime en \u00e9mettant un bruit de seulement 50 d\u00e9cibels, soit un volume qui est tout \u00e0 fait appropri\u00e9 pour les bureaux et que nos concurrents ne peuvent se vanter d'offrir. En mode veille, le volume de l'imprimante est de 30 dBA. Ainsi, que ce soit avant ou pendant l'impression, vos coll\u00e8gues n'auront plus \u00e0 crier pour se faire entendre. Les portes pourront rester ouvertes le long des couloirs puisqu'en mati\u00e8re de fonctionnement silencieux, la ML-2950NDR d\u00e9passe toutes les autres imprimantes renomm\u00e9es, et ce, impression apr\u00e8s impression.\\n\\n<b>Efficace et compacte<\/b>\\nL\u2019imprimante laser ML-2950NDR de Samsung arbore un design \u00e9l\u00e9gant qui convient parfaitement \u00e0 tout espace de travail gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 sa compacit\u00e9. Son couvercle offre aussi une protection contre la poussi\u00e8re.\\n\\n<b>Un design \u00e9pur\u00e9<\/b>\\n- Boitier de protection\\nEn plus de donner \u00e0 l\u2019imprimante un look \u00e9pur\u00e9 et \u00e9l\u00e9gant, le boitier contribue \u00e0 r\u00e9duire le niveau sonore lors de l\u2019impression, pour un environnement de travail calme.\\n\\n- Bac d'alimentation int\u00e9gr\u00e9\\nPratique, le bac int\u00e9gr\u00e9 est compact et permet de conserver le papier \u00e0 l\u2019abri de la poussi\u00e8re et de la salet\u00e9, pour une impression toujours professionnelle.\\n\\n- Un design \u00e9pur\u00e9\\nLa surface lisse qui enveloppe l\u2019appareil, cr\u00e9e ainsi une imprimante laser monochrome qui donne une touche de style \u00e0 tout environnement professionnel."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-06T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d6a3316d-d014-4e13-bbd1-bfc4aa1244f7","identifier":"11699224","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["hp","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LE2002xi"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Dieser LED-Monitor mit Hintergrundbeleuchtung und Integrated Work Center-Standfu\u00df kombiniert umweltschonende Features mit gestochen scharfen Darstellungen und eignet sich hervorragend f\u00fcr Umgebungen mit geringer Stellfl\u00e4che.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Platzsparend<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Der elegante, flache HP Compaq LE2002xi LCD-Monitor ist in jeder Umgebung ein Blickfang und zeichnet sich durch sein flaches Profil und seine geringe Aufstellfl\u00e4che aus.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Geringere Umweltbelastung<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Dieser Monitor schont die Umwelt dank quecksilberfreien LEDs, BFR\/PVC-freien Komponenten, arsenfreiem Bildschirmglas<SUP>1<\/SUP>, ENERGY STAR\u00ae Zertifizierung und EPEAT\u00ae Silver Registrierung<SUP>2<\/SUP> sowie einer TCO Displays Zertifizierung.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Bessere Leistung<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Gestochen scharfe Ansichten auf einem Monitor mit einer Diagonalen von 50,8 cm (20\"), einer systemeigenen Aufl\u00f6sung von 1600 x 900, einem dynamischen Kontrastverh\u00e4ltnis von 3.000.000:1, Betrachtungswinkel von bis zu 170\u00b0 und einer Reaktionszeit von nur 5 ms<SUP>3<\/SUP>. Die DVD-D- und VGA-Eing\u00e4nge bieten noch mehr Anschlussm\u00f6glichkeiten.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Sorgenfrei dank HP Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;3 Jahre Herstellergarantie auf Teile, inklusive Hintergrundbeleuchtung, und Arbeit sowie Vor-Ort-Service. Verf\u00fcgbarkeit je nach Region. Es gelten bestimmte Einschr\u00e4nkungen und Ausschlussklauseln. Details erhalten Sie bei der HP Kundenhotline.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Arsen und Arsenverbindungen wurden mit den Testmethoden 3052\/6010b der US-amerikanischen EPA durch ICP-AES nicht festgestellt.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> EPEAT\u00ae Silver f\u00fcr registrierte kommerzielle HP Monitorprodukte.  Unter www.epeat.net erfahren Sie den Registrierungsstatus im jeweiligen Land.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Bei s\u00e4mtlichen Leistungsangaben handelt es sich um die typischen Spezifikationen laut den mit HP kooperierenden Komponentenherstellern,; die tats\u00e4chliche Leistung kann dar\u00fcber oder darunter liegen.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>HP Compaq LE2002xi 50,8 cm (20\u201d) LCD Monitor with IWC Stand<\/b>\\nThis LED backlit monitor with an Integrated Work Center stand, features eco-solutions and a crisp, clear display ideal for space constrained environments.\\n\\n<b>Space efficient<\/b>\\n- The stylish, slim HP Compaq LE2002xi LCD Monitor looks great in any environment with a thin profile and modest footprint.\\n- The built-in HP Integrated Work Center stand helps create a compact and comfortable work station. Attach an HP t5335z Smart Client or Ultra-slim Desktop (USDT) to the back of the stand to help free up valuable desk space.\\n- The HP Compaq LE2002xi features adjustable height, tilt and swivel settings to allow for comfortable positioning.\\n\\n<b>Reduce your impact<\/b>\\nWith the use of Mercury-free LEDs, BFR\/PVC-free components, Arsenic-free display glass, an ENERGY STAR\u00ae qualification, an EPEAT\u00ae Silver registration, and a TCO Displays certification, this monitor can help reduce your impact.\\n\\n<b>Boost your performance<\/b>\\nGet crisp, clear, views on a 50,8 cm (20\u201d) diagonal, 1600 x 900 native resolution screen with a 3M:1 DCR, up to a 170\u00b0 viewing angle, and fast 5ms response times. As well, DVD-D and VGA inputs enable advanced connectivity.\\n\\n<b>Relax with HP reliability<\/b>\\nLimited three-year parts, labor, and on-site service, including backlight. Availability varies by region. Certain restrictions and exclusions apply. For details, contact HP Customer Support."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Ce moniteur r\u00e9tro\u00e9clair\u00e9 \u00e0 LED \u00e9quip\u00e9 d'un socle IWC (Integrated Work Center) int\u00e8gre des solutions \u00e9cologiques et offre un affichage net et clair id\u00e9al pour les environnements restreints en espace.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>\u00c9conome en espace<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;L'\u00e9cran LCD LE2002xi HP\u00a0Compaq, \u00e0 la fois \u00e9l\u00e9gant et compact, offre un bel aspect dans n'importe quel environnement gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 sa silhouette mince et \u00e0 son faible encombrement.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Respect de l'environnement<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Avec l'utilisation de LED sans mercure, de composants sans BFR\/PVC, d'un verre d'\u00e9cran sans arsenic<SUP>1<\/SUP>, une qualification ENERGY STAR\u00ae, un enregistrement EPEAT\u00ae Silver et une certification d'\u00e9cran TCO, cet \u00e9cran contribue \u00e0 r\u00e9duire votre impact environnemental.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Des performances optimis\u00e9es<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Profitez d'un visionnement net et d\u00e9taill\u00e9 sur un \u00e9cran d'une diagonale de 20\u00a0pouces\u00a0(50,8\u00a0cm) et d'une r\u00e9solution native de 1\u00a0600\u00a0x\u00a0900 avec un taux de contraste dynamique de 3M:1, un angle de visualisation allant jusqu'\u00e0 170\u00b0 et des temps de r\u00e9ponse courts de 5\u00a0ms<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Par ailleurs, les entr\u00e9es DVD-D et VGA offrent une connectivit\u00e9 avanc\u00e9e.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>D\u00e9tendez-vous avec la fiabilit\u00e9 HP<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Garantie limit\u00e9e 3\u00a0ans, pi\u00e8ces, main-d'\u0153uvre et intervention sur site, r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage compris. La disponibilit\u00e9 varie selon les r\u00e9gions. Certaines restrictions et exclusions sont applicables. Pour en savoir plus, contactez l'Assistance client\u00e8le HP.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Les m\u00e9thodes de test U.S. EPA 3052\/6010b d'ICP-AES n'ont d\u00e9tect\u00e9 ni arsenic ni compos\u00e9s d'arsenic.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Toutes les sp\u00e9cifications de performance sont les sp\u00e9cifications nominales fournies par les fabricants de composants HP\u00a0; les performances r\u00e9elles peuvent \u00eatre plus \u00e9lev\u00e9es ou plus faibles.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":20,"unit":"INCH"}}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"3.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"941ccbb3-1921-45e7-9ec1-be2c86bbe7a7","identifier":"11702466","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales","viewsonic"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Viewsonic Value Series VA2231WMA-LED"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The ViewSonic\u00ae VA2231wma-LED LCD is ideal for both home and office with its fast response time and piano black finish VESA\u00ae mountable design. Environmentally friendly mercury-free VA2231wma-LED offers full HD 1920x1080 resolution, 10,000,000:1 MEGA dynamic contrast ratio and analog inputs, integrated stereo speakers and Eco-mode for power savings! It has an automatic aspect ratio adjustment so when your input is a 4:3 signal, the image will not be stretched but instead it will be positioned in the middle of the screen with side bars. Industry\u2019s best pixel performance policy, Windows 7 certification, Energy Star 5.0 and TCO 5.0 certified, make the VA2231wma-LED the best choice for both corporate and education customers as well.\\n\\n<b>Eco-mode automatically reduces power consumption and can extend backlight life and reduce operating power consumption by up to 70%<\/b>\\n\\n<b>High brightness and 10,000,000 DCR to reflect the true colour<\/b>\\n250 nits high brightness delivers precise accurate colour to realistically display a full array of brilliant shades and hues.\\n\\n<b>Impressive 10,000,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio provides greater detail and definition<\/b>\\nProvides darker black levels and better overall front-ofscreen performance.\\n\\n<b>Performance HD 1080p pour un affichage HD in\u00e9gal\u00e9<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Ultra-Slim Bezel<\/b>\\nThe ultra-slim bezel makes more productive use of the screen area while minimizing the image gap in multi display applications for continuous data display which enhances the visual experience with clean, minimalist borders around the active image area."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6eccbf48-85df-4189-8278-fb127159535d","identifier":"11704286","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["kyocera","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kyocera FS-1135MFP"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Geringste Druckkosten seiner Klasse\\n- Bis zu 35 Seiten A4 pro Minute (Druck\/Kopie)\\n- Bis zu 35 SW-Scans pro Minute bzw. 14 Farb-Scans pro Minute\\n- Erste Kopie bereits nach 6,9 Sekunden\\n- Integrierte Duplex-Funktionalit\u00e4t f\u00fcr beidseitiges Drucken, Kopieren, Scannen und Faxen\\n- 300 Blatt Papierkapazit\u00e4t, maximal 800 Blatt\\n- Vertraulicher Druck mit pers\u00f6nlicher PIN-Code-Abfrage (Speichererweiterung erforderlich)\\n- Kostenstellenmanagement\\n- Einfache Authentifizierung mit optionalem USB-Kartenleser\\n- USB Host f\u00fcr direktes Drucken und Scannen ohne PC"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Up to 35 pages per minute in A4\\n- Time to first copy: 6.9 seconds\\n- Double sided print, copy, scan and fax functionality as standard\\n- 50 sheet document processor scans double sided originals\\n- Up to 2 optional paper feeders for up to 800 sheets\\n- High security through SSL, IPsec and Private Print (requires additional memory) functionality\\n- Print from and scan to USB memory\\n- Exceptionally low printing costs in its class\\n- Automatic Power Off mode provides lowest power consumption"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Flexibilit\u00e9 du papier : jusqu\u2019\u00e0 4 entr\u00e9es papier incluant les options et le bac polyvalent\\n- Rapidit\u00e9 : 1\u00e8re impression en moins de 7 secondes\\n- La fonction d\u2019impression priv\u00e9e (M\u00e9moire additionnelle n\u00e9cessaire) permet de lib\u00e9rer le document gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019entr\u00e9e d\u2019un code\\n- Facilit\u00e9 d\u2019impression: impression directe depuis le port USB\\n- Compatible avec l\u2019Active Directory pour un gain de temps lors de l\u2019envoi d\u2019un scan vers e-mail\\n- Ecologique : programmation du mode arr\u00eat automatique pour une consommation de 0,5 W"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"656d50c3-d346-4dad-bd6a-3c0b707d2c9b","identifier":"11704300","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon i-SENSYS MF4410"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Dieses kompakt-elegante SW-Laser-Multifunktionssystem mit Drucker, Kopierer und Scanner ist ideal f\u00fcr zu Hause, in kleinen B\u00fcros und punktet mit Produktivit\u00e4t, Komfort und hoher Energieeffizienz.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n- SW-Laser-Multifunktionssystem: Drucker, Kopierer und Scanner.\\n- Elegantes, Platz sparendes Design.\\n- Anwenderfreundliches, intuitiv zu bedienendes LCD.\\n- Bis zu 23 SW-Drucke\/Min.; Druck der ersten Seite nach nur ca. 9 Sekunden.\\n- Druckaufl\u00f6sung von bis zu 1.200 x 600 dpi f\u00fcr qualitativ hochwertige Ausdrucke und Kopien.\\n- Energieeffizient.\\n\\n<b>Das kompakte, elegante 3-in-1 Multifunktionssystem f\u00fcr zu Hause<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Elegant und kompakt<\/b>\\nDieses kompakte Multifunktionssystem \u00fcberzeugt mit einem attraktiven Preis-Leistungs-Verh\u00e4ltnis: Neben Kopieren und Scannen ist es ideal f\u00fcr das Drucken von Dokumenten in ausgezeichneter Druckqualit\u00e4t. Mit seinem eleganten, vollst\u00e4ndig in schwarz gehaltenem Design und der kleinen Stellfl\u00e4che ist das System ein Blickfang auf jedem Schreibtisch und ideal f\u00fcr den Einsatz im B\u00fcro oder zu Hause.\\n\\n<b>Exzellente Bildqualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nDie interpolierte Druckaufl\u00f6sung von 1.200 x 600 dpi liefert professionell aussehende Laserdrucke mit gestochen scharfem Text und detailgetreuen Grafiken.\\n\\n<b>Komfortable Bedienung<\/b>\\nDas LC-Display des i-SENSYS MF4410 ist klar, intuitiv verst\u00e4ndlich und optimiert f\u00fcr maximalen Bedienkomfort. Ein 5-zeiliges LC-Display und die animierte Benutzerf\u00fchrung erh\u00f6hen den Bedienkomfort; Sie k\u00f6nnen schnell und einfach auf die Funktionen zugreifen, alle erforderlichen Informationen werden verst\u00e4ndlich angezeigt. Das spart Zeit und M\u00fche!\\n\\n<b>Zeitsparend und effizient<\/b>\\nBei einer Druckgeschwindigkeit von ca. 23 Seiten pro Minute und der Ausgabe der ersten Seite nach nur ca. 9 Sekunden k\u00f6nnen Sie sicher sein, Ihre Ausdrucke und Kopien immer sofort zur Hand haben, wenn Sie sie ben\u00f6tigen. Dank der Quick First-Print-Technologien geh\u00f6ren lange Wartezeiten vor dem Drucker der Vergangenheit an. Dieses umweltfreundliche System ben\u00f6tigt gerade einmal ca. 3 Watt im Sleep-Modus \u2013 das spart Energie.\\n\\n<b>Vielseitiges Scannen von Farbdokumenten<\/b>\\nDas Scannen von farbigen Dokumenten und Fotos wird mit einer Aufl\u00f6sung von bis zu 600 dpi zum Kinderspiel. Mithilfe der MF Toolbox lassen sich Daten direkt als E-Mail-Anhang oder durchsuchbare PDF-Dateien scannen \u2013 so finden sich Informationen sp\u00e4ter leichter wieder.\\n\\n<b>All-in-One-Cartridge<\/b>\\nDie recycelbare All-in-One Cartridge sorgt f\u00fcr gleichbleibend hochwertige Druckqualit\u00e4t und minimiert den Wartungsaufwand. Sie enth\u00e4lt neben dem Toner auch die Trommel und die Reinigungseinheit \u2013 nach dem Austausch mit einer original Canon Lasercartridge ist das Multifunktionssystem wieder so gut wie neu."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"This stylish mono laser 3-in-1 offers print, copy and scan functions in one compact device. Ideal for homes and small offices it\u2019s productive, easy-to-use and energy efficient.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n- Mono laser 3-in-1: print, copy & scan.\\n- Stylish, space-saving design.\\n- Easy to use intuitive LCD display.\\n- 23 ppm, 9 seconds First Copy Out Time.\\n- Up to 1200 x 600 dpi resolution for prints and copies.\\n- Energy efficient.\\n\\n<b>The compact, stylish 3-in-1 multifunctional for personal use<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Stylish and compact<\/b>\\nOffering excellent value for money, this sleek multifunctional provides high quality print, copy and scan functionality in one space saving unit. With its stylish all black design and small footprint, it looks great on any desk and is perfect for both home and small office use.\\n\\n<b>Superior image quality<\/b>\\nAn enhanced print resolution of up to 1200 x 600 dpi delivers professional laser output for all your work, with sharp text and fine graphics.\\n\\n<b>Easy to use<\/b>\\nThe i-SENSYS MF4410 features a simple and intuitive LCD interface designed for easy operation. With 5 lines of text plus animations, features can be quickly and easily accessed and more information can be communicated saving time and effort.\\n\\n<b>Time saving and efficient<\/b>\\nWith an output speed of 23 ppm and a Fast First Copy Out Time of less than 9 seconds, prints and copies are delivered the moment you need them. With quick recovery from sleep mode, thanks to Quick First-Print technologies, long waits for your documents are a thing of the past. Additionally, this economical device uses only 3 watts in sleep mode, ensuring energy efficiency.\\n\\n<b>Versatile colour scanning<\/b>\\nScanning colour documents and photos is easy and highly versatile using a resolution as high as 9600 x 9600 dpi. Files can be scanned directly to email, or searchable PDF using the MF Toolbox, enabling them to be quickly retrieved in the future.\\n\\n<b>All-in-One cartridge<\/b>\\nThe All-In-One recyclable cartridge ensures maintenance-free operation and continuous high quality output. Replace the compact cartridge in seconds \u2013 containing toner, drum and cleaning units \u2013 with an Authentic Canon Laser Cartridge and your multifunctional is as good as new."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Ce multifonction laser noir et blanc 3-en-1 \u00e9l\u00e9gant permet l'impression, la copie et la num\u00e9risation. Id\u00e9al pour les particuliers et les bureaux de petite taille, il est performant, simple \u00e0 utiliser et \u00e9conome en \u00e9nergie.\\n\\n<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/b>\\n- Multifonction laser noir et blanc 3-en-1 : imprimez, copiez et num\u00e9risez.\\n- Design \u00e9l\u00e9gant et peu encombrant.\\n- \u00c9cran LCD intuitif simple \u00e0 utiliser.\\n- 23 ppm, premi\u00e8re copie en 9 secondes.\\n- R\u00e9solution jusqu'\u00e0 1200 x 600 dpi pour des impressions et des copies de qualit\u00e9 sup\u00e9rieure.\\n- Faible consommation d'\u00e9nergie.\\n\\n<b>Multifonction 3-en-1 compact et \u00e9l\u00e9gant destin\u00e9 \u00e0 une utilisation personnelle<\/b>\\n\\n<b>\u00c9l\u00e9gant et compact<\/b>\\nCe multifonction \u00e9l\u00e9gant offre un excellent rapport qualit\u00e9-prix. Il r\u00e9unit des fonctions d'impression, de copie et de num\u00e9risation haute qualit\u00e9 au sein d'un seul appareil tr\u00e8s compact. Avec son design noir \u00e9pur\u00e9 et son faible encombrement, il ne d\u00e9parera pas votre bureau. Il convient aussi bien aux particuliers qu'aux petites entreprises.\\n\\n<b>Qualit\u00e9 d'image sup\u00e9rieure<\/b>\\nLa r\u00e9solution d'impression optimis\u00e9e de 1200 x 600 dpi permet de r\u00e9aliser des sorties laser professionnelles pour tous vos travaux, avec des impressions de texte nettes et des images claires.\\n\\n<b>Simplicit\u00e9 d'utilisation<\/b>\\nL'i-SENSYS MF4410 comporte une interface LCD simple et intuitive qui fait de son utilisation un jeu d'enfant. Gr\u00e2ce aux 5 lignes de texte et aux animations de cette interface, vous acc\u00e9dez rapidement aux fonctions et obtenez des informations qui vous font \u00e9conomiser temps et efforts.\\n\\n<b>\u00c9conomie de temps et d'\u00e9nergie<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la vitesse d'impression de 23 ppm et \u00e0 la sortie de la premi\u00e8re feuille en moins de 9 secondes, les impressions et les copies sont r\u00e9alis\u00e9es en temps et en heure. Avec les technologies \u00ab Quick First Print \u00bb (impression premi\u00e8re page rapide), l'appareil sort imm\u00e9diatement du mode veille : les longues attentes appartiennent d\u00e9sormais au pass\u00e9. De plus, cet appareil \u00e9conomique ne consomme que 3 watts en mode veille, et assure ainsi des \u00e9conomies d'\u00e9nergie.\\n\\n<b>Num\u00e9risation couleur polyvalente<\/b>\\nNum\u00e9riser des documents et des photos couleur se fait tr\u00e8s simplement, et l'appareil offre une grande polyvalence avec une r\u00e9solution pouvant atteindre 9600 x 9600 dpi. Les fichiers num\u00e9ris\u00e9s peuvent \u00eatre instantan\u00e9ment envoy\u00e9s par courriel. \u00c0 l'aide de MF Toolbox, vous pouvez \u00e9galement les convertir en PDF avec fonction de recherche, ce qui vous permettra de les retrouver rapidement \u00e0 l'avenir.\\n\\n<b>Cartouche Tout-en-Un<\/b>\\nLa cartouche Tout-en-Un recyclable garantit un fonctionnement sans entretien et des sorties d'une qualit\u00e9 constante. Quelques secondes suffisent \u00e0 remplacer la cartouche compacte (qui comprend le toner, le tambour et les unit\u00e9s de nettoyage) par une cartouche laser Canon authentique, et votre multifonction fonctionnera comme au premier jour."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9580d7cb-40f4-4a6a-8094-ec3f30b165e0","identifier":"11704310","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["kyocera","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kyocera FS-1030MFP\/DP\/KL3"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- G\u00fcnstige Druckkosten dank ECOSYS-Technologie\\n- Bis zu 30 Seiten A4 pro Minute (Druck\/Kopie)\\n- Bis zu 35 SW-Scans pro Minute bzw. 14 Farb-Scans pro Minute\\n- Integrierte Duplex-Funktionalit\u00e4t f\u00fcr beidseitiges Drucken, Kopieren und Scannen\\n- Erste Druckseite bereits nach 6 Sekunden\\n- Erste Kopie schon nach 6,9 Sekunden\\n- Integrierte Duplex-Einheit f\u00fcr beidseitige Ausdrucke\\n- 300 Blatt Papierkapazit\u00e4t, maximal 800 Blatt\\n- Vertraulicher Druck mit pers\u00f6nlicher PIN-Code-Abfrage (Speichererweiterung erforderlich)\\n- Kostenstellenmanagement\\n- Einfache Authentifizierung mit optionalem USB-Kartenleser\\n- USB Host f\u00fcr direktes Drucken und Scannen ohne PC"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Up to 30 pages per minute in A4\\n- Time to first copy: 6.9 seconds\\n- 5-line LCD display for clear messages and ease of use\\n- Print, copy and scan functionality as standard\\n- Duplex unit for cost saving double sided printing\\n- 50 sheet document processor scans double sided originals\\n- Copy with ease double sided ID-cards on a single sheet of paper\\n- Auto-power-off-mode provides lowest power consumption"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1db467ab-881a-4c75-b633-1c67dc3d3cef","identifier":"11747429","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 241P4QPYES"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der Philips PowerSensor AMVA LED-Monitor verwendet 65\u00a0% wiederverwertete Kunststoffe. Mit seinem ohne PVC und bromierte Flammschutzmittel hergestellten Geh\u00e4use ist er somit umweltfreundlich und produktiv zugleich."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Philips PowerSensor AMVA LED display using 65% post consumer recycled plastics and PVC, BFR free housing is ideal for eco-friendly productivity\\n<b>Sustainable Eco-design<\/b>\\n- PowerSensor saves up to 80% energy costs\\n- Zero power consumption with 0 watt hard switch\\n- 65% post consumer recycled plastics with TCO Edge\\n- PVC-BFR free housing\\n<b>Brilliant performance<\/b>\\n- AMVA LED for wide-view super-high contrast, vivid images\\n- DisplayPort offers audio and video over a single, long cable\\n- Built-in stereo speakers for multimedia\\n<b>Designed for people<\/b>\\n- SmartErgoBase enables people-friendly ergonomic adjustments\\n- Low bezel-to-table height for maximum reading comfort\\n<b>Easy to experience<\/b>\\n- SmartImage presets for easy optimized image settings\\n- USB Hub with 4 ports for easy connection"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Utilisant 65\u00a0% de plastiques issus d'un recyclage post-consommation et ne contenant ni PVC ni BFR, cet \u00e9cran LED AMVA Philips PowerSensor est la solution id\u00e9ale pour combiner productivit\u00e9 et respect de l'environnement"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":6}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a2d83193-866c-483b-8ff3-abf595881425","identifier":"11753192","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["dell","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"DELL P2312H"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Create your vision of success.<\/b>\\n\\nInspire your team with productivity-boosting performance, all-day comfort and energy-conscious features on this spacious Full-HD 23\"(58 cm) monitor with LED.\\n\\n- Help reduce energy usage: Remote asset management, PowerNap software, Dynamic dimming and scheduling features help eliminate excess energy usage.\\n- Enhance productivity: Manage big projects in maximum comfort with full adjustability features such as tilt, pivot, swivel and a generous height adjustment range.\\n- Maintain a healthy workspace: The 23\" (58 cm) DellTM P2312H monitor is designed to have a minimal impact on your environment. It\u2019s BFR\/PVC-free (excluding cables) and has an arsenic-free and mercury-free LED panel.\\n\\n<b>One vivid view. One smart move.<\/b>\\n\\nTackle big projects in comfort with the 23\" (58 cm) Dell P2312H monitor. Vivid clarity and improved adjustability and rotation features make this monitor an intelligent choice.\\n\\n<b>Performance meets productivity.<\/b>\\nWhether you\u2019re working multiple spreadsheets, reviewing patient files, writing legal briefs or analyzing the stock market, the clarity and performance of the 23\" (58 cm) P2312H monitor inspire productivity.\\n\\n- See your work in a new light: Enjoy the sharp imagery provided by Full HD (1920 x 1080 (max.) resolution and a high dynamic contrast ratio of 2,000,000:1 (typical).\\n- Discover a world of colour: Watch as vivid colour makes presentations come alive with a high colour gamut of 84%4 and a colour depth of 16.7 million colours.\\n- Make connections easily: Plug into productivity with a wide assortment of connectivity options, including DVI, VGA and USB ports for your peripherals."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-16T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d9e14a8e-8f57-458c-81e0-8bc94037913a","identifier":"11759619","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung MV 800"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Looking to take outstanding photos? Then look for the unexpected angles! Presenting the Samsung MV800 with the Flip-out Display, the camera that lets you easily capture life in ways you never could before. With the MV800\u2019s wide range of features, you can approach the shot from every direction, and explore every artistic possibility. Shoot from overhead or from down low \u2014 you\u2019ll add a dynamic sense of drama you simply can\u2019t find in a picture taken straight on. Then use the Flip-out Display as a kickstand to prop up the camera, and instantly play back your brilliant shots for everybody to enjoy.\\n\\n<b>The Flip-out Display - Life, from all angles<\/b>\\nEasily capture your unique perspective. The MV800\u2019s 3.0\" Display flips up and down so you can frame shots at any angle without having to twist your body or bend your back. Snap a high-angle shot over a crowd to effortlessly capture a street performance, or get waist-level candids of your dog. Take low angle shots without getting on the ground, or spin the display all the way around for dazzling self-portraits.The LCD lets you stand the camera so everyone can enjoy from a comfortable position. Life\u2019s more fun when you can cover all the angles.\\n\\n<b>Stylish design that captures your imagination<\/b>\\nEngineered for the style-conscious, the MV800 has a slim, sleek, minimalist form that\u2019s as impressive as its photographic functions. From the bolts to the lens barrel, the camera\u2019s striking, sensuous front case is uniformly crafted from shimmering metal. All complements by the stunning 3.0\" touchscreen.\\n\\n<b>Elevate your photography with high picture quality<\/b>\\nWhether you\u2019re hitting the boutiques with friends, or enjoying mocha lattes and conversation at a caf\u00e9, capture the moment perfectly with the high-res quality of 16.1 mega pixels. But don\u2019t stop there: the 5x optical zoom lets you get up close to get even closer to your friends . And should a whole group of friends decide to join you, get them all in the picture too \u2014 the MV800 features a 26mm wide-angle lens that lets you go really wide to ensure you get every smile in the picture.\\n\\n<b>Personalise your home screen with Smart touch 3.0<\/b>\\nIf you already have a smartphone with a touchscreen, then you\u2019ll feel right at home with the MV800\u2019s interface \u2014 and right at home with the wallpaper you choose. Smart Touch 3.0 lets you drag and scroll through menu options intuitively and effortlessly to launch the feature you want \u2014 with one touch. And it\u2019s your camera \u2014 so put your personal stamp on the display with customisable wallpaper. The MV800 comes with great backgrounds to choose from \u2014 or, for even more fun, personalise the wallpaper with your current favorite image. Then show it off to anyone, anytime!\\n\\n<b>Show both side of the story with picture in picture shot<\/b>\\nWhy settle for one picture when you can have two at the same time? Picture in Picture Shot lets you insert one image within another, to capture the full, glorious story you want to share. Snap a picture of a friend bowling a strike, then combine it with an image of everyone cheering the score. Adjust the size and position of the smaller picture to create endless variations.\\n\\n<b>See what you're going to get with Live panorama<\/b>\\nWith Live Panorama, you can practically capture the whole wide world without having to step back! Live Panorama lets you see the final image in advance, so you know you\u2019re getting the picture you want. It\u2019s as simple as holding down the shutter button and sweeping the camera across the scene.\\n\\n<b>Bring on the laughter with funny face<\/b>\\nWho needs a funhouse mirror when you have the MV800 handy? The Funny Face feature lets you bend, stretch and warp the portraits of friends and family to hilarious effect. Simply tap the screen to enlarge heads or noses, or drag your fingers across the screen to radically distort faces. Face Tracking ensures that the distorted face remains the same, even if you move the camera.\\n\\n<b>Add hocus pocus to your photo with Magic Frame<\/b>\\nMake a portrait look like an antique, or put your face on a rising moon \u2014 Magic Frame\u2019s 12 background templates offer lots of picture-taking enjoyment. You can even rub an area of a photo to create your own Magic Frame, and insert another image. Add your friend to a group shot or add yourself to a crowd. There are many possibilities for fun \u2014 especially when you share the poster-quality results!\\n\\n<b>More fun, more artistry with Smart Filter<\/b>\\nBoost creative fun with Smart Filter 3.0 \u2014 right on the display! Cartoon Filter makes any photo look like an animated film scene while Cross Filter makes light sources appear to have several points of light, like stars. And Zooming Shot adds motion lines to make it look like you\u2019re speeding towards your subject. There\u2019s also Water Paint, Oil Painting, Half-tone Dot \u2014 and more!"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"27715ad0-ab98-4506-a6cf-b8fca1c7418f","identifier":"11770023","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung B2030N"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung B2030N. Display resolution: 1600 x 900, Display: LCD, Contrast ratio (typical): 1000:1. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 75 x 75. Power consumption (standby): 0.3. Depth: 69.5, Height: 330.1. Windows operating systems supported: Windows Vista Home Basic"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Son nouveau design chic ajoutera certainement une touche de style au lieu o\u00f9 vous d\u00e9ciderez de le placer. Les fonctionnalit\u00e9s telles que MagicBright et MagicColour vous offrent plus de contr\u00f4le sur ce que vous voyez, tandis que 4 niveaux d\u2019\u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie vous propose un choix encore plus vari\u00e9 lorsqu\u2019il s\u2019agit de surveiller votre empreinte de carbone.\\n<br\/><b>Entrez dans les d\u00e9tails.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Les diff\u00e9rences font toute la diff\u00e9rence. C'est pour cette raison que le r\u00e9glage du r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage automatique au rapport de contraste ultra-\u00e9lev\u00e9 de 50 000:1 cr\u00e9e des tons sombres plus spectaculaires et profonds et des tons clairs plus \u00e9clatants et \u00e9poustouflants. Vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais profiter d'images qui refl\u00e8tent la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des couleurs riches et vives et une intensit\u00e9 naturelle et \u00e9clatante. Lorsqu'il s'agit des d\u00e9tails, les moniteurs conventionnels font tout simplement p\u00e2le figure.\\n<br\/><b>Des performances \u00e0 haute vitesse parfaites<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un temps de r\u00e9ponse de 5 ms, vous \u00eates assur\u00e9 que les performances de votre moniteur seront parfaites, m\u00eame pour les sc\u00e8nes d\u2019action les plus rapides. Ce traitement d'image incroyablement homog\u00e8ne permet de visionner des films, des jeux et du contenu diffus\u00e9 sur Internet avec la plus haute pr\u00e9cision et sans aucun tremblement, flou et tra\u00een\u00e9e pouvant appara\u00eetre sur un moniteur plus lent, ce qui vous permet de profiter d\u2019une exp\u00e9rience visuelle totale.\\n<br\/><b>Contr\u00f4lez la luminosit\u00e9 et \u00e9conomisez l\u2019\u00e9nergie.<\/b>\\n<br\/>La fonction Magic Eco facilite l\u2019\u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie. Elle permet de r\u00e9gler la luminosit\u00e9 du moniteur Samsung sur base de la quantit\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9nergie que vous souhaitez \u00e9conomiser.  Vous pouvez choisir parmi quatre options d\u2019\u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie: 100%, 75%, et 50%, ainsi que Power saving off (Economie d\u2019\u00e9nergie d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9e).  Si vous d\u00e9sactivez Magic Eco, vous profiterez n\u00e9anmoins de la fonction Magic Bright de Samsung qui est con\u00e7ue pour vous permettre de r\u00e9gler manuellement la luminosit\u00e9 de l\u2019\u00e9cran. Ne vous souciez plus d\u2019\u00e9conomiser de l\u2019\u00e9nergie et prenez le contr\u00f4le gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Magic Eco.\\n<br\/><b>R\u00e9duisez la fatigue visuelle. Am\u00e9liorez votre exp\u00e9rience visuelle.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Comment aimez-vous regarder un film? Aimez-vous vous coucher sur le canap\u00e9? Vous asseoir sur votre si\u00e8ge favori? Aimez-vous cuisiner ou faire de l\u2019exercice? Quelle que soit votre position, la fonction Magic Angle de Samsung permet au film de toujours occuper le devant de la sc\u00e8ne. Il vous permet \u00e9galement de profiter d\u2019un confort optimal. Quel que soit l\u2019endroit o\u00f9 vous placez le moniteur Samsung, ses 5 modes de gestion d\u2019angle vous permettent d\u2019\u00e9tendre son angle de vision afin que vous ayez toujours l\u2019impression de faire face \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9cran. Ainsi, ne tendez plus le cou et profitez du film.\\n<br\/><b>Ressentez les effets de la couleur<\/b>\\n<br\/>Am\u00e9liorez vos images \u00e0 votre mani\u00e8re via la fonctionnalit\u00e9 avanc\u00e9e Color Effect. D\u00e9couvrez une exp\u00e9rience visuelle enti\u00e8rement personnalis\u00e9e en utilisant des effets photographiques qui correspondent \u00e0 votre humeur. Choisissez parmi les effets Aqua, S\u00e9pia, Vert et Niveaux de gris afin d\u2019interagir avec votre \u00e9cran de fa\u00e7on tout \u00e0 fait novatrice \u2013 c\u2019est-\u00e0-dire la v\u00f4tre."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":20,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"818b93f6-a121-48ce-8f4a-4e256dd4990c","identifier":"11776556","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 196V3LSB2"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Enjoy great LED pictures in vivid colours<\/b>\\nThis attractive, slim display is a delight to use. Essential features like SmartContrast that\\nensure rich, bright images make it a great choice!\\n<b>Great picture quality<\/b>\\n- LED technology for natural colours\\n- SmartContrast 10,000,000:1 for incredibly rich black details\\n<b>Design that complements any interior<\/b>\\n- Attractive slim, glossy design\\n- Small footprint to blend into any lifestyle\\n<b>Greener every day<\/b>\\n- Mercury Free eco-friendly display\\n- Energy Star for energy efficiency and low power consumption\\n<b>Great convenience<\/b>\\n- Easy display performance tuning with SmartControl Lite\\n\\n<b>LED technology for natural colours<\/b>\\nWhite LED's are solid state devices which light up to full, consistent brightness faster saving startup time. LED's are free from mercury content, which allows for eco-friendly recycling and disposal process. LED's allow for better dimming control of the LCD backlight, resulting in a super high contrast ratio. It also gives superior colour reproduction thanks to consistent brightness across the screen.\\n\\n<b>SmartContrast 10,000,000:1 for incredibly rich black details<\/b>\\nYou want the LCD flat display with the highest contrast and most vibrant images. Philips advanced video processing combined with unique extreme dimming and backlight-boosting technology results in vibrant images. SmartContrast will increase the contrast with excellent black level and accurate rendition of dark shades and colours. It gives a bright, lifelike picture with high contrast and vibrant colours.\\n\\n<b>Easy display performance tuning with SmartControl Lite<\/b>\\nSmartControl Lite is the next generation 3D icon-based GUI monitor control software. This allows the user to fine-tune most parameters of the monitor like Colour, Brightness, screen calibration, Multimedia, ID management etc with the mouse.\\n\\n<b>Mercury Free eco-friendly display<\/b>\\nPhilips monitors with LED backlighting are free of Mercury content, one of the most toxic natural substances, which affects humans and animals. This allows for an eco-friendly display throughout its life-cycle, from manufacturing to disposal.\\n\\n<b>Energy Star for energy efficiency and low power consumption<\/b>\\nEnergy Star is a US EPA sponsored energy efficiency programme also adopted by many other countries. Energy Star certification ensures that you are buying a product which meets the latest power efficiency standards and which operates with maximum power efficiency at all operational levels. New Philips monitors are certified for Energy Star 5.0 specifications and meet or exceed the standard. For example, in sleep mode Energy Star 5.0 requires less than 1 Watt power consumption, whereas Philips monitors consume less than 0.5 Watts."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec son design fin et \u00e9l\u00e9gant, cet \u00e9cran est facile \u00e0 utiliser. Les fonctions essentielles, dont SmartContrast, vous permettent de b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier d'images profondes et lumineuses. Ce mod\u00e8le est exceptionnel\u00a0!"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-22T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8415845e-7c0a-4a0f-bee7-055b09b5c195","identifier":"11811252","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["n"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung SCX-3405W multifunctional"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der Samsung SCX-3405W kombiniert Kosteneffizienz und Leistung. Das Multifunktionsger\u00e4t unterst\u00fctzt eine einfache Kostenverwaltung, damit Sie Ihr Budget halten k\u00f6nnen. Der Drucker ist sehr einfach in der Handhabung, macht Schnelldrucke m\u00f6glich und bietet weitere n\u00fctzliche Funktionen wie die One-Touch-Eco-Taste, eine einfache Druckerverwaltung und kabelloses Drucken von mobilen Ger\u00e4ten. Sparen Sie Platz und Geld mit dem Multifunktionsger\u00e4t SCX-3405W.\\n\\n<b>Umweltfreundlich mit One Touch<\/b>\\nMit einem einfachen Knopfdruck aktivieren Sie die umweltfreundliche One-Touch-Eco-Funktion und der Drucker stellt s\u00e4mtliche Funktionen automatisch auf die umweltfreundlichste Variante ein. Von der Tonersparfunktion bis hin zum Duplexdruck \u2013 der Drucker stellt auf Energiesparen und liefert weiterhin professionelle Ausdrucke. Die Ergebnisse k\u00f6nnen sich sehen lassen \u2013 und das mit nur einem Knopfdruck.\\n\\n<b>Verbessern Sie Ihre Ausdrucke mit dem Easy Eco Driver<\/b>\\nDurch die Anzeige des CO2-Aussto\u00dfes, der verbrauchten Energie und des Papierbedarfs k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihre Druckereinstellungen ganz auf Ihre Arbeitsziele zuschneiden. Der Easy Eco Driver optimiert Ihre Druckvorg\u00e4nge, ganz gleich ob es Ihnen um Kostenreduzierung oder Energieersparnis geht.\\n\\n<b>Einfache Druckerverwaltung<\/b>\\nDruckvorg\u00e4nge gelingen leicht mit Samsungs Easy Print Manager. Jedes Detail, von Tonerstand und Arbeitsnachweis bis Ger\u00e4teeinstellungen und Onlinebestellungen, wird in einem leicht zu bedienenden Programm gespeichert.\\n\\n<b>Samsung MobilePrint<\/b>\\nMachen Sie mehr aus Ihren mobilen Ger\u00e4ten: Mit der Samsung MobilePrint-Funktion wird das Drucken von Fotos, Webseiten, PDF-Dateien usw., die sich auf Ihrem mobilen Ger\u00e4t befinden, zu einer ganz einfachen Angelegenheit. Egal ob es sich um ein Android- oder iOS-basiertes Smartphone oder Tablet handelt \u2013 suchen Sie einfach nach der \u201eSamsung MobilePrint\u201c-App und drucken Sie die gew\u00fcnschten Inhalte aus. Es k\u00f6nnte nicht einfacher sein.\\n\\n<b>Besser arbeiten mit Schnelldruck<\/b>\\nVerschwenden Sie keine Zeit: Drucken Sie kleine oder gro\u00dfe Dokumente mit einer Druckgeschwindigkeit von 20 Seiten pro Minute. Verbessern Sie Produktivit\u00e4t und Workflow in Ihrem B\u00fcro und drucken Sie wichtige Dokumente in hoher Qualit\u00e4t und v\u00f6llig stressfrei.\\n\\n<b>3-in-1-Funktion f\u00fcr besseres Arbeiten<\/b>\\nDie 3-in-1-Funktion des SCX-3405W rationalisiert Ihre Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe und sorgt daf\u00fcr, dass Ihre Druckvorg\u00e4nge so effizient wie m\u00f6glich ablaufen. Drucken, Kopieren und Scannen \u2013 der SCX-3405W ist unglaublich flexibel und optimal f\u00fcr den modernen Arbeitsalltag ausger\u00fcstet.\\n\\n<b>Detailreiche Ausdrucke<\/b>\\nWenn Sie einen guten Eindruck machen m\u00f6chten, verlassen Sie sich auf die atemberaubende Aufl\u00f6sung von 1.200 x 1.200 dpi des Samsung SCX-3405W. Wichtige Ausdrucke wie Pr\u00e4sentationen oder Gutachten werden mit dieser hohen Aufl\u00f6sung besonders scharf und beeindruckend detailgenau.\\n\\n<b>Leistungsf\u00e4higkeit in kompaktem Design<\/b>\\nWenn Sie einen platzsparenden multifunktionalen Drucker f\u00fcr Ihr B\u00fcro suchen, ist der SCX-3405W genau die richtige Wahl f\u00fcr Sie. Er ist perfekt f\u00fcr kleine bis mittelgro\u00dfe B\u00fcros und Heimb\u00fcros geeignet. Dank des kompakten Designs ist der SCX-3405W auch mobiler als andere Laserdrucker und l\u00e4sst sich einfach an einen anderen Platz stellen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Discover economical printing that can easily be tailored to meet your budget and needs. One touch of the Samsung SCX-3405W multifunction printer\u2019s Eco Button takes you to Eco Mode, conserving paper, toner and power usage. With Easy Eco Driver, you can preview your print, and adjust and monitor toner use, print quality and more, as well as removing unnecessary page elements. Administration is easy, too, with integrated Easy Printer Manager software to streamline tasks like application linking and device discovery. You can even print directly from wireless devices \u2013 from PCs to smartphones and tablets - with a printer that\u2019s as feature-filled as it is economically-efficient.\\n\\n<b>Push the button. Save on print costs.<\/b>\\nOptimise your printing in one simple step with Samsung\u2019s One touch Eco Button. You can save on printing expenses when you quickly switch to Eco Mode and conserve toner, paper and energy. There\u2019s no need to waste time changing settings or altering your documents with this useful feature, as one touch is all you need to configure your printer to deliver the most economical results.\\n\\n<b>Optimise your printing with Easy Eco Driver<\/b>\\nEnjoy cost-optimised results every time you print thanks to Samsung\u2019s Easy-Eco Driver. With this useful software, you\u2019ll be able to accurately preview your document before printing and adjust quality, colour and other settings to meet your precise requirements and budget, as well as removing unnecessary text, images and other elements. You can even monitor savings, including paper, toner, energy and overall cost. Say goodbye to wasted printouts and discover more economically-efficient printing.\\n\\n<b>Simple and efficient printer management made easy<\/b>\\nDiscover simplified print management with Easy Printer Manager. This integrated EPM software allows you to quickly set up your device and monitor status using only simple-to-use software. Never worry about unexpectedly running out of toner again, as toner ordering, device discovery, application linking and other functions are all easily accessible with our Easy Printer Manager.\\n\\n<b>Setup is a cinch with our secure, one-touch wireless connection.<\/b>\\nThe SCX-3405W\u2019s One Touch Wi-Fi Setting lets you connect quickly and easily. Simply select the WPS (WiFi Protected Set-up) button on the access point (router), press the WPS button on the printer and you\u2019re done. Normally, you would have to spend time creating a wireless network name and manually entering a security key or password on all the wireless devices. But the ultra-convenient One Touch Wi-Fi Setting automatically configures \u2014 and protects \u2014 your wireless network for you.\\n\\n<b>Unleash your workforce with 3-in-1 functionality<\/b>\\nWith 3-in-1 versatility, the Samsung SCX-3405W printer streamlines workflow and ensures that the office print operation is working as efficient as possible. With print, copy and scan functionality, the SCX-3405W offers flexibility and lets you work with less barriers. A host of innovative features like ID Copy, N-up copy, Scan-to-email and the convenient PC fax functionality ensure that your workforce has the necessary functionality needed to thrive in the modern world of business.\\n\\n<b>Improve efficiency with compact design<\/b>\\nWith the growing demand for more space efficient office equipment, the Samsung SCX-3405W Laser Printer is a perfect choice. This compact multifunction printer delivers the standard in premium printing service without the excess of unwanted size. Small to medium businesses and home offices will find this printer ideal. And because it is so compact in design, it adds to its portability. So, save space and hassle with the Samsung SCX-3405W Laser Printer and its contemporary compact design.\\n\\n<b>Discover the power of easy mobile printing<\/b>\\nEnhance the productivity of your mobile devices with Samsung MobilePrint, available for both Android and iOS users. With this application, you can print directly from a wide range of smartphones, mobile tablets and more. You can also scan images to your device using the multifunction printer\u2019s scanner. MobilePrint makes wireless connections quickly and easily without setting up new network configurations or installing new drivers , so you can enjoy smart connectivity for a smarter workplace.\\n\\n<b>Achieve more with Samsung\u2019s Fast Print<\/b>\\nDon\u2019t settle for slow printing. With Samsung\u2019s faster printing speed of 20 pages per minute, you can minimise time wasted hanging around the printer. The enhanced printer performance will streamline workflows and let employees, and businesses, reach their full potential.\\n\\n<b>Give your print-outs standout detail<\/b>\\nIf you need to make an impression, nothing shows professionalism like the stunning 1200 x 1200dpi clarity produced by the Samsung SCX-3405W Laser Printer. High resolution printing of this caliber ensures that important print-outs, like work presentations and reports, are sharp and impressive. So, give your operation every chance of making a good impression with high resolution printing."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le mode \u00e9co est activ\u00e9 par simple pression sur la touche \"Eco\" et agit comme mode par d\u00e9faut une fois activ\u00e9. Il vous permet de r\u00e9duire votre consommation de papier gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression recto verso, \u00e0 l'impression recto 2 ou 4 pages par feuille et au param\u00e8tre d'\u00e9conomie de toner. En outre, le simulateur de r\u00e9sultat vous permet d'\u00e9valuer pr\u00e9cis\u00e9ment vos progr\u00e8s. La simulation vous montre votre niveau d'\u00e9missions de CO\u00b2, ainsi que votre consommation d'\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 et de papier. Le mode \u00e9co est une mani\u00e8re facile et pratique de surveiller la consommation de votre imprimante. Un avantage pour vous et pour la plan\u00e8te!\\n\\n<b>Optimisez vos impressions avec le pilote d'impression Easy Eco<\/b>\\nFaites des \u00e9conomies \u00e0 chaque impression gr\u00e2ce au pilote d'impression Easy Eco de Samsung. Ce logiciel pratique vous permet de pr\u00e9visualiser vos documents avant de les imprimer et d\u2019en ajuster la qualit\u00e9, la couleur et d'autres param\u00e8tres. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement supprimer le texte, les images ou d\u2019autres \u00e9l\u00e9ments dont vous n\u2019avez pas besoin. Vous pouvez m\u00eame contr\u00f4ler les \u00e9conomies r\u00e9alis\u00e9es (papier, encre, \u00e9lectricit\u00e9 et co\u00fbtl). D\u00e9couvrez une fa\u00e7on plus efficace et plus \u00e9conomique d\u2019imprimer.\\n\\n<b>Gestionnaire Easy Printer Manager<\/b>\\nCe programme de gestion facile \u00e0 utiliser contr\u00f4le l'utilisation du multifonction.\\nDes niveaux d'encre \u00e0 la comptabilisation des travaux d'impression en passant par les r\u00e9glages de l'appareil et les commandes en ligne, chaque d\u00e9tail est int\u00e9gr\u00e9. Il offre aussi la possibilit\u00e9 de surveiller plusieurs imprimantes Samsung \u00e0 distance sur un seul \u00e9cran.\\n\\n<b>Il est multit\u00e2che pour que vous n'ayez pas \u00e0 l'\u00eatre<\/b>\\nLa productivit\u00e9 est un \u00e9l\u00e9ment cl\u00e9 pour tout bureau et groupe de travail. Le multifonction SCX-3405W a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7u pour am\u00e9liorer la productivit\u00e9. Maintenant, vous pouvez imprimer, copier et scanner facilement et rapidement. Pourquoi encombrer un coin de votre bureau avec plusieurs machines quand le SCX-3405W peut tout faire?\\n\\n<b>Travaillez mieux gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'imprimante efficace<\/b>\\nImprimez rapidement des documents (petits et grands) gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la vitesse d'impression de 20 pages par minute.\\nUn multifonction fiable et efficace comme celui-ci deviendra tr\u00e8s vite un outil indispensable pour votre bureau. Vous vous demanderez m\u00eame comment vous avez pu vous en passer.\\n\\n<b>Une installation Wifi simple et efficace!<\/b>\\nD\u00e9couvrez la touche WPS (Wifi Protected Set-up) permettant de configurer votre multifonction en WiFi rapidement et simplement. Pressez ce bouton et celui de votre box ADSL ou de votre routeur et le tour est jou\u00e9! Termin\u00e9 le temps des configurations longues et fastidieuses!\\n\\n<b>Application MobilePrint<\/b>\\nObtenez plus de vos appareils mobiles gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'application Samsung MobilePrint, qui offre l'impression, la num\u00e9risation et le transfert de fichiers sans fil pour vous permettre de faire plus en toute mobilit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Soignez les d\u00e9tails de vos impressions<\/b>\\nAvec une r\u00e9solution d'impression de 1200 x 1200 dpi, le multifonction Samsung SCX-3405W vous garantit une impression professionnelle et de haute qualit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Efficace et compact<\/b>\\nLe multifonction laser SCX-3405W de Samsung arbore un design \u00e9l\u00e9gant qui convient parfaitement \u00e0 tout espace de travail gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 sa compacit\u00e9. Son couvercle offre aussi une protection contre la poussi\u00e8re."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"259042a1-e1b3-4d4a-990c-8e76db3be9c0","identifier":"11813988","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 47LV355H LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>FULL HD LED LCD PRO:CENTRIC V TV<\/b>\\n\\nLG INTERACTIVE TV(Ready) has been designed for hoteliers who are seeking to provide their guests with value added in-room services at minimum cost. With Pro:Centric solution-enabled LG Interactive TVs, hotels can greet their guests with a welcome message. It can also provide guests with vital hotel information such as local tourist attractions and facility information far more easily. Contents can be updated through a web-based editor and it also allows hotels to remotely manage cloning and channel mapping via a remote server. For hotels without their own server, LG offers Pro:Centric server which has been optimized for hotel users.\\n\\n<b>Pro:Centric(V)<\/b>\\nPro:Centric is LG\u2019s unique and dedicated hotel data broadcasting platform for various service applications. LG Pro:Centric V comes with various features customized for hoteliers in need of cost reduction. Hoteliers can remotely manage contents, software updates, channel mapping, application cloning of TVs in guestrooms via server.\\n\\n<b>Hotel Mode<\/b>\\nFrom channel selection to energy-saving features, you can reset TVs across entire rooms to their default settings or prevent misuse, over loud volume or changes to color or display settings. You\u2019re in control.\\n\\n<b>Front LED Clock<\/b>\\nThe integrated LED clock has an array of alarm functions that are useful for guests, yet introduces cost savings for hoteliers - no need to supply a separate alarm clock.\\n\\n<b>External Speaker Out<\/b>\\nBy adding an additional speaker, guests can immerse themselves in pristine sound wherever they choose. Even if they\u2019re in the bathroom, guests can hear and control the TV sound as if it were next to them. Perfect for music.\\n\\n<b>One Channel Map<\/b>\\nYou no longer need to bother managing channel listings either for DTV (DVB-T, DVB-C), analog or radio. The one channel map feature allows users to edit and list the channels of their choice, regardless of the broadcasting signal type.\\n\\n<b>LED<\/b>\\nBrilliant edge LED backlighting display delivers crystal-clear images, true blacks, and the most vivid, life-like colors on a slim screen."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-11-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":47,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5fcf2bb4-3ab6-4b45-a74c-84e395965a45","identifier":"11834327","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["kyocera","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kyocera FS-1035MFP\/DP"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Geringste Druckkosten seiner Klasse\\n- Bis zu 35 Seiten A4 pro Minute (Druck\/Kopie)\\n- Bis zu 35 SW-Scans pro Minute bzw. 14 Farb-Scans pro Minute\\n- Erste Kopie bereits nach 6,9 Sekunden\\n- Integrierte Duplex-Funktionalit\u00e4t f\u00fcr beidseitiges Drucken, Kopieren und Scannen\\n- 300 Blatt Papierkapazit\u00e4t, maximal 800 Blatt\\n- Vertraulicher Druck mit pers\u00f6nlicher PIN-Code-Abfrage (Speichererweiterung erforderlich)\\n- Kostenstellenmanagement\\n- Einfache Authentifizierung mit optionalem USB-Kartenleser\\n- USB Host f\u00fcr direktes Drucken und Scannen ohne PC\\n\\nH\u00f6chste Effizienz und Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit kombiniert mit vielf\u00e4ltigen Standardfunktionen macht dieses Multifunktionssystem zum idealen Partner f\u00fcr\u2018s B\u00fcro. Beachtlich sein Arbeitstempo mit enormen 35 Seiten\/Min. \u2013 und die integrierte Duplex-Einheit, die den Papierbedarf deutlich reduziert. Und: F\u00fcr den digitalen Dokumentenfluss hat das System vielf\u00e4ltige Scan-M\u00f6glichkeiten an Bord."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Up to 35 pages per minute in A4\\n- Time to first copy: 6.9 seconds\\n- Double sided print, copy and scan functionality as standard\\n- 50 sheet document processor scans double sided originals\\n- Up to 2 optional paper feeders for up to 800 sheets\\n- High security through SSL, IPsec and Private Print (requires additional memory) functionality\\n- Print from and scan to USB memory\\n- Exceptionally low printing costs in its class\\n- Automatic Power Off mode provides lowest power consumption\\n\\nThese compact A4 MFPs are perfect for every workgroup requesting a very productive document workflow. Printing, copying and scanning speeds of up to 35 pages, a fast first-print and copy time as well as the document processor for double sided originals and duplexoutput will increase your productivity. Excellent media flexibility and optional paper-feeders support your individual document output needs."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1955887e-3d3f-4ca8-bf10-1494e2790f44","identifier":"11834328","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["kyocera","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kyocera FS-1135MFP"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Geringste Druckkosten seiner Klasse\\n- Bis zu 35 Seiten A4 pro Minute (Druck\/Kopie)\\n- Bis zu 35 SW-Scans pro Minute bzw. 14 Farb-Scans pro Minute\\n- Erste Kopie bereits nach 6,9 Sekunden\\n- Integrierte Duplex-Funktionalit\u00e4t f\u00fcr beidseitiges Drucken, Kopieren, Scannen und Faxen\\n- 300 Blatt Papierkapazit\u00e4t, maximal 800 Blatt\\n- Vertraulicher Druck mit pers\u00f6nlicher PIN-Code-Abfrage (Speichererweiterung erforderlich)\\n- Kostenstellenmanagement\\n- Einfache Authentifizierung mit optionalem USB-Kartenleser\\n- USB Host f\u00fcr direktes Drucken und Scannen ohne PC\\n\\nH\u00f6chste Effizienz und Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit kombiniert mit vielf\u00e4ltigen Standardfunktionen macht dieses Multifunktionssystem zum idealen Partner f\u00fcr\u2018s B\u00fcro. Beachtlich sein Arbeitstempo mit enormen 35 Seiten\/Min. \u2013 und die integrierte Duplex-Einheit, die den Papierbedarf deutlich reduziert. Und: F\u00fcr den digitalen Dokumentenfluss hat das System vielf\u00e4ltige Scan-M\u00f6glichkeiten an Bord. Fax ist nat\u00fcrlich auch dabei."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Up to 35 pages per minute in A4\\n- Time to first copy: 6.9 seconds\\n- Double sided print, copy, scan and fax functionality as standard\\n- 50 sheet document processor scans double sided originals\\n- Up to 2 optional paper feeders for up to 800 sheets\\n- High security through SSL, IPsec and Private Print (requires additional memory) functionality\\n- Print from and scan to USB memory\\n- Exceptionally low printing costs in its class\\n- Automatic Power Off mode provides lowest power consumption\\n\\nThe new compact A4 MFPs are perfect for every workgroup requesting a very productive document workflow. Printing, copying and scanning speeds of up to 35 pages, a fast first-print and copy time as well as the document processor for double sided originals and duplexoutput will increase your productivity. Excellent media flexibility and optional paper-feeders support your individual document output needs."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c1949b83-b9ac-4c8d-893d-1806832588d3","identifier":"11854320","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","ricoh"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Ricoh CX 6"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Leistungsstarke Bildverarbeitung mit Schwerpunkt auf unverf\u00e4lschter Bildqualit\u00e4t.<\/b>\\n<b>R\u00fcckseitig belichteter CMOS-Sensor + Bildprozessor Smooth Imaging Engine IV<\/b>\\nDie CX6 arbeitet mit einem r\u00fcckseitig belichteten CMOS-Sensor in Kombination mit dem fortschrittlichen Bildprozessor Smooth Imaging Engine IV. Dunkle Innenr\u00e4ume und Nachtmotive werden in makelloser Qualit\u00e4t wiedergegeben, genauso wie stark beleuchtete Objekte. Ein Interpolations-Algorithmus f\u00fcr die Pixel-Ausgabe, der in einem speziellen Schaltkreis des Bildprozessors angesiedelt ist, wirkt gegen Detailverluste in hellsten Bildbereichen. Kontrastreiche Motive werden damit so wiedergegeben, wie man sie mit eigenen Augen wahrnimmt.\\n\\n<b>RICOH Pure Image Quality Technology<\/b>\\nDie Philosophie, die allen Ricoh-Digitalkameras zugrunde liegt, hat nicht nur \"hohe Bildqualit\u00e4t\" zum Ziel sondern \"unverf\u00e4lschte Bildqualit\u00e4t, die der Wahrnehmung mit dem Auge gleichkommt\". Dies wird durch drei wichtige Komponenten erreicht: ein Objektiv mit fehlerarmer und wirklichkeitsgetreuer Abbildung, ein Bildsensor mit hoher Lichtempfindlichkeit und ein Bildprozessor, der Fotos mit feinsten Details erzeugt. Aneinander angepasst bilden diese Komponenten eine Einheit, die eine un\u00fcbertroffene Aufl\u00f6sung und wirklichkeitsgetreue Farbwiedergabe liefert.\\n\\n<b>Herrliche Aufnahmen \u2013 Bild f\u00fcr Bild.<\/b>\\n<b>Bedeutender Fortschritt bei der Rauschreduzierung<\/b>\\nDer Algorithmus zur Verminderung des Bildrauschens nutzt direkt die aus dem CMOS-Bildsensor kommenden Signale, um das gerade bei hoher Empfindlichkeitseinstellung auftretende Rauschen zu reduzieren. Das Ergebnis sind wunderbar klare Aufnahmen mit Details, Tonwerten und lebendigen Farben wie in der Wirklichkeit.\\n\\n* F\u00fcr die St\u00e4rke der Rauschverminderung kann zwischen den Einstellungen Aus, Automatik, Schwach, Stark und MAX gew\u00e4hlt werden.\\n* Die Zeit f\u00fcr das Aufzeichnen eines Bildes differiert mit der gew\u00e4hlten Rauschreduzierungseinstellung.\\n\\n<b>Die Super-Resolution-Technologie sorgt f\u00fcr hochaufl\u00f6sende Bilder in jeder Lage<\/b>\\n<b>\u2013 bei der \"normalen\" Fotografie, beim Zoomen, bei Makrofotos.<\/b>\\nDie Super-Resolution-Technologie der CX6 erkennt im Bild automatisch Umrisse, Details und Tonwertstufen und verarbeitet sie mit den jeweils optimalen Einstellungen. Dies erlaubt der Kamera, Bilder mit noch h\u00f6herer Aufl\u00f6sung als bei den Vorg\u00e4ngermodellen aufzuzeichnen.\\n\\n<b>Kompensiert wackelige Kamerahaltung.<\/b>\\n<b>Bildstabilisierung mittels Sensor-Shift<\/b>\\nDie Bildstabilisierungsfunktion verringert die Gefahr von Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen, wie sie besonders bei Tele- und Makro-Aufnahmen auftreten k\u00f6nnen. Sobald die Kamera unruhiges Halten erkennt, verschiebt sie den CMOS-Sensor gegenl\u00e4ufig, um die Verwacklung auszugleichen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Imaging processing performance that places a premium on pure image quality.<\/b>\\n<b>Back-illuminated CMOS sensor + Smooth Imaging Engine IV<\/b>\\nThe CX6 boasts a back-illuminated CMOS image sensor combined with advanced Smooth Imaging Engine IV image processing. Poorly-lit indoor or night scenes are rendered in pure, unblemished quality, as of course are brightly-lit subjects. An output pixel interpolation algorithm residing in dedicated logic circuits in the imaging engine reduces loss of detail in highlights to faithfully recreate high-contrast scenes exactly as they appear to the naked eye.\\n\\n<b>RICOH Pure Image Quality Technology<\/b>\\nThe imaging philosophy that lies at the root of all Ricoh digital cameras: not just \"high image quality\" but \"pure image quality, true to what is perceived by the naked eye.\" This is achieved through three core technologies\u2014a low-distortion lens with true-to-life imaging properties, an image sensor with superior high-sensitivity performance, and an imaging engine that reproduces images in minute detail\u2014that have been designed and developed as a single mechanism, offering unsurpassed resolution and faithful, unaffected color reproduction.\\n\\n<b>Breathtakingly pure beauty with each shot.<\/b>\\n<b>Breakthrough noise reduction function<\/b>\\nThe camera's noise reduction algorithm processes the image signal as it is output from the CMOS image sensor, reducing the image noise that tends to occur in photographs taken at high sensitivities. The result is beautiful, limpid photographs with details, tones, and colors as vivid as those seen in the original subject.\\n\\n<b>Super-resolution technology for high-resolution image quality<\/b>\\n<b>for everything from normal photography to zoom and macro shooting.<\/b>\\nThe CX6's super-resolution technology discerns the outlines, details, and gradations in the image automatically and processes the photograph based on the optimal settings for each. This allows the camera to record images with even higher resolution than with previous models.\\n\\n<b>Corrects for even slight hand-motion blur.<\/b>\\n<b>Image sensor shift image stabilizer<\/b>\\nThe image sensor shift image stabilizer function reduces the hand-motion blurring that tends to occur in situations such as telephoto and macro shooting. When blurring is detected, the CMOS sensor automatically compensates by shifting in a direction that eliminates the blur."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":11}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"95fa3ede-95c7-4304-9360-998820f41517","identifier":"11854940","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lg","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 47WV30"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>\u00dcbersicht Digital Signage<\/b>\\n\\nDigital Signage bietet eine Vielzahl an M\u00f6glichkeiten f\u00fcr Ihr Unternehmen und Ihre Produkte zu werden. Gro\u00dfformatige Displays f\u00fcr den Einsatz am POS, als Informations- und Wegweisersysteme oder als interaktive Werbefl\u00e4chen, stellen Sie eine zeitgem\u00e4\u00dfe Form der Kundenkommunikation dar.\\n\\n<b>LG L\u00f6sungen f\u00fcr Digital Signage<\/b>\\n\\nLG SuperSign ist eine Full-HD Digital Signage Software zur Optimierung von KMUs (Kleinen und mittelst\u00e4ndischen Unternehmen). Mit einem beispiellosen Ma\u00df an intuitiven und benutzerfreundlichen Bedienelementen erm\u00f6glicht es praktisch jedem, das System bequem zu bedienen. Dar\u00fcber hinaus ersparen Ihnen die einfachen und benutzerfreundlichen Funktionen Zeit und Kosten. Jetzt k\u00f6nnen Sie sich voll und ganz auf SuperSign verlassen.\\n\\nMit LG SuperSign wird Ihr Gesch\u00e4ft noch heller leuchten."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"LG 47WV30. Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Display: LED, Display technology: IPS. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 600 x 400, Tilt angle: -15 - 15. Input voltage: 100 - 240, Input frequency: 50\/60, Power consumption (off): 0.5. Cables included: VGA"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":47,"unit":"INCH"}}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":12}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a43a3f77-e46f-4fa8-a4a3-6a2b28243e12","identifier":"11858104","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung TS190C"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung S Series is built with great features and capabilities. The S series is an innovative approach to monitor stand design due to its ability to house circuitry and other devices within its casing. This facilitates a slim design and minimises the amount of loose cables and wires. The S series can also be wall mounted, providing businesses with great versatility and interior design options. The S series model comes in three different screen sizes and two different models to suit individual business needs.\\n\\n<b>All-in-one design<\/b>\\nSamsung's innovative Cloud Display integrates a thin client into the LED* screen. Its contemporary and innovative design ensures that keeping your work environment clean and tidy is simple. The benefit of not having a separate thin client box is that you can use your desk space in a productive manner. These innovative features come together perfectly for an all-in-one design that increases desktop space.\\n* Samsung\u2019s LED TVs utilise LCD Screens with LED edge lights.\\n\\n<b>Remote management S\/W<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s Cloud Monitor delivers amazing levels of convenience by using the remote management software of MagicRMS Pro. It delivers a more centralised operation and saves administrators the time and hassle associated with physically having to visit each device for routine checks. Other benefits include real-time device status monitoring, an efficient and accurate inventory process and finally remote upgrading of firmware to all devices. With so many standout benefits for day-to-day operations, the MagicRMS software really is essential to any efficient office environment.\\n\\n<b>Citrix Zero Cliend Monitor<\/b>\\nInnovative zero client technology allows consolidation of most of your IT resources into a data centre, and provides high-performance computing via the web interface network without reduction in performance or information, this provides a virtualised set of hardware to the operating system. It lets you run virtual multiple machines. The HDX chipset and onboard processing distributes video, audio and data contents while preserving high performance and real-time graphics.\\n\\n<b>Little Maintenance<\/b>\\nBecause all software and data is stored on the centralised host platform. The network is easy to install and easy to maintain."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"47f3c95f-021a-4e66-93fc-61485193fa0d","identifier":"11858105","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung TS190W"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung S Series is built with great features and capabilities. The S series is an innovative approach to monitor stand design due to its ability to house circuitry and other devices within its casing. This facilitates a slim design and minimises the amount of loose cables and wires. The S series can also be wall mounted, providing businesses with great versatility and interior design options. The S series model comes in three different screen sizes and two different models to suit individual business needs.\\n\\n<b>All-in-one design<\/b>\\nSamsung's innovative Cloud Display integrates a thin client into the LED* screen. Its contemporary and innovative design ensures that keeping your work environment clean and tidy is simple. The benefit of having not a separate thin client box is that you can use your desk space in a productive manner. These innovative features come together perfectly for an all-in-one design that increases desktop space.\\n* Samsung\u2019s LED TVs utilise LCD Screens with LED edge lights.\\n\\n<b>Remote management S\/W<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s Cloud Monitor delivers amazing levels of convenience by using the remote management software of MagicRMS Pro. It delivers a centralised operation and saves administrators the time and hassle associated with physically having to visit each device for routine checks. Other benefits include real-time device status monitoring, an inventory process and finally remote upgrading of firmware to all devices. With so many standout benefits for day-to-day operations, the MagicRMS software helps to make the office environment productive.\\n\\n<b>Security you can trust<\/b>\\nConsolidate \u201calmost all\u201d of your resources on the data centre and deliver your applications and data over LAN\/WAN via a number encrypted protocol including RDP,HDX and PColP to your thin client. Access your critical data and applications while they are maintained and controlled in the data centre\\n\\n<b>Little Maintenance<\/b>\\nBecause all software and data is stored on the centralised host platform. The network is easy to install and easy to maintain."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"nbsp;\\n<br\/><b>Dalle LED<\/b>\\n<br\/>Assurez vous un impact positif sur l'environnement. Les solutions d'affichage cloud de Samsung utilisent l'innovation LED Black Light Unite (BLU). C'est une technologie qui permet de r\u00e9duire jusqu'\u00e0 40% votre facture \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique compar\u00e9 aux \u00e9crans traditionnels (CCFL). Encore mieux, cet \u00e9cran LED est produit sans mercure ni halog\u00e8ne, vous permettant de pr\u00e9server les ressources naturelles de la plan\u00e8te tout en r\u00e9duisant votre empreinte carbone.\\n<br\/><b>Logiciel de gestion \u00e0 distance des moniteurs<\/b>\\n<br\/>Les moniteurs cloud Samsung sont faciles d'usage gr\u00e2ce au logiciel de gestion \u00e0 distance MagicRMS Pro. Il permet ainsi de centraliser vos op\u00e9rations et de faire gagner du temps aux administrateurs en leurs \u00e9vitant le tracas d'aller visiter physiquement chaque unit\u00e9 pour un simple contr\u00f4le. Il y a aussi d'autres avantages comme la surveillance des moniteurs en temps r\u00e9el, un processus d'inventaire efficace, une mise \u00e0 niveau des logiciels \u00e0 distance. Avec de nombreuses plus-valus pour votre travail au quotidien, le logiciel MagicRMS est vraiment l'outil essentiel pour tout environnement de travail performant."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"32e26798-ace2-4703-94c3-35763cad9c27","identifier":"11858111","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung TS240C"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung S Series is built with great features and capabilities. The S series is an innovative approach to monitor stand design due to its ability to house circuitry and other devices within its casing. This facilitates a slim design and minimises the amount of loose cables and wires. The S series can also be wall mounted, providing businesses with great versatility and interior design options. The S series model comes in three different screen sizes and two different models to suit individual business needs.\\n\\n<b>All-in-one design<\/b>\\nSamsung's innovative Cloud Display integrates a thin client into the LED* screen. Its contemporary and innovative design ensures that keeping your work environment clean and tidy is simple. The benefit not of having a separate thin client box is that you can use your desk space in a productive manner. These innovative features come together perfectly for an all-in-one design that increases desktop space.\\n\\n<b>Remote management S \/ W<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s Cloud Monitor delivers amazing levels of convenience by using the remote management software of MagicRMS Pro. It delivers a centralised operation and saves administrators the time and hassle associated with physically having to visit each device for routine checks. Other benefits include real-time device status monitoring, an inventory process and finally remote upgrading of firmware to all devices. With so many standout benefits for day-to-day operations, the MagicRMS software helps to make the office environment productive.\\n\\n<b>Security you can trust<\/b>\\nConsolidate \u201calmost all\u201d of your resources on the data centre and deliver your applications and data over LAN\/WAN via and encrypted protocol HDX to your zero client. Access your critical data and applications while they are maintained and controlled in the data centre.\\n\\n* Samsung\u2019s LED TVs utilise LCD Screens with LED edge lights."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"70574ddf-23be-41a0-b7ad-64eb8bde31c6","identifier":"11858114","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung SM 40\" SUR40"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung SM 40\" SUR40"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec ses fonctionnalit\u00e9s in\u00e9dites, la Samsung SUR40 r\u00e9volutionne la mani\u00e8re dont nous communiquons les uns avec les autres. D\u00e9couvrez une interactivit\u00e9 in\u00e9dite et un nouveau monde d\u2019applications \u00e0 utilisateurs multiples.\\n<br\/><b>Des applications multiples adapt\u00e9es pour de nombreux secteurs<\/b>\\n<br\/>La Surface\u2122 SUR40 pour Microsoft\u2122 a \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9velopp\u00e9e pour satisfaire les besoins des entreprises dans de nombreux secteurs : Point de vente, Automobile, H\u00f4tellerie, Sant\u00e9, Finance, \u00c9ducation. Avec ses fonctionnalit\u00e9s in\u00e9dites, la Samsung SUR40 r\u00e9volutionne la mani\u00e8re dont nous communiquons les uns avec les autres. D\u00e9couvrez une interactivit\u00e9 in\u00e9dite et un nouveau monde d\u2019applications \u00e0 utilisateurs multiples. Apportez une exp\u00e9rience consommateur unique avec des applications sur mesure et r\u00e9volutionnaire. Cr\u00e9ez une interconnexion avec vos clients, consommateurs et coll\u00e8gues\\n<br\/><b>Reconnaissance d\u2019objets et de mouvements<\/b>\\n<br\/>Profitez d\u2019une technologie r\u00e9volutionnaire permettant la reconnaissance d\u2019objets et de mouvements. Gr\u00e2ce au logiciel de reconnaissance \u00e0 distance, la Samsung SUR40 pour Microsoft\u2122 Surface\u2122 peut d\u00e9tecter et rentrer en connexion sans fil avec de nombreux appareils \u00e9lectroniques. Le micro-cameras PixelSense\u2122 visualisent au travers de l\u2019\u00e9cran LCD des Tags plac\u00e9s sur des objets (objet de la courante, documentation, Smartphone) et d\u00e9clenchent une r\u00e9ponse digitale sp\u00e9cifique\\n<br\/><b>Tactile comme jamais!<\/b>\\n<br\/>D\u00e9passez les fronti\u00e8res de l\u2019interaction avec la nouvelle technologie tactile int\u00e9gr\u00e9e dans la Samsung SUR40. Plus besoin de clavier ou de souris, cette dalle tactile reconnait les gestes, les objets et vous permet d\u2019avoir au travers d\u2019une interface naturelle une exp\u00e9rience intuitive et unique\\n<br\/><b>Attirez les foules avec une exp\u00e9rience utilisateur unique<\/b>\\n<br\/>La Samsung SUR40 encourage le travail collaboratif et change radicalement la mani\u00e8re dont nous communiquons ensemble. Reconnaissant simultan\u00e9ment jusqu\u2019\u00e0 52 points de contact, plusieurs utilisateurs peuvent travailler en m\u00eame temps sur plusieurs contenus et ainsi avoir un \u00e9change plus productif. Cette fonctionnalit\u00e9 encourage le d\u00e9veloppement d\u2019applications sociales avec de multiples acteurs. La potentiel d\u2019une \u00e9quipe est d\u00e9sormais sans limite\\n<br\/><b>Une plateforme PC de nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration<\/b>\\n<br\/>La puissance du PC atteint un niveau sup\u00e9rieur avec la SUR40 pour Microsoft\u2122 Surface\u2122. Avec un processeur Dual Core AMD Athlon\u2122 II X2 2.9GHz, le travail multit\u00e2che n\u2019a jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 aussi fluide. La carte graphique AMD Radeon\u2122 HD 6570M fournit \u00e0 la SUR40 une image nette et vibrante. Enfin, ses haut-parleurs int\u00e9gr\u00e9s vous d\u00e9livrent une exp\u00e9rience multim\u00e9dia intense. Choisissez la solution tactile qui r\u00e9pondra parfaitement \u00e0 vos besoins"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-02T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f404bec2-7dc9-4fc1-bb2b-8abf3a102c8f","identifier":"11867748","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung PL 120"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Twice the fun with Dual LCDs<\/b>\\n\\nThe effortless way to get perfect pictures, Samsung\u2019s 2View PL120 has a generous 1.5\u201d front-side display so you\u2019re part of every image. Preview self-portraits, then click, with you in the frame __ easy. Flip the camera around to enjoy photos on the wide 2.7\u201d display. New features change the view on hard to-capture experiences. Children Mode has built-in and downloadable animation options to keep kids\u2019 attention. Jump Shot offers cues before taking two continuous shot. Self-Timer is a visual countdown to coordinate group shots so everyone smiles at the results. Quickly pressing the top display on \/ off button efficiently manages power. From now on, no more out of the frame glitches. No more babies caught crying. You will never have more fun with other cameras.\\n\\n<b>Get a whole new view<\/b>\\n\\nGet more from your lens, whether shooting a memorable landscape or the gang\u2019s reunion around a restaurant table. By using the precision-cut PL120 26mm wide-angle lens, with its 5x optical zoom, you instantly cover a whole-horizon field of view. Now, you can now capture full-scale memories of landmarks and landscapes, entire wedding parties and the tallest skyscrapers.\\n\\n<b>Invent new looks for your images<\/b>\\n\\nSamsung\u2019s Smart Filter lens and color options make special moods easy for still shots and videos. Tilt & Shift Lens Effect adds a miniaturised look and the Vignetting Effect makes striking compositional contrasts. New special effects include Soft Focus to soften colours and add an emotional feel as well as Half-Tone Dot to enhance images with a comic-book look. Palette Effect adds an ultra-vivid vibe and a variety of colour options for your images. It\u2019s now a snap to get creative.\\n\\n<b>Edit your own special effects<\/b>\\n\\nThe unique Magic Frame feature allows you to create sophisticated images and poster-quality visuals that express your mood and personality. Just select one of the built-in Magic Frame templates, including Wall Art, Old Film, Ripple, Full Moon, Old Record, Magazine, Holiday, Classic TV and more. Point the camera at the subject you want, match it within the on-screen template and capture. That\u2019s it. Your subject now is framed by a special mood and background \u2013 like magic.\\n\\n<b>HD quality video. Now in a compact camera<\/b>\\n\\nThe PL120 artfully combines a professional-grade still camera with a compact HD video camera. You get 720p HD quality video at 30 frames per second. Use the 5x zoom to get up close and vividly personal.\\n\\n<b>The simple way to go pro<\/b>\\n\\nTurn any moment into a perfect memory. And a professional-looking photo. Whether it's a few friends from last night's party or the moon reflecting off the lake, Smart Auto 2.0 (Still & Movie) instantly analyzes key elements of your composition then automatically adjusts to capture the perfect shot with multitude of different photo modes and movie modes. And since life isn't a still life, the camera's object tracking feature captures those subjects that just don't, or won't, stand still."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"df9717bd-7abe-4a8f-a7e6-14eaabb48b02","identifier":"11867890","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"215_x_355_mm"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox Phaser 3010"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Xerox Phaser 3010. Maximum resolution: 1200 x 1200, Print technology: Laser. ISO A-series sizes (A0...A9): A4, A5, Maximum print size: 215 x 355 mm, Standard tray media types: Envelopes, Labels, Plain paper, Recycled paper. Standard interfaces: USB 2.0. Power consumption (standby): 57.6, Power consumption (PowerSave): 3.4. Dimensions (WxDxH): 358 x 197 x 208"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9b43d86b-1e72-4c2e-9fd4-a1f540d6f16f","identifier":"11881648","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","lg","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_720"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"4\/9\/1\/3\/4913d7ca711c9eba27a27ea5579c284e8aef5884_11881648_7170.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/4\/9\/1\/3\/4913d7ca711c9eba27a27ea5579c284e8aef5884_11881648_7170.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG AN-VC300 webcam"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>TV Skype\u00ae Camera<\/b>\\nDo you use Skype\u00ae?\\nWith LG you have the capability to make free video and voice calls over the Internet, on your TV, using Skype\u00ae. Get the LG Skype\u00ae Web Camera and keep in touch with family and friends.\\n\\n<b>Features:<\/b>\\n- built-in microphone;\\n- 30f\/s (@VGA);\\n- 2.0 Megapixel;\\n- CMOS."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Cam\u00e9ra Skype<\/b>\\nCam\u00e9ra Skype pour TV LCD s\u00e9ries LW650S LW659S LW570S LW579S LW5500 LW5590 LV570S LV5500 (32\u2019\u2019 et +) \/ LV5300 \/ LV375S et TV Plasma s\u00e9rie PZ950S.\\n\\nCette cam\u00e9ra Skype est compatible avec tous les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs Smart TV 2011. Connectez-vous \u00e0 Skype et communiquez avec vos proches en toute simplicit\u00e9 !"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4c4d23f2-d0c4-4552-b64d-b020b5887648","identifier":"11898428","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lg","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG E2541T-BN"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"LG E2541T-BN. Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Display: LCD, Display technology: TN+Film. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 200 x 100, Tilt angle: -5 - 15. Input voltage: 100 - 240, Power consumption (standby): 0.3, Power consumption (off): 0.3. Windows operating systems supported: Windows Vista Home Premium. Cables included: AC, DVI, VGA"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Consulter ses e-mails, visionner des films, accomplir ses t\u00e2ches administratives, jouer des parties de jeux vid\u00e9os\u2026 Pour les utilisateurs aux multiples activit\u00e9s informatiques, le E2541T-BN est le produit id\u00e9al.\\n\\n- Technologie LED\\n- R\u00e9solution : 1920x1080\\n- C\u00e2ble DVI, VGA\\n- Compatible VESA 200x100\\n- Eco Friendly"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":25,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"aaf2daa4-d751-4027-aafc-ccf052ab9b9f","identifier":"11898445","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","yarvik"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a\/c\/e\/7\/ace71014a7498cd9c258a35258148cf1d194d391_11898445_394.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/a\/c\/e\/7\/ace71014a7498cd9c258a35258148cf1d194d391_11898445_394.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Yarvik PMP200 MP3 player & recorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Yarvik Media Players allow you to enjoy your favourite music, videos and pictures everywhere. A sleek, robust, and compact design. But don\u2019t let the compact size fool you; the Yarvik Media Players offer large-scale entertainment in pocket size."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-07T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cf57db90-2c0a-4402-9566-2764336ef5e6","identifier":"11898446","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","yarvik"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"e\/d\/c\/d\/edcdd83c6e61bc5d3205e1142d8d4d21e600b740_11898446_9208.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/e\/d\/c\/d\/edcdd83c6e61bc5d3205e1142d8d4d21e600b740_11898446_9208.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Yarvik PMP201 MP3 player & recorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Yarvik Media Players allow you to enjoy your favourite music, videos and pictures everywhere. A sleek, robust, and compact design. But don\u2019t let the compact size fool you; the Yarvik Media Players offer large-scale entertainment in pocket size."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-07T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ec60512c-f4fd-41d7-a418-9cb8478e31ac","identifier":"11919593","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["brother","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Brother MFC-9325CW multifunctional"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fast, Reliable, Convenient Color for Home Offices and Small Offices<\/b>\\nA built-in wireless interface coupled with fast color and black print speeds make this All-in-One the perfect choice for your home office or small office! Help save time and money by producing your own high-quality, professional-looking business documents at an impressive print speed of up to 19ppm - Up to 4X faster color printing than competing color laser All-in-Ones!\u2021 Plus, it has a USB Direct Interface to print from or scan to your USB flash memory drive!\u2021 or print from your PictBridge-enabled camera, too!\\n\\n<b>Main Features<\/b>\\n- Fast printing and copying. Help increase your productivity with fast print and copy speeds of up to 19ppm.\\n- Vibrant Color Output. Produce your own professional-looking business documents at up to 600 x 2400 dpi resolution using Brother Digital LED print technology.\\n- Flexible connectivity. Built-in wireless and Ethernet network interfaces to install on a wired or wireless network or connect locally to a single computer via USB.\\n- Large paper capacity. Equipped with an adjustable 250-sheet capacity letter\/legal paper tray, it also includes a single-sheet manual feed slot for envelopes or thicker media.\\n- Fax Flexibility. Send faxes from the All-in-One or your computer.\\n- Versatile paper handling. Use the document glass or the 35-page capacity auto document feeder for copying, scanning or faxing a single page or multiple pages.\\n- High quality color scanning. Up to 19200 dpi (interpolated), with a variety of \"scan-to\" features .\\n- Convenient direct printing and scanning. Includes a USB Direct Interface to print from or scan to your USB flash memory drive\u2021 or print from your PictBridge-enabled camera.\\n- Compact footprint. With its space-saving design, it can virtually fit in any environment.\\n- Easy to replace toner cartridges. A top-loading design makes it easy to install and replace toner cartridges.\\n- Brother\u2122 iPrint&Scan. Free app download for wireless printing (JPEG, PDF & web page) from and scanning to your Apple\u00ae, Android\u2122 or Windows\u00ae Phone 7 (JPEG only and scanning not available) mobile device."}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-09T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fd316b43-c788-4d21-8a1a-26bbe5e1e81e","identifier":"11935382","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S27A850T"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A bigger, better picture and lower energy use<\/b>\\n- Reduce energy costs and environmental impact;\\n- Get a bigger picture with 2560 x 1400 resolution;\\n- See images with more natural sRGB colour;\\n- Enjoy an extra-wide 178 degree viewing angle.\\n\\n<b>Product Features<\/b>\\n<b>Conserves Energy and Preserves the Environment<\/b>\\nEngineered with the ecologically responsible homeowner in mind, the Samsung monitor reduces power consumption by 40%;, making it much more efficient than conventional monitors. By reducing the number of LED and defaulting to standby power, which requires less than 0.3W as opposed to the typical 1.0W, the Samsung monitor is poised to make a difference. How big a difference? If your monitor saves 120W each day, that\u2019s the annual equivalent of eliminating 10.8kg of CO2 emitted from an oil-burning power plant\u2014which produces the same effect as planting four pine trees.\\n\\n<b>See more content with unbelievable screen resolution<\/b>\\nThe Samsung SA850 Monitor showcases an astounding WQHD display with 2560 x 1440 pixel resolution, which is four times the resolution of HD (720p). It is perfect for businesses and industries that rely on access to extremely fine monitor detail. The wide screen, which features dual link DVI and display port, allows for more detail to be viewed and is ideal for work places such as hospitals, clinics and studios. The enhanced screen resolution provides greater efficiency and quality, and really is the must-have business tool.\\n\\n<b>Picture Perfect, Natural-Looking Images<\/b>\\nWhether it\u2019s video from an HD camcorder or photos from your digital camera, sRGB support makes sure that nature looks just as natural on your Samsung Monitor as it did when you shot it or filmed it. No matter what digital device the image was captured on, it\u2019s as picture perfect on screen as Mother Nature intended it to be. So you can view, edit, and save images in their original format with no picture quality degradation whatsoever \u2014 which translates to 100%; pure digital satisfaction."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":27,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"86bd9227-08e9-4d56-9266-bdf7fc7b41d4","identifier":"1194788","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","hp"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Photosmart M447 Digital Camera"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit dieser voll ausgestatteten, bedienerfreundlichen 5-MP-Kamera sind gestochen scharfe Fotos garantiert. Das Motiv mit dem 3x optischen Zoom heranholen, auf dem hellen 6 cm Display betrachten und den Ausl\u00f6ser bet\u00e4tigen \u2013 das ist schon alles. Intuitive Tasten und Men\u00fcs sorgen f\u00fcr eine einfache Bedienung aller Funktionen der Kamera, einschlie\u00dflich Videoaufnahme. Mit der HP Stabilisierungsfunktion gegen Verwackeln sind gestochen scharfe Fotos garantiert, und die branchenweit f\u00fchrende Red-Eye Removal-Funktion[p1] setzt die fotografierten Personen ins rechte Licht. Geeignet f\u00fcr Windows Vista\u2122."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Be sure of crisp, clear photos with this fully-equipped, easy-to-use 5 MP camera. Get up close with 3x optical zoom, preview on the bright 6 cm display and snap \u2013 it\u2019s as easy as that. Intuitive buttons and menus help you make the most of this camera\u2019s easy-to-use features, including video recording. Enjoy sharp, blur-free photos with HP steady photo anti-shake mode and make sure your subjects look their best with industry-leading in-camera red-eye removal[p1]. Windows Vista\u2122 ready."}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e4bbed3c-b83e-4c24-87da-df09732158fa","identifier":"11952770","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 26LV255H LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"LG INTERACTIVE TV(Ready) has been designed for hoteliers who are seeking to provide their guests with value added in-room services at minimum cost. With Pro:Centric solution-enabled LG Interactive TVs, hotels can greet their guests with a welcome message. It can also provide guests with vital hotel information such as local tourist attractions and facility information far more easily. Contents can be updated through a web-based editor and it also allows hotels to remotely manage cloning and channel mapping via a remote server. For hotels without their own server, LG offers Pro:Centric server which has been optimized for hotel users."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"527d93f3-032d-4ea2-a0d1-44eaad5f2bf3","identifier":"11953488","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["acer","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Acer S S191HQLGb"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die Displays der Serie S sind extraflach, haben jedoch eine gro\u00dfe Anzeigefl\u00e4che und eignen sich daher perfekt f\u00fcr Multitasking und zum Surfen im Web. Die Full HD-Aufl\u00f6sung und das besonders hohe Kontrastverh\u00e4ltnis erwecken High Definition-Bilder f\u00f6rmlich zum Leben. Von diesem leistungsstarken Acer-Display werden Sie begeistert sein, von seiner Darstellungsqualit\u00e4t ebenso wie von seinem attraktiven Look!\\n\\n<b>Ultraflaches, platzsparendes Design<\/b>\\n\\nDie Modelle der Serie S haben ein Design, mit dem sie sich exzellent in jedes Ambiente einbinden lassen, sei es ein Wohnzimmer, ein Heimb\u00fcro, ein \u00f6ffentlicher Bereich oder ein Schalter. Sie sind ultra-flach, und ultra-elegant mit einer rundum modernen, schlichten Ausstrahlung.\\n\\n<b>Umweltfreundliche Technologien<\/b>\\n\\nDie Serie S wird mit quecksilberfreien Materialien hergestellt und arbeitet mit LED-Technologie. Diese Technologie senkt den Energiebedarf um bis zu 68%, was Kosten spart und zus\u00e4tzlich die Umwelt sch\u00fctzt. Die Konformit\u00e4t mit dem Standard ENERGY STAR\u00ae 5.0 ist ein weiterer Beweis f\u00fcr die \u00f6kologische Nachhaltigkeit.\\n\\n<b>Beeindruckende Leistung<\/b>\\n\\nDank Full HD-Aufl\u00f6sung sind Spiele spannender und alle Inhalte werden mit pr\u00e4zisen Details auf Kino-Niveau dargestellt. \u00dcber den HDMI\u00ae oder den DVI Port k\u00f6nnen Sie die neuesten HD-Ger\u00e4te anschlie\u00dfen und der unglaubliche Kontrast sorgt f\u00fcr h\u00f6chste Pr\u00e4zision in der Darstellung."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Acer S Series monitors are very slim yet spacious displays that are great for multitasking and web browsing. High-def visuals leap to life thanks to Full HD resolution and an extremely high contrast ratio. You'll appreciate both the imagery and the look of this streamlined yet powerful Acer monitor!\\n\\n<b>Ultra-thin, space-saving design<\/b>\\n\\nThe S Series is designed to fit nicely in your living space, be it at home or in a SOHO, public area, or front-desk setting. Ultra-thin and ultra-elegant, the display is built around a sense of simple modernism.\\n\\n<b>Earth-friendly technologies<\/b>\\n\\nThe S Series uses mercury-free materials and white LED technology for up to 68% lower power consumption, giving you big savings while helping preserve nature's energy resources. By meeting ENERGY STAR\u00ae 5.0 requirements, the S Series considers the environment.\\n\\n<b>Impressive performance<\/b>\\n\\nGames are more exciting and entertainment is truly cinematic with excellent detail courtesy of Full HD resolution. In addition, an HDMI\u00ae or DVI interface connects you to the latest high-definition devices, while an astounding contrast ratio delivers fantastic clarity."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"\u00c0 la fois fins et larges, les \u00e9crans de la s\u00e9rie S d\u2019Acer sont parfaits pour les activit\u00e9s multit\u00e2ches et la navigation sur Internet. Les images haute d\u00e9finition prennent vie gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la r\u00e9solution Full HD et au taux de contraste extr\u00eamement \u00e9lev\u00e9. Vous appr\u00e9cierez non seulement la qualit\u00e9 des images mais \u00e9galement l\u2019allure \u00e9lanc\u00e9e et puissante de ces \u00e9crans Acer.\\n\\n<b>Un design compact et ultrafin<\/b>\\n\\nLes \u00e9crans de la s\u00e9rie S sont con\u00e7us pour s\u2019int\u00e9grer parfaitement dans votre cadre de vie, qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse de votre domicile ou de votre bureau, d\u2019un lieu public ou d\u2019un comptoir. Ultrafins et ultra\u00e9l\u00e9gants, ils profitent d\u2019un design \u00e0 la fois moderne et simple.\\n\\n<b>Des technologies respectueuses de l'environnement<\/b>\\n\\nLes \u00e9crans de la s\u00e9rie S sont con\u00e7us avec des mat\u00e9riaux exempts de mercure. La technologie \u00e0 LED blanche permet de diminuer la consommation d\u2019\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 68 %, ce qui all\u00e8ge consid\u00e9rablement les frais tout en contribuant \u00e0 pr\u00e9server les ressources \u00e9nerg\u00e9tiques de la plan\u00e8te. Conformes aux exigences ENERGY STAR\u00ae 5.0, ils ont \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7us dans le souci du plus grand respect de l\u2019environnement.\\n\\n<b>Des performances impressionnantes<\/b>\\n\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la r\u00e9solution Full HD, les jeux sont plus passionnants et les divertissements aux d\u00e9tails pr\u00e9cis sont dignes des salles de cin\u00e9ma. En outre, l\u2019interface HDMI\u00ae ou DVI vous permet de raccorder les appareils haute d\u00e9finition les plus r\u00e9cents, tandis que le taux de contraste exceptionnel offre une nettet\u00e9 impressionnante."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9d5e2306-574d-4f6a-86f7-aa1e491ecc2f","identifier":"1198700","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet 9040dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Suchen Sie einen bedienerfreundlichen Hochleistungsdrucker mit gutem Preis-Leistungs-Verh\u00e4ltnis zur Einbindung in ein Netzwerk? Dieser Drucker f\u00fcr Formate bis DIN A3 bietet eine kosteng\u00fcnstige L\u00f6sung f\u00fcr Ausdrucke in Schwarzwei\u00df in gro\u00dfen Arbeitsgruppen und Abteilungen. Anwender und IT-Manager werden die Bedienerfreundlichkeit und praktischen Funktionen zu sch\u00e4tzen wissen. Die erweiterbaren Funktionen f\u00fcr die Papierzuf\u00fchrung gestatten effizientere Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe und eine verbesserte Flexibilit\u00e4t. Dank der Fernverwaltung k\u00f6nnen die Ressourcen maximiert werden. Dar\u00fcber hinaus verf\u00fcgt dieser stabile und zuverl\u00e4ssige Drucker \u00fcber schnelle Druck- und Prozessorgeschwindigkeiten und einen erweiterbaren Speicher."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Are you looking for simple, high-volume, network printing at a reasonable price? This A3 printer is your cost-effective solution for large workgroup and department black-and-white printing. Users and IT managers alike will appreciate its ease and functionality. Expandable paper-handling options enable more efficient workflows and increased flexibility. Maximise resources with remote management. Plus, get a solid, reliable performer with fast print and processor speeds and expandable memory.\\n\\nABU - United Kingdom - UK English localization"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"\\n\\nABU - United Kingdom - UK English localization"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2006-09-21T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a093883f-f353-43a0-bf8a-536ad7112736","identifier":"1198871","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet 4350n Printer"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Steigern Sie die Produktivit\u00e4t gro\u00dfer Arbeitsgruppen mit der HP LaserJet 4350 Serie. Profitieren Sie von der fantastischen Druckgeschwindigkeit von bis zu 52 S.\/Min, einer schnellen Ausgabe der ersten Seite in weniger als 8 Sekunden auch aus dem Kaltstart sowie hervorragenden Leistungsmerkmalen wie dem 460-MHz-Prozessor, dem erweiterbaren Speicher, den \u00fcberlegenen internen Netzwerkfunktionen* und der HP Smart Drucktechnologie** mit Original HP Zubeh\u00f6r. Hohe Bedienerfreundlichkeit und einfache Verwaltung durch integrierten Webserver und Web Jetadmin sowie eine gro\u00dfe Auswahl an  Papierhandhabung bei der Dokumenterstellung.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span>\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Boost a large workgroup\u2019s productivity with the HP LaserJet 4350 Printer series. Enjoy breakthrough print speeds of up to 52 ppm, a first page out in under 8 seconds plus advanced performance features like a 460 MHz processor, expandable memory, industry-leading internal networking* and HP Smart Printing Technology** in HP printing supplies. Easy to use and manage with an Embedded Web Server and Web Jetadmin and a choice of paper handling and finishing options to meet document creation needs.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span>\\n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Productivit\u00e9 max. avec cette puissante solution d'impression HP, jusqu'\u00e0 52\u00a0ppm. Fonctionnalit\u00e9s tr\u00e8s performantes, simplicit\u00e9 d'utilisation avec r\u00e9seau standard et options extensibles parfaitement adapt\u00e9es aux besoins de gros groupes de travail.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f5dc52a9-1e59-4454-bc74-13175117b161","identifier":"1199244","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","hp"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Photosmart R742 Digital Camera"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c0db67eb-bb86-483e-8279-40d3261b2d2f","identifier":"11996158","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lenovo","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenovo ThinkVision LT1421"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":14,"unit":"INCH"}}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-14T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A second screen for mobile professionals<\/b>\\n\\nThis mobile monitor works great for ad hoc meetings in places like hotel lobbies or cafes that lack access to a projector and even for extra screen space for work that requires multitasking on the go.\\n\\nTrue mobility: USB 2.0 video input delivers both signal and power\\nUltra Productivity: Connects up to six mobile monitors\\nExtends the display for on-the-go multitasking\\nShares presentations effectively with mirror mode\\nPacks easily at under 2 LBS and 0.36 inches at its thinnest\\nConnects quickly with plug-and-play technology\\nConvenient ergonomic design: control brightness (up to 16 settings) and tilt angle for comfort\\nTested durability and reliability for travel convenience"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"02a878b9-71e4-43ba-8c3a-f34b328de278","identifier":"12019138","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lenovo","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenovo ThinkVision LT1952P"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"For enterprises that need a green, fully functional display screen, with unparalleled visual quality, the ThinkVision LT1952p is the best choice. Compatible with virtually any hardware platform, the LT1952p offers VGA, DVI-D, and DisplayPort connections. The LT1952p is a breeze to use with exceptional LED performance, swivel, tilt, and lift options, 5 milliseconds response time, and a 1000:1 contrast ratio. The LT1952p delivers high energy cost savings, through compliance with go green certifications. The monitors are mercury-free, contain reduced toxic chemicals. The LT1952p delivers the best value on investment for large enterprises."}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"91145c34-b1f6-4b82-aea3-0ebf48993486","identifier":"12020918","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lenovo","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenovo ThinkVision LT1952p"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"For enterprises that need a green, fully functional display screen, with unparalleled visual quality, the ThinkVision LT1952p is the best choice.Compatible with virtually any hardware platform, the LT1952p offers VGA, DVI-D, and DisplayPort connections. The LT1952p is a breeze to use with exceptional LED performance, swivel, tilt, and lift options, 5 milliseconds response time, and a 1000:1 contrast ratio. The LT1952p delivers high energy cost savings, through compliance with go green certifications. The monitors are mercury-free, contain reduced toxic chemicals. The LT1952p delivers the best value on investment for large enterprises."}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"37c38e23-5459-4656-bf29-90e834389174","identifier":"12026248","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"7\/a\/7\/4\/7a74340031823fffd0003b451d7eb992e8e88e35_12026248_Philips.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/7\/a\/7\/4\/7a74340031823fffd0003b451d7eb992e8e88e35_12026248_Philips.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SPA4350"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Wir sind perfekt f\u00fcr die Wiedergabe von Musik, Stimmen und Soundtracks. Wir erwecken den Sound Ihres Notebooks, PCs oder MP3-Players zum Leben, und Sie werden nicht nur unsere perfekte Soundausgabe und die verbesserte Leistung lieben, sondern auch unser modernes Design und die praktische kabelgebundene Lautst\u00e4rkeregelung."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Dynamic sound<\/b>\\n\\nWe're perfect for music, voice and soundtracks. We'll bring life to the sound from your\\nnotebook, PC or MP3 player and you'll love our bigger sound output and enhanced\\nsound performance, contemporary design and handy wired volume control.\\n\\nRich, complex sound\\n- SPDTM innovative bass port technology for deep, rounded tones\\n- Band pass subwoofer design for accurate bass reproduction\\n- Well damped driver reduces vibration and sound distortion\\n- 30 W RMS total output power\\n- 3 integrated power amplifier circuits for balanced sound\\n- Distortion-free at maximum sound output\\nContemporary design\\n- Curvilinear cabinet for well-rounded sound\\n- Attractive high gloss finish\\nSimplicity\\n- Compatible with any media"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Nous sommes parfaites pour la musique, la voix et les bandes son. Le son de votre ordinateur de bureau, ordinateur portable ou lecteur\u00a0MP3 va s'animer. Vous aimerez notre puissance et nos performances sonores am\u00e9lior\u00e9es, notre design contemporain et notre r\u00e9glage du volume pratique sur fil."}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"83c1292a-0daf-45c0-8285-fd04e1c28a38","identifier":"12026257","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 42PFL7696M"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":42,"unit":"INCH"}}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Be part of the action!<\/b>\\n<b>with Ambilight and 3D TV<\/b>\\n\\nExcite your senses with the ultra thin Philips 7000 series 42PFL7696 3D TV. It\\ncombines powerful LED pictures and the immersion of Ambilight to deliver an immersive\\n3D movie experience. Be assured you will always be part of the action.\\n\\n<b>Intensify your viewing experience<\/b>\\n- Ambilight Spectra 2-sided intensifies the viewing experience\\n- Easy 3D for a truly immersive 3D movie experience\\n\\n<b>Action captured in stunning detail<\/b>\\n- Full HD TV with Pixel Precise HD for details in action\\n- Brilliant LED images with incredible contrast\\n- 600Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) for superb motion sharpness\\n- Perfect Natural Motion for ultra smooth Full HD movies\\n\\n<b>Authentic and clear sound experience<\/b>\\n- Feel the power of 28W RMS and Incredible Surround\\n\\n<b>Enjoy the online world with Smart TV<\/b>\\n- A wealth of online apps, videos to rent and catch-up TV\\n- Control the TV with your smart phone, tablet or keyboard\\n- With DLNA, enjoy photos, music and movies on your TV\\n- Find, schedule, record* & pause TV"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1d26b214-bf73-4220-a6b3-a0b0c6f5c1eb","identifier":"12026799","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox Phaser 5550"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-21T00:00:00+00:00"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Xerox Phaser 5550 laser printer combines productivity and reliability with exceptional value. Fast printing, A3, and extensive paper handling and finishing capabilities make this an ideal powerhouse for large offices with diverse, high-volume print demands.\\n\\n- Fast speeds, up to 50 ppm for both single- and two-sided printing, and as fast as 6.5 seconds to first page, quickly handle your demanding workload\\n- Sharp image quality, fine lines and text, fast warm up time, and durable for archiving documents with Xerox EA Toner\\n- Show me more on EA Toner \u203a\\n- 1200 x 1200 dpi resolution delivers exceptional print quality without slowing down the Phaser 5550 printer's powerful performance\\n- High paper capacity of up to 4,100 sheets allows the Phaser 5550 to print more without interruption\\n- Network printing comes standard on all models (except Phaser 5550B) to help more users get more work done\\n- 500 MHz processor and up to 1 GB of memory handles even complex multi-page jobs quickly and easily\\n- Extensive paper handling with custom sizes from postcard to A3 size give you the flexibility to meet your diverse printing needs\\n- Finishing options include a 3,500-sheet stacker or a finisher that stacks, staples, and hole-punches\\n- Advanced printing features include collation, booklet making, and edge-to-edge printing\\n- Secure Print protects your confidential documents by requiring a password entry at the printer before printing (requires optional hard drive)\\n- RAM collation speeds up larger jobs by quickly processing multiple sets of multi-page documents."}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"97d50ac6-7e24-4731-9eb8-83cbbbdcde05","identifier":"1206232","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_letter_216_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung ML-3471ND"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Stellen Sie sich einen Laserdrucker vor, der so zuverl\u00e4ssig ist, dass Sie nie einen Gedanken an seine Leistung verlieren. Mit dem SAMSUNG ML-3471ND f\u00e4llt es leicht, sich das vorzustellen, denn er gibt Ihnen die totale Freiheit mit einem Monatszyklus bis zu 50.000 Seiten und einer gro\u00dfen Tonerkapazit\u00e4t.\\n\\n<B>umfangreiche Kompatibilit\u00e4t<\/b>\\n- Der Drucker unterst\u00fctzt die meisten g\u00e4ngigen Betriebssysteme wie Windows, verschiedene Linux-Betriebssysteme sowie Mac OS 10.3.\\n\\n<B>stabile Netzwerkl\u00f6sungen<\/b>\\n- Nutzen Sie den netzwerkf\u00e4higen Drucker durch den Ethernet-Netzwerkadapter 10\/100 Base TX oder in Kombination mit 10\/100 Basis TX und 802.11b Wireless LAN \u2013 entweder als Zusatz- oder Standardkonfiguration. Die SAMSUNG-Software zur Druckersteuerung erm\u00f6glicht es Ihnen, die SAMSUNG Netzwerkdrucker in Ihrem Netzwerk zu installieren, zu kontrollieren und zu bedienen.\\n\\n<B>vielseitiges Papiermanagement<\/b>\\n- 250-Blatt-Papierzufuhr mit praktischer Abdeckung sorgt f\u00fcr sauberes Papier und einen guten Eindruck auf dem Schreibtisch. Auch Folien, Karten, Umschl\u00e4ge und Etiketten lassen sich \u00fcber die manuelle Papierzufuhr ohne Kassettenwechsel drucken.\\n\\n<B>vielf\u00e4ltige Druckm\u00f6glichkeiten Duplex-Druck<\/b>\\n- Beidseitiger Druck erh\u00f6ht automatisch Ihre Effektivit\u00e4t! Gestalten Sie Ihre Dokumente mit Funktionen wie Drucken \u00fcber die lange oder kurze Seite. Dar\u00fcber hinaus spart Duplex-Druck Papier und macht die Aufbewahrung sowie den Transport einfacher.\\n\\n<B>Druckgeschwindigkeit (A4)<\/b>\\n- Durch den SAMSUNG PowerPC-Hochgeschwindigkeitsprozessor mit 400 MHz und 32 MB (erweiterbar auf 288 MB) drucken Sie bis zu 33 Seiten\/Minute.\\n\\n<B>integrierte Duplex-Einheit<\/b>\\n- Mit nur einem Knopfdruck k\u00f6nnen Sie komfortabel doppelseitige Ausdrucke erstellen. Duplex-Druck \u00fcber die Treibereinstellungen ist selbstverst\u00e4ndlich ebenso m\u00f6glich."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Imagine a network-ready workgroup laser printer designed to perform as fast and efficiently as you do. With a powerful 400 MHz processor and 64 MB memory, this Professional Series Printer is able to deliver a first-page-out in less than 9 seconds and continue to print at up to 35 ppm. With our exclusive TonerSave mode you can even print up to 40% more pages with the same toner cartridge. Built-in duplexing and a 50,000 pages-per-month duty cycle make the ML-3471ND the ideal printer for your busy office.\\n\\n<B>fast print speed<\/b>\\n- Fast print speed means increased productivity. The ML-3471ND delivers single sheets in less than 9 seconds and 100 pages in less than 3 minutes.\\n\\n<B>expandable memory<\/b>\\n- With a 400MHz processor and a 64 MB memory expandable to 320 MB, the ML-3471ND starts fast and stays fast, even when handling complex, large documents.\\n\\n<B>ENERGY STAR compliant<\/b>\\n- By being ENERGY STAR compliant you are assured that your Samsung model is helping the environment by using less energy while saving you money. ENERGY STAR is a joint program of the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency and the U.S. Department of Energy promoting energy efficiency.\\n\\n<B>duplex printing<\/b>\\n- Enhance your efficiency with this built-in, one-touch automatic duplex feature. Printing double-sided documents saves money and time.\\n\\n<B>TonerSave<\/b>\\n- At the touch of a button, the exclusive TonerSave feature saves money and time by extending cartridge life up to 40%.\\n\\n<B>extended duty dycle<\/b>\\n- Boasting a maximum monthly duty cycle of 50,000 pages, the ML-3471ND is designed to meet the demands of the busiest workgroup."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Imaginez une imprimante laser r\u00e9seau pour groupes de travail con\u00e7ue pour fonctionner aussi rapidement et efficacement que vous. Avec son processeur puissant de 400 MHz et sa m\u00e9moire de 64 Mo, cette s\u00e9rie d'imprimantes professionnelles ram\u00e8ne le d\u00e9lai d'impression de la premi\u00e8re page \u00e0 moins de neuf secondes et imprime ensuite jusqu'\u00e0 35 ppm. Gr\u00e2ce au mode d'\u00e9conomie de toner exclusif, vous pouvez imprimer jusqu'\u00e0 40 % de pages de plus avec la m\u00eame cartouche. La fonction recto-verso int\u00e9gr\u00e9e et sa capacit\u00e9 mensuelle de 50 000 pages font de la ML - 3471 ND l'imprimante id\u00e9ale pour les bureaux g\u00e9rant des volumes d'impression \u00e9lev\u00e9s.\\n\\n<B>impression ultrarapide<\/b>\\n- Qui dit rapidit\u00e9 d'impression, dit productivit\u00e9 accrue. La ML-3471ND imprime une page en moins de neuf seconde et 100 page en moins de trois minutes.\\n\\n<B>m\u00e9moire extensible<\/b>\\n- Dot\u00e9e d'un processeur de 400 MHz et d'une m\u00e9moire de 64 Mo extensible \u00e0 320 Mo, la ML-3471ND vous garantit une rapidit\u00e9 constante, m\u00eame avec lors de l'impression de documents volumineux et complexes.\\n\\n<B>\u00e9conomie de toner<\/b>\\n- Il suffit d'appuyer sur un bouton pour activer la fonction exclusive Toner Save : vous gagnez ainsi du temps et de l'argent en augmentant la dur\u00e9e de vie de votre cartouche jusqu'\u00e0 40 %.\\n\\n<B>compatible ENERGY STAR<\/b>\\n- Compatible avec l'initiative ENERGY STAR, votre imprimante SAMSUNG non seulement contribue \u00e0 la pr\u00e9servation de l'environnement en utilisant moins d'\u00e9nergie, mais vous permet de r\u00e9aliser des \u00e9conomies. ENERGY STAR est un programme conjoint de l'organisme am\u00e9ricain Environmental Protection Agency et du minist\u00e8re am\u00e9ricain de l'Energie pour encourager l'efficacit\u00e9 \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique.\\n\\n<B>impression recto-verso<\/b>\\n- Optimisez votre efficacit\u00e9 avec la fonction d'impression recto-verso automatique int\u00e9gr\u00e9e, accessible par la pression d'un seul bouton. Gagnez du temps et de l'argent en imprimant des documents double face.\\n\\n<B>capacit\u00e9 d'impression \u00e9tendue<\/b>\\n- Affichant une capacit\u00e9 d'impression mensuelle maximale de 50 000 pages, la ML-3471ND est con\u00e7ue pour r\u00e9pondre aux attentes des groupes de travail les plus actifs."}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"db983a7c-85b7-4992-a084-f35ff3bf8997","identifier":"1209128","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","trust","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_1024"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5\/6\/6\/d\/566da258479a9f08d41f3bcfae1215261ff7e3d9_1209128_Trust.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/5\/6\/6\/d\/566da258479a9f08d41f3bcfae1215261ff7e3d9_1209128_Trust.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust Megapixel Pro"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1.3"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Hochwertige USB2-Webcam mit einer hohen Hardwareaufl\u00f6sung von 1280 x 1024 Pixel und einer Schnappschussaufl\u00f6sung von 5 Megapixel\\n\\n- Hochwertige USB2-Webcam mit einer hohen Hardwareaufl\u00f6sung von 1280 x 1024 Pixel und einer Schnappschussaufl\u00f6sung von 5 Megapixel\\n- Mit automatischer Gesichtsverfolgung und Digitalzoom mit 3-facher Vergr\u00f6\u00dferung\\n- Mit Schnappschusstaste und integriertem Mikrofon\\n- Ideal f\u00fcr Live Messenger, MSN Messenger, Skype oder andere Messenger-Dienste\\n- Einschlie\u00dflich Software mit Echtzeitvideoeffekten und Bilderrahmen\\n- Selbsteinstellende Klemme zum Befestigen an LCD-Bildschirmen von Notebooks und Flachbildschirmen oder zum Aufstellen auf glatten Oberfl\u00e4chen"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"High quality USB 2.0 webcam with 1280 x 1024 High Definition hardware resolution and 5 megapixel snapshot resolution\\n\\n- 1280 x 1024 hardware resolution\\n- Automatic face tracking technology\\n- Snapshot button\\n- 3x digital zoom\\n- Self-adjusting clamp"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Webcam USB2 de haute qualit\u00e9 avec une r\u00e9solution mat\u00e9rielle 1280 x 1024 de haute d\u00e9finition et une r\u00e9solution de prise de vue de 5 m\u00e9gapixels\\n\\n- Webcam USB2 de haute qualit\u00e9 avec une r\u00e9solution mat\u00e9rielle 1280 x 1024 de haute d\u00e9finition et une r\u00e9solution de prise de vue de 5 m\u00e9gapixels\\n- \u00c9quip\u00e9e de la technologie de suivi automatique des visages et zoom num\u00e9rique 3x\\n- Avec bouton de capture d'image et microphone int\u00e9gr\u00e9e\\n- Id\u00e9ale pour Live Messenger, MSN Messenger, Skype et autres services de messagerie\\n- Logiciel inclus avec des effets vid\u00e9o en temps r\u00e9el et des cadres d'images\\n- Fixation r\u00e9glable automatiquement pour installer la webcam sur des \u00e9crans LCD de portables, des moniteurs \u00e0 \u00e9cran plat ou \u00e0 poser sur une surface plane"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"39682c76-fe4f-44ec-be59-2f7473736fcd","identifier":"1211614","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["kodak","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3\/f\/c\/4\/3fc4a665d3a0ba034411f6829231ff16f0d22082_1211614_5608.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/3\/f\/c\/4\/3fc4a665d3a0ba034411f6829231ff16f0d22082_1211614_5608.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kodak Scanner upgrade kit I640 TO I660"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Through the years, Kodak has led the way with an abundance of new products and processes that have made photography simpler, more useful and more enjoyable. Today, the company's work increasingly involves digital technology, combining the power and convenience of electronics with the quality of traditional photography to produce systems that bring levels of utility and fun to the taking, \"making\" and utilization of images."}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9f4dcb23-0d94-4dd9-bf96-2b00f10aa3c6","identifier":"12226421","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox Phaser 7500DT"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"110-240V, 50\/60 Hz"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"79.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Competitive Edge - Phaser 7500<\/b>\\n- Faster print speeds than the competition;\\n- Faster processor than most competitive products;\\n- Faster first-page-out time in color compared with the competition;\\n- Prints on heavier media than competitors (up to 280 gsm) for more creative flexibility;\\n- True Adobe\u00ae PostScript\u00ae 3\u2122 and PCL\u00ae 5c versus emulations for more accurate printing across platforms;\\n- Supports oversized media from the tray without having to resort to the manual feeder. Optional lower trays (1 standard on the Phaser 7500\/DT) support up to 12\" x 18\";\\n- More print features come standard on the Phaser 7500, including Booklet printing, Scaling, Watermarks, Custom size paper, Run black, Cover pages, RAM collation, Remote printing, Separation pages, N-Up printing, Banners and Black trapping;\\n- Xerox Total Satisfaction Guarantee, only offered by Xerox, ensures that you will be satisfied with your choice to buy a Phaser 7500.\\n\\n<b>On-demand productivity - Phaser 7500<\/b>\\n- Fast print speeds (up to 35 ppm and first-page-out as fast 7 seconds) mean you don\u2019t have to wait, even for complex color jobs;\\n- Built-in networking is standard so all users--Microsoft Windows, Apple Macintosh and Linux--can tap into the fast Gigabit Ethernet;\\n- Increase accountability and reduce costs with features that track and analyze color and black-only printing, and help you accurately charge back billing for individuals or departments;\\n- Scale to fit your workgroup\u2019s space from a low-profile desktop model to a highly productive floor-standing model with three additional oversize media ready 500-sheet trays;\\n- Print in-house with Phaser 7500 instead of sending jobs out to commercial printers or quick copy shops, saving time and money.\\n\\n<b>Quality color you can count on - Phaser 7500<\/b>\\n- Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi image resolution gives you sharp, detailed prints on the Phaser 7500;\\n- Precise color matching with Pantone\u00ae-approved color tables and true Adobe\u00ae PostScript\u00ae 3\u2122 mean your prints will look exactly as you intended;\\n- Xerox Emulsion Aggregate (EA) Toner produces the smallest toner particles in the market, resulting in finer lines, higher contrast and sharper image quality. It requires less energy to manufacture and less toner per page.\\n\\n<b>Easy to use and manage - Phaser 7500<\/b>\\n- Easily manage, configure and troubleshoot the Phaser 7500 from any computer using CentreWare\u00ae Internet Services network web administration tools;\\n- Easy-open access is in front so you don\u2019t need to rotate or move the Phaser 7500 to change toner or add paper;\\n- Get immediate updates on your print job status, toner supply levels and troubleshooting tips via the front panel, your desktop or the web;\\n- Store frequently printed files on the built-in hard drive (standard on 7500DX) for fast, easy, walk-up printing;\\n- Private data stays secure with Secure Print, which holds the job in the queue until a PIN is entered at the printer, and Hard Drive overwrite \"shreds\" data after every job or request;\\n- Built-in support for security protocols, including IPv6, 802.1x and IPSec, makes the Phaser 7500 a good network citizen;\\n- Consistent output print after print is ensured thru advanced automatic color calibration requiring no user intervention;\\n- Color By Words color correction lets you select desired color modifications from a simple drop-down list."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"15ead78e-876f-43a4-8e67-55f246ede9e5","identifier":"12228970","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","sony","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony KDL-60NX720"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"29.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":60,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony KDL-60NX720. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital, Dolby Digital Plus, Dolby Pulse. Smart modes: Cinema, Game, Personal, Photo, Sports, Standard, Vivid. Power consumption (standby): 0.3, Energy efficiency class: A"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-29T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"28f8a3cd-81b8-497c-9be2-9a7612167b64","identifier":"12229003","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","sony","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony KDL-55HX820"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"23.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":55,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony KDL-55HX820. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital, Dolby Digital Plus, Dolby Pulse. Smart modes: Cinema, Game, Personal, Photo, Sports, Standard, Vivid. Swivel angle range: -20 - 20"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-29T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0454dafc-65be-4666-aa9c-62ceeb463f97","identifier":"12233955","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung 700DX-3"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":70,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Samsung DX (n) -3 Serie \u2013 Pro-AV-Displays f\u00fcr Langzeitbetrieb<\/b>\\n- 177,8 cm (70\u201c) Large Format Display;\\n- F\u00fcr 24\/7 Betrieb geeignet;\\n- Sehr gute Darstellungsqualit\u00e4t;\\n- Hohe Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit;\\n- Kompatibel mit PC-Modul \u201eSBB-A\u201c.\\n\\nDie DX-3 Serie, verf\u00fcgbar in 101,6 cm (40\"), 116,84 cm (46\") und 178,8 cm (70\") \u00fcberzeugt mit hoher Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit und sehr guter Darstellungsqualit\u00e4t. Das hochwertige Full HD DID Panel bietet ideale Voraussetzungen f\u00fcr den Langzeitbetrieb und eine repr\u00e4sentative Darstellung Ihrer Inhalte am POS & POI. Gegen\u00fcber den Vorg\u00e4ngermodellen der DX (n) -2 Serie gl\u00e4nzen die Nachfolger mit einer um bis zu 25% reduzierten Leistungsaufnahme und einem deutlich reduzierten Gewicht von bis zu 32% (modellabh\u00e4ngig). Gleichzeitig wurde das Anschlussfeld optimiert und verf\u00fcgt jetzt unter anderem auch \u00fcber einen Display-Port-Anschluss. Weitere Verbesserungen gab es im Bereich der Fernsteuerung, die nun neben RS-232C auch per RJ-45 m\u00f6glich ist. Zudem ist ein deutlich umfangreicherer On \/ Off Timer implementiert worden und \u00fcber den DVI Loop Out Anschluss k\u00f6nnen untereinander (Daisy Chain) jetzt \u00fcber 100 Ger\u00e4te bei Full-HD-Aufl\u00f6sung verbunden werden, ohne dass zus\u00e4tzliche teure Videosplitter-Hardware oder Signalverst\u00e4rker ben\u00f6tigt werden. Durch den vorhandenen PC-Modul-Einschubschacht k\u00f6nnen die Modelle um einen integrierten PC auf Basis von Windows Embedded Standard 2009 oder Windows 7 Embedded Standard (modellabh\u00e4ngig) erweitert werden, was die Digital Signage Eigenschaften aufwertet.\\n\\n<b>Ein wirklich zeitgem\u00e4\u00dfer Terminplaner<\/b>\\nWollen Sie sichergehen, dass Ihr Gro\u00dfbildschirm keine unn\u00f6tige Energie verbraucht? Daf\u00fcr bieten Samsung LFDs ein praktisches Hilfsmittel: den Terminplaner. Mit ihm k\u00f6nnen Sie Betriebszeiten, Ruhezeiten, Wochentage, Lautst\u00e4rken und Signalquellen im Voraus einstellen \u2013 und auf dem intuitiv bedienbaren On-Screen-Display haben Sie gleich drei solcher Pl\u00e4ne im \u00dcberblick.\\n\\n<b>Verbesserte Konnektivit\u00e4t ohne zus\u00e4tzliche Kosten<\/b>\\nStellen Sie sich ein professionelles digitales Monitorsystem zusammen, ohne kostspielige Investitionen, wie etwa Signalverteiler oder andere Zusatzger\u00e4te. Samsung macht es Ihnen leicht: mit dem Display-Port, einem Interface, das verbesserte Verbindungsm\u00f6glichkeiten schafft. Sollten Sie schon \u00fcber l\u00e4ngere HDMI- oder DVI-Kabel verf\u00fcgen, so k\u00f6nnen Sie diese durch die Verwendung eines einfachen, optional erh\u00e4ltlichen Adapters von DVI -> DP oder HDMI -> DP weiterverwenden. Der neue DP-Anschluss erm\u00f6glicht die Verwendung von l\u00e4ngeren Kabeln ohne zus\u00e4tzliche Hardware. Das ist die einfache und kosteng\u00fcnstige M\u00f6glichkeit, wie Sie eindrucksvolle Display-Ideen verwirklichen k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>Ausdrucksstarke, brillante Bilder<\/b>\\nMit dem hochwertigen DID-Panel steht Ihre visuelle Botschaft immer im Mittelpunkt. Die hohe Leuchtkraft und das sehr gute Kontrastverh\u00e4ltnis dieser Monitorserie garantieren eine kristallklare und eindrucksvolle Pr\u00e4sentation \u2013 selbst unter ung\u00fcnstigen Bedingungen und an \u00f6ffentlichen Pl\u00e4tzen. Tats\u00e4chlich ist die Eigenhelligkeit bei diesem Display durchschnittlich 1 1\/2-mal so gro\u00df, wie bei einem Display f\u00fcr TV-Zwecke. Dabei garantieren die niedrigen Betriebstemperaturen des LFD einen langj\u00e4hrigen und absolut zuverl\u00e4ssigen Betrieb.\\n\\n<b>Eingebaute Lautsprecher sparen Geld und Platz<\/b>\\nBestes Bild und detailreicher Klang \u2013 so macht Ihre Multimedia-Pr\u00e4sentation wirklich Eindruck. Die hochwertigen eingebauten Lautsprecher liefern einen umwerfenden Sound. Sie sparen sich ein klobiges und kostspieliges externes Soundsystem und nicht zuletzt viel Platz.\\n\\n<b>Hervorragende Bildqualit\u00e4t ohne st\u00f6rende Lichtreflexionen<\/b>\\nOb Filmvorf\u00fchrung oder Produktpr\u00e4sentation \u2013 Spiegelungen und Blendeffekte sind hier nicht gew\u00fcnscht, sondern kristallklare, eindrucksvolle Bilder, die genau das wiedergeben, was man sich vorgestellt hat. Dieses Samsung LFD schafft das sogar unter schwierigsten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen. Reflexionen werden eliminiert und Ihre visuellen Botschaften kommen immer klar und deutlich beim Zuschauer an.\\n\\n<b>Digitale Video Walls leicht gemacht<\/b>\\n\u00dcber den DVI Loop Out Anschluss k\u00f6nnen Sie das Bildsignal in verlustfreier Qualit\u00e4t an weitere LFD-Monitore durchleiten. W\u00e4hrend man fr\u00fcher f\u00fcr eine Video-Wand jeden einzelnen Monitor mit einem digitalen Videodistributor verbinden musste, ist die Sache dank des DVI Loop Out Anschlusses wesentlich einfacher geworden: Jeder Monitor erzeugt seinen Bildausschnitt in bester digitaler Qualit\u00e4t und Sie ben\u00f6tigen keinen zentralen Videoverteiler mehr. Das ist nun wirklich eine benutzerfreundliche und preisg\u00fcnstige L\u00f6sung, um mehrere Displays miteinander zu vernetzen.\\n\\n<b>Zuverl\u00e4ssig, robust und staubresistent<\/b>\\nWir stellen vor: ein Monitor, dem der Zahn der Zeit nicht viel anhaben kann. Dieses LFD von Samsung ist besonders widerstandsf\u00e4hig. Dank eines aufw\u00e4ndig gekapselten Designs des DID-Panels ist dieses deutlich unempfindlicher gegen feinen Staub als z.B. ein vergleichbares TV-Panel. Somit werden auch in schwierigen Umgebungen Bildinhalte langfristig optimal dargestellt.\\n\\n<b>Update n\u00f6tig? \u2013 Kein Problem!<\/b>\\nBei den neuen Samsung LFDs kann im Falle eines n\u00f6tigen Firmware-Updates dieses auf genial einfache Weise durchgef\u00fchrt werden. Das Einzige, was f\u00fcr die \u00dcbertragung der neuen Firmware-Datei ben\u00f6tigt wird, ist ein PC oder NotePC mit DP-, HDMI- oder DVI-Anschluss. Keine spezielle Hardware, keine speziellen Kabel \u2013 eine einfache Direktverbindung reicht vollkommen aus.\\n\\n<b>Eine Videowand, wie in Ihren k\u00fchnsten Tr\u00e4umen<\/b>\\nBauen Sie sich die ultimative Videowand. Der in jedem Ger\u00e4t integrierte Bildprozessor unterst\u00fctzt Anordnungen von 1 x 1 bis 10 x 10 Displays und l\u00e4sst Ihnen jeden Freiraum bei der Gestaltung des Gro\u00dfbilderlebnisses. Die M\u00f6glichkeiten sind nahezu unbegrenzt.\\n\\n<b>Einfache Fernwartung mehrerer Monitore<\/b>\\nGerade bei umfangreicheren Display-Installationen, z.B. in Firmengeb\u00e4uden \u00fcber verschiedene Etagen verteilt, ist eine zentrale und einfache Fernwartung von gro\u00dfer Bedeutung. Dieses Samsung Large Format Display unterst\u00fctzt die Fernsteuerung und \u00dcberwachung per konventioneller RS-232C-Schnittstelle, aber auch per RJ-45-Anschluss, was besonders bei gr\u00f6\u00dferen Distanzen zwischen Kontroll-PC und zu \u00fcberwachenden Displays von Vorteil ist.\\n\\n<b>Immer die richtige Perspektive \u2013 Breitbild oder Portr\u00e4t<\/b>\\nDie LFD-Monitore von Samsung lassen sich um 90 Grad drehen und k\u00f6nnen Bilder auf unkomplizierte Weise im Hochformat anzeigen. Die Pivot-Funktion bietet Ihnen ein Optimum an Flexibilit\u00e4t f\u00fcr Pr\u00e4sentationen aller Art.\\n\\n<b>Wer cool bleibt, lebt l\u00e4nger<\/b>\\nWenn es hei\u00df hergeht, bleibt das Backlight unserer LFD-Monitore trotzdem angenehm k\u00fchl \u2013 dank einer fl\u00fcsterleisen und automatisch zugeschalteten Luftk\u00fchlung, die stets f\u00fcr niedrige Betriebstemperaturen, Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit und lange Lebensdauer sorgt. Mit dem einfach zu bedienenden On-Screen-Display haben Sie zus\u00e4tzliche Kontrollm\u00f6glichkeiten zur L\u00fcftersteuerung.\\n\\n<b>Modulsystem f\u00fcr h\u00f6chste technische Flexibilit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nDank des Einschubschachts f\u00fcr das Samsung Slide-in-Module (SIM-NT) kann Ihr Large Format Display auch nachtr\u00e4glich um einen integrierten PC erweitert werden. Der seitliche Slot erm\u00f6glicht eine einfache Installation in nur wenigen Minuten. Die Spezifikationen des SIM-NT k\u00f6nnen unter dem Reiter \"Zubeh\u00f6r\" eingesehen werden.\\n\\n<b>Doppeltes Informationsangebot auf einem Bildschirm<\/b>\\nDank der Funktionen PBP (Picture by Picture = Bild neben Bild) und PIP (Picture in Picture = Bild im Bild) lassen sich Bilder aus zwei verschiedenen Quellen gleichzeitig darstellen \u2013 eine M\u00f6glichkeit, die in vielen F\u00e4llen den Eindruck einer Pr\u00e4sentation nochmals verbessert."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung 700DX-3. Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Display: LCD, Display technology: PVA. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 800 x 400. Input voltage: 100 - 240, Input frequency: 50\/60. Certification: FCC, CE, EN, VCCI, KCC, BSMI, C-Tick, CCC, GB, UL, CSA, NEMKO, PSB, GOST, SIQ, PCBC, NOM, IRAM, SASO. Dimensions (WxDxH): 1668 x 138 x 990, Package dimensions (WxDxH): 1850 x 610 x 1231"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>700DX-3<\/b>\\n- Fiable, r\u00e9sistant et anti-poussi\u00e8re.\\n- \u00c9conomisez de l'argent et de l'espace avec les haut-parleurs int\u00e9gr\u00e9s.\\n- Un kit de ventilation int\u00e9gr\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Fiable, r\u00e9sistant et anti-poussi\u00e8re<\/b>\\nOptez pour un moniteur professionnel \u00e0 l'\u00e9preuve du temps et de la poussi\u00e8re. Ce moniteur LFD Samsung b\u00e9n\u00e9ficie d'un traitement anti-poussi\u00e8re ainsi que d'une fabrication renforc\u00e9 et \u00e9tanche. Soyez certains que la poussi\u00e8re et la salet\u00e9 ne d\u00e9grade la bonne diffusion de votre message.\\n\\n<b>Un kit de ventilation int\u00e9gr\u00e9<\/b>\\nProfitez d\u2019un fonctionnement fiable et continu gr\u00e2ce au ventilateur int\u00e9gr\u00e9. Log\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur de votre moniteur SyncMaster 700DX-3, le ventilateur \u00e9vite tout risque de surchauffe. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement configurer les param\u00e8tres de ventilation \u00e0 l\u2019aide d\u2019un menu intuitif sur l'\u00e9cran.\\n\\n<b>Paysage ou portrait, choisissez le format qui convient \u00e0 vos besoins<\/b>\\nCe moniteur grand format Samsung vous offre la possibilit\u00e9 d'afficher votre image verticalement ou horizontalement. Avec sa fonction pivot qui bascule le contenu m\u00e9dia de 90\u00b0 degr\u00e9, affichez vos pr\u00e9sentations et publicit\u00e9s comme bon vous semble. Avec un tel avantage, votre moniteur b\u00e9n\u00e9ficie d'une polyvalence et d'une flexibilit\u00e9 incomparable.\\n\\n<b>Profitez d'une connectique compl\u00e8te sans frais suppl\u00e9mentaires<\/b>\\nCr\u00e9er un \u00e9cran digital professionnel sans avoir \u00e0 d\u00e9penser des frais suppl\u00e9mentaires. Samsung facilite la connectivit\u00e9 par la pr\u00e9sence d'un Display Port sur le 700DX-3. Avec un simple adaptateur, vous pouvez connecter votre PC. D\u00e9couvrez une mani\u00e8re simple et rentable pour cr\u00e9er un affichage dynamique professionnel et puissant.\\n\\n<b>Param\u00e9trer un planning de diffusion toujours \u00e0 l'heure<\/b>\\nLaisser votre moniteur fonctionner de mani\u00e8re efficace tout le temps. Ce moniteur LFD Samsung poss\u00e8de une fonction de programmation horaire intelligente. La fonction de mise en fonctionnement automatique vous permet de r\u00e9gler l'heure, la date, le contenu, la source ainsi que des horaires de mise en veille. Il existe \u00e9galement un param\u00e9trage intuitif permettant de r\u00e9gler jusqu'\u00e0 trois programmes incluant jour et heure.\\n\\n<b>Mise \u00e0 jour sans effort<\/b>\\nCe LFD Samsung rend les mises \u00e0 jour faciles. La transmission d'information est simplement effectu\u00e9e via un c\u00e2ble DVI, HDMI ou Display Port. Ainsi, les LFD Samsung vous permettent de faire des mises \u00e0 jour sans effort depuis une connexion directe avec votre PC."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2011-12-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3cc5f6b0-fda5-4a49-bb15-52d80632ee0a","identifier":"12239052","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["hp","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"b\/e\/b\/9\/beb98d68cd3922f5416658d6ccbe97d34708bf02_12239052_HP.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/b\/e\/b\/9\/beb98d68cd3922f5416658d6ccbe97d34708bf02_12239052_HP.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Scanjet G4050"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"5.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Es ist m\u00f6glich, mehrere Fotos, Dias, Folien und Negative gleichzeitig zu scannen. 6-Farb-Scans mit 96 Bit sorgen f\u00fcr au\u00dferordentliche<SUP>1<\/SUP> Farbgenauigkeit \u2013 das bietet nur HP. Dank einer Hardware-Aufl\u00f6sung von 4.800 x 9.600 dpi wird jedes Detail erfasst<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Zus\u00e4tzlich gibt es die Option, auf Infrarotbasis Staub- und Kratzspuren zu retuschieren.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Hoch aufl\u00f6sende 6-Farb-Scans von Fotos, Dias, Folien und Negativen: Das gibt es nur bei HP.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Mehrere Fotos, Dias, Folien und Negative gleichzeitig in brillante, farbgenaue digitale Bilder umwandeln. 6-Farb-Scans mit 96 Bit erm\u00f6glichen Ergebnisse h\u00f6chster Qualit\u00e4t<SUP>1<\/SUP> \u2013 das bietet nur HP. Hoch aufl\u00f6sende Ergebnisse mit 4.800 x 9.600 dpi<SUP>3<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Viele Fotos, Dias, Folien oder Negative gleichzeitig scannen und automatisch Staub- und Kratzspuren retuschieren.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Mehrere Originale gleichzeitig scannen und als separate Dateien speichern \u2013 16 Kleinbilddias, 30 Negative, zwei mittelgro\u00dfe Durchsichtsvorlagen (120 mm), eine gro\u00dfe Durchsichtsvorlage oder vier Fotos im Format 10 x 15 cm. Staub- und Kratzspuren lassen sich mithilfe der integrierten Infrarottechnologie retuschieren.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erinnerungen per Tastendruck bewahren \u2013 plus einfache Farbauffrischung und Fotooptimierung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Fotos, Dias, Folien und Negative per Tastendruck digitalisieren. Alte Originale werden dank verschiedener intuitiver Tools wieder lebendig. Farben auffrischen, rote Augen korrigieren und Details auf dunklen Fotos besser zur Geltung bringen \u2013 all dies leisten die HP Real Life Technologies.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Auf Grundlage unabh\u00e4ngiger Scanner-Tests, Dez. 06. http:\/\/digitalkamera.image-engineering.de\/index.php\/Publications<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Nicht verf\u00fcgbar beim 6-Farb-Scannen von Negativen; Die maximale Aufl\u00f6sung h\u00e4ngt von den Systemfaktoren des PCs ab<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Nicht verf\u00fcgbar beim 6-Farb-Scannen von Negativen; die maximale Aufl\u00f6sung ist abh\u00e4ngig von den Systemfaktoren des PC<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Scan multiple photos, slides, film and negatives and get superior[1] colour accuracy with 6-colour, 96-bit scanning \u2013 exclusive to HP. Capture every detail with 4800 x 9600-dpi hardware resolution[2]. Get infrared-based dust \/scratch removal too.\\n\\n<b>HP-exclusive 6-colour high-definition scanning for photos, slides, film and negatives.<\/b>\\n\\nConvert packs of photos, slides, film and negatives into vivid, colour accurate digital images and get the highest quality scans[1] with 6-colour, 96-bit scanning \u2013 exclusive to HP. Get high definition results at 4800 x 9600-dpi resolution[2].\\n\\n<b>Scan stacks of photos, slides, films or negatives, and automatically remove dust and scratches.<\/b>\\n\\nScan multiple originals \u2013 sixteen 35 mm slides, 30 negative frames, two medium format (120 mm) or one large format film frame or four 10 x 15 cm prints \u2013 and save as separate files. Remove dust and scratches using built-in infrared technology.\\n\\n<b>Preserve your memories at the touch of a button \u2013 plus easy colour restoration and photo fixing.<\/b>\\n\\nDigitise photos, slides, film and negatives using one-touch buttons. Bring old originals back to life with a range of intuitive tools. Restore faded colour, remove red-eye and bring detail out of dark photos, all using HP Real Life technologies.\\n\\n- [1] Based on independent tests of in-class scanners, Dec 06. www.digitalkamera.image-engineering.de\/index.php\/Publications\\n- [2] Not available when scanning negatives in 6-colour; maximum resolution may be affected by PC system factors"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Num\u00e9risez un grand nombre de photos, diapositives, pellicules et n\u00e9gatifs et dotez-vous d'une pr\u00e9cision de couleurs sup\u00e9rieure<SUP>1<\/SUP> avec une num\u00e9risation 6\u00a0couleurs, 96\u00a0bits \u2013 une exclusivit\u00e9 HP. Captez chaque d\u00e9tail en r\u00e9solution mat\u00e9rielle 4\u00a0800 x 9\u00a0600\u00a0ppp<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Dotez-vous \u00e9galement de la suppression des poussi\u00e8res\/des rayures par infrarouge.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Pr\u00e9cision des couleurs haute d\u00e9finition 6\u00a0couleurs, pour photos, diapositives, pellicules et n\u00e9gatifs - une exclusivit\u00e9 HP.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Convertissez un grand nombre de photos, diapositives, pellicules et n\u00e9gatifs en images num\u00e9riques aux couleurs pr\u00e9cises et vives et obtenez des num\u00e9risations de tr\u00e8s haute qualit\u00e9<SUP>3<\/SUP>, avec une num\u00e9risation 6 couleurs, 96 bits - une exclusivit\u00e9 HP. Obtenez des r\u00e9sultats haute d\u00e9finition avec r\u00e9solution 4\u00a0800 x 9\u00a0600\u00a0ppp<SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Num\u00e9risez des piles de photos, diapositives, pellicules ou n\u00e9gatifs et supprimez automatiquement les poussi\u00e8res et les rayures.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Num\u00e9risez un grand nombre d'originaux - seize diapositives 35\u00a0mm, 30 n\u00e9gatifs, deux pellicules moyen format (120\u00a0mm), une pellicule grand format ou quatre impressions 10 x 15\u00a0cm, et enregistrez-les en fichiers s\u00e9par\u00e9s. Supprimez les poussi\u00e8res et les rayures avec la technologie infrarouge int\u00e9gr\u00e9e.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Pr\u00e9servez vos souvenirs d'une pression de touche \u2013 et restaurez facilement les photos et les couleurs.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Num\u00e9risez les photos, diapositives, pellicules et n\u00e9gatifs avec les touches de fonctions directes. Redonnez vie \u00e0 vos anciens originaux avec toute une gamme d'outils intuitifs. Restaurez les couleurs pass\u00e9es, \u00e9liminez l'effet \u00ab\u00a0yeux rouges\u00a0\u00bb et r\u00e9v\u00e9lez les d\u00e9tails des photos sombres, \u00e0 l'aide de la technologie HP Real Life.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Bas\u00e9 sur des tests ind\u00e9pendants des scanners int\u00e9gr\u00e9s, d\u00e9c. 06. http:\/\/digitalkamera.image-engineering.de\/index.php\/Publications<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Non disponible lors de la num\u00e9ration de n\u00e9gatifs en 6\u00a0couleurs\u00a0; la r\u00e9solution maximale peut \u00eatre affect\u00e9e par des facteurs li\u00e9s au syst\u00e8me de l'ordinateur<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Bas\u00e9 sur des tests ind\u00e9pendants des scanners int\u00e9gr\u00e9s, Dec 06. http:\/\/digitalkamera.image-engineering.de\/index.php\/Publications<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> Non disponible lors de la num\u00e9ration de n\u00e9gatifs en 6 couleurs; la r\u00e9solution maximale peut \u00eatre affect\u00e9e par des facteurs li\u00e9s au syst\u00e8me de l'ordinateur<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-01T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"141593c8-a456-40fb-b97a-86ca83efa7b3","identifier":"12239064","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["hp","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3\/d\/a\/f\/3daf5f8f374d52a25b6528c049f785036324e796_12239064_HP.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/3\/d\/a\/f\/3daf5f8f374d52a25b6528c049f785036324e796_12239064_HP.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Scanjet G4010"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"4.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Herausragende<SUP>1<\/SUP> Farbgenauigkeit durch innovatives 6-Farb-Fotoscannen \u2013 das bietet nur HP. Auch das Scannen von Dias und Negativen ist m\u00f6glich, wobei dank einer Hardware-Aufl\u00f6sung von 4.800 x 9.600 dpi jedes Detail erfasst wird<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Verblasste Farben lassen sich auffrischen und sogar alte Fotos und Dias werden wieder sch\u00f6n.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Hoch aufl\u00f6sende 6-Farb-Fotoscans plus Durchlichteinheit f\u00fcr Dias und Negative: Das gibt es nur bei HP.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Um 40 % genauere Farbwiedergabe<SUP>1<\/SUP> als bei anderen Scannern dank 6-Farb-Scans mit 96 Bit \u2013 das bietet nur HP. Die integrierte Durchlichteinheit erm\u00f6glicht das Scannen von Dias und Negativen \u2013 f\u00fcr gestochen scharfe, hoch aufl\u00f6sende Ergebnisse mit 4.800 x 9.600 dpi<SUP>2<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erinnerungen bewahren \u2013 mit intuitiven Tools lassen sich alte oder besch\u00e4digte Originale restaurieren.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Alte Fotos, Dias und Negative werden dank verschiedener intuitiver Tools wieder lebendig. U. a. gibt es ein Tool zum einfachen Retuschieren von Staub- und Kratzspuren. Farben auffrischen, rote Augen korrigieren und Details auf dunklen Fotos besser zur Geltung bringen \u2013 all dies leisten die HP Real Life Technologies.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Mit praktischen Direkttasten scannen und die Scans \u00fcber die mitgelieferte Software bearbeiten und weiterleiten.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Schnelles, einfaches Scannen von Fotos oder Dias\/Negativen per Tastendruck. Kopien und Vervielf\u00e4ltigungen per Tastendruck erstellen und Dateien als PDFs speichern, die sich bequem weiterleiten lassen. Die benutzerfreundliche HP Photosmart Software erm\u00f6glicht das Verwalten, Bearbeiten und Mailen von Fotos.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Auf Grundlage unabh\u00e4ngiger Scanner-Tests, Dez. 06. http:\/\/digitalkamera.image-engineering.de\/index.php\/Publications<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Die maximale Aufl\u00f6sung ist abh\u00e4ngig von den Systemfaktoren des PC<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>World's first 6-colour photo scanner for industry-leading colour accuracy. Enjoy high-definition scan quality that delivers vivid and realistic images with each scan.<\/b>\\n\\n- Capture true-to-original colour for your creative projects with HP\u2019s exclusive, 6-colour, 96-bit photo scanning. Get high-definition detail with 4800 x 9600-dpi resolution[1].\\n- Easily restore colours to old, faded photos, and remove dust or scratches with HP Real Life technologies' scanning software. Give photos a more vibrant, realistic quality with HP Adaptive Lighting which brighten darker areas and bring out details.\\n- Easily convert documents and images to digital files using the 4 one-touch buttons: Scan, Scan Film, Copy and HP Photosmart Instant Share. Archive or share via email and edit text from scanned documents.\\n\\n[1] Not available for scanning negatives in 6-colour; maximum resolution may be affected by PC system factors"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Dotez-vous d'une pr\u00e9cision de couleurs sup\u00e9rieure et exceptionnelle <SUP>1<\/SUP> avec la num\u00e9risation de photos 6\u00a0couleurs \u2013 une exclusivit\u00e9 HP. Num\u00e9risez les diapositives et les n\u00e9gatifs et captez chaque d\u00e9tail en r\u00e9solution mat\u00e9rielle 4\u00a0800 x 9\u00a0600\u00a0ppp<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Ravivez les couleurs pass\u00e9es et restaurez vos anciennes photos et diapositives.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Num\u00e9risation de photos haute d\u00e9finition 6 couleurs, une exclusivit\u00e9 HP, plus adaptateur de diapos\/n\u00e9gatifs.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Captures des couleurs qui sont 40 % plus pr\u00e9cises<SUP>1<\/SUP> que les autres scanners avec la num\u00e9risation HP de photos 6 couleurs, 96 bits. Num\u00e9risez \u00e9galement vos diapositives et n\u00e9gatifs avec l'adaptateur int\u00e9gr\u00e9, pour des r\u00e9sultats impeccables haute d\u00e9finition en r\u00e9solution 4 800 x 9 600 ppp<SUP>2<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Pr\u00e9servez vos souvenirs \u2013 des outils intuitifs vous aident \u00e0 restaurer des originaux anciens ou ab\u00eem\u00e9s.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Rendez vie aux photos, diapositives et n\u00e9gatifs anciens, avec toute une gamme d'outils intuitifs notamment pour supprimer poussi\u00e8res et rayures. Restaurez les couleurs pass\u00e9es, \u00e9liminez l'effet \u00ab\u00a0yeux rouges\u00a0\u00bb et r\u00e9v\u00e9lez les d\u00e9tails des photos sombres, \u00e0 l'aide de la technologie HP Real Life.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Num\u00e9risez facilement \u00e0 l'aide des touches de fonctions directes, modifiez et partagez \u00e0 l'aide du logiciel fourni.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Appr\u00e9ciez la num\u00e9risation rapide de photos ou de diapos\/n\u00e9gatifs, avec les touches de fonctions directes. R\u00e9alisez copies et retirages d'une pression de touche, et enregistrez-les au format PDF pour faciliter le partage. Organisez vos photos, corrigez-les et envoyez-les par courrier \u00e9lectronique avec le logiciel HP Photosmart, facile \u00e0 utiliser.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Bas\u00e9 sur des tests ind\u00e9pendants des scanners int\u00e9gr\u00e9s, Dec 06. http:\/\/digitalkamera.image-engineering.de\/index.php\/Publications<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> La r\u00e9solution maximale peut \u00eatre affect\u00e9e par des facteurs li\u00e9s au syst\u00e8me de l'ordinateur<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-01T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"720691c4-e2de-4942-8f82-a34005ef3351","identifier":"12240420","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["acer","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Acer S 230HL Abd"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Acer 230HL Abd, S. Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Display: LED, Contrast ratio (dynamic): 100000000:1. Input voltage: 100 - 240, Input frequency: 50\/60. Depth: 12.9. Cables included: AC"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-01T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7ad2f111-be51-451f-beed-2def5516cd24","identifier":"12246589","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","salora","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Salora 32LED7100C LED TV"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Salora 32LED7100C. HD type: HD-Ready, Display resolution: 1367 x 768, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. HDMI version: 1.3. Video formats supported: XVID, Audio formats supported: MP3, Image formats supported: JPG. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 200 x 100"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-03T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bf64c1b7-c8b6-45df-9a87-2ab8c4d9a902","identifier":"12249736","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"c\/3\/1\/f\/c31f857d4e564810a2504fd3a7cbc475fbe785a6_12249736_407.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/c\/3\/1\/f\/c31f857d4e564810a2504fd3a7cbc475fbe785a6_12249736_407.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision AV-220C2M+"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der AV220C2M+ ist ein hochqualitativer Scanner mit einem integrierten Imprinter. Durch diese Kombination k\u00f6nnen Sie Vorlagen einscannen und gleichzeitig eine Zahlen- und Buchstabenreihe auf die R\u00fcckseite drucken. \u00dcber die TWAIN-Schnittstelle k\u00f6nnen Sie den Druckbereichi f\u00fcr den alphanummerischen Code festlegen und auch die Schriftart und -gr\u00f6\u00dfe definieren.\\n\\nDer Avision AV220C2M+ kann Ihre Tr\u00e4ume wahr werden lassen. Alles was Sie machen m\u00fcssen ist es, die zu scannenden Unterlagen in den automatischen Dokumenteneinzug zu legen und den 'Scan'-Knopf dr\u00fccken.\\n\\nMit einem Minimum an Zeit und Aufwand k\u00f6nnen Sie nun vorbereitete Dokumente einscannen, wenn Sie sie ben\u00f6tigen. Der Avision AV220C2M+ ist mit einer 600 dpi hochaufl\u00f6senden, professionellen CCD optischen Scanner Technologie und einem wartungsfreien, automatischen Dokumenteneinzug f\u00fcr gro\u00dfe Kapazit\u00e4ten ausgestattet. Mit der Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 40 Seiten pro Minute und den anderen Funktionen macht der Avision AV220C2M+ Ihr Unternehmen wettbewerbsf\u00e4hig!"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Avision's popular 220 series has a new addition \u2013 the AV220C2M+. With the same outstanding speeds, reliability and capacity as the rest of the series, the AV220C2M+ has a special new feature: a detachable magnetic ink character recognition endorser module.\\n\\nThis is perfect for endorsing cheques and other official documents, making light work of record-keeping, indexing and retrieval. Choose from applying the endorsement digitally or by printing it on the back of the originals\/copies. Bundled software with the AV220C2M+ also means you can output scans as searchable PDFs - making information retrieval and distribution as easy as pie.\\n\\nAvision AV220C2M+ Features:\\n\\n- Detachable endorser \/ magnetic ink character recognition (MICR) module enables endorsement of scanned documents, digitally or printed on their reverse.\\n- Ideal for endorsing cheques and other official documents, making record-keeping, retrieval and indexing easy.\\n- Scan rate up to 36 pages \/ 72 images per minute (simplex \/ duplex modes, B&W or colour at 200 dpi)\\n- Auto document feed holds up to 50 pages."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eb055bb2-0466-4000-9fb1-7790ec8c105e","identifier":"12249740","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3\/5\/a\/4\/35a4b5db0b5ed11428448d7cb567b1db0def0e81_12249740_4511.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/3\/5\/a\/4\/35a4b5db0b5ed11428448d7cb567b1db0def0e81_12249740_4511.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision AV36"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Sammeln sich unterwegs zu viele Dokumente an?\\nEntscheiden sie sich f\u00fcr den Avision AV36 Scanner.\\n\\nDieser vollst\u00e4ndig portable Scanner erlaubt ihnen das Einscannen von allen ihren Dokumenten, Fotos, Visitenkarten, Ausweisen, Kreditkarten und Bl\u00e4ttern bis\\nzu einer Gr\u00f6\u00dfe von 216 x 356mm.\\nDieser handliche und vielseitige Scanner kommt mit der Stromversorgung eines USB 2.0 Anschlusses aus.\\nDer Avision AV36 Scanner l\u00e4\u00dft sich bequem transportieren und ben\u00f6tigt nur ein Minimum an Platz auf dem Schreibtisch.\\nDurch die Verwendung der CIS Technik (Contact Image Sensor) entgegen der CCD Technik, kann der Scanner kleiner und portabler sowie stromsparender gebaut werden.\\n\\nSomit ist der Avision AV36 Scanner die perfekte L\u00f6sung f\u00fcr alle, die f\u00fcr unterwegs eine effiziente und leicht verst\u00e4ndliche Scannl\u00f6sung ben\u00f6tigen.\\n\\nEin einfacher Druck auf die Scanntaste und das Dokument wird mit bis zu 24bit Farbtiefe und 600dpi optischer Aufl\u00f6sung gescannt. Die gerade Papierf\u00fchrung erlaubt es dem AV36 Ausweise und sogar Kreditkarten problemlos zu scannen, ohne diese zu besch\u00e4digen.\\n\\nDer brandneue AV36 ist nicht nur f\u00fcr den portablen Einsatz entwickelt worden sondern auch mit der Absicht das Ger\u00e4t frei von einer externen Stromquelle nutzen zu k\u00f6nnen.Es reicht ein USB Anschlu\u00df aus um das Ger\u00e4t mit Strom zu versorgen und das Bild zu \u00fcbertragen.\\n\\n<b>Mobile Stromversorgung via USB<\/b>\\nTragen sie das Ger\u00e4t nicht von einem Standort zum n\u00e4chsten sondern nutzen sie es unterwegs! Diese Vision wurde mit dem AV36 Scanner realisiert, der unabh\u00e4ngig vom Stromnetz, nur \u00fcber den USB-Anschluss mit Strom versorgt wird. Somit scannen sie ihre Dokumente \u00fcberall wo ein Notebook genutzt werden kann, praktisch \u00fcberall.\\n\\n<b>Portabel<\/b>\\nDer AV36 ist sehr leicht (nur 0.7kg) und sehr klein mit 290mm x 77mm x 52mm. Die geringe Gr\u00f6\u00dfe erlaubt es dem Nutzer das Ger\u00e4t problemlos mitzuf\u00fchren ohne zus\u00e4tzllichen Ballast zu tragen. Aufgrund der Tatsache das kein Netzteil ben\u00f6tigt wird ist der Avision AV36 der ideale Begleiter f\u00fcr unterwegs und setzt einen neuen Standard in der Welt der portablen Scanner ohne auf Qualit\u00e4t verzichten zu m\u00fcssen.\\n\\n<b>Duplex Scanner<\/b>\\nDer AV36 ist ein Duplex Scannermit einer optischen Aufl\u00f6sung von 600dpi. Sparen sie Zeit und M\u00fche indem sie ihre doppelseitigen Dokumente oder ID-Karten in einem Scannvorgang einlesen. Das Scannen eines Dokuments dauert in Farbe bei 300 dpi Aufl\u00f6sung nur 12 Sekunden im Simplex Modus, sowie 15 Sekunden im Duplex Modus.\\n\\n<b>Kompatibel mit Plastik Karten(EC)<\/b>\\nUnterst\u00fctzt Dokumente von A8 bis A4, und kann dabei Plastik Karten(z.B EC Karten\/P\u00e4sse) bis zu einer H\u00f6he von 1.25mm einscannen.\\n\\n<b>Software Umfang<\/b>\\nDer Avision AV36 Scanner wird mit Twain und ISIS Treibern ausgeliefert, der Vollversion des exklusiven Avision Button Manager, AVScan, ScanSoft PaperPort 11SE , NewSoft Presto! BizCard\\n\\n<b>NewSoft Presto! BizCard Presto!<\/b>\\nPresto! BizCard ist eine umfassende Kontaktverwaltungs Software mit der Sie ihre Visitenkarten scannen , bearbeiten und mit einer Vielzahl an Anwendungen synchronisieren k\u00f6nnen.Das ideale Werkzeug um ihre Kontakte zu pflegen und sprach\u00fcbergreifend zu organisieren.\\nPresto! BizCard erfasst und konvertiert ihre Visitenkarten in eine durchsuchbare und editierbare Datenbank. Diese Informationen lassen sich somit einfach und m\u00fchelos mit dem AV36 zu ihrem\\nComputer\/Laptop \u00fcbertragen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Mobile power by USB<\/b>\\nDon\u2019t just haul the scanner from one destination to another, use it on the go! This is the vision fully realized with the AV36, which is powered by a USB port instead of a wall socket. So now, documents can be scanned whenever a laptop is present, which can be anywhere.\\n\\n<b>Portable<\/b>\\nThe AV36 is light (only 0.7kg) and small in size at 290mm x 77mm x 52mm. The small form factor enables users to pack along easily without sacrificing too much luggage space or become a burden to carry. Coupled with the benefits of being USB powered, the AV36 sets a new standard for scanner portability.\\n\\n<b>Duplex scanning<\/b>\\nThe AV36 is a duplex scanner with an optical resolution of 600dpi. Save the time and effort of manually scanning a double-sided document or a plastic ID card. A complete color scan of A4 document at 300dpi in simplex mode takes 12 seconds, and 7.5 seconds per image in duplex mode.\\n\\n<b>Compatible with plastic cards<\/b>\\nSupported document size ranges from A8 to A4, and it can scan embossed plastic cards up to 1.25mm thick, such as credit cards and ID cards.\\n\\n<b>Bundled software<\/b>\\nThe newest version of TWAIN (v5.60) and extensive software applications Avision Button Manager, AVScan 5, NewSoft Presto! BizCard and ScanSoft PaperPort 11SE are included with every shipped unit to bring the most out of the AV36.\\n\\n<b>NewSoft Presto! BizCard Presto!<\/b>\\nBizCard is a complete contact management solution that lets you scan, edit and synchronize business card contacts to various contact management software applications. It captures and converts business cards into a searchable and editable database, with support for 12 different languages including English, most European languages, Simplified\/Traditional Chinese and Japanese. BizCard is the ideal tool for helping you stay in touch and organized."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"88435467-79b4-4730-ab78-e3faa5a30bb2","identifier":"12249741","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"f\/0\/d\/b\/f0dbeaf21843aa5dadf450f678bc7dedf1d1166e_12249741_3548.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/f\/0\/d\/b\/f0dbeaf21843aa5dadf450f678bc7dedf1d1166e_12249741_3548.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision IS25"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Scan-to-Flash\/SD Karte<\/b>\\nOhne komplexe Einstellungen werden die Dokumente direkt auf die SD Karte oder USB flash Laufwerk gespeichert.\\n\\n<b>Verbinden Sie den Scanner einfach mit Ihrem iPad oder anderen Unterhaltungselektronikger\u00e4ten<\/b>\\n\\nLaden Sie die gescannten Dokumente via USB auf Ihr Smartphone, iPad oder andere mobile Ger\u00e4te, die einen Massenspeicher unterst\u00fczten.\\n\\n<b>Die Ausstattung<\/b>\\nDer Avision IS25 Scanner ist ausgestattet mit dem TWAIN Treiber und dem Avision Button Manager."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Scan documents, receipts, photos, business card, and plastic ID cards\\n- Start instant scan immediately after paper is inserted\\n- Instant scan saves images to micro SDTM card or USB flash drive in JPEG, PDF, or TIFFfile format\\n- Powered by a rechargeable Li-ion battery\\n- Battery can be charged with either the power adapter or USB cable\\n- Include TWAIN\/ISIS driver\\n- Easy to use \"one button\" scanning\\n- Maximum document size: 8.5\" x 11.7\"\\n- Optical resolution: 600 dpi\\n- Battery durability: 200 pages (A4, Color, 300 dpi)\\n- TWAIN driver provides auto color detection, auto crop, deskew and thresholding image-enhancing features\\n- Scan to iPad or some Smart Phone which supports Android 2.2 & Symbian S60"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1cc373f3-7ad6-4ebd-aa8f-5e39cd596152","identifier":"1225449","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PIXMA MP520"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 100-240V, 50\/60 Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<i>Dieses Multifunktionssystem ist eine gro\u00dfartige und vielseitige Allroundl\u00f6sung f\u00fcr die ganze Familie. Es verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber zahlreiche Funktionen f\u00fcr das Drucken von Fotos und Dokumenten: zwei Papierf\u00e4cher, Easy-Scroll Bedienrad und 4 einzelne Tintentanks.<\/i>\\n\\n- Fotos mit bis zu 4.800 x 1.200 dpi*; randlos im Format 10 x 15 cm in 46 Sek. \\n- 5,0 cm gro\u00dfes TFT-Farbdisplay \\n- Drucken vom PC, von Speicherkarten und Digitalkameras \\n- Zwei Papierf\u00e4cher \\n- Easy-Scroll Bedienrad \\n- 4 Tintentanks \\n- Quick Start \\n- Automatische Bildkorrekturen \\n \\n \\n<b>Zu Hause mehr machen <\/b>\\n\\nFotodruck\\nSie erhalten Fotos in Laborqualit\u00e4t mit hoher Detailgenauigkeit und sanften Farbabstufungen dank der nur 2 Picoliter feinen Tintentr\u00f6pfchen und der hohen Druckaufl\u00f6sung von 4.800 x 1.200 dpi*.\\n\\nDrucken von randlosen Fotos im Format 10 x 15 in nur ca.46 Sekunden im Standardmodus*. Foto-Direktdruck von Speicherkarten, \u00fcber den PictBridge-Anschluss der Digitalkamera oder des Camcorders.\\n\\nDie automatische Bildkorrektur optimiert Ihre digitalen Fotos auf Wunsch automatisch. Die Bildbearbeitungssoftware bietet zudem Rote-Augen-Korrektur und Hauttonkorrektur.\\n\\nChromaLife100** sorgt f\u00fcr brillante, langlebige Fotoprints, die f\u00fcr eine Dauer von bis zu 100 Jahren archiviert werden k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\nDokumentdruck\\nDrucken von Dokumenten mit einer Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 30 Seiten\/Minute (Schwarzwei\u00df) oder 20 Seiten\/Minute (Farbe).\\n\\nKopieren\\nErstellen von Kopien mit einer Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 30 Seiten\/Minute (Schwarzwei\u00df) oder 20 Seiten\/Minute (Farbe). Die fortschrittliche Kopiertechnologie sorgt f\u00fcr eine au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnliche Farbqualit\u00e4t.\\n\\nDie Text- und Bild-Separationstechnologie trennt Bilder und Text und liefert so optimale Ergebnisse, wenn Text, Grafiken und Fotos kombiniert gedruckt werden. Kopieren Sie nur den gew\u00fcnschten Bildausschnitt mit den Funktionen f\u00fcr Rahmenentfernung, Zuschneiden und Ausschneiden.\\n\\nScannen\\nDie Aufl\u00f6sung von 2.400 dpi sorgt f\u00fcr brillante Farbscans. Scan to PC, E-mail oder PDF. Die Software MP Navigator EX vereinfacht s\u00e4mtliche Arbeitsschritte, von der Bildsuche bis hin zur Bearbeitung eines PDF-Dokuments.\\n\\nScannen Sie Ihre vorhandenen Fotoprints, und drucken Sie sie erneut aus, um die Abz\u00fcge mit Ihrer Familie und Freunde zu teilen. Oder scannen Sie verblasste Aufnahmen, und lassen Sie sie mithilfe der einfach zu bedienenden Software wieder lebendig werden.\\n\\nSchnittstelle\\nDas kristallklare 5,0 cm gro\u00dfe TFT-Display sorgt f\u00fcr einfaches Handling ganz ohne PC. Drehen Sie einfach das Easy-Scroll Bedienrad, um die Optionen auf dem Display auszuw\u00e4hlen. Anzeigen, Ausw\u00e4hlen, Bearbeiten und Drucken - alles auf Knopfdruck.\\n\\nSingle Ink-Technologie\\nAlle vier Single Ink-Tintentanks k\u00f6nnen einzeln ausgetauscht werden. Dies f\u00fchrt zu einer optimalen Nutzung der Tinten und senkt die Kosten. Eine intelligente LED blinkt, wenn die Farbe zur Neige geht oder ersetzt werden muss.\\n\\nEffizienz\\nZwei Papierf\u00e4cher f\u00fcr Foto- und Normalpapier. Quick Start sorgt f\u00fcr kurze Aufw\u00e4rmzeiten bei Ihrem PIXMA. Alle Funktionen stehen quasi sofort zur Verf\u00fcgung.\\n\\nBetriebssysteme\\nWindows und Mac OSX kompatibel\\n\\n* siehe Technische Daten"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Canon MP520, PIXMA. Print technology: Inkjet, Printing: Colour, Copying: Colour. Optical scanning resolution: 2400 x 4800, Maximum scan area: 216 x 297. ISO A-series sizes (A0...A9): A4, A5, Standard tray media types: Envelopes, Glossy paper, Photo paper, Plain paper, ISO B-series sizes (B0...B9): B5. Standard interfaces: USB 2.0. Compatible memory cards: Microdrive"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d846eb38-1d84-4429-85b4-33709f106813","identifier":"12255228","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","hp","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1920_x_1080"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1\/4\/5\/3\/1453d468f9995ab5b39d5850a0ed2eb2190653f0_15743_12255228_692.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/1\/4\/5\/3\/1453d468f9995ab5b39d5850a0ed2eb2190653f0_15743_12255228_692.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP HD-5210"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Die hochwertige HP HD 5210 Webcam \u00fcbertr\u00e4gt Videos per Streaming schnell, exakt und reibungslos bei wesentlich geringerer Bandbreite. Profitieren Sie von noch nie da gewesener herausragender Technologie und innovativen Funktionen.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;Die bahnbrechende H.264-Technologie ist Bestandteil der HP HD 5210. Die Bildqualit\u00e4t ist so hoch, dass sie Skype\u00ae-zertifiziert wurde. Nur mit dieser Auszeichnung sind H.264-basierte HD-Web-Chats \u00fcber Skype\u00ae gew\u00e4hrleistet.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Die Blu-ray-\u00ae-Qualit\u00e4t der aufgezeichneten Bilder ist beeindruckend. Wenn Sie maximale Aufl\u00f6sung und spektakul\u00e4re Videoqualit\u00e4t im Breitbildformat w\u00fcnschen, dann ist diese Webcam mit nativem HD-Widescreen (1.920 x 1.080) wie f\u00fcr Sie geschaffen.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Autofokus und die \u00fcber HP TrueVision verf\u00fcgbare automatische Belichtung sind im Lieferumfang enthalten. Gesichtserkennung und digitales Zoomen (F\u00fcnffachzoom). Die vielseitig einsetzbare Befestigung bietet 270\u00b0 Schwenkwinkel\/30\u00b0 Neigungswinkel und l\u00e4sst sich \u00fcberall anbringen. Das \u00e4u\u00dferst kompakte Design unterstreicht die erstklassige Glaslinse.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;War es jemals einfacher? Einmal klicken zum Hochladen, und schon stehen Ihre Inhalte f\u00fcr Ihre Onlinekontakte bereit.  Es besteht schneller Zugriff auf Facebook, YouTube und zum ersten Mal auch auf Twitter und Flickr.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Hochwertige Materialien mit attraktiver geb\u00fcrsteter Metallleiste runden das \u00e4u\u00dferst kompakte Design ab.  Obwohl die HD 5210 nur etwa halb so gro\u00df wie vergleichbare Webcams ist, ist sie mit mehr Technik ausgestattet.\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- HP's HD 5210 high-end webcam streams faster, clearer and smoother video over much less bandwidth. It's superb technology and advanced features than you've experienced before.\\n- The ground-breaking H.264 technology is right here in the HP HD 5210. Your image quality is so high, it\u2019s been Skype\u00ae-certified. That stamp of approval is the only way to ensure true H.264 HD web chats via Skype\u00ae.\\n- You'll be amazed by the Blu-ray\u00ae quality images you can record. If you're looking for the highest resolution and the most spectacular video quality in true widescreen format, this webcam with a native HD 1920 x 1080 widescreen was made just for you.\\n- Auto-focus and HP's TrueVision auto-light exposure are included. Face tracking and 5x digital zoom capabilities. Versatile swivel clip\u2014270\u00b0 pan\/30\u00b0 tilt\u2014mounts anywhere. Ultra-compact design highlights the premium glass component lens.\\n- Have you ever seen it this easy? Just a 1 click upload and you're sharing with your on-line world. You've got fast access to Facebook, YouTube and for the first time- Twitter & Flickr.\\n- High-end materials with attractive brushed metal trim frame this ultra- compact style. And, although the HD 5210 is almost 1\/2 the size of comparable webcams, it's packed with more technology."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>La webcam HD haut de gamme HP 5210 offre un flux vid\u00e9o plus rapide, plus nette et plus agr\u00e9able en utilisant une bande passante bien moindre. Une technologie fantastique et des fonctionnalit\u00e9s avanc\u00e9es comme vous n'en avez jamais rencontr\u00e9es auparavant.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;La technologie r\u00e9volutionnaire H.264 \u00e9quipe le HP HD 5210. La qualit\u00e9 de l'image est tellement \u00e9lev\u00e9e que ce mod\u00e8le a re\u00e7u la certification Skype\u00ae. Cette homologation est la seule \u00e0 garantir de v\u00e9ritables conversations vid\u00e9o HD avec le codec H.264 HD sur Skype\u00ae .<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Vous serez conquis par les images de qualit\u00e9 Blu-ray Intel\u00ae que vous pouvez enregistrer. Si vous recherchez la r\u00e9solution la plus \u00e9lev\u00e9e et la qualit\u00e9 vid\u00e9o la plus spectaculaire dans un format \u00e9cran large v\u00e9ritable, cette webcam qui offre un mode HD \u00e9cran large 1920 x 1080 de s\u00e9rie est faite pour vous.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Les fonctions autofocus et auto-exposition \u00e0 la lumi\u00e8re HP TrueVision sont incluses. Suivi des visages et zoom num\u00e9rique 5x. Cette pince polyvalente et pivotante (rotation 270\u00b0\/inclinaison 30\u00b0) s'adapte partout. La conception ultra-compacte met en \u00e9vidence l'objectif dot\u00e9 d'un verre de qualit\u00e9.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Avez-vous jamais vu quelque chose d'aussi facile ? T\u00e9l\u00e9chargement en un seul clic pour partager avec votre monde en ligne.  Vous avez un acc\u00e8s rapide \u00e0 Facebook, YouTube et, pour la premi\u00e8re fois, \u00e0 Twitter et \u00e0 Flickr.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Des mat\u00e9riaux haut de gamme avec un m\u00e9tal bross\u00e9 s\u00e9duisant donnent du style \u00e0 ce mod\u00e8le ultra-compact.  Et, m\u00eame si la HD 5210 a une taille de presque la moiti\u00e9 de celle de webcams comparables, elle renferme davantage de technologie.\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4f14ada2-a996-42bf-aee9-202e1870cf6d","identifier":"12255424","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony W610"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>W610 Digitale Kompaktkamera<\/b>\\nLeichte, kompakte und benutzerfreundliche Cyber-shot\u2122 Kamera\\n14,1 Mio. Pixel, 4fach-Zoom, Filmaufnahme, 6,7-cm-LCD, Schwenkpanorama und iAUTO\\nDieses Produkt ist ein fr\u00fcheres Modell und bei Ihrem \u00f6rtlichen H\u00e4ndler m\u00f6glicherweise nicht mehr verf\u00fcgbar.\\n- 26-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv mit optischem 4fach-Zoom.\\n- Extrabreite Bilder dank 360\u00b0-Schwenkpanorama.\\n- Einfache Bedienung, auch f\u00fcr Anf\u00e4nger geeignet.\\n\\n<b>Hochwertige Bilder im Handumdrehen<\/b>\\nDie leichte und kompakte Cyber-shot\u2122 W610 Digitalkamera ist der perfekte Begleiter f\u00fcr Urlaub, Familientreffen und mehr. Die Kombination aus herausragender Bildqualit\u00e4t und einfacher Bedienung macht sie auch dann zu einer guten Wahl, wenn Sie zum ersten Mal eine Digitalkamera verwenden.\\n\\n<b>Einfach mehr im Bild<\/b>\\nAufnahmen von beeindruckenden Landschaften, Bauwerken, Innenansichten und sogar Familienfotos fallen oft entt\u00e4uschend aus, wenn an den Bildr\u00e4ndern etwas fehlt. Mit einem Weitwinkelobjektiv passt mehr auf Ihr Foto, ohne dass Sie sich daf\u00fcr weiter vom Motiv entfernen m\u00fcssen.\\n\\n<b>Die ganze Bildbreite einfangen<\/b>\\nAtemberaubende Aufnahmen von Landschaften oder Stadtszenen sind kein Problem. Cyber-shot\u2122 erm\u00f6glicht High-Speed-Serienaufnahmen bei einem Kameraschwenk (von einer Seite zur anderen oder von oben nach unten) und setzt diese dann automatisch zu einem Bild zusammen. So erzielen Sie beeindruckende Panoramaansichten.\\n\\n<b>Ganz einfach sch\u00f6nere Bilder<\/b>\\nSie sind sich nicht sicher, wie Sie die optimale Kameraeinstellung f\u00fcr eine bestimmte Szene ausw\u00e4hlen? Hilfe ist schon zur Hand. Intelligenter Automatikmodus (iAUTO) passt die Belichtung und andere Kameraeinstellungen in verschiedenen Aufnahmesituationen automatisch an und sorgt so f\u00fcr optimale Ergebnisse.\\n\\n<b>Sch\u00f6ne Portr\u00e4taufnahmen<\/b>\\nNehmen Sie sch\u00f6ne Portr\u00e4tfotos mit l\u00e4chelnden Gesichtern von Freunden und Familie auf. Die Gesichtserkennung passt Kameraeinstellungen so an, dass klare, scharfe Bilder mit nat\u00fcrlichen Hautt\u00f6nen entstehen. Der Smile Shutter l\u00f6st automatisch aus, damit Sie gl\u00fcckliche Momente festhalten k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n- CCD Sensor mit 14,1 Mio. Pixel (effektiv) - \u00c4u\u00dferst hohe Bildqualit\u00e4t und detailgetreue Vergr\u00f6\u00dferungen.\\n- Optischer 4-fach-Zoom, 26-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv - Das hochwertige Zoomobjektiv deckt eine breite Palette an Aufnahmesituationen ab und bietet eine Weitwinkeleinstellung f\u00fcr Gruppen- oder Landschaftsaufnahmen.\\n- Intelligenter Automatikmodus - Die Kamera erkennt zahlreiche h\u00e4ufige Aufnahmesituationen und optimiert die Einstellungen, sodass Sie ohne gro\u00dfen Aufwand herausragende Ergebnisse erhalten.\\n- Videoaufnahme - Nehmen Sie scharfe, klare Videos mit Ton auf, und sehen Sie sie auf dem angeschlossenen Fernseher an (optionales AV-Kabel erforderlich).\\n- SteadyShot - Elektronische Bildstabilisierung f\u00fcr sch\u00e4rfere Bilder bei handgef\u00fchrten Aufnahmen.\\n- 360\u00b0-Schwenkpanorama - Schwenken Sie die Kamera f\u00fcr extrabreite Landschaftsaufnahmen, Stadtansichten oder Aufnahmen hoher Geb\u00e4ude; der neue 360\u00b0-Modus erstellt vollst\u00e4ndige Rundumaufnahmen.\\n- 6,7-cm-\/2,7\"-LCD mit Clear Photo Technologie - Hochwertiges LCD (230.000 Bildpunkte) f\u00fcr ausgezeichnete Details, hohe Kontraste und einen weiten Betrachtungswinkel.\\n- Gesichtserkennung - F\u00fcr noch sch\u00e4rfere Portr\u00e4ts stellt die Kamera Fokus, Belichtung und Wei\u00dfabgleich automatisch ein und verf\u00fcgt zudem \u00fcber eine Priorit\u00e4tenauswahl f\u00fcr Kinder\/Erwachsene.\\n- Smile Shutter - L\u00f6st die Aufnahme automatisch aus, wenn die Person im Sucher l\u00e4chelt: mit anpassbarem Schwellenwert und w\u00e4hlbaren Einstellungen f\u00fcr Kinder und Erwachsene.\\n- Selbstausl\u00f6ser - F\u00fcr richtige Bildkompositionen bei kurzem Abstand zum Motiv; ein automatischer Ausl\u00f6ser sorgt f\u00fcr perfekt in Szene gesetzte Selbstportr\u00e4ts.\\n- Benutzerfreundlicher Aufnahmemodus - Gut lesbare Bildschirmanweisungen erleichtern selbst Anf\u00e4ngern den Umgang mit der Kamera.\\n- Retusche direkt in der Kamera - Retuschefunktionen, einschlie\u00dflich Zuschneiden und Rote-Augen-Korrektur.\\n- PlayMemories Home - Vorinstallierte Software f\u00fcr eine einfache Bild\u00fcbertragung auf den PC zum Ansehen, Bearbeiten, Drucken, Versenden per E-Mail, Upload ins Internet usw.\\n- Speicherkartenkompatibilit\u00e4t - Cyber-shot\u2122 unterst\u00fctzt zahlreiche Speicherkarten, darunter Memory Stick\u2122 und SD- bzw. SDHC-Karten (Angaben zur Kompatibilit\u00e4t siehe technische Daten)."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sweep Panorama\u2122 mode (up to 360\u00b0)<\/b>\\nReach beyond the traditional wide angle lens, and capture more breathtaking shots with Sweep Panorama\u2122 mode. Simply press the shutter button and sweep the camera in the desired direction and the camera continuously shoots at a high speed, then seamlessly stitches the images together with automatic position adjustment to create one stunning panoramic image. Available in wide and up to 360\u00b0 full circle, the camera can take a variety of panoramic shots. Now capturing wide landscapes is as easy as press and sweep.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Auto Mode<\/b>\\nUnlike traditional auto mode, Intelligent Auto (iAuto) mode thinks for you, recognizing scenes, lighting conditions, faces, and adjusts settings resulting in clear images, faces with natural skin tone and less blur. Take advantage of all the technology without leaving Auto mode. Kids on the playground, landscape shots, a beautiful flower or an indoor birthday party; all result in clear images without leaving auto mode.\\n\\n<b>Soft Skin mode<\/b>\\nPortrait subjects will love the results. Soft Skin mode recognizes skin tones and reduces the appearance of blemishes and wrinkles without affecting the rest of the shot.\\n\\n<b>Self-Portrait Timer<\/b>\\nSelf-Portrait Timer helps take the guesswork out of self-portraits by utilizing Face Detection technology to recognize when your face enters the frame. Once the camera detects your face, it triggers a 2-second timer, and then snaps a picture.\\n\\n<b>14.1 Megapixel Super HAD\u2122 CCD Image Sensor<\/b>\\nA powerful 14.1 megapixel1\/2.3\u201d Super HAD\u2122 CCD image sensor helps you capture gorgeous images with superb contrast and clarity down to the finest detail. With 14.1 megapixels, you can create stunning, photo-quality prints up to A3+ (13x19\u201d) size, or crop your images and still come away with high resolution shots.\\n\\n<b>Face Detection technology<\/b>\\nFace Detection technology detects up to eight individual faces and adjusts focus, exposure, and white balance to help deliver crisp, properly lit images of family and friends.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Scene Recognition mode<\/b>\\nIntelligent Scene Recognition (iSCN) mode automatically detects seven different types of scenes and, within just 1\/30th of a second, selects the appropriate camera settings: Backlight, Backlight Portrait, Twilight, Twilight Portrait, Twilight using a tripod, Portrait, Landscape and macro. iSCN has two modes: Auto and Advanced. In Auto Mode, the camera takes a single shot using the optimal settings. In Advanced Mode, the camera takes a photo with the optimal settings and, if in difficult lighting (low light or back light) immediately takes a second photo with another optimized setting so you can choose which to keep.\\n\\n<b>2.7\u201d (230K dots) Clear Photo\u2122 LCD display<\/b>\\nGenerous 2.7\u201d (230K dots) Clear Photo\u2122 LCD display features sharp, natural color that makes it easy to compose shots, read menus, and view photos, even in bright sunlight.\\n\\n<b>Smile Shutter\u2122 technology<\/b>\\nSmile Shutter\u2122 technology captures a smile the moment it happens. Simply press the Smile Shutter\u2122 button and the camera does the rest. You can also select adult and child priority and indicate the degree of Smile Detection sensitivity. Intelligent Scene Recognition can now be used together with Smile Shutter\u2122 mode when the Intelligent Auto mode is on. This means that beautiful smiles can be captured with settings optimized for the particular scene, even in difficult conditions such as twilight and backlighting.\\n\\n<b>Dynamic Range Optimizer<\/b>\\nDynamic Range Optimizer (DRO) Standard and Plus uses a sophisticated algorithm to help recover shadows and highlights. The result is more natural images with clearer details that more closely match what your naked eye sees. DRO is particularly effective when shooting backlit portraits or any scene with a dramatic contrast between background and foreground lighting. DRO Plus allows for even greater optimization by analyzing each region of an image and performing additional image processing."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>W610 Appareil photo num\u00e9rique compact<\/b>\\nUn appareil photo Cyber-shot\u2122 l\u00e9ger, compact, et facile \u00e0 utiliser\\n14,1 m\u00e9gapixels, zoom 4 x, enregistrement vid\u00e9o, \u00e9cran LCD 6,7 cm (2,7\"), mode Panorama par balayage et iAUTO\\n- Zoom optique 4x pour un grand angle de 26 mm.\\n- Photos panoramiques r\u00e9alis\u00e9es en mode 360 Sweep Panorama par balayage.\\n- Simplicit\u00e9 d'utilisation, m\u00eame pour les d\u00e9butants.\\n\\n<b>Images \u00e9poustouflantes en toute simplicit\u00e9<\/b>\\nL\u00e9ger, compact et facile \u00e0 transporter, l'appareil photo num\u00e9rique W610 Cyber-shot est le compagnon id\u00e9al de vos vacances, de vos r\u00e9unions de famille et de toutes les autres occasions. Une qualit\u00e9 d'image incomparable est associ\u00e9e \u00e0 une utilisation simple, m\u00eame si vous \u00eates d\u00e9butant en mati\u00e8re de photographie num\u00e9rique.\\n\\n<b>Elargissez votre champ de vision<\/b>\\nLes paysages spectaculaires, les photos d\u2019architecture, les int\u00e9rieurs et m\u00eame les photos de famille peuvent s\u2019av\u00e9rer d\u00e9cevants lorsqu\u2019ils sont tronqu\u00e9s sur les bords. L\u2019objectif grand angle vous permet d\u2019\u00e9largir votre cadre sans vous \u00e9loigner du sujet.\\n\\n<b>De plus belles photos en toute facilit\u00e9<\/b>\\nVous n'\u00eates pas s\u00fbr d'avoir effectu\u00e9 les r\u00e9glages optimaux sur votre appareil photo pour capturer une sc\u00e8ne en particulier ? Nous allons vous aider. Le mode Auto intelligent (iAUTO) r\u00e8gle automatiquement l'exposition et les autres r\u00e9glages de l'appareil photo pour des r\u00e9sultats optimaux dans de nombreuses.\\n\\n<b>Un point de vue complet<\/b>\\nIl est d\u00e9sormais facile de r\u00e9aliser de magnifiques photos d'un paysage ou d'une ville. Le mod\u00e8le Cyber-shot superpose automatiquement des images prises en rafale ultrarapide pendant que vous d\u00e9crivez un cercle de gauche \u00e0 droite (ou de haut en bas !) avec l'appareil photo pour cr\u00e9er une image panoramique.\\n\\n<b>De sublimes portraits<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez de magnifiques portraits de vos amis et de votre famille. La fonction D\u00e9tection des visages ajuste les param\u00e8tres de l'appareil photo pour des r\u00e9sultats nets et clairs et des tons plus naturels. La fonction D\u00e9tecteur automatique de sourires prend automatiquement la photo pour capturer ces instants.\\n\\n- Capteur CCD 14,1 m\u00e9gapixels effectifs - Prend des photos de tr\u00e8s grande qualit\u00e9 pour obtenir des agrandissements avec un haut niveau de d\u00e9tails.\\n- Zoom optique 4 x \/ Objectif grand angle de 26 mm - Objectif zoom haute qualit\u00e9 pour une grande vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de prises de vue en toutes circonstances, avec un grand angle pour les photos de groupe et les paysages.\\n- Mode Auto intelligent - L'appareil photo reconna\u00eet de nombreuses situations courantes de prise de vue. Il optimise les param\u00e8tres afin d'obtenir des r\u00e9sultats clairs et nets sans difficult\u00e9.\\n- Enregistrement vid\u00e9o - Des clips vid\u00e9o d'une nettet\u00e9 parfaite avec son : visionnez sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur connect\u00e9 (c\u00e2ble AV en option requis).\\n- Stabilisateur SteadyShot - Le stabilisateur d'image \u00e9lectronique permet d'obtenir des photographies plus nettes \u00e0 main lev\u00e9e.\\n- Panorama par balayage 360 - Balayez l'appareil photo et saisissez des images de paysages extr\u00eamement larges, ou de villes ou de b\u00e2timents tr\u00e8s \u00e9lev\u00e9s ; Nouveau mode 360 prend une vue panoramique.\\n- Ecran LCD 6,7 cm \/ 2,7\" Clear Photo - Ecran LCD haute qualit\u00e9 (r\u00e9solution 230 000 points) au niveau de d\u00e9tail exceptionnel, \u00e0 contraste \u00e9lev\u00e9 avec un grand angle de visualisation.\\n- Reconnaissance des visages - R\u00e9glage automatique de la mise au point, de l'exposition et de la balance des blancs pour des portraits plus nets et choix de priorit\u00e9 enfants \/ adultes.\\n- D\u00e9tecteur automatique de sourires - Prend automatiquement la photo lorsque le sujet sourit, en fonction des param\u00e8tres d\u00e9finis et du niveau de priorit\u00e9 choisi pour les enfants ou les adultes.\\n- D\u00e9clencheur pour autoportrait - D\u00e9tecte le cadrage id\u00e9al lorsque l'appareil photo est tenu \u00e0 bout de bras ; L'obturateur se d\u00e9clenche automatiquement pour de magnifiques autoportraits.\\n- Mode de prise vue simple - Fonctionnement simple pour les d\u00e9butants avec instructions exhaustives et claires \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran.\\n- Fonctionnalit\u00e9s de retouche int\u00e9gr\u00e9e - Fonctions de retouche de la photo amusantes, notamment pour la correction automatique des yeux rouges et le recadrage.\\n- PlayMemories Home\u2122 - Un logiciel pr\u00e9install\u00e9 facilite le transfert d'images vers l'ordinateur pour la visualisation, le montage, l'impression, l'envoi par e-mail, le t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement \u00e0 partir du web et bien plus.\\n- Compatibilit\u00e9 de la carte m\u00e9moire - Cyber-shot\u2122 accepte une large gamme de cartes, y compris Memory Stick\u2122 et SD\/SDHC - voir les sp\u00e9cifications techniques pour la compatibilit\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":4}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"21873239-ed10-436d-b3ef-a6175e98f916","identifier":"12255426","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony W610"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sweep Panorama\u2122 mode (up to 360\u00b0)<\/b>\\nReach beyond the traditional wide angle lens, and capture more breathtaking shots with Sweep Panorama\u2122 mode. Simply press the shutter button and sweep the camera in the desired direction and the camera continuously shoots at a high speed, then seamlessly stitches the images together with automatic position adjustment to create one stunning panoramic image. Available in wide and up to 360\u00b0 full circle, the camera can take a variety of panoramic shots. Now capturing wide landscapes is as easy as press and sweep.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Auto Mode<\/b>\\nUnlike traditional auto mode, Intelligent Auto (iAuto) mode thinks for you, recognizing scenes, lighting conditions, faces, and adjusts settings resulting in clear images, faces with natural skin tone and less blur. Take advantage of all the technology without leaving Auto mode. Kids on the playground, landscape shots, a beautiful flower or an indoor birthday party; all result in clear images without leaving auto mode.\\n\\n<b>Soft Skin mode<\/b>\\nPortrait subjects will love the results. Soft Skin mode recognizes skin tones and reduces the appearance of blemishes and wrinkles without affecting the rest of the shot.\\n\\n<b>Self-Portrait Timer<\/b>\\nSelf-Portrait Timer helps take the guesswork out of self-portraits by utilizing Face Detection technology to recognize when your face enters the frame. Once the camera detects your face, it triggers a 2-second timer, and then snaps a picture.\\n\\n<b>14.1 Megapixel Super HAD\u2122 CCD Image Sensor<\/b>\\nA powerful 14.1 megapixel1\/2.3\u201d Super HAD\u2122 CCD image sensor helps you capture gorgeous images with superb contrast and clarity down to the finest detail. With 14.1 megapixels, you can create stunning, photo-quality prints up to A3+ (13x19\u201d) size, or crop your images and still come away with high resolution shots.\\n\\n<b>Face Detection technology<\/b>\\nFace Detection technology detects up to eight individual faces and adjusts focus, exposure, and white balance to help deliver crisp, properly lit images of family and friends.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Scene Recognition mode<\/b>\\nIntelligent Scene Recognition (iSCN) mode automatically detects seven different types of scenes and, within just 1\/30th of a second, selects the appropriate camera settings: Backlight, Backlight Portrait, Twilight, Twilight Portrait, Twilight using a tripod, Portrait, Landscape and macro. iSCN has two modes: Auto and Advanced. In Auto Mode, the camera takes a single shot using the optimal settings. In Advanced Mode, the camera takes a photo with the optimal settings and, if in difficult lighting (low light or back light) immediately takes a second photo with another optimized setting so you can choose which to keep.\\n\\n<b>2.7\u201d (230K dots) Clear Photo\u2122 LCD display<\/b>\\nGenerous 2.7\u201d (230K dots) Clear Photo\u2122 LCD display features sharp, natural color that makes it easy to compose shots, read menus, and view photos, even in bright sunlight.\\n\\n<b>Smile Shutter\u2122 technology<\/b>\\nSmile Shutter\u2122 technology captures a smile the moment it happens. Simply press the Smile Shutter\u2122 button and the camera does the rest. You can also select adult and child priority and indicate the degree of Smile Detection sensitivity. Intelligent Scene Recognition can now be used together with Smile Shutter\u2122 mode when the Intelligent Auto mode is on. This means that beautiful smiles can be captured with settings optimized for the particular scene, even in difficult conditions such as twilight and backlighting.\\n\\n<b>Dynamic Range Optimizer<\/b>\\nDynamic Range Optimizer (DRO) Standard and Plus uses a sophisticated algorithm to help recover shadows and highlights. The result is more natural images with clearer details that more closely match what your naked eye sees. DRO is particularly effective when shooting backlit portraits or any scene with a dramatic contrast between background and foreground lighting. DRO Plus allows for even greater optimization by analyzing each region of an image and performing additional image processing."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":4}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a73d0e40-44c4-4527-bbe5-e6bb22d447c5","identifier":"12255427","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony W610"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>W610 Digitale Kompaktkamera<\/b>\\nLeichte, kompakte und benutzerfreundliche Cyber-shot\u2122 Kamera\\n14,1 Mio. Pixel, 4fach-Zoom, Filmaufnahme, 6,7-cm-LCD, Schwenkpanorama und iAUTO\\nDieses Produkt ist ein fr\u00fcheres Modell und bei Ihrem \u00f6rtlichen H\u00e4ndler m\u00f6glicherweise nicht mehr verf\u00fcgbar.\\n- 26-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv mit optischem 4fach-Zoom.\\n- Extrabreite Bilder dank 360\u00b0-Schwenkpanorama.\\n- Einfache Bedienung, auch f\u00fcr Anf\u00e4nger geeignet.\\n\\n<b>Hochwertige Bilder im Handumdrehen<\/b>\\nDie leichte und kompakte Cyber-shot\u2122 W610 Digitalkamera ist der perfekte Begleiter f\u00fcr Urlaub, Familientreffen und mehr. Die Kombination aus herausragender Bildqualit\u00e4t und einfacher Bedienung macht sie auch dann zu einer guten Wahl, wenn Sie zum ersten Mal eine Digitalkamera verwenden.\\n\\n<b>Einfach mehr im Bild<\/b>\\nAufnahmen von beeindruckenden Landschaften, Bauwerken, Innenansichten und sogar Familienfotos fallen oft entt\u00e4uschend aus, wenn an den Bildr\u00e4ndern etwas fehlt. Mit einem Weitwinkelobjektiv passt mehr auf Ihr Foto, ohne dass Sie sich daf\u00fcr weiter vom Motiv entfernen m\u00fcssen.\\n\\n<b>Die ganze Bildbreite einfangen<\/b>\\nAtemberaubende Aufnahmen von Landschaften oder Stadtszenen sind kein Problem. Cyber-shot\u2122 erm\u00f6glicht High-Speed-Serienaufnahmen bei einem Kameraschwenk (von einer Seite zur anderen oder von oben nach unten) und setzt diese dann automatisch zu einem Bild zusammen. So erzielen Sie beeindruckende Panoramaansichten.\\n\\n<b>Ganz einfach sch\u00f6nere Bilder<\/b>\\nSie sind sich nicht sicher, wie Sie die optimale Kameraeinstellung f\u00fcr eine bestimmte Szene ausw\u00e4hlen? Hilfe ist schon zur Hand. Intelligenter Automatikmodus (iAUTO) passt die Belichtung und andere Kameraeinstellungen in verschiedenen Aufnahmesituationen automatisch an und sorgt so f\u00fcr optimale Ergebnisse.\\n\\n<b>Sch\u00f6ne Portr\u00e4taufnahmen<\/b>\\nNehmen Sie sch\u00f6ne Portr\u00e4tfotos mit l\u00e4chelnden Gesichtern von Freunden und Familie auf. Die Gesichtserkennung passt Kameraeinstellungen so an, dass klare, scharfe Bilder mit nat\u00fcrlichen Hautt\u00f6nen entstehen. Der Smile Shutter l\u00f6st automatisch aus, damit Sie gl\u00fcckliche Momente festhalten k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n- CCD Sensor mit 14,1 Mio. Pixel (effektiv) - \u00c4u\u00dferst hohe Bildqualit\u00e4t und detailgetreue Vergr\u00f6\u00dferungen.\\n- Optischer 4-fach-Zoom, 26-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv - Das hochwertige Zoomobjektiv deckt eine breite Palette an Aufnahmesituationen ab und bietet eine Weitwinkeleinstellung f\u00fcr Gruppen- oder Landschaftsaufnahmen.\\n- Intelligenter Automatikmodus - Die Kamera erkennt zahlreiche h\u00e4ufige Aufnahmesituationen und optimiert die Einstellungen, sodass Sie ohne gro\u00dfen Aufwand herausragende Ergebnisse erhalten.\\n- Videoaufnahme - Nehmen Sie scharfe, klare Videos mit Ton auf, und sehen Sie sie auf dem angeschlossenen Fernseher an (optionales AV-Kabel erforderlich).\\n- SteadyShot - Elektronische Bildstabilisierung f\u00fcr sch\u00e4rfere Bilder bei handgef\u00fchrten Aufnahmen.\\n- 360\u00b0-Schwenkpanorama - Schwenken Sie die Kamera f\u00fcr extrabreite Landschaftsaufnahmen, Stadtansichten oder Aufnahmen hoher Geb\u00e4ude; der neue 360\u00b0-Modus erstellt vollst\u00e4ndige Rundumaufnahmen.\\n- 6,7-cm-\/2,7\"-LCD mit Clear Photo Technologie - Hochwertiges LCD (230.000 Bildpunkte) f\u00fcr ausgezeichnete Details, hohe Kontraste und einen weiten Betrachtungswinkel.\\n- Gesichtserkennung - F\u00fcr noch sch\u00e4rfere Portr\u00e4ts stellt die Kamera Fokus, Belichtung und Wei\u00dfabgleich automatisch ein und verf\u00fcgt zudem \u00fcber eine Priorit\u00e4tenauswahl f\u00fcr Kinder\/Erwachsene.\\n- Smile Shutter - L\u00f6st die Aufnahme automatisch aus, wenn die Person im Sucher l\u00e4chelt: mit anpassbarem Schwellenwert und w\u00e4hlbaren Einstellungen f\u00fcr Kinder und Erwachsene.\\n- Selbstausl\u00f6ser - F\u00fcr richtige Bildkompositionen bei kurzem Abstand zum Motiv; ein automatischer Ausl\u00f6ser sorgt f\u00fcr perfekt in Szene gesetzte Selbstportr\u00e4ts.\\n- Benutzerfreundlicher Aufnahmemodus - Gut lesbare Bildschirmanweisungen erleichtern selbst Anf\u00e4ngern den Umgang mit der Kamera.\\n- Retusche direkt in der Kamera - Retuschefunktionen, einschlie\u00dflich Zuschneiden und Rote-Augen-Korrektur.\\n- PlayMemories Home - Vorinstallierte Software f\u00fcr eine einfache Bild\u00fcbertragung auf den PC zum Ansehen, Bearbeiten, Drucken, Versenden per E-Mail, Upload ins Internet usw.\\n- Speicherkartenkompatibilit\u00e4t - Cyber-shot\u2122 unterst\u00fctzt zahlreiche Speicherkarten, darunter Memory Stick\u2122 und SD- bzw. SDHC-Karten (Angaben zur Kompatibilit\u00e4t siehe technische Daten)."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sweep Panorama\u2122 mode (up to 360\u00b0)<\/b>\\nReach beyond the traditional wide angle lens, and capture more breathtaking shots with Sweep Panorama\u2122 mode. Simply press the shutter button and sweep the camera in the desired direction and the camera continuously shoots at a high speed, then seamlessly stitches the images together with automatic position adjustment to create one stunning panoramic image. Available in wide and up to 360\u00b0 full circle, the camera can take a variety of panoramic shots. Now capturing wide landscapes is as easy as press and sweep.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Auto Mode<\/b>\\nUnlike traditional auto mode, Intelligent Auto (iAuto) mode thinks for you, recognizing scenes, lighting conditions, faces, and adjusts settings resulting in clear images, faces with natural skin tone and less blur. Take advantage of all the technology without leaving Auto mode. Kids on the playground, landscape shots, a beautiful flower or an indoor birthday party; all result in clear images without leaving auto mode.\\n\\n<b>Soft Skin mode<\/b>\\nPortrait subjects will love the results. Soft Skin mode recognizes skin tones and reduces the appearance of blemishes and wrinkles without affecting the rest of the shot.\\n\\n<b>Self-Portrait Timer<\/b>\\nSelf-Portrait Timer helps take the guesswork out of self-portraits by utilizing Face Detection technology to recognize when your face enters the frame. Once the camera detects your face, it triggers a 2-second timer, and then snaps a picture.\\n\\n<b>14.1 Megapixel Super HAD\u2122 CCD Image Sensor<\/b>\\nA powerful 14.1 megapixel1\/2.3\u201d Super HAD\u2122 CCD image sensor helps you capture gorgeous images with superb contrast and clarity down to the finest detail. With 14.1 megapixels, you can create stunning, photo-quality prints up to A3+ (13x19\u201d) size, or crop your images and still come away with high resolution shots.\\n\\n<b>Face Detection technology<\/b>\\nFace Detection technology detects up to eight individual faces and adjusts focus, exposure, and white balance to help deliver crisp, properly lit images of family and friends.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Scene Recognition mode<\/b>\\nIntelligent Scene Recognition (iSCN) mode automatically detects seven different types of scenes and, within just 1\/30th of a second, selects the appropriate camera settings: Backlight, Backlight Portrait, Twilight, Twilight Portrait, Twilight using a tripod, Portrait, Landscape and macro. iSCN has two modes: Auto and Advanced. In Auto Mode, the camera takes a single shot using the optimal settings. In Advanced Mode, the camera takes a photo with the optimal settings and, if in difficult lighting (low light or back light) immediately takes a second photo with another optimized setting so you can choose which to keep.\\n\\n<b>2.7\u201d (230K dots) Clear Photo\u2122 LCD display<\/b>\\nGenerous 2.7\u201d (230K dots) Clear Photo\u2122 LCD display features sharp, natural color that makes it easy to compose shots, read menus, and view photos, even in bright sunlight.\\n\\n<b>Smile Shutter\u2122 technology<\/b>\\nSmile Shutter\u2122 technology captures a smile the moment it happens. Simply press the Smile Shutter\u2122 button and the camera does the rest. You can also select adult and child priority and indicate the degree of Smile Detection sensitivity. Intelligent Scene Recognition can now be used together with Smile Shutter\u2122 mode when the Intelligent Auto mode is on. This means that beautiful smiles can be captured with settings optimized for the particular scene, even in difficult conditions such as twilight and backlighting.\\n\\n<b>Dynamic Range Optimizer<\/b>\\nDynamic Range Optimizer (DRO) Standard and Plus uses a sophisticated algorithm to help recover shadows and highlights. The result is more natural images with clearer details that more closely match what your naked eye sees. DRO is particularly effective when shooting backlit portraits or any scene with a dramatic contrast between background and foreground lighting. DRO Plus allows for even greater optimization by analyzing each region of an image and performing additional image processing."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>W610 Appareil photo num\u00e9rique compact<\/b>\\nUn appareil photo Cyber-shot\u2122 l\u00e9ger, compact, et facile \u00e0 utiliser\\n14,1 m\u00e9gapixels, zoom 4 x, enregistrement vid\u00e9o, \u00e9cran LCD 6,7 cm (2,7\"), mode Panorama par balayage et iAUTO\\n- Zoom optique 4x pour un grand angle de 26 mm.\\n- Photos panoramiques r\u00e9alis\u00e9es en mode 360 Sweep Panorama par balayage.\\n- Simplicit\u00e9 d'utilisation, m\u00eame pour les d\u00e9butants.\\n\\n<b>Images \u00e9poustouflantes en toute simplicit\u00e9<\/b>\\nL\u00e9ger, compact et facile \u00e0 transporter, l'appareil photo num\u00e9rique W610 Cyber-shot est le compagnon id\u00e9al de vos vacances, de vos r\u00e9unions de famille et de toutes les autres occasions. Une qualit\u00e9 d'image incomparable est associ\u00e9e \u00e0 une utilisation simple, m\u00eame si vous \u00eates d\u00e9butant en mati\u00e8re de photographie num\u00e9rique.\\n\\n<b>Elargissez votre champ de vision<\/b>\\nLes paysages spectaculaires, les photos d\u2019architecture, les int\u00e9rieurs et m\u00eame les photos de famille peuvent s\u2019av\u00e9rer d\u00e9cevants lorsqu\u2019ils sont tronqu\u00e9s sur les bords. L\u2019objectif grand angle vous permet d\u2019\u00e9largir votre cadre sans vous \u00e9loigner du sujet.\\n\\n<b>De plus belles photos en toute facilit\u00e9<\/b>\\nVous n'\u00eates pas s\u00fbr d'avoir effectu\u00e9 les r\u00e9glages optimaux sur votre appareil photo pour capturer une sc\u00e8ne en particulier ? Nous allons vous aider. Le mode Auto intelligent (iAUTO) r\u00e8gle automatiquement l'exposition et les autres r\u00e9glages de l'appareil photo pour des r\u00e9sultats optimaux dans de nombreuses.\\n\\n<b>Un point de vue complet<\/b>\\nIl est d\u00e9sormais facile de r\u00e9aliser de magnifiques photos d'un paysage ou d'une ville. Le mod\u00e8le Cyber-shot superpose automatiquement des images prises en rafale ultrarapide pendant que vous d\u00e9crivez un cercle de gauche \u00e0 droite (ou de haut en bas !) avec l'appareil photo pour cr\u00e9er une image panoramique.\\n\\n<b>De sublimes portraits<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez de magnifiques portraits de vos amis et de votre famille. La fonction D\u00e9tection des visages ajuste les param\u00e8tres de l'appareil photo pour des r\u00e9sultats nets et clairs et des tons plus naturels. La fonction D\u00e9tecteur automatique de sourires prend automatiquement la photo pour capturer ces instants.\\n\\n- Capteur CCD 14,1 m\u00e9gapixels effectifs - Prend des photos de tr\u00e8s grande qualit\u00e9 pour obtenir des agrandissements avec un haut niveau de d\u00e9tails.\\n- Zoom optique 4 x \/ Objectif grand angle de 26 mm - Objectif zoom haute qualit\u00e9 pour une grande vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de prises de vue en toutes circonstances, avec un grand angle pour les photos de groupe et les paysages.\\n- Mode Auto intelligent - L'appareil photo reconna\u00eet de nombreuses situations courantes de prise de vue. Il optimise les param\u00e8tres afin d'obtenir des r\u00e9sultats clairs et nets sans difficult\u00e9.\\n- Enregistrement vid\u00e9o - Des clips vid\u00e9o d'une nettet\u00e9 parfaite avec son : visionnez sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur connect\u00e9 (c\u00e2ble AV en option requis).\\n- Stabilisateur SteadyShot - Le stabilisateur d'image \u00e9lectronique permet d'obtenir des photographies plus nettes \u00e0 main lev\u00e9e.\\n- Panorama par balayage 360 - Balayez l'appareil photo et saisissez des images de paysages extr\u00eamement larges, ou de villes ou de b\u00e2timents tr\u00e8s \u00e9lev\u00e9s ; Nouveau mode 360 prend une vue panoramique.\\n- Ecran LCD 6,7 cm \/ 2,7\" Clear Photo - Ecran LCD haute qualit\u00e9 (r\u00e9solution 230 000 points) au niveau de d\u00e9tail exceptionnel, \u00e0 contraste \u00e9lev\u00e9 avec un grand angle de visualisation.\\n- Reconnaissance des visages - R\u00e9glage automatique de la mise au point, de l'exposition et de la balance des blancs pour des portraits plus nets et choix de priorit\u00e9 enfants \/ adultes.\\n- D\u00e9tecteur automatique de sourires - Prend automatiquement la photo lorsque le sujet sourit, en fonction des param\u00e8tres d\u00e9finis et du niveau de priorit\u00e9 choisi pour les enfants ou les adultes.\\n- D\u00e9clencheur pour autoportrait - D\u00e9tecte le cadrage id\u00e9al lorsque l'appareil photo est tenu \u00e0 bout de bras ; L'obturateur se d\u00e9clenche automatiquement pour de magnifiques autoportraits.\\n- Mode de prise vue simple - Fonctionnement simple pour les d\u00e9butants avec instructions exhaustives et claires \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran.\\n- Fonctionnalit\u00e9s de retouche int\u00e9gr\u00e9e - Fonctions de retouche de la photo amusantes, notamment pour la correction automatique des yeux rouges et le recadrage.\\n- PlayMemories Home\u2122 - Un logiciel pr\u00e9install\u00e9 facilite le transfert d'images vers l'ordinateur pour la visualisation, le montage, l'impression, l'envoi par e-mail, le t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement \u00e0 partir du web et bien plus.\\n- Compatibilit\u00e9 de la carte m\u00e9moire - Cyber-shot\u2122 accepte une large gamme de cartes, y compris Memory Stick\u2122 et SD\/SDHC - voir les sp\u00e9cifications techniques pour la compatibilit\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":4}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0148e6b0-c5f0-4174-8aa6-a18e675dec8d","identifier":"12255428","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony W610"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>W610 Digitale Kompaktkamera<\/b>\\nLeichte, kompakte und benutzerfreundliche Cyber-shot\u2122 Kamera\\n14,1 Mio. Pixel, 4fach-Zoom, Filmaufnahme, 6,7-cm-LCD, Schwenkpanorama und iAUTO\\nDieses Produkt ist ein fr\u00fcheres Modell und bei Ihrem \u00f6rtlichen H\u00e4ndler m\u00f6glicherweise nicht mehr verf\u00fcgbar.\\n- 26-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv mit optischem 4fach-Zoom.\\n- Extrabreite Bilder dank 360\u00b0-Schwenkpanorama.\\n- Einfache Bedienung, auch f\u00fcr Anf\u00e4nger geeignet.\\n\\n<b>Hochwertige Bilder im Handumdrehen<\/b>\\nDie leichte und kompakte Cyber-shot\u2122 W610 Digitalkamera ist der perfekte Begleiter f\u00fcr Urlaub, Familientreffen und mehr. Die Kombination aus herausragender Bildqualit\u00e4t und einfacher Bedienung macht sie auch dann zu einer guten Wahl, wenn Sie zum ersten Mal eine Digitalkamera verwenden.\\n\\n<b>Einfach mehr im Bild<\/b>\\nAufnahmen von beeindruckenden Landschaften, Bauwerken, Innenansichten und sogar Familienfotos fallen oft entt\u00e4uschend aus, wenn an den Bildr\u00e4ndern etwas fehlt. Mit einem Weitwinkelobjektiv passt mehr auf Ihr Foto, ohne dass Sie sich daf\u00fcr weiter vom Motiv entfernen m\u00fcssen.\\n\\n<b>Die ganze Bildbreite einfangen<\/b>\\nAtemberaubende Aufnahmen von Landschaften oder Stadtszenen sind kein Problem. Cyber-shot\u2122 erm\u00f6glicht High-Speed-Serienaufnahmen bei einem Kameraschwenk (von einer Seite zur anderen oder von oben nach unten) und setzt diese dann automatisch zu einem Bild zusammen. So erzielen Sie beeindruckende Panoramaansichten.\\n\\n<b>Ganz einfach sch\u00f6nere Bilder<\/b>\\nSie sind sich nicht sicher, wie Sie die optimale Kameraeinstellung f\u00fcr eine bestimmte Szene ausw\u00e4hlen? Hilfe ist schon zur Hand. Intelligenter Automatikmodus (iAUTO) passt die Belichtung und andere Kameraeinstellungen in verschiedenen Aufnahmesituationen automatisch an und sorgt so f\u00fcr optimale Ergebnisse.\\n\\n<b>Sch\u00f6ne Portr\u00e4taufnahmen<\/b>\\nNehmen Sie sch\u00f6ne Portr\u00e4tfotos mit l\u00e4chelnden Gesichtern von Freunden und Familie auf. Die Gesichtserkennung passt Kameraeinstellungen so an, dass klare, scharfe Bilder mit nat\u00fcrlichen Hautt\u00f6nen entstehen. Der Smile Shutter l\u00f6st automatisch aus, damit Sie gl\u00fcckliche Momente festhalten k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n- CCD Sensor mit 14,1 Mio. Pixel (effektiv) - \u00c4u\u00dferst hohe Bildqualit\u00e4t und detailgetreue Vergr\u00f6\u00dferungen.\\n- Optischer 4-fach-Zoom, 26-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv - Das hochwertige Zoomobjektiv deckt eine breite Palette an Aufnahmesituationen ab und bietet eine Weitwinkeleinstellung f\u00fcr Gruppen- oder Landschaftsaufnahmen.\\n- Intelligenter Automatikmodus - Die Kamera erkennt zahlreiche h\u00e4ufige Aufnahmesituationen und optimiert die Einstellungen, sodass Sie ohne gro\u00dfen Aufwand herausragende Ergebnisse erhalten.\\n- Videoaufnahme - Nehmen Sie scharfe, klare Videos mit Ton auf, und sehen Sie sie auf dem angeschlossenen Fernseher an (optionales AV-Kabel erforderlich).\\n- SteadyShot - Elektronische Bildstabilisierung f\u00fcr sch\u00e4rfere Bilder bei handgef\u00fchrten Aufnahmen.\\n- 360\u00b0-Schwenkpanorama - Schwenken Sie die Kamera f\u00fcr extrabreite Landschaftsaufnahmen, Stadtansichten oder Aufnahmen hoher Geb\u00e4ude; der neue 360\u00b0-Modus erstellt vollst\u00e4ndige Rundumaufnahmen.\\n- 6,7-cm-\/2,7\"-LCD mit Clear Photo Technologie - Hochwertiges LCD (230.000 Bildpunkte) f\u00fcr ausgezeichnete Details, hohe Kontraste und einen weiten Betrachtungswinkel.\\n- Gesichtserkennung - F\u00fcr noch sch\u00e4rfere Portr\u00e4ts stellt die Kamera Fokus, Belichtung und Wei\u00dfabgleich automatisch ein und verf\u00fcgt zudem \u00fcber eine Priorit\u00e4tenauswahl f\u00fcr Kinder\/Erwachsene.\\n- Smile Shutter - L\u00f6st die Aufnahme automatisch aus, wenn die Person im Sucher l\u00e4chelt: mit anpassbarem Schwellenwert und w\u00e4hlbaren Einstellungen f\u00fcr Kinder und Erwachsene.\\n- Selbstausl\u00f6ser - F\u00fcr richtige Bildkompositionen bei kurzem Abstand zum Motiv; ein automatischer Ausl\u00f6ser sorgt f\u00fcr perfekt in Szene gesetzte Selbstportr\u00e4ts.\\n- Benutzerfreundlicher Aufnahmemodus - Gut lesbare Bildschirmanweisungen erleichtern selbst Anf\u00e4ngern den Umgang mit der Kamera.\\n- Retusche direkt in der Kamera - Retuschefunktionen, einschlie\u00dflich Zuschneiden und Rote-Augen-Korrektur.\\n- PlayMemories Home - Vorinstallierte Software f\u00fcr eine einfache Bild\u00fcbertragung auf den PC zum Ansehen, Bearbeiten, Drucken, Versenden per E-Mail, Upload ins Internet usw.\\n- Speicherkartenkompatibilit\u00e4t - Cyber-shot\u2122 unterst\u00fctzt zahlreiche Speicherkarten, darunter Memory Stick\u2122 und SD- bzw. SDHC-Karten (Angaben zur Kompatibilit\u00e4t siehe technische Daten)."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sweep Panorama\u2122 mode (up to 360\u00b0)<\/b>\\nReach beyond the traditional wide angle lens, and capture more breathtaking shots with Sweep Panorama\u2122 mode. Simply press the shutter button and sweep the camera in the desired direction and the camera continuously shoots at a high speed, then seamlessly stitches the images together with automatic position adjustment to create one stunning panoramic image. Available in wide and up to 360\u00b0 full circle, the camera can take a variety of panoramic shots. Now capturing wide landscapes is as easy as press and sweep.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Auto Mode<\/b>\\nUnlike traditional auto mode, Intelligent Auto (iAuto) mode thinks for you, recognizing scenes, lighting conditions, faces, and adjusts settings resulting in clear images, faces with natural skin tone and less blur. Take advantage of all the technology without leaving Auto mode. Kids on the playground, landscape shots, a beautiful flower or an indoor birthday party; all result in clear images without leaving auto mode.\\n\\n<b>Soft Skin mode<\/b>\\nPortrait subjects will love the results. Soft Skin mode recognizes skin tones and reduces the appearance of blemishes and wrinkles without affecting the rest of the shot.\\n\\n<b>Self-Portrait Timer<\/b>\\nSelf-Portrait Timer helps take the guesswork out of self-portraits by utilizing Face Detection technology to recognize when your face enters the frame. Once the camera detects your face, it triggers a 2-second timer, and then snaps a picture.\\n\\n<b>14.1 Megapixel Super HAD\u2122 CCD Image Sensor<\/b>\\nA powerful 14.1 megapixel1\/2.3\u201d Super HAD\u2122 CCD image sensor helps you capture gorgeous images with superb contrast and clarity down to the finest detail. With 14.1 megapixels, you can create stunning, photo-quality prints up to A3+ (13x19\u201d) size, or crop your images and still come away with high resolution shots.\\n\\n<b>Face Detection technology<\/b>\\nFace Detection technology detects up to eight individual faces and adjusts focus, exposure, and white balance to help deliver crisp, properly lit images of family and friends.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Scene Recognition mode<\/b>\\nIntelligent Scene Recognition (iSCN) mode automatically detects seven different types of scenes and, within just 1\/30th of a second, selects the appropriate camera settings: Backlight, Backlight Portrait, Twilight, Twilight Portrait, Twilight using a tripod, Portrait, Landscape and macro. iSCN has two modes: Auto and Advanced. In Auto Mode, the camera takes a single shot using the optimal settings. In Advanced Mode, the camera takes a photo with the optimal settings and, if in difficult lighting (low light or back light) immediately takes a second photo with another optimized setting so you can choose which to keep.\\n\\n<b>2.7\u201d (230K dots) Clear Photo\u2122 LCD display<\/b>\\nGenerous 2.7\u201d (230K dots) Clear Photo\u2122 LCD display features sharp, natural color that makes it easy to compose shots, read menus, and view photos, even in bright sunlight.\\n\\n<b>Smile Shutter\u2122 technology<\/b>\\nSmile Shutter\u2122 technology captures a smile the moment it happens. Simply press the Smile Shutter\u2122 button and the camera does the rest. You can also select adult and child priority and indicate the degree of Smile Detection sensitivity. Intelligent Scene Recognition can now be used together with Smile Shutter\u2122 mode when the Intelligent Auto mode is on. This means that beautiful smiles can be captured with settings optimized for the particular scene, even in difficult conditions such as twilight and backlighting.\\n\\n<b>Dynamic Range Optimizer<\/b>\\nDynamic Range Optimizer (DRO) Standard and Plus uses a sophisticated algorithm to help recover shadows and highlights. The result is more natural images with clearer details that more closely match what your naked eye sees. DRO is particularly effective when shooting backlit portraits or any scene with a dramatic contrast between background and foreground lighting. DRO Plus allows for even greater optimization by analyzing each region of an image and performing additional image processing."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>W610 Appareil photo num\u00e9rique compact<\/b>\\nUn appareil photo Cyber-shot\u2122 l\u00e9ger, compact, et facile \u00e0 utiliser\\n14,1 m\u00e9gapixels, zoom 4 x, enregistrement vid\u00e9o, \u00e9cran LCD 6,7 cm (2,7\"), mode Panorama par balayage et iAUTO\\n- Zoom optique 4x pour un grand angle de 26 mm.\\n- Photos panoramiques r\u00e9alis\u00e9es en mode 360 Sweep Panorama par balayage.\\n- Simplicit\u00e9 d'utilisation, m\u00eame pour les d\u00e9butants.\\n\\n<b>Images \u00e9poustouflantes en toute simplicit\u00e9<\/b>\\nL\u00e9ger, compact et facile \u00e0 transporter, l'appareil photo num\u00e9rique W610 Cyber-shot est le compagnon id\u00e9al de vos vacances, de vos r\u00e9unions de famille et de toutes les autres occasions. Une qualit\u00e9 d'image incomparable est associ\u00e9e \u00e0 une utilisation simple, m\u00eame si vous \u00eates d\u00e9butant en mati\u00e8re de photographie num\u00e9rique.\\n\\n<b>Elargissez votre champ de vision<\/b>\\nLes paysages spectaculaires, les photos d\u2019architecture, les int\u00e9rieurs et m\u00eame les photos de famille peuvent s\u2019av\u00e9rer d\u00e9cevants lorsqu\u2019ils sont tronqu\u00e9s sur les bords. L\u2019objectif grand angle vous permet d\u2019\u00e9largir votre cadre sans vous \u00e9loigner du sujet.\\n\\n<b>De plus belles photos en toute facilit\u00e9<\/b>\\nVous n'\u00eates pas s\u00fbr d'avoir effectu\u00e9 les r\u00e9glages optimaux sur votre appareil photo pour capturer une sc\u00e8ne en particulier ? Nous allons vous aider. Le mode Auto intelligent (iAUTO) r\u00e8gle automatiquement l'exposition et les autres r\u00e9glages de l'appareil photo pour des r\u00e9sultats optimaux dans de nombreuses.\\n\\n<b>Un point de vue complet<\/b>\\nIl est d\u00e9sormais facile de r\u00e9aliser de magnifiques photos d'un paysage ou d'une ville. Le mod\u00e8le Cyber-shot superpose automatiquement des images prises en rafale ultrarapide pendant que vous d\u00e9crivez un cercle de gauche \u00e0 droite (ou de haut en bas !) avec l'appareil photo pour cr\u00e9er une image panoramique.\\n\\n<b>De sublimes portraits<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez de magnifiques portraits de vos amis et de votre famille. La fonction D\u00e9tection des visages ajuste les param\u00e8tres de l'appareil photo pour des r\u00e9sultats nets et clairs et des tons plus naturels. La fonction D\u00e9tecteur automatique de sourires prend automatiquement la photo pour capturer ces instants.\\n\\n- Capteur CCD 14,1 m\u00e9gapixels effectifs - Prend des photos de tr\u00e8s grande qualit\u00e9 pour obtenir des agrandissements avec un haut niveau de d\u00e9tails.\\n- Zoom optique 4 x \/ Objectif grand angle de 26 mm - Objectif zoom haute qualit\u00e9 pour une grande vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de prises de vue en toutes circonstances, avec un grand angle pour les photos de groupe et les paysages.\\n- Mode Auto intelligent - L'appareil photo reconna\u00eet de nombreuses situations courantes de prise de vue. Il optimise les param\u00e8tres afin d'obtenir des r\u00e9sultats clairs et nets sans difficult\u00e9.\\n- Enregistrement vid\u00e9o - Des clips vid\u00e9o d'une nettet\u00e9 parfaite avec son : visionnez sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur connect\u00e9 (c\u00e2ble AV en option requis).\\n- Stabilisateur SteadyShot - Le stabilisateur d'image \u00e9lectronique permet d'obtenir des photographies plus nettes \u00e0 main lev\u00e9e.\\n- Panorama par balayage 360 - Balayez l'appareil photo et saisissez des images de paysages extr\u00eamement larges, ou de villes ou de b\u00e2timents tr\u00e8s \u00e9lev\u00e9s ; Nouveau mode 360 prend une vue panoramique.\\n- Ecran LCD 6,7 cm \/ 2,7\" Clear Photo - Ecran LCD haute qualit\u00e9 (r\u00e9solution 230 000 points) au niveau de d\u00e9tail exceptionnel, \u00e0 contraste \u00e9lev\u00e9 avec un grand angle de visualisation.\\n- Reconnaissance des visages - R\u00e9glage automatique de la mise au point, de l'exposition et de la balance des blancs pour des portraits plus nets et choix de priorit\u00e9 enfants \/ adultes.\\n- D\u00e9tecteur automatique de sourires - Prend automatiquement la photo lorsque le sujet sourit, en fonction des param\u00e8tres d\u00e9finis et du niveau de priorit\u00e9 choisi pour les enfants ou les adultes.\\n- D\u00e9clencheur pour autoportrait - D\u00e9tecte le cadrage id\u00e9al lorsque l'appareil photo est tenu \u00e0 bout de bras ; L'obturateur se d\u00e9clenche automatiquement pour de magnifiques autoportraits.\\n- Mode de prise vue simple - Fonctionnement simple pour les d\u00e9butants avec instructions exhaustives et claires \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran.\\n- Fonctionnalit\u00e9s de retouche int\u00e9gr\u00e9e - Fonctions de retouche de la photo amusantes, notamment pour la correction automatique des yeux rouges et le recadrage.\\n- PlayMemories Home\u2122 - Un logiciel pr\u00e9install\u00e9 facilite le transfert d'images vers l'ordinateur pour la visualisation, le montage, l'impression, l'envoi par e-mail, le t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement \u00e0 partir du web et bien plus.\\n- Compatibilit\u00e9 de la carte m\u00e9moire - Cyber-shot\u2122 accepte une large gamme de cartes, y compris Memory Stick\u2122 et SD\/SDHC - voir les sp\u00e9cifications techniques pour la compatibilit\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":4}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"dd11688e-2311-4c33-aa5a-9cd0167b32a3","identifier":"12255433","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony W630"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Light, compact, easy to use Cyber-shot\u2122 camera<\/b>\\n16.1 megapixels, 5x zoom, 720p HD movie, Optical SteadyShot, 6.7 cm LCD, Sweep Panorama and iAUTO.\\n- Carl Zeiss\u00ae lens with 5x optical zoom.\\n- Shoot extra-wide images with 360 Sweep Panorama.\\n- Easy operation, even for beginners.\\n\\n<b>Superb images made simple<\/b>\\nLight, compact and comfortable to carry, the Cyber-shot\u2122 W630 digital camera is your perfect companion for holidays, family get-togethers and more. Superb image quality is teamed with simple, uncluttered operation - even if you're a first-time digital camera user.\\n\\n<b>Magical movies<\/b>\\nShoot brilliantly crisp, detailed HD video clips: you'll enjoy stable, blur-free images even while walking or zooming.\\n\\n<b>Better looking pictures made easy<\/b>\\nNot sure how to pick the perfect camera settings to suit a particular scene? Help is at hand. Intelligent Auto (iAUTO) mode automatically adjusts exposure and other camera settings for optimum results in a wide range of shooting situations.\\n\\n<b>Experience the whole picture<\/b>\\nIt's easy to grab breathtaking views of landscapes or city scenes. Cyber-shot\u2122 stitches together a high-speed burst of frames when you sweep the camera from side to side (or up and down!) to create one amazing panoramic image.\\n\\n<b>Beautiful portraits<\/b>\\nCapture beautiful, smiling portraits of friends and family. Face Detection adjusts camera settings for clear, crisp results with natural skin tones. Smile Shutter fires the shutter automatically to capture those happy moments.\\n\\n- 16.1 effective megapixels CCD sensor - Captures extremely high quality images, allowing detail-packed enlargements.\\n- 5x optical zoom\/25mm wide angle lens - High quality zoom lens by Carl Zeiss\u00ae covers a wide range of shooting situations, with wide angle for group shots \/ landscapes.\\n- BIONZ\u2122 processor - Powerful image processing ensures clear, detailed, low-noise images and quick, responsive shooting.\\n- Intelligent Auto Mode - Camera recognises a wide range of common shooting situations, optimising settings for clear, natural results without fuss.\\n- Artistic Picture Effect modes - Create four exciting 'in camera' effects - Toy Camera, Partial Colour, Soft High-Key, Pop Colour.\\n- 720p HD movie - Record smooth, high quality HD video clips using Motion JPEG format (720p): optical zoom possible during video shooting.\\n- Optical SteadyShot Active Mode - Cuts shaky camera movements when shooting video, even while walking or zooming: Optical SteadyShot cuts blur when shooting stills.\\n- 360 Sweep Panorama - Sweep the camera and grab extra-wide images of landscapes, city scenes and tall buildings; new 360 mode captures an all-round view.\\n- 6.7cm\/2.7\" Clear Photo LCD - High quality LCD screen (230k dot resolution) offers excellent detail, high contrast and wide viewing angle.\\n- HD output - View video and still images on HD TV (requires optional cable): PhotoTV HD enhances viewing on compatible BRAVIA\u2122.\\n- Face Detection - Automatically adjusts focus, exposure and white balance for clearer portraits and priority selectable for children \/ adults.\\n- Smile Shutter - Automatically fires shutter when subject smiles: with adjustable smile threshold and priority selectable for children \/ adults.\\n- Self Portrait Timer - Detects correct framing when camera is held at arm's length; shutter fires automatically for great self portraits.\\n- Easy Shooting mode - Fuss-free operation for beginners with large, easy-to-read on-screen instructions.\\n- In-Camera Guide - Get on-screen tips and information on operating your camera without leafing through instruction manuals.\\n- In-camera retouching - Fun in-camera still image retouching functions including Trimming, Red-Eye correction, Unsharp Masking.\\n- PlayMemories Home - Pre-installed software makes it easy to transfer images to PC for viewing, editing, printing, emailing, web uploads and more.\\n- Memory card compatibility - Cyber-shot\u2122 accepts a wide range of cards, including Memory Stick\u2122 and SD\/SDHC - see Technical Specifications for compatibility."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"79508342-4650-4538-bcc1-cfbbf0ce2eba","identifier":"12255435","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony W630"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>W630 Digitale Kompaktkamera<\/b>\\nLeichte, kompakte und benutzerfreundliche Cyber-shot\u2122 Kamera\\n16,1 Mio. Pixel, 5fach-Zoom, 720p-HD-Filmaufnahme, optischer SteadyShot, 6,7-cm-LCD, Schwenkpanorama und iAUTO\\nDieses Produkt ist ein fr\u00fcheres Modell und bei Ihrem \u00f6rtlichen H\u00e4ndler m\u00f6glicherweise nicht mehr verf\u00fcgbar.\\n- Carl Zeiss\u00ae Objektiv mit optischem 5fach-Zoom.\\n- Extrabreite Bilder dank 360\u00b0-Schwenkpanorama.\\n- Einfache Bedienung, auch f\u00fcr Anf\u00e4nger geeignet.\\n\\n<b>Hochwertige Bilder im Handumdrehen<\/b>\\nDie leichte und kompakte Cyber-shot\u2122 W630 Digitalkamera ist der perfekte Begleiter f\u00fcr Urlaub, Familientreffen und mehr. Die Kombination aus herausragender Bildqualit\u00e4t und einfacher Bedienung macht sie auch dann zu einer guten Wahl, wenn Sie zum ersten Mal eine Digitalkamera verwenden.\\n\\n<b>Magische Momente<\/b>\\nNehmen Sie brillante, klare Full HD-Videos auf. Freuen Sie sich auch beim Gehen oder Zoomen auf stabile, verwacklungsfreie Bilder.\\n\\n<b>Ergebnisse wie bei DSLR-Kamera leicht gemacht<\/b>\\nEs war nie leichter, erstklassige Bilder aufzunehmen. Mit dem hervorragenden Automatikmodus werden Belichtung und andere Kameraeinstellungen f\u00fcr optimale Ergebnisse in nahezu jeder Situation angepasst. Der High-Speed-Autofokus h\u00e4lt Ihr Motiv f\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Ergebnisse fest.\\n\\n<b>Vario-Tessar\u00ae Objektiv von Carl Zeiss\u00ae<\/b>\\nFangen Sie brillante Fotos und Videos in HD-Qualit\u00e4t ein. Das Vario-Tessar\u00ae Objektiv von Carl Zeiss\u00ae sorgt f\u00fcr \u00e4u\u00dferst detaillierte Bilder mit \u00e4u\u00dferst geringen Verzerrungen mit hervorragendem Kontrast bei allen Zoomeinstellungen von Weitwinkel bis hin zu Tele.\\n\\n<b>Die ganze Bildbreite einfangen<\/b>\\nAtemberaubende Aufnahmen von Landschaften oder Stadtszenen sind kein Problem. Cyber-shot\u2122 erm\u00f6glicht High-Speed-Serienaufnahmen bei einem Kameraschwenk (von einer Seite zur anderen oder von oben nach unten) und setzt diese dann automatisch zu einem Bild zusammen. So erzielen Sie beeindruckende Panoramaansichten.\\n\\n<b>Kreieren Sie wirkungsvolle Effekte<\/b>\\nSie ben\u00f6tigen keinen PC oder teure Bildbearbeitungssoftware, um mit der Kamera sch\u00f6ne Effekte zu erzielen, die nicht nur Portraits und Panoramaaufnahmen den letzten Schliff verleihen. W\u00e4hlen Sie aus verschiedenen Bildeffektmodi, um ihr Meisterwerk zu optimieren."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Light, compact, easy to use Cyber-shot\u2122 camera<\/b>\\n16.1 megapixels, 5x zoom, 720p HD movie, Optical SteadyShot, 6.7 cm LCD, Sweep Panorama and iAUTO.\\n- Carl Zeiss\u00ae lens with 5x optical zoom.\\n- Shoot extra-wide images with 360 Sweep Panorama.\\n- Easy operation, even for beginners.\\n\\n<b>Superb images made simple<\/b>\\nLight, compact and comfortable to carry, the Cyber-shot\u2122 W630 digital camera is your perfect companion for holidays, family get-togethers and more. Superb image quality is teamed with simple, uncluttered operation - even if you're a first-time digital camera user.\\n\\n<b>Magical movies<\/b>\\nShoot brilliantly crisp, detailed HD video clips: you'll enjoy stable, blur-free images even while walking or zooming.\\n\\n<b>Better looking pictures made easy<\/b>\\nNot sure how to pick the perfect camera settings to suit a particular scene? Help is at hand. Intelligent Auto (iAUTO) mode automatically adjusts exposure and other camera settings for optimum results in a wide range of shooting situations.\\n\\n<b>Experience the whole picture<\/b>\\nIt's easy to grab breathtaking views of landscapes or city scenes. Cyber-shot\u2122 stitches together a high-speed burst of frames when you sweep the camera from side to side (or up and down!) to create one amazing panoramic image.\\n\\n<b>Beautiful portraits<\/b>\\nCapture beautiful, smiling portraits of friends and family. Face Detection adjusts camera settings for clear, crisp results with natural skin tones. Smile Shutter fires the shutter automatically to capture those happy moments.\\n\\n- 16.1 effective megapixels CCD sensor - Captures extremely high quality images, allowing detail-packed enlargements.\\n- 5x optical zoom\/25mm wide angle lens - High quality zoom lens by Carl Zeiss\u00ae covers a wide range of shooting situations, with wide angle for group shots \/ landscapes.\\n- BIONZ\u2122 processor - Powerful image processing ensures clear, detailed, low-noise images and quick, responsive shooting.\\n- Intelligent Auto Mode - Camera recognises a wide range of common shooting situations, optimising settings for clear, natural results without fuss.\\n- Artistic Picture Effect modes - Create four exciting 'in camera' effects - Toy Camera, Partial Colour, Soft High-Key, Pop Colour.\\n- 720p HD movie - Record smooth, high quality HD video clips using Motion JPEG format (720p): optical zoom possible during video shooting.\\n- Optical SteadyShot Active Mode - Cuts shaky camera movements when shooting video, even while walking or zooming: Optical SteadyShot cuts blur when shooting stills.\\n- 360 Sweep Panorama - Sweep the camera and grab extra-wide images of landscapes, city scenes and tall buildings; new 360 mode captures an all-round view.\\n- 6.7cm\/2.7\" Clear Photo LCD - High quality LCD screen (230k dot resolution) offers excellent detail, high contrast and wide viewing angle.\\n- HD output - View video and still images on HD TV (requires optional cable): PhotoTV HD enhances viewing on compatible BRAVIA\u2122.\\n- Face Detection - Automatically adjusts focus, exposure and white balance for clearer portraits and priority selectable for children \/ adults.\\n- Smile Shutter - Automatically fires shutter when subject smiles: with adjustable smile threshold and priority selectable for children \/ adults.\\n- Self Portrait Timer - Detects correct framing when camera is held at arm's length; shutter fires automatically for great self portraits.\\n- Easy Shooting mode - Fuss-free operation for beginners with large, easy-to-read on-screen instructions.\\n- In-Camera Guide - Get on-screen tips and information on operating your camera without leafing through instruction manuals.\\n- In-camera retouching - Fun in-camera still image retouching functions including Trimming, Red-Eye correction, Unsharp Masking.\\n- PlayMemories Home - Pre-installed software makes it easy to transfer images to PC for viewing, editing, printing, emailing, web uploads and more.\\n- Memory card compatibility - Cyber-shot\u2122 accepts a wide range of cards, including Memory Stick\u2122 and SD\/SDHC - see Technical Specifications for compatibility."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>W630 Appareil photo num\u00e9rique compact<\/b>\\nUn appareil photo Cyber-shot\u2122 l\u00e9ger, compact, et facile \u00e0 utiliser\\n16,1 m\u00e9gapixels, zoom 5 x, vid\u00e9o HD 720 p, stabilisateur optique SteadyShot, \u00e9cran LCD 6,7 cm (2,7\"), mode Panorama par balayage et iAUTO\\n- Objectif Chez Carl Zeiss\u00ae avec zoom optique 5 x\\n- Photos panoramiques r\u00e9alis\u00e9es en mode 360 Sweep Panorama par balayage\\n- Simplicit\u00e9 d'utilisation, m\u00eame pour les d\u00e9butants.\\n\\n<b>Images \u00e9poustouflantes en toute simplicit\u00e9<\/b>\\nL\u00e9ger, compact et facile \u00e0 transporter, l'appareil photo num\u00e9rique W630 Cyber-shot est le compagnon id\u00e9al de vos vacances, de vos r\u00e9unions de famille et de toutes les autres occasions. Une qualit\u00e9 d'image incomparable est associ\u00e9e \u00e0 une utilisation simple, m\u00eame si vous \u00eates d\u00e9butant en mati\u00e8re de photographie num\u00e9rique.\\n\\n<b>Vivez toute la magie de vos films<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez de superbes vid\u00e9o HD nettes et d\u00e9taill\u00e9es pour profiter d'images stables et sans flou tout en marchant ou en zoomant.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9sultats dignes d'un reflex num\u00e9rique<\/b>\\nIl n'a jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 aussi simple d'obtenir de si belles images. Le mode Auto sup\u00e9rieur r\u00e8gle l'exposition et les autres param\u00e8tres de l'appareil photo pour de sublimes r\u00e9sultats en toutes circonstances. La mise au point automatique ultra-rapide verrouille votre sujet pour des photos d'une incroyable clart\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Objectif Vario-Tessar\u00ae de Carl Zeiss\u00ae<\/b>\\nPrenez des photos et enregistrez des vid\u00e9os HD avec pr\u00e9cision et haute r\u00e9solution. L'objectif Vario-Tessar\u00ae de Carl Zeiss\u00ae vous garantit des photos nettes et \u00e0 distorsion r\u00e9duite avec un contraste de qualit\u00e9 \u00e0 tous les niveaux de zoom, du grand angle au t\u00e9l\u00e9objectif.\\n\\n<b>Un point de vue complet<\/b>\\nIl est d\u00e9sormais facile de r\u00e9aliser de magnifiques photos d'un paysage ou d'une ville. Le mod\u00e8le Cyber-shot superpose automatiquement des images prises en rafale ultrarapide pendant que vous d\u00e9crivez un cercle de gauche \u00e0 droite (ou de haut en bas !) avec l'appareil photo pour cr\u00e9er une image panoramique fantastique.\\n\\n<b>Cr\u00e9ez des effets artistiques<\/b>\\nPlus besoin d'ordinateur ou de logiciel de retouche on\u00e9reux pour cr\u00e9er de superbes effets \u00e0 l'aide des fonctions de votre appareil photo pour am\u00e9liorer vos portraits, photos de paysages et autres cr\u00e9ations. Faites votre choix parmi nos diff\u00e9rents modes Effets sp\u00e9ciaux pour sublimer vos chefs-d'\u0153uvre."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"61df300d-b508-4f08-ba9f-58463a199094","identifier":"1225587","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["fujitsu","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujitsu SCENICVIEW Series 22\" LCD TFT Monitor"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>SCENICVIEW A22W-3<\/b>\\n<i>Convenience at low cost<\/i>\\nFeaturing the characteristic quality in the adapted SCENICVIEW family look, this 22-inch wide LCD TFT display of the Value Line is the ideal choice for entering the world of professional LCD displays. Space saving design and large display size make the SCENICVIEW A22W-3 the affordable ergonomic display solution for convenient workplaces. Enjoy the advantages of a wide visible screen area."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d95da097-ea45-43c0-98dc-0cd4062f305a","identifier":"12259936","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S24B350H"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>SyncMaster Serie 3 (SB350): Preisg\u00fcnstige LED-Monitore mit ansprechendem Design<\/b>\\n- Bildschirmgr\u00f6\u00dfe: 60,96 cm Wide (24 Zoll);\\n- Helligkeitswert: 250 cd\/m\u00b2;\\n- Kontrast (dynamisch): Mega Contrast;\\n- Reaktionszeit: 2 ms (G\/G).\\n\\nDie neuen LED-Monitore der Serie 3 (SB350) sind in drei Displaygr\u00f6\u00dfen verf\u00fcgbar: SyncMaster S22B350H LED (54,61 cm \/ 22\u201c), S24B350H LED (60,96 cm \/ 24\u201c), S27B350H (68,58 cm \/ 27\u201c). Ihr ansprechendes \u201eTransparent Red\u201c-Design l\u00e4sst sie nicht nur gut aussehen, sondern ist durch den Verzicht auf Lacke umweltfreundlicher als herk\u00f6mmliche lackierte Displayrahmen. Durch die Samsung MagicEco-Funktion kann auf Knopfdruck Strom gespart werden \u2013 bis zu 50%. Beste digitale Bildqualit\u00e4t garantiert der HDMI-Anschluss, dem auch ein analoger VGA-Anschluss zur Seite steht.\\n\\n<b>Erreichen Sie das n\u00e4chste Level mit Mega Dynamic Contrast<\/b>\\nErleben Sie mit Mega Dynamic Contrast eine neue Welt atemberaubender Farben, erstaunliche Brillanz und erstklassige Bildqualit\u00e4t. Samsung Displays der Serie SB350 liefern solch realistische Bilder, dass sich dadurch Ihre gesamte Wahrnehmung ver\u00e4ndern wird. Ausgestattet mit einer unglaublich hohen Kontrastrate von 5.000.000:1, der derzeit h\u00f6chsten erh\u00e4ltlichen Kontrastrate \u00fcberhaupt, garantieren diese Displays Schwarzt\u00f6ne, die dunkler nicht sein k\u00f6nnten, makelloses Wei\u00df und strahlende Farbe. Das kristallklare, extrem intensive Bild wird Ihnen sofort ins Auge stechen. Es wird Ihnen wie eine Farbexplosion vorkommen, gegen die andere Monitore geradezu fad wirken. Genie\u00dfen Sie Multimediainhalte ab sofort mit der Professionalit\u00e4t, die Sie verdienen \u2013 dank Samsungs Mega Dynamic Contrast.\\n\\n<b>Die Helligkeit bestimmt \u00fcber den Stromverbrauch<\/b>\\nEco Saving macht Energiesparen einfach. Je nachdem, wie viel Strom Sie sparen m\u00f6chten, stellt diese Funktion Ihr Samsung Display automatisch heller oder dunkler ein. Drei Energiesparmodi (50%, 25% und Energiesparen aus) sorgen daf\u00fcr, dass Sie Ihren Displayeinsatz ganz genau auf Ihre pers\u00f6nlichen Bed\u00fcrfnisse ausrichten k\u00f6nnen. Samsungs Verpflichtung zu stromsparenden Produkten hilft sowohl Ihnen als auch der Umwelt, und mit bis zu 50% Energieersparnis tragen Sie tats\u00e4chlich ma\u00dfgeblich zum Schutz der Umwelt bei. \u00dcbernehmen Sie die Kontrolle \u00fcber Ihren Stromverbrauch mit Eco Saving.\\n\\n<b>Sehen Sie mehr mit weiteren Blickwinkeln<\/b>\\nWie sehen Sie sich Filme am liebsten an? Liegen Sie gerne auf der Couch? Oder sitzen Sie lieber auf Ihrem Lieblingsstuhl? Oder vielleicht kochen Sie dabei ja gerne oder machen Sport? Egal ob Sie stehen, sitzen oder liegen \u2013 Samsungs Magic Angle stellt sicher, dass der Film immer im Mittelpunkt steht und Sie es sich so richtig bequem machen k\u00f6nnen. Dank der 5 Winkelmodi k\u00f6nnen Sie sich Ihre Lieblingsfilme aus jedem erdenklichen Winkel in exzellenter Bildqualit\u00e4t ansehen. Mit Magic Angle ist dies ganz bequem und ohne Einschr\u00e4nkungen m\u00f6glich."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Samsung S24B350H Series 3 LED Monitor features a range of inputs, including HDMI and DVI, to let you access all your devices and content. Thanks to a range of Eco Saving modes, you\u2019ll also be able to adjust screen brightness for maximum comfort and minimum cost \u2013 both in terms of the environment and your finances. Better viewing is a reality with your Series 3 LED Monitor, with Magic Angle technology providing a greater range of viewing angles and Mega Dynamic Contrast delivering a vivid and dramatic picture."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Une exp\u00e9rience sans limite gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 de nombreuses entr\u00e9es vid\u00e9o<\/b>\\nNe vous limitez plus seulement \u00e0 vos films pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s ! Les moniteurs Samsung s\u00e9rie 350 poss\u00e8dent une entr\u00e9e HDMI et une entr\u00e9e VGA, assurant une parfaite compatibilit\u00e9 de votre moniteur \u00e0 tous vos p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques.\\n\\n<b>Ne vous fatiguez plus les yeux et profitez de ce que vous voyez<\/b>\\nComment aimez-vous regarder un film ? Allong\u00e9 sur votre canap\u00e9, assis sur votre fauteuil pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9, en cuisinant ou en faisant de l\u2019exercice ? O\u00f9 que vous soyez \u2013 debout, assis ou couch\u00e9 \u2013 la technologie Magic Angle de Samsung vous garantit une parfaite visibilit\u00e9 sans perte de qualit\u00e9. Quel que soit l\u2019emplacement de votre moniteur Samsung, les 5 modes de gestion de l\u2019angle de vue vous permettent de r\u00e9gler l\u2019\u00e9cran et de b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier du meilleur r\u00e9sultat possible. Profitez de vos contenus multim\u00e9dia comme vous les aimez avec le plus grand confort visuel.\\n\\n<b>Contr\u00f4lez la luminosit\u00e9 tout en \u00e9conomisant de l'\u00e9nergie<\/b>\\nLa fonction Magic Eco vous permet d\u2019\u00e9conomiser facilement de l\u2019\u00e9nergie. En effet, elle ajuste la luminosit\u00e9 du moniteur Samsung en fonction de la quantit\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9nergie que vous souhaitez \u00e9conomiser. Vous avez quatre possibilit\u00e9s : consommation \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique de 100% ou 75%, 50% et sans \u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie. Si la fonction Magic Eco est d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9e, vous pouvez recourir \u00e0 la technologie Magic Bright de Samsung pour ajuster manuellement la luminosit\u00e9 de l\u2019\u00e9cran. Prenez les commandes avec MagicEco et \u00e9conomisez de l\u2019\u00e9nergie en toute simplicit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Passez au niveau sup\u00e9rieur avec le contraste Mega DCR (Dynamic Contrast Ratio)<\/b>\\nD\u00e9couvrez une image de haute qualit\u00e9 avec une incroyable richesse de couleurs gr\u00e2ce au taux de contraste am\u00e9lior\u00e9 (un taux de contraste parmi les plus \u00e9lev\u00e9s actuellement disponibles). Le moniteur Samsung S24B350H d\u00e9livre des images tellement r\u00e9alistes que vous verrez chaque couleur, chaque d\u00e9tail prendre vie sur votre \u00e9cran. Vous serez impressionn\u00e9 par la profondeur des noirs et la richesse des couleurs rendant l\u2019image incroyablement naturelle. Elevez votre exp\u00e9rience visuelle \u00e0 un niveau sup\u00e9rieur et profitez de vos meilleurs contenus gr\u00e2ce au contraste M\u00e9ga DCR du Samsung S24B350H."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":2}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f0c096dc-3744-4ffe-a0f3-13a17fae61b7","identifier":"12259938","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S27B370H"}],"description":[{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"\\n<br\/><b>Une exp\u00e9rience sans limite gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 de nombreuses entr\u00e9es vid\u00e9o<\/b>\\n<br\/>Ne vous limitez plus seulement \u00e0 vos films pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s ! Les moniteurs Samsung s\u00e9rie 370 poss\u00e8dent une entr\u00e9e HDMI et une entr\u00e9e VGA, assurant une parfaite compatibilit\u00e9 de votre moniteur \u00e0 tous vos p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques.\\n<br\/><b>Contr\u00f4lez la luminosit\u00e9 tout en \u00e9conomisant de l'\u00e9nergie<\/b>\\n<br\/>La fonction Magic Eco vous permet d\u2019\u00e9conomiser facilement de l\u2019\u00e9nergie. En effet, elle ajuste la luminosit\u00e9 du moniteur Samsung en fonction de la quantit\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9nergie que vous souhaitez \u00e9conomiser. Vous avez quatre possibilit\u00e9s : consommation \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique de 100% ou 75%, 50% et sans \u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie. Si la fonction Magic Eco est d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9e, vous pouvez recourir \u00e0 la technologie Magic Bright de Samsung pour ajuster manuellement la luminosit\u00e9 de l\u2019\u00e9cran. Prenez les commandes avec MagicEco et \u00e9conomisez de l\u2019\u00e9nergie en toute simplicit\u00e9.\\n<br\/><b>Ne vous fatiguez plus les yeux et profitez de ce que vous voyez<\/b>\\n<br\/>Comment aimez-vous regarder un film ? Allong\u00e9 sur votre canap\u00e9, assis sur votre fauteuil pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9, en cuisinant ou en faisant de l\u2019exercice ? O\u00f9 que vous soyez \u2013 debout, assis ou couch\u00e9 \u2013 la technologie Magic Angle de Samsung vous garantit une parfaite visibilit\u00e9 sans perte de qualit\u00e9. Quel que soit l\u2019emplacement de votre moniteur Samsung, les 5 modes de gestion de l\u2019angle de vue vous permettent de r\u00e9gler l\u2019\u00e9cran et de b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier du meilleur r\u00e9sultat possible. Profitez de vos contenus multim\u00e9dia comme vous les aimez avec le plus grand confort visuel.\\n<br\/><b>Passez au niveau sup\u00e9rieur avec le contraste Mega DCR (Dynamic Contrast Ratio)<\/b>\\n<br\/>D\u00e9couvrez une image de haute qualit\u00e9 avec une incroyable richesse de couleurs gr\u00e2ce au taux de contraste am\u00e9lior\u00e9 (un taux de contraste parmi les plus \u00e9lev\u00e9s actuellement disponibles). Le moniteur Samsung S27B370H d\u00e9livre des images tellement r\u00e9alistes que vous verrez chaque couleur, chaque d\u00e9tail prendre vie sur votre \u00e9cran. Vous serez impressionn\u00e9 par la profondeur des noirs et la richesse des couleurs rendant l\u2019image incroyablement naturelle. Elevez votre exp\u00e9rience visuelle \u00e0 un niveau sup\u00e9rieur et profitez de vos meilleurs contenus gr\u00e2ce au contraste M\u00e9ga DCR du Samsung S27B370H.\\n<br\/><b>Un moniteur que vous voudrez toucher<\/b>\\n<br\/>Affichez votre style sophistiqu\u00e9 avec l\u2019aspect moderne et unique du moniteur Samsung S\u00e9rie 370. Le design de la s\u00e9rie, brevet\u00e9 par Samsung, repose sur un doux m\u00e9lange entre courbes naturelles et finitions noir piano. Lorsque vos yeux se d\u00e9placeront autour du cadre, vous apercevrez le l\u00e9ger d\u00e9grad\u00e9 de couleurs qui l\u2019entoure. Transformez nos moniteurs d\u00e9j\u00e0 \u00e9l\u00e9gants en de v\u00e9ritables \u0153uvres d'art, diff\u00e9rents de tout ce que vous avez d\u00e9j\u00e0 connu. V\u00e9ritable pi\u00e8ce maitresse, le pied en cristal soutient avec \u00e9l\u00e9gance l'ensemble du cadre, ce qui ne manquera pas de vous faire remarquer sa l\u00e9g\u00e8ret\u00e9."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":2}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":27,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"62440526-aa2f-4f94-97ca-f21919ec6c43","identifier":"12271780","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["aoc","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AOC e950Swn"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Modernste Technologie mit LED-Backlights, eine starke Performance sowie ein zeitlos klassisches, schwarzes Design kennzeichnen dieses Modell. Aufgrund hoher Kontrast- und Helligkeitswerte sowie einer schnellen Reaktionszeit pr\u00e4sentiert es selbst rasante Bewegtbildsequenzen fl\u00fcssig und gestochen scharf. Das elegante Display mit haarfeinen Texturen an der R\u00fcckseite und an dem runden Sockel ist an seiner \u201eschlanksten\u201c Stelle gerade einmal 1,6 cm tief. Dank seiner zahlreichen Features empfiehlt es sich sowohl f\u00fcr B\u00fcroarbeitspl\u00e4tze als auch f\u00fcr Zuhause.\\n\\n<b>PRODUKTDETAILS<\/b>\\n- Eing\u00e4nge: D-SUB\\n- 1366 x 768 maximale Aufl\u00f6sung\\n- Special Features: -4\u00b0~17\u00b0 Tilt,5:4 switch,DCB,Eco Mode,e-Saver,i-Menu,Kensington Security Lock,Low-Power,Off Timer,screen+,VESA 75 mm\\n- 200 cd\/m\u00b2 (typ) cd\/m\u00b2\\n- 5 ms"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"This model is characterised by the latest display technology with LED backlights, a top performance and a timelessly classic, black design. Due to high contrast and brightness values as well as a quick response time, the monitor renders even the fastest movie sequences fluently and razor-sharp. At its slimmest region, this elegant display, which sports hairline textures on the rear side as well as the base, is just 1.6 cm deep. Thanks to numerous features it is recommended for both office and home.\\n\\nSpecial Features: -4\u00b0~17\u00b0 Tilt,5:4 switch,DCB,Eco Mode,e-Saver,i-Menu,Kensington Security Lock,Low-Power,Off Timer,screen+,VESA 75 mm"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Principales caract\u00e9ristiques de ce mod\u00e8le : une technologie d\u2019affichage de pointe \u00e0 r\u00e9tro-\u00e9clairage LED*, d\u2019excellentes performances et un design noir, \u00e0 la fois classique et ind\u00e9modable. Avec ses valeurs \u00e9lev\u00e9es de contraste et de luminosit\u00e9 et un temps de r\u00e9ponse rapide, le moniteur conf\u00e8re une nettet\u00e9 une fluidit\u00e9 exceptionnelle aux images anim\u00e9es les plus rapides. Cet \u00e9cran, \u00e0 texture bross\u00e9e sur la face arri\u00e8re et la base, ne mesure qu\u20191,6 cm \u00e0 l\u2019endroit le plus mince. Sa grande polyvalence en fait un outil aussi \u00e0 l\u2019aise au bureau qu\u2019\u00e0 la maison.\\n\\n<b>D\u00c9TAILS SUR LE PRODUIT<\/b>\\n- Inputs: D-SUB\\n- 1366 x 768 maximum resolution\\n- Special Features: -4\u00b0~17\u00b0 Tilt,5:4 switch,DCB,Eco Mode,e-Saver,i-Menu,Kensington Security Lock,Low-Power,Off Timer,screen+,VESA 75 mm\\n- 200 cd\/m\u00b2 (typ) cd\/m\u00b2\\n- 5 ms"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6b068744-a8d6-4480-a0d3-5825ea14f4ba","identifier":"122728","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["n","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LaserBase MF5650"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 200-240V,50-60Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Canon LaserBase MF5650, LaserBase. Print technology: Laser, Scanning: Colour. Maximum copy resolution: 600 x 600, Copier resize: 50 - 200. Scan type: Flatbed. Modem speed: 33.6. Bundled software: Presto!PageManager,ScanSoft OmniPage SE"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8155e4f7-7231-4236-a2cc-51ea5e72a556","identifier":"1229012","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 17\" SXGA LCD, Silver"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100-240VAC, 50\/60Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Optimierte Qualit\u00e4t und Komfort bezahlbar gemacht: Ausgestattet mit intelligenten Funktionen f\u00fcr eine verbesserte Darstellung unterst\u00fctzt der 170S8 auch SmartManage-Monitorfernverwaltung, seine umweltfreundliche Bauart sorgen f\u00fcr besonders niedrige Betriebskosten."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Compact display, rich performance on your budget<\/b>\\n\\nOptimized performance and convenience made affordable: Packed with smart features for enhanced display, the compact I70S8 also features SmartManage remote monitor management and green design that delivers the best total cost of ownership.\\n\\n<b>Best total cost of ownership solution<\/b>\\n-SmartManage compatibility enables LAN-based asset management.\\n-PerfecTune ensures top quality LCD display delivered to you.\\n-Empowered for Windows Vista.\\n-TCO'03 guarantees the highest safety and ergonomic standards.\\n\\n<b>Outstanding front of screen performance<\/b>\\n-Smartlmage for the best LCD viewing experience.\\n-SmartContrast Optimized contrast for visual clarity.\\n-5ms fast response time.\\n\\n<b>Maximum comfort for maximum productivity<\/b>\\n-Screen tilts to your ideal, individualized viewing angle.\\n\\n<b>Great convenience<\/b>\\n-Dual input accepts both analog VGA and digital DVI signals.\\n-Hassle-free display performance tuning with SmartControl II.\\n-Cable management for a tidy work space.\\n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Des performances et un confort optimis\u00e9s \u00e0 un prix abordable\u00a0: \u00e9quip\u00e9 de fonctions intelligentes qui renforcent la qualit\u00e9 d'image, le moniteur compact 170S8 dispose aussi de SmartManage qui permet une gestion \u00e0 distance et est respectueux de l'environnement, le tout pour un meilleur co\u00fbt total d'utilisation."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":17,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"823fac11-1b77-4966-b676-5cad18ff2307","identifier":"1229213","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","print_scan_sales","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["n"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox WorkCentre 5645 Offset Catch Tray"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"220 - 240 V; 50 Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Leichtere und schnellere Entwicklung angepasster Benutzeroberfl\u00e4chen als bei den meisten Wettbewerberprodukten dank der auf Webstandards basierenden Xerox Extensible Interface Platform (EIP).\\n- Umfassende Scan-L\u00f6sungen verf\u00fcgbar, die allen Bed\u00fcrfnissen im B\u00fcro gerecht werden. Die Scan-Angebote der Mitbewerber sind weitaus begrenzter.\\n- Schnellere CPU als mit dem WorkCentre 5645\/5655 vergleichbare Produkte (1,4 GHz).\\n- Gr\u00f6\u00dferer Standard-Duplexvorlageneinzug als vergleichbare Produkte f\u00fcr umfangreiche Druckauftr\u00e4ge (100 Blatt).\\n- H\u00f6here Scangeschwindigkeit als vergleichbare Produkte (bis zu 60 ipm).\\n- Xerox SMARTsend\u2122-Software zum Erfassen und Verteilen von Scans (optional) \u2013 mit wertvollen Merkmalen, die sich bei Wettbewerberprodukten nicht finden.\\n- Ergiebigeres Verbrauchsmaterial als vergleichbare Produkte \u2013 weniger Unterbrechungen und weniger Aufwand.\\n- Weniger Ausfallzeiten durch SMart Kit\u2122-Komponenten, die der Nutzer bequem selbst austauschen kann. Bei Wettbewerberprodukten muss der Austausch von einem Servicetechniker durchgef\u00fchrt werden.\\n- Netzwerkserverfax und Internet-Fax sind bei den Kopierer\/Drucker\/Scanner-Modellen WorkCentre 5645\/5655 im Lieferumfang enthalten \u2013 bei Wettbewerberprodukten werden diese Merkmale als Zusatzoption angeboten.\\n- Schnellere Scan\u00fcbertragung und geringere Netzwerkbelastung als bei vergleichbaren Produkten durch JBIG 2, MRC und optimierte, auf den Scaninhalt abgestimmte Komprimierung."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Easier and faster development of custom user interface software than most competitors because the Xerox Extensible Interface Platform (EIP) is based on web standards\\n- Comprehensive scanning solutions are available to meet any office need. Competitive scan offerings are more limited\\n- Faster processor (1.4 GHz) on the WorkCentre 5645\/5655 than competitive products\\n- Larger-capacity standard DADF (100 sheets) than competitive products to handle larger print jobs\\n- Faster scanning speed (up to 60 ipm) than competitive products\\n- Xerox SMARTsend\u2122 scan capture and distribution software (optional) has valuable features that competitive products don't have\\n- Higher-yield consumables for fewer interruptions and less hassle than competitive products\\n- Less downtime with SMart Kit\u2122 components that users can easily replace themselves. Competitive products require calls for service to do this\\n- Network Server Fax and Internet Fax are standard on the WorkCentre 5645\/5655 Copier\/Printer\/Scanner models versus optional on competitive products\\n- Faster scan transmissions and reduced network load than competitive products with JBIG 2, MRC, and optimized scan compression to match the scanned input"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-01T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"04540da6-a930-4581-b0b4-49aea7a60666","identifier":"12297708","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S22A460B"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Enjoy energy savings with the lightweight LED display<\/b>\\nThe Samsung LED Business Monitor SA460 has been designed to help boost work efficiency, delivering a tailored experience with its choice of viewer settings. The height-adjustable stand ensures that the screen can always be set at the optimal eye level, which enhances the visual experience while also helping maintain the viewer\u2019s body posture. Other features include the tilt and pivot capabilities, which not only increase comfort levels but also introduce new ways of working. The SA460 Monitor can rotate 90 degrees, allowing for more appropriate view depending on the work. So, now you can take convenience and efficiency to amazing heights with the Samsung LED Business Monitor SA460.\\n\\n<b>Maximize work space with the Adaptor Neck Stand<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s unique and stylish Adaptor Neck Stand is perfect for any modern workplace. Exclusive to the Samsung LED Business Monitor SA460, its slim design ensures that workspace is maximized while also delivering a sophisticated and professional look. The simple manner in which it attaches to the monitor ensures that the set-up is clean and easy to manage. It is the perfect business solution for numerous situations; it could be for businesses with large amounts of PC-users or operations with restricted space. Either way, the Samsung LED Business Monitor SA460 is ready to enhance work performance.\\n\\n<b>Go green with Samsung\u2019s Adaptor On Off 0W<\/b>\\nThe ultimate energy saving measure has been created by Samsung with the new Adaptor On Off mode. By simply flicking the mechanical switch found on the Samsung LED Business monitor SA460, you can cut energy output while not using the monitor down to an amazing 0 Watts. Conventional standby modes reduce energy output to about 1 Watt, but the SA460 goes one stop further for greater results. This helps minimize both environmental impact and operating costs, and is just one more step by Samsung in creating a greener environment."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fonctions pratiques d\u2019inclinaison, de pivot et de r\u00e9glage de la hauteur du moniteur<\/b>\\nLe moniteur DEL professionnel SA450 de Samsung a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7u pour augmenter votre efficacit\u00e9 au travail et pour offrir une exp\u00e9rience personnalis\u00e9e gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son choix de param\u00e8tres modifiables par l\u2019utilisateur. Son pied r\u00e9glable en hauteur permet de toujours avoir un \u00e9cran r\u00e9gl\u00e9 au niveau optimal pour les yeux, ce qui am\u00e9liore l\u2019exp\u00e9rience visuelle tout en contribuant au maintien d\u2019une bonne posture pour l\u2019utilisateur. Parmi les autres caract\u00e9ristiques offertes, on compte les fonctions d\u2019inclinaison et de pivot, qui non seulement am\u00e9liorent le degr\u00e9 de confort, mais offrent \u00e9galement de nouvelles fa\u00e7ons de travailler. De plus, le moniteur SA450 peut tourner \u00e0 90\u00b0, ce qui permet d\u2019avoir une vue appropri\u00e9e selon le travail effectu\u00e9. Ainsi, vous pouvez maintenant mener la commodit\u00e9 et l\u2019efficacit\u00e9 vers d\u2019incroyables sommets gr\u00e2ce au moniteur DEL professionnel SA450 de Samsung.\\n\\n<b>Maximisez l\u2019espace de travail gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un adaptateur amovible et efficace<\/b>\\nSi vous avez besoin d\u2019un moniteur de travail qui utilise efficacement l\u2019espace de bureau, le moniteur DEL professionnel SA450 de Samsung constitue le choix id\u00e9al. Il est dot\u00e9 d\u2019un nouvel adaptateur amovible novateur qui permet le transport et l\u2019installation faciles du moniteur. Puisqu\u2019il peut facilement \u00eatre d\u00e9plac\u00e9 au moyen de sa poign\u00e9e de transport et qu\u2019il permet une installation rapide, le SA450 est pr\u00eat \u00e0 offrir un espace de travail efficace et propre. De plus, le moniteur SA450 est dot\u00e9 d\u2019un support mural VESA, ce qui vous permet de le fixer au mur et m\u00eame d\u2019en faire une utilisation multi-\u00e9cran. Il est maintenant facile d\u2019optimiser son espace de travail gr\u00e2ce au moniteur DEL professionnel SA450 de Samsung.\\n\\n<b>\u00c9conomisez de l\u2019\u00e9nergie gr\u00e2ce au moniteur DEL l\u00e9ger<\/b>\\nLe moniteur DEL professionnel l\u00e9ger SA450 de Samsung offre une autre option d\u2019\u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie. En effet, sa faible consommation d\u2019\u00e9nergie am\u00e9liore \u00e0 la fois les aspects financier et environnemental de l\u2019entreprise, et constitue un \u00e9l\u00e9ment important dans l\u2019exploitation de celle-ci. De plus, le moniteur DEL professionnel SA450 est extr\u00eamement l\u00e9ger et r\u00e9duit ainsi les tracas associ\u00e9s \u00e0 son transport. Voil\u00e0 donc un autre moyen qu\u2019utilise Samsung pour contribuer \u00e0 am\u00e9liorer votre environnement de travail."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-08T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2e1ebaa2-c76a-40b6-b6f1-7174b260449e","identifier":"12312165","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["a4tech","cameras_sales","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"800_x_600"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"b\/1\/0\/8\/b108d9d2a8a09cce800473c77fc2c618490cb693_15743_12312165_8610.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/b\/1\/0\/8\/b108d9d2a8a09cce800473c77fc2c618490cb693_15743_12312165_8610.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"A4Tech PK-835MJ"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"0.3"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Since A4 Tech Corporation has founded in 1987, our commitment and passion have not changed . Today A4 Tech is a global leader of personal computer peripherals. A4 Tech had won many awards in recognition for our unique innovative technology. A4 Tech maintains an exceptionally strong commitment to develop , for it's within the discipline of development that yesterday's fiction becomes tomorrow's reality. We strive to identify things which, when made better, improve people's life style.\\n\\nA4 Tech has the latest in Optical technology, using these engines in most of the latest mouse products. A4 Tech makes many different shapes and sizes of pointing devices and ships over 25 million units per year. With high capacity manufacturing in China, A4 Tech has the ability to \" build to order \". With natural beauty environment factory, A4 Tech's worker has the spirit to develop and assemble .\\n\\nBecause the need of quality award winning product is universal, A4 Tech is worldwide. A list of international partners from distributors to system integrators, from OEM partners to ODM personalized product. A4 Tech believes that the expansion into the global market is an essential link between product and people."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"34e3a908-247b-474e-bd87-874a2087501a","identifier":"12312729","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["asus","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ASUS VW190DE"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Indulge your visual senses with 1366x768 resolution and 5ms quick response time for work and entertainment.\\n- The perfect 16:9 aspect ratio enables borderless high definition full-screen video display and gaming together with multimedia devices.\\n- The best dual-display companion with your widescreen notebook enlarges the visual space for multi-tasking efficiency.\\n\\nWhen you would like to watch movies upward lying down, Smart View Technology can adjust color parameters to deliver the same image quality and colors with straight viewing.\\n\\nThe exclusive Splendid Video Intelligence Technology optimizes video performance and image fidelity by enhancing color, brightness, contrast, and sharpness. 6 preset video modes (Scenery, Theater, Game, Night View, sRGB and Standard) can be selected via a hotkey.\\n\\n- Convenient key controls for functional set-up in the multi-language OSD.\\n- VESA Wall Mount Standard (100 x 100 mm ).\\n- 25\u00b0 ( forward 5\u00b0, backwards 20\u00b0 )Tilting Angle.\\n- KENSINGTON Security Lock."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e63b57fa-25ca-4dc3-9a53-a180ec038e8b","identifier":"1231464","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PIXMA MX310"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 100-240V, 50\/60Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Dieses Multifunktionssystem mit Fax und ADF wurde f\u00fcr alle entwickelt, die bei vertretbarem Kostenaufwand eine h\u00f6here Produktivit\u00e4t anstreben. Wenn das auch in Ihrem Sinne ist, sehen Sie hier Ihren PIXMA.<\/b>\\n\\n\\n- Super G3-Fax, 20 Codewahltasten, Faxspeicher f\u00fcr bis zu 50 Seiten \\nautomatischer Dokumenteneinzug f\u00fcr bis zu 30 Seiten \\n- Quick Start \\n- Drucken und Kopieren von Dokumenten in s\/w und Farbe mit einer Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 22\/17 Seiten pro Minute \\n- Scannen mit einer Aufl\u00f6sung von 1.200 dpi \\n- Fotos mit bis zu 4.800 x 1.200 dpi; randlos im Format 10 x 15 cm in nur 46 Sek. \\n- Zweizeilige LCD-Anzeige \\n \\n \\n<b>Ihr ganz pers\u00f6nlicher Office-Assistent <\/b>\\n \\n\\nFaxen\\nDas Super G3-Faxmodem sendet Ihre Faxe in Schwarzwei\u00df oder Farbe innerhalb k\u00fcrzester Zeit \u2013 mit nur 3 Sekunden pro Seite. Das W\u00e4hlen geht schnell und einfach: 20 Codewahltasten dienen zum Speichern von regelm\u00e4\u00dfig gew\u00e4hlten Rufnummern. Der 50 Seiten fassende Faxspeicher speichert alle eingehenden Faxe, falls Papier und Tinte mal ausgehen sollten. \\n\\nNie wieder unleserlicher Text oder verzerrte Bilder in gesendeten Faxen: dank der Ultra High Quality-Faxtechnologie von Canon mit 256 Graustufen und einer Farbtiefe von 24 Bit.\\n\\nEffizientes B\u00fcro\\nDer bis zu 30 Seiten fassende automatische Dokumenteneinzug (ADF) unterst\u00fctzt die Stapelverarbeitung beim Faxen, Scannen und schnellen Kopieren von Dokumenten, um die Produktivit\u00e4t zu erh\u00f6hen. Quick Start sorgt f\u00fcr kurze Aufw\u00e4rmzeiten bei Ihrem PIXMA. Alle Funktionen stehen quasi sofort zur Verf\u00fcgung.\\n\\nDokumentdruck\\nDrucken von Dokumenten mit einer Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 22 Seiten\/Minute (Schwarzwei\u00df) oder 17 Seiten\/Minute (Farbe).\\n\\nKopieren\\nErstellen von Kopien mit einer Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 22 Seiten\/Minute (Schwarzwei\u00df) oder 17 Seiten\/Minute (Farbe). Die fortschrittliche Kopiertechnologie sorgt f\u00fcr eine au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnliche Farbqualit\u00e4t.\\n\\nDie Text- und Bild-Separationstechnologie trennt Bilder und Text und liefert so optimale Ergebnisse, wenn Text, Grafiken und Fotos kombiniert gedruckt werden. Kopieren Sie mit der Funktion \"Rahmen l\u00f6schen\" nur den gew\u00fcnschten Bereich.\\n\\nScannen\\nDie Aufl\u00f6sung von 1.200 dpi sorgt f\u00fcr Fotoscans in \u00fcberragender Farbqualit\u00e4t. Scan to PC, E-Mail oder PDF. Die Software MP Navigator EX vereinfacht s\u00e4mtliche Arbeitsschritte, von der Bildsuche bis hin zur Bearbeitung eines PDF-Dokuments.\\n\\nDie Texterkennungssoftware (OCR) wandelt gedruckten Text in editierbaren Text um und liefert so elektronische Dokumente, die ohne l\u00e4stiges Abtippen digital bearbeitet werden k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\nFotodruck\\nSie erhalten Fotos in Laborqualit\u00e4t mit hoher Detailgenauigkeit und sanften Farbabstufungen, dank der nur 2 Picoliter feinen Tintentr\u00f6pfchen und der hohen Druckaufl\u00f6sung von 4.800 x 1.200 dpi.\\n\\nDrucken von randlosen Fotos im Format 10 x 15 in nur ca.46 Sekunden im Standardmodus. Foto-Direktdruck \u00fcber den PictBridge-Anschluss der Digitalkamera oder des Camcorders.\\n\\nDie automatische Bildkorrektur optimiert Ihre Fotos automatisch. Die Bildbearbeitungssoftware bietet unter anderem Rote-Augen-Korrektur und Hauttonkorrektur.\\n\\nChromaLife100 sorgt f\u00fcr brillante, langlebige Fotoprints, die f\u00fcr eine Dauer von bis zu 100 Jahren archiviert werden k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\nSchnittstelle\\nDie zweizeilige LCD-Anzeige erm\u00f6glicht den Standalone-Betrieb ganz ohne PC.\\n\\nFINE-Druckk\u00f6pfe mit Tintentanks\\nDie zwei fortschrittlichen FINE-Druckk\u00f6pfe mit Tinte sorgen f\u00fcr den Fotodruck in Laborqualit\u00e4t und sind dank der einfachen Installation leicht zu ersetzen. Die schwarze Farbtinte liefert gestochen scharfen Text f\u00fcr den Dokumentdruck; die Farbpatrone verleiht den Grafiken satte und brillante Farbt\u00f6ne.\\n\\nBetriebssysteme\\nWindows und Mac OSX kompatibel"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<i>This mid-range Fax and Photo All-in-One is designed for people demanding more productivity, but without the huge budget. If you're ready to get serious, this is your PIXMA.<\/i>\\n \\n\\n- Super G3 fax, 20 speed dials, 50-page fax memory \\n- 30-page Auto Document Feeder \\n- Quick-Start \\n- Print & copy documents, mono & colour, up to 22\/17ppm \\n- Scan at 1200dpi \\n- Photos up to 4800x1200dpi; 10x15cm borderless in 46sec \\n- Two-line LCD display \\n \\n \\n<b>Your personal office assistant <\/b>\\n\\nFaxing\\nThe Super G3 fax modem sends your mono and colour faxes fast - in as little as 3 seconds per page*. Dialling is quick and simple, with 20 coded speed dials to store regular numbers. The 50-page fax memory safely stores all incoming faxes if paper or ink runs out, for printing out later. \\n\\nThere\u2019s no more illegible text or distorted images in sent faxes, thanks to Canon\u2019s Ultra High Quality faxing technology with 256 greyscales and 24bit colour.\\n\\nOffice efficiency\\nThe 30-page Automatic Document Feeder handles batch faxing, scanning and fast copying of documents, to increase productivity. Quick-Start gets your PIXMA going fast, with instant use of functions.\\n\\nDocument printing\\nPrint documents at up to 22ppm in mono or 17ppm in colour.\\n\\nCopying\\nCopy at up to 22cpm in mono or 17cpm in colour. Advanced copy technology ensures exceptional colour performance.\\n\\nText and image separation technology gives optimal results when text, graphics and photos are combined. Copy the exact area you want with frame erase copying.\\n\\nScanning\\n1200dpi resolution delivers great photo quality colour scans. Scan straight to PC, email or PDF. MP Navigator EX software makes every stage of operation easier, from image search to PDF document editing.\\n\\nOptical Character Recognition software converts printed text perfectly providing editable electronic documents without the hassle of re-typing.\\n\\nPhoto printing\\nEnjoy photo lab quality prints with fine detail and smooth colour gradations, thanks to 2pl ink droplets and a high 4800x1200dpi print resolution.\\n\\nPrint a 10x15cm borderless photo in approx. 46 seconds in Standard Mode. Print photos directly from your PictBridge-ready digital camera or camcorder.\\n\\nAuto Image Fix automatically enhances your photos. Apply Red Eye Removal, face brightening and more with the image editing software.\\n\\nChromaLife100 delivers beautiful, long-lasting prints with longevity up to 100 years.\\n\\nInterface\\nThe two-line LCD display makes standalone operation easy, without using a PC.\\n\\nFINE Cartridges\\nAdvanced FINE cartridges provide precision printing and are simple to replace with one click installation. The black cartridge ensures sharp, crisp text for document printing while the colour cartridge makes graphics bold and bright.\\n\\nOperating systems\\nWindows and Mac OS X compatible."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Ce multifonction t\u00e9l\u00e9copie et photo a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7u pour ceux qui exigent une plus grande productivit\u00e9 pour un budget raisonnable. Avec ce PIXMA, les choses deviennent s\u00e9rieuses.\\n\\n<b>T\u00e9l\u00e9copie<\/b>\\n- Le modem t\u00e9l\u00e9copieur Super G3 envoie vos t\u00e9l\u00e9copies en noir et blanc et couleur au rythme de 3 secondes par page*. La num\u00e9rotation est simple et rapide, avec 20 num\u00e9ros rapides cod\u00e9s pour enregistrer les num\u00e9ros r\u00e9currents. La m\u00e9moire de 50 pages* stocke en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9 les t\u00e9l\u00e9copies entrantes en cas de manque d'encre ou de papier, en vue d'une impression ult\u00e9rieure.\\n\\nFinis le texte illisible et les images d\u00e9form\u00e9es dans les t\u00e9l\u00e9copies envoy\u00e9es gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie de t\u00e9l\u00e9copie Ultra-Haute Qualit\u00e9 de Canon, avec 256 niveaux de gris et couleur 24 bits.\\n\\n<b>Efficacit\u00e9 professionnelle<\/b>\\n- Le chargeur automatique de documents 30 pages prend en charge les lots de t\u00e9l\u00e9copie, la num\u00e9risation et la copie de documents, afin d'am\u00e9liorer la productivit\u00e9. La fonction de d\u00e9marrage rapide \u00ab Quick Start \u00bb accro\u00eet la vitesse de mise en fonctionnement de votre PIXMA et permet l'utilisation instantan\u00e9e de toutes les fonctions.\\n\\n<b>Impression de documents<\/b>\\n- Imprimez jusqu'\u00e0 22 ppm en noir et blanc et 17 ppm en couleur.\\n\\n<b>Copie<\/b>\\n- Copiez jusqu'\u00e0 22 cpm en noir et blanc et 17 cpm en couleur. La technologie de copie avanc\u00e9e vous garantit une qualit\u00e9 chromatique exceptionnelle.\\n\\nEn cas de combinaison de texte, graphiques et images, la technologie avanc\u00e9e de s\u00e9paration de texte et d'image donne les meilleurs r\u00e9sultats. Avec la fonction de copie avec effacement du cadre, copiez la zone dont vous avez pr\u00e9cis\u00e9ment besoin.\\n\\n<b>Num\u00e9risation<\/b>\\n- La r\u00e9solution 1 200 ppp garantit de superbes num\u00e9risations couleur de qualit\u00e9 photo. Num\u00e9risez directement vers un ordinateur, un e-mail ou au format PDF. Le logiciel MP Navigator EX facilite toutes les \u00e9tapes de l'op\u00e9ration, de la recherche d'image \u00e0 l'\u00e9dition de documents PDF.\\n\\nConvertissez du texte imprim\u00e9 en documents \u00e9lectroniques modifiables gr\u00e2ce au logiciel de reconnaissance de caract\u00e8res, sans plus vous soucier de devoir retaper vos documents."}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-08T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9e5bb5f6-0e4a-4b27-9441-b3c67ddf1f87","identifier":"1231471","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","logitech","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech AudioHub"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Powered, integrated USB hub: Connect your speakers and other devices to your notebook with a single cable.\\n- Space-saving design: One-piece design elegantly combines a premium speaker system, USB hub, and cable control.\\n- Adjustable body: Adapts to your workspace. Telescoping speakers accommodate setup of most notebooks and LCD monitors.\\n- Webcam stand: Removable stand keeps your webcam at the optimal height.\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-08T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d5259fd4-47d6-48b0-a094-eb4009da9d7c","identifier":"1231611","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","logitech","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech G51 Surround Sound Speaker System"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Performance\\nMatrix mode: Turn on Matrix mode to create 5.1 surround sound from 2-channel stereo sound sources such as music or legacy games. Music Matrix mode delivers a natural audio profile, while Gaming Matrix mode boosts the subwoofer and rear satellites for a more intense gaming experience. \\nFDD2\u2122 sound technology: FDD2 technology produces a uniform soundfield anywhere in the room. FDD2 eliminates the hot spots and uneven response of conventional dual-driver design. \\nHigh-performance audio: 155 watts of total RMS power. \\n\\nConvenience and Control\\nDual precision mute: Mute just the audio output when you need to hear what's going on around you. Mute only the microphone when you don't want to be overheard. \\nWeighted, non-skid control pod: Enjoy quick and convenient access to your audio controls. \\nRotating stands: Mount your satellite speakers on the wall. \\nCentre-channel clip: Secure the centre-channel speaker to the top of your LCD monitor. \\n\\nCustomisation\\nSatellite speaker skins: Personalise your speakers with custom speaker skins and a patent-pending mod system."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-09T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"47cbaf76-7fd2-4b1a-86a8-6f64f783441c","identifier":"1232316","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"d\/a\/5\/0\/da50fc514e7d417adee7cb81ba96c173254f8aa8_1232316_7018.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/d\/a\/5\/0\/da50fc514e7d417adee7cb81ba96c173254f8aa8_1232316_7018.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony 2GB WALKMAN, BLack"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony 2GB WALKMAN, BLack. Player media type: flash-media. Display resolution: 320 x 240. Depth: 9.6, Width: 44.5. Bundled software: -Windows Media Player 11. -MP3 Conversion Tool."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-12T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"86f6097b-ffa2-4271-961f-293a4b141369","identifier":"12329116","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon Digital IXUS 500 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8efd13ba-a5a7-40b9-a451-8f5d8ca624b0","identifier":"1232939","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"9\/8\/b\/f\/98bf6c091535718659b36d67390cee972009dc05_1232939_6100.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/9\/8\/b\/f\/98bf6c091535718659b36d67390cee972009dc05_1232939_6100.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung T10 4GB Black"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der YP-T10JA ist die perfekte Mischung aus Technologie und Trend. Er bietet viele verschiedene Funktionen in einem ganz schmalen, federleichten und stilvollen Player. Die grafische Benutzeroberfl\u00e4che (GUI) f\u00fchrt Sie mit einer Fun-Character-Animation durch das Men\u00fc und bietet somit eine v\u00f6llig neue Art der Navigation von MP3-Playern. Mit den animierten Strichzeichnungen brilliert die Benutzeroberfl\u00e4che mit einem weiteren grafischen Highlight."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The T10 has a screen built for video, bright and sharp and rotated 90 degrees ideal for watching 30 frames per second high quality video\\n\\n<b>Bluetooth 2.0<\/b>\\nBluetooth 2.0 implemented allows 2 sets of headphones to be paired with the P2, with A2DP (advanced audio streaming) and AVRCP \u2013 remote control via Bluetooth.\\n\\n<b>Sound Quality<\/b>\\nDNSE 2.0 for superior sound quality, so it can be reproduced the way it was intended through Sound personalization, User equalizer setting, Bass extension."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-13T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fc1c3210-1546-4d26-9bb9-ca323238decd","identifier":"1233714","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["fujitsu","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujitsu SCENICVIEW Series A19-3"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 - 240 VAC, 50 - 60 Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der SCENICVIEW A19-3 ist die ideale Wahl f\u00fcr den Einstieg in die professionelle Welt der LCD Displays. Platzsparendes, ergonomisches Design und das gro\u00dfe Display-Format machen den SCENICVIEW A19-3 zur erschwinglichen, ergonomischen Display L\u00f6sung f\u00fcr komfortable Arbeitspl\u00e4tze."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Featuring all the advantages of TFT technology in the adapted SCENICVIEW family look, this 19-inch Value Line LCD TFT display is the ideal choice for customers seeking a low-price standard TFT display with excellent picture quality. The space saving design offers a new scope for arranging a workplace. With its low power consumption, the SCENICVIEW A19-3 saves energy and environment."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-16T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b24739b5-24e6-4e54-b993-fac6f9b91205","identifier":"12347640","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales","viewsonic"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Viewsonic Value Series VA1931w-LED"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>GO LED GO GREEN<\/b>\\nThe VA1931w-LED is a top-of-the-line professional monitor which is ideal for easy daily works such as writing, web surfing, learning, gaming or video viewing. This monitor boasts a great performance and affordable price without compromising on ease of use, image quality and environmental friendliness.\\nThe VA1931w-LED has many features such as a premium 16:9 display of 10,000,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio; the capability to dynamically adjust the backlit module according to the input signal; a 1366x768 resolution with 1080p HD compatibility; brilliant colour darker black with no distortion and DVI and VGA input. This Windows 7-certified monitor offers a full array of functions via its OSD interface, including the TCO 5.0 and Energy Star 5.0-compliant Eco-mode that automatically reduces power consumption by up to 40% and therefore extends backlight life significantly.\\nThe slim bezel, glossy piano-black finish and small desktop footprint of the VA1931w-LED make it a nice addition to your desk and lifestyle. Trendy, versatile and eye-popping, this monitor will satisfy your viewing requirements at an affordable price.\\n\\n<b>Ultra-Slim Bezel<\/b>\\nThe ultra-slim bezel makes more productive use of the screen area while minimizing the image gap in multi display applications for continuous data display which enhances the visual experience with clean, minimalist borders around the active image area.\\n\\n<b>Impressive 10,000,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio provides greater detail and definition<\/b>\\nProvides darker black levels and better overall front-of- screen performance.\\n\\n<b>High brightness and 10,000,000 DCR to reflect the true colour<\/b>\\n250 nits high brightness delivers precise accurate colour to realistically display a full array of brilliant shades and hues.\\n\\n<b>Eco-mode automatically reduces power consumption and can extend backlight life and reduce operating power consumption by up to 70%<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Windows\u00ae 7 certified<\/b>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-12T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bed32b1c-6dc1-49e8-8e21-eb18029c6c4a","identifier":"12349011","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["nec","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"NEC AccuSync AS241W"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"24-Zoll 16:9 Wide LCD mit TN TFT Display bietet ein umweltfreundliches Produktdesign und neueste 2-Backlight-Technologie zu einem erschwinglichen Preis. Das attraktive Designdisplay verf\u00fcgt zudem \u00fcber einen DVI-D-Eingang.\\n\\nDer ideale Monitor als Einstiegsmodell f\u00fcr Unternehmen und anspruchsvolle Kunden.\\n\\n- G\u00fcnstig und umweltfreundlich - niedriger Energieverbrauch mit neuester LED Backlight-Technologie, EcoMode -Funktion und CO2 Emmissions-Anzeige \/ CO2 Einspar-Anzeige .\\n- \u00d6kologie und Ergonomie \u2013 gem\u00e4\u00df aktuellster Standards einschlie\u00dflich TCO 5.0 und ISO 9241-307.\\n- Hervorragendes Produktdesign\\n- Technologie \u2013 16:9-TN -Display im Full-HD-Format mit Rapid-Response-Technologie\\n- Besondere Eigenschaften - Auto Kontrast; CO2 Einspar-Anzeige ; Rapid Response Technologie ; Windows 7 kompatibel"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"24\u201d 16:9 Wide LCD with TN TFT Display features green product design using the latest LED backlight technology at an affordable price. The attractively designed display comes also with DVI-D input.\\n\\nThe ideal monitor for entry-level, corporate and demanding consumers.\\n\\n- Affordable Green - low power consumption with latest LED backlight technology, EcoMode function and Carbon Footprint Meter \/ Carbon Savings Meter .\\n- Ecologics and Ergonomics - complying to the latest standards including TCO 5.0 and ISO 9241-307.\\n- Excellent Product Design\\n- Technology - 16:9 full HD format TN display with Rapid Response technology.\\n- Special Characteristics - Auto Contrast; Carbon Savings Meter ; Rapid Response Technology ; Windows 7 compatible"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"\u00c9cran LCD 24\u201d Wide 16:9 avec technologie TN met en avant son eco-conception gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son r\u00e9tro-\u00e9clairage de derni\u00e8re g\u00e9n\u00e9ration, tout en \u00e9tant disponible \u00e0 un prix attractif. Ce moniteur design est dot\u00e9 de la connectique DVI-D.\\n\\nL\u2019\u00e9cran id\u00e9al pour une utilisation en entreprise ou de la bureautique chez soi.\\n\\n- \u00c9cologique et abordable - faible consommation d'\u00e9nergie avec la derni\u00e8re technologie de r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage avec LED sources, fonction EcoMode et compteur emprunte carbone \/ syst\u00e8me de mesure du carbone.\\n- \u00c9cologique et ergonomique - conforme aux derniers standards incluant TCO 5.0 et ISO 9241-307.\\n- Excellent design de produit\\n- Technologie - \u00e9cran 16:9 Full HD au format TN avec technologie Rapid Response\\n- Particularit\u00e9s du produit - Ajustement automatique du contraste; Carbon Savings Meter ; Compatible Windows 7; Technologie Rapid Response"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-12T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b129e789-6b61-44aa-bae8-d826a31f203b","identifier":"12349098","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon Digital IXUS 500 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Digital Compact Camera<\/b>\\nThe IXUS 500 HS brings a big 12x zoom to a compact, stunning metal body - getting you closer, in style. With HS System, Intelligent IS and Smart Auto, shooting great images is easy, even in low light.\\n\\n- 12x zoom in tiny and stunning metal body.\\n- HS System: 10.1 MP CMOS and DIGIC 5.\\n- Intelligent IS.\\n- 7.5 cm (3.0\") PureColor II G LCD.\\n- Full HD movies.\\n- Smart Auto (58 scenes).\\n- Face ID.\\n- High-speed shooting.\\n- Movie Digest (720p).\\n- Optional 3m waterproof case.\\n\\n<b>Amazing by design. Tiny, 12x zoom IXUS.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>12x zoom in tiny and stunning metal body<\/b>\\nWith a tiny metal body in an amazing finish the IXUS 500 HS packs a powerful 12x optical zoom extending to 21x with ZoomPlus. The huge zoom offers a wide range of shooting options and lets you get right up close to distant objects whether shooting stills or movies.\\n\\n<b>HS System: 10.1 MP CMOS<\/b>\\nThe HS System excels in low light so you can capture the real atmosphere of the scene without flash or tripod. Advanced DIGIC 5 processing and a high sensitivity 10.1 Megapixel CMOS sensor give excellent image quality in all situations.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 7 modes \u2013 counteracting movement to prevent blur and delivering sharp and detailed photos and movies at full zoom and in low light.\\n\\n<b>7.5 cm (3.0\") PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nA large, high quality 460k dot LCD screen with excellent visibility allows easy framing and reviewing of images from any angle plus effortless menu navigation. A tempered glass outer layer gives excellent durability.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movies<\/b>\\nRecord superb Full HD (1080p) movies at 24fps with stereo sound and optical zoom. Intelligent IS keeps footage steady while filming, even at full zoom. An HDMI connection ensures high quality playback on an HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (58 scenes)<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot great photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and selects perfect settings from 58 variables. It also works with faces registered with Face ID and adapts shooting settings to the person\u2019s age \u2013 for example turning off flash and sounds when a sleeping baby is detected or engaging continuous auto-focus when children over 2 years old are detected.\\n\\n<b>Face ID<\/b>\\nFace ID lets you register up to 12 faces of family and friends, so they are automatically the focusing priority in every shot, and tags images with their names so they are easy to find in playback.\\n\\n<b>High-speed shooting<\/b>\\nNever miss a moment. Capture fast-paced action with High-speed Burst or slow down fast movement with Super Slow Motion Movie. Handheld Night Scene combines a sequence of high-speed shots into one file to capture nightscapes without a tripod.\\n\\n<b>Movie Digest (720p)<\/b>\\nMovie Digest records up to 4-seconds of action before each still shot, joining the day\u2019s clips into a bonus HD (720p) movie.\\n\\n<b>Optional waterproof case<\/b>\\nProtect your camera outdoors and shoot underwater down to depths of 3m with an optional waterproof case."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-12T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":12}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"833b8c0a-3173-4a9f-b764-ab128803f3ca","identifier":"12349100","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon Digital IXUS 125 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die IXUS 125 HS \u00fcberzeugt mit einem schlanken Metallgeh\u00e4use im schicken Design und vielen n\u00fctzlichen Funktionen \u2013 f\u00fcr gro\u00dfartige Bilder selbst bei wenig Licht. Face ID und Full-HD-Movies f\u00fcr noch mehr Filmspa\u00df.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n- Elegantes, schlankes Metallgeh\u00e4use mit 24-mm-Objektiv mit 5fach optischem Zoom\\n- HS System: 16,1 MP CMOS und DIGIC 5\\n- Intelligent IS\\n- 7,5 cm PureColor II G LCD\\n- Full-HD-Movies\\n- Smart Auto (intelligenter AUTO-Modus f\u00fcr 58 Aufnahmesituationen)\\n- Face ID\\n- High-Speed-Reihenaufnahmen\\n- Filmtagebuch (720p)\\n- Optionales Unterwassergeh\u00e4use\\n\\n<b>Schlank, unkompliziert und einfach typisch IXUS<\/b>\\n\\nElegantes, schlankes Metallgeh\u00e4use mit 24-mm-Objektiv mit 5fach optischem Zoom\\nDie IXUS 125 HS hat ein edles, schlankes Metallgeh\u00e4use und passt in praktisch jede Jackentasche. Das 24-mm-Ultraweitwinkelobjektiv ist geradezu pr\u00e4destiniert f\u00fcr Aufnahmen gro\u00dfer Personengruppen oder Landschaftspanoramen; mit dem 5fach optischen Zoom (bis zu 10fach mit ZoomPlus) holen Sie weit entfernte Motive nah heran.\\n\\n<b>HS System: 16,1 MP CMOS und DIGIC 5<\/b>\\nDas HS System brilliert bei schwachen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen \u2013 ideal, um den Zauber einer Stimmung auch ohne Blitz und Stativ festzuhalten. Der fortschrittliche DIGIC 5 Prozessor und der hoch empfindliche 16,1 Megapixel starke CMOS-Sensor sorgen gemeinsam f\u00fcr \u00fcberzeugende Bildqualit\u00e4t in allen Situationen.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS mit sieben Modi passt den optischen Bildstabilisator automatisch an das Motiv an \u2013 durch Reduzieren von Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfe entstehen gestochen scharfe, detaillierte Bilder und Videos selbst bei maximaler Zoomeinstellung und wenig Licht.\\n\\n<b>7,5 cm PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nDas gro\u00dfe, hochwertige LC-Display mit ca. 460.000 Bildpunkten erm\u00f6glicht die bequeme Men\u00fcnavigation sowie eine komfortable Bildkomposition und -\u00fcberpr\u00fcfung aus nahezu jedem Winkel. Die speziell geh\u00e4rtete Glasschicht sorgt f\u00fcr eine robuste Oberfl\u00e4che.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD-Movies<\/b>\\nDie IXUS 125 HS kann mehr als nur fotografieren: Im Movie-Modus gelingen hervorragende Full-HD-Movies (1080p) mit 24 B\/s und Stereoton; auch hier steht der optische Zoom zur Verf\u00fcgung. Intelligent IS reduziert Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfe, selbst bei maximaler Zoomeinstellung. Die HDMI\u2122-Schnittstelle erlaubt den Anschluss an einen kompatiblen HD-Fernseher f\u00fcr die Wiedergabe in Topqualit\u00e4t.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (intelligenter AUTO-Modus f\u00fcr 58 Aufnahmesituationen)<\/b>\\nIm intelligenten Automatik-Modus (Smart Auto) entstehen ganz komfortabel hochwertige Fotos oder Movies. 58 Aufnahmesituationen (21 bei Movies) werden unterschieden und automatisch die richtigen Einstellungen ausgew\u00e4hlt. Smart Auto funktioniert auch bei Gesichtern im Motiv \u2013 dank Face ID erfolgt eine Anpassung der Aufnahmeeinstellungen an das Alter der Person. So werden etwa bei einem schlafenden Baby Blitz und Kamerager\u00e4usche deaktiviert.\\n\\n<b>Face ID<\/b>\\nMit Face ID k\u00f6nnen Sie bis zu 12 Gesichter von Personen aus dem Familien- oder Freundeskreis registrieren \u2013 diese Gesichter genie\u00dfen bei der Scharfstellung automatisch Priorit\u00e4t; au\u00dferdem werden die Bilder mit den Namen versehen, damit man sie bei der Wiedergabe leicht wiederfindet.\\n\\n<b>High-Speed-Reihenaufnahmen<\/b>\\nGanz wie Sie wollen: Per High-Speed-Reihenaufnahmen erfassen Sie rasante Non-Stop-Action, und mit Super Slow Motion Movie lassen sich schnelle Bewegungen verlangsamt darstellen. Im Modus Nachtaufnahme ohne Stativ kombiniert die Kamera eine schnelle Folge von Einzelbildern zu einem Bild; so gelingen auch ohne Stativ gro\u00dfartige Bilder bei Nacht.\\n\\n<b>Filmtagebuch (720p)<\/b>\\nIm Modus Filmtagebuch wird vor jedem Foto eine 4 Sekunden lange Moviesequenz aufgenommen; die Movieclips eines Tages k\u00f6nnen zu einem interessanten Bonus-Video in HD-Qualit\u00e4t (720p) zusammengef\u00fcgt werden.\\n\\n<b>Optionales Unterwassergeh\u00e4use<\/b>\\nDas optional als Zubeh\u00f6r erh\u00e4ltliche Unterwassergeh\u00e4use sch\u00fctzt Ihre Kamera beim Outdoor-Einsatz und Unterwasseraufnahmen bis 3 m Tiefe."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Inside a slim, stylish metal body the IXUS 125 HS packs a host of helpful features - so taking great shots is a breeze, even in low light. Face ID prioritises friends and Full HD movies add to the fun.\\n\\n<b>Beautiful slim metal body with 24mm, 5x zoom<\/b>\\nThe IXUS 125 HS has a beautiful slim, metal body that\u2019s small enough to take everywhere. Fit more in the frame for great group shots and panoramic landscapes with 24mm ultra-wide-angle and use the 5x optical zoom (up to 10x with ZoomPlus) to get close to distant objects.\\n\\n<b>HS System: 16.1 MP CMOS and DIGIC 5<\/b>\\nHS System excels in low light so you can capture the real atmosphere of the moment without flash or tripod. Advanced DIGIC 5 processing and a high-sensitivity 16.1 Megapixel CMOS sensor give exceptional image quality in all situations.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 7 modes \u2013 counteracting movement to prevent blur and delivering sharp and detailed photos and videos at full zoom and in low light.\\n\\n<b>7.5 cm (3.0\") PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nA large, high quality 460k dot LCD screen with excellent visibility allows easy framing and reviewing of images from any angle plus effortless menu navigation. A tempered glass outer layer gives extra durability.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movies<\/b>\\nRecord superb Full HD (1080p) movies at 24fps with optical zoom. Intelligent IS keeps footage steady while filming, even at full zoom. An HDMI connection ensures loss-less playback on an HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (58 scenes)<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot great photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and selects perfect settings from 58 variables (21 in movies). It also works with faces stored in Face ID and adapts shooting according to registered age \u2013 for example turning off flash and sounds when a sleeping baby is detected.\\n\\n<b>Face ID<\/b>\\nFace ID lets you register up to 12 faces of family and friends, so they are automatically the focusing priority in every shot, and tags images with their names so they are easy to find in playback.\\n\\n<b>High-speed shooting<\/b>\\nUse High-speed Burst to capture non-stop, fast-paced action or slow things down with Super Slow Motion Movie. Handheld Night Scene combines a sequence of high-speed shots into one file to capture nightscapes without a tripod.\\n\\n<b>Movie Digest (720p)<\/b>\\nMovie Digest records 4 seconds of video before each photo is shot and then joins all the recorded short clips into a bonus HD (720p) movie.\\n\\n<b>Optional waterproof case<\/b>\\nProtect your camera outdoors and shoot underwater down to 3m depths with a waterproof case."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>\u00c9l\u00e9gant bo\u00eetier plat en m\u00e9tal avec zoom 5x 24 mm<\/b>\\nAvec son \u00e9l\u00e9gant bo\u00eetier plat en m\u00e9tal, l'IXUS 125 HS est suffisamment compact pour \u00eatre emport\u00e9 partout. Le zoom ultra grand-angle (24 mm) vous permet d'\u00e9largir le champ, ce qui s'av\u00e8re tr\u00e8s pratique pour les photos de groupe et les paysages. Le zoom optique 5x (jusqu'\u00e0 10x avec ZoomPlus) vous permet quant \u00e0 lui de vous rapprocher des sujets distants.\\n\\n<b>Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 : capteur CMOS 16,1 MP et DIGIC 5<\/b>\\nLe Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 est particuli\u00e8rement performant en basse lumi\u00e8re : vous pouvez restituer l'atmosph\u00e8re r\u00e9elle de l'instant sans utiliser de flash ni de tr\u00e9pied. Le traitement avanc\u00e9 du processeur DIGIC 5 et le capteur CMOS haute sensibilit\u00e9 de 16,1 millions de pixels garantissent une qualit\u00e9 d'image exceptionnelle en toutes circonstances.\\n\\n<b>Stabilisateur d'image intelligent<\/b>\\nLe stabilisateur d'image intelligent adapte automatiquement le stabilisateur d'image optique \u00e0 la sc\u00e8ne, en choisissant parmi 7 modes pour compenser les mouvements g\u00e9n\u00e9rant du flou et garantir ainsi des photos et vid\u00e9os nettes et riches en d\u00e9tails, m\u00eame au niveau de zoom maximal et en basse lumi\u00e8re.\\n\\n<b>\u00c9cran LCD PureColor II G de 7,5 cm (3 pouces)<\/b>\\nLe grand \u00e9cran LCD haute qualit\u00e9 460.000 points \u00e0 l'excellente lisibilit\u00e9 permet de cadrer et de visionner facilement les images depuis n'importe quel angle et assure une navigation ais\u00e9e dans les menus. Sa protection en verre tremp\u00e9 lui conf\u00e8re une grande r\u00e9sistance.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9os Full HD<\/b>\\nEnregistrez de magnifiques vid\u00e9os Full HD (1080p) \u00e0 24 im.\/s avec son st\u00e9r\u00e9o et zoom optique. Le stabilisateur d'image intelligent garantit des vid\u00e9os nettes m\u00eame au niveau de zoom maximal. Le port HDMI permet de lire les enregistrements sans perte de qualit\u00e9 sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD.\\n\\n<b>Mode Smart Auto (58 sc\u00e8nes)<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez facilement des photos et vid\u00e9os de grande qualit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au mode Smart Auto, qui analyse la sc\u00e8ne et choisit les meilleurs r\u00e9glages parmi 58 options possibles (21 en mode vid\u00e9o). Il utilise \u00e9galement les visages enregistr\u00e9s via la reconnaissance faciale et adapte les r\u00e9glages \u00e0 l'\u00e2ge enregistr\u00e9 pour un sujet, en d\u00e9sactivant par exemple le flash et les sons en cas de d\u00e9tection d'un b\u00e9b\u00e9 endormi.\\n\\n<b>Reconnaissance faciale<\/b>\\nLa reconnaissance faciale vous permet d'enregistrer jusqu'\u00e0 12 visages de proches pour que ceux-ci aient automatiquement la priorit\u00e9 de la mise au point sur toutes les photos. Elle vous permet aussi de marquer leur nom pour pouvoir retrouver facilement les images dans lesquelles ils apparaissent.\\n\\n<b>Prise de vues ultra-rapide<\/b>\\nSaisissez les actions rapides gr\u00e2ce au mode Rafale grande vitesse ou ralentissez les mouvements gr\u00e2ce au mode Super ralenti en vid\u00e9o. Le mode Nuit \u00e0 main lev\u00e9e associe quant \u00e0 lui une s\u00e9quence de clich\u00e9s pris \u00e0 grande vitesse en un seul fichier, permettant ainsi d'immortaliser des sc\u00e8nes de nuit sans tr\u00e9pied.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9sum\u00e9 vid\u00e9o (720p)<\/b>\\nLa fonction R\u00e9sum\u00e9 vid\u00e9o enregistre 4 secondes de vid\u00e9o avant chaque prise de vue et r\u00e9unit tous les clips ainsi enregistr\u00e9s en une vid\u00e9o HD (720p).\\n\\n<b>Bo\u00eetier \u00e9tanche en option<\/b>\\nProt\u00e9gez votre appareil contre les intemp\u00e9ries lorsque vous \u00eates dehors et prenez des photos sous l'eau jusqu'\u00e0 3 m de profondeur gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un bo\u00eetier \u00e9tanche."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-12T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8d21d234-3fbc-4582-90ed-a83e51035387","identifier":"12357043","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S20B300N"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>See it your way with wider viewing angles.<\/b>\\nHow do you like to watch movies? Do you like lying down on the couch? Sitting in your favourite chair? Cooking or exercising? Whether you\u2019re standing, sitting or lying down, Samsung Magic Angle makes sure that the movie always takes centre stage and that you\u2019re always comfortable. This means, thanks to the 5-mode angle management, that whatever angle you watch your Samsung monitor, you will enjoy a full visual experience with amazing picture clarity. So, start seeing your favourite movies and other multimedia in total comfort and without limitations thanks to Magic Angle.\\n\\n<b>Control brightness, conserve energy.<\/b>\\nEco saving makes saving energy easy. It adjusts the brightness of your Samsung monitor based on how much energy you want to save. And with the choice of three energy saving modes (50%, 25% and Power Saving off), you can really tailor your monitor use to meet your own personal needs. Samsung\u2019s commitment to saving energy is designed to help both you and the environment, and with up to 50% saving on consumption, you can really make a positive impact on your eco footprint. Take the effort out of saving energy and take control with Eco saving."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Passez au niveau sup\u00e9rieur avec le contraste Mega DCR (Dynamic Contrast Ratio).<\/b>\\nD\u00e9couvrez une image de haute qualit\u00e9 avec une incroyable richesse de couleurs gr\u00e2ce au taux de contraste am\u00e9lior\u00e9 (le plus haut ratio de contraste actuellement disponible). Le Samsung S20B300N d\u00e9livre des images tellement r\u00e9alistes que vous verrez chaque couleur, chaque d\u00e9tail prendre vie sur votre \u00e9cran. Vous serez impressionn\u00e9 par la profondeur des noirs et la richesse des couleurs rendant l\u2019image incroyablement intense. Elevez votre exp\u00e9rience visuelle \u00e0 un niveau sup\u00e9rieur et profitez de vos contenus multim\u00e9dias avec l\u2019affichage optimis\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au contraste Mega DCR du Samsung S20B300N.\\n\\n<b>Ne vous fatiguez plus les yeux et profitez de ce que vous voyez.<\/b>\\nComment aimez-vous regarder un film? Couch\u00e9 sur votre canap\u00e9, assis sur votre chaise pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e, en cuisinant ou en faisant de l\u2019exercice ? O\u00f9 que vous soyez \u2013 debout, assis ou couch\u00e9 \u2013 la technologie Magic Angle de Samsung s'assure que le film restera le point de mire. Et que vous \u00eates aux meilleures loges. O\u00f9 que vous placiez le moniteur Samsung, ses 5 modes de gestion de l\u2019angle de vue vous permettent de le r\u00e9gler pour que l\u2019\u00e9cran semble toujours \u00eatre en face de vous. Alors profitez de vos contenus multim\u00e9dia comme vous l\u2019aimez avec le plus grand confort visuel.\\n\\n<b>Contr\u00f4lez la luminosit\u00e9 tout en \u00e9conomisant de l'\u00e9nergie.<\/b>\\nLa fonction MagicEco vous permet d\u2019\u00e9conomiser facilement de l\u2019\u00e9nergie. En effet, elle ajuste la luminosit\u00e9 du moniteur Samsung en fonction de la quantit\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9nergie que vous souhaitez \u00e9conomiser. Vous avez quatre possibilit\u00e9s : consommation \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique de 100% ou 75%, 50% et sans \u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie. Si la fonction MagicEco est d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9e, vous pouvez recourir \u00e0 la technologie MagicBright de Samsung pour ajuster manuellement la luminosit\u00e9 de l\u2019\u00e9cran. Prenez les commandes avec MagicEco et \u00e9conomisez de l\u2019\u00e9nergie en toute facilit\u00e9."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":20,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"33d8aeaa-2481-4240-81e2-6f2ddccdeeeb","identifier":"12357044","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S22B300N"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Samsung S22B300N Monitor features Magic Angle technology that lets you make the most of entertainment whether you\u2019re sitting, standing or lounging on the sofa. Meanwhile, with three different Eco Saving modes as well as sophisticated brightness adjustment, the monitor is kinder to the planet and your finances. You can lower your power bills as well as your impact on the environment."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le S22B300N offre un taux de contraste reccord pour des couleurs intenses ainsi qu'un confort visuel quelque soit l'angle de vue. Le S22B300N a la particularit\u00e9 d\u00eatre un moniteur \u00e9cologique qui permet d'obtenir une baisse de consommation d'\u00e9nergie significative.\\n<br\/><b>Ne vous fatiguez plus les yeux et profitez de ce que vous voyez.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Comment aimez-vous regarder un film? Couch\u00e9 sur votre canap\u00e9, assis sur votre chaise pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e, en cuisinant ou en faisant de l\u2019exercice ? O\u00f9 que vous soyez \u2013 debout, assis ou couch\u00e9 \u2013 la technologie Magic Angle de Samsung s'assure que le film restera le point de mire. Et que vous \u00eates aux meilleures loges. O\u00f9 que \\nvous placiez le moniteur Samsung, ses 5 modes de gestion de l\u2019angle de vue vous permettent de le r\u00e9gler pour que l\u2019\u00e9cran semble toujours \u00eatre en face de \\nvous. Alors profitez de vos contenus multim\u00e9dia comme vous l\u2019aimez avec le plus grand confort visuel.\\n<br\/><b>Contr\u00f4lez la luminosit\u00e9 tout en \u00e9conomisant de l'\u00e9nergie.<\/b>\\n<br\/>La fonction MagicEco vous permet d\u2019\u00e9conomiser facilement de l\u2019\u00e9nergie. En effet, elle ajuste la luminosit\u00e9 du moniteur Samsung en fonction de la quantit\u00e9 \\nd\u2019\u00e9nergie que vous souhaitez \u00e9conomiser. Vous avez quatre possibilit\u00e9s : consommation \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique de 100% ou 75%, 50% et sans \u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie. Si la \\nfonction MagicEco est d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9e, vous pouvez recourir \u00e0 la technologie MagicBright de Samsung pour ajuster manuellement la luminosit\u00e9 de l\u2019\u00e9cran. Prenez les commandes avec MagicEco et \u00e9conomisez de l\u2019\u00e9nergie en toute facilit\u00e9.\\n<br\/><b>Passez au niveau sup\u00e9rieur avec le contraste Mega DCR (Dynamic Contrast Ratio).<\/b>\\n<br\/>D\u00e9couvrez une image de haute qualit\u00e9 avec une incroyable richesse de couleurs gr\u00e2ce au taux de contraste am\u00e9lior\u00e9 (le plus haut ratio de contraste\\nactuellement disponible). Le Samsung S222B300N d\u00e9livre des images tellement r\u00e9alistes que vous verrez chaque couleur, chaque d\u00e9tail prendre vie sur votre\\n\u00e9cran. Vous serez impressionn\u00e9 par la profondeur des noirs et la richesse des couleurs rendant l\u2019image incroyablement intense. Elevez votre exp\u00e9rience \\nvisuelle \u00e0 un niveau sup\u00e9rieur et profitez de vos contenus multim\u00e9dias avec l\u2019affichage optimis\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au contraste Mega DCR du Samsung S22B300N."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"083a6893-4f1b-4c19-8a4a-f259be2e458a","identifier":"12357053","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S27B750V"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Series 7 LED monitor\u2019s stunning curves and premium look are warm as well as edgy. With Mobile High-Definition Link, built-in stereo speakers and Mega Dynamic Contrast Ratio you\u2019ll enjoy optimised multimedia from mobiles or PCs. Inputs like 2HDMI deliver all your content, and Eco Saving lowers costs. The LED Monitor Series 7 brings harmony to your viewing and environment.\\n<br\/><b>The total audio-video solution with built-in speakers<\/b>\\n<br\/>With a built-in Samsung Stereo Speaker, a 5 Way Speaker delivers high-quality stereo sound and a richer multimedia experience. You\u2019ll enjoy enhanced movies and music, as if you were in a theatre or concert, thanks to Samsung\u2019s outstanding audio.  Experience total convenience and make the most of home or office space with cost-efficient built-in speakers.\\n<br\/><b>Enhance viewing from mobile to monitor<\/b>\\n<br\/>With Mobile High-Definition Link (MHL), experience entertainment with full-size monitor luxury and higher-quality HD viewing. MHL lets you watch video and other content on the move, then easily connect the mobile device to a monitor with the included cable. You can finish viewing in stunning HD anywhere you want, and charge devices while connected, too. Combine portability with home comfort for an optimised view.\\n<br\/><b>Captivate the senses with stunning curves<\/b>\\n<br\/>Choose a monitor with a premium aesthetic that will brighten up any surroundings. Elegant curvilinear design and a harmonious blend of black and white offer an organic look that appears warmer and more natural than other monitors. This combination of straight lines and gentle contours was developed to be more appealing. So, blend minimalism with stylish curves and discover the future of monitor design.\\n<br\/><b>Expand your experience with various inputs<\/b>\\n<br\/>Why not bring more than just your favourite films to life? Samsung LED Monitor Series 7 2HDMI with its wide range of inputs ensures that everything from gaming to chatting with friends online is easily achieved. The various inputs such as DP, HDMI and DVI, ensure that your monitor is more compatible and ready to handle all of your content.\\n<br\/><b>Control power consumption, conserve energy<\/b>\\n<br\/>Eco Saving makes saving energy easy. It adjusts the brightness of your Samsung monitor based on the amount of energy you want to save. Choose from three energy saving modes (50%, 25% and Power Saving off) to tailor your monitor use. By consuming 50% less, you can really make a positive impact on your eco footprint. Take the effort out of saving energy and take control with Eco Saving."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"\\n<br\/><b>Une solution compl\u00e8te avec haut-parleurs int\u00e9gr\u00e9s<\/b>\\n<br\/>Les  haut-parleurs int\u00e9gr\u00e9s de 5 watts d\u00e9livrent un son st\u00e9r\u00e9o de haute qualit\u00e9 pour une exp\u00e9rience multim\u00e9dia accrue. Vous red\u00e9couvrirez vos films et vos musiques comme si vous \u00e9tiez au cin\u00e9ma ou dans une salle de concert. Pratiques et \u00e9conomiques, les enceintes int\u00e9gr\u00e9es permettent de profiter d\u2019un son de qualit\u00e9 \u00e0 la maison ou au bureau.\\n<br\/><b>Le moniteur de votre Smartphone<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie MHL (Mobile High-Definition Link), faites l\u2019exp\u00e9rience in\u00e9dite d\u2019afficher vos contenus mobiles sur grand \u00e9cran en HD. La technologie MHL vous permet de regarder des vid\u00e9os, d\u2019afficher des photos et de jouer simplement en connectant votre t\u00e9l\u00e9phone compatible Android \u00e0 l\u2019aide du c\u00e2ble fourni. La technologie MHL permet de profiter des contenus tout en rechargeant la batterie du t\u00e9l\u00e9phone. Combinez mobilit\u00e9 et plaisir d\u2019\u00eatre \u00e0 la maison pour une exp\u00e9rience enrichie en confort.\\n<br\/><b>Captivez les sens gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un design hors normes<\/b>\\n<br\/>Egayez votre int\u00e9rieur avec un moniteur \u00e0 l\u2019esth\u00e9tique haut de gamme. Son design \u00e9l\u00e9gant et futuriste est un m\u00e9lange harmonieux de noir et de blanc offrant un rendu plus agr\u00e9able et naturel. Cette combinaison de lignes droites et de contours \u00e9pur\u00e9s a \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9velopp\u00e9e pour relever son originalit\u00e9. Au final, m\u00e9langez simplicit\u00e9 et \u00e9l\u00e9gance pour d\u00e9couvrir l\u2019avenir du design des moniteurs.\\n<br\/><b>Une exp\u00e9rience sans limite gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 de nombreuses entr\u00e9es vid\u00e9o<\/b>\\n<br\/>Ne vous limitez plus seulement \u00e0 vos films pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s ! Les moniteurs Samsung s\u00e9rie 7 poss\u00e8dent 2 entr\u00e9es HDMI ainsi qu\u2019un large \u00e9ventail d\u2019entr\u00e9es permettant tous les usages : jeux vid\u00e9o, photos, vid\u00e9o, chaque exp\u00e9rience devient intense et incroyablement vivante. Les diff\u00e9rentes entr\u00e9es telles que Display Port, HDMI et DVI, assurent une parfaite compatibilit\u00e9 de votre moniteur \u00e0 tous vos p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques.\\n<br\/><b>Contr\u00f4lez la luminosit\u00e9 tout en \u00e9conomisant de l'\u00e9nergie<\/b>\\n<br\/>La fonction Magic Eco vous permet d\u2019\u00e9conomiser facilement de l\u2019\u00e9nergie. En effet, elle ajuste la luminosit\u00e9 du moniteur Samsung en fonction de la quantit\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9nergie que vous souhaitez \u00e9conomiser. Vous avez quatre possibilit\u00e9s : consommation \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique de 100% ou 75%, 50% et sans \u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie. Si la fonction Magic Eco est d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9e, vous pouvez recourir \u00e0 la technologie Magic Bright de Samsung pour ajuster manuellement la luminosit\u00e9 de l\u2019\u00e9cran. Prenez les commandes avec MagicEco et \u00e9conomisez de l\u2019\u00e9nergie en toute simplicit\u00e9."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":2}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":27,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d8cedbc9-31fc-4cda-b7ba-764f930a70da","identifier":"12360635","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","hiper","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"f\/2\/1\/8\/f2185542854d17219aee0c4fd8d17b39b1626952_15743_12360635_6782.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/f\/2\/1\/8\/f2185542854d17219aee0c4fd8d17b39b1626952_15743_12360635_6782.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Hiper MS2058 loudspeaker"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Hiper MS2058. Recommended usage: universal, Speaker placement: Tabletop\/bookshelf, Speaker enclosure: Closed. Frequency range: 100 - 20000. Connectivity technology: Wired, Speaker interface type: USB, Headphone connectivity: 3.5 mm. Housing material: Plastic. Power source type: USB"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-16T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3fdc56af-ab4b-4b59-b67a-f76049163a48","identifier":"12361250","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1\/f\/2\/0\/1f20572c48030ced621790c8a3c0557e6fecd49d_15743_12361250_2167.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/1\/f\/2\/0\/1f20572c48030ced621790c8a3c0557e6fecd49d_15743_12361250_2167.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R36"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- WLAN; MP4\\n- 51fach Advanced Zoom; Full-HD-CMOS\\n- Optischer Intelligent IS\\n- Story-Creator\\n- Cinema-Look-Filter; Touch Decoration\\n- Direktspeicherung auf externe Festplatte\\n- 7,5 cm Touch-LCD\\n- Smart Auto, Gesichtserkennung\\n- HD-SD-Konvertierung\\n- 8 GB Speicher, SDXC-Steckplatz\\n\\nWLAN-Camcorder: Lassen Sie Freunde an Ihren Storys teilhaben\\n\\n<b>WLAN; MP4<\/b>\\nDie integrierte WLAN-Funktion ist ideal, um Ihre Videos ganz bequem \u00fcber Ihr Social Network mit anderen zu teilen oder auf DLNA zertifizierten TVs und iOS-Systemen zu betrachten. Die MP4-Unterst\u00fctzung erm\u00f6glicht einen schnellen Datentransfer von HD-Videos.\\n\\n<b>51fach Advanced Zoom; Full-HD-CMOS<\/b>\\nMit dem original Canon HD-Videoobjektiv mit 51fach Advanced Zoom halten Sie auch weit entfernte Motive brillant und detailreich fest. Der Full-HD-CMOS-Sensor sorgt f\u00fcr exzellente Full-HD-Videos mit pr\u00e4ziser Farbwiedergabe. Auch bei schwachen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen entstehen brillante Aufnahmen, die sich hervorragend f\u00fcr die Wiedergabe auf Ihrem HD-TV eignen.\\n\\n<b>Optischer Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS ist die ideale L\u00f6sung zur Minimierung von Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen. Anhand der automatischen Erkennung der Aufnahmesituation wird aus 4 Modi die richtige optische Bildstabilisierung gew\u00e4hlt, um Verwacklungen zu kompensieren. Das sichert gestochen scharfe, detailreiche Videos in jeder Aufnahmesituation - Sie k\u00f6nnen sich ganz auf das Filmen konzentrieren.\\n\\n<b>Story-Creator<\/b>\\nMit Story-Creator werden sie ganz intuitiv zum Filmregisseur und kreieren attraktive Videos. W\u00e4hlen Sie einfach ein Thema f\u00fcr Ihr Video und Story Creator gibt Ihnen Drehbuchvorlagen und Aufnahmetipps f\u00fcr faszinierende Filme.\\n\\n<b>Cinema-Look-Filter; Touch Decoration<\/b>\\nCinema-Look-Filter er\u00f6ffnen neue M\u00f6glichkeiten f\u00fcr die kreative Entfaltung. Die 8 einstellbaren Farbfilter erm\u00f6glichen tolle Videos mit attraktivem Kino-Flair. Mit Touch Decoration bauen Sie ganz einfach ohne Nachbearbeitung am PC tolle Effekte in Ihre Filme ein.\\n\\n<b>Direktspeicherung auf externe Festplatte<\/b>\\nVideos, die auf dem integrierten Speicher oder einer im Speicherkartenslot eingesteckten SDXC-Speicherkarte abgelegt sind, lassen sich ganz bequem auf eine externe Festplatte kopieren. Zur schnellen und einfachen Speicherung stehen Ihnen praktische Men\u00fc-Angaben auf dem Display zur Verf\u00fcgung.\\n\\n<b>Bedienung per Fingertipp<\/b>\\nDas 7,5 cm (3 Zoll) gro\u00dfe Touch-LCD erm\u00f6glicht eine denkbar einfache Bedienung. Einstellungen vornehmen oder Wiedergabe starten \u2013 alles erfolgt ganz intuitiv per Fingertipp.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto, Gesichtserkennung<\/b>\\nSmart Auto ist eine intelligente Automatik-Funktion f\u00fcr hohen Aufnahmekomfort. Basierend auf intelligenter Scene-Detection-Technologie werden 38 Aufnahmesituationen unterschieden und die perfekten Einstellungen gew\u00e4hlt \u2013 Sie k\u00f6nnen sich beim Filmen ausschlie\u00dflich auf Ihr Motiv konzentrieren; die Gesichtserkennung optimiert dabei die Einstellungen f\u00fcr gro\u00dfartige Personenaufnahmen.\\n\\n<b>HD-SD-Konvertierung<\/b>\\nBereits im Camcorder k\u00f6nnen Videos von HD- in SD-Aufl\u00f6sung konvertiert werden, ideal f\u00fcr das einfache Teilen und den schnellen Web-Upload.\\n\\n<b>8 GB Flash-Speicher, SDXC-Karten-Steckplatz<\/b>\\nDer integrierte 8 GB Flash-Speicher bietet Speicherkapazit\u00e4t f\u00fcr mehr 3 Stunden Full-HD-Videos. SDXC-Speicherkartenslot f\u00fcr hohe Aufzeichnungskapazit\u00e4t."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Wi-Fi with MP4 support\\n- 51x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS\\n- Optical Intelligent IS\\n- Story Creator\\n- Cinema-look filters; Touch Decoration\\n- Store direct to external HDD\\n- 7.5cm touch screen\\n- Smart Auto, Face Detection\\n- HD-SD conversion\\n- 8GB memory, SDXC card slot\\n\\nShare your stories effortlessly with Wi-Fi\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi with MP4 support<\/b>\\nIn-built Wi-Fi lets you effortlessly share your creations to social networking sites and view your videos on DNLA certified TVs and iOS devices. Support for MP4 format ensures quick transfer times of HD movies.\\n\\n<b>51x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS<\/b>\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 51x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives excellent colour reproduction even in low light, so your movies will look great on your HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake. It automatically detects the scene and selects exactly the right optical Image Stabilizer settings from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. It ensures sharp, detailed videos in every situation - leaving you free to concentrate on shooting.\\n\\n<b>Story Creator<\/b>\\nUse Story Creator to effortlessly create memorable movies and help develop your video skills. Choose a theme for your movie and Story Creator gives you on screen suggestions and shooting tips, so you can make captivating videos.\\n\\n<b>Cinema-look filters; Touch Decoration<\/b>\\nInspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters. Select from 8 adjustable colour-grading filters to capture the perfect movie scene. Adding fun effects to your movies without a PC is easy using Touch Decoration.\\n\\n<b>Store direct to external HDD<\/b>\\nCopy movies direct from the inbuilt memory or SDXC card slot to an external hard drive. Just follow the simple on-screen menus for quick and easy storage.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nOperation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm (3.0\u201d) gesture-based Touch-screen LCD, which gives you intuitive fingertip control of settings and simplifies playback.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto, Face Detection<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot high quality video with Smart Auto. Intelligent Scene Detection Technology selects the perfect settings from 38 scene modes \u2013 all you have to do is point and shoot, whilst Face Detection optimises the settings for great people shots.\\n\\n<b>HD-SD conversion<\/b>\\nConvert movies from HD to SD in camera for really easy sharing and web uploading.\\n\\n<b>8GB Dual Flash memory, SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nAn in-built 8GB Dual Flash memory lets you store over 3 hours of Full HD movies. Record even longer with the SDXC card slot."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi avec prise en charge MP4\\n- Zoom perfectionn\u00e9 51x ; capteur CMOS Full HD\\n- Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent\\n- Cr\u00e9ation de Sc\u00e9narios\\n- Filtres effet Cin\u00e9ma ; fonction Touche D\u00e9coration\\n- Stockage direct sur disque dur externe\\n- \u00c9cran tactile de 7,5 cm\\n- Mode Smart Auto, d\u00e9tection de visage\\n- Conversion HD-SD\\n- M\u00e9moire de 8 Go ; logement pour carte SDXC\\n\\nPartagez vos histoires sans le moindre effort gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi\\n\\n<b>Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi avec prise en charge MP4<\/b>\\nSa connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi int\u00e9gr\u00e9e vous permet de partager vos cr\u00e9ations en toute simplicit\u00e9 sur vos r\u00e9seaux sociaux et de regarder vos vid\u00e9os sur des p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques iOS et des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs certifi\u00e9s DNLA. La prise en charge du format MP4 garantit une vitesse de transfert rapide pour les vid\u00e9os HD.\\n\\n<b>Zoom perfectionn\u00e9 51x ; capteur CMOS Full HD<\/b>\\nUn objectif vid\u00e9o authentique Canon HD avec zoom perfectionn\u00e9 51x vous permet de capturer vos sujets, m\u00eame \u00e9loign\u00e9s, dans leurs moindres d\u00e9tails. Le capteur CMOS Full HD offre une excellente reproduction des couleurs m\u00eame en basse lumi\u00e8re : vos vid\u00e9os auront fi\u00e8re allure sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD.\\n\\n<b>Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent<\/b>\\nLe stabilisateur d'image intelligent compense les effets de vibration comme aucun autre syst\u00e8me. Il d\u00e9tecte automatiquement la sc\u00e8ne et s\u00e9lectionne parmi 4 modes les param\u00e8tres de stabilisateur d'image optique les mieux adapt\u00e9s pour compenser le mouvement et \u00e9viter les flous de boug\u00e9. Il garantit une image vid\u00e9o nette et d\u00e9taill\u00e9e dans tous les cas de figure, vous permettant ainsi de porter toute votre attention sur la prise de vues.\\n\\n<b>Cr\u00e9ation de Sc\u00e9narios<\/b>\\nUtilisez le mode Cr\u00e9ation de Sc\u00e9narios pour cr\u00e9er en toute simplicit\u00e9 des vid\u00e9os inoubliables et d\u00e9velopper vos talents de r\u00e9alisateur. Une fois le th\u00e8me de votre s\u00e9quence choisi, le mode Cr\u00e9ation de Sc\u00e9narios vous fournit \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran des suggestions et des conseils de prise de vues qui vous permettront de r\u00e9aliser des vid\u00e9os captivantes.\\n\\n<b>Filtres effet Cin\u00e9ma ; fonction Touche D\u00e9coration<\/b>\\nExprimez votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 avec les filtres effet Cin\u00e9ma. Choisissez l'un des 8 filtres de nuances de couleurs r\u00e9glables pour obtenir la sc\u00e8ne de cin\u00e9ma id\u00e9ale. Avec la fonction Touche D\u00e9coration, ajoutez des effets amusants \u00e0 vos vid\u00e9os en toute simplicit\u00e9, sans ordinateur.\\n\\n<b>Stockage direct sur disque dur externe<\/b>\\nCopiez des vid\u00e9os directement \u00e0 partir de la m\u00e9moire int\u00e9gr\u00e9e ou du logement pour carte SDXC vers un disque dur externe. Acc\u00e9dez aux options de stockage rapidement et en toute simplicit\u00e9 \u00e0 partir des menus conviviaux \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran.\\n\\n<b>Le contr\u00f4le au bout des doigts<\/b>\\nLe fonctionnement est ais\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran LCD tactile haute r\u00e9solution de 7,5 cm (3 pouces) qui garantit un contr\u00f4le intuitif des param\u00e8tres et simplifie la lecture.\\n\\n<b>Mode Smart Auto, d\u00e9tection de visage<\/b>\\nEnregistrez facilement des vid\u00e9os de haute qualit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au mode Smart Auto. La technologie de reconnaissance de sc\u00e8ne intelligente s\u00e9lectionne les param\u00e8tres appropri\u00e9s parmi 38 modes sc\u00e8ne ; il ne vous reste plus alors qu'\u00e0 cadrer et \u00e0 d\u00e9clencher. La technologie de d\u00e9tection de visage optimise quant \u00e0 elle les param\u00e8tres de prise de vues pour des portraits toujours r\u00e9ussis.\\n\\n<b>Conversion HD-SD<\/b>\\nConvertissez, depuis le cam\u00e9scope, des vid\u00e9os du format HD \u00e0 SD pour un partage et un t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement sur Internet faciles.\\n\\n<b>Double m\u00e9moire Flash de 8 Go ; logement pour carte SDXC<\/b>\\nUne double m\u00e9moire Flash int\u00e9gr\u00e9e de 8 Go vous permet de stocker plus de 3 heures de vid\u00e9o Full HD. Le logement pour carte SDXC permet une dur\u00e9e d'enregistrement encore plus longue."}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4d0299f3-909b-4dd1-a23a-85f96c32746d","identifier":"12362211","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["hp","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Compaq LA2306x"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Die Advantage-Serie der kompakten und dennoch gro\u00dfen HP Compaq LA2306x LCD-Monitore mit einer Diagonale von 58,4 cm (23\") bietet umfassende Anpassungsm\u00f6glichkeiten f\u00fcr mehr Produktivit\u00e4t, w\u00e4hrend die LED-Technologie den Umweltschutz und Full HD <SUP>1<\/SUP> die Bildqualit\u00e4t verbessert.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Mehr Komfort und Produktivit\u00e4t<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Der superflache HP Monitor hat einen Standfu\u00df mit Schiebemechanismus, der eine H\u00f6henanpassung von beeindruckenden 130 mm, eine Drehung um 90\u00b0 in das Hochformat, eine Schwenkung und eine Neigung von 35\u00b0 f\u00fcr die komfortable Anpassung erm\u00f6glicht.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Resolutes Recycling<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Dank der Verwendung von quecksilberfreien LEDs, arsenfreiem Bildschirmglas <SUP>3<\/SUP> und mehr als 25 % gebrauchtem und recyceltem Kunstharz in Geh\u00e4use und Standfu\u00df kann der Monitor am Ende seiner Betriebsdauer umweltgerecht entsorgt werden.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Gr\u00f6\u00dfere Anzeige. H\u00f6here Effizienz.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Feine Farbdetails und hohe Bildsch\u00e4rfe auf einem gro\u00dfen Full HD-Bildschirm <SUP>1<\/SUP> mit einer Diagonale von 58,4 cm (23\"), dynamischem Kontrast von 1 Mio.:1, Betrachtungswinkel von bis zu 170\u00b0 und schneller Antwortzeit von 5 ms <SUP>2<\/SUP>. Au\u00dferdem k\u00f6nnen Sie dank eines integrierten USB-Hubs mit zwei Anschl\u00fcssen Daten auf USB-Sticks anzeigen.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Entspricht den strengsten Standards<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Der HP Compaq LA2306x ist mit ENERGY STAR\u00ae 5.0 und TCO 5 zertifiziert sowie mit EPEAT\u00ae Gold registriert <SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Zur Anzeige von hochaufl\u00f6senden Bildern sind High-Definition-Inhalte erforderlich. Dieser Monitor verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber eine Aufl\u00f6sung von 1080p.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Alle Leistungsdaten geben die typischen Spezifikationen an, die von den Herstellern der HP Komponenten bereitgestellt werden; die tats\u00e4chliche Leistung kann \u00fcber oder unter diesen Angaben liegen.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Arsen und Arsenverbindungen wurden mit den Testmethoden 3052\/6010b der US-amerikanischen EPA durch ICP-AES nicht festgestellt.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> EPEAT\u00ae Gold f\u00fcr registrierte kommerzielle HP Monitorprodukte. Siehe www.epeat.net f\u00fcr den Registrierungsstatus im jeweiligen Land.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Advantage Series HP Compaq LA2306x\u2019s slender, yet expansive 58,4 cm (23\") diagonal LCD monitor enables advanced adjustability for increased productivity, while LED technology helps improve recyclability and Full HD [1] helps improve image quality."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>L'\u00e9cran plat mais large LCD d'une diagonale de 58,4 cm (23 pouces) du HP Compaq LA2306x de la gamme Advantage offre des r\u00e9glages avanc\u00e9s pour une productivit\u00e9 accrue, la technologie LED am\u00e9liore le recyclage et la full HD <SUP>1<\/SUP> am\u00e9liore la qualit\u00e9 de l'image.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Confort et productivit\u00e9 garantis<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;L'\u00e9cran ultra plat HP avec support coulissant offre une plage de r\u00e9glage en hauteur de 130 mm, tandis que la rotation portrait 90\u00b0, le pivotement et les 35\u00b0 d'inclinaison permettent des r\u00e9glages confortables tout au long de la journ\u00e9e au quotidien.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Recyclage responsable<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Avec l'utilisation de LED sans mercure, un verre d'\u00e9cran sans arsenic <SUP>3<\/SUP> et un bo\u00eetier et un socle compos\u00e9s de plus de 25\u00a0% de r\u00e9sines recycl\u00e9es apr\u00e8s consommation, vous avez la conscience tranquille en mati\u00e8re de recyclage quand vient le moment de remplacer votre \u00e9cran.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Etendez votre affichage. Devenez plus productif.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Obtenez de subtils d\u00e9tails de couleurs et des affichages clairs sur un \u00e9cran Full HD <SUP>1<\/SUP> grand format 58,4 cm (23 pouces) avec un TCD de 1\u00a0000\u00a0000:1, des angles de visualisation jusqu'\u00e0 170\u00b0 et un temps de r\u00e9ponse rapide de 5 ms <SUP>2<\/SUP>. Un hub USB deux ports int\u00e9gr\u00e9 permet \u00e9galement d'avoir les donn\u00e9es de lecteurs flash \u00e0 port\u00e9e de main.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>respectez les standards les plus exigeants<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;HP Compaq LA2306x est certifi\u00e9 ENERGY STAR\u00ae 5.0, EPEAT\u00ae Gold <SUP>4<\/SUP> et TCO 5.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> un contenu haute d\u00e9finition (HD) est n\u00e9cessaire pour visualiser des images HD. Cet \u00e9cran offre une r\u00e9solution pouvant atteindre 1080p.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Toutes les sp\u00e9cifications de performance sont les sp\u00e9cifications nominales fournies par les fabricants de composants HP\u00a0; les performances r\u00e9elles peuvent \u00eatre plus \u00e9lev\u00e9es ou plus faibles.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Les m\u00e9thodes de test U.S. EPA 3052\/6010b d'ICP-AES n'ont d\u00e9tect\u00e9 ni arsenic ni compos\u00e9 d'arsenic.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> EPEAT\u00ae Gold l\u00e0 o\u00f9 HP enregistre les \u00e9crans professionnels. Consultez le site www.epeat.net pour conna\u00eetre l'\u00e9tat d'enregistrement dans votre pays.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3e78c1d2-d40b-4d69-bdd4-f2b263d22ee1","identifier":"12363529","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["print_scan_sales","scanners","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox Mobile Scanner, WiFi, 10Spp, 300Dpi"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"When you\u2019re wireless, you\u2019re everywhere!\\n\\n- Scan to PC, Mac, Android phones and tablets, iPhone, iPad, iPod touch, and the cloud\\n- Create JPGs or multi-page PDFs\\n- Rechargable battery lasts for over 300 scanned pages"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"638.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1d7a6b60-37b2-4703-b5e8-d0ef3134fd2f","identifier":"1239693","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lg","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 24\" LCD L246WH"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Das Multitalent f\u00fcr Multimedia-Anwendungen\\n\\nSeine herausragende Bildqualit\u00e4t im 16:10 Breitbildformat verdankt der LG L246 WH seinen hohen Kontrastwerten (2.000:1) und einem au\u00dferordentlichen Helligkeitswert von 400 cd\/m\u00b2. \u00dcberaus vielseitig machen ihn zudem eine Vielzahl n\u00fctzlicher Anschlussm\u00f6glichkeiten. Neben einem analogen Sub-D-Eingang bietet dieses Display eine HDMI- und Komponenten-Schnittstelle sowie einen USB-Hub mit zwei Buchsen und einen Kopfh\u00f6reranschluss. Damit ist der LG 246 WH auf alles bestens vorbereitet. \\n\\nSchnelles Panel mit 5 ms (GTG) Reaktionszeit und 170\u00b0 Blickwinkel.\\n\\nUltra hoher Kontrast von 2.000:1 mit DFC und sehr hohe Helligkeit von 400 cd\/m\u00b2.\\n\\nUltra hohe WUXGA Aufl\u00f6sung (1.920 x 1.200 Pixel).\\n\\nHD f\u00e4hig.\\n\\nHDMI Anschluss mit HDCP Kopierschutzunterst\u00fctzung. Zus\u00e4tzlicher analoger 15 Pin D-Sub VGA\u2013Eingang f\u00fcr den Anschluss eines zweiten Rechners.\\n\\nHochaufl\u00f6sender Chinch Komponenteneingang (YPbPr) bis 1080i.\\n\\nPIP (Picture in Picture)und PBP (Picture beside picture) Funktion.\\n\\nHohe Ergonomie durch TC099 und DIN-ISO 13406-2 Zertifizierung sowie Dreh- und Neigefu\u00df.\\n\\n- USB 2.0 Hub zum Anschluss von Peripherieger\u00e4ten (1 upstream\/2 downstream)\\n- Schmaler Geh\u00e4userahmen\\n- Vorbereitet f\u00fcr Schwenkarme und Wandhalterungen nach VESA FDMI (75 mm)\\n- Funktionelles edles Design in Schwarz\\n- Integriertes Netzteil\\n- OSD Sperre\\n- Zertifiziert f\u00fcr Windows Vista Premium"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Wide Screen, 16:10 aspect ratio gives us the best condition for Viewing TV & DVD movies and playing video games. HDMI deliver sharper image and sounds with no data loss HDMI deliver sharper image and sounds with no data loss for graphic and multimedia users. Crystal clear all digital and video via a single cable \\n\\n- Height Adjustable\\n- High Contrast Ratio\\n- Excellent picture quality and control\\n- HDCP - full resolution HD-DVD & Blu-Ray Playback\\n- Ideal for Windows Vista industrial design toolkit"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7d05fb7d-7d21-408d-8640-1008a68c936f","identifier":"12397971","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","salora","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Salora 46LED7100C LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Salora 46LED7100C. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. HDMI version: 1.3. Video formats supported: MPEG4, XVID, Audio formats supported: MP3, Image formats supported: JPG. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 400 x 400"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a0b3f053-0b3d-4e79-9d98-6d3ee067d26a","identifier":"12431976","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3\/6\/3\/3\/36333f80b8979ccdfa21a96769005bd561b450a5_12431976_8797.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/3\/6\/3\/3\/36333f80b8979ccdfa21a96769005bd561b450a5_12431976_8797.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony HDR-CX570E"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"20.4"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Full-HD-Camcorder mit sehr hoher Bildqualit\u00e4t und vielseitigen Funktionen\\n- Full HD-Aufnahmen 1920 x 1080 50p - Full HD-Aufnahmen mit sehr hohen Bitraten und progressivem 50p-Aufnahmemodus f\u00fcr h\u00f6chste Bildqualit\u00e4t und Pr\u00e4zision\\n- Progressiver 25p-Aufnahmemodus - Nimmt 25 Full HD-Bilder pro Sekunde auf, f\u00fcr das echte Kinoerlebnis mit Ihren Videos\\n- Aufzeichnung auf optionaler Speicherkarte - Aufnahmen auf abnehmbarem Memory Stick' oder SD Card (Memory Stick Pro Duo' oder SD\/SDHC)\\n- G-Objektiv mit 12-fachem optischem Zoom\/20-fachem erweitertem Zoom - Hervorragende optische Leistung: 26,8 mm (Video und Foto) Weitwinkel, perfekt f\u00fcr Gruppenbilder, Landschaften und vieles mehr\\n- Optischer SteadyShot mit erweitertem Active-Modus - Mit 3-Wege-Verwacklungsschutz f\u00fcr scharfe Bilder, sogar bei Aufnahmen im Gehen. Jetzt mit verbesserter Stabilit\u00e4t in allen Zoom-Einstellungen\\n- Besonders empfindlicher Exmor R' CMOS-Sensor des Typs 1\/3,91 - Hocheffizienter, gro\u00dfer Sensor f\u00fcr detailreiche Video- und Fotoaufnahmen mit reduziertem Bildrauschen, insbesondere bei schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen\\n- BIONZ Prozessor - High-Speed-Bildprozessor f\u00fcr verbesserte Bildqualit\u00e4t und reaktionsschnelle Leistung\\n- Standbilder mit bis zu 20,4 Mio. Pixeln - By Pixel Super Resolution Technologie sorgt f\u00fcr Standbilder mit au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnlicher Detailtreue und hoher Qualit\u00e4t\\n- Xtra Fine-LC-Display (7,5 cm\/3\") - Breitbild-Touchscreen (921.000 Bildpunkte) mit TruBlack Technologie f\u00fcr Bilder mit hohem Kontrastverh\u00e4ltnis\\n- Anschluss und schnelles Laden \u00fcber ein integriertes USB-Kabel - USB-Kabel passt perfekt in die Handschlaufe des Camcorders. Handycam\u00ae an Ihren Computer anschlie\u00dfen und Videos \u00fcbertragen oder Akku laden\\n- Bedienfreundliche Schnittstelle mit Event Browse - Intuitive Wiedergabel\u00f6sung f\u00fcr die Gruppierung Ihrer Camcorder-Aufnahmen und Fotos nach Ereignissen: Erm\u00f6glicht einfaches Suchen nach Ihren Lieblingsaufnahmen\\n- Highlight-Wiedergabe - Bearbeitet automatisch die \u00dcberg\u00e4nge Ihrer Film-Highlights und Fotos und f\u00fcgt Musik hinzu: Brennen Sie die Ergebnisse auf DVD oder teilen Sie sie online\\n- Intelligenter Automatikmodus (iAUTO) - Erkennt bis zu 180 Kombinationen f\u00fcr Gesichtserkennung, Belichtungseinstellung und Handheld-\/Stativmodus: passt die Kameraeinstellungen f\u00fcr optimale Ergebnisse an\\n- Tracking-Fokus - W\u00e4hlen Sie auf dem Touchscreen ein Thema und legen Sie den Autofokus f\u00fcr sich bewegende Motive fest, auch wenn es sich nicht um Menschen handelt: Perfekt f\u00fcr Haustiere\\n- Quick AF - Der Autofokus verfolgt Motive mit hoher Geschwindigkeit, um klare, detailreiche Bilder auch bei schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen zu erzielen\\n- Hochwertiger 5.1-Kanal Surround Sound - Mit dem neuen, besonders empfindlichen Mikrofon-Design werden Dialoge und Surround Sound mit \u00fcberragender Klarheit erfasst\\n- Automatische Reduzierung von Windger\u00e4uschen - Innovative Audioverarbeitungsfunktionen sorgen f\u00fcr Reduzierung von Windger\u00e4uschen und bessere Klangqualit\u00e4t bei Au\u00dfenaufnahmen; automatische Anpassung der Audioverarbeitung an die Windst\u00e4rke\\n- Closer Voice f\u00fcr klarere Sprachwiedergabe - Verbessert bei Erkennung von Gesichtern deutlich die Mikrofonausrichtung und optimiert die Audioverarbeitung, um Rauschen und Hintergrundger\u00e4usche zu reduzieren\\n- Stereo-Lautsprecher mit S-Master Verst\u00e4rkertechnologie - Hochwertiges Linear Phase-Lautsprechersystem f\u00fcr klaren, nat\u00fcrlichen Stereo-Sound bei der Wiedergabe Ihrer Clips\\n- Gesichtserkennung und Smile Shutter - Aufnehmen klarer, nat\u00fcrlicher Portr\u00e4ts: Automatische Standbilder von l\u00e4chelnden Gesichtern w\u00e4hrend der Videoaufzeichnung\\n- Direktes Kopieren - Direkte \u00dcbertragung von Videos auf eine externe Festplatte, ohne PC: Wiedergabe mit tollen Camcorder-Funktionen\\n- Kompatibel mit DVDirect Express - Brennen ohne PC auf AVCHD oder DVDs mit Standardaufl\u00f6sung mit kompatiblem Sony DVDirect Express Brenner\\n- HDMI\u00ae Ausgang - Anschlie\u00dfen des Camcorders an einen beliebigen HD ready Fernseher\\n- BRAVIA Sync - Direkte Steuerung der Wiedergabefunktionen des Camcorders \u00fcber die Fernbedienung des angeschlossenen BRAVIA Fernsehers\\n- Golf Shot - Automatische High-Speed-Aufnahme von Bilderserien zum Einfrieren schneller Bewegungen genau im richtigen Moment\\n- PlayMemories Home - Integrierte Software zur einfachen \u00dcbertragung an einen PC zum Bearbeiten, Drucken, Brennen, Versenden per E-Mail und Hochladen ins Internet"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Full HD camcorder with very high image quality and versatile functions\\n- Full HD 1920x1080 50p recording - Full HD recording at very high bit rate with 50p progressive shooting mode for highest image quality and smoothness\\n- 25p progressive recording mode - Shoots Full HD images at 25 frames per second to achieve cinematic feel with your video footage\\n- Recording on optional memory card - Records on choice of removable Memory Stick' or SD cards (Memory Stick Pro Duo' or SD\/SDHC)\\n- G Lens with 12x optical zoom\/20x extended zoom - Excellent optical performance: 26.8mm (video and photo) wide angle ideal for group shots, landscapes and more\\n- Optical SteadyShot with enhanced Active Mode - With 3-Way Shake-Cancelling for stable images, even while walking. Now offers enhanced stabilisation at all zoom settings\\n- Super sensitive 1\/3.91 type Exmor R' CMOS Sensor - Highly efficient, large sensor captures detail-packed video and still images with reduced image noise, especially in low light\\n- BIONZ processor - High-speed image processor for enhanced image quality and responsive performance\\n- Up to 20.4 Megapixel still photo - By Pixel Super Resolution Technology ensures extremely detailed, high quality still images\\n- 7.5cm\/3\" Xtra Fine LCD - 921k dot wide touchscreen with TruBlack technology for high-contrast images\\n- Connect and quick charge with built-in USB cable - USB cable stows neatly in camcorder's hand strap. Connect Handycam\u00ae to your computer and transfer videos or recharge battery\\n- Easy interface with Event Browse - Intuitive playback solution groups your camcorder footage and still photos by events: allows easy searching to favourites\\n- Highlight Playback - Automatically edits together movie highlights and still photos with music and transitions: burn the results to DVD or share online\\n- Intelligent AUTO (iAUTO) mode - Recognizes up to 180 combinations of Face Detection, scene settings and handheld\/tripod shooting: adjusts for best results\\n- Tracking focus - Select an object on the touchscreen and keep autofocus locked on moving subjects, even if they're not people: ideal for pets\\n- Quick AF - Autofocus locks onto subject at high speed for clear, sharply-focused images, even in low-light conditions\\n- High Quality 5.1ch surround sound - Sensitive new microphone design captures dialogue and surround sound with superb clarity\\n- Auto Wind Noise Reduction - Advanced processing reduces wind noise for clearer outdoor sountracks; automatically adjusts processing to match wind strength\\n- Closer Voice for clearer dialogue and speech - Boosts microphone directionality and optimises processing to reduce noise and background sounds when faces are detected\\n- Stereo speaker with S-Master amplifer technology - High quality linear phase speaker system delivers clear, natural stereo sound when playing back your clips\\n- Face Detection and Smile Shutter - Capture clear, natural portraits: automatically shoot still photos of smiling faces during video recording\\n- Direct Copy - Transfer video footage direct to an external hard disk drive without PC: playback with fun camcorder features\\n- DVDirect Express compatibility - PC-free burning to AVCHD or Standard Definition DVD discs with compatible Sony DVDirect Express writer\\n- HDMI\u00ae output - Connect camcorder for viewing any HD Ready TV\\n- BRAVIA Sync - Directly control camcorder playback functions via remote of connected BRAVIA\u00ae television\\n- Golf Shot - Automatically captures a high-speed burst of images to freeze fast-moving action at exactly the right moment\\n- PlayMemories Home - Built-in software allows easy transfers to PC for editing, printing, disc burning, emailing and web uploads"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":12}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"123d0529-d308-488b-8305-51dbca02318c","identifier":"12435196","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot ELPH 520 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>An Ultra-Slim High Performer.<\/b>\\nIn the twelve years since the original ELPH was instantly and universally proclaimed an icon of style, successive ELPH cameras have remained at the forefront of design even while boasting the very latest in digital technology. Now, opening a new era of ELPH design, the PowerShot ELPH 520 HS digital camera is both homage to the original ELPH and astonishing synthesis of Canon's leadership in technical advancements. A mere 0.76 inches thick, it is the world's thinnest 12x zoom camera*. Canon's pursuit of perfection has driven the development of new miniaturization including a new lens and new 10.1 Megapixel CMOS sensor that, powered by Canon's DIGIC 5 Image Processor, create images as breathtakingly beautiful as the camera itself. It's also packed with the latest Canon technologies including Smart AUTO with new Face ID and Full HD Video. Brimming with a full range of advanced technologies that automatically optimize the image quality of every shot, the PowerShot ELPH 520 HS digital camera makes the ultimate style icon incredibly effortless.\\n\\n<b>Incredibly Thin Design<\/b>\\nCanon's unwavering commitment to equipping an ultra-thin, clean-profiled ELPH with 12x zooming power required a redesign of the lens, sensor and other technologies. This pursuit of perfection paid off, creating the world's thinnest camera with a 12x zoom. At an astonishingly thin 0.76 inches, it is significantly slimmer than competitors' 12x zoom models.\\n\\n<b>12x Optical Zoom and 28mm Wide-Angle Lens<\/b>\\nNewly designed to custom-fit the PowerShot ELPH 520 HS digital camera's incredibly thin profile, the camera's 12x Optical Zoom and 28mm Wide-Angle Lens is a marvel of optical technology. The Wide-Angle lens gives you more to work with in every shot, adding depth, perspective and grandeur as called for. Landscapes, city scenes, family shots and more all benefit from the extra width. With a 12x Optical Zoom, no shot is beyond your reach. You'll love the flexibility it gives you when shooting: from a single vantage point you can capture an unlimited number of different images simply by zooming in and out. It also incorporates the latest in Canon UA lens technology, suppressing lens aberration for outstanding image quality throughout the entire zoom range. The camera's sensor was specifically designed for this lens, so even at the long end of the zoom images are bright and clear.\\n\\n<b>UA Lens Technology<\/b>\\nPioneered by Canon, UA Lens technology makes possible compact lenses with remarkable optical performance. By using molded glass with an ultra-high refractive index in aspherical lens elements, Canon has succeeded in reducing lens size while significantly reducing image aberrations. Another stellar example of cutting-edge Canon optics, UA Lens technology helps make PowerShot digital cameras pocket-friendly and capable of astounding image quality."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":12}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0e8d8b54-04f0-4af7-89a0-1213eed08990","identifier":"12436987","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["print_scan_sales","scanners","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox DocuMate Travel Scanner 150"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Instant scan to searchable PDF for easy search and retrieval\\n- USB Powered \u2013 No external power supply needed\\n- Auto-crop, Auto-straighten, Auto-brightness\\n- Lightweight ( 300g \/ 10.6 oz.)\\n- Scans items up to 216 mm ( 8.5\u201d) wide and 356 mm (14\u201d) long\\n\\nWhat is the benefit of being able to scan from anywhere?\\nWhether you\u2019re on a business trip or work in a mobile environment, you collect paper on your travels. Business cards, receipts, contracts, forms, and photos. And it all has to wait in an overcrowded bag or briefcase (sometimes even pockets, wallets and purses) until you get back to your office, where you are already burdened with a to-do list. If you can get your documents organised while you are on the road, you will have less to worry about when you get back to the office. The Xerox Travel Scanner 150 is lightweight, compact and needs no AC outlet. Just connect the USB cable to your laptop, insert a document and you\u2019re scanning. And not just scanning, but scanning to popular and productive destinations such as email and Word, local\/network\/cloud storage or Microsoft SharePoint.\\n\\nThe secret to staying organised.\\nIf you take care of paper when you first receive it, then you won\u2019t have big piles to deal with later. Documents from the road can\u2019t always wait for your trip home. With the Xerox Travel Scanner 150 you can scan business cards after your meeting; they will be intelligently recognised and the data is sync\u2019d with your Outlook Contacts or smartphone, immediately. Your receipts will no longer get lost (and you\u2019re not out of pocket for a lost cab fare receipt). Work on and complete your expense report before your plane lands.\\n\\nWho needs to scan documents?\\n\\nThe Business Traveller: The \u201croad warrior\u201d... all the tools of the office need to be in their bag,\\nnot just at their desk. The Insurance Adjuster: Every client has photos and forms. Every body shop has bills that need to be paid. No time to wait. They need to be scanned and sent now. The Construction Contractor: Plans, permits, contracts, invoices. These important documents need to be captured to keep business moving and to keep it secure. The Estate Agent: Timing is the difference between a sale made and a sale lost. Agreements, deposits, notes and drawings need to be shared with banks, clients, builders, lawyers. These are just a small example of professionals that rely on high-quality mobile scanners with which they can travel to capture, secure and share the documents that keep their business moving. The Xerox Travel Scanner 150 is the secret of their success.\\n\\n<b>Visioneer OneTouch<\/b>\\nOneTouch is an easy-to-use utility that connects the Travel Scanner 150 with a powerful set of scanner settings to greatly improve the efficiency of your workflow \u2014 so that with one touch the document is scanned automatically to email, Microsoft Word, your printer, a file folder, or to one of many cloud destinations.\\n\\n<b>Visioneer DriverPLUS<\/b>\\nDriverPLUS is a new generation of driver technology that is based on TWAIN\u2122 2.1 specifications that provides advanced features and greater reliability for both users and system integrators. DriverPLUS combines the features of advanced 32- and 64-bit native Windows-based TWAIN and WIA drivers PLUS new Acuity optimisation software and a sophisticated user interface.\\n\\n<b>Visioneer Acuity<\/b>\\nAcuity enables your scanner to instantly improve the visual clarity of every document that you scan. Using advanced algorithms and dynamic thresholding Acuity will intelligently correct documents containing imperfections, improve quality of scanned images for archiving, increase OCR accuracy, and save time.\\n\\n<b>Nuance PaperPort<\/b>\\nMillions of professionals rely on PaperPort to save time and money by transforming paper documents into searchable digital documents. PaperPort combines the efficiency of document management, the convenience of superbly scanned documents and the power of creating PDF files, to bring a new level of operational proficiency to your organisation.\\n\\n<b>Nuance OmniPagePro<\/b>\\nOmniPage Pro provides a precise OCR and layout retention solution, quickly turning scanned documents into editable, formatted text. The text can then be used in virtually any word processing, desktop publishing or web publishing program."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"40c75265-415f-4061-94c6-9db9c5475a18","identifier":"12442463","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["acer","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Acer S 240HL Abid"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>S Series<\/b>\\nAcer S Series monitors are very slim yet spacious displays that are great for multitasking and web browsing. High-def visuals leap to life thanks to Full HD resolution and an extremely high contrast ratio. You'll appreciate both the imagery and the look of this streamlined yet powerful Acer monitor!\\n\\n<b>Ultra-thin, space-saving design<\/b>\\nThe S Series is designed to fit nicely in your living space, be it at home or in a SOHO, public area, or front-desk setting. Ultra-thin and ultra-elegant, the display is built around a sense of simple modernism.\\n\\n<b>Earth-friendly technologies<\/b>\\nThe S Series uses mercury-free materials and white LED technology for up to 68% lower power consumption, giving you big savings while helping preserve nature's energy resources. By meeting ENERGY STAR\u00ae 5.0 requirements, the S Series considers the environment.\\n\\n<b>Impressive performance<\/b>\\nGames are more exciting and entertainment is truly cinematic with excellent detail courtesy of Full HD resolution. In addition, an HDMI\u00ae or DVI interface connects you to the latest high-definition devices, while an astounding contrast ratio delivers fantastic clarity."}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f9e0fd07-3594-4956-b739-292985637833","identifier":"12462010","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung DV DV300F"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Hochwertige Portr\u00e4ts und witzige Profilbilder haben in der Social-Network-Generation Hochkonjunktur. Samsung hat die richtige Kamera daf\u00fcr \u2013 mit zus\u00e4tzlichem Front-Display! \u00dcber die Kamera-interne WiFi-Schnittstelle gelangen Schnappsch\u00fcsse und Videos kabellos, schnell und unkompliziert sofort zu Facebook, Picasa oder YouTube ins Netz. Via Samsung Mobile Link sendet die Kamera die sch\u00f6nsten Erinnerung an das Smartphone oder Tablet. Und die automatische PC-Back-Up-Funktion sorgt daf\u00fcr, dass kein wertvoller Schnappschuss verloren geht. Kreative und witzige Funktionen wie Motion Foto, Bild-im-Bild und Split Shot machen Spa\u00df und sorgen, einmal hochgeladen, f\u00fcr besonders viele \u201eLikes\u201c in der Community.\\n\\n<b>Mit im Bild<\/b>\\n\\nDie DV300F sorgt daf\u00fcr, dass der Fotograf auch vor der Kamera eine Rolle spielt: Auf dem fast vier Zentimeter gro\u00dfen, zus\u00e4tzlichen Front-Display kann er selbst vor der Kamera genau feststellen, ob die Aufnahme perfekt arrangiert ist. Von dieser Position aus ist auch der Selbstausl\u00f6ser bequem zu verfolgen und der Kindermodus fesselt mit lustigen Animationen im Ausl\u00f6semoment selbst die Aufmerksamkeit der Kleinsten \u2013 das schafft entspannte Aufnahmesituationen und gelungene Bildergebnisse. Und die neue Jump-Shot-2.0-Funktion zaubert aus Sprungaufnahmen eine dynamische Gif-Animation.\\n\\n<b>Immer bestens verbunden: Bilder einfach teilen und sichern<\/b>\\n<b>WiFi-Konnektivit\u00e4t<\/b>\\n\\nDas integrierte WiFi-Modul der Samsung DV300F sorgt daf\u00fcr, dass Bilder und Videos drahtlos und per Knopfdruck direkt ins Internet in Soziale Netzwerke wie Facebook, Flickr oder YouTube hochgeladen werden k\u00f6nnen und dort f\u00fcr angeregten Austausch sorgen. Auch der Link zum Online-Fotoalbum kann per E-Mail verschickt werden. Ebenfalls auf Knopfdruck lassen sich Bilder in der Samsung Cloud speichern, sammeln und sichern. F\u00fcr das Kinoerlebnis in den eigenen vier W\u00e4nden lassen sich via TV-Link-Funktion die sch\u00f6nsten Aufnahmen ohne Umweg durch das Kabel an den TV senden. Und die Auto-Back-up-Funktion speichert drahtlos und automatisch Aufnahmen auf dem eigenen PC: Das schafft Platz auf der Speicherkarte der Kamera und sorgt daf\u00fcr, dass kein wertvoller Schnappschuss verloren geht.\\n\\n<b>Bringt Action aufs Bild<\/b>\\n<b>Motion Foto<\/b>\\n\\nMotion Foto sorgt in Hollywood-Manier f\u00fcr dramatische Effekte: So kann bei der Aufnahme die Umgebung \u201eeingefroren\u201c werden. Wenn zum Beispiel ein Freund im Park zum Sprung ansetzt, erstarren alle anderen bewegungslos und die einzige Bewegung im Bild wird zum grandios inszenierten H\u00f6hepunkt der Aufnahme. Dazu gen\u00fcgt es, ein Bild aufzunehmen und den zu animierenden Bereich auszuw\u00e4hlen \u2013 die Kamera erledigt den Rest.\\n\\n<b>N\u00e4her, breiter, heller<\/b>\\n<b>Gehobene Ausstattung f\u00fcr alle Situationen<\/b>\\n\\nOb Landschaftsaufnahme oder Gruppenbild \u2013 der 25-mm-Weitwinkel bildet alle Motive in ihrer vollen Bandbreite ab. Und auch in der Ferne entgeht der DV300F kein Motiv \u2013 daf\u00fcr sorgt der 5-fach optische Zoom. Der leistungsstarke 16,1-Megapixel-Sensor schafft in Verbindung mit dem lichtstarken F2,5-Objektiv ideale Voraussetzungen auch unter schwachen Lichtbedingungen und sorgt f\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Fotos mit nat\u00fcrlichen, lebhaften Farben.\\n\\n<b>Klassisches Design mit<\/b>\\n<b>modernem Touch<\/b>\\n<b>DualView-Kamera<\/b>\\n\\nDie hochwertig verarbeitete Kamera pr\u00e4sentiert sich im makellos abgerundeten, schlanken Design. Der flache Front-Bildschirm schmiegt sich nahtlos ins metallisch gl\u00e4nzende Geh\u00e4use, die R\u00fcckseite setzt mit seiner Ledertextur moderne Akzente. Ein Designerst\u00fcck, das sowohl den Fotografen als auch das Motiv immer ins richtige Rampenlicht r\u00fcckt.\\n\\n<b>Fotos und Videos nach Wunsch: Smart Auto 2.0<\/b>\\n\\nVolle Konzentration auf das Motiv \u2013 mehr braucht der Fotograf nicht mitzubringen. Mit ihrer Szeneautomatik \u201eSmart Auto\u201c erkennt die Kamera in Sekundenschnelle immer wiederkehrende Motive, wie Landschaften, Portr\u00e4ts, Nahaufnahmen oder Sportszenen und sorgt selbst\u00e4ndig f\u00fcr die passenden Einstellungen. Ganze 16 unterschiedliche Szenen f\u00fcr Fotos und vier verschiedene f\u00fcr Video stehen der DV300F hier zur Wahl.\\n\\n<b>Foto und Video endlich vereint<\/b>\\n<b>Picture-in-Picture (Foto & Video)<\/b>\\n\\nWenn das eine Bild nicht reicht, schafft Picture-in-Picture Abhilfe: Mit dieser innovativen Funktion l\u00e4sst sich ein Bild in ein anderes oder auch in einen Videoclip integrieren. So kann ein separat aufgenommenes Hintergrundbild zum Beispiel mit einem Portr\u00e4t oder Videoclip kombiniert und dann direkt drahtlos zu Youtube oder Facebook hochgeladen werden.\\n\\n<b>Lustige Grimassen \u2013 f\u00fcr Gel\u00e4chter ist gesorgt<\/b>\\n\\nBesonders lange Nase, vorgezogenes Kinn oder breites Grinsen \u2013 was sonst nur mit aufwendigen Bildbearbeitungsprogrammen gelingt, hat die DV300F gleich mit im Gep\u00e4ck. Ein Knopfdruck gen\u00fcgt und sorgt f\u00fcr Spa\u00df bei Freunden und Familie. Dank der innovativen Gesichtsverfolgung bleibt das Gesicht erkennbar, auch beim Schwenken der Kamera.\\n\\n<b>Magic Frame \u2013 f\u00e4llt aus dem Rahmen<\/b>\\n\\nMagic Frame er\u00f6ffnet kreative Spielformen, zum Beispiel f\u00fcr Portr\u00e4ts von guten Freunden, die wahlweise als antiquierte Film-Shots, in Werbeplakat-Manier oder vielen anderen Optionen dargestellt werden k\u00f6nnen. Und das ganz einfach per Knopfdruck: Vorlage ausw\u00e4hlen, die Kamera auf das Motiv ausrichten und ausl\u00f6sen. So l\u00e4sst sich schnell eine originelle Postkarte oder ein witziges Poster zaubern.\\n\\n<b>K\u00fcnstler-Pinsel<\/b>\\n\\nPortr\u00e4ts als Bleistiftzeichnung erstellen, aus Landschaftsaufnahmen ein Aquarell zaubern oder Schnappsch\u00fcsse in einen Comic verwandeln \u2013 sehen Sie dem K\u00fcnstler im wahrsten Sinnes des Wortes bei der Arbeit zu. Die neue Funktion \u201eK\u00fcnstler-Pinsel\u201c macht aus Ihren Bildern ein bewegendes Kreativ-Erlebnis. Die Kamera erstellt auf Knopfdruck ein Video, in dem gezeigt wird, wie der Filtereffekt angewendet wird.\\n\\n<b>Split Shot kombiniert Bilder<\/b>\\n\\nMit der neuen Split-Shot-Funktion k\u00f6nnen auf Wunsch bis zu drei Bilder kombiniert werden. So kann zum Beispiel das eigene Portr\u00e4t mit einem Tierk\u00f6rper verbunden werden. Lassen Sie Ihrer Kreativit\u00e4t freien Lauf \u2013 f\u00fcr Fotospa\u00df ist garantiert gesorgt.\\n\\n<b>F\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Bilder<\/b>\\n\\nDie optische Bildstabilisierung der DV300F sorgt zuverl\u00e4ssig f\u00fcr verwacklungsfreie Bilder in hoher Qualit\u00e4t. Ob unter schwachen Lichtbedingungen, beim Zoomen oder unruhiger Hand \u2013 gestochen scharfe Bilder gelingen ganz einfach per Knopfdruck.\\n\\n<b>Brillanter Monitor<\/b>\\n\\nDas gro\u00dfz\u00fcgige, 7,6 cm messende hVGA-LCD bietet eine ungetr\u00fcbte Sicht aufs Motiv: Eine Aufl\u00f6sung von 460.000 Bildpunkten sorgt f\u00fcr eine verbesserte Kontrast- und Farbdarstellung, Motive werden heller und detailreicher dargestellt."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The DV300F captures and conveniently shares images worthy of showing. Use the 1.5\" LCD on the front of the camera to line up the perfect shot of you and your friends, and then upload them to Facebook\u2122, Picasa\u2122, Photobucket\u2122 directly from the camera. Send your images directly to your smartphone and tablet using Samsung Mobile Link or manage them with your PC using Auto backup. Fun features such as Motion Photo, Picture in Picture and Split Shot let you create and share fun, artful images and videos in a snap.\\n\\n<b>Capture yourself in one shot<\/b>\\n<b>Dual LCD (1.5\" Front LCD)<\/b>\\n\\nThe DV300F features a front LCD that makes taking group and other tricky self-portraits a snap. Play Children Mode animation to hold a kid still; let the group know just when to smile with Self Timer\u2019s visual countdown. Be part of every image with the front LCD, preview self-portraits, then click, and effortlessly get perfect pictures with you in the middle of the action. With Jump Shot 2.0, quickly shoot images of your friends jumping around, and then create fun GIF animations.\\n\\n<b>Instant Sharing & Saving, simply<\/b>\\n<b>Wi-Fi Connectivity<\/b>\\n\\nWith Built-in Wi-Fi capability, you can share any special moment and exciting moment on the move. Send photos by uploading to Facebook\u2122, Picasa\u2122, Photobucket\u2122 or email directly from the camera. You can also upload videos to YouTube then sit back to wait for the raves. The DV300F lets you upload photos to cloud service so never worried about losing the pictures while on the go or losing chance with limited memory size. Samsung Mobile Link allows you to directly send your images to your smartphone and tablet. You can also save the images to your PC by just one click with Auto Backup. No more searching for the cable, it is that easy.\\n\\n<b>Add action to your still photos<\/b>\\n<b>Motion Photo<\/b>\\n\\nWith Motion Photo, you can freeze time around a moving subject to create enchanting images. Capture a friend dancing while everyone else around him is still as a statue \u2014 just like in a Hollywood blockbuster. Simply shoot the footage then select the area where you want action \u2014 the photo around it will freeze. It\u2019s that easy.\\n\\n<b>Closer, wider, brighter<\/b>\\n<b>5X Zoom \/ F2.5 25mm Lens \/ 16.1 Mega Pixels<\/b>\\n\\nWhen you\u2019re taking pictures at a performance, make every seat the best seat in the house. The 5x optical zoom gives you great close-ups, even from the back row. Up front? The 25mm wide-angle lens captures all the action on stage. And the combination of 16.1 megapixels and F2.5 lens give you high quality images \u2014 even in dim lights.\\n\\n<b>Classic design with modern touch<\/b>\\n<b>Design<\/b>\\n\\nWith the modern design of the dual LCD screens, the front LCD is neatly hidden leaving much room for style. The front catches your subject\u2019s eye with its shimmering metallic colour, while the point colour leather grip pattern of the back provides a pleasing contrast. With its sleek, seamless body and rounded design, the camera feels as good in your hand as it feels great to have handy.\\n\\n<b>The simple way to go pro<\/b>\\n<b>Smart Auto 2.0<\/b>\\n\\nWhether you\u2019re capturing under bright conditions and cannot see the subject\u2019s face, use the backlight mode and get a clearer picture using Smart Auto 2.0 (Still & Movie). Get the best possible result every time. Scene detection technology identifies up to 16 different shooting conditions, instantly analyses key elements of your composition, and then automatically adjusts to optimise settings for every individual situation.\\n\\n<b>Videos and photos, together at last<\/b>\\n<b>Picture in Picture (Still \/ Movie)<\/b>\\n\\nPicture in Picture (Still \/ Movie) lets you show off two images at the same time. Simply insert one picture within another, and then adjust its size and position. You can even add a video clip to one of your still photos. Done? Instantly upload the moments to YouTube or your favourite social network to share with the rest of the world.\\n\\n<b>Funny Face brings you larger-than-life smiles<\/b>\\n<b>Funny Face<\/b>\\n\\nGive friends and family members goofy grins, comical noses and crazy eyes \u2013Funny Face comes with 8 modes \u2014 including Professor, Gobbler and Alien \u2014 that let you hilariously alter faces, right on the display. And with Face Tracking, funny faces stay the way you want, even when you move the camera.\\n\\n<b>Frame your pictures in fun<\/b>\\n<b>Magic Frame<\/b>\\n\\nTurn a portrait into an old film still, or put a friend\u2019s face on a billboard. Magic Frame comes with 12 background templates such as Wall Art, Full Moon, Magazine and Holiday that let you easily create poster-quality art that\u2019s perfect for sharing\\n\\n<b>Turn life into an art<\/b>\\n<b>Artistic Brush<\/b>\\n\\nArtistic Brush is a fun, new feature that draws on your life. Literally. It can take any portrait, landscape or candid and turn it into a black and white sketch \u2014 then colours in the picture as an artist would! Show off The Artist at Work animation on the camera\u2019s LCD to your friends and family.\\n\\n<b>Combine images for unique creations<\/b>\\n<b>Split Shot<\/b>\\n\\nWith Split Shot, you can merge up to three different images to create an artistic statement \u2013 turn yourself into a centaur by combining a self-portrait with a picture of a horse. Or simply take one image and run it through three different filters to produce an evocative collage. Let your imagination loose and enjoy fun, energetic, even ethereal results.\\n\\n<b>OIS (Optical Image Stabilisation)<\/b>\\n\\nThe DV300F\u2019s Optical Image Stabilisation (OIS) gives you perfect pictures, even if you\u2019re not perfectly still. Whether you\u2019re in a low light situation, zooming into a shot, or have a momentary case of shaky hands, your photos come out sharp and clear.\\n\\n<b>3.0\u201d hVGA LCD<\/b>\\n\\nThe large 3.0\" hVGA LCD display makes it easier to see just what you\u2019re shooting\u2014 no second-guessing your shot. And with a substantial 460k dots \u2014 about twice that of QVGA, the high-resolution display also provides improved contrast and colour reproduction. What you see looks as perfect as what you\u2019ll capture."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le nouveau Samsung Smart Camera DV300F vous permet de capturer de belles images et de les partager rapidement. Avec son \u00e9cran LCD 1.5'' \u00e0 l\u2019avant, prenez vous en photo facilement seul ou avec vos amis et partagez vos clich\u00e9s ensuite sur Facebook, Picasa ou encore Photobucket directement depuis votre Smart Camera. Transf\u00e9rez vos photos sur votre smartphone ou votre tablette avec l\u2019application Mobile Link ou sur votre PC en une seule touche gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Sauvegarde auto sur PC. Votre Smart Camera DV300F int\u00e8gre de nombreuses applications amusantes comme Picture in Picture, photo en mouvement ou prise de vue fractionn\u00e9e pour lib\u00e9rer votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 et la partager.\\n\\n<b>Trouvez le bon cadre du premier coup<\/b>\\n<b>Double \u00e9cran (\u00e9cran avant 1.5'' LCD)<\/b>\\n\\nLa Samsung Smart Camera DV300F embarque un \u00e9cran LCD avant qui vous facilitera la vie pour tous les types d\u2019autoportraits. Activez le mode Enfant pour captiver l\u2019attention de votre prog\u00e9niture, prenez la pose tous ensemble pour une photo r\u00e9ussie gr\u00e2ce au compte \u00e0 rebours qui s\u2019affiche sur l\u2019\u00e9cran avant et cadrez vos autoportraits pour un rendu impeccable. Avec le mode Saut 2.0, prenez plusieurs photos de vos amis en train de sauter et cr\u00e9ez des animations GIF amusantes.\\n\\n<b>Partagez et sauvegardez en toute simplicit\u00e9!<\/b>\\n<b>SmartCamera: Technologie Wi-Fi embarqu\u00e9e<\/b>\\n\\nAvec la technologie Wi-Fi du DV300F, vous pouvez \u00e0 tout moment partager vos moments favoris. Mettez en ligne vos photos sur Facebook, Picasa, Photobucket ou encore via un e-mail et vos vid\u00e9os sur Youtube directement depuis votre Samsung SmartCamera. Si vous avez peur de ne plus avoir de place sur votre carte m\u00e9moire, votre WB150F se charge de cela en sauvegardant vos fichiers directement sur une plateforme \u00ab Cloud \u00bb pour ne plus jamais perdre vos souvenirs. Une fois rentr\u00e9 chez vous et gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019option sauvegarde automatique, votre SmartCamera t\u00e9l\u00e9charge automatiquement vos fichiers sur votre PC. Enfin, profitez pleinement sur un \u00e9cran \u00e0 la taille de vos exploits gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connexion directe sur votre TV!\\n\\n<b>Ajoutez de l\u2019action \u00e0 vos photos<\/b>\\n<b>Photo en mouvement<\/b>\\n\\nAvec le mode Photo en mouvement, vous pouvez figer le temps autour d\u2019un sujet pr\u00e9cis pour cr\u00e9er un effet inattendu \u00e0 vos photos. Vous pourrez alors filmer un proche en train de danser alors que l\u2019environnement semblera figer autour, tout comme dans un film hollywoodien. Filmez simplement la sc\u00e8ne puis s\u00e9lectionner la partie \u00e0 conserver et ce qu\u2019il y a autour se figera. C\u2019est aussi simple que \u00e7a!\\n\\n<b>Des photos lumineuses et claires en toutes circonstances<\/b>\\n<b>Zoom 5x \/ Ouverture f2.5 25 mm \/ 16.1 Millions de pixels<\/b>\\n\\nQuand vous prenez une photo, elle doit d\u2019\u00eatre la plus belle quel que soit l\u2019endroit o\u00f9 vous la prenez. Le zoom optique 5x vous rapprochera de votre sujet quand le grand angle 25 mm vous permettra de ne pas reculer. Combinez le tout \u00e0 un capteur 16.1 Millions de pixels et \u00e0 une ouverture lumineuse f2.5 et vous obtiendrez tous les \u00e9l\u00e9ments pour r\u00e9aliser de belles photos en toutes circonstances.\\n\\n<b>Sobri\u00e9t\u00e9 et Modernit\u00e9<\/b>\\n<b>Design<\/b>\\n\\nCe double \u00e9cran aux courbes modernes ne laisse pas transparaitre l\u2019\u00e9cran avant quand celui-ci est \u00e9teint pour garder un design \u00e9pur\u00e9. L\u2019avant du nouveau Samsung Smart Camera DV300F est compos\u00e9 d\u2019un m\u00e9tal bross\u00e9 alors que l\u2019arri\u00e8re de mati\u00e8re plus brute ajoute un contraste int\u00e9ressant. Sa forme fine aux angles arrondis procure un confort de prise en main incomparable!\\n\\n<b>Un pont vers le professionalisme<\/b>\\n<b>Reconnaissance automatique des modes sc\u00e8nes 2.0<\/b>\\n\\nDans n\u2019importe quelle condition, la Reconnaissance automatique des Modes Sc\u00e8ne 2.0 (Photo et vid\u00e9o) analyse instantan\u00e9ment les \u00e9l\u00e9ments cl\u00e9s de votre composition et proc\u00e8de ensuite \u00e0 un r\u00e9glage automatique pour capturer le clich\u00e9 parfait, parmi une multitude de modes de prise de vue et de films diff\u00e9rents (16 modes photo et 4 modes vid\u00e9o). Et comme la vie est en mouvement permanent, le suivi des objets automatique ne sera pas de trop pour saisir tous vos proches, m\u00eame ceux qui ne restent pas en place.\\n\\n<b>Donnez vie \u00e0 vos photos<\/b>\\n<b>Picture in Picture (Photo \/ Vid\u00e9o)<\/b>\\n\\nCe nouveau mode Picture in Picture vous laisse composer deux images ensemble. La manipulation est tr\u00e8s simple, il suffit de s\u00e9lectionner une image \u00e0 ins\u00e9rer dans une autre et de l\u2019adapter \u00e0 la taille que l\u2019on a choisie. Vous pouvez m\u00eame ajouter des vid\u00e9os sur vos photos. Une fois fait, n\u2019h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 partager votre cr\u00e9ation avec vos amis sur Youtube!\\n\\n<b>Riez aux \u00e9clats<\/b>\\n<b>Mode Grimace<\/b>\\n\\nPourquoi faire des grimaces quand votre Samsung Smart Camera DV300F peut les reproduire pour vous! Ce mode vous permet d\u2019\u00e9tirer, plaquer ou plier le visage de vos proches pour un rendu hilarant. M\u00eame en mouvement, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la d\u00e9tection de visage, l\u2019effet sera garanti que ce soit sur l\u2019image ou aupr\u00e8s de vos proches!\\n\\n<b>Des cadres pour des photos d\u00e9cal\u00e9es<\/b>\\n<b>Mode Cadre magique<\/b>\\n\\nIns\u00e9rez votre photo dans une atmosph\u00e8re de vieux film ou int\u00e9grez le visage d\u2019un proche sur la couverture d\u2019un journal. Le mode Cadre magique et ses 12 arri\u00e8res plans originaux vous permet d\u2019\u00e9laborer des cr\u00e9ations amusantes pour vous et votre entourage.\\n\\n<b>La photo est un art<\/b>\\n<b>Pinceau artistique<\/b>\\n\\nLe pinceau artistique est un mode amusant qui donne une touche artistique \u00e0 vos clich\u00e9s. Vous pourrez vraiment prendre n\u2019importe quel type de clich\u00e9 et le transformer en \u0153uvre d\u2019art. Prenez en photo par exemple votre chien et cette application en fera d\u2019abord le croquis puis rajoutera les couleurs comme un v\u00e9ritable peintre! Visionnez \u00e0 volont\u00e9 cette vid\u00e9o sur votre \u00e9cran LCD et faites parler l\u2019artiste qui est en vous!\\n\\n<b>Des combinaisons uniques pour des photos magiques<\/b>\\n<b>Prise de vue fractionn\u00e9e<\/b>\\n\\nLa fonction Prise de vue fractionn\u00e9e vous permet de combiner jusqu\u2019\u00e0 3 photos ensemble pour un rendu \u00e9patant. Transformez vous en centaure en combinant le corps d\u2019un cheval et en y ajoutant votre buste ou simplement prenez le m\u00eame clich\u00e9 avec une un angle diff\u00e9rent pour cr\u00e9er un collage unique. Faites parler le cr\u00e9atif qui est en vous car les possibilit\u00e9s de cette application sont sans limites!"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4d3e24ec-8382-43c4-809f-3d62728aade5","identifier":"12462013","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung ST ST200F"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Share unforgettable scenes in Full HD<\/b>\\nWhether filming at the carnival in Rio de Janeiro or from a vantage point at the top the world\u2019s highest buildings, Samsung Long zoom cameras mean you can film and share your travel memories in HD. The WB850F captures awesome detail in 1080 \/ 25p Full HD and 1080 \/ 50i for spectacular scenery shots whilst the WB150F and ST200F also feature fantastic 720 \/ 25p HD capture ensuring that once-in-a-lifetime experiences can be captured in all the colour and vibrancy that you experienced them in.\\n\\n<b>Make any picture come to life with Motion Photo<\/b>\\nBe the only person walking through a crowd of statues, see a solitary tree bending in the breeze \u2013 with Motion Photo you can make one element of a normal photograph come to life and keep moving while the rest of the frame stays still. With the ST200F, edit your photo instantly and use Wi-Fi to share it immediately without the need for a computer.\\n\\n<b>Making it easy to get the best shot<\/b>\\nWith the new travel zoom cameras, it\u2019s up to you how you get the best shot. On the WB850F and WB150F you can explore your own photographic skills with Full Manual Control, also taking advantage of the OIS (available on all models - WB850F, WB150F, and ST200F) Alternatively, Smart Auto, also available on all the new models, identifies and automatically selects the most appropriate of its scene modes to provide you with the best possible result every time. From a fireworks display to a dimly-lit party, scene detection technology identifies the shooting conditions and automatically tailors the settings to help achieve the best results.\\n\\n<b>Live Panorama to get everyone in the shot!<\/b>\\nLive Panorama, featured on the WB850F, WB150F and ST200F, allows you to capture even more of the action, facilitating wide panoramic shots which don\u2019t miss any of the detail, from sprawling mountain peaks through to large groups of friends. The function allows the easy capture of large scenes by simply holding down the shutter button and sweeping the camera across. Users can even preview the whole scene they\u2019ve just captured via the LCD screen.\\n\\n<b>Fun features to add a twist to your travels<\/b>\\nWhy not add some more fun to your travels by getting creative with your photographs? With Split Shot you can divide the screen into three separate shots and create up to three different photographs simply blending them together to create a whole new view of your travels. Using Magic Frame you can also position your target in the middle of a fun background \u2013 either choose from one of the many pre-designed backgrounds like movie billboards or posters or erase part of an existing picture to be even more creative! Or use the Picture in Picture feature whichallows you to insert your photosinto another image so you can combine your favourite shots and make a memorable collage. Finally, with the Funny Face feature you can bend, stretch and warp your friends and family to create hilarious pictures and when you move the camera, Face Tracking preserves the funny looks you\u2019ve added just the way you want them."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Appareil photo Samsung SMART ST200F<\/b>\\n<b>Zoom et partage intelligents<\/b>\\nUn zoom optique puissant et une connexion Wi-Fi, le tout dans un bo\u00eetier fin et styl\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques du produit<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Un zoom puissant pour un appareil tr\u00e8s fin<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Un zoom 10x qui prend peu de place<\/b>\\nLe ST200F est la preuve qu\u2019un appareil dot\u00e9 d\u2019un zoom longue port\u00e9e puissant n'a pas besoin d'\u00eatre encombrant. Cet appareil comporte en effet un zoom longue port\u00e9e 10x qui vous aide \u00e0 r\u00e9aliser des photos parfaitement nettes, m\u00eame de loin. Avec seulement 18,9 mm, le ST200F se glisse facilement dans toutes les poches. Vous pouvez donc voyager l\u00e9ger, o\u00f9 que vous alliez, et obtenir des gros plans parfaits sans avoir \u00e0 tra\u00eener des appareils encombrants.\\n\\n<b>Partagez et sauvegardez vite et bien<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi<\/b>\\nLa connexion Wi-Fi int\u00e9gr\u00e9e vous permet de partager les instants pr\u00e9cieux en un clin d\u2019\u0153il. Envoyez des photos en les chargeant sur Facebook\u2122, Picasa\u2122, Photobucket\u2122, ou envoyez-les directement par e-mail depuis l\u2019appareil photo. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement charger des vid\u00e9os sur YouTube puis attendre tranquillement les r\u00e9actions. Le ST200F vous permet \u00e9galement de charger vos photos vers des services cloud afin que vous n'ayez plus \u00e0 vous inqui\u00e9ter de perdre vos photos lorsque vous \u00eates en d\u00e9placement ou d'avoir \u00e0 renoncer \u00e0 des souvenirs \u00e0 cause d\u2019une m\u00e9moire limit\u00e9e. Samsung Mobile Link vous permet d\u2019envoyer directement vos images vers votre smartphone et votre tablette. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement sauvegarder les images sur votre PC simplement en cliquant sur la fonction de sauvegarde automatique. C\u2019est tellement facile que vous n\u2019avez m\u00eame plus besoin d\u2019aller chercher un c\u00e2ble.\\n\\n<b>Ajoutez de l\u2019action \u00e0 vos photos.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Motion Photo<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Motion Photo, vous pouvez figer le temps autour d\u2019un sujet en mouvement afin de cr\u00e9er des images admirables. Capturez un ami en train de danser tandis que tous ceux qui l\u2019entourent restent de marbre, comme dans une superproduction hollywoodienne.. Il vous suffit de capturer la prise de vue et de s\u00e9lectionner la zone dans laquelle vous souhaitez que l\u2019action apparaisse. Ensuite, la photo autour d\u2019elle se figera. Ce n\u2019est pas plus compliqu\u00e9 que cela.\\n\\nSamsung pr\u00e9sente un appareil photo num\u00e9rique \u00e9poustouflant aux allures d\u2019accessoire de mode : l\u2019appareil photo ST200F au design fin et styl\u00e9, avec zoom 10x. Son zoom optique longue port\u00e9e am\u00e9lior\u00e9, ses 16,1 MP et son objectif grand angle 27 mm vous aident \u00e0 r\u00e9aliser des photos incroyables. De plus, des innovations artistiques telles que Motion Photo et Live Panorama vous permette d'explorer de nouvelles dimensions cr\u00e9atrices. Avec la fonction Wi-Fi, vous pouvez en outre poster imm\u00e9diatement vos meilleurs clich\u00e9s sur vos r\u00e9seaux sociaux pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s.\\n\\n<b>Un zoom puissant pour un appareil tr\u00e8s fin<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Un zoom 10x qui prend peu de place<\/b>\\nLe ST200F est la preuve qu\u2019un appareil dot\u00e9 d\u2019un zoom longue port\u00e9e puissant n'a pas besoin d'\u00eatre encombrant. Cet appareil comporte en effet un zoom longue port\u00e9e 10x qui vous aide \u00e0 r\u00e9aliser des photos parfaitement nettes, m\u00eame de loin. Avec seulement 18,9 mm, le ST200F se glisse facilement dans toutes les poches. Vous pouvez donc voyager l\u00e9ger, o\u00f9 que vous alliez, et obtenir des gros plans parfaits sans avoir \u00e0 tra\u00eener des appareils encombrants.\\n\\n<b>Partagez et sauvegardez vite et bien<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi<\/b>\\nLa connexion Wi-Fi int\u00e9gr\u00e9e vous permet de partager les instants pr\u00e9cieux en un clin d\u2019\u0153il. Envoyez des photos en les chargeant sur Facebook\u2122, Picasa\u2122, Photobucket\u2122, ou envoyez-les directement par e-mail depuis l\u2019appareil photo. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement charger des vid\u00e9os sur YouTube puis attendre tranquillement les r\u00e9actions. Le ST200F vous permet \u00e9galement de charger vos photos vers des services cloud afin que vous n'ayez plus \u00e0 vous inqui\u00e9ter de perdre vos photos lorsque vous \u00eates en d\u00e9placement ou d'avoir \u00e0 renoncer \u00e0 des souvenirs \u00e0 cause d\u2019une m\u00e9moire limit\u00e9e. Samsung Mobile Link vous permet d\u2019envoyer directement vos images vers votre smartphone et votre tablette. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement sauvegarder les images sur votre PC simplement en cliquant sur la fonction de sauvegarde automatique. C\u2019est tellement facile que vous n\u2019avez m\u00eame plus besoin d\u2019aller chercher un c\u00e2ble.\\n\\n<b>Ajoutez de l\u2019action \u00e0 vos photos.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Motion Photo<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Motion Photo, vous pouvez figer le temps autour d\u2019un sujet en mouvement afin de cr\u00e9er des images admirables. Capturez un ami en train de danser tandis que tous ceux qui l\u2019entourent restent de marbre, comme dans une superproduction hollywoodienne.. Il vous suffit de capturer la prise de vue et de s\u00e9lectionner la zone dans laquelle vous souhaitez que l\u2019action apparaisse. Ensuite, la photo autour d\u2019elle se figera. Ce n\u2019est pas plus compliqu\u00e9 que cela.\\n\\n<b>Affichez votre r\u00e9sultat.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Live Panorama<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Live Panorama, vous pouvez capture chaque sommet d\u2019une immense cha\u00eene de montagnes ou chaque gratte-ciel d\u2019un magnifique paysage urbain afin de cr\u00e9er des images panoramiques \u00e9poustouflantes \u00e0 180 \u00ba. De m\u00eame, vous pouvez avoir un aper\u00e7u de l'image sur l'\u00e9cran LCD avant m\u00eame de la capturer. Il suffit de maintenir le d\u00e9clencheur enfonc\u00e9 et de balayer la sc\u00e8ne pour voir le r\u00e9sultat avant de le capturer.\\n\\n<b>La mani\u00e8re la plus simple de devenir un pro<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto 2.0<\/b>\\nLorsque vous prenez des clich\u00e9s dans des conditions lumineuses et que vous ne parvenez pas \u00e0 voir le visage de votre sujet, utilisez le mode Backlight pour obtenir une image plus claire gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Smart Auto 2.0. Vous obtiendrez toujours le meilleur r\u00e9sultat possible. La technologie de d\u00e9tection de sc\u00e8ne est capable d\u2019identifier jusqu\u2019\u00e0 16 conditions de prise de vue diff\u00e9rentes, d\u2019analyser instantan\u00e9ment les \u00e9l\u00e9ments cl\u00e9s de votre composition et de se r\u00e9gler automatiquement pour optimiser les param\u00e8tres pour chaque situation particuli\u00e8re.\\n\\n<b>Un style classique avec une touche de modernit\u00e9<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Un look fin et styl\u00e9<\/b>\\nDe l\u2019allure moderne de son bo\u00eetier aux lignes pures et de son rev\u00eatement avant en m\u00e9tal brillant au style classique de sa poign\u00e9e moul\u00e9e et de son look cuir sur la partie arri\u00e8re, le ST200F a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7u pour capter le regard autant que vos sujets. Il est en outre disponible en quatre couleurs tendance, pour que vous soyez libre de choisir celui qui vous pla\u00eet le plus.\\n\\n<b>Enfin des vid\u00e9os et des photos simultan\u00e9ment<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Image dans l\u2019image (photo et vid\u00e9o)<\/b>\\nLa fonction image dans l\u2019image vous permet d\u2019afficher deux images simultan\u00e9ment. Il vous suffit d\u2019ins\u00e9rer une image dans une autre et de r\u00e9gler sa taille et sa position. Vous pouvez m\u00eame ajouter un clip vid\u00e9o \u00e0 l\u2019une de vos photos. C\u2019est fait ? T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez instantan\u00e9ment vos moments pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s sur YouTube ou votre r\u00e9seau social favori et partagez-les avec le reste du monde.\\n\\n<b>Funny Face vous permet d\u2019obtenir des sourires plus grands que nature.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Funny Face<\/b>\\nDonnez un sourire bizarre, des nez comiques et des yeux fous \u00e0 vos amis et aux membres de votre famille, ou d\u00e9formez leurs visages de la mani\u00e8re qui vous plaira simplement en glissant un doigt sur l\u2019\u00e9cran. La fonction Funny Face (visages comiques) vous propose 8 modes, y compris professeur, dindon et alien, qui vous permettent de modifier les visages de mani\u00e8re hilarante, et ce directement \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9cran. En outre, gr\u00e2ce au suivi du visage, les visages comiques restent comme vous le souhaitez, m\u00eame lorsque vous d\u00e9placez l\u2019appareil photo.\\n\\n<b>Mettez vos photos dans des cadres amusants.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Magic Frame<\/b>\\nTransformez un portrait en une image tir\u00e9e d\u2019un vieux film ou mettez le visage d\u2019un ami sur un panneau. Magic Frame vous propose 12 mod\u00e8les d\u2019arri\u00e8re-plan tels que art mural, pleine lune, magazine et vacances afin de cr\u00e9er des images de qualit\u00e9 poster id\u00e9ales pour le partage."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a23e44bd-cf0e-48b1-b11d-2413f4ec2193","identifier":"12462021","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung WB 850F"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The WB850F Samsung SMART Camera allows you to zoom in close, capture stunning photos using a 16MP BSI CMOS Sensor, and share them instantly with family and friends. Using the camera's built-in wireless functionality, you can upload high quality photos to social networking sites and seamlessly sync your camera to other SMART devices (TV, phone, tablet).\\n\\n<b>Your Best Photos Instantly Shared<\/b>\\n\\nInstantly send quality photos to social networks like Facebook or email them to a small group of people\u2014directly from the camera. Access your uploaded content on supported connected devices with Samsung\u2019s TV Link and MobileLink. Plus, you can store cool images and video directly from the camera to Microsoft Skydrive.\\n\\n<b>Remote Viewfinder<\/b>\\n\\nOperate your camera directly from your smartphone.\\n\\n<b>Smartphone Link<\/b>\\n\\nStore and access your camera photos on your phone or tablet.\\n\\n<b>Easier to Take, Store and Share Pictures<\/b>\\n\\nUse Auto Backup to transfer and store your photos on your PC with the touch of a button. Then, enjoy the ultimate picture and video slideshow on your home TV with TV Link.\\n\\n<b>Get the Best Shot from Far Away or Up Close<\/b>\\n\\nZoom in with the super long 21x optical zoom that puts you right in the action. Plus, the 16MP BSI CMS Sensor delivers brighter and clear images.\\n\\n<b>Full HD 1080p Movie Recording<\/b>\\n\\nShoot thousands of different angles with 1080p HD Movie Recording.\\n\\n<b>Dual Capture Mode<\/b>\\n\\nShoot in Full HD 1080p and capture photo simultaneously.\\n\\n<b>Intuitive Photo Editing Software Right from the Camera<\/b>\\n\\nCreate 1080p movie clips with your photos using Creative Movie Maker (CMOS Models only). You can even use the Artistic Brush feature to have the camera instantly draw the photo you've just captured.\\n\\n<b>Magic Frame<\/b>\\n\\nChoose from 12 different background templates that lets you edit a portrait to look like an antique wall art and other fun effects.\\n\\n<b>Funny Face<\/b>\\n\\nCreatively bend, stretch and warp your friend faces.\\n\\n<b>Live Panorama<\/b>\\n\\nAim, hold the shutter button down, and pan to capture the perfect scene with everyone in it."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Facile \u00e0 transporter, il embarque un tr\u00e8s grand zoom 21x et un ultra grand angle 23 mm pour une capture sans concessions ! Avec sa technologie Wi-Fi int\u00e9gr\u00e9e, capturez et partagez sans attendre avec vos proches. Enfin, le nouveau Samsung Smart Camera WB850F est \u00e9quip\u00e9 d\u2019un GPS qui ravira tous les globes trotteurs. Avec le WB850F, passez enfin la vitesse sup\u00e9rieure !\\n<br\/><b>R\u00e9volutionnez le photographe qui est en vous<\/b>\\n<br\/><b>Zoom optique 21x, Ultra Grand Angle 23 mm<\/b>\\nAvec le nouveau Samsung Smart Camera WB850F, capturez ce que vous voulez. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son tr\u00e8s grand zoom optique 21x et son ultra grand angle 23 mm, saisissez le plus petit des d\u00e9tails d\u2019un paysage ou \u00e0 l\u2019inverse sa globalit\u00e9 en toute simplicit\u00e9. Cadrez parfaitement \u00e0 tout moment ! \\n<br\/><b>Partagez et sauvegardez en toute simplicit\u00e9!<\/b>\\n<br\/><b>SmartCamera :Technologie Wi-Fi embarqu\u00e9e<\/b>\\nAvec la technologie Wi-Fi du WB850F, vous pouvez \u00e0 tout moment partager vos moments favoris. Mettez en ligne vos photos sur Facebook, Picasa, Photobucket ou encore via un e-mail et vos vid\u00e9os sur Youtube directement depuis votre Samsung SmartCamera. Si vous avez peur de ne plus avoir de place sur votre carte m\u00e9moire, votre WB850F se charge de cela en sauvegardant vos fichiers directement sur une plateforme \u00ab Cloud \u00bb pour ne plus jamais perdre vos souvenirs. Une fois rentr\u00e9 chez vous et gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019option sauvegarde automatique, votre SmartCamera t\u00e9l\u00e9charge automatiquement vos fichiers sur votre PC. Enfin, profitez pleinement sur un \u00e9cran \u00e0 la taille de vos exploits gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connexion directe sur votre SmartTV !\\n<br\/><b>GPS int\u00e9gr\u00e9: Rep\u00e9rez, photographiez<\/b>\\n<br\/><b>GPS (Point de rep\u00e8re en direct)<\/b>\\nVos voyages prendront une nouvelle dimension avec la fonctionnalit\u00e9 GPS int\u00e9gr\u00e9 du nouveau Samsung Smart Camera WB850F. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 sa technologie de r\u00e9alit\u00e9 augment\u00e9e, l\u2019application Point de rep\u00e8re en direct vous donne des informations sur les monuments qui se trouveront en face de vous. Les applications MapView et Boussole \u00e9lectronique vous permettront de trouver facilement n\u2019importe quel endroit d\u2019une ville et d\u2019y acc\u00e9der facilement. Enfin pour g\u00e9o-tagguer une photo, utilisez l\u2019application Carte Photo et retrouvez l\u2019endroit pr\u00e9cis ou vous avez pris votre photo.\\n<br\/><b>Un rendu \u00e9clatant \u00e0 chaque prise<\/b>\\n<br\/><b>Capteur CMOS BSI 16.2 Mp<\/b>\\nLa tour Eiffel qui s\u2019illumine ou un lev\u00e9 de soleil sur les Calanques \u2026 ces moments m\u00e9ritent un rendu photographique irr\u00e9prochable, Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son capteur CMOS BSI 16.2 Mp, le nouveau Samsung Smart Camera WB850F offre la possibilit\u00e9 de r\u00e9ussir \u00e0 coup sur des photos nettes et \u00e9clatantes de couleurs, \u00e0 tous les coups. Contrairement \u00e0 un capteur CCD ou \u00e0 un CMOS classique, le capteur 16.2 Mp CMOS haute sensibilit\u00e9 du WB850F capte plus de lumi\u00e8re et ainsi vous offre de belles photos dans toutes les conditions de lumi\u00e8re.\\n<br\/><b>Exposez vous aux vrais couleurs<\/b>\\n<br\/><b>Ecran 3\" AMOLED (VGA)<\/b>\\nSi vous \u00eates en train de faire des photos en plein soleil, l\u2019\u00e9cran de votre appareil photo est souvent illisible. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son \u00e9cran AMOLED (921 000 pixels) 7.6 cm (3\"), les couleurs sont plus vives et les noirs beaucoup plus profonds que sur un \u00e9cran LCD classique, pour une parfaite visibilit\u00e9 de ce que vous cadrez, m\u00eame avec le soleil au z\u00e9nith."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":21}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4e4f75cf-6f7d-4b12-9b9c-c2935187b8fb","identifier":"12465065","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lg","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG E2211PB-BN"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Go wide with the LG E11 series WIDESCREEN LCD monitors. Designed with a remarkable 5M:1 Digital Fine Contrast, 5ms response and 16.7 million colors, images are rendered with striking effect while text comes through sharp. It has a tilt and height adjustable stand while the pivot function allows you to rotate from landscape to portrait modes. From web browsing to desktop publishing, the E11 series can enhance productivity in professional environments. It also comes with Super Energy Saving function to reduce power consumption."}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f477ceba-c07e-4fd7-92f8-f7ae0825bd16","identifier":"12468511","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"b\/e\/5\/8\/be58569163b1a850aa85b0e26b1cd203ce437050_12468511_Philips.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/b\/e\/5\/8\/be58569163b1a850aa85b0e26b1cd203ce437050_12468511_Philips.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4MUS16KF"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Hervorragendes Sounderlebnis<\/b>\\n<b>Selbst in sehr lauten Umgebungen<\/b>\\nTanzen Sie zu Musik, die noch nie besser klang. Der GoGEAR Muse MP4-Player verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber FullSound\\nf\u00fcr au\u00dferordentliche Klarheit, SafeSound f\u00fcr H\u00f6rgenuss ohne die Gefahr von H\u00f6rsch\u00e4den, einen\\nkapazitiven 7,1 cm (2,8\") Touchscreen f\u00fcr eine einfache Bedienung sowie Surround Sound f\u00fcr Filme mit\\nbreiterem Raumklang.\\n\\n<b>Hervorragende Soundqualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\n- FullSoundTM erweckt Ihre MP3-Musik zum Leben\\n- Ger\u00e4uschisolierende Kopfh\u00f6rer f\u00fcr minimale Umgebungsger\u00e4usche\\n- SafeSound f\u00fcr maximalen Musikgenuss ohne H\u00f6rsch\u00e4den\\n\\n<b>Bereichert Ihr Leben<\/b>\\n- Kapazitiver 7 cm QVGA-Touchscreen zur m\u00fchelosen Navigation\\n- microSD-Kartensteckplatz f\u00fcr erweiterten Speicherplatz\\n- Genie\u00dfen Sie bis zu 26 Stunden Musik- oder 5 Stunden Videowiedergabe\\n- UKW-Radio mit RDS und 20 Programmspeicherpl\u00e4tzen f\u00fcr weitere Musikoptionen\\n\\n<b>Einfach und intuitiv<\/b>\\n- Soundpersonalisierung f\u00fcr eine individuelle Gestaltung Ihrer Musik\\n- Philips Songbird \u2013 ganz einfach entdecken, wiedergeben und synchronisieren!\\n- LikeMusic f\u00fcr die Erstellung von Wiedergabelisten aus Titeln, die sehr gut zusammenpassen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Superior sound experience<\/b>\\n<b>Even in the noisiest settings<\/b>\\nDance to music that never sounded better. GoGEAR Muse MP4 player features\\nFullSound for exceptional clarity, SafeSound for damage-free listening, a 2.8\" capacitive\\ntouchscreen for ease of use and Surround for movies for broader sound.\\n\\n<b>Superb quality sound<\/b>\\n- FullSoundTM to bring your MP3 music to life\\n- Sound Isolation headphones to minimise environmental noise\\n- SafeSound for maximum music enjoyment without hearing damage\\n\\n<b>Complements your life<\/b>\\n- 2.8\" QVGA capacitive touchscreen for effortless navigation\\n- microSD card slot for expanded memory capacity\\n- Enjoy up to 26 hours of music or 5 hours of video playback\\n- FM radio with RDS and 20 presets for more music options\\n\\n<b>Easy and intuitive<\/b>\\n- Sound personalisation for fun customisation of your music\\n- Philips Songbird: one simple program to discover, play, sync\\n- LikeMusic for playlists of songs that sound great together"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Des performances sonores sup\u00e9rieures<\/b>\\n<b>M\u00eame dans des environnements bruyants<\/b>\\nDansez sur une musique d'une qualit\u00e9 sonore in\u00e9gal\u00e9e. Le baladeur MP4 GoGEAR Muse est dot\u00e9\\ndes technologies FullSound pour une clart\u00e9 exceptionnelle et SafeSound pour une ou\u00efe pr\u00e9serv\u00e9e.\\nSon \u00e9cran tactile de 2,8\" est tr\u00e8s simple \u00e0 utiliser et le son Surround est id\u00e9al pour les films.\\n\\n<b>Une qualit\u00e9 de son exceptionnelle<\/b>\\n- FullSoundTM pour donner vie \u00e0 vos fichiers musicaux MP3\\n- \u00c9couteurs intra-auriculaires \u00e0 isolation phonique pour r\u00e9duire le bruit environnant\\n- SafeSound pour un plaisir d'\u00e9coute absolu, en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9\\n\\n<b>Plus de divertissement dans votre vie<\/b>\\n- \u00c9cran tactile capacitatif QVGA 2,8\", pour une navigation sans effort\\n- Logement pour carte Micro SD, pour une capacit\u00e9 de stockage accrue\\n- Profitez de 26 heures de musique ou de 5 heures de vid\u00e9o\\n- Radio FM avec RDS et 20 pr\u00e9s\u00e9lections pour un plus grand choix de musique\\n\\n<b>Simple et intuitif<\/b>\\n- Sound Personalization pour personnaliser votre musique\\n- Philips Songbird ; un seul logiciel pour d\u00e9couvrir, lire et synchroniser !\\n- LikeMusic pour des playlists homog\u00e8nes"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d7d3ed12-5b51-4673-8ba9-dd30f4abc64f","identifier":"12473010","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2\/6\/1\/5\/26155b3ea5166205e01315b7562d19424a7ac4be_12473010_Sony.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/2\/6\/1\/5\/26155b3ea5166205e01315b7562d19424a7ac4be_12473010_Sony.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony Walkman NWZ-B173F"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"WALKMAN\u00ae mit farbenfroh blinkender LED<br\/>\\n<br\/>Drehen Sie den Bass auf: Holen Sie sich satte Beats per Knopfdruck ... auch bei geringer Lautst\u00e4rke..<br\/>\\nSchnelles Aufladen: WALKMAN\u00ae 3 Minuten lang einstecken f\u00fcr 90 Minuten Wiedergabe; bei Komplettladung bis zu 18 Stunden Musikwiedergabe.<br\/>\\nModerner Clip: Zeigen Sie allen Ihren bunten WALKMAN\u00ae der B-Serie. Bringen Sie ihn an Ihrer Kleidung, einer Tasche, einem G\u00fcrtel oder Ihrer Jackentasche an, und werden Sie zum Trendsetter..<br\/>\\nBlinkendes LED-Display: Eine farbliche passende LED leuchtet zum Takt der Musik.<br\/>\\nEinfaches \u00dcbertragen: \u00dcbertragen Sie per Drag & Drop mp3-Titel von jedem beliebigen PC auf Ihren WALKMAN\u00ae..<br\/>\\nDirekter USB-Anschluss: Schlie\u00dfen Sie Ihren WALKMAN\u00ae zur einfachen Wiedergabe per USB an eine kompatible HiFi-Anlage oder ein Autoradio an, und profitieren Sie von PC-\u00dcbertragungen ganz ohne Kabel..<br\/>\\nUKW-Radio: Empfang Ihrer Lieblingssendungen mit 30 Senderspeichern.<br\/>\\nSprachaufzeichnung: Aufnehmen, Wiedergeben und Teilen von Radio- oder Sprachaufzeichnungen; drei Aufnahmequalit\u00e4ten anhand der Bitrates w\u00e4hlbar.<br\/>\\nZAPPIN\u2122: Bet\u00e4tigen Sie die ZAP-Taste, um auf der Suche nach dem perfekten Song, alle Titel kurz anzuspielen..<br\/>\\nEqualizer: Optimieren Sie Ihr H\u00f6rvergn\u00fcgen durch zahlreiche Equalizer-Voreinstellungen f\u00fcr jeden Titel..<br\/>\\nJog Dial\u2122: Gro\u00dfes Drehrad f\u00fcr leichte Steuerung unterwegs.<br\/>\\nLeicht, kompakt und handlich: Mit einem Gewicht von nur 28 g und einer L\u00e4nge von 89,2 mm eignet sich das Ger\u00e4t auch f\u00fcr die kleinste Jackentasche besonders gut.<br\/>\\n4-GB-Speicher: Speichert ca. 970 Songs (viermin\u00fctige Songs im mp3-Format bei 128 Kbit\/s).<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>4GB B Series MP3 WALKMAN<\/b>\\nFeel the bass and dance to the beat with the new generation of B series players, NWZ-B170F series. It features new ZAPPIN\u2122 function, built-in USB for easy drag & drop of music files, bass enhancement, colour matching power illuminator and Quick Charge Technology.\\n\\n- 4GB capacity\\n- New ZAPPIN\u2122 Function allows you to find songs easily, and to listen to music in a new way\\n- Built-in USB for easy drag and drop transfer of content\\n- 18 Hours Battery Life (Quick charge : 3 minutes charge 90 minutes play back)\\n- FM Tuner and Voice\/FM Recording Function\\n- Colour Matching Power Illuminator"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"WALKMAN\u00ae avec voyant color\u00e9 clignotant<br\/>\\n<br\/>Renforcez vos basses: Appuyez sur un bouton et obtenez des basses riches et puissantes, m\u00eame \u00e0 faible volume..<br\/>\\nChargement rapide: Branchez votre WALKMAN\u00ae pendant 3 minutes pour 90 minutes de lecture. Une charge compl\u00e8te pour jusqu'\u00e0 18 heures d'autonomie.<br\/>\\nClip tendance: Affichez votre WALKMAN\u00ae s\u00e9rie B tr\u00e8s color\u00e9\u00a0: fixez-le \u00e0 vos v\u00eatements, \u00e0 un sac, \u00e0 votre ceinture ou \u00e0 votre poche pour un look tendance.<br\/>\\nVoyant clignotant: Le voyant de couleur assortie clignote au rythme de votre musique.<br\/>\\nTransferts ais\u00e9s: Transf\u00e9rez vos fichiers musicaux mp3 vers votre WALKMAN\u00ae par simple glisser-d\u00e9poser depuis n'importe quel PC.<br\/>\\nConnexion USB directe: Connectez votre WALKMAN\u00ae \u00e0 une cha\u00eene hi-fi ou \u00e0 un autoradio st\u00e9r\u00e9o compatible \u00e0 l'aide du port USB pour une lecture facile\u00a0; profitez de transferts PC faciles sans c\u00e2ble.<br\/>\\nRadio FM: Connectez-vous \u00e0 vos \u00e9missions pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9es\u00a0; 30 stations pr\u00e9r\u00e9gl\u00e9es.<br\/>\\nEnregistrement vocal: Capturez, lisez et partagez des enregistrements radio ou vocaux\u00a0; choisissez l'un des trois d\u00e9bits binaires pour la qualit\u00e9 d'enregistrement.<br\/>\\nZAPPIN\u2122: Appuyez sur le bouton \u00ab\u00a0ZAP\u00a0\u00bb pour \u00e9couter un court extrait de chaque piste et vous aider \u00e0 choisir la chanson id\u00e9ale.<br\/>\\nEgaliseur: Affinez votre qualit\u00e9 d'\u00e9coute gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un choix de pr\u00e9r\u00e9glages d'\u00e9galiseur pour am\u00e9liorer chaque chanson.<br\/>\\nJog Dial\u2122: Grande interface pour un contr\u00f4le facile lors de vos d\u00e9placements.<br\/>\\nL\u00e9ger, compact et facile \u00e0 transporter: Adapt\u00e9 \u00e0 toutes les poches, m\u00eame les plus petites, il ne p\u00e8se que 28 g et mesure 89,2 mm de long.<br\/>\\nM\u00e9moire de 4 Go: Permet de stocker environ 970 chansons (chansons de 4 minutes enregistr\u00e9es au format mp3 \u00e0 128 Kbit\/s).<br\/>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"55a9937a-b3b8-4250-b284-d695b4c90063","identifier":"12477895","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","ricoh"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Ricoh Aficio SP 300DN"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Small, smart and speedy, the Aficio\u2122SP 300DN is ideal for any small office. Compact enough to fit unobtrusively on a desk, this B\/W A4 laser printer offers everything you need for everyday personal document production. Network-ready as standard, it is easy to operate and simple to maintain. And all this comes at an affordable price.\\n- Productive: 28 pages per minute.\\n- Easy operation.\\n- Standard networking and duplexing.\\n- Versatile printing.\\n- Attractive rounded two-tone styling."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-26T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eee68aef-45ec-4ca6-b690-11bc656d1f3d","identifier":"12480130","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix Z1000EXR"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fujifilm FinePix Z1000EXR: Stay connected in style<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Fujifilm\u2019s Z-series cameras have always combined the very latest in style with cutting-edge technology, and the new FinePix Z1000EXR is no exception.<\/b>\\n\\nThe camera\u2019s super-stylish exterior contains a premium 16 megapixel EXR-CMOS sensor and Fujifilm\u2019s latest imaging technologies for great results every time.\\n\\nIn addition, the FinePix Z1000EXR adds a Wireless Image Transfer function that allows users to connect their Android smartphone\/tablet or iPhone\/iPad with the camera and upload high-quality images to social networking sites in seconds.\\n\\n<b>Perfect pictures, every time<\/b>\\nThe FinePix Z1000EXR\u2019s 16 mega-pixel EXR-CMOS sensor helps users to always get great results, regardless of the conditions. The EXR-CMOS sensor has also been redesigned to prioritise light sensitivity with a 30% reduction in digital noise over its predecessor, ensuring smoother tones in both highlight and shadow areas at higher ISO settings.\\n\\nFujifilm\u2019s acclaimed EXR AUTO mode assesses the amount of available light, establishes the type of scene, tracks motion and locates any people within the frame before applying Advanced Anti Blur technology and choosing one of three optimised settings: High Resolution Priority mode for well-lit subjects and optimum image quality, Dynamic Range Priority mode for scenes of high-contrast or High Sensitivity and Low Noise Priority mode for smooth, sharp images taken in dark environments. Users can also choose to select the modes themselves, but with EXR Auto mode\u2019s 103 different shooting patterns that can be applied to a scene, it\u2019s unlikely they\u2019ll need to!\\n\\n<b>Always connected<\/b>\\nWith the FinePix Z1000EXR, fast image upload to social networking sites no longer means low quality pictures. The camera can be connected with any Android smartphone\/tablet or iPhone\/iPad via the simple download of the \"FUJIFILM Photo Receiver\" free app to their device, which includes easy to follow instructions to get them quickly connected.\\n\\nTo start uploading, users press the FinePix Z1000EXR\u2019s touch icon to connect to their smartphone and the images can be transferred to Android smartphone\/tablet or iPhone\/iPad ready for uploading to social networking sites.\\n\\nDespite the advanced imaging technology contained within the FinePix Z1000EXR, the camera\u2019s menu system is designed to be both intuitive and easy to operate. The FinePix Z1000EXR\u2019s wide 3.5-inch LCD offers touchscreen control with multi-touch capabilities for smartphone-style navigation. What\u2019s more, the screen offers a 460,000 dots resolution for exceptional clarity when reviewing images and movie or composing a shot.\\n\\n<b>Capture the perfect face<\/b>\\nIn addition to the advanced imaging technologies offered by the FinePix Z1000EXR, the camera also contains several features for improving the appearance of people in their photographs.\\n\\nFace tracking combines Face Detection with Tracking Auto Focus to ensure any faces in a scene are always sharp, no matter where they move. The camera itself has a wide-angle Frame Assist Mirror located and specially engineered to show the whole of a scene to assist users when framing a shot of themselves.\\n\\nIf there\u2019s more than one person to capture on camera, the FinePix Z1000EXR offers innovative image timer technology for both couples and groups: activating Couple Timer and the camera waits until two faces are close together before capturing an image, while Self-portrait Timer detects up to four individual faces, giving friends and family time to get ready for their close-up.\\n\\nThe beautification doesn\u2019t stop when the shutter button\u2019s pressed. After capture, users can choose to apply face retouching functions (Skin smoothing\/brighten) to improve appearance even further.\\n\\n<b>Choose your own shooting style<\/b>\\nThe FinePix Z1000EXR isn\u2019t just about still images \u2013 it also offers Full 1080p HD movie capture at a rate of 30fps for smooth and clear movies. Face Tracking Auto Focus locks on to any faces in the scene and will keep them sharp throughout filming, regardless of motion or the user recomposing the shot using the camera\u2019s Fujinon 5x optical zoom lens. Stereo sound capture adds more realism to movies captured on the camera, and both stills and movie can be reviewed on an HD ready TV - when connected using the camera\u2019s mini HDMI output.\\n\\nWhen capturing still images, the optical zoom lens\u2019 range can be extended using the camera\u2019s Intelligent Digital Zoom function. This assesses the zones of the photo and selectively applies image processing to increase the length of zoom to 10x without reduction in quality that\u2019s normally associated with digital zoom enhancement. And if users want to get closer, the FinePix Z1000EXR offers a minimum focusing distance of 9cm for macro pictures full of colour and sharp detail.\\n\\n<b>Substance and style<\/b>\\nIt may be packed with innovative photographic technology, but the FinePix Z1000EXR doesn\u2019t compromise on appearances. Even though it\u2019s only 18mm thick at its thickest point, the FinePix Z1000EXR appears even more sleek, streamlined and ready for anything."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"db1c9fb1-7d20-486e-b7d9-e76b2f432151","identifier":"12480131","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix Z1000EXR"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fujifilm FinePix Z1000EXR: Stay connected in style<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Fujifilm\u2019s Z-series cameras have always combined the very latest in style with cutting-edge technology, and the new FinePix Z1000EXR is no exception.<\/b>\\n\\nThe camera\u2019s super-stylish exterior contains a premium 16 megapixel EXR-CMOS sensor and Fujifilm\u2019s latest imaging technologies for great results every time.\\n\\nIn addition, the FinePix Z1000EXR adds a Wireless Image Transfer function that allows users to connect their Android smartphone\/tablet or iPhone\/iPad with the camera and upload high-quality images to social networking sites in seconds.\\n\\n<b>Perfect pictures, every time<\/b>\\nThe FinePix Z1000EXR\u2019s 16 mega-pixel EXR-CMOS sensor helps users to always get great results, regardless of the conditions. The EXR-CMOS sensor has also been redesigned to prioritise light sensitivity with a 30% reduction in digital noise over its predecessor, ensuring smoother tones in both highlight and shadow areas at higher ISO settings.\\n\\nFujifilm\u2019s acclaimed EXR AUTO mode assesses the amount of available light, establishes the type of scene, tracks motion and locates any people within the frame before applying Advanced Anti Blur technology and choosing one of three optimised settings: High Resolution Priority mode for well-lit subjects and optimum image quality, Dynamic Range Priority mode for scenes of high-contrast or High Sensitivity and Low Noise Priority mode for smooth, sharp images taken in dark environments. Users can also choose to select the modes themselves, but with EXR Auto mode\u2019s 103 different shooting patterns that can be applied to a scene, it\u2019s unlikely they\u2019ll need to!\\n\\n<b>Always connected<\/b>\\nWith the FinePix Z1000EXR, fast image upload to social networking sites no longer means low quality pictures. The camera can be connected with any Android smartphone\/tablet or iPhone\/iPad via the simple download of the \"FUJIFILM Photo Receiver\" free app to their device, which includes easy to follow instructions to get them quickly connected.\\n\\nTo start uploading, users press the FinePix Z1000EXR\u2019s touch icon to connect to their smartphone and the images can be transferred to Android smartphone\/tablet or iPhone\/iPad ready for uploading to social networking sites.\\n\\nDespite the advanced imaging technology contained within the FinePix Z1000EXR, the camera\u2019s menu system is designed to be both intuitive and easy to operate. The FinePix Z1000EXR\u2019s wide 3.5-inch LCD offers touchscreen control with multi-touch capabilities for smartphone-style navigation. What\u2019s more, the screen offers a 460,000 dots resolution for exceptional clarity when reviewing images and movie or composing a shot.\\n\\n<b>Capture the perfect face<\/b>\\nIn addition to the advanced imaging technologies offered by the FinePix Z1000EXR, the camera also contains several features for improving the appearance of people in their photographs.\\n\\nFace tracking combines Face Detection with Tracking Auto Focus to ensure any faces in a scene are always sharp, no matter where they move. The camera itself has a wide-angle Frame Assist Mirror located and specially engineered to show the whole of a scene to assist users when framing a shot of themselves.\\n\\nIf there\u2019s more than one person to capture on camera, the FinePix Z1000EXR offers innovative image timer technology for both couples and groups: activating Couple Timer and the camera waits until two faces are close together before capturing an image, while Self-portrait Timer detects up to four individual faces, giving friends and family time to get ready for their close-up.\\n\\nThe beautification doesn\u2019t stop when the shutter button\u2019s pressed. After capture, users can choose to apply face retouching functions (Skin smoothing\/brighten) to improve appearance even further.\\n\\n<b>Choose your own shooting style<\/b>\\nThe FinePix Z1000EXR isn\u2019t just about still images \u2013 it also offers Full 1080p HD movie capture at a rate of 30fps for smooth and clear movies. Face Tracking Auto Focus locks on to any faces in the scene and will keep them sharp throughout filming, regardless of motion or the user recomposing the shot using the camera\u2019s Fujinon 5x optical zoom lens. Stereo sound capture adds more realism to movies captured on the camera, and both stills and movie can be reviewed on an HD ready TV - when connected using the camera\u2019s mini HDMI output.\\n\\nWhen capturing still images, the optical zoom lens\u2019 range can be extended using the camera\u2019s Intelligent Digital Zoom function. This assesses the zones of the photo and selectively applies image processing to increase the length of zoom to 10x without reduction in quality that\u2019s normally associated with digital zoom enhancement. And if users want to get closer, the FinePix Z1000EXR offers a minimum focusing distance of 9cm for macro pictures full of colour and sharp detail.\\n\\n<b>Substance and style<\/b>\\nIt may be packed with innovative photographic technology, but the FinePix Z1000EXR doesn\u2019t compromise on appearances. Even though it\u2019s only 18mm thick at its thickest point, the FinePix Z1000EXR appears even more sleek, streamlined and ready for anything."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2fddf6dd-f94d-418b-9368-98d54b35e640","identifier":"12480133","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix Z110"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fujifilm FinePix Z110: Perfect camera for the style conscious snapper<\/b>\\nThe FinePix Z110 is the perfect camera for young, style-conscious, individuals that love taking pictures and videos of their friends and family.\\n\\nThe FinePix Z110 has a 14.1 megapixel CCD sensor, a 5x Fujinon optical zoom lens and a host of innovative functions on board, so it\u2019ll deliver great results whatever the conditions.\\n\\n<b>Premium image quality<\/b>\\nThe FinePix Z110 is perfectly designed for taking stunning portraits of friends and family, with unique imaging technology to lend a helping hand in the makeover process. Next to the FinePix Z110\u2019s lens is a Frame Assist Mirror that\u2019s curved to show the entirety of a scene and assist composition when the camera\u2019s held at arms length for shooting a self-portrait or group shot. To help further, Face Detection will ensure that everyone in the shot is sharp and perfectly exposed. Plus, after an image has been taken, users can choose to apply the FinePix Face Retouching function, which helps to improve the subject\u2019s appearance \u2013 always picture perfect.\\n\\n<b>Great pictures after dark<\/b>\\nSometimes it\u2019s hard to get a good shot when light is limited. With the FinePix Z110 in hand, however, users can take their best ever party pictures, thanks to the camera\u2019s dedicated Night Out mode that enables the capture of clear, sharp pictures with full detail.\\nNight Out mode has been optimised to work most effectively at a distance of approximately 2m from the subject. The FinePix Z110\u2019s Intelligent Flash technology provides the correct amount of illumination and with a maximum sensitivity of ISO 3200 users can turn up the camera\u2019s capability for those times when they don\u2019t want to fire the flash.\\nIn addition, the FinePix Z110 has Digital Image Stabilisation built-in, which reduces the effect of camera shake or subject movement for the very best results.\\n\\n<b>Supermodel styling<\/b>\\nThe FinePix Z110 is also a camera that users will enjoy showing off. The sleek all-metal casing slides open at the front to activate the camera and to reveal the premium-quality Fujinon lens. What\u2019s more, the camera\u2019s large 2.7-inch LCD screen allows users to compose and review images in detail, while the sleek and easy-to-use buttons enable swift control of the camera. The buttons are also illuminated, with a cool and contemporary blue LED light, for easy operation even in the dark.\\n\\n<b>Creative captures<\/b>\\nArtistic individuals can go beyond still images with the FinePix Z110\u2019s Motion Panorama mode and 720p HD movie capture. The Motion Panorama mode automatically stitches together pictures to create seamless, detail-filled panoramic images and is ideal for shooting holiday destinations or recording wide shots of action-packed parties.\\nFor capturing movies, the FinePix Z110 has a dedicated button to start and finish movie recording so users don\u2019t have to flick through the camera\u2019s menus to begin creating short films. And thanks to the 14.1 mega-pixel sensor\u2019s 720p HD movie capture, users can watch their creations in full quality on their HD ready TV, so the whole family can share the memories.\\n\\n<b>Easy pictures, every time<\/b>\\nThe FinePix Z110 also offers SR Auto mode that automatically assesses a scene and applies different settings to optimise the resulting images. Up to six different scenes can be detected: Portrait, Backlit Portrait, Macro, Landscape, Night Portrait and Night.\\nThe FinePix Z110 will be available in six gorgeous colours: pink, purple, jade, blue, white and black."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"61e24d60-19b6-447e-8938-a06ce1694af2","identifier":"12480168","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix AX550"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Fujifilm AX550 makes it easy to take great photos. The AX550 features a 16MP CCD sensor that captures large, high quality images. Also, a precision Fujinon 5x Optical Zoom Lens brings the action closer, and a bright 2.7\" LCD makes shooting and viewing a snap. The AX550 also features the convenience of AA battery operation. These features and more make the AX550 a simple to use value solution for the everyday picture taker."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cbef9074-2906-4ede-8602-cb0cd1561836","identifier":"12480327","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DSC-WX50"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Advanced Cyber-shot\u2122 mit leistungsstarken Funktionen, Full HD-Videowiedergabe und 3D-Aufnahme\\n<br \/>\\n<br \/>\\nExmor R\u2122 CMOS Sensor, 16,2 Mio. Pixel (effektiv): Hocheffizienter Sensor mit BIONZ\u2122 Prozessor reduziert Bildrauschen f\u00fcr tolle Aufnahmen auch bei schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen.\\n<br \/>\\nOptischer 5fach-Zoom, 25-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv: Das hochwertige Zoomobjektiv von Carl Zeiss\u00ae deckt eine breite Palette an Aufnahmesituationen ab und bietet eine Weitwinkeleinstellung f\u00fcr Gruppen- oder Landschaftsaufnahmen..\\n<br \/>\\n10fach-Zoom f\u00fcr klare Bilder: Verdoppelt den Zoombereich auf 10fache Vergr\u00f6\u00dferung, sodass weit entfernte Objekte nah herangeholt und in fabelhafter Bildqualit\u00e4t festgehalten werden k\u00f6nnen.\\n<br \/>\\nPixel Super Resolution Technologie: Optimiert auf intelligente Weise Details und Sch\u00e4rfe f\u00fcr ultrarealistische Bilder. Au\u00dferdem verbessert sie die effektive Aufl\u00f6sung von Aufnahmen mit hohem Zoomfaktor..\\n<br \/>\\nHervorragender Automatikmodus: Problemlos Bildqualit\u00e4t wie bei DSLR erreichen: Automatische Anpassung der Einstellungen, um hervorragende Bilder mit geringem Rauschen und High Dynamic Range zu erreichen.\\n<br \/>\\nTechnologie mit besonders hoher Empfindlichkeit: Erweitert die Aufnahmem\u00f6glichkeiten f\u00fcr Fotos unter besonders schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen.\\n<br \/>\\nTracking-Fokus:: Pr\u00e4ziser Autofokus selbst bei beweglichen Objekten; Ihre Motive werden also immer von ihrer besten Seite gezeigt.\\n<br \/>\\nModi f\u00fcr kreative Bildeffekte: Nutzen Sie integrierte Kameraeffekte, wie Spielzeugkamera, Teilfarbfilter, Pop Colour, HDR Painting, Miniatur, Illustration oder Wasserfarben.\\n<br \/>\\nUnsch\u00e4rfe-Effekte im Hintergrund: Erstellen Sie wie mit einer DSLR-Kamera Bilder in Profiqualit\u00e4t mit scharfen Motiven im Vordergrund vor einem sanft verschwommenen Hintergrund.\\n<br \/>\\nSerienaufnahmefunktion: Einfach den Ausl\u00f6ser bet\u00e4tigen und mit bis zu 10 Bildern pro Sekunde eine Serie von Actionmomenten festhalten.\\n<br \/>\\nFull HD-Film mit 1080i: Einfaches Aufnehmen hochwertiger Full HD-Videoclips per Knopfdruck im AVCHD-Format (1920 x 1080i) und mit Zoomfunktion.\\n<br \/>\\nOptischer SteadyShot (Active-Modus) (zusammen mit elektronischer Bildstabilisierung): Gleicht Verwacklungen der Kamera bei Videoaufnahmen aus (selbst beim Gehen oder Zoomen).\\n<br \/>\\nDoppelte Aufnahmefunktion: Dr\u00fccken Sie den Ausl\u00f6ser, und halten Sie w\u00e4hrend der Videoaufnahme Fotos in hoher Aufl\u00f6sung fest.\\n<br \/>\\nIntelligentes Schwenkpanorama: Ganze Bilderserien werden automatisch zu extrabreiten Landschaftsaufnahmen zusammengefasst, selbst bei sich bewegenden Motiven.\\n<br \/>\\n3D Sweep Panorama: Schwenken Sie die Kamera, und fangen Sie \u00e4u\u00dferst breite 3D-Panoramabilder ein. Freuen Sie sich auf tolle Ergebnisse in 2D oder auf einem 3D-Fernseher.\\n<br \/>\\nHochaufl\u00f6sendes Schwenkpanorama: Schwenken Sie die Kamera, um detailreiche Panoramaaufnahmen zu erstellen Genie\u00dfen Sie die Inhalte auf Ihrem angeschlossenen HD-Fernseher, oder seien Sie mit der PlayStation\u00ae3 noch n\u00e4her am Geschehen..\\n<br \/>\\nSchwenkbare Mehrfach-Winkel: Bei der Aufnahme einer Bildserie sehen Sie das Motiv aus verschiedenen Blickwinkeln. Sehen Sie Ihre Aufnahmen auf einem LC-Display oder einem angeschlossenen HD-Fernseher mit PS3\u2122 und PlayMemories Studio an.\\n<br \/>\\n3D-Standbild: Dr\u00fccken Sie den Ausl\u00f6ser: Ihre Cyber-shot\u2122 erstellt automatisch ein 3D-Bild aus zwei aufeinanderfolgenden Einzelaufnahmen: Sehen Sie das Ergebnis auf einem 3D-Fernseher an!.\\n<br \/>\\n6,7-cm-\/2,7\"-LCD mit Clear Photo Technologie: Hochwertiges LC-Display (460.000 Bildpunkte) f\u00fcr \u00fcberragende Details, hohe Kontraste und einen weiten Betrachtungswinkel.\\n<br \/>\\nHD-Diashow mit Musik: Tolle Bildwiedergabe mit Hintergrundmusik und Effekten auf LC-Display oder einem angeschlossenen HD-Fernseher.\\n<br \/>\\nHD-Ausgang: Zur Wiedergabe von Videos und Fotos auf dem HD-Fernseher (optionales Kabel erforderlich): PhotoTV HD optimiert die Anzeige von Standbildern auf kompatiblen BRAVIA Fernsehern.\\n<br \/>\\nGesichtserkennung: F\u00fcr noch sch\u00e4rfere Portr\u00e4ts stellt die Kamera Fokus, Belichtung und Wei\u00dfabgleich automatisch ein und verf\u00fcgt zudem \u00fcber eine Priorit\u00e4tenauswahl f\u00fcr Kinder\/Erwachsene..\\n<br \/>\\nSmile Shutter: L\u00f6st die Aufnahme automatisch aus, wenn die Person im Sucher l\u00e4chelt: mit anpassbarem Schwellenwert und w\u00e4hlbaren Einstellungen f\u00fcr Kinder und Erwachsene.\\n<br \/>\\nHintergrundlicht-Korrektur HDR: Sorgt f\u00fcr nat\u00fcrliche, gleichm\u00e4\u00dfige Ergebnisse mit starken Kontrasten und starkem Gegenlicht.\\n<br \/>\\nSoft-Teint Modus: Automatisches Retuschieren von Portr\u00e4ts, Entfernen von Flecken und Teintoptimierung f\u00fcr sch\u00f6ne Darstellung von Gesichtern.\\n<br \/>\\nSelbstausl\u00f6ser: F\u00fcr richtige Bildkompositionen bei kurzem Abstand zum Motiv; ein automatischer Ausl\u00f6ser sorgt f\u00fcr perfekt in Szene gesetzte Selbstportr\u00e4ts..\\n<br \/>\\nBenutzerfreundlicher Aufnahmemodus: Gut lesbare Bildschirmanweisungen erleichtern selbst Anf\u00e4ngern den Umgang mit der Kamera.\\n<br \/>\\nIntegrierter Leitfaden: Profitieren Sie von Tipps und Informationen zur Bedienung Ihrer Kamera direkt auf dem Bildschirm \u2013 kein l\u00e4stiges Bl\u00e4ttern mehr in Leitf\u00e4den..\\n<br \/>\\nRetusche direkt in der Kamera: Retusche-Funktionen direkt in der Kamera, einschlie\u00dflich Zuschneiden, Rote-Augen-Korrektur und Unsch\u00e4rfefilter.\\n<br \/>\\nPlayMemories Home: Vorinstallierte Software f\u00fcr eine einfache Bild\u00fcbertragung auf den PC zum Ansehen, Bearbeiten, Drucken, Versenden per E-Mail, Upload ins Internet usw..\\n<br \/>\\nSpeicherkartenkompatibilit\u00e4t: Cyber-shot\u2122 unterst\u00fctzt zahlreiche Speicherkarten, darunter Memory Stick\u2122 und SD- bzw. SDHC-Karten (Angaben zur Kompatibilit\u00e4t siehe technische Daten).\\n<br \/>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Pro quality in your pocket<\/b>\\nStunningly styled, compact and beautifully easy to use, the Cyber-shot\u2122 WX50 digital camera offers extraordinary imaging possibilities and limitless creative options. Step up to high-performance imaging with detail-packed stills, 3D and smooth Full HD 1080i video.\\n\\n<b>Add a new dimension with 3D<\/b>\\nDiscover an incredible world of 3D imaging. Shoot 3D stills at the touch of a button. Capture wide 3D images to enjoy on your 3D TV with Sweep Panorama. Sweep Multi Angle creates amazing 3D-like views you can explore by tilting the camera screen.\\n\\n<b>Magical movies<\/b>\\nShoot brilliantly crisp, detailed Full HD video clips: you'll enjoy stable, blur-free images even while walking or zooming.\\n\\n<b>Experience the whole picture<\/b>\\nIt's easy to grab breathtaking views of landscapes or city scenes. Cyber-shot\u2122 stitches together a high-speed burst of frames when you sweep the camera from side to side (or up and down!) to create one amazing panoramic image.\\n\\n<b>DSLR-style results made easy<\/b>\\nIt's never been easier to achieve superb images. Superior Auto Mode adjusts exposure and other camera settings for optimum results in virtually any situation.High-speed autofocus locks onto your subject for pin-sharp results.\\n\\n<b>Create artistic effects<\/b>\\nYou don't need a PC or expensive image editing software to create beautiful 'in camera' effects that enhance portraits, landscapes and more. Pick from a choice of Picture Effect modes to enhance your masterpiece."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Cyber-shot avanc\u00e9 avec fonctions puissantes, enregistrement vid\u00e9o Full HD et prises de vue 3D\\n<br \/>\\n<br \/>\\nCapteur CMOS Exmor R\u2122 de 16,2 m\u00e9gapixels effectifs: Compatible avec le processeur BIONZ\u2122, le capteur tr\u00e8s performant r\u00e9duit le bruit d'image pour de superbes images par faible luminosit\u00e9.\\n<br \/>\\nZoom optique 5x \/ objectif grand angle de 25 mm: Objectif zoom Carl Zeiss\u00ae haute qualit\u00e9, pour une grande vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de prises de vue en toutes circonstances, avec un grand angle pour les photos de groupe et les paysages.\\n<br \/>\\nZoom 10x haute r\u00e9solution: Permet de doubler la port\u00e9e du zoom (jusqu'\u00e0 10x), pour cadrer les objets distants tout en conservant une qualit\u00e9 d'image optimale.\\n<br \/>\\nTechnologie Super r\u00e9solution par pixel: Optimise intelligemment la pr\u00e9cision et la nettet\u00e9 pour des images d'un r\u00e9alisme saisissant, et maximise la r\u00e9solution effective des gros plans.\\n<br \/>\\nMode Auto sup\u00e9rieur: La qualit\u00e9 reflex num\u00e9rique en toute simplicit\u00e9 : les param\u00e8tres s'ajustent automatiquement pour de magnifiques images \u00e0 faible bruit et une plage dynamique \u00e9lev\u00e9e.\\n<br \/>\\nTechnologie Tr\u00e8s haute sensibilit\u00e9: Permet d'\u00e9largir les possibilit\u00e9s de prise de vue aux conditions d'extr\u00eame mauvaise visibilit\u00e9.\\n<br \/>\\nMise au point avec suivi: Conserve une mise au point pr\u00e9cise sur l'objet s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9, m\u00eame lorsqu'il se d\u00e9place : la star de vos vid\u00e9os est toujours sous son meilleur jour.\\n<br \/>\\nModes Effets sp\u00e9ciaux artistiques: Cr\u00e9ez des effets \u00e0 l'aide des fonctions de votre appareil photo : Photo \u00e0 l'ancienne, Couleur partielle, Couleur pop, Effet HDR, Miniature, Illustration, Aquarelle.\\n<br \/>\\nEffet de flou artistique en arri\u00e8re-plan: R\u00e9alisez des photos dignes d'un professionnel, repr\u00e9sentant votre sujet au premier plan sur un arri\u00e8re-plan l\u00e9g\u00e8rement flou, comme avec un reflex num\u00e9rique.\\n<br \/>\\nPrise de vue continue ultrarapide: Appuyez sur le bouton de l'obturateur et figez l'action avec une prise de vue en rafale ultra-rapide atteignant 10 images par seconde.\\n<br \/>\\nVid\u00e9o Full HD 1080i: Enregistrement en une seule touche avec zoom haute qualit\u00e9. Vid\u00e9o Full HD via le format AVCHD (1 920 x 1 080).\\n<br \/>\\nStabilisateur optique SteadyShot mode actif (combin\u00e9 \u00e0 la stabilisation \u00e9lectronique): Corrige l'instabilit\u00e9 de l'appareil photo lors d'enregistrements vid\u00e9o, m\u00eame en marchant ou en zoomant.\\n<br \/>\\nDouble enregistrement: Appuyez sur le bouton de l'obturateur pour capturer des photos haute r\u00e9solution pendant l'enregistrement de vid\u00e9os.\\n<br \/>\\nBalayage panoramique intelligent: Les prises de vue en rafale sont automatiquement assembl\u00e9es pour des photos panoramiques tr\u00e8s larges, m\u00eame sur des sujets en mouvement.\\n<br \/>\\nMode Panorama par balayage 3D: D\u00e9crivez un cercle avec l'appareil photo et prenez des photos panoramiques extra larges en 3D. Admirez le r\u00e9sultat \u00e9poustouflant en 2D ou sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur 3D.\\n<br \/>\\nPanorama par balayage haute r\u00e9solution: D\u00e9placez l'appareil photo d'un c\u00f4t\u00e9 \u00e0 un autre pour r\u00e9aliser des panoramas d'une nettet\u00e9 exceptionnelle. Visionnez-les sur un TV HD connect\u00e9, ou agrandissez-les sur votre PLAYSTATION\u00ae3.\\n<br \/>\\nBalayage \u00e0 angles multiples: Les prises de vue en rafale vous permettent de voir votre sujet sous plusieurs angles. Visionnez vos photos sur un \u00e9cran LCD ou HDTV avec PS3\u2122 et PlayMemories Studio.\\n<br \/>\\nImage fixe 3D: Appuyez sur le bouton de l'obturateur : votre Cyber-shot cr\u00e9e automatiquement une seule et m\u00eame image 3D \u00e0 partir de deux photos prises \u00e0 la suite. Affichage sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur 3D.\\n<br \/>\\nEcran LCD 6,7 cm \/ 2,7\" Clear Photo: Grand \u00e9cran LCD de tr\u00e8s haute qualit\u00e9 (460 000 points) au niveau de d\u00e9tail exceptionnel et au contraste \u00e9lev\u00e9 avec un grand angle de visualisation.\\n<br \/>\\nDiaporama HD avec musique: Affichage amusant des photos avec effets et musique sur un \u00e9cran LCD ou un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD connect\u00e9.\\n<br \/>\\nSortie HD :: Visionnez des films et des photos sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD (c\u00e2ble en option requis) : Le mode PhotoTV HD am\u00e9liore la visualisation de photos sur des BRAVIA compatibles.\\n<br \/>\\nReconnaissance des visages: R\u00e9glage automatique de la mise au point, de l'exposition et de la balance des blancs pour des portraits plus nets et choix de priorit\u00e9 enfants \/ adultes..\\n<br \/>\\nD\u00e9tecteur automatique de sourires: Prend automatiquement la photo lorsque le sujet sourit, en fonction des param\u00e8tres d\u00e9finis et du niveau de priorit\u00e9 choisi pour les enfants ou les adultes.\\n<br \/>\\nCorrection du r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage HDR: Garantit des r\u00e9sultats naturels et \u00e9quilibr\u00e9s \u00e0 fort contraste pour les \u00e0 r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage \u00e9lev\u00e9.\\n<br \/>\\nMode Peau lisse: Effectue automatiquement des retouches sur les portraits, efface les petites imperfections et optimise les tons chair pour de beaux visages.\\n<br \/>\\nD\u00e9clencheur pour autoportrait: D\u00e9tecte le cadrage id\u00e9al lorsque l'appareil photo est tenu \u00e0 bout de bras ; L'obturateur se d\u00e9clenche automatiquement pour de magnifiques autoportraits.\\n<br \/>\\nMode de prise vue simple: Fonctionnement simple pour les d\u00e9butants avec instructions exhaustives et claires \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran.\\n<br \/>\\nGuide int\u00e9gr\u00e9 \u00e0 l'appareil photo: Astuces et informations \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran sur le fonctionnement de l'appareil photo sans avoir \u00e0 feuilleter les pages d'un manuel d'instructions.\\n<br \/>\\nFonctionnalit\u00e9s de retouche int\u00e9gr\u00e9e: Fonctions de retouche de l'image amusantes notamment pour la correction des yeux rouges, le recadrage et le masquage flou.\\n<br \/>\\nPlayMemories Home\u2122: Un logiciel pr\u00e9install\u00e9 facilite le transfert d'images vers l'ordinateur pour la visualisation, le montage, l'impression, l'envoi par e-mail, le t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement \u00e0 partir du web et bien plus.\\n<br \/>\\nCompatibilit\u00e9 de la carte m\u00e9moire: Cyber-shot\u2122 accepte une large gamme de cartes, y compris Memory Stick\u2122 et SD\/SDHC - voir les sp\u00e9cifications techniques pour la compatibilit\u00e9.\\n<br \/>"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3ecf76e4-0c68-4006-9517-883c2dc55c9d","identifier":"12482897","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision MiWand 2"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Ein mobilder Scanner der \u00fcberall und jederzeit einsetzbar ist<\/b>\\nErfahren Sie die Effizienz und Bequemlichkeit eines wirklich mobilen Scanners! Versorgt mit nur zwei AA Alkaline Batterien, erlaubt es der MiWand2 ohne Computer oder Software zu scannen. Einfach \u00fcber die Oberfl\u00e4che einer Seite gleiten und schon ist der Scan fertig. Die Bilder werden dann auf der MicroSD Karte (bis zu 32GB) gespeichert.\\nDer Scanner ist klein und portabel. Dennoch liefert der Avision MiWand 2 au\u00dferordentliche Leistung. Wenn der Scanner \u00fcber ein Fl\u00e4che mit einer Gr\u00f6\u00dfe von 21,5cm x 35,5cm gleitet, scannt der hochempfndliche CIS Sensor mit einer Aufl\u00f6sungvon 600dpi oder 300dpi mit 24-bit true color. Die hochwertigen Scans werden als JPEG oder PDF Format auf der micro SD Karte gespeichert. Das Beste ist: der MiWand 2 ben\u00f6tigt nur 1,6 Sekunden f\u00fcr eine ganze Seite in 300dpi Fabe.\\n\\n<b>Einfach im Gebrauch<\/b>\\nDer Scanner hat eine brilliante Farb - Anzeige,welche die Vorschaubilder, Scannereinstellungen und Warnmeldungen anzeigt.Schalten Sie den Scanner an, dr\u00fccken Sie die Power\/Scan Taste, bewegen Sie den Scanner \u00fcber die zu scannenden Seite, eine Wand oder Box, dr\u00fccken Sie die Power\/Scan Taste erneut, um den Scan zu stoppen. Schon ist Ihr Scan fertig.\\n\\n<b>Vorschaubild auf dem 1.8\u201d Farb - LCD<\/b>\\nDas Vorschaufeature erm\u00f6glicht es das JPEG Bild auf dem Farb - LCD f\u00fcr 2 Sekunden sofort anzuschauen, um das Bild zu best\u00e4tigen, welches gescannt wurde. Zus\u00e4tzlich k\u00f6nnen alle Bilder einzeln oder als Diashow angezeigt werden.\\n\\n<b>Scans auf dem iPad anschauen<\/b>\\nMit dem mini USB Anschluss k\u00f6nnen die gescannten Dokumente einfach (mit dem zus\u00e4tzlichen iPad Camera Kit) auf dem iPad oder jedem anderen SmartPhone, welches einen USB Host oder USB OTG M\u00f6glichkeit unterst\u00fctzt, gezeigt werden.\\n\\n<b>\u00dcberall kabellos Scannen<\/b>\\nDieser brandneue Scanner kann mit nur einer Hand bedient werden. Es mu\u00df kein schweres Stromkabel mitgenommen und nach einer Steckdose gesucht werden, denn die Stromversorgung l\u00e4uft \u00fcber zwei AA Alkaline Batterien. Da kein Computer zum Scannen n\u00f6tig ist, kann mit diesem Scanner \u00fcberall und zu jeder Zeit gescannt werden. Wann auch immer: im Flugzeug, im Auto oder im Caf\u00e9, alles kann sofort digitalisiert werden. Ob stehend oder sitzend, der Scan kann einfach durchgef\u00fchrt werden, indem man den Scanner \u00fcber die Oberfl\u00e4che gleiten l\u00e4sst. Sogar Poster an der Wand oder ein sch\u00f6ner Karton k\u00f6nnen digitalisiert werden."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A mobile scanner that scans anywhere, anytime<\/b>\\n\\nExperience the efficiency and convenience of a truly mobile scanner! Powered only by 2x AA alkaline batteries, the MiWand 2 is a mobile scanner that allows you to scan without a computer or software. Simply gliding the scanner over the surface of a page and the scan is done. The images are then saved to a micro SD card up to 32G.\\n\\n<b>Wireless design, scan images anywhere<\/b>\\nThe brand new portable scanner can be operated with a single hand. Powered by alkaline batteries, you do not need to carry a heavy power adapter and hunt for an electric outlet anymore! Since no computer is required to start a scan, you can carry it to anywhere, anytime! Whenever on the road, in a plane, a car or a caf\u00e9, you can digitize almost everything right away! Whether standing or sitting, you can complete your scan by simply gliding it over a surface. Even the posters on the wall or a pretty carton can be easily digitized!\\n\\n<b>Preview images with 1.8\u201d color LCD display<\/b>\\nThe Preview feature allows you to view your JPEG image on the color LCD screen for 2 seconds immediately after a scan to confirm the images you have just captured. In addition, you can also view all images individually or as a slideshow.\\n\\n<b>View images in iPad<\/b>\\nThrough the mini USB port, the scanned documents can be easily transferred to iPad (with additional iPad Camera Kit) or any SmartPhone which supports USB Host or OTG capability.\\n\\n<b>Patented Double-Roller and Bookedge Design<\/b>\\nThe innovative double roller technology delivers outstanding feeding reliability and image quality by significantly reducing the risk of skewing and distortion. The bookedge design makes book scanning fast and easy."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"64c5d21b-1f80-42cb-ab39-bfbd99dec504","identifier":"12482899","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision MiWand 2"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Ein mobilder Scanner der \u00fcberall und jederzeit einsetzbar ist<\/b>\\nErfahren Sie die Effizienz und Bequemlichkeit eines wirklich mobilen Scanners! Versorgt mit nur zwei AA Alkaline Batterien, erlaubt es der MiWand2 ohne Computer oder Software zu scannen. Einfach \u00fcber die Oberfl\u00e4che einer Seite gleiten und schon ist der Scan fertig. Die Bilder werden dann auf der MicroSD Karte (bis zu 32GB) gespeichert.\\nDer Scanner ist klein und portabel. Dennoch liefert der Avision MiWand 2 au\u00dferordentliche Leistung. Wenn der Scanner \u00fcber ein Fl\u00e4che mit einer Gr\u00f6\u00dfe von 21,5cm x 35,5cm gleitet, scannt der hochempfndliche CIS Sensor mit einer Aufl\u00f6sungvon 600dpi oder 300dpi mit 24-bit true color. Die hochwertigen Scans werden als JPEG oder PDF Format auf der micro SD Karte gespeichert. Das Beste ist: der MiWand 2 ben\u00f6tigt nur 1,6 Sekunden f\u00fcr eine ganze Seite in 300dpi Fabe.\\n\\n<b>Einfach im Gebrauch<\/b>\\nDer Scanner hat eine brilliante Farb - Anzeige,welche die Vorschaubilder, Scannereinstellungen und Warnmeldungen anzeigt.Schalten Sie den Scanner an, dr\u00fccken Sie die Power\/Scan Taste, bewegen Sie den Scanner \u00fcber die zu scannenden Seite, eine Wand oder Box, dr\u00fccken Sie die Power\/Scan Taste erneut, um den Scan zu stoppen. Schon ist Ihr Scan fertig.\\n\\n<b>Vorschaubild auf dem 1.8\u201d Farb - LCD<\/b>\\nDas Vorschaufeature erm\u00f6glicht es das JPEG Bild auf dem Farb - LCD f\u00fcr 2 Sekunden sofort anzuschauen, um das Bild zu best\u00e4tigen, welches gescannt wurde. Zus\u00e4tzlich k\u00f6nnen alle Bilder einzeln oder als Diashow angezeigt werden.\\n\\n<b>Scans auf dem iPad anschauen<\/b>\\nMit dem mini USB Anschluss k\u00f6nnen die gescannten Dokumente einfach (mit dem zus\u00e4tzlichen iPad Camera Kit) auf dem iPad oder jedem anderen SmartPhone, welches einen USB Host oder USB OTG M\u00f6glichkeit unterst\u00fctzt, gezeigt werden.\\n\\n<b>\u00dcberall kabellos Scannen<\/b>\\nDieser brandneue Scanner kann mit nur einer Hand bedient werden. Es mu\u00df kein schweres Stromkabel mitgenommen und nach einer Steckdose gesucht werden, denn die Stromversorgung l\u00e4uft \u00fcber zwei AA Alkaline Batterien. Da kein Computer zum Scannen n\u00f6tig ist, kann mit diesem Scanner \u00fcberall und zu jeder Zeit gescannt werden. Wann auch immer: im Flugzeug, im Auto oder im Caf\u00e9, alles kann sofort digitalisiert werden. Ob stehend oder sitzend, der Scan kann einfach durchgef\u00fchrt werden, indem man den Scanner \u00fcber die Oberfl\u00e4che gleiten l\u00e4sst. Sogar Poster an der Wand oder ein sch\u00f6ner Karton k\u00f6nnen digitalisiert werden."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A mobile scanner that scans anywhere, anytime<\/b>\\n\\nExperience the efficiency and convenience of a truly mobile scanner! Powered only by 2x AA alkaline batteries, the MiWand 2 is a mobile scanner that allows you to scan without a computer or software. Simply gliding the scanner over the surface of a page and the scan is done. The images are then saved to a micro SD card up to 32G.\\n\\n<b>Wireless design, scan images anywhere<\/b>\\nThe brand new portable scanner can be operated with a single hand. Powered by alkaline batteries, you do not need to carry a heavy power adapter and hunt for an electric outlet anymore! Since no computer is required to start a scan, you can carry it to anywhere, anytime! Whenever on the road, in a plane, a car or a caf\u00e9, you can digitize almost everything right away! Whether standing or sitting, you can complete your scan by simply gliding it over a surface. Even the posters on the wall or a pretty carton can be easily digitized!\\n\\n<b>Preview images with 1.8\u201d color LCD display<\/b>\\nThe Preview feature allows you to view your JPEG image on the color LCD screen for 2 seconds immediately after a scan to confirm the images you have just captured. In addition, you can also view all images individually or as a slideshow.\\n\\n<b>View images in iPad<\/b>\\nThrough the mini USB port, the scanned documents can be easily transferred to iPad (with additional iPad Camera Kit) or any SmartPhone which supports USB Host or OTG capability.\\n\\n<b>Patented Double-Roller and Bookedge Design<\/b>\\nThe innovative double roller technology delivers outstanding feeding reliability and image quality by significantly reducing the risk of skewing and distortion. The bookedge design makes book scanning fast and easy."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9b1804cb-4065-4f63-89da-28e1778f8aba","identifier":"12483452","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X792dte"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"112.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Business productivity with robust color performance<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark X792dte color multifunction printer combines robust color printing with flexible finishing options, expanded input capacity, productivity solutions and an intuitive color touch screen.\\n\\n<b>Intuitive Color Touch Screen<\/b>\\nThe extra large 10.2-inch color touch screen allows you to operate your printer with ease and confidence through smart and intuitive navigation, easy access to workflow solutions and shortcuts, and the ability to preview your documents and print jobs at the device.\\n\\n<b>Flexible Output Options<\/b>\\nChoose from four output options, including a five-bin mailbox, an offset stacker, a staple finisher, and a staple with hole punch finisher.\\n\\n<b>Advance Copy Functions<\/b>\\nAdvanced copy functions let you interrupt long print runs to make a quick copy, and proof the first copy set before completing your copy job.\\n\\n<b>Scan to Multiple Destinations<\/b>\\nScan to multiple destinations, including scan to email, scan to FTP, scan to fax, scan to network, and more.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark Solutions<\/b>\\nReduce unnecessary printing and simplify work processes through solutions applications preloaded on your device. Choose additional Lexmark solutions to fit your unique workflow needs.\\n\\n<b>Long-lasting Toner<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark Extra High Yield Print Cartridge delivers up to 20,000* pages, reducing interventions, cartridge waste and cost. * Average continuous black or composite CMY declared cartridge yield in accordance with ISO\/IEC 19798."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b7b785bf-0eb3-4b0a-af66-f694350ef0c7","identifier":"1248433","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Photosmart C7280 All-in-One Printer, Fax, Scanner, Copier"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Extrem leistungsstarkes All-in-One Ger\u00e4t mit gro\u00dfem Funktionsumfang f\u00fcr h\u00f6chste Produktivit\u00e4t im privaten Wired- oder Wireless-Netzwerk[p1]. Drucken und Kopieren in rasantem Tempo. Durch automatischen beidseitigen Druck spart man Papier und noch mehr Zeit. Die automatische 50-Blatt-Dokumentenzuf\u00fchrung erm\u00f6glicht unbeaufsichtigtes Faxen, Scannen oder Kopieren. \u00dcber die Speicherkarten-Steckpl\u00e4tze, das 6,1 cm LCD-Farbdisplay und die automatische Fotopapierzuf\u00fchrung lassen sich Fotos ganz ohne PC drucken \u2013 mit sechs separaten HP Vivera Tinten."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Our versatile Photosmart C7280 All\u2013in-One is ready to print, scan, copy, and fax as directed. It's ready to turn out lab-quality photos and reprints, laser-quality documents, and beautiful scans. It will print on both sides of the page, print uncut Web pages, and automatically feed paper so you don't have to stand around. And you can even add it to your home network, as it has built-in wireless2 and Ethernet connectivity."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Connectez cette multifonction haute performance \u00e0 votre r\u00e9seau pour la productivit\u00e9 \u00e0 domicile sans fil[p1] ultime. Imprimez des photos couleurs 6\u00a0encres et des documents recto ou recto verso \u00e0 des vitesses vertigineuses et t\u00e9l\u00e9copiez, num\u00e9risez et copiez \u00e0 l'aide du chargeur automatique de 50\u00a0feuilles."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-08-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"145700bb-b039-46d0-84df-66e3feab3456","identifier":"1250017","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Deskjet F2180 All-in-One Printer, Scanner, Copier"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Kosteng\u00fcnstiger und zuverl\u00e4ssiger All-in-One f\u00fcr den Alltagsgebrauch f\u00fcr bequemes Drucken, Scannen und Kopieren. Farb- und Schwarzwei\u00dfkopien, hochwertige Scans und scharfe Fotovervielf\u00e4ltigungen erstellen \u2013 ohne den Computer einschalten zu m\u00fcssen. Dauerhafte Textdokumente in Laserqualit\u00e4t, perfekte Webseiten[p1] und wundersch\u00f6ne Fotos schnell und einfach drucken. Fotos in Laborqualit\u00e4t mit dem optionalen 6-Farb-Tintendruck[p2] drucken.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span>\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Enjoy easy home printing, scanning and copying with this affordable and reliable everyday all-in-one. Make colour and black and white copies, high-quality scans and crisp, sharp photo reprints \u2013 all without having to switch on your computer. Print long-lasting, laser-quality text documents, perfect web pages[p1] and beautiful photos quickly and easily. Get lab-quality photo printing with optional 6-ink colour[p2].<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span>\\n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez de l'impression, la num\u00e9risation et la copie faciles \u00e0 domicile avec ce tout-en-un fiable et abordable de tous les jours. Effectuez des copies couleurs et noir et blanc sans ordinateur, et imprimez des documents texte de qualit\u00e9 laser et des photos vibrantes \u2013 rapidement et facilement.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4dccc10f-e5d1-48b6-9f3b-5abb96669db9","identifier":"12502413","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung NX11"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Featuring the i-Function lens\u2014which lets you intuitively control complex manual settings\u2014it comes with new features like Panorama Mode and Sound Picture. You can capture everything from sweeping landscapes to the chirping of birds in the background. Your eyes and ears take it all in, and now so does your camera.\\n<br\/><b>The large camera sensor that\u2019s big on quality.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Equipped with a large APS-C size CMOS sensor that minimises noise, the NX11 reproduces clearer images with richer, more natural colours. It also allows the use of high ISO in low-light settings, with less noise. A large sensor also makes it easy to achieve shallow depth of field for more dramatic results.\\n<img src=\"\/uk\/consumer\/flagship\/NX11\/images\/feat1a.jpg\" style=\"width:250px;height:145px;\" alt=\"The large camera sensor that\u2019s big on quality.\" \/>\\n<br\/><b>Take control with the i-Function Lens.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Whether you\u2019re a beginner or an expert, the i-Function Lens meets your needs with its dual modes. An expert can instantly adjust manual settings such as shutter speed and exposure in the P \/ A \/ S \/ M modes, while the built-in Lens Priority mode lets a beginner use different lenses easily and correctly.\\n<br\/><b>Set the scene right with Lens Priority Mode.<\/b>\\n<br\/>With Lens Priority Mode, the camera recognises the attached lens and provides optimised settings for that particular lens. And when you change the lens, the settings automatically readjust for optimal shooting. Just push the i-Function button, rotate the lens and let the camera do the rest.\\n<br\/><b>Take in the entire view with Panorama Mode<\/b>\\n<br\/>It\u2019s now very easy to create amazing, wide-screen shots. Simply press the shutter button in Panorama Mode while moving the camera in the direction you want. A progress bar on the screen will let you know when you\u2019ve reached the maximum width\u2014just perfect for those shots that can\u2019t be contained by a standard 4 x 6.\\n<br\/><b>Fast AF that captures life in an instant<\/b>\\n<br\/>Looking for the camera that can keep up with you? The NX11 features a quick, accurate and highly optimised AF (Auto Focus) that focuses in an incredible, approximate 170ms (0.17 seconds)*. No more missed photo ops or kids half out of frame. Capture fleeting moments perfectly before they pass you by.\\n* Tested under Samsung's standard conditions and may vary depending on camera firmware and settings."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"026a3dfa-1463-4f87-a5be-f92ed60d7e4c","identifier":"12549272","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2\/e\/3\/9\/2e39c5c889dca837bfd98be6054e4bedd3145403_15743_12549272_187.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/2\/e\/3\/9\/2e39c5c889dca837bfd98be6054e4bedd3145403_15743_12549272_187.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R36"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Wi-Fi with MP4 support\\n- 51x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS\\n- Optical Intelligent IS\\n- Story Creator\\n- Cinema-look filters; Touch Decoration\\n- Store direct to external HDD\\n- 7.5cm touch screen\\n- Smart Auto, Face Detection\\n- HD-SD conversion\\n- 8GB memory, SDXC card slot\\n\\nShare your stories effortlessly with Wi-Fi\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi with MP4 support<\/b>\\nIn-built Wi-Fi lets you effortlessly share your creations to social networking sites and view your videos on DNLA certified TVs and iOS devices. Support for MP4 format ensures quick transfer times of HD movies.\\n\\n<b>51x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS<\/b>\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 51x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives excellent colour reproduction even in low light, so your movies will look great on your HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake. It automatically detects the scene and selects exactly the right optical Image Stabilizer settings from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. It ensures sharp, detailed videos in every situation - leaving you free to concentrate on shooting.\\n\\n<b>Story Creator<\/b>\\nUse Story Creator to effortlessly create memorable movies and help develop your video skills. Choose a theme for your movie and Story Creator gives you on screen suggestions and shooting tips, so you can make captivating videos.\\n\\n<b>Cinema-look filters; Touch Decoration<\/b>\\nInspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters. Select from 8 adjustable colour-grading filters to capture the perfect movie scene. Adding fun effects to your movies without a PC is easy using Touch Decoration.\\n\\n<b>Store direct to external HDD<\/b>\\nCopy movies direct from the inbuilt memory or SDXC card slot to an external hard drive. Just follow the simple on-screen menus for quick and easy storage.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nOperation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm (3.0\u201d) gesture-based Touch-screen LCD, which gives you intuitive fingertip control of settings and simplifies playback.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto, Face Detection<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot high quality video with Smart Auto. Intelligent Scene Detection Technology selects the perfect settings from 38 scene modes \u2013 all you have to do is point and shoot, whilst Face Detection optimises the settings for great people shots.\\n\\n<b>HD-SD conversion<\/b>\\nConvert movies from HD to SD in camera for really easy sharing and web uploading.\\n\\n<b>8GB Dual Flash memory, SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nAn in-built 8GB Dual Flash memory lets you store over 3 hours of Full HD movies. Record even longer with the SDXC card slot."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi avec prise en charge MP4\\n- Zoom perfectionn\u00e9 51x ; capteur CMOS Full HD\\n- Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent\\n- Cr\u00e9ation de Sc\u00e9narios\\n- Filtres effet Cin\u00e9ma ; fonction Touche D\u00e9coration\\n- Stockage direct sur disque dur externe\\n- \u00c9cran tactile de 7,5 cm\\n- Mode Smart Auto, d\u00e9tection de visage\\n- Conversion HD-SD\\n- M\u00e9moire de 8 Go ; logement pour carte SDXC\\n\\nPartagez vos histoires sans le moindre effort gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi\\n\\n<b>Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi avec prise en charge MP4<\/b>\\nSa connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi int\u00e9gr\u00e9e vous permet de partager vos cr\u00e9ations en toute simplicit\u00e9 sur vos r\u00e9seaux sociaux et de regarder vos vid\u00e9os sur des p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques iOS et des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs certifi\u00e9s DNLA. La prise en charge du format MP4 garantit une vitesse de transfert rapide pour les vid\u00e9os HD.\\n\\n<b>Zoom perfectionn\u00e9 51x ; capteur CMOS Full HD<\/b>\\nUn objectif vid\u00e9o authentique Canon HD avec zoom perfectionn\u00e9 51x vous permet de capturer vos sujets, m\u00eame \u00e9loign\u00e9s, dans leurs moindres d\u00e9tails. Le capteur CMOS Full HD offre une excellente reproduction des couleurs m\u00eame en basse lumi\u00e8re : vos vid\u00e9os auront fi\u00e8re allure sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD.\\n\\n<b>Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent<\/b>\\nLe stabilisateur d'image intelligent compense les effets de vibration comme aucun autre syst\u00e8me. Il d\u00e9tecte automatiquement la sc\u00e8ne et s\u00e9lectionne parmi 4 modes les param\u00e8tres de stabilisateur d'image optique les mieux adapt\u00e9s pour compenser le mouvement et \u00e9viter les flous de boug\u00e9. Il garantit une image vid\u00e9o nette et d\u00e9taill\u00e9e dans tous les cas de figure, vous permettant ainsi de porter toute votre attention sur la prise de vues.\\n\\n<b>Cr\u00e9ation de Sc\u00e9narios<\/b>\\nUtilisez le mode Cr\u00e9ation de Sc\u00e9narios pour cr\u00e9er en toute simplicit\u00e9 des vid\u00e9os inoubliables et d\u00e9velopper vos talents de r\u00e9alisateur. Une fois le th\u00e8me de votre s\u00e9quence choisi, le mode Cr\u00e9ation de Sc\u00e9narios vous fournit \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran des suggestions et des conseils de prise de vues qui vous permettront de r\u00e9aliser des vid\u00e9os captivantes.\\n\\n<b>Filtres effet Cin\u00e9ma ; fonction Touche D\u00e9coration<\/b>\\nExprimez votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 avec les filtres effet Cin\u00e9ma. Choisissez l'un des 8 filtres de nuances de couleurs r\u00e9glables pour obtenir la sc\u00e8ne de cin\u00e9ma id\u00e9ale. Avec la fonction Touche D\u00e9coration, ajoutez des effets amusants \u00e0 vos vid\u00e9os en toute simplicit\u00e9, sans ordinateur.\\n\\n<b>Stockage direct sur disque dur externe<\/b>\\nCopiez des vid\u00e9os directement \u00e0 partir de la m\u00e9moire int\u00e9gr\u00e9e ou du logement pour carte SDXC vers un disque dur externe. Acc\u00e9dez aux options de stockage rapidement et en toute simplicit\u00e9 \u00e0 partir des menus conviviaux \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran.\\n\\n<b>Le contr\u00f4le au bout des doigts<\/b>\\nLe fonctionnement est ais\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran LCD tactile haute r\u00e9solution de 7,5 cm (3 pouces) qui garantit un contr\u00f4le intuitif des param\u00e8tres et simplifie la lecture.\\n\\n<b>Mode Smart Auto, d\u00e9tection de visage<\/b>\\nEnregistrez facilement des vid\u00e9os de haute qualit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au mode Smart Auto. La technologie de reconnaissance de sc\u00e8ne intelligente s\u00e9lectionne les param\u00e8tres appropri\u00e9s parmi 38 modes sc\u00e8ne ; il ne vous reste plus alors qu'\u00e0 cadrer et \u00e0 d\u00e9clencher. La technologie de d\u00e9tection de visage optimise quant \u00e0 elle les param\u00e8tres de prise de vues pour des portraits toujours r\u00e9ussis.\\n\\n<b>Conversion HD-SD<\/b>\\nConvertissez, depuis le cam\u00e9scope, des vid\u00e9os du format HD \u00e0 SD pour un partage et un t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement sur Internet faciles.\\n\\n<b>Double m\u00e9moire Flash de 8 Go ; logement pour carte SDXC<\/b>\\nUne double m\u00e9moire Flash int\u00e9gr\u00e9e de 8 Go vous permet de stocker plus de 3 heures de vid\u00e9o Full HD. Le logement pour carte SDXC permet une dur\u00e9e d'enregistrement encore plus longue."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-28T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"91c84f25-3349-4375-aa1a-c9cbd75ab6c7","identifier":"12567261","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung TC240"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Crystal-clear LCD screen<\/b>\\nUnlike other Thin Clients, the Samsung TC190 and TC240 come ready-to-view\\n<b>Creating a comprehensive resource archive<\/b>\\nThe advantage of storing information on a central server is that resources can be stored and shared in a more efficient and effective way"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fd505fe3-d6e0-4563-91ac-ac77081912a3","identifier":"12567405","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix Z1000EXR"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fujifilm FinePix Z1000EXR: Stay connected in style<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Fujifilm\u2019s Z-series cameras have always combined the very latest in style with cutting-edge technology, and the new FinePix Z1000EXR is no exception.<\/b>\\n\\nThe camera\u2019s super-stylish exterior contains a premium 16 megapixel EXR-CMOS sensor and Fujifilm\u2019s latest imaging technologies for great results every time.\\n\\nIn addition, the FinePix Z1000EXR adds a Wireless Image Transfer function that allows users to connect their Android smartphone\/tablet or iPhone\/iPad with the camera and upload high-quality images to social networking sites in seconds.\\n\\n<b>Perfect pictures, every time<\/b>\\nThe FinePix Z1000EXR\u2019s 16 mega-pixel EXR-CMOS sensor helps users to always get great results, regardless of the conditions. The EXR-CMOS sensor has also been redesigned to prioritise light sensitivity with a 30% reduction in digital noise over its predecessor, ensuring smoother tones in both highlight and shadow areas at higher ISO settings.\\n\\nFujifilm\u2019s acclaimed EXR AUTO mode assesses the amount of available light, establishes the type of scene, tracks motion and locates any people within the frame before applying Advanced Anti Blur technology and choosing one of three optimised settings: High Resolution Priority mode for well-lit subjects and optimum image quality, Dynamic Range Priority mode for scenes of high-contrast or High Sensitivity and Low Noise Priority mode for smooth, sharp images taken in dark environments. Users can also choose to select the modes themselves, but with EXR Auto mode\u2019s 103 different shooting patterns that can be applied to a scene, it\u2019s unlikely they\u2019ll need to!\\n\\n<b>Always connected<\/b>\\nWith the FinePix Z1000EXR, fast image upload to social networking sites no longer means low quality pictures. The camera can be connected with any Android smartphone\/tablet or iPhone\/iPad via the simple download of the \"FUJIFILM Photo Receiver\" free app to their device, which includes easy to follow instructions to get them quickly connected.\\n\\nTo start uploading, users press the FinePix Z1000EXR\u2019s touch icon to connect to their smartphone and the images can be transferred to Android smartphone\/tablet or iPhone\/iPad ready for uploading to social networking sites.\\n\\nDespite the advanced imaging technology contained within the FinePix Z1000EXR, the camera\u2019s menu system is designed to be both intuitive and easy to operate. The FinePix Z1000EXR\u2019s wide 3.5-inch LCD offers touchscreen control with multi-touch capabilities for smartphone-style navigation. What\u2019s more, the screen offers a 460,000 dots resolution for exceptional clarity when reviewing images and movie or composing a shot.\\n\\n<b>Capture the perfect face<\/b>\\nIn addition to the advanced imaging technologies offered by the FinePix Z1000EXR, the camera also contains several features for improving the appearance of people in their photographs.\\n\\nFace tracking combines Face Detection with Tracking Auto Focus to ensure any faces in a scene are always sharp, no matter where they move. The camera itself has a wide-angle Frame Assist Mirror located and specially engineered to show the whole of a scene to assist users when framing a shot of themselves.\\n\\nIf there\u2019s more than one person to capture on camera, the FinePix Z1000EXR offers innovative image timer technology for both couples and groups: activating Couple Timer and the camera waits until two faces are close together before capturing an image, while Self-portrait Timer detects up to four individual faces, giving friends and family time to get ready for their close-up.\\n\\nThe beautification doesn\u2019t stop when the shutter button\u2019s pressed. After capture, users can choose to apply face retouching functions (Skin smoothing\/brighten) to improve appearance even further.\\n\\n<b>Choose your own shooting style<\/b>\\nThe FinePix Z1000EXR isn\u2019t just about still images \u2013 it also offers Full 1080p HD movie capture at a rate of 30fps for smooth and clear movies. Face Tracking Auto Focus locks on to any faces in the scene and will keep them sharp throughout filming, regardless of motion or the user recomposing the shot using the camera\u2019s Fujinon 5x optical zoom lens. Stereo sound capture adds more realism to movies captured on the camera, and both stills and movie can be reviewed on an HD ready TV - when connected using the camera\u2019s mini HDMI output.\\n\\nWhen capturing still images, the optical zoom lens\u2019 range can be extended using the camera\u2019s Intelligent Digital Zoom function. This assesses the zones of the photo and selectively applies image processing to increase the length of zoom to 10x without reduction in quality that\u2019s normally associated with digital zoom enhancement. And if users want to get closer, the FinePix Z1000EXR offers a minimum focusing distance of 9cm for macro pictures full of colour and sharp detail.\\n\\n<b>Substance and style<\/b>\\nIt may be packed with innovative photographic technology, but the FinePix Z1000EXR doesn\u2019t compromise on appearances. Even though it\u2019s only 18mm thick at its thickest point, the FinePix Z1000EXR appears even more sleek, streamlined and ready for anything."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8f3dd1ca-f9b7-4ab1-8b8d-fa2c53513544","identifier":"12568104","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon Digital IXUS 230 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Mit dem 8fach Zoomobjektiv, Full HD und HS-System f\u00fcr optimierte Aufnahmen beischwachen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen ist die schlanke IXUS 230 HS der ideale Begleiter f\u00fcr Nachtschw\u00e4rmer. Dank intelligentem AUTO-Modus (Smart Auto) werden brillante Aufnahmen zum Kinderspiel.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Vielseitige und intelligente Kamera f\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Fotos<\/b>\\nDas 28-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv mit 8fach optischem Zoom ist ideal f\u00fcr detailreiche Fotos weit entfernter Motive, f\u00fcr Gruppen- und f\u00fcr Landschaftsaufnahmen Mit 7 Modi passt Intelligent IS den Bildstabilisator automatisch an das Motiv an; das Resultat: minimierte Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfe und gestochen scharfe, detailreiche Fotos und Movieclips.\\n\\n<b>HS-System<\/b>\\nDas innovative HS-System, die Kombination aus leistungsstarkem DIGIC-4-Bildprozessor und hoch empfindlichem Sensor, sorgt f\u00fcr exzellente Bildqualit\u00e4t in nahezu allen Aufnahmesituationen. Es brilliert besonders bei schwachen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen \u2013 ideal, um den Zauber einer Stimmung auch ohne Blitz und Stativ festzuhalten. Die Kombination aus hoch empfindlichem Bildsensor und leistungsstarkem DIGIC-4-Bildprozessor sorgt f\u00fcr exzellente Bildqualit\u00e4t in nahezu allen Situationen.\\n\\n<b>Smart und kompakt<\/b>\\nDie IXUS 230 HS ist mit ihrem kompakten, eleganten Metallgeh\u00e4use eine der schlanksten Kameras mit 8fach Zoom und klein genug f\u00fcr die meisten Taschen.\\n\\n<b>7,5 cm PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nDas gro\u00dfe, hochwertige LC-Display erm\u00f6glicht mit 460.000 Bildpunkten die bequeme Men\u00fcnavigation, komfortable Bildauswahl und Motiv\u00fcberpr\u00fcfung aus nahezu jedem Winkel. Die speziell geh\u00e4rtete Glasschicht sorgt f\u00fcr eine robuste Oberfl\u00e4che.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD-Movies, Powered IS<\/b>\\nIm Moviemodus entstehen 1080p-Full-HD-Movies mit Stereoton; die teilt man gern mit Freunden. Mit dem optischen Zoom kommen Sie ganz nah an das Geschehen heran; dank des optischen Bildstabilisators entstehen gestochen scharfe Movieclips. \u00dcber eine spezielle Taste wechseln Sie sofort vom Foto- in den Moviemodus; die Kamera ist mit einem HDMI-CEC-Anschluss f\u00fcr die bequeme Wiedergabe auf einem HD-Fernseher ausgestattet.\\n\\n<b>Intelligenter AUTO-Modus (Smart Auto)<\/b>\\nIm intelligenten AUTO-Modus (Smart Auto) entstehen ganz komfortabel hochwertige Fotos oder Movies. 32 Aufnahmesituationen (21 bei Movies) werden unterschieden und automatisch die richtigen Einstellungen ausgew\u00e4hlt. Sie m\u00fcssen nur noch das Motiv anvisieren und ausl\u00f6sen.\\n\\n<b>Highspeed-Serienbilder. Superzeitlupe-Movie<\/b>\\nDie Funktion Highspeed-Serienbilder erm\u00f6glicht die ununterbrochene Aufnahme mit 8,7 Bildern pro Sekunde (bei 3,0 MP), Sie verpassen nichts mehr. Im Super Slow Motion Movie Modus werden Szenen mit schneller Action bei der Wiedergabe auf 1\/8 ihrer eigentlichen Geschwindigkeit reduziert.\\n\\n<b>720p-iFrame-Movie Filmtagebuch<\/b>\\nPC- und Mac-kompatible 720p-HD-Movies filmen Sie im optimierten Apple iFrame-Format \u2013 ideal f\u00fcr den schnellen Import, die m\u00fchelose Bearbeitung und bequeme Weitergabe. Im Modus Filmtagebuch wird vor jedem Foto eine 4 Sekunden lange Moviesequenz in VGA-Qualit\u00e4t aufgenommen; die Movieclips eines Tages k\u00f6nnen zu einem interessanten Bonus-Video zusammengef\u00fcgt werden.\\n\\n<b>Kreativmodi<\/b>\\nEntdecken Sie mit interessanten Aufnahmemodi Ihre kreative Ader. Beispielsweise mit dem Spielzeugkamera-Effekt f\u00fcr einen altmodischen Look, dem Miniatureffekt, der ein Foto oder eine Filmszene wie in einer Miniaturwelt darstellt oder dem Monochrom-Effekt.\\n\\n<b>Hinweise und Tipps<\/b>\\nMit einfachen und auf dem Display einblendbaren Hinweisen und Tipps lernen Sie die Funktionsweise Ihrer Kamera besser verstehen und optimieren Ihre Ergebnisse."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>With an 8x zoom lens, Full HD and the low-light skills of the HS System, the fashionably slim IXUS 230 HS is the perfect partner for nights out. Smart Auto lets you focus on living life to the full.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Sharp, versatile, intelligent<\/b>\\nA powerful 8x optical zoom lets you home in on details of far away objects or fit more in the frame with the 28mm wide-angle lens for great group shots and landscapes. Intelligent IS automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 7 modes to prevent blur and deliver sharp and detailed photos and videos.\\n\\n<b>HS System<\/b>\\nHS System excels in low light allowing you to capture the real atmosphere of the moment without flash or tripod. A high performance DIGIC 4 processor and high sensitivity sensor combine to give superior image quality in all situations.\\n\\n<b>Smart and compact<\/b>\\nOne of the slimmest 8x zoom cameras available, the IXUS 230 HS has a compact, elegant metal body that\u2019s small enough to carry in your pocket.\\n\\n<b>7.5 cm (3.0\") PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nA large, high quality 460k dot LCD screen allows easy framing and reviewing of images from any angle and effortless menu navigation. A tempered glass outer layer gives excellent durability.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movies, Powered IS<\/b>\\nCreate Full HD (1080p) movies with stereo sound you\u2019ll be proud to share. Use the optical zoom to get close to the action while the optical Image Stabilizer keeps your movies steady. A dedicated movie button lets you switch instantly from stills to movie mode; an HDMI-CEC connector allows easy playback on an HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot high quality photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and selects the perfect settings from 32 variables (21 in movie). All you have to do is point and shoot.\\n\\n<b>High-speed Burst. Super Slow Motion Movie<\/b>\\nHigh-speed Burst delivers non-stop photo shooting, capturing 8.7 shots per second (3.0 MP), so you never miss a thing. Super Slow Motion Movie slows fast-paced action up to an 1\/8th of the real speed.\\n\\n<b>iFrame movie (720p). Movie Digest<\/b>\\nShoot PC and Mac friendly HD video (720p) in the optimised Apple iFrame format for fast importing, easy editing and simple sharing. Movie Digest records up to 4-seconds of action before each still shot, joining the day\u2019s clips into a bonus VGA movie.\\n\\n<b>Creative modes<\/b>\\nExplore your creativity with fun shooting modes. Effects include Toy Camera for an older style camera look, Miniature to transform a photo or movie scene into a scale model and Monochrome.\\n\\n<b>Hints & Tips<\/b>\\nSimple Hints & Tips interface messages offer step-by-step menu guidance making it easy to understand camera features and settings."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec son zoom 8x, sa fonctionnalit\u00e9 Full HD et les excellentes performances en basse lumi\u00e8re de son Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9, l'appareil photo compact \u00e9l\u00e9gant IXUS 230 HS sera le partenaire id\u00e9al de vos soir\u00e9es. Le mode Smart Auto vous permet d'immortaliser la vie en Full HD en toute simplicit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Soyez au c\u0153ur de la vie<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Pr\u00e9cis, polyvalent, intelligent<\/b>\\nLe puissant zoom optique 8x vous permet de saisir au mieux les d\u00e9tails des objets distants. L'objectif grand-angle de 28 mm \u00e9largit le champ : tr\u00e8s pratique pour les photos de groupe et les paysages. Le stabilisateur d'image intelligent r\u00e8gle la stabilisation d'image optique en fonction de la sc\u00e8ne, en choisissant parmi 7 modes qui \u00e9vitent le flou et garantissent des photos et vid\u00e9os nettes et un niveau de d\u00e9tail \u00e9lev\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9<\/b>\\nLe Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 est particuli\u00e8rement performant en conditions de faible \u00e9clairage : vous pouvez restituer l'atmosph\u00e8re r\u00e9elle de l'instant sans utiliser de flash ou de tr\u00e9pied. Le processeur DIGIC 4 hautes performances et le capteur haute sensibilit\u00e9 assurent une qualit\u00e9 d'image optimale dans toutes les situations.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent et compact<\/b>\\nL'IXUS 230 HS est l'un des appareils photo \u00e0 zoom 8x les plus plats du march\u00e9 : son bo\u00eetier m\u00e9tallique compact et \u00e9l\u00e9gant tient facilement dans la poche.\\n\\n<b>\u00c9cran LCD PureColor II G de 7,5 cm (3 pouces)<\/b>\\nLe grand \u00e9cran LCD haute qualit\u00e9 460 000 points permet de cadrer et de visionner facilement les images depuis n'importe quel angle et assure une navigation ais\u00e9e dans les menus. Sa protection par verre tremp\u00e9 lui conf\u00e8re une grande r\u00e9sistance.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9os Full HD, stabilisateur d'image \u00e9lectronique<\/b>\\nCr\u00e9ez des vid\u00e9os Full HD (1080p) en st\u00e9r\u00e9o que vous pourrez partager avec fiert\u00e9. Utilisez le zoom optique pour \u00eatre au c\u0153ur de l'action, tandis que le stabilisateur d'image \u00e9lectronique \u00e9vite les flous. La touche vid\u00e9o sp\u00e9cifique vous fait passer instantan\u00e9ment du mode photo au mode vid\u00e9o. Le connecteur HDMI-CEC facilite la lecture sur les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs HD.\\n\\n<b>Mode \"Smart Auto\"<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez facilement des photos et vid\u00e9os en mode Smart Auto, qui d\u00e9tecte le type de sc\u00e8ne et s\u00e9lectionne les meilleurs r\u00e9glages possibles parmi un choix de 32 configurations (21 pour les vid\u00e9os). Il ne vous reste plus qu'\u00e0 cadrer et \u00e0 d\u00e9clencher.\\n\\n<b>Rafale grande vitesse Super ralenti vid\u00e9o<\/b>\\nLe mode rafale grande vitesse vous permet d'enregistrer des photos en continu \u00e0 une vitesse de 8,7 clich\u00e9s par seconde (3 millions de pixels). Vous ne manquerez plus rien. Le mode super ralenti vid\u00e9o ralentit les mouvements jusqu'\u00e0 1\/8e de la vitesse r\u00e9elle.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9o iFrame (720p). Pr\u00e9-enregistrement vid\u00e9o<\/b>\\nTournez des vid\u00e9os HD (720p) compatibles PC et Mac, rapides \u00e0 importer, faciles \u00e0 monter et simples \u00e0 partager avec le format optimis\u00e9 Apple iFrame. La fonction de pr\u00e9-enregistrement vid\u00e9o enregistre jusqu'\u00e0 4 secondes d'action avant la prise de vues effective et r\u00e9unit toutes les s\u00e9quences r\u00e9alis\u00e9es le m\u00eame jour en une vid\u00e9o VGA.\\n\\n<b>Modes cr\u00e9atifs<\/b>\\nDonnez libre cours \u00e0 votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 avec des modes de prise de vue amusants. Les effets incluent l'appareil photo-jouet pour un aspect de photo r\u00e9alis\u00e9e avec un mod\u00e8le ancien, la miniature pour transformer une photo ou sc\u00e8ne vid\u00e9o en mod\u00e8le r\u00e9duit et le mode monochrome.\\n\\n<b>Trucs et astuces<\/b>\\nDes trucs et astuces simples sous forme de messages d'interface vous guident \u00e9tape par \u00e9tape dans les menus. Vous apprenez ainsi facilement \u00e0 utiliser les fonctions et r\u00e9glages de l'appareil."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
