Kameras mit 8fach Zoom und klein genug f\u00fcr die meisten Taschen.\\n\\n<b>7,5 cm PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nDas gro\u00dfe, hochwertige LC-Display erm\u00f6glicht mit 460.000 Bildpunkten die bequeme Men\u00fcnavigation, komfortable Bildauswahl und Motiv\u00fcberpr\u00fcfung aus nahezu jedem Winkel. Die speziell geh\u00e4rtete Glasschicht sorgt f\u00fcr eine robuste Oberfl\u00e4che.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD-Movies, Powered IS<\/b>\\nIm Moviemodus entstehen 1080p-Full-HD-Movies mit Stereoton; die teilt man gern mit Freunden. Mit dem optischen Zoom kommen Sie ganz nah an das Geschehen heran; dank des optischen Bildstabilisators entstehen gestochen scharfe Movieclips. \u00dcber eine spezielle Taste wechseln Sie sofort vom Foto- in den Moviemodus; die Kamera ist mit einem HDMI-CEC-Anschluss f\u00fcr die bequeme Wiedergabe auf einem HD-Fernseher ausgestattet.\\n\\n<b>Intelligenter AUTO-Modus (Smart Auto)<\/b>\\nIm intelligenten AUTO-Modus (Smart Auto) entstehen ganz komfortabel hochwertige Fotos oder Movies. 32 Aufnahmesituationen (21 bei Movies) werden unterschieden und automatisch die richtigen Einstellungen ausgew\u00e4hlt. Sie m\u00fcssen nur noch das Motiv anvisieren und ausl\u00f6sen.\\n\\n<b>Highspeed-Serienbilder. Superzeitlupe-Movie<\/b>\\nDie Funktion Highspeed-Serienbilder erm\u00f6glicht die ununterbrochene Aufnahme mit 8,7 Bildern pro Sekunde (bei 3,0 MP), Sie verpassen nichts mehr. Im Super Slow Motion Movie Modus werden Szenen mit schneller Action bei der Wiedergabe auf 1\/8 ihrer eigentlichen Geschwindigkeit reduziert.\\n\\n<b>720p-iFrame-Movie Filmtagebuch<\/b>\\nPC- und Mac-kompatible 720p-HD-Movies filmen Sie im optimierten Apple iFrame-Format \u2013 ideal f\u00fcr den schnellen Import, die m\u00fchelose Bearbeitung und bequeme Weitergabe. Im Modus Filmtagebuch wird vor jedem Foto eine 4 Sekunden lange Moviesequenz in VGA-Qualit\u00e4t aufgenommen; die Movieclips eines Tages k\u00f6nnen zu einem interessanten Bonus-Video zusammengef\u00fcgt werden.\\n\\n<b>Kreativmodi<\/b>\\nEntdecken Sie mit interessanten Aufnahmemodi Ihre kreative Ader. Beispielsweise mit dem Spielzeugkamera-Effekt f\u00fcr einen altmodischen Look, dem Miniatureffekt, der ein Foto oder eine Filmszene wie in einer Miniaturwelt darstellt oder dem Monochrom-Effekt.\\n\\n<b>Hinweise und Tipps<\/b>\\nMit einfachen und auf dem Display einblendbaren Hinweisen und Tipps lernen Sie die Funktionsweise Ihrer Kamera besser verstehen und optimieren Ihre Ergebnisse."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>With an 8x zoom lens, Full HD and the low-light skills of the HS System, the fashionably slim IXUS 230 HS is the perfect partner for nights out. Smart Auto lets you focus on living life to the full.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Sharp, versatile, intelligent<\/b>\\nA powerful 8x optical zoom lets you home in on details of far away objects or fit more in the frame with the 28mm wide-angle lens for great group shots and landscapes. Intelligent IS automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 7 modes to prevent blur and deliver sharp and detailed photos and videos.\\n\\n<b>HS System<\/b>\\nHS System excels in low light allowing you to capture the real atmosphere of the moment without flash or tripod. A high performance DIGIC 4 processor and high sensitivity sensor combine to give superior image quality in all situations.\\n\\n<b>Smart and compact<\/b>\\nOne of the slimmest 8x zoom cameras available, the IXUS 230 HS has a compact, elegant metal body that\u2019s small enough to carry in your pocket.\\n\\n<b>7.5 cm (3.0\") PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nA large, high quality 460k dot LCD screen allows easy framing and reviewing of images from any angle and effortless menu navigation. A tempered glass outer layer gives excellent durability.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movies, Powered IS<\/b>\\nCreate Full HD (1080p) movies with stereo sound you\u2019ll be proud to share. Use the optical zoom to get close to the action while the optical Image Stabilizer keeps your movies steady. A dedicated movie button lets you switch instantly from stills to movie mode; an HDMI-CEC connector allows easy playback on an HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot high quality photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and selects the perfect settings from 32 variables (21 in movie). All you have to do is point and shoot.\\n\\n<b>High-speed Burst. Super Slow Motion Movie<\/b>\\nHigh-speed Burst delivers non-stop photo shooting, capturing 8.7 shots per second (3.0 MP), so you never miss a thing. Super Slow Motion Movie slows fast-paced action up to an 1\/8th of the real speed.\\n\\n<b>iFrame movie (720p). Movie Digest<\/b>\\nShoot PC and Mac friendly HD video (720p) in the optimised Apple iFrame format for fast importing, easy editing and simple sharing. Movie Digest records up to 4-seconds of action before each still shot, joining the day\u2019s clips into a bonus VGA movie.\\n\\n<b>Creative modes<\/b>\\nExplore your creativity with fun shooting modes. Effects include Toy Camera for an older style camera look, Miniature to transform a photo or movie scene into a scale model and Monochrome.\\n\\n<b>Hints & Tips<\/b>\\nSimple Hints & Tips interface messages offer step-by-step menu guidance making it easy to understand camera features and settings."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec son zoom 8x, sa fonctionnalit\u00e9 Full HD et les excellentes performances en basse lumi\u00e8re de son Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9, l'appareil photo compact \u00e9l\u00e9gant IXUS 230 HS sera le partenaire id\u00e9al de vos soir\u00e9es. Le mode Smart Auto vous permet d'immortaliser la vie en Full HD en toute simplicit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Soyez au c\u0153ur de la vie<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Pr\u00e9cis, polyvalent, intelligent<\/b>\\nLe puissant zoom optique 8x vous permet de saisir au mieux les d\u00e9tails des objets distants. L'objectif grand-angle de 28 mm \u00e9largit le champ : tr\u00e8s pratique pour les photos de groupe et les paysages. Le stabilisateur d'image intelligent r\u00e8gle la stabilisation d'image optique en fonction de la sc\u00e8ne, en choisissant parmi 7 modes qui \u00e9vitent le flou et garantissent des photos et vid\u00e9os nettes et un niveau de d\u00e9tail \u00e9lev\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9<\/b>\\nLe Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 est particuli\u00e8rement performant en conditions de faible \u00e9clairage : vous pouvez restituer l'atmosph\u00e8re r\u00e9elle de l'instant sans utiliser de flash ou de tr\u00e9pied. Le processeur DIGIC 4 hautes performances et le capteur haute sensibilit\u00e9 assurent une qualit\u00e9 d'image optimale dans toutes les situations.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent et compact<\/b>\\nL'IXUS 230 HS est l'un des appareils photo \u00e0 zoom 8x les plus plats du march\u00e9 : son bo\u00eetier m\u00e9tallique compact et \u00e9l\u00e9gant tient facilement dans la poche.\\n\\n<b>\u00c9cran LCD PureColor II G de 7,5 cm (3 pouces)<\/b>\\nLe grand \u00e9cran LCD haute qualit\u00e9 460 000 points permet de cadrer et de visionner facilement les images depuis n'importe quel angle et assure une navigation ais\u00e9e dans les menus. Sa protection par verre tremp\u00e9 lui conf\u00e8re une grande r\u00e9sistance.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9os Full HD, stabilisateur d'image \u00e9lectronique<\/b>\\nCr\u00e9ez des vid\u00e9os Full HD (1080p) en st\u00e9r\u00e9o que vous pourrez partager avec fiert\u00e9. Utilisez le zoom optique pour \u00eatre au c\u0153ur de l'action, tandis que le stabilisateur d'image \u00e9lectronique \u00e9vite les flous. La touche vid\u00e9o sp\u00e9cifique vous fait passer instantan\u00e9ment du mode photo au mode vid\u00e9o. Le connecteur HDMI-CEC facilite la lecture sur les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs HD.\\n\\n<b>Mode \"Smart Auto\"<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez facilement des photos et vid\u00e9os en mode Smart Auto, qui d\u00e9tecte le type de sc\u00e8ne et s\u00e9lectionne les meilleurs r\u00e9glages possibles parmi un choix de 32 configurations (21 pour les vid\u00e9os). Il ne vous reste plus qu'\u00e0 cadrer et \u00e0 d\u00e9clencher.\\n\\n<b>Rafale grande vitesse Super ralenti vid\u00e9o<\/b>\\nLe mode rafale grande vitesse vous permet d'enregistrer des photos en continu \u00e0 une vitesse de 8,7 clich\u00e9s par seconde (3 millions de pixels). Vous ne manquerez plus rien. Le mode super ralenti vid\u00e9o ralentit les mouvements jusqu'\u00e0 1\/8e de la vitesse r\u00e9elle.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9o iFrame (720p). Pr\u00e9-enregistrement vid\u00e9o<\/b>\\nTournez des vid\u00e9os HD (720p) compatibles PC et Mac, rapides \u00e0 importer, faciles \u00e0 monter et simples \u00e0 partager avec le format optimis\u00e9 Apple iFrame. La fonction de pr\u00e9-enregistrement vid\u00e9o enregistre jusqu'\u00e0 4 secondes d'action avant la prise de vues effective et r\u00e9unit toutes les s\u00e9quences r\u00e9alis\u00e9es le m\u00eame jour en une vid\u00e9o VGA.\\n\\n<b>Modes cr\u00e9atifs<\/b>\\nDonnez libre cours \u00e0 votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 avec des modes de prise de vue amusants. Les effets incluent l'appareil photo-jouet pour un aspect de photo r\u00e9alis\u00e9e avec un mod\u00e8le ancien, la miniature pour transformer une photo ou sc\u00e8ne vid\u00e9o en mod\u00e8le r\u00e9duit et le mode monochrome.\\n\\n<b>Trucs et astuces<\/b>\\nDes trucs et astuces simples sous forme de messages d'interface vous guident \u00e9tape par \u00e9tape dans les menus. Vous apprenez ainsi facilement \u00e0 utiliser les fonctions et r\u00e9glages de l'appareil."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d9a6c89e-921b-4c9e-94b1-b15659abacda","identifier":"12568107","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon Digital IXUS 230 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Mit dem 8fach Zoomobjektiv, Full HD und HS-System f\u00fcr optimierte Aufnahmen beischwachen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen ist die schlanke IXUS 230 HS der ideale Begleiter f\u00fcr Nachtschw\u00e4rmer. Dank intelligentem AUTO-Modus (Smart Auto) werden brillante Aufnahmen zum Kinderspiel.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Vielseitige und intelligente Kamera f\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Fotos<\/b>\\nDas 28-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv mit 8fach optischem Zoom ist ideal f\u00fcr detailreiche Fotos weit entfernter Motive, f\u00fcr Gruppen- und f\u00fcr Landschaftsaufnahmen Mit 7 Modi passt Intelligent IS den Bildstabilisator automatisch an das Motiv an; das Resultat: minimierte Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfe und gestochen scharfe, detailreiche Fotos und Movieclips.\\n\\n<b>HS-System<\/b>\\nDas innovative HS-System, die Kombination aus leistungsstarkem DIGIC-4-Bildprozessor und hoch empfindlichem Sensor, sorgt f\u00fcr exzellente Bildqualit\u00e4t in nahezu allen Aufnahmesituationen. Es brilliert besonders bei schwachen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen \u2013 ideal, um den Zauber einer Stimmung auch ohne Blitz und Stativ festzuhalten. Die Kombination aus hoch empfindlichem Bildsensor und leistungsstarkem DIGIC-4-Bildprozessor sorgt f\u00fcr exzellente Bildqualit\u00e4t in nahezu allen Situationen.\\n\\n<b>Smart und kompakt<\/b>\\nDie IXUS 230 HS ist mit ihrem kompakten, eleganten Metallgeh\u00e4use eine der schlanksten Kameras mit 8fach Zoom und klein genug f\u00fcr die meisten Taschen.\\n\\n<b>7,5 cm PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nDas gro\u00dfe, hochwertige LC-Display erm\u00f6glicht mit 460.000 Bildpunkten die bequeme Men\u00fcnavigation, komfortable Bildauswahl und Motiv\u00fcberpr\u00fcfung aus nahezu jedem Winkel. Die speziell geh\u00e4rtete Glasschicht sorgt f\u00fcr eine robuste Oberfl\u00e4che.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD-Movies, Powered IS<\/b>\\nIm Moviemodus entstehen 1080p-Full-HD-Movies mit Stereoton; die teilt man gern mit Freunden. Mit dem optischen Zoom kommen Sie ganz nah an das Geschehen heran; dank des optischen Bildstabilisators entstehen gestochen scharfe Movieclips. \u00dcber eine spezielle Taste wechseln Sie sofort vom Foto- in den Moviemodus; die Kamera ist mit einem HDMI-CEC-Anschluss f\u00fcr die bequeme Wiedergabe auf einem HD-Fernseher ausgestattet.\\n\\n<b>Intelligenter AUTO-Modus (Smart Auto)<\/b>\\nIm intelligenten AUTO-Modus (Smart Auto) entstehen ganz komfortabel hochwertige Fotos oder Movies. 32 Aufnahmesituationen (21 bei Movies) werden unterschieden und automatisch die richtigen Einstellungen ausgew\u00e4hlt. Sie m\u00fcssen nur noch das Motiv anvisieren und ausl\u00f6sen.\\n\\n<b>Highspeed-Serienbilder. Superzeitlupe-Movie<\/b>\\nDie Funktion Highspeed-Serienbilder erm\u00f6glicht die ununterbrochene Aufnahme mit 8,7 Bildern pro Sekunde (bei 3,0 MP), Sie verpassen nichts mehr. Im Super Slow Motion Movie Modus werden Szenen mit schneller Action bei der Wiedergabe auf 1\/8 ihrer eigentlichen Geschwindigkeit reduziert.\\n\\n<b>720p-iFrame-Movie Filmtagebuch<\/b>\\nPC- und Mac-kompatible 720p-HD-Movies filmen Sie im optimierten Apple iFrame-Format \u2013 ideal f\u00fcr den schnellen Import, die m\u00fchelose Bearbeitung und bequeme Weitergabe. Im Modus Filmtagebuch wird vor jedem Foto eine 4 Sekunden lange Moviesequenz in VGA-Qualit\u00e4t aufgenommen; die Movieclips eines Tages k\u00f6nnen zu einem interessanten Bonus-Video zusammengef\u00fcgt werden.\\n\\n<b>Kreativmodi<\/b>\\nEntdecken Sie mit interessanten Aufnahmemodi Ihre kreative Ader. Beispielsweise mit dem Spielzeugkamera-Effekt f\u00fcr einen altmodischen Look, dem Miniatureffekt, der ein Foto oder eine Filmszene wie in einer Miniaturwelt darstellt oder dem Monochrom-Effekt.\\n\\n<b>Hinweise und Tipps<\/b>\\nMit einfachen und auf dem Display einblendbaren Hinweisen und Tipps lernen Sie die Funktionsweise Ihrer Kamera besser verstehen und optimieren Ihre Ergebnisse."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>With an 8x zoom lens, Full HD and the low-light skills of the HS System, the fashionably slim IXUS 230 HS is the perfect partner for nights out. Smart Auto lets you focus on living life to the full.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Sharp, versatile, intelligent<\/b>\\nA powerful 8x optical zoom lets you home in on details of far away objects or fit more in the frame with the 28mm wide-angle lens for great group shots and landscapes. Intelligent IS automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 7 modes to prevent blur and deliver sharp and detailed photos and videos.\\n\\n<b>HS System<\/b>\\nHS System excels in low light allowing you to capture the real atmosphere of the moment without flash or tripod. A high performance DIGIC 4 processor and high sensitivity sensor combine to give superior image quality in all situations.\\n\\n<b>Smart and compact<\/b>\\nOne of the slimmest 8x zoom cameras available, the IXUS 230 HS has a compact, elegant metal body that\u2019s small enough to carry in your pocket.\\n\\n<b>7.5 cm (3.0\") PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nA large, high quality 460k dot LCD screen allows easy framing and reviewing of images from any angle and effortless menu navigation. A tempered glass outer layer gives excellent durability.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movies, Powered IS<\/b>\\nCreate Full HD (1080p) movies with stereo sound you\u2019ll be proud to share. Use the optical zoom to get close to the action while the optical Image Stabilizer keeps your movies steady. A dedicated movie button lets you switch instantly from stills to movie mode; an HDMI-CEC connector allows easy playback on an HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot high quality photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and selects the perfect settings from 32 variables (21 in movie). All you have to do is point and shoot.\\n\\n<b>High-speed Burst. Super Slow Motion Movie<\/b>\\nHigh-speed Burst delivers non-stop photo shooting, capturing 8.7 shots per second (3.0 MP), so you never miss a thing. Super Slow Motion Movie slows fast-paced action up to an 1\/8th of the real speed.\\n\\n<b>iFrame movie (720p). Movie Digest<\/b>\\nShoot PC and Mac friendly HD video (720p) in the optimised Apple iFrame format for fast importing, easy editing and simple sharing. Movie Digest records up to 4-seconds of action before each still shot, joining the day\u2019s clips into a bonus VGA movie.\\n\\n<b>Creative modes<\/b>\\nExplore your creativity with fun shooting modes. Effects include Toy Camera for an older style camera look, Miniature to transform a photo or movie scene into a scale model and Monochrome.\\n\\n<b>Hints & Tips<\/b>\\nSimple Hints & Tips interface messages offer step-by-step menu guidance making it easy to understand camera features and settings."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec son zoom 8x, sa fonctionnalit\u00e9 Full HD et les excellentes performances en basse lumi\u00e8re de son Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9, l'appareil photo compact \u00e9l\u00e9gant IXUS 230 HS sera le partenaire id\u00e9al de vos soir\u00e9es. Le mode Smart Auto vous permet d'immortaliser la vie en Full HD en toute simplicit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Soyez au c\u0153ur de la vie<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Pr\u00e9cis, polyvalent, intelligent<\/b>\\nLe puissant zoom optique 8x vous permet de saisir au mieux les d\u00e9tails des objets distants. L'objectif grand-angle de 28 mm \u00e9largit le champ : tr\u00e8s pratique pour les photos de groupe et les paysages. Le stabilisateur d'image intelligent r\u00e8gle la stabilisation d'image optique en fonction de la sc\u00e8ne, en choisissant parmi 7 modes qui \u00e9vitent le flou et garantissent des photos et vid\u00e9os nettes et un niveau de d\u00e9tail \u00e9lev\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9<\/b>\\nLe Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 est particuli\u00e8rement performant en conditions de faible \u00e9clairage : vous pouvez restituer l'atmosph\u00e8re r\u00e9elle de l'instant sans utiliser de flash ou de tr\u00e9pied. Le processeur DIGIC 4 hautes performances et le capteur haute sensibilit\u00e9 assurent une qualit\u00e9 d'image optimale dans toutes les situations.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent et compact<\/b>\\nL'IXUS 230 HS est l'un des appareils photo \u00e0 zoom 8x les plus plats du march\u00e9 : son bo\u00eetier m\u00e9tallique compact et \u00e9l\u00e9gant tient facilement dans la poche.\\n\\n<b>\u00c9cran LCD PureColor II G de 7,5 cm (3 pouces)<\/b>\\nLe grand \u00e9cran LCD haute qualit\u00e9 460 000 points permet de cadrer et de visionner facilement les images depuis n'importe quel angle et assure une navigation ais\u00e9e dans les menus. Sa protection par verre tremp\u00e9 lui conf\u00e8re une grande r\u00e9sistance.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9os Full HD, stabilisateur d'image \u00e9lectronique<\/b>\\nCr\u00e9ez des vid\u00e9os Full HD (1080p) en st\u00e9r\u00e9o que vous pourrez partager avec fiert\u00e9. Utilisez le zoom optique pour \u00eatre au c\u0153ur de l'action, tandis que le stabilisateur d'image \u00e9lectronique \u00e9vite les flous. La touche vid\u00e9o sp\u00e9cifique vous fait passer instantan\u00e9ment du mode photo au mode vid\u00e9o. Le connecteur HDMI-CEC facilite la lecture sur les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs HD.\\n\\n<b>Mode \"Smart Auto\"<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez facilement des photos et vid\u00e9os en mode Smart Auto, qui d\u00e9tecte le type de sc\u00e8ne et s\u00e9lectionne les meilleurs r\u00e9glages possibles parmi un choix de 32 configurations (21 pour les vid\u00e9os). Il ne vous reste plus qu'\u00e0 cadrer et \u00e0 d\u00e9clencher.\\n\\n<b>Rafale grande vitesse Super ralenti vid\u00e9o<\/b>\\nLe mode rafale grande vitesse vous permet d'enregistrer des photos en continu \u00e0 une vitesse de 8,7 clich\u00e9s par seconde (3 millions de pixels). Vous ne manquerez plus rien. Le mode super ralenti vid\u00e9o ralentit les mouvements jusqu'\u00e0 1\/8e de la vitesse r\u00e9elle.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9o iFrame (720p). Pr\u00e9-enregistrement vid\u00e9o<\/b>\\nTournez des vid\u00e9os HD (720p) compatibles PC et Mac, rapides \u00e0 importer, faciles \u00e0 monter et simples \u00e0 partager avec le format optimis\u00e9 Apple iFrame. La fonction de pr\u00e9-enregistrement vid\u00e9o enregistre jusqu'\u00e0 4 secondes d'action avant la prise de vues effective et r\u00e9unit toutes les s\u00e9quences r\u00e9alis\u00e9es le m\u00eame jour en une vid\u00e9o VGA.\\n\\n<b>Modes cr\u00e9atifs<\/b>\\nDonnez libre cours \u00e0 votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 avec des modes de prise de vue amusants. Les effets incluent l'appareil photo-jouet pour un aspect de photo r\u00e9alis\u00e9e avec un mod\u00e8le ancien, la miniature pour transformer une photo ou sc\u00e8ne vid\u00e9o en mod\u00e8le r\u00e9duit et le mode monochrome.\\n\\n<b>Trucs et astuces<\/b>\\nDes trucs et astuces simples sous forme de messages d'interface vous guident \u00e9tape par \u00e9tape dans les menus. Vous apprenez ainsi facilement \u00e0 utiliser les fonctions et r\u00e9glages de l'appareil."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cb16c66d-d1b7-4fe9-bfd8-67fd17c1a401","identifier":"12571492","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 19B4LPCB"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der Philips PowerSensor LED-Monitor verwendet 65\u00a0% wiederverwertete Kunststoffe. Mit seinem ohne PVC und bromierte Flammschutzmittel hergestellten Geh\u00e4use ist er somit umweltfreundlich und produktiv zugleich."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sustainable eco design display<\/b>\\n<b>with PowerSensor saves energy bills<\/b>\\nThe Philips PowerSensor LED display using 65% post-consumer recycled plastics and PVC, BFR free housing is ideal for eco-friendly productivity\\n\\n<b>Sustainable Eco-design<\/b>\\n- PowerSensor saves up to 80% energy costs\\n- Zero power consumption with 0 watt hard switch\\n- 65% post consumer recycled plastics with TCO Edge\\n- PVC-BFR free housing\\n\\n<b>Excellent performance<\/b>\\n- LED technology ensures natural colours\\n- TrueVision ensures lab quality images\\n- Built-in stereo speakers for multimedia\\n\\n<b>Designed for people<\/b>\\n- SmartErgoBase enables user-friendly ergonomic adjustments\\n- Low bezel-to-table height for maximum reading comfort\\n\\n<b>Easy to experience<\/b>\\n- SmartImage presets for easy optimised image settings\\n- USB Hub with 2 ports for easy connection"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Utilisant 65\u00a0% de plastiques issus d'un recyclage post-consommation et ne contenant ni PVC ni BFR, cet \u00e9cran LED Philips PowerSensor est la solution id\u00e9ale pour combiner productivit\u00e9 et respect de l'environnement"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9283dae8-70c7-419e-a3da-bfe4f8ae2871","identifier":"12576581","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix T400"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>10x zoom in Slim body<\/b>\\nThe small camera with a big performance. The FinePix T400 \/ T350 packs intelligent scene recognition, 16 \/ 14-megapixels and a 10x optical zoom into a body that is so compact it fits in every pocket, purse or bag.\\nSuper slim styling in seven amazing colors\\n\\nThe FinePix T400 \/ T350 is sleek and slim. This 19.8mm* of super slim compact body fits in your pocket or purse effortlessly. Colors available in Black, Silver, Champagne Gold, Blue, Red, Pink and Purple.\\n* Minimum depth\\nFujinon Wide angle 28mm & 10x Zoom Lens\\n\\n<b>Highly Regarded by Professionals World-wide<\/b>\\nWide Angle (28mm*)10x Optional Zoom (280mm*)\\nA high-quality Fujinon 10x zoom lens delivers picture-perfect results across the entire zoom range, from wide-angle compositions to dramatic close-up shots.\\n* Equivalent on 35mm camera\\n16 \/ 14 Megapixels*1 - With Vivid Colors and Clarity\\n\\nAn impressive 16 \/ 14 megapixels resolution won't miss the finest details of your subject. Images are captured sharp and clear, in vivid colors, even when printed at large sizes.\\n*1: T400 : 16 Megapixels \/ T350 : 14 Megapixels\\nHigh Sensitivity + CCD Shift Image Stabilization\\n\\nDual Image Stabilization is the combination of high sensitivity and CCD shift image stabilization that works to eliminate blurred photos by freezing action and minimizing blurs at maximum zoom range.\\nWorks in scenes such as subjects in motion, low-light conditions, and underwater that usually gives blurry results.\\n\\nConventional Digital CameraFinePix T400 \/ T350\\n<b>3.0-inch Large LCD<\/b>\\nThe large, bright LCD display makes it easy to compose great photos. Sharing pictures is a pleasure, thanks to a high-impact 230,000-dot resolution.\\n\\n<b>HDTV-compatible Photos & Video<\/b>\\nAble to capture both photos and movies in high-definition 16:9 format, the FinePix T400 \/ T350 lets you discover the impact of full-screen HDTV image display.\\nCapture high resolution images in 16:9 format (1,280 x 720 pixels).\\n* Optional HD Player HDP-L1 is required.\\n\\n<b>One Touch Movie Recoding Button<\/b>\\nOne Touch Movie Recoding Button just for shooting movies! No settings. Just press, shoot, and enjoy the movie.\\n\\n<b>Post Capture Editing<\/b>\\nTry our in-camera movie and image editing functions to artistically enliven photos, creating distinctive ambiances.\\n\\nMovie Editing Movie Trimming\\nAfter you take a clip, just set the IN and OUT points to crop and save only the part you want. It's that easy.\\n\\nMovie Join\\nSelect any previously recorded movie file and \"resume\" shooting to create a movie up to 2GB size.\\n\\n<b>Optional HDTV Connection Kit<\/b>\\nCombining an HD card reader and a remote control, the optional connection kit makes it easy to display photos and movies on your HDTV.\\nCompatible Accessories\\n* Please use commercially available HDMI cable for connecting with HDTV.\\n* HDP-L1 is compatible with SD \/ SDHC cards only.\\n\\n<b>6 Scene SR AUTO<\/b>\\nFramed scenes are automatically detected and selected into appropriate camera settings: Portrait, Landscape, Night, Macro, Night Portrait, and Backlit Portrait.\\n\\nPortrait\\nRecognizes portraits by detecting the faces quickly in the frame and optimizing focus, brightness and white balance.\\n\\nLandscape\\nScenic shots such as mountains and buildings are automatically recognized. Colors of the sky, forests, and flower fields are captured in vivid colors and depth.\\n\\nNight\\nFor low-light and night-time scenarios, shutter speed and sensitivity are automatically adjusted, producing blur-free pictures with minimal noise.\\n\\nMacro\\nMacro mode sets the focusing position of the details of small flowers or tiny subjects accurately.\\n\\nNight Portrait\\nWhen photographing people at night or in low light, SR AUTO optimizes flash range, shutter speed, and exposure of the portraits, while capturing smooth and luminous background.\\n\\nBacklit Portrait\\nOptimizes brightness of the faces that usually end up in shadow and underexposure caused by the light behind.\\n\\n<b>Face Detection<\/b>\\nFace Detection optimizes people pictures by detecting faces and adjusting focus and exposure to ensure bright, clear results.\\nConventional Digital CameraFinePix T400 \/ T350\\n\\nRed-eye Removal in Detected Faces\\nRed-eye removal automatically detects and corrects flash reflection for a perfect end result.\\nInstantly Detect up to 10 Faces!\\n\\nThe Face Detection can simultaneously recognizes up to 10 faces in a photo. Share your group portraits using the Zoom Up function in playbacks, checking each detected face. Each priceless expression can be cropped and saved in clear high resolution results.\\n\\n<b>Blink Detection<\/b>\\nThe camera will warn you when people in the frame are blinking, giving you the option to retake the photo, or enlarge the face so you can save or delete the image before you take the next shot.\\n\\n<b>Smile & Shoot Mode<\/b>\\nThe Smile & Shoot mode of Scene Position, automatically releases the shutter when the smile appears so you won't miss the adorable smile the moment they happen.\\nConventional Digital CameraFinePix T400 \/ T350\\n\\n<b>Face Recognition<\/b>\\nThe FinePix T400 \/ T350 not only detects faces in a frame but it can also recognize who is who! You can register up to 8 people in your camera and next time you take a photo of them it will bring up their name and optimize settings in favor of your registered faces. In playback, you can search for all photos containing registered faces to quickly find photos of your favorites."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"02c4e31d-3703-41a7-bcc2-5e0fa1218ac2","identifier":"12576582","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix S2980"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Perfect for those looking to step up from a basic compact to a camera with more features. The FinePix S2980 camera has a generous 18x zoom, 14-megapixel resolution and an electronic viewfinder to compliment its LCD view screen.\\n\\nIn addition to the same core specifications of the previous S2950, the S2980 also features a brighter LCD screen, faster startup time, longer flash range and a shorter time between shots.\\n\\n<b>14-megapixel resolution and 18x optical zoom<\/b>\\n\\nA 14-megapixel CCD sensor delivers large, high-resolution images, while a 18x optical zoom gets you close to the action.\\n\\n<b>From wide angle to extreme telephoto at the flick of a switch<\/b>\\n\\nAn 18x Fujinon optical zoom provides the equivalent of a 28-504mm lens on a full-frame digital camera, but at a fraction of the size and weight! The wide-angle end focal lengths will be popular with those shooting landscapes, street scenes and interiors, while extreme telephoto settings will get you closer to the action when shooting sports or wildlife. Experiment with intermediate zoom settings when shooting portraits, still life and travel photography.\\n\\n<b>28mm wide angle<\/b>\\n\\nWhere some bridge cameras sacrifice the wide-angle part of the zoom range to get extra reach at the telephoto end, the S2900 series gives you the best of both worlds, starting with a very useful 28mm (equivalent) wide-angle zoom setting.\\n\\nAt 28mm you\u2019ll be able to take in those big-sky landscapes, shoot interiors in great detail and cope easily with large group shots.\\n\\n<b>14 megapixel resolution for great image quality<\/b>\\n\\nWith 14-megapixels you\u2019ll not be left wanting more when it comes to resolution. The FinePix S2900 series produces JPEG files measuring up to 4288x3216 pixels, which is big enough to produce prints larger than A3, or allow creative cropping on your home PC without loosing quality. The Fujifilm CCD sensor captures the world around you in vivid colour and stunning clarity.\\n\\n<b>Dual image stabilisation<\/b>\\n\\nCamera shake at long shutter speeds can ruin an otherwise golden moment with image blur.\\n\\nThe FinePix S2900 series tackles this head on by combining high ISO sensitivity with sensor-shift image stabilisation \u2013 great for photography indoors without using flash\\n\\n<b>High ISO sensitivity (max. ISO6400)<\/b>\\n\\nDon\u2019t just rely on flash in low light: adjust the sensitivity all of the way from ISO64 to ISO6400, according to shooting conditions. Or use a higher ISO value in good light to ensure that shutter speeds are fast enough to freeze any action.\\n\\n* At ISO3200 and 6400, number of recorded pixels is limited to a maximum 3 megapixels. At full resolution (14 megapixels), sensitivity is limited to a maximum ISO1600."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":18}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3151a190-b2ae-42a0-8752-88d19f001784","identifier":"12576592","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix XP100"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Rugged Design For The Great Outdoors!<\/b>\\nBuilt to withstand whatever you throw at it.\\nThe XP100 is waterproof to 10m, shock proof to 2m, sealed against dust and sand, and even works in temperatures down to -10\u00b0C.\\n\\n<b>Waterproof<\/b>\\nSealed with powerful waterproof of up to 10m (32.8ft.) depth, get close, capture the excitement and dynamic scenes of the water world.\\n\\n<b>Shockproof<\/b>\\nPerfect for sports activities! The FinePix XP100 can survive a 2m (6.6ft.) fall.\\n\\n<b>Freezeproof<\/b>\\nThe FinePix XP100 will suit perfectly for any winter activities proving its durability for max. -10\u00b0C (14\u00b0F).\\n\\n<b>Dustproof<\/b>\\nGreat for locations such as sandy beaches and outdoor wilderness.\\n\\n<b>Anti Reflection LCD<\/b>\\nThe bright, clear 2.7-inch LCD features an anti-reflective coating for excellent visibility, even in full sunlight. It also gives you a great view of the underwater world.\\n\\n<b>Underwater<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Double Lock<\/b>\\nThe battery compartment is sealed with a double lock as an extra waterproofing safeguard using the camera underwater or in the field.\\n\\n<b>Water-repellent Coating Lens<\/b>\\nThe reinforced lens cover is treated with a water-repellant coating \u2014 just shake the water off the lens and go right on shooting.\\n\\n<b>Shockproof Bumper Design<\/b>\\nA shockproof bumper protects the LCD in the midst of the action.\\n\\n<b>New Long-life Li-ion Battery<\/b>\\nCapable of shooting more than 300 frames on a single charge, the long-life Li-ion battery keeps up with your most active itineraries.\\n\\n<b>Cool Five Colors<\/b>\\nPerfect for outdoor activities, the FinePix XP100 is available in Blue, Black, Silver, Orange and Green."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4c084982-e586-4723-b1c5-3e3f7f2af93a","identifier":"12576603","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix T350"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>10x zoom in Slim body<\/b>\\nThe small camera with a big performance. The FinePix T400 \/ T350 packs intelligent scene recognition, 16 \/ 14-megapixels and a 10x optical zoom into a body that is so compact it fits in every pocket, purse or bag.\\nSuper slim styling in seven amazing colors\\n\\nThe FinePix T400 \/ T350 is sleek and slim. This 19.8mm* of super slim compact body fits in your pocket or purse effortlessly. Colors available in Black, Silver, Champagne Gold, Blue, Red, Pink and Purple.\\n* Minimum depth\\nFujinon Wide angle 28mm & 10x Zoom Lens\\n\\n<b>Highly Regarded by Professionals World-wide<\/b>\\nWide Angle (28mm*)10x Optional Zoom (280mm*)\\nA high-quality Fujinon 10x zoom lens delivers picture-perfect results across the entire zoom range, from wide-angle compositions to dramatic close-up shots.\\n* Equivalent on 35mm camera\\n16 \/ 14 Megapixels*1 - With Vivid Colors and Clarity\\n\\nAn impressive 16 \/ 14 megapixels resolution won't miss the finest details of your subject. Images are captured sharp and clear, in vivid colors, even when printed at large sizes.\\n*1: T400 : 16 Megapixels \/ T350 : 14 Megapixels\\nHigh Sensitivity + CCD Shift Image Stabilization\\n\\nDual Image Stabilization is the combination of high sensitivity and CCD shift image stabilization that works to eliminate blurred photos by freezing action and minimizing blurs at maximum zoom range.\\nWorks in scenes such as subjects in motion, low-light conditions, and underwater that usually gives blurry results.\\n\\nConventional Digital CameraFinePix T400 \/ T350\\n<b>3.0-inch Large LCD<\/b>\\nThe large, bright LCD display makes it easy to compose great photos. Sharing pictures is a pleasure, thanks to a high-impact 230,000-dot resolution.\\n\\n<b>HDTV-compatible Photos & Video<\/b>\\nAble to capture both photos and movies in high-definition 16:9 format, the FinePix T400 \/ T350 lets you discover the impact of full-screen HDTV image display.\\nCapture high resolution images in 16:9 format (1,280 x 720 pixels).\\n* Optional HD Player HDP-L1 is required.\\n\\n<b>One Touch Movie Recoding Button<\/b>\\nOne Touch Movie Recoding Button just for shooting movies! No settings. Just press, shoot, and enjoy the movie.\\n\\n<b>Post Capture Editing<\/b>\\nTry our in-camera movie and image editing functions to artistically enliven photos, creating distinctive ambiances.\\n\\nMovie Editing Movie Trimming\\nAfter you take a clip, just set the IN and OUT points to crop and save only the part you want. It's that easy.\\n\\nMovie Join\\nSelect any previously recorded movie file and \"resume\" shooting to create a movie up to 2GB size.\\n\\n<b>Optional HDTV Connection Kit<\/b>\\nCombining an HD card reader and a remote control, the optional connection kit makes it easy to display photos and movies on your HDTV.\\nCompatible Accessories\\n* Please use commercially available HDMI cable for connecting with HDTV.\\n* HDP-L1 is compatible with SD \/ SDHC cards only.\\n\\n<b>6 Scene SR AUTO<\/b>\\nFramed scenes are automatically detected and selected into appropriate camera settings: Portrait, Landscape, Night, Macro, Night Portrait, and Backlit Portrait.\\n\\nPortrait\\nRecognizes portraits by detecting the faces quickly in the frame and optimizing focus, brightness and white balance.\\n\\nLandscape\\nScenic shots such as mountains and buildings are automatically recognized. Colors of the sky, forests, and flower fields are captured in vivid colors and depth.\\n\\nNight\\nFor low-light and night-time scenarios, shutter speed and sensitivity are automatically adjusted, producing blur-free pictures with minimal noise.\\n\\nMacro\\nMacro mode sets the focusing position of the details of small flowers or tiny subjects accurately.\\n\\nNight Portrait\\nWhen photographing people at night or in low light, SR AUTO optimizes flash range, shutter speed, and exposure of the portraits, while capturing smooth and luminous background.\\n\\nBacklit Portrait\\nOptimizes brightness of the faces that usually end up in shadow and underexposure caused by the light behind.\\n\\n<b>Face Detection<\/b>\\nFace Detection optimizes people pictures by detecting faces and adjusting focus and exposure to ensure bright, clear results.\\nConventional Digital CameraFinePix T400 \/ T350\\n\\nRed-eye Removal in Detected Faces\\nRed-eye removal automatically detects and corrects flash reflection for a perfect end result.\\nInstantly Detect up to 10 Faces!\\n\\nThe Face Detection can simultaneously recognizes up to 10 faces in a photo. Share your group portraits using the Zoom Up function in playbacks, checking each detected face. Each priceless expression can be cropped and saved in clear high resolution results.\\n\\n<b>Blink Detection<\/b>\\nThe camera will warn you when people in the frame are blinking, giving you the option to retake the photo, or enlarge the face so you can save or delete the image before you take the next shot.\\n\\n<b>Smile & Shoot Mode<\/b>\\nThe Smile & Shoot mode of Scene Position, automatically releases the shutter when the smile appears so you won't miss the adorable smile the moment they happen.\\nConventional Digital CameraFinePix T400 \/ T350\\n\\n<b>Face Recognition<\/b>\\nThe FinePix T400 \/ T350 not only detects faces in a frame but it can also recognize who is who! You can register up to 8 people in your camera and next time you take a photo of them it will bring up their name and optimize settings in favor of your registered faces. In playback, you can search for all photos containing registered faces to quickly find photos of your favorites."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"34d607fd-55d0-4352-a3ab-2a7966b885b5","identifier":"1264383","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["iiyama","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"iiyama ProLite B1702S-W2, ivory"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 100 - 240 V, 50 \/ 60 Hz"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":17,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The new \u2018B\u2019 series of displays from iiyama means what it stands for; Business. The impressive specification and feature set offers superb picture quality and flexibility for Business applications with integrated Height Adjustability in the stand. The core component is a high-grade TN panel with a 1.3 megapixel resolution, high contrast ratio and powerful brightness ensuring optimum picture quality. Comprising of both Analogue and Digital inputs with free Digital cable compatibility with your system is assured.  The PLB1702S is available in Black or Ivory.\\n \\n \\n"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"29fd2d31-70f6-4d12-bfe5-b006dcec7420","identifier":"12677165","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["hp","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP 638553-001"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":13,"unit":"INCH"}}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"520d7dc6-dcaf-406b-83cb-0f5b04b3df35","identifier":"1270258","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung YP-P2J - 8GB MP3 Player, White"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung YP-P2J - 8GB MP3 Player, White. Player media type: flash-media. Display: LCD, Display resolution: 272 x 480. Audio formats supported: MP3, WMA, Video formats supported: MPEG4. Battery technology: Lithium Polymer (LiPo). Bundled software: Samsung Media Studio 5.0"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>DNSe 2.0<\/b> \\nAvec le syst\u00e8me DNSe 2.0+, vibrez au son d\u2019une musique saisissante de r\u00e9alisme. Reproduction parfaite du son st\u00e9r\u00e9o, amplification des basses, mode 3D, mode Rue adapt\u00e9 aux environnements bruyants\u2026 DNSe vous offre une exp\u00e9rience musicale hors normes. \\n\\n<b>Bluetooth 2.0<\/b> \\nL'exp\u00e9rience totale du sans-fil !\\n\\nLa norme Bluetooth 2.0 permet de connecter simultan\u00e9ment deux casques st\u00e9r\u00e9o Bluetooth \u00e0 votre baladeur et d'utiliser \u00e9galement un casque sans-fil lors de la lecture de films (casque non fourni). \\n\\n<b>Grand \u00e9cran tactile 3\"<\/b> \\nUn \u00e9cran large 16:9 LCD WQVGA 3\" enti\u00e8rement tactile une interface utilisateur sp\u00e9cifiquement pens\u00e9e pour le large \u00e9cran tactile, qui pr\u00e9sente une ergonomie incomparable."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-26T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1cbaab75-d6be-4f47-8034-43276d327ce5","identifier":"12732545","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"e\/b\/9\/a\/eb9ae7c39110e182a518d38437a047d176cf0da3_12732545_8046.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/e\/b\/9\/a\/eb9ae7c39110e182a518d38437a047d176cf0da3_12732545_8046.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony HDR-CX200E"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5.3"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Defined High Def<\/b>\\nNot all high definition is created equal. Get it in decidedly gorgeous, truly Full 1920x1080\/60i HD for exceptional high definition quality.\\n\\n<b>Better Shots in Low Light<\/b>\\nExperience stunning low-light sensitivity with improved image clarity and drastically reduced grain with a back-illuminated Exmor R CMOS sensor. Engineered specifically for compact cameras and camcorders, the Exmor R CMOS sensor is designed to let you shoot video in lower lighting conditions with better results.\\n\\n<b>Bye Bye Blur<\/b>\\nSteadyShot image stabilization with Active Mode compensates for greater degrees of camera shake to deliver stunningly smooth video from wide angle to full telephoto shooting. Innovative 3-way shake-canceling adds electronic roll stability for even smoother video capture.\\n\\n<b>30x Extended Zoom<\/b>\\nExtended digital zoom works in conjunction with 25x optical zoom to get you 30x closer to the action, maintaining HD image quality as you pan in for an extreme close-up.\\n\\n<b>Legendary Lens<\/b>\\nStep it up with a professional-quality Carl Zeiss Vario-Tessar lens designed specifically for compact camcorders. Precision ground optics help maintain the sharpness and contrast of larger lenses, while SteadyShot image stabilization helps reduce annoying blur caused by camera shake.\\n\\n<b>A Brilliant Touch<\/b>\\nVibrant 2.7\" Clear Photo LCD touch screen makes framing up and reviewing footage a breeze. Sharp, vivid images make subjects pop off the screen \u2013 even outdoors \u2013 while enabling you to switch up menu settings on the fly ensuring the best shoot possible."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":25}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0b790a0c-646f-4676-be38-f13d4bb14b9f","identifier":"127469","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet 1160 Printer"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"110 - 127 VAC (+\/- 10%), 50\/60 Hz (+\/- 2 Hz); 220 to 240 VAC (+\/- 10%), 50\/60 Hz (+\/- 2 Hz)"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der leistungsstarke, \u00e4u\u00dferst zuverl\u00e4ssige HP LaserJet 1160 Arbeitsplatzdrucker liefert professionelle Schwarzwei\u00dfdokumente in hoher Geschwindigkeit und bietet optimale Kompatibilit\u00e4t \u2013\u00a0zu einem g\u00fcnstigen Preis."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The HP LaserJet 1160 Printer provides the dependable, high-quality output you are used to expecting from HP, along with the performance you need, all at an affordable price. \\n\u2022 Get professional-looking documents with the HP LaserJet 1160 Printer, featuring 1200 dpi effective output quality. With Instant-on technology and up to 19 ppm A4, your print job is finished before many printers have even started printing. \\n\u2022 The highly-reliable HP LaserJet 1160 Printer easily fits into your office environment, supporting a wide range of operating systems and offering simple connectivity via USB and parallel ports - all at a great price. \\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-09-16T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"09128cd0-6125-42df-86c5-32502ec22f30","identifier":"127470","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet Color LaserJet 5550dn Printer"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 - 240 VAC (- 10\/+ 6%), 50\/60 Hz (+\/-2 Hz)"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Dieser Farblaserdrucker bis DIN A3 bietet eindrucksvolle Druckqualit\u00e4t bei der Erstellung beliebiger Dokumente. Die HP Color LaserJet 5550 Serie verbindet Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit optimal mit Leistung, und dank des bew\u00e4hrten Designs ist der Ausdruck auf einer Vielzahl von Medien bis zu 200 g\/m\u00b2 in professioneller Qualit\u00e4t m\u00f6glich. Die leicht auszutauschenden Verbrauchsmaterialien und ein grafisches Bedienfeld sorgen daf\u00fcr, dass die Anwender nur sehr selten eingreifen m\u00fcssen. Aufgrund der optionalen Netzwerkeinbindung und der zus\u00e4tzlichen Papierzuf\u00fchrungen sind diese Drucker auch f\u00fcr verschiedenste Anforderungen in Arbeitsgruppen ideal geeignet."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Create impressive colour documents easily with this simple-to-use, wide-format laser printer. With its proven design, high performance and flexible features the HP Color LaserJet 5550 series printer meets the needs of dynamic workgroups.\\n\\n- Delivers a perfect blend of brilliant print quality and great performance.\\n- Powerful wide-format colour performance for versatile workgroups.\\n- Experience office printing as it's meant to be."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Obtenez une qualit\u00e9 d'impression sup\u00e9rieure pour vos documents de bureautique et de marketing avec une imprimante couleur laser moyen format rapide. La HP Color LaserJet s\u00e9rie 5550 combine parfaitement fiabilit\u00e9 et performances pour des impressions d'excellente qualit\u00e9. Sa conception \u00e9prouv\u00e9e offre une superbe qualit\u00e9 d'impression sur une large gamme de supports jusqu'\u00e0 200\u00a0g\/m2. Des consommables faciles \u00e0 remplacer et un panneau de commande graphique limitent les interventions. La mise en r\u00e9seau optionnelle et les bacs suppl\u00e9mentaires en font l'imprimante id\u00e9ale pour les groupes de travail polyvalents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"693f08d0-efd3-4de3-8345-01d21e5e9b0f","identifier":"127480","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet 1320 Printer"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"110 - 127 VAC (+\/- 10%), 50\/60 Hz (+\/- 2 Hz); 220 - 240 VAC (+\/- 10%), 50\/60 Hz (+\/- 2 Hz)"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit der HP LaserJet 1320 Serie erstellen Sie professionelle Dokumente in Schwarzwei\u00df. Sie eignet sich ideal f\u00fcr Einzelanwender und kleine Arbeitsgruppen, und bietet die M\u00f6glichkeit zur flexiblen Einbindung in ein Netzwerk bzw. den automatisch beidseitigen Druck f\u00fcr papiersparendes Drucken."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fast, professional-quality printing for business<\/b>\\n\\nProduce professional, black-and-white documents quickly with HP LaserJet 1320 printers. Ideal for individuals and small workteams, this series also offers flexible networking options and automatic two-sided printing."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1496723c-cbf6-40a7-98ba-622b0bfdd663","identifier":"127484","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet Color LaserJet 5550 Printer"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 - 240 VAC (- 10\/+ 6%), 50\/60 Hz (+\/-2 Hz)"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Dieser Farblaserdrucker bis DIN A3 bietet eindrucksvolle Druckqualit\u00e4t bei der Erstellung beliebiger Dokumente. Die HP Color LaserJet 5550 Serie verbindet Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit optimal mit Leistung, und dank des bew\u00e4hrten Designs ist der Ausdruck auf einer Vielzahl von Medien bis zu 200 g\/m\u00b2 in professioneller Qualit\u00e4t m\u00f6glich. Die leicht auszutauschenden Verbrauchsmaterialien und ein grafisches Bedienfeld sorgen daf\u00fcr, dass die Anwender nur sehr selten eingreifen m\u00fcssen. Aufgrund der optionalen Netzwerkeinbindung und der zus\u00e4tzlichen Papierzuf\u00fchrungen sind diese Drucker auch f\u00fcr verschiedenste Anforderungen in Arbeitsgruppen ideal geeignet."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Create impressive colour documents easily with this simple-to-use, wide-format laser printer. With its proven design, high performance and flexible features the HP Color LaserJet 5550 series printer meets the needs of dynamic workgroups.\\n\\n- Delivers a perfect blend of brilliant print quality and great performance.\\n- Powerful wide-format colour performance for versatile workgroups.\\n- Experience office printing as it's meant to be."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Obtenez une qualit\u00e9 d'impression sup\u00e9rieure pour vos documents de bureautique et de marketing avec une imprimante couleur laser moyen format rapide. La HP Color LaserJet s\u00e9rie 5550 combine parfaitement fiabilit\u00e9 et performances pour des impressions d'excellente qualit\u00e9. Sa conception \u00e9prouv\u00e9e offre une superbe qualit\u00e9 d'impression sur une large gamme de supports jusqu'\u00e0 200\u00a0g\/m2. Des consommables faciles \u00e0 remplacer et un panneau de commande graphique limitent les interventions. La mise en r\u00e9seau optionnelle et les bacs suppl\u00e9mentaires en font l'imprimante id\u00e9ale pour les groupes de travail polyvalents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b1a6452b-e694-4357-b4e0-ba900fd47fc0","identifier":"12766853","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","sony","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony KDL-32HX755"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Die Wahl liegt bei Ihnen: Entdecken Sie die Unterschiede bei 2D- & 3D-Inhalten in High Definition<\/b>\\n\\n80 cm\/32\", Full HD 3D mit Dynamic Edge LED, X-Reality, integriertem Wi-Fi\u00ae und Sony Internet TV\\n\\n- Klare, detailreiche Bilder und Full HD 3D\\n- Wi-Fi\u00ae f\u00fcr einfachen Zugriff auf Catch-up TV, Filme und Apps\\n- \u00c4ndern des Betrachtungswinkels Ihres Fernsehers f\u00fcr perfekte Sicht\\n\\n<b>Realistische Bilder in 2D und 3D<\/b>\\n\\nNehmen Sie Platz, und bereiten Sie sich auf ein atemberaubendes 3D-Erlebnis mit hervorragender Bildqualit\u00e4t sowie faszinierendes Fernsehen in 2D vor. \u00dcbertragen Sie ein umfangreiches Angebot an Online-Unterhaltung, Apps und Services auf den kontrastreichen LED-Bildschirm. Freuen Sie sich auf noch mehr Leben und Unterhaltung in Ihrem Wohnzimmer.\\n\\n<b>Sch\u00e4rfere 2D-HD- und 3D-Bilder<\/b>\\n\\nOb Sie nun \u00fcber das Internet fernsehen, einen Ihrer Lieblingsfilme auf DVD oder ein Heimvideo ansehen, mit X-Reality erreichen Sie nahezu HD-Qualit\u00e4t. Wir haben mithilfe eines 4x High-Speed-3D-Displays auch gestochen scharfe und nat\u00fcrliche 3D-Filme geschaffen, bei denen jedes Bild auf dem LED-Bildschirm hinsichtlich Beleuchtung und Kontrast optimal ausgerichtet wird.\\n\\n<b>Drahtloser Zugriff auf Online-Entertainment<\/b>\\n\\nGreifen Sie entweder \u00fcber die Fernbedienung Ihres Fernsehers oder mobilen Ger\u00e4ts (mit Spracherkennung) auf Sony Entertainment Network zu, wo Sie HD-Filme, Millionen Musiktitel, Ihre Lieblings-Fernsehsender wiedergeben k\u00f6nnen, und Sie einen Webbrowser und Apps wie z. B. Twitter\u2122, Facebook\u00ae, YouTube\u2122 und Skype\u2122 nutzen k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>Freuen Sie sich auf ein neues, leichtes Design<\/b>\\n\\nDas Design der HX75-Serie kombiniert kontrastierende Materialien mit nahtlosen Kanten. Sie werden von der Leichtigkeit dieses Fernsehers mit Standfu\u00df begeistert sein. Sie k\u00f6nnen das Ger\u00e4t vertikal oder horizontal drehen, um den optimalen Betrachtungswinkel zu erreichen.\\n\\n<b>Energiesparfunktionen f\u00fcr Fernseher<\/b>\\n\\nDank der neuen LED Frame Dimming Funktion wird Energie eingespart, indem die Hintergrundbeleuchtung auf intelligente Weise an die entsprechende Situation angepasst wird. Freuen Sie sich also auf gestochen scharfe, kontrastreiche Fernsehbilder bei geringerem Energieverbrauch. Den Unterschied werden Sie an Ihrer Stromrechnung erkennen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony KDL-32HX755. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-C2, DVB-S2, DVB-T, DVB-T2. Audio system: Dolby Digital\/Dolby Digital Plus\/Dolby Digital Pulse. HDMI version: 1.4. Browser supported: Opera"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"dd69cc86-4bec-4584-9617-84638d7401ba","identifier":"12766858","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","sony","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony KDL40HX850BAE2"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony KDL40HX850BAE2. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, PAL, SECAM, Digital signal format system: DVB-C. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus \/ Dolby Pulse. Power consumption (standby): 0.25, Energy efficiency class: B, Input voltage: 220 - 240. Package dimensions (WxDxH): 1062 x 283 x 667"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le meilleur traitement d\u2019image jamais con\u00e7u par Sony associ\u00e9 \u00e0 une vitesse de rafra\u00eechissement de 800Hz.\\n\\nLa nouvelle dalle en verre avec traitement anti reflets optimise les contrastes. Reposant sur un socle en aluminium bross\u00e9 amplificateur de son, le design monolithe n\u2019a jamais sembl\u00e9 aussi l\u00e9ger"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d61d7332-a2a1-4bf7-ad82-639da0ad809a","identifier":"127750","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung SyncMaster 710N"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Samsung SyncMaster 710N is a 17-inch TFT-LCD offering razor-sharpness and innovative features. An analog monitor with a 0.6\" ultra-thin bezel and wall-mount capability, it delivers a 600:1 contrast ratio, 0.264mm pixel pitch, 1280 x 1024 resolution, scanning frequency of 30-81 KHz horizontal and 56-75 vertical, and 160\u00b0\/160\u00b0 horizontal\/vertical viewing angle."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":17,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b406c08a-e364-4989-bb38-5d3f2ff56dc3","identifier":"12779375","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["nec","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"NEC AS241W-BK"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The 24\u201d NEC AccuSync AS241W, a widescreen monitor boasting tremendous value, enhances your desktop computing with full HD resolution and eco-friendly benefits. The LED backlighting of this monitor permits a slimmer profile, lighter weight and increased power savings compared to previous generation models, while ECO Mode\u2122 helps extend the life of the product. Additional benefits include a carbon footprint meter and Rapid Response technology, both of which make this model ideal for small-to-medium-sized businesses, schools and government offices.\\n\\n- LED backlight technology provides for industry-leading low power consumption and less hazardous materials\\n- Ambix\u00ae dual-input technology allows for digital\/analog compatibility with upgraded video cards and software as well as connection to two systems\\n- Rapid Response\u2122 technology delivers virtually uninterrupted, undistorted viewing of high-speed, full-motion video\\n- ECO Mode\u2122 function helps save power, reduce heat and extend the life of the display by allowing you to dim the backlight\\n- Carbon footprint meter helps track and calculate the reduction of green gas emissions"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e1cea93d-9c72-44c2-9105-452ad2976806","identifier":"12779569","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["aoc","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AOC E2752VH"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"\\nThe e2752Vh is a 27\" widescreen LEDA light-emitting-diode (LED) is a semiconductor diode that emits light when an electric current is applied in the forward direction of the device, as in the simple LED circuit. The effect is a form of electroluminescence where incoherent and narrow-spectrum light is emitted from the p-n junction. monitor that delivers stunningly crisp and impressive image quality, as well as solid performance with a two millisecond response time. Ideal for multimedia applications, the energy efficient display also features two built-in 2.5 watt speakers for SRS-quality sound and is perfectly suited for PC gaming and Home Theater environments.\\n\\nThe monitor is able to display 16.7 million colors and offers a 2ms response time that provides crisp, clear images even in fast action sequences while gaming or watching action films. The ultra-high dynamic contrast ratio of 20,000,000:1 reveals more depth and detail in darker scenes, while built-in speakers provide improved desktop sound. The versatile monitor is VESA 100mm wall mount compliant, meaning that it can be used on a desktop or conveniently mounted on the wall to save space. The monitor\u2019s slim and streamlined appearance is complemented by ergonomic, user-friendly design.\\n\\nThe e2752Vh comes with Analog, DVI-D and HDMI with HDCP for easy connectivity and features easily accessible digital and power connections that are rear-facing for direct insertion, a placement that is much more convenient than the more common downward-pointing ports. The monitor settings can be adjusted via the on-screen menu system, which is available in 14 languages including English, French and Spanish. The iMenu option also allows the user to change settings using only the keyboard and mouse, so that it is not necessary to reach up to the screen to adjust contrast, brightness and other preset modes. Other bonus features include embedded Screen+ software that divides the screen into four self-contained work areas for improved productivity, and an Off Timer that sets an alarm clock to turn off the monitor automatically.\\n\\nAlong with delivering strong performance, image quality and bonus features, the ENERGY STAR compliant e2752Vh also reduces energy costs and environmental impact. The display\u2019s LEDA light-emitting-diode (LED) is a semiconductor diode that emits light when an electric current is applied in the forward direction of the device, as in the simple LED circuit. The effect is a form of electroluminescence where incoherent and narrow-spectrum light is emitted from the p-n junction. backlight is completely free of toxic Mercury, and the monitor also includes an eSaver feature that lets the user preset power conservation modes for the display when the PC is not in use. The monitor\u2019s Power Saving Mode uses 50 percent less power, and Standby Mode uses only 0.1w."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":27,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":2}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a7de4aa3-9b21-4488-963b-dbc32d47a9f9","identifier":"1279259","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips PSS231"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"XSL-Akustik sorgt bei der ShoqBox, einem MP3-Player im Taschenformat mit integrierten Lautsprechern, f\u00fcr starken Sound. Sie k\u00f6nnen bis zu 500 Titel unterwegs oder zu Hause mit Freunden genie\u00dfen! Verw\u00f6hnen Sie Ihre Ohren!!"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Live out loud\\n\\nMP3 player with powerful speakers\\n\\nEnjoy powerful sound from ShoqBox, a palm-sized MP3 player with built-in speakers that\\nfeature XSL Acoustics. Enjoy up to 500 songs on the road or with friends at home. Go\\non and play it loud!\\n\\n<b>Powerful sound from a small player<\/b>\\n- Built-in speakers with XSL Acoustics for potent sound\\n\\n<b>Freedom to enjoy music anywhere<\/b>\\n- Take up to 500 songs with you on the go (1GB*)\\n- Palm-sized companion at home and on the road\\n- Built-in rechargeable battery\\n\\n<b>All-in-one convenience<\/b>\\n- Use as portable speakers for any music player or PC\\n- PlaysForSure* with Windows XP only\\n- Wake up to your own music or alarm"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Profitez d'un son puissant depuis votre ShoqBox, un lecteur MP3 de la taille d'une main dot\u00e9 d'enceintes int\u00e9gr\u00e9es avec acoustique XSL. \u00c9coutez plus de 500\u00a0morceaux en voyage ou \u00e0 la maison avec des amis. Allez-y et montez le son\u00a0!"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-26T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"adcc7ebc-254d-49b4-9709-69e69ef9a221","identifier":"12795299","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 239C4QHSB\/00"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der neue Philips Blade 2-Monitor sorgt mit seinem eleganten und besonders schlanken Design sowie dem breiten IPS-Display f\u00fcr eine brillante Leistung.\\n<b>Brillante Leistung<\/b>\\n- IPS-LED-Technologie f\u00fcr einen gr\u00f6\u00dferen Blickwinkel und verbesserte Bildgenauigkeit und Farbtreue\\n- HDMI-ready f\u00fcr perfekte Unterhaltung in Full HD\\n- SmartContrast 20.000.000:1 f\u00fcr unglaubliche Details in dunklen Bildszenen\\n- SmartImage: Optimale benutzerfreundliche Anzeigequalit\u00e4t\\n- SmartTxt f\u00fcr optimales Lesen\\n- SmartKolor f\u00fcr satte lebendige Bilder\\n<b>Zeitloses Design, passt zu jeder Einrichtung<\/b>\\n- Elegantes, schlankes Design f\u00fcr einen modernen Look\\n- Erstklassiges Hochglanzdesign mit herausragenden Eigenschaften\\n- Moderne Bedienelemente mit Touch-Technologie\\n<b>T\u00e4glich etwas Gutes f\u00fcr die Umwelt tun<\/b>\\n- EnergyStar f\u00fcr effiziente Energienutzung und niedrigen Energieverbrauch\\n- Die umweltfreundlichen Materialien entsprechen internationalen Standards."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Ultra Slim display for best viewing experience<\/b>\\nThe new Philips Blade 2 monitor with stylish, ultra slim design and wide view IPS display is ready for brilliant performance\\n<b>Brilliant performance<\/b>\\n- IPS LED wide view technology for image and color accuracy\\n- HDMI-ready for Full HD entertainment\\n- SmartContrast 20000000:1 for incredible rich black details\\n- SmartImage: Optimized user friendly display experience\\n- SmartTxt for a optimized reading experience\\n- SmartKolor for rich vibrant images\\n<b>Design that complements any interior<\/b>\\n- Stylish, ultra slim design for modern looks\\n- Superb glossy polish with distinctive features\\n- Modern Touch controls\\n<b>Greener everyday<\/b>\\n- Energy Star for energy efficiency and low power consumption\\n- Eco-friendly materials that meets international standards"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le nouveau moniteur Philips Blade 2 ultra-fin et \u00e9l\u00e9gant \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran IPS grand angle offre d'excellentes performances.\\n<b>Des performances exceptionnelles<\/b>\\n- Technologie LED IPS grand angle pour des images et couleurs plus pr\u00e9cises\\n- Compatible HDMI pour un divertissement en Full HD\\n- SmartContrast 20 000 000:1 pour des d\u00e9tails de noir incroyablement profonds\\n- SmartImage : affichage optimal et convivial\\n- SmartTxt pour une exp\u00e9rience de lecture optimale\\n- SmartKolor pour des images profondes et r\u00e9alistes\\n<b>Un design adapt\u00e9 \u00e0 tous les int\u00e9rieurs<\/b>\\n- Design ultrafin \u00e9l\u00e9gant, pour un look moderne\\n- Fantastique finition brillante aux caract\u00e9ristiques distinctives\\n- Touches tactiles\\n<b>Soyez un peu plus \u00e9colo chaque jour<\/b>\\n- Energy Star : plus d'efficacit\u00e9 pour une consommation minimale\\n- Mat\u00e9riaux \u00e9cologiques, conformes aux normes internationales"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":7}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5b4e32f0-a4fb-4672-bfcf-e08c3d084d96","identifier":"1279723","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung I85 (Gold)"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Multimedia function<\/b>\\n\\nSamsung i85, one of Samsung\u2019s brand new multimedia digital cameras will give you a great satisfaction. his model is equipped with 8.2 mega pixel 1\/2.5\" CCD, 5x optical zoom, MP3 player, SRS wow HD sound effect, and PMP. Those equipments allow Samsung i85 to function as a movie player, text viewer, voice recorder, portable hard drive, and camcorder.\\n\\n<b>Slim 5x optical zoom<\/b>\\n\\nIt has powerful 5x optical zoom in only 20.2mm stainless body \\n\\n<b>World Tour Guide function<\/b>\\n\\nBy adding the World Tour Guide function to a digital camera for the first time, the Samsung i85 provides more convenient and diverse usability while travelling. Images and explanations of famous attractions in 29 countries are provided. With the World Tour Guide function for images and explanations of famous attractions, you can check global travel information easily and conveniently. \\n\\n<b>3.0\u201d TFT LCD (230K)<\/b>\\n\\nThe Samsung i85 has a 3.0\u201d large LCD for improved contrast and colour reproduction, allowing you to enjoy a wider and clearer image.\\n\\n<b>Multi charging system<\/b>\\n\\nWith Samsung's unique multi charging system, your travel has become even lighter. You don't have to carry an AC adapter for your travel any more. With a multi charging kit, SAC-46 Kit (SAC-46,SUC-C2), you can conveniently charge the camera on a power point, your laptop or desktop computer."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ce18fcce-d379-44e2-a05a-4352f7f5b7cd","identifier":"12797595","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony Walkman NWZ-B172"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>WALKMAN mit farbenfroh blinkender LED<\/b>\\n\\nBASS Boost, Schnellladefunktion, Leuchtanzeige, direkter USB-Anschluss, ZAPPIN, Einfaches \u00dcbertragen, praktischer Clip\\n\\n- Satte B\u00e4sse per Knopfdruck\\n- 3-Minuten-Ladefunktion, 90 Minuten Wiedergabe\\n- Stilvoll unterwegs \u2013 Clip zum Befestigen des Ger\u00e4ts an Kleidung oder Taschen"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony NWZ-B172, Walkman. Player media type: flash-media. Display: LCD. Audio formats supported: MP3, WMA. Headphone connectivity: 3.5 mm. Interface: USB 2.0"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"81ecce3a-ef12-45d1-9217-c640c50c3e7c","identifier":"12797596","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony Walkman NWZ-B172"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>WALKMAN mit farbenfroh blinkender LED<\/b>\\n\\nBASS Boost, Schnellladefunktion, Leuchtanzeige, direkter USB-Anschluss, ZAPPIN, Einfaches \u00dcbertragen, praktischer Clip\\n\\n- Satte B\u00e4sse per Knopfdruck\\n- 3-Minuten-Ladefunktion, 90 Minuten Wiedergabe\\n- Stilvoll unterwegs \u2013 Clip zum Befestigen des Ger\u00e4ts an Kleidung oder Taschen"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony NWZ-B172, Walkman. Player media type: flash-media. Display: LCD. Audio formats supported: MP3, WMA. Headphone connectivity: 3.5 mm. Interface: USB 2.0"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c9a96595-573c-437a-99ba-54e6a6df128d","identifier":"12798348","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung T23B350EW"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung T23B350EW. Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Display: LED, Display technology: TN+Film. Audio system: Dolby Digital + \/ Pulse, dts 2.0 +. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 75 x 75, Tilt angle: 0 - 20. Input voltage: 220 - 240, Input frequency: 50\/60, Power consumption (off): 0.5. Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Elargissez votre exp\u00e9rience gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 diverses entr\u00e9es, branchez et regardez votre contenu avec ConnectShare\u2122 et passez au niveau sup\u00e9rieur gr\u00e2ce au contraste dynamique m\u00e9ga!\\n\\n<b>Elargissez votre exp\u00e9rience gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 diverses entr\u00e9es<\/b>\\n\\nPourquoi ne pas donner vie \u00e0 autre chose que vos films favoris? Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ses diverses entr\u00e9es, le moniteur HDTV \u00e0 2 entr\u00e9es HDMI de Samsung garantit des op\u00e9rations en ligne simplifi\u00e9es, comme par exemple les jeux ou le chat en ligne avec des amis. Les diff\u00e9rentes entr\u00e9es telles que la DP et les deux HDMI vous garantissent en effet que votre moniteur est encore plus compatible et pr\u00eat \u00e0 traiter tous vos contenus.\\n\\n<b>Passez au niveau sup\u00e9rieur gr\u00e2ce au contraste dynamique m\u00e9ga.<\/b>\\n\\nD\u00e9couvrez d\u2019incroyables niveaux de couleur, de brillance et de qualit\u00e9 d\u2019image gr\u00e2ce au rapport de contraste dynamique m\u00e9ga dernier cri. Les moniteurs HDTV TB350 de Samsung fournissent des images tellement r\u00e9alistes qu\u2019ils transforment toute votre exp\u00e9rience visuelle. En proposant un rapport de contraste dynamique m\u00e9ga (statique 1 000:1) \u00e0 vous couper le souffle, soit le niveau le plus \u00e9lev\u00e9 actuellement disponible, le moniteur TB350 garantit les noirs les plus sombres et les couleurs (y compris les blancs parfaits) les plus \u00e9clatantes possible. Vous remarquerez imm\u00e9diatement l\u2019image cristalline et son incroyable intensit\u00e9. Tous les autres moniteurs sembleront ternes en comparaison avec cette exp\u00e9rience semblable \u00e0 une explosion de couleurs. Passez donc au niveau de plaisir sup\u00e9rieur gr\u00e2ce au rapport de contraste dynamique m\u00e9ga de Samsung et profitez de votre contenu multim\u00e9dia avec le professionnalisme qu\u2019il m\u00e9rite.\\n\\n<b>Branchez et regardez votre contenu avec ConnectShare\u2122<\/b>\\n\\nSi vous ne pouvez pas attendre avant de lire votre contenu num\u00e9rique, qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse de films, de photos ou de fichiers musicaux, ne perdez pas votre temps pr\u00e9cieux et profitez au mieux de ConnectShare\u2122. En branchant simplement votre p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique de m\u00e9moire (disque dur ou cl\u00e9 USB) \u00e0 votre moniteur HDTV TB350 via le port USB, ConnectShare\u2122 vous permet d\u2019afficher votre contenu sans devoir allumer votre ordinateur ou votre ordinateur portable. Ainsi, vous pourrez tout simplement profiter de votre contenu et le TB350 vous apportera encore plus de confort dans votre journ\u00e9e."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cebaacd4-b425-473b-a53a-e38bda50a933","identifier":"12800224","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix REAL 3D W3"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Shoot 3D<\/b>\\nShoot high-resolution 3D photos and movies effortlessly with 3D Auto.\\n\\n<b>Capture 3DHD Movies and Still Photo<\/b>\\nFrame your subject, press the shutter, and the scene is captured in a high-quality 3D image.\\n\\n<b>Advanced 3D Modes: Individual Shutter 3D Shooting<\/b>\\nWith Individual Shutter 3D Shooting, you can take two shots of the same subject from different positions, and the camera automatically merges and saves the captured images as a single enhanced 3D photo. After the first image is taken, it appears as a transparent overlay on the monitor to help you align and frame the second shot. Photos of distant subjects like mountains and skyscrapers look amazing in enhanced 3D, while close-up subjects like flowers come to life in natural 3D.\\n\\n<b>Advanced 3D Modes: Interval 3D Shooting<\/b>\\nWith a single press of the button, the camera automatically takes successive shots. Perfect for shooting from a car, train or even an airplane to create a photo with an ultra 3D sense of depth. Imagine shooting clouds from the window of your flight and capturing the scene in super 3D. Fujifilm truly brings a whole new dimension to photo enjoyment!\\n\\n<b>Parallax Control (3D Tuning Function)<\/b>\\nThe camera automatically adjusts parallax in 3D Auto mode for an optimal sense of depth. Manual mode is also possible by operating the Parallax Control lever on the back of the camera to easily fine- tune the sense of depth and alignment of the images.\\n\\n<b>10.0 Megapixels & Fujinon 3x Optical Zoom<\/b>\\nThis camera is a real multi-tasker! Not only can it shoot in spectacular 3D, but you can also switch to standard 2D mode and use it as a normal camera. There are even special features that allow you to use the fact that the camera has two lenses and two sensors and take two different photos at once! Also, Super Intelligent Flash and Scene Position are featured to automatically make the optical settings to match your scene.\\n\\n<b>Tele\/Wide Simultaneous Shooting<\/b>\\nZoom in on your subject and also take a wide-angle shot of the same scene at the same time. The twin-lens system lets you freely set the zoom magnification for one lens while the other is set to wide angle, letting you capture the exact same instant with totally different angles of view.\\n\\n<b>Shoot 2D\/3D Hybrid<\/b>\\nThe FinePix REAL 3D W3 comes loaded with a variety of functions for both 3D and 2D. Super Intelligent Flash and Scene Position automatically make the optimal settings to match your scene.\\n\\n<b>Fujinon Lens - Two Sets of Lens that Work in the Same Way as Human Eyes<\/b>\\nOur ability to perceive depth comes from viewing an object along two different lines of sight. This phenomenon is called parallax. The FinePix REAL 3D W3 is fitted with dual lenses to capture realistic images that are unchanged from how human eyes see them. Both optical 3x zoom lenses capture subjects beautifully, even from a distance. The camera's newly developed stainless steel frame maintains the optical axis with high precision. All these features are combined in a light, compact, stylish body."}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":3}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1f3f4fcc-44ba-4e2b-b28a-59ac0af883b6","identifier":"12805169","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UN60ES6500F"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Discover a new reality in Full HD<\/b>\\nFull HD 1080p 2D displays launched many years ago. Now, it\u2019s difficult to find a big screen LED display that does not have Full HD 1080p resolution. Why was Full HD 1080p so important on 2D displays? Full HD 1080p offered more than two times the detail than non-Full HD panels. The more detail in the image the more realistic the image looks. The benefits of Full HD 3D works on the same principle, the more detail in the image the more realistic the experience. Viewing Full HD 3D can only be achieved using Active 3D shutter glasses technology. Samsung is the global leader in 3D display sales, and is using the highest quality 3D imaging technology available today. You will be completely immersed in a new world of TV viewing reality watching 3D content on Samsung Full HD 3DTV.\\n\\n<b>SMART TV<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s SMART TV\u2019s deliver a completely different TV viewing experience, seamlessly choose between a broad array of Internet content, broadcast programming, personal content, and virtually unlimited applications\u2014all viewable on the big screen. Wirelessly connect to endless offerings of movies, TV Shows, Music, Sports and information through internet based services all through our user-friendly user interface, Smart Hub. Surf the web on our optimized Web Browser which supports the latest flash and HTML decoding, so browsing on the TV is just like browsing on the PC, **complete with wireless keyboard and mouse compatibilities. Stay connected with friends and family with Samsung\u2019s Social TV. This is a split screen experience that allows you to share your commentary with friends and family through services like Facebook, Twitter and Google Talk, all while simultaneously watching live TV. Still need convincing?* How about Skype\u2122 on your TV. Free yourself from the confines of your PC or home office and enjoy making Skype-to-Skype voice and video calls from the big screen. A simpler and more convenient way to communicate over distances and all from the comfort of your living room. Combine all that with the industry\u2019s first TV app store that contains the broadest range of TV apps, and you have the most unique and most satisfying TV viewing experience available.\\n\\nDiscover a new world of social and personalised home entertainment with Samsung\u2019s updated Smart Hub and three great new services. Family Story lets you share special photos, messages and events with loved ones. Meanwhile, children can stay entertained and educated with the Kids feature. You can also exercise and manage your training using Fitness. With access to great content as well as a selection of Samsung Apps, web browsing, Skype and more, this is the ultimate family home entertainment experience.\\n\\n<b>Watch movies from your USB<\/b>\\nWith ConnectShare Movie, simply plug your USB memory drive into the TV and instantaneously enjoy movies, photos or music. Now, you can experience a wide variety of content in the comfort of your living room on your TV.\\n\\n<b>Skype\u2122<\/b>\\nSkype\u2122 is a free internet video calling service that allows users to communicate with each other. Historically each user would need a PC and\\nspecific software as well as a web cam, now just create an account and communicate with friends and family worldwide directly through your TV. A Samsung Skype camera is required and sold separately.\\n\\n<b>Clear Motion Rate 480<\/b>\\nExperience the true meaning of motion clarity with Samsung\u2019s Clear Motion Rate. Unlike the \u201crefresh rate,\u201d expressed in Hz that all manufacturers use, Clear Motion Rate expresses the TV\u2019s true ability to resolve detail in fast moving images by incorporating three factors: the TV\u2019s video processor, the TV panel, and the TV backlight. The combination of these three devices determines how well the TV performs with fast moving images. The higher the rating, the better the set can display details in fast moving content. With this new standard in motion measurement, you will clearly see the difference CMR makes.\\n\\n<b>Designed for maximum appeal<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s One Design maximizes the viewing experience as well as enhances your home interior. One Design elegantly combines the LED TV\u2019s bezel with its panel to remove any barriers from a seamless viewing experience.\\n\\n<b>Wirelessly access and stream your content<\/b>\\nMake the most of all your content and devices with wireless sharing. Thanks to AllShare Play, you can stream movies, photos, music and more from any compatible devices nearby, including PCs. Cloud technology and Samsung web storage give you even greater freedom and mobility, allowing you to access and share multimedia when you\u2019re away from home, too. Now you can enjoy all your favourite content on your TV or away from it.\\n\\n<b>Web Browser<\/b>\\nBenefit from the convenience of surfing the Internet on a PC, but through your Samsung Smart TV. The Web Browser feature has been optimized for your TV so that you can enjoy a true Internet-surfing experience but on the big screen. So now you can watch TV or surf the web without ever having to turn on your PC."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":60,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f34ceb4b-d4aa-4ac7-8e9b-83db0d3c854e","identifier":"12822289","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S23B350B"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Control power consumption, conserve energy<\/b>\\nEco Saving makes saving energy easy. It adjusts the brightness of your Samsung monitor based on how much energy you want to save. And with the choice of three energy saving modes (50%, 25% and Power Saving off), you can really tailor your monitor use to meet your own personal needs. Samsung\u2019s commitment to saving energy is designed to help both you and the environment, and with up to 50% saving on consumption, you can really make a positive impact on your eco footprint. Take the effort out of saving energy and take control with Eco Saving.\\n\\n<b>Upgrade to the next level with Mega Dynamic Contrast<\/b>\\nExperience amazing new levels of colour, brilliance and picture quality through the very latest in Mega Dynamic Contrast Ratio. Samsung HDTV SB350 monitors deliver images so real-to-life that it will transform your whole viewing experience. Packed with breathtaking 5,000,000:1 contrast ratio, the highest level currently available, the SB350 monitor ensures that blacks are at their absolute darkest and (with pristine whites) colours are at their brightest. You will immediately notice the crystal clear picture and its unbelievable intensity. It is like an explosion of colours and leaves other screens seeming dull in comparison. So, take your viewing pleasure to the next level with Samsung Mega Dynamic Contrast Ratio \u2013 and enjoy your multimedia content with the professionalism it deserves.\\n\\n<b>See it your way with wider viewing angles<\/b>\\nHow do you like to watch movies? Do you like lying down on the couch? Sitting in your favourite chair? Cooking or exercising? Whether you\u2019re standing, sitting or lying down, Samsung\u2019s Magic Angle makes sure that the movie always takes centre stage and that you\u2019re always comfortable. This means, thanks to the 5-mode angle management, that whatever angle you watch your Samsung monitor, you will enjoy a full visual experience with amazing picture clarity. So, start seeing your favourite movies and other multimedia in total comfort and without limitations thanks to Magic Angle."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Contr\u00f4lez la consommation \u00e9lectrique et \u00e9conomisez l\u2019\u00e9nergie.<\/b>\\nLa fonction d\u2019\u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie est on ne peut plus simple. La fonction d\u2019\u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie est on ne peut plus simple. En outre, gr\u00e2ce aux trois modes d\u2019\u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie (50%, 25% et d\u00e9connect\u00e9), vous pouvez r\u00e9ellement personnaliser votre moniteur en fonction de vos besoins personnels. L\u2019engagement de Samsung envers la r\u00e9alisation d'\u00e9conomies d\u2019\u00e9nergie est aussi bien destin\u00e9 \u00e0 vous aider qu\u2019\u00e0 pr\u00e9server l\u2019environnement. Ainsi, avec une \u00e9conomie de consommation allant jusqu\u2019\u00e0 50%, vous pouvez r\u00e9ellement avoir un impact positif sur votre empreinte \u00e9cologique. L'\u00e9conomie d\u2019\u00e9nergie devient facile. Prenez le contr\u00f4le gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Eco.\\n\\n<b>Passez au niveau sup\u00e9rieur gr\u00e2ce au contraste dynamique m\u00e9ga.<\/b>\\nD\u00e9couvrez d\u2019incroyables niveaux de couleur, de brillance et de qualit\u00e9 d\u2019image gr\u00e2ce au rapport de contraste dynamique m\u00e9ga dernier cri. Les moniteurs HDTV SB350 de Samsung fournissent des images tellement r\u00e9alistes qu\u2019ils transforment toute votre exp\u00e9rience visuelle. Dot\u00e9 d\u2019un rapport de contraste 5 000 000:1 \u00e0 vous couper le souffle, soit le niveau le plus \u00e9lev\u00e9 actuellement disponible, le moniteur SB350 garantit les noirs d\u2019un sombre absolu et les couleurs (avec les blancs les plus purs) les plus lumineuses. Vous remarquerez imm\u00e9diatement l\u2019image cristalline et son incroyable intensit\u00e9. Tous les autres moniteurs sembleront ternes en comparaison avec cette exp\u00e9rience semblable \u00e0 une explosion de couleurs. Passez donc au niveau de plaisir sup\u00e9rieur gr\u00e2ce au rapport de contraste dynamique m\u00e9ga de Samsung et profitez de votre contenu multim\u00e9dia avec le professionnalisme qu\u2019il m\u00e9rite."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b6cb9d55-299c-4cdc-9765-6267e83fade7","identifier":"128283","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","logitech","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech S100"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Designed to look as good as they sound, the Logitech S100 stereo speakers deliver great sound and great value in a package optimized for PC integration. Available in either a Midnight Black or Sea Grey color scheme, these speakers complete the Logitech OEM desktop peripheral range. The speakers are easily controlled with a convenient volume knob to the right side of the right speaker. The audio headset jack can be found just below the volume knob when private listening is desired."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-08-30T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cbb07967-c22a-477b-99d0-64b57c3e673f","identifier":"128295","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","logitech","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech OEM S100 Speakers Black (EU)"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Logitech's new OEM S-100 Black speaker system is the fist to be designed specifically to meet the PC integration market. With a clean New Midnight Black color scheme and round edges, the speaker set will make any PC a complete offering for resale. Leveraging a blue LED to display power, the speakers are easily controlled with a convenient volume knob to the right side of the right speaker. In addition, if end users desired to have a private listening experience, just below the volume knob is the audio headset jack for quick setup of any 3.5mm headset plug.\\n\\nDesigned to look as good as they sound, Logitech&#8217;s S-100 Black stereo speakers deliver the ultimate in value and make the perfect audio companion. Power and volume controls conveniently located full, rich sound. Headphone jack for private listening."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cb2f1129-592d-4f5d-90ca-00cf6eb23d8f","identifier":"12829967","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon Digital IXUS 240 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Schlankes Metallgeh\u00e4use; 24-mm-Weitwinkel, 5fach optisches Zoom<\/b>\\nMit dem schlanken und eleganten Metallgeh\u00e4use kann sich die IXUS 240 HS \u00fcberall sehen lassen. Alles im Blick mit dem 24-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv oder ganz nah ran mit 5fach optischem Zoom und 10fach ZoomPlus, der modernen Zoomtechnologie, die weit mehr Detail und Bildsch\u00e4rfe bietet, als der konventionelle Digitalzoom.\\n\\n<b>HS System: 16,1 MP CMOS und DIGIC 5<\/b>\\nDas HS System brilliert bei schwachen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen \u2013 ideal, um den Zauber einer Stimmung auch ohne Blitz und Stativ festzuhalten. Der fortschrittliche DIGIC 5 Prozessor und der hoch empfindliche 16,1 Megapixel starke CMOS-Sensor sorgen gemeinsam f\u00fcr \u00fcberzeugende Bildqualit\u00e4t in allen Situationen.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nDer Intelligent IS kompensiert Kamerawackler, so dass die Aufnahmen auch dann noch scharf und deutlich sind, wenn mit hohem Zoomwert oder bei wenig Licht fotografiert wird. Er passt den optischen Bildstabilisator je nach Szene auf einen von sieben verschiedene Modi an und minimiert Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen.\\n\\n<b>WLAN zur unkomplizierten Datenweitergabe<\/b>\\nPer WLAN kann die Kamera an eine Reihe von anderen Systemen*, wie z. B. Smartphones, angeschlossen werden. Damit k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihre Aufnahmen noch schneller mit Freunden und der Familie teilen.\\n\\n<b>Bedienung per Fingertipp<\/b>\\nDer hochaufl\u00f6sende 8,0 cm (3,2 Zoll) PureColor II Widescreen-Touch-LCD mit individuell einstellbarem, intelligentem Touch-Interface erm\u00f6glicht die intuitive Bedienung bei Aufnahme und Wiedergabe. Der Touch-Ausl\u00f6ser erm\u00f6glicht sofort nach der Motivauswahl das Ausl\u00f6sen der Aufnahme.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD-Movies, HDMI<\/b>\\nDie IXUS 240 HS kann mehr als nur fotografieren: Im Movie-Modus gelingen hervorragende Full-HD-Movies (1080p) mit 24 B\/s und Stereoton; auch hier steht der optische Zoom zur Verf\u00fcgung. Intelligent IS reduziert Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfe, selbst bei maximaler Zoomeinstellung. Die HDMI\u2122-Schnittstelle erlaubt den Anschluss an einen kompatiblen HD-Fernseher f\u00fcr die Wiedergabe in Topqualit\u00e4t.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (intelligenter AUTO-Modus f\u00fcr 58 Aufnahmesituationen)<\/b>\\nIm intelligenten Automatik-Modus (Smart Auto) entstehen ganz einfach hochwertige Fotos oder Movies. 58 Aufnahmesituationen (21 bei Movies) werden unterschieden und automatisch die richtigen Einstellungen ausgew\u00e4hlt. Smart Auto funktioniert auch bei Gesichtern im Motiv \u2013 dank Face ID erfolgt sogar eine Anpassung der Aufnahmeeinstellungen an das Alter der Person. So werden etwa bei einem schlafenden Baby Blitz und Kamerager\u00e4usche deaktiviert.\\n\\n<b>Face ID<\/b>\\nMit Face ID k\u00f6nnen Sie bis zu 12 Gesichter von Personen aus dem Familien- oder Freundeskreis registrieren \u2013 diese Gesichter genie\u00dfen bei der Scharfstellung automatisch Priorit\u00e4t; au\u00dferdem werden die Bilder mit den Namen versehen, damit man sie bei der Wiedergabe leicht wiederfindet.\\n\\n<b>High-Speed-Reihenaufnahmen<\/b>\\nGanz wie Sie wollen: Per High-Speed-Reihenaufnahmen erfassen Sie rasante Non-Stop-Action, und mit Super Slow Motion Movie lassen sich schnelle Bewegungen verlangsamt darstellen.\\n\\n<b>Filmtagebuch (720p)<\/b>\\nIm Modus Filmtagebuch wird vor jedem Foto eine 4 Sekunden lange Moviesequenz aufgenommen; die Movieclips eines Tages k\u00f6nnen zu einem interessanten Bonus-Video in HD-Qualit\u00e4t (720p) zusammengef\u00fcgt werden.\\n\\n*WLAN-Unterst\u00fctzung kann je nach Region variieren. Weitere Informationen finden Sie unter www.canon-europe.com\/wirelesscompacts."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"With HS System and a huge touch screen for capturing any moment with ease, the slim IXUS 240 HS offers Wi-Fi connection for instantly sharing your stunning shots.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS combats camera shake to ensure all your photos and videos are sharp and detailed even at full zoom or in low light. It automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 7 modes to prevent blur.\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi for easy image sharing<\/b>\\nWi-Fi lets you connect your camera wirelessly with other devices* such as your smartphone, for quick and easy sharing of photos and movies with friends and family.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nA widescreen, high-resolution 8.0 cm (3.2\") PureColor II Touch LCD with customisable smart touch interface provides intuitive control for fast, easy operation and pleasurable playback. Touch Shutter allows you to touch on the point of focus and then to trigger the shot.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movies, HDMI<\/b>\\nRecord superb Full HD (1080p) movies at 24fps with stereo sound and optical zoom. Intelligent IS keeps footage steady while filming, even at full zoom. An HDMI connection ensures high quality playback on an HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (58 scenes)<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot great photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and selects optimal settings from 58 variables (21 in movies). It also works with faces stored in Face ID and adapts shooting according to registered age \u2013 for example turning off flash and sounds when a sleeping baby is detected.\\n\\n<b>Face ID<\/b>\\nFace ID registers up to 12 faces of family and friends, so they are automatically the focusing priority in every shot, and tags images with their names so they are easy to find in playback.\\n\\n<b>High-speed shooting<\/b>\\nUse High-speed Burst to capture non-stop, fast-paced action or slow things down with Super Slow Motion Movie.\\n\\n<b>Movie Digest (720p)<\/b>\\nMovie Digest records 4 seconds of video before each photo is shot and then joins all the recorded short clips into a bonus HD (720p) movie."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Bo\u00eetier plat en m\u00e9tal ; objectif de 24 mm avec zoom optique 5x<\/b>\\nPr\u00e9sentant un \u00e9l\u00e9gant bo\u00eetier plat en m\u00e9tal, l'IXUS 240 HS est suffisamment compact pour \u00eatre emport\u00e9 partout. \u00c9largissez le champ gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'ultra grand-angle de 24 mm ou rapprochez-vous des sujets distants \u00e0 l'aide du zoom optique 5x, extensible \u00e0 10x avec le mode ZoomPlus. Cette technologie de zoom avanc\u00e9e permet d'obtenir une plus grande richesse de d\u00e9tail et une plus grande nettet\u00e9 qu'un zoom num\u00e9rique traditionnel.\\n\\n<b>Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 : capteur CMOS 16,1 MP et DIGIC 5<\/b>\\nLe Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 est particuli\u00e8rement performant en basse lumi\u00e8re : vous pouvez restituer l'atmosph\u00e8re r\u00e9elle de l'instant sans utiliser de flash ni de tr\u00e9pied. Le traitement avanc\u00e9 du processeur DIGIC 5 et le capteur CMOS haute sensibilit\u00e9 de 16,1 millions de pixels garantissent une qualit\u00e9 d'image exceptionnelle en toutes circonstances.\\n\\n<b>Stabilisateur d'image intelligent<\/b>\\nLe stabilisateur d'image intelligent minimise les flous de boug\u00e9 afin de garantir des photos et des vid\u00e9os nettes et d\u00e9taill\u00e9es, m\u00eame au niveau de zoom maximal ou en basse lumi\u00e8re. Il adapte automatiquement le stabilisateur d'image optique \u00e0 la sc\u00e8ne en choisissant l'un des 7 modes disponibles afin d'\u00e9viter tout effet de flou.\\n\\n<b>Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi pour partager les images en toute simplicit\u00e9<\/b>\\nLe Wi-Fi vous permet de connecter votre appareil photo sans fil \u00e0 d'autres p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques*, tels que votre smartphone, afin de partager rapidement et en toute simplicit\u00e9 vos photos et vos vid\u00e9os avec des amis ou des proches.\\n\\n<b>Le contr\u00f4le au bout des doigts<\/b>\\nLe grand \u00e9cran LCD tactile PureColor II de 8 cm (3,2 pouces) pr\u00e9sente une interface tactile intelligente et personnalisable qui offre un contr\u00f4le intuitif et garantit une utilisation simple et rapide, ainsi qu'un visionnage agr\u00e9able des prises de vue. Le d\u00e9clencheur tactile vous permet d'appuyer \u00e0 l'endroit o\u00f9 vous souhaitez effectuer la mise au point, puis de prendre la photo.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9os Full HD, HDMI<\/b>\\nEnregistrez de magnifiques vid\u00e9os Full HD (1080p) \u00e0 24 im.\/s avec son st\u00e9r\u00e9o et zoom optique. Le stabilisateur d'image intelligent garantit des vid\u00e9os nettes m\u00eame au niveau de zoom maximal. Le port HDMI permet de lire les enregistrements en haute qualit\u00e9 sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD.\\n\\n<b>Mode Smart Auto (58 sc\u00e8nes)<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez facilement des photos et vid\u00e9os de grande qualit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au mode Smart Auto, qui analyse la sc\u00e8ne et choisit les meilleurs r\u00e9glages parmi 58 options possibles (21 en mode vid\u00e9o). Il utilise \u00e9galement les visages enregistr\u00e9s via la fonction Identification des visages et adapte les r\u00e9glages \u00e0 l'\u00e2ge enregistr\u00e9 pour un sujet, en d\u00e9sactivant par exemple le flash et les sons en cas de d\u00e9tection d'un b\u00e9b\u00e9 endormi.\\n\\n<b>Identification des visages<\/b>\\nLa fonction Identification des visages enregistre jusqu'\u00e0 12 visages de proches pour que ceux-ci aient automatiquement la priorit\u00e9 de la mise au point dans toutes les photos. Elle vous permet aussi de marquer leur nom pour pouvoir retrouver facilement les images dans lesquelles ils apparaissent.\\n\\n<b>Prise de vues ultra-rapide<\/b>\\nSaisissez les actions rapides gr\u00e2ce au mode Rafale grande vitesse ou ralentissez les mouvements gr\u00e2ce au mode Vid\u00e9o pour lecture au ralenti.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9sum\u00e9 vid\u00e9o (720p)<\/b>\\nLa fonction R\u00e9sum\u00e9 vid\u00e9o enregistre 4 secondes de vid\u00e9o avant chaque prise de vue et r\u00e9unit tous les clips ainsi enregistr\u00e9s en une vid\u00e9o HD (720p).\\n\\n* La prise en charge de la connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi varie en fonction de l'appareil et de la r\u00e9gion. Pour obtenir des informations suppl\u00e9mentaires, acc\u00e9dez \u00e0 la page : www.canon-europe.com\/wirelesscompacts."}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fe2d35b1-3cee-47ed-80d8-68aefb92011d","identifier":"12829972","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot D20"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Robuste Kamera; 12,1 MP HS System<\/b>\\nDie PowerShot D20 ist so robust, dass sie der ideale Begleiter selbst f\u00fcr extreme Outdoor-Aktivit\u00e4ten wie Snowboarding oder Schnorcheln ist. Und unabh\u00e4ngig vom Abenteuer sorgt das HS System f\u00fcr gro\u00dfartige Aufnahmen. Der moderne DIGIC 4 Bildprozessor und der hoch empfindliche 12,1 MP CMOS-Sensor helfen beim Einfangen der echten Atmosph\u00e4re des Momentes \u2013 selbst bei schwachem Licht und ohne Stativ.\\n\\n<b>Wasserdicht, sto\u00dffest, frostbest\u00e4ndig und staubgesch\u00fctzt<\/b>\\nExtra f\u00fcr besonders harte Bedingungen entwickelt, ist die Kamera bis zu 10 m Tauchtiefe wasserdicht, sto\u00dffest bis zu einer Fallh\u00f6he von 1,5 m [1], voll funktionsf\u00e4hig bei Temperaturen bis zu -10 \u00b0C und vollkommen staubgesch\u00fctzt.\\n\\n<b>28-mm-Weitwinkel, 5fach optisches Zoom, Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIdeal f\u00fcr Gruppen- und Nahaufnahmen: Das 28-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv und das 5fach optische Zoom geben Ihnen die M\u00f6glichkeit, alles im Blick zu haben, oder ganz nah ran zu gehen. Der Intelligent IS sorgt auch dann noch f\u00fcr scharfe, deutliche Fotos und Movies, wenn Sie in Action sind, mit hohem Zoomwert oder bei wenig Licht fotografieren. Er passt den optischen Bildstabilisator je nach Szene auf einen von sieben verschiedene Modi an und minimiert so Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen.\\n\\n<b>GPS [2]<\/b>\\nGPS versieht Fotos und Movies mit Standortdaten und dokumentiert so Ihre Abenteuerreisen. Mit der Map Utility Software (im Lieferumfang) kann die Aufnahmeort sogar auf der Karte aufgezeigt und an Freunde weiter gegeben werden.\\n\\n<b>7,5 cm (3,0 Zoll) PureColor II LCD<\/b>\\nDer gro\u00dfe und besonders gut lesbare LCD mit 460.000 Bildpunkten ist mit Spezialbeschichtungen versehen, damit sogar bei Sonnenschein und Unterwasser alles darauf gut sichtbar ist. Das Active Display mit Gestensteuerung kann auch dann noch bedient werden, wenn man Handschuhe tr\u00e4gt.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD-Movies<\/b>\\nDie Movie-Taste startet unmittelbar die Aufzeichnung in Full-HD (1080p) mit optischem Zoom und der Intelligent IS h\u00e4lt die Aufnahmen frei von Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen. Die HDMI\u2122-Schnittstelle erlaubt den Anschluss an einen kompatiblen HD-Fernseher f\u00fcr die Wiedergabe in Topqualit\u00e4t.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (f\u00fcr 32 Aufnahmesituationen)<\/b>\\nIm intelligenten Automatik-Modus (Smart Auto) entstehen ganz einfach hochwertige Fotos oder Movies. 32 Aufnahmesituationen (21 bei Movies) werden unterschieden und automatisch die richtigen Einstellungen ausgew\u00e4hlt.\\n\\n<b>Spezielle Movie-Modi<\/b>\\nFilmtagebuch (720p) und Super Slow Motion Movie f\u00fcr noch mehr M\u00f6glichkeiten beim Filmdreh.\\n\\n<b>Unterwasserfunktionen<\/b>\\nF\u00fcr ganz besondere Unterwasseraufnahmen sorgen Funktionen wie Unterwasser-Makro f\u00fcr exzellente Nahaufnahmen oder Quick AF f\u00fcr das blitzschnelle, automatische Scharfstellen. Dank benutzerdefiniertem und automatischem Wei\u00dfabgleich zeigen die Aufnahmen selbst bei den unterschiedlichsten Unterwasserbedingungen immer die richtigen Farben.\\n\\n<b>Optionales Unterwassergeh\u00e4use f\u00fcr bis zu 40 m Tauchtiefe<\/b>\\nUm sich auf jedes Unterwasserabenteuer einstellen zu k\u00f6nnen ist im Handel optional ein Unterwassergeh\u00e4use f\u00fcr bis zu 40 m Tauchtiefe erh\u00e4ltlich. Oder man greift zum Zubeh\u00f6r Kit [3], das zus\u00e4tzlich noch den Schultergurt, den Karabiner-Trageriemen, eine Weichtasche, sowie Silikonh\u00fclle und Schwimmer beinhaltet.\\n\\n[1] Die Testverfahren zur Bestimmung der Ersch\u00fctterungsresistenz sind auf dieses Produkt beschr\u00e4nkt und garantieren nicht, dass es nicht zu Sch\u00e4den oder Fehlfunktionen des Produkts kommen kann.\\n[2] Die Verwendung von GPS kann in bestimmten L\u00e4ndern oder Regionen eingeschr\u00e4nkt sein. Bei der Verwendung von GPS m\u00fcssen die Gesetze und Vorschriften des Landes bzw. der Region eingehalten werden, in dem das Ger\u00e4t betrieben wird. Dazu geh\u00f6ren auch eventuelle Einschr\u00e4nkungen in Bezug auf die Verwendung solcher Ger\u00e4te.\\n[3] Die optional erh\u00e4ltlichen Trageriemen sind nicht f\u00fcr die Nutzung unter Wasser geeignet."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Rugged camera; 12.1 Megapixel HS System<\/b>\\nThe PowerShot D20 is rugged enough for the most extreme outdoor activities, from snowboarding to snorkelling, while HS System ensures exceptional results whatever the adventure. Advanced DIGIC 4 processing and a high-sensitivity 12.1 Megapixel CMOS sensor let you capture the real atmosphere of the moment without flash or tripod even in low light.\\n\\n<b>Water, shock, freeze and dustproof<\/b>\\nConstructed for harsh conditions, the camera is waterproof down to 10m, shockproof to drops up to 1.5m[1], operates in temperatures as low as -10 \u00b0C and is fully protected from dust.\\n\\n<b>28mm, 5x optical zoom; Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nFit more in the frame with 28mm wide-angle for panoramic landscapes and great group shots and use the 5x optical zoom to get closer to distant subjects. Intelligent IS keeps photos and videos sharp and detailed even on the move, at full zoom or in low light, automatically adjusting the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 7 modes.\\n\\n<b>GPS[2]<\/b>\\nGPS tags the location of your photos and videos while the Logger function can keep track of your journey. Use the supplied Map Utility software to pinpoint shooting locations and to share them with friends.\\n\\n<b>7.5 cm (3.0\") PureColor II LCD<\/b>\\nA large, high visibility 460k dot LCD screen with multiple coatings provides good visibility in all conditions from sunshine to underwater. Active display with Tap Control offers comfortable reviewing of images even when wearing gloves.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movies<\/b>\\nUse the movie button to instantly record Full HD (1080p) movies with optical zoom, while Intelligent IS keeps footage steady. An HDMI connection ensures high quality playback on an HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (32 scenes)<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot great photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and selects optimal settings from 32 variables (21 in movies).\\n\\n<b>Special movie modes<\/b>\\nMovie Digest and Super Slow Motion Movie add more ways to capture the action on your adventures.\\n\\n<b>Underwater functions<\/b>\\nCapture stunning shots underwater with functions like Underwater Macro for sharp close ups and Quick AF for fast automatic focusing. Custom and White Balance Compensation quickly adjust colours to different aquatic environments.\\n\\n<b>Optional 40m Waterproof Case<\/b>\\nGet equipped for more adventures with an optional waterproof case (40m) or the Accessory Kit[3] that includes Shoulder Strap, Carabiner Strap, Softcase, Silicon jacket and Float.\\n\\n[1] The shock resistant testing methods are unique to this product and do not guarantee against damage or malfunction of the product.\\n[2] GPS use may be restricted in certain countries or regions. Use of GPS should comply with the laws and regulations of the country and area in which it is being operated including any restriction on the use of electronics.\\n[3] Optional straps not designed for underwater use."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Appareil photo robuste ; Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 12,1 millions de pixels<\/b>\\nExtr\u00eamement robuste, le PowerShot D20 peut \u00eatre utilis\u00e9 dans la plupart des activit\u00e9s extr\u00eames en ext\u00e9rieur, du snowboard \u00e0 la plong\u00e9e au tuba. Son Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 garantit des r\u00e9sultats exceptionnels, quel que soit le type d'aventure. Par ailleurs, le processeur DIGIC 4 avanc\u00e9 et le capteur CMOS haute sensibilit\u00e9 de 12,1 millions de pixels vous permettent de restituer la v\u00e9ritable atmosph\u00e8re du moment sans utiliser de flash ou de tr\u00e9pied, m\u00eame en basse lumi\u00e8re.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9sistant aux chocs, au gel, \u00e9tanche et herm\u00e9tique \u00e0 la poussi\u00e8re<\/b>\\nCon\u00e7u pour une utilisation dans des conditions difficiles, cet appareil photo est \u00e9tanche jusqu'\u00e0 une profondeur de 10 m, r\u00e9siste aux chutes de 1,5 m maximum[1], fonctionne \u00e0 des temp\u00e9ratures aussi basses que -10 \u00b0C et est compl\u00e8tement herm\u00e9tique \u00e0 la poussi\u00e8re.\\n\\n<b>Objectif de 28 mm avec zoom optique 5x ; stabilisateur d'image intelligent<\/b>\\n\u00c9largissez le champ gr\u00e2ce au grand-angle de 28 mm, pour des photos de paysages panoramiques et des photos de groupe uniques. Le zoom optique 5x vous permet quant \u00e0 lui de vous rapprocher des sujets distants. Le stabilisateur d'image intelligent garantit la nettet\u00e9 et la pr\u00e9cision des photos et des vid\u00e9os, m\u00eame en mouvement, au niveau de zoom maximal ou en basse lumi\u00e8re, en adaptant automatiquement le stabilisateur d'image optique \u00e0 la sc\u00e8ne \u00e0 partir de l'un des 7 modes disponibles.\\n\\n<b>GPS[2]<\/b>\\nG\u00e9olocalisez vos photos et vos vid\u00e9os et retracez votre itin\u00e9raire gr\u00e2ce aux fonctions de marquage et d'enregistrement GPS. Vous pouvez ensuite utiliser le logiciel Map Utility fourni pour marquer les endroits o\u00f9 vous avez r\u00e9alis\u00e9 vos prises de vues et les partager avec des amis.\\n\\n<b>\u00c9cran LCD PureColor II de 7,5 cm (3 pouces)<\/b>\\nLe grand \u00e9cran LCD de 460.000 points b\u00e9n\u00e9ficie de plusieurs traitements pour offrir une bonne visibilit\u00e9 dans toutes les conditions, y compris en plein soleil ou sous l'eau. La fonction Affichage actif avec contr\u00f4le tactile permet un visionnage confortable des photos, m\u00eame avec des gants.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9os Full HD<\/b>\\nUtilisez la touche vid\u00e9o pour enregistrer instantan\u00e9ment des vid\u00e9os Full HD (1080p) en vous servant du zoom optique : le stabilisateur d'image intelligent s'occupe de pr\u00e9server la stabilit\u00e9 et la nettet\u00e9 de vos prises de vues. Le port HDMI permet de lire les enregistrements en haute qualit\u00e9 sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD.\\n\\n<b>Mode Smart Auto (32 sc\u00e8nes)<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez facilement des photos et des vid\u00e9os de grande qualit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au mode Smart Auto, qui analyse la sc\u00e8ne et choisit les meilleurs r\u00e9glages parmi 32 options possibles (21 en mode vid\u00e9o).\\n\\n<b>Modes vid\u00e9o sp\u00e9ciaux<\/b>\\nLes fonctions R\u00e9sum\u00e9 vid\u00e9o et Vid\u00e9o pour lecture au ralenti offrent de nouvelles fa\u00e7ons de capturer vos aventures.\\n\\n<b>Fonctions sous-marines<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez d'incroyables prises de vue sous l'eau gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des fonctions telles que le mode macro sous-marin pour capturer des gros plans ou la mise au point automatique rapide pour effectuer une mise au point rapide sur un sujet. Le mode personnalis\u00e9 et la correction de balance des blancs permettent un ajustement rapide des couleurs en fonction des diff\u00e9rents environnements aquatiques.\\n\\n<b>Bo\u00eetier \u00e9tanche jusqu'\u00e0 40 m en option<\/b>\\n\u00c9quipez-vous pour encore plus d'aventures en optant pour le bo\u00eetier \u00e9tanche (40 m\u00e8tres) ou le kit d'accessoires[3], qui comprend une bandouli\u00e8re, une dragonne \u00e0 mousqueton, un \u00e9tui souple, un \u00e9tui en silicone et une sangle flottante.\\n\\n[1] Les m\u00e9thodes de test permettant d'\u00e9valuer la r\u00e9sistance aux chocs sont r\u00e9serv\u00e9es \u00e0 ce produit et ne garantissent pas l'absence de d\u00e9g\u00e2ts et de dysfonctionnements sur ce dernier.\\n[2] L'utilisation du GPS peut \u00eatre soumise \u00e0 des restrictions dans certains pays ou certaines r\u00e9gions. L'utilisation du GPS doit \u00eatre conforme aux lois et aux r\u00e8glements du pays et de la zone dans lesquels il est utilis\u00e9, y compris vis-\u00e0-vis des restrictions d'utilisation appliqu\u00e9es aux appareils \u00e9lectroniques.\\n[3] Les courroies en option ne sont pas adapt\u00e9es \u00e0 une utilisation sous l'eau."}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2526aa56-2cda-4465-8ed9-a684bfe93abb","identifier":"12829977","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot A4000"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>28-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv mit 8fach optischem Zoom<\/b>\\nDas vielseitige Canon Objektiv mit 8fach optischem Zoom bringt auch weit entfernte Motive so nah heran, dass jedes Detail sichtbar wird und mit dem 28-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv sind auch ausladende Landschaften oder gro\u00dfe Gruppen gut im Bild einzufangen.\\n\\n<b>16,0 Megapixel<\/b>\\nOriginal Canon Objektiv und 16 MP CMOS-Sensor sorgen f\u00fcr hervorragende Bildqualit\u00e4t und erm\u00f6glichen Bildvergr\u00f6\u00dferungen bis zum Format DIN A3+ und hochwertige Ausschnittvergr\u00f6\u00dferungen.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nDer Intelligent IS kompensiert Kamerawackler, so dass die Aufnahmen auch dann noch scharf und deutlich sind, wenn mit hohem Zoomwert oder bei wenig Licht fotografiert wird. Er passt den optischen Bildstabilisator je nach Szene auf einen von f\u00fcnf verschiedene Modi an und minimiert Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen.\\n\\n<b>Gro\u00dfes 7,5 cm (3,0 Zoll) LCD<\/b>\\nDas helle und gut lesbare Display (230.000 Bildpunkte) bietet ideale Voraussetzungen zur Motivsuche aber auch um Aufnahmen direkt anzusehen und anderen zu zeigen.\\n\\n<b>Kompaktes Metallgeh\u00e4use<\/b>\\nDas schlanke und kompakte Metallgeh\u00e4use in attraktiven Farbausf\u00fchrungen ist so klein und edel, dass es ist \u00fcberall hin passt.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (intelligenter AUTO-Modus f\u00fcr 32 Aufnahmesituationen)<\/b>\\nIm intelligenten Automatik-Modus (Smart Auto) entstehen ganz einfach hochwertige Fotos oder Movies. 32 Aufnahmesituationen werden unterschieden und automatisch die richtigen Einstellungen ausgew\u00e4hlt. Einfach die AUTO-Taste dr\u00fccken und Sie gelangen von jedem zuvor eingestellten Modus zu Smart Auto.\\n\\n<b>HD-Movies (720p) mit Movie-Aufnahmetaste<\/b>\\nMit einem Druck auf die Movie-Taste nehmen Sie sofort Hochwertige HD-Movies (720p) auf. Der Intelligent IS sorgt f\u00fcr Movie-Aufnahmen ohne Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen.\\n\\n<b>Hilfe-Taste<\/b>\\nEin Druck auf die Hilfe-Taste f\u00fchrt zu einer leicht verst\u00e4ndlichen Erkl\u00e4rung der Kamerafunktionen \u2013 das ist ideal f\u00fcr Anf\u00e4nger.\\n\\n<b>Kreativ-Modi<\/b>\\nZahlreiche Kreativfilter laden zum Experimentieren ein und bieten echten Fotospa\u00df. Mit dem Fischaugen-Effekt erscheinen die Aufnahmen, als w\u00e4ren sie durch ein Fischaugen-Objektiv verzerrt und Super Vivid verst\u00e4rkt die Farbs\u00e4ttigung. Poster-Effekt, Spielzeugkamera-Effekt und Monochrome sind weitere kreative Modi, die echten Fotospa\u00df bieten. Der Miniatur-Effekt gibt Fotos und Movies das Aussehen einer Miniatur-Spielzeugwelt.\\n\\n<b>Livebildkontrolle, Face Detection<\/b>\\nPer Livebildkontrolle wird das Experimentieren mit Einstellungen wie Helligkeit oder Farbintensit\u00e4t noch einfacher, weil das Ergebnis sofort auf dem Display zu sehen ist. So werden nur die besten Aufnahmen gespeichert. Face Detection ist eine Technologie zur Gesichtserkennung und sorgt f\u00fcr tolle Personenaufnahmen. Sie erkennt bis zu 35 Gesichter in einem Motiv und optimiert automatisch Scharfstellung und Helligkeit. Der Face Detection Wei\u00dfabgleich l\u00e4sst Hautt\u00f6ne selbst bei ungew\u00f6hnlichen Lichtbedingungen ganz nat\u00fcrlich erscheinen. Automatische Rote-Augen-Korrekturgegen rot Augen"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Go wide or get 8x closer with a Canon quality 8x optical zoom lens, Intelligent IS and Smart Auto for great photos and HD movies. The compact PowerShot A4000 IS captures every moment with ease.\\n\\n- 28mm wide, 8x optical zoom\\n- 16.0 Megapixels\\n- Intelligent IS\\n- Large 7.5 cm (3.0\u201d) LCD\\n- Compact metal body\\n- Smart Auto (32 scenes)\\n- HD movies (720p) with movie button\\n- Help button\\n- Fun and creative modes\\n- Live View Control, Face Detection\\n\\n<b>Intelligent and easy 8x zoom<\/b>\\n\\n<b>28mm wide, 8x optical zoom<\/b>\\nA versatile, Canon 8x optical zoom lens lets you get closer to distant subjects and focus on the detail while the 28mm wide-angle fits more in the frame for sweeping landscapes and great group shots.\\n\\n<b>16.0 Megapixels<\/b>\\nCapturing all the detail from the genuine Canon lens the 16MP sensor delivers superb quality images that are perfect for large-scale prints (A3+) or creative cropping.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS combats camera shake to ensure all your photos and videos are sharp and detailed even at full zoom or in low light. It automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 6 modes to prevent blur.\\n\\n<b>Large 7.5 cm (3.0\u201d) LCD<\/b>\\nA large, high quality LCD screen (230k dots) allows effortless menu navigation, lets you frame and view your shots with ease and makes sharing them with friends a pleasure.\\n\\n<b>Compact metal body<\/b>\\nThe slim, compact metal body in attractive colours is small and stylish enough to take anywhere.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (32 scenes)<\/b>\\nEven complete beginners can effortlessly shoot high quality photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and automatically selects the optimal settings from 32 variables. Press the Auto button to return instantly to Smart Auto from any other mode.\\n\\n<b>HD movies (720p) with movie button<\/b>\\nInstantly record high quality HD movies (720p) using one touch of the dedicated movie button. Intelligent IS keeps movies steady.\\n\\n<b>Help button<\/b>\\nSimply press the Help button for quick, easy-to-follow guidance on using your camera and its different functions \u2013 the ideal introduction for beginners.\\n\\n<b>Fun and creative modes<\/b>\\nHave fun with a range of creative filters. Use Fish-eye Effect to re-create fish-eye lens distortion, Super Vivid to boost colour saturation, retro Poster and Toy Camera Effects or Monochrome. Miniature Effect makes scenes in stills or movies look like miniature scale models.\\n\\n<b>Live View Control, Face Detection<\/b>\\nLive View Control allows you to easily experiment with picture settings like brightness and colour intensity and preview the results while framing, so you can capture the best shot. Face Detection Technology ensures great people shots. It detects up to 35 faces in a single frame making sure they remain in focus and with optimum brightness. Face Detection White Balance ensures natural skin tones even in unusual lighting conditions. Auto Red-Eye Correction eliminates red-eye."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Objectif grand-angle de 28 mm avec zoom optique 8x<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce au zoom optique 8x polyvalent de Canon, vous pouvez vous rapprocher des sujets distants et effectuer la mise au point sur des d\u00e9tails pr\u00e9cis. L'objectif grand-angle de 28 mm vous permet quant \u00e0 lui de photographier des paysages \u00e9tendus ou de prendre de superbes photos de groupe.\\n\\n<b>16 millions de pixels<\/b>\\nEnregistrant tous les d\u00e9tails transmis par l'objectif Canon, le capteur de 16 millions de pixels fournit des images d'une qualit\u00e9 exceptionnelle, parfaites pour des tirages en grand format (A3 ou plus) ou pour des recadrages cr\u00e9atifs.\\n\\n<b>Stabilisateur d'image intelligent<\/b>\\nLe stabilisateur d'image intelligent minimise les flous de boug\u00e9 afin de garantir des photos et des vid\u00e9os nettes et d\u00e9taill\u00e9es, m\u00eame au niveau de zoom maximal ou en basse lumi\u00e8re. Il adapte automatiquement le stabilisateur d'image optique \u00e0 la sc\u00e8ne en choisissant l'un des 6 modes disponibles afin d'\u00e9viter tout effet de flou.\\n\\n<b>Grand \u00e9cran LCD de 7,5 cm (3 pouces)<\/b>\\nLe grand \u00e9cran LCD de haute qualit\u00e9 (230.000 points) assure une navigation ais\u00e9e dans les menus et vous permet de cadrer et de visionner vos prises de vue en toute simplicit\u00e9 \u2014 partager les photos est un vrai plaisir.\\n\\n<b>Bo\u00eetier en m\u00e9tal compact<\/b>\\nLe bo\u00eetier en m\u00e9tal plat et \u00e9l\u00e9gant, disponible dans diff\u00e9rentes couleurs attrayantes, est suffisamment compact pour vous permettre d'emporter l'appareil photo o\u00f9 que vous alliez, et ce, avec style.\\n\\n<b>Mode Smart Auto (32 sc\u00e8nes)<\/b>\\nLe mode Smart Auto d\u00e9tecte le type de sc\u00e8ne et s\u00e9lectionne automatiquement les param\u00e8tres les mieux adapt\u00e9s parmi 32 variables. Ainsi, m\u00eame les utilisateurs les moins exp\u00e9riment\u00e9s peuvent prendre des photos de haute qualit\u00e9 en toute simplicit\u00e9. Et gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la touche Auto, une simple pression suffit \u00e0 revenir au mode Smart Auto depuis n'importe quel autre mode.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9os HD (720p) avec touche vid\u00e9o<\/b>\\nEnregistrez instantan\u00e9ment des vid\u00e9os HD (720p) de haute qualit\u00e9 en appuyant simplement sur la touche vid\u00e9o d\u00e9di\u00e9e. Et gr\u00e2ce au stabilisateur d'image intelligent, vous pouvez dire adieu aux vid\u00e9os tremblantes.\\n\\n<b>Touche Aide<\/b>\\nLa touche Aide permet d'obtenir d'une simple pression des instructions claires et rapides sur l'utilisation de l'appareil photo et ses diff\u00e9rentes fonctions \u2014 une fa\u00e7on extr\u00eamement pratique pour les d\u00e9butants de se familiariser avec l'appareil.\\n\\n<b>Modes amusants et cr\u00e9atifs<\/b>\\nAmusez-vous avec un large \u00e9ventail de filtres cr\u00e9atifs. Utilisez le filtre Effet tr\u00e8s grand angle pour recr\u00e9er la distorsion d'un objectif \u00ab fish-eye \u00bb, le filtre Super \u00e9clatant pour augmenter la saturation des couleurs, le filtre Effet poster r\u00e9tro, ou encore les filtres Toy Camera ou Monochrome. Avec le filtre Effet miniature, vos photos et vos vid\u00e9os prennent l'aspect de mod\u00e8les r\u00e9duits.\\n\\n<b>Contr\u00f4le de vis\u00e9e directe et d\u00e9tection des visages<\/b>\\nLe contr\u00f4le de vis\u00e9e directe vous permet d'exp\u00e9rimenter diff\u00e9rents param\u00e8tres photo tels que la luminosit\u00e9 ou l'intensit\u00e9 des couleurs et de pr\u00e9visualiser le r\u00e9sultat pendant le cadrage afin d'obtenir la prise de vue souhait\u00e9e. La technologie de d\u00e9tection de visages permet de r\u00e9aliser de magnifiques portraits. L'appareil photo d\u00e9tecte jusqu'\u00e0 35 visages dans un m\u00eame cadre et optimise la mise au point et la luminosit\u00e9 pour chacun d'entre eux. La d\u00e9tection de visages avec balance des blancs garantit des tons chair naturels, m\u00eame dans des conditions d'\u00e9clairage inhabituelles. La correction automatique des yeux rouges \u00e9liminecet effet inesth\u00e9tique des prises de vue."}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e2a50e81-2fad-40dd-b8f6-6661ee055d45","identifier":"12829988","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot SX260 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>25-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv, 20fach optisches Zoom; kompaktes Geh\u00e4use<\/b>\\nAlles im Blick mit dem 25-mm-Weitwinkelobjektiv oder extrem nah ran mit 20fach optischem Zoom und bis zu 39fach ZoomPlus, der modernen Zoomtechnologie, die weit mehr Detail und Bildsch\u00e4rfe bietet, als der konventionelle Digitalzoom. Und trotzdem ist das Geh\u00e4use so kompakt, dass die Kamera \u00fcberall zur Stelle sein kann, um die sch\u00f6nsten Momente einzufangen.\\n\\n<b>HS System: 12,1 MP CMOS und DIGIC 5<\/b>\\nDas HS System brilliert bei schwachen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen \u2013 ideal, um den Zauber einer Stimmung auch ohne Blitz und Stativ festzuhalten. Der fortschrittliche DIGIC 5 Prozessor und der hoch empfindliche 12,1 MP starke CMOS-Sensor sorgen gemeinsam f\u00fcr \u00fcberzeugende Bildqualit\u00e4t in allen Situationen.\\n\\n<b>GPS*<\/b>\\nGPS versieht Fotos und Movies mit Standortdaten und dokumentiert so Ihre Abenteuerreisen. Mit der Map Utility Software (im Lieferumfang) kann die Location sogar auf der Karte aufgezeigt und an Freunde weiter gegeben werden.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nDer Intelligent IS kompensiert Kamerawackler, so dass die Aufnahmen auch dann noch scharf und deutlich sind, wenn mit hohem Zoomwert oder bei wenig Licht fotografiert wird. Er passt den optischen Bildstabilisator je nach Szene auf einen von sieben verschiedene Modi an und minimiert Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD-Movies<\/b>\\nDie Movie-Taste startet unmittelbar die Aufzeichnung in Full-HD (1080p) mit optischem Zoom und Stereoton und der Intelligent IS h\u00e4lt die Aufnahmen frei von Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen. Die HDMI\u2122-Schnittstelle erlaubt den Anschluss an einen kompatiblen HD-Fernseher f\u00fcr die Wiedergabe in Topqualit\u00e4t.\\n\\n<b>7,5 cm PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nDas gro\u00dfe, hochwertige LC-Display mit ca. 460.000 Bildpunkten erm\u00f6glicht die bequeme Men\u00fcnavigation sowie Bildkomposition und -\u00fcberpr\u00fcfung aus nahezu jedem Winkel. Die speziell geh\u00e4rtete Glasschicht sorgt f\u00fcr eine robuste Oberfl\u00e4che.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (intelligenter AUTO-Modus f\u00fcr 58 Aufnahmesituationen), Gesichtserkennung<\/b>\\nIm intelligenten Automatik-Modus (Smart Auto) entstehen ganz einfach hochwertige Fotos oder Movies. 58 Aufnahmesituationen (21 bei Movies) werden unterschieden und automatisch die richtigen Einstellungen ausgew\u00e4hlt. Smart Auto funktioniert auch bei Gesichtern im Motiv \u2013 dank Face ID erfolgt die Anpassung der Aufnahmeeinstellungen sogar an das Alter der Person. So werden etwa bei einem schlafenden Baby Blitz und Kamerager\u00e4usche deaktiviert. In Face ID k\u00f6nnen bis zu 12 Gesichter registriert werden, die dann in jeder Aufnahme besonders priorisiert werden.\\n\\n<b>Manueller, Av und Tv Modus<\/b>\\nMit den manuell w\u00e4hlbaren Modi Tv, Av und Manuell macht das kreative Experimentieren mit Belichtungszeit und Blende besonderen Spa\u00df.\\n\\n<b>High-Speed-Reihenaufnahmen<\/b>\\nGanz wie Sie wollen: Per High-Speed-Reihenaufnahmen erfassen Sie dynamische Action, und mit Super Slow Motion Movie lassen sich schnelle Bewegungen verlangsamt darstellen.\\n\\n<b>Optionales Unterwassergeh\u00e4use f\u00fcr bis zu 40 m Tauchtiefe<\/b>\\nDas optional als Zubeh\u00f6r erh\u00e4ltliche Unterwassergeh\u00e4use sch\u00fctzt Ihre Kamera beim Outdoor-Einsatz und Unterwasseraufnahmen bis 40 m Tiefe.\\n\\n*Die Verwendung von GPS kann in bestimmten L\u00e4ndern oder Regionen eingeschr\u00e4nkt sein. Bei der Verwendung von GPS m\u00fcssen die Gesetze und Vorschriften des Landes bzw. der Region eingehalten werden, in dem das Ger\u00e4t betrieben wird. Dazu geh\u00f6ren auch eventuelle Einschr\u00e4nkungen in Bezug auf die Verwendung solcher Ger\u00e4te."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>20x zoom, 25mm wide-angle lens; compact body<\/b>\\nFit more in the frame with 25mm or get extremely close to distant subjects with 20x optical zoom or up to 39x with ZoomPlus- an advanced zoom technology with more visible detail and sharpness than conventional digital zoom. The compact body means you can capture every precious memory wherever you go.\\n\\n<b>HS System: 12.1 Megapixel CMOS and DIGIC 5<\/b>\\nHS System excels in low light allowing you to capture the real atmosphere of the moment without flash or tripod. Advanced DIGIC 5 processing and a high sensitivity 12.1 Megapixel CMOS sensor give excellent image quality in all situations.\\n\\n<b>GPS*<\/b>\\nGPS tags the location of your photos and videos while the Logger function can keep track of your journey. Use the supplied Map Utility software to pinpoint shooting locations and to share them with friends.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS combats camera shake to ensure all your photos and videos are sharp and detailed even at full zoom or in low light. It automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 7 modes to prevent blur.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movies<\/b>\\nUse the movie button to instantly record Full HD (1080p) movies in stereo with optical zoom, while Intelligent IS keeps footage steady. An HDMI connection ensures high quality playback on an HDTV.\\n\\n<b>7.5 cm (3.0\") PureColor II G LCD<\/b>\\nA large 460k dot LCD screen with excellent visibility allows easy framing and reviewing of images from any angle plus effortless menu navigation. A tempered glass outer layer gives great durability.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (58 scenes); Face ID<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot great photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and selects optimal settings from 58 variables (21 in movies). It also works with faces stored in Face ID and adapts shooting according to registered age \u2013 for example turning off flash and sounds when a sleeping baby is detected. Face ID lets you register up to 12 faces, so they are the focusing priority in every shot.\\n\\n<b>Manual, Av and Tv modes<\/b>\\nExperiment with different effects using Manual modes (Tv, Av and M), which give you creative control over shutter speed and aperture.\\n\\n<b>High-speed shooting<\/b>\\nCapture fast-paced action with High-speed Burst or slow down fast movement with Super Slow Motion Movie.\\n\\n<b>Optional 40m Waterproof Case<\/b>\\nProtect your camera outdoors and shoot underwater down to 40m with a waterproof case.\\n\\n*GPS use may be restricted in certain countries or regions. Use of GPS should comply with the laws and regulations of the country and area in which it is being operated including any restriction on the use of electronics."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Objectif grand-angle de 25 mm avec zoom 20x ; bo\u00eetier compact<\/b>\\n\u00c9largissez le champ gr\u00e2ce au grand-angle de 25 mm ou rapprochez-vous des sujets distants \u00e0 l'aide du zoom optique 20x, extensible \u00e0 39\u00d7 avec le mode ZoomPlus. Cette technologie de zoom avanc\u00e9e permet d'obtenir une plus grande richesse de d\u00e9tail et une plus grande nettet\u00e9 qu'un zoom num\u00e9rique traditionnel. Et gr\u00e2ce au bo\u00eetier compact de l'appareil photo, vous pouvez capturer tous vos meilleurs moments, o\u00f9 que vous alliez.\\n\\n<b>Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 : capteur CMOS 12,1 millions de pixels et processeur DIGIC 5<\/b>\\nLe Syst\u00e8me Haute Sensibilit\u00e9 est particuli\u00e8rement performant en conditions de faible \u00e9clairage : vous pouvez restituer l'atmosph\u00e8re r\u00e9elle de l'instant sans utiliser de flash ou de tr\u00e9pied. Le traitement avanc\u00e9 du processeur DIGIC 5 et le capteur CMOS haute sensibilit\u00e9 de 12,1 millions de pixels garantissent une qualit\u00e9 d'image exceptionnelle en toutes circonstances.\\n\\n<b>GPS*<\/b>\\nG\u00e9olocalisez vos photos et vos vid\u00e9os et retracez votre itin\u00e9raire gr\u00e2ce aux fonctions de marquage et d'enregistrement GPS. Vous pouvez ensuite utiliser le logiciel Map Utility fourni pour marquer les endroits o\u00f9 vous avez r\u00e9alis\u00e9 vos prises de vues et les partager avec des amis.\\n\\n<b>Stabilisateur d'image intelligent<\/b>\\nLe stabilisateur d'image intelligent minimise les flous de boug\u00e9 afin de garantir des photos et des vid\u00e9os nettes et d\u00e9taill\u00e9es, m\u00eame au niveau de zoom maximal ou en basse lumi\u00e8re. Il adapte automatiquement le stabilisateur d'image optique \u00e0 la sc\u00e8ne en choisissant l'un des 7 modes disponibles afin d'\u00e9viter tout effet de flou.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9os Full HD<\/b>\\nUtilisez la touche vid\u00e9o pour enregistrer instantan\u00e9ment des vid\u00e9os Full HD (1080p) en st\u00e9r\u00e9o \u00e0 l'aide du zoom optique : le stabilisateur d'image intelligent s'occupe de pr\u00e9server la stabilit\u00e9 et la nettet\u00e9 de vos prises de vues. Le port HDMI permet de lire les enregistrements en haute qualit\u00e9 sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD.\\n\\n<b>\u00c9cran LCD PureColor II G de 7,5 cm (3 pouces)<\/b>\\nLe grand \u00e9cran LCD haute visibilit\u00e9 de 460.000 points permet de cadrer et de visionner facilement les images depuis n'importe quel angle et assure une navigation ais\u00e9e dans les menus. Sa protection en verre tremp\u00e9 lui conf\u00e8re une grande r\u00e9sistance.\\n\\n<b>Mode Smart Auto (58 types de sc\u00e8nes) ; Identification des visages<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez facilement des photos et vid\u00e9os de grande qualit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au mode Smart Auto, qui analyse la sc\u00e8ne et choisit les meilleurs r\u00e9glages parmi 58 options possibles (21 en mode vid\u00e9o). Il utilise \u00e9galement les visages enregistr\u00e9s via la fonction Identification des visages et adapte les r\u00e9glages \u00e0 l'\u00e2ge enregistr\u00e9 pour un sujet, en d\u00e9sactivant par exemple le flash et les sons en cas de d\u00e9tection d'un b\u00e9b\u00e9 endormi. La fonction Identification des visages vous permet d'enregistrer jusqu'\u00e0 12 visages pour que ceux-ci b\u00e9n\u00e9ficient automatiquement d'une mise au point prioritaire sur toutes les prises de vue.\\n\\n<b>Modes Manuel, Av et Tv<\/b>\\nExp\u00e9rimentez diff\u00e9rents effets en utilisant les modes manuels (Tv, Av et M), qui vous permettent de contr\u00f4ler les r\u00e9glages d'ouverture et de vitesse d'obturation, pour encore plus de cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Prise de vues ultra-rapide<\/b>\\nSaisissez les actions rapides gr\u00e2ce au mode Rafale grande vitesse ou ralentissez les mouvements gr\u00e2ce au mode Vid\u00e9o pour lecture au ralenti.\\n\\n<b>Bo\u00eetier \u00e9tanche jusqu'\u00e0 40 m en option<\/b>\\nProt\u00e9gez votre appareil contre les intemp\u00e9ries lorsque vous \u00eates dehors et prenez des photos sous l'eau jusqu'\u00e0 40 m de profondeur gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un bo\u00eetier \u00e9tanche.\\n\\n* L'utilisation du GPS peut \u00eatre soumise \u00e0 des restrictions dans certains pays ou certaines r\u00e9gions. L'utilisation du GPS doit \u00eatre conforme aux lois et aux r\u00e8glements du pays et de la zone dans lesquels il est utilis\u00e9, y compris vis-\u00e0-vis des restrictions d'utilisation appliqu\u00e9es aux appareils \u00e9lectroniques."}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":20}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d2e66d4e-7076-46fb-9091-493a4a0a595f","identifier":"12830519","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["hp","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LD4730G"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Perfect for eye-popping large format video wall installations that attract customer attention, the HP LD4730 delivers stunning display technology and performance features and a micro-thin bezel that\u2019s virtually invisible between tiled displays.\\n\\n<b>Smart technology<\/b>\\n- Efficiently manage and deploy network-attached digital signage displays (DSDs) over the enterprise with simplified Video\u2013Over\u2013Ethernet (VOE), an HP-exclusive video input.\\n- VOE also helps simplify installation and cabling, increase flexibility, and reduce your cost of deployment.\\n- Save time and money by associating up to 12 DSDs with a single media player. HP remote management features make it easy to manage associations from any computer on the network.\\n- Video inputs on the DSDs provide expansive connectivity options for a range of devices.\\n\\n<b>Out-of-the-box productivity<\/b>\\n- HP Network Sign Manager Software helps you remotely control and manage your DSD and your message.\\n- Integrated software enables \u201con-the-fly\u201d command and setting changes to one or more DSDs from a single source\u2014great for businesses with multiple LAN-connected displays in different physical locations like stores, lobbies, offices, and travel hubs.\\n\\n<b>HP DreamColor quality<\/b>\\n- HP\u2019s leading color management technology, HP DreamColor, helps ensure simplified color matching on all your displays and keeps your video wall at peak performance with vibrant colors and deep rich tones.\\n- The HP DreamColor Calibration Solution (sold separately) delivers host-less color calibration for all displays in the video wall to help ensure consistent and accurate color across the entire display area.\\n\\n<b>Built to last<\/b>\\n- HP Digital Signage Displays are engineered for demanding usage for enhanced performance and reliability and rated to operate 24\/7 in traditional retail and commercial environments."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":12}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":47,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bbb3f3f0-f5bd-41df-ad68-633aae691a2f","identifier":"12835964","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["aoc","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AOC e2343Fi"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit dem e2343Fi stellt AOC ein Designer-Display f\u00fcr die millionenstarke Apple\u00ae-Fangemeinde vor. Denn im Standfu\u00df des eleganten, nur 1,26 cm tiefen Bildschirms befindet sich ein integriertes Dock f\u00fcr den Anschluss zahlreicher Modelle von iPhone\u00ae und iPod\u00ae. Im Nu lassen sich Videoinhalte oder Fotos vom iPhone mehr als 37-mal gr\u00f6\u00dfer direkt auf dem 58,5 cm (23\u2033)-Display darstellen. Die Wiedergabe von Audiodateien erfolgt \u00fcber SRS-Premium-Lautsprecher. Damit ist der e2343Fi nicht nur ein Monitor mit allgemein ausgezeichneten Leistungsmerkmalen, sondern f\u00fcr Apple-Nutzer auch eine Multimedia-Komplettl\u00f6sung.\\n\\n<b>Produktdetails<\/b>\\n\\n- Eing\u00e4nge: D-SUB, HDMI\\n- 1920 x 1080 maximale Aufl\u00f6sung\\n- Special Features: -5\u00b0~+18\u00b0 Tilt,5:4 switch,Eco Mode,e-Saver,i-Menu,iPhone docking Station,Kensington Security Lock,Low-Power,Off Timer,Premium Speaker (2x 5W),screen+,Touch Key,Ultra Slim,USB (up)\\n- 250 cd\/m\u00b2 (typ) cd\/m\u00b2\\n- 5 ms\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"With the e2343Fi, display specialist AOC introduces an intelligent concept targeted at the million-strong Apple\u00ae fan community. The 58.5 cm (23\u2033) model features a universal iPhone and iPod dock integrated in its base. Enlarge the viewing area for your photos on your iPhone or iPod by the factor 37, or listen to your music via SRS premium speakers whilst charging your mobile device at the same time! This super-slim (12.6 mm) and ultra-fast (2 ms response time) model is the all-in-one solution for Apple fans.\\n\\n<b>Product Details<\/b>\\n\\n- Inputs: D-SUB, HDMI\\n- 1920 x 1080 maximum resolution\\n- Special Features: -5\u00b0~+18\u00b0 Tilt,5:4 switch,Eco Mode,e-Saver,i-Menu,iPhone docking Station,Kensington Security Lock,Low-Power,Off Timer,Premium Speaker (2x 5W),screen+,Touch Key,Ultra Slim,USB (up)\\n- 250 cd\/m\u00b2 (typ) cd\/m\u00b2\\n- 5 ms"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec l'e2343Fi, AOC, le sp\u00e9cialiste de l'affichage, pr\u00e9sente un concept intelligent \u00e0 l'intention des millions d'inconditionnels de la marque Apple\u00ae. Cet \u00e9cran de 58,5 cm (23 pouces) int\u00e8gre dans sa base une station d'accueil universelle pour iPhone et iPod. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 lui, vous multiplierez par 37 le format d\u2019affichage des photos stock\u00e9es sur votre iPhone ou iPod et b\u00e9n\u00e9ficierez de la haute qualit\u00e9 de diffusion des haut-parleurs SRS pour \u00e9couter votre musique tout en rechargeant votre appareil mobile ! Ultra-fin (12,6 mm) et ultra-rapide (temps de r\u00e9ponse 2 ms), ce mod\u00e8le est la solution tout-en-un pour les fans d'Apple.\\n\\n<b>D\u00e9tails sur le produit<\/b>\\n\\n- Inputs: D-SUB, HDMI\\n- 1920 x 1080 maximum resolution\\n- Special Features: -5\u00b0~+18\u00b0 Tilt,5:4 switch,Eco Mode,e-Saver,i-Menu,iPhone docking Station,Kensington Security Lock,Low-Power,Off Timer,Premium Speaker (2x 5W),screen+,Touch Key,Ultra Slim,USB (up)\\n- 250 cd\/m\u00b2 (typ) cd\/m\u00b2\\n- 5 ms\\n"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f3534280-3674-4665-9db9-391d93388da6","identifier":"12836033","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["fujitsu","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujitsu fi-6130Z"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Designed with innovative features, the Fujitsu fi-6130Z scanner offers outstanding price\/performance value in a compact footprint, conserving both space and budget.\\n\\n<b>Scanning Performance<\/b>\\nWith duplex scanning speeds of up to 80 images per minute in Color, Grayscale, and Black & White, the fi-6130Z also delivers uncompromised high-resolution performance of up to 60 images per minute at an astounding 300 dpi resolution for high accuracy OCR and bar code recognition. Combined with one of the most advanced paper separation features in its class, the fi-6130Z employs reversing roller technology and a host of intelligent functions to provide exceptional feeding reliability for a wide variety of document types.\\n\\n- Continuous hard and embossed card scanning up to 1.4mm thick;\\n- Ultrasonic Double-feed Detection sensor for security against lost images;\\n- Intelligent Multi-Feed Function for efficiently scanning overlapped documents like taped receipts;\\n- Paper Protection sensor to stop a jam before it happens;\\n- Long document support up to 10 feet.\\n\\n<b>Centralized Efficiency<\/b>\\nWhether the infrastructure is fixed or expanding, managing technology efficiently inside the organization is key to reducing total cost of ownership and the Fujitsu fi-6130Z provides system administrators with advanced software tools to centrally manage the scanner more productively and cost effectively.\\n\\n- Agent, console and server remote scanner management;\\n- Real-time Fujitsu scanner inventory;\\n- Status and alert monitoring;\\n- Centralized driver update deployment;\\n- Consumable management.\\n\\n<b>Fully Loaded One Box Solution<\/b>\\nFujitsu fi-6130Z workgroup scanner conveniently includes everything in the box to get organizations up and scanning. With Kofax VRS\u00ae Professional and ScandAll PRO software users get image enhancement functionality as well as the option of scanning directly to PDF, file, print or batch."}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d296c28b-de6f-41e2-bfc8-520870963c33","identifier":"12838770","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["hp","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Scanjet Enterprise 7000nx Document Capture Workstation"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Verbessern Sie Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe und steigern Sie die Produktivit\u00e4t mit einer gemeinsam benutzten Workstation f\u00fcr die Dokumenterfassung. Sie zeichnet sich durch eine gute Verwaltbarkeit aus und bietet erweiterte Netzwerk- und Sicherheitsfunktionen sowie einen leicht zu bedienenden Farb-Touchscreen f\u00fcr den allt\u00e4glichen Gebrauch.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Dokumente und Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe lassen sich direkt \u00fcber diese gemeinsam benutzte Workstation auf Abteilungsebene verwalten.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Steigern Sie Ihren Return-on-Investment: Mit dieser leistungsf\u00e4higen und doch einfach zu bedienenden Workstation f\u00fcr die Dokumenterfassung k\u00f6nnen Sie dokumentbezogene Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe optimieren.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>HP Web Jetadmin bietet zuverl\u00e4ssige Sicherheitsfunktionen und eine einfache Netzwerkverwaltung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Steigern Sie die Produktivit\u00e4t und erm\u00f6glichen Sie die gemeinsame Nutzung \u2013 mit einem Netzwerk mit 10\/100\/1000 Mbit\/s mit hochentwickelten Sicherheitsfunktionen wie IPsec, SSL, SNMPv3 und Kerberos.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Schnelle, einfache und zuverl\u00e4ssige Dokumentenerfassung mit vielseitigen Funktionen f\u00fcr die Dokumentenhandhabung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Sie k\u00f6nnen beidseitig bedruckte Dokumente mit bis zu 40 S.\/Min. bzw. 80 Bildern\/Min. in Schwarzwei\u00df und Graustufen schnell scannen; bis zu 35 S.\/Min. bzw. 70 Bilder\/Min. in Farbe<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Sie profitieren von personalisierten, flexibel einsetzbaren L\u00f6sungen.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Sie profitieren von der nahtlosen Integration mit Unterst\u00fctzung einer Vielzahl unternehmensweiter Dokumentenmanagement-Systeme und einem breiten Angebot an vollst\u00e4ndig kompatiblen L\u00f6sungen von zertifizierten HP Partnern.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 200 dpi (Schwarzwei\u00df, Farbe und Graustufen) mit Smart Document Scan Software, Papier im Format DIN A4.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Improve workflow and boost productivity with a shared document capture workstation offering efficient manageability, and advanced networking and security features, along with an easy-to-use colour touchscreen for everyday users.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Manage documents and workflows directly from this shared, departmental document capture workstation.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Improve your return on investment: streamline document workflows with this powerful yet easy-to-use document capture workstation.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Experience robust security, and easy network management with HP Web Jetadmin.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Boost productivity and enable sharing using 10\/100\/1000 Mbit\/s networking with advanced security features including IPSec, SSL, SNMPv3 and Kerberos.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Fast, easy and reliable document capture with versatile document handling features.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Quickly scan two-sided documents at up to 40 ppm\/80 ipm in black and greyscale; up to 35 ppm\/70 ipm in colour<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Benefit from personalised, flexible solutions.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Get seamless integration with support for a variety of enterprise document management systems, and a broad portfolio of fully compatible HP Certified Partner solutions.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Speeds attained at 200 dpi black and white, colour and greyscale using Smart Document Scan Software, A4 paper.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Am\u00e9liorez le flux de travail et la productivit\u00e9 avec une station de travail de capture de document partag\u00e9e offrant une gestion efficace et des fonctions de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 et de mise en r\u00e9seau avanc\u00e9es, ainsi que d'un \u00e9cran couleur tactile pour les utilisateurs quotidiens.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>G\u00e9rez des documents et des flux de travail directement depuis cette station de travail partag\u00e9e de saisie de documents.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Am\u00e9liorez votre retour sur investissement : Rationalisez vos flux de documents avec cette station de travail de capture puissante mais facile \u00e0 utiliser.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Profitez d'une s\u00e9curit\u00e9 solide et d'une gestion r\u00e9seau ais\u00e9e avec HP Web Jetadmin.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Am\u00e9liore la productivit\u00e9 et permet le partage gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la mise en r\u00e9seau 10\/100\/1000 mbps \u00e0 l'aide avec des fonctionnalit\u00e9s de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 avanc\u00e9es, y compris IPSec, SSL, SNMPv3 et Kerberos.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Capture de documents rapide, facile et fiable avec des fonctions de gestion de documents polyvalentes.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Num\u00e9risation recto verso rapide de documents jusqu'\u00e0 40 ppm\/80 ipm en noir et niveaux de gris ; jusqu'\u00e0 35\u00a0ppm\/70\u00a0ipm en couleur<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Avantage des solutions souples et personnalis\u00e9es.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Obtenez une int\u00e9gration parfaite avec prise en charge d'un large \u00e9ventail de syst\u00e8mes de gestion de document d'entreprise et une large gamme de solutions enti\u00e8rement compatibles HP Partenaire certifi\u00e9.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> la vitesse atteinte \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution de 200 ppp noir et blanc, la couleur et les niveaux de gris en utilisant logiciel intelligent de num\u00e9risation de documents, le papierA4.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-11T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8fd78b23-53fd-447d-a146-fe281686f9a3","identifier":"12839973","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips BDL2331VS"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Vermitteln Sie Ihre Botschaften in atemberaubendem 3D-Format, mit erstklassiger Bildqualit\u00e4t und ohne dass eine spezielle Brille erforderlich ist. Dank 28\u00a0Linsenansichten k\u00f6nnen Sie umwerfende Bilder anzeigen, die Ihr Publikum begeistern werden."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Autostereoscopic 3D<\/b>\\nEnjoy a stunning 3D experience with no need for special glasses thanks to the autostereoscopic 3D effect. Using lenticular technology, it gives excellent clarity and depth, making your 3D experience even more lifelike and enjoyable.\\n\\n<b>Full HD LCD display, 1920x1080p<\/b>\\nThis display has a resolution that is referred to as Full HD. The state-of-the-art LCD screen technology has the full high-definition widescreen resolution of 1080 progressive lines, each with 1920 pixels. This allows the best possible picture quality for HD input signals with up to 1080 lines. It produces brilliant flicker-free progressive scan pictures with optimum brightness and superb colors. This vibrant and sharp image will provide you with an enhanced viewing experience.\\n\\n<b>SmartPower for energy saving<\/b>\\nThe backlight intensity can be controlled and pre-set by the system to reduce the power consumption by up to 50%, which saves substantially on energy costs.\\n\\n<b>Temperature sensor measures the health condition<\/b>\\nThis public dispay contains a temperature sensor to monitor the internal health condition. In case the internal temperature surpasses the preset threshold, automatically two internal fans will be activated to cool down the display to normal conditions.\\n\\n<b>28 lenticular views<\/b>\\nWith 28 lenticular views, you can \"peek\" around virtual objects on the 3D display, giving you the most stunning 3D visual effects around.\\n\\n<b>3D Content Visualisation<\/b>\\nThe 2D-plus-Depth format is compatible with existing compression tools, as the additional bandwidth of the depth is small. Software tools are provided with the 3D display to play-out 3D content and control the 3D and 2D visualization parameters. The actual 3D content can be created via plug-ins available for popular 3D animation software packages. Existing 2D or stereo content can be converted into 2D-plus-Depth format. Tools are available to support real-time extraction and usage of the depth information from Direct3D or OpenGL applications, and thus real-time visualisation on the 3D display.\\n\\n<b>Complies with RoHS standards to care for the environment<\/b>\\nPhilips designs and produces display products in compliance with strict Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS) standards that restrict lead and other toxic substances that can harm the environment.\\n\\n<b>2D plus depth<\/b>\\n2D-plus-Depth converted to 28 different views and interwoven into a stunning 3D format"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Communiquez vos messages \u00e0 l'aide d'une 3D \u00e9poustouflante, \u00e0 la qualit\u00e9 incomparable, le tout sans lunettes sp\u00e9ciales. Les 28\u00a0vues lenticulaires offrent des images incroyables qui enchanteront votre public."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"388476f7-a17d-41d0-95d3-35c894f3e2a9","identifier":"12840264","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon Digital IXUS 240 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"With HS System and a huge touch screen for capturing any moment with ease, the slim IXUS 240 HS offers Wi-Fi connection for instantly sharing your stunning shots.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n- Slim metal body; 24mm, 5x optical zoom\\n- HS System: 16.1 MP CMOS and DIGIC 5\\n- Intelligent IS\\n- Wi-Fi for easy image sharing\\n- 8.0 cm (3.2\") touch screen with Touch Shutter\\n- Full HD movies, HDMI\\n- Smart Auto (58 scenes)\\n- Face ID\\n- High-speed shooting\\n- Movie Digest (720p)\\n\\n<b>Stay in touch with IXUS<\/b>\\n\\n\\n\\n<b>Slim metal body; 24mm, 5x optical zoom<\/b>\\nWith an elegantly slim metal body, you can take the IXUS 240 HS everywhere. Fit more in the frame with ultra-wide 24mm or get close to distant subjects with 5x optical zoom or up to 10x with ZoomPlus - an advanced zoom technology with more visible detail and sharpness than conventional digital zoom.\\n\\n<b>HS System: 16.1 MP CMOS and DIGIC 5<\/b>\\nHS System excels in low light so you can capture the real atmosphere of the moment without flash or tripod. Advanced DIGIC 5 processing and a high-sensitivity 16.1 Megapixel CMOS sensor give exceptional image quality in all situations.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS combats camera shake to ensure all your photos and videos are sharp and detailed even at full zoom or in low light. It automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 7 modes to prevent blur.\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi for easy image sharing<\/b>\\nWi-Fi lets you connect your camera wirelessly with other devices* such as your smartphone, for quick and easy sharing of photos and movies with friends and family.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nA widescreen, high-resolution 8.0 cm (3.2\") PureColor II Touch LCD with customisable smart touch interface provides intuitive control for fast, easy operation and pleasurable playback. Touch Shutter allows you to touch on the point of focus and then to trigger the shot.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movies, HDMI<\/b>\\nRecord superb Full HD (1080p) movies at 24fps with stereo sound and optical zoom. Intelligent IS keeps footage steady while filming, even at full zoom. An HDMI connection ensures high quality playback on an HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (58 scenes)<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot great photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and selects optimal settings from 58 variables (21 in movies). It also works with faces stored in Face ID and adapts shooting according to registered age \u2013 for example turning off flash and sounds when a sleeping baby is detected.\\n\\n<b>Face ID<\/b>\\nFace ID registers up to 12 faces of family and friends, so they are automatically the focusing priority in every shot, and tags images with their names so they are easy to find in playback.\\n\\n<b>High-speed shooting<\/b>\\nUse High-speed Burst to capture non-stop, fast-paced action or slow things down with Super Slow Motion Movie.\\n\\n<b>Movie Digest (720p)<\/b>\\nMovie Digest records 4 seconds of video before each photo is shot and then joins all the recorded short clips into a bonus HD (720p) movie."}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c2caf6ec-1df2-40f0-b84b-aa8a54c344e3","identifier":"12840274","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon Digital IXUS 510HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Canon IXUS 510 HS\\n\\n<b>Stylish and well connected<\/b>\\n\\nAn amazingly chic, tiny 12x optical zoom camera with Wi-Fi for easy sharing, effortless touch screen control and HS System for incredible photos and Full HD movies even in low light.\\n\\n<b>12x optical zoom in tiny, chic body<\/b>\\n\\nThe IXUS 510 HS packs a powerful 12x optical zoom in a tiny metal body with a sophisticated finish. Extremely versatile it offers a huge range of shooting options and lets you get up close to distant objects with 21x ZoomPlus - an advanced zoom technology with more visible detail and sharpness than conventional digital zoom.\\n\\n<b>HS System: 10.1 MP CMOS and DIGIC 5<\/b>\\n\\nThe HS System excels in low light so you can capture the real atmosphere of the moment without flash or tripod. Advanced DIGIC 5 processing and a high sensitivity 10.1 Megapixel CMOS sensor give excellent image quality in all situations.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent IS<\/b>\\n\\nIntelligent IS combats camera shake to ensure all your photos and videos are sharp and detailed even at full zoom or in low light. It automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 7 modes to prevent blur.\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi for easy image sharing<\/b>\\n\\nWi-Fi lets you connect your camera wirelessly with other devices* such as your smartphone, for quick and easy sharing of photos and movies with friends and family.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\n\\nA widescreen, high-resolution 8.0 cm (3.2\") PureColor II Touch LCD with customisable smart touch interface provides intuitive control for fast, easy operation and pleasurable playback. Touch Shutter allows you to touch on the point of focus and then to trigger the shot.\\n\\n<b>Full HD movies, HDMI<\/b>\\n\\nRecord superb Full HD (1080p) movies at 24fps with stereo sound and optical zoom. Intelligent IS keeps footage steady while filming, even at full zoom. An HDMI connection ensures high quality playback on an HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto (58 scenes)<\/b>\\n\\nEffortlessly shoot great photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and selects optimal settings from 58 variables (21 in movies). It also works with faces stored in Face ID and adapts shooting according to registered age \u2013 for example turning off flash and sounds when a sleeping baby is detected.\\n\\n<b>Face ID<\/b>\\n\\nFace ID registers up to 12 faces of family and friends, so they are automatically the focusing priority in every shot, and tags images with their names so they are easy to find in playback.\\n\\n<b>High-speed shooting<\/b>\\n\\nUse High-speed Burst to capture non-stop, fast-paced action or slow things down with Super Slow Motion Movie.\\n\\n<b>Movie Digest (720p)<\/b>\\n\\nMovie Digest records 4 seconds of video before each photo is shot and then joins all the recorded short clips into a bonus HD (720p) movie."}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":12}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"528e27c4-6e06-4f04-b16b-1966dddd9d60","identifier":"12841605","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot SX260 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Incredibly thin compact camera with 20x optical zoom<\/b>\\nThe PowerShot SX260 HS is the perfect travel companion with a huge 20x Optical Zoom, 25mm wide angle lens and GPS technology. The camera will remember where you have been with the log function and display using Google Maps*. The PowerShot SX260 HS also offers versatile shooting in a slim body with a 12.1 Megapixel High Sensitivity CMOS Sensor perfect for low light situations and Full High Definition video.\\n\\n<b>High Sensitivity CMOS Sensor<\/b>\\n12.1 Megapixel High Sensitivity CMOS Sensor allows you to capture amazing\\n\\n<b>Optical Zoom Wide-Angle Lens<\/b>\\n20x Optical Zoom and 25mm wide-angle lens allows you to get closer whilst shoot\\n\\n<b>GPS Technology<\/b>\\nPerfect for travelling, log all your photos and display with Google maps.\\n\\n<b>DiG!C 5 Image Processor<\/b>\\nDiG!C 5 Image Processor achieves the most natural looking images with\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Image Stabilisation<\/b>\\nThe camera will automatically choose the correct image stabilisation to use in different shooting situations.\\n\\n<b>Manual Control<\/b>\\nGet creative with your photography and enjoy full flexibility with manual control or explore a range of scene modes."}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":20}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"56d69db6-7bf9-4046-877f-2b0f89563dc9","identifier":"12843917","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 196V3LSB7"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Enjoy great LED pictures in vivid colours<\/b>\\nThis attractive, slim display is a delight to use. Essential features like SmartContrast that ensure rich, bright images make it a great choice!\\n\\n<b>Great picture quality<\/b>\\n- LED technology for natural colours\\n- SmartContrast 10,000,000:1 for incredibly rich black details\\n\\n<b>Design that complements any interior<\/b>\\n- Attractive slim, glossy design\\n- Small footprint to blend into any lifestyle\\n\\n<b>Greener every day<\/b>\\n- Mercury Free eco-friendly display\\n- Energy Star for energy efficiency and low power consumption\\n\\n<b>Great convenience<\/b>\\n- Easy display performance tuning with SmartControl Lite"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Profitez de superbes images LED aux couleurs \u00e9clatantes<\/b>\\nAvec son design fin et \u00e9l\u00e9gant, cet \u00e9cran est facile \u00e0 utiliser. Les fonctions essentielles, dont SmartContrast, vous permettent de b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier d'images profondes et lumineuses. Ce mod\u00e8le est exceptionnel !\\n\\n<b>Une qualit\u00e9 d'image exceptionnelle<\/b>\\n- Technologie LED pour des couleurs naturelles\\n- SmartContrast 10 000 000:1 pour des d\u00e9tails de noir incroyablement profonds\\n\\n<b>Un design adapt\u00e9 \u00e0 tous les int\u00e9rieurs<\/b>\\n- Design fin et brillant, tr\u00e8s esth\u00e9tique\\n- Encombrement r\u00e9duit adapt\u00e9 \u00e0 votre style de vie\\n\\n<b>Soyez un peu plus \u00e9colo chaque jour<\/b>\\n- \u00c9cran sans mercure respectueux de l'environnement\\n- Energy Star : plus d'efficacit\u00e9 pour une consommation minimale\\n\\n<b>Pour un confort maximal<\/b>\\n- R\u00e9glage facile des performances d'affichage avec SmartControl Lite"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-14T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"52ed4022-8b80-4c81-a06c-7cc2f00aa5e5","identifier":"12844446","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lg","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG N195WU-PN"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"LG Network Monitor U Series embedded multi computing monitor with Windows Multipoint Server 2011. With the U Series, you can connect multiple network monitors to a single host PC using a USB cable. Monitors can serve as an independent PC for users to perform various tasks. Without any installation process, monitors can easily be connected to the host via USB, making multi-computing easier than ever. In addition, the LG Network Monitor U Series minimizes initial set up cost and power consumption as well as reduces the maintenance time and cost associated with multiple PC\u2019s. The U Series platform is optimized for various computing environments such as SMB, public area, etc. where word processing, video playing, internet, e-mail, and simple applications are used. Especially for education institutions, U series empowers educators, engages students, and makes learning personal."}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-14T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6ccec4da-7b28-47c6-b586-68d9df154afd","identifier":"12848917","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE32ES5500K"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>More vibrant colours for better images<\/b>\\n\\nUsing an advanced picture quality improvement algorithm, Samsung\u2019s Wide Colour Enhancer Plus drastically improves the quality of any image and uncovers hidden details. Now see colours as they were meant to be seen with Wide Colour Enhancer Plus.\\n\\n<b>Stay in closer contact with great widescreen Skype video calls<\/b>\\n\\nStay in touch with friends and family from the comfort of your home thanks to the Skype app for Smart TV, available for free in the Samsung App store. Combined with the separately-sold Skype camera kit, it allows you to make high-quality widescreen video calls to loved ones throughout the world at low rates or even for free. You can create new Skype accounts, access existing ones and navigate using your TV\u2019s remote control. Be closer with face-to-face communication.\\n\\n<b>Bringing a full multimedia experience into your living room<\/b>\\n\\nWith High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI) inputs, the Samsung TV will transform your living room into a multimedia entertainment centre. HDMI provides high-speed transmission of high definition digital data from multiple devices straight into your TV.\\n\\n<b>Watch movies from your USB<\/b>\\n\\nWith ConnectShare Movie, simply plug your USB memory drive into the TV and instantaneously enjoy movies, photos or music. Now, you can experience a wide variety of content in the comfort of your living room on your TV.\\n\\n<b>Connect and Share<\/b>\\n\\nBring it all together. AllShare Play wirelessly connects to compatible devices through DLNA technology so the movies, photos and music stored on them can be viewed, listened to and shared on your TV. Now, effortlessly transfer content from your PC or mobile device to your TV.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy apps, videos, Skype, web browsing and more<\/b>\\n\\nDiscover a new world of social and personalised home entertainment with Samsung\u2019s updated Smart Hub and three great new services. Family Story lets you share special photos, messages and events with loved ones. Meanwhile, children can stay entertained and educated with the Kids feature. You can also exercise and manage your training using Fitness. With access to great content as well as a selection of Samsung Apps, web browsing, Skype and more, this is the ultimate family home entertainment experience.\\n\\n<b>Your personal media library<\/b>\\n\\nRecord and store TV shows and movies with Extended Personal Video Recorder Ready. Simply plug in a USB memory drive or HDD into your TV\u2019s USB port, select which show to record and download them onto the drive.\\n\\n<b>Discover a new reality in Full HD<\/b>\\n\\nEnjoy a greater level of home entertainment realism than ever before. Thanks to a resolution twice as high as standard HD TVs, your Samsung Smart TV delivers a breathtaking viewing experience that takes you beyond the screen into a world of total immersion. When you\u2019ve seen the rich and vivid texture of Full HD images, your favourite TV programmes and movies will never be the same again. Discover reality with a full high definition experience.\\n\\n<b>Wirelessly access and stream your content<\/b>\\n\\nMake the most of all your content and devices with wireless sharing. Thanks to AllShare Play, you can stream movies, photos, music and more from any compatible devices nearby, including PCs. Cloud technology and Samsung web storage give you even greater freedom and mobility, allowing you to access and share multimedia when you\u2019re away from home, too. Now you can enjoy all your favourite content on your TV or away from it."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-14T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"34ff13cc-902a-4d1e-8081-84423eb52ed6","identifier":"12848930","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE46ES6300U"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Samsung 40\u201d ES6300 Smart 3D Full HD TV delivers high-definition viewing and a more realistic home entertainment experience. Smart Hub gives you access to a range of great online content and services and you can also enjoy your movies, music and photos on USB storage. All your entertainment is delivered with vibrant colour and enhanced detail, thanks to Wide Colour Enhancer Plus. You can even experience stunning 3D entertainment, too.\\n<br\/><b>True 3D experience in a whole new light<\/b>\\n<br\/>The Samsung LED TVs have created an entirely new and immersive viewing experience when it comes to home entertainment. With the latest 3D imaging technology, you will be completely immersed in a new world of TV viewing reality.\\n<br\/><b>Enjoy apps, videos, Skype, web browsing and more<\/b>\\n<br\/>Discover a new world of social and personalised home entertainment with Samsung\u2019s updated Smart Hub and three great new services. Family Story lets you share special photos, messages and events with loved ones. Meanwhile, children can stay entertained and educated with the Kids feature.   You can also exercise and manage your training using Fitness. With access to great content as well as a selection of Samsung Apps, web browsing, Skype and more, this is the ultimate family home entertainment experience.\\n<br\/><b>Discover a new reality in Full HD<\/b>\\n<br\/>Enjoy a greater level of home entertainment realism than ever before. Thanks to a resolution twice as high as standard HD TVs, your Samsung Smart TV delivers a breathtaking viewing experience that takes you beyond the screen into a world of total immersion. When you\u2019ve seen the rich and vivid texture of Full HD images, your favourite TV programmes and movies will never be the same again.  Discover reality with a full high definition experience.\\n<br\/><b>More vibrant colours for better images<\/b>\\n<br\/>Using an advanced picture quality improvement algorithm, Samsung\u2019s Wide Colour Enhancer Plus drastically improves the quality of any image and uncovers hidden details. Now see colours as they were meant to be seen with Wide Colour Enhancer Plus.\\n<br\/><b>Watch movies from your USB<\/b>\\n<br\/>With ConnectShare Movie, simply plug your USB memory drive into the TV and instantaneously enjoy movies, photos or music. Now, you can experience a wide variety of content in the comfort of your living room on your TV."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-14T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a6c59fee-c45a-40ba-a2ff-e968ad06f4f2","identifier":"128501","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","logitech","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech Z-5500 Digital"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"We've taken the award-winning Logitech Z-680 speaker system and made it even better. How? By improving everything from the subwoofer to the satellites and adding new innovations like real-time digital sound equalization.\\n\\nThe result is the Logitech Z-5500 Digital, a THX-certified, 500-watt 5.1 surround sound speaker system that offers everything you could possibly want\u2026 and some things you didn't even know you needed. And once you plug in your PC, DVD or music player, or video game console, you'll never want to listen to anything else.\\n\\n    - Powerful, distortion-free bass: The new, larger 10-inch long-throw subwoofer driver with flared bass port delivers 188 watts of thunderous bass.\\n    - Innovative driver technology: Polished aluminum phase-plug satellites combine two drivers into one--the clarity of a tweeter with the richness and fullness of a separate mid-range.\\n    - Digital equalization: The Z-5500 Digital actively adjusts frequency response in real time for the cleanest, most accurate sound reproduction.\\n    - DTS\u00ae 96\/24 support: Enjoy studio-quality sound thanks to the Z-5500's support for 96 kHz \/ 24-bit digital audio streams\\n    - Amazingly powerful controls: The Digital SoundTouch\u2122 Control Center lets you control volume to all speakers, set inputs, and much more. And the separate wireless remote is great for home theaters and video game consoles.\\n    - Innovative satellite design: Cloth grilles are removable for a pro-audio look. Pedestals rotate for easy wall mounting or desk placement. Center channel can be mounted on wall, above or below monitor.\\n    - Connect to multiple sources: Simultaneously connect 6 audio sources including PCs, video game consoles, and DVD, CD & portable music players\u2026 and control it all from the Digital SoundTouch\u2122 Control Center.\\n\\n<b>Digital SoundTouch\u2122 Control Center<\/b>\\n\\n    - Digital LCD: Clear, crisp high contrast display\\n    - Input: Select audio source (optical, coax, or direct)\\n    - Effect: Select digital surround sound effect\\n    - Settings: Adjust parameters of digital surround sound effects\\n    - Mute: Mute the entire system\\n    - Level: Adjust volume, subwoofer, center, and fader levels\\n    - Pro-audio style knob: Oversized, weighted control knob with digital precision\\n    - System Power\\n    - Auxiliary input jack: For convenient connection to portable audio devices (CD, MP3, MiniDisc\u00ae, etc.)\\n\\nDolby\u00ae Digital is the universal standard for 5.1 digital sound. DVDs, PlayStation\u00ae2, Xbox\u00ae, digital cable, satellite TV, and HDTV all use Dolby Digital. The Z-5500 Digital includes a hardware Dolby Digital decoder for full, rich 5.1 sound.\\n\\nTHX\u00ae certification is the \"seal of approval\" for speaker quality. It is an absolute assurance that these speakers accurately recreate the full sonic experience of a movie theater. The Z-5500 Digital is one of a select few speaker systems that meets the rigid standards for unparalleled THX-quality sound.\\n\\nDTS\u00ae Digital Surround delivers 5.1 digital sound that rivals master soundtracks. DTS soundtracks are included in many DVD videos, DVD Audio discs, and PlayStation\u00ae2 games. The Z-5500 Digital includes a hardware DTS decoder for master-quality sound. The Z-5500 Digital also includes support for DTS 96\/24, an enhanced, higher-resolution, studio-quality format available on many DVD video and DVD Audio discs. \\n\\n<b>Package Contents<\/b>\\nSpeakers:\\n          - 4 satellites\\n          - 1 center channel\\n          - 1 subwoofer\\n6-channel direct cable\\nDigital SoundTouch\u2122 control center\\nWireless remote control, batteries included\\n    * User\u00b4s manual"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1018ba9b-3b8c-4be7-a711-e0704146021e","identifier":"128775","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Color LaserJet 3550 printer"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Ingangsspanning 100 tot 127 V (\u00b110%), 50\/60 Hz (\u00b12 Hz), 5 amp.; 220 tot 240 V (\u00b110%), 50\/60 Hz (\u00b1 2 Hz), 3 amp"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The HP Color LaserJet 3550 uses the combined power of the computer and printer to bring colour into your day-to-day business. Get fast, easy and affordable true colour laser printing with vibrant results. Great colour, great quality, great value."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"L'imprimante HP Color LaserJet 3550 utilise la puissance de l'ordinateur et de l'imprimante pour apporter de la couleur \u00e0 vos activit\u00e9s. Obtenez des impressions laser en couleur, rapides, faciles et \u00e9conomiques avec des r\u00e9sultats \u00e9clatants. Couleurs \u00e9clatantes, qualit\u00e9 remarquable et rapport qualit\u00e9\/prix excellent."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"610b998c-8ee1-431b-83eb-9438d223ad11","identifier":"129066","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP PSC 1215 all-in-one printer\/scanner\/copier"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Print, scan and copy  three key tools in a ultra-compact and easy-to-use all-in-one.Easy-to-use and designed to fit comfortably in any room of the house, this is the world's smallest flatbed all-in-one* with a footprint little bigger than A4. This versatile product delivers true-to-life photo quality colour printing at up to 4800-optimised dpi**, convenient copying at up to 12 ppm without having to switch on the computer, and easy flatbed scanning.Ultra-compact and easy-to-use all-in-one.Print, scan and copy  three key tools in a ultra-compact and easy-to-use all-in-one.Designed to fit in any room, this is the world's smallest flatbed all-in-one*. Versatile and easy-to-use, it delivers true-to-life photo quality colour printing at 4800-optimised dpi**, plus flatbed scanning and convenient, standalone copying.Ultra-compact and easy-to-use all-in-one.Designed to fit in any room, this is the world's smallest flatbed all-in-one*. Versatile and easy-to-use, it delivers true-to-life photo quality colour printing at 4800-optimised dpi**, plus flatbed scanning and convenient, standalone copying."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8495f7f3-e721-4037-85b1-7beb59d5b7ab","identifier":"12941044","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE46ES6800U"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Enjoy easier and more convenient Smart Hub services<\/b>\\n\\nEnter a world of online entertainment with the new enhanced Smart Hub. Three new signature services \u2013 Fitness, Kids and Family Story - help you to exercise, keep children entertained and educated, and share precious memories. The powerful Dual Core processor allows you to do smooth multitasking between content. Browse the web, access Samsung Apps and enjoy breathtaking Full HD 3D content at home. Experience 3D content with the 3D explore feature. Discover the ultimate Smart TV experience.\\n\\n* Content available via Smart Hub may vary among product categories, models, and territories. See Samsung.com for more details.\\n* Certain apps must be purchased and may not be available in all regions.\\n* Certain Smart TV features may require firmware upgrades.\\n* Fitness Service may not be available in all regions.\\n* Web Browser is not available on all models.\\n\\n<b>Enrich your experience with superior picture quality<\/b>\\n\\nDiscover breathtaking images that will allow you a more immersive viewing experience. Micro Dimming brings you enhanced contrast that delivers realistic picture quality. Meanwhile, the impressive Clear Motion Rate delivers onscreen movement with greater clarity. With the high-quality 3D glasses provided, you\u2019ll also be able to enjoy amazing Full HD 1080p 3D visuals. Make the most of your entertainment with better picture quality.\\n\\n<b>Stylish design for seamless and immersive viewing<\/b>\\n\\nImprove your viewing experience and your surroundings. The slim LED TV is developed for enjoyment that goes beyond the screen. One Design brings an attractive premium look that will brighten your home, with a thinner bezel for a more expansive and immersive viewing. This is a TV that blends into your environment perfectly, so there\u2019s no distraction from your entertainment. Enjoy One Design that appeals to everyone in every way.\\n\\n<b>Share, store and enjoy content \u2013 it\u2019s easier than ever<\/b>\\n\\nEnjoy a more intuitive and convenient viewing experience thanks to smarter connectivity. You can stream and share music, photos, movies and other multimedia directly to your TV with AllShare Play, and enjoy it on a bigger screen. Built-in Wi-Fi allows access to a range of nearby compatible devices, including mobile devices. With cloud based technology, you can also make the most of your content away from home. Share and enjoy your multimedia easily with better connections."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5f70c2ce-47d5-4d56-b4f9-e98a48eabeeb","identifier":"129705","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C762dtn Colour Laser Printer"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Network-ready and fully equipped, the Lexmark C762dtn colour laser offers your business big performance, outstanding colour quality and intelligent new ways to bring down costs. \\nThe Lexmark C762 colour laser gives you a smart new way to liven up your documents. Pantone-certified, it\u2019s the only printer in its class to offer 4800 Colour Quality resolution. And thanks to its high-yield toner cartridges, you benefit from a mono-like cost per page. What\u2019s more, the C762 is equipped with useful colour-control tools, including user-specific \u201ccolour permission\u201d settings and a ColourSaver feature that saves you up to 50% on toner when printing in draft mode.\\nEnhancing print quality should never mean compromising performance. The C762 delivers big results on both fronts! Perfect for demanding workloads, it gives you rapid 25ppm output whether you\u2019re printing in colour or mono. A powerful 600 MHz RISC processor  and 128 MB of RAM let you run off complex jobs with no problem. With a robust 100K monthly duty cycle, the C762 is ready for the long haul. \\nAs your needs evolve, you can take advantage of a wide range of flexible options, including networking, duplex printing, additional paper trays, a 5-bin mailbox and a 650-sheet output stacker and a staple and hole punch finisher. You can also upgrade to a fully equipped multifunction device, consolidating print, copy, fax and scan functions into a single space-saving solution. The C762 is built to fit your needs today and tomorrow!"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"60.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ec6f3478-c448-4f36-8ecf-15a4decfa98b","identifier":"129766","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C762 Colour Laser Printer"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Outstanding colour and performance unite\u2013for your demanding needs!<\/b>\\n- Affordable A4 colour laser printer.\\n- Low cost per page in colour and even lower in monochrome with high yield cartridges.\\n- Advanced colour-management tools to control printing costs.\\n- Very quick from the first page: Less than 15 seconds time to\\nfirst colour page and Up to 25 ppm.\\n- Wide range of expandable options for your growing needs."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6baf98bd-a051-425b-add4-0ab84df5432d","identifier":"1301486","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony 2GB Walkman, NWZ-S615F, Red"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Transfer video and music from your collection via Windows Media Player or simple drag-and-drop; \\n- High quality 30 frame p\/sec video playback for outstanding clarity from even fast-moving images; \\n- 1.8\" QVGA (320x240) high brightness screen for superior colour reproduction. Plays video horizontally or vertically; \\n- Superb sound quality from 3 built-in audio technologies: Clear Stereo, Clear Bass and DSEE digital sound enhancement; \\n- 2GB with capacity of up to 500 tracks or 7 hours of video files* \\n- Plays most popular music formats:MP3, AAC (non DRM), WMP (DRM10) and WMA (non DRM); \\n- Compatible with popular video formats MPEG4 & AVC (H.264) Baseline; \\n- Listen for longer - incredible battery life of approx. 33 Hrs music or 8 Hrs video; \\n- Express yourself - choose from 3 different colours; \\n- Exists in Black, Red and Silver; \\n- Intuitive operation from mobile phone-like interface and menus; \\n- FM radio tuner with 30 presets; \\n- Song capacity based on 4 minutes per song and 128kbps MP3 encoding."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"74381c65-048e-4c55-9626-75d2b77726c6","identifier":"130345","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C762N Colour Laser Printer"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Lexmark C762 colour laser gives you a smart new way to liven up your documents. Pantone-certified, it\u2019s the only printer in its class to offer 4800 Colour Quality resolution. And thanks to its high-yield toner cartridges, you benefit from a mono-like cost per page. What\u2019s more, the C762 is equipped with useful colour-control tools, including user-specific \u201ccolour permission\u201d settings and a ColourSaver feature that saves you up to 50% on toner when printing in draft mode.\\nEnhancing print quality should never mean compromising performance. The C762 delivers big results on both fronts! Perfect for demanding workloads, it gives you rapid 25ppm output whether you\u2019re printing in colour or mono. A powerful 600 MHz RISC processor  and 128 MB of RAM let you run off complex jobs with no problem. With a robust 100K monthly duty cycle, the C762 is ready for the long haul. \\nAs your needs evolve, you can take advantage of a wide range of flexible options, including networking, duplex printing, additional paper trays, a 5-bin mailbox and a 650-sheet output stacker and a staple and hole punch finisher. You can also upgrade to a fully equipped multifunction device, consolidating print, copy, fax and scan functions into a single space-saving solution. The C762 is built to fit your needs today and tomorrow!"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"48.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"22dfb021-635c-41d1-85e1-6099c8b03282","identifier":"13052756","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung ST ST88"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung ST88, ST. Megapixel: 16.1, Camera type: Compact, Sensor type: CCD. Focal length range (f-f): 4.5 - 22.5, Minimum aperture: 2.5, Maximum aperture: 6.3. Focus: TTL, Focus adjustment: Auto, Auto focusing (AF) modes: Centre weighted Auto Focus, Face detection, Multi Point Auto Focus, Spot Auto Focus. ISO sensitivity: 100, 200, 400, 800, 1600, 3200, Light exposure modes: Aperture priority AE, Shutter priority AE, Light exposure control: Program AE. Flash modes: Auto, Flash off, Red-eye reduction, Slow synchronization, Flash range (wide): 0.2 - 3.5, Flash range (tele): 1 - 2"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>des clich\u00e9s plus clairs, m\u00eame dans l\u2019obscurit\u00e9<\/b>\\nIl vous arrive de passer une soir\u00e9e en ville ? L\u2019objectif F2,5 capture la lumi\u00e8re pour prendre des clich\u00e9s plus clairs dans l\u2019obscurit\u00e9. Il n\u2019a jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 aussi facile de capturer des moments pendant la nuit gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019objectif lumineux F2,5. Qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse d\u2019un coucher de soleil ou d\u2019un d\u00eener aux chandelles, profitez du moment o\u00f9 que vous soyez et ne vous souciez plus d\u2019obtenir des r\u00e9sultats sombres ou flous, ni de perturber les personnes autour de vous avec le flash lumineux de l\u2019appareil photo.\\n\\n<b>capturez une vision plus claire et plus large<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son remarquable capteur haute r\u00e9solution de 16,1 m\u00e9gapixels, le ST88 compact et \u00e9l\u00e9gant capture vos souvenirs sur des images \u00e9clatantes et aux d\u00e9tails pr\u00e9cis. L\u2019objectif grand angle de 25 mm vous garantit des photos de groupe m\u00e9morables sur lesquelles chaque personne figurera dans le cadre. En outre, m\u00eame si vous prenez des clich\u00e9s \u00e0 distance, vous pouvez vous rapprocher de votre sujet comme vous le souhaitez tout en conservant une qualit\u00e9 d'image optimale gr\u00e2ce au zoom optique 5x.\\n\\n<b>Il reste parfaitement immobile, m\u00eame si vous n\u2019y parvenez pas.<\/b>\\nLa stabilisation optique de l\u2019image (OIS) du ST88 vous permet d\u2019obtenir des images parfaitement nettes, m\u00eame si vous n\u2019\u00eates pas parfaitement immobile. Dans une semi-obscurit\u00e9, que vous zoomiez ou que vos mains tremblent, vos photos b\u00e9n\u00e9ficieront d\u2019une nettet\u00e9 et d\u2019une clart\u00e9 incomparables.\\n\\n<b>des images de toute beaut\u00e9<\/b>\\nIl est dot\u00e9 d\u2019un \u00e9cran hVGA 3\u201d qui am\u00e9liore les contrastes et la reproduction des couleurs, pour vous permettre de profiter d\u2019images plus grandes et plus claires. En outre, il d\u00e9tecte automatiquement le degr\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9clairage ext\u00e9rieur et ajuste la luminosit\u00e9 de son \u00e9cran hVGA en cons\u00e9quence, pour un visionnage optimal. Il r\u00e9fl\u00e9chit pour vous. Pas de doute, le ST88 est un choix intelligent.\\n\\n<b>affichez votre r\u00e9sultat<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Live Panorama, vous pouvez capturer chaque sommet d\u2019une immense cha\u00eene de montagnes ou chaque gratte-ciel d\u2019un magnifique paysage urbain afin de cr\u00e9er des images panoramiques \u00e9poustouflantes \u00e0 180\u00ba. De m\u00eame, vous pouvez avoir un aper\u00e7u de l'image sur l'\u00e9cran LCD avant m\u00eame de la capturer. Il suffit de maintenir le d\u00e9clencheur enfonc\u00e9 et de balayer la sc\u00e8ne pour voir le r\u00e9sultat avant de le capturer.\\n\\n<b>des films HD dans la paume de votre main<\/b>\\nCet appareil photo \u00e9l\u00e9gant mais puissant capture des vid\u00e9os 720 p de qualit\u00e9 HD \u00e0 30 images par seconde, soit un r\u00e9sultat plus clair qu\u2019un cam\u00e9scope vid\u00e9o num\u00e9rique compact moyen. Vous obtiendrez ainsi des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 HD o\u00f9 que vous soyez, dans une salle de concert ou dans une f\u00eate d\u2019anniversaire.\\n\\n<b>la mani\u00e8re la plus simple de devenir un pro<\/b>\\nLorsque vous prenez des clich\u00e9s dans des conditions lumineuses et que vous ne parvenez pas \u00e0 voir le visage de votre sujet, utilisez le mode r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage pour obtenir une image plus claire gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Smart Auto 2.0 (photo et vid\u00e9o). Vous obtiendrez toujours le meilleur r\u00e9sultat possible. La technologie de d\u00e9tection de sc\u00e8ne est capable d\u2019identifier jusqu\u2019\u00e0 16 conditions de prise de vue diff\u00e9rentes, d\u2019analyser instantan\u00e9ment les \u00e9l\u00e9ments cl\u00e9s de votre composition et de se r\u00e9gler automatiquement pour optimiser les param\u00e8tres pour chaque situation particuli\u00e8re.\\n\\n<b>montrez les deux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de l\u2019histoire<\/b>\\nUne image peut valoir mille mots, mais une photo n'est pas toujours capable de raconter toute l'histoire. D\u00e8s lors, la fonction d\u2019incrustation d\u2019image vous permet d\u2019ins\u00e9rer une image dans une autre, comme par exemple un clich\u00e9 d\u2019un but d\u00e9cisif ins\u00e9r\u00e9 dans une image de la foule en d\u00e9lire. Vous pouvez m\u00eame r\u00e9gler la taille et la position d\u2019un plus petit clich\u00e9 comme bon vous semble afin de pr\u00e9senter une vue d\u2019ensemble de la mani\u00e8re dont vous l\u2019avez v\u00e9cue.\\n\\n<b>cr\u00e9ez des photos surprenantes avec Magic Frame<\/b>\\nTransformez un portrait en une image tir\u00e9e d\u2019un vieux film ou placez le visage d\u2019un ami sur un panneau. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Magic Frame, vous pouvez cr\u00e9er facilement des images amusantes et de type poster. Il vous suffit de s\u00e9lectionner l\u2019un des mod\u00e8les d\u2019arri\u00e8re-plan int\u00e9gr\u00e9 tels que Art mural, Pleine lune, Magazine ou Vacances. Dirigez l\u2019appareil photo vers le sujet, ajustez-le par rapport au mod\u00e8le \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9cran, et capturez-le \u2013 pour ensuite le pendre \u00e0 votre mur ou le partager!\\n\\n<b>suscitez l\u2019amusement<\/b>\\nTordez, \u00e9tendez ou d\u00e9formez vos amis ou des membres de votre famille pour obtenir des effets amusants. En effet, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Funny Face (visage comique), vous pouvez appuyer sur les 5 touches directionnelles pour \u00e9largir leur t\u00eate ou leur nez, ou pour cr\u00e9er des distorsions hilarantes. En outre, lorsque vous d\u00e9placez l\u2019appareil photo, la fonction Face Tracking (suivi du visage) conserve les aspects amusants de la mani\u00e8re dont vous le souhaitez.\\n\\n<b>Smart Filter 2.0<\/b>\\nFaites passer votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 au niveau sup\u00e9rieur gr\u00e2ce aux 13 effets de couleur et d\u2019objectif de Smart Filter 2.0. Pendant la lecture, choisissez le filtre Vignetting, qui offre une composition tr\u00e8s contrast\u00e9e, le filtre Fish-eye, qui am\u00e9liore les vid\u00e9os gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un look d\u00e9form\u00e9 tr\u00e8s tendance, ou le filtre Miniature, qui donne \u00e0 vos sujets un aspect miniaturis\u00e9 ou mod\u00e9lis\u00e9. Enfin, les filtres couleurs, tels que Dessin et Defog, ajoutent une touche d\u2019\u00e9motion, de vivacit\u00e9 ou de cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 \u00e0 vos images\\n\\n<b>portrait intelligent<\/b>\\nLa fonction Portrait intelligent vous aide \u00e0 \u00e9valuer tous les angles et \u00e0 choisir le meilleur. Faites une photo grand angle de l\u2019un de vos amis et l\u2019appareil photo capture deux autres angles et compositions appropri\u00e9s en un seul clic. Conservez les trois images ou s\u00e9lectionnez uniquement la meilleure \u2013 le ST88 vous offre cette option.\\n\\n<b>reconnaissance intelligente du visage et suivi du visage<\/b>\\nLa technologie de reconnaissance intelligente du visage applique vos r\u00e9glages favoris \u2014 elle reconna\u00eet et ajuste automatiquement la mise au point et l\u2019exposition pour les 20 visages qui apparaissent le plus souvent sur vos photos. Les personnes qui vous sont ch\u00e8res ne se fondront d\u00e9sormais plus dans la masse. Le suivi des visages, quant \u00e0 lui, garantit un param\u00e9trage optimal pour les visages en mouvement afin que vos sujets favoris soient toujours le centre d'attraction.\\n\\n<b>Sound Alive<\/b>\\nSound Alive, la technologie avanc\u00e9e de r\u00e9duction du bruit du zoom de Samsung, contribue \u00e0 \u00e9liminer le bruit de ronronnement de la fonction de zoom lorsque vous capturez du son. Faites des zooms avant et arri\u00e8re sur tout ce que vous souhaitez lorsque vous capturez une vid\u00e9o HD et profitez d\u2019une qualit\u00e9 optimale et d\u2019un son cristallin lors de la lecture.\\n\\n<b>Syst\u00e8me Perfect Portrait<\/b>\\nLe syst\u00e8me Perfect Portrait contribue \u00e0 cr\u00e9er des portraits impeccables en toute simplicit\u00e9. La d\u00e9tection du visage ajuste automatiquement les param\u00e8tres pour obtenir la mise au point et l\u2019exposition id\u00e9ales. En outre, la fonction Beauty Shot et la correction yeux rouges prennent le plus grand soin des d\u00e9tails en permettant de retoucher la tonalit\u00e9 de la peau et d\u2019\u00e9liminer les imperfections du visage et les yeux rouges.\\n\\n<b>Smart Album<\/b>\\nLa fonction Smart Album permet d\u2019organiser automatiquement vos photos par type, date, couleur, semaine, et m\u00eame par visage, afin que vous puissiez retrouver un clich\u00e9 particulier. Vous souhaitez acc\u00e9der rapidement \u00e0 l\u2019image souhait\u00e9e ? Laissez Smart Album effectuer une recherche sur base du visage ou utilisez l\u2019option du menu de lecture pour afficher jusqu\u2019\u00e0 16 images \u00e0 la fois."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-16T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7517e054-6a78-4f23-91ed-d899f62be769","identifier":"13052759","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"d\/8\/8\/3\/d883012167548cc16ed96b9d5bd8256041f6301d_13052759_8017.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/d\/8\/8\/3\/d883012167548cc16ed96b9d5bd8256041f6301d_13052759_8017.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung HMX-QF20BP hand-held camcorder"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5.1"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Shoot with either hand and share easily<\/b>\\n- Shoot using right or left hand with Switch Grip II;\\n- Share and save photos wirelessly with built-in Wi-Fi;\\n- Record in stunning 1920 x 1080 60i Full HD clarity;\\n- Get closer to the action with 20x optical zoom.\\n\\n<b>0\u00ba, 90\u00ba, 180\u00ba - Enjoy a greater degree of flexibility with Switch Grip II<\/b>\\nOne thing lefties and righties can agree on is that the streamlined and compact QF20 \/ Q20 with Switch Grip II was made for both. Because no matter in which hand it\u2019s held, the camcorder\u2019s LCD screen will adjust to ensure that the picture is shown right-side up. More comfortable shooting while holding the camcorder vertically? Good news: you can rotate the screen 90\u00ba, and the image will remain right-side up. Shooting video from difficult positions has never been easier.\\n\\n<b>Instant Sharing & Saving, simply Wi-Fi Connectivity<\/b>\\nWith built-in Wi-Fi capability, you can share any special and exciting videos on the move. Send videos by uploading to Facebook\u2122, Picasa\u2122, Photobucket\u2122 or email directly from the camcorder. You can also upload them to YouTube\u2122 then sit back and wait for the rave reviews. The QF20 also lets you upload to online cloud services so never worried about losing your videos while on the go or running out of memory. The TV Link feature allows you to wirelessly display videos on a Wi-Fi TV screen. You can also save them to your PC with just one click using the Auto Backup feature. No more searching for the cable \u2013 it\u2019s that easy.\\n\\n<b>Relive your adventures with Full HD Recording 1920 x 1080 \/ 60p<\/b>\\nWhy shoot just video when you can shoot Full HD movies? With 1920x1080 60i resolution, you capture richly detailed images with vivid colour and intense clarity. This helps ensure picture perfection on your HDTV or Wi-Fi HD monitor, and a superb viewing experience for you.\\n\\nPresenting a new take on Full HD recording. The QF20 \/ Q20\u2019s Switch Grip II function not only lets you hold the camcorder in either hand, it also allows for vertical recording so you\u2019re always in perfect position to capture heartwarming moments and hilarious slipups in amazing HD. The QF20 also allows you to share your memories straight away, through its Wi-Fi capabilities, to your favourite online social networks and cloud services, from any Wi-Fi hotspot. It\u2019s never been this easy to shoot and share Full HD 1080p video.\\n\\n<b>My Clip<\/b>\\nPlay back your favourite moments of a night out with friends or a hike through the woods without having to waste time fast-forwarding or rewinding. The My Clip feature allows you to tag any scene in your video, so you can instantly relive the most hilarious bits or amazing sights over and over again with no additional editing.\\n\\n<b>20x Optical zoom, 40x Digital-zoom<\/b>\\nLightweight and compact, the QF20\/Q20 goes wherever you go. It also features a Schneider-Kreuznach lens with 20x Optical Zoom (40x Digital Zoom) that puts you in the middle of the action, even when you\u2019re far away. Capture a game-winning goal from the far end of the soccer field, or a band rocking out even from the back row. Details are as crisp and clear as if you were shooting from up close.\\n\\n<b>OIS Duo Plus<\/b>\\nWith OIS (Optical Image Stabiliser) Duo Plus, you can capture clear and steady video, even if you have a case of shaky hands. The QF20 \/ Q20 combines a built-in OIS with digital image stabilisation technology to prevent bumps, jolts, and shivers from blurring image quality. OIS Duo Plus also compensates for body movement that can occur while you\u2019re moving around, or for the movement of the digital zoom.\\n\\n<b>Smart BGM II (with My Music)<\/b>\\nAdd a professional touch to your movies with Smart BGM II (with My Music).Select one of four preloaded classical pieces to add to your videos, or import your favourite songs from your PC\u2019s music library by using Samsung\u2019s Intelli-Studio. And if there\u2019s talking in the scene, it won\u2019t get drowned out - Smart BGM II automatically lowers the music, so you always hear whoever is speaking.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto<\/b>\\nNo matter what time of day it is, no matter where you are, with Smart Auto you\u2019re ready for nearly any shooting scenario. Automatically select from one of 11 preset modes - such as Night, Natural Green, Macro and Portrait - to instantly compensate for a variety of varying light conditions or image details. Never again miss shooting a spontaneous scene due to time-consuming setting adjustments.\\n\\n<b>Art Time-lapse Recording<\/b>\\nCapture an event that takes place over the course of hours such the sun rising and setting and present it in a fraction of the time. Art Time-Lapse Recording captures still frames at preset intervals, then creates an HD file with the stills placed in sequential order. A variety of modes, including Night Time, Zooming, Panning and Reverse Playback, give you more creative options.\\n\\n<b>Record Pause<\/b>\\nWhile shooting a video in Record Pause mode, it allows you to briefly pause the recording and then pick up right where you left off without creating a new file. This way you only have one file to work with and don\u2019t have to merge files for editing, sharing or transferring.\\n\\n<b>Shake It<\/b>\\nNext time you record a get-together, add some fun with Shake It. Just a couple of jostles of the camcorder can randomly add one of several different fun and artistic digital effects to a scene. Shake It even works in Playback Mode, when it will embed preloaded music into your clip.\\n\\n<b>2.7\u201d Smart Touch LCD<\/b>\\nChange the way you look at things with the 2.7\" QVGA Touch LCD (230k resolution). The large screen delivers clean, crisp images that are saturated with natural colour and deep, dynamic detail. And the size also makes the touchscreen easier to use to find the feature or content you\u2019re looking for.\\n\\n<b>4.9M Still Photo<\/b>\\nWhile recording video and without interruption, you are able to capture still images (5.5 Megapixel) that are as vivid and vibrant as life itself."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Les appareils Q20 et QF20 sont dot\u00e9s de la fonction Switch Grip II. Cela vous permet non seulement de le tenir de la main gauche ou droite mais \u00e9galement de pouvoir filmer \u00e0 la verticale vos moments \u00e9mouvants ou hilarants, le tout dans une qualit\u00e9 HD exceptionnelle. Il est alors logique de vouloir partager ses vid\u00e9os, gr\u00e2ce au Wi-Fi cela devient possible ! T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez-les sur vos r\u00e9seaux sociaux pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s en vous connectant \u00e0 un Hotpost ou depuis chez vous. Il n\u2019a jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 aussi facile de partagez et profitez de vid\u00e9os FULL HD1080p.\\n<br\/><b>Filmez sous tous les angles avec Switch Grip II<\/b>\\n<br\/><b>Switch Grip II (Enregistrement vertical) 0\u00b0, 90\u00b0, 180\u00b0<\/b>\\nUne chose sur laquelle les droitiers et gauchers peuvent s\u2019entendre, c\u2019est que le cam\u00e9scope compact Q20 \/ QF20 dot\u00e9 du Switch Grip II a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7ue pour tout le monde. Avec ce cam\u00e9scope, peu importe de quelle main vous le tenez, l\u2019\u00e9cran LCD s\u2019adapte automatiquement \u00e0 l\u2019angle de prise de vue. Vous trouvez \u00e7a plus confortable de filmer des sujets \u00e9troits \u00e0 la verticale? Bonne nouvelle: vous pouvez faire pivoter l\u2019\u00e9cran LCD \u00e0 90 degr\u00e9s et l\u2019image restera \u00e0 l\u2019endroit. Enregistrer des vid\u00e9os depuis une position compliqu\u00e9e n\u2019a jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 aussi simple. \\n<br\/><b>Partagez et sauvegardez instantan\u00e9ment. Simplement<\/b>\\n<br\/><b>Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi <\/b>\\nAvec le Wi-Fi int\u00e9grer, vous pouvez partager vos moments les plus pr\u00e9cieux tout en \u00e9tant en voyage. Envoyez des photos directement sur Facebook\u2122, Picasa\u2122, Photobucket\u2122 ou par email directement depuis votre cam\u00e9scope. Vous pouvez envoyer directement vos vid\u00e9os sur YouTube et attendre les commentaires de vos amis. Le QF20 vous donne \u00e9galement la possibilit\u00e9 de t\u00e9l\u00e9charger vos donn\u00e9es sur un service \u00ab Cloud \u00bb. Ainsi, vous n\u2019aurez plus de probl\u00e8mes de carte m\u00e9moire ou la peur de perdre vos donn\u00e9es. La connexion avec un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur en Wi-Fi direct vous permet de partager sur grand \u00e9cran vos plus beaux moments. Enfin, vous pourrez sauvegarder vos vid\u00e9os et photos sur votre PC en un seul click gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la sauvegarde automatique. C\u2019est aussi simple que \u00e7a, plus besoin de chercher son c\u00e2ble.\\n\\n* uniquement disponible sur le QF20.\\n<br\/><b>Revivez vos aventures en vid\u00e9o Full HD<\/b>\\n<br\/><b>1920 x 1080 \/ 60p<\/b>\\nPourquoi prendre juste des vid\u00e9os basiques quand vous pouvez enregistrer des vid\u00e9os Full HD? Avec une r\u00e9solution de 1920 x 1080 60i, vous pouvez capturez tous les d\u00e9tails, le tout avec un respect des couleurs et de la lumi\u00e8re incomparable. Cela permet de garantir une perfection d'image sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD ou un moniteur HD, et une exp\u00e9rience visuelle exceptionnelle.\\n<br\/><b>Enregistrer des vid\u00e9os au c\u0153ur de l\u2019action avec le zoom optique x20<\/b>\\n<br\/><b>Zoom optique x20, zoom num\u00e9rique x40<\/b>\\nA la fois l\u00e9ger et compact, le Q20 \/ QF20 se glisse partout avec vous. Son objectif Schneider Kreuznach dote d\u2019un zoom optique x20 and d\u2019un zoom num\u00e9rique x40 vous permets de capturer tous les d\u00e9tails de l\u2019action m\u00eame si vous \u00eates loin de la sc\u00e8ne. Les d\u00e9tails sont aussi nets et claires que si vous \u00e9tiez proche de l\u2019action.\\n<br\/><b>Mettez directement en favoris vos sc\u00e8nes pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9es sur votre appareil avec \u00ab My clip \u00bb<\/b>\\n<br\/><b>My Clip<\/b>\\nRegardez vos moments pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s d\u2019une sortie entre amis sans perdre de temps \u00e0 naviguer dans toutes vos s\u00e9quences vid\u00e9o enregistr\u00e9es. La fonction \u00ab My Clip \u00bb vous permets de s\u00e9lectionner n\u2019importe quelle s\u00e9quences vid\u00e9o et ainsi de les revoir les unes \u00e0 la suite des autres sans interruption."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":20}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-16T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"44bc8141-d3d5-4dfd-a39d-3d817563e86b","identifier":"13054611","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","yarvik"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Yarvik PMP037 MP3 player & recorder"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-17T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0f90051b-cf76-41c3-b678-0e0faba7ba97","identifier":"130580","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Tout-en-un Photosmart 2610"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"This All-in-One offers built-in networking plus advanced photo printing features including memory card slots and 6.4 cm colour LCD for selecting, editing and printing photos without a PC, plus borderless photos up to 2x A4 size.\\n\\nABH - Netherlands - Dutch localization"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Ce tout-en-un offre un r\u00e9seau int\u00e9gr\u00e9 plus des fonctions d'impression photo avanc\u00e9es comprenant des logements de carte m\u00e9moire et un \u00e9cran \u00e0 cristaux liquides couleur 6,4 cm pour choisir, retoucher et imprimer des photos sans ordinateur, avec des photos sans marge jusqu'au format 2x A4.\\n\\nABH - Netherlands - Dutch localization"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7f99eb5e-9560-4730-8034-4f6ead1ebfd3","identifier":"130744","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DSC-F707 digital camera"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<br\/>Super HAD CCD\u2122 mit 5,0 Mio. Pixel (effektiv).<br\/>\\nCarl Zeiss\u00ae Vario-Sonnar\u00ae Objektiv.<br\/>\\nOptischer 5fach-Zoom (Carl Zeiss\u00ae Objektiv).<br\/>\\nSchwenkbares Objektiv.<br\/>\\nBurst-Modus.<br\/>\\nVerschlusszeiten-Priorit\u00e4t.<br\/>\\nBlendenpriorit\u00e4t.<br\/>\\nElektronischer Sucher.<br\/>\\nMehrfeldmessung.<br\/>\\nHologramm-Autofokus.<br\/>\\nVorblitz.<br\/>\\nSTAMINA 2,5 h\/2.500 Aufnahmen.<br\/>\\nRauschminimierung bei Langzeitbelichtungen (Slow Shutter Noise Reduction).<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Capture images like a pro with the Cyber-shot F707 which features a 5 effective Megapixel Super HAD CCD, Carl Zeiss Vario Sonnar mulit-angle lens, 5x optical zoom and advanced photo features."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<br\/>Capteur Super HAD CCD\u2122 5 m\u00e9gapixels effectifs.<br\/>\\nObjectif Carl Zeiss\u00ae Vario-Sonnar\u00ae.<br\/>\\nZoom optique 5x (objectif Carl Zeiss\u00ae).<br\/>\\nObjectif rotatif \u00e0 angles multiples.<br\/>\\nMode rafale.<br\/>\\nPriorit\u00e9 \u00e0 la vitesse d'obturation.<br\/>\\nPriorit\u00e9 \u00e0 l'ouverture.<br\/>\\nViseur \u00e9lectrique.<br\/>\\nMesure multizone.<br\/>\\nMise au point laser.<br\/>\\nPr\u00e9flash.<br\/>\\nSTAMINA\u00a0: 2,5 heures \/ 2 500 prises.<br\/>\\nObturateur lent \u00e0 r\u00e9duction du bruit.<br\/>\\n"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-08-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"04e7274b-b9fe-4753-8264-1d5ddf56e385","identifier":"13088385","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X925de"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"79.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Lexmark X925de. Print technology: LED, Printing: Colour, Copying: Colour. Print resolution (colour, normal quality): 600 x 600, Print resolution (black, normal quality): 600 x 600. Maximum copy resolution: 600 x 600, Copier resize: 25 - 400. Optical scanning resolution: 600 x 600, Maximum scan area: 297 x 432, Scan type: Flatbed & ADF. Modem speed: 33.6"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"73d0538d-3a7a-4a21-8ae7-3080b1b7997a","identifier":"13118336","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm F770EXR"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>The Premium Travel Zoom - All You Dreamed of and More!<\/b>\\n20x optical zoom performance plus Intelligent Digital Zoom for extreme 40x telephoto shots - all in the smallest long-zoom compact in the world.* Every control is at your fingertips.\\n* Among compact digital cameras equipped with a 20x optical zoom lens as of December 2011.\\n\\n<b>High Quality Photos & Movies with the New EXR AUTO<\/b>\\nThe EXR CMOS sensor for breathtaking image quality in low-light scenes, and the EXR Processor for lightning-fast auto focus.\\n\\n<b>Capture the Moment of Your Trip with Built-in GPS<\/b>\\n- GPS + AR Technology\\n- Photo Navigation\\n- Route Logging with MyFinePix Studio\\n\\n<b>More Creative Photography for You<\/b>\\n- 3D Shooting Function\\n- Motion Panorama 360\\n- Film Simulation Mode\\n- Face Recognition\\n\\n<b>Image Sharing and Post Capture Essentials<\/b>\\n- Easyweb Uploading\\n- Playback Functions"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":20}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-21T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"988f758d-f496-4f0a-966f-a840502ce56f","identifier":"1312877","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLP-610ND"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"220-240V; 50Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Stellen Sie sich vor, Sie drucken mit hohen Druckvolumen in Schwarzwei\u00df und in lebendigen Farben bei hoher Druckgeschwindigkeit und niedrigen Betriebskosten. Mit dem ersten Single-Pass-Farblaserdrucker CLP-600 und dem netzwerkf\u00e4higen CLP-600N von SAMSUNG f\u00e4llt es leicht, sich das vorzustellen.\\n\\n<B>schnelle USB 2.0 Verbindung<\/b>\\n- Mit dem USB 2.0 Standardport verabschieden Sie sich von l\u00e4stigen Engp\u00e4ssen zwischen Ihrem PC und Ihrem Drucker.\\n\\n<B>integrierte Duplex-Einheit<\/b>\\n- Mit nur einem Knopfdruck k\u00f6nnen Sie komfortabel doppelseitige Ausdrucke erstellen. Duplex-Druck \u00fcber die Treibereinstellungen ist selbstverst\u00e4ndlich ebenso m\u00f6glich.\\n\\n<B>erstklassige Druckqualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\n- Professionelle Dokumente mit gestochen scharfen Schriftbildern und Grafikdarstellungen bei einer Aufl\u00f6sung von 2.400 x 600 dpi.\\n\\n<B>hohe Geschwindigkeit<\/b>\\n- Druck von bis zu 20 Seiten (A4) pro Minute. Dank des \u00e4u\u00dferst schnellen 250 MHz Prozessors wird die erste Seite sehr schnell ausgedruckt.\\n\\n<B>stabile Netzwerkl\u00f6sungen<\/b>\\n- Nutzen Sie den netzwerkf\u00e4higen Drucker durch den Ethernet-Netzwerkadapter 10\/100 Base TX oder in Kombination mit 10\/100 Basis TX und 802.11b Wireless LAN - entweder als Zusatz- oder Standardkonfiguration. Die SAMSUNG-Software zur Druckersteuerung erm\u00f6glicht es Ihnen, die SAMSUNG Netzwerkdrucker in Ihrem Netzwerk zu installieren, zu kontrollieren und zu bedienen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The SAMSUNG CLP-610ND color laser printer delivers full color at speeds up to 21 ppm. Boasting a durable monthly duty cycle of 65,000 pages, built-in automatic duplexing and image detail up to 2400 x 600dpi effective output the 610ND delivers. Backed by a 360 MHz processor and 128 MB RAM, not even your biggest jobs can slow it down. Innovation without compromise; the CLP-610ND.\\n\\n<B>fast print speed<\/b>\\n- Faster print speeds mean increased productivity. The CLP-610ND delivers single sheets in less than 20 seconds and 100 pages in less than 5 minutes, whether simple text or full color.\\n\\n<B>expandable memory<\/b>\\n- With a 360 MHz processor and 128 MB memory expandable to 384 MB, the CLP-610ND starts fast and stays fast, even when handling complex large documents.\\n\\n<B>less consumables<\/b>\\n- Four consumables. Less hassle.\\n\\n<B>duplex printing<\/b>\\n- Enhance your efficiency with the built-in, one-touch automatic duplex feature. Printing double-sided documents saves money and time.\\n\\n<B>extended duty cycle<\/b>\\n- Boasting an average monthly duty cycle of 65,000 pages, the CLP-610ND is designed to meet the demands of the busiest workgroups.\\n\\n<B>ENERGY STAR compliant<\/b>\\n- By being ENERGY STAR compliant you are assured that your SAMSUNG model is helping the environment by using less energy while saving you money. ENERGY STAR is a joint program of the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency and the U.S. Department of Energy promoting energy efficiency."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"L'imprimante laser couleur SAMSUNG CLP-610ND offre une palette chromatique compl\u00e8te et atteint une vitesse d'impression allant jusqu'\u00e0 21 ppm. En plus d'afficher une capacit\u00e9 d'impression mensuelle de 65 000 pages, la 610ND comprend une fonction d'impression recto-verso automatique int\u00e9gr\u00e9e et pr\u00e9sente une r\u00e9solution effective de 2 400 x 600 ppp. Et gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son processeur de 360 MHz et \u00e0 une m\u00e9moire vive de 128 Mo, elle est capable de maintenir sa cadence, m\u00eame lors de travaux d'impression volumineux. La CLP-610ND, c'est l'innovation sans compromis.\\n\\n<B>impression ultrarapide<\/b>\\n- Qui dit rapidit\u00e9 d'impression, dit productivit\u00e9 accrue. La CLP-610ND imprime une page en moins de vingt secondes et 100 pages en moins de cinq minutes, qu'il s'agisse de texte simple ou d'un document couleur.\\n\\n<B>moins de consommables<\/b>\\n- Parce qu'elle utilise seulement quatre consommables, cette imprimante est beaucoup plus pratique.\\n\\n<B>capacit\u00e9 d'impression \u00e9tendue<\/b>\\n- Avec sa capacit\u00e9 d'impression mensuelle moyenne de 65 000 pages, la CLP-610ND est con\u00e7ue pour r\u00e9pondre aux attentes des groupes de travail les plus actifs.\\n\\n<B>impression recto-verso<\/b>\\n- Optimisez votre efficacit\u00e9 avec la fonction d'impression recto-verso automatique int\u00e9gr\u00e9e, accessible \u00e0 l'aide d'un seul bouton.\\nGagnez du temps et de l'argent en imprimant des documents double face.\\n\\n<B>m\u00e9moire extensible<\/b>\\n- Dot\u00e9e d'un processeur de 360 MHz et d'une m\u00e9moire de 384 Mo, la CLP-610ND vous garantit une rapidit\u00e9 constante, m\u00eame lors de l'impression de documents volumineux et complexes."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-10-07T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"219b4d50-5129-4dc7-a340-374a672b50a2","identifier":"131496","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lg","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG L2010P 20.1\" TFT .255 94kHz TCO99 silver"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 90~264 V (47 ~ 63Hz)"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":20,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"20.1\" LCD Monitor L2010P <br>\\nFLATRON LCD Professional series - narrow bezel, pivot function, and ergonomic design ensure comfortable work <p>\\nBuilt-in Power Adapter <br>\\n- For reduced cable clutter and easy wall-mounting <br>\\n Dual Input  <br>\\n- DVI delivers sharper and cleaner images without any data loss, making it suitable for graphic and multimedia users. <br>\\n OSD Lock  <br>\\n- OSD Lock function prevents unwanted changes to the display settings \\n Wide viewing angle  <br>\\n- Our wide viewing technology provides wide viewing angles in every direction to prevent colors and images from deviation. <br>\\n Wall mountable  <br>\\n- Mounting slots at the back allow the LG's LCD monitor to be hung just like a picture <br>\\n USB Hub  <br>\\n- Connects to outer devices for the user's convenience <br>\\n Pivot Enabled  <br>\\n- Pivot function enables the computer display to rotate for different applications: landscape, portrait making, or word processing. <br>\\n Height Adjustable  <br>\\n Narrow Bezel  <br>\\n- Narrow Bezel design gives monitors a tiled look, making them ideal for trading floors, banks and airports <br>\\n LightView Function <br>\\n- LightView function allows users to freely adjust brightness and color temperature according to their application, like day\/night, photo, text, and movie. <br>\\n Certified TCO-03 <br>\\n- With a stricter regulation than the TCO-99, the product guarantees excellent user ergonomics, visual performance, and environment. <br>"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":16}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"938ae150-ce58-4f79-bd24-b772addcdd0e","identifier":"1314976","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1\/3\/e\/7\/13e778a8ab62769744366a4d10ecc56cc55ef6a7_1314976_5566.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/1\/3\/e\/7\/13e778a8ab62769744366a4d10ecc56cc55ef6a7_1314976_5566.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony SS-SP32FWB"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"When it comes to creating high-quality Hi-Fi sound in your home, selecting the proper speakers is even more important. Sony makes it easy with an extremely wide range of different speakers. Whether you're listening to a refined string quartet or watching a powerful action-packed movie, Sony's speakers are designed to deliver an intensive acoustic experience that is both powerful and emotional."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-10-13T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8b876459-23eb-4447-9dc2-916722c0bbcd","identifier":"13153516","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix X100 LE"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fujifilm X100<\/b>\\nA camera for those who love photography. Combining classic styling and handling with cutting edge optical and electronic design, the X100 is instantly desirable from the moment you pick it up.\\n\\nA 23mm f\/2 Fujinon prime lens (35mm full-frame equiv.) and superb hybrid optical viewfinder bring a purity back to photography, and put you in charge of your creativity.\\n\\n<b>Features:<\/b>\\n<b>A Perfected Fusion of Optical and Electronic Viewfinder<\/b>\\nThe new Hybrid Viewfinder offers expanded freedom in the composition and enjoyment of photography in a range of challenging shooting conditions.\\n\\n<b>Newly Developed Fujinon 23mm F2 Lens<\/b>\\nFixed focal length lens designed with a passion for performance captures the excitement in vivid detail and expand your range of expression.\\n\\n<b>Custom CMOS Sensor x New EXR Processor<\/b>\\nJust as your senses seek to capture the beauty, the heart of the FinePix X100 collects every ray of light to attain the ultimate image quality.\\n\\n<b>Professional and Creative Photo Expression<\/b>\\nRefined functions let you endeavor distinctive photo expressions. For both professional and creative needs, the FinePix X100 functions will fire your passion for photography.\\n\\n<b>When Camera Meets the Grand Expression<\/b>\\nSelected functions that let you capture the moment as the total experience. The FinePix X100 is much more than a precision instrument for your endless fascination of photography."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"90c2df41-21e5-43a0-97d0-95db71f8af55","identifier":"131580","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lg","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG L1715S 17\" TFT .264 80kHz TCO99"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 90~264 V (47 ~ 63Hz)"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":17,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"LCD Monitor model L1715S <p>\\n Built-in Power Adapter <br>\\n- For reduced cable clutter and easy wall-mounting <br>\\n OSD Lock  <br>\\n- OSD Lock function prevents unwanted changes to the display settings <br>\\n  Auto Adjustment Function  <br>\\n- Automatically sets image position, phase and pitch <br>\\n Wall mountable  <br>\\n- Mounting slots at the back allow the LG's LCD monitor to be hung just like a picture. <br>\\n LightView Function <br>\\n- LightView function allows users to freely adjust brightness and color temperature according to their application, like day\/night, photo, text, and movie <br>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":16}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9fb598b5-24f7-4395-ace9-d75267883b33","identifier":"1316590","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","conceptronic","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Conceptronic Lounge\u2019n\u2019LISTEN Portable USB Tube Speakers, Black"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Dieses elegante R\u00f6hrenlautsprecherset verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber ein einzigartiges \u201aKlick-& Dreh- System\u2019- Um es kompakter zu machen und damit einfacher transportieren zu k\u00f6nnen, klicken Sie einfach die zwei Satelliten des R\u00f6hrenlautsprechers ineinander."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"This stylish portable Tube Speaker set has a unique click&turn system. For easy carrying during traveling, just click the two satellites of the Tube Speaker together to make it compact."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant kit de Haut-parleurs Tube portables poss\u00e8de un syst\u00e8me unique de click&turn. Pour faciliter son transport lors des voyages, il vous suffi t de connecter les deux satellites du Haut-parleur Tube pour le rendre plus compact."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-10-18T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f43d5b80-fda8-4d68-9f44-e576538f4315","identifier":"1316833","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLP-660ND"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Stellen Sie sich vor, Sie drucken mit hohen Druckvolumen in Schwarzwei\u00df und in lebendigen Farben bei hoher Druckgeschwindigkeit und niedrigen Betriebskosten. Mit dem ersten Single-Pass-Farblaserdrucker CLP-600 und dem netzwerkf\u00e4higen CLP-600N von SAMSUNG f\u00e4llt es leicht, sich das vorzustellen.\\n\\n<B>variables Papiermanagement<\/b>\\n- Die 150-Blatt-Papiermagazin mit praktischer Abdeckung sorgt f\u00fcr sauberes Papier und einen geordneten Gesamteindruck. Auch Folien, Etiketten, Postkarten und Umschl\u00e4ge lassen sich damit ohne Kassettenwechsel drucken.\\n\\n<B>Druckaufl\u00f6sung<\/b>\\n- Mit einer Aufl\u00f6sung von bis zu 2.400 x 600 dpi (effektive Ausgabe) drucken Sie Bilder und Grafiken in exzellenter Qualit\u00e4t.\\n\\n<B>umfangreiche Kompatibilit\u00e4t<\/b>\\n- Der Drucker unterst\u00fctzt die meisten g\u00e4ngigen Betriebssysteme wie Windows, verschiedene Linux-Betriebssysteme sowie Mac OS 10.3.\\n\\n<B>Schnelle USB 2.0 Verbindung<\/b>\\n- Mit dem USB 2.0 Standardport verabschieden Sie sich von l\u00e4stigen Engp\u00e4ssen zwischen Ihrem PC und Ihrem Drucker."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The powerful, network-ready SAMSUNG CLP-660ND color laser printer delivers full color or black text at blazing print speeds up to 25ppm, with the first-page-out-times in less than 14 seconds. To help you stay focused without interruption, the 660ND includes a 250 page cassette tray. Once you own the CLP-660ND it\u2019s hard to imagine working without it.\\n\\n<B>maximize efficiency<\/b>\\n- Samsung CLP-660ND achieves exceptional printing results while reducing total operating costs and producing a low cost per page. Maximize efficiency for your business with the effective Samsung CLP-660ND. What\u2019s more, the CLP-660ND has a Duplex facility available on option, meaning lower paper consumption and even greater efficiency for your business.\\n\\n<B>device management solution<\/b>\\n- While we\u2019ve increased the speed of our printers to let you get on with the work at hand, we realize you won\u2019t want to compromise on quality. With the ability to produce up to 24 pages per minute in A4 (up to 25ppm in Letter), Samsung\u2019s new printer range possesses the capacity to provide quality printouts at break-neck speeds, providing the ideal environment for maximum productivity in a home or business setting.\\n\\n<B>high memory capacity<\/b>\\n- Increase efficiency in your office with a higher memory capacity. Give your business the ability to operate at its fullest potential with an expandable memory of up to 640 MB.\\n\\n<B>duplex printing<\/b>\\n- Enhance your efficiency with the built-in, one-touch automatic duplex feature. Printing double-sided documents saves money and time.\\n\\n<B>ENERGY STAR compliant<\/b>\\n- By being ENERGY STAR compliant you are assured that your Samsung model is helping the environment by using less energy while saving you money. ENERGY STAR is a joint program of the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency and the U.S. Department of Energy promoting energy efficiency."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Puissante et dot\u00e9e d'une fonction de connexion au r\u00e9seau, l'imprimante laser couleur SAMSUNG CLP-660ND r\u00e9alise des impressions couleur ou en texte noir \u00e0 une vitesse incroyable de 25 ppm, la premi\u00e8re page \u00e9tant produite en moins de 14 secondes. Pour interrompre le moins possible votre travail, la 660ND comprend un chargeur de 250 feuilles. Inutile d'imaginer pouvoir vous passer de la CLP-660ND une fois que l'aurez essay\u00e9e!\\n\\n<B>impression ultrarapide<\/b>\\n- Qui dit rapidit\u00e9 d'impression, dit productivit\u00e9 accrue. La CLP-660ND imprime une page en moins de vingt secondes et 100 pages en moins de cinq minutes, qu'il s'agisse de texte simple ou d'un document couleur.\\n\\n<B>capacit\u00e9 d'impression \u00e9tendue<\/b>\\n- Avec sa capacit\u00e9 d'impression mensuelle moyenne de 65 000 pages, la CLP-660ND est con\u00e7ue pour r\u00e9pondre aux attentes des groupes de travail les plus actifs.\\n\\n<B>moins de consommables<\/b>\\n- Parce qu'elle utilise seulement quatre consommables, cette imprimante est beaucoup plus pratique.\\n\\n<B>m\u00e9moire extensible<\/b>\\n- Dot\u00e9e d'un processeur de 360 MHz et d'une m\u00e9moire de 384 Mo, la CLP-660ND vous garantit une rapidit\u00e9 constante, m\u00eame lors de l'impression de documents volumineux et complexes.\\n\\n<B>impression recto-verso<\/b>\\n- Optimisez votre efficacit\u00e9 avec la fonction d'impression recto-verso automatique int\u00e9gr\u00e9e, accessible \u00e0 l'aide d'un seul bouton.Gagnez du temps et de l'argent en imprimant des documents double face."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-10-19T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1c2bd5fc-431e-4464-9594-ff9caa78175f","identifier":"13177279","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","vogel_s"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Vogel's PFA 9111\/Video Conferencing loudspeaker"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The PFA 9111 (RS232-485) loudspeaker is especially developed for video conferencing. The loudspeaker is equipped with patented technology which produces unparalleled, clear (vocal) sound reproduction. Because of this special filter technology the sound reaches much further into the room, even at low volumes, than conventional loudspeakers. The PFA 9111 loudspeaker exactly matches the PFF 5100 video conferencing furniture.\\n\\nIn addition to the usual audio input, the built-in digital amplifier has a port for RS232-485 communication. This makes it possible to operated and control the loudspeaker remotely in larger installations."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le haut-parleur PFA 9111 (RS232-485) est sp\u00e9cialement con\u00e7u pour la vid\u00e9oconf\u00e9rence. Le haut-parleur est \u00e9quip\u00e9 d'une technologie brevet\u00e9e qui garantit une reproduction sonore claire (vocale) in\u00e9gal\u00e9e. Cette technologie de filtre permet \u00e9galement au son d'\u00eatre mieux diffus\u00e9 dans la pi\u00e8ce, m\u00eame \u00e0 faible volume, par rapport aux haut-parleurs classiques. Le haut-parleur PFA 9111 correspond exactement au meublre de vid\u00e9oconf\u00e9rence PFF 5100.\\n\\nOutre l'entr\u00e9e audio habituelle, l'amplificateur num\u00e9rique int\u00e9gr\u00e9 a un port pour communication RS232-485. Ceci permet d'activer le haut-parleur \u00e0 distance dans de plus grandes installations."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-25T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3b7f27a1-6669-44b2-b254-b261f06eccdb","identifier":"131783","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["ibm","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"IBM Infoprint 1332 L"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"110 \u2014 127 V 50\/60 Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"IBM is adding new models to its Infoprint\u00ae 1332 printer line. The new L models achieve a lower price point than the other 1332 printer models by shipping to the customer with a lower capacity (5,000-print) toner cartridge.\\nThe Infoprint 1332 is a 35 page per minute (PPM) monochrome laser printer. This printer is ideal for small and medium workgroups because of its speed, scalable input and output capacity, durability, and highly reliable printing. The IBM Infoprint 1332 is small enough to fit on a desktop, but can also be adapted to floor-standing units with optional input options that can enable input capacities up to 3,850 sheets. The printer also offers a wide range of output options, including stapling capabilities, which can expand the printer's output capacity up to 2,750 sheets.\\nThe printer supports a robust line of networking options, which includes Fast Ethernet, Token-Ring, Twinax, and Coax. All models have a Universal Serial Bus (USB) port standard for local connections, and optional parallel and serial connections are available. The base models additionally come with parallel standard. In terms of datastreams, the capability to integrate PCL 6 and PostScript 3 emulation, Page Printer Data Stream (PPDS), and PDF V1.2 and PDF V1.3 come standard; Intelligent Printer Data Stream\u2122 (IPDS\u2122) is optional."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-06-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d4c65cd0-0eb7-4a43-8c29-a7304efac03c","identifier":"13184463","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 46TL933"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Toshiba TL933\/963 series puts 3D into everyone's reach. So if you\u2019d like a great 3D cinema experience in your living room, this is the TV for you. Whether you\u2019re watching in 2D or 3D, the picture quality is glorious in 1080p full high definition, and our 200 AMR (Active Motion & Resolution) technology gives a high refresh rate that can easily keep up with the fastest moving sports, games and movies. On top of that it\u2019s a Smart TV, so you can easily enjoy entertainment from the internet.\\n\\n<b>DIVE INTO 3D<\/b>\\nOnce you dive into the next dimension of 3D, you will never look back. Movies, sports and gaming will never be the same after you enjoy the magic of Toshiba Full HD 3D. Our 2D-to-3D upconversion software is also built in, so you can add 3D effects to movies shot in 2D. (Note: 3D-glasses sold separately).\\n\\n<b>KEEP UP WITH THE ACTION<\/b>\\nThe action stays crisp, fast and smooth thanks to our 200 AMR (Active Motion & Resolution) HD image-processing technology. It cuts motion blur and keeps the refresh rate high, so the TL933\/963 series can easily keep up with the fastest moving sports and action sequences.\\n\\n<b>GET INTO SMART TV<\/b>\\nNow you can watch entertainment from the internet on the best screen in the house. With just a few clicks of the remote, you\u2019ll be watch videos on YouTube, catching up with Euronews or sharing photos on Flickr. You can also view and share a wide range of other online content via various service providers through the Toshiba Places internet portal\\n\\n<b>GREAT CONNECTIONS<\/b>\\nConnect your TV to your home network and enjoy all the music, videos and photos stored on your computer on the big screen via WiDi technology*. On top of that four HDMI ports and two USB ports mean there\u2019s plenty of room to connect all your other devices and with the USB Video Recording function* you can record your favourite programmes.\\n\\n<b>CONTROL FROM YOUR PHONE<\/b>\\nYou can now control your TV with your smart device based on iOS (iPod Touch, iPhone or iPad) or Android operating system, allowing you to change the channel or turn the volume up with a swipe of your finger. Just download our free app, Toshiba AppsConnect, from iTunes or Android Market.\\n\\n<b>RICHER VIEWING<\/b>\\nBecome a more discerning viewer with our pre-installed MediaGuide, powered by Rovi. It helps you to decide what to watch from a database of over 2.5 million titles and gives richer multimedia background information than standard electronic programme guides."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-25T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1fc7c0f2-6cfa-47f8-aede-8f6f75635005","identifier":"13191282","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot A4000 IS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Advanced capabilities and chic style set PowerShot A4000 IS digital camera apart from the crowd. In a new high for the A-Series, it's equipped with a powerful 8x Optical Zoom to get you close to the action fast, and a 28mm Wide-Angle lens and Optical Image Stabilizer that deliver beautifully clear images with more excitement in every frame. This chic, compact camera in a range of appealing colors has a 16.0 Megapixel Image Sensor with DIGIC 4 Image Processor to ensure superior resolution and fast performance. Beautiful images are easy thanks to Smart AUTO that picks the perfect camera settings for 32 predefined shooting situations, and Intelligent IS that automatically optimizes image stabilization based on the shooting conditions. Touch a button and you'll be shooting brilliantly lifelike 720p HD video!\\n\\n- 8x Optical Zoom with 28mm Wide-Angle lens and Optical Image Stabilizer deliver stunning images.\\n- A 16.0 Megapixel Image Sensor with DIGIC 4 Image Processor for exceptional performance.\\n- Smart AUTO intelligently selects the proper camera settings based on 32 predefined shooting situations for capturing spectacular images with ease.\\n- Shoot brilliant 720p HD video with a dedicated movie button.\\n- A 3.0-inch LCD enables easy viewing.\\n- Intelligent IS automatically chooses from six different modes to optimize image stabilization for the shooting condition.\\n- Help Button provides simple explanations and easy controls of your settings.\\n- Scene Modes such as Super Vivid, Poster Effect and Miniature Effect provide creative freedom to capture your photos.\\n- Lithium-ion battery makes it easy to recharge your batteries."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-28T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2b161910-4b25-43ad-91a3-1727d85e8878","identifier":"13191283","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot A3400 IS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Touch control comes to the A-Series! You'll love the ease and familiarity of controlling PowerShot A3400 IS digital camera with its big 3.0-inch Touch Panel LCD. Touch to shoot, choose shooting modes and select settings - it's easy and intuitive. The camera makes it easy to get the best possible quality from every shot, too, with Smart AUTO that selects proper camera settings based on 32 predefined shooting situations. Simply push the dedicated Movie Button, and you'll be shooting gorgeous 720p HD video. With the 16.0 Megapixel Image Sensor and the power of the DIGIC 4 Image Processor, resolution is spectacular and performance is ultra-fast. Beautiful image quality with today's touch-panel interface makes PowerShot A3400 IS digital camera an easy choice.\\n\\n- A 3.0-inch touch panel LCD offers easy and intuitive operation and Touch Shutter makes capturing photos easy and interactive.\\n- Smart AUTO intelligently selects the proper camera settings based on 32 predefined shooting situations for capturing spectacular images with ease.\\n- Shoot brilliant 720p HD video with a dedicated movie button.\\n- A 16.0 Megapixel Image Sensor with DIGIC 4 Image Processor for exceptional performance.\\n- 5x Optical Zoom with 28mm Wide-Angle lens and Optical Image Stabilizer deliver stunning images.\\n- Intelligent IS automatically chooses from six different modes to optimize image stabilization for the shooting condition.\\n- Help Button provides simple explanations and easy controls of your settings.\\n- Scene Modes such as Super Vivid, Poster Effect and Miniature Effect provide creative freedom to capture your photos.\\n- Lithium-ion battery makes it easy to recharge your batteries.\\n- Available in black, silver, red, and gold."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-28T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a4faef51-3c12-4709-a4a4-17ee5c572df7","identifier":"1320064","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lenovo","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenovo Flat Panel Performance ThinkVision L190x"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 - 240 VAC, 50 - 60 Hz"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The ThinkVision L190x is an ultra-slim, 19-inch monitor offering outstanding image quality with a stand that offers tilt, swivel, pivot, and height adjustments. Its ultra slim bezel is only 6.6 mm wide and saves space to provide a nearly seamless view in a multiple-monitor environment. ThinkVision L190x is thoughtfully designed, delivering high performance images even when viewed from extreme angles. These monitors are the ideal choice for multiple, dual, or tilted configurations and allow for greater collaboration and productivity. The monitor can be rotated to change from landscape to portrait viewing and the image will adjust automatically. The ThinkVision L190x is in the Performance ThinkVision family of monitors. It is best suited for specialized applications in multi-monitor environments where quick access to USB ports is needed.\\n  \\n<b>Features & Benefits:<\/b> \\n  \\n- 19-in viewable image size \\n- Native resolution of 1280 x 1024 \\n- ThinkVantage design \\n- Ultra slim side bezels (6.6 mm) for multi-monitoring \\n- Pivot for portrait or landscape viewing (graphics card dependent) \\n- Automatic image rotating software included \\n- Rear stand cover and clip to keep cables hidden \\n- Carrying handle for easy transport \\n- Direct access button for automatic image setup \\n- Complimentary design for ThinkPad and ThinkCentre systems \\n- Analog and DVI-D video signal connectors \\n- Supports High Definition Content Protection (HDCP) \\n- Compliance with ENERGY STAR 4.0 requirements \\n- The Electronic Product Environmental Assessment Tool(EPEAT) Silver category \\n- Four port USB hub \\n- Kensington Lock slot for security \\n- TCO'03 compliance \\n- Offers attachment points for optional ThinkVision USB Soundbar (40Y7616) \\n- Analog and digital connectors provide attachment flexibility \\n- Wide viewing angles (178 degrees both horizontal and vertical) for multi-monitoring \\n- Dual input connectors allow attachment to two systems simultaneously \\n- Windows Vista Premium Certified \\n- 31 Watt power consumption via internal power \\n- Kensington lock slot \\n- Meets 100 mm VESA standard for mounting \\n- Detachable base for wall- or arm-mounting (sold separately) \\n- Available in business black"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-10-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":25}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8275b41f-634d-45c3-b866-3c7afced861e","identifier":"13204536","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DSC-WX100"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Schlanke, fortschrittliche Cyber-shot mit leistungsstarkem Zoom, Full HD-Film und 3D-Aufnahme<\/b>\\n\\n- Superschlank mit starkem optischen 10fach-Zoom.\\n- Gestochen scharfe HD-Videos und Standbilder, selbst im Gehen.\\n- Wunderbar scharfe, detailreiche Bilder in schwierigen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen.\\n\\n<b>Die weltweit kleinste und leichteste Kamera mit optischem 10fach-Zoom<\/b>\\n\\nDie erste Kamera ihrer Klasse, die \u00fcber einen starken optischen 10fach-Zoom in einem so wunderbar schlanken Geh\u00e4use verf\u00fcgt. Die bedienfreundliche Cyber-shot WX100 nimmt detailreiche Standbilder, 3D-Aufnahmen und beeindruckende Full HD-Videos mit unz\u00e4hligen kreativen M\u00f6glichkeiten auf.\\n\\n<b>Schlank und mit Superzoom<\/b>\\nF\u00fcr beeindruckende Nahaufnahmen ist nicht unbedingt eine gro\u00dfe, sperrige Kamera erforderlich. Die schlanke Cyber-shot verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber ein \u00e4u\u00dferst leistungsstarkes Zoomobjektiv. Mit dieser kompakten Kamera k\u00f6nnen Sie sowohl Weitwinkel- als auch detaillierte Nahaufnahmen einfangen.\\n\\n<b>Magische Momente<\/b>\\nNehmen Sie brillante, klare Full HD-Videos auf. Freuen Sie sich auch beim Gehen oder Zoomen auf stabile, verwacklungsfreie Bilder.\\n\\n<b>Die ganze Bildbreite einfangen<\/b>\\nAtemberaubende Aufnahmen von Landschaften oder Stadtszenen sind kein Problem. Cyber-shot erm\u00f6glicht High-Speed-Serienaufnahmen bei einem Kameraschwenk (von einer Seite zur anderen oder von oben nach unten) und setzt diese dann automatisch zu einem Bild zusammen. So erzielen Sie beeindruckende Panoramaansichten.\\n\\n<b>Ergebnisse wie bei DSLR-Kamera leicht gemacht<\/b>\\nEs war nie leichter, erstklassige Bilder aufzunehmen. Mit dem hervorragenden Automatikmodus werden Belichtung und andere Kameraeinstellungen f\u00fcr optimale Ergebnisse in nahezu jeder Situation angepasst. Der High-Speed-Autofokus h\u00e4lt Ihr Motiv f\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Ergebnisse fest.\\n\\n<b>Kreieren Sie wirkungsvolle Effekte<\/b>\\nSie ben\u00f6tigen keinen PC oder teure Bildbearbeitungssoftware, um mit der Kamera sch\u00f6ne Effekte zu erzielen, die nicht nur Portraits und Panoramaaufnahmen den letzten Schliff verleihen. W\u00e4hlen Sie aus verschiedenen Bildeffektmodi, um ihr Meisterwerk zu optimieren."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Slim, advanced Cyber-shot with powerful zoom, Full HD and 3D shooting.\\n\\n- Super slim with high 10x optical zoom.\\n- Blur-free HD movies and stills, even when walking.\\n- Beautifully clear, detailed images in low light.\\n\\n<b>World's smallest and lightest with 10x optical zoom<\/b>\\n\\nIt's the first camera in its class to pack a powerful 10x optical zoom lens into such a slim, beautiful body. The easy to use Cyber-shot WX100 shoots detail-packed stills, 3D and smooth Full HD video with limitless creative options.\\n\\n<b>Slim with super zoom<\/b>\\nBig, bold close-ups don't have to mean a big, bulky camera. Cyber-shot packs a powerful zoom lens into its incredibly slim body. So you can capture everything from wide-angle shots to detail-packed close-ups with less to carry.\\n\\n<b>Magical movies<\/b>\\nShoot brilliantly crisp, detailed Full HD video clips: you'll enjoy stable, blur-free images even while walking or zooming.\\n\\n<b>Experience the whole picture<\/b>\\nIt's easy to grab breathtaking views of landscapes or city scenes. Cyber-shot\u2122 stitches together a high-speed burst of frames when you sweep the camera from side to side (or up and down!) to create one amazing panoramic image.\\n\\n<b>DSLR-style results made easy<\/b>\\nIt's never been easier to achieve superb images. Superior Auto Mode adjusts exposure and other camera settings for optimum results in virtually any situation.High-speed autofocus locks onto your subject for pin-sharp results.\\n\\n<b>Create artistic effects<\/b>\\nYou don't need a PC or expensive image editing software to create beautiful 'in camera' effects that enhance portraits, landscapes and more. Pick from a choice of Picture Effect modes to enhance your masterpiece."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-29T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"04d2873b-3b72-46be-a96e-9dfdd8f1aca8","identifier":"1320551","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["hp","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP L1950 19-inch LCD Monitor"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Auto-ranging, 90 to 265 VAC, Internal power supply, 50 to 60 Hz (built-in power supply)"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der HP L1950 Flachbildschirm \u00fcberzeugt durch verbesserte Funktionen und Leistungsmerkmale, exzellenten Sichtkomfort und modernste Technologie f\u00fcr vielf\u00e4ltigste Benutzeranforderungen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The HP L1950 Flat Panel Monitor offers advanced features and functionality, superior user comfort design, and the latest technologies suited to a wide variety of users."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le moniteur \u00e0 \u00e9cran plat HP L1950 associe des fonctionnalit\u00e9s avanc\u00e9es, une conception sup\u00e9rieure du confort de l'utilisateur et les toutes derni\u00e8res technologies adapt\u00e9es aux utilisateurs les plus divers."}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-10-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"468a01dc-75d4-4630-9986-ffb25010184a","identifier":"13206043","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE32EH5000W"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Bring home a TV with a better picture, better connectivity and better protection. The Samsung EH5000 Series 5 LED TV delivers spectacular Full HD viewing and HDMI connectivity, so you can enjoy all your favourite entertainment in ultra-realistic high definition. You can also connect to USB storage to access movies, music and photos. Thanks to Wide Colour Enhancer Plus, which boosts picture quality with an advanced algorithm, you\u2019ll see more vivid and detailed images than ever. Even environmental conditions won\u2019t spoil your enjoyment, thanks to protection from lightning, power surges and humidity.\\n\\n<b>Discover a new reality in Full HD<\/b>\\nEnjoy a greater level of home entertainment realism than ever before. Thanks to a resolution twice as high as standard HD TVs, your samsung LED TV delivers a breathtaking viewing experience that takes you beyond the screen into a world of total immersion. When you\u2019ve seen the rich and vivid texture of Full HD images, your favourite TV programmes and movies will never be the same again. Discover reality with a full high definition experience.\\n\\n<b>Watch movies from your USB<\/b>\\nWith ConnectShare Movie, simply plug your USB memory drive into the TV and instantaneously enjoy movies, photos or music. Now, you can experience a wide variety of content in the comfort of your living room on your TV.\\n\\n<b>Bringing a full multimedia experience into your living room<\/b>\\nWith High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI) inputs, the Samsung TV will transform your living room into a multimedia entertainment centre. HDMI provides high-speed transmission of high definition digital data from multiple devices straight into your TV.\\n\\n<b>More vibrant colours for better images<\/b>\\nUsing an advanced picture quality improvement algorithm, Samsung\u2019s Wide Colour Enhancer Plus drastically improves the quality of any image and uncovers hidden details. Now see colours as they were meant to be seen with Wide Colour Enhancer Plus.\\n\\n<b>A TV prepared for surges, lighting and humidity<\/b>\\nEnsure you can enjoy your entertainment without worry, whatever your environment. Thanks to the Samsung TV\u2019s Triple Protector, your TV is designed to maintain operation even in the most challenging or unstable conditions. The robust enhanced inner circuit is protected against electrical surges and lightning as well as humidity. Choose a television that can cope with difficult conditions so that you\u2019ll be able to enjoy great viewing without inconvenience."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-01T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5000f562-f310-4375-b14e-9f9e6bad6c32","identifier":"13209345","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot ELPH 320 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Super Smart, Elegantly Thin.<\/b>\\nSuperb image quality, modern convenience and plenty of fun pack the elegantly designed ELPH 320 HS. Built-in Wi-Fi lets you share images and beautiful 1080p Full HD videos anywhere, while the 3.2-inch wide PureColor System LCD responds to your touch for an interactive shooting experience. The 16.1 Megapixel High-Sensitivity CMOS Sensor and DIGIC 5 Image Processor create Canon\u2019s HS System, letting you capture exceptional images even in low light. See how expressive your simple shots become with the 24mm Wide-Angle lens with 5x Optical Zoom. Great image quality is easy with improved Smart AUTO that optimizes camera settings for 58 predefined shooting situations, and Intelligent IS that ensures clear, stable images under any shooting conditions."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e2c17408-c4c0-4166-887b-8d524317d1bd","identifier":"13213008","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot ELPH 320 HS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Super Smart, Elegantly Thin.<\/b>\\nSuperb image quality, modern convenience and plenty of fun pack the elegantly designed ELPH 320 HS. Built-in Wi-Fi lets you share images and beautiful 1080p Full HD videos anywhere, while the 3.2-inch wide PureColor System LCD responds to your touch for an interactive shooting experience. The 16.1 Megapixel High-Sensitivity CMOS Sensor and DIGIC 5 Image Processor create Canon\u2019s HS System, letting you capture exceptional images even in low light. See how expressive your simple shots become with the 24mm Wide-Angle lens with 5x Optical Zoom. Great image quality is easy with improved Smart AUTO that optimizes camera settings for 58 predefined shooting situations, and Intelligent IS that ensures clear, stable images under any shooting conditions."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"684174db-5042-4db2-9635-81b65d5527a3","identifier":"13217531","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DSC-HX10V"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Leistungsstarke Cyber-shot mit leistungsstarkem 20fach-Zoom und Makromodus<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Ihr leistungsstarker Reisebegleiter<\/b>\\n\\nDie kompakte Cyber-shot HX10V mit gro\u00dfem Zoom, besonders hoher Empfindlichkeit und GPS ist vollgepackt mit einfachen Funktionen f\u00fcr sch\u00f6nere Bilder und HD-Videos und ist daher der ultimative Reisebegleiter. Erleben Sie fortschrittliche Aufnahmefunktionen f\u00fcr detaillierte Fotos, 3D-Aufnahmen und Full HD-Video.\\n\\n<b>Noch n\u00e4her am Geschehen<\/b>\\nVon schnellem Sportgeschehen bis hin zu atemberaubenden Natur-Nahaufnahmen: So fangen Sie unglaublich detailreiche Bilder ein. Der Zoom f\u00fcr klare Bilder verdoppelt den optischen 16fach-Zoom auf eine unglaubliche 32fache Vergr\u00f6\u00dferung und beh\u00e4lt dennoch die makellose Bildqualit\u00e4t bei.\\n\\n<b>Magische Momente<\/b>\\nNehmen Sie brillante, klare Full HD-Videos auf. Freuen Sie sich auch beim Gehen oder Zoomen auf stabile, verwacklungsfreie Bilder.\\n\\n<b>Ergebnisse wie bei DSLR-Kamera leicht gemacht<\/b>\\nEs war nie leichter, erstklassige Bilder aufzunehmen. Mit dem hervorragenden Automatikmodus werden Belichtung und andere Kameraeinstellungen f\u00fcr optimale Ergebnisse in nahezu jeder Situation angepasst. Der High-Speed-Autofokus h\u00e4lt Ihr Motiv f\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Ergebnisse fest.\\n\\n<b>Tolle Bilder, auch bei schlechtem Licht<\/b>\\nViele Kameras versagen bei schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen. Der Exmor R CMOS Sensor hingegen erh\u00f6ht die Empfindlichkeit bei gleichzeitiger Unterdr\u00fcckung von Bildrauschen und sorgt so f\u00fcr brillante und detailreiche Bilder.\\n\\n<b>Dr\u00fccken Sie Ihre Kreativit\u00e4t aus<\/b>\\nKomplizierte Men\u00fcs und Tasten k\u00f6nnen Sie getrost vergessen. Dank der benutzerfreundlichen \u201ePhoto Creativity\u201c Benutzeroberfl\u00e4che lassen sich Kameraeinstellungen nun einfach \u00e4ndern. Kreieren Sie au\u00dferdem ganz ohne PC beeindruckende Bildeffekte."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>High-performance Cyber-shot with powerful 20x zoom and macro shooting<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Your powerful travel partner<\/b>\\n\\nPacked with easy-to-use features for better-looking images and HD videos, the compact, high-zoom Cyber-shot HX10V with Extra High Sensitivity Technology and GPS is your ideal travel partner. Experience high-performance imaging for detail-packed stills, 3D and Full HD video.\\n\\n<b>Bring the action even closer<\/b>\\nFrom action packed sports scenes to thrilling close-ups of distant wildlife: fill the frame with stunningly detailed images. Clear Image Zoom doubles 16x optical zoom to an incredible 32x magnification while maintaining flawless picture quality.\\n\\n<b>Magical movies<\/b>\\nShoot brilliantly crisp, detailed Full HD video clips: you'll enjoy stable, blur-free images even while walking or zooming.\\n\\n<b>DSLR-style results made easy<\/b>\\nIt's never been easier to achieve superb images. Superior Auto Mode adjusts exposure and other camera settings for optimum results in virtually any situation.High-speed autofocus locks onto your subject for pin-sharp results.\\n\\n<b>Sensational images, even in low light<\/b>\\nMany cameras struggle to produce crisp, clear images in low light. The high-resolution Exmor R CMOS sensor boosts sensitivity while reducing image noise for brilliant, detail-packed pictures."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":16}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6d3b60b0-7e10-4ded-a789-6af5a12b61ac","identifier":"1325806","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","kodak"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kodak EasyShare ZD710"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Stable shots makes stunning prints.<\/b>\\n-7.1 MP for prints up to 30 \u00d7 40 in. (76 \u00d7 102 cm).  \\n-10X optical zoom lens.  \\n-Digital image stabilization.\\n-High ISO (up to 1600). \\n-KODAK PERFECT TOUCH Technology. \\n-Smart scene mode. \\n-2.0 in. (5.0 cm) wide angle color LCD.\\n\\n \\n"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-11-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bd1c401c-28cc-4519-94eb-129915b60e5b","identifier":"13303917","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung T24B350EW"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>More connections. More entertainment possibilities<\/b>\\nMake sure you can enjoy all your entertainment. The Samsung B300EW Monitor provides you with HDMI inputs for high-definition viewing, as well as others including DVI and DP. You can also access your favourite videos, photos and music on USB storage thanks to ConnectShare Movie. The monitor\u2019s Mega Dynamic Contrast Ration means you\u2019ll see it all with vivid colour and great clarity, too. And, with Dolby Digital Plus audio, high-quality viewing is complemented by outstanding sound.\\n\\n<b>Key features:<\/b>\\n- Connect with inputs including HDMI, DVI and DP\\n- Enjoy content via USB with ConnectShare Movie\\n- Boost your listening with Dolby Digital Plus audio\\n- See vivid images with Mega Dynamic Contrast Ratio\\n- Expand your experience with various inputs\\n- Upgrade to the next level with Mega Dynamic Contrast\\n- Plug in and watch your content with ConnectShare"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eafb504d-bc37-47c7-8dc9-6ebd3bfd5eb4","identifier":"13349021","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DSC-HX20V"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Leistungsstarke Cyber-shot mit leistungsstarkem 20fach-Zoom und Makromodus<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Ihr leistungsstarker Reisebegleiter<\/b>\\n\\nDie kompakte Cyber-shot HX30V mit gro\u00dfem Zoom, besonders hoher Empfindlichkeit und GPS ist vollgepackt mit einfachen Funktionen f\u00fcr sch\u00f6nere Bilder und HD-Videos und ist daher der ultimative Reisebegleiter. Fangen Sie detailreiche Bilder, 3D und Full HD 50p-Videoaufnahmen ein.\\n\\n<b>Noch n\u00e4her am Geschehen<\/b>\\nVon schnellem Sportgeschehen bis hin zu atemberaubenden Natur-Nahaufnahmen: So fangen Sie unglaublich detailreiche Bilder ein. Der Zoom f\u00fcr klare Bilder verdoppelt den optischen 20fach-Zoom auf eine unglaubliche 40fache Vergr\u00f6\u00dferung und beh\u00e4lt dennoch die makellose Bildqualit\u00e4t bei.\\n\\n<b>Magische Momente<\/b>\\nNur ein Tastendruck, und Sie nehmen gestochen scharfe und detaillierte Full HD-Videoclips auf: Freuen Sie sich auch beim Gehen oder Zoomen auf stabile, verwacklungsfreie Bilder. Nehmen Sie 50 Full HD-Bilder (1920 x 1080) pro Sekunde mit weichen \u00dcberg\u00e4ngen wie im Kino auf.\\n\\n<b>Ergebnisse wie bei DSLR-Kamera leicht gemacht<\/b>\\nEs war nie leichter, erstklassige Bilder aufzunehmen. Mit dem hervorragenden Automatikmodus werden Belichtung und andere Kameraeinstellungen f\u00fcr optimale Ergebnisse in nahezu jeder Situation angepasst. Der High-Speed-Autofokus h\u00e4lt Ihr Motiv f\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Ergebnisse fest.\\n\\n<b>Tolle Bilder, auch bei schlechtem Licht<\/b>\\nViele Kameras versagen bei schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen. Der Exmor R CMOS Sensor hingegen erh\u00f6ht die Empfindlichkeit bei gleichzeitiger Unterdr\u00fcckung von Bildrauschen und sorgt so f\u00fcr brillante und detailreiche Bilder.\\n\\n<b>Wissen, wo Sie sind \u2026 und wo Sie waren<\/b>\\nWenn Sie den Aufnahmeort Ihrer Fotos und Videoclips kennen, macht jede Reise gleich noch viel mehr Spa\u00df. Wenn Sie unterwegs sind, wird die entsprechende Position mithilfe von GPS mit Kompass auf dem Bildschirm angezeigt. Wieder zuhause k\u00f6nnen Sie mit tollen Online-Karten auf Ihrem PC dann genau nachverfolgen, wo Sie waren."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>High-performance Cyber-shot with powerful 20x zoom and macro shooting<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Your powerful travel partner<\/b>\\n\\nPacked with easy-to-use features for better-looking images and HD videos, the compact, high-zoom Cyber-shot HX30V with Extra High Sensitivity Technology and GPS is your ideal travel partner. Experience detail-packed stills, 3D and Full HD 50p video.\\n\\n<b>Bring the action even closer<\/b>\\nFrom action packed sports scenes to thrilling close-ups of distant wildlife: fill the frame with stunningly detailed images. Clear Image Zoom doubles 20x optical zoom to an incredible 40x magnification while maintaining flawless picture quality.\\n\\n<b>Magical movies<\/b>\\nJust touch a button and shoot brilliantly crisp, detailed Full HD video clips: you'll enjoy stable, blur-free images even while walking or zooming. Record 50 Full HD (1920x1080) frames every second to capture silky-smooth, cinematic action.\\n\\n<b>DSLR-style results made easy<\/b>\\nIt's never been easier to achieve superb images. Superior Auto Mode adjusts exposure and other camera settings for optimum results in virtually any situation.High-speed autofocus locks onto your subject for pin-sharp results.\\n\\n<b>Sensational images, even in low light<\/b>\\nMany cameras struggle to produce crisp, clear images in low light. The high-resolution Exmor R CMOS sensor boosts sensitivity while reducing image noise for brilliant, detail-packed pictures.\\n\\n<b>Know where you are\u2026 and where you\u2019ve been<\/b>\\nKnowing where your photos and videos were taken adds a fun dimension to any trip. GPS with Compass displays your position on screen while you\u2019re travelling. Back home, retrace your travels with exciting online map views on your PC."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":20}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f26f1492-432a-4e19-b01e-6303bf3c59af","identifier":"13349246","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PIXMA MX715"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- 4-in-1 Multifunktionssystem mit Single Ink, LAN + WLAN: Drucken, Kopieren, Scannen und Faxen\\n- Bis 9.600 dpi, bis zu 1Pikoliter feine Tintentr\u00f6pfchen\\n- Ca. 12,5 \/ 9,3 ISO-Seiten\/Min. (SW\/Farbe)\\n- Unterst\u00fctzt Apple AirPrint und das Drucken von passenden Smartphones\\n- 6,2 cm TFT-Display und bifunktionales Bedienfeld\\n- Dokumenteneinzug f\u00fcr bis zu 35 Blatt auch beidseitig\\n- Automatischer beidseitiger Druck und 2 Papierzuf\u00fchrungen\\n- 5 separate Tintentanks inkl. Textschwarz\\n- Scan-to-USB-Stick, Faxempfang auf USB-Stick oder Speicherkarte\\n- Umfangreiches Softwarepaket mit Full HD Movie Print\\n- Das Single-Ink Multifunktionssystem mit Duplex-Funktionalit\u00e4t\\n\\n<b>Ideal f\u00fcr zu Hause und das B\u00fcro<\/b>\\nLAN- und WLAN-Schnittstelle pr\u00e4destinierten dieses elegante, schwarze Multifunktionssystem zur gemeinsamen Nutzung beim Drucken, Scannen, Kopieren und Faxen und das von praktisch \u00fcberall im Haus oder im B\u00fcro. Durch die Unterst\u00fctzung von Apple AirPrint k\u00f6nnen Sie ganz einfach (ohne Treiberinstallation) von Ihrem iPad und iPhone drucken. Canon iEPP \u2013 als kostenlose App im Apple App-Store erh\u00e4ltlich \u2013 erweitert die M\u00f6glichkeiten \u00fcber WLAN zu drucken und neuerdings sogar zum iPhone, iPad und iPod touch zu scannen. Auch f\u00fcr Android Mobilsysteme stellt Canon im Android Market ein kostenloses App zur Verf\u00fcgung.\\n\\n<b>Schnelles Handling Ihrer Dokumente<\/b>\\nDer Automatische Dokumenteneinzug mit Duplexfunktion (DADF) f\u00fcr bis zu 35 Blatt erleichtert das Verarbeiten umfangreicher, auch beidseitig bedruckter Vorlagen. Die M\u00f6glichkeit Scans direkt als Kompakt-PDF zu speichern ist u. a. ideal zum Archivieren oder f\u00fcr E-Mail-Anh\u00e4nge.\\n\\n<b>Eindrucksvolle Geschwindigkeit<\/b>\\nDie Druckgeschwindigkeit von Dokumenten betr\u00e4gt ca. 12,5 ISO-Seiten pro Minute in Schwarzwei\u00df bzw. ca. 9,3 ISO-Seiten pro Minute in Farbe. Ein randloses Foto im Format 10 x 15 cm ist in ca. 20 Sekunden gedruckt; eine DIN A4 Seite in nur 14 Sekunden kopiert. Dank der Quick Start-Technologie ist dieses Multifunktionssystem nur wenige Sekunden nach dem Einschalten einsatzbereit.\\n\\n<b>Bedienerfreundlich<\/b>\\nEin 6,2 Zoll gro\u00dfes TFT-Farbdisplay erleichtert den Zugriff auf ausgew\u00e4hlte Funktionen und die Vorschau von Bildern. Das bifunktionale Bedienfeld hat zweifach belegte LED-Tasten. Je nach gew\u00e4hltem Betriebsmodus \u00e4ndert sich die Tastenanzeige; die Tastenanzahl konnte so deutlich reduziert werden.\\n\\n<b>Singe Ink Technologie<\/b>\\nDer PIXMA MX715 verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber 5 separate Tintentanks. Wenn eine Farbe ausgeht, muss nur der entsprechende Tank ausgewechselt werden. Das ist effizient und wirtschaftlich.\\n\\n<b>Umweltfreundlich und sparsam<\/b>\\nMit dem automatischen Duplexdruck sparen Sie nicht nur Papier, weil dieses beidseitig bedruckt werden kann, sondern reduzieren damit auch den CO2 Aussto\u00df.\\n\\n<b>Exzellente Laborqualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nDer FINE-Druckkopf von Canon sorgt mit Mikrod\u00fcsen f\u00fcr bis zu 1 Pikoliter feine Tintentr\u00f6pfchen f\u00fcr eine Druckaufl\u00f6sung von bis zu 9.600 dpi \u2013 Farbdrucke sind beeindruckend detailreich.\\n\\n<b>Direktscan auf USB-Stick oder Speicherkarte<\/b>\\nVorn am Multifunktionssystem befinden sich eine USB-Schnittstelle und Speicherkartensteckplatz. Dokumente k\u00f6nnen direkt \u2013 ohne den Umweg \u00fcber den PC \u2013 auf einen hier angebrachten USB-Stick oder eine kompatible Karte gespeichert werden"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- All-In-One with fax, Wi-Fi & Ethernet\\n- Stylish black design\\n- Dual Function panel\\n- 35-sheet Duplex ADF\\n- 5 Single Ink Tanks\\n- ISO ESAT 12.5 ipm mono\/9.3 ipm colour\\n- Up to 9600 dpi\\n- ISO A4 Copy: 14 seconds\\n- Auto Duplex Print\\n- Scan to USB memory without a PC\\n- Quality, speed and functionality in one powerful All-In-One\\n\\n\\n<b>Ideal for home and office<\/b>\\nWi-Fi and Ethernet connectivity make this stylish black All-In-One easy for everyone to share and print, scan, copy and fax from virtually anywhere in the home or office. Apple AirPrint support allows you to print directly from iPad and iPhone.\\n\\n<b>High-speed document handling<\/b>\\nLarge double-sided documents can be automatically scanned, copied or faxed with the fully integrated, 35-sheet Duplex Automatic Document Feeder (DADF). Scan and save to a \u2018compact PDF' is ideal for archiving or emailing.\\n\\n<b>Impressive speeds<\/b>\\nEnjoy print speeds of 12.5 ipm mono or 9.3 ipm colour. A photolab-quality 10x15 cm borderless photo is printed in approximately 20 seconds, while an A4 page copies in just 14 seconds. Quick Start means this All-In-One is ready to go seconds after switching on.\\n\\n<b>Easy to work with<\/b>\\nA 6.2cm colour TFT display makes it easy to view selected functions and preview images. The Dual Function Panel features LED-lit dual purpose keys. These keys change appearance according to the mode selected, reducing the number of physical keys on the product.\\n\\n<b>Economical, single Ink tanks<\/b>\\nFor greater economy, the PIXMA MX715 has 5 single ink tanks. When a colour runs out, only this single tank needs replacing.\\n\\n<b>Go green and save<\/b>\\nSee how much paper and CO2 you save using the Auto Duplex Print feature that automatically prints both sides of the paper.\\n\\n<b>Superb photolab-quality<\/b>\\nCanon's FINE technology, with minimum 1pl ink droplets, delivers up to 9600dpi print resolution for amazingly detailed colour photos and images.\\n\\n<b>Scan to USB or memory card<\/b>\\nUsing the USB and memory card port on the front, documents can be saved directly without the need to connect to a PC."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Multifonction avec t\u00e9l\u00e9copieur et connexions Wi-Fi et Ethernet\\n- Design noir \u00e9l\u00e9gant\\n- Panneau de commande \u00e0 double fonction\\n- Chargeur automatique de documents recto verso 35 feuilles\\n- 5 r\u00e9servoirs d'encre individuels\\n- ESAT ISO 12,5 ipm en noir et blanc \/ 9,3 ipm en couleur\\n- R\u00e9solution maximale de 9600 dpi\\n- Copie A4 ISO : 14 secondes\\n- Impression recto verso automatique\\n- Num\u00e9risez vos documents vers une cl\u00e9 USB, sans ordinateur\\n- Qualit\u00e9, rapidit\u00e9 et fonctionnalit\u00e9s r\u00e9unies dans un multifonction aux performances exceptionnelles\\n\\n<b>La solution id\u00e9ale pour la maison et le bureau<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi et Ethernet de cet \u00e9l\u00e9gant multifonction noir, tout le monde peut se le partager et imprimer, num\u00e9riser, copier et t\u00e9l\u00e9copier des documents depuis quasiment n'importe quel endroit de la maison ou du bureau, en toute simplicit\u00e9. La prise en charge d'Apple AirPrint vous permet d'imprimer directement depuis votre iPad ou votre iPhone.\\n\\n<b>Gestion rapide des documents<\/b>\\nLe chargeur automatique recto verso de 35 feuilles int\u00e9gr\u00e9 permet de num\u00e9riser, copier et t\u00e9l\u00e9copier automatiquement des documents recto verso volumineux. La fonction de num\u00e9risation et d'enregistrement au format Compact PDF est id\u00e9ale pour l'archivage ou l'envoi par voie \u00e9lectronique de documents.\\n\\n<b>Une vitesse impressionnante<\/b>\\nB\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une vitesse d'impression de 12,5 ipm en noir et blanc et de 9,3 ipm en couleur. L'impression d'une photo sans marge de 10 \u00d7 15 cm de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle prend environ 20 secondes, tandis qu'une copie au format A4 n\u00e9cessite seulement 14 secondes. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie Quick Start, le multifonction est pr\u00eat \u00e0 fonctionner quelques secondes apr\u00e8s sa mise sous tension.\\n\\n<b>Simplicit\u00e9 d'utilisation<\/b>\\nUn grand \u00e9cran TFT couleur de 6,2 cm am\u00e9liore la visibilit\u00e9 des fonctions s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9es et facilite la visualisation des images. Le panneau de commande \u00e0 double fonction int\u00e8gre des touches \u00e0 LED \u00e0 deux fonctions. Ces touches changent d'apparence en fonction du mode s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9, ce qui r\u00e9duit le nombre de touches physiques sur le produit.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9servoirs d'encre s\u00e9par\u00e9s \u00e9conomiques<\/b>\\nLe PIXMA MX715 est dot\u00e9 de 5 r\u00e9servoirs d'encre individuels, pour encore plus d'\u00e9conomies. Lorsqu'une couleur est \u00e9puis\u00e9e, il suffit de remplacer le r\u00e9servoir correspondant.\\n\\n<b>Agissez pour la plan\u00e8te et r\u00e9alisez des \u00e9conomies<\/b>\\nD\u00e9couvrez combien de papier et de CO2 vous \u00e9conomisez gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction d'impression recto verso automatique qui imprime automatiquement sur les deux faces d'une feuille de papier.\\n\\n<b>Une qualit\u00e9 professionnelle d'exception<\/b>\\nLa technologie FINE de Canon utilise des gouttelettes d'encre de 1 pl minimum et une r\u00e9solution d'impression pouvant atteindre 9600 dpi, pour des photos et des images couleur aux d\u00e9tails stup\u00e9fiants.\\n\\n<b>Num\u00e9risation vers une carte m\u00e9moire ou une cl\u00e9 USB<\/b>\\nLes ports USB et carte m\u00e9moire situ\u00e9s \u00e0 l'avant de l'appareil permettent d'enregistrer les documents directement, sans avoir \u00e0 se connecter \u00e0 un ordinateur."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1f9d44f6-3beb-4a38-89ad-8d406227aa6d","identifier":"13353187","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","trust"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust Ricaro"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Tragbarer Lautsprecher f\u00fcr die drahtlose Wiedergabe von Musik von Ihrem Notebook, PC, iPhone\/Smartphone oder iPad\/Tablet\\n\\n- Tragbarer Lautsprecher f\u00fcr die drahtlose Wiedergabe von Musik von Ihrem Notebook, PC, iPhone\/Smartphone oder iPad\/Tablet\\n- Netz- oder Batteriebetrieb f\u00fcr ortsungebundene Wiedergabe, sogar unterwegs\\n- Ausgezeichnete Tonqualit\u00e4t mit leistungsstarken 30 W Ausgangsspitzenleistung (15 W RMS)\\n- Bluetooth-Technologie f\u00fcr einfachen Anschluss und eine Funkverbindung mit einer Reichweite von bis zu 10 Metern\\n- Leicht zug\u00e4ngliche Lautst\u00e4rkeregelung und Wiedergabe-\/Pausesteuerung an der Vorderseite\\n- Extraeingang f\u00fcr iPod oder MP3-Player (Kabel inbegriffen)"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Portable speaker to wirelessly play music from your notebook, PC, iPhone\/smartphone or iPad\/tablet\\n\\n- 15 Watt RMS\\n- Bluetooth\u00ae technology\\n- Wall or battery powered\\n- 10 meter wireless range\\n- Volume controle on front side\\n- extra input for MP3\/iPod\/iPhone (including cable)"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Haut-parleur portable permettant de diffuser sans fil de musique \u00e0 partir de votre ordinateur portable, PC, iPhone\/smartphone ou iPad\/tablette\\n\\n- Haut-parleur portable permettant de diffuser sans fil de musique \u00e0 partir de votre ordinateur portable, PC, iPhone\/smartphone ou iPad\/tablette\\n- Alimentation secteur ou sur batterie permettant de diffuser de la musique n'importe o\u00f9, m\u00eame en voiture\\n- D\u00e9livre un son st\u00e9r\u00e9o de haute qualit\u00e9 avec une puissance de cr\u00eate de 30 W (15 W RMS)\\n- Technologie Bluetooth pour une connexion simplifi\u00e9e et une port\u00e9e sans fil jusqu'\u00e0 10 m\u00e8tres\\n- Commandes de volume et de lecture\/pause facilement accessibles sur la fa\u00e7ade\\n- Entr\u00e9e suppl\u00e9mentaire pour iPod ou lecteur MP3 (c\u00e2ble fourni)"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-05T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2ed8c190-4dcd-4dd6-aa08-a3cdc8831b2c","identifier":"13353432","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lg","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG E2242T-BN"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>SUPER LED-Monitor mit 54,61 cm (21,5 Zoll) Bildschirmdiagonale, schlankem Hairline-Design und Mega-Kontrast<\/b>\\nErleben Sie mit dem LG E2242T alle Vorteile der SUPER LED-Technologie: nat\u00fcrliche Farbbrillanz, ultrahoher Kontrast und tiefes Schwarz. Das schnelle Full HD-Panel \u00fcberzeugt zudem mit einer schnellen Reaktionszeit von nur 5 ms, dem 170\u00b0 gro\u00dfen Blickwinkel und einem Kontrastverh\u00e4ltnis von 5.000.000:1. Der zukunftssichere DVI-D-Anschluss mit HDCP-Kopierschutzunterst\u00fctzung und der analoge 15 Pin D-Sub-Anschluss f\u00fcr \u00e4ltere Ger\u00e4te sorgen f\u00fcr optimale Konnektivit\u00e4t. Dank vereinfachtem Kabelmanagement bleibt Ihnen dabei ab sofort l\u00e4stiges Kabelgewirr auf dem Schreibtisch erspart. Senken Sie au\u00dferdem durch die Super Energy Saving Plus-Funktion Ihren Energieverbrauch um bis zu 30 % gegen\u00fcber herk\u00f6mmlichen LED-Ger\u00e4ten \u2013 ohne jeglichen Performanceverlust."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>PREPARE TO BE DAZZLED.<\/b>\\nWant deeper blacks and richer colors? LG's LED technology provides even greater control of brightness and delivers better contrast, amazing clarity and color detail, as well as greater energy efficiency compared to conventional LCD monitors.\\n\\n<b>ULTRA SLIM DESIGN<\/b>\\nYou'll love the stunning picture while it's on and marvel at its appearance when it's off. It\u2019s a sleek, elegant design that will appeal to even the most refined sense of style.\\n\\n<b>DOUBLE THE DETAIL.<\/b>\\nThis stunning picture is the reason you wanted HD in the first place. With almost double the pixel resolution, Full HD 1080p gives it superior picture quality over standard resolution. You\u2019ll see details and colors like never before.\\n\\n<b>SAVE MORE THAN ENERGY.<\/b>\\nEarning the ENERGY STAR means a product meets strict energy efficiency guidelines set by the US Environmental Protection Agency and the Department of Energy. For Monitors, it means they save energy both in standby and active (when they're on) modes. ENERGY STAR qualified Monitors use about 25% less energy than standard units."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Moniteur LED Full HD 21,5 pouces (54cm)<\/b>\\nLes moniteurs LG de la s\u00e9rie E42 font rimer informatique et intelligence. Ces \u00e9crans haut de gamme 16\/9\u00e8me et Full HD int\u00e8grent une suite compl\u00e8te de fonctionnalit\u00e9s intuitives. Ainsi, nos \u00e9crans informatiques ont la facult\u00e9 d\u2019ajuster leur luminosit\u00e9 selon l\u2019intensit\u00e9 lumineuse ambiante. Les moniteurs E42 sont \u00e9galement \u00ab design \u00bb avec une esth\u00e9tique proche de celle des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs : tons noirs laqu\u00e9s, lignes \u00e9l\u00e9gantes et sobres\u2026 Disponibles en 22, 23, 24 pouces et 27 pouces."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9935c749-8100-4357-8356-9f4438d240d1","identifier":"13353434","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lg","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG E2442T-BN"}],"description":[{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Les moniteurs LG de la s\u00e9rie E42 font rimer informatique et intelligence. Ces \u00e9crans haut de gamme 16\/9\u00e8me et Full HD int\u00e8grent une suite compl\u00e8te de fonctionnalit\u00e9s intuitives. Ainsi, nos \u00e9crans informatiques ont la facult\u00e9 d\u2019ajuster leur luminosit\u00e9 selon l\u2019intensit\u00e9 lumineuse ambiante. Les moniteurs E42 sont \u00e9galement \u00ab design \u00bb avec une esth\u00e9tique proche de celle des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs : tons noirs laqu\u00e9s, lignes \u00e9l\u00e9gantes et sobres\u2026 Disponibles en 22, 23, 24 pouces et 27 pouces."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e39833cc-ebdc-4d16-9dcf-0c2f451dae65","identifier":"13354736","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 32PFL4007H"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Entspannen Sie sich, und genie\u00dfen Sie einen gro\u00dfartigen Fernsehabend in brillanter LED-Qualit\u00e4t mit dem Philips Full HD LED-Fernseher 32PFL4007. Dank Pixel Plus HD k\u00f6nnen Sie mit Smart TV Plus eine Welt verschiedener Inhalte in klaren, lebendigen Bildern entdecken."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Relax and enjoy a great TV night with Full HD LED and Smart TV<\/b>\\nRelax and enjoy a great TV night in brilliant LED quality on the Philips 32PFL4007 Full HD LED TV. Powered by the Pixel Plus HD engine, you can enjoy a world of content with Smart TV Plus in clear, vivid details.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy a world of content with Smart TV Plus<\/b>\\n- Easy wireless connection with optional wireless USB adaptor\\n- A wealth of online apps, videos to rent and catch-up TV\\n- Control the TV with your smart phone, tablet or keyboard\\n- With DLNA, enjoy photos, music and movies on your TV\\n- Find, schedule, record & pause TV\\n- Enjoy video calls on your TV and be close to your loved ones\\n\\n<b>A clear, vivid picture everytime<\/b>\\n- Full HD TV with Pixel Plus HD for better details and clarity\\n- Brilliant LED images with incredible contrast\\n- 200Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) for superb motion sharpness\\n\\n<b>Complete digital connectivity made simple<\/b>\\n- 3 USB slots for fantastic multimedia playback\\n- PC input allows you to use your TV as a PC monitor\\n- Seamless connectivity with 4 HDMI inputs and Easylink"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"D\u00e9tendez-vous et profitez d'une soir\u00e9e t\u00e9l\u00e9 r\u00e9ussie avec le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur LED Full HD Philips 32PFL4007 aux superbes images LED. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie Pixel Plus HD Engine, profitez de toute une gamme de contenus diff\u00e9rents via la fonction Smart TV Plus, avec une image aux d\u00e9tails nets et \u00e9clatants."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"39ba831b-7227-41d8-84f4-63cabc5a19f8","identifier":"13354763","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips GoGEAR SoundDot 2GB"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Swingen Sie zur Musik vom kleinen und farbenfrohen GoGEAR Sounddot MP3-Player. Er verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber einen integrierten Clip zur Befestigung an Ihrer Kleidung sowie \u00fcber LED- und Soundanzeigen f\u00fcr eine einfache Navigation. \u00dcbertragen Sie Musik \u00fcber Direct USB, und genie\u00dfen Sie dank FastCharge eine schnelle Aufladung."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Music becomes more fun<\/b>\\n\\nWith color choices, all ready to wear\\n\\nJive to the small and colorful GoGEAR Sounddot MP3 player. It comes with a built-in clip\\nfor attachment to clothes and the LED and sound indicators for easy navigation. Transfer\\nmusic via Direct USB and enjoys FastCharge for quick charging.\\n\\nComplements your life\\n\\n- Small, colorful and stylish like a fashion accessory\\n- Built-in clip for convenient and hands-free use\\n- Sound and LED indicators for charging and easy navigation\\n- Enjoy up to 6 hours of music playback\\n\\nEasy and intuitive\\n\\n- Philips Songbird: one simple program to discover, play, sync\\n- Quick 6-minute charge for 60 minutes of play\\n- Direct USB for easy file transfers - without cables"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Dansez avec votre baladeur MP3 GoGEAR SoundDot compact et color\u00e9. Il est \u00e9quip\u00e9 d'un clip de fixation aux v\u00eatements, tandis que son voyant et son indicateur sonore facilitent la navigation. Transf\u00e9rez votre musique via USB Direct et profitez d'une charge rapide gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie FastCharge."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-06T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"71fdb92a-34e8-4517-993c-9f9ddaceaaa9","identifier":"13356671","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","sony","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony KDL-46HX750 LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Realistische Bilder in 2D und 3D<\/b>\\n\\nNehmen Sie Platz, und bereiten Sie sich auf ein atemberaubendes 3D-Erlebnis mit hervorragender Bildqualit\u00e4t sowie faszinierendes Fernsehen in 2D vor. \u00dcbertragen Sie ein umfangreiches Angebot an Online-Unterhaltung, Apps und Services auf den kontrastreichen LED-Bildschirm. Freuen Sie sich auf noch mehr Leben und Unterhaltung in Ihrem Wohnzimmer.\\n\\n<b>Sch\u00e4rfere 2D-HD- und 3D-Bilder<\/b>\\n\\nOb Sie nun \u00fcber das Internet fernsehen, einen Ihrer Lieblingsfilme auf DVD oder ein Heimvideo ansehen, mit X-Reality erreichen Sie nahezu HD-Qualit\u00e4t. Wir haben mithilfe eines 4x High-Speed-3D-Displays auch gestochen scharfe und nat\u00fcrliche 3D-Filme geschaffen, bei denen jedes Bild auf dem LED-Bildschirm hinsichtlich Beleuchtung und Kontrast optimal ausgerichtet wird.\\n\\n<b>Drahtloser Zugriff auf Online-Entertainment<\/b>\\n\\nGreifen Sie entweder \u00fcber die Fernbedienung Ihres Fernsehers oder mobilen Ger\u00e4ts (mit Spracherkennung) auf Sony Entertainment Network zu, wo Sie HD-Filme, Millionen Musiktitel, Ihre Lieblings-Fernsehsender wiedergeben k\u00f6nnen, und Sie einen Webbrowser und Apps wie z. B. Twitter\u2122, Facebook\u00ae, YouTube\u2122 und Skype\u2122 nutzen k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>Klare Linien, flaches Design<\/b>\\n\\nVerleihen Sie Ihrem Raum einen vollst\u00e4ndig neuen Look mit dem smarten und minimalistischen Fernseher mit klaren Linien und schnittigem Design.\\n\\n<b>Energiesparfunktionen f\u00fcr Fernseher<\/b>\\n\\nDank der neuen LED Frame Dimming Funktion wird Energie eingespart, indem die Hintergrundbeleuchtung auf intelligente Weise an die entsprechende Situation angepasst wird. Freuen Sie sich also auf gestochen scharfe, kontrastreiche Fernsehbilder bei geringerem Energieverbrauch. Den Unterschied werden Sie an Ihrer Stromrechnung erkennen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Add a new dimension to watch TV<\/b>\\n\\n- Crisp, detailed picture and Full HD 3D\\n- Wi-Fi for easy access to catch-up TV, movies & apps\\n- Light design with clean lines and slim edge\\n\\n- See every detail with Full HD 2D and 3D - Get totally immersed in the action with smooth, highly detailed 2D and 3D Full High Definition viewing.\\n- Natural colours and clear, detailed pictures - See crisp detail with no degradation or noise, even for Standard Definition pictures, with the X-Reality picture engine.\\n- Ultra-smooth action with 4x High Speed 3D Panel - When you\u2019re watching any 3D content, enjoy a smooth, high quality picture with minimised blurring and cross-talk.\\n- Watch comfortably with Auto 3D Depth Adjustment - Watch for hours with more relaxed 3D viewing and less eye strain.\\n- Smooth action scenes with Motionflow XR 400Hz - Follow the action at the equivalent of 400 frames a second and catch every detail as it happens.\\n- Dynamic Edge LED with Frame Dimming - Get a high quality picture with improved contrast in an LED screen that uses less power.\\n- Built-in Wi-Fi to easily connect to the Internet - Stream entertainment from your wireless home network and the Internet without the clutter of cables.\\n- Easily connect to the web on your TV - Stream full-screen movies, music, Internet videos, apps, and access social networks on the Sony Entertainment Network.\\n- Ready for video and voice calls with Skype\u2122 - Add a voice control camera and microphone and make free Skype\u2122 calls to friends and family from the comfort of your sofa.\\n- Surf the web through your TV - Go online to browse text and picture-based Internet pages through your TV."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Profitez pleinement de vos contenus en 2D ou en 3D<\/b>\\n\\nAccrochez-vous \u00e0 votre si\u00e8ge et pr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 l'exp\u00e9rience 3D la plus immersive possible avec une qualit\u00e9 d'image et une visualisation en 2D incomparables. Diffusez tous vos contenus, applications et services en ligne sur un \u00e9cran LED \u00e0 contraste \u00e9lev\u00e9. Encore plus de divertissement dans votre salon.\\n\\n<b>Des images plus nettes en 2D HD et en 3D<\/b>\\n\\nQue vous soyez en train de regarder la TV en ligne, votre DVD favori ou une vid\u00e9o personnelle, les images sont plus nettes et plus proches de la HD gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 X-Reality. Nous avons aussi donn\u00e9 \u00e0 la 3D plus de clart\u00e9 et de naturel gr\u00e2ce aux 4 \u00e9crans 3D haute vitesse, o\u00f9 chaque image est ajust\u00e9e sur l'\u00e9cran LED pour une luminosit\u00e9 et un contraste d'exception.\\n\\n<b>Le divertissement en ligne sans fil<\/b>\\n\\nUtilisez votre t\u00e9l\u00e9commande TV ou votre t\u00e9l\u00e9phone portable (avec reconnaissance vocale) pour acc\u00e9der au r\u00e9seau Sony Entertainment Network et profiter de films en HD, de millions de chansons, de vos cha\u00eenes TV pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9es, d'un navigateur Web et d'applications telles que Twitter\u2122, Facebook\u00ae, YouTube\u2122 ou encore Skype\u2122.\\n\\n<b>D\u00e9couvrez notre nouveau mod\u00e8le a\u00e9rien<\/b>\\n\\nLe design de la s\u00e9rie HX75 associe des mat\u00e9riaux contrast\u00e9s et des contours parfaitement int\u00e9gr\u00e9s. Vous serez surpris par la l\u00e9g\u00e8ret\u00e9 de ce t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur. Son support chevalet peut \u00eatre orient\u00e9 verticalement ou horizontalement pour un angle de visualisation optimal.\\n\\n<b>Fonctions d'\u00e9conomie d'\u00e9nergie<\/b>\\n\\nNotre nouvelle technologie LED \u00e0 variation d'image permet de r\u00e9duire la consommation d'\u00e9nergie en r\u00e9glant automatiquement le niveau de r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage en fonction de la sc\u00e8ne. Profitez d'un contraste et d'une nettet\u00e9 incomparables tout en consommant moins d'\u00e9nergie. Vous constaterez une r\u00e9elle diff\u00e9rence \u00e0 la fin du mois."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b2662078-97c7-49ec-a700-a06539b6391b","identifier":"13356843","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","logitech","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech X-140"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>With real-time bass equalization and a two-driver design for deeper bass, these PC speakers let you feel the beat.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Two-driver speakers<\/b>\\nYou\u2019ll experience deeper bass while saving space on your desk thanks to the slim profile. Watt? Learn more about audio terminology and what it means for you.\\n\\n<b>Real-time bass equalization<\/b>\\nEqualization gives you more bass response with less distortion.\\n\\n<b>Auxiliary input<\/b>\\nA 3.5 mm stereo jack lets you connect your iPod\u00ae, CD, DVD, or MP3 player with the included cable.\\n\\n<b>Stereo headphone jack<\/b>\\nWhen you want to listen privately, you just plug in your headphones.\\n\\n<b>Integrated controls<\/b>\\nYou can easily control power, tone, and volume to listen how and when you like."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-06T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d108c06d-caf6-4897-b28b-baa44070cef9","identifier":"13359777","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"c\/a\/1\/c\/ca1c89256ca8f7bb94233431054fe964af74d7ee_13359777_233.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/c\/a\/1\/c\/ca1c89256ca8f7bb94233431054fe964af74d7ee_13359777_233.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R36"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Share your stories effortlessly with Wi-Fi\\n\\nIt\u2019s easy to get close to the action in superb Full HD with the compact LEGRIA HF R36. Share your creations effortlessly with Wi-Fi and enjoy steady footage with Intelligent IS.\\n\\n- Wi-Fi with MP4 support\\n- 51x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS\\n- Optical Intelligent IS\\n- Story Creator\\n- Cinema-look filters; Touch Decoration\\n- Store direct to external HDD\\n- 7.5cm touch screen\\n- Smart Auto, Face Detection\\n- HD-SD conversion\\n- 8GB memory, SDXC card slot"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Partagez vos histoires sans le moindre effort gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi\\n\\nPlongez au c\u0153ur de l'action dans une r\u00e9solution Full HD \u00e0 couper le souffle avec le cam\u00e9scope compact LEGRIA HF R36. Partagez vos cr\u00e9ations en toute simplicit\u00e9 \u00e0 l'aide de la connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi et b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une image stable gr\u00e2ce au stabilisateur d'image intelligent..\\nPoints forts\\n\\n- Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi avec prise en charge MP4\\n- Zoom perfectionn\u00e9 51x ; capteur CMOS Full HD\\n- Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent\\n- Cr\u00e9ation de Sc\u00e9narios\\n- Filtres effet Cin\u00e9ma ; fonction Touche D\u00e9coration\\n- Stockage direct sur disque dur externe\\n- \u00c9cran tactile de 7,5 cm\\n- Mode Smart Auto, d\u00e9tection de visage\\n- Conversion HD-SD\\n- M\u00e9moire de 8 Go ; logement pour carte SDXC"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fd8160b7-2113-4ca9-a0ad-d2e56ce4cc23","identifier":"1336006","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["iiyama","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"iiyama ProLite B1702S-B2"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 - 240 VAC, 50 - 60 Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The new \u2018B\u2019 series of displays from iiyama means what it stands for; Business. The impressive specification and feature set offers superb picture quality and flexibility for Business applications with integrated Height Adjustability in the stand. The core component is a high-grade TN panel with a 1.3 megapixel resolution, high contrast ratio and powerful brightness ensuring optimum picture quality. Comprising of both Analogue and Digital inputs with free Digital cable compatibility with your system is assured.  The PLB1702S is available in Black or Ivory."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-11-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":17,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"46101b15-40b9-4e59-b4fc-127c5f628da5","identifier":"1336418","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["fujitsu","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujitsu SCALEOVIEW Series L22W-9"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 - 230 VAC, 50 - 60 Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der SCALEOVIEW L22W-9 ist ein exzellentes 22-Zoll-TFT-Widescreen-Display f\u00fcr alle Anwendungen zu Hause und im Home-Office. E-mails schreiben, im Internet surfen, die neuesten Spiele ausprobieren oder DVDs anschauen wird durch das gro\u00dfe Widescreen-Format und die perfekte Bildwiedergabe besonders komfortabel. Der SCALEOVIEW L22W-9 beeindruckt mit brillanten Farben, gestochen scharfen Bildern und lebensechter Videodarstellung bei hoher Performance und sorgt so f\u00fcr ein beeindruckendes Seherlebnis. Sein schlankes und attraktives Design f\u00fcgt sich harmonisch in jedes Wohn-Umfeld ein."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Fujitsu SCALEOVIEW L22W-9, SCALEOVIEW Series. Display resolution: 1680 x 1050, Contrast ratio (typical): 1000:1, Pixel pitch: 0.282. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 100 x 100, Tilt angle: -5 - 20. Power requirements: 100 - 230 VAC, 50 - 60 Hz"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-11-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"116942db-8c9b-41a2-8ff9-7aec2eb9537e","identifier":"13373463","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 32LS570S LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>LED Smart TV mit Resolution Upscaler, USB Recording und 81 cm (32 Zoll) Bildschirmdiagonale<\/b>\\nFernsehger\u00e4te sind f\u00fcr's Fernsehen, und PCs f\u00fcr's Surfen im Netz: Diese Aufgabenverteilung war immer klar. Bis heute. Denn die neueste Smart TV-Technologie hebt diese Grenzen auf. Mit LGs 32LS570S k\u00f6nnen die Nutzer im Internet navigieren und verschiedene TV-optimierte Anwendungen genie\u00dfen. Das ausgestrahlte Fernsehprogramm wird so um die ganze Welt der Web-Inhalte erg\u00e4nzt."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"LG 32LS570S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. HDMI version: 1.4, Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Audio formats supported: AAC, AC3, HE-AAC, MP3, PCM. Smart modes: Cinema, Game, Standard, Vivid"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>UN \u00c9CRAN SMART TV RICHE EN CONTENUS !<\/b>\\n\\n<b>3D WORLD<\/b>\\nTout un nouvel univers de contenus 3D !\\nAcc\u00e9dez \u00e0 un univers 3D sans limite, \u00e0 port\u00e9e de votre t\u00e9l\u00e9commande Magic Control. !.\\nQue ce soient des films, du sport, des clips musicaux ou bien encore des jeux, il y en a pour tous les go\u00fbts dans le nouvel espace 3D des TV LG smart TV.\\n\\n<b>MAGIC REMOTE<\/b>\\nPointeur, Geste, Molette :\\nLa t\u00e9l\u00e9commande la plus intuitive et la plus \u00e9volu\u00e9e du march\u00e9.\\nPointeur: Pointez, cliquez, naviguez. Une t\u00e9lecommande intelligente pour votre Smart TV\\nGeste: Gagnez du temps gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 de simples gestes.\\nMolette: Fa\u00eetes d\u00e9filer vos pages internet de haut en bas , zoomer et d\u00e9zoomer gr\u00e2ce la molette comme avec une souris d'ordinateur.\\n\\n<b>HOME DASHBOARD<\/b>\\nLG a compris que la complixit\u00e9 est le pire ennemi du divertissement. C'est pourquoi les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs LG Smart TV ont \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7us pour offrir un environnement tr\u00e8s intuitif, \u00e9quip\u00e9 d'un tableau de bord exclusif qui vous permet de naviguer rapidement et simplement dans vos options de divertissement. Ce tableau de bord appel\u00e9 \"Home\" sert de menu principal au t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur LG Smart TV et est habilement con\u00e7u pour optimiser votre exp\u00e9rience d'utilisateur. .\\n\\n<b>UNIVERSAL SEARCH<\/b>\\nNe perdez plus de temps \u00e0 chercher !\\n\\n<b>D\u00e9couvrez la recherche universelle de la Smart TV LG.<\/b>\\nIl vous suffit d\u2019entrer un mot-cl\u00e9 et la recherche sera lanc\u00e9e parmi toutes les vid\u00e9os\/pages du Web et les p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques DLNA connect\u00e9s au m\u00eame r\u00e9seau. la meilleure fonctionnalit\u00e9 de recherche pour enrichir vos divertissements connect\u00e9s et simplifier votre utilisation !\\n\\n<b>SMART SHARE<\/b>\\nConsultez et partagez les contenus multim\u00e9dia de vos p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques USB ou DLNA, connect\u00e9s au m\u00eame r\u00e9seau que votre TV (box ou routeur). Partagez via Wi-Fi les contenus de votre PC, Tablette ou Smartphone.\\n\\n<b>WIRELESS DISPLAY<\/b>\\nUn partenariat exclusif entre Intel et LG Electronics : Dupliquez ais\u00e9ment votre \u00e9cran d\u2019ordinateur \u00e9quip\u00e9 de la technologie Intel WiDi sur votre TV LG Smart TV.\\n\\n<b>SOCIAL CENTER<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019application \u00ab Social Center \u00bb de votre Smart TV LG, vous \u00eates connect\u00e9 \u00e0 vos r\u00e9seaux sociaux depuis votre t\u00e9l\u00e9vision. suivez toutes les actualit\u00e9s de vos amis sur Facebook ou sur Twitter en toute simplicit\u00e9, comme avec un smart phone.\\n\\n<b>LED<\/b>\\nUne image de qualit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage LED !\\n\\n<b>MCI 200<\/b>\\nLe MCI ne concerne que les \u00e9crans LCD. Il s\u2019agit d\u2019un index qui permet de mesurer la qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019image en mouvement. Il est calcul\u00e9 \u00e0 partir de 3 crit\u00e8res :\\n\\n- La fr\u00e9quence native de l\u2019\u00e9cran : 50Hz, 100Hz, 200Hz\\n- Le type de r\u00e9tro \u00e9clairage utilis\u00e9 : LCD, LED, LED Plus, Nano Full LED\\n- La performance du traitement de l\u2019image : XD Engine\\n\\nPlus l\u2019index est \u00e9lev\u00e9, plus l\u2019image en mouvement est performante.\\n\\n<b>RESOLUTION UPSCALER<\/b>\\nAppr\u00e9ciez vos contenus en haute d\u00e9finition ! Il arrive tr\u00e8s souvent que des contenus provenant de sources externes (Internet , PC, Smartphone, Tablette) perdent de leur d\u00e9finition lors du visionnage TV. Avec la fonction LG \"Resolution Upscaler\", la d\u00e9finition du contenu initial est optimis\u00e9e \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran comme par magie."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8b0d847a-a4de-43f0-b727-1b342637877e","identifier":"13373480","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 47LS5600 LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Super-slim, eco-friendly and with a sharper, more detailed picture and stunning contrasts ratio, LED TV is a revolution in image quality and design and its low profile makes it perfect for wall-mounting.\\n\\n<b>INCREDIBLE CLARITY, VIBRANT COLOURS<\/b>\\n\\nFULL HD 1080p provides the pinnacle of picture resolution with incredible clarity and vibrant colours. With up to five times the resolution compared to standard definition TVs and twice that of \u2018HD-Ready\u2019 TVs, FULL HD 1080p is the only way to enjoy the full potential of Blu-ray and HD gaming.\\n\\nA TVs motion clarity index (MCI) gives you a comprehensive indicator of its ability to handle fast motion without blurring. LG\u2019s expertise here makes good use of detailed backlight scanning, advanced local dimming and a powerful clarity engine to deliver a lifelike, detailed picture every time.\\n\\n<b>ECO-FRIENDLY REVOLUTION<\/b>\\n\\nLG Intelligent Sensor technology automatically finds the optimal brightness, sharpness, colour and contrast picture settings to enhance the picture quality and reduce power consumption.\\n\\n<b>SEAMLESS NETWORKING<\/b>\\n\\nCreate a home network to talk to your PC, digital camera, mobile phone and even Blu-ray player. This connection to multiple DLNA certified devices anywhere in your home lets you to watch your favourite media directly on the big screen (ethernet connection from TV to Router required)\\n\\nHigh-Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI) carries both sound and picture in a single cable from your devices to your high definition TV. Now you can easily connect your games console, satellite box, Blu-ray or Home Cinema System through the three HDMI ports for a true high definition entertainment experience\\n\\nConnect your digital camera, M-P-3 player or USB stick through the USB port to show off your latest holiday snaps, music collection or High Definition movies for a true multimedia experience.\\n\\n<b>Get ready for the digital switch-over.<\/b>\\nAll LG TVs come with built-in Digital Freeview making sure you're ready for the digital switch-over. With LG TVs you'll have access to over 40 Freeview TV and radio channels, 8 day on-screen guide and access to digital interactive services.\\n\\nSmart Energy Saving technology controls the brightness of the TV to reduce the power consumption and therefore help you save money off your electricity bills. The Screen-Off function even lets you listen to music from the TV whilst the screen is off"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":47,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e1bc2595-384d-4be1-b369-3bc21a4de8af","identifier":"13374511","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"d\/6\/a\/9\/d6a9142b1c03750924b29eefb2e89ea993441666_13374511_5041.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/d\/6\/a\/9\/d6a9142b1c03750924b29eefb2e89ea993441666_13374511_5041.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung HMX-W300BP hand-held camcorder"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung HMX-W300BP. Sensor type: CMOS, Optical sensor size: 1\/3.3, Effective megapixels (image): 5.5. Camcorder media type: Memory card, Compatible memory cards: SD, SDHC. Focus adjustment: Auto, Normal focusing range: 0.04. ISO sensitivity: Auto. White balance: Auto"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":1}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7efc7f85-1288-484d-a4dc-8f55ac1da9cc","identifier":"13376026","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_letter_216_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark XS796dte"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Robust Color Output<\/b>\\nDesigned for busy color environments, the Lexmark XS796 Family delivers vibrant, professional quality output that is consistent from the first page to the last. \\n\\n- Lexmark Extra High Yield Print Cartridge available, offering yields of up to 20000 pages\\n- Print and copy at speeds as fast as 50 ppm in both black and color\\n- PANTONE calibration for consistent color tones\\n- Named Color Replacement for easy color matching\\n- Instant warm-up fuser to help reduce energy consumption and improve time to first page\\n\\n<b>Business Productivity<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark XS796 Family combines exceptional multifunction performance with time-saving applications designed to make you more productive. These MFPs can deliver the performance of much larger copiers, but with a smaller footprint and a more affordable price. \\n\\n- Duplex scanning to scan both sides of your documents in one pass\\n- Advanced copy functions let you interrupt long print runs to make a quick copy, and proof the first copy set before completing your copy job\\n- Scan to multiple destinations, including scan to email, scan to FTP, scan to fax, scan to network, and more\\n- Preloaded applications to drive greater efficiency, and Lexmark Embedded Solutions\\n- Framework to further extend the capabilities of the device\\n\\n<b>Easy and Intuitive<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark XS796 Family is designed for easy operation and maintenance. \\n\\n- Extra large, easy to navigate 10.2-inch color touch screen provides audible and tactile feedback to make completing tasks intuitive\\n- Print and scan preview features help you select documents or specific pages within a document\\n- Directional lights on the device provide visual cues to guide you through tasks\\n- Eco-friendly settings such as the Sleep Button and Hibernate Mode\\n- Available device fleet management software"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0adcebe9-6666-4117-a7e3-99e159b15508","identifier":"13378171","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon EOS 5D MARK III + EF 24-105mm f\/4L IS USM"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Vollformat-CMOS-Sensor mit 22,3 MP\\n- 61-Punkt-AF\\n- Reihenaufnahmen mit bis zu 6 B\/s\\n- ISO-Empfindlichkeit 100-25.600, erweiterbar auf ISO 50-102.400\\n- Full-HD-Videos mit manueller Steuerung\\n- 14-Bit DIGIC 5+ Prozessor\\n- Schutz gegen Umwelteinfl\u00fcsse\\n- 8,11 cm (3,2 Zoll) LCD, ca. 1.040.000 Bildpunkte\\n- HDR-Modus\\n- Vollformat-DSLR f\u00fcr Bilder mit 22,3 MP bei 6 B\/s und Full-HD-Videoaufzeichnung.\\n\\n<b>22,3 Megapixel Vollformat-Sensor<\/b>\\nHochwertige Aufnahmen mit enormer Detailvielfalt dank 22,3 MP CMOS-Sensor und DIGIC 5+ Bildprozessor. Farben werden mit nat\u00fcrlicher Intensit\u00e4t wiedergegeben und selbst in dunklen oder schattigen und extrem hellen Bereichen werden noch feinste Details dargestellt.\\n\\n<b>Erstklassige Leistung, selbst bei schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen<\/b>\\nDie EOS 5D Mark III liefert bei praktisch allen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen erstklassige Bilder. Dank einem ISO-Bereich von 100\u201325.600 (erweiterbar auf bis zu \u00cdSO 102.400) sind selbst nach Sonnenuntergang Aufnahmen ohne Stativ m\u00f6glich.\\n\\n<b>61-Punkt-Weitbereich-Autofokus<\/b>\\nSelbst wenn das Motiv sich nicht in der Mitte des Bildes befindet, sorgt der 61-Punkt-Weitbereich-Autofokus f\u00fcr eine schnelle und pr\u00e4zise Scharfstellung. 41 Kreuzsensoren (von denen 5 extra empfindliche Doppelkreuzsensoren sind) unterst\u00fctzen die pr\u00e4zise Sch\u00e4rfenachf\u00fchrung.\\n\\n<b>Schnelle Reihenaufnahmen<\/b>\\nReihenaufnahmen mit bis zu 6 B\/s fangen jede Action ein; diese Geschwindigkeit wird f\u00fcr bis zu 16.270 Bilder im JPEG-Format beibehalten (mit UDMA Speicherkarte der Kategorie 7).\\n\\n<b>High Dynamic Range (HDR) Aufnahmen<\/b>\\nHoher Detailreichtum auch in besonders dunklen oder hellen Bereichen erm\u00f6glicht die Erstellung von HDR-Aufnahmen direkt in der Kamera.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD-Videos mit manueller Steuerung<\/b>\\nDie Kamera bietet Full-HD-Videoaufzeichnung in 1.080p. Umfassende manuelle Steuerung und das umfassende Canon EF Objektiv-Sortiment erm\u00f6glichen eine Reihe von besonderen Cinema-Effekten.\\n\\n<b>Hochwertige Tonaufzeichnung<\/b>\\nEin hervorragendes Video braucht einen hervorragenden Ton. Die EOS 5D Mark III nimmt Stereoton mit 48 KHz auf und bietet manuelle Tonaussteuerung. \u00dcber eine Standard 3,5 mm Miniklinke kann ein externes Mikrofon angeschlossen werden. Eine weitere Buchse erm\u00f6glicht den Anschluss eines Kopfh\u00f6rers zur Tonkontrolle w\u00e4hrend der Aufnahme.\\n\\n<b>Kamera-interne Bearbeitung<\/b>\\nDer digitale Workflow kann schon lange vorm Nachhausekommen beginnen. Auf dem Kameramonitor k\u00f6nnen Bilder mit einem bis f\u00fcnf Sternen bewertet, oder zwei Aufnahmen nebeneinander verglichen werden. Auch bietet die Kamera eine interne RAW-Verarbeitung an \u2013 so kann eine Aufnahme in ein Schwarzwei\u00dfbild konvertiert werden oder der Wei\u00dfabgleich im Nachhinein ver\u00e4ndert werden.\\n\\n<b>Robuste und dennoch leichte Konstruktion<\/b>\\nDas Magnesiumgeh\u00e4use ist robust und haltbar, bringt jedoch kein \u00fcberfl\u00fcssiges Gewicht mit sich. Spezielle Versiegelung bietet Staub- und Feuchtigkeitsschutz."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Full-frame 22.3-megapixel sensor<\/b>\\nCapture high-quality images that are full of detail with a 22.3 megapixel CMOS sensor and DIGIC 5+ image processor. Colours are bright but natural, and fine detail is preserved even in dark shadow areas and bright highlights.\\n\\n<b>High-quality performance, even in low light<\/b>\\nThe EOS 5D Mark III delivers superb picture quality whatever the lighting conditions. Keep shooting hand-held even after the sun goes down, thanks to an ISO 100\u201325,600 sensitivity range (extendable to ISO 102,400).\\n\\n<b>61-point wide-area autofocus<\/b>\\nFocus quickly and accurately, even on off-centre subjects, with a 61 point wide-area autofocus system. 41 cross-type points (five of which are extra sensitive double-cross type) ensure highly accurate tracking of moving objects.\\n\\n<b>High-speed continuous shooting<\/b>\\nKeep up with the action at 6fps, recording up to 16,270 continuous JPEG images to a UDMA mode 7 card in a single burst.\\n\\n<b>High dynamic range imaging<\/b>\\nPreserve detail in highlight and shadow areas with in-camera HDR image creation.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD video with manual control<\/b>\\nEnjoy high quality Full HD video at 1080p resolution. Use manual controls and Canon\u2019s comprehensive EF lens range to achieve cinematic visual effects.\\n\\n<b>Great quality sound<\/b>\\nGive your video footage the soundtrack it deserves. The EOS 5D Mark III records digital stereo sound at 48KHz and offers manual control over audio level. A standard 3.5mm mic socket enables the use of third-party microphones; a headphone socket permits audio monitoring while recording.\\n\\n<b>In-camera editing functions<\/b>\\nBegin your digital editing workflow before you arrive back home. Rate your images on a scale of one to five and compare two images simultaneously on screen. Use in-camera Raw processing to explore creative possibilities \u2013 such as black & white conversion and retrospective white balance.\\n\\n<b>Built to go anywhere<\/b>\\nA magnesium chassis provides strength and durability without adding weight. Weather sealing offers protection against dust and moisture."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Capteur full frame de 22,3 millions de pixels<\/b>\\nPrenez des photos de haute qualit\u00e9 et d'une pr\u00e9cision in\u00e9gal\u00e9e gr\u00e2ce au capteur CMOS de 22,3 millions de pixels et au processeur d'image DIGIC 5+. Vous obtiendrez des couleurs \u00e0 la fois lumineuses et naturelles et vos photos regorgeront de d\u00e9tails, m\u00eame dans les zones sombres et de haute lumi\u00e8re.\\n\\n<b>Des performances exceptionnelles, m\u00eame en basse lumi\u00e8re<\/b>\\nLe EOS 5D Mark III offre une qualit\u00e9 d'image sup\u00e9rieure, quelles que soient les conditions d'\u00e9clairage. Vous pouvez continuer \u00e0 prendre des photos apr\u00e8s le coucher du soleil gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la plage de sensibilit\u00e9s de 100 \u00e0 25.600 ISO (possibilit\u00e9 d'extension jusqu'\u00e0 102.400 ISO).\\n\\n<b>Autofocus large zone \u00e0 61 collimateurs<\/b>\\nB\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une mise au point rapide et pr\u00e9cise, m\u00eame sur les sujets non centr\u00e9s, gr\u00e2ce au syst\u00e8me autofocus large zone \u00e0 61 collimateurs. 41 collimateurs de type crois\u00e9 (dont 5 de type double crois\u00e9 ultra-sensibles) garantissent un suivi extr\u00eamement pr\u00e9cis des sujets en mouvement.\\n\\n<b>Prise de vue en continu haute vitesse<\/b>\\nImmortalisez les actions les plus rapides gr\u00e2ce au syst\u00e8me de prise de vue \u00e0 6 im.\/s et enregistrez jusqu'\u00e0 16.270 images JPEG en rafale sur une carte UDMA 7.\\n\\n<b>Plage dynamique \u00e9lev\u00e9e<\/b>\\nLe syst\u00e8me de cr\u00e9ation d'images HDR (High Dynamic Range, plage dynamique \u00e9lev\u00e9e) int\u00e9gr\u00e9 offre une richesse de d\u00e9tails in\u00e9gal\u00e9e dans les zones sombres et lumineuses.\\n\\n<b>Vid\u00e9os Full HD avec contr\u00f4le manuel<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez des vid\u00e9os Full HD haute qualit\u00e9 en r\u00e9solution 1080p. Utilisez les commandes manuelles et la gamme compl\u00e8te d'objectifs EF de Canon pour cr\u00e9er des effets visuels de qualit\u00e9 cin\u00e9matographique.\\n\\n<b>Qualit\u00e9 sonore sup\u00e9rieure<\/b>\\nAccompagnez vos vid\u00e9os de la bande son qu'elles m\u00e9ritent. Le EOS 5D Mark III offre un enregistrement audio st\u00e9r\u00e9o num\u00e9rique \u00e0 48 KHz et vous permet de contr\u00f4ler manuellement le volume. La prise micro standard de 3,5 mm vous permet d'utiliser des micros tiers. Et gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la prise casque, vous pouvez contr\u00f4ler les r\u00e9glages audio pendant l'enregistrement.\\n\\n<b>Fonctions d'\u00e9dition int\u00e9gr\u00e9es<\/b>\\nCommencez \u00e0 retoucher vos photos avant m\u00eame de rentrer chez vous. Attribuez une note de 1 \u00e0 5 \u00e0 vos photos et comparez deux photos en les affichant c\u00f4te \u00e0 c\u00f4te \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran. Utilisez le traitement RAW int\u00e9gr\u00e9 pour exprimer votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9, par exemple en convertissant vos photos en noir et blanc ou en appliquant une balance des blancs vintage.\\n\\n<b>Conception tout terrain<\/b>\\nSon bo\u00eetier en magn\u00e9sium allie robustesse et durabilit\u00e9, sans aucun compromis en termes de l\u00e9g\u00e8ret\u00e9. Sa conception \u00e9tanche le prot\u00e8ge contre la poussi\u00e8re et l'humidit\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":4}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"40eca79c-083b-4b9f-90c9-dc6665b42802","identifier":"13378490","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S20B350H"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Breakthrough Picture Quality With LED Technology<\/b>\\n\\nSamsung's LED monitors deliver a visually stunning picture quality that leaves you speechless. Just as you\u2019ve seen in Samsung LED TV\u2019s, our LED monitors make colors more rich and the action more real than you\u2019ve dreamt possible. Let the story come to life with vivid colors and crystal-clear detail.\\n\\n<b>Ultra Slim Design with High Glossy Finish<\/b>\\n\\nRemember when you replaced your bulky CRT monitor with a slimmer LCD monitor? The next leap forward is here. Samsung LED technology enables striking, ultra-thin displays. As slim as 11.4 mm, LED monitors add elegance to your desk. They are also very lightweight, making them easy to lift and move.\\n\\n<b>Perfect Viewing from Every Angle<\/b>\\n\\nEnjoy a rich, high contrast image from various angles of view, whether you\u2019re viewing from straight on, above, below or the side. While the picture washes out on a normal monitor, Samsung MagicAngle offers consistently outstanding color and contrast.\\n\\n<b>Watch Full 1080p HD Video with HDMI<\/b>\\n\\nWatch Full 1080p HD Video with HDMI Monitors aren\u2019t just for computers any more. Now you can watch TV programs, movies, or play your game console on your monitor too. Simply select a monitor with an HDMI port and connect it to your cable box, BluRay player, HD game system, or any other device with an HDMI output. Best of all, you can connect your computer to a different video port (VGA) and switch back and forth without having to unplug anything. To switch between inputs, press the \u201cSource\u201d button on the monitor.\\n\\n<b>Rated EPEAT\u00ae Gold Standard<\/b>\\n\\nBy meeting and exceeding the highest green standards, this product has been rated GOLD by the EPEAT\u00ae. The rating is based on the environmental impact in a complete product lifecycle, so consumers can easily match high-performance electronics with green benefits. Earning this top rating means this product surpasses standard green criteria by at least 75%."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":20,"unit":"INCH"}}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":2}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f890d6da-1195-486f-836a-5272996daea6","identifier":"13378496","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung T22B350ND"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>2 in 1: HDTV<\/b>\\n<b>Monitor Combo<\/b>\\n\\nSamsung\u2019s high-performance TB350 Series LED HDTV monitor combo has all of the key features you would expect from a premium HDTV and a premium monitor. Samsung\u2019s LED backlighting provides an efficient, crystal-clear image and an Energy Star 5.0 rating. With the built-in DTV tuner, Picture-in-Picture (PiP) and ConnectShare\u2122 USB media player, the TB350 can also be the perfect way to watch all of your favorite TV programs as well as access movies, pictures and music without even turning your computer on.\\n\\n<b>Breakthrough Picture Quality<\/b>\\nSamsung's LED monitors deliver a visually stunning picture quality that leaves you speechless. Just as you\u2019ve seen in Samsung LED TV\u2019s, our LED monitors make colors more rich and the action more real than you\u2019ve dreamt possible. Let the story come to life with vivid colors and crystal-clear detail.\\n\\n<b>USB Media Player<\/b>\\nEliminate the need of turning on your PC or laptop to share your digital content with ConnectShare\u2122 USB media player. With ConnectShare\u2122, you can connect a USB memory drive or other USB device directly into the HDTV Monitor, and immediately access a wide range of digital content such as movies, photos, and music. ConnectShare\u2122 allows you to enjoy all the content you would normally access through your PC, now without your PC.\\n\\n<b>2 HDMI Inputs<\/b>\\nBuilt with two High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI) inputs, the Samsung HDTV Monitor can now be considered to be a complete multimedia entertainment center. HDMI provides high definition digital data from devices including set-top boxes, DVD and Blu-ray players, and gaming consoles, straight into your HDTV Monitor. Plus, you can use HDMI inputs to connect Mobile High-definition Link compatible devices such as mobile phones and portable consumer electronics to your Samsung HDTV monitor. That means you can now enjoy a wider variety of content at the highest quality."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"972e0c0e-ab0d-427d-a188-e589f000a5a6","identifier":"13378935","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","xtrememac"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"XtremeMac Tango Bar"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"XtremeMac\u2019s Tango Bar\u2122 speaker let\u2019s you enjoy audio from the computer like never before with cutting edge technology that delivers twice the output power of most traditional USB speakers. There is a six speaker configuration with dual dome tweeters, midrange drivers and passive radiators. Tango Bar\u2019s single USB connection for both power and audio can connect to any computer or wall charger USB port. The simple plug and play USB connection cleans up any workstation area by reducing cord clutter. Additional connections include a headphone output and line-in jack for personal listening or use with MP3 devices as well as an optional sub-out port.\\n\\n- 10W amplified USB powered technology\\n- Single USB connection for both power and audio\\n- Stereo dome tweeters and midrange drivers for best in class audio\\n- Dual passive radiators provide that extra kick\\n- Connections for headphone output, line-in jack, and optional sub out port\\n- Backlit volume control"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-09T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e3fef7ed-bd24-4866-afcd-fcc1f9f7e6fc","identifier":"1338","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet 8150mfp printer"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The LaserJet 8150mfp is an extremely reliable and stable network multifunction product for high quality, economical end effortless black and white output."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-06-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"51.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2ea49161-5c36-4950-8ac1-46d6d0d4446c","identifier":"13380552","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["nec","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"NEC P702"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The 70\u201d P702 professional-grade, large-screen LCD display offers industrial-strength, 24\/7 operation for the most demanding digital signage installations. Along with its sturdy mechanical design, this display offers full high-definition resolution for smooth video and crisp imagery. Its advanced connectivity with integrated digital loop-through and Open Pluggable Specification (OPS) via the built-in expansion slot enable you to easily connect components to run your digital signage. With TileMatrix\u2122 technology, you can build a video wall up to 100 displays to maximize impact with your audience, while monitoring your network from a remote location with the most advanced control and communication options available. The P702 is ideal in quick-service restaurants, airports, public information environments, healthcare facilities and retail stores.\\n\\n- Industrial-strength, premium-grade panel with additional thermal protection, internal temperature sensors with self-diagnostics and fan-based technology, allows for 24\/7 operation\\n- Open Pluggable Specification is the industry's first standardized option slot that simplifies digital signage installations\\n- Built-in expansion slot allows for seamless integration of NEC\/third-party components, as well as future OPS-based products\\n- Expanded connectivity with digital loop-through\\n- Full 1080p high-definition resolution provides stunning detail\\n- Comprehensive input panel connects you to the latest peripherals, including DisplayPort, HDMI, DVI, VGA, composite and component\\n- TileMatrix allows you to create video walls up to 10 x 10"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":70,"unit":"INCH"}}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8dcb64e3-9ffc-4bc4-b507-c2a207e5a099","identifier":"13381342","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 32LM660S LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Einfach smart, diese bequemen, flimmerfreien 3D-Brillen! Genie\u00dfen Sie ein noch komfortableres 3D-Erlebnis mit leichten, batterielosen und erschwinglichen 3D-Brillen.\\n\\nUltimative Konzentration auf das Wesentliche \u2013 f\u00fcr ein hautnahes Seherlebnis. 3D-Filme sieht man am Besten im Kino auf einer gro\u00dfen und mitrei\u00dfenden Leinwand, ganz ohne st\u00f6rende R\u00e4nder und sonstige Ablenkungen. Jetzt gibt es ein TV-Ger\u00e4t, das in inspirierendem Design und mit bahnbrechender Technologie die gleiche Erfahrung in Ihrem Wohnzimmer m\u00f6glich macht.\\n\\n<b>3D-Tiefenkontrolleicon<\/b>\\nKontrollieren Sie Ihr pers\u00f6nliches 3D-Programm mit der 3D-Tiefenkontrolle. Erleben Sie 3D-Inhalte mit einem leichten Tiefeneffekt oder st\u00fcrzen Sie sich direkt mitten ins Geschehen \u2013 Sie haben die Wahl. Mit der individuell einstellbaren Tiefenkontrolle regulieren Sie die Intensit\u00e4t des 3D-Effekts genau so, wie es f\u00fcr Sie am angenehmsten ist.\\n\\n<b>3D Sound Zoomicon<\/b>\\nJetzt k\u00f6nnen Sie die dritte Dimension nicht nur sehen, sondern auch h\u00f6ren! Erleben Sie 3D mit allen Sinnen beim perfekten Zusammenspiel von Bild und Ton \u2013 fast wie das echte Leben.\\n\\n<b>Smart Shareicon<\/b>\\nDurchsuchen Sie externe Speichermedien auf dem Fernsehbildschirm oder teilen Sie Dateien von Ihrem PC, Tablet-PC oder Smartphone einfach kabellos \u00fcber Wi-Fi."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>42\u201d LED CINEMA 3D Smart TV with 7 pairs of glasses, CINEMA SCREEN design, freeview HD,<\/b>\\n<b>Wi-Fi and MCI 800. Magic remote included<\/b>\\n\\nWith stylish and immersive CINEMA SCREEN design, the LM860V LED TV is packed with features such as LED Plus technology for deeper blacks as well as 7 pairs of glasses to bring home the magic of CINEMA 3D to share with friends & family.\\n\\nSmart TV provides your gateway to a world of web-based apps \u2013 from catch-up TV services such as BBC iPlayer, streaming films on demand through LoveFilm or to your Favourite social networks like Facebook & Twitter.\\n\\nAnd with freeview HD built-in you can enjoy free high-definition TV with stunning picture quality boosted by LG\u2019s cutting-edge motion processing - control it all with the motion-sensitive, voice-controlled Magic Remote."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Vivez une exp\u00e9rience 3D confortable et sans scintillements gr\u00e2ce aux lunettes CINEMA 3D l\u00e9g\u00e8res, sans batterie et \u00e9conomiques.\\n\\nD\u00e9couvrez l'exp\u00e9rience 3D la plus confortable pour vos yeux gr\u00e2ce aux images sans scintillement de la technologie LG CINEMA 3D.\\nContrairement aux t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurx LCD 3D conventionnels, la technologie LG CINEMA 3D Smart TV offre des images 3D plus lumineuses, sans aucune impression de flou, pour un confort in\u00e9gal\u00e9.\\n\\nMinimalisme et \u00e9l\u00e9gance pour une immersion totale.Au cin\u00e9ma, l\u2019immersion, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019absence de cadre lors de la projection en 3D, procure au spectateur la meilleure exp\u00e9rience possible.\\nRetrouvez chez vous cette sensation unique d\u2019\u00eatre plong\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de l\u2019action gr\u00e2ce aux nouvelles TV LG Cinema 3D dot\u00e9es d\u2019un Design unique: le Cinema Screen! Minimalisme et raffinement pour une int\u00e9gration parfaite quel que soit l\u2019environnement.\\n\\n<b>3D Depth Controlicon<\/b>\\nPersonnalisez votre exp\u00e9rience 3D avec la fonction 3D Depth Control.Optimisez l\u2019effet 3D en fonction de vos pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences pour plus de confort ou de sensations. Avec le calibrage de la profondeur 3D, vous contr\u00f4lez le niveau d\u2019effet 3D \u00e0 votre guise.\\n\\n<b>3D Sound Zoomingicon<\/b>\\nDu relief aussi dans le son ! Un algorithme sonore 3D exclusif pour une exp\u00e9rience encore plus intense. L\u2019exp\u00e9rience 3D ne peut \u00eatre belle que lorsque le son est \u00e0 la hauteur de l\u2019image, \u00e0 la fois riche et intense. LG vous offre un moment d\u2019immersion totale gr\u00e2ce au 3D Sound Zooming."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9451f808-73f3-4b5d-afb0-5bdd7742a3cc","identifier":"13381349","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 42LM860V LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>42\u201d LED CINEMA 3D Smart TV with 7 pairs of glasses, CINEMA SCREEN design, freeview HD, Wi-Fi and MCI 800. Magic remote included<\/b>\\nWith stylish and immersive CINEMA SCREEN design, the LM860V LED TV is packed with features such as LED Plus technology for deeper blacks as well as 7 pairs of glasses to bring home the magic of CINEMA 3D to share with friends & family.\\nSmart TV provides your gateway to a world of web-based apps \u2013 from catch-up TV services such as BBC iPlayer, streaming films on demand through LoveFilm or to your Favourite social networks like Facebook & Twitter.\\nAnd with freeview HD built-in you can enjoy free high-definition TV with stunning picture quality boosted by LG\u2019s cutting-edge motion processing - control it all with the motion-sensitive, voice-controlled Magic Remote."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>L\u2019alliance du design et de la performance dans un \u00e9cran Cinema 3D Smart TV !<\/b>\\nTV Cinema Screen, Smart TV, Dual Core, Magic Remote Voice, Cinema 3D, Dual Play, LED Plus, HDTV 1080p, 107cm (42 pouces)\\nLG 42LM860V\\n- Cinema Screen\\n- SMART TV\\n- Dual Core\\n- Magic Remote"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":42,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"29de56af-f215-46a8-a078-2cecc8f35b77","identifier":"13386406","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE46ES6710S"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE46ES6710S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Supported graphics resolutions: 1920 x 1080 (HD 1080). Tuner type: Analogue & Digital. Audio system: SRS. Power consumption (standby): 0.1, Energy efficiency class: A, Input voltage: 220 - 240. Width: 1060.4, Depth: 46.9, Height: 628.7"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7767d124-f8c9-4bcb-8b8f-5a2377449a4a","identifier":"13386414","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE60ES6100W"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE60ES6100W. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Power consumption (standby): 0.3, Energy efficiency class: A+. Width: 1372.9, Depth: 46.9, Height: 804.1"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":60,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"04b36c48-2ea1-413e-8ad0-24163004d882","identifier":"13387258","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 42PFL3507H"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Entspannen Sie sich, und genie\u00dfen Sie einen gro\u00dfartigen Fernsehabend in brillanter LED-Qualit\u00e4t mit dem Philips 42PFL3507 Full HD LED TV. Dank Digital Crystal Clear k\u00f6nnen Sie sich jetzt YouTube-Videos in klaren, lebendigen Bildern ansehen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Relax and enjoy a great TV night with Full HD LED and Smart TV<\/b>\\nRelax and enjoy a great TV night in brilliant LED quality on the Philips 42PFL3507 Full HD LED TV. Powered by Digital Crystal Clear, you can now watch YouTube videos in clear, vivid details.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy a world of content with Smart TV<\/b>\\n- Easy wireless connection with optional wireless USB adaptor\\n- A wealth of online videos via YouTube\\n- With DLNA, enjoy photos, music and movies on your TV\\n- Pause your program easily\\n- Enjoy video calls on your TV and be close to your loved ones\\n\\n<b>A clear, vivid picture everytime<\/b>\\n- Full HD TV with Digital Crystal Clear for depth and clarity\\n- Brilliant LED images with incredible contrast\\n- 100Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) for superb motion sharpness\\n\\n<b>Complete digital connectivity made simple<\/b>\\n- 2 USB slots for fantastic multimedia playback\\n- PC input allows you to use your TV as a PC monitor\\n- Seamless connectivity with 3 HDMI inputs and Easylink\\n- Integrated Digital DVB-C\/T Tuner for digital cable reception"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"D\u00e9tendez-vous et profitez d'une soir\u00e9e t\u00e9l\u00e9 r\u00e9ussie avec le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur LED Full HD Philips 42PFL3507 aux superbes images LED. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie Digital Crystal Clear, vos vid\u00e9os YouTube s'affichent avec des d\u00e9tails nets et \u00e9clatants."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":42,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"20d58d67-bf9d-4ab3-96cf-cb230b0b502f","identifier":"13387481","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE19ES4000W"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE19ES4000W. Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Aspect ratio: 16:9, Screen format adjustments: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: SRS TheaterSound. Power consumption (standby): 0.3, Energy efficiency class: B, Input voltage: 220 - 240. Width: 446.8, Depth: 49.6, Height: 278.7"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"nbsp;\\n<br\/><b>Une toute nouvelle r\u00e9alit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au Full HD<\/b>\\n<br\/>Profitez d\u2019un divertissement \u00e0 domicile encore plus \u00e9poustouflant et plus r\u00e9aliste que jamais. En effet, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution deux fois plus pr\u00e9cise que celle des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs HD traditionnels, votre Smart TV Samsung vous offre une exp\u00e9rience visuelle \u00e0 couper le souffle qui vous fera plonger dans un monde qui d\u00e9passe de loin les limites de votre \u00e9cran. Lorsque vous aurez vu la texture riche et vive des images Full HD, vous ne verrez plus jamais vos programmes t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9s et vos films de la m\u00eame mani\u00e8re.  L\u2019exp\u00e9rience Full HD vous fera d\u00e9couvrir une toute autre r\u00e9alit\u00e9.\\n<br\/><b>Des couleurs encore plus vives pour de meilleures images<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un algorithme avanc\u00e9 permettant d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019image, la fonction Wide Color Enhancer Plus de Samsung am\u00e9liore consid\u00e9rablement la qualit\u00e9 des images et d\u00e9voile tous les d\u00e9tails les plus subtils. Wide Color Enhancer Plus vous permet de voir les couleurs telles qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 pens\u00e9es.\\n<br\/><b>Regardez des films \u00e0 partir de vos p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques USB.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ConnectShare Movie, il vous suffit de brancher votre cl\u00e9 de m\u00e9moire USB au t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur pour profiter instantan\u00e9ment de vos films, de vos photos ou de votre musique. Vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais lire une large vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de contenus sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur en \u00e9tant confortablement install\u00e9 dans votre salon.\\n<br\/><b>Ouvrez les portes de votre salon \u00e0 une exp\u00e9rience multim\u00e9dia compl\u00e8te.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce aux entr\u00e9es High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI), le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur Samsung transformera votre salon en un v\u00e9ritable centre de divertissement multim\u00e9dia. En effet, la technologie HDMI permet une transmission \u00e0 haute vitesse de donn\u00e9es num\u00e9riques \u00e0 haute d\u00e9finition directement sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur depuis une large vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d\u2019appareils."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"24c29a7c-0f5f-4ed6-80f3-856a509aa8e3","identifier":"13387482","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE22ES5000W"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE22ES5000W. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: SRS TheaterSound. Power consumption (standby): 0.3, Power consumption (typical): 22.4, Energy efficiency class: A. Width: 513.4, Depth: 49.6, Height: 316.2"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"nbsp;\\n<br\/><b>Des couleurs encore plus vives pour de meilleures images<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un algorithme avanc\u00e9 permettant d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019image, la fonction Wide Color Enhancer Plus de Samsung am\u00e9liore consid\u00e9rablement la qualit\u00e9 des images et d\u00e9voile tous les d\u00e9tails les plus subtils. Wide Color Enhancer Plus vous permet de voir les couleurs telles qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 pens\u00e9es.\\n<br\/><b>Ouvrez les portes de votre salon \u00e0 une exp\u00e9rience multim\u00e9dia compl\u00e8te.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce aux entr\u00e9es High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI), le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur Samsung transformera votre salon en un v\u00e9ritable centre de divertissement multim\u00e9dia. En effet, la technologie HDMI permet une transmission \u00e0 haute vitesse de donn\u00e9es num\u00e9riques \u00e0 haute d\u00e9finition directement sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur depuis une large vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d\u2019appareils.\\n<br\/><b>Une toute nouvelle r\u00e9alit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au Full HD<\/b>\\n<br\/>Profitez d\u2019un divertissement \u00e0 domicile encore plus \u00e9poustouflant et plus r\u00e9aliste que jamais. En effet, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution deux fois plus pr\u00e9cise que celle des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs HD traditionnels, votre Smart TV Samsung vous offre une exp\u00e9rience visuelle \u00e0 couper le souffle qui vous fera plonger dans un monde qui d\u00e9passe de loin les limites de votre \u00e9cran. Lorsque vous aurez vu la texture riche et vive des images Full HD, vous ne verrez plus jamais vos programmes t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9s et vos films de la m\u00eame mani\u00e8re.  L\u2019exp\u00e9rience Full HD vous fera d\u00e9couvrir une toute autre r\u00e9alit\u00e9.\\n<br\/><b>Regardez des films \u00e0 partir de vos p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques USB.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ConnectShare Movie, il vous suffit de brancher votre cl\u00e9 de m\u00e9moire USB au t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur pour profiter instantan\u00e9ment de vos films, de vos photos ou de votre musique. Vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais lire une large vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de contenus sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur en \u00e9tant confortablement install\u00e9 dans votre salon.\\n<br\/><b>Une nouvelle norme en mati\u00e8re de clart\u00e9 de mouvement<\/b>\\n<br\/>La technologie Clear Motion Rate de Samsung est capable de produire des images en mouvement claires en combinant trois facteurs : le chipset, l\u2019\u00e9cran du t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur et le r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage. Cette nouvelle avanc\u00e9e en termes de contr\u00f4le des mouvements produit les images en mouvement les plus claires gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie de r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage situ\u00e9e au niveau du panneau du t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e97d33d5-9821-461a-88c1-2dbcad46bab4","identifier":"13387490","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE32EH5300W"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE32EH5300W. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Motion interpolation technology: CMR (Clear Motion Rate). Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T2. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus \/ Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Smart modes: Energy saving, Game"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"La s\u00e9rie 5 de TV LED cache bien plus que des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs. En effet, gr\u00e2ce au Smart Hub int\u00e9gr\u00e9, cette Smart TV devient votre centre de divertissement personnel : films, r\u00e9seaux sociaux et applications \u2013 tout converge sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur.\\n\\n<b>des couleurs resplendissantes pour une meilleure image<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un algorithme avanc\u00e9 permettant d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 d\u2019image, la technologie Wide Color Enhancer Plus de Samsung sublime encore la qualit\u00e9 des images et d\u00e9voile les d\u00e9tails cach\u00e9s. Vous verrez d\u00e9sormais les couleurs telles qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 voulues avec Wide Color Enhancer Plus.\\n\\n<b>restez en contact avec des appels vid\u00e9os sur grand \u00e9cran via Skype<\/b>\\nRestez en contact avec vos amis et votre famille partout dans le monde gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'application Skype pour Smart TV, disponible gratuitement dans la boutique Samsung Apps. Utilis\u00e9e avec le kit cam\u00e9ra Skype, elle vous donne la possibilit\u00e9 de passer des appels vid\u00e9os d'excellente qualit\u00e9 sur grand \u00e9cran et de joindre ainsi ceux que vous aimez partout dans le monde, gratuitement ou \u00e0 des tarifs tr\u00e8s bas. Vous pouvez cr\u00e9er de nouveaux comptes Skype, acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des comptes existants et discuter face \u00e0 face avec vos amis.\\n\\n<b>d\u00e9couvrez une r\u00e9alit\u00e9 nouvelle en full HD<\/b>\\nProfitez d\u2019un divertissement \u00e0 domicile plus r\u00e9aliste que jamais. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution deux fois sup\u00e9rieure \u00e0 celle des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs HD traditionnels, votre Samsung Smart TV vous offre une exp\u00e9rience \u00e0 couper le souffle qui vous emm\u00e8ne au-del\u00e0 des limites de l\u2019\u00e9cran, pour une immersion totale. Une fois que vous aurez exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 le caract\u00e8re riche et vivant des images full HD, vos programmes t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9s et vos films pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s ne seront plus jamais les m\u00eames. D\u00e9couvrez la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 en haute d\u00e9finition !\\n\\n<b>acc\u00e9dez sans fil \u00e0 vos contenus<\/b>\\nAcc\u00e9dez \u00e0 vos contenus depuis n\u2019importe o\u00f9. AllShare Play vous permet de visionner des films et des photos, ainsi que d\u2019\u00e9couter de la musique depuis tous les appareils compatibles se trouvant \u00e0 proximit\u00e9. En outre, la technologie cloud vous offre encore plus de libert\u00e9, puisque vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais acc\u00e9der \u00e0 vos fichiers stock\u00e9s sur Internet o\u00f9 que vous soyez. Vous pouvez ainsi profiter de vos contenus pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s aussi bien sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur qu\u2019\u00e0 distance.\\n\\n<b>profitez d\u2019applications, de vid\u00e9os, de Skype, de la navigation web et bien plus encore<\/b>\\nD\u00e9couvrez un nouveau monde de possibilit\u00e9s avec la nouvelle version du Smart Hub de Samsung. Family Story, par exemple, vous permet de pr\u00e9voir des r\u00e9unions de famille, ainsi que de partager des photos et des messages sp\u00e9ciaux avec ceux que vous aimez. Pendant ce temps, vos enfants peuvent s\u2019amuser et s\u2019instruire gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Kids. La fonction Fitness r\u00e9unit \u00e9galement toute la famille. De fait, le Fitness Hub vous donne acc\u00e8s \u00e0 des vid\u00e9os qui vous aident \u00e0 maigrir en vous amusant et vous permet de suivre vos progr\u00e8s sur grand \u00e9cran. Pendant la pause, divertissez-vous avec des applications comme ORF TVthek et profitez tranquillement de votre programme.\\n\\n<b>pour vivre une exp\u00e9rience multim\u00e9dia totale dans le confort de votre salon<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce aux entr\u00e9es High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI), ce t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur Samsung va transformer votre salon en un centre de divertissement multim\u00e9dia. De fait, la technologie HDMI permet une transmission ultra rapide de signaux haute d\u00e9finition depuis diff\u00e9rents appareils vers votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur.\\n\\n<b>regardez des films directement depuis votre cl\u00e9 USB<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ConnectShare Movie, il vous suffit de connecter votre cl\u00e9 USB \u00e0 votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur pour profiter imm\u00e9diatement de vos films, de vos photos et de votre musique. Vous avez ainsi acc\u00e8s \u00e0 toutes sortes de contenus directement sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur, dans le confort de votre salon.\\n\\n<b>connectez-vous et partagez<\/b>\\nLa connexion intelligente vous donne acc\u00e8s \u00e0 vos contenus de mani\u00e8re intuitive et pratique. Vous pouvez en effet profiter de musique, de photos, de films et d\u2019autres contenus multim\u00e9dia directement sur votre grand \u00e9cran gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 AllShare Play - et ce partout dans le monde et \u00e0 tout moment gr\u00e2ce au cloud."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"33c266ae-522e-4362-a402-71f7ee9fd22d","identifier":"13387499","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE37ES6710S"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE37ES6710S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: SRS TheaterSound HD. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Power consumption (standby): 0.3, Energy efficiency class: B, Input voltage: 220 - 240"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"nbsp;"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":37,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d56cf1b5-b3e3-4634-bca9-f01f4b646b33","identifier":"13387512","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE46ES5700S"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE46ES5700S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus \/ Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Power consumption (standby): 0.3, Energy efficiency class: A+, Input voltage: 220 - 240"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Dot\u00e9 d\u2019une r\u00e9solution Full HD, cet \u00e9cran int\u00e8gre un ensemble de fonctionnalit\u00e9s qui rendra votre exp\u00e9rience t\u00e9l\u00e9visuelle in\u00e9dite : CMR 100 Hz et Wide Color Enhancer Plus procurent des images \u00e0 couper le soufle tandis que les fonctions AllShare et Connect Share Movie vous permettent un niveau d\u2019interactivit\u00e9 maximal avec tous vos p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique multim\u00e9dia.\\n<br\/><b>Des couleurs encore plus vives pour de meilleures images<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un algorithme avanc\u00e9 permettant d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019image, la fonction Wide Color Enhancer Plus de Samsung am\u00e9liore consid\u00e9rablement la qualit\u00e9 des images et d\u00e9voile tous les d\u00e9tails les plus subtils. Wide Color Enhancer Plus vous permet de voir les couleurs telles qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 pens\u00e9es.\\n<br\/><b>Profitez des applications, de vid\u00e9os, de Skype, de la navigation sur le Web, et plus encore.<\/b>\\n<br\/>D\u00e9couvrez un nouvel univers de divertissement \u00e0 domicile personnalis\u00e9 et social gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Smart Hub de Samsung mise au go\u00fbt du jour et aux trois incroyables nouveaux services. Family Story vous permet de partager des photos, des messages et des \u00e9v\u00e9nements qui vous tiennent \u00e0 c\u0153ur avec les personnes que vous aimez. En outre, les enfants peuvent se divertir tout en apprenant gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Kids.   Vous pouvez aussi faire de l\u2019exercice et g\u00e9rer votre entra\u00eenement gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Fitness. Il s\u2019agit l\u00e0 de l\u2019exp\u00e9rience de divertissement \u00e0 domicile familial ultime qui vous permet d'acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des contenus stup\u00e9fiants, ainsi qu'\u00e0 un vaste choix d'applications Samsung, \u00e0 la navigation sur le Web, \u00e0 Skype, et bien plus encore.\\n<br\/><b>Gardez le contact gr\u00e2ce aux appels vid\u00e9o Skype sur grand \u00e9cran.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Restez en contact avec votre famille et vos amis en \u00e9tant confortablement install\u00e9 chez vous gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019application Skype pour for Smart TV, disponible gratuitement sur la boutique Samsung Apps. Si vous y ajoutez le kit de cam\u00e9ra Skype vendu s\u00e9par\u00e9ment, vous passerez des appels vid\u00e9o de haute qualit\u00e9 sur grand \u00e9cran \u00e0 vos proches, et ce dans le monde entier et \u00e0 des tarifs r\u00e9duits, voire gratuitement. Vous pouvez cr\u00e9er de nouveaux comptes Skype, acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des comptes existants ou naviguer en utilisant la t\u00e9l\u00e9commande de votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur. Soyez encore plus proche gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la communication en face \u00e0 face.\\n<br\/><b>Votre biblioth\u00e8que multim\u00e9dia personnelle<\/b>\\n<br\/>Enregistrez et stockez vos \u00e9missions t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9es et vos films gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction \u00e9tendue d\u2019enregistreur vid\u00e9o personnel Ready (Extended Personal Video Recorder Ready). Il suffit de brancher une cl\u00e9 de m\u00e9moire USB ou un disque dur au port USB de votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur, de s\u00e9lectionner le programme \u00e0 enregistrer et de le t\u00e9l\u00e9charger sur la cl\u00e9.\\n<br\/><b>Ouvrez les portes de votre salon \u00e0 une exp\u00e9rience multim\u00e9dia compl\u00e8te.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce aux entr\u00e9es High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI), le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur Samsung transformera votre salon en un v\u00e9ritable centre de divertissement multim\u00e9dia. En effet, la technologie HDMI permet une transmission \u00e0 haute vitesse de donn\u00e9es num\u00e9riques \u00e0 haute d\u00e9finition directement sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur depuis une large vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d\u2019appareils."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c0133053-e896-4609-a2b9-160d2dc79704","identifier":"13387521","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE50ES6710S"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der \u00e4u\u00dferst flache Smart TV der Serie 6 hat f\u00fcr fast jeden Geschmack etwas zu bieten: Pr\u00e4zise Farb- und Kontrastverbesserung durch Micro Dimming und intelligente Funktionen wie Smart Hub, PVR und AllShare Play erm\u00f6glichen ein unterhaltsames TV- Entertainment.\\n\\n<b>Apps, Videos, Skype, Internet und vieles mehr<\/b>\\n\\nEntdecken Sie eine neue Welt sozialer und personalisierter Heimkinounterhaltung mit Samsungs weiterentwickeltem Smart Hub und drei gro\u00dfartigen neuen Features: Mit Family Story k\u00f6nnen Sie Fotos, Mitteilungen und besondere Ereignisse mit Ihren Liebsten teilen. Ihre Kinder sind mit der Kids-Funktion gut unterhalten und k\u00f6nnen dabei auch noch etwas lernen. \u00dcber die Fitness-Anwendung k\u00f6nnen Sie trainieren und Ihren Sportplan verwalten. Erleben Sie wundervolle Heimkinounterhaltung f\u00fcr die ganze Familie \u2013 mit tollen Inhalten, Samsung Apps, Internetzugang, Skype und vielem mehr.\\n\\n<b>Filme direkt vom USB-Stick anschauen<\/b>\\n\\nStecken Sie Ihren USB-Stick einfach in den USB-Anschluss des Fernsehers und genie\u00dfen Sie mit ConnectShare Movie sofort die darauf gespeicherten Filme, Fotos oder Musik. Erleben Sie eine Vielzahl an Multimedia-Inhalten in Ihrem Wohnzimmer.\\n\\n<b>Entdecken Sie eine neue Realit\u00e4t in Full HD<\/b>\\n\\nErreichen Sie das n\u00e4chste Level des Home Entertainments. Dank einer Aufl\u00f6sung, die zweimal gr\u00f6\u00dfer ist als die von Standard-HDTVs, bietet Ihr Samsung Smart TV ein atemberaubendes Fernseherlebnis, mit dem Sie in eine ganz andere Welt eintauchen. Haben Sie erst einmal die satten, lebendigen Farben von Full-HD-Bildern erlebt, werden Sie Ihre Lieblingssendungen und -filme mit anderen Augen sehen. Entdecken Sie mit Full HD eine neue Realit\u00e4t.\\n\\n<b>Lebhaftere Farben f\u00fcr ein besseres Bild<\/b>\\n\\nSamsungs Technologie Wide Color Enhancer Plus verbessert ma\u00dfgeblich die Bildqualit\u00e4t und stellt Details \u00e4u\u00dferst scharf dar. Durch eine Erweiterung der Farbskala sorgt der Wide Color Enhancer Plus f\u00fcr kr\u00e4ftige und ausgewogene Farben \u00fcber das gesamte Spektrum hinweg.\\n\\n<b>Kabellos auf Inhalte zugreifen und abspielen<\/b>\\n\\nHolen Sie durch kabellose Verbindung das Beste aus Ihren Inhalten und Ger\u00e4ten heraus. Dank AllShare Play k\u00f6nnen Sie auf Ihrem Fernseher Filme, Fotos, Musik und vieles mehr von jedem kompatiblen Ger\u00e4t abspielen \u2013 auch von PCs. Mit der Cloud-Technologie und dem Samsung Webspeicher erhalten Sie ein gr\u00f6\u00dferes Ma\u00df an Freiheit und Mobilit\u00e4t, da Sie auch unterwegs Zugriff auf Ihre Multimedia-Inhalte haben. Entscheiden Sie selbst, ob Sie sich Ihre Lieblingsinhalte auf Ihrem Fernseher zu Hause oder unterwegs ansehen m\u00f6chten.\\n\\n<b>Elegantes, nahtloses Design<\/b>\\n\\nSamsungs One Design verbessert nicht nur das Fernseherlebnis, es wertet auch Ihr Wohnambiente auf. Das elegante One Design verbindet den Rahmen des LED TVs mit dem Bildschirm, wodurch jegliche Grenzen verschwinden und nahtloses Fernsehvergn\u00fcgen m\u00f6glich ist.\\n\\n<b>AllShare Play<\/b>\\nNie mehr Kabelsalat: Mit AllShare Play lassen sich Filme, Fotos und Musik direkt von kompatiblen mobilen Endger\u00e4ten, zum Beispiel von einem Samsung Smartphone, kabellos auf Ihr TV-Ger\u00e4t schicken. Egal, an welchem Ort Sie sich befinden, Sie k\u00f6nnen jederzeit auf die Inhalte zugreifen.\\n\\n<b>PVR<\/b>\\nMit dem integrierten TV-Recorder kommen Sie in den Genuss eines digitalen Videorecorders mit allen wichtigen Funktionen. So k\u00f6nnen Sie mit der TimeShift-Funktion jederzeit eine Live-Sendung anhalten und \u00fcber die elektronische Programmzeitschrift l\u00e4sst sich Ihre Lieblingssendung komfortabel per Knopfdruck programmieren. Einfach ein Speichermedium an die USB-Schnittstelle anschlie\u00dfen und schon kann es losgehen.\\n\\n<b>HDTV Triple Tuner<\/b>\\nErleben Sie einzigartige Technologie ohne zus\u00e4tzliche Extra-Box. Denn bei Samsung sind die Tuner f\u00fcr den Empfang von digitalem Fernsehen bereits integriert. DVB bedeutet \u201eDigital Video Broadcasting\u201c und steht f\u00fcr den Standard der digitalen \u00dcbertragung von Videosignalen. Hierbei unterscheidet man zwischen den verschiedenen Sendearten: DVB-S f\u00fcr Satelliten\u00fcbertragung, DVB-C f\u00fcr die \u00dcbertragung durch das Kabelnetz und DVB-T f\u00fcr terrestrische \u00dcbertragung.\\n\\n<b>CI+<\/b>\\nCI steht f\u00fcr \u201eCommon Interface\u201c und ist eine Schnittstelle, die es erm\u00f6glicht \u00fcber ein CI-Modul und eine Smart Card verschl\u00fcsselte Fernsehprogramme wiederzugeben. Im Gegensatz zu einer herk\u00f6mmlichen CI-Schnittstelle (CI V.1) erf\u00fcllt CI+ relevante Sicherheitsanforderungen und ist damit fit f\u00fcr den Empfang von verschl\u00fcsselten Programmen und HDTV. Dies macht die Fernseher ohne zus\u00e4tzliche Extrager\u00e4te digitaltauglich und zukunftssicher.\\n\\n<b>HD+<\/b>\\nDieser Fernseher mit CI-Plus-Schnittstelle erm\u00f6glicht Ihnen alle Vorteile von HD+ \u00fcber den Satellitenempfang ohne einen zus\u00e4tzlichen Satellitenreceiver \u2013 denn dank integriertem CI-Plus-Slot k\u00f6nnen Sie die HD+-Sender mithilfe eines CI-Plus-Moduls und einer HD+-Karte empfangen. Die Karte bietet Ihnen die M\u00f6glichkeit, die HD+-Sender RTL, Sat.1, ProSieben, VOX, kabel eins und viele mehr in HD-Qualit\u00e4t zu genie\u00dfen.\\n\\n<b>Eco-Lichtsensor<\/b>\\nSparsam, umweltschonend und optimale Bilddarstellung. Der Eco-Sensor passt die Hintergrundbeleuchtung der Fernseher an das Umgebungslicht an und sorgt so f\u00fcr eine niedrige Stromrechnung und die richtige Beleuchtungsst\u00e4rke f\u00fcr ein optimales Bild. Insgesamt verbrauchen s\u00e4mtliche Samsung TV-Ger\u00e4te des neuen Sortiments weniger Energie als ihr jeweiliges Vorjahresmodell.\\n\\n<b>Planet First<\/b>\\nDie neuen Samsung TVs schonen durch den Einsatz effizienter Technologien, der Verwendung einer geringen Anzahl von Bauteilen und nichtgiftiger Materialien die Umwelt. Helfen Sie mit und sch\u00fctzen Sie unseren Planeten.\\n\\n<b>Energieeffizienzklasse<\/b>\\nDas Energielabel ist die offizielle EU-Energieeffizienzkennzeichnung, die ab Ende November 2011 verpflichtend wird. Die Kennzeichnung zeigt u.a. die Energieeffizienzklasse, nennt die Leistungsaufnahme in Watt und zeigt den Jahresverbrauch des jeweiligen Ger\u00e4tes an. Damit bietet sie eine objektive Orientierungshilfe f\u00fcr den Verbrauch des TV-Ger\u00e4tes."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE50ES6710S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus, Dolby Puls. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Video formats supported: 3GP, ASF, AVI, DIVX, FLV, H.263, H.264, MKV, MP4, MPEG1, MPEG2, MPEG4, RMVB, TS, VOB, WMV9, Audio formats supported: AAC, AC3, AMR, LPCM, MP3, WMA"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":50,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3136623a-b08b-4780-a7fc-09456bb8a51d","identifier":"13387772","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE22ES5410W"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Internetzugriff ohne Kabel<\/b>\\nMit dem eingebauten WLAN k\u00f6nnen Sie alle Inhalte genie\u00dfen und das kabellos. Der Platz Ihres Fernsehers h\u00e4ngt damit nicht mehr vom n\u00e4chsten verf\u00fcgbaren Anschluss ab. Mit der \u201eOne Foot Verbindung\u201c k\u00f6nnen Sie ausserdem Ger\u00e4te die sich ca. 25 cm vom Fernseher befinden verbinden und das ohne jegliche Kabel oder Passworteingaben.\\n\\n<b>Apps genie\u00dfen, mit Skype telefonieren, im Internet surfen und vieles mehr<\/b>\\nEntdecken Sie eine neue Welt von M\u00f6glichkeiten mit der neuen Version des Samsung Smart Hubs. Mit Family Story verbinden Sie Ihre Familie. Es lassen sich Familientreffen planen, gemeinsam geschossene Bilder teilen und sogar Nachrichten lassen sich einfach austauschen. In der Zwischenzeit k\u00f6nnen sich die Kinder mit der Kid\u2019s Story unterhalten und dabei spielend lernen. Und auch die gemeinsame Fitness verbindet die Familie. Mit dem Fitness Hub k\u00f6nnen Sie mit Hilfe von Fitness Videos spielend abnehmen und Ihre Erfolge am gro\u00dfen Fernseher betrachten. In den Ruhepausen k\u00f6nnen Sie dann mit Apps wie der ORF TVthek entspannt abschalten und in Ruhe das Programm genie\u00dfen.\\n\\n<b>Das umfassende Multimediaerlebnis in Ihrem Wohnzimmer<\/b>\\nMithilfe der HDMI-Eing\u00e4nge (High Definition Multimedia Interface) wird Ihr Fernseher von Samsung Ihr Wohnzimmer in ein Zentrum f\u00fcr Multimediaunterhaltung verwandeln. HDMI \u00fcbertr\u00e4gt digitale HD-Daten mit hohen Geschwindigkeiten von mehreren Ger\u00e4ten direkt auf Ihren Fernseher.\\n\\n<b>Filme direkt vom USB ansehen<\/b>\\nDank ConnectShare Movie k\u00f6nnen Sie einfach Ihren USB-Stick an Ihren Fernseher anschlie\u00dfen und sofort Filme, Fotos oder Musik genie\u00dfen. Erleben Sie eine Vielzahl verschiedenster Inhalte bequem auf Ihrem Fernseher im Wohnzimmer.\\n\\n<b>Verbinden und teilen<\/b>\\nErleben Sie dank intelligenter Konnektivit\u00e4t einen intuitiveren und komfortableren Bildgenuss. Sie k\u00f6nnen Musik, Fotos, Filme und andere Multimedieninhalte \u00fcber AllShare Play direkt auf Ihren Fernseher streamen, um sie auf einem gr\u00f6\u00dferen Bildschirm zu genie\u00dfen. Und das alles grenzenlos \u00fcber die Cloud, von \u00fcberall auf der Welt, egal zu welcher Zeit.\\n\\n<b>Strahlendere Farben f\u00fcr ein besseres Bild<\/b>\\nDank der Benutzung eines weiterentwickelten Algorithums zur Verbesserung der Bilddarstellung bringt Ihnen Samsung\u2019s Wide Color Enhancer Plus eine deutlich bessere Bildqualit\u00e4t und zeigt Ihnen damit sogar bis jetzt versteckte Details. Sehen Sie die Farben mit dem Wide Color Enhancer Plus so wie sie sein sollten.\\n\\n<b>Bleiben Sie in Kontakt mit Skype Videokonferenzen und genie\u00dfen Sie Ihr gegen\u00fcber in voller Gr\u00f6\u00dfe am TV<\/b>\\nMit Skype App f\u00fcr Samsungs Smart TV ist es ein Einfaches mit Freunden und Familie \u00fcberall auf der Welt in Kontakt zu bleiben. In Kombination mit dem Skype Kamera Kit k\u00f6nnen Sie ganz einfach mit Personen \u00fcberall auf der Welt Videokonferenzen abhalten und das zu niedrigen Raten oder sogar kostenlos. In der App k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihren bisherigen Skype Account nutzen oder auch einen Neuen erstellen und dann direkt in Kontakt mit Ihren Freunden tretten und das von Angesicht zu Angesicht.\\n\\n<b>Entdecken Sie eine neue Realit\u00e4t in Full HD<\/b>\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie mehr Realismus als je zuvor. Dank der Aufl\u00f6sung, die doppelt so hoch wie bei anderen HD-Fernsehern ist, liefert Ihr Smart TV von Samsung einen atemberaubenden Bildgenuss, in den Sie vollst\u00e4ndig abtauchen k\u00f6nnen. Entdecken Sie Ihre Lieblingssendungen in einem komplett neuen Bild mit lebendigeren Farben und einem reichhaltigerem Full-HD Bild als je zuvor.\\n\\n<b>Kabelloser Zugang zu Ihren Inhalten<\/b>\\nGreifen Sie von von \u00fcberall auf Ihre Inhalte zu. Mit AllShare Play k\u00f6nnen Sie Filme streamen, Fotos \u00fcbertragen und Musik anh\u00f6ren und das von allen kompatiblen Ger\u00e4ten in Ihrer N\u00e4he. Mit der Cloud Technoloie bekommen Sie ausserdem noch mehr Freiheit, denn damit k\u00f6nnen Sie von \u00fcberall mit dem Internet auf die in der Cloud gespeicherten Inhalte zugreifen. Ihre Lieblingsinhalte k\u00f6nnen Sie jetzt \u00fcberall benutzen \u2013 egal ob zu Hause oder unterwegs."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Bring home a world of new entertainment options. The Samsung 22\u201d ES5410W LED TV features built-in wireless LAN capabilities, making it easy for you to connect to the Internet and your devices. You\u2019ll be able to access a wide range of online Smart Hub content and services. Widescreen Skype video chats are also possible if you add a Skype camera kit. And, with Wide Colour Enhancer Plus, you\u2019ll always enjoy richly vivid and realistic picture quality.\\n\\n<b>Access the Internet without wires<\/b>\\nWith Wireless LAN Built-in, streamline your TV\u2019s connectivity capabilities without adding more external features and maintain its attractive design. The convenient \u201cOne Foot Connection\u201d feature wirelessly detects compatible devices that are placed within one foot of the TV and wireless router.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy apps, videos, Skype, web browsing and more<\/b>\\nDiscover a new world of social and personalised home entertainment with Samsung\u2019s updated Smart Hub and three great new services. Family Story lets you share special photos, messages and events with loved ones. Meanwhile, children can stay entertained and educated with the Kids feature. You can also exercise and manage your training using Fitness. With access to great content as well as a selection of Samsung Apps, web browsing, Skype and more, this is the ultimate family home entertainment experience.\\n\\n<b>Bringing a full multimedia experience into your living room<\/b>\\nWith High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI) inputs, the Samsung TV will transform your living room into a multimedia entertainment centre. HDMI provides high-speed transmission of high definition digital data from multiple devices straight into your TV.\\n\\n<b>Watch movies from your USB<\/b>\\nWith ConnectShare Movie, simply plug your USB memory drive into the TV and instantaneously enjoy movies, photos or music. Now, you can experience a wide variety of content in the comfort of your living room on your TV.\\n\\n<b>Connect and Share<\/b>\\nBring it all together. AllShare Play wirelessly connects to compatible devices through DLNA technology so the movies, photos and music stored on them can be viewed, listened to and shared on your TV. Now, effortlessly transfer content from your PC or mobile device to your TV.\\n\\n<b>More vibrant colours for better images<\/b>\\nUsing an advanced picture quality improvement algorithm, Samsung\u2019s Wide Colour Enhancer Plus drastically improves the quality of any image and uncovers hidden details. Now see colours as they were meant to be seen with Wide Colour Enhancer Plus.\\n\\n<b>Stay in closer contact with great widescreen Skype video calls<\/b>\\nStay in touch with friends and family from the comfort of your home thanks to the Skype app for Smart TV, available for free in the Samsung App store. Combined with the separately-sold Skype camera kit, it allows you to make high-quality widescreen video calls to loved ones throughout the world at low rates or even for free. You can create new Skype accounts, access existing ones and navigate using your TV\u2019s remote control. Be closer with face-to-face communication.\\n\\n<b>Discover a new reality in Full HD<\/b>\\nEnjoy a greater level of home entertainment realism than ever before. Thanks to a resolution twice as high as standard HD TVs, your Samsung Smart TV delivers a breathtaking viewing experience that takes you beyond the screen into a world of total immersion. When you\u2019ve seen the rich and vivid texture of Full HD images, your favourite TV programmes and movies will never be the same again. Discover reality with a full high definition experience.\\n\\n<b>Wirelessly access and stream your content<\/b>\\nMake the most of all your content and devices with wireless sharing. Thanks to AllShare Play, you can stream movies, photos, music and more from any compatible devices nearby, including PCs. Cloud technology and Samsung web storage give you even greater freedom and mobility, allowing you to access and share multimedia when you\u2019re away from home, too. Now you can enjoy all your favourite content on your TV or away from it."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec le UE22ES5410, vous disposez d\u2019une TV LED avec une fonctionnalit\u00e9 SMART, \u00e0 la fois design, performante et accessible. Dot\u00e9 d\u2019une r\u00e9solution Full HD, cet \u00e9cran int\u00e8gre un ensemble de fonctionnalit\u00e9s qui rendra votre exp\u00e9rience t\u00e9l\u00e9visuelle in\u00e9dite : CMR 50 Hz et Wide Color Enhancer Plus procurent des images \u00e0 couper le soufle tandis que les fonctions AllShare et Connect Share Movie vous permettent un niveau d\u2019interactivit\u00e9 maximal avec tous vos p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique multim\u00e9dia.\\n\\n<b>Acc\u00e9dez \u00e0 Internet sans c\u00e2bles<\/b>\\nAvec le wifi int\u00e9gr\u00e9, connectez votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur sur votre r\u00e9seau Internet sans passer par le Dongle Wifi. La connexion \u00ab One Foot \u00bb est une fonctionnalit\u00e9 qui d\u00e9tecte les appareils Wifi plac\u00e9s \u00e0 une distance de moins de 30 centim\u00e8tres.\\n\\n<b>Profitez d'applications, de vid\u00e9os, de Skype, d'une naviguation Internet et plus<\/b>\\nD\u00e9couvrez un nouveau monde de divertissement personnalis\u00e9 \u00e0 domicile avec Samsung Smart HUB et trois grands nouveaux services. Family Story vous permet de partager des photos, des messages et des \u00e9v\u00e9nements sp\u00e9ciaux avec vos proches. Pendant ce temps vos enfants pourront se divertir avec l\u2019application p\u00e9dagogique Kids. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement vous exercer et g\u00e9rer vos entrainements avec Fitness. Avec l\u2019acc\u00e8s \u00e0 un grand contenu comme la s\u00e9lection Samsung Apps, les moteurs de recherche, Skype et plus, faites l\u2019exp\u00e9rience ultime de divertissement \u00e0 domicile.\\n\\n<b>Connectez-vous et partagez<\/b>\\nRetrouvez tout vos contenus directement sur votre TV. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie DLNA, AllShare Play connecte tout vos appareils compatibles sur votre TV afin de regarder, \u00e9couter et partager les vid\u00e9os, photos et musiques stock\u00e9s. Transf\u00e9rez sans effort le contenu de votre PC ou de votre mobile sur votre TV.\\n\\n<b>Des couleurs plus vives pour de meilleures images<\/b>\\nSamsung Wide Color Enhancer Plus am\u00e9liore consid\u00e9rablement la qualit\u00e9 d\u2019une image pour d\u00e9couvrir des d\u00e9tails cach\u00e9s. Maintenant, voyez les couleurs telles qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7ues pour \u00eatre vues avec Wide Color Enhancer Plus.\\n\\n<b>D\u00e9couvrez une nouvelle r\u00e9alit\u00e9 en Full HD<\/b>\\nProfitez d\u2019un plus grand niveau de r\u00e9alisme \u00e0 domicile. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution deux fois plus \u00e9lev\u00e9e que la norme HD TV, votre TV Samsung offre une exp\u00e9rience de visionnement \u00e0 couper le souffle qui vous emm\u00e8ne au-del\u00e0 de l\u2019\u00e9cran dans un monde d\u2019immersion total. Lorsque vous aurez vu la texture riche et vivante des images Full HD, vos programmes TV et vos films pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s ne seront jamais les m\u00eames. D\u00e9couvrez la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 avec une exp\u00e9rience haute d\u00e9finition compl\u00e8te."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3cd34b60-4c0a-46a0-b702-fa52f2ef57e6","identifier":"13387783","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE37ES6710S"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Design das gef\u00e4llt<\/b>\\nOne Design von Samsung verbessert nicht nur den Bildgenuss, sondern versch\u00f6nert auch Ihr zu Hause. Mit One Design verschmilzt der Rahmen noch mehr mit dem eigentlichen Bild und bringt damit ein nahtloses Fernseherlebnis.\\n\\n<b>Filme direkt vom USB ansehen<\/b>\\nDank ConnectShare Movie k\u00f6nnen Sie einfach Ihren USB-Stick an Ihren Fernseher anschlie\u00dfen und sofort Filme, Fotos oder Musik genie\u00dfen. Erleben Sie eine Vielzahl verschiedenster Inhalte bequem auf Ihrem Fernseher im Wohnzimmer.\\n\\n<b>Kabelloser Zugang zu Ihren Inhalten<\/b>\\nGreifen Sie von von \u00fcberall auf Ihre Inhalte zu. Mit AllShare Play k\u00f6nnen Sie Filme streamen, Fotos \u00fcbertragen und Musik anh\u00f6ren und das von allen kompatiblen Ger\u00e4ten in Ihrer N\u00e4he. Mit der Cloud Technoloie bekommen Sie ausserdem noch mehr Freiheit, denn damit k\u00f6nnen Sie von \u00fcberall mit dem Internet auf die in der Cloud gespeicherten Inhalte zugreifen. Ihre Lieblingsinhalte k\u00f6nnen Sie jetzt \u00fcberall benutzen \u2013 egal ob zu Hause oder unterwegs.\\n\\n<b>Das umfassende Multimediaerlebnis in Ihrem Wohnzimmer<\/b>\\nMithilfe der HDMI-Eing\u00e4nge (High Definition Multimedia Interface) wird Ihr Fernseher von Samsung Ihr Wohnzimmer in ein Zentrum f\u00fcr Multimediaunterhaltung verwandeln. HDMI \u00fcbertr\u00e4gt digitale HD-Daten mit hohen Geschwindigkeiten von mehreren Ger\u00e4ten direkt auf Ihren Fernseher.\\n\\n<b>Apps genie\u00dfen, mit Skype telefonieren, im Internet surfen und vieles mehr<\/b>\\nEntdecken Sie eine neue Welt von M\u00f6glichkeiten mit der neuen Version des Samsung Smart Hubs. Mit Family Story verbinden Sie Ihre Familie. Es lassen sich Familientreffen planen, gemeinsam geschossene Bilder teilen und sogar Nachrichten lassen sich einfach austauschen. In der Zwischenzeit k\u00f6nnen sich die Kinder mit der Kid\u2019s Story unterhalten und dabei spielend lernen. Und auch die gemeinsame Fitness verbindet die Familie. Mit dem Fitness Hub k\u00f6nnen Sie mit Hilfe von Fitness Videos spielend abnehmen und Ihre Erfolge am gro\u00dfen Fernseher betrachten. In den Ruhepausen k\u00f6nnen Sie dann mit Apps wie der ORF TVthek entspannt abschalten und in Ruhe das Programm genie\u00dfen.\\n\\n<b>Strahlendere Farben f\u00fcr ein besseres Bild<\/b>\\nDank der Benutzung eines weiterentwickelten Algorithums zur Verbesserung der Bilddarstellung bringt Ihnen Samsung\u2019s Wide Color Enhancer Plus eine deutlich bessere Bildqualit\u00e4t und zeigt Ihnen damit sogar bis jetzt versteckte Details. Sehen Sie die Farben mit dem Wide Color Enhancer Plus so wie sie sein sollten.\\n\\n<b>Entdecken Sie eine neue Realit\u00e4t in Full HD<\/b>\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie mehr Realismus als je zuvor. Dank der Aufl\u00f6sung, die doppelt so hoch wie bei anderen HD-Fernsehern ist, liefert Ihr Smart TV von Samsung einen atemberaubenden Bildgenuss, in den Sie vollst\u00e4ndig abtauchen k\u00f6nnen. Entdecken Sie Ihre Lieblingssendungen in einem komplett neuen Bild mit lebendigeren Farben und einem reichhaltigerem Full-HD Bild als je zuvor."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE37ES6710S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus, Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Power consumption (standby): 0.3, Energy efficiency class: B, Input voltage: 220 - 240"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Un design qui va vous plaire<\/b>\\nOne Design de Samsung am\u00e9liore non seulement votre exp\u00e9rience visuelle, mais \u00e9galement l\u2019allure de votre int\u00e9rieur. De fait, avec One Design, le cadre du t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur se fond avec l\u2019\u00e9cran pour un look global parfaitement \u00e9pur\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Regardez des films directement depuis votre cl\u00e9 USB<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ConnectShare Movie, il vous suffit de connecter votre cl\u00e9 USB \u00e0 votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur pour profiter imm\u00e9diatement de vos films, de vos photos et de votre musique. Vous avez ainsi acc\u00e8s \u00e0 toutes sortes de contenus directement sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur, dans le confort de votre salon.\\n\\n<b>Acc\u00e9dez sans fil \u00e0 vos contenus<\/b>\\nAcc\u00e9dez \u00e0 vos contenus depuis n\u2019importe o\u00f9. AllShare Play vous permet de visionner des films et des photos, ainsi que d\u2019\u00e9couter de la musique depuis tous les appareils compatibles se trouvant \u00e0 proximit\u00e9. En outre, la technologie cloud vous offre encore plus de libert\u00e9, puisque vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais acc\u00e9der \u00e0 vos fichiers stock\u00e9s sur Internet o\u00f9 que vous soyez. Vous pouvez ainsi profiter de vos contenus pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s aussi bien sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur qu\u2019\u00e0 distance.\\n\\n<b>Pour vivre une exp\u00e9rience multim\u00e9dia totale dans le confort de votre salon<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce aux entr\u00e9es High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI), ce t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur Samsung va transformer votre salon en un centre de divertissement multim\u00e9dia. De fait, la technologie HDMI permet une transmission ultra rapide de signaux haute d\u00e9finition depuis diff\u00e9rents appareils vers votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur.\\n\\n<b>Profitez d\u2019applications, de vid\u00e9os, de Skype, de la navigation web et bien plus encore<\/b>\\nD\u00e9couvrez un nouveau monde de possibilit\u00e9s avec la nouvelle version du Smart Hub de Samsung. Family Story, par exemple, vous permet de pr\u00e9voir des r\u00e9unions de famille, ainsi que de partager des photos et des messages sp\u00e9ciaux avec ceux que vous aimez. Pendant ce temps, vos enfants peuvent s\u2019amuser et s\u2019instruire gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Kids. La fonction Fitness r\u00e9unit \u00e9galement toute la famille. De fait, le Fitness Hub vous donne acc\u00e8s \u00e0 des vid\u00e9os qui vous aident \u00e0 maigrir en vous amusant et vous permet de suivre vos progr\u00e8s sur grand \u00e9cran. Pendant la pause, divertissez-vous avec des applications comme ORF TVthek et profitez tranquillement de votre programme.\\n\\n<b>Des couleurs resplendissantes pour une meilleure image<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un algorithme avanc\u00e9 permettant d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 d\u2019image, la technologie Wide Color Enhancer Plus de Samsung sublime encore la qualit\u00e9 des images et d\u00e9voile les d\u00e9tails cach\u00e9s. Vous verrez d\u00e9sormais les couleurs telles qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 voulues avec Wide Color Enhancer Plus.\\n\\n<b>D\u00e9couvrez une r\u00e9alit\u00e9 nouvelle en full HD<\/b>\\nProfitez d\u2019un divertissement \u00e0 domicile plus r\u00e9aliste que jamais. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution deux fois sup\u00e9rieure \u00e0 celle des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs HD traditionnels, votre Samsung Smart TV vous offre une exp\u00e9rience \u00e0 couper le souffle qui vous emm\u00e8ne au-del\u00e0 des limites de l\u2019\u00e9cran, pour une immersion totale. Une fois que vous aurez exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 le caract\u00e8re riche et vivant des images full HD, vos programmes t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9s et vos films pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s ne seront plus jamais les m\u00eames. D\u00e9couvrez la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 en haute d\u00e9finition !"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":37,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a11fb42a-7f49-46be-8e7b-61e6a0ff22be","identifier":"13387795","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE46ES6710S"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der \u00e4u\u00dferst flache Smart TV der Serie 6 hat f\u00fcr fast jeden Geschmack etwas zu bieten: Pr\u00e4zise Farb - und Kontrastverbesserung durch Micro Dimming und intelligente Funktionen wie Smart Hub, PVR und AllShare Play erm\u00f6glichen ein unterhaltsames TV- Entertainment.\\n\\n<b>Design das gef\u00e4llt<\/b>\\nOne Design von Samsung verbessert nicht nur den Bildgenuss, sondern versch\u00f6nert auch Ihr zu Hause. Mit One Design verschmilzt der Rahmen noch mehr mit dem eigentlichen Bild und bringt damit ein nahtloses Fernseherlebnis.\\n\\n<b>Filme direkt vom USB ansehen<\/b>\\nDank ConnectShare Movie k\u00f6nnen Sie einfach Ihren USB-Stick an Ihren Fernseher anschlie\u00dfen und sofort Filme, Fotos oder Musik genie\u00dfen. Erleben Sie eine Vielzahl verschiedenster Inhalte bequem auf Ihrem Fernseher im Wohnzimmer.\\n\\n<b>Kabelloser Zugang zu Ihren Inhalten<\/b>\\nGreifen Sie von von \u00fcberall auf Ihre Inhalte zu. Mit AllShare Play k\u00f6nnen Sie Filme streamen, Fotos \u00fcbertragen und Musik anh\u00f6ren und das von allen kompatiblen Ger\u00e4ten in Ihrer N\u00e4he. Mit der Cloud Technoloie bekommen Sie ausserdem noch mehr Freiheit, denn damit k\u00f6nnen Sie von \u00fcberall mit dem Internet auf die in der Cloud gespeicherten Inhalte zugreifen. Ihre Lieblingsinhalte k\u00f6nnen Sie jetzt \u00fcberall benutzen \u2013 egal ob zu Hause oder unterwegs.\\n\\n<b>Das umfassende Multimediaerlebnis in Ihrem Wohnzimmer<\/b>\\nMithilfe der HDMI-Eing\u00e4nge (High Definition Multimedia Interface) wird Ihr Fernseher von Samsung Ihr Wohnzimmer in ein Zentrum f\u00fcr Multimediaunterhaltung verwandeln. HDMI \u00fcbertr\u00e4gt digitale HD-Daten mit hohen Geschwindigkeiten von mehreren Ger\u00e4ten direkt auf Ihren Fernseher.\\n\\n<b>Apps genie\u00dfen, mit Skype telefonieren, im Internet surfen und vieles mehr<\/b>\\nEntdecken Sie eine neue Welt von M\u00f6glichkeiten mit der neuen Version des Samsung Smart Hubs. Mit Family Story verbinden Sie Ihre Familie. Es lassen sich Familientreffen planen, gemeinsam geschossene Bilder teilen und sogar Nachrichten lassen sich einfach austauschen. In der Zwischenzeit k\u00f6nnen sich die Kinder mit der Kid\u2019s Story unterhalten und dabei spielend lernen. Und auch die gemeinsame Fitness verbindet die Familie. Mit dem Fitness Hub k\u00f6nnen Sie mit Hilfe von Fitness Videos spielend abnehmen und Ihre Erfolge am gro\u00dfen Fernseher betrachten. In den Ruhepausen k\u00f6nnen Sie dann mit Apps wie der ORF TVthek entspannt abschalten und in Ruhe das Programm genie\u00dfen.\\n\\n<b>Strahlendere Farben f\u00fcr ein besseres Bild<\/b>\\nDank der Benutzung eines weiterentwickelten Algorithums zur Verbesserung der Bilddarstellung bringt Ihnen Samsung\u2019s Wide Color Enhancer Plus eine deutlich bessere Bildqualit\u00e4t und zeigt Ihnen damit sogar bis jetzt versteckte Details. Sehen Sie die Farben mit dem Wide Color Enhancer Plus so wie sie sein sollten.\\n\\n<b>Entdecken Sie eine neue Realit\u00e4t in Full HD<\/b>\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie mehr Realismus als je zuvor. Dank der Aufl\u00f6sung, die doppelt so hoch wie bei anderen HD-Fernsehern ist, liefert Ihr Smart TV von Samsung einen atemberaubenden Bildgenuss, in den Sie vollst\u00e4ndig abtauchen k\u00f6nnen. Entdecken Sie Ihre Lieblingssendungen in einem komplett neuen Bild mit lebendigeren Farben und einem reichhaltigerem Full-HD Bild als je zuvor."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE46ES6710S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus, Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Power consumption (standby): 0.1, Energy efficiency class: A, Input voltage: 220 - 240"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec le UE46ES6710, profitez d\u2019images 3D d\u2019une nettet\u00e9 et d\u2019une fluidit\u00e9 impressionnante gr\u00e2ce au Clear Motion Rate de 400 Hz et du syst\u00e8me de r\u00e9tro\u00e9clairage Micro Dimming qui optimise la gestion du contraste. Ce t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur garantit une qualit\u00e9 d\u2019image sans compromis. Le UE46ES6710 est un Smart TV qui vous ouvre l\u2019acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une offre p\u00e9renne et personnalis\u00e9e de contenus, de services VOD, d\u2019un navigateur Internet, de Skype. D\u00e9couvrez un nouveau monde de divertissement personnalis\u00e9 \u00e0 domicile avec trois nouveaux services : Family Story, Fitness et Kids.\\n\\n<b>Con\u00e7u pour un attrait maximum<\/b>\\nSamsung One Design maximise l'exp\u00e9rience de visionnement et embellit votre int\u00e9rieur. One Design allie avec \u00e9l\u00e9gance les bordures de la t\u00e9l\u00e9vision LED avec son \u00e9cran afin d'\u00e9liminer les obstacles pour cr\u00e9er une exp\u00e9rience de visionnement sans faille.\\n\\n<b>Regardez des vid\u00e9os depuis une source USB<\/b>\\nAvec ConnectShare Movie, il vous suffit de brancher votre source USB dans le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur et vous profiterez instantan\u00e9ment de vos films, photos ou musique. Vous pouvez maintenant d\u00e9couvrir une grande vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de contenu dans le confort de votre salon sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur.\\n\\n<b>Acc\u00e9dez \u00e0 vos contenus sans c\u00e2ble<\/b>\\nAvec AllShare Play, profitez de tous vos contenus. Vous pouvez streamer des films, photos, musique et bien plus encore \u00e0 partir des appareils compatibles \u00e0 proximit\u00e9, y compris les PC. La technologie de stockage Cloud de Samsung vous donne encore plus de libert\u00e9 et de mobilit\u00e9, vous permettant d'acc\u00e9der et de partager vos fichiers multim\u00e9dia lorsque vous \u00eates loin de votre domicile. Maintenant, vous pouvez profiter de tous vos contenus pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur ou loin de lui.\\n\\n<b>Apportez une exp\u00e9rience multim\u00e9dia compl\u00e8te dans votre salon<\/b>\\nAvec une Interface haute d\u00e9finition (et une entr\u00e9e HDMI), le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur Samsung va transformer votre salon en un centre de divertissement multim\u00e9dia. La prise HDMI offre une grande vitesse de transmission de donn\u00e9es num\u00e9riques en HD \u00e0 partir de plusieurs p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques directement sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur.\\n\\n<b>Profitez d'applications, de vid\u00e9os, de Skype, de navigateur Internet et plus<\/b>\\nD\u00e9couvrez un nouveau monde de divertissement personnalis\u00e9 \u00e0 domicile avec Samsung Smart HUB et trois grands nouveaux services. Family Story vous permet de partager des photos, des messages et des \u00e9v\u00e9nements sp\u00e9ciaux avec vos proches. Pendant ce temps vos enfants pourront se divertir avec l\u2019application p\u00e9dagogique Kids. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement vous exercer et g\u00e9rer vos entrainements avec Fitness. Avec l\u2019acc\u00e8s \u00e0 un grand contenu comme la s\u00e9lection Samsung Apps, les moteurs de recherche, Skype et plus, faites l\u2019exp\u00e9rience ultime de divertissement \u00e0 domicile.\\n\\n<b>Des couleurs plus vives pour de meilleures images<\/b>\\nSamsung Wide Color Enhancer Plus am\u00e9liore consid\u00e9rablement la qualit\u00e9 d\u2019une image pour d\u00e9couvrir des d\u00e9tails cach\u00e9s. Maintenant, voyez les couleurs telles qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7ues pour \u00eatre vues avec Wide Color Enhancer Plus.\\n\\n<b>D\u00e9couvrez une nouvelle r\u00e9alit\u00e9 en Full HD<\/b>\\nProfitez d\u2019un plus grand niveau de r\u00e9alisme \u00e0 domicile. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution deux fois plus \u00e9lev\u00e9e que la norme HD TV, votre TV Samsung offre une exp\u00e9rience de visionnement \u00e0 couper le souffle qui vous emm\u00e8ne au-del\u00e0 de l\u2019\u00e9cran dans un monde d\u2019immersion total. Lorsque vous aurez vu la texture riche et vivante des images Full HD, vos programmes TV et vos films pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s ne seront jamais les m\u00eames. D\u00e9couvrez la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 avec une exp\u00e9rience haute d\u00e9finition compl\u00e8te."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"acdd8552-622c-4fb9-bd1b-adddf19898f4","identifier":"13387800","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","samsung","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_720"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a\/7\/e\/d\/a7ed8fdd48f480695635e9b5e556de83c60ce2a9_13387800_840.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/a\/7\/e\/d\/a7ed8fdd48f480695635e9b5e556de83c60ce2a9_13387800_840.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung VG-STC2000"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Ihre Lieblingssendung: Ihre eigene Familie und Ihre Freunde \u2013 dank der Smart TV\u2122 Kamera. Sie ben\u00f6tigen keinen Computer zur Videokonvertierung, wenn Ihr HDTV mit der VG-STC2000 Smart TV\u2122 Kamera ausgestattet ist. Richten Sie den Hals so aus, dass Sie bequem im Bild sind, und genie\u00dfen Sie Ihre Familie und Ihre Freunde \u2013 auch am anderen Ende der Welt\\n\\n<b>Immer auf dem Laufenden mit HD-Videoanrufen<\/b>\\nErleben Sie Videoanrufe von der sch\u00f6nsten Seite: mit der Samsung Fernsehkamera. Videoanrufe \u00fcber Dienste wie Skype\u2122 erleben neue Sch\u00e4rfe und Brillanz und dank der zwei eingebauten Mikrofone geht auch kein Wort verloren. Und mit der hohen Videoqualit\u00e4t erfasst die Kamera jedes Detail gestochen scharf. Die Unterhaltung mit Freunden und Familie macht also noch mehr Spa\u00df \u2013 als w\u00e4ren alle im selben Raum. Fernsehen wird \u00fcber Videoanrufe ein soziales Ereignis.\\n\\n<b>Ein Kabel f\u00fcr schnelle Konnektivit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nHauchen Sie Ihrem Heimkinosystem mit der stilvollen und doch einfach zu bedienenden Videokamera von Samsung neues Leben ein. Mit nur einem USB-Kabel f\u00fcr Verbindung und Stromversorgung k\u00f6nnen Sie diese HD-Videokamera schnell und einfach an Ihren Fernseher anschlie\u00dfen. Strom und Daten werden \u00fcber den USB-Anschluss des Fernsehers bereitgestellt, damit die STC2000 HD-Fernsehkamera immer einsatzbereit ist. Sie k\u00f6nnen l\u00e4ngere Videokonferenzen ohne unn\u00f6tige und l\u00e4stige Stromkabel genie\u00dfen. Es war noch nie so einfach, den Unterhaltungsbereich aufger\u00e4umt zu halten.\\n\\n<b>Minimales Design bietet verbesserte Interaktivit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nDank der Samsung TV Kamera f\u00fcr HD-Videoanrufe st\u00f6rt eine Kamera am Fernseher Ihr Stilempfinden nicht mehr. Mit dem innovativen Doppelgelenksystem k\u00f6nnen Sie die Position f\u00fcr den besten Blickwinkel und die kompakteste Anordnung einstellen und sogar einen eingebauten Fu\u00df erstellen, um sie vor oder neben dem Bildschirm zu platzieren. Mit zwei Mikrofonen und einer einmaligen Abdeckung f\u00fcr Ungest\u00f6rtheit zeigt die STC2000 minimales Design von seiner besten Seite. Durch das schlichte und doch auffallende Design der STC2000 verbessert sie Ihre Videoanrufe auch dann, wenn sie auf oder neben dem Fernseher steht."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Come together with HD video calls<\/b>\\n\\nExperience video calls at their absolute best with the Samsung TV Camera. Video calls via services like Skype\u2122 take on new levels of sharpness and brilliance, especially with two built-in microphones that pick up on every word. And with high-quality video, the camera captures every detail with great clarity, so catching up with friends and family will be a far more immersive and rewarding experience \u2013 as if you are actually chatting in person. So now you can enjoy video calling and turn watching TV into a social event.\\n\\n<b>One cord for faster connectivity<\/b>\\n\\nBring your home entertainment system to life with Samsung\u2019s stylish yet easy-to-install video camera. With just one USB cord for both connectivity and power, attaching this HD video camera to your TV is a quick and easy task. Both electricity and data are delivered through the TV\u2019s USB port, so the STC2000 HD TV Camera keeps its charge and will allow you to enjoy longer conversations, as well as eliminating unnecessary and messy power cables. Keeping a clean entertainment area has never been easier.\\n\\n<b>Minimal design delivers enhanced interactivity<\/b>\\n\\nThanks to the Samsung TV Camera for HD video calls, adding a camera to your television no longer means compromising your style. With an innovative Dual Hinge system, you can adjust positioning to get the best angle and most compact arrangement, and even create a built-in stand for stand-alone placement in front of or beside the screen. With two microphones and a unique lens cover for extra privacy, the STC2000 shows minimal design at its best. The simple yet eye-catching design ensures that when placed on top of or beside the television, the STC2000 complements and enhances the video calling experience."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2dd27127-6c46-4ec5-8f6b-52beab59f95d","identifier":"134116","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["iiyama","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"iiyama ProLite E481S 19\" TFT .29 80kHz MM Silve"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 100-240 V, 50 \/ 60Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"iiyama ProLite E481S 19\" TFT .29 80kHz MM Silve, ProLite. Display resolution: 1280 x 1024, Display: LCD, Contrast ratio (typical): 400:1. Audio system: Stereo. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 100 x 100. Depth: 196.5, Height: 411.5. Certification: TCO 99, MPR III, Safety: CE, T\u00dcV GS, FCC-B, UL\/C-UL, VCCI-B"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":25}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fb8d41a2-0000-4f75-bba7-1fba4db9c806","identifier":"1342089","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["fujitsu","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujitsu SCENICVIEW Series A17-3A"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 - 240 VAC, 50 - 60 Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Featuring the characteristic quality in the adapted SCENICVIEW family look, this 17-inch Advanced Value Line LCD TFT display is the ideal choice for entering the world of professional LCD displays. The space saving and ergonomic design with height adjust offers a new scope for arranging a workplace."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-11-08T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":17,"unit":"INCH"}}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"123647b6-007d-495f-be8c-91d4071a52c2","identifier":"134291","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet 2430t"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 - 127V \/ 220 - 240V, 50\/60 Hz (+\/- 2 Hz)"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"\\n\\nABU - United Kingdom - UK English localization"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"\\n\\nABU - United Kingdom - UK English localization"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2006-09-21T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c82963a4-21ac-4e9b-99d6-6e7791b9a2b1","identifier":"134298","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet 2430dtn"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 - 127V \/ 220 - 240V, 50\/60 Hz (+\/- 2 Hz)"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"\\n\\nABU - United Kingdom - UK English localization"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"\\n\\nABU - United Kingdom - UK English localization"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2006-09-21T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d5ed26d5-60e1-44bd-9932-7cad45c896f9","identifier":"1349295","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","hp"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Photosmart R937 Digital Camera"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-11-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"24183817-e7a7-4b6d-bb1a-20e99b3decb1","identifier":"1349296","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","hp"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Photosmart Mz67 Digital Camera"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Wundersch\u00f6ne Fotos von nah und fern mit bis zu 8 MP und einem HP Pr\u00e4zisionsobjektiv mit 6x optischem Zoom aufnehmen. Es kann direkt losgehen \u2013 \u00fcber intuitive Tasten und Men\u00fcs sowie verschiedene automatische Aufnahmemodi k\u00f6nnen hervorragende Fotos problemlos aufgenommen werden. Fotos auf dem hellen 6,35 cm Display anzeigen, mit der branchenweit f\u00fchrenden integrierten Red-Eye Removal-Funktion[p1] korrigieren und originelle Farben und Rahmen zu Fotos hinzuf\u00fcgen \u2013 und das alles ohne PC. Begeisternde Fotoausdrucke und Vergr\u00f6\u00dferungen bis zum Posterformat. Geeignet f\u00fcr Windows Vista\u2122."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Capture beautiful photos from near or far with up to 8 MP and an HP Precision 6x optical zoom lens. Just grab your camera and go \u2013 easy buttons, intuitive menus and a range of auto modes make it easy to take great photos. View photos on a bright 6.35 cm display, fix them using industry-leading in-camera red-eye removal[p1] and add fun colours and borders \u2013 all without a PC. Create stunning prints and enlargements up to poster size. Windows Vista\u2122 ready."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2007-11-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"442d96bd-de57-4fdc-8f18-9bd628bcdf78","identifier":"134953","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Officejet 7410 All-in-One Printer"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"This advanced All-in-One offers built-in wired and wireless* network capability for sharing between up to 5 PCs. Built-in tools include auto-duplexer, copy collator and 50-sheet ADF, with high speed performance ensuring maximum productivity."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Ce tout-en-un avanc\u00e9 pr\u00e9sente une capacit\u00e9 de r\u00e9seau avec ou sans fil* int\u00e9gr\u00e9e pour un partage avec 5\u00a0PC maximum. Parmi ses outils int\u00e9gr\u00e9s, le recto verso automatique, le tri des copies et un chargeur automatique de documents de 50\u00a0feuilles, avec des vitesses \u00e9lev\u00e9es offrant une productivit\u00e9 maximale."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-08-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b02dc251-1993-49e5-aa87-92175d0222e5","identifier":"135146","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Officejet 7310"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 ~ 240 VAC"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der HP Officejet 7310 All-in-One ist ein hochproduktives Ger\u00e4t mit Ethernet-Netzwerktechnologie, das speziell f\u00fcr die bequeme gemeinsame Nutzung durch bis zu 5 Computer konzipiert wurde. Via Internet ist auch ein Fernzugriff auf den Drucker m\u00f6glich. Fotos k\u00f6nnen ohne PC mit anderen Ger\u00e4ten ausgetauscht werden*. Erstklassige Druckgeschwindigkeiten (bis zu 30 S.\/Min. in Schwarzwei\u00df, bis zu 20 S.\/Min. in Farbe), ein eingebautes 6,4 cm LCD-Farbdisplay und die M\u00f6glichkeit zum automatischen beidseitigen Drucken, Faxen, Scannen und Kopieren machen den HP Officejet 7310 zur idealen, topflexiblen Multifunktionsl\u00f6sung f\u00fcr kleinere Anwendergruppen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Network-ready with 6.4 cm colour LCD and automatic two-sided printing, faxing, scanning and copying.\\n \\n<b>Features<\/b> \\n \\n- Share printing, scanning, fax sending and memory card access with built-in Ethernet networking.\\n\\n- Get more done with outstanding performance and two-sided printing, faxing, scanning and copying.\\n\\n- Print professional quality borderless photos directly from memory cards or via your computer."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique tout-en-un HP Officejet 7310 haut d\u00e9bit a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7u pour faciliter le partage entre cinq ordinateurs maximum sur un r\u00e9seau Ethernet. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement imprimer \u00e0 distance par le biais d'Internet et \u00e9changer des photos entre p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques sans PC*. La vitesse d'impression atteignant 30\u00a0ppm en noir et 20\u00a0ppm en couleurs, alli\u00e9e au confort d'un \u00e9cran int\u00e9gr\u00e9 de 6,4\u00a0cm et \u00e0 l'impression, la t\u00e9l\u00e9copie, la num\u00e9risation et la copie recto verso automatiques, fait de ce tout-en-un un outil polyvalent id\u00e9al pour le partage de donn\u00e9es entre plusieurs utilisateurs."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-08-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"28cacd9e-06ec-4582-8819-0e4d26854097","identifier":"13526636","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 241P4LRYES"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der innovative Philips ErgoSensor-Monitor ist der weltweit erste intelligente Monitor, der Ihnen Empfehlungen f\u00fcr die ergonomisch richtige Sitzposition vor Ihrem Computerbildschirm gibt."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The innovative Philips ErgoSensor monitor is the world's first intelligent display that can advise you how to sit in an ergonomically correct position at your computer screen ErgoSensor for ultimate ergonomics\\n- ErgoSensor for a healthier way of working\\n- Neck posture detection and corrective advice\\n- Optimal viewing distance measurement and advice\\n- Time-break reminder\\n- Saves up to 80% energy costs\\n<b>Sustainable Eco-design<\/b>\\n- Zero power consumption with 0 watt hard switch\\n- 65% post consumer recycled plastics with TCO Edge\\n- PVC-BFR free housing\\n<b>Designed for people<\/b>\\n- SmartErgoBase enables people-friendly ergonomic adjustments\\n- Low bezel-to-table height for maximum reading comfort\\n<b>Easy to experience<\/b>\\n- SmartImage presets for easy optimized image settings"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Premier \u00e9cran \u00e0 ErgoSensor au monde pour un lieu de travail sain et productif<\/b>\\nLe moniteur Philips \u00e0 ErgoSensor est le premier \u00e9cran intelligent, vous indiquant comment vous installer de mani\u00e8re ergonomique devant l'ordinateur.\\n\\n<b>ErgoSensor pour une ergonomie parfaite<\/b>\\n- ErgoSensor, pour travailler en pr\u00e9servant sa sant\u00e9\\n- D\u00e9tection de la position du cou et conseil de correction\\n- Distance de visionnage optimale et conseil\\n- Rappel de pause\\n- Jusqu'\u00e0 80 % d'\u00e9conomie d'\u00e9nergie\\n\\n<b>\u00c9co-conception et d\u00e9veloppement durable<\/b>\\n- Consommation d'\u00e9nergie nulle gr\u00e2ce au commutateur 0 watt\\n- 65 % de plastiques issus d'un recyclage post-consommation avec TCO Edge\\n- Bo\u00eetier sans PVC ni BFR\\n\\n<b>Con\u00e7u pour les utilisateurs<\/b>\\n- La base Super Ergo vous fait gagner en ergonomie\\n- Faible hauteur ch\u00e2ssis-table assurant un confort de lecture maximal\\n\\n<b>Facile d'utilisation<\/b>\\n- Pr\u00e9r\u00e9glages SmartImage pour une qualit\u00e9 d'image facilement optimis\u00e9e"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"338b77ce-b051-41d9-9973-1905ad3ee61a","identifier":"13526654","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 17S1AB"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"3.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":17,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit Funktionen wie SmartImage, SmartContrast, SmartControl und TrueVision tr\u00e4gt der energiesparende Monitor 17S1 zur Steigerung Ihrer Produktivit\u00e4t bei."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Feature packed display for increased productivity<\/b>\\nWith features like SmartImage, SmartContrast, SmartControl and TrueVision, the energy efficient 17S1 business display increases your productivity.\\n\\n<b>Sustainable Eco-friendly solution<\/b>\\n- Energy Star for energy efficiency and low power consumption;\\n- Eco-friendly materials that meets international standards;\\n- EPEAT Silver ensures lower impact on environment.\\n\\n<b>Outstanding display performance<\/b>\\n- SmartImage: Optimized user friendly display experience;\\n- SmartContrast: For incredible rich black details;\\n- TrueVision: Laboratory quality display performance.\\n\\n<b>Great convenience<\/b>\\n- Built-in stereo speakers for multimedia;\\n- Dual input accepts both analog VGA and digital DVI signals;\\n- Screen tilts to your ideal, individualized viewing angle;\\n- Hassle-free display performance tuning with SmartControl II;\\n- Cable management for a tidy work space.\\n\\n<b>Dual input<\/b>\\nDual input provides connectors to accommodate input of both analog VGA and digital DVI signals.\\n\\n<b>SmartImage<\/b>\\nSmartImage is an exclusive leading edge Philips technology that analyzes the content displayed on your screen and gives you optimized display performance. This user friendly interface allows you to select various modes like Office, Image, Entertainment, Economy etc., to fit the application in use. Based on the selection, SmartImage dynamically optimizes the contrast, color saturation and sharpness of images and videos for ultimate display performance. The Economy mode option offers you major power savings. All in real time with the press of a single button!\\n\\n<b>SmartControl II<\/b>\\nSmartControl II is monitor-based software with an easy-to-use on-screen graphic interface that guides you through fine-tuning resolution, color calibration and other display settings including brightness, contrast, clock & phase, position, RGB, white point and - on models with onboard speakers - volume adjustments.\\n\\n<b>Built-in stereo speakers<\/b>\\nA pair of high quality stereo speakers built into a display device. It can be visible front firing, or invisible down firing, top firing, rear firing, etc depending on model and design.\\n\\n<b>TrueVision<\/b>\\nTrueVision is industry-leading, proprietary Philips testing and algorithm technology for monitor adjustment and fine tuning, an extensive process that ensures ultimate display performance in compliance with a standard four-times more stringent than Microsoft's Vista requirements from each and every monitor that leaves the factory - not just a few review samples. Only Philips goes to these lengths to deliver this exacting level of color accuracy and display quality in every new monitor.\\n\\n<b>Adjustable tilt<\/b>\\nAdjustable tilt is backward and forward movement of a screen on its base to achieve custom positioning for an ideal viewing angle and more comfort for people who spend long hours working on the computer.\\n\\n<b>Cable management<\/b>\\nCable management is a system that maintains tidy workspace by organizing cables and wires required for the operation of a display device.\\n\\n<b>EPEAT Silver<\/b>\\nPhilips EPEAT Silver certified monitors ensure protection for human health and environment, and are highly energy efficient ensuring low emissions of climate changing green house gases. EPEAT program helps purchasers evaluate, compare and select Monitors based on 51 environmental criteria supported by US EPA. EPEAT Silver is valid only where Philips registers the product.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly materials<\/b>\\nPhilips is committed to use sustainable, ecofriendly materials across its monitor range. All body plastic parts, metal chassis parts and packing materials use 100% recyclable materials. In some selected models we utilize upto 65% post consumer recycled plastics. Strict adherence to RoHS standards ensure substantial reduction or elimination of toxic substances like Lead, for example. Mercury content in monitors with CCFL backlight has been reduced significantly, while eliminated in monitors with LED backlight completely.\\n\\n<b>Energy Star 5.0<\/b>\\nEnergy Star is a US EPA sponsored energy efficiency program also adopted by many other countries. Energy Star certification ensures that you are buying a product which meets the latest power efficiency standards which operates with maximum power efficiency at all operational levels. New Philips monitors are certified for Energy Star 5.0 specifications and meet or exceed the standard. For example, in sleep mode Energy Star 5.0 requires less than 1watt power consumption, whereas Philips monitors consume less than 0.5watts."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Dot\u00e9 des fonctions SmartImage, SmartContrast, SmartControl et TrueVision, l'\u00e9cran professionnel 17S1 \u00e0 faible consommation d'\u00e9nergie am\u00e9liore votre productivit\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"562e3474-3188-4b0c-a54d-9c7d64123f79","identifier":"13526679","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 19S4LSB"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der Philips LED-Monitor verwendet 25\u00a0% recycelte Materialien. Mit seinem ohne PVC und bromierte Flammschutzmittel hergestellten Geh\u00e4use ist er somit umweltfreundlich und produktiv zugleich."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sustainable productivity with energy efficient LED display<\/b>\\n\\nThe Philips LED display using 25% recycled materials and PVC, BFR free housing is ideal\\nfor eco-friendly productivity\\n\\n<b>Sustainable Eco-design<\/b>\\n\\n- 25% recycled material with EPEAT Gold\\n- PVC-BFR free housing\\n- 100% recyclable packaging\\n- Zero mercury content\\n- SmartPower: Up to 50% power saving\\n- 0.1 watt Soft-Off mode\\n\\n<b>Great performance<\/b>\\n\\n- LED technology ensures natural colors\\n- SmartContrast gives enhanced rich black details\\n- TrueVision ensures lab quality images\\n\\n<b>Easy to experience<\/b>\\n\\n- Modern Touch controls\\n- SmartImage presets for easy optimized image settings\\n- SmartControl for easy performance tuning"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Utilisant 25\u00a0% de mat\u00e9riaux recycl\u00e9s et ne contenant ni PVC ni BFR, cet \u00e9cran LED Philips est la solution id\u00e9ale pour combiner productivit\u00e9 et respect de l'environnement"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"77dced9e-bbd4-4b6f-8515-4b280caa6869","identifier":"13527381","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["hp","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LV1911"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The HP LV1911 18.5-inch LED Backlit LCD Monitor combines reliable performance with an affordable price. A slim profile and \u201cplug and play\u201d connectivity features complement HP desktops without sacrificing space or IT tie-ups.\\n\\n<b>An affordable, smart solution for your work space<\/b>\\nExperience true brightness and quality visuals across an 18.5-inch diagonal screen with LED backlighting and convienent VGA input for a simple and dependable business montior solution.\\n\\n<b>The power of LED<\/b>\\nHP\u2019s mercury-free LED backlighting reduces the number and overall size of components in a monitor, consumes less power and provides quicker on\/off switching times in comparison to CCFL panel monitors.\\n\\n<b>Design features your business can count on<\/b>\\nUser-friendly features and impressive display performance with a 1366 x 768 screen resolution, 3,000,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio and 5ms on\/off response time.\\n\\n<b>Eco-Highlights<\/b>\\n- The HP LV1911 18.5-inch LED Backlit LCD Monitor makes an impact with:\\n- Arsenic free display glass\\n- Mercury free LED backlighting\\n- ENERGY STAR\u00ae qualification\\n- EPEAT\u00ae Silver registration\\n- China Energy Label\\n\\n<b>HP Support, service and dependability<\/b>\\nIncludes a standard, three-year limited warranty for parts, labor and on-site service. Availability varies by region. Certain restrictions and exclusions apply. For details, contact HP Customer Support.\\n\\n\\n* Except where noted, all prices are estimated U.S. HP prices. Actual prices from other locations or websites may vary.\\n\\n** Leasing information, where displayed, is for a 48-month lease. Shipping and tax not included. Details\\n\\n*** Savings based on preconfigured SmartBuy pricing versus configuring to order. Pricing is available at HP.com and participating resellers and is subject to change without notice."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"430246d0-a4ea-425c-b485-ec55fc9ae8d5","identifier":"13527382","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["hp","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LV2311"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The HP LV2311 23-inch LED Backlit LCD Monitor delivers quality business performance at an affordable price. The ultra-slim ID with \u201cplug and play\u201d connectivity features complement HP desktops without sacrificing space or IT infrastructure.\\n\\n<b>Meeting your business needs, and the budget<\/b>\\nExpand productivity across this 23-inch diagonal LED backlit screen with quality visuals, an attractive, thin profile and convenient VGA and DVI-D (with HDCP) input connectivity.\\n\\n<b>Experience LED<\/b>\\nMercury-free LED backlighting reduces the overall size of the monitor for a sleek, slim profile, consumes less power and provides quicker on\/off switching times in comparison to CCFL panel monitors.\\n\\n<b>A new class of quality<\/b>\\nImpressive display performance with Full HD 1920 x 1080 screen resolution, 1,000,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio and 5ms on\/off response time.\\n\\n<b>Eco-Highlights<\/b>\\n- The HP LV2311 23-inch LED Backlit LCD Monitor makes an impact with:\\n- Arsenic free display glass\\n- Mercury free LED backlighting\\n- BFR\/PVC free plastics, finishes and stand\\n- ENERGY STAR\u00ae qualification\\n- EPEAT\u00ae Silver registration\\n- China Energy Label\\n\\n<b>HP Support, service and dependability<\/b>\\nIncludes a standard, three-year limited warranty. Availability varies by region. Certain restrictions and exclusions apply. For details, contact HP Customer Support.\\n\\n* Except where noted, all prices are estimated U.S. HP prices. Actual prices from other locations or websites may vary.\\n\\n** Leasing information, where displayed, is for a 48-month lease. Shipping and tax not included. Details\\n\\n*** Savings based on preconfigured SmartBuy pricing versus configuring to order. Pricing is available at HP.com and participating resellers and is subject to change without notice."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"445f64db-33f6-4c38-b142-3b69562c76ee","identifier":"13527420","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales","viewsonic"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Viewsonic LED LCD CDP4737-L"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":47,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"ViewSonic\u2019s new CDP4737-L commercial display features full HD 1920x1080p IPS panel technology, fast 120Hz response time and 50,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio. Slim ID design, combined with 28mm bezel width makes the CDP4737-L an ideal large screen solution for your digital signage application. Additional features include versatile inputs \u2013 HDMI, DVI, VGA, YPbPr and built in media player utilizing USB storage. Other key features include up to 5x5 tiling for video walls and VGA and DVI loop through support."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":12}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6e6283a8-7e39-420c-98d9-4e885618b9c5","identifier":"13538907","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"f\/3\/4\/a\/f34ab0f1d143ea6da8d28b7c9938f1e986cf1c23_13538907_8630.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/f\/3\/4\/a\/f34ab0f1d143ea6da8d28b7c9938f1e986cf1c23_13538907_8630.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony HDR-GW55VE"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5.43"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Full HD-Camcorder mit Resistenz gegen Wasser, Staub und Ersch\u00fctterungen<\/b>\\n\\nFull HD-Aufnahmen auf Mikro-Speicherkarte, optischer 10fach-Zoom\/29,8-mm-Weitwinkel, 7,5-cm\/3\"-LCD-Touchscreen, GPS\\n\\n- Resistent gegen Wasser, Staub und Ersch\u00fctterungen\\n- Verwacklungsfreie Videoaufnahmen, selbst beim Zoomen\\n- Besonders hochwertige Full HD-Bilder bei schwachem Licht"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Full HD camcorder resistant to water, dust and shocks<\/b>\\n\\nRecord Full HD on micro memory card, 10x optical zoom\/29.8mm wide angle, 7.5cm\/3\" LCD touchpanel, GPS\\n\\n- Resists water, dust and shocks\\n- Steady video footage, even when zooming\\n- Very high quality Full HD images in low light"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Camescope Full HD r\u00e9sistant \u00e0 l'eau, \u00e0 la poussi\u00e8re et aux chocs<\/b>\\n\\nEnregistrement Full HD sur microcarte m\u00e9moire, zoom optique 10x \/ grand angle de 29,8 mm, \u00e9cran LCD 7,5 cm \/ 3\", GPS\\n\\n- R\u00e9sistant \u00e0 l'eau, \u00e0 la poussi\u00e8re et aux chocs\\n- R\u00e9alisation de vid\u00e9o plus stable, m\u00eame en zoomant\\n- Qualit\u00e9 sup\u00e9rieure d'image Full HD par faible luminosit\u00e9"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-14T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0b29e8a9-c6cb-4e31-99fe-5efb6b6199f2","identifier":"13544547","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","v7","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_720"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1\/3\/8\/3\/138366db3a77bede7fac5ac0099e7be8d7caff3e_13544547_6105.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/1\/3\/8\/3\/138366db3a77bede7fac5ac0099e7be8d7caff3e_13544547_6105.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"V7 CS720A0"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>The Better to See You With<\/b>\\nV7\u2019s web cameras make it easy to enhance your online communications with high photo resolution and built-in microphone functionality. Chatting online will never be the same again"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b91b51a2-c758-425c-bb72-65ce25a707da","identifier":"13549634","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1\/3\/6\/1\/13619534be6fc56655e22d84cb26b74277db4f3d_13549634_8648.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/1\/3\/6\/1\/13619534be6fc56655e22d84cb26b74277db4f3d_13549634_8648.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R36"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Share your stories effortlessly with Wi-Fi\\nIt\u2019s easy to get close to the action in superb Full HD with the compact LEGRIA HF R36. Share your creations effortlessly with Wi-Fi and enjoy steady footage with Intelligent IS.\\n\\nWi-Fi with MP4 support\\nIn-built Wi-Fi lets you effortlessly share your creations to social networking sites and view your videos on DNLA certified TVs and iOS devices. Support for MP4 format ensures quick transfer times of HD movies.\\n\\n51x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 51x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives excellent colour reproduction even in low light, so your movies will look great on your HDTV.\\n\\nOptical Intelligent IS\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake. It automatically detects the scene and selects exactly the right optical Image Stabilizer settings from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. It ensures sharp, detailed videos in every situation - leaving you free to concentrate on shooting.\\n\\nStory Creator\\nUse Story Creator to effortlessly create memorable movies and help develop your video skills. Choose a theme for your movie and Story Creator gives you on screen suggestions and shooting tips, so you can make captivating videos.\\n\\nCinema-look filters; Touch Decoration\\nInspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters. Select from 8 adjustable colour-grading filters to capture the perfect movie scene. Adding fun effects to your movies without a PC is easy using Touch Decoration.\\n\\nStore direct to external HDD\\nCopy movies direct from the inbuilt memory or SDXC card slot to an external hard drive. Just follow the simple on-screen menus for quick and easy storage.\\n\\nFingertip control\\nOperation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm (3.0\u201d) gesture-based Touch-screen LCD, which gives you intuitive fingertip control of settings and simplifies playback.\\n\\nSmart Auto, Face Detection\\nEffortlessly shoot high quality video with Smart Auto. Intelligent Scene Detection Technology selects the perfect settings from 38 scene modes \u2013 all you have to do is point and shoot, whilst Face Detection optimises the settings for great people shots.\\n\\nHD-SD conversion\\nConvert movies from HD to SD in camera for really easy sharing and web uploading.\\n\\n8GB Dual Flash memory, SDXC card slot\\nAn in-built 8GB Dual Flash memory lets you store over 3 hours of Full HD movies. Record even longer with the SDXC card slot."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-16T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d7eadac2-c1f3-46c3-b2b5-6f80b9c93cd3","identifier":"13550095","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["canon","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon i-SENSYS LBP-6670DN"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Canon LBP-6670DN, i-SENSYS. Maximum resolution: 1200 x 600, Print technology: Laser. ISO A-series sizes (A0...A9): A4, A5, A6, Maximum print size: Legal (216 x 356 mm), Standard tray media types: Labels, Recycled paper, Transparencies. Standard interfaces: USB 2.0. Standard printer languages: PCL 5e, PCL 6, UFRII-LT. Mac operating systems supported: Mac OS X 10.5 Leopard, Mac OS X 10.6 Snow Leopard, Mac OS X 10.7 Lion, Mac OS X 10.8 Mountain Lion"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques d\u00e9taill\u00e9es<\/b>\\n<b>Gagnez en productivit\u00e9<\/b>\\n\\nId\u00e9ale pour optimiser la productivit\u00e9 au sein des groupes de travail \u00e0 forte activit\u00e9, l'i-SENSYS LBP6670dn est assez compacte pour \u00eatre install\u00e9e sur un bureau. Elle permet aux utilisateurs d'obtenir facilement et rapidement des impressions laser noir et blanc de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle, \u00e0 une vitesse de 33 pages par minute. Et avec un temps de sortie de la premi\u00e8re impression de 6 secondes maximum, vous n'aurez plus \u00e0 patienter pour obtenir vos documents.\\n\\n<b>Impression laser de haute qualit\u00e9<\/b>\\n\\nDonnez une valeur ajout\u00e9e \u00e0 vos documents professionnels avec un texte noir parfaitement net et des graphiques clairs et pr\u00e9cis. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution d'impression maximale de 1200 x 1200 dpi, l'i-SENSYS LBP6670dn garantit une finition haut de gamme pour tous vos travaux. Int\u00e9grant en standard une m\u00e9moire de 512 Mo, l'imprimante est \u00e9quip\u00e9e pour r\u00e9pondre aux exigences de l'impression r\u00e9seau et traiter des documents et des graphiques volumineux et complexes avec la plus grande pr\u00e9cision.\\n\\n<b>Simplicit\u00e9 d'utilisation<\/b>\\n\\nFacile \u00e0 utiliser, m\u00eame pour des utilisateurs inexp\u00e9riment\u00e9s, l'imprimante est dot\u00e9e d'un \u00e9cran LCD intuitif de 5 lignes qui simplifie la configuration et la navigation entre les diff\u00e9rents param\u00e8tres.\\n\\n<b>Int\u00e9gration r\u00e9seau facile<\/b>\\n\\nAvec l'i-SENSYS LBP6670dn, partager des impressions sur le r\u00e9seau est facile et rapide. Elle int\u00e8gre la connexion Gigabit Ethernet pour suivre des cadences soutenues sans affecter les performances r\u00e9seau. Elle prend \u00e9galement en charge les normes d'impression PCL5e\/6 et Adobe\u00ae PostScript pour s'int\u00e9grer parfaitement \u00e0 vos flux d'impression.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez vos co\u00fbts tout en faisant des \u00e9conomies d'\u00e9nergie<\/b>\\n\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression recto verso automatique, la consommation de papier et les gaspillages sont r\u00e9duits. Un ensemble de fonctions d'\u00e9conomie d'\u00e9nergie permet \u00e9galement de diminuer les co\u00fbts d'exploitation. Affichant une consommation de 1 W seulement en veille, l'imprimante i-SENSYS LBP6670dn est conforme \u00e0 la norme Energy Star. Sa faible consommation r\u00e9elle d'\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 (TEC) de 1,3 kWh fait d'elle l'imprimante la plus \u00e9conome en \u00e9nergie de sa cat\u00e9gorie.\\n\\n<b>Simplicit\u00e9 d'entretien<\/b>\\n\\nPour une disponibilit\u00e9 maximale et un minimum d'entretien, l'imprimante est dot\u00e9e d'une cartouche \u00e9conomique Tout-en-Un contenant le toner, le tambour et les unit\u00e9s de nettoyage. La cartouche se remplace facilement en quelques secondes, sans laisser de traces. Utilisez une cartouche laser Canon authentique pour des r\u00e9sultats de haute qualit\u00e9 \u00e0 chaque fois."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-16T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"427d6c92-1b57-499b-a9cf-d064159034a8","identifier":"13554859","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lenovo","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenovo ThinkVision LT1421"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A second screen for mobile professionals<\/b>\\n\\nThis mobile monitor works great for ad hoc meetings in places like hotel lobbies or cafes that lack access to a projector and even for extra screen space for work that requires multitasking on the go.\\n\\n- True mobility: USB 2.0 video input delivers both signal and power;\\n- Ultra Productivity: Connects up to six mobile monitors;\\n- Extends the display for on-the-go multitasking;\\n- Shares presentations effectively with mirror mode;\\n- Packs easily at under 2 LBS and 0.36 inches at its thinnest;\\n- Connects quickly with plug-and-play technology;\\n- Convenient ergonomic design: control brightness (up to 16 settings) and tilt angle for comfort;\\n- Tested durability and reliability for travel convenience."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":14,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4b307e1a-3ebe-4a68-a78e-c6e3eb558b1e","identifier":"13561062","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["lenovo","pc_monitors","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenovo ThinkVision LS1922"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"This monitor is best suited for individual study and entertainment, spreadsheet users and web browsing. The Lenovo LS1922 Wide is a 18.5\" Monitor which adopts the latest W-LED backlight technology and provides great display quality and saves power consumption up to 40% compared to previous product. The Lenovo LS1922 Wide is packed with green features including being mercury-free by adopting white LED backlights, arsenic-free glass, and meeting the latest Energy-Star standard and being TCO Displays 5.2 compliant. The Lenovo LS1922 Wide monitor provides 1366 x 768 resolution. This widescreen monitor improves efficiency with easy viewing of multiple applications. The LS1922 Wide monitor coordinates with any Lenovo ThinkCentre, IdeaCentre. It matches the Lenovo design and comes in a black finish."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6455d0dd-d4ab-4c3e-9a0c-0be3e24382bf","identifier":"13561106","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","print_scan_sales","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox D125V_A multifunctional"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Schnelle und produktive Ausgabe - so sparen Sie nicht nur Zeit, sondern auch Geld.\\n- Un\u00fcbertroffene Bildqualit\u00e4t unterst\u00fctzt Sie bei der Gewinnung von Folgeauftr\u00e4gen.\\n- Benutzerfreundlich - durch die intuitive Benutzeroberfl\u00e4che sind Sie schnell in der Lage, mehr Druckauftr\u00e4ge zu realisieren.\\n- Flexibilit\u00e4t - Sie w\u00e4hlen die Serveroption und die Zufuhr- und Endverarbeitungsoptionen, die am besten zu Ihrem Unternehmen passen.\\n- Ausgelegt f\u00fcr hohe Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit und Produktivit\u00e4t.\\n\\n- hohe Druckgeschwindigkeit von bis zu 95 Seiten pro Minute\\n- leistungsstarkes Kopieren\/Scannen mit bis zu 200 Seiten pro Minute\\n- Druckaufl\u00f6sung von 2400 x 2400 dpi f\u00fcr eine kontinuierlich hochwertige Wiedergabe von Texten, kompakten Abbildungen, Fotos und Grafiken. Mit au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnlicher Druckbildausrichtung f\u00fcr makellose, professionelle Ergebnisse.\\n- Farbscannen mit einer Scanaufl\u00f6sung von 600 x 600 dpi und 8-Bit Grau (256 Stufen) f\u00fcr Kopien, die dem Original tats\u00e4chlich entsprechen .\\n- Exklusiver EA-Toner von Xerox f\u00fcr feinste Details, gestochen scharfen Text, perfekte Halbt\u00f6ne und tiefschwarze Vollfl\u00e4chen.\\n- Umfassende integrierte Endbearbeitungsoptionen f\u00fcr die Erweiterung Ihres Anwendungsspektrums, z. B. Sortieren, Heften, Lochen, Beschneiden, Brosch\u00fcrenerstellung und verschiedene Falzoptionen.\\n- Modernster integrierter Controller f\u00fcr die Prozessflusskontrolle standardm\u00e4\u00dfig. Es besteht aber auch die M\u00f6glichkeit zum Upgrade auf den FreeFlow\u2122 Print Server, um die Einsatzm\u00f6glichkeiten f\u00fcr den Produktionsdruck zu erweitern.\\n\\n- Bildungswesen: Unterrichtsmaterialien f\u00fcr Lehrer, \u00dcbungsmappen, Studentenverzeichnisse, Kursmaterialien und Jahrb\u00fccher\\n- Rechts-, Versicherungs- und Gesundheitswesen: Dokumente f\u00fcr Antr\u00e4ge, Beweisf\u00fchrung und Fallbetreuung, Zeitpl\u00e4ne und Kundeninformationen\\n- Schnelldruckereien, Franchise-Druckbetriebe oder unternehmensinterne \/ Werksdruckereien: Handb\u00fccher, Marketingmaterial, Kalender, Kataloge, Newsletter und Formulare\\n- Serviceb\u00fcro oder Datencenter: Berichte, Rechnungen und Zeitpl\u00e4ne\\n- B\u00fcroumgebung: Zeitungen\/Magazine, Infomaterial, Pr\u00e4sentationen, Berichte und Korrespondenz\\n\\n<b>Digitalisieren. . . Organisieren. . . Verteilen. . . Zusammenarbeiten<\/b>\\nDigitale Dokumente haben zahlreiche Vorteile: Sie lassen sich leichter erstellen, durchsuchen, wiederverwenden und weiterentwickeln. Mit einer innovativen Workflow-Software von Xerox und Xerox Business Partnern sch\u00f6pfen Sie das Potenzial Ihrer Investitionen optimal aus und profitieren von entscheidenden Vorteilen:\\n- Kosteneinsparung\\n- Wissensaustausch\\n- Schnellerer Workflow\\n- Integration gedruckter und elektronischer Dokumente\\n- H\u00f6here Effektivit\u00e4t bei Dokumentmanagement und -distribution"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Fast speeds and productive output save you both time and money\\n- Unsurpassed image quality helps you win repeat customers\\n- Easy to use \u2013 minimal learning curve gets you up and printing quickly so you can produce more jobs\\n- Flexibility to choose the server options, media feeding and finishing capabilities that make the most sense for your business or organization\\n- Engineered for maximum uptime and long-life durability\\n\\n- Fast print speeds of up to 95 pages per minute\\n- High-performance copying\/scanning at up to 200 images per minute\\n- 2400 x 2400 dpi print resolution delivers consistent, high-quality reproduction of text, solids, photos and graphics, with exceptional registration for polished, professional results\\n- Color scanning with 600 x 600 dpi with 8-bit gray (256 shades) scan resolution produces copy output that truly matches the original\\n- Xerox-exclusive EA toner produces the highest levels of detailing, with the sharpest text and halftones, and deep, solid blacks.\\n- A robust set of in-line finishing options to expand your application capabilities \u2013 including collating, stapling, hole punching, trimming, booklet making, lay-flat books, full-bleed booklets, and various folding options\\n- State-of-the-art integrated controller comes standard to control your workflow, with the option to upgrade to FreeFlow\u2122 Print Server to step up to production-level printing capabilities.\\n\\n- Education: teacher curriculum materials, workbooks, student directories, course packs and yearbooks\\n- Legal, Insurance and Healthcare: evidentiary, discovery and case management documents, schedules and newsletters\\n- Quick, Franchise or Enterprise\/In-plant Printers: manuals, collateral, calendars, catalogs, newsletters and forms\\n- Service Bureau or Data Center: statements, bills and schedules\\n- Office: newsletters, handouts, presentations, reports and correspondence\\n\\n<b>Digitize . . . Organize . . . Distribute . . . Collaborate<\/b>\\nWith digital documents, you can easily create, search, re-use, and build upon your documents. Maximize your hardware investments with innovative software solutions from Xerox and Xerox Business Partners:\\n- Contain costs\\n- Share knowledge\\n- Accelerate workflow\\n- Integrate paper and electronic documents\\n- Manage and distribute documents effectively"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Les vitesses rapides et la capacit\u00e9 de production \u00e9pargnent votre temps et votre budget\\n- La qualit\u00e9 d'image in\u00e9gal\u00e9e vous aide \u00e0 gagner des clients r\u00e9currents\\n- Simple d'emploi \u2013 une courbe d'apprentissage minimale vous permet de commencer \u00e0 imprimer rapidement. Vous produisez davantage\\n- Souplesse du choix des options de serveur, de l'alimentation du support et des capacit\u00e9s de finition les mieux adapt\u00e9es \u00e0 votre activit\u00e9 ou \u00e0 votre entreprise\\n- Con\u00e7u pour une disponibilit\u00e9 optimale et une dur\u00e9e de service prolong\u00e9e\\n\\n- Vitesses d'impression rapides pouvant atteindre 95 pages par minute\\n- Copie\/num\u00e9risation haut volume pouvant atteindre 200 images par minute\\n- La r\u00e9solution d'impression de 2400 x 2400 dpi assure syst\u00e9matiquement la reproduction de haute qualit\u00e9 des textes, des \u00e0-plats, des photos et des graphiques, avec un calage exceptionnel pour des r\u00e9sultats professionnels impeccables\\n- La r\u00e9solution de num\u00e9risation couleur en 600 x 600 dpi et niveaux de gris 8 bits (256 nuances) produit des copies r\u00e9ellement fid\u00e8les \u00e0 l'original\\n- Le toner EA exclusif de Xerox produit les plus hauts niveaux de d\u00e9tail, le texte et les demi-teintes les plus nets et des \u00e0-plat d'un noir profond.\\n- Une solide offre d'options de finition en ligne pour \u00e9tendre les capacit\u00e9s applicatives, notamment assemblage, agrafage, perforation, rognage, brochage et diff\u00e9rentes options de pliage\\n- Le contr\u00f4leur de pointe est int\u00e9gr\u00e9 en standard pour g\u00e9rer votre flux de travail, avec option de mise \u00e0 niveau vers le serveur d'impression\u2122 FreeFlow pour intensifier les capacit\u00e9s de production haut volume.\\n\\n- Enseignement : documents de cursus de l'enseignant, manuels, r\u00e9pertoires de l'\u00e9tudiant, cours et albums de fin d'ann\u00e9e\\n- Juridique, assurances et sant\u00e9 : documents de preuves, d'indices et de gestion des cas, \u00e9ch\u00e9anciers et bulletins d'information\\n- Reprographe ou centre de reprographie interne : manuels, accessoires, calendriers, catalogue, bulletins d'information et formulaires\\n- Bureau d'\u00e9tudes ou centre de traitement : relev\u00e9s, factures et \u00e9ch\u00e9anciers\\n- Bureautique : bulletins d'information, prospectus, pr\u00e9sentations, rapports et correspondance\\n\\n<b>Num\u00e9risez . . . Organisez . . . Distribuez . . . Collaborez<\/b>\\n- Gr\u00e2ce aux documents num\u00e9riques, vous pouvez facilement cr\u00e9er, rechercher, r\u00e9utiliser et d\u00e9velopper vos documents. Optimisez vos investissements gr\u00e2ce aux logiciels Workflow Software innovants de Xerox et des partenaires Xerox Business Partners, puis :\\n- Ma\u00eetrisez les co\u00fbts\\n- Partagez les connaissances\\n- Acc\u00e9l\u00e9rez le workflow\\n- Int\u00e9grez les documents papier et \u00e9lectroniques\\n- G\u00e9rez et distribuez les documents efficacement"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5d3058ca-871e-4ae9-9979-e46744f9ec79","identifier":"13561192","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 23EL933G LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit ihren schlanken Geh\u00e4usen bieten die Fernseher der EL933G-Serie beste HD-Unterhaltung auf kleinstem Raum.\\n\\n<b>LED<\/b>\\nLEDs wandeln Strom effizient in Licht um und liefern zus\u00e4tzlich bessere Kontraste und leuchtendere Farben. Die Full-HD-Aufl\u00f6sung unterstreicht diese hervorragenden Eigenschaften zus\u00e4tzlich.\\n\\n<b>FULL HD<\/b>\\nF\u00fcr Bilder in High Definition Aufl\u00f6sung, wie sie durch HDTV und Blu-ray bereitgestellt werden, hat sich in Europa die Aufl\u00f6sung 1.920x1.080 Bildpunkte f\u00fcr das \u00fcbertragene Signal weitgehend durchgesetzt.\\n\\n<b>Dualtuner<\/b>\\nDieser TV bietet neben einem analogen Tuner ebenfalls einen Tuner f\u00fcr DVB-T und DVB-C (HD).\\n\\n<b>Videos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle<\/b>\\nMit diesem TV k\u00f6nnen Sie Videos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle genie\u00dfen.\\n\\n<b>Dolby Pulse<\/b>\\nDiser TV verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber die Dolby Pulse Technologie."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba 23EL933G. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, NTSC 4.43, PAL BG, PAL DK, PAL I, SECAM B\/G, SECAM D\/K, SECAM L, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-C2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital +. Video formats supported: AVCHD, AVI, DAT, FLV, H.264, M-JPEG, MKV, MP4, MPEG1, MPEG2, MPEG4, MPG, TP, TRP, TS, VOB, XVID, Audio formats supported: AAC, HE-AAC, LPCM, MP3, MP4, Image formats supported: JPG. Control type: Buttons"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"309e5d39-00c9-423d-858e-d13a1b333e24","identifier":"13561193","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 23EL934G LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>LED<\/b>\\nLEDs wandeln Strom effizient in Licht um und liefern zus\u00e4tzlich bessere Kontraste und leuchtendere Farben. Die Full-HD-Aufl\u00f6sung unterstreicht diese hervorragenden Eigenschaften zus\u00e4tzlich.\\n\\n<b>FULL HD<\/b>\\nF\u00fcr Bilder in High Definition Aufl\u00f6sung, wie sie durch HDTV und Blu-ray bereitgestellt werden, hat sich in Europa die Aufl\u00f6sung 1.920x1.080 Bildpunkte f\u00fcr das \u00fcbertragene Signal weitgehend durchgesetzt.\\n\\n<b>Videos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle<\/b>\\nMit diesem TV k\u00f6nnen Sie Videos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle genie\u00dfen.\\n\\n<b>Dualtuner<\/b>\\nDieser TV bietet neben einem analogen Tuner ebenfalls einen Tuner f\u00fcr DVB-T und DVB-C (HD).\\n\\n<b>Dolby Pulse<\/b>\\nDiser TV verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber die Dolby Pulse Technologie."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba 23EL934G. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, NTSC 4.43, PAL BG, PAL DK, PAL I, SECAM B\/G, SECAM D\/K, SECAM L, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-C2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital +. Video formats supported: AVI, DAT, FLV, H.264, M-JPEG, MKV, MP4, MPEG1, MPEG2, MPEG4, MPG, TP, TRP, TS, VOB, XVID, Audio formats supported: AAC, HE-AAC, LPCM, MP3, MP4, Image formats supported: JPG. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 100 x 100"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e2a112ce-c105-479d-8272-3fec6ade4654","identifier":"13561194","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 26DL934G LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Warum nur im Wohnzimmer ein hervorragendes Bild genie\u00dfen? Erleben Sie scharfe HD-Bildqualit\u00e4t mit einem schlanken, stromsparenden LED-Fernseher der DL934G-Serie. Integrierter Digital-Tuner, USB-Wiedergabe und DVD-Laufwerk sparen Platz und bieten jederzeit beste Unterhaltung auf Knopfdruck.\\n\\n<b>LED<\/b>\\nLEDs wandeln Strom effizient in Licht um und liefern zus\u00e4tzlich bessere Kontraste und leuchtendere Farben. Die Full-HD-Aufl\u00f6sung unterstreicht diese hervorragenden Eigenschaften zus\u00e4tzlich.\\n\\n<b>HD READY<\/b>\\nHD Ready bedeutet, dass dieser Fernseher \u00fcber eine HD Aufl\u00f6sung von 1366 x 768 Bildpunkten verf\u00fcgt und somit f\u00fcr HD-Fernsehen geeignet ist.\\n\\n<b>DVD-Player integriert<\/b>\\nDieser TV hat einen integrierten DVD Player, so dass Sie auf ein externes Ger\u00e4t verzichten k\u00f6nnen und trotzdem all Ihre Lieblingsfilme genie\u00dfen k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>Dualtuner<\/b>\\nDieser TV bietet neben einem analogen Tuner ebenfalls einen Tuner f\u00fcr DVB-T und DVB-C (HD).\\n\\n<b>Videos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle<\/b>\\nMit diesem TV k\u00f6nnen Sie Videos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle genie\u00dfen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba 26DL934G. HD type: HD-Ready, Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, NTSC 4.43, PAL BG, PAL DK, PAL I, SECAM B\/G, SECAM D\/K, SECAM L, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-C2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital +. Optical disc player type: DVD player, Disc types supported: CD, CD-R, DVD, DVD+R, DVD+RW, DVD-R, DVD-RW. Video formats supported: AVCHD, AVI, DAT, H.264, M-JPEG, MKV, MP4, MPEG1, MPEG2, MPEG4, MPG, VOB, XVID, Audio formats supported: AAC, HE-AAC, LPCM, MP3, MP4, Image formats supported: JPG"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bcdf3e72-1a98-4580-be9b-7eb7da734739","identifier":"13565309","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE40ES5500W"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE40ES5500W. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, PAL, SECAM, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus \/ Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Smart modes: Cinema, Energy saving, Game, Sports"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"nbsp;\\n<br\/><b>Des couleurs encore plus vives pour de meilleures images<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un algorithme avanc\u00e9 permettant d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019image, la fonction Wide Color Enhancer Plus de Samsung am\u00e9liore consid\u00e9rablement la qualit\u00e9 des images et d\u00e9voile tous les d\u00e9tails les plus subtils. Wide Color Enhancer Plus vous permet de voir les couleurs telles qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 pens\u00e9es.\\n<br\/><b>Profitez des applications, de vid\u00e9os, de Skype, de la navigation sur le Web, et plus encore.<\/b>\\n<br\/>D\u00e9couvrez un nouvel univers de divertissement \u00e0 domicile personnalis\u00e9 et social gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Smart Hub de Samsung mise au go\u00fbt du jour et aux trois incroyables nouveaux services. Family Story vous permet de partager des photos, des messages et des \u00e9v\u00e9nements qui vous tiennent \u00e0 c\u0153ur avec les personnes que vous aimez. En outre, les enfants peuvent se divertir tout en apprenant gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Kids.   Vous pouvez aussi faire de l\u2019exercice et g\u00e9rer votre entra\u00eenement gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Fitness. Il s\u2019agit l\u00e0 de l\u2019exp\u00e9rience de divertissement \u00e0 domicile familial ultime qui vous permet d'acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des contenus stup\u00e9fiants, ainsi qu'\u00e0 un vaste choix d'applications Samsung, \u00e0 la navigation sur le Web, \u00e0 Skype, et bien plus encore.\\n<br\/><b>Gardez le contact gr\u00e2ce aux appels vid\u00e9o Skype sur grand \u00e9cran.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Restez en contact avec votre famille et vos amis en \u00e9tant confortablement install\u00e9 chez vous gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019application Skype pour for Smart TV, disponible gratuitement sur la boutique Samsung Apps. Si vous y ajoutez le kit de cam\u00e9ra Skype vendu s\u00e9par\u00e9ment, vous passerez des appels vid\u00e9o de haute qualit\u00e9 sur grand \u00e9cran \u00e0 vos proches, et ce dans le monde entier et \u00e0 des tarifs r\u00e9duits, voire gratuitement. Vous pouvez cr\u00e9er de nouveaus comptes Skype, acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des comptes existants ou naviguer en utilisant la t\u00e9l\u00e9commande de votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur. Soyez encore plus proche gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la communication en face \u00e0 face.\\n<br\/><b>Votre biblioth\u00e8que multim\u00e9dia personnelle<\/b>\\n<br\/>Enregistrez et stockez vos \u00e9missions t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9es et vos films gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction \u00e9tendue d\u2019enregistreur vid\u00e9o personnel Ready (Extended Personal Video Recorder Ready). Il suffit de brancher une cl\u00e9 de m\u00e9moire USB ou un disque dur au port USB de votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur, de s\u00e9lectionner le programme \u00e0 enregistrer et de le t\u00e9l\u00e9charger sur la cl\u00e9.\\n<br\/><b>Ouvrez les portes de votre salon \u00e0 une exp\u00e9rience multim\u00e9dia compl\u00e8te.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce aux entr\u00e9es High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI), le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur Samsung transformera votre salon en un v\u00e9ritable centre de divertissement multim\u00e9dia. En effet, la technologie HDMI permet une transmission \u00e0 haute vitesse de donn\u00e9es num\u00e9riques \u00e0 haute d\u00e9finition directement sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur depuis une large vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d\u2019appareils."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eac9e7f1-ea90-431d-8f00-e4a89a1f8d5b","identifier":"13565310","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE40ES6300S"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE40ES6300S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, PAL, SECAM, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus \/ Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Wireless LAN type: 802.11b, 802.11g, 802.11n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"nbsp;\\n<br\/><b>Profitez des applications, de vid\u00e9os, de Skype, de la navigation sur le Web, et plus encore.<\/b>\\n<br\/>D\u00e9couvrez un nouvel univers de divertissement \u00e0 domicile personnalis\u00e9 et social gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Smart Hub de Samsung mise au go\u00fbt du jour et aux trois incroyables nouveaux services. Family Story vous permet de partager des photos, des messages et des \u00e9v\u00e9nements qui vous tiennent \u00e0 c\u0153ur avec les personnes que vous aimez. En outre, les enfants peuvent se divertir tout en apprenant gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Kids.   Vous pouvez aussi faire de l\u2019exercice et g\u00e9rer votre entra\u00eenement gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Fitness. Il s\u2019agit l\u00e0 de l\u2019exp\u00e9rience de divertissement \u00e0 domicile familial ultime qui vous permet d'acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des contenus stup\u00e9fiants, ainsi qu'\u00e0 un vaste choix d'applications Samsung, \u00e0 la navigation sur le Web, \u00e0 Skype, et bien plus encore.\\n<br\/><b>Une toute nouvelle r\u00e9alit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au Full HD<\/b>\\n<br\/>Profitez d\u2019un divertissement \u00e0 domicile encore plus \u00e9poustouflant et plus r\u00e9aliste que jamais. En effet, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution deux fois plus pr\u00e9cise que celle des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs HD traditionnels, votre Smart TV Samsung vous offre une exp\u00e9rience visuelle \u00e0 couper le souffle qui vous fera plonger dans un monde qui d\u00e9passe de loin les limites de votre \u00e9cran. Lorsque vous aurez vu la texture riche et vive des images Full HD, vous ne verrez plus jamais vos programmes t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9s et vos films de la m\u00eame mani\u00e8re.  L\u2019exp\u00e9rience Full HD vous fera d\u00e9couvrir une toute autre r\u00e9alit\u00e9.\\n<br\/><b>Des couleurs encore plus vives pour de meilleures images<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un algorithme avanc\u00e9 permettant d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019image, la fonction Wide Color Enhancer Plus de Samsung am\u00e9liore consid\u00e9rablement la qualit\u00e9 des images et d\u00e9voile tous les d\u00e9tails les plus subtils. Wide Color Enhancer Plus vous permet de voir les couleurs telles qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 pens\u00e9es.\\n<br\/><b>Regardez des films \u00e0 partir de vos p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques USB.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ConnectShare Movie, il vous suffit de brancher votre cl\u00e9 de m\u00e9moire USB au t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur pour profiter instantan\u00e9ment de vos films, de vos photos ou de votre musique. Vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais lire une large vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de contenus sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur en \u00e9tant confortablement install\u00e9 dans votre salon.\\n<br\/><b>Acc\u00e9dez \u00e0 Internet sans fil.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction LAN int\u00e9gr\u00e9e, simplifiez les capacit\u00e9s de connectivit\u00e9 de votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur sans ajouter de fonctionnalit\u00e9s suppl\u00e9mentaires, tout en conservant un design agr\u00e9able. En effet, la fonction pratique Connexion one Foot permet de d\u00e9tecter sans fil les appareils compatibles qui sont plac\u00e9s \u00e0 moins d\u2019un pied (environ 25 cm) du t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur ou du routeur sans fil."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c939a083-c207-4a37-ad00-2b9509850c62","identifier":"13565311","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE46ES5500W"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE46ES5500W. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, PAL, SECAM, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus \/ Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Smart modes: Cinema, Energy saving, Game, Sports"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec sa r\u00e9solution Full HD, cet \u00e9cran int\u00e8gre un ensemble de caract\u00e9ristiques qui rendra votre exp\u00e9rience t\u00e9l\u00e9visuelle in\u00e9dite : CMR 100 Hz et Wide Color Enhancer Plus procurent des images \u00e0 couper le souffle tandis que les fonctions AllShare et Connect Share Movie vous permettent un niveau d\u2019interactivit\u00e9 maximal avec tous vos p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques multim\u00e9dia. Le UE46ES5500 est une Smart TV qui vous ouvre l\u2019acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une offre p\u00e9renne et personnalis\u00e9e de contenus, de services VOD, d\u2019un navigateur Internet, de Skype. D\u00e9couvrez un nouveau monde de divertissement personnalis\u00e9 \u00e0 domicile avec trois nouveaux services : Family Story, Fitness et Kids.\\n<br\/><b>Des couleurs encore plus vives pour de meilleures images<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un algorithme avanc\u00e9 permettant d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019image, la fonction Wide Color Enhancer Plus de Samsung am\u00e9liore consid\u00e9rablement la qualit\u00e9 des images et d\u00e9voile tous les d\u00e9tails les plus subtils. Wide Color Enhancer Plus vous permet de voir les couleurs telles qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 pens\u00e9es.\\n<br\/><b>Profitez des applications, de vid\u00e9os, de Skype, de la navigation sur le Web, et plus encore.<\/b>\\n<br\/>D\u00e9couvrez un nouvel univers de divertissement \u00e0 domicile personnalis\u00e9 et social gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Smart Hub de Samsung mise au go\u00fbt du jour et aux trois incroyables nouveaux services. Family Story vous permet de partager des photos, des messages et des \u00e9v\u00e9nements qui vous tiennent \u00e0 c\u0153ur avec les personnes que vous aimez. En outre, les enfants peuvent se divertir tout en apprenant gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Kids.   Vous pouvez aussi faire de l\u2019exercice et g\u00e9rer votre entra\u00eenement gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Fitness. Il s\u2019agit l\u00e0 de l\u2019exp\u00e9rience de divertissement \u00e0 domicile familial ultime qui vous permet d'acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des contenus stup\u00e9fiants, ainsi qu'\u00e0 un vaste choix d'applications Samsung, \u00e0 la navigation sur le Web, \u00e0 Skype, et bien plus encore.\\n<br\/><b>Gardez le contact gr\u00e2ce aux appels vid\u00e9o Skype sur grand \u00e9cran.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Restez en contact avec votre famille et vos amis en \u00e9tant confortablement install\u00e9 chez vous gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019application Skype pour for Smart TV, disponible gratuitement sur la boutique Samsung Apps. Si vous y ajoutez le kit de cam\u00e9ra Skype vendu s\u00e9par\u00e9ment, vous passerez des appels vid\u00e9o de haute qualit\u00e9 sur grand \u00e9cran \u00e0 vos proches, et ce dans le monde entier et \u00e0 des tarifs r\u00e9duits, voire gratuitement. Vous pouvez cr\u00e9er de nouveaux comptes Skype, acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des comptes existants ou naviguer en utilisant la t\u00e9l\u00e9commande de votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur. Soyez encore plus proche gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la communication en face \u00e0 face.\\n<br\/><b>Votre biblioth\u00e8que multim\u00e9dia personnelle<\/b>\\n<br\/>Enregistrez et stockez vos \u00e9missions t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9es et vos films gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction \u00e9tendue d\u2019enregistreur vid\u00e9o personnel Ready (Extended Personal Video Recorder Ready). Il suffit de brancher une cl\u00e9 de m\u00e9moire USB ou un disque dur au port USB de votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur, de s\u00e9lectionner le programme \u00e0 enregistrer et de le t\u00e9l\u00e9charger sur la cl\u00e9.\\n<br\/><b>Ouvrez les portes de votre salon \u00e0 une exp\u00e9rience multim\u00e9dia compl\u00e8te.<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce aux entr\u00e9es High Definition Multimedia Interface (HDMI), le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur Samsung transformera votre salon en un v\u00e9ritable centre de divertissement multim\u00e9dia. En effet, la technologie HDMI permet une transmission \u00e0 haute vitesse de donn\u00e9es num\u00e9riques \u00e0 haute d\u00e9finition directement sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur depuis une large vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d\u2019appareils."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a836af60-3d99-469a-a920-29b90e697354","identifier":"13566441","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 32TL963G LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die Fernseher der TL963G-Serie bieten den optimalen Einstieg in die 3D-Unterhaltung. Fortschrittliche Bildverarbeitung sorgt f\u00fcr optimale Bildqualit\u00e4t sowohl in 2D als auch 3D und bringt Sie n\u00e4her ans Geschehen. Dank Smart TV genie\u00dfen Sie obendrein die beste Unterhaltung aus dem Internet direkt in Ihrem Wohnzimmer.\\n\\n<b>IN 3D EINTAUCHEN<\/b>\\n3D wird Sie begeistern! Erleben Sie Filme, Sport und Spiele wortw\u00f6rtlich in einer neuen Dimension in Full-HD-3D. Unsere fortschrittliche Bildverarbeitung konvertiert selbst gew\u00f6hnliche 2D-Signale auf Wunsch in die dritte Dimension. (Hinweis: 3D-Brillen separat erh\u00e4ltlich).\\n\\n<b>BESTENS VERBUNDEN<\/b>\\n\u00dcber das Heimnetzwerk k\u00f6nnen Sie sich Fotos, Videos und Musik von Ihrem Computer direkt auf den gro\u00dfen TV-Bildschirm holen. Medien lassen sich sogar drahtlos via WiDi-Technologie* direkt auf den Fernseher senden. \u00dcber drei HDMI-Buchsen finden alle Ger\u00e4te von Spielkonsole bis Blu-ray-Player Anschluss.\\n\\n<b>FINDEN SIE DIE BESTEN SENDUNGEN<\/b>\\nUnser MediaGuide von Rovi hilft Ihnen, die besten Sendungen, Serien und Filme im Fernsehen zu finden. Die umfangreiche Datenbank umfasst mehr als 2,5 Millionen Eintr\u00e4ge und liefert mehr Informationen als herk\u00f6mmliche Programmf\u00fchrer. So k\u00f6nnen Sie beispielsweise gezielt nach Schauspielern oder Regisseuren suchen.\\n\\n<b>Toshiba AppsConnect<\/b>\\nBedienen Sie Ihren Toshiba Fernseher mit Ihrem iOS-Ger\u00e4t (iPhone, iPod Touch, iPad) oder einem Android basierten Mobiltelefon\/Tablet."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba 32TL963G. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, NTSC 4.43, PAL BG, PAL DK, PAL I, SECAM, SECAM B\/G, SECAM D\/K, SECAM L, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S, DVB-S2, DVB-T, DVB-T2. Audio system: Dolby Digital +. Video formats supported: DIVX, MKV, Audio formats supported: MP3, MP4, Image formats supported: JPG. Smart modes: Cinema, Dynamic, Game, Hotel, Movie, PC, Standard, Control type: Buttons"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"92a64532-ece3-4900-b8f7-e12411473ee4","identifier":"13571843","enabled":true,"family":"pc_monitors","categories":["pc_monitors","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S24A650S"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Gentle on the Eyes and on the Environment<\/b>\\nSave electricity and hassle with Samsung\u2019s Eco light sensor. By adjusting screen brightness to match your surrounding environment, the SA650\u2019s Eco light sensor creates a brilliant visual display while also minimizing your energy consumption. You will benefit from a more comfortable viewing experience that is far better for the environment. Monitor brightness is adjusted to match your ambient light, which ensures that the screen is highly visible and appropriately set for your eyes. So, in a dark room the screen will reduce brightness, but when sitting in a room with plenty of light, it will increase brightness. The Eco light sensor is simply perfect for modern living - helping you conserve energy and keep comfortable.\\n\\n<b>Save Energy with New Smart Motion Technology<\/b>\\nStep into the future with the SA650 monitor, which utilizes the very latest in motion sensors to create a monitor that hangs on your every movement. With a built-in PIR (Pyrolectric Infrared Ray) sensor, the SA650 automatically detects movement within a specified area in front of the screen. This allows your monitor to automatically dim or power off, and then power back on or brighten once detecting a nearby viewer. Eco motion sensor is the easiest way to conserve energy.\\n\\n<b>A Business Tool That Produces Crystal-Clear Images<\/b>\\nThe Samsung Business Monitor produces the highest level of static contrast ratio of 3000 : 1. Compared to competitive models in the same class, the Samsung Business Monitor possesses a contrast ratio that is three times higher. This provides users with clear and sharp image representation which is a strong benefit for businesses that work heavily around graphics and other high-resolution images.\\n\\n<b>See Your Work from the Best Possible Angle<\/b>\\nProvide employees with an optimal viewing experience in the office with the reasonably priced Samsung Business Monitor. While conventional monitors have a viewing angle of 170 degrees horizontally, the Samsung monitor has an extra wide viewing angle of 178 degrees. The additional 8 degrees is particularly useful when sharing on-screen information with one or more coworkers or presenting your ideas to clients. The Samsung Business Monitor has improved its vertical viewing angles by 18 degrees, making it the perfect display for giving presentations in front of a large audience or when viewing other content such as a video.\\n\\n<b>A Monitor Designed to Match Business Needs<\/b>\\nThe Samsung LED Business Monitor SA650 has been designed to enhance work conditions and efficiency. Featuring Front Tactile Buttons, the SA650 minimizes costly errors found with high usage, which is a common problem with touch type button monitors. Furthermore, with its smarter design, users can still access these buttons when wall mounted, which can be an issue when monitors feature side panel buttons. Adding to the visual experience, the SA650 features a Narrow Matt Bezel. This reduces distraction around display area and delivers an experience that is immersive and engaging.\\n\\n<b>Conveniently Adjust Monitor Height, Tilt, and Perspective<\/b>\\nThe Samsung LED Business Monitor SA650 has been designed to help boost work efficiency, delivering a tailored experience with its choice of viewer settings. The height-adjustable stand ensures that the screen can always be set at the optimal eye level, which enhances the visual experience while also helping maintain the viewer\u2019s body posture. Other features include the tilt and pivot capabilities, which not only increase comfort levels but also introduce new ways of working. The SA650 Monitor can rotate 90\u00b0 degrees, allowing for more appropriate view depending on the work. So, now you can take convenience and efficiency to amazing heights with the Samsung LED Business Monitor SA650.\\n\\n<b>Control Power Consumption, Conserve Energy<\/b>\\nEco saving makes saving energy easy. It adjusts the brightness of your Samsung monitor based on how much energy you want to save. And with the choice of three energy saving modes (50%, 25% and Power Saving off), you can really tailor your monitor use to meet your own personal needs. Samsung\u2019s commitment to saving energy is designed to help both you and the environment, and with up to 50% saving on consumption, you can really make a positive impact on your eco footprint. Take the effort out of saving energy and take control with Eco saving.\\n\\n<b>Maximize Workspace with the Efficient Handle VESA Wall Mount<\/b>\\nIf you need a work monitor that uses office space efficiently, then Samsung LED Business Monitor SA650 is the perfect choice. From physically moving the monitor with the carrying handle to quickly installing, the SA650 is ready to deliver an efficient and clean work space. The SA650 is also equipped and prepared for you as a VESA Wall mount, providing a multi-screen or wall mounted monitor. Optimizing your office space is now easily achieved with the Samsung LED Business Monitor SA650.\\n\\n<b>Save Energy and See the Results with the Energy Tree<\/b>\\nTake the guess work out of eco savings with Samsung new Energy Tree feature. For the first time, you can now know exactly how much energy you are saving through your eco modes such as the Eco light sensor and the Eco motion sensor. Through an intuitive energy saving status, which can be displayed either intuitively or graphically, you can keep tabs on your efforts to make the world a better place."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}],"display_srgb":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"display_color":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"response_time":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"48b8069b-b133-4ecd-808c-fbb4e78f9a51","identifier":"13572541","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon EOS 5D Mark III + EF 24-105 F4L IS USM"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"EOS 5D Mark III is generated by a full-frame 22.3-megapixel CMOS sensor that can shoot up to 6 frames per second (fps). Powered by Canon's state-of-the-art DIGIC 5+ image processor, the EOS 5D MARK III is capable of incredible ISO speeds of up to 25600 (expandable to 102400). A newly expanded 61-point Auto-Focus (AF) system makes it easier to track subjects with higher levels of precision and speeds.\\n\\n<b>22.3-megapixel sensor<\/b>\\nHigh resolution 22.3-megapixel images of superb quality and detail are attained from Canon's cutting-edge full-frame CMOS sensor technology. New photodiode construction, gapless microlens array and on-chip noise reduction circuitry on the CMOS keep image data clean and clear even at high ISO settings and long exposures, so your photographic vision is never compromised.\\n\\n<b>61-point high-density reticular AF<\/b>\\nThe EOS 5D Mark III features a next-generation Auto Focus (AF) system sporting 61 point high-density reticular AF (41 cross-type points) that offers wide, auto focus coverage at high precision as well as enhanced subject tracking capability.\\n\\nIt offers multi-zone wide-area AF for better tracking, has 5 central dual cross-type points (f\/2.8 diagonal), 21 central cross-type points (f\/5.6 horizontal & vertical) and 20 outer cross-type points (f\/4.0 horizontal) and is sensitive in extremely low-light situations (EV-2 for a central point with a f\/2.8 lens).\\n\\nThe technological advancement in the EOS 5D Mark III dramatically expands focusing accuracy to support a larger range of f\/4.0 and f\/5.6 lenses.\\n\\n<b>ISO expandable to 102400<\/b>\\nNo matter your exposure requirements, the EOS 5D Mark III allows flexible ISO speed settings of ISO 100 \u2013 25600 and expandable to L: ISO50, H1: 51200 and H2: 102400 to adjust the camera's sensitivity to light. From low light indoor environments to the great outdoors in broad daylight, the EOS 5D Mark III captures every picture in the best possible light."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9da6d528-48bd-4e5a-ac3a-a0319497fd6d","identifier":"13574095","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["print"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark XS796de"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"This Lexmark product offers the following resource conserving features:\\n\\nInstant Warm-Up fuser \u2013 Saves energy\\nPower Saver Features \u2013 Reduces the power state of the printer after printing when entering Sleep Mode \u2013 adjustable from 1-240 minutes; reduces power state further when entering Hibernate Mode (a virtual \u201coff mode\u201d)\\nScheduled \u201cwake up\u201d \u2013 Allows accounts to conserve energy by engaging Hibernate\\nMode during periods of the day or week when the printer is not in use and disengaging\\nHibernate Mode during work periods\\nEco-Mode \u2013 Conserves energy and paper through three optional settings:\\nEnergy Saving Mode: Print engine motors do not start until a document is ready to print, the printer enters Sleep Mode after a period of inactivity and printer control panel display light is turned off in this mode\\nPaper Saving Mode: Device defaults to duplex printing and print log features are turned off\\nEnergy + Paper Saving Mode: Energy and paper saving settings are activated\\nQuiet Mode \u2013 Reduces noise emission by adjusting print speed, disabling advanced paper start, disabling or minimizing beeps (key press, alarms, etc.), and adjusting fan speed (Quiet mode may be combined with Eco-Mode)\\nMulti-Page Printing \u2013 Prints multiple page images on one page\\nDuplex \u2013 Prints on both sides of a page\\nRecycled Paper \u2013 Supports the use of recycled content media\\nLexmark Solutions \u2013 Reduces unnecessary printing and simplifies your work processes, such as eliminating the need for stocking paper forms\\nFax Forwarding \u2013 Conserves paper by digitalizing faxes and redirecting to email or file rather than printing (Hard drive option required)\\nPrint Preview \u2013 Conserves paper by allowing users to review print jobs and select pages needed before printing\\nPrint and Hold \u2013 Holds print jobs until released by the user at the printer interface by entering a pin number (Hard drive option needed)\\nDistribute Information Electronically \u2013 Conserves paper by routing scanned documents to e-mail, network folders, USB thumb drives, FTP, and LDSS destinations (Additional options may be required)"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ce998e75-bb7b-4c1f-a3de-3ee5e56407a4","identifier":"13580294","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix JZ100"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A slim and stylish wide-angle 8x zoom camera<\/b>\\nIn six unique colors, a stylish, powerful camera with the prestigious Fujinon 8x zoom lens offers High resolution images.\\n\\nRich in choice with six colors, the stylish compact body brings out the great image quality in the FinePix JZ250 \/ JZ100.\\nAvailable in Black, Silver, Pink, Blue, Red and Purple, simply choose the one that will fit your style.\\n\\nA high- quality Fujinon 8x zoom lens delivers picture-perfect results across the entire zoom range, from wide-angle compositions to dramatic close-up shots.\\n\\nAn impressive 14 Megapixels resolution won't miss the finest details of your subject. Images are captured sharp and clear, in vivid colors, even when printed at large sizes.\\n\\nEven when it's hard to keep your camera steady, the powerful combinetion of lens-shift image stabilization and high sensitivity protects against blurring from camera shake and subject motion so you can capturethe moment.\\n\\nThe large, bright LCD display makes it easy to compose great photos. Sharing pictures is a pleasure, thanks to a high-impact 230,000-dot resolution.\\n\\nFramed scenes are automatically detected and selected into appropriate camera settings: Portrait, Landscape, Night, Macro, Night Portrait, and Backlit Portrait.\\n\\nFace Detection optimizes people pictures by detecting faces and adjusting focus and exposure to ensure bright, clear results.\\n\\nRed-eye removal automatically detects and corrects flash reflection for a perfect end result.\\n\\n<b>Versatile shooting modes<\/b>\\nSet specific scene-based modes suited to the subject matter you are photographing. Or experiment with advanced features, like Motion Panorama.\\n\\nKeeps fast moving subjects in the frame and in focus, even at 8x zoom extended. Great for capturing dynamic close-ups.\\n\\nCan't decide whether it's best to use flash? Choose this mode, press the shutter and automatically capture the same scene twice: once with high sensitivity and natural light, and the second time with Intelligent Flash. Later choose one or keep both!\\n\\nAn extensive selection of pre-programmed shooting modes ensures great photos in various conditions, eliminating the need to fuss with camera settings while delivering optimum results.\\n\\nThe versatile card slot is compatible with high-capacity Secure Digital (SDHC\/SDXC) memory cards."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-22T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5e038b14-1c07-4d82-a56e-e753faca4f3d","identifier":"13584389","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon imageCLASS D1350"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The new imageCLASS D1350 offers your small or medium business speed, convenience and reliability. This device was designed to exceed all of your business needs. It combines the ability to copy, print, scan and fax into one easy-to-use machine.\\n\\nThe D1350 has multiple features that will allow you to be productive throughout the entire day. It features a 500-sheet cassette plus 50-sheet multipurpose tray1 and has print and copy speeds of up to 35 pages-per-minute2. With Quick First Print Technology, your first copy will be ready in approximately 8 seconds3. The 50-sheet Duplex Automatic Document Feeder (DADF) will allow you to copy or color scan from one or two-sided originals and produce two-sided output effortlessly, reducing your paper usage to as much as half.\\n\\nA step up from the D1320, you have the ability to send and receive faxes with the D1350. This model uses a built-in 33.6 Kbps Super G34 fax modem. This machine includes fax features such as 19 one-touch speed dial numbers, 181 coded speed dial numbers, memory capacity of up to 512 sheets5, and duplex faxing.\\n\\nThe intelligent Energy Saver Mode reduces your power consumption to approximately 2.3 watts of energy and the product meets Energy Star guidelines, helping you save money on energy costs. The D1350 also features Department ID Management which allows you to set limits on who can use the machine and how much they can print, copy or scan. This can also be another effective solution for saving money.\\n\\nThe imageCLASS D1350 also incorporates the Canon Single Cartridge System, which combines the toner and drum in one unit making it easy to replace. The result is outstanding image quality and eliminating the complication and warehousing of separate toner and drum consumables."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"21.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a2fb445d-62c7-4334-8e99-d0bf8c0e538f","identifier":"13584390","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon imageCLASS D1370"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The new imageCLASS D1370 will help your small or medium business stay ahead of the curve. This reliable machine combines all of your needs into one easy-to-use compact design, making it a cost effective choice for your business.\\n\\nThe D1370 offers you multiple ways to maintain a productive environment throughout the work day. It features a 500-sheet cassette plus 50-sheet multipurpose tray and has print and copy speeds of up to 35 pages-per-minute. With Quick First Print Technology, your first copy will be ready in approximately 8 seconds. The 50-sheet Duplex Automatic Document Feeder (DADF) will allow you to copy or color scan from one or two-sided originals and produce two-sided output effortlessly, reducing your paper usage to as much as half.\\n\\nThe D1370 is a step up from its sister model the D1350 as it provides Canon's Send Lite feature which allows you to scan digital document information and send it to e-mail addresses and network folders. It also adds the secure print feature which can be an excellent solution for professionals in the medical field as well as law firms. You can feel free to print confidential information and not have to be concerned that another person will take it off of the printer.\\n\\nThe imageCLASS D1370 gives you the ability to send and receive faxes using the built-in 33.6 Kbps Super G34 fax modem. This model has a strong list of fax features, including 19 one-touch speed dial numbers, 181 coded speed dial numbers, memory capacity of up to 512 sheets, and duplex faxing.\\n\\nThe imageCLASS D1370 also incorporates the Canon Single Cartridge System, which combines the toner and drum in one unit making it easy to replace. The result is outstanding image quality and eliminating the complication and warehousing of separate toner and drum consumables."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"354d9aca-934a-4d0f-8184-53b247a95de4","identifier":"13584761","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_letter_216_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet Enterprise 500 color MFP M575dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Einfache Erstellung von Farbdokumenten in professioneller Qualit\u00e4t auf einem Tisch-Multifunktionsdrucker mit einem 8-Zoll HP Easy Select Farb-Touchscreen-Display. Mit Hilfe von individuellen Schnelleinstellungen (HP Quick Sets) k\u00f6nnen wiederkehrende Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe automatisiert werden, einschlie\u00dflich einer Reihe von Senden-an-Funktionen. Vorschau, Bearbeiten und Zoomen von Bildern f\u00fcr pr\u00e4zise Ergebnisse. Zentrale Verwaltung von Aufgaben \u00fcber die gesamte Druckerflotte hinweg mit HP Web Jetadmin. Das Sichern vertraulicher Daten wird unterst\u00fctzt. Funktionalit\u00e4ten k\u00f6nnen bei Verf\u00fcgbarkeit einfach aktualisiert und erweitert werden. Mit den Energiesparfunktionen werden Kosten gesenkt und Ressourcen geschont.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Mit dem 20,32 cm (8 Zoll) Farb-Touchscreen-Display lassen sich Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe ganz einfach im Blick behalten.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Mehr Produktivit\u00e4t: Verwalten Sie Auftr\u00e4ge \u00fcber das 20,32 cm Farb-Touchscreen-Display.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erh\u00f6hung der Leistungsf\u00e4higkeit. Individuell konfigurierbare Schnelleinstellungen (HP Quick Sets) erm\u00f6glichen den Start wiederkehrender Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe mit nur einem Knopfdruck. Vor dem digitalen Versenden an verschiedene Ziele lassen sich gescannte Dokumente auf dem gro\u00dfen Touchscreen-Display bequem betrachten und editieren. Leere Seiten k\u00f6nnen automatisch aus gescannten Dokumenten entfernt werden.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Scan-Auftr\u00e4ge k\u00f6nnen einfach direkt am Drucker verwaltet werden. Individuell konfigurierbare Voreinstellungen (HP Quick Sets) erm\u00f6glichen den Start wiederkehrender Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe mit nur einem Knopfdruck. Hierzu z\u00e4hlen das direkte Versenden gescannter Dokumente per E-Mail, per Fax oder an einen Netzwerkordner. Mit dem gro\u00dfen, farbigen Tochscreen-Display lassen sich diese Aufgaben einfach und im Handumdrehen erledigen.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erstklassige Verwaltbarkeit, Erweiterbarkeit und zuverl\u00e4ssige Sicherheitsfunktionen.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Die f\u00fchrenden L\u00f6sungen HP Web Jetadmin und HP Universal Print Driver erm\u00f6glichen die effiziente Verwaltung der Druckumgebung<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Herausragende Funktionen zum Einsparen von Energie- und Papier schonen die Umwelt.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technologie spart Energie, indem der Drucker bei Bedarf automatisch eingeschaltet und nach dem Druckjob wieder ausgeschaltet wird<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Instant-on Technologie<SUP>3<\/SUP> und Instant-on Copy sparen Energie<SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> HP Web Jetadmin ist kostenlos und kann unter www.hp.com\/go\/webjetadmin heruntergeladen werden. Der HP Universal Print Driver ist kostenlos und kann unter www.hp.com\/go\/upd heruntergeladen werden.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Funktionen h\u00e4ngen vom Drucker und den Einstellungen ab; erfordert m\u00f6glicherweise eine Firmware-Aktualisierung.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Im Vergleich zu Produkten, die herk\u00f6mmliche Fixierung verwenden.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> Im Vergleich mit Leuchtstoffr\u00f6hren.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- The HP LaserJet Enterprise 500 color MFP M575 is an easy-to-use color printer that helps SMBs and enterprise customers manage and streamline their document workflows.\\n- Access and manage using the 8-inch color pivoting control panel; fax, print, copy and scan directly from the printer.\\n- Save time with automatic two-sided printing, a 50-sheet automatic document feeder, and print speeds of up to 31 ppm.\\n- Help keep sensitive business information protected with full IPSec and IPv6 support, and a standard encrypted hard drive.\\n- Update and manage printing capabilities with HP FutureSmart Firmware and add a variety of solutions to enhance performance through the hardware integration pocket."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Cr\u00e9er des documents couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle facilement sur un MFP de bureau avec \u00e9cran tactile couleur HP Easy Select 8 pouces. Utiliser les r\u00e9glages rapides pour lancer les flux de travail une touche, y compris une vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d'options d'envoi. Donner un aper\u00e7u, \u00e9diter et zoomer les images pour des r\u00e9sultats pr\u00e9cis. G\u00e9rer centralement les t\u00e2ches sur toute la flotte avec HP Web Jetadmin. Aider \u00e0 s\u00e9curiser les donn\u00e9es confidentielles. Mettre \u00e0 jour facilement et d\u00e9velopper les capacit\u00e9s \u00e0 mesure que de nouvelles fonctions deviennent disponibles. Les fonctions d'\u00e9conomie d'\u00e9nergie contribuent \u00e0 r\u00e9duire les co\u00fbts et \u00e0 \u00e9conomiser les ressources.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une bonne vision des flux de travail sur un \u00e9cran tactile 20,32 cm (8 pouces).<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Am\u00e9liorer la productivit\u00e9\u00a0: g\u00e9rer les travaux \u00e0 l'aide de l'\u00e9cran tactile couleur de 20,32 cm.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Acc\u00e9l\u00e9rer les performances. Utiliser HP Quick Sets personnalisables pour lancer des flux de travail \u00e0 une touche. Donner un aper\u00e7u et modifier les num\u00e9risations sur le grand \u00e9cran tactile pour l'envoi num\u00e9rique vers de multiples destinations. Supprimer automatiquement les pages blanches des documents num\u00e9ris\u00e9s.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;G\u00e9rer facilement les t\u00e2ches d'imagerie directement sur l'imprimante multifonction. Utiliser HP Quick Sets pour lancer les flux de travail \u00e0 une touche - y compris l'envoi de documents num\u00e9ris\u00e9s directement vers une adresse e-mail ou un dossier r\u00e9seau - depuis le grande \u00e9cran tactile couleur.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une grande g\u00e9rabilit\u00e9, extensibilit\u00e9 et de puissantes fonctionnalit\u00e9s de s\u00e9curit\u00e9.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;G\u00e9rer votre environnement efficacement avec HP Web Jetadmin et le pilote d'impression HP universel<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Aider \u00e0 conserver les ressources avec d'incroyables fonctions d'\u00e9conomie de papier et d'\u00e9nergie.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;R\u00e9duire la consommation d'\u00e9nergie\u00a0avec la technologie HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off qui met l'imprimante sous tension et hors tension en fonction des besoins<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Conserver l'\u00e9nergie avec technologie instantan\u00e9e<SUP>3<\/SUP>et la copie instantan\u00e9e<SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> HP Web Jetadmin est gratuit et peut \u00eatre t\u00e9l\u00e9charg\u00e9 \u00e0 l'adresse www.hp.com\/go\/webjetadmin. Le pilote d'imprimante universel HP est gratuit et peut \u00eatre t\u00e9l\u00e9charg\u00e9 \u00e0 l'adresse www.hp.com\/go\/upd.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Les fonctions HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off d\u00e9pendent de l'imprimante et des param\u00e8tres\u00a0; peut n\u00e9cessiter une mise \u00e0 niveau du micrologiciel.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Par rapport aux produits utilisant la technologie d'alimentation classique.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> En comparaison avec les tubes fluorescents.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eaba4bbe-7ad5-4465-b68b-cdc9484f585d","identifier":"13584765","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_letter_216_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet Enterprise 500 color MFP M575f"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Einfache Erstellung von Farbdokumenten in professioneller Qualit\u00e4t auf einem Tisch-Multifunktionsdrucker mit einem 8-Zoll HP Easy Select Farb-Touchscreen-Display. Mit Hilfe von individuellen Schnelleinstellungen (HP Quick Sets) k\u00f6nnen wiederkehrende Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe automatisiert werden, einschlie\u00dflich von Senden-an-Funktionen. Vorschau, Bearbeiten und Zoomen von Bildern f\u00fcr pr\u00e4zise Ergebnisse. Zentrale Verwaltung von Aufgaben \u00fcber die gesamte Druckerflotte hinweg mit HP Web Jetadmin. Schutz vertraulicher Daten. Funktionalit\u00e4ten k\u00f6nnen bei Verf\u00fcgbarkeit erweitert werden. Mit den Energiesparfunktionen werden Kosten gesenkt und die Umwelt gesch\u00fctzt. Eine integrierte manuelle Hefteinrichtung sorgt f\u00fcr gr\u00f6\u00dfere Bedienerfreundlichkeit.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Mit dem 20,32 cm (8 Zoll) Farb-Touchscreen-Display lassen sich Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe ganz einfach im Blick behalten.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Mehr Produktivit\u00e4t: Verwalten Sie Auftr\u00e4ge \u00fcber das 20,32 cm Farb-Touchscreen-Display.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erh\u00f6hung der Leistungsf\u00e4higkeit. Individuell konfigurierbare Schnelleinstellungen (HP Quick Sets) erm\u00f6glichen den Start wiederkehrender Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe mit nur einem Knopfdruck. Vor dem digitalen Versenden an E-Mail, Fax oder Netzwerkordner lassen sich gescannte Dokumente auf dem gro\u00dfen Touchscreen-Display bequem betrachten und editieren. Leere Seiten k\u00f6nnen automatisch aus gescannten Dokumenten entfernt werden.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Druck-, Kopier-, Fax- und Scanauftr\u00e4ge k\u00f6nnen einfach direkt am Drucker verwaltet werden. Individuell konfigurierbare Voreinstellungen (HP Quick Sets) erm\u00f6glichen den Start wiederkehrender Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe mit nur einem Knopfdruck. Hierzu z\u00e4hlen das direkte Versenden gescannter Dokumente per E-Mail, per Fax oder an einen Netzwerkordner. Mit dem gro\u00dfen, farbigen Tochscreen-Display lassen sich diese Aufgaben einfach und im Handumdrehen erledigen.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erstklassige Verwaltbarkeit, Erweiterbarkeit und zuverl\u00e4ssige Sicherheitsfunktionen.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Die f\u00fchrenden L\u00f6sungen HP Web Jetadmin und HP Universal Print Driver erm\u00f6glichen die effiziente Verwaltung der Druckumgebung<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Herausragende Funktionen zum Einsparen von Energie- und Papier schonen die Umwelt.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technologie spart Energie, indem der Drucker bei Bedarf automatisch eingeschaltet und nach dem Druckjob wieder ausgeschaltet wird<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Instant-on Technologie<SUP>3<\/SUP> und Instant-on Copy sparen Energie<SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> HP Web Jetadmin ist kostenlos und kann unter www.hp.com\/go\/webjetadmin heruntergeladen werden. Der HP Universal Print Driver ist kostenlos und kann unter www.hp.com\/go\/upd heruntergeladen werden.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Funktionen h\u00e4ngen vom Drucker und den Einstellungen ab; erfordert m\u00f6glicherweise eine Firmware-Aktualisierung.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Im Vergleich zu Produkten, die herk\u00f6mmliche Fixierung verwenden.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> Im Vergleich mit Leuchtstoffr\u00f6hren.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- The HP LaserJet Enterprise 500 color MFP M575 is an easy-to-use color printer that helps SMBs and enterprise customers manage and streamline their document workflows.\\n- Access and manage using the 8-inch color pivoting control panel; fax, print, copy and scan directly from the printer.\\n- Save time with automatic two-sided printing, a 50-sheet automatic document feeder, and print speeds of up to 31 ppm.\\n- Help keep sensitive business information protected with full IPSec and IPv6 support, and a standard encrypted hard drive.\\n- Update and manage printing capabilities with HP FutureSmart Firmware and add a variety of solutions to enhance performance through the hardware integration pocket."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Cr\u00e9er des documents couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle facilement sur un MFP de bureau avec \u00e9cran tactile couleur HP Easy Select 8 pouces. Utiliser les r\u00e9glages rapides pour lancer les flux de travail une touche, y compris les options d'envoi. Donner un aper\u00e7u, \u00e9diter et zoomer les images pour des r\u00e9sultats pr\u00e9cis. G\u00e9rer centralement les t\u00e2ches sur toute la flotte avec HP Web Jetadmin. Prot\u00e9ger les donn\u00e9es confidentielles. D\u00e9velopper les capacit\u00e9s au fur et \u00e0 mesure que de nouvelles fonctions deviennent disponibles. Les fonctions d'\u00e9conomie d'\u00e9nergie contribuent \u00e0 r\u00e9duire les co\u00fbts et l'impact. Une agrafeuse int\u00e9gr\u00e9e contribue \u00e0 la commodit\u00e9.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une bonne vision des flux de travail sur un \u00e9cran tactile 20,32 cm (8 pouces).<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Am\u00e9liorer la productivit\u00e9\u00a0: g\u00e9rer les travaux \u00e0 l'aide de l'\u00e9cran tactile couleur de 20,32 cm.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Acc\u00e9l\u00e9rer les performances. Utiliser HP Quick Sets personnalisables pour lancer des flux de travail \u00e0 une touche. Donner un aper\u00e7u et modifier les num\u00e9risations sur le grand \u00e9cran tactile pour l'envoi num\u00e9rique vers e-mail, fax ou dossier r\u00e9seau. Supprimer automatiquement les pages blanches des documents num\u00e9ris\u00e9s.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;G\u00e9rer facilement l'impression, la copie, la t\u00e9l\u00e9copie et la num\u00e9risation directement sur l'imprimante multifonction. Utiliser HP Quick Sets pour lancer les flux de travail \u00e0 une touche - y compris l'envoi de documents num\u00e9ris\u00e9s directement vers une adresse e-mail, un fax ou un dossier r\u00e9seau - depuis le grande \u00e9cran tactile couleur.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une grande g\u00e9rabilit\u00e9, extensibilit\u00e9 et de puissantes fonctionnalit\u00e9s de s\u00e9curit\u00e9.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;G\u00e9rer votre environnement efficacement avec HP Web Jetadmin et le pilote d'impression HP universel<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Aider \u00e0 conserver les ressources avec d'incroyables fonctions d'\u00e9conomie de papier et d'\u00e9nergie.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;R\u00e9duire la consommation d'\u00e9nergie\u00a0avec la technologie HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off qui met l'imprimante sous tension et hors tension en fonction des besoins<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Conserver l'\u00e9nergie avec technologie instantan\u00e9e<SUP>3<\/SUP>et la copie instantan\u00e9e<SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> HP Web Jetadmin est gratuit et peut \u00eatre t\u00e9l\u00e9charg\u00e9 \u00e0 l'adresse www.hp.com\/go\/webjetadmin. Le pilote d'imprimante universel HP est gratuit et peut \u00eatre t\u00e9l\u00e9charg\u00e9 \u00e0 l'adresse www.hp.com\/go\/upd.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Les fonctions HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off d\u00e9pendent de l'imprimante et des param\u00e8tres\u00a0; peut n\u00e9cessiter une mise \u00e0 niveau du micrologiciel.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Par rapport aux produits utilisant la technologie d'alimentation classique.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> En comparaison avec les tubes fluorescents.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"caa2bc0e-20ef-4907-8d40-7d5e689df5b1","identifier":"13586563","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","toshiba"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba Camileo Clip Hot Red"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der neue spritzwassergesch\u00fctzte CAMILEO CLIP Full HD Minicamcorder ist der perfekte Outdoor-Begleiter: Klipsen Sie ihn einfach an Ihre Jacke und nehmen Sie die Action auf, wenn Sie mittendrin sind. Mit nur 85 g Gewicht und kaum gr\u00f6\u00dfer als eine Scheckkarte ist der CAMILEO CLIP nicht nur \u00fcberaus handlich, sondern auch schnell und einfach zu bedienen. Ein 5MP-CMOS-Sensor mit BSI-Technologie f\u00e4ngt Ihre aufregendsten Abenteuer in Full HD und brillanten Farben ein - auch wenn die Lichtbedingungen nicht optimal sind.\\n\\n<b>Hauptfunktionen<\/b>\\n- 1080p Full-HD-Grafikaufl\u00f6sung\\n- Digitaler H.264 HD-Camcorder\\n- Anklipsfunktion\\n- 5MP CMOS-Sensor (bis zu 16MP-Fotos)\\n- BSI-Sensortechnologie\\n- 1,5\" (3,8 cm) LCD\\n- 10-facher digitaler Zoom\\n- Electronic Image Stabiliser (EIS)\\n- HDMI- und USB-Anschluss\\n- Unterst\u00fctzt Micro-SD \/ SDHC \/ SDXC\\n- Webcam und Sprachaufnahme\\n- Robustes Design\\n- Spritzwassergesch\u00fctzt (IPX-2)\\n- Videobearbeitungsfunktion\\n- CAMILEO Uploader"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba Camileo Clip Hot Red. Sensor type: CMOS. Image stabilizer type: digital. Camcorder media type: Memory card, Compatible memory cards: SD, SDHC, SDXC. Focus adjustment: Auto. White balance: Auto, Daylight, Fluorescent, Tungsten"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"81b01fed-75fa-4969-99d3-70152cb336af","identifier":"13598608","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung ST 66"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Product Features<\/b>\\n<b>Clearer shots in the dark with F2.5 Bright lens<\/b>\\nEnjoying a night out on the town? The F2.5 lens captures the light to take clearer shots in the dark. Capturing moments at night have never been easier with this bright F2.5 lens. From sunsets to candle lit dinners, enjoy the moments as they are and never worry about getting dark and blurry results or disturbing those around you with the bright flash of a camera.\\n\\n<b>Capture a vision that\u2019s clearer and wider<\/b>\\nWith its remarkable 16.1MP high-resolution sensor, the slim, stylish ST66 delivers your memories in vivid, sharply-detailed images. The 25mm wide-angle lens ensures you\u2019ll get a memorable group shots, with each and every person in the frame. Also, even if you\u2019re shooting from far away, get as close as you\u2019d like while maintaining optimal image quality with the 5x optical zoom.\\n\\n<b>See what you are going to get<\/b>\\nWith Live Panorama, you can capture every peak of a sprawling mountain range or every skyscraper in a magnificent city skyline to create astounding 180\u00ba panoramic images. And you can preview the image on the LCD before you even snap it. Just hold the shutter button, sweep across the scene and see what you\u2019re going to get before you get it."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"41ab5cb8-330f-4c45-be74-00afb64c1b4e","identifier":"13603494","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung 26HA473"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die optische Besonderheit dieser Serie ist die wei\u00dfe Geh\u00e4usefarbe, die sehr gut in Design- hotels passt. Aber auch in Fitnessstudios, Krankenh\u00e4usern oder Seniorenheimen sorgt sie f\u00fcr ein frisches und freundliches Ambiente. In diesen Bereichen, in denen es in besonde- rem Ma\u00dfe auf Hygiene ankommt, ist zudem Samsungs Fernbedienung ein weiterer Pluspunkt. Sie ist aufgrund ihrer \u00fcbergangslosen Oberfl\u00e4che einfach zu reinigen und bleibt immer sauber und ansprechend."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- REACH\\n- SIRCH Compatibility\\n- Hospitality Plug & Play (Easy Setup)\\n- RJ12 \/ IR pass through\\n- Music Mode (Input: PC\/AV\/Component)\\n- My Channel\\n- Software Clock\\n- Jack Pack Compatiblity\\n- USB Cloning\\n- Bathroom Speaker output\\n- Logo Display with Time out Setting (BMP\/Movie)\\n- Welcome Message\\n- Auto Source mode\\n- Multi Code Remote\\n- Alarm Key\\n- Mixed channel list(DVB T\/C, Analog)\\n- Smoovie Compatibility"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"78de0b3a-4081-49b1-b7cd-ea8947e9e9f0","identifier":"13603495","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung 26HA475"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Da Zeit f\u00fcr Hotelg\u00e4ste immer ein wichtiger Faktor ist, verf\u00fcgt diese Serie \u00fcber eine leicht ablesbare externe Uhr. Ebenfalls entscheidend neben einer gestochen scharfen Bild\u00ad - qualit\u00e4t ist ein beeindruckender Klang, der durch die Soundbar-Kompatibilit\u00e4t noch aus\u00ad gebaut werden kann. Vor allem internationale G\u00e4ste profitieren von der \u201eMy Channel\u201c- Funktion, mit der per Knopfdruck Kan\u00e4le nach L\u00e4nderlisten oder auch Genres ausgew\u00e4hlt werden k\u00f6nnen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Clock & on\/off timer\\n- USB Cloning\/SIRCH\\n- RJP jack\\n- Multi-code Remote\\n- \ufeffScrewed Remote Battery Cover\\n- Sleep Timer\\n- Intergraded speakers (2x 5W)\\n- Bathroom Speaker output\\n- LCD CLock\\n- REACH\\n- Narrow bezel\\n- Soundbar compatibility\\n- My channel"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d245268b-9ebb-420d-a346-69ff61f966cd","identifier":"13603496","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung 32HA470"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Diese solide Hospitality Display-Serie f\u00e4llt vor allem durch ihr elegantes Narrow Bezel Design mit ultraschmalem Geh\u00e4userahmen ins Auge und schafft eine hochwertige Atmosph\u00e4re in jedem Raum. Integrierte Software-Uhr, USB Media Player, Jack Pack Kompatibilit\u00e4t: Ihre G\u00e4sten profitieren von praktischen Funktionen f\u00fcr ein entspanntes Unterhaltungserlebnis. Sehr komfortabel ist auch die \u201eMy Channel\u201c-Funktion, mit der G\u00e4ste auf Knopfdruck spezifi- sche Kan\u00e4le nach L\u00e4ndersprachen oder Genres ausw\u00e4hlen k\u00f6nnen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"With the Samsung LED Series 57\/47, your guests will experience the viewing pleasure that a typical HDTV would deliver, but in an elegantly designed exterior. With the REACH and My Channel feature, your guests receive a wider range of TV programming, enabling you to deliver diverse services directly to the display. Your guests will also experience a true home theatre experience with Soundbar compatibility and additional connectivity capabilities helping to make their stay more memorable. Samsung\u2019s outstanding TV design approach will help to elevate and complement the d\u00e9cor of the room."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"72ff649a-92d7-42d7-9ba7-2e4692d83203","identifier":"13603502","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung 40HA790"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die Hospitality TV Displays von Samsung werden Ihnen helfen den Gastkomfort erheblich zu steigern. Die Kombination der neuesten LED-Technologie mit einem eleganten auff\u00e4lligen Design macht den LED Monitor zum echten Eyecatcher. F\u00fcr viele G\u00e4ste, dreht sich die Welt der Unterhaltung rund um ein Display. Mit der neue Reihe von einzigartigen Features wie verbesserter Bildqualit\u00e4t, topaktuelles Design und umweltfreundliche Funktionen bieten Samsung Hospitality Displays eine flexible Business L\u00f6sung. Die Samsung Hospitality Displays werden dar\u00fcber hinaus die Wahrnehmung Ihres Hotels verbessern. Mit der My Channel Funktion geben Sie Ihren G\u00e4sten die M\u00f6glichkeit Ihr TV-Erlebnis zu personalisieren. Die \u00fcbersichtlichen Men\u00fcs helfen den G\u00e4sten durch die Wahl von Land und Genre schnell die gew\u00fcnschten Programme zu finden. Die Multi Code Fernbedienung erm\u00f6glicht es bis zu 10 TV Ger\u00e4te im selben Raum anzusteueren. Dank der HDMI-CEC Kompatibilit\u00e4t werden beim Anschlie\u00dfen einer Soundbar s\u00e4mtliche TV-Audio Einstellungen automatisch vorgenommen, sodass man sofort beste Surround Sound Qualit\u00e4t genie\u00dfen kann. Die Monitore sind Remote Jack Pack kompatibel wodurch sich zahlreiche Ger\u00e4te, wie zum Beispiel Laptops und TV-Kameras bequem in Bettn\u00e4he anschlie\u00dfen lassen. Die angeschlossenen Ger\u00e4te werden automatisch vom Samsung Monitor erkannt und G\u00e4ste k\u00f6nnen einfach ihre eigenen Filme per USB Verbindung ansehen. REACH ist eine integrierte Set Top Box, die zum Beispiel elektronische Programmguides oder detailierte Informationen zu Hotel und Wetter entweder manuell oder per USB-Cloning auf Raum zu Raum Basis anzeigen und updaten kann. Auf diese Weise lassen sich auch Hotel Logos und Begr\u00fc\u00dfungsbilder auf den Monitoren anzeigen. Die Samsung LED Displays sind sehr energiesparend. Bereiten Sie Ihren G\u00e4sten ein unvergessliches Hotel TV Erlebnis, an das sie sich gerne zur\u00fcckerinnern werden.\\n\\n<b>Full HD 3D-Erlebnis:<\/b>\\nModernste TV-Technik mit Samsung Hospitality Displays. Dieser Hotel TV pr\u00e4sentiert den G\u00e4sten ein verbl\u00fcffend echtes 3D-Erlebnis bei bester Bildqualit\u00e4t. Der Samsung 3D Converter verleiht Ihren Lieblings-TV-Programmen oder Filmen erstaunliche 3D-Tiefe.\\n\\n<b>SIRCH:<\/b>\\nSamsung Interactive Remote Control Hospitality stellt eine unglaubliche Zeitersparnis dar. Statt jeden Hotel TV einzeln zu konfigurieren, nehmen Sie von einer zentralen Position alle n\u00f6tigen Einstellungen vor. So k\u00f6nnen Sie sicherstellen, dass alle G\u00e4ste das beste TV-Erlebnis genie\u00dfen k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>Smart HUB und Smart TV:<\/b>\\nSmart Hub ist eine neue Benutzeroberfl\u00e4che, die dem Nutzer eine gro\u00dfe Vielfalt an M\u00f6glichkeiten bietet. Parallel auf einem Bildschirm Facebook- und Twitter-Nachrichten an Bekannte und Freunde versenden oder mit dem Webbrowser im Netz surfen w\u00e4hrend das TV-Programm weiterl\u00e4uft ist problemlos m\u00f6glich. Smart-TV bietet Ihren G\u00e4sten maximalen Komfort. zahlreiche APPs und eine hervorragende Suchfunktion sind auf den neuen Samsung Hospitality Ger\u00e4ten verf\u00fcgbar.\\n\\n<b>Erh\u00f6hte Wireless-Konnektivit\u00e4t durch AllShare:<\/b>\\nSamsung Hospitality Displays mit AllShare k\u00f6nnen Inhalte wie Filme, Fotos und Musik von pers\u00f6nlichen Ger\u00e4ten drahtlos von dem Ger\u00e4t zum Fernseher weitergeben. So k\u00f6nnen pers\u00f6nliche Inhalte k\u00f6nnen auf dem lebhaften gro\u00dfen Bildschirm genossen werden.\\n\\n<b>Bleiben Sie in Verbindung mit SoftAP:<\/b>\\nSoftAP ist die Abk\u00fcrzung f\u00fcr einen Software-f\u00e4higen Access Point. Diese virtuelle Wi-Fi-Funktion aktiviert einen WLAN-Hotspot, damit andere drahtlose Ger\u00e4te in der Umgebung darauf zugreifen k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>Eingebautes Wi-Fi:<\/b>\\nDank der eingebauten Wi-Fi Funktion ben\u00f6tigen Sie keine LAN-Kabel f\u00fcr eine Internetverbindung.\\n\\n<b>DVB-T\/C\/S2 Tuner:<\/b>\\nDer Tuner bietet DVB-T\/C\/S2 HD-Bildqualit\u00e4t Satellitenrundfunk ohne die zus\u00e4tzlichen Kosten f\u00fcr die Installation von Head-End-Ger\u00e4ten\\n\\n<b>Anti-Diebstahl-Akkuabdeckung:<\/b>\\nDas Ersetzen von gestohlen Batterien kann im Laufe der Zeit kostspielig sein, deshalb werden die Fernbedienungen mit einer speziellen Batterie-Abdeckung gesichert.\\n\\n<b>Feuerbest\u00e4ndiger Rahmen:<\/b>\\nDie Displays sind feuerresistent und sind in der Lage extrem hohen Temperaturen standzuhalten, was die Brandausbreitung verhindert.\\n\\n<b>Musik-Modus:<\/b>\\nG\u00e4ste k\u00f6nnen ihre externen Ger\u00e4te einfach mit dem Samsung Hospitality Monitor verbinden um Musik abzuspielen. Die Panel-Hintergrundbeleuchtung kann ausgeschaltet werden um w\u00e4hrend des Musik-Modus Strom zu sparen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung 40HA790. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2. Audio system: SRS TheaterSound HD. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Cable lock slot: Kensington"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"103e9d79-3583-459e-9c4c-010405892479","identifier":"13603503","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung 46HA590"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Diese schlanke und energieeffiziente Serie mit schlanker Slim-LED-Technologie integriert sich hervorragend in elegante Design-Umgebungen und hilft dabei, das Ambiente eines Raumes aufzuwerten. Hinzu kommt ein hervorragendes Full HD-Sehvergn\u00fcgen. Dank Soundbar-Kompatibilit\u00e4t l\u00e4sst sich das Klangerlebnis zus\u00e4tzlich noch aufwerten. Besonders praktisch: Die Software-Uhr, die \u00fcber einen Knopfdruck auf die Fernbedienung aktiviert werden kann \u2013 auch bei ausgeschaltetem Ger\u00e4t."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Full HD 3D experience Slim LED<\/b>\\nCutting edge TV technology with Samsung Hospitality Displays.\\nIt\u2019s a TV that will satisfy guests looking for the best picture quality, along with an utterly absorbing 3D viewing experience. And because Samsung is at the forefront of 3D technology, viewers will experience the future of home entertainment from the comfort of their room. Available in various screen sizes, Samsung\u2019s Hospitality Displays produce full HD 3D images that are amazingly realistic and bursting with vivid colour. We achieve the very highest standard in 3D imaging through our intuitive 3D HyperReal Engine. This technology controls the colour, contrast, 3D effects and motion for mind-blowing results. Images are so life-like and crystal-clear that they ensure that the viewing experience is not only captivating, but also comfortable. Enjoying 2D images in 3D is a brilliant reality with Samsung Hospitality Displays. At the push of a button Samsung 3D Converter transforms your favourite TV programmes or movies with amazing 3D-depth. It will reinvent your favourite 2D content.\\n\\n<b>Slim LED<\/b>\\nSuperior TVs in your rooms can provide a valuable part of a quality hotel experience. With the eye-catching yet elegant design of our slim LED Hospitality Displays, you can elevate your guest\u2019s viewing pleasure like never before. Created specifically for premium hotels, the sophisticated design of our TVs will become the focal point of your rooms\\n\\n<b>Increased wireless connectivity through AllShare<\/b>\\nThrough Samsung Hospitality Displays with AllShare, powered by DLNA, content including movies, photos and music in DLNA en-abled personal devices can be seamlessly shared between the device and the TV, even wirelessly. That means personal content can be enjoyed on the vivid larger screen, helping to enhance the overall entertainment experience.\\n\\n<b>Energy saving of up to 40%<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s range of energy-efficient LED TVs is setting the standard when it comes to saving energy and reducing costs. Samsung Hospitality Displays are a cost effective business solution due to their energy-efficient features and ability to decrease maintenance and management oversight. Our Hospital-ity Displays offer a number of energy efficient advantages that are designed to lower power usage and your overall energy bill. Samsung LED technology cuts energy consumption by nearly\\n50% compared with Energy STAR 4.0. This means a 56\u201d Samsung LED TV consumes the same amount of energy as a conventional 32\u201d LCD TV. What\u2019s more, LED TVs from Samsung are durable,\\noffering a long lifetime without loss of picture quality. Samsung Displays are also built with less harmful materials, so that the manufacturing and recycling processes are much more efficient and friendlier to the environment."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a101f7e1-8a3e-4045-9cd3-fc582c27d31b","identifier":"13605290","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon EOS 5D Mark III + EF 24-105 F4L IS USM"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"EOS 5D Mark III is generated by a full-frame 22.3-megapixel CMOS sensor that can shoot up to 6 frames per second (fps). Powered by Canon's state-of-the-art DIGIC 5+ image processor, the EOS 5D MARK III is capable of incredible ISO speeds of up to 25600 (expandable to 102400). A newly expanded 61-point Auto-Focus (AF) system makes it easier to track subjects with higher levels of precision and speeds.\\n\\n<b>22.3-megapixel sensor<\/b>\\nHigh resolution 22.3-megapixel images of superb quality and detail are attained from Canon's cutting-edge full-frame CMOS sensor technology. New photodiode construction, gapless microlens array and on-chip noise reduction circuitry on the CMOS keep image data clean and clear even at high ISO settings and long exposures, so your photographic vision is never compromised.\\n\\n<b>61-point high-density reticular AF<\/b>\\nThe EOS 5D Mark III features a next-generation Auto Focus (AF) system sporting 61 point high-density reticular AF (41 cross-type points) that offers wide, auto focus coverage at high precision as well as enhanced subject tracking capability.\\n\\nIt offers multi-zone wide-area AF for better tracking, has 5 central dual cross-type points (f\/2.8 diagonal), 21 central cross-type points (f\/5.6 horizontal & vertical) and 20 outer cross-type points (f\/4.0 horizontal) and is sensitive in extremely low-light situations (EV-2 for a central point with a f\/2.8 lens).\\n\\nThe technological advancement in the EOS 5D Mark III dramatically expands focusing accuracy to support a larger range of f\/4.0 and f\/5.6 lenses.\\n\\n<b>ISO expandable to 102400<\/b>\\nNo matter your exposure requirements, the EOS 5D Mark III allows flexible ISO speed settings of ISO 100 \u2013 25600 and expandable to L: ISO50, H1: 51200 and H2: 102400 to adjust the camera's sensitivity to light. From low light indoor environments to the great outdoors in broad daylight, the EOS 5D Mark III captures every picture in the best possible light."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"30dc26ce-d5ac-482c-9ad1-05bf2ea256a4","identifier":"13606081","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","sony","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony KDL-32HX757 LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Die Wahl liegt bei Ihnen: Entdecken Sie die Unterschiede bei 2D- & 3D-Inhalten in High Definition.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>80 cm\/32\", Full HD 3D mit Dynamic Edge LED, X-Reality, integriertem Wi-Fi\u00ae und Sony Internet TV.<\/b>\\n\\nDieses Produkt ist ein fr\u00fcheres Modell und bei Ihrem \u00f6rtlichen H\u00e4ndler m\u00f6glicherweise nicht mehr verf\u00fcgbar.\\n\\n- Klare, detailreiche Bilder und Full HD 3D.\\n- Wi-Fi\u00ae f\u00fcr einfachen Zugriff auf Catch-up TV, Filme und Apps.\\n- \u00c4ndern des Betrachtungswinkels Ihres Fernsehers f\u00fcr perfekte Sicht."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony KDL-32HX757. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, PAL, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-C2, DVB-S2, DVB-T, DVB-T2. Audio system: Dolby Digital. Browser supported: Opera. Swivel angle range: 0 - 15"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"A vous de choisir\u00a0: voyez la diff\u00e9rence avec la 2D et la 3D Haute D\u00e9finition<br\/>\\n<br\/>Profitez de chaque d\u00e9tail avec la Full HD 2D et 3D: Plongez-vous totalement dans l'action gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'affichage Full HD 2D et 3D tout en fluidit\u00e9 et en d\u00e9tails..<br\/>\\nDes couleurs naturelles et claires pour des images nettes: B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'images affich\u00e9es sans aucune perte ni aucun bruit m\u00eame en d\u00e9finition standard gr\u00e2ce au moteur d'imagerie X-Reality..<br\/>\\nDes sc\u00e8nes d'action d'une fluidit\u00e9 in\u00e9gal\u00e9e gr\u00e2ce aux panneaux 3D 4 fois plus rapides: Regardez tous vos contenus en 3D avec une image d'une fluidit\u00e9 et d'une qualit\u00e9 incomparables avec un effet de flou et de scintillement r\u00e9duits au minimum..<br\/>\\nProfitez d'un confort de visionnage in\u00e9gal\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au r\u00e9glage automatique de la profondeur 3D: Regardez la t\u00e9l\u00e9vision pendant des heures avec l'affichage 3D confortable et une fatigue visuelle r\u00e9duite..<br\/>\\nFluidit\u00e9 des sc\u00e8nes d'action gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Motionflow XR 400 Hz: Suivez l'action \u00e0 une fr\u00e9quence \u00e9quivalente \u00e0 400 images par seconde et saisissez chaque d\u00e9tail instantan\u00e9ment..<br\/>\\nTechnologie LED dynamique de pointe avec variation de l'intensit\u00e9 lumineuse: Profitez d'une image de haute qualit\u00e9 avec un contraste am\u00e9lior\u00e9 pour un \u00e9cran LED peu gourmand en \u00e9nergie..<br\/>\\nWi-Fi\u00ae int\u00e9gr\u00e9 pour se connecter facilement \u00e0 Internet: Diffusez vos contenus pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s depuis votre r\u00e9seau domestique sans fil et Internet sans vous embarrasser de c\u00e2bles..<br\/>\\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 Internet sur votre TV en toute facilit\u00e9: Diffusez des films en plein \u00e9cran, de la musique, des vid\u00e9os Internet et des applications et acc\u00e9dez aux r\u00e9seaux sociaux via Sony Entertainment Network..<br\/>\\nCompatible avec les appels vid\u00e9o et vocaux Skype\u2122: Connectez une webcam et un microphone \u00e0 commande vocale pour appeler vos amis et votre famille gratuitement sur Skype\u2122 depuis votre canap\u00e9..<br\/>\\nParcourez le Web \u00e0 l'aide de votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur: Connectez-vous \u00e0 Internet pour consulter des pages de texte et d'images sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur..<br\/>\\nUtilisez votre smartphone comme t\u00e9l\u00e9commande: T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez l'application Media Remote et transformez votre iPhone, votre t\u00e9l\u00e9phone Android\u2122 ou votre tablette en t\u00e9l\u00e9commande ou en souris pour parcourir le Web..<br\/>\\nConnectez-vous directement \u00e0 d'autres p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques Wi-Fi\u00ae: Connectez votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur \u00e0 d'autres p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques Wi-Fi\u00ae Direct sans c\u00e2ble, routeur ni param\u00e9trage compliqu\u00e9..<br\/>\\nEnregistrez vos s\u00e9ries pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9es sur un disque dur externe: Sauvegardez vos programmes t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9s sur un disque dur externe via une connexion USB et regardez-les quand vous le souhaitez. Vous pouvez m\u00eame mettre en pause des programmes diffus\u00e9s en direct et enregistrer vos s\u00e9ries..<br\/>\\nPartagez des films et de la musique depuis votre PC et d'autres p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques: Diffusez des films et de la musique depuis votre PC vers votre TV ou votre lecteur mp3, ou envoyez vos photos et vid\u00e9os depuis votre smartphone vers votre TV..<br\/>\\nTrouvez des informations sur une bande-son TV: Une chanson vous pla\u00eet dans votre \u00e9mission t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9e pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e\u00a0? Appuyez sur TRACK ID pour acc\u00e9der \u00e0 tous les d\u00e9tails, puis continuez votre recherche sur Twitter..<br\/>\\nVisualisez les informations du film que vous regardez: Acc\u00e9dez \u00e0 des informations d\u00e9taill\u00e9es sur vos films et vos \u00e9missions de t\u00e9l\u00e9vision pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s et associez-les \u00e0 la vid\u00e9o \u00e0 la demande et \u00e0 l'enregistrement USB..<br\/>\\nB\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'avantages et d'offres sp\u00e9ciales gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 My Sony: Enregistrez votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur BRAVIA et devenez membre de My Sony pour acc\u00e9der en exclusivit\u00e9 \u00e0 des didacticiels, des offres sp\u00e9ciales et bien plus encore..<br\/>\\nT\u00e9l\u00e9vision par satellite, par c\u00e2ble et hertzienne: Triple tuner HD int\u00e9gr\u00e9 permettant d'acc\u00e9der \u00e0 de nombreuses cha\u00eenes sans d\u00e9codeur (selon les pays et fournisseurs d'acc\u00e8s)..<br\/>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"270f316a-11b3-4ab6-887a-372aad448b0a","identifier":"13608165","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C546DTN"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Outstanding Color Performance<\/b>\\nWith a small and smart design this printer offers business color and duplex printing.\\n\\n<b>Fast, Professional, and Budget-Conscious<\/b>\\nThe C546dtn is compact, network-ready and loaded with benefits for small to midsize workgroups. Reap the productivity advantages of 25 ppm printing in both color and black, 256MB RAM, an optional 550-sheet drawer to load up to 1,450 sheets, paper-saving duplex printing and economical extra-high-yield cartridges.\\n\\n<b>Convenience By Your Side<\/b>\\nWith its sleek design and quiet operation, the Lexmark C546dtn color laser printer will be a welcome addition to your desktop or small workgroup. Welcome more value too, with the included 4,000*-page black and 4,000*-page color cartridges and the innovative Duo Drawer. (*Declared yield up to this number of standard pages, ISO\/IEC 19798)\\n\\n<b>Trust Lexmark Color Expertise<\/b>\\nStudies show that color can significantly increase brand recognition and reader retention. Lexmark gives you 1200 x 1200 dpi color for vivid accuracy to the finest details plus tools to effectively manage color output costs.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark Rewards\u2014Save Money and the Planet<\/b>\\nSave up to 20% on supplies and go green with Lexmark Rewards. You'll earn free high-yield toner cartridges and imaging kits simply for using genuine Lexmark toner and returning your empty cartridges to Lexmark for recycling.\\n\\n<b>Lifetime Pricing Guarantee<\/b>\\nFor as long as you own your C546dtn, Lexmark guarantees never to increase the U.S. toner cartridge price on Lexmark.com.\\n\\n<b>Eco-Responsible<\/b>\\nSaving resources means everyone wins \u2013 your business, your budget and the environment. Print greener with paper-saving duplex, Eco-Mode, and an energy-saving instant warm-up fuser. And toner cartridges for Lexmark C540 Series printers never require shaking to deliver their full declared yield."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3d83917d-cce1-4d87-998f-a31dc0b879b9","identifier":"13608177","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C792dte"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Flexible, robust color printing<\/b>\\nWorkgroup color laser printing with expanded paper capacity, combining a robust design, exceptional media handling, two-sided printing and an intuitive color touch screen.\\n\\n<b>Flexible, Robust Color Printing<\/b>\\nWorkgroup color laser printing with expanded paper capacity, combining a robust design, exceptional media handling, two-sided printing and an intuitive color touch screen.\\n\\n<b>Intuitive Color Touch Screen<\/b>\\nThe 4.3-inch color touch screen allows you to operate your printer with ease and confidence through smart and intuitive navigation, easy access to workflow solutions and shortcuts, and the ability to preview your documents and print jobs at the device.\\n\\n<b>Expandable Input and Flexible Output Options<\/b>\\nPrint on multiple paper types and boost total capacity up to 3,200 sheets. Choose from four output options, including a five-bin mailbox, an offset stacker, a staple finisher, and a staple with hole punch finisher.\\n\\n<b>Exceptional Media Handling<\/b>\\nUltra-reliable paper feeding to support diverse media, including card stock, labels, UV-resistant outdoor media, banner media and more.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark Solutions<\/b>\\nReduce unnecessary printing and simplify work processes through solutions applications preloaded on your device. Choose additional Lexmark solutions to fit your unique workflow needs.\\n\\n<b>Long-lasting Toner<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark Extra High Yield Print Cartridge delivers up to 20,000* pages, reducing interventions, cartridge waste and cost. * Average continuous black or composite CMY declared cartridge yield in accordance with ISO\/IEC 19798."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fa513642-690a-437a-a090-3f3637ea72f4","identifier":"13617619","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet Pro M401dw"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Sparen Sie Zeit durch produktiven Wireless-Druck und Optionen f\u00fcr mobiles Drucken.\\n<b>Wireless-Produktivit\u00e4t \u2013 eindrucksvolle Mobilit\u00e4t<\/b>\\n\\nHohe Druckgeschwindigkeiten steigern die Produktivit\u00e4t. Die Papierzuf\u00fchrungskapazit\u00e4t ist bis auf 300 Blatt erweiterbar.\\n\\n<b>Webbasierte Benutzerfreundlichkeit<\/b>\\nEinfache Steuerung der Druckumgebung mit marktf\u00fchrenden Verwaltungstools.\\n\\n<b>Erstellen Sie Ausdrucke in professioneller Qualit\u00e4t zum g\u00fcnstigen Preis.<\/b>\\nMit der Papierzuf\u00fchrungskapazit\u00e4t von 300 Blatt (800 Blatt insgesamt mit optionalem 500-Blatt-Fach) m\u00fcssen Sie seltener Papier nachf\u00fcllen.\\n\\n<b>F\u00fcr eine geringere Umweltbelastung.<\/b>\\nWeniger Verpackungsabfall: Die Original HP Toner-Druckkassette HP 80 A ist bei der Lieferung schon im Drucker installiert."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Do more with your workday. Set up anywhere in the office using built-in wireless networking<SUP>1<\/SUP><SUP>2<\/SUP> and share printing resources on a network<SUP>3<\/SUP>. Print on the go with mobile printing options<SUP>3<\/SUP>. Use business apps to access and print from the web<SUP>4<\/SUP><SUP>5<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Stay productive and boost business with wireless networking and impressive mobility.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Set up and share anywhere in the office with wireless connectivity<SUP>2<\/SUP>,<SUP>3<\/SUP>. Configure networking fast<SUP>1<\/SUP>,<SUP>6<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Experience web-connected ease of use.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Use business apps and the 8.89 cm (3.5-inch) colour touchscreen to access and print from the web<SUP>4<\/SUP>,<SUP>5<\/SUP>, e.g. with Google Docs \u00a92012 Google.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Enjoy professional-quality output for a great value.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Produce professional-quality business documents with bold, crisp text and sharp images.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Reduce your environmental impact.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Save energy with HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technology which turns your printer on when you need it and off when you don\u2019t<SUP>7<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Available on M401dw model only.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Wireless performance is dependent upon physical environment and distance from access point, and may be limited during active VPN connections.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Available on M401n, M401dn, and M401dw models only.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> Available on M401dn and M401dw models only.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>5<\/SUP><i> Requires a wireless access point and an Internet connection to the printer. Services may require registration. Availability varies by country, language, and agreements, and requires a firmware upgrade. For details, www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>6<\/SUP><i> HP Auto Wireless Connect may not be available for all system configurations. Wireless performance is dependent upon physical environment and distance from access point. For information on compatibility, visit www.hp.com\/go\/autowirelessconnect.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>7<\/SUP><i> HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technology capabilities subject to printer and settings.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Exploitez davantage votre journ\u00e9e de travail. Installez n'importe o\u00f9 au bureau l'aide de la mise en r\u00e9seau int\u00e9gr\u00e9e sans fil,<SUP>1<\/SUP> et partagez les ressources d'impression sur un r\u00e9seau. Imprimez en d\u00e9placement avec les options d'impression mobiles. Utilisez les applications professionnelles pour acc\u00e9der au Web et imprimer \u00e0 partir du Web.<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Productivit\u00e9 sans fil - mobilit\u00e9 impressionnante<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Configurez et partagez n'importe o\u00f9 dans le bureau avec une connectivit\u00e9 sans fil.<SUP>1<\/SUP> Configurez la mise en r\u00e9seau rapidement.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Facilit\u00e9 d'utilisation connect\u00e9e \u00e0 Internet.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Utilisez les applications professionnelles et l'\u00e9cran tactile couleur 8,89 cm (3,5\u00a0pouces) pour acc\u00e9der au Web et imprimer des informations.<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'un r\u00e9sultat de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle \u00e0 un prix remarquable.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Produisez des documents de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle avec du texte gras et pr\u00e9cis et des images nettes.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez votre impact environnemental.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;\u00c9conomisez l'\u00e9nergie\u00a0avec la technologie HP\u00a0Auto-On\/Auto-Off qui met l'imprimante sous tension lorsque vous en avez besoin et l'\u00e9teint lorsque vous n'en avez plus besoin<SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> N\u00e9cessite un point d'acc\u00e8s sans fil et une connexion Internet \u00e0 l'imprimante. Les services peuvent n\u00e9cessiter une inscription. Les disponibilit\u00e9s varient selon la r\u00e9gion g\u00e9ographique, la langue et les contrats. Une mise \u00e0 niveau du micrologiciel peut s'av\u00e9rer n\u00e9cessaire. Pour plus d'informations, rendez-vous sur le site www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> N\u00e9cessite une connexion Internet \u00e0 l'imprimante. Fonctionne avec tout p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique compatible Internet et messagerie \u00e9lectronique. N\u00e9cessite HP Web Services Account Registration. Dur\u00e9es d'impression variables. Voir la liste des types de documents et d'images pris en charge sur la page www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. Pour des solutions suppl\u00e9mentaires, reportez-vous \u00e0 la page www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i>\u00a0Cartouche de toner noir HP LaserJet 80X non fournie\u00a0; Il doit \u00eatre achet\u00e9 s\u00e9par\u00e9ment.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> Les fonctions HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off et d\u00e9pendent de l'imprimante et des param\u00e8tres.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-29T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"091db1b8-f978-472f-9397-635c26a51e22","identifier":"13620748","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE40ES5500PXZT LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE40ES5500PXZT. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Supported graphics resolutions: 1920 x 1080 (HD 1080). Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus, Dolby Pulse, SRS HD TheaterSound. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Smart modes: Game"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-29T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"20c619b8-14b9-4d84-b17c-9909ffbaea26","identifier":"13624182","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 26B2LW1G LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba 26B2LW1G. HD type: HD-Ready, Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Analog signal format system: NTSC, PAL BG, PAL DK, PAL I, SECAM, SECAM B\/G, SECAM D\/K, SECAM L, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. HDMI version: 1.3. Smart modes: Hotel. Cable lock slot: Kensington"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Mode H\u00f4tel (clonage USB)\\n- Message d\u2019accueil personnalisable\\n- Mixage des cha\u00eenes ATV\/DTV\\n- USB d\u00e9connectable\\n\\nUne qualit\u00e9 d\u2019image \u00e0 couper le souffle\\nUn Son pr\u00e9cis et puissant\\nDesign\\nConfort et Fonctionnalit\u00e9s\\nFonctionnalit\u00e9s Hospitality"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-30T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"342636d4-efc2-48ac-84a0-12bfbcf1185f","identifier":"13624885","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE26EH4510PXZT LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE26EH4510PXZT. HD type: HD-Ready, Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus \/ Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Power consumption (standby): 0.3, Energy efficiency class: A, Input voltage: 220 - 240"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-03-30T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b4f9979b-b3f2-45e2-a309-128f176a195e","identifier":"136410","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony NW-HD1 MP3 player & recorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"20 GB internal Hard Disk Drive memory \\n  Extremely long playback time of up to 30 hours with the built-in Li-ion battery \\n  Sony's unique G-sensor technology protects the internal HDD even if it falls from a height of 1 m \\n  Large 7 line (1.5 inch) LCD with green backlight \\n  SonicStage 2.1 software for easy music management and transfers \\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-06-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"96eba162-9358-4c3d-8aec-aeb7d6dcace8","identifier":"13646485","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix JX500"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Super Slim Compact in Seven Colors<\/b>\\n\\nRich in choice with seven colors, the stylish compact body brings out the great image quality in the FinePix J series.\\nAvailable in Black, Blue, Gold, Pink, Silver, Red and Purple, simply choose the one that will fit your style.\\n\\n<b>Face Detection<\/b>\\nFace Detection optimizes people pictures by detecting faces and adjusting focus and exposure to ensure bright, clear results.\\n\\n<b>Blink Detection<\/b>\\nThe camera will warn you when people in the frame are blinking, giving you the option to retake the photo, or enlarge the face so you can save or delete the image before you take the next shot.\\n\\n<b>Smile & Shoot Mode<\/b>\\nThe Smile & Shoot mode of Scene Position, automatically releases the shutter when the smile appears so you won't miss the adorable smile the moment they happen.\\n\\n<b>2.7-inch Clear LCD<\/b>\\nThe large, bright LCD display makes it easy to compose great photos. Sharing pictures is a pleasure, thanks to a high-impact 230,000-dot resolution."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-01T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c5be67ab-da95-4e99-b000-5c0a3ec2618f","identifier":"13646489","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix JZ100"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A slim and stylish wide-angle 8x zoom camera<\/b>\\nIn six unique colors, a stylish, powerful camera with the prestigious Fujinon 8x zoom lens offers High resolution images.\\n\\nRich in choice with six colors, the stylish compact body brings out the great image quality in the FinePix JZ250 \/ JZ100.\\nAvailable in Black, Silver, Pink, Blue, Red and Purple, simply choose the one that will fit your style.\\n\\nA high- quality Fujinon 8x zoom lens delivers picture-perfect results across the entire zoom range, from wide-angle compositions to dramatic close-up shots.\\n\\nAn impressive 14 Megapixels resolution won't miss the finest details of your subject. Images are captured sharp and clear, in vivid colors, even when printed at large sizes.\\n\\nEven when it's hard to keep your camera steady, the powerful combinetion of lens-shift image stabilization and high sensitivity protects against blurring from camera shake and subject motion so you can capturethe moment.\\n\\nThe large, bright LCD display makes it easy to compose great photos. Sharing pictures is a pleasure, thanks to a high-impact 230,000-dot resolution.\\n\\nFramed scenes are automatically detected and selected into appropriate camera settings: Portrait, Landscape, Night, Macro, Night Portrait, and Backlit Portrait.\\n\\nFace Detection optimizes people pictures by detecting faces and adjusting focus and exposure to ensure bright, clear results.\\n\\nRed-eye removal automatically detects and corrects flash reflection for a perfect end result.\\n\\n<b>Versatile shooting modes<\/b>\\nSet specific scene-based modes suited to the subject matter you are photographing. Or experiment with advanced features, like Motion Panorama.\\n\\nKeeps fast moving subjects in the frame and in focus, even at 8x zoom extended. Great for capturing dynamic close-ups.\\n\\nCan't decide whether it's best to use flash? Choose this mode, press the shutter and automatically capture the same scene twice: once with high sensitivity and natural light, and the second time with Intelligent Flash. Later choose one or keep both!\\n\\nAn extensive selection of pre-programmed shooting modes ensures great photos in various conditions, eliminating the need to fuss with camera settings while delivering optimum results.\\n\\nThe versatile card slot is compatible with high-capacity Secure Digital (SDHC\/SDXC) memory cards."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-01T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":8}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"030f442c-7b33-4d0c-821b-bf9f2c61b998","identifier":"13652758","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Officejet 6600 e-AiO"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Dieser effiziente e-All-in-One Drucker erstellt Farbdrucke in Profiqualit\u00e4t bei niedrigen Kosten pro Seite. Der Touchscreen bietet Zugriff auf Apps sowie auf Scan-, Kopier- und Faxtools. Mit HP ePrint k\u00f6nnen Sie unterwegs drucken. Diese Ausdrucke lassen sich \u00fcber Ihr Wireless-Netzwerk gemeinsam nutzen.\\n\\n<b>Funktionen<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Drucken Sie professionelle Farbdokumente bei niedrigen Kosten pro Seite.<\/b>\\n- Drucken Sie brillante Farbdokumente in Profiqualit\u00e4t bei niedrigen Kosten pro Seite.\\n- Kosteng\u00fcnstiges Drucken mit vier separaten Tinten \u2013 f\u00fcr hohes Druckaufkommen sind XL-Tintenpatronen verf\u00fcgbar.\\n- Erstellen Sie mit HP Officejet Tinten lebendige und eindrucksvolle Dokumente, die auch bei Einwirkung von Wasser, Licht oder Textmarkern nicht verschmieren.\\n- Ein Drucker, der zuverl\u00e4ssige Leistung mit einem monatlichen Druckvolumen von 12.000 Seiten garantiert \u2013 ideal f\u00fcr den Farbdruck in Unternehmen.\\n\\n<b>Die Wireless-Netzwerktechnologie und die mobilen Druckfunktionen garantieren ein produktives Arbeiten.<\/b>\\n- Drucken Sie direkt von Ihrem mobilen Endger\u00e4t mit HP ePrint \u2013 von nun an k\u00f6nnen Sie von praktisch \u00fcberall aus drucken.\\n- Sie k\u00f6nnen leistungsstarke Funktionen gemeinsam mit mehreren Benutzern \u00fcber ein Wireless-Netzwerk nutzen.\\n- E-Mails, Dokumente, Webseiten und vieles mehr direkt \u00fcber Ihr iPad\u00ae, Ihr iPhone\u00ae oder Ihren iPod touch\u00ae drucken \u2013 mithilfe von AirPrint\u2122.\\n- \u00dcber den intuitiven Touchscreen k\u00f6nnen Sie auf Ihrem e-All-in-One Drucker Aufgaben direkt verwalten und auf Gesch\u00e4ftsanwendungen zugreifen.\\n\\n<b>Mit diesem vielseitigen e-All-in-One Ger\u00e4t arbeiten Sie jederzeit produktiver.<\/b>\\n- ISO-Druckgeschwindigkeiten (vergleichbar mit Laserdruckern) von bis zu 14 S.\/Min. in Schwarzwei\u00df und 8 S.\/Min. in Farbe.\\n- Optimieren Sie Ihre Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe \u2013 schnelles Versenden von Faxen und direktes \u00dcbertragen von Scans auf einen PC.\\n- Arbeiten Sie produktiver \u2013 mit der automatischen 35-Blatt-Dokumentenzuf\u00fchrung k\u00f6nnen Sie bequem mehrseitige Dokumente scannen, kopieren oder faxen.\\n- ID-Kartendetails schnell und problemlos erfassen \u2013 beidseitig bedruckte ID-Karten auf eine Papierseite kopieren."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Produce professional-quality colour for a low cost per page with this efficient e-all-in-one. Use the touchscreen to access apps and scan, copy and fax tools. Print on the go using HP ePrint and share across your wireless network.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Print professional colour documents for a low cost per page.<\/b>\\n- Print attention-grabbing, professional-quality colour documents for a low cost per page.\\n- Print affordably with four individual inks \u2013 high capacity XL ink cartridges available for frequent printing.\\n- Create vivid, high impact materials that resist water, fading and highlighter-pen smearing with HP Officejet inks.\\n- Enjoy reliable performance from a printer with a 12,000-page monthly duty cycle \u2013 ideal for business colour printing.\\n\\n<b>Stay productive with wireless networking and mobile printing.<\/b>\\n- Print direct from your mobile device with HP ePrint \u2013 now you can print from virtually anywhere.\\n- Share high productivity features between multiple users on your wireless network.\\n- Print e-mails, documents, web pages and more direct from your iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae or iPod touch\u00ae with AirPrint\u2122.\\n- Manage tasks and access business apps directly on your e-all-in-one via the intuitive touchscreen.\\n\\n<b>Get more done every day with this versatile e-all-in-one.<\/b>\\n- Print at ISO (laser comparable) speeds of up to 14 ppm black, 8 ppm colour.\\n- Improve your business workflow - send quick faxes and scan documents directly to a PC.\\n- Do more with your time \u2013 scan, copy or fax multipage documents using the convenient 35-page automatic document feeder.\\n- Capture ID card details quickly and easily \u2013 copy two-sided ID cards onto one side of paper."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Obtenez des impressions couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle \u00e0 un faible co\u00fbt par page avec cette e-tout-en-un performante. Utilisez l'\u00e9cran tactile pour acc\u00e9der aux applications ainsi qu'aux outils de num\u00e9risation, de copie et de t\u00e9l\u00e9copie. Imprimez pendant vos d\u00e9placements avec l'ePrint de HP que vous pouvez partager sur votre r\u00e9seau sans fil.\\n\\n<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Imprimez des documents couleur professionnels \u00e0 un faible co\u00fbt par page.<\/b>\\n- Appuyez-vous sur HP pour obtenir des couleurs de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle \u00e0 faible co\u00fbt.\\n- Faites des \u00e9conomies gr\u00e2ce aux encres individuelles - cartouches d'encre XL grande capacit\u00e9 disponibles pour les impressions fr\u00e9quentes.\\n- Produisez des couleurs intenses et des mat\u00e9riaux d'excellente qualit\u00e9 r\u00e9sistant \u00e0 l'eau, la d\u00e9coloration et aux marques de surligneur avec les encres HP Officejet.\\n- Profitez des performances fiables avec une imprimante affichant un cycle de rendement mensuel de 12 000 pages - id\u00e9al pour les impressions couleur professionnelles.\\n\\n<b>Rester productifs gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la mise en r\u00e9seau sans fil et l'impression mobile.<\/b>\\n- D\u00e9couvrez la libert\u00e9 de l'impression mobile HP ePrint directement depuis votre p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique mobile - vous pouvez imprimer depuis presque partout.\\n- Partagez les fonctionnalit\u00e9s de productivit\u00e9 \u00e9lev\u00e9e entre plusieurs ordinateurs sur votre r\u00e9seau sans fil.\\n- Avec AirPrint\u2122, imprimez des courriers \u00e9lectroniques, documents, pages Web, etc., directement \u00e0 partir de votre iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae ou iPod touch\u00ae.\\n- G\u00e9rez des t\u00e2ches et acc\u00e9dez directement \u00e0 vos applications professionnelles par l'\u00e9cran tactile de votre imprimante e-tout-en-un.\\n\\n<b>Renforcez votre productivit\u00e9 avec cette imprimante e-All-in-One polyvalente.<\/b>\\n- Vitesses d'impression ISO (comparable au laser), jusqu'\u00e0 14 ppm en noir, 8 ppm en couleur.\\n- Am\u00e9liorez votre flux de travail - envoi rapide de t\u00e9l\u00e9copies et num\u00e9risation de documents directement vers un ordinateur.\\n- Exploitez davantage votre temps - scannez, copiez ou faxez plusieurs documents \u00e0 la fois \u00e0 l'aide du chargeur automatique de documents de 35 pages.\\n- Capturez les d\u00e9tails de cartes d'identit\u00e9 rapidement et ais\u00e9ment : copiez les cartes d'identit\u00e9 recto verso sur une face de papier."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-02-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"51e335af-c68b-4b5c-8067-9f6c4bf14fab","identifier":"13658688","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R306"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Canon LEGRIA HF R306<\/b>\\n<b>Capture stories on the go in stunning Full HD<\/b>\\nThe effortless LEGRIA HF R306 has a 51x Advanced zoom to get you close to the action in stunning Full HD, while Intelligent IS keeps movies steady. Use Story Creator to develop your video skills.\\n\\n<b>51x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS<\/b>\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 51x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives true HD quality and excellent colour reproduction even in low light, so your movies will look great on your HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake. It automatically detects the scene and selects exactly the right optical Image Stabilizer settings from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. It ensures sharp, detailed videos in every situation - leaving you free to concentrate on shooting.\\n\\n<b>Story Creator<\/b>\\nUse Story Creator to effortlessly create memorable movies and help develop your video skills. Choose a theme for your movie and Story Creator gives you on screen suggestions and shooting tips, so you can make captivating videos.\\n\\n<b>Cinema-look filters; Touch Decoration<\/b>\\nInspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters. Select from 8 adjustable colour-grading filters to capture the perfect movie scene. Adding fun effects to your movies without a PC is easy using Touch Decoration. Write messages straight on the Touch-screen with the Stylus Pen, add stamps or active animations like shooting stars and mix in still images.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nOperation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm (3.0\u201d) gesture-based Touch-screen LCD, which gives you intuitive fingertip control of settings and simplifies playback.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto, Face Detection<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot high quality video with Smart Auto. Intelligent Scene Detection Technology selects the perfect settings from 38 scene modes \u2013 all you have to do is point and shoot, whilst Face Detection optimises the settings for great people shots.\\n\\n<b>Video Snapshot<\/b>\\nWith Video Snapshot it\u2019s easy to create fun, short movies to share with friends - without a PC. Capture 2, 4 or 8 second clips with just one touch of the record button, create a playlist, add music and your movie is ready.\\n\\n<b>SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nThe LEGRIA HF R306 records Full HD movies direct to an SDXC memory card and are ideal for sharing. Available in a range of sizes allowing you to capture hours of footage."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"58da6a88-4601-43d8-af03-e84db37c9135","identifier":"13667393","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4VBE04RF"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der GoGEAR Vibe MP4-Player in pr\u00e4chtigen Farben verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber FullSound, wodurch Musik und Videos zum Leben erweckt werden, sowie \u00fcber Philips Songbird, mit dem Sie Musik synchronisieren und volle Unterhaltung genie\u00dfen k\u00f6nnen. SafeSound sch\u00fctzt Ihre Ohren, w\u00e4hrend FastCharge f\u00fcr eine schnelle Aufladung sorgt."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Small, colorful and entertaining<\/b>\\nThe vibrantly colored GoGEAR Vibe MP4 player comes with FullSound to bring music and videos to life, and Philips Songbird to synchronize music and enjoy entertainment. SafeSound protects your ears and FastCharge offers quick charging.\\n\\n<b>Superb quality sound<\/b>\\n- Fullsound\u2122 to bring your MP3 music to life\\n- SafeSound for maximum music enjoyment without hearing damage\\n\\n<b>Complements your life<\/b>\\n- 4.6 cm\/1.8\" full color screen for easy, intuitive browsing\\n- Soft and smooth finish for easy comfort and handling\\n- Enjoy up to 20 hours of music or 4 hours of video playback\\n\\n<b>Easy and intuitive<\/b>\\n- Philips Songbird: one simple program to discover, play, sync\\n- LikeMusic for playlists of songs that sound great together\\n- Quick 5-minute charge for 90 minutes of play\\n- Folder view to organize and view media files like on your PC"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le baladeur MP4 GoGEAR Vibe aux couleurs vitamin\u00e9es et dot\u00e9 de la technologie FullSound donne vie \u00e0 vos musiques et \u00e0 vos vid\u00e9os, tandis que Philips Songbird les synchronise. La technologie SafeSound prot\u00e8ge vos oreilles et FastCharge permet une charge rapide."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-03T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cf26b1fa-6a45-4c21-8a54-72fb99975b00","identifier":"13667551","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","toshiba"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba Camileo Clip Snow White"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der neue spritzwassergesch\u00fctzte CAMILEO CLIP Full HD Minicamcorder ist der perfekte Outdoor-Begleiter: Klipsen Sie ihn einfach an Ihre Jacke und nehmen Sie die Action auf, wenn Sie mittendrin sind. Mit nur 85 g Gewicht und kaum gr\u00f6\u00dfer als eine Scheckkarte ist der CAMILEO CLIP nicht nur \u00fcberaus handlich, sondern auch schnell und einfach zu bedienen. Ein 5MP-CMOS-Sensor mit BSI-Technologie f\u00e4ngt Ihre aufregendsten Abenteuer in Full HD und brillanten Farben ein - auch wenn die Lichtbedingungen nicht optimal sind.\\n\\n<b>Hauptfunktionen<\/b>\\n- 1080p Full-HD-Grafikaufl\u00f6sung\\n- Digitaler H.264 HD-Camcorder\\n- Anklipsfunktion\\n- 5MP CMOS-Sensor (bis zu 16MP-Fotos)\\n- BSI-Sensortechnologie\\n- 1,5\" (3,8 cm) LCD\\n- 10-facher digitaler Zoom\\n- Electronic Image Stabiliser (EIS)\\n- HDMI- und USB-Anschluss\\n- Unterst\u00fctzt Micro-SD \/ SDHC \/ SDXC\\n- Webcam und Sprachaufnahme\\n- Robustes Design\\n- Spritzwassergesch\u00fctzt (IPX-2)\\n- Videobearbeitungsfunktion\\n- CAMILEO Uploader"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba Camileo Clip Snow White. Sensor type: CMOS. Image stabilizer type: digital. Camcorder media type: Memory card, Compatible memory cards: SD, SDHC, SDXC. Focus adjustment: Auto. White balance: Auto, Daylight, Fluorescent, Tungsten"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>LE T\u00c9MOIN DE VOTRE PASSION<\/b>\\nR\u00e9sistant aux \u00e9claboussures, le mini-cam\u00e9scope Full HD CAMILEO CLIP est pr\u00eat \u00e0 supporter les conditions m\u00e9t\u00e9orologiques les plus difficiles : fixez-le sur votre veste gr\u00e2ce au clip et enregistrez l'action depuis votre point de vue. Le CAMILEO CLIP ne p\u00e8se que 85 g et n'est pas plus grand qu'une carte de visite. Vous serez surpris par sa l\u00e9g\u00e8ret\u00e9, mais \u00e9galement pas sa simplicit\u00e9 d'utilisation. Le capteur CMOS de 5 m\u00e9gapixels avec technologie BSI enregistre vos aventures les plus palpitantes en qualit\u00e9 Full HD et avec des couleurs vives, m\u00eame lorsque l'\u00e9clairage n'est pas optimal.\\n\\nFixez-le sur votre veste gr\u00e2ce au clip et enregistrez l'action depuis votre point de vue. Gr\u00e2ce au solide bo\u00eetier r\u00e9sistant aux \u00e9claboussures, le Camileo Clip est pr\u00eat \u00e0 supporter les conditions m\u00e9t\u00e9orologiques les plus difficiles. Fixez-le sur votre veste gr\u00e2ce au clip et enregistrez l'action depuis votre point de vue. Gr\u00e2ce au solide bo\u00eetier r\u00e9sistant aux \u00e9claboussures, le Camileo Clip est pr\u00eat \u00e0 supporter les conditions m\u00e9t\u00e9orologiques les plus difficiles.\\n\\nLe Camileo clip ne p\u00e8se que 85 g et n'est pas plus grand qu'une carte de visite. Vous serez surpris par sa l\u00e9g\u00e8ret\u00e9, mais \u00e9galement par sa simplicit\u00e9 d'utilisation.\\n\\nLe capteur CMOS de 5 m\u00e9gapixels avec technologie BSI enregistre vos aventures les plus palpitantes en qualit\u00e9 Full HD et avec des couleurs vives, m\u00eame lorsque l'\u00e9clairage n'est pas optimal."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c54be9d6-e947-4ae6-8e46-c46130f5bafd","identifier":"13675186","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips GoGEAR Ariaz 16GB w\/FullSound"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Erleben Sie mit dem GoGEAR Ariaz MP4-Player mit FullSound hervorragenden Sound. Zus\u00e4tzlich sorgt SafeSound f\u00fcr Schutz vor H\u00f6rsch\u00e4den bei maximalem Musikgenuss. Entdecken und synchronisieren Sie au\u00dferdem die Welt der Musik mit Songbird."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Superior sound experience<\/b>\\n\\nAnd enjoy all the multimedia you can pack in\\n\\nTune in to amazing sound on the GoGEAR Ariaz MP4 Player with FullSound. Plus, enjoy music to the max without worrying about hearing damage with SafeSound. Discover and sync a universe of music with Songbird.\\n\\n<b>Superb quality sound<\/b>\\n\\n- Fullsound to bring your MP3 music to life\\n- SafeSound for maximum music enjoyment without hearing damage\\n- Built-in speaker for entertainment out loud\\n\\n<b>Complements your life<\/b>\\n\\n- 6.1 cm\/2.4\" full color screen for fantastic video quality\\n- Enjoy up to 26 hours of music or 5 hours of video playback\\n- FM radio with RDS and 30 presets for more music options\\n- Voice recording to take notes or record anything, anytime\\n\\n<b>Easy and intuitive<\/b>\\n\\n- Philips Songbird: one simple program to discover, play, sync\\n- LikeMusic for playlists of songs that sound great together\\n- Folder view to organize and view media files like on your PC"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Profitez d'un son exceptionnel avec le baladeur MP4 GoGEAR Ariaz avec technologie FullSound. La technologie SafeSound vous permet d'\u00e9couter votre musique comme vous l'aimez, sans risque pour vos oreilles. Avec Songbird, c'est tout un univers de musique que vous pouvez d\u00e9couvrir et synchroniser."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4de59c88-c5d6-42e9-afa2-3867f4d5a2dc","identifier":"13689212","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF M52"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.37"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Share exceptional movie creations with Wi-Fi<\/b>\\nEffortlessly create and share professional quality video with the Wi-Fi enabled LEGRIA HF M52. An HD CMOS PRO sensor ensures superb images even in low light while Intelligent IS combats camera shake.\\n\\n- Wi-Fi with MP4 support.\\n- Canon HD CMOS PRO sensor.\\n- Optical Intelligent IS.\\n- Audio Scene Select.\\n- 10x HD Video lens, iris diaphragm.\\n- Store direct to external HDD.\\n- 32GB memory, SDXC slot.\\n- Creative cinematic features.\\n- 7.5cm touch screen.\\n- Smart Auto, Face Detection, Instant AF.\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi with MP4 support<\/b>\\nIn-built Wi-Fi lets you effortlessly share your creations to social networking sites and view your videos on DNLA certified TVs and iOS devices. Support for MP4 format ensures quick transfer times of HD movies.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD CMOS PRO sensor<\/b>\\nThe HD CMOS PRO sensor is designed and made by Canon for its professional camcorders. The light gathering area of the pixels is 160% bigger than conventional CMOS sensors, delivering a wider dynamic range and advanced low-light performance.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake. It automatically detects the scene and selects exactly the right optical Image Stabilizer settings from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. It ensures sharp, detailed videos in every situation - leaving you free to concentrate on shooting.\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nIt\u2019s simple to make your movies sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select and a high-sensitivity, built-in zoom microphone. Just select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD Video lens<\/b>\\nA high-quality, Canon HD Video lens with 10x optical zoom features an iris diaphragm for soft background blurring.\\n\\n<b>Store direct to external HDD<\/b>\\nCopy movies direct from the inbuilt memory or SDXC card slot to an external hard drive. Just follow the easy on-screen menus for simple storage.\\n\\n<b>32GB memory, SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nA 32GB Dual Flash memory lets you store over 12 hours of movies to the built-in memory. Record even longer with the SDXC card slot.\\n\\n<b>Creative cinematic features<\/b>\\nUse Story Creator to develop your video skills and effortlessly create memorable short videos with a story - just choose a theme and follow the in-built scene suggestions. Inspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters and add fun effects to your movies without a PC using Touch Decoration.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nOperation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm (3.0\u201d) gesture-based Touch-screen LCD, which gives you intuitive fingertip control of shooting and playback functions.\\n\\n<b>Effortless shooting<\/b>\\nCreating high-quality movies is effortless with Smart Auto. Fully automatic, it intelligently selects shooting settings from 38 scenes. Face Detection optimises the settings for great people shots and Instant AF ensures fast and accurate focusing."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6b6b621b-c117-401f-95a6-3b0538d7077d","identifier":"136945","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony Speaker set SS-SP50FW"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"2-components silver speaker set for SONY FWD-50PX1"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2004-12-29T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"62bbbf0b-f87c-4d79-955e-1ed1bb9a95d4","identifier":"13700619","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R36"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Share your stories effortlessly with Wi-Fi\\n\\nIt\u2019s easy to get close to the action in superb Full HD with the compact LEGRIA HF R36. Share your creations effortlessly with Wi-Fi and enjoy steady footage with Intelligent IS.\\n\\n- Wi-Fi with MP4 support\\n- 51x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS\\n- Optical Intelligent IS\\n- Story Creator\\n- Cinema-look filters; Touch Decoration\\n- Store direct to external HDD\\n- 7.5cm touch screen\\n- Smart Auto, Face Detection\\n- HD-SD conversion\\n- 8GB memory, SDXC card slot"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f902c814-6504-4df3-b8cd-aafc0fae566d","identifier":"13700622","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF M56"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.37"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Create professional quality video \u2013 share anywhere, anytime with Wi-Fi<\/b>\\nEnjoy shooting movies with the LEGRIA HF M56, which features Canon\u2019s Full HD CMOS PRO sensor for exceptional quality. With Wi-Fi connectivity it\u2019s even easier to share superb movies anytime, anywhere.\\n\\n- Wi-Fi with MP4 support.\\n- Canon HD CMOS PRO sensor.\\n- Optical Intelligent IS.\\n- Audio Scene Select.\\n- 10x HD Video lens, iris diaphragm.\\n- Store direct to external HDD.\\n- 8GB memory, SDXC slot.\\n- Creative cinematic features.\\n- 7.5cm touch screen.\\n- Smart Auto, Face Detection, Instant AF.\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi with MP4 support<\/b>\\nIn-built Wi-Fi lets you effortlessly share your creations to social networking sites and view your videos on DNLA certified TVs and iOS devices. Support for MP4 format ensures quick transfer times of HD movies.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD CMOS PRO sensor<\/b>\\nThe HD CMOS PRO sensor is designed and made by Canon for its professional camcorders. The light gathering area of the pixels is 160% bigger than conventional CMOS sensors, delivering a wider dynamic range and advanced low-light performance.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake. It automatically detects the scene and selects exactly the right optical Image Stabilizer settings from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. It ensures sharp, detailed videos in every situation - leaving you free to concentrate on shooting.\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nIt\u2019s simple to make your movies sound as good as they look, with Audio Scene Select and a high-sensitivity, built-in zoom microphone. Just select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD Video lens<\/b>\\nA high-quality, Canon HD Video lens with 10x optical zoom features an iris diaphragm for soft background blurring.\\n\\n<b>Store direct to external HDD<\/b>\\nCopy movies direct from the inbuilt memory or SDXC card slot to an external hard drive. Just follow the easy on-screen menus for simple storage.\\n\\n<b>8GB memory, SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nAn in-built 8GB Dual Flash memory lets you store over 3 hours of Full HD movies. Record even longer with the SDXC card slot.\\n\\n<b>Creative cinematic features<\/b>\\nUse Story Creator to develop your video skills and effortlessly create memorable short videos with a story - just choose a theme and follow the in-built scene suggestions. Inspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters and add fun effects to your movies without a PC using Touch Decoration.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nOperation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm (3.0\u201d) gesture-based Touch-screen LCD, which gives you intuitive fingertip control of shooting and playback functions.\\n\\n<b>Effortless shooting<\/b>\\nCreating high-quality movies is effortless with Smart Auto. Fully automatic, it intelligently selects shooting settings from 38 scenes. Face Detection optimises the settings for great people shots and Instant AF ensures fast and accurate focusing."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d935de39-0992-4249-a10b-5af15e59c7ac","identifier":"13700623","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF M506"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.37"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Exceptional video quality for every occasion<\/b>\\nThe LEGRIA HF M506 delivers professional quality video with ease whatever the occasion. Featuring Canon\u2019s HD CMOS PRO sensor and Audio Scene Select movies look and sound superb.\\n\\n- Canon HD CMOS PRO sensor.\\n- Optical Intelligent IS.\\n- Audio Scene Select.\\n- 10x HD Video lens, iris diaphragm.\\n- Creative cinematic features.\\n- 7.5cm intuitive touch screen.\\n- Smart Auto (38 scenes), Face Detection, Instant AF.\\n- SDXC card slot.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD CMOS PRO sensor<\/b>\\nThe HD CMOS PRO sensor is designed and made by Canon for its professional camcorders. The light gathering area of the pixels is 160% bigger than conventional CMOS sensors, delivering a wider dynamic range and advanced low-light performance.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to camera shake. It automatically detects the scene and selects exactly the right optical Image Stabilizer settings from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. It ensures sharp, detailed videos in every situation - leaving you free to concentrate on shooting.\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nIt\u2019s simple to make your movies sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select and a high-sensitivity, built-in zoom microphone.. Just select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD Video lens<\/b>\\nA high-quality, Canon HD Video lens with 10x optical zoom features an iris diaphragm for soft background blurring.\\n\\n<b>Creative cinematic features<\/b>\\nUse Story Creator to develop your video skills and effortlessly create memorable short videos with a story - just choose a theme and follow the in-built scene suggestions. Inspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters and add fun effects to your movies without a PC using Touch Decoration. Write messages straight on the Touch-screen with the Stylus Pen, add stamps or active animations like shooting stars and mix in still images.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nOperation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm (3.0\u201d) gesture-based Touch-screen LCD, which gives you intuitive fingertip control of shooting and playback functions.\\n\\n<b>Effortless shooting<\/b>\\nCreating high-quality movies is effortless with Smart Auto. Fully automatic, it intelligently selects shooting settings from 38 scenes \u2013 leaving you free to concentrate on your subject. Face Detection optimises the settings for great people shots and Instant AF ensures fast and accurate focusing.\\n\\n<b>SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nThe LEGRIA HF M506 records Full HD movies direct to an SDXC memory card. Available in a wide range of sizes, the cards are easy to carry and ideal for sharing."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a9630683-298c-4a73-89d8-5a378cffcd1b","identifier":"13701682","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","salora","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Salora 22LED6105CD LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Salora 22LED6105CD. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Supported graphics resolutions: 1920 x 1080 (HD 1080). Tuner type: Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. HDMI version: 1.3. Optical disc player type: DVD player, Disc types supported: CD, CD-R, CD-RW, DVD, DVD+R, DVD+RW, DVD-R, DVD-RW. Video formats supported: XVID, Audio formats supported: MP3, Image formats supported: JPG"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":22,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e3fd0a7d-af0a-413c-a6f8-9c0e1c78b07b","identifier":"13701687","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","salora","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Salora 24LED6105CD LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Salora 24LED6105CD. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Contrast ratio (typical): 1000:1. Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: A2 Nicam. HDMI version: 1.3. Optical disc player type: DVD player, Disc types supported: CD, CD-R, CD-RW, DVD, DVD+R, DVD+RW, DVD-R, DVD-RW"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":24,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5d7dacfd-09ca-4197-8e76-38d24d240d32","identifier":"13710067","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix S4200"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Long 24x optical zoom<\/b>\\nThe combination of versatile & functional Fujinon lens and a bright viewfinder gives a sensational shooting experience.\\n\\n<b>SR AUTO & Detection Functions<\/b>\\nEquipped with SR AUTO, an auto 6 scene-recognition function fully loaded with detection functions that finds faces, blinks and smiles for clear optimised people photos.\\n\\n<b>High Performance Shooting Functions<\/b>\\nIntroducing high-performance shooting functions of Motion Panorama, Super Macro, Tracking Auto Focus, Instant Zoom and a Zoom Bracketing Mode.\\n\\n<b>Easy Upload and Searching<\/b>\\nShare pictures with friends and family, tagging pictures and movies for upload to FACEBOOK and YouTube\u2122 right within your camera."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-08T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":24}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:33:03+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:33:03+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"56f46770-bba4-4ecd-a8e6-a1ed695f146d","identifier":"13710101","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","philips","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"picture":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"9\/5\/2\/8\/9528ea089def5a40919e0e0e20c1abfb024054b7_13710101_Philips.jpg","_links":{"download":{"href":"https:\/\/ak7-ee.cloud.induxx.be\/api\/rest\/v1\/media-files\/9\/5\/2\/8\/9528ea089def5a40919e0e0e20c1abfb024054b7_13710101_Philips.jpg\/download"}}}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips PTA317"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Teilen Sie Erlebnisse mit Menschen, die Ihnen wichtig sind, egal wo diese sich gerade befinden. Mit Skype\u2122 auf Ihrem Fernseher k\u00f6nnen Sie Sprach und Videoanrufe kostenlos genie\u00dfen. Schlie\u00dfen Sie diese hochwertige Kamera einfach an Ihren mit dem Internet verbundenen Philips Smart LED-Fernseher an, und beginnen Sie mit dem Telefonieren."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Enjoy SkypeTM on your TV<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Voice and video calls from your living room<\/b>\\n\\nShare experiences with people that matter to you, wherever they are. With SkypeTM on\\nyour TV, enjoy voice and video calls for free. Simply connect this high-quality camera to\\nyour Internet-connected Philips Smart LED TV and start calling.\\n\\n<b>Keep in touch with Skype<\/b>\\n\\n- Talk face-to-face with live video for free\\n- Make calls to phones, anywhere in the world for great rates\\n- Talk to more people on one call from your TV\\n\\n<b>Enjoy excellent quality with ease of use<\/b>\\n\\n- Enjoy video calls with high-quality TV camera\\n- A clear image no matter where you sit with 3x digital zoom\\n- Clear speech regardless of distance and space\\n- Universal clamping on all Philips Smart TV Premium TVs"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Partagez les \u00e9v\u00e8nements de votre vie avec vos proches, o\u00f9 que vous soyez. Avec Skype\u2122 sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur, les appels vocaux et vid\u00e9o sont gratuits. Connectez simplement cette webcam haute qualit\u00e9 \u00e0 votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur LED Smart\u00a0TV Philips connect\u00e9 \u00e0 Internet pour passer des appels."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-08T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7c892396-1bc7-4642-8465-2ebb47d9a5ac","identifier":"1375557","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["canon","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon DR-2050SP"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Dank seiner innovativen \u201eScan-to-Projector\u201c-Funktion ist der kompakte Dokumentenscanner DR-2050SP Ihr leistungsstarker Assistent bei Pr\u00e4sentationen.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n-Kompakter Tischscanner.\\n-Scan-to-Projector \u2013 ganz ohne PC.\\n-Verschiedene Eingabem\u00f6glichkeiten, u. a. \u00fcber Mobiltelefon (Irda).\\n-Einfache Pr\u00e4sentationen \u00fcber Fernbedienung.\\n-S\u00e4mtliche Scanm\u00f6glichkeiten und Software des Canon DR-2050C.\\n\\n<b>Weitere Informationen<\/b>\\n\\nEin Platz sparender Farbscanner, der nicht nur alle Ihre Dokumente digitalisieren, sondern auch gleich w\u00e4hrend einer Pr\u00e4sentation auf einem Projektor anzeigen kann. Genau das macht den DR-2050SP von Canon so innovativ: Er bietet Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit, Qualit\u00e4t und Schnelligkeit und hilft Ihnen dabei, auf genial einfache Art und Weise Ihre Pr\u00e4sentationen aufzuwerten.\\nSchlie\u00dfen Sie den DR-2050SP an Ihren Projektor an, und entdecken Sie v\u00f6llig neue M\u00f6glichkeiten f\u00fcr Ihre Pr\u00e4sentationen:\\n\\n<b>Scannen ohne PC<\/b>\\nSie k\u00f6nnen den DR-2050SP ohne PC direkt an Ihren Projektor anschlie\u00dfen und gescannte Dokumente oder Bilder direkt von einem USB-Stick oder einem Mobiltelefon mit Infrarotschnittstelle anzeigen. \\n\\n<b>Erwecken Sie Ihre Pr\u00e4sentationen zum Leben<\/b>\\nSie k\u00f6nnen Skizzen, technische Dokumente, handgeschriebene Notizen oder detaillierte Ausdrucke mit Kollegen und Kunden gemeinsam nutzen \u2013 sofort, professionell und ohne PC. Der DR-2050SP arbeitet mit allen g\u00e4ngigen Aufl\u00f6sungen (SXGA, XGA und SVGA) und w\u00e4hlt automatisch die beste verf\u00fcgbare Aufl\u00f6sung. Es sind bis zu 1.280 x 1.024 Pixel (mit SXGA) m\u00f6glich \u2013 so werden scharfe Bilder bei einer Pr\u00e4sentation zum Leben erweckt. \\n\\nWeitere Verarbeitungsfunktionen wie automatische Gr\u00f6\u00dfenerkennung, Schr\u00e4glagen- und Farbkorrektur sorgen daf\u00fcr, dass jede Ihrer Pr\u00e4sentationen Eindruck hinterl\u00e4sst.\\n\\n<b>Einfache Bedienung<\/b>\\nDer DR-2050SP verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber 64 MB internen Speicher und kann so bis zu 40 Seiten scannen und anzeigen. Sie k\u00f6nnen aber auch einen USB-Stick an den DR-2050SP anschlie\u00dfen und die auf dem Stick gespeicherten Bilder anzeigen.\\n\\n\u00dcber eine Miniaturansicht sehen Sie alle zum Anzeigen verf\u00fcgbaren Bilder. Die Bildauswahl erfolgt ganz einfach \u00fcber eine Fernbedienung, mit der Sie die Bilder auch drehen und die Helligkeit anpassen k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\nSchlie\u00dfen Sie den DR-2050SP an Ihren PC an, und freuen Sie sich auf:\\n\\n<b>Schnelles und pr\u00e4zises Scannen<\/b>\\nAn den PC angeschlossen wird der DR-2050SP zu einem kompakten und leistungsstarken Desktop-Scanner. Die Scangeschwindigkeit betr\u00e4gt 20 Seiten pro Minute (Hochformat, Simplex und Schwarzwei\u00dfmodus, 200 dpi) f\u00fcr A4 und alle kleineren Papierformate. Doppelseitige Dokumente werden mit beeindruckenden 38 Seiten pro Minute gescannt, und mit weiteren n\u00fctzlichen Funktionen wie 24-Bit-Farbscannen, optimaler 600 dpi-Aufl\u00f6sung, \u201eScan-to-PDF\u201c und \u201eScan-to-Email\u201c erh\u00f6ht der DR-2050SP Ihre Produktivit\u00e4t noch weiter."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The DR-2050SP is a compact document scanner that doubles as a powerful presentation aid thanks to its innovative \u201cscan-to-projector\u201d functionality.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n-Compact desktop scanning.\\n-Scan to projector - without the need for a PC.\\n-Multiple source inputs including mobile phone (Irda).\\n-Easy, remote control presentations.\\n-All the scanning capabilities and software of Canon\u2019s DR-2050C.\\n\\n<b>Further Information<\/b>\\n\\nImagine a space-saving colour scanner that can not only digitise all your documents, but can also instantly display them on a projector during a presentation. That\u2019s the innovative thinking behind Canon\u2019s DR-2050SP: combining reliability, quality, and speedy scanning capabilities with a brilliant, easy way to add value to your presentations.\\nConnect the DR-2050SP to your projector to open up a new realm of presentation possibilities:\\n\\n<b>Scanning without a PC<\/b>\\nThe DR-2050SP connects to your projector without needing a PC, allowing you to instantly display scanned documents, images from a USB memory stick or an infrared-compatible mobile phone. \\n\\n<b>Bring presentations to life<\/b>\\nImagine being able to share sketches, technical documents, handwritten annotations, or detailed print-outs with colleagues and customers \u2013 instantly, professionally and without a PC. The DR-2050SP works with all resolution standards (SXGA, XGA and SVGA), automatically adjusting resolution to achieve the maximum attainable. This means up to 1280 x 1024 pixels (using SXGA) is possible for sharp images that are brought to life when projected. \\n\\nAdditionally, image processing capabilities such as auto-size detection, de-skewing and colour correction ensure you can maximize impact with every presentation.\\n\\n\\n<b>Easy to use<\/b>\\nThe DR-2050SP has a built-in memory of 64MB, which allows it to scan up to 40 pages for projection. Alternatively, insert a USB memory stick and the DR-2050SP switches modes, accessing the images held on the stick for projection.\\n\\nA thumbnail view helps you see all the images ready for projection. Selecting and moving from one to another is easily handled via a remote control, which allows you to also rotate images and fine-tune the brightness.\\n\\nConnect the DR-2050SP to your PC and look forward to:\\n\\n<b>Quick, accurate scanning<\/b>\\nConnect to your PC and the DR-2050SP works as a compact, powerful desktop scanner. Performance is quick at 20 pages per minute (A4 portrait, simplex, black and white, 200 dpi), with same-speed scanning of all paper sizes up to A4. Double-sided documents are scanned at an impressive 38 pages per minute and, to boost productivity further, the DR-2050SP includes useful features such as 24 bit colour scanning, 600 dpi optimum resolution, scan-to-PDF, and scan-to-email. For further explanation of the powerful scanning capabilities please refer to the DR-2050C."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-01-16T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fced6378-3f7e-4fee-aae2-61f155a657c1","identifier":"1377452","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DCR-HC53"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"8"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Videoaufnahmen in Standard Definition-Qualit\u00e4t auf g\u00fcnstigen DV-B\u00e4ndern\\n- CCD-Sensor mit 800.000 Pixeln\\n- Carl Zeiss Vario-Tessar Objektiv mit optischem 40fach-Zoom und digitalem 2000fach-Zoom\\n- SteadyShot INSIDE f\u00fcr bessere Videostabilit\u00e4t, insbesondere bei niedriger Belichtung\\n- 2,5\" gro\u00dfer LCD-Touchscreen\\n- Farbsucher\\n- Start-\/Stopp- und Zoom-Taste am LC-Display-Rahmen\\n- Dank STAMINA Akku bis zu 14 Stunden fortlaufende Aufnahmezeit (mit optionalem Akku)\\n- DV-Verbindung (i.LINK) f\u00fcr die Videobearbeitung auf einem angeschlossenen PC (nur Ausgang)\\n- USB-Streaming f\u00fcr den Einsatz einer Webcam\\n- Benutzerfreundliche Picture Motion Browser-Software mit Internet-Upload-Assistenten."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Simple, affordable, fun. Widely-available DV tape makes a great choice if you're into editing your own shots. Handycam\u00ae quality video with super power 40x Carl Zeiss lens. Easy to use touchscreen LCD and long 14 hour battery life for extended shooting.\\n\\n- Standard Definition video recording on affordable DV tape \\n800k pixel CCD sensor \\n- Carl Zeiss Vario-Tessar lens with 40x optical zoom \/ 2000x digital zoom \\n- Super SteadyShot for improved still image and video stability, especially in low light \\n- 2.5\u201d LCD touchscreen \\n- Colour viewfinder \\n- Start \/ Stop and Zoom buttons on LCD screen frame \\n- Up to 14 hours STAMINA continuous shooting time (with optional battery) \\n- DV (i.LINK) connection for video editing with connected PC (output only) \\n- USB streaming for webcam use \\n- Fun, easy to use Picture Motion Browser software with web upload assist function"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-01-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":40}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9e6bfe31-3166-41e7-a38c-3fa0b747e164","identifier":"1377615","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DSLR-A200 + 18-70mm + 75-300mm"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- CCD-Sensor mit effektiv 10,2 Mio. Pixel und optimierter BIONZ Prozessor f\u00fcr mehr Bildqualit\u00e4t, weniger Bildrauschen und schnelle Reaktionen\\n- Die hohe Empfindlichkeit bis zu ISO3200 und die Rauschunterdr\u00fcckung f\u00fcr hohe ISO-Werte erlauben auch bei schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen handgehaltene Aufnahmen ohne Blitz.\\n- Die dynamische Bereichsoptimierung passt Belichtung und Kontrast an, um bei Szenen mit Hintergrundbeleuchtung eine optimale Belichtungseinstellung zu erreichen.\\n- Die verbesserte SteadyShot INSIDE-Bildstabilisierung bietet eine Anti-Shake-Funktion mit 2,5-3,5 Schritten f\u00fcr alle \u03b1-Objektive.*\\n- 2,7\" gro\u00dfes Clear Photo LC-Display mit benutzerfreundlichen Funktionsanzeigen und Ladezustandsanzeige\\n- Verbesserter 9-Punkte-Autofokus mit Fadenkreuz mit EyeStart-Aktivierung zur schnellen und pr\u00e4zisen Fokussierung\\n- 3 Serienbilder pro Sekunde (JPEG Fine-Modus, Einschr\u00e4nkung je nach Speicherkartenkapazit\u00e4t)\\n- Der InfoLITHIUM-Akku mit hoher Kapazit\u00e4t erlaubt zwischen den Ladezyklen bis zu 750 Aufnahmen (CIPA-Messung)\\n- Ein zweifaches Anti-Staubsystem sch\u00fctzt den Sensor beim Austauschen des Objektivs\\n- *\u201eSteadyShot INSIDE\u201c war zuvor unter der Bezeichnung \u201eSuper SteadyShot\u201c bekannt."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Enter the exciting world of DSLR photography with the highly capable \u03b1 (alpha) DSLR-A200 camera and the included 18-70mm zoom lens. With total creative control over your shots, you'll have frame-worthy results in no time."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Capteur CCD 10,2 m\u00e9gapixels effectifs et processeur BIONZ optimis\u00e9 pour une qualit\u00e9 d'image optimale, un bruit r\u00e9duit et un fonctionnement dynamique\\n- Haute sensibilit\u00e9 jusqu'\u00e0 ISO3200 avec r\u00e9duction du bruit High ISO pour des photos r\u00e9ussies sans flash en condition de faible luminosit\u00e9, m\u00eame sans tr\u00e9pied\\n- Optimisateur de gamme D pour r\u00e9gler la luminosit\u00e9 et le contraste pour de magnifiques photos en contre-jour\\n- Le stabilisateur SteadyShot int\u00e9gr\u00e9 avanc\u00e9 offre une grande stabilit\u00e9 (pas 2,5 - 3,5) avec tous les objectifs \u00e0 monture de type \u03b1*\\n- Grand \u00e9cran 2,7\" \u00ab Clear Photo LCD \u00bb facile d'utilisation et t\u00e9moin d'usure de la batterie\\n- Mise au point automatique centr\u00e9e 9 points am\u00e9lior\u00e9e avec activation EyeStart pour une mise au point rapide et pr\u00e9cise\\n- Prise de vue continue \u00e0 3 ips (mode Fine JPEG, limit\u00e9 par la capacit\u00e9 de la carte m\u00e9moire)\\n- La batterie InfoLITHIUM haute capacit\u00e9 permet de prendre jusqu'\u00e0 750 photos entre deux charges (norme CIPA)\\n- Le double syst\u00e8me anti-poussi\u00e8re prot\u00e8ge le capteur lors des changements d'objectif\\n- *SteadyShot int\u00e9gr\u00e9 \u00e9tait auparavant connu sous le nom Super SteadyShot."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-01-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":4}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"17c1ce8f-10be-4502-86eb-d4ccd0044596","identifier":"1382100","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_letter_216_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["n","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon i-SENSYS MF4270"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"This compact network-ready All-in-One offers small offices productive laser printing, faxing, copying and colour scanning. Cut paper costs and create professional documents with double-sided printing.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n-  Print, fax, copy, colour scan\\n- Built-in network interface\\n- Super G3 fax modem\\n- Auto duplexing\\n- Zero warm-up time from sleep mode\\n- First Copy Out Time in less than 9 seconds\\n- 20 ppm\/cpm, up to 1200x600dpi print resolution\\n- 35-sheet Automatic Document Feeder \\n\\nNetwork ready, compact Laser All-in-One for small offices\\n\\n<b>Space-saving productivity<\/b>\\nThis stylish multifunctional is the ideal solution for small offices that want to boost productivity and save on space. Benefit from professional print, fax, copy and colour scan functionality in a compact desktop unit.\\n\\n<b>Easy network connectivity<\/b>\\nShare printing and PC faxing thanks to the built-in network interface card. A Remote User Interface allows users to view machine status and monitor print jobs from their web browser. Also administrators can control machine settings.\\n\\n<b>Fast, high quality faxing<\/b>\\nThe Super G3 fax modem transmits faxes in as little as 3 seconds per page* to cut your communication costs. The 256-page* fax memory stores faxes safely if paper or toner runs out. Scan documents to memory before transmission to save time.\\n\\nOur Ultra High Quality imaging technology ensures that all details come out clearly when sending documents containing diagrams, photos or fine text.\\n\\n<b>Cut paper costs<\/b>\\nCut paper costs and produce professional looking documents and booklets with built-in automatic double-sided printing.\\n\\n<b>Save time, save energy<\/b>\\nSpeed up your workflow. With virtually zero warm-up time from sleep mode, and a First Copy Out Time of less than 9 seconds, there no waiting for prints or copies. Save on power costs too as this energy efficient unit uses only 3 watts in sleep mode.\\n\\n<b>High speed, high quality output<\/b>\\nPrint and copy large multi-page documents with ease thanks to a rapid 20 ppm\/cpm print speed. Up to 1200 x 600dpi print resolution provides high quality output, with sharp text and clear graphics.\\n\\n<b>35-sheet Automatic Document Feeder<\/b>\\nCopy, fax and scan multiple page documents quickly and with ease using the 35-sheet Automatic Document Feeder. A 250-sheet paper tray and multi purpose tray offer flexible paper handling.\\n\\n<b>Versatile colour scanning<\/b>\\nThe user-friendly MF toolbox software allows quick access to various colour scan functions including scan to pdf and scan to email. Convert paper documents into digital documents using the bundled OCR software.\\n\\n<b>All-in-One cartridge<\/b>\\nThe All-in-One cartridge reduces maintenance requirements and ensures continuous high quality output. Simply replace the compact cartridge - containing toner, drum and cleaning units - and the printer is almost as good as 'new'."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-01-30T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fc7e1758-5d04-4022-bf76-1d8c4c672149","identifier":"13825492","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix F750EXR"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>The Premium Travel Zoom - All You Dreamed of and More!<\/b>\\n20x optical zoom performance plus Intelligent Digital Zoom for extreme 40x telephoto shots - all in the smallest long-zoom compact in the world.* Every control is at your fingertips.\\n\\n- NEW FUJINON 20x Optical Zoom Lens Plus 40x Intelligent Digital Zoom\\n- Image Stabilization (CMOS Shift + High ISO)\\n- Faster So Your Never Miss a Moment\\n- High Speed Shooting Functions\\n- Intuitive Control Palette\\n- 3.0-inch LCD with NEW \u201cMonitor Sunlight Mode\u201d\\n- FUJINON Lens Technology\\n\\n<b>High Quality Photos & Movies with the New EXR AUTO<\/b>\\nThe EXR CMOS sensor for breathtaking image quality in low-light scenes, and the EXR Processor for lightning-fast auto focus.\\n\\n- NEW EXR AUTO 103 Shooting Patterns with Motion Detection\\n- New Face Tracking AF\\n- Super High Quality Full HD Movies\\n- RP (Real Photo) Technology\\n\\n<b>More Creative Photography for You<\/b>\\nWith Individual Shutter 3D Shooting, you can make two shots of the same subjects from different positions. For creative needs, various shooting options and functions are available.\\n\\n- NEW 3D Shooting with \u201cIndividual Shutter 3D\u201d\\n- Multiple Exposures\\n- Motion Panorama 360 - Photo Gallery Quality\\n- Super Intelligent Flash\\n- Image Processing Function of Multi Frame Composition\\n- Film Simulation Mode\\n- Face Recognition\\n- Three Bracketing Functions\\n- Dog \/ Cat Detection\\n\\n<b>Image Sharing and Post Capture Essentials<\/b>\\nPhoto playback, in-camera movie editing\/upload and image search are as simple as it can be! With easy photo and video sharing online, advanced picture search function, micro thumbnail and slideshow, revive your captured memories along with user friendly design.\\n\\n- Share your images with built in social networking\\n- Playback Functions\\n- Memory Card"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":20}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b9a746dc-4917-4cfd-aace-d4a94e3655c8","identifier":"13836769","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","oki","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["n"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"OKI MB461"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"For small businesses or workgroups requiring print, copy and scan functionality the MB461 is a robust MFP with outstanding features that add control. In addition, with a low initial capital outlay and low running costs, this is an attractive option for the budget conscious business.\\n\\n<b>Fast, reliable and easy to use<\/b>\\n- Print speeds of 33ppm for time critical print jobs\\n- Built on tried and tested, award winning digital LED technology\\n- Ideal for use by a wide range of organisations thanks to its flexible media handling, from labels to spreadsheets, invoices, proposals, forms, technical drawings and more\\n- Perfect for businesses that require fast mono printing with the added functionality of copying, scanning and faxing\\n\\nGreat features to improve workplace productivity\\nThe MB461 is packed full of outstanding standard features, including:\\n- 50-sheet RADF enabling you to copy, scan and fax two sided documents\\n- Front facing USB port enabling you to directly print from a USB stick\\n- Overlay function enables you to save logos or forms in the MFP memory, for re-use in other documents\\n- Compatible with mobile printing applications allowing you to print directly from your mobile device over wireless networks\\n\\n<b>Looking after the environment<\/b>\\nThe MB461 is one of the most environmentally conscious A4 mono MFPs on the market, incorporating a wide range of features to help your organisation reduce its energy consumption, impact on the environment and ongoing costs.:\\n- Reduced energy usage through combining several devices in one\\n- Advanced LED technology\\n- Eco and Deep Sleep modes\\n- Reduced toner usage with a Toner Save function, Duplex printing and advanced fax functionality that helps to reduce the amount you print\\n\\n<b>Plus, extra peace of mind<\/b>\\nWe are so confident in the reliability of the MB461 you can benefit from OKI\u2019s 3 year warranty at no extra cost by registering your product within 30 days of purchase."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9bfe4256-2ccf-4d8a-8a65-997af8d11c0c","identifier":"13836783","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","oki","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["print"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"OKI MC562dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"OKI MC562dn. Print technology: Laser, Printing: Colour, Copying: Mono. Time to first page (black, normal): 7.5. Maximum copy resolution: 600 x 600, Copier resize: 25 - 400. Optical scanning resolution: 1200 x 1200, Scan type: Flatbed. Modem speed: 33.6"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"29.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6c91f51f-2cf5-4ae1-88a8-37397f723410","identifier":"13837398","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE40ES7000Q"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE40ES7000Q. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus \/ Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Power consumption (standby): 0.1, Energy efficiency class: B, Input voltage: 220 - 240"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ddbb2ec7-90a2-423d-899a-731189800b78","identifier":"13837402","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE55ES7000Q"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE55ES7000Q. HD type: HD-Ready, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus \/ Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Power consumption (standby): 0.1, Energy efficiency class: A, Input voltage: 220 - 240"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":55,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7b930913-ded2-45a7-822d-d43697cc66ff","identifier":"13841946","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 46PFL8007K"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Entdecken Sie eine Welt verschiedener Inhalte mit einem Philips 3D Smart LED-Fernseher 46PFL8007. Genie\u00dfen Sie die unbegrenzten M\u00f6glichkeiten durch Smart TV Premium, Skype\u2122 auf Ihrem Fernseher mit der mitgelieferten Fernsehkamera sowie die einzigartige Fernbedienung mit integrierter PC-Tastatur und Mauszeiger*."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Be part of the action!<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Enjoy Full HD 3D and Smart TV with Ambilight<\/b>\\nExperience a world of content with a Philips 46PFL8007 3D Smart LED TV. Enjoy endless possibilities of Smart TV Premium, SkypeTM on your TV with the provided TV camera and the unique remote control with integrated keyboard and pointer*.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy a world of content with Smart TV Premium<\/b>\\n- Integrated Wi-Fi to use Smart TV wirelessly\\n- A wealth of online apps, videos to rent and catch-up TV\\n- Control the TV with your smart phone, tablet or keyboard\\n- Find, schedule, record* & pause TV\\n- Watch TV wherever you like at home with Wi-Fi smart screen*\\n- Make voice and video calls with SkypeTM on your TV\\n\\n<b>Breathtaking performance<\/b>\\n- Ambilight Spectra XL, a new Ambilight for more immersion\\n- 3D Max Clarity 700 for stunning Full HD 3D experience\\n- Enjoy any 2D content in flawless 3D at a push of a button\\n- Unique 3D depth adjustment to view 3D the way you like it\\n- Unique Two Player Full Screen Gaming mode for your 2D games\\n- Full HD TV and Perfect Pixel HD Engine for unrivaled clarity\\n- 800Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) for superb motion sharpness"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Profitez de toute une gamme de contenus avec le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur LED Smart 3D Philips 46PFL8007. Laissez-vous s\u00e9duire par les possibilit\u00e9s infinies de Smart TV Premium, les conversations Skype\u2122 sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la webcam\u00a0TV fournie et la t\u00e9l\u00e9commande exclusive avec clavier et pointeur int\u00e9gr\u00e9s.*"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"804b8778-2a18-46b8-900a-ca4d08f94e3e","identifier":"13844560","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["brother","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Brother ADS-2100 scanner"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Kompakter Duplex-Dokumentenscanner mit USB-Host<\/b>\\n\\nDokumentenscanner\\n\\n- Scangeschwindigkeit bis zu 24 Seiten\/Minute\\n- Beidseitiges Scannen von bis zu 48 Bildern\/Minute\\n- Bis zu 600 x 600 dpi Scanaufl\u00f6sung (optisch)\\n- Automatischer 50 Blatt Vorlageneinzug f\u00fcr mehrseitiges Scannen\\n- USB-Host: direktes Scannen auf den USB-Stick ohne PC\\n- Scan-to-USB\/ -E-Mail\/ -Text\/ -Datei\/ -Bild\/ -PDF(durchsuchbar)\\n- Multieinzugs-Erkennung \u00fcber Ultraschall\\n\\nInklusive professionellem Softwarepaket\\n\\n- Nuance\u00ae PDF Converter Professional 7 (Windows\u00ae)\\n- Nuance\u00ae PaperPort 12SE (Windows\u00ae)\\n- Presto!\u00ae PageManager\u00ae Version 9 (MacOS)\\n- NewSoft\u00ae Presto!\u00ae BizCard 6 (Windows\u00ae)\\n- NewSoft\u00ae Presto!\u00ae BizCard 5 (MacOS)"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Brother Automatic Document Scanners allow you to transform multiple paper documents up to A3 in size into a high-res digital format, with ease.\\n\\nOur range of automatic document scanners are feature packed, with fast two-sided scanning with multipage detection as standard. Fast scan speeds of 24ppm (48ipm for double sided document) mean you won't be left waiting either.\\n\\nOur range of scanners can be easily integrated with existing document management using either TWAIN and ISIS* scan drivers. The suite of software which includes great features such as business card scanning, scan to searchable PDF and one touch scanning direct to PC or USB stick, is even compatible with both Windows and Apple operating systems.\\n\\nWhether saving time by putting fast scanning, archiving and sharing at your fingertips, or saving space by making a paper-free office a reality, the Brother scanners deliver the results you demand every time.\\n\\n<b>Flexible Scanning Sizes<\/b>\\n\\nA variety of media types including documents, business cards, plastic ID cards (insurance cards, drivers licenses and ID cards), receipts and photos up to 8.5\" in width and up to 34\" in length.\\n\\n<b>Improve Productivity and Save Time<\/b>\\n\\nFeaturing scan speeds ranging from 5ppm to 24ppm, higher scan speeds save time for multiple users and on large volume scanning tasks.\\n\\n<b>Duplex Scanning<\/b>\\n\\nScans two-sided documents in a single pass with dual CIS.\\n\\n<b>Scan Destinations<\/b>\\n\\nInclude a variety of destinations such as E-mail, OCR, File and Image. Additionally supports scanning to USB flash memory drive and scanning to Android\u2122 phone and tablet."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Num\u00e9risation directe vers un port USB en fa\u00e7ade\\n- Num\u00e9risation facilit\u00e9e gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la pression d'une touche unique\\n- D\u00e9tection et suppression des pages blanches\\n- Calage automatique\\n- D\u00e9tection ultrasonique de doublons"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"70c9fa6b-321b-41eb-b007-918ddb90a186","identifier":"13847114","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 19DL934G LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die DL934G-Serie kombiniert beste HD-Unterhaltung mit sparsamer LED-Beleuchtung und schlankem, platzsparendem Design durch einen integrierten DVD-Player.\\n\\n<b>LED<\/b>\\nLEDs wandeln Strom effizient in Licht um und liefern zus\u00e4tzlich bessere Kontraste und leuchtendere Farben. Die Full-HD-Aufl\u00f6sung unterstreicht diese hervorragenden Eigenschaften zus\u00e4tzlich.\\n\\n<b>HD READY<\/b>\\nHD Ready bedeutet, dass dieser Fernseher \u00fcber eine HD Aufl\u00f6sung von 1366 x 768 Bildpunkten verf\u00fcgt und somit f\u00fcr HD-Fernsehen geeignet ist.\\n\\n<b>DVD-Player integriert<\/b>\\nDieser TV hat einen integrierten DVD Player, so dass Sie auf ein externes Ger\u00e4t verzichten k\u00f6nnen und trotzdem all Ihre Lieblingsfilme genie\u00dfen k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>Dualtuner<\/b>\\nDieser TV bietet neben einem analogen Tuner ebenfalls einen Tuner f\u00fcr DVB-T und DVB-C (HD).\\n\\n<b>Videos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle<\/b>\\nMit diesem TV k\u00f6nnen Sie Videos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle genie\u00dfen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba 19DL934G. HD type: HD-Ready, Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, NTSC 4.43, PAL BG, PAL DK, PAL I, SECAM B\/G, SECAM D\/K, SECAM L, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-C2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital +. Optical disc player type: DVD player, Disc types supported: CD, CD-R, DVD, DVD+R, DVD+RW, DVD-R, DVD-RW. Video formats supported: AVCHD, AVI, DAT, H.264, M-JPEG, MKV, MP4, MPEG1, MPEG2, MPEG4, MPG, VOB, XVID, Audio formats supported: AAC, HE-AAC, LPCM, MP3, MP4, Image formats supported: JPG"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":19,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6b527e9f-3f0f-46a3-889e-a9c07462d846","identifier":"13851841","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 40PFL7007K"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Integriertes WiFi f\u00fcr die kabellose Verwendung von Smart TV<\/b>\\nMit dem integrierten WiFi-Netzwerk in Ihrem Philips Fernseher k\u00f6nnen Sie mit Smart TV zuhause kabellos auf umfassende Inhalte zugreifen.\\n\\n<b>Eine beeindruckende Auswahl an Online-Apps, Leihvideos und Catch-up TV<\/b>\\nLeihen Sie Filme aus Online-Videoshops direkt auf Ihrem Fernseher aus, verpassen Sie nie mehr Sendungen auf Ihren Lieblingssendern, genie\u00dfen Sie eine Vielzahl von Online-Apps mit Net TV, und surfen Sie im Internet.\\n\\n<b>Steuern Sie Ihren Fernseher \u00fcber Smartphone, Tablet oder Tastatur<\/b>\\nSteuern Sie Ihren Fernseher einfach und unkompliziert. Schlie\u00dfen Sie einfach eine drahtlose Tastatur an, oder steuern Sie Ihren Smart TV \u00fcber Ihr Smartphone oder Tablet.\\n\\n<b>Sendungen suchen, programmieren, aufnehmen und pausieren<\/b>\\nNehmen Sie digitale Live-Sendungen auf einem an den Philips Fernseher angeschlossenen USB-Ger\u00e4t auf, oder pausieren Sie Inhalte wann immer Sie m\u00f6chten, und setzen Sie die Wiedergabe jederzeit fort. Mit der elektronischen Programmzeitschrift finden Sie Ihre Lieblingsprogramme und k\u00f6nnen die Aufnahme ganz einfach programmieren. So passen Sie Ihr Fernsehvergn\u00fcgen Ihrem Leben an.\\n\\n<b>Schauen Sie mit dem WiFi Smart Screen* \u00fcberall in Ihrem Zuhause Fernsehen<\/b>\\nMit dem WiFi Smart Screen* sind Sie nicht l\u00e4nger an Ihre Couch gebunden. Sehen Sie sich digitale Fernsehinhalte an, ganz gleich, wo Sie sich in Ihrem Zuhause befinden. Laden Sie ganz einfach die Philips MyRemote App herunter. Streamen Sie das Programm anschlie\u00dfend von Ihrem Fernseher auf Ihr iPad, und genie\u00dfen Sie weiterhin das Programm. Streamen Sie auch Fotos, Videos oder Musik von Ihren intelligenten Ger\u00e4ten auf den gro\u00dfen Bildschirm. Dies bedeutet echte Freiheit f\u00fcr Ihr Fernseherlebnis!\\n\\n<b>Ambilight Spectra 2 verleiht Fernsehvergn\u00fcgen eine neue Dimension<\/b>\\nMit Ambilight Spectra 2 erreicht Ihr Fernseherlebnis ganz neue Dimensionen. Diese patentierte Technologie von Philips vergr\u00f6\u00dfert den Bildschirm mehr als je zuvor, indem ein Umgebungslicht auf zwei Seiten des Ger\u00e4ts von der R\u00fcckseite des Bildschirms auf die umliegenden W\u00e4nde projiziert wird. Ambilight passt Farbe und Helligkeit des Umgebungslichts automatisch an das Fernsehbild an. Dank der Wandanpassungsfunktion passt die Farbe immer zum Fernsehbild, ganz gleich, welche Farbe Ihre Wand hat.\\n\\n<b>3D Max Clarity 700 f\u00fcr ein eindrucksvolles 3D-Erlebnis in Full HD<\/b>\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie ein atemberaubendes 3D-Erlebnis in Full HD auf Ihrem Philips Fernseher. Mit der Active3D-Technologie bietet 3D Max Clarity 700 ein unvergleichliches 3D-Fernseherlebnis in hoher Aufl\u00f6sung und mit optimaler Bewegungssch\u00e4rfe. Sie k\u00f6nnen sogar beliebige 2D-Inhalte in lebendiges und perfektes 3D konvertieren.\\n\\n<b>Genie\u00dfen Sie per Tastendruck 2D-Inhalte in perfekter 3D-Qualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie Ihre gesamte Filmsammlung in lebendiger und perfekter 3D-Qualit\u00e4t \u2013 sogar alte Schwarz-Wei\u00df-Klassiker. Philips bietet hochwertige Qualit\u00e4t bei der Konvertierung von 2D-Inhalten in Echtzeit per Tastendruck. Dadurch wird sichergestellt, dass Untertitel gleichm\u00e4\u00dfig angezeigt werden und keine Fehler auftreten, wie beispielsweise das Anzeigen des Hintergrunds im Vordergrund.\\n\\n<b>Einzigartige 3D-Tiefenanpassung zur Anzeige von 3D-Inhalten<\/b>\\nJeder Mensch nimmt 3D unterschiedlich wahr. Aus diesem Grund bietet Philips Ihnen die M\u00f6glichkeit, die 3D-Tiefensch\u00e4rfe Ihrem pers\u00f6nlichen Geschmack anzupassen. Die einzigartige 3D-Tiefenanpassung erm\u00f6glicht Ihnen die Auswahl der Bildtiefe, die sich am besten f\u00fcr den Inhalt auf dem Bildschirm und Ihren pers\u00f6nlichen Bed\u00fcrfnisse eignet. Dadurch wird das Bild auch f\u00fcr Ihre Augen angenehmer. Kommen Sie nun in den vollen 3D-Genuss.\\n\\n<b>Einzigartiger Zwei-Spieler Fullscreen Gaming-Modus f\u00fcr Ihre 2D-Spiele<\/b>\\nMit der 3D-Brille von Philips kann Ihr Fernseher das ultimative Zwei-Spieler Fullscreen Gaming bieten. Bei 2D-Spielen f\u00fcr zwei Spieler sehen die Spieler ihr Spiel in der Regel auf einer H\u00e4lfte des Bildschirms. Dank der 3D-Technologie k\u00f6nnen jetzt beide Spieler mit nur einem Tastendruck auf der Brille das Spiel gleichzeitig in der 2D-Vollbildansicht genie\u00dfen.\\n\\n<b>Full HD Fernseher mit Pixel Precise HD f\u00fcr mehr Bewegungssch\u00e4rfe<\/b>\\nPixel Precise HD basiert auf dem preisgekr\u00f6nten Pixel Plus System. Die Bildqualit\u00e4t erh\u00e4lt damit dank der 4 Billionen Farben eine neue Dimension. Egal, ob Sie sich ein Internet-Video oder einen hochwertigen Blu-ray-Film ansehen \u2013 Super Resolution und Pixel Precise HD gew\u00e4hrleisten immer die beste HD-Bildqualit\u00e4t.\\n\\n<b>800 Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) f\u00fcr eine perfekte Bewegungssch\u00e4rfe<\/b>\\n800 Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) erzeugt noch sch\u00e4rfere Bilder bewegter Objekte in rasanten Actionfilmen. Der neue Philips PMR-Standard liefert Ihnen sichtbare Effekte dank sehr hoher Bildwiederholraten und Perfect Natural Motion mit seiner einzigartigen Prozessor-Power f\u00fcr unglaubliche Bewegungssch\u00e4rfe.\\n\\n<b>T\u00e4tigen Sie mit Skype\u2122 Sprach- und Videoanrufe auf Ihrem Fernseher<\/b>\\nRevolutionieren Sie Ihre Art zu telefonieren, und teilen Sie Erlebnisse mit Menschen, die Ihnen wichtig sind, egal wo diese sich gerade befinden. Mit Skype\u2122 auf Ihrem Fernseher k\u00f6nnen Sie Sprach-und Videoanrufe von Ihrem Wohnzimmer aus t\u00e4tigen. Schlie\u00dfen Sie einfach die optionale Philips TV-Kamera (PTA317\/00) an Ihren Fernseher an, und genie\u00dfen Sie exzellente Video- und erstklassige Soundqualit\u00e4t ganz entspannt auf Ihrem Sofa."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Be part of the action!<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Enjoy Full HD 3D and Smart TV with Ambilight<\/b>\\nExperience a world of content with a Philips 40PFL7007 3D Smart LED TV. Enjoy endless possibilities of Smart TV Premium, combined with the unique remote control and its integrated keyboard.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy a world of content with Smart TV Premium<\/b>\\n- Integrated Wi-Fi to use Smart TV wirelessly\\n- A wealth of online apps, videos to rent and catch-up TV\\n- Control the TV with your smart phone, tablet or keyboard\\n- Find, schedule, record & pause TV\\n- Watch TV wherever you like at home with Wi-Fi smart screen*\\n- Make voice and video calls with Skype\u2122 on your TV\\n\\n<b>Breathtaking perfomance<\/b>\\n- 3D Max Clarity 700 for stunning Full HD 3D experience\\n- Enjoy any 2D content in flawless 3D at a push of a button\\n- Unique 3D depth adjustment to view 3D the way you like it\\n- Unique Two Player Full Screen Gaming mode for your 2D games\\n- Full HD TV with Pixel Precise HD for details in action\\n- 800Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) for superb motion sharpness"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Profitez de toute une gamme de contenus avec le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur LED Smart Philips 40PFL7007. Laissez-vous s\u00e9duire par les possibilit\u00e9s infinies de Smart TV Premium, ainsi que par sa t\u00e9l\u00e9commande exclusive avec clavier int\u00e9gr\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d55c8cdd-c9b5-493f-8f5c-ed3fcdb418e2","identifier":"13854870","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 55PFL7007H\/12 LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Be part of the action!<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Enjoy Full HD 3D and Smart TV with Ambilight<\/b>\\n\\nExperience a world of content with a Philips 55PFL7007 3D Smart LED TV. Enjoy endless possibilities of Smart TV Premium, combined with the unique remote control and its integrated keyboard.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy a world of content with Smart TV Premium<\/b>\\n\\n- Integrated Wi-Fi to use Smart TV wirelessly\\n- A wealth of online apps, videos to rent and catch-up TV\\n- Control the TV with your smart phone, tablet or keyboard\\n- Find, schedule, record & pause TV\\n- Watch TV wherever you like at home with Wi-Fi smart screen\\n- Make voice and video calls with SkypeTM on your TV\\n\\n<b>Breathtaking performance<\/b>\\n\\n- Ambilight Spectra 2-sided intensifies the viewing experience\\n- 3D Max Clarity 700 for stunning Full HD 3D experience\\n- Enjoy any 2D content in flawless 3D at a push of a button\\n- Unique 3D depth adjustment to view 3D the way you like it\\n- Unique Two Player Full Screen Gaming mode for your 2D games\\n- Full HD TV with Pixel Precise HD for details in action\\n- 800Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) for superb motion sharpness"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Profitez de toute une gamme de contenus avec le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur LED Smart TV 3D Philips 55PFL7007. Laissez-vous s\u00e9duire par les possibilit\u00e9s infinies de Smart TV Premium, ainsi que par sa t\u00e9l\u00e9commande exclusive avec clavier int\u00e9gr\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-19T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":55,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c4540bd1-0c5e-42ff-b1f2-817618d2788c","identifier":"13857935","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","ngs"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"NGS Funny Bombs"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"This portable mini speaker can be easily carried anywhere because its small size and light weight. The 3.5mm cable allows you to play music from any music player, smartphone and tablet.Exclusive NGS design; these cute animals will become your musical pets! Enjoy Loud and Powerful music on the go!"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Ces mini haut-parleurs portables peuvent \u00eatre emport\u00e9s n\u00b4importe o\u00f9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 leur petite taille et leur faible poids. Le connecteur 3.5 mm vous permet de diffuser votre musique pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e de n\u00b4importe quel lecteur mp3, t\u00e9l\u00e9phone portable, tablette Avec un design exclusif NGS."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-19T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6a6de93e-c714-43b9-8746-3fbcfa8f7016","identifier":"13871461","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X464de"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Streamlined Reliability<\/b>\\nA smart, reliable option for bringing duplex printing, copying, scanning and high-speed faxing into one machine, with up to 40 ppm and the ability to scan documents straight to e-mail or a flash drive.\\n\\n<b>As Easy as It Gets<\/b>\\nRight out of the box, you\u2019ll power through tasks at exceptionally fast speeds\u2014up to 40 ppm. It\u2019s a breeze to set up, install, and start enjoying the benefit of doing all those multiple tasks on one user-friendly machine.\\n\\n<b>Smarter Printer, Smarter Business<\/b>\\nThe large LCD color touch screen offers amazingly simple access to a rich range of features, including duplex scanning, advanced copying and easy user authorization for enhanced security. You can even customize the touch screen to meet your workgroup\u2019s specific needs.\\n\\n<b>Small in Size, Huge on Features<\/b>\\nEnjoy an intelligent, efficient combination of built-in features like duplex printing, copying and scanning plus a front Direct USB port. Gives you the ability to scan to multiple destinations, letting your workgroup breeze through intense workloads.\\n\\n<b>Save the Earth and Money<\/b>\\nLower your cost per page while helping conserve resources with up to 9,000*-page or 15,000*-page replacement cartridges. Add that to the automatic duplex printing and the energy savings of consolidating to one smart device, and you\u2019re taking big steps toward an eco-conscious workplace. (*Declared yield in accordance with ISO\/IEC 19752.)"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"550fa5fa-78d6-49ff-ba6b-61b3ffb47280","identifier":"13871467","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X464de"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Streamlined Reliability<\/b>\\nA smart, reliable option for bringing duplex printing, copying, scanning and high-speed faxing into one machine, with up to 40 ppm and the ability to scan documents straight to e-mail or a flash drive.\\n\\n<b>As Easy as It Gets<\/b>\\nRight out of the box, you\u2019ll power through tasks at exceptionally fast speeds\u2014up to 40 ppm. It\u2019s a breeze to set up, install, and start enjoying the benefit of doing all those multiple tasks on one user-friendly machine.\\n\\n<b>Smarter Printer, Smarter Business<\/b>\\nThe large LCD color touch screen offers amazingly simple access to a rich range of features, including duplex scanning, advanced copying and easy user authorization for enhanced security. You can even customize the touch screen to meet your workgroup\u2019s specific needs.\\n\\n<b>Small in Size, Huge on Features<\/b>\\nEnjoy an intelligent, efficient combination of built-in features like duplex printing, copying and scanning plus a front Direct USB port. Gives you the ability to scan to multiple destinations, letting your workgroup breeze through intense workloads.\\n\\n<b>Save the Earth and Money<\/b>\\nLower your cost per page while helping conserve resources with up to 9,000*-page or 15,000*-page replacement cartridges. Add that to the automatic duplex printing and the energy savings of consolidating to one smart device, and you\u2019re taking big steps toward an eco-conscious workplace. (*Declared yield in accordance with ISO\/IEC 19752.)"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eda0a8a0-5c10-4714-b394-7d36312837ee","identifier":"13871955","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X658dfe"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"75.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Enhancements the Team Will Love<\/b>\\nGet advanced workflow right away, with a compact, affordable alternative to copiers. Robust MFP features 55 ppm speed, cutting-edge security features, an embedded solutions framework, and superior paper handling, including a 50-page StapleSmart II\u2122 Finisher.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark X658dfe A Large-Impact Touch Screen<\/b>\\nThe extra large 9\u201d color touch screen is command central and can be tailored with the solutions apps and shortcuts you need most.\\n\\n<b>Personalized User Settings<\/b>\\nMyMFP feature lets multiple users save and re-access their personal copy\/scan settings and address book on a simple flash drive\u2014even their own touch screen configuration.\\n\\n<b>Less Work for the Help Desk<\/b>\\nNetwork-ready and very easy to set up, plus Universal Driver support for simple multiple deployment. Also includes free MarkVision\u2122 Professional software for time-saving remote management. Ships with an 18,000*-page print cartridge and offers a 36,000*-page cartridge at replacement time. (*Average standard yield, ISO\/IEC 19752)\\n\\n<b>Get Efficient with Solution Apps<\/b>\\nOpt for one of Lexmark's leading workflow-enhancing applications to help you lower costs, analyze usage data, expand your functionality, and move information more securely. Just call a Lexmark representative to get started."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"633bf26a-9955-44d8-9e0b-f838ccc56e6e","identifier":"13871965","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["n"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X658dtfe"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"80.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Upgrade Your Output Capabilities<\/b>\\nGet advanced workflow right away, with a compact, affordable alternative to copiers. Robust MFP features 55 ppm speed, cutting-edge security features, an embedded solutions framework, and superior paper handling, including a 50-page StapleSmart II\u2122 Finisher for stapling up to 50 sheets per job and standard input capacity for up to 1,750 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Make a Large Impact<\/b>\\nThe extra large 9\u201d color touch screen is command central and can be tailored with the solution apps and shortcuts you need most.\\n\\n<b>Personalized User Settings<\/b>\\nMyMFP feature lets multiple users save and re-access their personal copy\/scan settings and address book on a simple flash drive\u2014even their own touch screen configuration.\\n\\n<b>Less Work for the Help Desk<\/b>\\nNetwork-ready and very easy to set up, plus Universal Driver support for simple multiple deployment. Also includes free MarkVision\u2122 Professional software for time-saving remote management. Ships with an 18,000*-page print cartridge and offers a 36,000*-page cartridge at replacement time. (*Average standard yield, ISO\/IEC 19752)\\n\\n<b>Get Efficient with Solution Apps<\/b>\\nOpt for one of Lexmark's leading workflow-enhancing applications to help you lower costs, analyze usage data, expand your functionality, and move information more securely. Just call a Lexmark representative to get started."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9b4ce73f-0a11-4974-84aa-c5cc7ac314be","identifier":"13872785","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X544dn"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"27.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A Workgroup Wonder<\/b>\\nNetwork-ready, with output speeds up to 25 ppm and built-in duplex printing. Value is also built in, with clever features that increase productivity and extra high yield cartridges for eco-smart savings.\\n\\n<b>Consolidate with Ease<\/b>\\nA surprisingly compact, easy-on-the-budget way to equip your office with color multifunction performance. Simple, quiet operation for effortless integration into your office space or shared network.\\n\\n<b>Great Color, No Sacrifice<\/b>\\nHigh-quality PANTONE\u00ae calibrated color adds impact to every impression you make and Lexmark High Yield Toner Cartridges keep printing costs low\u2014a smart combination for hardworking offices.\\n\\n<b>Eco-Responsible<\/b>\\nSaving resources means everyone wins\u2014your business, your budget and the environment! Eco-features include paper-saving duplex, energy-saving Eco-Mode and an instant warm-up fuser to help you print greener at every level. And toner cartridges for the Lexmark X540 Series never require shaking to deliver their full declared yield.\\n\\n<b>Lifetime Pricing Guarantee<\/b>\\nFor as long as you own your X544dn, Lexmark guarantees never to increase the U.S. toner cartridge price found on Lexmark.com.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark Rewards\u2014Save Money and the Planet<\/b>\\nSave up to 20% on supplies and go green with Lexmark Rewards. You'll earn free high-yield toner cartridges and imaging kits simply for using genuine Lexmark toner and returning your empty cartridges to Lexmark for recycling."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"28b34d5a-97f2-4310-b558-8572d7ae83c4","identifier":"1387783","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DSC-W110"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Compact, feature rich camera with aluminium case in silver finish. 7.2 megapixels and 4x optical zoom lens. 2.5-inch screen, Face Detection, Smile Shutter and HD output.\\n\\n- 7.2 effective megapixels resolution for clear enlargements up to A3 size\\n- 4x optical zoom Carl Zeiss Vario-Tessar lens\\n- Smile Shutter waits until the subject smiles before firing the shutter with adjustable smile threshold setting\\n- Enhanced Face Detection with high-speed subject tracking for clearer portraits\\n- Large 2.5-inch LCD\\n- HD Output compatible with PhotoTV HD displays for optimised still images on BRAVIA TV\\n- BIONZ processor for enhanced image quality and fast response\\n- D-Range Optimiser adjusts exposure and contrast in high contrast and backlit scenes\\n- High Sensitivity ISO 3200 for clearer handheld shooting in low light"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-02-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":4}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e6db14c4-d4d6-4334-a755-9f5d2400aec7","identifier":"1390957","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DSC-W120"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Compact, feature rich camera with aluminium case in silver finish. 7.2 megapixels and 4x optical zoom lens. 2.5-inch screen, Face Detection, Smile Shutter and Super SteadyShot image stabilisation.\\n\\n- 7.2 effective megapixels resolution for clear enlargements up to A3 size\\n- 4x optical zoom Carl Zeiss Vario-Tessar lens\\n- Smile Shutter waits until the subject smiles before firing the shutter with adjustable smile threshold setting\\n- Enhanced Face Detection with high-speed subject tracking for clearer portraits\\n- Large 2.5-inch LCD\\n- HD Output compatible with PhotoTV HD displays for optimised still images on BRAVIA TV\\n- BIONZ processor for enhanced image quality and fast response\\n- Double Anti-blur with Super SteadyShot image stabilisation and High Sensitivity ISO 3200 for clearer handheld shooting in low light\\n- D-Range Optimiser adjusts exposure and contrast in high contrast and backlit scenes."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-02-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":4}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4fd0d398-512c-4dad-871c-9abd6358d38e","identifier":"1391309","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DSC-T300"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- 10,1 Mio. Pixel (effektiv) f\u00fcr klare Vergr\u00f6\u00dferungen bis zum Format A3\\n- Carl Zeiss\u00ae Vario-Tessar\u00ae Objektiv mit optischem 5fach-Zoom\\n- Mithilfe einer anpassbaren Schwelleneinstellung l\u00f6st die Smile-Erkennung die Aufnahme erst dann aus, wenn die Person im Bild l\u00e4chelt.\\n- Optimierte Gesichtserkennung mit High-Speed-Tracking der Personen im Bild f\u00fcr klarere Aufnahmen\\n- Abh\u00e4ngig vom Thema w\u00e4hlt intelligente Motiverkennung den richtigen Aufnahmemodus\\n- Gro\u00dfes 3,5\"-Clear Photo LC-Breitbilddisplay (230.000 Bildpunkte) mit Touchscreen\\n- HD-Ausgang kompatibel mit PhotoTV HD-Anzeige f\u00fcr optimierte Standbildanzeige auf BRAVIA TV\\n- BIONZ Prozessor f\u00fcr optimierte Bildqualit\u00e4t und schnelle Reaktionszeit\\n- Doppelter Verwackelungsschutz mit Super SteadyShot Bildstabilisierung und hoher Empfindlichkeit bis zu ISO 3200 f\u00fcr klarere Aufnahmen bei Handheld-Aufnahmen und schwachem Licht\\n- D-Umfangoptimierer passt Belichtung und Kontrast an in Kulissen mit hohem Kontrast und mit Hintergrundbeleuchtung an."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"-10.1 effective megapixels resolution for clear enlargements beyond A3 size.\\n-Carl Zeiss Vario-Tessar lens with 5x optical zoom.\\n-Smile Shutter waits until the subject smiles before firing the shutter with adjustable smile threshold setting.\\n-Enhanced Face Detection with high-speed subject tracking for clearer portraits.\\n-Intelligent Scene Recognition automatically selects correct shooting mode depending on subject.\\n-Large, wide 3.5-inch (230K dot) Clear Photo LCD Plus touchscreen.\\n-HD Output compatible with PhotoTV HD displays for optimised still images on BRAVIA TV.\\n-BIONZ processor for enhanced image quality and fast response.\\n-Double Anti-blur with Super SteadyShot image stabilisation and High Sensitivity ISO 3200 for clearer handheld shooting in low light.\\n-D-Range Optimiser adjusts exposure and contrast in high contrast and backlit scenes."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- R\u00e9solution de 10,1 m\u00e9gapixels effectifs pour des agrandissements A3 et plus impeccables\\n- Objectif Carl Zeiss\u00ae Vario-Tessar\u00ae avec zoom optique 5x\\n- Avec la fonction D\u00e9tecteur automatique de sourires, l'obturateur ne se d\u00e9clenche que lorsque le sujet sourit, en fonction des param\u00e8tres d\u00e9finis\\n- Reconnaissance des visages am\u00e9lior\u00e9e avec suivi des sujets ultra-rapide pour des portraits encore plus nets\\n- La fonction de reconnaissance intelligente des sc\u00e8nes adapte automatiquement le mode de prise de vue au sujet\\n- Grand \u00e9cran tactile de 3,5\" (230 000 points) avec technologie \u00ab Clear Photo LCD Plus \u00bb\\n- Sortie HD compatible avec les \u00e9crans PhotoTV HD pour un affichage optimis\u00e9 des images fixes sur les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs BRAVIA\\n- Processeur BIONZ pour une meilleure qualit\u00e9 d'image et un temps de r\u00e9ponse plus rapide\\n- Double solution anti-flou avec stabilisateur Super SteadyShot et haute sensibilit\u00e9 ISO 3200 pour de meilleures photos avec l'appareil en main en faibles conditions de luminosit\u00e9\\n- L'optimisateur de plage dynamique ajuste l'exposition et le contraste pour les sc\u00e8nes \u00e0 fort contraste ou r\u00e9tro-\u00e9clairage puissant."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-02-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"092d8d0b-26b4-4853-9d05-aeb672ea7579","identifier":"139523","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["kyocera","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kyocera FS1920N Network Laser Printer"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The speedy network printer for small teams \\n  \\n   28 ppm with 1,200 dpi quality \\n   600 sheet capacity as standard, upgradeable to 2,100 sheets \\n   High-speed duplex (optional) \\n   High-speed parallel and USB interface \\n   Lowest cpp in its class"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"65f7a24b-72e7-4059-a17a-2397c5f53fe3","identifier":"1405232","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X560n"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Designed especially for medium-sized workgroups that want quality color and increased productivity, Lexmark\u2019s network-ready X560n MFP delivers high-performance printing, copying, scanning and faxing. This is the perfect solution for your everyday color needs! Options include duplex printing and additional input capacity. \\n\\n- Color laser multifunction device.\\n- Print up to 31 ppm black, 20 ppm color.\\n- Newly enhanced toner.\\n- Easy to share; easy to use.\\n\\n<b>Great value for your everyday color needs<\/b>\\nPrinting should be as attractive on your budget as it is on your documents. Built for demanding medium-sized workgroups, the Lexmark X560n MFP brings you a world of cost-saving benefits. By merging print, copy, fax and scan into one high-performance network device, you save considerably on office space, hardware costs, consumables, service contracts and energy. But why stop there? Opt for the high-yield cartridges to drive down your cost per page. Add the optional duplex unit to save paper, money and the environment \u2013 all at the same time!\\n\\n<b>Elevate office productivity! <\/b>\\nThe Lexmark X560n is robust, reliable and ready to go to work with PostScript 3 and PCL 6 compatibility. It is perfect for integration into any IT environment. Need to copy a large presentation before lunch? No problem. Just load the 50-page Automatic Document Feeder and zip through your document. More than just fast, the X560n gives you a range of efficiency-boosting features too, like a multipurpose feeder, fax speed dials and intuitive workflow software to digitize, manage, search and edit documents with ease.\\n\\n<b>An effortless way of working <\/b>\\nA plug-and-print solution, everything about the Lexmark X560n is straightforward and simple. The consumables are 100% front-loading, so they take just seconds to replace. The operator panel offers a variety of intuitive features to simplify everyday workflow tasks. For instance, it includes a handy job-cancel button to put the brakes on print runs quickly, so you don\u2019t waste paper. The 4-line graphical display guides you through printing and maintenance tasks with ease. You get the tools you need to help maximize uptime and boost productivity!\\n\\n<b>Color you can be proud of <\/b>\\nStudies show that color can increase brand recognition and reader retention by up to 80%, and that more than 60% of buying decisions are based on color! * Even a little bit of color can make a big difference in your business. So when you can acquire color that\u2019s fast and affordable as well as eye-catching, why settle for anything less? Combining newly enhanced toner, Pantone calibration and crisp 2400 Image Quality, the Lexmark X560n is perfect for all your important document needs \u2013 from presentations and office memos to spreadsheets and newsletters. \\n\\n<b>Lexmark\u2019s guarantee to you <\/b>\\nAt Lexmark, we\u2019re always working hard to ensure you achieve maximum productivity and minimum downtime. Our X560n MFP includes our solid service warranty of One-year Onsite Repair, with a response time of next business day *. For an even greater level of peace of mind, you can opt for one of our extended-warranty service offerings. For more information on any of these offerings, contact your local dealer or visit us today at www.lexmark.com.\\n\\n<b>Duplex print unit <\/b>\\nWhat better way to reduce costs while promoting earth-friendly practices in your business? With two-sided printing, everyone wins. Save paper, money and the environment!\\n\\n<b>Extra drawer with floor stand <\/b>\\nTo load a second paper type or increase your input capacity, add the extra 550-sheet drawer. It comes with a flexible floor stand that gives you extra storage space."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-02-03T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c142dbea-a3e8-401b-b735-e2a8ace014e2","identifier":"14060315","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 26LS359S LED TV"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>LED<\/b>\\nMit der Steuerung der Hintergrundbeleuchtung l\u00e4sst sich die\\nHelligkeit des Displays regeln, mit \u201eScreen off\u201c l\u00e4sst sich das\\nDisplay ganz abschalten, wenn Sie zum Beispiel nur Musik h\u00f6ren\\nund nicht fernsehen wollen. Der Stand-by Mode \u201e0\u201c schaltet den\\nFernseher in den Power Safe Mode, der gar keinen Strom mehr\\nverbraucht.\\n\\n<b>HDMI<\/b>\\nDer digitale Nachfolger des Scart-Anschlusses. Bild und Ton werden \u00fcber ihn gleichzeitig in einem einzigen Kabel \u00fcbertragen. Die Qualit\u00e4t zeigt Vorteile gegen\u00fcber dem DVI-Anschluss (Bild), jedoch keine gegen\u00fcber herk\u00f6mmlichen digitalen Ton\u00fcbertragungssystemen. HDMI ist abw\u00e4rtskompatibel mit DVI.\\n\\n<b>Triple Tuner (DVB-T\/-C\/-S)<\/b>\\nMit dem Triple Tuner steht Ihnen h\u00f6chste Anschlusskompatibilit\u00e4t zur Verf\u00fcgung. Mit dem digitalen Empfangsteil empfangen Sie DVB-T, -C, -S und \u2013S2 inklusive CI+ Slot.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Sensor<\/b>\\nDie mit dieser Funktion ausgestatteten TVs passen ihre Helligkeit, Kontrast, Sch\u00e4rfe und Displayhelligkeit automatisch den Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen im Raum an. Damit ist jederzeit eine optimale Bildqualit\u00e4t ohne l\u00e4stiges Nachregeln garantiert."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"LG 26LS359S. HD type: HD-Ready, Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S, DVB-T. HDMI version: 1.4, Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Video formats supported: DIVX, Audio formats supported: MP3, Image formats supported: JPG, MPO. Smart modes: Game, Movie, Sports, Standard"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-22T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"aa5ca3d0-5616-4ecf-9914-40287a83c91b","identifier":"14060320","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 42LS560S LED TV"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":42,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Stilvoll und elegant \u2013 der 42LS560S von LG sorgt f\u00fcr \u00c4sthetik und maximales Fernsehvergn\u00fcgen in Ihrem Wohnzimmer. Mit seinen gestochen scharfen Bildern dank der Kombination von Full HD und 100 Hz MCI kommen Sie in den Genuss von actionreichen und emotionsgeladenen Bildern in bester Qualit\u00e4t. Das TV-Ger\u00e4t ist au\u00dferdem mit einem integrierten Triple Tuner f\u00fcr besten TV-Empfang ausgestattet, und der Intelligent Sensor sorgt daf\u00fcr, dass die Bildhelligkeit an die Lichtverh\u00e4ltnisse im Raum angepasst wird. Die Sensor-Funktion spart zusammen mit Smart Energy Saving Plus jede Menge Energie und beschert dem 42LS560S von LG Klasse A im Bereich Energieeffizienz. Den LS560S von LG gibt es auch noch in folgenden Gr\u00f6\u00dfen: 81 cm (32 Zoll), 94 cm (37 Zoll) und 119 cm (47 Zoll) Bildschirmdiagonale.\\n\\n- Scart (vollbelegt) per Adapter (liegt bei)\\n- Komponent in (Y,Pb, Pr) + Audio per Adapter (liegt bei)"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"LG 42LS560S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: Infinite Surround. Video formats supported: DIVX, MKV, Audio formats supported: MP3, Image formats supported: JPG. Smart modes: Energy saving"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-22T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b3f85f1b-b9fa-46c8-a9be-47783ef78eb5","identifier":"14067910","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["dell","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"DELL V725w"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Erzielen Sie professionelle Ergebnisse beim Drucken, Scannen, Kopieren und Faxen. Mit dem funktionsreichen V725w All-in-One-Wireless-Tintenstrahldrucker bleiben Sie stets produktiv und effizient.\\n\\n- 4-in-1-Vielseitigkeit: Drucken, scannen, kopieren und faxen Sie mit einem einzigen platzsparenden Ger\u00e4t. Mit dem 2,4-Zoll-LCD-Farbdisplay k\u00f6nnen Sie ganz einfach durch die Druckermen\u00fcs navigieren.\\n- Programmierbare Tastenkombinationen: Mithilfe von Tastenkombinationen k\u00f6nnen Sie per einfachem Tastendruck Aufgaben optimieren. So k\u00f6nnen Sie zum Beispiel eine Tastenkombination f\u00fcr \"Weiterleiten der Scanergebnisse an eine E-Mail\" erstellen, um gescannte Inhalte direkt an ein E-Mail-Konto zu senden.\\n- Zeit- und Energieersparnis: Sorgen Sie f\u00fcr effizientes Arbeiten durch hohe Druckgeschwindigkeiten, automatische Dokumentzuf\u00fchrung f\u00fcr 50 Blatt und die Funktion f\u00fcr beidseitiges Drucken. Mit der Eco-Mode-Taste versetzen Sie Ihren PC in den Stromsparmodus und sparen somit aktiv Energie.\\n- Vielf\u00e4ltige Konnektivit\u00e4tsoptionen: Greifen Sie auf Ihren V725w \u00fcber die integrierte Ethernet-Verbindung und die integrierte Wireless 802.11b\/g\/n Funktion1 zu.\\n- Direkt von mobilen Ger\u00e4ten drucken2: Drucken Sie mit Dell Mobile Print direkt von Ihrem mobilen AndroidTM Ger\u00e4t oder mit AirPrintTM 2 von Ihrem iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae und iPod touch\\n\\nDrucken, scannen, kopieren und faxen Sie schnell und problemlos mit dem DellTM V725w All-in-One-Wireless-Tintenstrahldrucker.\\nEffizienz und Konnektivit\u00e4t: Sparen Sie Platz, indem Sie ein Ger\u00e4t nutzen, das s\u00e4mtliche Druck-, Scan-, Kopier- und Faxanforderungen erf\u00fcllt. Dank der Ethernet- und Wireless-1Konnektivit\u00e4t k\u00f6nnen mehrere Benutzer von \u00fcberall aus im Haus oder in Ihrem kleinen B\u00fcro drucken. Nun k\u00f6nnen Sie auch direkt von mobilen Android Ger\u00e4ten \u00fcber Dell Mobile Print oder von mobilen iOS Ger\u00e4ten \u00fcber via AirPrintTM 3 drucken.\\n\\nEinfacheres Arbeiten dank Tastenkombinationen: Nutzen Sie individuell anpassbare Tastenkombinationen, um die zur Ausf\u00fchrung h\u00e4ufiger Aufgaben notwendigen Schritte zu optimieren. So k\u00f6nnen Sie zum Beispiel eine Tastenkombination f\u00fcr \"Weiterleiten der Scanergebnisse an eine E-Mail\" erstellen, um gescannte Inhalte direkt an ein E-Mail-Konto zu senden. F\u00fcr \"Scannen an Netzwerk\" und \"ID-Karten-Kopierfunktion\" sind ebenfalls Tastenkombinationen verf\u00fcgbar.\\n\\nKomfort der Extraklasse: Mithilfe des 2,4-Zoll-LCD-Farbdisplays k\u00f6nnen Sie durch die Men\u00fcs navigieren, ohne dazu Ihren PC einschalten zu m\u00fcssen. Vereinfachen Sie Aufgaben mit der automatischen Dokumentzuf\u00fchrung f\u00fcr das Kopieren, Scannen oder Faxen von bis zu 50 Seiten auf einmal. Dar\u00fcber hinaus k\u00f6nnen Sie mit der Funktion f\u00fcr den automatischen beidseitigen Druck Zeit und Papier einsparen.\\n\\nErzielen Sie professionelle Qualit\u00e4t kombiniert mit einem hervorragenden Preis-Leistungs-Verh\u00e4ltnis.\\n\\nProfitieren Sie von einer bemerkenswerten Bildqualit\u00e4t und beachtlichen Druckgeschwindigkeiten und erledigen Sie allt\u00e4gliche Aufgaben so problemlos wie nie zuvor.\\n- Gro\u00dfe Zeitersparnis: Nutzen Sie f\u00fcr Druckaufgaben zu Hause oder in Ihrem kleinen B\u00fcro ein Ger\u00e4t mit herausragenden Druckgeschwindigkeiten. Drucken Sie mit Geschwindigkeiten von bis zu 35 Seiten pro Minute in Schwarz-Wei\u00df und 30 Seiten pro Minute in Farbe (im Draft-Modus) bzw. bis zu 10 Seiten pro Minute in Schwarz-Wei\u00df und 6 Seiten pro Minute in Farbe (ISO-Geschwindigkeit).4\\n- Brillante Fotos und gestochen scharfe Dokumente: Genie\u00dfen Sie mit einer Aufl\u00f6sung von 4.800 \u00d7 1.200 dpi eine klare Bildqualit\u00e4t, bei pers\u00f6nlichen Fotos genau wie bei farblichen Diagrammen f\u00fcr Ihre Pr\u00e4sentationen im B\u00fcro. Ganz gleich, ob Sie die Druck-, Kopier-, Scan- oder Faxfunktion nutzen, Sie erhalten immer gestochen scharfe Dokumente in professioneller Qualit\u00e4t.\\n- Zus\u00e4tzliches Einsparpotenzial: Durch die Nutzung von Dell Einzelpatronen m\u00fcssen Sie nur die leeren Tintenpatronen ersetzen.5 Wenn Sie h\u00e4ufig drucken, entscheiden Sie sich f\u00fcr die Ersatzpatronen mit hoher oder extra hoher Kapazit\u00e4t und sparen Sie zus\u00e4tzlich.\\n\\nDer V725w All-in-One-Wireless-Tintenstrahldrucker bietet dank energieeffizientem Design und energiesparenden Funktionen vielf\u00e4ltige Einsparm\u00f6glichkeiten.\\n- Stromsparmodus: Bei aktiviertem Stromsparmodus werden automatisch beidseitige Ausdrucke erstellt und das LCD-Display wird bei Nichtverwendung gedimmt. \u00dcber die Eco-Mode-Taste wird der V725w Drucker nach zehnmin\u00fctiger Inaktivit\u00e4t au\u00dferdem in den Energiesparmodus versetzt, um zus\u00e4tzliche Kosten- und Energieeinsparungen zu erzielen.\\n- Verantwortungsbewusstes Recycling: Schicken Sie Ihre leeren Tintenpatronen an Dell zur\u00fcck und nutzen Sie unsere kostenlosen Recyclingoptionen. Weitere Informationen finden Sie unter www.dell.com\/recycle.\\n- Energieeffizientes Design: Seien Sie unbesorgt \u2013 Ihr V725w All-in-One-Wireless-Tintenstrahldrucker entspricht den neuesten Umweltstandards, einschlie\u00dflich WEEE, RoHS und Energy Star"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Print, scan, copy and fax, and get professional results. The full-featured V725w All-in-One Wireless Inkjet Printer can keep you productive and efficient.\\n\\n- Enjoy 4-in-one convenience: Use one space-saving device to print, scan, copy and fax. Easily navigate printer menus with a 2.4\" colour LCD display.\\n- Use customizable shortcuts: One-touch shortcuts streamline tasks. For example, create a \"scan to email\" shortcut to send scans directly to an email account.\\n- Save time and energy: Gain efficiency with fast speeds, hands free 50-page ADF and two-sided printing. The Eco-Mode button helps save energy.\\n- Get connected: Access your V725w through its built-in Ethernet and embedded wireless 802.11b\/g\/n1.\\nPrint directly from mobile devices: Print directly from your AndroidTM mobile device with Dell Mobile Print or from your iPad\u00ae , iPhone\u00ae and iPod touch\u00ae with AirPrintTM\\n\\nPrint, scan, copy and fax quickly and easily with the DellTM V725w All-in-One Wireless Inkjet Printer.\\nBe efficient and well connected: Save space with one device to handle all your printing, scanning, copying and faxing needs. With Ethernet and wireless1 connectivity, multiple users can print from anywhere within your home or small office. Plus, now you can print directly from Android mobile devices via Dell Mobile Print or from iOS mobile devices via AirPrint3.\\n\\nSimplify with shortcuts: Create customizable shortcuts and streamline the steps needed to tackle frequent tasks. You can create a \"Scan to Email\" shortcut, then send the scan directly to an email account. \"Scan to Network\" and \"ID Card Copy\" shortcuts are also available.\\n\\nGet maximum convenience: Navigate menus without turning on your PC with the 2.4\" colour LCD display. Simplify tasks with handsfree copying, scanning or faxing of up to 50-pages at a time. Plus, save time and paper with automatic two-sided printing.\\n\\nStep up to professional quality at an outstanding value.\\n\\nRemarkable image quality and impressive print speeds make everyday jobs easier than ever.\\n- Save valuable time: Count on outstanding print speeds for your home and small office tasks. Print up to 35 ppm in black and up to 30 ppm in colour (draft speed) as well as up to 10 ppm in black and 6 ppm in colour (ISO speed).4\\n- Get brilliant photos and sharp documents: From personal photos to colourful office charts, experience vivid imagery with up to 4800x1200 dpi resolution. Enjoy crisp, professional-looking documents whether you\u2019re printing, copying, scanning and faxing.\\n- Find more ways to save: With Dell individual inks, you\u2019ll only need to replace the cartridge that runs out of ink.5 For frequent printing, opt for high and extra high capacity replacement cartridges offering additional savings.\\n\\nConserve where you can with the energy-conscious design and features of the V725w All-in-One Wireless Inkjet Printer.\\n- Eco-Mode: When engaged, the Eco-Mode enables two-sided printing and dimming of the LCD display when it\u2019s not in use. The Eco-Mode button also switches your V725w into power saver mode after 10 minutes of nonuse for additional cost and energy savings.\\n- Responsible recycling: Return your empty ink cartridges to Dell and take advantage of free recycling. Visit www.dell.com\/recycle for details.\\n- Choose an environmentally-conscious design: Rest assured your V725w All-in-One Wireless Inkjet Printer is designed and built in compliance with the latest environmental standards, including WEEE, RoHS and Energy Star\u00ae ."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fcdf17c2-f9d5-48de-882b-9f1021273bbd","identifier":"14074398","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","oki","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"OKI C301DN"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Affordable A4 colour printing with media flexibility and reliability built in<\/b>\\n\\n-A4 colour printer, 1-5 users\\n-22ppm mono and 20ppm colour\\n-350 sheet standard paper capacity\\n-Host-based (GDI) printer language emulation\\n-Auto duplex and networked as standard\\n\\nThe C301dn A4 colour desktop printer is perfect for micro and small businesses that require colour and mono printing of day-to-day business documents for their workgroups. Offering outstanding High Definition colour quality and duplex printing with fast, reliable performance, all in a low cost, compact and highly competitively priced device.\\n\\n<b>In-house printing that saves time and money<\/b>\\nThe use of High Definition digital LED technology achieves a superior level of print quality. This, combined with flexible media handling of up to 220gsm and OKI\u2019s unique Template Manager, means that micro and small businesses can now create and print a wide variety of documents and marketing materials in-house, including business cards, CD\/DVD labels, leaflets, presentations and banners up to 1320mm.\\n\\n<b>Energy saving features that reduces your impact upon the environment<\/b>\\nThese outstanding devices have many features that reduce your impact upon the environment, whilst also reducing your on-going costs. A pre-set option automatically powers off devices when not in use. This is in addition to our Deep Sleep mode that places the printers to sleep when not in use and powers up as you request to print a job.\\n\\n<b>Reliability you can depend upon<\/b>\\nOKI printers are inherently more reliable due to LED technology requiring fewer moving parts. This means that we can offer a 3-year warranty, giving you complete peace of mind."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-25T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9db64b4a-766f-4150-bcea-85fe324d8ced","identifier":"14075566","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Officejet 6600 e-AiO"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Produce professional-quality colour for a low cost per page with this efficient e-all-in-one. Use the touchscreen to access apps and scan, copy and fax tools. Print on the go using HP ePrint and share across your wireless network.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Print professional colour documents for a low cost per page.<\/b>\\n- Print attention-grabbing, professional-quality colour documents for a low cost per page.\\n- Print affordably with four individual inks \u2013 high capacity XL ink cartridges available for frequent printing.\\n- Create vivid, high impact materials that resist water, fading and highlighter-pen smearing with HP Officejet inks.\\n- Enjoy reliable performance from a printer with a 12,000-page monthly duty cycle \u2013 ideal for business colour printing.\\n\\n<b>Stay productive with wireless networking and mobile printing.<\/b>\\n- Print direct from your mobile device with HP ePrint \u2013 now you can print from virtually anywhere.\\n- Share high productivity features between multiple users on your wireless network.\\n- Print e-mails, documents, web pages and more direct from your iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae or iPod touch\u00ae with AirPrint\u2122.\\n- Manage tasks and access business apps directly on your e-all-in-one via the intuitive touchscreen.\\n\\n<b>Get more done every day with this versatile e-all-in-one.<\/b>\\n- Print at ISO (laser comparable) speeds of up to 14 ppm black, 8 ppm colour.\\n- Improve your business workflow - send quick faxes and scan documents directly to a PC.\\n- Do more with your time \u2013 scan, copy or fax multipage documents using the convenient 35-page automatic document feeder.\\n- Capture ID card details quickly and easily \u2013 copy two-sided ID cards onto one side of paper."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Obtenez des impressions couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle \u00e0 un faible co\u00fbt par page avec cette e-tout-en-un performante. Utilisez l'\u00e9cran tactile pour acc\u00e9der aux applications ainsi qu'aux outils de num\u00e9risation, de copie et de t\u00e9l\u00e9copie. Imprimez pendant vos d\u00e9placements avec l'ePrint de HP que vous pouvez partager sur votre r\u00e9seau sans fil.\\n\\n<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Imprimez des documents couleur professionnels \u00e0 un faible co\u00fbt par page.<\/b>\\n- Appuyez-vous sur HP pour obtenir des couleurs de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle \u00e0 faible co\u00fbt.\\n- Faites des \u00e9conomies gr\u00e2ce aux encres individuelles - cartouches d'encre XL grande capacit\u00e9 disponibles pour les impressions fr\u00e9quentes.\\n- Produisez des couleurs intenses et des mat\u00e9riaux d'excellente qualit\u00e9 r\u00e9sistant \u00e0 l'eau, la d\u00e9coloration et aux marques de surligneur avec les encres HP Officejet.\\n- Profitez des performances fiables avec une imprimante affichant un cycle de rendement mensuel de 12 000 pages - id\u00e9al pour les impressions couleur professionnelles.\\n\\n<b>Rester productifs gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la mise en r\u00e9seau sans fil et l'impression mobile.<\/b>\\n- D\u00e9couvrez la libert\u00e9 de l'impression mobile HP ePrint directement depuis votre p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique mobile - vous pouvez imprimer depuis presque partout.\\n- Partagez les fonctionnalit\u00e9s de productivit\u00e9 \u00e9lev\u00e9e entre plusieurs ordinateurs sur votre r\u00e9seau sans fil.\\n- Avec AirPrint\u2122, imprimez des courriers \u00e9lectroniques, documents, pages Web, etc., directement \u00e0 partir de votre iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae ou iPod touch\u00ae.\\n- G\u00e9rez des t\u00e2ches et acc\u00e9dez directement \u00e0 vos applications professionnelles par l'\u00e9cran tactile de votre imprimante e-tout-en-un.\\n\\n<b>Renforcez votre productivit\u00e9 avec cette imprimante e-All-in-One polyvalente.<\/b>\\n- Vitesses d'impression ISO (comparable au laser), jusqu'\u00e0 14 ppm en noir, 8 ppm en couleur.\\n- Am\u00e9liorez votre flux de travail - envoi rapide de t\u00e9l\u00e9copies et num\u00e9risation de documents directement vers un ordinateur.\\n- Exploitez davantage votre temps - scannez, copiez ou faxez plusieurs documents \u00e0 la fois \u00e0 l'aide du chargeur automatique de documents de 35 pages.\\n- Capturez les d\u00e9tails de cartes d'identit\u00e9 rapidement et ais\u00e9ment : copiez les cartes d'identit\u00e9 recto verso sur une face de papier."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"648d9a9f-741d-4c35-8f0a-e75d6a4bc646","identifier":"14077419","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","oki","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"OKI C841dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Compact, productive A3 and A4 colour printer for design and creative professionals<\/b>\\nShowcase all your creative ideas with superb quality high definition colour output you can rely on. With 1200 x 1200dpi print resolution the C841 enables you to print rich vibrant colours with greater sharpness of detail, so you get crisp clear text, finer lines and smooth gradations. You also get fast print speeds, flexible paper capacity, high capacity toners and low running cost.\\n\\n<b>Fast, robust and superb colour print quality<\/b>\\nThe C841 is built on tried and tested LED technology that your business can rely on to deliver over and over again, supported by a 3 year warranty.\\n- Outstanding A4 print speeds of up to 35ppm in high definition colour\\n- A range of energy and cost saving functions to reduce your total cost of ownership, improving efficiency and productivity.\\n- 1200 x 1200dpi print resolution and Photo Enhance setting guarantee sharp, clear and vibrant photo-like pictures.\\n\\n<b>Excellent media flexibility to support your business<\/b>\\nThe C841 provides complete flexibility, enabling users to print on a wide range of media sizes, formats and paper weights:\\n- Print on paper sizes from A6 to A3\\n- Produce banners of up to 1321mm in length\\n- Standard 400 sheet paper capacity expands to 1,990 sheets\\n- Print on paper weights of up to 256gsm."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-25T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"aaf2697b-7112-403d-a9ec-a3d12810d11b","identifier":"14088464","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark OfficeEdge Pro5500"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Schaffen Sie mehr mit Duplex-Scan und zeitsparenden Anwendungen<\/b>\\nDer Lexmark OfficeEdge Pro5500 Farbdruck-Multifunktionsdrucker bietet Business-Class-Funktionen wie professionelle Druckqualit\u00e4t, Duplex-Scannen und einen Touch-Screen, der Lexmark SmartSolutions unterst\u00fctzt.\\n\\n<b>Laserdruckqualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nDer Pro5500 verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber alle erforderlichen Funktionen und erm\u00f6glicht beim Dokumentendruck in Laserqualit\u00e4t Kosteneinsparungen von 50 %.\\n\\n<b>Bedienerfreundlicher Touchscreen<\/b>\\nDer intuitive 4,3 Zoll gro\u00dfe Farb-Touchscreen bietet ein einfach zu bedienendes Men\u00fcsystem, das immer nur das anzeigt, was Sie brauchen.\\n\\n<b>Flexibler Netzwerkdruck<\/b>\\nIdeal f\u00fcr Arbeitsgruppen mit mehreren Benutzern. Bietet die Flexibilit\u00e4t von Netzwerkdruck \u00fcber Ethernet oder WLAN-N.\\n\\n<b>Duplex-Scannen und hohe Druckgeschwindigkeiten<\/b>\\nScannen Sie beide Seiten eines Dokuments in weniger als 5 Sekunden pro Seite und drucken Sie Dokumente in Laserqualit\u00e4t mit bis zu 21 Seiten\/Minute in Schwarz-Wei\u00df und 14 Seiten\/Minute in Farbe auf einer Vielzahl von speziellen Papiertypen, einschlie\u00dflich Karton, und Papierformate bis zu 21,5 x 35,5 cm.\\n\\n<b>Zeitsparende Anwendungen<\/b>\\nVerbessern Sie die Effizienz und Produktivit\u00e4t mit einfach herunterzuladenden Shortcuts, einschlie\u00dflich Scannen an Netzwerk, Scannen an E-Mail und Scannen an PDF."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Do More with Duplex Scan and Time-Saving Apps<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark OfficeEdge Pro5500 Colour MFP offers business-class features such as professional print quality, duplex scanning and a touch screen that supports Lexmark SmartSolutions.\\n\\n<b>Laser-quality printing<\/b>\\nThe Pro5500 includes the features you need and a 50% lower printing cost on laser-quality documents.\\n\\n<b>Easy-to-navigate touch screen<\/b>\\nThe intuitive 4.3 inch\/11 cm colour touch screen provides an easy-to-navigate menu system that shows you what you need only when you need it.\\n\\n<b>Flexible networking<\/b>\\nIdeal for multi-user workgroups; provides the flexibility of networking via Ethernet or wireless-N.\\n\\n<b>Duplex scan and fast print speeds<\/b>\\nQuickly scan both sides of a page in less than 5 seconds and print laser-quality jobs at speeds up to 21 ppm black and 14 ppm colour on a variety of specialty paper types, including card stock and paper sizes up to 8.5 x 14 inches (21.5 x 35.5 cm).\\n\\n<b>Time-saving apps<\/b>\\nEnhance efficiency and productivity with easy-to-download applications, including Scan to Network, Scan to Email and Scan to PDF."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b555c515-da84-4613-8333-e4b5490ee522","identifier":"14089240","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X746DE"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Lexmark X746DE. Print technology: Laser, Printing: Colour, Copying: Colour. Print resolution (colour, normal quality): 2400 x 600, Print resolution (black, normal quality): 1200 x 1200. Copier resize: 25 - 400, Time to first copy (colour, normal): 13.5. Optical scanning resolution: 600 x 600, Maximum scan area: 216 x 355, Scan type: ADF. ISO A-series sizes (A0...A9): A4, A5, A6, Maximum print size: Legal (216 x 356 mm), Standard tray media types: Card stock, Envelopes, Labels, Plain paper, Transparencies"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Ecran tactile couleur intuitif<\/b>\\nL'\u00e9cran tactile couleur convivial de 17,8 cm r\u00e9agit de mani\u00e8re sonore et offre un mode de navigation similaire \u00e0 celui d'une tablette pour une utilisation simple et intuitive de l'\u00e9quipement.\\n\\n<b>Respect des couleurs de l'entreprise<\/b>\\nRestez fid\u00e8le aux couleurs de votre entreprise sur tous vos supports marketing, ainsi que dans les textes et graphiques porteurs de votre marque, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Lexmark de remplacement d'une couleur d\u00e9sign\u00e9e et au calibrage PANTONE.\\n\\n<b>Mise \u00e0 jour des param\u00e8tres<\/b>\\nVous pouvez pr\u00e9visualiser vos documents et modifier les param\u00e8tres d'impression (tels que le recto verso) directement sur l'\u00e9quipement.\\n\\n<b>Gestion papier polyvalente<\/b>\\nAugmentez la capacit\u00e9 d'alimentation gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des bacs suppl\u00e9mentaires en option. Vous pouvez ainsi charger diff\u00e9rents types de papier et faire passer la capacit\u00e9 d\u2019alimentation totale \u00e0 4 300 feuilles.\\n\\n<b>Fonctions de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 avanc\u00e9es<\/b>\\nProt\u00e9gez votre multifonction, vos donn\u00e9es et votre r\u00e9seau avec des contr\u00f4les de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 innovants, comme l'authentification et l'autorisation ou le cryptage et le nettoyage de disque.\\n\\n<b>Eco-responsabilit\u00e9<\/b>\\nImprimez de fa\u00e7on responsable. Les param\u00e8tres Eco vous permettent de personnaliser les param\u00e8tres d'impression et le mode Hibernation fait tomber la consommation d'\u00e9nergie au-dessous d'un watt."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"55aac2bb-ff78-44c0-b850-defd2ba105d1","identifier":"14089241","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_letter_216_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X748de"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Robust color MFPs for productive workgroups<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark X748de MFP delivers high-quality color printing and reliable performance. Security controls and workflow-enhancing solutions make high-volume printing easy and secure.\\n\\n<b>Intuitive color touch screen<\/b>\\nThe easy-to-use 7-inch color touch screen provides audible feedback and tablet-like navigation to make device operation intuitive and simple.\\n\\n<b>Corporate color matching<\/b>\\nMatch corporate colors on marketing collateral and brand-sensitive text and graphics with Lexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE\u00ae calibration.\\n\\n<b>Convenient updates<\/b>\\nPreview documents and change output settings such as two-sided printing directly at the device.\\n\\n<b>Multiple media support<\/b>\\nExpand input capacity with optional drawers that let you load multiple types and boost total input capacity up to 4,300 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Advanced security<\/b>\\nProtect your device, data and network with innovative security controls like authentication and authorization and disk wiping and encryption.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly printing<\/b>\\nPrint responsibly with Eco-Settings that let you customize print settings and Hibernate Mode which reduces energy consumption to less than one watt."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Des multifonctions couleur endurants pour les groupes de travail productifs<\/b>\\nLe multifonction Lexmark X748de offre une haute qualit\u00e9 couleur et une grande fiabilit\u00e9. Des contr\u00f4les de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 et des solutions d'optimisation des flux documentaires permettent de prendre facilement en charge de gros volumes d'impression en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Ecran tactile couleur intuitif<\/b>\\nL'\u00e9cran tactile couleur convivial de 17,8 cm r\u00e9agit de mani\u00e8re sonore et offre un mode de navigation similaire \u00e0 celui d'une tablette pour une utilisation simple et intuitive de l'appareil.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark X748de Harmonisation avec les couleurs de l'entreprise<\/b>\\nRestez fid\u00e8le aux couleurs de votre entreprise sur tous vos supports marketing, ainsi que dans les textes et graphiques porteurs de votre marque, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Lexmark de remplacement d'une couleur d\u00e9sign\u00e9e et au calibrage PANTONE\u00ae.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark X748de Mises \u00e0 jour pratiques<\/b>\\nVous pouvez pr\u00e9visualiser vos documents et modifier les param\u00e8tres d'impression (tels que le recto verso) directement sur l'appareil.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark X748de Prise en charge de supports multiples<\/b>\\nAugmentez la capacit\u00e9 d'alimentation gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des bacs suppl\u00e9mentaires en option. Vous pouvez ainsi charger diff\u00e9rents types de papier et faire passer la capacit\u00e9 d\u2019alimentation totale \u00e0 4 300 feuilles.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark X748de Fonctions de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 avanc\u00e9es<\/b>\\nProt\u00e9gez votre multifonction, vos donn\u00e9es et votre r\u00e9seau avec des contr\u00f4les de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 innovants, comme l'authentification et l'autorisation ou le cryptage et le nettoyage de disque.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark X748de Impression \u00e9cologique<\/b>\\nImprimez de fa\u00e7on responsable. Les param\u00e8tres Eco vous permettent de personnaliser les param\u00e8tres d'impression et le mode Sommeil fait tomber la consommation d'\u00e9nergie au-dessous d'un watt."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"01905137-13ca-4a6e-ab05-0a054d0a7184","identifier":"14089255","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C748dte"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Intuitiver Farb-Touchscreen<\/b>\\nDer 10,9 cm gro\u00dfe Farb-Touchscreen bietet eine akustische R\u00fcckmeldung und Tablet-\u00e4hnliche Navigation f\u00fcr eine intuitive und einfache Bedienung des Ger\u00e4ts.\\n\\n<b>Anpassung an Corporate-Farben<\/b>\\nPassen Sie Ihr Marketingmaterial und ihre markensensiblen Texte und Grafiken mithilfe von Lexmark Named Color Replacement und PANTONE\u00ae-Kalibrierung an Ihre Corporate-Farben an.\\n\\n<b>Verbrauchen Sie weniger Energie<\/b>\\nDie Instant Warm-up-Fixiereinheit reduziert den Stromverbrauch und bietet eine Ausgabe der ersten Seite in nur 9 Sekunden sowohl in Schwarz als auch in Farbe.\\n\\n<b>Unterst\u00fctzung zahlreicher Medien<\/b>\\nErweitern Sie Ihre Zuf\u00fchrungskapazit\u00e4t mit optionalen Papierkassetten, die es Ihnen erm\u00f6glichen, verschiedene Papiertypen einzulegen und Ihre gesamte Zuf\u00fchrungskapazit\u00e4t auf bis zu 4.300 Blatt zu steigern.\\n\\n<b>Umweltfreundliches Drucken<\/b>\\nDrucken Sie umweltfreundlich mit Eco-Einstellungen, die es Ihnen erm\u00f6glichen, die Druckeinstellungen anzupassen und einen Hibernate-Modus festzulegen, der den Stromverbrauch auf weniger als ein Watt verringert.\\n\\n<b>High-Speed-Verarbeitung<\/b>\\nDer High-Speed-Prozessor und Gigabit Ethernet-Netzwerkunterst\u00fctzung gew\u00e4hrleisten eine schnelle Daten\u00fcbertragung und eine schnelle Verarbeitung auch bei komplexen Farbdokumenten."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Intuitive color touch screen<\/b>\\nThe easy-to-use 4.3-inch color touch screen provides audible feedback and tablet-like navigation to make device operation intuitive and simple.\\n\\n<b>Corporate color matching<\/b>\\nMatch corporate colors on marketing collateral and brand-sensitive text and graphics with Lexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE\u00ae calibration.\\n\\n<b>Use less energy<\/b>\\nThe instant warm-up fuser reduces energy consumption and delivers a time to first page as fast as 9 seconds in both black and color.\\n\\n<b>Multiple media support<\/b>\\nExpand input capacity with optional paper drawers that let you load multiple paper types and boost total input capacity up to 4,300 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly printing<\/b>\\nPrint responsibly with Eco-Settings that let you customize print settings and Hibernate Mode which reduces energy consumption to less than one watt.\\n\\n<b>High-speed processing<\/b>\\nThe high-speed processor and Gigabit Ethernet networking mean fast data transfer and fast processing even on complex color documents."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Ecran tactile couleur intuitif<\/b>\\nL'\u00e9cran tactile couleur convivial de 10,9 cm r\u00e9agit de mani\u00e8re sonore et offre un mode de navigation similaire \u00e0 celui d'une tablette pour une utilisation simple et intuitive de l'appareil.\\n\\n<b>Respect des couleurs de votre Entreprise<\/b>\\nRestituez fid\u00e8lement les couleurs de votre entreprise sur tous vos supports marketing, ainsi que dans les textes et graphiques porteurs de votre marque, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Lexmark de remplacement d'une couleur d\u00e9sign\u00e9e et au calibrage PANTONE\u00ae.\\n\\n<b>Consommation d'\u00e9nergie r\u00e9duite<\/b>\\nLe pr\u00e9chauffage instantan\u00e9 r\u00e9duit la consommation d'\u00e9nergie et offre un temps de sortie de la premi\u00e8re page de 9 secondes seulement en noir comme en couleur.\\n\\n<b>Gestion papier polyvalente<\/b>\\nAugmentez la capacit\u00e9 d'alimentation gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des bacs suppl\u00e9mentaires en option. Vous pouvez ainsi charger diff\u00e9rents types de papier et faire passer la capacit\u00e9 d\u2019alimentation totale \u00e0 4 300 feuilles.\\n\\n<b>Eco-responsabilit\u00e9<\/b>\\nImprimez de fa\u00e7on responsable. Les param\u00e8tres Eco vous permettent de personnaliser les param\u00e8tres d'impression et le mode Hibernation fait tomber la consommation d'\u00e9nergie au-dessous d'un watt.\\n\\n<b>Impression ultra-rapide<\/b>\\nLe processeur ultra-rapide et la connectivit\u00e9 Gigabit Ethernet garantissent une grande rapidit\u00e9 de traitement et de transfert des donn\u00e9es, m\u00eame pour les documents couleur les plus complexes."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-04-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"30.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e68c9c33-b78a-4ea6-bc7f-19110b162eea","identifier":"14094299","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C746n"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Intuitive navigation<\/b>\\nThe 2.4-inch (6-cm) LCD is easy to read and the colour graphics make navigation and troubleshooting intuitive.\\n\\n<b>Corporate colour matching<\/b>\\nMatch corporate colours on marketing collateral and brand-sensitive text and graphics with Lexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE\u00ae calibration.\\n\\n<b>Use less energy<\/b>\\nThe instant warm-up fuser reduces energy consumption and delivers a time to first page as fast as 9 seconds in both black and colour.\\n\\n<b>Multiple media support<\/b>\\nExpand input capacity with optional paper trays that let you load multiple paper types and boost total input capacity up to 4,300 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly printing<\/b>\\nPrint responsibly with Eco-Settings that let you customise print settings and Hibernate Mode which reduces energy consumption to less than one watt.\\n\\n<b>High-speed processing<\/b>\\nThe high-speed processor and Gigabit Ethernet networking mean fast data transfer and fast processing, even on complex colour documents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"25.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"233b4de7-eb16-4361-9e3f-75e807f5ab5e","identifier":"14094721","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C748e"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Intuitive colour touch screen<\/b>\\nThe easy-to-use 4.3-inch (10.9-cm) colour touch screen provides audible feedback and tablet-like navigation to make device operation intuitive and simple.\\n\\n<b>Corporate colour matching<\/b>\\nMatch corporate colours on marketing collateral and brand-sensitive text and graphics with Lexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE\u00ae calibration.\\n\\n<b>Use less energy<\/b>\\nThe instant warm-up fuser reduces energy consumption and delivers a time to first page as fast as 9 seconds in both black and colour.\\n\\n<b>Multiple media support<\/b>\\nExpand input capacity with optional paper drawers that let you load multiple paper types and boost total input capacity up to 4,300 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly printing<\/b>\\nPrint responsibly with Eco-Settings that let you customise print settings and Hibernate Mode which reduces energy consumption to less than one watt.\\n\\n<b>High-speed processing<\/b>\\nThe high-speed processor and Gigabit Ethernet networking mean fast data transfer and fast processing, even on complex colour documents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"26.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"573133de-9902-46a7-a901-2abb9b347b21","identifier":"14097017","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_letter_216_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X748de"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Robust color MFPs for productive workgroups<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark X748de MFP delivers high-quality color printing and reliable performance. Security controls and workflow-enhancing solutions make high-volume printing easy and secure.\\n\\n<b>Intuitive color touch screen<\/b>\\nThe easy-to-use 7-inch color touch screen provides audible feedback and tablet-like navigation to make device operation intuitive and simple.\\n\\n<b>Corporate color matching<\/b>\\nMatch corporate colors on marketing collateral and brand-sensitive text and graphics with Lexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE\u00ae calibration.\\n\\n<b>Convenient updates<\/b>\\nPreview documents and change output settings such as two-sided printing directly at the device.\\n\\n<b>Multiple media support<\/b>\\nExpand input capacity with optional drawers that let you load multiple types and boost total input capacity up to 4,300 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Advanced security<\/b>\\nProtect your device, data and network with innovative security controls like authentication and authorization and disk wiping and encryption.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly printing<\/b>\\nPrint responsibly with Eco-Settings that let you customize print settings and Hibernate Mode which reduces energy consumption to less than one watt."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fda52bd5-14a1-40ea-b79d-87c5725dc5d9","identifier":"14097020","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C748dte"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Intuitive color touch screen<\/b>\\nThe easy-to-use 4.3-inch color touch screen provides audible feedback and tablet-like navigation to make device operation intuitive and simple.\\n\\n<b>Corporate color matching<\/b>\\nMatch corporate colors on marketing collateral and brand-sensitive text and graphics with Lexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE\u00ae calibration.\\n\\n<b>Use less energy<\/b>\\nThe instant warm-up fuser reduces energy consumption and delivers a time to first page as fast as 9 seconds in both black and color.\\n\\n<b>Multiple media support<\/b>\\nExpand input capacity with optional paper drawers that let you load multiple paper types and boost total input capacity up to 4,300 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly printing<\/b>\\nPrint responsibly with Eco-Settings that let you customize print settings and Hibernate Mode which reduces energy consumption to less than one watt.\\n\\n<b>High-speed processing<\/b>\\nThe high-speed processor and Gigabit Ethernet networking mean fast data transfer and fast processing even on complex color documents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"30.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5ebf47ce-edd4-4865-9880-5800bd3009b4","identifier":"14101037","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 23DL933G LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>LED<\/b>\\nLEDs wandeln Strom effizient in Licht um und liefern zus\u00e4tzlich bessere Kontraste und leuchtendere Farben. Die Full-HD-Aufl\u00f6sung unterstreicht diese hervorragenden Eigenschaften zus\u00e4tzlich.\\n\\n<b>FULL HD<\/b>\\nF\u00fcr Bilder in High Definition Aufl\u00f6sung, wie sie durch HDTV und Blu-ray bereitgestellt werden, hat sich in Europa die Aufl\u00f6sung 1.920x1.080 Bildpunkte f\u00fcr das \u00fcbertragene Signal weitgehend durchgesetzt.\\n\\n<b>DVD-Player integriert<\/b>\\nDieser TV hat einen integrierten DVD Player, so dass Sie auf ein externes Ger\u00e4t verzichten k\u00f6nnen und trotzdem all Ihre Lieblingsfilme genie\u00dfen k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>Dualtuner<\/b>\\nDieser TV bietet neben einem analogen Tuner ebenfalls einen Tuner f\u00fcr DVB-T und DVB-C (HD).\\n\\n<b>Videos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle<\/b>\\nMit diesem TV k\u00f6nnen Sie Videos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle genie\u00dfen.\\nVideos, Musik und Bilder per USB Schnittstelle"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba 23DL933G. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: PAL BG, PAL DK, PAL I, SECAM B\/G, SECAM D\/K, SECAM L, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. RMS rated power: 2.5. Optical disc player type: DVD player, Disc types supported: DVD+R, DVD+RW, DVD-R, DVD-RW. Video formats supported: AVI, DAT, H.264, ISO, MKV, MP4, MPEG1, MPEG2, MPEG4, VOB, XVID, Audio formats supported: AAC, MP3, MP4, Image formats supported: JPG"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eed12b43-68df-4ca9-83fc-048f161dae95","identifier":"14107352","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","oki","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"OKI C831cdtn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fast, affordable A3 and A4 colour printing that enhances your business<\/b>\\nThe C831 is the ideal choice for small to medium businesses or workgroups looking for fast, high quality, high volume, print on demand capabilities, in-house. With the fastest A4 print speeds for its price at 35ppm and high capacity 10k toners, you can rely on this device to deliver on your day to day business printing needs, hassle free. And with low running costs this is an attractive option for budget conscious businesses with high print volume demands.\\n\\n<b>Reliable, robust and superb colour print quality<\/b>\\nThe C831 is built on tried and tested technology that your business can rely on to deliver over and over again, supported by a 3-year warranty.\\n\\n<b>Fast, accurate printing with added efficiency<\/b>\\nThe C831 offers outstanding A4 print speeds of up to 35ppm in high definition colour,whilst also including a range of energy and cost saving functions to reduce your total cost of ownership, improving efficiency and productivity. ProQ2400 Multi-level output quality, 1200 x 600dpi print resolution and Photo Enhance feature guarantee sharp, clear and vibrant photo-like pictures.\\n\\n<b>Excellent media flexibility<\/b>\\nThe C831 provides complete flexibility, enabling users to print on a wide range of media sizes, formats and paper weights. You can print on paper sizes from A6 to A3 and produce banners of up to 1321mm in length. Standard 400 sheet paper capacity expands to 1,990 sheets and you can print on paper weights of up to 256gsm."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"La C831 est l\u2019imprimante id\u00e9ale pour les PME et groupes de travail qui souhaitent imprimer rapidement en interne et \u00e0 la demande, des impressions de haute qualit\u00e9 et des volumes \u00e9lev\u00e9s. Offrant les meilleures vitesses d\u2019impression (35 ppm) dans cette cat\u00e9gorie de prix et avec ses cartouches de toner haute capacit\u00e9 (10k), elle peut prendre en charge tous vos besoins d\u2019impression, jour apr\u00e8s jour.\\n\\n<b>Fiable, robuste et avec une superbe qualit\u00e9 d'impression en couleur<\/b>\\nCon\u00e7ue sur la base de la technologie LED OKI reconnue pour sa robustesse, la C831 apporte aux entreprises de toutes tailles une fiabilit\u00e9 \u00e0 toute \u00e9preuve, soutenue par une garantie de trois ans\\n\\n<b>Vitesses d'impression A4 jusqu'\u00e0 35ppm en couleur haute d\u00e9finition<\/b>\\nUn \u00e9ventail de fonctions pour \u00e9conomiser l'\u00e9nergie et r\u00e9duire le co\u00fbt total de possession, et pour am\u00e9liorer l'efficaciit\u00e9 et la productivit\u00e9.\\nTechnologie multi-niveaux ProQ2400, r\u00e9solution d'impression de 1200 x 600dpi et Photo Enhance garantissent une qualit\u00e9 d'impression exceptionnelle, proche de la qualit\u00e9 photo, avec des couleurs soutenues et une grande brillance.\\n\\n<b>Souplesse exceptionnelle dans la gestion des supports<\/b>\\nOffrant une grande souplesse, la C831 apporte aux utilsateurs la possibilit\u00e9 d'imprimer sur un large \u00e9ventail de papiers de formats, de grammages et de qualit\u00e9 tr\u00e8s vari\u00e9s\\n\\n- Imprimez sur formats du A6 au A3\\n- Produisez \u00e0 la demande des banni\u00e8res jusqu'\u00e0 1321 mm de long\\n- Capacit\u00e9 papier standard de 400 feuilles pouvant \u00eatre \u00e9tendue jusqu'\u00e0 1990 feuilles\\n- Imprimez sur des grammages jusqu'\u00e0 256g\/m\u00b2."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-02T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c2cbfa44-425b-4e79-88db-1024fdf16aba","identifier":"14108871","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 55PFL7007K"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Integriertes WiFi f\u00fcr die kabellose Verwendung von Smart TV<\/b>\\nMit dem integrierten WiFi-Netzwerk in Ihrem Philips Fernseher k\u00f6nnen Sie mit Smart TV zuhause kabellos auf umfassende Inhalte zugreifen.\\n\\n<b>Eine beeindruckende Auswahl an Online-Apps, Leihvideos und Catch-up TV<\/b>\\nLeihen Sie Filme aus Online-Videoshops direkt auf Ihrem Fernseher aus, verpassen Sie nie mehr Sendungen auf Ihren Lieblingssendern, genie\u00dfen Sie eine Vielzahl von Online-Apps mit Net TV, und surfen Sie im Internet.\\n\\n<b>Steuern Sie Ihren Fernseher \u00fcber Smartphone, Tablet oder Tastatur<\/b>\\nSteuern Sie Ihren Fernseher einfach und unkompliziert. Schlie\u00dfen Sie einfach eine drahtlose Tastatur an, oder steuern Sie Ihren Smart TV \u00fcber Ihr Smartphone oder Tablet.\\n\\n<b>Sendungen suchen, programmieren, aufnehmen* und pausieren<\/b>\\nNehmen Sie digitale Live-Sendungen auf einem an den Philips Fernseher angeschlossenen USB-Ger\u00e4t auf, oder pausieren Sie Inhalte wann immer Sie m\u00f6chten, und setzen Sie die Wiedergabe jederzeit fort. Mit der elektronischen Programmzeitschrift finden Sie Ihre Lieblingsprogramme und k\u00f6nnen die Aufnahme ganz einfach programmieren. So passen Sie Ihr Fernsehvergn\u00fcgen Ihrem Leben an.\\n\\n<b>Schauen Sie mit dem WiFi Smart Screen* \u00fcberall in Ihrem Zuhause Fernsehen<\/b>\\nMit dem WiFi Smart Screen* sind Sie nicht l\u00e4nger an Ihre Couch gebunden. Sehen Sie sich digitale Fernsehinhalte an, ganz gleich, wo Sie sich in Ihrem Zuhause befinden. Laden Sie ganz einfach die Philips MyRemote App herunter. Streamen Sie das Programm anschlie\u00dfend von Ihrem Fernseher auf Ihr iPad, und genie\u00dfen Sie weiterhin das Programm. Streamen Sie auch Fotos, Videos oder Musik von Ihren intelligenten Ger\u00e4ten auf den gro\u00dfen Bildschirm. Dies bedeutet echte Freiheit f\u00fcr Ihr Fernseherlebnis!\\n\\n<b>Ambilight Spectra 2 verleiht Fernsehvergn\u00fcgen eine neue Dimension<\/b>\\nMit Ambilight Spectra 2 erreicht Ihr Fernseherlebnis ganz neue Dimensionen. Diese patentierte Technologie von Philips vergr\u00f6\u00dfert den Bildschirm mehr als je zuvor, indem ein Umgebungslicht auf zwei Seiten des Ger\u00e4ts von der R\u00fcckseite des Bildschirms auf die umliegenden W\u00e4nde projiziert wird. Ambilight passt Farbe und Helligkeit des Umgebungslichts automatisch an das Fernsehbild an. Dank der Wandanpassungsfunktion passt die Farbe immer zum Fernsehbild, ganz gleich, welche Farbe Ihre Wand hat.\\n\\n<b>3D Max Clarity 700 f\u00fcr ein eindrucksvolles 3D-Erlebnis in Full HD<\/b>\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie ein atemberaubendes 3D-Erlebnis in Full HD auf Ihrem Philips Fernseher. Mit der Active3D-Technologie bietet 3D Max Clarity 700 ein unvergleichliches 3D-Fernseherlebnis in hoher Aufl\u00f6sung und mit optimaler Bewegungssch\u00e4rfe. Sie k\u00f6nnen sogar beliebige 2D-Inhalte in lebendiges und perfektes 3D konvertieren.\\n\\n<b>Genie\u00dfen Sie per Tastendruck 2D-Inhalte in perfekter 3D-Qualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie Ihre gesamte Filmsammlung in lebendiger und perfekter 3D-Qualit\u00e4t \u2013 sogar alte Schwarz-Wei\u00df-Klassiker. Philips bietet hochwertige Qualit\u00e4t bei der Konvertierung von 2D-Inhalten in Echtzeit per Tastendruck. Dadurch wird sichergestellt, dass Untertitel gleichm\u00e4\u00dfig angezeigt werden und keine Fehler auftreten, wie beispielsweise das Anzeigen des Hintergrunds im Vordergrund.\\n\\n<b>Einzigartige 3D-Tiefenanpassung zur Anzeige von 3D-Inhalten<\/b>\\nJeder Mensch nimmt 3D unterschiedlich wahr. Aus diesem Grund bietet Philips Ihnen die M\u00f6glichkeit, die 3D-Tiefensch\u00e4rfe Ihrem pers\u00f6nlichen Geschmack anzupassen. Die einzigartige 3D-Tiefenanpassung erm\u00f6glicht Ihnen die Auswahl der Bildtiefe, die sich am besten f\u00fcr den Inhalt auf dem Bildschirm und Ihren pers\u00f6nlichen Bed\u00fcrfnisse eignet. Dadurch wird das Bild auch f\u00fcr Ihre Augen angenehmer. Kommen Sie nun in den vollen 3D-Genuss.\\n\\n<b>Einzigartiger Zwei-Spieler Fullscreen Gaming-Modus f\u00fcr Ihre 2D-Spiele<\/b>\\nMit der 3D-Brille von Philips kann Ihr Fernseher das ultimative Zwei-Spieler Fullscreen Gaming bieten. Bei 2D-Spielen f\u00fcr zwei Spieler sehen die Spieler ihr Spiel in der Regel auf einer H\u00e4lfte des Bildschirms. Dank der 3D-Technologie k\u00f6nnen jetzt beide Spieler mit nur einem Tastendruck auf der Brille das Spiel gleichzeitig in der 2D-Vollbildansicht genie\u00dfen.\\n\\n<b>Full HD Fernseher mit Pixel Precise HD f\u00fcr mehr Bewegungssch\u00e4rfe<\/b>\\nPixel Precise HD basiert auf dem preisgekr\u00f6nten Pixel Plus System. Die Bildqualit\u00e4t erh\u00e4lt damit dank der 4 Billionen Farben eine neue Dimension. Egal, ob Sie sich ein Internet-Video oder einen hochwertigen Blu-ray-Film ansehen \u2013 Super Resolution und Pixel Precise HD gew\u00e4hrleisten immer die beste HD-Bildqualit\u00e4t.\\n\\n<b>800 Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) f\u00fcr eine perfekte Bewegungssch\u00e4rfe<\/b>\\n800 Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) erzeugt noch sch\u00e4rfere Bilder bewegter Objekte in rasanten Actionfilmen. Der neue Philips PMR-Standard liefert Ihnen sichtbare Effekte dank sehr hoher Bildwiederholraten und Perfect Natural Motion mit seiner einzigartigen Prozessor-Power f\u00fcr unglaubliche Bewegungssch\u00e4rfe.\\n\\n<b>T\u00e4tigen Sie mit Skype\u2122 Sprach- und Videoanrufe auf Ihrem Fernseher<\/b>\\nRevolutionieren Sie Ihre Art zu telefonieren, und teilen Sie Erlebnisse mit Menschen, die Ihnen wichtig sind, egal wo diese sich gerade befinden. Mit Skype\u2122 auf Ihrem Fernseher k\u00f6nnen Sie Sprach-und Videoanrufe von Ihrem Wohnzimmer aus t\u00e4tigen. Schlie\u00dfen Sie einfach die optionale Philips TV-Kamera (PTA317\/00) an Ihren Fernseher an, und genie\u00dfen Sie exzellente Video- und erstklassige Soundqualit\u00e4t ganz entspannt auf Ihrem Sofa.\\n\\n* Net TV: Besuchen Sie www.philips.com\/smarttv, und erfahren Sie, welche Dienste in Ihrem Land verf\u00fcgbar sind.\\n* Der WiFi Smart Screen ist \u00fcber ein Software-Update ab Herbst 2012 erh\u00e4ltlich\\n* Die Skype Kamera wird separat vertrieben.\\n* Eltern sollten w\u00e4hrend der 3D-Wiedergabe ihre Kinder \u00fcberwachen und sicherstellen, dass sie sich nicht unwohl f\u00fchlen (wie oben beschrieben). Die Wiedergabe von 3D wird nicht f\u00fcr Kinder unter sechs Jahren empfohlen, da ihr visuelles System noch nicht vollst\u00e4ndig ausgebildet ist.\\n* Der Fernseher unterst\u00fctzt DVB-T-Empfang f\u00fcr Free-to-Air-\u00dcbertragungen. Bestimmte DVB-T-Betreiber werden m\u00f6glicherweise nicht unterst\u00fctzt. Eine aktuelle Liste dieser Betreiber finden Sie in den FAQs auf der Philips Support-Website. Bei einigen Betreibern sind Conditional Access und ein Abonnement erforderlich. Weitere Informationen erhalten Sie von Ihrem Betreiber.\\n* Energieverbrauch in kWh pro Jahr, beruhend auf dem Stromverbrauch des Fernsehers, wenn dieser 4 Stunden pro Tag an 365 Tagen in Betrieb ist. Der tats\u00e4chliche Energieverbrauch h\u00e4ngt davon ab, wie der Fernseher verwendet wird.\\n* Durchschnittlicher Stromverbrauch bei Betrieb entsprechend IEC62087 Ed. 2.\\n* USB-Aufnahmen sind nur f\u00fcr digitale Sender m\u00f6glich (l\u00e4nder- und senderabh\u00e4ngig), nicht f\u00fcr analoge Sendungen oder externe Quellen. Aufnahmen k\u00f6nnen durch Kopierschutz (CI+) eingeschr\u00e4nkt sein."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Be part of the action!<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Enjoy Full HD 3D and Smart TV with Ambilight<\/b>\\nExperience a world of content with a Philips 55PFL7007 3D Smart LED TV. Enjoy endless possibilities of Smart TV Premium, combined with the unique remote control and its integrated keyboard.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy a world of content with Smart TV Premium<\/b>\\n- Integrated Wi-Fi to use Smart TV wirelessly\\n- A wealth of online apps, videos to rent and catch-up TV\\n- Control the TV with your smart phone, tablet or keyboard\\n- Find, schedule, record* & pause TV\\n- Watch TV wherever you like at home with Wi-Fi smart screen*\\n- Make voice and video calls with SkypeTM on your TV\\n\\n<b>Breathtaking performance<\/b>\\n- Ambilight Spectra 2-sided intensifies the viewing experience\\n- 3D Max Clarity 700 for stunning Full HD 3D experience\\n- Enjoy any 2D content in flawless 3D at a push of a button\\n- Unique 3D depth adjustment to view 3D the way you like it\\n- Unique Two Player Full Screen Gaming mode for your 2D games\\n- Full HD TV with Pixel Precise HD for details in action\\n- 800Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) for superb motion sharpness"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Profitez de toute une gamme de contenus avec le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur LED Smart TV 3D Philips 55PFL7007. Laissez-vous s\u00e9duire par les possibilit\u00e9s infinies de Smart TV Premium, ainsi que par sa t\u00e9l\u00e9commande exclusive avec clavier int\u00e9gr\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":55,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0481613e-8017-4fa7-9e84-5d8af8d913ab","identifier":"14109207","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 32HFL3016D\/10 LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Beeindrucken Sie Ihre G\u00e4ste mit h\u00f6chster Effizienz<\/b>\\nLCD-Hotel-Fernseher mit LED-Hintergrundbeleuchtung von Philips\\n\\nMit diesem modernen und energieeffizienten HD LCD-Hotel-Fernseher mit LED-Hintergrundbeleuchtung k\u00f6nnen Sie alle Vorteile des digitalen Fernsehens nutzen. Dank des\\nprofessionellen Hotel-Fernsehers genie\u00dfen Ihre G\u00e4ste nicht nur ein herzliches Willkommen sondern\\nauch ein unvergleichliches Fernseherlebnis.\\n\\nErweiterte Hotel-Funktionen und zukunftssicher\\n- Brillante LED-Bilder bei geringem Stromverbrauch\\n- Volle Hotel-, Klinik- und Gef\u00e4ngnismodi\\n- MyChoice-Kompatibilit\u00e4t f\u00fcr wiederkehrende Einnahmen\\n- Integriertes Connectivity Panel\\n- Sperre f\u00fcr Installationsmen\u00fc\\nBieten Sie Ihren G\u00e4sten etwas Besonderes\\n- ThemeTV Lite f\u00fcr einfache Sendernavigation\\n- Hotel Scenea f\u00fcr einen individuell angepassten Info- und Startkanal\\n- Zus\u00e4tzlicher Kopfh\u00f6reranschluss f\u00fcr privaten H\u00f6rgenuss\\nNachhaltig und sicher\\n- Niedriger Stromverbrauch\\n- Mit der gr\u00fcnen Taste k\u00f6nnen G\u00e4ste noch mehr Energie sparen\\n- Umweltfreundliches Design und schwer entflammbares Geh\u00e4use"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips 32HFL3016D\/10. Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Aspect ratio: 16:9, Screen format adjustments: 4:3, 14:9, 16:9, Zoom. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, PAL, SECAM, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: Incredible Surround. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): EasyLink. Video formats supported: H.264, MPEG1, MPEG2, MPEG4, Audio formats supported: MP3, Image formats supported: JPG"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5ce68790-18eb-4554-9b6f-51ff37107aaf","identifier":"14110919","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet M401dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Arbeiten Sie produktiver. Dank integrierter Wireless-Netzwerktechnologie k\u00f6nnen Sie den Drucker \u00fcberall im B\u00fcro konfigurieren und Druckressourcen im Netzwerk bereitstellen. Mobildruckoptionen erlauben das Drucken von unterwegs. \u00dcber Gesch\u00e4ftsanwendungen (Business Apps) k\u00f6nnen Sie webbasiert drucken.\\n\\nDank leistungsstarker Funktionen und hoher Bedienerfreundlichkeit unterst\u00fctzt Sie dieser schnelle und zuverl\u00e4ssige HP LaserJet Drucker bei der Erf\u00fcllung s\u00e4mtlicher professioneller Druckanforderungen \u2013 einschlie\u00dflich der M\u00f6glichkeit zum Drucken \u00fcber mobile Ger\u00e4te sowie Touchscreen-Zugriff auf Business-Apps \u2013 und tr\u00e4gt gleichzeitig dazu bei, Ihre Umweltbilanz zu verbessern.\\n\\n<b>Arbeiten Sie produktiver und schneller mit Hilfe der Wireless-Netzwerktechnologie und eindrucksvoller Mobilit\u00e4t.<\/b>\\n- Wireless-Konnektivit\u00e4t erm\u00f6glicht die Verbindung zum Drucker und die Druckerfreigabe \u00fcberall im B\u00fcro. Die Netzwerkkonfiguration ist im Handumdrehen erledigt.\\n- Drucken Sie von praktisch jedem Ort aus \u2013 mit HP ePrint. AirPrint\u2122 erm\u00f6glicht den Wireless-Druck von Ihrem iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae und iPod touch\u00ae aus.\\n- Mit HP Wireless Direct Printing k\u00f6nnen Sie Dateien von einem mobilen Endger\u00e4t direkt an Ihren Drucker senden.\\n- Sparen Sie Papier durch automatischen beidseitigen Druck. Das Ger\u00e4t druckt mit bis zu 33 S.\/Min. (A4) und gibt die erste Seite in weniger als 8 Sekunden aus.\\n\\n<b>Erleben Sie webbasierte Benutzerfreundlichkeit.<\/b>\\n- Gesch\u00e4ftsanwendungen (Business Apps) und ein Farb-Touchscreen Display mit 8,89 cm (3,5 Zoll) Diagonale erm\u00f6glichen den Internetzugriff und webbasiertes Drucken, z. B. mit Google Docs \u00a92012 Google.\\n- Die Installation ist im Handumdrehen erledigt \u2013 dank HP Smart Install ist keine CD erforderlich.\\n- Intuitive Druckerfunktionen verbessern die Kontrolle von Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufen. Ein praktischer USB-Anschluss erm\u00f6glicht das Drucken direkt von einem Flash-Laufwerk.\\n- Die einfache Steuerung Ihrer Druckumgebung spart der IT-Abteilung Zeit und Geld \u2013 HP Web Jetadmin unterst\u00fctzt die Ger\u00e4te\u00fcberwachung und verbessert die Verf\u00fcgbarkeit.\\n\\n<b>Erstellen Sie Ausdrucke in professioneller Qualit\u00e4t zum g\u00fcnstigen Preis.<\/b>\\n- Produzieren Sie hochwertige Gesch\u00e4ftsdokumente mit gestochen scharfem Text und klaren Abbildungen.\\n- Bew\u00e4hrte HP LaserJet Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit sorgt f\u00fcr einen sorgenfreien Druckbetrieb und konsistente Druckqualit\u00e4t von der ersten bis zur letzten Seite.\\n- Sparen Sie Zeit mit einfach einzusetzenden Original HP Druckkassetten und Geld durch optionale Druckkassetten mit hoher Kapazit\u00e4t f\u00fcr h\u00e4ufiges Drucken.\\n- Mehr M\u00f6glichkeiten mit einer Papierkapazit\u00e4t von 300 Blatt (800 Blatt gesamt mit optionalem 500-Blatt-Fach).\\n\\n<b>F\u00fcr eine geringere Umweltbelastung.<\/b>\\n- Sparen Sie Energie mit der HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off-Technologie, die Ihren Drucker nach Bedarf ein- oder ausschaltet.\\n- Automatischer beidseitiger Druck senkt den Papierverbrauch um bis zu 50 %.\\n- \u00dcber das HP Planet Partners Programm lassen sich Original HP LaserJet Toner-Druckkassetten problemlos recyceln.\\n- Weniger Verpackungsabfall: Die Original HP Toner-Druckkassette HP 80 A ist bei der Lieferung schon im Drucker installiert."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Do more with your workday. Set up anywhere in the office using built-in wireless networking and share printing resources on a network. Print on the go with mobile printing options. Use business apps to access and print from the web.\\n\\nFeature-packed and easy to use, this fast and reliable HP LaserJet helps you meet all your professional printing needs \u2013 including printing from mobile devices plus optional touchscreen access to business apps \u2013 while reducing environmental impact.\\n\\n<b>Stay productive and boost business with wireless networking and impressive mobility.<\/b>\\n- Set up and share anywhere in the office with wireless connectivity. Configure networking fast.\\n- Print from virtually anywhere with HP ePrint. Print wirelessly from your iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae, and iPod touch\u00ae with AirPrint\u2122.\\n- Send files from a mobile device directly to your printer using HP wireless direct printing.\\n- Save paper with automatic two-sided printing. Get fast print speeds up to 33 ppm A4 and a first page out in less than 8 seconds.\\n\\n<b>Experience web-connected ease of use.<\/b>\\n- Use business apps and the 8.89 cm (3.5-inch) colour touchscreen to access and print from the web, e.g. with Google Docs \u00a92012 Google.\\n- Install your printer fast \u2013 there's no CD required with HP Smart Install.\\n- Manage workflow with intuitive features right on the printer. A convenient USB port enables printing directly from a flash drive.\\n- Easily control your print environment and save IT time and costs \u2013 HP Web Jetadmin helps you monitor equipment and increase uptime.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy professional-quality output for a great value.<\/b>\\n- Produce professional-quality business documents with bold, crisp text and sharp images.\\n- Get peace of mind with trusted HP LaserJet reliability and consistent print quality from the first to the last page.\\n- Save time with easy-to-install Original HP cartridges, and save money with optional high-capacity cartridges designed for frequent printing.\\n- Do more with a 300-sheet paper capacity (800-sheets total with optional 500-sheet tray).\\n\\n<b>Reduce your environmental impact.<\/b>\\n- Save energy with HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technology which turns your printer on when you need it and off when you don\u2019t.\\n- Reduce paper use by up to 50% with automatic two-sided printing.\\n- Easily recycle Original HP LaserJet toner cartridges through HP Planet Partners.\\n- Reduce packaging waste: Original HP toner cartridge HP 80A ships in the printer."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Exploitez davantage votre journ\u00e9e de travail. Installez n'importe o\u00f9 au bureau l'aide de la mise en r\u00e9seau int\u00e9gr\u00e9e sans fil, et partagez les ressources d'impression sur un r\u00e9seau. Imprimez en d\u00e9placement avec les options d'impression mobiles. Utilisez les applications professionnelles pour acc\u00e9der au Web et imprimer \u00e0 partir du Web.\\n\\nAvec une ample vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de fonctionnalit\u00e9s et une utilisation facile, cette imprimante HP LaserJet rapide et fiable vous aide \u00e0 r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 tous vos besoins d'impression professionnels, y compris l'impression \u00e0 partir d'appareils mobiles ainsi que l'acc\u00e8s facultatif par \u00e9cran tactile aux applications professionnelles, tout en r\u00e9duisant l'impact sur l'environnement.\\n\\n<b>Restez productifs et stimulez vos activit\u00e9s avec la mise en r\u00e9seau sans fil et la mobilit\u00e9 impressionnante.<\/b>\\n- Configurez et partagez n'importe o\u00f9 au bureau avec la connectivit\u00e9 sans fil. Configurez la mise en r\u00e9seau rapide.\\n- Imprimez o\u00f9 que vous soyez avec HP ePrint. Imprimez sans fil depuis votre iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae et iPod touch\u00ae \u00e9quip\u00e9 d'AirPrint\u2122.\\n- Envoyez des fichiers depuis un p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique mobile directement \u00e0 votre imprimante \u00e0 l'aide de l'impression directe sans fil HP.\\n- R\u00e9duisez votre consommation de papier en optant pour l'impression recto-verso automatique. Restez productif - Imprimez jusqu'\u00e0 33 ppm et la premi\u00e8re page en seulement 8 secondes.\\n\\n<b>Exp\u00e9rimentez la facilit\u00e9 d'utilisation connect\u00e9e \u00e0 Internet.<\/b>\\n- Utilisez des applications professionnelles et l'\u00e9cran couleur tactile de 8,89 cm (3,5 pouces) pour acc\u00e9der au Web et imprimer des informations, par exemple, Google Docs \u00a9 2012 Google.\\n- Installez votre imprimante rapidement - aucun CD requis avec HP Smart Install.\\n- G\u00e9rez le flux de travail avec des fonctions intuitives sur l'imprimante. Un port USB pratique permet d'imprimer directement \u00e0 partir d'un lecteur flash.\\n- Contr\u00f4lez facilement votre environnement d'impression, gagnez du temps et r\u00e9duisez les co\u00fbts - HP Web Jetadmin vous aide \u00e0 contr\u00f4ler votre mat\u00e9riel et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre la disponibilit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'un r\u00e9sultat de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle \u00e0 un prix remarquable.<\/b>\\n- Produisez des documents de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle avec du texte gras et pr\u00e9cis et des images nettes.\\n- Obtenez une grande tranquillit\u00e9 d'esprit avec la qualit\u00e9 d'impression HP LaserJet fiable et consistante, de la premi\u00e8re \u00e0 la derni\u00e8re page.\\n- Gagnez du temps avec les cartouches HP d'origine faciles \u00e0 installer et \u00e9conomisez de l'argent avec les cartouches haute capacit\u00e9 en option con\u00e7ues pour l'impression fr\u00e9quente.\\n- Faites en plus avec une capacit\u00e9 de 300 feuilles (800 feuilles au total avec bac de 500 feuilles en option).\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez votre impact environnemental.<\/b>\\n- \u00c9conomisez l'\u00e9nergie avec la technologie HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off qui met l'imprimante sous tension lorsque vous en avez besoin et l'\u00e9teint lorsque vous n'en avez plus besoin.\\n- R\u00e9duisez la consommation de papier de 50 % avec l'impression recto verso automatique.\\n- Recyclez facilement les cartouches de toner HP LaserJet originales via le programme HP Planet Partners.\\n- R\u00e9duisez les d\u00e9chets d'emballages : Cartouche de toner HP d'origine HP 80A fournie dans l'imprimante."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-03T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b8ad3294-a638-4e40-a46f-fa16e3101431","identifier":"14112094","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["brother","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Brother HL-5440D"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Professioneller Arbeitsplatz-Laserdrucker mit Duplexdruck<\/b>\\n\\n- Bis zu 38 Seiten pro Minute\\n- Duplexeinheit inkl. automatischer Brosch\u00fcrendruckfunktion\\n- Echte Aufl\u00f6sung bis zu 1.200 x 1.200 dpi\\n- 64 MB Speicher\\n- PCL 6, PostScript 3, Epson FX-850, IBM ProPrinter XL Emulation\\n- Druckertreiber f\u00fcr Windows, Macintosh und Linux\\n- USB 2.0 Hi-Speed und parallele Schnittstelle\\n- 250 Blatt Papierkassette und 50 Blatt Multifunktionszufuhr\\n- optionale 500 Blatt Papierkassette\\n- Toner f\u00fcr ca. 2.000 Seiten nach ISO\/IEC 19752 und\\n- Trommel f\u00fcr ca. 30.000 Seiten im Lieferumfang."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>THE HL-5440D IS THE PROFESSIONAL PRINT PARTNER OFFERING HIGH SPEED OUTPUT TO MEET YOUR BUSINESS REQUIREMENTS<\/b>\\n\\nRegardless of your business size Brother understands that your business runs on information.\\n\\nThe HL-5440D is packed with a range of easy-to-use, cost effective output solutions that are designed to deliver outstanding results time after time.\\n\\n- Save time with fast 38ppm print speed\\n- First page out time of less than 8.5 seconds (incorporating <1 second eco Warm up)\\n- Automatic 2-Sided Print as Standard\\n- Less refilling with a 300 sheet paper capacity expandable to 800 sheets\\n- Keep print costs down with the High Yield Toner Option."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Imprimante laser monochrome recto-verso<\/b>\\nQuelle que soit la taille de votre entreprise, la HL-5440D vous offre de nombreuses solutions d\u2019impression intuitives et \u00e9conomiques, con\u00e7ues pour vous offrir des r\u00e9sultats exceptionnels jour apr\u00e8s jour\\n\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 sa vitesse d'impression \u00e9lev\u00e9e et une compatibilit\u00e9 avec les plateformes Windows, Mac, Linux, Unix, la Brother HL-5440D r\u00e9pondra \u00e0 toutes vos demandes d'impression."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-03T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e3d21b62-79f1-40e5-aee6-00f69fd1e89d","identifier":"14115366","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark OfficeEdge Pro4000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Laser-quality printing<\/b>\\nThe Pro4000 includes the features you need and a 50% lower printing cost on laser-quality documents.\\n\\n<b>Flexible networking<\/b>\\nIdeal for multi-user workgroups; provides the flexibility of networking via Ethernet or wireless-N.\\n\\n<b>Vizix Pro<\/b>\\nMake a lasting impression on customers and do more in-house printing with smear-resistant Vizix Pro inks.\\n\\n<b>Fast scan and print speeds<\/b>\\nQuickly scan documents in as fast as 5 seconds per page and print laser-quality jobs at speeds up to 21 ppm black and 14 ppm colour on a variety of specialty paper types, including card stock and paper sizes up to 8.5 x 21.5 x 35.5 cm).\\n\\n<b>Time-saving shortcuts<\/b>\\nSimplify everyday tasks with time-saving Lexmark 1-touch shortcuts. Eliminate unnecessary steps and save time by customising shortcuts to run commonly performed workflows."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Impression qualit\u00e9 laser<\/b>\\nLe multifonction Pro4000 est \u00e9quip\u00e9 de toutes les fonctions dont vous avez besoin et offre un co\u00fbt d'impression de qualit\u00e9 laser 50% moins cher.\\n\\n<b>Options de connexion r\u00e9seau flexibles<\/b>\\nId\u00e9al pour les groupes de travail multi-utilisateur. Permet de profiter de la flexibilit\u00e9 du r\u00e9seau via la technologie Ethernet ou Wi-Fi N.\\n\\n<b>Vizix Pro<\/b>\\nImpressionnez vos clients en imprimant en interne des documents sans bavure gr\u00e2ce aux encres Vizix Pro.\\n\\n<b>Num\u00e9risation et impression rapides<\/b>\\nNum\u00e9risation rapide de documents en moins de 5 secondes par page et impression de travaux en qualit\u00e9 laser \u00e0 une vitesse pouvant atteindre 21 ppm en noir et 14 ppm en couleur sur papier sp\u00e9cial, notamment sur papier Bristol, avec des supports jusqu'\u00e0 21,5 x 35,5 cm.\\n\\n<b>Raccourcis offrant un gain de temps<\/b>\\nSimplifiez vos t\u00e2ches quotidiennes gr\u00e2ce aux touches de raccourcis Lexmark. Supprimez les \u00e9tapes inutiles et gagnez du temps en personnalisant des raccourcis pour ex\u00e9cuter les flux documentaires les plus fr\u00e9quents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"16.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"00756e23-4587-464f-8b4e-af6baa5f3c79","identifier":"14119709","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark X748dte"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die Lexmark X748dte Farblaser-Multifunktionsl\u00f6sung bietet hochwertige Farbdokumente. Merkmale wie die 550-Blatt-Zuf\u00fchrung erh\u00f6hen die Effizienz und Sicherheitskontrollen machen das Drucken sicher.\\n\\n<b>Intuitiver Farb-Touchscreen<\/b>\\n\\nDer 17,8 cm gro\u00dfe Farb-Touchscreen bietet eine akustische R\u00fcckmeldung und Tablet-\u00e4hnliche Navigation, um die Bedienung des Ger\u00e4ts intuitiv und einfach zu machen.\\n\\n<b>Anpassung an Corporate-Farben<\/b>\\n\\nPassen Sie Ihr Marketingmaterial und ihre markensensiblen Texte und Grafiken mithilfe von Lexmark Named Color Replacement und PANTONE\u00ae-Kalibrierung an Ihre Corporate-Farben an.\\n\\n<b>Einfache Aktualisierungen<\/b>\\n\\nZeigen Sie eine Vorschau der Dokumente an und \u00e4ndern Sie die Outputeinstellungen direkt am Ger\u00e4t, wie z. B. zweiseitiges Drucken.\\n\\n<b>Unterst\u00fctzung zahlreicher Medien<\/b>\\n\\nErweitern Sie Ihre Zuf\u00fchrungskapazit\u00e4t mit optionalen Papierkassetten, die es Ihnen erm\u00f6glichen, verschiedene Medientypen einzulegen und Ihre gesamte Zuf\u00fchrungskapazit\u00e4t auf bis zu 4.300 Blatt zu steigern.\\n\\n<b>Fortschrittliche Sicherheitsfunktionen<\/b>\\n\\nSch\u00fctzen Sie Ihr Ger\u00e4t, Ihre Daten und Ihr Netzwerk mit innovativen Sicherheitskontrollen wie Authentifizierung und Berechtigung, Disk Wiping und Verschl\u00fcsselung.\\n\\n<b>Umweltfreundliches Drucken<\/b>\\n\\nDrucken Sie umweltfreundlich mit Eco-Einstellungen, die es Ihnen erm\u00f6glichen, die Druckeinstellungen anzupassen und einen Hibernate-Modus festzulegen, der den Stromverbrauch auf weniger als ein Watt verringert."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Lexmark X748dte color laser MFP delivers high-quality color documents. Features like the 550-sheet tray increase efficiency and security controls make high-volume printing secure.\\n\\n<b>Intuitive color touch screen<\/b>\\n\\nThe easy-to-use 7-inch color touch screen provides audible feedback and tablet-like navigation to make device operation intuitive and simple.\\n\\n<b>Corporate color matching<\/b>\\n\\nMatch corporate colors on marketing collateral and brand-sensitive text and graphics with Lexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE\u00ae calibration.\\n\\n<b>Convenient updates<\/b>\\n\\nPreview documents and change output settings such as two-sided printing directly at the device.\\n\\n<b>Multiple media support<\/b>\\n\\nExpand input capacity with optional drawers that let you load multiple media types and boost total input capacity up to 4,300 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Advanced security<\/b>\\n\\nProtect your device, data and network with innovative security controls like authentication and authorization, and disk wiping and encryption.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly printing<\/b>\\n\\nPrint responsibly with Eco-Settings that let you customize print settings and Hibernate Mode which reduces energy consumption to less than one watt."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e18b9b3d-1597-404b-a104-a4f32158daf4","identifier":"14119715","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C748dte"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Lexmark C748dte Farblaserdrucker bieten eine zuverl\u00e4ssige Leistung und anwenderfreundliche Funktionen, die f\u00fcr mittelgro\u00dfe Arbeitsgruppen unverzichtbar sind. Merkmale wie die 550-Blatt-Zuf\u00fchrung erh\u00f6hen die Effizienz.\\n\\n<b>Intuitiver Farb-Touchscreen<\/b>\\n\\nDer 10,9 cm gro\u00dfe Farb-Touchscreen bietet eine akustische R\u00fcckmeldung und Tablet-\u00e4hnliche Navigation f\u00fcr eine intuitive und einfache Bedienung des Ger\u00e4ts.\\n\\n<b>Anpassung an Corporate-Farben<\/b>\\n\\nPassen Sie Ihr Marketingmaterial und ihre markensensiblen Texte und Grafiken mithilfe von Lexmark Named Color Replacement und PANTONE\u00ae-Kalibrierung an Ihre Corporate-Farben an.\\n\\n<b>Verbrauchen Sie weniger Energie<\/b>\\n\\nDie Instant Warm-up-Fixiereinheit reduziert den Stromverbrauch und bietet eine Ausgabe der ersten Seite in nur 9 Sekunden sowohl in Schwarz als auch in Farbe.\\n\\n<b>Unterst\u00fctzung zahlreicher Medien<\/b>\\n\\nErweitern Sie Ihre Zuf\u00fchrungskapazit\u00e4t mit optionalen Papierkassetten, die es Ihnen erm\u00f6glichen, verschiedene Papiertypen einzulegen und Ihre gesamte Zuf\u00fchrungskapazit\u00e4t auf bis zu 4.300 Blatt zu steigern.\\n\\n<b>Umweltfreundliches Drucken<\/b>\\n\\nDrucken Sie umweltfreundlich mit Eco-Einstellungen, die es Ihnen erm\u00f6glichen, die Druckeinstellungen anzupassen und einen Hibernate-Modus festzulegen, der den Stromverbrauch auf weniger als ein Watt verringert.\\n\\n<b>High-Speed-Verarbeitung<\/b>\\n\\nDer High-Speed-Prozessor und Gigabit Ethernet-Netzwerkunterst\u00fctzung gew\u00e4hrleisten eine schnelle Daten\u00fcbertragung und eine schnelle Verarbeitung auch bei komplexen Farbdokumenten."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Lexmark C748de color laser printer offers midsize workgroups high-quality color printing and easy-to-use features. Eco-friendly features, like automatic two-sided printing, make responsible printing easy.\\n\\n<b>Intuitive color touch screen<\/b>\\n\\nThe easy-to-use 4.3-inch color touch screen provides audible feedback and tablet-like navigation to make device operation intuitive and simple.\\n\\n<b>Corporate color matching<\/b>\\n\\nMatch corporate colors on marketing collateral and brand-sensitive text and graphics with Lexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE\u00ae calibration.\\n\\n<b>Use less energy<\/b>\\n\\nThe instant warm-up fuser reduces energy consumption and delivers a time to first page as fast as 9 seconds in both black and color.\\n\\n<b>Multiple media support<\/b>\\n\\nExpand input capacity with optional paper drawers that let you load multiple paper types and boost total input capacity up to 4,300 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly printing<\/b>\\n\\nPrint responsibly with Eco-Settings that let you customize print settings and Hibernate Mode which reduces energy consumption to less than one watt.\\n\\n<b>High-speed processing<\/b>\\n\\nThe high-speed processor and Gigabit Ethernet networking mean fast data transfer and fast processing even on complex color documents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fdc6446e-eceb-41f7-a36e-2af61d9dbbf0","identifier":"14120655","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C746n"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Intuitive navigation<\/b>\\nThe 2.4-inch (6-cm) LCD is easy to read and the colour graphics make navigation and troubleshooting intuitive.\\n\\n<b>Corporate colour matching<\/b>\\nMatch corporate colours on marketing collateral and brand-sensitive text and graphics with Lexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE\u00ae calibration.\\n\\n<b>Use less energy<\/b>\\nThe instant warm-up fuser reduces energy consumption and delivers a time to first page as fast as 9 seconds in both black and colour.\\n\\n<b>Multiple media support<\/b>\\nExpand input capacity with optional paper trays that let you load multiple paper types and boost total input capacity up to 4,300 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly printing<\/b>\\nPrint responsibly with Eco-Settings that let you customise print settings and Hibernate Mode which reduces energy consumption to less than one watt.\\n\\n<b>High-speed processing<\/b>\\nThe high-speed processor and Gigabit Ethernet networking mean fast data transfer and fast processing, even on complex colour documents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"25.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bf22177a-8c4d-484f-b022-c279ab8bbe97","identifier":"14120657","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C746dtn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Intuitive navigation<\/b>\\nThe 2.4-inch LCD is easy to read and the colour graphics make navigation and troubleshooting intuitive.\\n\\n<b>Corporate colour matching<\/b>\\nMatch corporate colours on marketing collateral and brand-sensitive text and graphics with Lexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE\u00ae calibration.\\n\\n<b>Use less energy<\/b>\\nThe instant warm-up fuser reduces energy consumption and delivers a time to first page as fast as 9 seconds in both black and colour.\\n\\n<b>Multiple media support<\/b>\\nExpand input capacity with optional paper drawers that let you load multiple paper types and boost total input capacity up to 4,300 sheets.\\n\\n<b>Eco-friendly printing<\/b>\\nPrint responsibly with Eco-Settings that let you customise print settings and Hibernate Mode which reduces energy consumption to less than one watt.\\n\\n<b>High-speed processing<\/b>\\nThe high-speed processor and Gigabit Ethernet networking mean fast data transfer and fast processing,even on complex colour documents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"30.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2d8ba823-e285-418e-850d-f56547f07c07","identifier":"14120667","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark OfficeEdge Pro4000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>LASER-QUALITY PRINTING<\/b>\\nThe Pro4000 includes the features you need and a 50% lower printing cost on laser-quality documents. \u00b9\\n\\n<b>FLEXIBLE NETWORKING<\/b>\\nIdeal for multi-user workgroups; provides the flexibility of networking via Ethernet or wireless-N. \u00b2\\n\\n<b>VIZIX PRO<\/b>\\nMake a lasting impression on customers and do more in-house printing with smear-resistant Vizix Pro inks.\\n\\n<b>FAST SCAN AND PRINT SPEEDS<\/b>\\nQuickly scan documents in as fast as 5 seconds per page and print laser-quality jobs at speeds up to 21 ppm black and 14 ppm colour on a variety of specialty paper types, including card stock and paper sizes up to 8.5 x 21.5 x 35.5 cm). \u00b3,\u2074\\n\\n<b>TIME-SAVING SHORTCUTS<\/b>\\nSimplify everyday tasks with time-saving Lexmark 1-touch shortcuts. Eliminate unnecessary steps and save time by customising shortcuts to run commonly performed workflows.\\n\\n<b>FOOTNOTES<\/b>\\n\u00b9 When comparing cost-per-page with the weighted average cost-per-page (based on IDC Market share report from November 2011) of most of the colour laser MFPs below \u20ac500, or equivalent in local currency, in France, UK, Germany, Italy, Spain, Netherlands, Sweden, Poland, and South Africa. \u00b2 When used with a wireless-N enabled router. Compatible with W-Fi CERTIFIED IEEE 802.11 b\/g\/n routers. \u00b3 When scanning a multi-page document in mono 300 dpi, standalone mode to a USB flash-drive in PDF format. Excludes first page scan time. Actual scan times may vary based on factors such as media card and PC performance. \u2074 Average of Estimated Saturated Throughput from the Office Category Test for the default simplex mode. Determined in accordance with ISO\/IEC 24734."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ba410f2d-44bb-4cb9-a159-55321dcdc1e7","identifier":"14125367","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung 32HA475"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Da Zeit f\u00fcr Hotelg\u00e4ste immer ein wichtiger Faktor ist, verf\u00fcgt diese Serie \u00fcber eine leicht\\n- ablesbare externe Uhr\\n- Ebenfalls entscheidend neben einer gestochen scharfen Bildqualit\u00e4t ist ein beeindruckender\\n- Klang, der durch die Soundbar-Kompatibilit\u00e4t ausgebaut werden kann\\n- Vor allem internationale G\u00e4ste profitieren von der \u201eMy Channel\u201c-Funktion, mit der per Knopf-\\n- druck Kan\u00e4le nach L\u00e4nderlisten oder auch Genres ausgew\u00e4hlt werden k\u00f6nnen"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung 32HA475. Display resolution: 1366 x 768, Screen format adjustments: 16:9, Supported graphics resolutions: 1366 x 768. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: SRS TheaterSound. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Cable lock slot: Kensington"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"be604958-9383-4672-b306-3ae2466d196d","identifier":"14125372","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung 40'' HA790"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung 40'' HA790. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: SRS TruSurround HD. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Cable lock slot: Kensington"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"SAMSUNG Electronics, un des leaders mondiaux des \u00e9crans plats, annonce le lancement de sa toute derni\u00e8re gamme de t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs \u00ab Hospitality TV \u00bb pour l\u2019h\u00f4tellerie. Con\u00e7us pour moderniser les chambres d'h\u00f4tel, ces nouveaux t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs sont dot\u00e9s des toutes derni\u00e8res technologies pour une diffusion num\u00e9rique haute d\u00e9finition, une consommation d\u2019\u00e9nergie r\u00e9duite et une installation facile. Leur design \u00e9l\u00e9gant aux finitions brillantes est adapt\u00e9 au style de tous les h\u00f4tels, de l'h\u00f4tel \u00e9conomique \u00e0 l'h\u00f4tel de luxe. Alors que l'industrie h\u00f4teli\u00e8re se pr\u00e9pare \u00e0 vivre l\u2019une des transitions les plus importantes de son histoire depuis la t\u00e9l\u00e9vision en noir et blanc, SAMSUNG a dot\u00e9 tous ses t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs \u00ab Hospitality TV \u00bb d'un tuner num\u00e9rique pour recevoir les programmes en haute d\u00e9finition. Cette nouvelle gamme de t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs est \u00e9galement fabriqu\u00e9e avec des mat\u00e9riaux plus \u00e9cologiques et plus \u00e9conomes en \u00e9nergie. (la consommation d'\u00e9nergie est r\u00e9duite de 60 % par rapport \u00e0 un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur traditionnel). \u00ab Le secteur de l'h\u00f4tellerie fait d\u00e9sormais des choix r\u00e9fl\u00e9chis en mati\u00e8re de technologie. Les h\u00f4teliers sont sensibles au design et aux \u00e9conomies d'\u00e9nergie mais ils d\u00e9sirent \u00e9galement remplacer leurs anciens mod\u00e8les analogiques par des \u00e9crans plats LCD modernes.Ils sont dot\u00e9s de la technologie de \u00abclonage\u00bb via USB, qui permet de dupliquer sur chaque t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur les param\u00e8tres, les cha\u00eenes et les logos de l'h\u00f4tel tr\u00e8s facilement. Cette nouvelle technologie constitue une \u00e9conomie de temps et d'argent consid\u00e9rable pour les h\u00f4tels et une garantie d\u2019avoir les m\u00eames r\u00e9glages standards sur tous les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs. Les h\u00f4teliers peuvent \u00e9galement afficher leur logo pendant 3 \u00e0 7 secondes lors de l\u2019allumage de l\u2019\u00e9cran (dur\u00e9e r\u00e9glable), ce qui leur permet de mettre en valeur leur marque aupr\u00e8s de leur client\u00e8le. Les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs Hospitality int\u00e8grent \u00e9galement une prise d\u2019alimentation \u00e0 l\u2019arri\u00e8re de l\u2019\u00e9cran pour alimenter directement la Set-Top Box et peuvent \u00eatre connect\u00e9s \u00e0 des enceintes externes install\u00e9es dans la salle de bain pour profiter au maximum de la radio. Pour une plus grande connectivit\u00e9 entre les \u00e9crans plats et les appareils multim\u00e9dia, les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs Hospitality sont compatibles avec les prises externes Jack Pack qui peuvent \u00eatre install\u00e9es n\u2019importe o\u00f9 dans la chambre d\u2019h\u00f4tel. Les clients peuvent ainsi \u00e9couter leur musique pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e ou regarder leurs photos sur l\u2019\u00e9cran du t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur. Enfin, les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs Hospitality de SAMSUNG ont une t\u00e9l\u00e9commande multi codes. Cette fonction est particuli\u00e8rement pratique pour les salles de sport ou les caf\u00e9t\u00e9rias afin de changer le programme sur tous les \u00e9crans avec une seule t\u00e9l\u00e9commande. Les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs des s\u00e9ries 450 et 457 disposent de la technologie HD Ready et d\u2019une finition noire \u00e9l\u00e9gante."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8a6be7e9-e6d5-45c0-bfbd-f81fadc6fa7e","identifier":"14130687","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","logitech","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_720"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech C270"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>HD 720p video calling that\u2019s simple\u2014on most major IMs, including Logitech Vid\u2122 HD.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>HD video calls<\/b>\\n\\nYou\u2019ll get HD 720p video calling on most major instant messaging applications and Logitech Vid\u2122 HD.\\n\\n<b>3-megapixel snapshots<\/b>\\n\\nIt\u2019s easy to take snapshots when you don\u2019t have time for a video call (software enhanced).\\n\\n<b>Includes Logitech Vid\u2122 HD<\/b>\\n\\nNow HD video calling is free, fast and easy for you and anyone you want to talk to. It\u2019s built into your webcam setup, so you can call right away.\\n\\n<b>Built-in mic with RightSound\u2122<\/b>\\n\\nIt gives you clear conversations without annoying background noise.\\n\\n<b>RightLight\u2122 technology<\/b>\\n\\nIt automatically adjusts the image during your call, so you look your best even in dim light.\\n\\n<b>IM compatibility<\/b>\\n\\nWorks with Skype\u2122, Windows Live\u2122 Messenger, Yahoo!\u00ae Messenger, AOL\u00ae Instant Messenger (AIM\u00ae) and other popular instant messaging applications.\\n\\n<b>Free video editing software<\/b>\\n\\nLogitech has teamed up with MAGIX to offer MAGIX\u2122 Photo Manager 9 and MAGIX\u2122 Video Easy with your new Logitech webcam. And they\u2019re free."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8ca17654-3760-49fb-b6ab-773200e336a8","identifier":"14132790","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 26LT360C LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- LED TV, 16:9 Breitbildformat\\n- Gemischte Sendertabelle (Analog\/DVB-T\/DVB-C)\\n- Hotel mode\\n- Welcome Screen, USB Cloning\\n- IR Out, Multi IR Code\\n- Frei von umweltsch\u00e4digenden Substanzen nach RoHS Richtlinie"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"LT Series - New dedicated platform of Hotel TV LED model with new, trendy design, without clock. Product is created to fulfill demands of all hoteliers with wide size range: 22\" \/ 32\" \/ 37\" \/ 42\" \/ 47\".\\n\\n- USB Cloning\\n- Hotel Mode\\n- Welcome Screen\\n- RJP Interface\\n- Multi IR Code\\n- IR Out\\n- Commercial Dedicated Tool"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"23a42fd3-9eaa-471a-8a4f-15a7ecaf7c02","identifier":"14135140","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 37PFL6007K"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Mitten im Geschehen!<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Genie\u00dfen Sie 3D und Smart TV mit Ambilight<\/b>\\n\\nEntdecken Sie eine Welt verschiedener Inhalte mit einem Philips 3D Smart LED-Fernseher 37PFL6007.\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie hochwertige LED-Bilder in Full HD sowie die unbegrenzten M\u00f6glichkeiten durch Smart\\nTV Premium mit dem einzigartigen Ambilight. Mitten im Geschehen dank komfortablem 3D-Fernsehen!\\n\\n<b>Entdecken Sie eine Welt verschiedener Inhalte m. Smart TV Premium<\/b>\\n- Integriertes WiFi f\u00fcr die kabellose Verwendung von Smart TV\\n- Eine beeindruckende Auswahl an Online-Apps, Leihvideos und Catch-up TV\\n- Steuern Sie Ihren Fernseher \u00fcber Smartphone, Tablet oder Tastatur\\n- Sendungen suchen, programmieren, aufnehmen und pausieren\\n- Schauen Sie mit dem WiFi Smart Screen* \u00fcberall in Ihrem Zuhause Fernsehen\\n- T\u00e4tigen Sie mit SkypeTM Sprach- und Videoanrufe auf Ihrem Fernseher\\n\\n<b>Faszinierendes Fernseherlebnis in Ihrem Wohnzimmer<\/b>\\n- Ambilight Spectra 2 verleiht Fernsehvergn\u00fcgen eine neue Dimension\\n- Easy 3D Clarity 700 f\u00fcr ein 3D-Filmerlebnis mit hohem Komfort\\n- Genie\u00dfen Sie per Tastendruck 2D-Inhalte in perfekter 3D-Qualit\u00e4t\\n- Einzigartige 3D-Tiefenanpassung zur Anzeige von 3D-Inhalten\\n- Einzigartiger Zwei-Spieler Fullscreen Gaming-Modus f\u00fcr Ihre 2D-Spiele\\n- Full HD Fernseher mit Pixel Precise HD f\u00fcr mehr Bewegungssch\u00e4rfe\\n- 400 Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) f\u00fcr eine perfekte Bewegungssch\u00e4rfe"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Be part of the action!<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Enjoy 3D and Smart TV with Ambilight<\/b>\\nExperience a world of content with a Philips 37PFL6007 3D Smart LED TV. Enjoy powerful Full HD LED pictures and endless possibilities of Smart TV Premium with immersive Ambilight. Be part of the action with the most comfortable 3D!\\n\\n<b>Enjoy a world of content with Smart TV Premium<\/b>\\n- Integrated Wi-Fi to use Smart TV wirelessly\\n- A wealth of online apps, videos to rent and catch-up TV\\n- Control the TV with your smart phone, tablet or keyboard\\n- Find, schedule, record & pause TV\\n- Watch TV wherever you like at home with Wi-Fi smart screen*\\n- Make voice and video calls with Skype\u2122 on your TV\\n\\n<b>Fascinating view experience in your living room<\/b>\\n- Ambilight Spectra 2-sided intensifies the viewing experience\\n- Easy 3D Clarity 700 for a comfortable 3D movie experience\\n- Enjoy any 2D content in flawless 3D at a push of a button\\n- Unique 3D depth adjustment to view 3D the way you like it\\n- Unique Two Player Full Screen Gaming mode for your 2D games\\n- Full HD TV with Pixel Precise HD for details in action\\n- 400Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) for superb motion sharpness"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Profitez de toute une gamme de contenus avec le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur LED Smart 3D Philips 37PFL6007. Vous ne serez pas d\u00e9\u00e7u par les superbes images LED Full HD et les possibilit\u00e9s infinies de Smart TV Premium avec Ambilight immersif. Plongez au c\u0153ur de l'action avec une 3D des plus agr\u00e9ables\u00a0!"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":37,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a29a4e45-95bf-49bb-8ff7-88ff8097a4b3","identifier":"14149243","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE40ES6530S"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE40ES6530S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: SRS, Dolby Digital Plus, Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Power consumption (standby): 0.1, Energy efficiency class: A, Input voltage: 220 - 240"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e3a94dd3-2fe3-4c03-94fa-668d009400de","identifier":"14154834","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Deskjet 3055A"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Mit diesem kosteng\u00fcnstigen e-All-in-One profitieren Sie von einfachem, kabellosem Drucken, einschlie\u00dflich schneller Einrichtung und Verbindung. Entdecken Sie die Vorteile des mobilen Druckens mit HP ePrint \u2013 von nun an k\u00f6nnen Sie von praktisch \u00fcberall aus drucken.<SUP>1<\/SUP>,<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Vielf\u00e4ltige Optionen f\u00fcr mobiles Drucken \u2013 ob wireless oder von unterwegs.<SUP>1<\/SUP>,<SUP>2<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Genie\u00dfen Sie die Flexibilit\u00e4t von HP ePrint \u2013 von nun an k\u00f6nnen Sie von praktisch jedem Ort aus mit Ihrem Smartphone oder Tablet-PC drucken.<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Drucken, scannen und kopieren Sie mit einem kosteng\u00fcnstigen und benutzerfreundlichen Ger\u00e4t.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Profitieren Sie von bequemem Drucken, Scannen und Kopieren mit intuitiven Schaltfl\u00e4chen und einem praktischen Schwarzwei\u00df-Display.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erst schnelle und einfache Installation, dann schnelle und zuverl\u00e4ssige Leistung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Legen Sie sofort los \u2013 dieser benutzerfreundliche e-All-in-One l\u00e4sst sich in Minutenschnelle installieren.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Die Leistung beim kabellosen Einsatz ist abh\u00e4ngig von den Umgebungsbedingungen und vom Abstand zum Zugangspunkt.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Erfordert eine Internetverbindung zum Drucker. Erfordert ggf. einen Wireless Access Point, Registrierung, ein Firmware-Upgrade oder zus\u00e4tzliche Ma\u00dfnahmen. Verf\u00fcgbarkeit und die Druckdauer k\u00f6nnen variieren. HP ePrint funktioniert bei jedem Internet- und E-Mail-f\u00e4higen Endger\u00e4t. Details finden Sie unter: www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Take advantage of easy wireless printing and sharing at home\u2014even print through e-mail.Designed to deliver dependable performance, this affordable e-all-in-one makes it easy to copy and scan, and conserve resources.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Get easy wireless printing\u2014even print through e-mail.<\/b>\\n- Use HP ePrint mobile printing\u2014if you can e-mail it, you can print it.\\n- Now with AirPrint\u2122. Simply print wirelessly from your iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae or iPod touch\u00ae.\\n- Get quick and easy wireless printing and sharing\u2014automatically connect to a network.\\n- Wirelessly print directly from a smartphone, using HP mobile printing applications.\\n\\n<b>Print, scan and copy affordably.<\/b>\\n- Easily print, scan and copy everyday documents from an intuitive, 2.0-inch (5.08 cm) mono display.\\n- Balance form and function with this compact, wireless e-all-in-one\u2014designed to fit in tight spaces.\\n- Produce high-quality documents with laser-quality text and vivid color graphics.\\n- Get a better value for frequent printing when you choose optional high-capacity ink cartridges.\\n\\n<b>Count on dependable performance and convenience.<\/b>\\n- Reduce the time you spend waiting for prints\u2014jobs finish in as little time as 21 seconds.\\n- Start printing right away with quick and easy installation, and print within a few seconds.\\n- Get a dependable e-all-in-one that powers up in less than five seconds and shuts down instantly.\\n- Use Original HP print cartridges for quality, reliability and rewards.\\n\\n<b>Reduce energy consumption and conserve resources.<\/b>\\n- Save energy, using an e-all-in-one that is ENERGY STAR\u00ae qualified.\\n- Take advantage of intuitive design\u2014this e-all-in-one is composed of 25% post-consumer recycled plastics.\\n- Save energy with HP Auto-Off Technology\u2014intelligence that can turn your printer off when you don\u2019t need it.\\n- Get free, easy recycling\u2014cartridges returned through HP Planet Partners are recycled responsibly."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Profitez de la simplicit\u00e9 de l'impression sans fil gr\u00e2ce notamment \u00e0 une configuration et \u00e0 une connexion rapides avec cette imprimante HP e-all-in-one\u00a0; d\u00e9couvrez la libert\u00e9 de l'impression mobile HP ePrint et imprimez depuis n'importe o\u00f9.<SUP>1<\/SUP>,<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une s\u00e9lection d'options d'impression mobiles, imprimez sans fil ou en d\u00e9placement. <SUP>1<\/SUP>, <SUP>2<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;D\u00e9couvrez la libert\u00e9 de l'impression avec HP\u00a0ePrint\u00a0: vous pouvez maintenant imprimer de pratiquement n'importe quel endroit.<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Imprimez, num\u00e9risez et copiez avec un seul appareil abordable et facile \u00e0 utiliser.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Imprimez, num\u00e9risez et copiez facilement avec des boutons intuitifs et un \u00e9cran monochrome pratique.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Profitez de la rapidit\u00e9 et de la simplicit\u00e9 d'installation, puis de la vitesse et de la fiabilit\u00e9 des performances.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Commencez tout de suite : e-tout-en-un install\u00e9 en quelques minutes et facile \u00e0 utiliser.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Les performances sans fil d\u00e9pendent de l'environnement physique et de la distance au point d'acc\u00e8s.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> N\u00e9cessite une connexion Internet \u00e0 l'imprimante. Peut n\u00e9cessiter un point d'acc\u00e8s sans fil, un enregistrement, une mise \u00e0 niveau du micrologiciel, ou d'autres actions. La disponibilit\u00e9 et les temps d'impression peuvent varier. HP ePrint fonctionne avec tout p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique disposant d'une connexion Internet et du courrier \u00e9lectronique. Pour plus d'informations, rendez-vous sur le site http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c7591288-172a-46cd-aa59-cb9dd061c030","identifier":"14155764","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","print_scan_sales","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox Color 550 R"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Xerox Color 550\/560 Printer is a high-performance, professional, light production\/multifunction printer best suited for graphic arts, pay-for-print, commercial print and corporate environments. It copies and prints with incredible color control up to 2400 x 2400 dpi resolution. It also can fax, as well as scan at high speed \u2013 in color or monochrome \u2013 to PC, USB or email. Numerous finishing and color server options make it flexible to fit your unique needs, and grow along with your business.\\n\\n- A true multifunction product \u2013 print, copy, fax and scan, including scan to PC, USB or email, and mobile printing.\\n- Enhanced productivity at 50 ppm color\/65 ppm black in copy mode; 50 ppm color\/ 80 ppm black in network scanning mode.\\n- Benchmark image quality with 2400 x 2400 dpi resolution and EA low melt toner for a smooth, offset-like finish.\\n- Makes mobile printing simpler and more convenient.\\n- Expansive media range lets you print everything from postcards to posters, both coated and uncoated stock, up to 300 gsm.\\n- Xerox Extensible Interface Platform (EIP) allows you to connect to third-party software solutions that you can access from the touch-screen of the device.\\n- Your choice of 2 internal color servers and 3 powerful external color servers to best fit your environment:\\n\\n- Xerox Integrated Color Server\\n- Xerox Integrated Fiery Color Server\\n- EX Print Server, powered by Fiery\\n- CX Print Server, powered by Creo\\n- Xerox FreeFlow Print Server\\n\\n- Inline finishing options offer a professional polish with stapling, hole-punching, folding and booklet making for presentations, brochures, reports and newsletters.\\n- Be secure with integrated security features such as IP filtering, image overwrite, secure print, encrypted scan-to-email, authentication and IPv6 support."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"28a48e4f-a718-4e88-bfde-5e259be5c0de","identifier":"14155949","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","print_scan_sales","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox WorkCentre 7525V_RL multifunctional"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The print quality you need to succeed. With the Xerox WorkCentre 7500 series multifunction printer, you\u2019ll achieve high-impact color documents that impress customers and deliver results \u2014 while minimizing costs.\\n\\n<b>Take color to a whole new level<\/b>\\nThe Xerox WorkCentre 7500 series, with advanced Hi-Q LED technology, helps you create professional-looking documents at the touch of a button.\\n\\n<b>- High-resolution output, highly impactful documents.<\/b>\\nWith 1200 x 2400 dpi, photoquality color images and rich, crisp text, your output always makes a huge impact.\\n\\n<b>- Always accurate image quality.<\/b>\\nThe WorkCentre 7500 series multifunction printer employs advanced print heads with Digital Image Registration Control Technology, which ensures consistently outstanding image registration.\\n\\n<b>- Impressive results.<\/b>\\nPrint brilliant, attentiongrabbing images on a variety of stock as large as 12.6 x 19 in. and on paper weights up to 300 gsm, and take advantage of impressive finishing capabilities from saddle-stitch booklets to folded brochures.\\n\\n<b>- Harness the power of Fiery.<\/b>\\nUpgrading your WorkCentre 7500 series with an EFI Fiery\u00ae network server gives you a host of benefi ts including easy-to-use color management tools, enhanced productivity and security features and fl exible workfl ow tools."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fedae053-3274-432c-b905-a27a4f33e6e1","identifier":"14174953","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Deskjet 3520 e-All-in-One Printer"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Count on affordable wireless performance to do more at home and on the go. Wirelessly print from virtually anywhere,<SUP>1<\/SUP><SUP>2<\/SUP> and print two-sided documents automatically. Produce impressive results, using individual Original HP ink cartridges.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Easy wireless printing\u2014from virtually anywhere<SUP>1<\/SUP><SUP>2<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;With HP ePrint, you can now print from your smartphone or tablet from virtually anywhere.<SUP>1<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Trusted HP performance and two-sided printing<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Automatically print and copy on both sides of a single page.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Convenient and compact to help you do more at home<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Easily print, scan, and copy everyday documents, using the 2.0-inch (5.08 cm) mono display.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Designed with the environment in mind<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Consume up to 50% less paper, using automatic two-sided printing and copying.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i>Requires an Internet connection to the printer. Feature works with any connected Internet- and email-capable device. Requires HP Web Services Account Registration. Print times may vary. For a list of supported documents, and image types, see www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. And for additional solutions, see www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i>Wireless performance is dependent upon physical environment and distance from access point.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3570f1a4-fb91-4ea4-8856-a1a691313087","identifier":"14187741","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet CP1025nw"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Dieser kosteng\u00fcnstige, mit Wireless- und Ethernet-Technologie ausgestattete HP LaserJet<SUP>1<\/SUP> ist der kleinste HP Farblaserdrucker und zugleich einer der energieeffizientesten weltweit<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Er gibt Ihnen die Chance, Dokumente in exzellenter Farbqualit\u00e4t zu erstellen. Dabei k\u00f6nnen Sie dank HP ePrint von nahezu \u00fcberall drucken.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Kosteng\u00fcnstiger Farbdruck mit Wireless-Verbindung.<SUP>1<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Mit der Wireless-Funktion k\u00f6nnen Sie von \u00fcberall im B\u00fcro drucken. \u00dcber integrierte Ethernet-Technologie lassen sich Druckressourcen gemeinsam nutzen.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Aufgaben werden im Handumdrehen erledigt \u2013 dank schneller Installation und einfachem mobilen Drucken.<SUP>3<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;HP ePrint \u2013 Jetzt k\u00f6nnen Sie von nahezu \u00fcberall drucken.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>F\u00fcr eine geringere Umweltbelastung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Einer der weltweit energieeffizientesten Farblaserdrucker.<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erstellen und drucken Sie Ihr eigenes Marketingmaterial.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Ansprechende Marketingbrosch\u00fcren und neue Impulse f\u00fcr Druckprojekte dank HP Creative Studio for Business.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Integrierte Wireless- und Ethernet-Verbindungen sind nur beim HP LaserJet Pro CP1025nw verf\u00fcgbar. Die Leistung beim kabellosen Einsatz ist abh\u00e4ngig von den Umgebungsbedingungen und der Entfernung vom Zugangspunkt und ist w\u00e4hrend einer aktiven VPN-Verbindungen wom\u00f6glich eingeschr\u00e4nkt.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Angaben zum Energieverbrauch basierend auf  den Ergebnissen von TEC-Vergleichstests mit Einzelfunktions-Farblaserdruckern (aufgef\u00fchrt unter energystar.gov und eu-energystar.org \u2013 Stand: Juni 2010). Die TEC-Tests wurden beim Schwarzwei\u00dfdruck mit entsprechender Druckgeschwindigkeit durchgef\u00fchrt. Der tats\u00e4chliche Stromverbrauch h\u00e4ngt von der individuellen Produktkonfiguration und -nutzung ab.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Erfordert eine Internetverbindung zum Drucker. Die Funktion ist mit allen angeschlossenen Internet- und E-Mail-f\u00e4higen Ger\u00e4ten verwendbar. Die Druckgeschwindigkeiten k\u00f6nnen variieren. Einige HP LaserJet Produkte erfordern m\u00f6glicherweise ein Firmware-Upgrade. Eine Liste der unterst\u00fctzten Dokument- und Bildtypen finden Sie unter www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. Wenn Sie Informationen \u00fcber weitere L\u00f6sungen ben\u00f6tigen, besuchen Sie uns unter www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions. Nur mit dem HP LaserJet Pro CP1025nw Farbdrucker verf\u00fcgbar.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Add high-quality colour using an affordable, wireless and Ethernet-connected HP LaserJet. HP\u2019s smallest colour laser printer is also one of the planet\u2019s most energy efficient. Print from virtually anywhere with HP ePrint.<\/b>"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Ajoutez de la couleur haut de gamme \u00e0 vos documents avec une HP LaserJet abordable, sans fil et connect\u00e9e via Ethernet.<SUP>1<\/SUP> L'imprimante laser couleur la plus compacte de HP est \u00e9galement l'une des moins gourmandes en \u00e9nergie au monde.<SUP>2<\/SUP> Imprimez o\u00f9 que vous soyez avec HP ePrint.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>La couleur abordable avec une connexion sans fil.<SUP>1<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Imprimez \u00e0 partir de n'importe o\u00f9 dans le bureau gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connexion sans fil. Partagez les ressources d'impression au moyen de l'Ethernet int\u00e9gr\u00e9.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Concentrez-vous sur votre travail \u2013 impression mobile sans peine et r\u00e9glage rapide.<SUP>3<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Avec HP ePrint, vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais imprimer depuis n'importe quel endroit.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez votre impact environnemental.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;L'une des imprimantes laser couleur offrant le plus haut rendement \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique au monde.<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Cr\u00e9ez et imprimez vos propres documents commerciaux.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Cr\u00e9ez du mat\u00e9riel marketing et trouvez des id\u00e9es pour vos projets d'impression gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 HP Creative Studio for Business.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> La connectivit\u00e9 Ethernet et le sans fil int\u00e9gr\u00e9s sont disponibles sur l'imprimante HP LaserJet Pro CP1025nw uniquement. Les performances sans fil d\u00e9pendent de l'environnement physique et de la distance au point d'acc\u00e8s et peuvent \u00eatre limit\u00e9es lors des connections VPN.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Consommation d'\u00e9nergie bas\u00e9e sur les calculs de TEC de la concurrence disponibles sur energystar.gov et eu-energystar.org pour les imprimantes laser couleur fonction unique en juin 2010. TEC bas\u00e9e sur une impression recto et une vitesse d'impression recto. La configuration individuelle du produit et son utilisation influencent la consommation.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> N\u00e9cessite une connexion Internet \u00e0 l'imprimante. Fonctionne avec tout p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique connect\u00e9 \u00e0 Internet et une messagerie \u00e9lectronique. Dur\u00e9es d'impression variables. Une mise \u00e0 niveau du micrologiciel peut \u00eatre n\u00e9cessaire pour certains mod\u00e8les HP LaserJet. Reportez-vous \u00e0 la liste des types de document et d'image pris en charge, voir www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. Pour des solutions suppl\u00e9mentaires, reportez-vous \u00e0 la page www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions. Disponible uniquement sur l'imprimante couleur HP LaserJet Pro CP1025nw.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-13T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b0f12179-d0e0-47bf-a2f4-cf1b3cdbb568","identifier":"14187749","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony HDR-PJ200"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5.3"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Crowd pleaser.\\n\\nCapture incredibly crisp 1920x1080\/60i Full HD video and thrill your audiences by making anytime movie time with a built-in high contrast projector. Use the brilliant 2.7\" LCD touchscreen to simplify switching up menu settings on the fly for a fun, easy way to set up the shots, better preserving the memories you'll treasure forever. Running out of daylight? Not a problem. Back-illuminated Exmor\u00ae CMOS sensor gets phenomenal results even when lighting conditions are less than optimal so you can keep going long after the sun is gone.\\n\\nThe Makings of a Masterpiece\\n\\nImmortalize precious moments in time by shooting in exquisitely rich Full 1920x1080\/60i HD and special occasions become even more special the second time around. Capture 5.3MP still images for yet another way to share the excitement.\\n\\nReady, Set, Project\\n\\nLight up the room and everyone in it by sharing treasured memories whenever and wherever you choose with nothing more than the camcorder you used to record them. Transform your Handycam camcorder into a mobile movie theater capable of projecting up to a 100\" diagonal image using the projector cleverly built into the LCD panel. Savor the true-to-life sound Clear Phase stereo speakers provide when combined with S-Master digital amplifier technology during playback.\\n\\nBetter Shots in Low Light\\n\\nExperience stunning low-light sensitivity with improved image clarity and drastically reduced grain with a back-illuminated Exmor\u00ae R CMOS sensor. Engineered specifically for compact cameras and camcorders, the Exmor R CMOS sensor is designed to let you shoot video in lower lighting conditions with better results.\\n\\n30x Zoom\\n\\nExtended digital zoom works in conjunction with 25x optical zoom to get you 30x closer to the action while maintaining HD image quality, even as you pan in for that extreme close-up.\\n\\nLegendary Lens\\n\\nStep it up with a professional-quality Carl Zeiss\u00ae Vario-Tessar\u00ae lens designed specifically for compact camcorders. Precision ground optics help maintain the sharpness and contrast of larger lenses, while SteadyShot\u00ae image stabilization helps reduce bothersome blur caused by camera shake.\\n\\nA Brilliant Touch\\n\\nVibrant 2.7\" Clear Photo LCD\u2122 touch screen (230k) makes framing up and reviewing footage a breeze. Sharp, vivid images make subjects pop off the screen \u2013 even outdoors \u2013 while enabling you to switch up menu settings on the fly ensuring the best shoot possible."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":25}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"26ed5ff3-2108-437f-8e13-2b65fc6ca0dc","identifier":"14191635","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung DV 300F"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung 300F, DV. Megapixel: 16.1, Camera type: Compact, Optical sensor size: 1\/2.3. Focal length range (f-f): 4.5 - 22.5, Minimum aperture: 2.5, Maximum aperture: 6.3. Focus: TTL, Focus adjustment: Auto, Normal focusing range: 0.8 - \u221e, 2.5 - \u221e. ISO sensitivity: 80, 100, 200, 400, 800, 1600, 3200, Auto, Light exposure modes: Auto, Light exposure control: Program AE. Camera shutter speed (min): 0.0005"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-14T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"54449d86-2e27-4e08-afc7-901e4c1be2e3","identifier":"14192008","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung Galaxy Wi-Fi"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"A perfect addition to your non-stop life has arrived. Say hello to the new compact Galaxy S WiFi 3.6, your always-in-the-know never-miss-a-moment partner-in-fun. Small in size, big on everything else."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-14T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e7a058d8-5612-405e-bd92-b73c302350fc","identifier":"14226874","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","philips","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips 55PFL5507T"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Experience a world of content with a Philips 55PFL5507 3D Smart LED TV. Enjoy powerful Full HD LED pictures and the endless possibilities of Smart TV Plus, and step into the world of 3D!\\n\\n<b>Enjoy a world of content with Smart TV Plus<\/b>\\n- Integrated Wi-Fi to use Smart TV wirelessly\\n- A wealth of online apps, videos to rent and catch-up TV\\n- Control the TV with your smart phone, tablet or keyboard\\n- With DLNA, enjoy photos, music and movies on your TV\\n- Find, schedule, record and pause TV\\n- Enjoy video calls on your TV and be close to your loved ones\\n\\n<b>Your entertainment in brilliant detail<\/b>\\n- 3D Clarity 400 for an exciting Full HD 3D experience\\n- Enjoy any 2D content in flawless 3D at the push of a button\\n- Unique Two Player Full Screen Gaming mode for your 2D games\\n- Full HD TV with Pixel Plus HD for better details and clarity\\n- Brilliant LED images with incredible contrast\\n- 400 Hz Perfect Motion Rate (PMR) for superb motion sharpness"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":55,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"594eaa15-f6b4-43d3-a663-fec602c60569","identifier":"1422973","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PIXMA MP140"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 100-240V, 50\/60Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Highly affordable All-in-One offers colour printing, scanning and copying in one device. Designed for ease-of-use this multifunctional is able to print sharp text photo-lab quality at high speeds.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n-Photo lab quality: Max. 4800x1200dpi.\\n-Prints a 10x15cm borderless photo in approx. 60 seconds. \\n-Fast copying, optimum colour output. \\n-600x1200dpi scanner. \\n-ChromaLife100 system for long-lasting, beautiful photos. \\n-Easy-to-use software.\\n\\n<b>Compact and stylish All-in-One printer<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Photo lab print quality<\/b>\\nThis stylish, easy-to-use and affordable Photo All-in-One delivers a 4800x1200dpi print resolution using FINE Cartridges with 2pl ink droplets. You benefit from detailed and vivid prints for all your photos.\\n\\n<b>Rapid photo print and copy speeds<\/b>\\nPrint a photo lab quality 10x15cm borderless photo in approximately 60 seconds in Standard mode*. Enjoy rapid borderless photo printing and copying on formats ranging from a small credit card size right up to A4.\\n\\nThe PIXMA MP140 can be used as a standalone copier, delivering up to 19 copies per minute in mono and up to 15 copies per minute in colour. Dual Colour Gamut Processing Technology ensures faithful reproduction when copying your photos.\\n\\n<b>Quality scanning<\/b>\\nThe built-in scanner has a 600x1200dpi resolution for crisp and clear colour scans. A USB2.0 Hi-Speed interface speeds up image transfer to your PC.\\n\\n<b>Long-lasting prints<\/b>\\nCanon's ChromaLife100 system delivers beautiful photographs with enhanced durability up to 100 years to preserve your memories. By using genuine Canon FINE Cartridges and genuine Canon photo papers, the system provides you with long-lasting, beautiful photo prints.\\n\\n<b>Easy-to-use software<\/b>\\nGet the most out of your Photo All-in-One with easy-to-use software. MP Navigator software provides a user-friendly interface linking all PIXMA functions to your PC. Select, enhance and print beautiful digital photos in just a few clicks with Easy-PhotoPrint. The PIXMA MP140 is Windows and Mac OS X compatible."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-02-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7a6501fd-a9c4-4eac-b386-b82a48bf9a23","identifier":"14230053","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLP-365"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"10.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Vivid printing \u2013 even from mobile devices<\/b>\\n- Quick and easy 3-step wireless printing from your mobile;\\n- Print vividly thanks to new polymerised toner;\\n- Save space thanks to compact ergonomic design;\\n- Easily print screen or eco-optimise output.\\n\\nNow you can make sure you print with vibrant colour \u2013 even from mobile devices. The Samsung CLP-365W Colour Laser Printer lets you print from smartphones, tabs and other devices in just three simple steps. It\u2019s delivered with stunning print quality thanks to Samsung\u2019s Rendering Engine for Clean Page (ReCP) technology. What\u2019s more, its compact, ergonomic design helps you to save space and make the most of your home or workplace.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy quality printouts<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s unique ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) Technology improves the overall quality and vibrancy of your colour printing, ensuring every printout looks perfect. It automatically sharpens the focus of both graphics and text, while solid objects are overlapped to eliminate white gaps.\\n\\n<b>Polymerized toner<\/b>\\nOur newly developed polymerized toner has smaller and more uniform particles than conventional toner. Meaning, your printouts will have crisper lines and more vivid colours - helping avoid any paper curling. Also, its higher wax content improves the image gloss and enhances the durability preventing unwanted fading.\\n\\n<b>Ergonomic design<\/b>\\nDon't worry about this printer crowding your space. Its beautiful and compact design makes it a pleasure to share a desk with.\\n\\n<b>Small size Footprint<\/b>\\nWith a footprint of just 38.2 x 30.9 cm the CLP-365 is one of the world's smallest colour laser printers.\\n\\n<b>Ergonomic design<\/b>\\nIts ergonomic design with ebony brown and ice grey colour creates a modern and elegant work environments.\\n\\n<b>Easy to use<\/b>\\nDesigned for simple and intuitive operation the CLP-365 saves you precious time and effort.\\n\\n<b>One Touch Eco Button<\/b>\\nJust One push of the ECO button and you can save on toner, paper, and energy. Print multiple pages on one sheet, change colour to greyscale or skip blank pages.\\n\\n<b>One Touch Print Screen Button<\/b>\\nPrint exactly what you see on the screen with just one click, saving time.\\n\\n<b>Easy Colour Manager<\/b>\\nCreate and use your own colour profiles with Samsung's Easy Colour Manager. Match the exact colours of a company logo or simply give your print outs the individual look you want.\\n\\n<b>Easy Solution support<\/b>\\nThe printer also brings you software support designed to put you in control of delivering ultimate quality printouts easier than ever before.\\n\\n<b>Easy Eco Driver<\/b>\\nEasy Eco Driver helps you compile digital documents in multiple formats and makes it easy to share them with others - even through social networks."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"nbsp;\\n<br\/><b>Une haute qualit\u00e9 couleur<\/b>\\n<br\/>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une haute qualit\u00e9 d'impression gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie couleur ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) de Samsung. Cette technologie novatrice vous permet d'obtenir une meilleure qualit\u00e9 d'image et une meilleure definition des caract\u00e8res pour des r\u00e9sultats nets et pr\u00e9cis.\\n<br\/><b>Toner polym\u00e9ris\u00e9 nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration<\/b>\\n<br\/>Le nouveau toner polym\u00e9ris\u00e9 Samsung contient des particules plus petites et plus uniformes pour des lignes plus nettes et plus pr\u00e9cises. De plus, avec sa formule \u00e0 la cire, il vous garantit durabilit\u00e9 et rendu glossy.\\n<br\/><b>Une imprimante efficace et compacte<\/b>\\n<br\/>Le design et la compacit\u00e9 de l'imprimante laser couleur CLP-365 en feront un compagnon de travail id\u00e9al.\\n* Compacte\\nAvec une dimension de 38.2 x 30.9 cm, la CLP-365 est la plus petite imprimante de sa gamme.\\n\\n* Un design \u00e9pur\u00e9\\nSon design ergonomique et ses couleurs modernes donne une touche de style \u00e0 tout environnement professionnel. \\n<br\/><b>Facile \u00e0 utiliser<\/b>\\n<br\/>Con\u00e7ue pour \u00eatre utiliser de mani\u00e8re simple et intuitive, l'imprimante laser couleur CLP-365 vous permet d'\u00e9conomiser temps et effort. \\n\\n* Bouton Eco\\nEconomisez toner, papier et \u00e9nergie par simple pression sur la touche ECO. Le mode ECO vous permet de g\u00e9rer vos impressions gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression de plusieurs pages par feuille, \u00e0 la gestion d'echelle de gris, ou encore la suppression de pages blanches.\\n\\n* Bouton imprime \u00e9cran\\nCapturez et imprimez ce que vous voyez \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran \u00e0 l'aide de la touche imprime \u00e9cran.\\n\\n* Bouton WPS\\nConnectez votre imprimante en Wi-Fi rapidement et simplement en appuyant sur la touche WPS (Wi-Fi Protected Setup).\\n<br\/><b>Logiciel Easy Colour Manager<\/b>\\n<br\/>Cr\u00e9ez et gerez vos profils couleur avec le logiciel Easy Colour Manager. Ce programme vous permet de r\u00e9gler le rendu couleur de vos impressions pour correspondre avec la couleur d'un logo, ou tout simplement pour personnaliser vos impressions."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-16T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0d3b133d-d561-41f5-8f73-08a6e953afaf","identifier":"14230054","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLP-365W"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"10.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Das kompakte Farbwunder f\u00fcr den Einsatz im Heimb\u00fcro<\/b>\\nSamsung Farblaserdrucker.\\nDieser unglaublich kompakte Farblaserdrucker steht f\u00fcr beeindruckend brillante Farbqualit\u00e4t und eine Bedienung, die leicht von der Hand geht.\\n\\nDieser unglaublich kompakte Farblaserdrucker steht f\u00fcr beeindruckend brillante Farbqualit\u00e4t und eine Bedienung, die leicht von der Hand geht. Mit seinen geringen Abmessungen geh\u00f6rt er zu den derzeit kleinsten Farblaser-Druckern am Markt und ziert jeden Schreibtisch mit seinem raffinierten zweifarbigen Design. Das W-Modell bietet eine WLAN-Funktionalit\u00e4t auf Knopfdruck und l\u00e4sst sich dank WiFi-Direct \u00fcber die Samsung Mobile Print App auch von mobilen Endger\u00e4ten aus ansprechen. Die Eco Save Taste sorgt bei beiden Modellen f\u00fcr noch weniger Toner-, Papier- und Energieverbrauch.\\n\\n<b>Benutzerfreundliches mobiles Drucken<\/b>\\nDrucken Sie jetzt problemlos, schnell und praktisch von Ihren mobilen Ger\u00e4ten aus Dokumente in Farbe auf Ihrem Samsung Drucker, ohne einen Druckertreiber installieren zu m\u00fcssen.\\n\\n<b>Mobiles Drucken in 3 einfachen Schritten<\/b>\\nAnwendung installieren, Ger\u00e4t ausw\u00e4hlen und Datei drucken.\\n\\n<b>Schnelles mobiles Drucken<\/b>\\nSie k\u00f6nnen problemlos, schnell und praktisch von Ihren mobilen Ger\u00e4ten aus in satten Farben drucken.\\n\\n<b>Wifi-Direct<\/b>\\nMit Wifi-Direct k\u00f6nnen Sie auch ohne Netzwerkumgebung von Ihren mobilen Ger\u00e4ten aus drucken.\\n\\n<b>Genie\u00dfen Sie qualitativ hochwertige Ausdrucke<\/b>\\nSamsungs einzigartige ReCP-Technologie (ReCP steht f\u00fcr \"Rendering Engine for Clean Page\") verbessert die Gesamtqualit\u00e4t und Lebendigkeit Ihres Farbdrucks. Damit wird gew\u00e4hrleistet, dass jeder Ausdruck hervorragend aussieht. Die Farbpunkte werden extrem pr\u00e4zise gesetzt und damit beispielsweise wei\u00dfe R\u00e4nder an Objekten und Schriften vermieden.\\n\\n<b>Polymertoner<\/b>\\nDie Farbpartikel der neuen von Samsung entwickelten Polymertoner sind sehr einheitlich. Sie k\u00f6nnen in hoher Pr\u00e4zision gleichm\u00e4\u00dfiger und d\u00fcnner aufgetragen werden. Das Ergebnis sind klare und lebendige Ausdrucke. Der erh\u00f6hte Wachsgehalt verbessert zudem den Bildglanz und sorgt f\u00fcr h\u00f6here Langlebigkeit, weil unerw\u00fcnschtes Ausbleichen verhindert wird.\\n\\n<b>Einfache Bedienung<\/b>\\nDer f\u00fcr einfachen und intuitiven Einsatz gestaltete CLP-365W spart wertvolle Zeit und M\u00fche.\\n\\n<b>Eco Save Taste<\/b>\\nDie Eco Save Taste hilft Ihnen, sofort Papier und Strom zu sparen. Drucken Sie mehrere Seiten auf einem Blatt, verwenden Sie Graustufen oder \u00fcberspringen Sie leere Seiten.\\n\\n<b>WPS Taste<\/b>\\nStellen Sie mit nur einem Tastendruck eine schnelle und sichere Verbindung zu Ihrem drahtlosen Netzwerk her \u2013 ganz einfach mit der WPS Taste.\\n\\n<b>Keine Sorgen \u2013 dieser Drucker nimmt nicht zu viel Platz weg<\/b>\\nSein ansprechendes und kompaktes Design macht ihn zu einem Schmuckst\u00fcck f\u00fcr jeden Schreibtisch.\\n\\n<b>Geringer Platzbedarf<\/b>\\nMit einem Platzbedarf von nur 38,2 x 30,9 cm ist der CLP-365W einer der weltweit kleinsten Farblaser-Drucker.\\n\\n<b>Ergonomisches Design<\/b>\\nSein ergonomisches Design mit Ebenholz und eisgrauen Farben sorgt f\u00fcr ein modernes und elegantes Arbeitsumfeld.\\n\\n<b>Easy Colour Manager<\/b>\\nErstellen und nutzen Sie eigene Farbprofile mit Samsungs Easy Colour Manager. Damit treffen Sie die richtigen Farben eines Unternehmenslogos oder geben Ihren Ausdrucken einfach das gew\u00fcnschte individuelle Aussehen.\\n\\n<b>Einfache Unterst\u00fctzung von L\u00f6sungen<\/b>\\nDer Drucker wird durch Software unterst\u00fctzt, mit der Sie einfacher als je zuvor ultimative Qualit\u00e4tsdrucke erstellen k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>Easy Eco Treiber<\/b>\\nDer Easy Eco Treiber hilft Ihnen dabei, digitale Dokumente in mehrere Formate umzuwandeln und erleichtert die Weitergabe an Andere \u2013 selbst \u00fcber soziale Netzwerke."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Vivid printing \u2013 even from mobile devices<\/b>\\n- Quick and easy 3-step wireless printing from your mobile;\\n- Print vividly thanks to new polymerised toner;\\n- Save space thanks to compact ergonomic design;\\n- Eco-optimise or connect to WiFi networks.\\n\\nNow you can make sure you print with vibrant colour \u2013 even from mobile devices. The Samsung CLP-365W Colour Laser Printer lets you print wirelessly from smartphones, tabs and other devices in just three simple steps. It\u2019s delivered with stunning print quality thanks to Samsung\u2019s Rendering Engine for Clean Page (ReCP) technology. What\u2019s more, its compact, ergonomic design helps you to save space and make the most of your home or workplace.\\n\\n<b>Easy Mobile Printing<\/b>\\nPrint from all your mobile devices in colour easily, quickly and conveniently without the need for installing any print drivers.\\n\\n<b>Easy 3 step Mobile Printing<\/b>\\nSamsung's easy 3 step mobile print - install application, select device & print file.\\n\\n<b>Fast Mobile Printing<\/b>\\nPrint from all your mobile devices in glorious colour easily, quickly and conveniently.\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi Direct<\/b>\\nWith Wi-Fi Direct, you can print from your mobile devices even in a non-network environment.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy quality printouts<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s unique ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) Technology improves the overall quality and vibrancy of your colour printing, ensuring every printout looks perfect. It automatically sharpens the focus of both graphics and text, while solid objects are overlapped to eliminate white gaps.\\n\\n<b>Polymerized toner<\/b>\\nOur newly developed polymerized toner has smaller and more uniform particles than conventional toner. Meaning, your printouts will have crisper lines and more vivid colours - helping avoid any paper curling. Also, its higher wax content improves the image gloss and enhances the durability preventing unwanted fading.\\n\\n<b>Ergonomic design<\/b>\\nDon't worry about this printer crowding your space. Its beautiful and compact design makes it a pleasure to share a desk with.\\n\\n<b>Small size Footprint<\/b>\\nWith a footprint of just 38.2 x 30.9cm the CLP-365W is one of the world's smallest colour laser printers.\\n\\n<b>Ergonomic design<\/b>\\nIts ergonomic design with ebony brown and ice grey colour creates a modern and elegant work environments.\\n\\n<b>Easy to use<\/b>\\nDesigned for simple and intuitive operation the CLP-365W saves you precious time and effort.\\n\\n<b>One Touch Eco Button<\/b>\\nJust One push of the ECO button and you can save on toner, paper, and energy. Print multiple pages on one sheet, change colour to greyscale or skip blank pages.\\n\\n<b>One Touch Print Screen Button<\/b>\\nPrint exactly what you see on the screen with just one click, saving time.\\n\\n<b>One Touch WPS Button<\/b>\\nConnect quickly and securely to your wireless network with the touch of a button, via the one-touch WPS(Wi-Fi Protected Setup).\\n\\n<b>Easy Colour Manager<\/b>\\nCreate and use your own colour profiles with Samsung's Easy Colour Manager. Match the exact colours of a company logo or simply give your print outs the individual look you want.\\n\\n<b>Easy Solution support<\/b>\\nThe printer also brings you software support designed to put you in control of delivering ultimate quality printouts easier than ever before.\\n\\n<b>Easy Eco Driver<\/b>\\nEasy Eco Driver helps you compile digital documents in multiple formats and makes it easy to share them with others - even through social networks."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Imprimante laser couleur Wi-Fi\\n<br\/><b>Impression de votre mobile simplifi\u00e9e<\/b>\\n<br\/>Avec l'application Samsung Mobile Print plus besoin d'installer des pilotes, vous pouvez imprimer en couleur depuis votre smartphone ou tablette en toute simplicit\u00e9.\\n\\n* 3 \u00e9tapes suffisent\\nInstallez l'application, Selectionnez l'appareil et Imprimez!\\n\\n* Une impression rapide\\nImprimez des couleurs eclatantes simplement, rapidement et efficacement.\\n\\n* Wi-Fi Direct \\nPlus besoin d'un point d'acces central, imprimez \u00e0 distance depuis vos appareils mobiles gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction Wi-Fi Direct. \\n<br\/><b>Une haute qualit\u00e9 couleur<\/b>\\n<br\/>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une haute qualit\u00e9 d'impression gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie couleur ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) de Samsung. Cette technologie novatrice vous permet d'obtenir une meilleure qualit\u00e9 d'image et une meilleure definition des caract\u00e8res pour des r\u00e9sultats nets et pr\u00e9cis.\\n<br\/><b>Toner polym\u00e9ris\u00e9 nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration<\/b>\\n<br\/>Le nouveau toner polym\u00e9ris\u00e9 Samsung contient des particules plus petites et plus uniformes pour des lignes plus nettes et plus pr\u00e9cises. De plus, avec sa formule \u00e0 la cire, il vous garantit durabilit\u00e9 et rendu glossy.\\n<br\/><b>Une imprimante efficace et compacte<\/b>\\n<br\/>Le design et la compacit\u00e9 de l'imprimante laser couleur CLP-365W en feront un compagnon de travail id\u00e9al.\\n\\n*Compacte\\nAvec une dimension de 38.2 x 30.9 cm, la CLP-365W est la plus petite imprimante de sa gamme.\\n\\n*Un design \u00e9pur\u00e9\\nSon design ergonomique et ses couleurs modernes donne une touche de style \u00e0 tout environnement professionnel. \\n<br\/><b>Facile \u00e0 utiliser<\/b>\\n<br\/>Con\u00e7ue pour \u00eatre utiliser de mani\u00e8re simple et intuitive, l'imprimante laser couleur CLP-365W vous permet d'\u00e9conomiser temps et effort. \\n\\n*Bouton Eco\\nEconomisez toner, papier et \u00e9nergie par simple pression sur la touche ECO. Le mode ECO vous permet de g\u00e9rer vos impressions gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression de plusieurs pages par feuille, \u00e0 la gestion d'echelle de gris, ou encore la suppression de pages blanches.\\n\\n*Bouton imprime \u00e9cran\\nCapturez et imprimez ce que vous voyez \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran \u00e0 l'aide de la touche imprime \u00e9cran.\\n\\n*Bouton WPS\\nConnectez votre imprimante en Wi-Fi rapidement et simplement en appuyant sur la touche WPS (Wi-Fi Protected Setup)."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-16T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6d9994b3-3883-4079-8bac-a6d50d504cbc","identifier":"14233963","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF M506"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.37"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Canon LEGRIA HF M506<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Exceptional video quality for every occasion<\/b>\\nThe LEGRIA HF M506 delivers professional quality video with ease whatever the occasion. Featuring Canon\u2019s HD CMOS PRO sensor and Audio Scene Select movies look and sound superb.\\n\\n<b>Benefits<\/b>\\n- Canon HD CMOS PRO sensor;\\n- Optical Intelligent IS;\\n- Audio Scene Select;\\n- 10x HD Video lens, iris diaphragm;\\n- Creative cinematic features;\\n- 7.5cm intuitive touch screen;\\n- Smart Auto (38 scenes), Face Detection, Instant AF;\\n- SDXC card slot.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD CMOS PRO sensor<\/b>\\nThe HD CMOS PRO sensor is designed and made by Canon for its professional camcorders. The light gathering area of the pixels is 160% bigger than conventional CMOS sensors, delivering a wider dynamic range and advanced low-light performance.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to camera shake. It automatically detects the scene and selects exactly the right optical Image Stabilizer settings from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. It ensures sharp, detailed videos in every situation - leaving you free to concentrate on shooting.\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nIt\u2019s simple to make your movies sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select and a high-sensitivity, built-in zoom microphone.. Just select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD Video lens<\/b>\\nA high-quality, Canon HD Video lens with 10x optical zoom features an iris diaphragm for soft background blurring.\\n\\n<b>Creative cinematic features<\/b>\\nUse Story Creator to develop your video skills and effortlessly create memorable short videos with a story - just choose a theme and follow the in-built scene suggestions. Inspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters and add fun effects to your movies without a PC using Touch Decoration. Write messages straight on the Touch-screen with the Stylus Pen, add stamps or active animations like shooting stars and mix in still images.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nOperation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm (3.0\u201d) gesture-based Touch-screen LCD, which gives you intuitive fingertip control of shooting and playback functions.\\n\\n<b>Effortless shooting<\/b>\\nCreating high-quality movies is effortless with Smart Auto. Fully automatic, it intelligently selects shooting settings from 38 scenes \u2013 leaving you free to concentrate on your subject. Face Detection optimises the settings for great people shots and Instant AF ensures fast and accurate focusing.\\n\\n<b>SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nThe LEGRIA HF M506 records Full HD movies direct to an SDXC memory card. Available in a wide range of sizes, the cards are easy to carry and ideal for sharing."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"05ba4387-c92c-41e1-8b15-ff7366430515","identifier":"14259747","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung NX NX20"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die Samsung NX20 schafft die perfekte Balance zwischen Aufl\u00f6sung, Performance und Design und weckt den professionellen Fotografen in uns allen. Mit dem empfindlichen APS-C CMOS-Sensor mit 20,3 MP und der Verschlusszeit von 1\/8.000 k\u00f6nnen Sie in einem Sekundenbruchteil sehr detaillierte Fotos mit hoher Aufl\u00f6sung machen. Dank des Clear AMOLED-Schwenkdisplays k\u00f6nnen Sie bequem aus jedem Blickwinkel fotografieren. Und die WLAN-Konnektivit\u00e4t befreit Sie von dem \u00fcblichen Kabelsalat.\\n\\n<b>20,3 MP APS-C-Sensor<\/b>\\nDer brandneue und professionelle 20,3 MP APS-C CMOS-Sensor wurde f\u00fcr das NX-System angepasst und liefert Bilder, die mit den Aufnahmen jeder Premium DSLR mithalten k\u00f6nnen. Jedes einzelne Pixel hat einen gro\u00dfen Sensorbereich und erh\u00e4lt somit mehr Licht. Das gew\u00e4hrleistet weniger Bildrauschen, einen hohen Dynamikbereich (HDR) und genaue Farbunterscheidung. Mit der hohen Empfindlichkeit k\u00f6nnen Sie auch bei schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen fotografieren, ohne dass k\u00f6rnige oder unscharfe Bilder entstehen. Der neue Sensor bietet au\u00dferdem Full HD-Videoausgabefunktionen.\\n\\n<b>Die Geschwindigkeit im Griff<\/b>\\n\\n<b>1\/8.000 Verschlusszeit<\/b>\\nDie Verschlusszeit kann den gravierenden Unterschied dazwischen bedeuten, ob Sie die geniale Aufnahme rechtzeitig machen oder diese einmalige Gelegenheit verpassen. Die NX20 mit der Verschlusszeit von 1\/8.000 gibt Ihnen die M\u00f6glichkeit, wie ein Profi zu fotografieren: mit verschiedenen Geschwindigkeiten und unterschiedlichen Belichtungswerten. Die Blende der NX20 passt sich sogar automatisch an Umweltfaktoren wie Temperatur und Kameraausrichtung an. Und der elektronisch gesteuerte Schlitzverschluss verringert Belichtungsfehler.\\n\\n<b>Eine Kamera f\u00fcr schnelle<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Bilder schnell erfassen<\/b>\\nAufgrund der F\u00e4higkeit der NX20, Bilder extrem schnell zu erfassen, k\u00f6nnen Sie fl\u00fcchtige Moment und sich schnell bewegende Objekte ohne separates Sensormodul einfangen. Das NX-System bietet einen extrem schnellen Autofokus, der es mit nahezu jeder Systemkamera aufnehmen kann. Der Autofokus ist durch den brandneuen und fortschrittlichen Algorithmus noch schneller und genauer. Die NX20 kann f\u00fcr bessere Fotoserien mit 8 Frames je Sekunde fotografieren und die Ausl\u00f6severz\u00f6gerung wurde auf 40 ms verringert.\\n\\n<b>1080p Full HD Stereo Movie-Aufnahmen<\/b>\\nMit den 1080 30p Full HD-Aufnahmem\u00f6glichkeiten verwandelt die NX20 das Filmen von Videos mit einer Standbildkamera in eine Kunstform. Sie haben die Wahl zwischen vielen Blickwinkeln und Zoom-Einstellungen. Der spiegellose CMOS-Bildsensor bietet auch w\u00e4hrend der Aufnahme genausten Autofokus. F\u00fcr ein wahres Kinoerlebnis wurde das NX-System exklusiv f\u00fcr Full HD-Video mit einem 18 \u2013 200 mm Objektiv ausgestattet.\\n\\n<b>WLAN-Konnektivit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nMit der WLAN-Konnektivit\u00e4t der NX20 k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihre Digitalkamera mit einem WLAN-Netzwerk verbinden. Sie k\u00f6nnen Fotos und Videos w\u00e4hrend der Aufnahmen direkt auf einen Computer oder bei einem Cloud-Dienst speichern, per E-Mail senden, drahtlos drucken oder direkt auf Facebook\u2122 oder YouTube hochladen. Sie m\u00fcssen sich keine Gedanken machen, eine tolle Aufnahme zu verlieren, nicht gen\u00fcgend Speicher zu haben oder das richtige Kabel mitzunehmen.\\n\\n<b>Clear AMOLED-Schwenkdisplay<\/b>\\nMit dem Clear AMOLED-Schwenkdisplay k\u00f6nnen Sie Bilder genau in Szene setzen und aus nahezu jedem Blickwinkel fotografieren. Im Vergleich zum TFT-LCD der meisten Digitalkameras bietet das AMOLED-Display der NX20 auch bei direktem Sonnenlicht tieferes Schwarz und lebendigere, naturgetreuere Farben. Sie wissen sofort, ob das die gew\u00fcnschte Aufnahme wird. Das Display schont au\u00dferdem den Akku, damit Sie l\u00e4nger fotografieren k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>SVGA EVF<\/b>\\nEin wichtiges Merkmal der NX20 ist der integrierte elektronische Sucher (Electronic View Finder, EVF). Im Gegensatz zu den meisten Kameras dieser Klasse bietet die NX20 Fotografen bei gro\u00dfen und kleinen Entfernungen ein Fenster zur Realit\u00e4t. Jetzt k\u00f6nnen Sie also jede Aufnahme perfekt in Szene setzen und haben das Ergebnis sofort im Blick."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung NX20, NX. Megapixel: 20.3, Camera type: MILC, Sensor type: CMOS. Lens mount interface: Samsung NX. Auto focusing (AF) modes: Continuous Auto Focus, Single Auto Focus. ISO sensitivity: 100, 200, 400, 800, 3200, 6400, 12800, Auto, Light exposure modes: Aperture priority AE, Auto, Shutter priority AE, Light exposure correction: \u00b1 3EV (1\/3EV step). Camera shutter speed (min): 0.000125, Camera shutter type: Electronic"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6cf01dfb-0ace-4b58-b61e-e6276131bc1e","identifier":"14259834","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLX-6260FR multifunctional"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"27.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>CLX-6260FR Colour Laser Printer<\/b>\\n- Fast and economical colour printing;\\n- 4-in-1 Multifunction;\\n- Now every workgroup can enjoy professional colour output;\\n- Make sharp images and text even sharper.\\n\\n<b>Fast and economical colour printing<\/b>\\nBusinesses today need to know that they can produce a high level of printing quickly, and in a cost-effective way. The CLX-6260FR not only delivers brilliant colour quality, but can scan, copy and fax for extra convenience. Plus, a fast Dual CPU, gigabit network support and instant fusing technology ensures enhanced speed and less waiting time. Yet what sets it apart economically is the range of cost-effective and innovative features, such as high yield toner, low energy consumption and eco-friendly settings. It makes this medium workgroup printer as cost conscious as they come.\\n\\n<b>4-in-1 Multifunction<\/b>\\nWith 4-in-1 versatility, the Samsung CLX-6260FR printer streamlines workflow and ensures that the office print operation is working as efficient as possible. With print, copy, scan and fax functionality, the CLX-6260FR offers flexibility and lets you work with less barriers. A host of innovative features like ID Copy, N-up copy, Scan-to-email and the convenient PC fax functionality ensure that your workforce has the necessary functionality needed to thrive in the modern world of business.\\n\\n<b>Now every workgroup can enjoy professional colour output<\/b>\\nWhatever size your team, and however busy you are, you can rely on the CLX-6260FR to constantly deliver professional, quality colour output. Because anything less isn\u2019t good enough.\\n\\n<b>Make sharp images and text even sharper<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s unique ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) Technology improves the overall quality and vibrancy of your colour printing, ensuring every printout looks perfect. It automatically sharpens the focus of both graphics and text, while solid objects are overlapped to eliminate white gaps.\\n\\n<b>Make colours more vibrant<\/b>\\nOur newly developed polymerised toner has smaller and more uniform particles than conventional toner. Your printouts will have crisper lines and more vivid colours, in addition to eliminating paper curling. Also, its higher wax content improves the image gloss and enhances the durability preventing unwanted fading.\\n\\n<b>High power printing performance<\/b>\\nWhatever the size of your print job, the CLX-6260FR will shine with an impressive 17 seconds First Print Out Time, and a speedy 24 pages per minute after that. This means you can focus on what's important rather than wait for your prints.\\n\\n<b>More power, higher productivity<\/b>\\nSome days it seems like the printing never ends. With the CLX-6260FR's 533 MHz Dual CPU, and 512MB standard memory (expandable up to 1GB) you can be sure that this printer will handle the entire load of your workgroup's need.\\n\\n<b>Speedy and flexible paper handling<\/b>\\nIf you want to print or copy onto heavier weights of paper, you can. Weights of up to 220g\/m2 are handled with ease through the 50 page multipurpose tray as well as the 250 page standard cassette. Plus, with the optional 520 sheet second cassette you can increase your total paper input capacity to 820 sheets. That way you can also use up to three different media types without the need to waste time changing paper.\\n\\nYou can enhance your productivity further still with the 50 page document feeder that can process single as well as double sided documents automatically.\\n\\n<b>Professional colour printing made easy for you<\/b>\\nWith the CLX-6260FR you can increase your entire workgroup\u2019s workflow with a range of easy-to-use features and ingenious time-saving support software that helps free you to work smarter and faster.\\n\\n<b>Convenient USB printing<\/b>\\nWith the USB Direct slot located on the front of the device just below the operating panel, you can print from, or scan to, a USB key right from the device, without the need of a computer.\\n\\n<b>Secure, confidential printing<\/b>\\nIf you need to print sensitive data through your printer, you can relax. You can now ensure personal print jobs remain personal. Just enter a password, and you can retrieve a print job at your convenience, away from any prying eyes. And with the integrated numeric key pad it's easier than ever!\\n\\n<b>Low cost, low impact on the world<\/b>\\nSave toner, paper and energy with ease - it's good for the environment and it's good for your business' profits. Being economical and printing vibrant colour documents goes hand in hand with the CLX-6260FR.\\n\\n<b>Extra high yield means extra low costs<\/b>\\nEnjoy professional colour copies and print-outs while staying in complete control of your total cost of ownership. Our specially developed higher yield cartridges means more time between changes and less expense with each print out.\\n\\n<b>Cut costs with duplex printing and copying<\/b>\\nWith the integrated duplex feature, saving paper has never been easier. That\u2019s because the paper is turned automatically so that you can print on both sides. It could add up to an amazing saving of up to 50% on your paper consumption.\\n\\n<b>Save money the eco way<\/b>\\nEvery business sees the need to cut costs wherever it can. With the ECO button and the smart eco driver functions it's easier than ever. Print more on each page with the N-up and duplex functionality, skip blank pages or print in greyscale instead of full colour. With the result simulator you can even see how much CO2, power and paper you've saved.\\n\\n<b>Low Power Consumption<\/b>\\nDespite its impressive list of features and functions, the CLX-6260FR consumes less energy than most of its competitors. Its innovative polymerised toner requires lower fusing temperatures, the instant fusing technology saves warm up time before first print, and our new Dual CPU make it one of the greenest devices around today.\\n\\n<b>Easy Solution support<\/b>\\nThe printer also brings you software support designed to put you in control of delivering ultimate quality printouts easier than ever before.\\n\\n<b>Easy Eco Driver<\/b>\\nEasy Eco Driver helps you compile digital documents in multiple formats and makes it easy to share them with others - even through social networks.\\n\\n<b>Get the right result before printing<\/b>\\nThe Samsung Easy Colour Manager allows you to adjust the colour balance, saturation, brightness or contrast of any image prior to printing. Perfect for matching the exact colours of your company logo every time.\\n\\n<b>Take the stress out of print management<\/b>\\nFor maximum control, Easy Printer Manager lets you manage all your devices from one location. Check device and toner status\u2019, re-order toner, change device settings or set alerts \u2013 even through e-mail.\\n\\n<b>Make life simple with Easy Document Creator<\/b>\\nThis useful application is to help users scan, compile, and save documents in multiple formats, including .epub. These documents can then be shared via social networking sites or fax. Ideal if you\u2019re sharing notes from an important meeting.\\n\\n<b>Mobile Printing<\/b>\\nWith amazing Samsung Mobile Printing solution, you don\u2019t have install any drivers to your mobile devices. Simply Just Install Samsung Mobile Print application on your mobile devices, and you can print directly from your mobile device.\\n\\n<b>Easy toner replacement<\/b>\\nGone are the days of fiddly, dirty and time-consuming toner cartridge changes. It\u2019s all made easier with a push loading drawer. What\u2019s more, the high yield cartridges mean fewer changes."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Imprimante laser couleur CLP-775ND<\/b>\\n- Des impressions couleur rapides et \u00e9conomiques;\\n- Multifonction 4-en-1;\\n- Tous les groupes de travail b\u00e9n\u00e9ficient d\u00e9sormais d\u2019impressions couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle;\\n- Make sharp images and text even sharper.\\n\\n<b>Des impressions couleur rapides et \u00e9conomiques<\/b>\\nLes entreprises doivent savoir qu\u2019il est aujourd\u2019hui possible de produire des impressions de qualit\u00e9 \u00e9lev\u00e9e de mani\u00e8re rapide et \u00e9conomique. L\u2019imprimante CLX-6260FR produit non seulement une qualit\u00e9 de couleurs exceptionnelle, mais combine \u00e9galement des fonctions de num\u00e9risation, photocopie et t\u00e9l\u00e9copie pour plus de praticit\u00e9. En outre, le biprocesseur v\u00e9loce, la prise en charge de la connectivit\u00e9 r\u00e9seau Gigabit et la technologie de fusion instantan\u00e9e offrent une vitesse accrue et un temps d'attente r\u00e9duit. Ce qui la distingue toutefois sur le plan \u00e9conomique est son \u00e9ventail de fonctions innovantes et \u00e9conomes, telles que l\u2019optimisation du toner, la faible consommation d\u2019\u00e9nergie et les fonctionnalit\u00e9s respectueuses de l'environnement. Cette imprimante pour les groupes de travail de taille moyenne r\u00e9pond d\u00e8s le d\u00e9part aux besoins des utilisateurs soucieux de leurs porte-monnaie.\\n\\n<b>Multifonction 4-en-1<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une polyvalence 4-en-1, l\u2019imprimante Samsung CLX-6260FR simplifie le flux op\u00e9rationnel et garantit des impressions professionnelles aussi efficaces que possible. Avec ses fonctions d\u2019impression, de copie, de num\u00e9risation et de fax, l\u2019imprimante CLX-6260FR vous offre une flexibilit\u00e9 totale et vous permet de travailler plus librement. En outre, plusieurs fonctionnalit\u00e9s innovantes telles que la copie de pi\u00e8ces d\u2019identit\u00e9, la copie multiple, la num\u00e9risation vers la messagerie \u00e9lectronique et la fonction pratique de t\u00e9l\u00e9copie vers l\u2019ordinateur vous assurent que vos employ\u00e9s disposeront des fonctionnalit\u00e9s n\u00e9cessaires pour \u00e9voluer dans le monde professionnel moderne.\\n\\nTous les groupes de travail b\u00e9n\u00e9ficient d\u00e9sormais d\u2019impressions couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle\\nQuels que soient votre emploi du temps ou la taille de votre \u00e9quipe, vous pouvez compter sur l\u2019imprimante CLX-6260FR pour fournir \u00e0 tout moment des impressions couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle. Contentez-vous du meilleur.\\n\\n<b>Des images et du texte encore plus nets<\/b>\\nLa technologie ReCP (moteur de restitution d\u2019une page nette) unique de Samsung am\u00e9liore la qualit\u00e9 globale de vos impressions couleur et apporte \u00e0 chacune vitalit\u00e9 et perfection. La nettet\u00e9 est automatiquement accrue sur les images et le texte, tandis que les objets solides se chevauchent pour \u00e9liminer les espaces blancs.\\n\\n<b>Des couleurs encore plus vives<\/b>\\nNotre nouveau toner polym\u00e9ris\u00e9 utilise des particules plus petites et plus uniformes que les toners conventionnels. Par cons\u00e9quent, les lignes de vos impressions sont plus nettes, les couleurs plus vives et le papier n\u2019ondule plus. De plus, sa haute teneur en cire am\u00e9liore la brillance de l'image et augmente la durabilit\u00e9 en \u00e9vitant le fondu ind\u00e9sirable.\\n\\n<b>Des performances d\u2019impression sup\u00e9rieures<\/b>\\nPeu importe le volume, l\u2019imprimante CLX-6260FR vous offre un d\u00e9lai d\u2019impression de la premi\u00e8re page de 17 secondes puis 24 pages par minute pour des \u00e9conomies de temps. Vous pouvez alors vous concentrer sur ce qui est r\u00e9ellement important, plut\u00f4t que d\u2019attendre vos documents.\\n\\n<b>Plus de puissance pour une meilleure productivit\u00e9<\/b>\\nL\u2019impression de documents ne requiert pas forc\u00e9ment beaucoup de patience. Avec un double processeur 533 MHz et une m\u00e9moire standard de 512 Mo (extensible jusqu\u2019\u00e0 1 Go), vous pouvez compter sur l'imprimante CLX-6260FR pour une gestion optimale de tous les besoins en trafic de votre groupe de travail.\\n\\n<b>Rapidit\u00e9 et souplesse de la gestion du papier<\/b>\\nVous souhaitez imprimer ou photocopier des documents sur du papier \u00e9pais. Aucun souci. Les grammages atteignant jusqu'\u00e0 220 g\/m2 sont g\u00e9r\u00e9s en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9 dans le bac polyvalent de 50 pages ainsi que dans le bac standard de 250 pages. En outre, le bac suppl\u00e9mentaire en option de 250 feuilles vous permet d'augmenter la capacit\u00e9 totale d'alimentation papier jusqu\u2019\u00e0 820 feuilles. Vous pouvez ainsi utiliser pas moins de trois types de support diff\u00e9rents sans perdre votre temps \u00e0 changer le papier.\\n\\nAllez encore plus loin dans l\u2019optimisation de votre productivit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au chargeur de documents de 50 pages. Il traite \u00e0 la fois les documents une et double face, et ce automatiquement.\\n\\n<b>Des impressions couleur professionnelles \u00e0 votre port\u00e9e<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019imprimante CLX-6260FR, vous pouvez augmenter le flux de production de l'ensemble de votre groupe de travail au travers d\u2019une s\u00e9lection de fonctions conviviales et d\u2019un logiciel d\u2019assistance ing\u00e9nieux permettant de gagner du temps. Vous travaillez ainsi plus intelligemment et plus rapidement.\\n\\n<b>Impression pratique par USB<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019emplacement USB Direct situ\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019avant de l\u2019appareil, juste au-dessous du panneau de commande, vous pouvez lancer des impressions directement depuis une cl\u00e9 USB, ou y transf\u00e9rer des num\u00e9risations, le tout sans ordinateur.\\n\\n<b>Impression s\u00e9curis\u00e9e et confidentielle<\/b>\\nIf you need to print sensitive data through your printer, you can relax. You can now ensure personal print jobs remain personal. Just enter a password, and you can retrieve a print job at your convenience, away from any prying eyes. And with the integrated numeric key pad it's easier than ever!\\n\\n<b>Un tr\u00e8s haut rendement signifie des co\u00fbts tr\u00e8s faibles<\/b>\\nProfitez d\u2019impressions couleur professionnelles tout en ma\u00eetrisant le co\u00fbt total de possession. Nos cartouches sp\u00e9ciales \u00e0 haut rendement sont synonymes de remplacements moins fr\u00e9quents et vous font r\u00e9aliser des \u00e9conomies \u00e0 chaque impression.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez les co\u00fbts gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression et la copie recto verso<\/b>\\nAvec la fonction int\u00e9gr\u00e9e d\u2019impression recto verso, \u00e9conomiser du papier n\u2019a jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 aussi facile. Le principe est simple : le papier est retourn\u00e9 automatiquement afin de pouvoir imprimer des deux c\u00f4t\u00e9s. Vous pouvez ainsi diviser par deux votre consommation de papier.\\n\\n<b>Economisez de l'argent tout en pr\u00e9servant l'environnement<\/b>\\nChaque entreprise a besoin de r\u00e9duire ses co\u00fbts \u00e0 tous les niveaux. Gr\u00e2ce au bouton ECO et aux fonctions du pilote Smart Eco, r\u00e9aliser des \u00e9conomies est un vrai jeu d\u2019enfant. Effectuez des impressions plus efficaces avec les fonctions N-up (plusieurs pages par feuille) et recto verso, ignorez les pages vierges ou imprimez en niveaux de gris plut\u00f4t qu\u2019en couleur. Gr\u00e2ce au simulateur de r\u00e9sultats, vous pouvez m\u00eame conna\u00eetre les quantit\u00e9s de CO2, d'\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 ou de papier que vous avez \u00e9conomis\u00e9es.\\n\\n<b>Faible consommation d'\u00e9nergie<\/b>\\nM\u00eame avec une liste de fonctionnalit\u00e9s impressionnante, l'imprimante CLX-6260FR consomme moins d\u2019\u00e9nergie que la plupart des mod\u00e8les concurrents. Son toner polym\u00e9ris\u00e9 innovant n\u00e9cessite des temp\u00e9ratures de fusion moins \u00e9lev\u00e9es, la technologie de fusion instantan\u00e9e permet de s\u2019affranchir du pr\u00e9chauffage pr\u00e9alable \u00e0 la premi\u00e8re impression et tout cela combin\u00e9 \u00e0 notre nouveau biprocesseur en fait l\u2019un des p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques les plus \u00e9cologiques sur le march\u00e9 actuel.\\n\\n<b>Easy Eco Driver<\/b>\\nLa fonction Easy Eco Driver vous aide \u00e0 compiler des documents num\u00e9riques dans de nombreux formats et facilite leur partage avec d\u2019autres personnes, m\u00eame via les r\u00e9seaux sociaux."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e2bd15f7-4bf4-4736-9a1a-f8a5b5358590","identifier":"14259892","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung HG32EA590LS"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The innovative LED technology with Samsung Smart Widget Solution\\nThe Samsung LED Series 79\/59 has raised the standard for premium Hospitality Displays. Combining the latest in LED technology with an elegant eye-catching design, it will become the focal point of your rooms.\\nWith the image enhancing Slim LED technology and the latest in 3D imaging technology, the Series 79 delivers the highest image quality while providing your guests with an immersive 3D entertainment experience. Smart Hub and Smart Widget solution offer your guests an extra level of engagement and flexibility."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-18T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"30a70c23-b56d-46c8-950b-4849c4492103","identifier":"14259894","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung HG40EA590LS"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The innovative LED technology with Samsung Smart Widget Solution\\nThe Samsung LED Series 79\/59 has raised the standard for premium Hospitality Displays. Combining the latest in LED technology with an elegant eye-catching design, it will become the focal point of your rooms.\\nWith the image enhancing Slim LED technology and the latest in 3D imaging technology, the Series 79 delivers the highest image quality while providing your guests with an immersive 3D entertainment experience. Smart Hub and Smart Widget solution offer your guests an extra level of engagement and flexibility.\\n\\n<b>Key specification<\/b>\\n- Smart Hub \/ Smart Widget solution compatibility\\n- Soft AP\\n- AllShare (DLNA)\\n- REACH & SIRCH\\n- Built-in Wi-fi\\n- HBB TV\\n- DVB-T \/ C \/ S2\\n- Swivel stand 20\u00ba\/60\u00ba\/90\u00ba\\n- Soundbar compatibility\\n- Multi-code remote control"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-18T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c968ff6a-9d03-4a56-adf3-3d9bdbcf426f","identifier":"14287313","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony SLT-A37K"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sophisticated shooter.<\/b>\\n\\nFlex your photographic prowess and capture the moment perfectly with Sony's exclusive Translucent Mirror Technology DSLR. Experience superior performance whether you're shooting HD movie masterpieces or composing crystal clear still images. Tele-zoom High Speed Shooting of up to 7 frames per second works with continuous auto focus that gets visibly faster in Live View and HD Movie modes.\\n\\n<b>Photography as an Art<\/b>\\n\\nGet serious about taking your photography skills to the next level with the compact dimensions and highly sophisticated technology of an a37 camera. Bring it everywhere you go, explore creative photographic techniques and start transforming special moments into truly stunning images.\\n\\n<b>Maintain Your Focus<\/b>\\n\\nThe secret to the small bodies and huge performance advantages of Sony A-mount cameras is Translucent Mirror Technology, which simultaneously directs light to the image sensor and AF sensor at all times to realize accelerated, high-precision full-time continuous phase-detection autofocusing.\\n\\n<b>Professional Class Shooting Speeds<\/b>\\n\\nIt's never been easier to capture a game-changing soccer kick or the look of surprise on their face when you're shooting at 7 frames per second in the Tele-zoom Continuous Advance Priority AE mode. By utilizing Full-time Continuous AF you're ensured accurate tracking and clear focusing in every frame. This mode also magnifies the center of the action 1.4x to bring your subjects closer at a clear 8-megapixel resolution.\\n\\n<b>Tiltable Clear Photo LCD<\/b>\\n\\nTilt the Clear Photo LCD screen for the flexibility to view almost any kind of scene with clarity. Easily shoot from high perspectives by holding the camera up and tilting the screen down towards yourself. Or try setting the camera on the ground and tilting the screen up \u2014 you'll have a clear view perfect for framing your subjects.\\n\\n<b>Portfolio-Worthy Portraits<\/b>\\n\\nNow it's easy to create portraits with a truly professional look. Auto Portrait Framing uses face detection technology and the \"rule of thirds\" principle to produce optimally trimmed portraits. These sharp, beautifully balanced images feature the same number of pixels as your originals (which are also saved), thanks to By Pixel Super Resolution Technology.\\n\\n<b>Compose With Creativity<\/b>\\n\\nEnjoy the point-and-shoot convenience of various automatic features including Superior Auto mode, which detects and analyzes shooting conditions, adjusts camera settings accordingly, and activates advanced functions when necessary to achieve optimal results. 8 Scene Selection modes also optimize image quality for the type of scene you shoot."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f3f8d36a-2337-46b5-89db-ee5552f77bf1","identifier":"14288066","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon EOS 600D + EF-S 18-55mm"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"With class-leading 18-megapixel resolution, user-friendly design, and the entire EOS family of lenses and accessories at your disposal, the EOS 600D lets nothing stand in the way of your photography.\\n- 18-megapixel CMOS sensor\\n- Scene Intelligent Auto mode\\n- Full-HD EOS Movie\\n- On-screen Feature Guide\\n- 3.7fps continuous shooting\\n- Wide-area 9-point AF\\n- 1,040k-dot vari-angle 7.7cm (3.0\u201d) screen\\n- Basic+ and Creative Filters\\n- Built-in wireless flash control.\\n\\n<b>18 MP APS-C CMOS sensor<\/b>\\nAn APS-C sized, 18-megapixel CMOS sensor captures images that are packed with detail and clarity. Such high-resolution allows large print sizes and the flexibility to crop pictures for alternative compositions.\\n\\n<b>ISO 100-6400 sensitivity<\/b>\\nAn ISO range of 100-6400, extendable to ISO 12,800, enables high-quality hand-held shooting in low-light conditions, without the need for flash.\\n\\n<b>14-bit image processing<\/b>\\nAt the heart of the Canon EOS 600D is a 14-bit DIGIC 4 image processor that provides exceptional colour reproduction, smooth tonal gradation and tight control over noise.\\n\\n<b>Scene Intelligent Auto mode<\/b>\\nScene Intelligent Auto analyzes each scene in detail and picks the right camera settings each and every time, leaving you free to concentrate on what\u2019s important \u2013 your photography.\\n\\n<b>On-screen Feature Guide<\/b>\\nThe EOS 600D\u2019s on-screen Feature Guide provides descriptions of many of the camera\u2019s functions, as well as advice on how to use them.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD EOS Movie<\/b>\\nShoot Full-HD video with manual control over frame rate, exposure and sound. Video Snapshot technology allows short clips of 2, 4 or 8 sec to be merged into a single movie file, for footage that looks like it was edited professionally, while Movie Digital Zoom permits 3-10x magnification while retaining Full-HD quality.\\n\\n<b>9-point wide-area AF and iFCL metering<\/b>\\nNine AF points, including one central cross-type sensor, spread out across the frame for swift, accurate focusing, even with off-centre subjects. 63-zone iFCL metering ensures accurate exposures time after time.\\n\\n<b>1,040k-dot vari-angle 7.7cm (3.0\u201d) screen<\/b>\\nShoot from unique angles with a 7.7cm (3.0\u201d) 3:2 Clear View LCD screen, containing 1,040,000 dots for increased clarity.\\n\\n<b>Basic+<\/b>\\nBasic+ technology allows photographers to customize basic auto settings according to lighting conditions or ambience.\\n\\n<b>Creative Filter Effects<\/b>\\nCreative Filter Effects can be applied to Raw and JPEG files post capture, including Toy Camera, Soft Focus, Miniature, Grainy Black & White and Fish Eye simulations.\\n\\n<b>Built-in wireless flash control<\/b>\\nAn integrated wireless Speedlite flash controller and Easy Wireless technology allow off-camera TTL flash without the need for extra accessories.\\n\\n<b>Use with all EF and EF-S lenses<\/b>\\nThe EOS 600D is supported by the complete system: flashguns, remote releases and over 60 lenses trusted by professional photographers the world over."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a318c84e-adad-48e5-9852-8761b9e3b209","identifier":"14290208","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE46ES6530S"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":46,"unit":"INCH"}}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Apps genie\u00dfen, mit Skype telefonieren, im Internet surfen und vieles mehr<\/b>\\n\\nEntdecken Sie eine neue Welt von M\u00f6glichkeiten mit der neuen Version des Samsung Smart Hubs. Mit Family Story verbinden Sie Ihre Familie. Es lassen sich Familientreffen planen, gemeinsam geschossene Bilder teilen und sogar Nachrichten lassen sich einfach austauschen. In der Zwischenzeit k\u00f6nnen sich die Kinder mit der Kid\u2019s Story unterhalten und dabei spielend lernen. Und auch die gemeinsame Fitness verbindet die Familie. Mit dem Fitness Hub k\u00f6nnen Sie mit Hilfe von Fitness Videos spielend abnehmen und Ihre Erfolge am gro\u00dfen Fernseher betrachten. In den Ruhepausen k\u00f6nnen Sie dann mit Apps wie der ORF TVthek entspannt abschalten und in Ruhe das Programm genie\u00dfen.\\n\\n<b>Entdecken Sie eine neue Realit\u00e4t in Full HD<\/b>\\n\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie mehr Realismus als je zuvor. Dank der Aufl\u00f6sung, die doppelt so hoch wie bei anderen HD-Fernsehern ist, liefert Ihr Smart TV von Samsung einen atemberaubenden Bildgenuss, in den Sie vollst\u00e4ndig abtauchen k\u00f6nnen. Entdecken Sie Ihre Lieblingssendungen in einem komplett neuen Bild mit lebendigeren Farben und einem reichhaltigerem Full-HD Bild als je zuvor.\\n\\n<b>Strahlendere Farben f\u00fcr ein besseres Bild<\/b>\\n\\nDank der Benutzung eines weiterentwickelten Algorithums zur Verbesserung der Bilddarstellung bringt Ihnen Samsung\u2019s Wide Color Enhancer Plus eine deutlich bessere Bildqualit\u00e4t und zeigt Ihnen damit sogar bis jetzt versteckte Details. Sehen Sie die Farben mit dem Wide Color Enhancer Plus so wie sie sein sollten.\\n\\n<b>Filme direkt vom USB ansehen<\/b>\\n\\nDank ConnectShare Movie k\u00f6nnen Sie einfach Ihren USB-Stick an Ihren Fernseher anschlie\u00dfen und sofort Filme, Fotos oder Musik genie\u00dfen. Erleben Sie eine Vielzahl verschiedenster Inhalte bequem auf Ihrem Fernseher im Wohnzimmer.\\n\\n<b>Design das gef\u00e4llt<\/b>\\n\\nOne Design von Samsung verbessert nicht nur den Bildgenuss, sondern versch\u00f6nert auch Ihr zu Hause. Mit One Design verschmilzt der Rahmen noch mehr mit dem eigentlichen Bild und bringt damit ein nahtloses Fernseherlebnis.\\n\\n<b>Kabellos auf das Internet zugreifen<\/b>\\n\\nMit dem eingebauten WLAN k\u00f6nnen Sie alle Inhalte genie\u00dfen und das kabellos. Der Platz Ihres Fernsehers h\u00e4ngt damit nicht mehr vom n\u00e4chsten verf\u00fcgbaren Anschluss ab. Mit der \u201eOne Foot Verbindung\u201c k\u00f6nnen Sie ausserdem Ger\u00e4te die sich ca. 25 cm vom Fernseher befinden verbinden und das ohne jegliche Kabel oder Passworteingaben.\\n\\n<b>Bleiben Sie in Kontakt mit Skype Videokonferenzen und genie\u00dfen Sie Ihr gegen\u00fcber in voller Gr\u00f6\u00dfe am TV<\/b>\\n\\nMit Skype App f\u00fcr Samsungs Smart TV ist es ein Einfaches mit Freunden und Familie \u00fcberall auf der Welt in Kontakt zu bleiben. In Kombination mit dem Skype Kamera Kit k\u00f6nnen Sie ganz einfach mit Personen \u00fcberall auf der Welt Videokonferenzen abhalten und das zu niedrigen Raten oder sogar kostenlos. In der App k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihren bisherigen Skype Account nutzen oder auch einen Neuen erstellen und dann direkt in Kontakt mit Ihren Freunden tretten und das von Angesicht zu Angesicht.\\n\\n<b>Ihre pers\u00f6nliche Medienbibliothek<\/b>\\n\\nSpeichern Sie Ihre Lieblingsfilme und Serien ganz einfach auf Ihrem TV und greifen Sie immer darauf zu. Dazu m\u00fcssen Sie nur eine Festplatte oder einen USB Speicher an Ihren Fernseher anschlie\u00dfen und schon wird dieser zu Ihrer pers\u00f6nlichen Medienbibliothek.\\n\\n<b>Kabelloser Zugang zu Ihren Inhalten<\/b>\\n\\nGreifen Sie von von \u00fcberall auf Ihre Inhalte zu. Mit AllShare Play k\u00f6nnen Sie Filme streamen, Fotos \u00fcbertragen und Musik anh\u00f6ren und das von allen kompatiblen Ger\u00e4ten in Ihrer N\u00e4he. Mit der Cloud Technoloie bekommen Sie ausserdem noch mehr Freiheit, denn damit k\u00f6nnen Sie von \u00fcberall mit dem Internet auf die in der Cloud gespeicherten Inhalte zugreifen. Ihre Lieblingsinhalte k\u00f6nnen Sie jetzt \u00fcberall benutzen \u2013 egal ob zu Hause oder unterwegs.\\n\\n<b>Das umfassende Multimediaerlebnis in Ihrem Wohnzimmer<\/b>\\n\\nMithilfe der HDMI-Eing\u00e4nge (High Definition Multimedia Interface) wird Ihr Fernseher von Samsung Ihr Wohnzimmer in ein Zentrum f\u00fcr Multimediaunterhaltung verwandeln. HDMI \u00fcbertr\u00e4gt digitale HD-Daten mit hohen Geschwindigkeiten von mehreren Ger\u00e4ten direkt auf Ihren Fernseher.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE46ES6530S. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Power consumption (standby): 0.1, Energy efficiency class: A, Input voltage: 220 - 240. Width: 1065.8, Depth: 48.1, Height: 631.5"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-21T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a1e06a31-ad8f-4726-9d6c-83ef56337bed","identifier":"1432720","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","toshiba"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba Gigashot K40H"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"0.9"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Picture this. Small made smaller, light made lighter and bright made brighter. Now picture them all in high definition, helping you capture memories in the palm of your hand. Introducing the Toshiba Gigashot K Series, one of the smallest, lightest and most versatile HD digital camcorders in the world."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Donnez vie \u00e0 vos films sans effort gr\u00e2ce au Gigashot S\u00e9rie K de Toshiba. Profitant de bon nombre des avantages du Gigashot S\u00e9rie A, il marque l'arriv\u00e9e de la nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration dans le domaine de la vid\u00e9o HD. Profitez d\u00e9sormais d'une qualit\u00e9 irr\u00e9prochable sans compromis !"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-02-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3502472b-7458-4442-8080-5e3203fcab2d","identifier":"1432722","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","toshiba"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba Gigashot K80H"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"0.9"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Picture this. Small made smaller, light made lighter and bright made brighter. Now picture them all in high definition, helping you capture memories in the palm of your hand. Introducing the Toshiba Gigashot K Series, one of the smallest, lightest and most versatile HD digital camcorders in the world."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Donnez vie \u00e0 vos films sans effort gr\u00e2ce au Gigashot S\u00e9rie K de Toshiba. Profitant de bon nombre des avantages du Gigashot S\u00e9rie A, il marque l'arriv\u00e9e de la nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration dans le domaine de la vid\u00e9o HD. Profitez d\u00e9sormais d'une qualit\u00e9 irr\u00e9prochable sans compromis !"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-02-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"68ebb33f-eef8-45cb-bf0a-3ee459150508","identifier":"14332879","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 55VL963"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Unleash the splendour of 3D viewing in your home with the Toshiba VL963 series. The beautiful new super narrow bezel design houses the very latest in passive 3D LED TV picture technology. With four pairs of 3D glasses included, the whole family can experience 3D movies and programmes in HD quality. You can also view and share online content via various service providers through the Toshiba Places online portal.\\n\\n- The Toshiba VL963 delivers a cinema-like experience with the slimmest of frames bringing the picture almost to the edge of the glass for a genuinely immersive 3D viewing. The VL963 uses passive 3D technology with comfortable lightweight glasses. We've included four pairs of glasses, so the whole family can enjoy movies, sports and gaming.\\n\\n- The action stays crisp, fast and smooth thanks to our 400 AMR (Active Motion & Resolution) HD image-processing technology. It cuts motion blur and keeps the refresh rate high, so the VL963 series can easily keep up with the fastest moving sports and action sequences.\\n\\n- The VL963 comes with Audyssey Premium Television sound technology which produces rich sound at all volumes and a great audio experience in every listening environment. Whether you are blasting your TV at full capacity during the day or using low volumes for late-night viewing, Audyssey always maintains the ideal level of bass and clarity.\\n\\n- Now you can watch entertainment from the internet on the best screen in the house. With just a few clicks of the remote, you\u2019ll be watching videos on YouTube or sharing photos on Flickr. You can also view and share a wide range of other online content via Viewster, Woomi and Acetrax\u2122 through the Toshiba Places internet portal.\\n\\n- Connect your TV to your home network and enjoy all the music, videos and photos stored on your computer on the big screen via WiDi technology. Four HDMI ports and two USB ports mean there\u2019s plenty of room to connect all your other devices with the USB Video Recording function.\\n\\n- You can now control your TV with your smart device based on iOS (iPod Touch, iPhone or iPad) or Android operating system, allowing you to change the channel or turn the volume up with a swipe of your finger. Just download our free app, Toshiba AppsConnect, from iTunes or Android Market."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-22T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":55,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"dbfa6063-eaa9-4a13-be98-992569bc4970","identifier":"14334651","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon VIXIA HF M52"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.37"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Small and light with a sleek new design, the VIXIA HF M52 camcorder has 32GB of internal memory to record up to 12 hours of stunning HD video. Image quality is unsurpassed, thanks to the camcorder's newly designed, professional-level Canon HD CMOS Pro Image Sensor. The high-sensitivity sensor provides outstanding resolution, better low-light performance, and beautiful, natural detail in both shadow and highlight areas. Intelligent IS and SuperRange Optical Image Stabilization designed for the Genuine Canon 10x HD Video Lens make every scene clear and steady, and new built-in features make it easy to give your videos added creativity. Operation is fun and simple with a Flat Touch Panel LCD you'll control with your fingertips. This camcorder has the flexibility you crave: enjoy the convenience of recording in AVCHD or MP4 format to the internal flash drive or to a removable SD\/SDHC\/SDXC memory card. And now with built-in Wi-Fi\u00ae, you can immediately upload video from the camcorder directly to social networking sites via CANON iMAGE GATEWAY, or your own home computer. You can also choose to upload video to your iPhone\u00ae, iPad\u00ae or iPod touch\u00ae by installing the Canon Movie Uploader app, and enjoy wireless viewing on your DLNA\u2122-compatible TV."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-22T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f107917a-14c9-4e3d-9653-51df19192030","identifier":"14356747","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R306 + SDHC 4GB"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Canon LEGRIA HF R306<\/b>\\n<b>Capture stories on the go in stunning Full HD<\/b>\\nThe effortless LEGRIA HF R306 has a 51x Advanced zoom to get you close to the action in stunning Full HD, while Intelligent IS keeps movies steady. Use Story Creator to develop your video skills.\\n\\n<b>51x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS<\/b>\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 51x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives true HD quality and excellent colour reproduction even in low light, so your movies will look great on your HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake. It automatically detects the scene and selects exactly the right optical Image Stabilizer settings from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. It ensures sharp, detailed videos in every situation - leaving you free to concentrate on shooting.\\n\\n<b>Story Creator<\/b>\\nUse Story Creator to effortlessly create memorable movies and help develop your video skills. Choose a theme for your movie and Story Creator gives you on screen suggestions and shooting tips, so you can make captivating videos.\\n\\n<b>Cinema-look filters; Touch Decoration<\/b>\\nInspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters. Select from 8 adjustable colour-grading filters to capture the perfect movie scene. Adding fun effects to your movies without a PC is easy using Touch Decoration. Write messages straight on the Touch-screen with the Stylus Pen, add stamps or active animations like shooting stars and mix in still images.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nOperation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm (3.0\u201d) gesture-based Touch-screen LCD, which gives you intuitive fingertip control of settings and simplifies playback.\\n\\n<b>Smart Auto, Face Detection<\/b>\\nEffortlessly shoot high quality video with Smart Auto. Intelligent Scene Detection Technology selects the perfect settings from 38 scene modes \u2013 all you have to do is point and shoot, whilst Face Detection optimises the settings for great people shots.\\n\\n<b>Video Snapshot<\/b>\\nWith Video Snapshot it\u2019s easy to create fun, short movies to share with friends - without a PC. Capture 2, 4 or 8 second clips with just one touch of the record button, create a playlist, add music and your movie is ready.\\n\\n<b>SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nThe LEGRIA HF R306 records Full HD movies direct to an SDXC memory card and are ideal for sharing. Available in a range of sizes allowing you to capture hours of footage."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-22T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ef92d2f8-83b7-49c8-895a-31a0c25000f4","identifier":"14357245","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["brother","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Brother HL-2135W"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der HL-2135W ist der kompakte partner fur den arbeitsplatz und dank wlanprinserver Flexibel einsetzbar.\\n\\n- Bis zu 20 Seiten\/Minute Druckgeschwindigkeit\\n- WLAN-PrintServer und USB 2.0 Hi-Speed Schnittstelle\\n- 250 Blatt Papierkassette und Einzelblatteinzug\\n- Nur 0,9 Watt Stromverbauch im Tiefschlafmodus\\n- Zeit bis zum 1. Ausdruck: weniger als 10 Sekunden"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Brother's HL-2135W mono laser printer is the perfect choice for the home or small business office. Compact yet capable of delivering exceptional quality and performance, it will consistently meet the needs of a busy workload. With Brother's One Touch Wireless Connection as standard, it offers the flexibility to work anywhere as well as the ability to share with other users.\\n\\nAffordable to buy and affordable to run too, it comes with many time and money-saving features including 700 (1000 optional) page toner cartridges , separate drum unit, toner save mode, N-in-1 print (ability to print multiple pages onto a single sheet) and deep sleep mode, reducing energy when not in use."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Imprimante laser A4 N & B Wifi 20 ppm.<\/b>\\n<b>Rapide et connect\u00e9e, la HL-2135W vous offrira une excellente qualit\u00e9 d\u2019impression. Facile \u00e0 utiliser et disposant d\u2019un faible co\u00fbt d\u2019exploitation, sa connectivit\u00e9 \u00e9largie vous permettra de r\u00e9pondre aux besoins bureautiques.<\/b>\\n\\n- Bac papier 250 feuilles\\n- Garantie standard 1 an A\/R atelier\\n- Port USB 2.0 High Speed\\n- wifi 802.11 b\/g\\n- R\u00e9solution 2400 x 600 dpi\\n- Vitesse d'impression 20 ppm."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"7.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
