{"uuid":"cdee71a7-7f9b-442b-9e81-0c788748c772","identifier":"14380406","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 23DL934G LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"ALLEINUNTERHALTER F\u00dcR JEDEN RAUM<br>\\n<br>\\n- 23-Zoll (58 cm) LED-TV <br> \\n- integrierter DVD-Player<br>\\n- HD-Ready<br>\\n- 50 Hz AMR (Active Motion Rate)<br>\\n- Dualtuner (DVB-T, DVB-C)<br>\\n- Anschl\u00fcsse: 2x HDMI\u2122, 1x USB<br>\\n- Farbe: Klavierlack weiss"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba 23DL934G. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC, NTSC 4.43, PAL BG, PAL DK, PAL I, SECAM B\/G, SECAM D\/K, SECAM L, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. RMS rated power: 2.5, Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus. Optical disc player type: DVD player, Disc types supported: CD, DVD, DVD+R, DVD+RW, DVD-R, DVD-RW. Video formats supported: AVI, DAT, H.263, H.264, MKV, MP4, MPEG1, MPEG2, MPEG4, MPG, VOB, XVID, Audio formats supported: AAC, LPCM, MP3, MP4, Image formats supported: JPG"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-28T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":23,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5a6c454e-71c9-4338-a41e-9e4ccc228dd0","identifier":"14380469","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 42YL875G LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Wahlweise per Kabel oder drahtlos \u00fcber das integrierte WLAN-Modul nimmt der 42YL875G (107 cm diagonal screen size) Kontakt zum Internet und Heimnetzwerk auf. Dank USB-Video-Recording verpassen Sie nie wieder Ihre Lieblingssendung und k\u00f6nnen mit einem Knopfdruck das laufende Fernsehprogramm anhalten.\\n\\n<b>motto ii Premiumprodukt<\/b>\\nmotto ii bedeutet im Japanischen \"noch besser\" und ist gleichzeitig die Leitidee f\u00fcr das Premium-Produktprogramm von Toshiba. motto ii Modelle zeichnen sich durch exklusive Designvarianten und besondere technische Features aus. Nur ausgew\u00e4hlte Fachh\u00e4ndler nehmen am motto ii Partnerprogramm teil und f\u00fchren diese exklusiven Produkte.\\n\\nCEVO ENGINE\\nDie CEVO ENGINE ist eine speziell f\u00fcr den Einsatz in Fernsehern ausgelegte Multi-Prozessor-Plattform. Durch dieses Konzept k\u00f6nnen mehrere Rechenkerne f\u00fcr die unterschiedlichen Aufgaben und Funktionen eines TVs eingesetzt werden. Dies erm\u00f6glicht einmalige Funktionen und einen gro\u00dfen Sprung in der Qualit\u00e4t.\\n\\nACTIVE-SHUTTER-TECHNOLOGIE\\nZur Erzeugung von 3D-Bildern sind spezielle Panels und 3D-Brillen erforderlich. Dieser Fernseher ist in der Lage 3D-Inhalte in Full-HD-Aufl\u00f6sung (1920 x 1080 Bildpunkte) zu liefern.\\n\\nPRO LED 32\\nFernseher mit Pro LED 32 verf\u00fcgen \u00fcber 32 unabh\u00e4ngig voneinander steuerbare Zonen in der Hintergrundbeleuchtung. So k\u00f6nnen im gleichen Bild sehr helle und sehr dunkle Bereiche gleichzeitig angezeigt werden, was zu einem erh\u00f6hten Kontrastverh\u00e4ltnis und besseren Schwarzwerten f\u00fchrt.\\n\\nUSB VIDEO RECORDING\\nFernseher mit USB-Video-Recording-Funktion erlauben eine Aufzeichnung des TV-Programms auf ein per USB angeschlossenes Speichermedium. Aufnahmen lassen sich wie bei einem digitalen Festplattenrekorder programmieren, das laufende Programm kann zudem pausiert werden."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba 42YL875G. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC 4.43, PAL BG, PAL DK, PAL I, SECAM B\/G, SECAM D\/K, SECAM L, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-C2, DVB-S, DVB-S2, DVB-T, DVB-T2. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus. Video formats supported: ASF, AVCHD, AVI, DIVX, H.264, M2TS, M4V, MKV, MP4, MPEG2, MTS, VC-1, WMV, Audio formats supported: MP3, MP4, WMA, Image formats supported: JPG. VESA mounting interfaces compatibility: 400 x 400"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-28T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":42,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8193c154-7124-4a5a-a8ae-8b51170d734e","identifier":"14380475","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","toshiba","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Toshiba 47XL975G LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit der neuesten passiven 3D-Technik in der XL975G-Serie genie\u00dfen Sie dreidimensionale Filme, Spiele und Sport\u00fcbertragungen mit federleichten Brillen. Dem Fernseher liegen vier Brillen bei, sodass die ganze Familie sofort 3D schauen kann.\\n\\n<b>motto ii Premiumprodukt<\/b>\\nmotto ii bedeutet im Japanischen \"noch besser\" und ist gleichzeitig die Leitidee f\u00fcr das Premium-Produktprogramm von Toshiba. motto ii Modelle zeichnen sich durch exklusive Designvarianten und besondere technische Features aus. Nur ausgew\u00e4hlte Fachh\u00e4ndler nehmen am motto ii Partnerprogramm teil und f\u00fchren diese exklusiven Produkte.\\n\\n3D - SO ECHT WIE DAS LEBEN\\nErleben Sie 3D wie im Kino mit der XL975G-Serie. Vier federleichte 3D-Brillen liegen dem Fernseher bei, damit Sie und Ihre Familie oder Freunde unbeschwert in die dreidimensionale Unterhaltungswelt eintauchen k\u00f6nnen\\n\\nDER GUTE TON\\nIn der XL975G-Serie setzt Toshiba die digitale Klangoptimierung Audyssey Premium Television ein. Sie sorgt f\u00fcr ein ausgewogenes Klangbild mit klaren H\u00f6hen und guten B\u00e4ssen. Der Klang wird jederzeit analysiert und verbessert, sodass auch leise Dialoge bei niedriger TV-Lautst\u00e4rke noch klar und deutlich zu verstehen sind.\\n\\nSCHARF UND RUCKELFREI\\nEgal wie hektisch es auf dem Spielfeld, im Film oder beim Spiel zugeht - mit Toshibas Bewegungsoptimierung 400 Hertz AMR bleiben alle Szenen ruckelfrei und scharf.\\n\\nSMARTER FERNSEHEN\\nSchauen Sie Videos aus dem Internet auf Ihrem gro\u00dfen TV-Bildschirm. Mit wenigen Klicks auf der Fernbedienung sehen Sie die angesagtesten YouTube-Videos, aktuelle Nachrichten oder verpasste TV-Sendungen. Zudem bietet Ihnen Toshiba Places Zugang zu den neuesten Blockbustern der gr\u00f6\u00dften deutschen Online-Videothek Maxdome und noch vieles mehr."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Toshiba 47XL975G. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Analog signal format system: NTSC 4.43, PAL BG, PAL DK, PAL I, SECAM B\/G, SECAM D\/K, SECAM L, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-C2, DVB-S, DVB-S2, DVB-T, DVB-T2. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus. HDMI version: 1.4. Video formats supported: AVCHD, AVI, DIVX, H.264, M2TS, M4V, MKV, MP4, MPEG2, MTS, Audio formats supported: MP3, MP4, Image formats supported: JPG"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-05-28T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":47,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"222614c0-aefb-49fe-aafb-b7bb0c3028cd","identifier":"1439086","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Officejet Pro L7590 All-in-One Printer"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100 - 240 VAC (+\/- 10%), 50 - 60 Hz (+\/- 3 Hz), 1.8 amp"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mehr Farbe f\u00fcr Ihr Unternehmen mit diesem energieeffizienten All-in-One-Ger\u00e4t. Professionelle Farbdrucke mit 50 % niedrigeren Kosten pro Seite gegen\u00fcber Laserdruckern[p1], plus laservergleichbare Geschwindigkeit[p2] von bis zu 12 S.\/Min. in Schwarzwei\u00df und 10 S.\/Min. in Farbe. Der Entwurfsmodus erm\u00f6glicht es, mit sensationellen Geschwindigkeiten von bis zu 35 S.\/Min. in Schwarzwei\u00df und bis zu 34 S.\/Min. in Farbe zu drucken und zu kopieren. Maximale Produktivit\u00e4t des Teams mit einfacher Netzwerktechnologie, beidseitiges Drucken\/Kopieren und 50-Blatt-Dokumentenzuf\u00fchrung. Die Modelle L7680 und L7780 bieten noch mehr Leistungsmerkmale, u. a. Direct Digital Filing."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Add colour to your business with this energy-efficient all-in-one. Get professional-quality colour at a cpp up to 50% lower than lasers[p1], plus Laser Quality Speeds[p2] of up to 12 ppm black, 10 ppm colour. Choose draft mode for blistering print and copy speeds of up to 35 ppm black, 34 ppm colour. Maximise your team\u2019s productivity with easy networking, two-sided printing\/copying and 50-sheet ADF. Get even more features with L7680 and L7780 models including Direct Digital Filing."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-02-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"57799a1e-3bbc-461f-8c73-bde5d6d6d734","identifier":"144228","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","trust","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust Portable Webcam WB-3100P"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Compact USB webcam with built-in microphone and 640 x 480 resolution <br>\\nFor video recording and internet applications such as chatting and video conferencing <br>\\nWith self adjusting clip to attach webcam to your notebook or LCD monitor <br>\\nDesktop stand with ball joint for extra flexible positioning <br>\\nRecord videos with audio or use snapshot button for instant picture capturing <br>\\nCompatible with MSN Messenger <br>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bdfe23cd-7274-45c5-b91e-df0d4483ab3a","identifier":"14514835","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","yarvik"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Yarvik PMP220 MP3 player & recorder"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-01T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"00211587-d37c-489a-8d79-3fd5e7641175","identifier":"14514837","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","yarvik"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Yarvik PMP222 MP3 player & recorder"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-01T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9c086058-5f5e-4ac6-bf6a-b29fa031a18d","identifier":"14521811","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","hp","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_720"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP HD 3300"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Die umfangreich ausgestattete HP Webcam HD 3300 erm\u00f6glicht schnelle Verbindungen und die sofortige Kommunikation. Von 3-Wege-Videoanrufen bis zur Videoaufzeichnung (2) sorgt Widescreen 720P HD f\u00fcr eine enorme Bildqualit\u00e4t. Die automatische Belichtung erm\u00f6glicht klare und helle Bilder auch bei sich \u00e4ndernden Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;Die HP Webcam HD 3300 funktioniert mit den meisten Video Calling Services. Freier 3-Wege-Videochat. HP Software konsolidiert Ihre Videokontakte an zentraler Stelle. Desktop Sharing erm\u00f6glicht Freunden, Fotos, Videos, Dokumente und mehr anzusehen. Upload auf Social Media-Websites per Mausklick.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Die HP Webcam HD 3300 bietet fantastische Funktionen f\u00fcr eine h\u00f6here Bildqualit\u00e4t. 720P 16x9 Widescreen HD verbessert die Videoqualit\u00e4t, die Ihnen sofort auffallen wird. Die exklusive HP TrueVision stellt sich automatisch auf ver\u00e4nderte Lichtverh\u00e4ltnisse ein.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Die HP Webcam HD 3300 ist mit einer Vielzahl von Funktionen ausgestattet. Vielseitig verwendbare Clip-Halterungen. 360\u00b0 Schwenkm\u00f6glichkeit und 30\u00b0 Neigungswinkel f\u00fcr Ihre individuellen Anforderungen. Weniger Hintergrundger\u00e4usche durch Richtmikrofon. Bequemes Desktop Sharing. (2)<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Klare Linien. Schlankes, optimiertes Design. High-End-Merkmale. Leicht und \u00e4u\u00dferst kompakt. Die HP Webcam HD 3300 ist praktisch Ihr eigenes kleines Meisterst\u00fcck, das sich durch sein kompaktes, platzsparendes Design und seine innovative Funktionalit\u00e4t in jede Umgebung einf\u00fcgt.\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The feature-rich HP Webcam HD 3300 instantly connects and communicates. From 3-way video calling to recording video,(2) the widescreen 720P HD greatly improves image quality. Auto-exposure keep images clear and bright even in changing light conditions.\\n\\n- HP Webcam HD 3300 works with most video calling services. Free 3-way video chat. HP software consolidates your video contacts in 1 place. Desktop sharing allows friends to see photos, videos, documents & more. Plus, 1-click uploading to social sites.\\n- HP Webcam HD 3300 offers amazing image-enhancing features. 720P 16x9 widescreen HD improves video quality for a difference you'll notice right away. Plus, exclusive HP TrueVision automatically adjusts to changing light conditions.\\n- The HP Webcam HD 3300 is jam-packed. Versatile clip mounts almost anywhere. 360\u00b0 pan & 30\u00b0 tilt adjusts to your needs. Directional microphone cuts down on background noise. Convenient desktop sharing allows everyone to see.(2)\\n- Clean lines. Sleek, streamlined shape. High-end accents. Light and ultra-compact size. The HP Webcam HD 3300 is like your very own miniature masterpiece that's small, space-saving and adds sophistication to any environment.\\n\\n- (1) Internet service required and sold separately.\\n- (2) Requires installation of the included software."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>La webcam HP HD 3300 -riche en fonctions - connecte et communique instantan\u00e9ment. Qu'il s'agisse d'une conversation vid\u00e9o \u00e0 3 ou de l'enregistrement d'une s\u00e9quence vid\u00e9o,(2) la HD 720P 16\/9 am\u00e9liore consid\u00e9rablement la qualit\u00e9 de l'image. L'exposition automatique garantit des images claire m\u00eame avec des conditions d'\u00e9clairage \u00e9clairage variables.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;La Webcam HP HD 3300 fonctionne avec la plupart des services de conversation vid\u00e9o. Conversation vid\u00e9o \u00e0 3 gratuite. Le logiciel HP rassemble vos contacts vid\u00e9o \u00e0 1 seul endroit. Le partage de bureau permet \u00e0 vos amis de voir des photos, des vid\u00e9os, des documents et plus encore. En outre, il permet de t\u00e9l\u00e9charger vers les sites sociaux en 1-clic.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;La Webcam HP HD 3300 offre des fonctions d'am\u00e9lioration de l'image extraordinaires. La HD 720P 16x9 am\u00e9liore la qualit\u00e9 de la vid\u00e9o et offre une diff\u00e9rence que vous constaterez imm\u00e9diatement. En outre, le dispositif exclusif HP TrueVision ajuste automatiquement l'affichage en fonction des conditions d'\u00e9clairage.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;La Webcam HP 3300 HD est pleine \u00e0 craquer. Le support de fixation universel peut \u00eatre fix\u00e9 presque n'importe o\u00f9. La rotation sur 360 \u00b0 et l'inclinaison sur 30\u00b0 s'adaptent \u00e0 vos besoins. Le microphone directionnel \u00e9limine le bruit de fond. Le partage de bureau pratique permet \u00e0 tout le monde de voir. (2)<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Des lignes \u00e9pur\u00e9es. Une forme soign\u00e9e et rationnelle. Des accents haut-de-gamme. Format l\u00e9ger et ultra-compact. La webcam HP 3300 HD est un chef d'\u0153uvre de miniaturisation qui \u00e9conomies l'espace et ajoute du raffinement \u00e0 n'importe quel environnement.\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d78f8cf0-07cb-41eb-bb42-46fac46dfd45","identifier":"14532409","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung NX 1000"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Style and Perfection, All in One.\\n\\nIntroducing the 20.3 megapixels Samsung Smart Camera NX1000 with 1\/4000 fast shutter and Built-in WiFi.\\n\\n20.3MP APS-C Sensor\\n\\nCustomized for the NX System, the brand-new, professional-grade, 20.3MP APS-C CMOS Sensor produces images that rival those of any premium DSLR. Each individual pixel has a large sensor area and receives more light, guaranteeing low noise levels, high dynamic range and accurate color differentiation. The higher sensitivity allows you to shoot during low-light situations without graininess or other noise. The new sensor also provides Full HD video output capabilities.\\n\\n1\/4000 Fast Shutter\\n\\nShutter speed can make the difference between capturing an iconic image and missing a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. The NX1000\u2019s 1\/4000 shutter speed gives you the flexibility to shoot like the pros\u2014at varying speeds and light exposures. The NX1000\u2019s shutter even automatically adjusts itself as it senses environmental factors such as temperature and camera direction. And the electronically controlled focal-plane shutter reduces exposure errors.\\n\\nHigh Speed Capture\\n\\nThe NX1000 features super-fast High Speed Capture capabilities provide an simple yet sophisticated way to capture images in total focus. The ultra-high speed Auto Focus (AF) that can rival almost any system camera and is core component of the system. The result is a fast and precise AF System that captures life\u2019s fleeting moments. And with a sequential rate of 8fps, capturing fast-moving objects in perfect clarity are no longer a challenge.\\n\\nDiscover the True Beauty of HD Video\\n\\nBuilt with 1080 30p Full HD movie recording capabilities, the NX1000 transforms shooting video with a still camera into an art form. Choose from a wide range of viewing angles and zoom with confidence. The mirrorless CMOS image sensor offers precise auto focus even while you shoot. For a truly cinematic experience, the NX System has been fitted with an 18-200mm lens exclusively for Full HD video.\\n\\nInstant Sharing via Wi-Fi\\n\\nThe NX1000\u2019s Wi-Fi connectivity lets you connect your digital camera to a wireless network. Save photos and videos directly to a computer or cloud service while you shoot, email them, print them wirelessly, or upload them straight to Facebook, Twitter or YouTube. You\u2019ll never have to worry about losing a great shot, running out of storage space, or remembering to bring the right cable along.\\n\\nPremium Metal Design\\n\\nThe NX1000 packs the power of a professional-grade digital camera within a sleek and compact design. Its ergonomically crafted exterior fits perfectly within your hand, while the topside design feels solid and looks just as sturdy. The NX System gets its charming good looks through the perfect combination of modern metallic styling and classic clean lines. On the inside, the large CMOS Sensor replaces any mirrors for a smaller camera body. The lightweight body makes it more portable and easier to shoot in a variety of angles and positions, making it the ultimate professional-grade camera that you can carry in your pocket.\\n\\nSmart Filter 2.0 and Selective Color\\n\\nSmart Filter 2.0 options make it easy to create special moods. Choose the Tilt & Shift Lens Effect for a miniaturized look, the Vignetting Effect for striking contrasts, Half-Tone Dot for a comic-book look, and more. With the Selective Color feature, you can even choose the colors you want to emphasize.\\n\\nWide Range ISO for Perfect Exposure\\n\\nThe wrong exposure can ruin even the most carefully framed shot. The NX System\u2019s imaging sensor offers a wide ISO sensitivity range of up to 12,800 at normal settings. Even indoors or at night, you can create images with minimal noise, rich tonal gradations and faithful colors\u2014without a flash. You\u2019ll also capture clearer, crisper images of fast-moving objects.\\n\\nPanorama, 3D Panorama\\n\\nCapture the sweeping beauty of a natural landscape or the grandeur of a vast skyline. The NX1000\u2019s panoramic capabilities let you catch every detail on the horizon with the push of a button. You can even create 3D panoramic photos and wow your friends by displaying them on a 3D-ready HDTV.\\n\\nSmart Panel\\n\\nThe intuitive Smart Panel user interface puts all the settings you need right at your fingertips. Every key feature is easy to access, thanks to on-screen icons and clearly explained menu items. That means faster adjustments so you won\u2019t miss that perfect shot.\\n\\nTake Full Control of Your Pictures\\n\\nNo more fumbling to find the right buttons while you try to capture a fleeting moment. With i-Function 2.0, you can adjust key settings using the focus ring right on the lens. Whether you\u2019re a novice or a seasoned pro, you can quickly choose the perfect settings for your shot."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Elegance, Performance & Partage<\/b>\\n\\nLa photographie \u00e0 haute vitesse\\n\\n<b>La r\u00e9alit\u00e9, plus vraie que nature !<\/b>\\n\\nCapteur APS-C CMOS 20.3 MP\\nSamsung a con\u00e7u son nouveau capteur APS-C CMOS 20.3 Millions de pixels pour s\u2019int\u00e9grer parfaitement au Samsung NX1000, appareil photo hybride \u00e0 objectifs interchangeables, sans miroir interne, composant encombrant caract\u00e9ristique du r\u00e9flex. Le capteur haut de gamme de cet appareil lui assure plus de lumi\u00e8re par pixel ce qui rend vos images plus \u00e9clatantes et color\u00e9es. Ce nouveau capteur permet aussi de faire des vid\u00e9os en qualit\u00e9 Full HD pour une d\u00e9finition et une clart\u00e9 d\u2019image in\u00e9gal\u00e9e.\\n\\n<b>Des courbes renversantes<\/b>\\n\\nDesign \u00e9l\u00e9gant et \u00e9pur\u00e9\\nAvec seulement 220 g (sans batterie) et un bo\u00eetier ultra compact, le nouveau Samsung Smart Camera NX100 a un poids plume dans un corps de r\u00eave. Emmenez le partout o\u00f9 vous allez, il fera des ravages!\\n\\n<b>Le Wi-Fi n'est qu'\u00e0 un pas!<\/b>\\n\\nBouton de raccourci Wi-Fi\\nL'\u00e8re du sans-fil est arriv\u00e9e. Avec son bouton Wi-Fi sur le boitier, partagez encore plus vite vos oeuvres avec votre entourage."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-08T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b95a5f50-7064-431d-93bb-5a218f0a028c","identifier":"14532411","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung NX 210"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Share life in stunning detail with the Samsung NX210 Smart Camera. You can unleash the professional photographer within, thanks to the detail delivered by its 20.3MP APS-C CMOS sensor. Meanwhile, the NX210\u2019s High Speed Capture capabilities give the precision you need to capture split-second shots in superb focus. Premium metal design not only looks great but makes the camera more practical, with its compact shape and light weight adding to portability. And, with built-in Wi-Fi, you\u2019ll be able to share images wirelessly on social networks, save them to computers or cloud services and even print or email them.\\n\\n<b>Reality never looked so real<\/b>\\n\\n<b>20.3MP APS-C Sensor<\/b>\\nCustomised for the NX System, the brand-new, professional-grade, 20.3MP APS-C CMOS Sensor produces images that rival those of any premium DSLR. Each individual pixel has a large sensor area and receives more light, guaranteeing low noise levels, high dynamic range and accurate colour differentiation. The higher sensitivity allows you to shoot during low-light situations without graininess or other noise. The new sensor also provides Full HD video output capabilities.\\n\\n<b>Picture performance that meets its design<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Premium Metal Design<\/b>\\nThe NX210 packs the power of a professional-grade digital camera within a sleek and compact design. Its ergonomically crafted exterior fits perfectly within your hand, while the topside design feels solid and looks just as sturdy. The NX System gets its charming good looks through the perfect combination of modern metallic styling and classic clean lines. On the inside, the large CMOS Sensor replaces any mirrors for a smaller camera body. The lightweight body makes it more portable and easier to shoot in a variety of angles and positions, making it the ultimate professional-grade camera that you can carry in your pocket.\\n\\n<b>A camera\u2019s that quick on the draw<\/b>\\n\\n<b>High Speed Capture<\/b>\\nThe NX210 features super-fast High Speed Capture capabilities provide an simple yet sophisticated way to capture images in total focus. The ultra-high speed Auto Focus (AF) that can rival almost any system camera and is core component of the system. The result is a fast and precise AF System that captures life\u2019s fleeting moments. And with a sequential rate of 8fps, capturing fast-moving objects in perfect clarity are no longer a challenge.\\n\\n<b>Instant sharing and saving, simply<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi Connectivity<\/b>\\nThe NX210\u2019s Wi-Fi connectivity lets you connect your digital camera to a wireless network. Save photos and videos directly to a computer or cloud service while you shoot, email them, print them wirelessly, or upload them straight to Facebook\u2122 or YouTube. You\u2019ll never have to worry about losing a great shot, running out of storage space, or remembering to bring the right cable along.\\n\\n<b>Discover the true beauty of HD video<\/b>\\n\\n<b>1080p Full HD Stereo Movie Recording<\/b>\\nBuilt with 1080 30p Full HD movie recording capabilities, the NX210 transforms shooting video with a still camera into an art form. Choose from a wide range of viewing angles and zoom with confidence. The mirrorless CMOS image sensor offers precise auto focus even while you shoot. For a truly cinematic experience, the NX System has been fitted with an 18 - 200mm lens exclusively for Full HD video.\\n\\n<b>Wide Range ISO for perfect exposure<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Wide Range ISO (12800, 7 steps)<\/b>\\nThe wrong exposure can ruin even the most carefully framed shot. The NX System\u2019s imaging sensor offers a wide ISO sensitivity range of up to 12800 at normal settings. Even indoors or at night, you can create images with minimal noise, rich tonal gradations and faithful colours\u2014without a flash. You\u2019ll also capture clearer, crisper images of fast-moving objects.\\n\\n<b>Take full control of your pictures<\/b>\\n\\n<b>i-Function 2.0<\/b>\\nNo more fumbling to find the right buttons while you try to capture a fleeting moment. With i-Function 2.0, you can adjust key settings using the focus ring right on the lens. Whether you\u2019re a novice or a seasoned pro, you can quickly choose the perfect settings for your shot."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Jusqu\u2019\u00e0 aujourd\u2019hui, les photographes devaient choisir entre des appareils photo performants et simples d\u2019utilisation. Le Samsung NX200 vous \u00e9vite ce choix et r\u00e9veille le photographe qui sommeille en vous. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son nouveau capteur APS-C CMOS 20.3 Millions de pixels, les images de votre NX210 raviront m\u00eame les amateurs de photo les plus exigeants ! Les fonctionnalit\u00e9s innovantes du NX200, alli\u00e9es \u00e0 son design ergonomique et sa technologie Wi-Fi embarqu\u00e9e en font un bijou de performance et de simplicit\u00e9 connect\u00e9e!\\n\\n<b>La r\u00e9alit\u00e9, plus vraie que nature !<\/b>\\nSamsung a con\u00e7u son nouveau capteur APS-C CMOS 20.3 Millions de pixels pour s\u2019int\u00e9grer parfaitement au Samsung NX210, appareil photo hybride \u00e0 objectifs interchangeables, sans miroir interne, composant encombrant caract\u00e9ristique du r\u00e9flex. Le capteur haut de gamme de cet appareil lui assure plus de lumi\u00e8re par pixel ce qui rend vos images plus \u00e9clatantes et color\u00e9es. Ce nouveau capteur permet aussi de faire des vid\u00e9os en qualit\u00e9 Full HD pour une d\u00e9finition et une clart\u00e9 d\u2019image in\u00e9gal\u00e9e.\\n\\n<b>Un concentr\u00e9 de performance dans un boitier design!<\/b>\\nLe NX210 met \u00e0 disposition des hautes performances dans le creux de votre main. Chaque fonction a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7ue pour un acc\u00e8s facile et instinctif. En alliant capteur de qualit\u00e9 reflex et boitier compact, le NX210 est l\u2019appareil photo haute performance qui vous suivra partout !\\n\\n<b>Un appareil photo qui a la g\u00e2chette facile!<\/b>\\nSaisir un instant de bonheur est une question de rapidit\u00e9. Les capacit\u00e9s du Samsung NX210 vous permettent de photographier facilement des sujets en mouvements rapides. Le tout-nouveau algorithme de l\u2019autofocus permet une mise au point pr\u00e9cise et instantan\u00e9e. Avec une vitesse allant jusqu\u2019\u00e0 7 photos par seconde, vous ne risquez pas de rater le clich\u00e9 id\u00e9al !\\n\\n<b>Partagez et sauvegardez en toute simplicit\u00e9!<\/b>\\nAvec la technologie Wi-Fi du NX210, vous pouvez \u00e0 tout moment partager vos moments favoris. Mettez en ligne vos photos sur Facebook, Picasa, Photobucket ou encore via un e-mail et vos vid\u00e9os sur Youtube directement depuis votre Samsung SmartCamera. Si vous avez peur de ne plus avoir de place sur votre carte m\u00e9moire, votre WB850F se charge de cela en sauvegardant vos fichiers directement sur une plateforme \u00ab Cloud \u00bb pour ne plus jamais perdre vos souvenirs. Une fois rentr\u00e9 chez vous et gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019option sauvegarde automatique, votre SmartCamera t\u00e9l\u00e9charge automatiquement vos fichiers sur votre PC. Enfin, profitez pleinement sur un \u00e9cran \u00e0 la taille de vos exploits gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connexion directe sur votre SmartTV !\\n\\n<b>D\u00e9couvrez la beaut\u00e9 des vid\u00e9os FULL HD<\/b>\\nLes performances redoutables du NX210 ne sont pas limit\u00e9es \u00e0 la photo. L\u2019enregistrement vid\u00e9o en FULL HD 1080p de cet appareil donne \u00e0 vos vid\u00e9os un rendu professionnel. L\u2019objectif 18 - 200 mm sp\u00e9cialement adapt\u00e9 aux vid\u00e9os vous offre un rendu plus doux et dynamique, avec une plage focale \u00e9tendue. Quand le moment est venu de regarder vos r\u00e9alisations, une interface HDMI vous permet de tout transf\u00e9rer directement sur grand \u00e9cran !\\n\\n<b>Y voir claire ... m\u00eame en basse lumi\u00e8re!<\/b>\\nLa bonne exposition fait la diff\u00e9rence entre une photo exceptionnelle \u00e0 une photo banale. Certaines conditions de lumi\u00e8res exigent une plus haute sensibilit\u00e9 que ce que permet un appareil photo classique. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la haute sensibilit\u00e9 ISO du Samsung NX210 (100 ~ 12 800), vous pourrez prendre des photos nettes et rapides m\u00eame en basse lumi\u00e8re sans risque de flou ou de parasites.\\n\\n<b>Maitrisez vos photos<\/b>\\nLe NX210 permet de cr\u00e9er des effets spectaculaires facilement . Le nouveau I-Function 2.0 vous permet d\u2019acc\u00e9der \u00e0 l\u2019ensemble des param\u00e8tres de prise de vue, d\u2019une simple touche situ\u00e9e sur l\u2019objectif. Avec cette touche, vous avez acc\u00e9s non seulement aux r\u00e9glages de l\u2019objectif mais aussi au I-Zoom et I-Effect. Des \u00eecones simples vous expliquent chaque r\u00e9glage pour tirer le meilleur de chaque photo !"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-08T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ed6cf104-fd69-4d58-b43e-6ccb261ed028","identifier":"14540793","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony Alpha 77 + 18-135mm"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Never miss another shot. Whether you're shooting a sequence of your preschooler's somersault, or the game-changing instant when ball meets bat, the \u03b177 flawlessly captures fast action and fleeting moments with up to 12 fps continuous shooting\u2014all at full 24.3-megapixel resolution with uninterrupted auto focus. And packed with cutting-edge technologies\u2014like the world's first OLED electronic viewfinder2 and Sony's award-winning Translucent Mirror Technology\u2014it's easier than ever to capture professional-grade photos that burst with unimaginable richness, clarity and detail.\\n\\n<b>Spectacular 24.3MP Resolution<\/b>\\nCapture incredibly-detailed images that make for gorgeous enlargements thanks to an impressive 24.3- megapixel sensor\u2014the world's first among APS-C DSLR cameras. With resolution this high, each shot captures a massive amount of detail for greatly reduced noise and vibrant images that explode with clarity and richness.\\n\\n<b>Ultra High Speed Shooting<\/b>\\nIntroducing the world's fastest DSLR. By harnessing the power of Sony's Translucent Mirror Technology, you can shoot up to 12 fps at full 24.3-megapixel resolution with continuous auto focus. It's perfect for snapping a unique sequence of photos or capturing the defining moment in high-speed sports photography.\\n\\n<b>World's First OLED Viewfinder<\/b>\\nThere's never been anything like the Tru-Finder\u2122 OLED electronic viewfinder. Boasting 2359K dots for ultra-high resolution, images pop with richness, clarity and detail. A high contrast ratio lends superb depth, while motion blur is reduced to a minimum. You can even see the results of camera adjustments in real time through the viewfinder.\\n\\n<b>Amazing HD Movies<\/b>\\nThe choice is yours. Shoot super smooth 60p, standard 60i or cinematic 24p movies\u2014all at Full HD 1920 x 1080 resolution4. Capture high-quality AVCHD\u2122 video that looks great on your HDTV, or shoot MP4 videos to upload to the web. Plus, maintain creative control of your movies with access to shutter priority, aperture priority, manual mode and more.\\n\\n<b>Rugged Magnesium Alloy Body<\/b>\\nDon't let its pretty face fool you. With a strong-yet-lightweight magnesium alloy body, the \u03b177 delivers on the promise of its good looks with the strength and rugged reliability your active lifestyle demands. Plus, all ports, doors and controls are weather-resistant for worry-free shooting, come rain or shine.\\n\\n<b>Incredible Speed and Precision<\/b>\\nSome DSLRs can shoot. Others can focus with the speed and precision of Phase Detection AF. The \u03b177 does both at once. Infused with the latest version of Sony's award-winning Translucent Mirror Technology, light is directed to the image sensor and Phase Detection AF sensor simultaneously for ultra-fast shooting up to 12 fps with continuous auto focus."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"42239ce7-066b-4c98-ac7b-e7ff2d512b94","identifier":"14543651","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLX-4195N multifunctional"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>F\u00fcr Ihre t\u00e4glichen Druckanforderungen und jedes Unternehmen<\/b>\\n\\nSamsung Farblaser-Multifunktionsdrucker\\nSatte Farben mit Lichtgeschwindigkeit\\n\\n<b>3-in-1-Multifunktion<\/b>\\nDank der 3-in-1-Funktionalit\u00e4t optimiert der Drucker Samsung CLX-4195N die Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe und stellt sicher, dass die Druckauftr\u00e4ge im B\u00fcro so effizient wie m\u00f6glich ablaufen. Mit den Funktionen zum Drucken, Kopieren und Scannen bietet der CLX-4195N Flexibilit\u00e4t und legt Ihnen bei der Arbeit keine Steine in den Weg. Viele innovative Funktionen wie Ausweiskopie, N-up-Kopie und Scannen an E-Mail gew\u00e4hrleisten, dass Ihren Mitarbeitern die f\u00fcr eine moderne Gesch\u00e4ftswelt n\u00f6tigen Funktionalit\u00e4ten zur Verf\u00fcgung stehen.\\n\\n<b>Hochwertige Druckqualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nDie einmalige ReCP-Technologie (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) von Samsung verbessert die Gesamtqualit\u00e4t und Intensivit\u00e4t Ihrer S\/W-Drucke, damit jede gedruckte Seite perfekt aussieht. Sie passt automatisch die Sch\u00e4rfe bei Grafiken und Texten an und farbige Objekte \u00fcberlappen, damit keine wei\u00dfen L\u00fccken entstehen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung CLX-4195N. Print technology: Laser, Printing: Colour, Copying: Colour. Copier resize: 25 - 400. Optical scanning resolution: 1200 x 1200, Maximum scan resolution: 4800 x 4800, Scan type: Flatbed & ADF. Paper input type: Cassette. ISO A-series sizes (A0...A9): A4, A5, A6, Maximum print size: Legal (216 x 356 mm), ISO B-series sizes (B0...B9): B5"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"nbsp;\\n<br\/><b>Multifonction 3 en 1<\/b>\\n<br\/>R\u00e9duisez votre consommation de papier et d'\u00e9nergie d'une simple pression sur la touche Eco.\\nImprimez plus sur une seule feuille gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression de 2 ou 4 pages par feuille ou en recto verso. \\nLe logiciel Easy Document Creator vous aide \u00e0 utiliser vos documents scann\u00e9s tr\u00e8s simplement. \\n<br\/><b>Une haute qualit\u00e9 couleur<\/b>\\n<br\/>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une haute qualit\u00e9 d'impression gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie couleur ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) de Samsung. Cette technologie novatrice vous permet d'obtenir une meilleure qualit\u00e9 d'image et une meilleure definition des caract\u00e8res pour des r\u00e9sultats nets et pr\u00e9cis.\\n<br\/><b>Toner polym\u00e9ris\u00e9 nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration<\/b>\\n<br\/>Le nouveau toner polym\u00e9ris\u00e9 Samsung contient des particules plus petites et plus uniformes pour des lignes plus nettes et plus pr\u00e9cises. De plus, avec sa formule \u00e0 la cire, il vous garantit durabilit\u00e9 et rendu glossy.\\n<br\/><b>Des performances in\u00e9gal\u00e9es<\/b>\\n<br\/> La productivit\u00e9 de votre entreprise depend de la performance de votre multifonction. Avec une vitesse d'impression de 18 \/ 18 pages par minute et un temps de sortie de 1\u00e8re page de 16 secondes, le CLX-4195N ne vous laissera pas tomber.\\n\\n* Des performances sans compromis\\nGagnez en productivit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au double processeur de 533 MHz qui offre une impression et une num\u00e9risation rapide. \\nLa m\u00e9moire de 256Mo vous permet \u00e9galement d'imprimer rapidement et en grandes quantit\u00e9.\\nLe multifonction laser couleur CLX-4195N deviendra tr\u00e8s vite un outil indispensable pour votre bureau.\\n<br\/><b>Un travail simplifi\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une imprimante facile \u00e0 utiliser<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gagnez en productivit\u00e9 et obtenez des r\u00e9sultats incroyables en moins de temps gr\u00e2ce aux fonctionnalit\u00e9s du CLX-4195N. \\n\\n* Simple et intuitif\\nL'interface utilisateur dot\u00e9 d'un \u00e9cran LCD tactile couleur de 4.3\", vous permet de prendre facilement le contr\u00f4le de votre imprimante."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5114361e-20f2-40e8-87b9-d9151f057143","identifier":"14543652","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["brother","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"216_x_406_4_mm"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Brother DCP-7055W multifunctional"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Digitaler Kopierer<\/b>\\n- DIN A4 Vorlagenglas.\\n- 250 Blatt Kassette und Einzelblatteinzug.\\n- 2-zeiliges Display.\\n\\n<b>Laserdrucker<\/b>\\n- Bis zu 20 Seiten\/Minute Druckgeschwindigkeit.\\n- Bis zu 2.400 x 600 dpi.\\n- 32 MB Speicher.\\n- USB 2.0 Hi-Speed Schnittstelle.\\n- Interner 802.11 b\/g WLAN-DCP-Server.\\n\\n<b>Farbscanner<\/b>\\n- Scan-to-E-Mail\/Bild\/Datei\/Text\/PDF.\\n- 600 x 2.400 dpi (optisch) und 24 Bit Farbtiefe (extern)."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Up to A4 Print, Copy, Scan.\\n- First page out time of less than 10 seconds.\\n- Fast Wi-Fi and Hi-Speed USB 2.0 connection.\\n- Less refilling with a 250 sheet paper tray.\\n- High resolution colour scanning plus scan to PDF feature."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Impression rapide jusqu\u2019\u00e0 20 ppm.\\n- Compacit\u00e9 \u00e0 toute \u00e9preuve d\u00e9di\u00e9e aux petits espaces de travail.\\n- R\u00e9seau Wifi 802.11 b\/g.\\n- Bac papier de 250 feuilles, chargeur de documents universel pour enveloppes."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eda966f0-c1f1-4da8-851a-a463d3b56d8e","identifier":"14546019","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PowerShot A2400 IS"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Canon PowerShot A2400 IS<\/b>\\nSteady shots, with style\\n\\nWith Intelligent IS to effortlessly keep photos and HD movies sharp and steady, the beautifully slim PowerShot A2400 IS delivers Canon image quality, style and simplicity anytime, anywhere.\\n\\n- 16.0 Megapixels\\n- 28mm wide, 5x zoom lens\\n- Intelligent IS\\n- 6.8 cm (2.7\u201d) LCD\\n- Slim body in 4 colours\\n- Smart Auto (32 scenes)\\n- HD movies (720p) with movie button\\n- Help button\\n- Fun and creative modes\\n- Live View Control, Face Detection\\n\\n16.0 Megapixels\\nCapturing all the detail from the genuine Canon lens the 16MP sensor delivers superb quality images that are perfect for large-scale prints (A3+) or creative cropping.\\n\\n28mm wide, 5x zoom lens\\nFit more in the frame with 28mm wide-angle for sweeping landscapes and great group shots and use the 5x optical zoom to get closer to distant subjects.\\n\\nIntelligent IS\\nIntelligent IS combats camera shake to ensure all your photos and videos are sharp and detailed even at full zoom or in low light. It automatically adjusts the optical Image Stabilizer to the scene from 6 modes to prevent blur.\\n\\n6.8 cm (2.7\u201c) LCD\\nA bright and clear LCD screen (230k dots) lets you frame and view your shots with ease and makes sharing them with friends a pleasure.\\n\\nSlim body in 4 colours\\nThe slim, compact body is small enough to take anywhere while the metal exterior adds colour and style.\\n\\nSmart Auto (32 scenes)\\nEven complete beginners can effortlessly shoot high quality photos or movies with Smart Auto, which detects the scene and automatically selects the optimal settings from 32 variables. Press the Auto button to return instantly to Smart Auto from any other mode.\\n\\nHD movies (720p) with movie button\\nInstantly record high quality HD movies (720p) using one touch of the dedicated movie button. Intelligent IS keeps movies steady.\\n\\nHelp button\\nSimply press the Help button for quick, easy-to-follow guidance on using your camera and its different functions \u2013 the ideal introduction for beginners.\\n\\nFun and creative modes\\nHave fun with a range of creative filters. Use Fish-eye Effect to re-create fish-eye lens distortion, Super Vivid to boost colour saturation, retro Poster and Toy Camera Effects or Monochrome. Miniature Effect makes scenes in stills or movies look like miniature scale models.\\n\\nLive View Control, Face Detection\\nLive View Control allows you to easily experiment with picture settings like brightness and colour intensity and preview the results while framing, so you can capture the best shot. Face Detection Technology ensures great people shots. It detects up to 35 faces in a single frame making sure they remain in focus and with optimum brightness. Face Detection White Balance ensures natural skin tones even in unusual lighting conditions. Auto Red-Eye Correction eliminates red-eye."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5bf102cc-9b1c-4d3b-870a-a127829fc25c","identifier":"14551544","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon EOS 650D BODY"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Ein idealer Einstieg in die Welt von EOS Imaging. Dank 18,0 Megapixel Sensor sorgt die EOS 650D f\u00fcr exzellente Aufnahmen, ob Bilder oder Full-HD-Videos. Das dreh- und schwenkbare Clear View LCD II mit Touchscreen macht das Fotografieren und Filmen zum Kinderspiel.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n- 18,0 Megapixel APS-C CMOS-Sensor.\\n- Full-HD-Videos mit manueller Steuerung und kontinuierlichem AF.\\n- Reihenaufnahmen mit bis zu 5 B\/s.\\n- Dreh- und schwenkbarer Clear View Touchscreen LCD II.\\n- ISO 100-12.800, erweiterbar auf bis zu ISO 25.600.\\n- 9-Punkt-Weitbereich-Autofokus.\\n- Integrierter Speedlite Transmitter.\\n\\n<b>Hochwertige EOS f\u00fcr Einsteiger. Die erste Wahl f\u00fcr alle, die das Abenteuer DSLR beginnen m\u00f6chten.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Hohe Bildqualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nMit 18 Megapixel Aufl\u00f6sung l\u00e4sst sich jedes Detail festhalten. Der DIGIC 5 Prozessor mit 14-Bit-Bildverarbeitung sogt dabei f\u00fcr weiche Farbabstufungen und eine pr\u00e4zise Farbwiedergabe. Mit der EOS 650D sind die Dateien umfangreich genug f\u00fcr den Gro\u00dfformatdruck und den Druck von Bildausschnitten ohne Qualit\u00e4tsverlust.\\n\\n<b>Full-HD-Videoprojekte<\/b>\\nHochwertige Videoaufnahmen mit 1080p-Aufl\u00f6sung lassen sich sowohl mit Automatikeinstellungen als auch mit manueller Steuerung erreichen \u2013 oder einem ausgewogenen Verh\u00e4ltnis aus beidem. Auch beim Videodreh steht der Autofokus zur Verf\u00fcgung; das interne Mikrofon erm\u00f6glicht die Stereo-Tonaufzeichnung w\u00e4hrend der Aufnahme.\\n\\n<b>F\u00fcr die schnelle Action<\/b>\\nPr\u00e4zise Sch\u00e4rfenachf\u00fchrung auf sich bewegende Motive dank AF-System mit neun AF-Kreuzsensoren. Reihenaufnahmen mit bis zu 5 Bildern pro Sekunde f\u00fcr bis zu 22 Aufnahmen in Serie helfen immer den ganz speziellen Moment zu erfassen.\\n\\n<b>Neue Blickwinkel erforschen<\/b>\\nDie EOS 650D hat ein 7,7 cm (3,0 Zoll) dreh- und schwenkbares Clear View Touchscreen LCD II im Seitenverh\u00e4ltnis von 3:2, das ausgeklappt und um 270\u00ba gedreht werden kann. So k\u00f6nnen Fotos und Videos aus ganz ungew\u00f6hnlichen Blickwinkeln aufgenommen werden \u2013 beispielsweise \u00fcber die K\u00f6pfe einer Menschenmenge hinweg oder aus der H\u00fcftposition.\\n\\n<b>Touchscreen-Bedienfeld<\/b>\\nAuch die Funktionen der EOS 650D k\u00f6nnen \u00fcber das dreh- und schwenkbare Clear View Touchscreen LCD II gesteuert werden. Motivauswahl und Ausl\u00f6sung \u2013 ganz einfach per Fingertipp. Bei der Bildwiedergabe k\u00f6nnen Sie per 2-Finger-Zoomgesten die Bildansicht vergr\u00f6\u00dfern\/verkleinern.\\n\\n<b>Low-Light-Leistung<\/b>\\nDie ISO-Einstellungen der EOS 650D reichen von ISO 100-12.800 (erweiterbar auf ISO 25.600) \u2013 so lassen sich selbst bei schwachem Licht hochwertige Aufnahmen ohne Blitz auch ohne Stativ realisieren.\\n\\n<b>Integrierter Speedlite Transmitter<\/b>\\nErfahren Sie die kreativen M\u00f6glichkeiten der Blitzlichtfotografie: die EOS 650D ist mit einem integrierten Speedlite Transmitter ausgestattet, mit dem die Kamera mehrere Canon Speedlite EX Blitzger\u00e4te steuern kann.\\n\\n<b>Automatische Motiverkennung (Scene Intelligent Auto)<\/b>\\nDie Automatische Motiverkennung analysiert jede Szene und stellt automatisch die hierf\u00fcr optimalen Einstellungen ein.\\n\\n<b>Hervorragende Bilder selbst in schwierigen Aufnahmesituationen<\/b>\\nMit der Funktion HDR-Aufnahme macht die Kamera drei Aufnahmen mit jeweils unterschiedlicher Belichtung und kombiniert diese anschlie\u00dfen zu einem Bild, das sich durch hohe Detailzeichnung in Lichtern und Schatten auszeichnet. Die EOS 650D hat auch einen Modus f\u00fcr Nachtaufnahmen ohne Stativ. Hier werden mehrere Aufnahmen mit kurzer Verschlusszeit aufgenommen und anschlie\u00dfend zu einem Bild mit reduzierter Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfe vereint."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"An ideal entry to the world of EOS imaging. The EOS 650D\u2019s 18.0-megapixel sensor is superb for both still images and Full HD movies. A Vari-angle Clear View LCD II Touch screen makes shooting simple.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n- 18.0 MP APS-C CMOS sensor.\\n- Full-HD movies with manual controls and continuous AF.\\n- 5 fps continuous shooting.\\n- Vari-angle Clear View LCD II Touch screen.\\n- ISO 100-12,800 sensitivity, extendable to ISO 25,600.\\n- 9-point wide-area AF.\\n- Integrated Speedlite Transmitter.\\n\\n<b>High-quality, entry-level EOS. First choice for those starting their DSLR adventures.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Advanced image quality<\/b>\\nCapture every detail with 18-megapixel resolution, and enjoy the smooth tones and accurate colours of 14-bit DIGIC 5 image processing. The EOS 650D produces files big enough to print at large sizes or crop for alternative compositions without sacrificing quality.\\n\\n<b>Produce Full HD movie projects<\/b>\\nCapture premium-quality movies at 1080p resolution, enjoying the right level of automatic or manual control for you. Autofocus is possible while filming, and a built in microphone enables the recording of high-quality stereo audio.\\n\\n<b>Keep up with fast moving action<\/b>\\nTrack moving objects accurately across the frame with an autofocus system comprising nine cross-type AF points. Continuous shooting at 5 fps for bursts of up to 22 frames means you\u2019ll never miss that decisive moment.\\n\\n<b>Explore new viewpoints<\/b>\\nThe EOS 650D has a Vari-angle 7.7cm (3.0\u201d) 3:2 ratio Clear View LCD II Touch screen that hinges away from the camera\u2019s body and rotates through 270\u00ba. This enables video and still-image shooting from alternative viewpoints \u2013 such as over the top of crowds or from waist level.\\n\\n<b>Touch-screen control<\/b>\\nEnjoy alternative access to the EOS 650D\u2019s controls though a Vari-angle Clear View LCD II Touch screen. Shoot and focus with a single tap and use pinch and swipe gestures when reviewing images.\\n\\n<b>Low-light performance<\/b>\\nThe EOS 650D can capture images over a sensitivity range of ISO 100-12,800 (extendable to ISO 25,600), enabling hand-held shooting in low light without using flash.\\n\\n<b>Integrated Speedlite Transmitter<\/b>\\nExplore creative lighting options by positioning Canon Speedlite flashes off camera and controlling them with the EOS 650D\u2019s Integrated Speedlite Transmitter.\\n\\n<b>Scene Intelligent Auto<\/b>\\nCanon\u2019s Scene Intelligent Auto technology analyses each scene and sets the most appropriate combination of cameras settings automatically.\\n\\n<b>Great results in difficult conditions<\/b>\\nHDR Backlight control captures three different exposures and combines them into one, retaining shadow and highlight detail. The EOS 650D\u2019s hand-held night scene mode captures multiple images at fast shutter speeds and blends them together for a blur-free result."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le choix id\u00e9al pour d\u00e9couvrir le monde de la photographie EOS. Le capteur EOS 650D de 18 m\u00e9gapixels est l'outil indispensable pour obtenir des images fixes et des vid\u00e9os Full HD. L'\u00e9cran LCD tactile Clear View II orientable facilite les prises de vue.\\n\\n<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/b>\\n\\n- Capteur CMOS APS-C 18,0 millions de pixels.\\n- Vid\u00e9os Full HD avec commandes manuelles et AF continu.\\n- Prise de vue en continu \u00e0 5 im.\/s.\\n- \u00c9cran LCD tactile Clear View II orientable.\\n- Sensibilit\u00e9 ISO 100-12 800, extensible \u00e0 25 600 ISO.\\n- Large plage AF \u00e0 9 collimateurs.\\n- Transmetteur Speedlite int\u00e9gr\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Reflex EOS entr\u00e9e de gamme de qualit\u00e9 sup\u00e9rieure. Le choix id\u00e9al pour les utilisateurs qui se lancent dans la photographie avec reflex num\u00e9rique.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Qualit\u00e9 d'image am\u00e9lior\u00e9e<\/b>\\nFigez les moindres d\u00e9tails dans une r\u00e9solution de 18 m\u00e9gapixels et b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez de nuances impeccables et de couleurs des plus fid\u00e8les gr\u00e2ce au processeur d'image DIGIC 5 14 bits. L'EOS 650D produit des fichiers suffisamment volumineux pour imprimer de grands formats ou recadrer vos compositions sans aucune perte de qualit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9alisez des projets vid\u00e9o Full HD<\/b>\\nObtenez des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 sup\u00e9rieure avec une r\u00e9solution de 1080p en profitant d'un contr\u00f4le automatique ou manuel. La mise au point automatique est possible en filmant et le microphone int\u00e9gr\u00e9 permet d'enregistrer des s\u00e9quences audio st\u00e9r\u00e9o de haute qualit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Au c\u0153ur de l'action<\/b>\\nSuivez les sujets en mouvement dans leur ensemble avec un syst\u00e8me de mise au point automatique comportant 9 collimateurs \u00e0 capteurs AF de type crois\u00e9. Les prises de vue en rafale de 5 images par seconde permettent de ne rater aucun instant d\u00e9cisif.\\n\\n<b>D\u00e9couvrez de nouveaux points de vue<\/b>\\nL'EOS 650D est \u00e9quip\u00e9 d'un \u00e9cran LCD tactile Clear View II orientable de 7,7 cm (3 pouces), avec un ratio de 3:2, pivotant sur 270 degr\u00e9s. Vous pouvez ainsi r\u00e9aliser des vid\u00e9os et des prises de vue fixes depuis d'autres points de vue, comme au-dessus d'une foule ou \u00e0 mi-hauteur.\\n\\n<b>Contr\u00f4le par \u00e9cran tactile<\/b>\\nB\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'un autre acc\u00e8s aux commandes de l'EOS 650D gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran LCD tactile Clear View II orientable. Prenez vos photos et faites la mise au point en touchant l'\u00e9cran et pincez-\u00e9tirez ou balayez ce dernier pour visualiser vos images.\\n\\n<b>Performances en conditions de faible \u00e9clairage<\/b>\\nL'EOS 650D peut effectuer des prises de vue sur la plage de sensibilit\u00e9s ISO de 100-12 800 (extensible \u00e0 25 600 ISO), vous permettant ainsi de l'utiliser \u00e0 main lev\u00e9e en conditions de faible \u00e9clairage avec le flash.\\n\\n<b>Transmetteur Speedlite int\u00e9gr\u00e9<\/b>\\nD\u00e9couvrez des options d'\u00e9clairage cr\u00e9atives en \u00e9loignant les flashes Canon Speedlite de votre appareil et contr\u00f4lez-les avec le transmetteur Speedlite int\u00e9gr\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>S\u00e9lection de sc\u00e8ne intelligente<\/b>\\nLa technologie de sc\u00e8ne intelligente Canon analyse chaque sc\u00e8ne et d\u00e9finit automatiquement les combinaisons de r\u00e9glages de l'appareil les plus adapt\u00e9s.\\n\\n<b>Des r\u00e9sultats superbes en conditions difficiles<\/b>\\nL'option r\u00e9tro \u00e9clairage HDR saisit trois expositions diff\u00e9rentes pour les combiner en une seule, tout en conservant les ombres et les d\u00e9tails. Le mode Nuit \u00e0 main lev\u00e9e de l'EOS 650D saisit de multiples images avec des vitesses d'obturation \u00e9lev\u00e9es et les fusionne sans aucun flou."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"34597ac5-10ae-4527-bb1d-796caef2d126","identifier":"14551600","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon EOS 650D BODY"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"An ideal entry to the world of EOS imaging. The EOS 650D\u2019s 18.0-megapixel sensor is superb for both still images and Full HD movies. A Vari-angle Clear View LCD II Touch screen makes shooting simple.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n- 18.0 MP APS-C CMOS sensor.\\n- Full-HD movies with manual controls and continuous AF.\\n- 5 fps continuous shooting.\\n- Vari-angle Clear View LCD II Touch screen.\\n- ISO 100-12,800 sensitivity, extendable to ISO 25,600.\\n- 9-point wide-area AF.\\n- Integrated Speedlite Transmitter.\\n\\n<b>High-quality, entry-level EOS. First choice for those starting their DSLR adventures.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Advanced image quality<\/b>\\nCapture every detail with 18-megapixel resolution, and enjoy the smooth tones and accurate colours of 14-bit DIGIC 5 image processing. The EOS 650D produces files big enough to print at large sizes or crop for alternative compositions without sacrificing quality.\\n\\n<b>Produce Full HD movie projects<\/b>\\nCapture premium-quality movies at 1080p resolution, enjoying the right level of automatic or manual control for you. Autofocus is possible while filming, and a built in microphone enables the recording of high-quality stereo audio.\\n\\n<b>Keep up with fast moving action<\/b>\\nTrack moving objects accurately across the frame with an autofocus system comprising nine cross-type AF points. Continuous shooting at 5 fps for bursts of up to 22 frames means you\u2019ll never miss that decisive moment.\\n\\n<b>Explore new viewpoints<\/b>\\nThe EOS 650D has a Vari-angle 7.7cm (3.0\u201d) 3:2 ratio Clear View LCD II Touch screen that hinges away from the camera\u2019s body and rotates through 270\u00ba. This enables video and still-image shooting from alternative viewpoints \u2013 such as over the top of crowds or from waist level.\\n\\n<b>Touch-screen control<\/b>\\nEnjoy alternative access to the EOS 650D\u2019s controls though a Vari-angle Clear View LCD II Touch screen. Shoot and focus with a single tap and use pinch and swipe gestures when reviewing images.\\n\\n<b>Low-light performance<\/b>\\nThe EOS 650D can capture images over a sensitivity range of ISO 100-12,800 (extendable to ISO 25,600), enabling hand-held shooting in low light without using flash.\\n\\n<b>Integrated Speedlite Transmitter<\/b>\\nExplore creative lighting options by positioning Canon Speedlite flashes off camera and controlling them with the EOS 650D\u2019s Integrated Speedlite Transmitter.\\n\\n<b>Scene Intelligent Auto<\/b>\\nCanon\u2019s Scene Intelligent Auto technology analyses each scene and sets the most appropriate combination of cameras settings automatically.\\n\\n<b>Great results in difficult conditions<\/b>\\nHDR Backlight control captures three different exposures and combines them into one, retaining shadow and highlight detail. The EOS 650D\u2019s hand-held night scene mode captures multiple images at fast shutter speeds and blends them together for a blur-free result."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3531f492-285e-4f92-a31c-534156495bbd","identifier":"14553662","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Officejet Pro 8600 Premium e-All-in-One - N911n"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Produce professional color for up to 60% lower cost per page than lasers,<SUP>1<\/SUP> accelerate productivity with apps on the large touchscreen, networking options & versatile e-all-in-one performance.<SUP>5<\/SUP> Easily print from a mobile device with HP ePrint.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Professional color for a lower cost than lasers.<SUP>1<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Print professional color for up to 50% lower cost per page than lasers,<SUP>1<\/SUP> and get a better value for frequent printing.<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Efficient Web connectivity\u2014even print on the go.<SUP>3<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Print from a variety of mobile devices on the go. With HP ePrint\u2014now you can print from virtually anywhere.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Standout versatility with copy and scan solutions.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Create flawless copies with CopySmart solutions, and easily print two-sided identification cards.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Exceptional energy and resource savings.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Use up to 50% less energy than lasers with this ENERGY STAR\u00ae qualified printer,<SUP>4<\/SUP> and preset On or Off times.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i>For NA use: Majority of color laser AiOs <US$600, March 2011. For details: http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/officejet. OJ Pro ISO yield with highest-capacity cartridges based on continuous printing; see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/learnaboutsupplies. For LAR use: Majority of color laser AiOs <US$600, March 2011, based on Brazil pricing. Local syndicated data source not available for all countries in the region. For details: http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/officejet. OJ Pro ISO yield with highest-capacity cartridges based on continuous printing; see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/learnaboutsupplies. For EMEA use: Majority of color laser AiOs <\u20ac400 excluding VAT, March 2011. For details: http:\/\/www.hp.com\/eur\/ojfacts. OJ Pro ISO yield with highest-capacity cartridges based on continuous printing; see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/learnaboutsupplies. For AP use: Most industry-leading color laser AiOs <USD600 (<USD700 in India), March 2011, based on local supplies pricing of major countries in the region. For details: http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/officejet. OJ Pro ISO yield with highest-capacity cartridges based on continuous printing; see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/learnaboutsupplies.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i>Compared with the HP Officejet 950\/951 Black and color ink cartridges. For more information, see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/learnaboutsupplies. High-capacity cartridges not included; please purchase separately.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i>Requires an Internet connection to the printer. Feature works with any connected Internet- and e-mail-capable device. Print times may vary. Some HP LaserJets may require a firmware upgrade. For a list of supported documents, and image types, see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. And for additional solutions see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i>For NA\/LAR use: Majority of color laser AiOs <US$600, March 2011, OJ Pro with highest-capacity cartridges. Energy use based on HP testing using the ENERGY STAR\u00ae program's TEC test method criteria. For details, see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/officejet. For EMEA use: Majority of color laser AiOs < \u20ac400 excluding VAT, March 2011, OJ Pro with highest-capacity cartridges. Energy use based on HP testing using the ENERGY STAR\u00ae program's TEC test method criteria. For details, see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/eur\/ojfacts. For AP use: Most industry-leading color laser AiOs <USD600 (<USD700 in India), March 2011, OJ Pro with highest-capacity cartridges. Energy use based on HP testing using the ENERGY STAR\u00ae program's TEC test method criteria. For details, see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/officejet.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-12T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"38dba1d4-8c6f-4b74-b9d4-6d6539814216","identifier":"14563181","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["canon","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon PIXMA MG3150"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Compact and Stylish All-In-One with Wi-Fi and Auto Duplex Print for the home<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Excellent quality<\/b>\\nPerfect for first time buyers, students and families, this compact All-In-One is ideal for everyday printing, scanning and copying. Canon\u2019s class leading FINE cartridge system using minimum 2pl ink droplet size combined with a print resolution of up to 4800dpi delivers smooth, virtually grain free photo-lab quality prints and crisp text. Lower your printing cost by using optional XL FINE cartridges.\\n\\n<b>Quick printing for the home<\/b>\\nPrint your documents quickly with ISO ESAT speeds of 9.2 ipm for mono documents and 5.0 ipm for colour. A vivid photo-lab quality 10x15cm borderless print is produced in approximately 44 seconds.\\n\\n<b>Enhanced connectivity<\/b>\\nIn-built Wi-Fi makes it easy to share in the home. Print from and scan directly to mobile devices using the Easy-PhotoPrint App.\\n\\n<b>Easy to use and compact<\/b>\\nBenefiting from the FastFront feature, loading paper and replacing ink can now be done easily from the front and as a result has a more compact design. This allows the All-In-One to be placed closer to the wall or on a shelf - taking up less space.\\n\\n<b>Eco features<\/b>\\nUse Auto Duplex Print for automatic double-sided printing to reduce your paper consumption and help the environment - all without comprising on print quality. With ECO Information you can see your CO2 and paper savings made by double-sided printing. Save energy by using the Auto Power Off - set the printer to switch off, when not being used for a set amount of time.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent software<\/b>\\nTurn your movie moments into beautiful prints with Canon\u2019s unique Full HD Movie Print. New features include Merge Frames and Layout Print to create more striking images. Make your photos even more exciting by applying Fun Filter Effects with Easy-PhotoPrint EX. For easy web printing use Easy-WebPrint EX, combine clips from several web pages so you only print what you need from the web. Get creative with CREATIVE PARK PREMIUM an online service that lets you download photos, illustrations, paper crafts and much more, from internationally recognised photographers & artists.\\n\\n<b>Long lasting, beautiful photos<\/b>\\nThe ChromaLife100 system provides long lasting, beautiful photos. The combination of the PIXMA MG3150, original Canon inks and genuine Canon photo papers preserves memories for a lifetime."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>PIXMA Imprimante Multifonction jet d'encre<\/b>\\nLe PIXMA MG3150 est un multifonction compact et \u00e9l\u00e9gant int\u00e9grant impression recto verso automatique et connexion Wi-Fi. Rapide et efficace, il offre une qualit\u00e9 sup\u00e9rieure d'impression, de copie et de num\u00e9risation. Gr\u00e2ce au syst\u00e8me FastFront, le remplacement de l'encre et du papier est un jeu d'enfant.\\n\\n<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/b>\\n- Multifonction : impression, copie et num\u00e9risation\\n- Design compact avec syst\u00e8me FastFront\\n- R\u00e9solution jusqu'\u00e0 4800 dpi, 2 pl minimum\\n- Vitesse ESAT ISO de 9,2 ipm en noir et blanc\/5 ipm en couleur\\n- Photo 10 x 15 cm en 44 secondes environ\\n- Wi-Fi\\n- Impression recto verso automatique\\n- Full HD Movie Print\\n- CREATIVE PARK PREMIUM\\n\\n<b>Multifonction compact et \u00e9l\u00e9gant avec connexion Wi-Fi et impression recto verso automatique, id\u00e9al pour une utilisation \u00e0 la maison<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Excellente qualit\u00e9<\/b>\\nDestin\u00e9 aux n\u00e9ophytes, \u00e9tudiants et familles, ce multifonction compact est id\u00e9al pour les impressions, num\u00e9risations et copies du quotidien. Le syst\u00e8me de cartouches FINE de Canon \u00e0 gouttes d'encre de 2 pl minimum et la r\u00e9solution d'impression maximale de 4 800 dpi garantissent des impressions de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle quasiment exemptes de grain et des textes \u00e0 la nettet\u00e9 irr\u00e9prochable. R\u00e9duisez vos co\u00fbts d'impression avec les cartouches XL FINE en option.\\n\\n- Impressions rapides \u00e0 la maison\\nImprimez rapidement vos documents \u00e0 des vitesses ESAT ISO de 9,2 ipm en noir et blanc et 5 ipm en couleur. Produisez des tirages \u00e9clatants de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle au format 10 x 15 cm sans marge en 44 secondes environ.\\n\\n<b>Connectivit\u00e9 am\u00e9lior\u00e9e<\/b>\\nLe Wi-Fi int\u00e9gr\u00e9 facilite le partage \u00e0 la maison. Imprimez directement depuis des p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques mobiles et envoyez-leur directement des num\u00e9risations gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'application Easy-PhotoPrint.\\n\\n<b>Compact et simple d'utilisation<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce au syst\u00e8me FastFront, le chargement du papier et le remplacement de l'encre s'effectuent facilement \u00e0 l'avant de l'appareil, ce qui r\u00e9duit \u00e9galement l'encombrement. Ce design compact permet de placer l'appareil plus pr\u00e8s du mur ou sur une \u00e9tag\u00e8re.\\n\\n<b>Fonctions \u00e9conomiques<\/b>\\nImprimez automatiquement en recto verso pour r\u00e9duire votre consommation de papier et pr\u00e9server l'environnement sans transiger sur la qualit\u00e9 de vos impressions. La fonction ECO Information vous informe des \u00e9conomies de CO2 et de papier r\u00e9alis\u00e9es gr\u00e2ce aux impressions recto verso. \u00c9conomisez de l'\u00e9nergie avec la fonction de mise hors tension automatique : r\u00e9glez le d\u00e9lai de mise hors tension de l'imprimante en cas d'inactivit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Des logiciels intelligents<\/b>\\nCr\u00e9ez de magnifiques impressions \u00e0 partir de films avec le logiciel Full HD Movie Print de Canon. Les nouvelles fonctions incluent la fusion des images et l'impression avec mise en page, pour des images encore plus saisissantes. Appliquez des effets de filtre amusants \u00e0 vos photos avec Easy-PhotoPrint EX. Utilisez Easy-WebPrint EX pour combiner des \u00e9l\u00e9ments de plusieurs pages Web, ce qui vous permet d'imprimer seulement ce dont vous avez besoin sur Internet. Exprimez votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 avec CREATIVE PARK PREMIUM, un service en ligne qui vous permet de t\u00e9l\u00e9charger des photos, illustrations, maquettes papier et bien d'autres articles propos\u00e9s par des photographes et artistes de renomm\u00e9e mondiale.\\n\\n<b>Des photos belles et durables<\/b>\\nLe syst\u00e8me ChromaLife100 garantit des photos d'une beaut\u00e9 et d'une long\u00e9vit\u00e9 extraordinaires. Utilisez avec le multifonction PIXMA MG3150 les encres et les papiers photo Canon d'origine, et vos souvenirs resteront \u00e0 jamais intacts."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-12T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fbe4173f-95a3-47e3-acba-e82228ea572b","identifier":"14570755","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon EOS 650D"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Advanced image quality<\/b>\\nCapture every detail with 18-megapixel resolution, and enjoy the smooth tones and accurate colours of 14-bit DIGIC 5 image processing. The EOS 650D produces files big enough to print at large sizes or crop for alternative compositions without sacrificing quality.\\n\\n<b>Produce Full HD movie projects<\/b>\\nCapture premium-quality movies at 1080p resolution, enjoying the right level of automatic or manual control for you. Autofocus is possible while filming, and a built in microphone enables the recording of high-quality stereo audio.\\n\\n<b>Keep up with fast moving action<\/b>\\nTrack moving objects accurately across the frame with an autofocus system comprising nine cross-type AF points. Continuous shooting at 5 fps for bursts of up to 22 frames means you\u2019ll never miss that decisive moment.\\n\\n<b>Explore new viewpoints<\/b>\\nThe EOS 650D has a Vari-angle 7.7cm (3.0\u201d) 3:2 ratio Clear View LCD II Touch screen that hinges away from the camera\u2019s body and rotates through 270\u00ba. This enables video and still-image shooting from alternative viewpoints \u2013 such as over the top of crowds or from waist level.\\n\\n<b>Touch-screen control<\/b>\\nEnjoy alternative access to the EOS 650D\u2019s controls through a Vari-angle Clear View LCD II Touch screen. Shoot and focus with a single tap and use pinch and swipe gestures when reviewing images.\\n\\n<b>Low-light performance<\/b>\\nThe EOS 650D can capture images over a sensitivity range of ISO 100-12,800, enabling hand-held shooting in low light without using flash.\\n\\n<b>Integrated Speedlite Transmitter<\/b>\\nExplore creative lighting options by positioning Canon Speedlite flashes off camera and controlling them with the EOS 650D\u2019s Integrated Speedlite Transmitter.\\n\\n<b>Scene Intelligent Auto<\/b>\\nCanon\u2019s Scene Intelligent Auto technology analyses each scene and sets the most appropriate combination of cameras settings automatically.\\n\\n<b>Great results in difficult conditions<\/b>\\nHDR Backlight control captures three different exposures and combines them into one, retaining shadow and highlight detail. The EOS 650D\u2019s hand-held night scene mode captures multiple images at fast shutter speeds and blends them together for a blur-free result."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
