\n\\n<b>Explore new viewpoints<\/b>\\nThe EOS 650D has a Vari-angle 7.7cm (3.0\u201d) 3:2 ratio Clear View LCD II Touch screen that hinges away from the camera\u2019s body and rotates through 270\u00ba. This enables video and still-image shooting from alternative viewpoints \u2013 such as over the top of crowds or from waist level.\\n\\n<b>Touch-screen control<\/b>\\nEnjoy alternative access to the EOS 650D\u2019s controls though a Vari-angle Clear View LCD II Touch screen. Shoot and focus with a single tap and use pinch and swipe gestures when reviewing images.\\n\\n<b>Low-light performance<\/b>\\nThe EOS 650D can capture images over a sensitivity range of ISO 100-12,800 (extendable to ISO 25,600), enabling hand-held shooting in low light without using flash.\\n\\n<b>Integrated Speedlite Transmitter<\/b>\\nExplore creative lighting options by positioning Canon Speedlite flashes off camera and controlling them with the EOS 650D\u2019s Integrated Speedlite Transmitter.\\n\\n<b>Scene Intelligent Auto<\/b>\\nCanon\u2019s Scene Intelligent Auto technology analyses each scene and sets the most appropriate combination of cameras settings automatically.\\n\\n<b>Great results in difficult conditions<\/b>\\nHDR Backlight control captures three different exposures and combines them into one, retaining shadow and highlight detail. The EOS 650D\u2019s hand-held night scene mode captures multiple images at fast shutter speeds and blends them together for a blur-free result."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"791fa4d6-a86e-4bbc-909d-bb9249035f6f","identifier":"14579474","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 32LT640H LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"LG 32LT640H ist ein interaktiver LED Hotel TV mit HD-Aufl\u00f6sung und sparsamen LED-Backlight. F\u00fcr Java- und Flash-Anwendungen sowie serverbasierte L\u00f6sungen \u00fcber coaxiales Kabel wie Pro:centric V von LG geeignet. Der Hotel-TV bietet ein puristisches Design und dank der geb\u00fcrsteten Oberfl\u00e4che geh\u00f6ren st\u00f6rende Fingerabdr\u00fccke oder Schlieren vom putzen der Vergangenheit an. Im Sachen Filmvergn\u00fcgen trumpft der LG Hotel-TV richtig auf. Fl\u00fcssige Bildwiedergabe in 24p (CinemaMode) \u00fcber HDMI und brillante Bilder dank Edge LED und IPS-Technologie lassen keine W\u00fcnsche offen. Neben zweckdienlichem Design besticht der 32LT640H durch seine Vielseitigkeit. Dazu verhelfen ihm ein CI-Slot, USB 2.0-Anschluss \u00fcber den Bilder, HD-Videos (DivX-HD) und Musik abgespielt werden k\u00f6nnen, ein DVB-T\/C Tuner und die programmierbare RS-232C Schnittstelle. Der 32LT640H erf\u00fcllt alle Vorgaben nach RoHS-Richtlinie und Energy Star. Das professionelle IPS-Panel verleiht dem HotelTV eine hervorragende Bildqualit\u00e4t und gibt Farben originalgetreu wieder, auch bei sich \u00e4nderndem Betrachtungswinkel. Bieten Sie Ihren G\u00e4sten ein perfektes Bild. Die LG LT640H Serie gibt es in Gr\u00f6\u00dfen von 22\", 26\", 32\", 37\", 42\" und 47\". Ab 37\" haben alle Modelle der LT640H Serie FullHD-Aufl\u00f6sung."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Pro:Centric V<\/b>\\n\\nSimple and Easy Hotel TV management solution at lower total cost of ownership! With Pro:Centric solution-enabled TVs, multiple TVs and its contents can be remotely managed and updated via a server and a web-based editor while providing essential hotel information and messages from the hotel.\\n\\n<b>Pro:Centric Application<\/b>\\nThe easiest and most conveninent way to manage hotel TVs at the lowest cost. Pro:Centric Server and its easy editor clears out hotelier\u2019s main concerns about management and maintenance at lower cost along with LG Pro:Centric TV.\\n\\n<b>EzManager<\/b>\\nEzManager makes installation quicker and easier with auto configuration function in LG Hotel TV. When power on for the first time during installation, EzManager guides the installer to set up TVs with few sequences of simple steps to follow without having to do set all functions in the menu.\\n\\n<b>Front LED Clock<\/b>\\nThe integrated LED clock has an array of alarm functions that are useful for guests, yet introduces cost savings for hoteliers - no need to supply a separate alarm clock.\\n\\n<b>Lock Mode<\/b>\\nLock Mode can make TV to be blocked from external input signals for illegal communication in such areas; Prison, Mental hospital and any applicable public spaces."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-14T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"13c95e41-fb8a-4d83-b73d-bddac6451cd2","identifier":"14579476","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 37LT640H LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Pro:Centric V<\/b>\\n\\nSimple and Easy Hotel TV management solution at lower total cost of ownership! With Pro:Centric solution-enabled TVs, multiple TVs and its contents can be remotely managed and updated via a server and a web-based editor while providing essential hotel information and messages from the hotel.\\n\\n<b>Pro:Centric Application<\/b>\\nThe easiest and most conveninent way to manage hotel TVs at the lowest cost. Pro:Centric Server and its easy editor clears out hotelier\u2019s main concerns about management and maintenance at lower cost along with LG Pro:Centric TV.\\n\\n<b>EzManager<\/b>\\nEzManager makes installation quicker and easier with auto configuration function in LG Hotel TV. When power on for the first time during installation, EzManager guides the installer to set up TVs with few sequences of simple steps to follow without having to do set all functions in the menu.\\n\\n<b>Front LED Clock<\/b>\\nThe integrated LED clock has an array of alarm functions that are useful for guests, yet introduces cost savings for hoteliers - no need to supply a separate alarm clock.\\n\\n<b>Lock Mode<\/b>\\nLock Mode can make TV to be blocked from external input signals for illegal communication in such areas; Prison, Mental hospital and any applicable public spaces."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-14T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":37,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"27dc4de9-15e0-44a0-83a2-05000abf7770","identifier":"14579515","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","hp","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_720"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP HD-2200"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Mit der HP Webcam HD-2200 ist das ganz einfach. Erstellen und bearbeiten Sie Videos, gestalten Sie Ihre Onlinechats mit Freunden interessanter, nehmen Sie Fotos auf und teilen Sie diese mit der Familie \u2013 alles mit integriertem Mikrofon und Plug-and-Play-USB-Verbindung.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;Die HP Webcam HD-2200 hat eine 720P-Videofunktion mit bis zu 30 Rahmen pro Sekunde, die f\u00fcr unterbrechungsfreie, nat\u00fcrliche Bewegungen sorgt. Es k\u00f6nnte nicht einfacher sein, Ihre Meisterwerke auf YouTube hochzuladen! Und nat\u00fcrlich k\u00f6nnen Sie auch Fotos f\u00fcr Ihre Familie und Freunde aufnehmen und freigeben.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;F\u00fchlen Sie sich Ihrer Familie und Freunden noch n\u00e4her! Diese Webcam verwendet die beliebteste Instant Messaging-Software, z. B. AIM\u2122, Windows\u00ae Live Messenger, Skype\u00ae und Yahoo!\u00ae Messenger. Au\u00dferdem kann sie in jedem beliebigen Winkel ausgerichtet werden.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Seien Sie kreativ, und bleiben Sie in Kontakt! Bearbeiten und teilen Sie selbst aufgenommene Kurzvideos, retuschieren Sie Fotos mit ArcSoft Webcam Companion 3, und setzen Sie Magic-I Visual Effects 2 ein, um Ihre Onlinechats mit Themen, Spa\u00df-Rahmen und speziellen Filtern interessanter zu gestalten.\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- It\u2019s easy, with the HP Webcam HD-2200. Make and edit videos, enhance your online chats with friends, capture and share still images \u2013 all with an integrated microphone and plug and play USB connection.\\n- The HP Webcam HD-2200 has a 720P video at up to 30 frames per second, giving ultra-smooth, natural body motion. It couldn\u2019t be easier to upload your masterpieces to YouTube! And of course you can capture still images to share with family and friends.\\n- Feel even closer to your family and friends! This webcam works with most popular instant messaging software, including AIM\u2122, Windows\u00ae Live Messenger, Skype\u00ae, and Yahoo!\u00ae Messenger. And it\u2019s fully adjustable, so you\u2019ll get just the view you need.\\n- Show your creative side while staying in touch! Capture, edit and share short videos and retouch photos with ArcSoft Webcam Companion 3, and use Magic-I Visual Effects 2 to enhance your online chats with Masque, fun frames and special filters."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Rien de plus facile avec la webcam HP HD-2200. Cr\u00e9ez et retouchez vos vid\u00e9os, am\u00e9liorez vos discussions en ligne avec vos amis, capturez et partagez des images fixes, le tout avec un microphone int\u00e9gr\u00e9 et une connexion USB plug-and-play.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;La webcam HP HD-2200 offre une vid\u00e9o 720P comprenant jusqu'\u00e0 30 vues par seconde, pour un rendu souple et naturel des mouvements. Rien de plus facile que de charger vos chefs-d'\u0153uvre sur YouTube ! Et bien entendu, vous pouvez capturer des images fixes \u00e0 partager avec votre famille et vos amis.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Soyez encore plus proche de votre famille et de vos amis ! Cette webcam fonctionne avec les principaux logiciels de messagerie instantan\u00e9e, y compris AIM\u2122, Windows\u00ae Live Messenger, Skype\u00ae et Yahoo!\u00ae Messenger. Et elle est enti\u00e8rement ajustable pour offrir l'angle de vision souhait\u00e9.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Affichez votre c\u00f4t\u00e9 cr\u00e9atif tout en gardant le contact ! Capturez, \u00e9ditez et partagez des vid\u00e9os courtes, et retouchez des photos avec ArcSoft Webcam Companion 3. Utilisez Magic-I Visual Effects 2 pour am\u00e9liorer vos discussions en ligne avec Masque, cadres amusants et filtres sp\u00e9ciaux.\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-14T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4c7f4b9d-5aea-4f6d-8223-a04155b0c7fc","identifier":"14585181","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["lexmark","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["n"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark XS860de 4"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fast 4-in-1, Up to A3 \/ 11 x 17<\/b>\\nBuilt for your most demanding document needs, this powerful multifunction device supports media sizes up to A3 (11 x 17 \/ tabloid) and delivers print and copy speeds up to 35 ppm.\\n\\n<b>Gain Real Momentum<\/b>\\nIdeal for high volumes, the Lexmark XS860de monochrome laser MFP provides fax, automatic duplexing and standard input capacity for up to 1,100 sheets, expandable to 5,100 sheets with optional paper handling accessories.\\n\\n<b>Enormously intuitive touchscreen<\/b>\\nLexmark\u2019s award-winning 9-inch (22.9 cm) color e-Task touchscreen gives you fast, easy access to document capture and workflow functions. Tailor it to your business requirements with the icons and shortcuts you need most.\\n\\n<b>Optional finishing<\/b>\\nSave time, money and office space by eliminating pre-printed documents and producing more of your print jobs on demand and in-house. Finishing options including stapling, hole punching (2\/3 or 2\/4 holes), offset stacking and booklet folding with overlap adjustment.\\n\\n<b>State-of-the-art security<\/b>\\nProtects you from risk with state-of-the-art features for secure management, network communication and information storage. What\u2019s more, customizable user-access controls let you enable or disable functions with ease.\\n\\n<b>Solutions-ready<\/b>\\nIncludes Lexmark's award-winning solutions platform for running tailored applications and workflow solutions, such as Lexmark Print Release and Document Accounting. Contact your Lexmark representative to learn more."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"83f64078-aaea-4be6-a92b-7d922be7a77a","identifier":"14585252","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung NX 1000"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"From its sleek and stylish design to its incredibly simple user interface, the NX1000 has been designed to be an extension of your creativity. As simple as it is to use, the NX1000 is a highly capable camera. Its super high-resolution APS-C sensor (20.3 megapixels) allows for photos with incredible detail that allow high quality enlargements to be made. With built-in WiFi features, the NX1000 keeps you connected to friends and family wherever you go. It makes showing and sharing your photos as simple as the push of a button. It\u2019s a lightweight camera that is great for vacations and comes in three colour variations (black, white, and pink).\\n\\n<b>Shoot like a pro!<\/b>\\n<b>20.3 MP APS-C Sensor<\/b>\\nThe professional-grade, 20.3 MP APS-C CMOS Sensor produces images that rival those of any premium DSLR. Each individual pixel has a large sensor area and receives more light, guaranteeing low noise levels, high dynamic range and accurate color differentiation. The higher sensitivity allows you to shoot during low-light situations without graininess or other noise. The NX1000 features super-fast High Speed Capture capabilities and an ultra-high speed Auto Focus (AF) that can rival almost any system camera. The result is a fast and precise AF System that captures life\u2019s fleeting moments. And with a sequential rate of 8fps, capturing fast-moving objects in perfect clarity are no longer a challenge.\\n\\n<b>Light and stylish<\/b>\\n<b>Simple & Emotional Design<\/b>\\nThe camera is extremely portable and the perfect travel companion. The lightweight body also makes it easier to shoot stills or video for longer periods of time. The exterior of the NX1000 is just as impressive. The modern and sleek body adds another layer of elegance and sophistication to something that\u2019s usually more functional than beautiful. The body of the NX1000 is available in three different colors (black, white, and pink).\\n\\n<b>Share your moments wirelessly<\/b>\\n<b>Wi-Fi (Smart Link)<\/b>\\n\\nWith Built-in Wi-Fi capability, you can share any special or exciting moment on the move. Send photos by uploading to Facebook\u2122, Picasa\u2122, Photobucket\u2122 or email directly from the camera. You can also upload videos to YouTube\u2122 then sit back to wait for the raves. Samsung Mobile Link allows you to directly send your images to your smartphone or tablet. You can also save the images to your PC by just one click with Auto Backup. No more searching for the cable, it is that easy.\\n\\n<b>Discover the true beauty of HD video<\/b>\\n<b>1080p Full HD Stereo Movie Recording<\/b>\\nBuilt with 1080 30p Full HD movie recording capabilities, the NX1000 transforms shooting video with a still camera into an art form. Choose from a wide range of viewing angles and zoom with confidence. The mirrorless CMOS image sensor offers precise auto focus even while you shoot. For a truly cinematic experience, the NX System has been fitted with an 18 - 200 mm lens exclusively for Full HD video.\\n\\n<b>The simple way to go pro<\/b>\\n<b>Smart Auto 2.0<\/b>\\nThe NX1000\u2019s Smart Auto 2.0 automatically analyzes the shooting environment and then chooses the appropriate scene mode for the best possible results. Smart Auto 2.0 analyzes key elements in the composition and automatically adjusts its 16 photo modes and 4 movie modes to capture the best shot.\\n\\n<b>A camera that\u2019s quick on the draw<\/b>\\n<b>High Speed Capture<\/b>\\nThe NX1000\u2019s High Speed Capture capabilities let you catch fleeting moments and fast-moving objects without requiring a separate sensor module. The NX System features an ultra-high-speed Auto Focus that can rival that of almost any system camera. Its all-new, advanced algorithm delivers faster and more accurate auto focus. The NX1000 can shoot at 8 frames per second for better continuous shooting.\\n\\n<b>Wide Range ISO for perfect exposure<\/b>\\n<b>Wide Range ISO (12800, 7 steps)<\/b>\\nWide Range ISO makes any lighting situation the perfect one. The ability to shoot as high as ISO 12800 at normal settings means that even in low light, you\u2019ll get rich tonal gradations and true colors. You\u2019ll also capture clear, crisp images of fast-moving objects.\\n\\n<b>i-Function 2.0<\/b>\\nThe i-Function 2.0 system makes it easy to adjust key camera settings through a single button and the value ring located on the lens, instead of the body. Designed for the novice and expert alike, i-Function 2.0 lets you quickly choose the settings that best fit the moment\u2014and your expertise.\\n\\n<b>Smart Filter & Selective Color<\/b>\\nSmart Filter 2.0 options make it easy to create special moods. Choose the Tilt & Shift Lens Effect for a miniaturized look, the Vignetting Effect for striking contrasts, Half-Tone Dot for a comic-book look, and more. With the Selective Color feature, you can even choose the colors you want to emphasize.\\n\\n<b>Panorama, 3D Panorama<\/b>\\nCapture the sweeping beauty of a natural landscape or the grandeur of a vast skyline. The NX1000\u2019s panoramic capabilities let you catch every detail on the horizon with the push of a button. You can even create 3D panoramic photos and wow your friends by displaying them on a 3D-ready HDTV.\\n\\n<b>LCD Display<\/b>\\nThe 3-inch LCD screen on the back of the NX1000 provides a perfect, glare-free way to review your photos. The wide and bright screen reproduces the images so they look as they truly appear - even in direct sunlight."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bde81856-9508-48d6-b3b6-8222c4e0e4d3","identifier":"14587419","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CJX-1000 multifunctional"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Optimale Fotoqualit\u00e4t mit 9.600 x 2.400 dpi<\/b>\\n\\nStarten Sie den Druckvorgang und lehnen Sie sich entspannt zur\u00fcck. Die Druckqualit\u00e4t mit 9.600 x 2.400 dpi sorgt f\u00fcr h\u00f6chste Aufl\u00f6sung und \u00fcberragende Detailtiefe. Damit bekommen Sie Bilder in HD-Qualit\u00e4t, die realistischer, leuchtender und lebensechter sind als alles, was Sie bisher mit einem Drucker erzielen konnten.\\n\\n<b>Fotobearbeitung leicht gemacht<\/b>\\n\\nHolen Sie das Beste aus allen Bildern heraus. Optimieren Sie Ihr Lieblingsfoto, bringen Sie die Farben wieder heraus, beseitigen Sie rote Augen, retuschieren Sie sogar eine verirrte Haarstr\u00e4hne \u2013 und das alles auf Tastendruck. Oder gehen Sie noch weiter ins Detail und bearbeiten Sie die Fotos ganz nach Ihren W\u00fcnschen. In jedem Fall erhalten Sie attraktive Bilder.\\n\\n<b>Einfacher Fotodruck von SNS<\/b>\\n\\nWenn Sie Fotos auf Websites von sozialen Netzwerken gespeichert haben, beispielsweise auf Facebook, Flickr, Photobucket oder Picasa, dann k\u00f6nnen Sie diese Bilder ganz schnell und bequem suchen, \u00f6ffnen, weiterleiten und drucken.\\n\\n<b>Standbilder aus Full-HD-Videofilmen erfassen und drucken<\/b>\\n\\nMit dem Samsung CJX-1000 k\u00f6nnen Sie m\u00fchelos Vollfarbbilder in HD-Qualit\u00e4t aus HD-Videofilmen erfassen und ausdrucken. \u00dcber die unkomplizierten Bedienelemente erhalten Sie genau das gew\u00fcnschte Bild in \u00fcberw\u00e4ltigender Detailtiefe.\\n\\n<b>Die volle Kraft des 3D-Fotodrucks<\/b>\\n\\nLassen Sie Ihre Fotos so lebendig werden wie nie zuvor: Erstellen Sie ganz pers\u00f6nliche, hochwertige 3D-Ausdrucke. Setzen Sie einfach eine 3D-Brille auf, und genie\u00dfen Sie die beeindruckende, im wahrsten Sinn des Wortes ins Auge springende Wirkung.\\n\\n<b>Viel mehr als nur ein Drucker<\/b>\\n\\nIn der heutigen Zeit ist Drucken allein einfach nicht mehr genug, weder daheim noch im Beruf. Genau deshalb bietet der Samsung CJX-1000 umfangreiche Funktionen in einem kompakten Ger\u00e4t. Alles f\u00fcrs Drucken, Scannen und Kopieren.\\n\\n<b>1,5-Zoll-LCD-Bildschirm<\/b>\\n\\nAuf dem gestochen scharfen, leicht ablesbaren 1,5\u201c LCD-Farbbildschirm haben Sie alle Funktionen und Vorg\u00e4nge des Samsung CJX-1000 im Blick.\\n\\n<b>Speicherkartenleseger\u00e4t<\/b>\\n\\nWenn Ihre Bilder auf einer Speicherkarte abgelegt sind, schieben Sie die Karte einfach in den Drucker ein. Das Ger\u00e4t erkennt MS und MS Duo sowie SD-, SDHC- und MMC-Karten in Sekundenschnelle."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung CJX-1000. Print technology: Inkjet, Printing: Colour, Copying: Colour. Maximum copy resolution: 1200 x 1200, Copier resize: 20 - 500. Optical scanning resolution: 1200 x 1200, Maximum scan resolution: 9600 x 9600, Scan technology: CIS. ISO A-series sizes (A0...A9): A4, A5, A6, Maximum print size: Legal (216 x 356 mm), Standard tray media types: Card stock, Envelopes, Labels, Photo paper, Plain paper, Transparencies. Display: LCD, Display diagonal: 1.5"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Une qualit\u00e9 photo digne des professionnels\\n\\n- Une qualit\u00e9 photo digne des professionnels\\n- Retouchez en toute simplicit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au Studio photo\\n- Cr\u00e9ez des photos en 3D\\n- Capturez des vid\u00e9os Full HD\\n\\n<b>Une r\u00e9solution extraordinaire de 9600 x 2400 dpi<\/b>\\n\\nAppuyez sur imprimer et regardez sortir des tirages plus r\u00e9alistes, plus lumineux et plus vivants que jamais. La qualit\u00e9 de 9600 x 2400 dpi vous assure haute r\u00e9solution et pr\u00e9cision pour vos images.\\n\\n<b>Des retouches photos en toute simplicit\u00e9<\/b>\\n\\nFaites de chaque image la meilleure. Perfectionnez vos photos pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9es en un clic: ajustement des couleurs, suppression des yeux rouges ou m\u00eame retouche d'un \u00e9pi rebelle. C'est tellement simple d'avoir les plus belles photos.\\n\\n<b>Acc\u00e8s direct aux photos de vos r\u00e9seaux sociaux<\/b>\\n\\nL'imprimante CJX-1000 vous garantie une impression photo de qualit\u00e9 et donne vie \u00e0 vos tirages avec l'impression 3D, la capture de vid\u00e9o Full HD et l'acc\u00e8s direct aux photos de vos r\u00e9seaux sociaux.\\nAcc\u00e9dez, visualisez, partagez et imprimez tr\u00e8s simplement toutes vos photos ou vid\u00e9os de vos r\u00e9seaux sociaux (Facebook, Flickr, Photobucket, Picasa...).\\n\\n<b>Capturez et imprimez depuis des films HD<\/b>\\n\\nLa CJX-1000 de Samsung vous permet de capturer et d'imprimer facilement et sans effort des photos couleur de haute qualit\u00e9 depuis des films HD. Simple d'utilisation, il vous est d\u00e9sormais possible d'imprimer exactement ce dont vous souhaitez.\\n\\n<b>Vivez pleinement l'experience photo 3D<\/b>\\n\\nDonnez vie \u00e0 vos photo gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression en 3D. Amusez-vous en cr\u00e9ant vos photos, il vous suffit ensuite de mettre vos lunettes (fournies) et de profiter de ces photos au r\u00e9alisme saisissant.\\n\\n<b>Bien plus qu'une simple imprimante<\/b>\\n\\nDe nos jours, une simple imprimante ne suffit plus. Le multifonction jet d'encre CJX-1000 vous apporte une large gamme de fonctionnalit\u00e9s en un seul appareil compact. Vous pouvez imprimer, scanner et copier, facilement et rapidement.\\n\\n<b>Ecran LCD 1.5\u201d<\/b>\\n\\nNaviguez facilement dans les menus de votre multifonction gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son \u00e9cran de 1.5\u201d.\\n\\n<b>Lecteur de carte m\u00e9moire<\/b>\\n\\nLa CJX-1000 dispose d'un lecteur de carte m\u00e9moire pouvant reconnaitre diff\u00e9rents types de cartes; MS, MS Duo, SD, SDHC, et MMC. Ins\u00e9rez votre carte dans le lecteur et imprimez vos photos depuis votre multifonction, tout simplement."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-15T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f886fd95-e057-4fb1-8f6d-fbce793ab310","identifier":"14591715","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","fax","print","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLX-3305FN"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Choose a Samsung CLX-3305FN Colour Laser Multifunction Printer and maximise your print quality \u2013 as well as your workspace. You can print, copy, fax and scan at the touch of a button. Not only that, but Samsung\u2019s ReCP technology and new polymerised toner make sure that your printouts are more vivid, crisp and vibrant than ever. And, thanks to compact ergonomic design, the CLX-3305FN even takes up less space.\\n\\n<b>4-in-1 Multifunction<\/b>\\nOne push of the ECO button and you can save paper and energy straightaway.\\nPrint more onto every page, including 2-up, 4-up and duplex. Easy Document Creator is an application to help you compile and share large documents or other scanned or faxed information digitally. Print exactly what you see on the screen with just one click, saving time. Connect quickly and securely to your wireless network with the touch of a button, via the CLX-3305FN Wi-Fi Protected Setup (WPS).\\n\\n<b>Enjoy quality printouts<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s unique ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) Technology improves the overall quality and vibrancy of your colour printing, ensuring every printout looks perfect. It automatically sharpens the focus of both graphics and text, while solid objects are overlapped to eliminate white gaps.\\n\\n<b>Polymerized toner<\/b>\\nOur newly developed polymerized toner has smaller and more uniform particles than conventional toner. Meaning, your printouts will have crisper lines and more vivid colours - helping avoid any paper curling. Also, its higher wax content improves the image gloss and enhances the durability preventing unwanted fading.\\n\\n<b>Ergonomic design<\/b>\\nDon't worry about this printer crowding your space. Its beautiful and compact design makes it a pleasure to share a desk with.\\n\\n* Small size Footprint\\nWith a footprint of just 40.6 x 36.2cm, it's the world's smallest colour laser MFP.\\n\\n* Ergonomic design\\nIts ergonomic design with ebony brown and ice grey colour creates a modern and elegant work environments.\\n\\n<b>Easy to use<\/b>\\nDesigned for simple and intuitive operation the CLX-3305FN saves you precious time and effort.\\n\\n* One Touch Eco Button\\nJust One push of the ECO button and you can save on toner, paper, and energy. Print multiple pages on one sheet, change colour to greyscale or skip blank pages.\\n\\n* One Touch Print Screen Button\\nPrint exactly what you see on the screen with just one click, saving time.\\n\\n* One Touch WPS Button\\nConnect quickly and securely to your wireless network with the touch of a button, via the one-touch WPS (Wi-Fi Protected Setup).\\n\\n* Direct USB Printing\\nEasily print images and documents directly from a USB memory stick with the intuitive menu and navigation keys.\\n\\n<b>Easy Colour Manager<\/b>\\nCreate and use your own colour profiles with Samsung's Easy Colour Manager. Match the exact colours of a compay logo or simply give your print outs the individual look you want.\\n\\n<b>Easy Document Creator<\/b>\\nEasy Document Creator helps you creat digital documents in multiple formats and makes it easy to share them with others - via e-mail, fax or social networks.\\n\\n<b>Easy Solution s<\/b>\\nupport\\nThe printer also brings you software support designed to put you in control of delivering ultimate quality printouts easier than ever before.\\n\\n* Easy Eco Driver\\nEasy Eco Driver helps you compile digital documents in multiple formats and makes it easy to share them with others - even through social networks."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-16T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"98dac2b1-693b-455c-8940-83d11f7ade83","identifier":"14591719","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["multifunctionals","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLX-4195FW"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Bei dem 4-in-1-Farblaser-Modellen CLX-4195FW wird Produktivit\u00e4t und Benutzerfreundlichkeit gro\u00df geschrieben. Das Ger\u00e4t ist mit allem ausgestattet, was anspruchsvolle Anwender f\u00fcr professionelles und wirtschaftliches Drucken, Kopieren, Scannen und Faxen ben\u00f6tigen. Herausragend ist auch die brillante Farbdruckqualit\u00e4t. Es verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber ein komfortables 4,3-Zoll-Farbdisplay und kann drahtlos bedient werden.\\n\\n<b>4-in-1-Multifunktion<\/b>\\nDank der 4-in-1-Funktionalit\u00e4t optimiert der Drucker Samsung CLX-4195FW die Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe und stellt sicher, dass die Druckauftr\u00e4ge im B\u00fcro so effizient wie m\u00f6glich ablaufen. Mit den Funktionen zum Drucken, Kopieren, Scannen und Faxen bietet der CLX-4195FW Flexibilit\u00e4t und legt Ihnen bei der Arbeit keine Steine in den Weg. Viele innovative Funktionen wie Ausweiskopie, N-up-Kopie und Scannen an E-Mail gew\u00e4hrleisten, dass Ihren Mitarbeitern die f\u00fcr eine moderne Gesch\u00e4ftswelt n\u00f6tigen Funktionalit\u00e4ten zur Verf\u00fcgung stehen.\\n\\n<b>Genie\u00dfen Sie qualitativ hochwertige Ausdrucke<\/b>\\nSamsungs einzigartige ReCP-Technologie (ReCP steht f\u00fcr \"Rendering Engine for Clean Page\") verbessert die Gesamtqualit\u00e4t und Lebendigkeit Ihres Ausdrucks. Damit wird gew\u00e4hrleistet, dass jeder Ausdruck perfekt aussieht. Die Farbpunkte werden extrem pr\u00e4zise gesetzt und damit beispielsweise wei\u00dfe R\u00e4nder an Objekten und Schriften vermieden.\\n\\n<b>Polymertoner<\/b>\\nDie Farbpartikel der neuen von Samsung entwickelten Polymertoner sind im Vergleich zu herk\u00f6mmlichen Tonern einheitlicher. Sie k\u00f6nnen in hoher Pr\u00e4zision gleichm\u00e4\u00dfiger und d\u00fcnner aufgetragen werden. Das Ergebnis sind klare und lebendige Ausdrucke. Der erh\u00f6hte Wachsgehalt verbessert zudem den Bildglanz und sorgt f\u00fcr h\u00f6here Langlebigkeit, weil unerw\u00fcnschtes Ausbleichen verhindert wird.\\n\\n<b>Eine h\u00f6here Druckleistung<\/b>\\nEine verbesserte Produktivit\u00e4t Ihres Unternehmens beginnt mit Ihrem Drucker. Mit einer Ausgabe von 18 Seiten pro Minute in Farbe und S\/W sowie der Ausgabe der ersten Seite nach nur 16 Sekunden l\u00e4sst Sie der CLX-4195FW nicht im Stich.\\n\\n* Mehr Leistung, mehr Produktivit\u00e4t\\nMit seinen beiden Prozessorkernen kann das Ger\u00e4t Ihre Dateien simultan und somit schneller verarbeiten. Der Arbeitsspeicher von 256 MB gew\u00e4hrleistet, dass selbst schwergewichtige Druckauftr\u00e4ge schneller verarbeitet werden und Sie nicht zu lang auf Ihren Ausdruck warten m\u00fcssen. Was das f\u00fcr Sie bedeutet? Ganz einfach: Der CLX-4195FW ist die perfekte L\u00f6sung f\u00fcr umfassende Druckaufgaben und knappe Abgabefristen.\\n\\n<b>Einfach benutzerfreundlich<\/b>\\nIhre Zeit ist zu kostbar, um stundenlang vor dem Drucker zu warten. Vom Betrieb bis zu den Softwareprogrammen haben Sie bei diesem Arbeitsgruppendrucker volle Kontrolle.\\n\\n* Einfaches Bedienfeld\\nDas vierzeilige Display des CLX-4195FW ist kristallklar, gut lesbar und macht das Verfolgen Ihrer Druckauftr\u00e4ge und Bedienen der einmaligen Funktionen zum Kinderspiel.\\n\\n<b>USB Direct<\/b>\\nSie k\u00f6nnen Ihre Druckauftr\u00e4ge auch direkt vom USB-Stick drucken: Senden Sie sie einfach \u00fcber unser spezielles USB-Dock, das sich direkt unter dem Bedienfeld befindet.\\n\\n<b>Praktischer Support<\/b>\\nDer Drucker bietet auch Softwaresupport, damit Sie einfacher als je zuvor hochwertig drucken k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n* Easy Eco Treiber\\nMit dem Easy Eco Treiber k\u00f6nnen Sie digitale Dokumente mit verschiedenen Formaten verarbeiten und problemlos mit anderen Teilen \u2013 auch \u00fcber soziale Netzwerke.\\n\\n<b>Easy Color Management<\/b>\\nDer Samsung Easy Color Manager erm\u00f6glicht Ihnen vor dem Druck die Einstellung der Farbbalance, der S\u00e4ttigung, der Helligkeit oder des Kontrasts jedes einzelnen Bilds. Perfekt, um jedes Mal die richtigen Farben Ihres Unternehmenslogos zu treffen.\\n\\n<b>Ger\u00e4testeuerung per Fernzugriff<\/b>\\nF\u00fcr eine maximale Kontrolle l\u00e4sst Sie der Easy Printer Manager alle Ger\u00e4te von einem Standort aus verwalten. \u00dcberpr\u00fcfen Sie Ger\u00e4te- und Tonerstatus, \u00e4ndern Sie Einstellungen oder setzen Sie\\n\\n<b>Alarmgrenzen fest.<\/b>\\n<b>Dokumenterstellung leicht gemacht<\/b>\\nDer Samsung Easy Document Creator ist eine Anwendung, die Benutzer beim Scannen, Zusammenstellen und Speichern von Dokumenten in mehreren Formaten einschlie\u00dflich .epub unterst\u00fctzt. Diese Dokumente k\u00f6nnen \u00fcber soziale Netzwerke oder per Fax weitergegeben werden. Das ist die ideale L\u00f6sung, um Ihre Notizen z.B. den Teilnehmern einer wichtigen Sitzung weiterzugeben.\\n\\n<b>Ihr zuverl\u00e4ssiger Gesch\u00e4ftspartner<\/b>\\nDank modernster Technologie und qualitativ hochwertiger Komponenten ist der CLX-4195FW absolut zuverl\u00e4ssig, selbst bei gro\u00dfen Druckauftr\u00e4gen.\\n\\n* Anti-Papierstau-Walze\\nWir haben unsere zuverl\u00e4ssige Anti-Papierstau-Walze entwickelt, um das Risiko eines fehlerhaften Einzugs und eines Papierstaus zu minimieren. Besser noch: Sie erm\u00f6glicht die Verwendung eines schwereren Papiergewichts bis zu Karton (220 g\/m\u00b2) in der Standardpapierkassette.\\n\\n* Zuverl\u00e4ssig auch bei hoher Belastung\\nSie wissen, wie wichtig es ist, dass Ihr Drucker zuverl\u00e4ssig funktioniert, gerade bei stressigen Projekten. Somit bedeutet ein Arbeitszyklus von 50.000 Blatt, dass beim Drucken tempor\u00e4re Spitzen mit Leichtigkeit aufgefangen werden k\u00f6nnen.\\n\\n<b>Immer kosteng\u00fcnstig drucken<\/b>\\nHalten Sie Ihre Druckkosten w\u00e4hrend des gesamten Betriebszeitraums des Druckers unter Kontrolle. Niedrige Kosten pro Seite halten Ihre laufenden Kosten w\u00e4hrend der Gesch\u00e4ftst\u00e4tigkeiten niedrig.\\n\\n<b>* Hohe Ergiebigkeit, niedrige Kosten<\/b>\\nMit Kassetten mit hoher Ergiebigkeit sparen Sie Zeit, da diese nicht so h\u00e4ufig ausgewechselt werden m\u00fcssen, und niedrige Tonerkosten bedeuten weniger Kosten pro Seite. Sie werden feststellen, dass die Gesamtkosten betr\u00e4chtlich reduziert werden.\\n\\n<b>* Weniger Strom, weniger Kosten<\/b>\\nDurch niedrigeren Stromverbrauch k\u00f6nnen Sie sogar noch mehr Geld sparen. Unser innovativer Polymertoner ben\u00f6tigt niedrigere Fixiertemperaturen und somit auch weniger Energie. Auch die Dual-CPU ben\u00f6tigt weniger Strom f\u00fcr ihre Aufgaben. Mit einem typischen Stromverbrauch von nur 1,2 kWh \u2013 gemessen von Energy Star \u2013 geh\u00f6rt der CLX-4195FW zu den Topger\u00e4ten seiner Klasse.\\n\\n<b>* Eco-Druck<\/b>\\nEin Druck auf die Eco Save Taste \u2013 und Sie k\u00f6nnen s\u00e4mtliche smarten Eco-Funktionen nutzen, die mithilfe des Druckertreibers individuell eingestellt werden k\u00f6nnen. Drucken Sie mehrere Seiten auf einem Blatt, \u00fcberspringen Sie leere Seiten oder verwenden Sie Graustufen. Sie k\u00f6nnen sofort Papier, Toner, Energie und Geld sparen.\\n\\n<b>Netzwerkf\u00e4hig<\/b>\\nDer Samsung CLX-4195FW verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber ein komfortables integriertes Netzwerk f\u00fcr eine erweiterte Konnektivit\u00e4t. Damit kann jeder PC Ihres Netzwerks den Drucker verwenden. So k\u00f6nnen Sie Geld sparen, statt weitere Drucker kaufen zu m\u00fcssen..\\n\\n<b>Mobile Druckfunktionen<\/b>\\nDank der beeindruckenden mobilen Druckl\u00f6sung von Samsung m\u00fcssen Sie keine Treiber auf Ihren mobilen Ger\u00e4ten installieren. Installieren Sie einfach nur die mobile Druckanwendung von Samsung auf Ihren mobilen Ger\u00e4ten, um direkt dar\u00fcber zu drucken.\\n\\n<b>Einfacher Toneraustausch<\/b>\\nSchluss mit dem komplizierten, schmutzigen und zeitaufwendigen Austausch von Tonerkassetten. Mit der Tonerschublade wird das alles viel einfacher. Und zudem m\u00fcssen die Hochleistungskassetten weniger oft ausgetauscht werden."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung CLX-4195FW. Print technology: Laser, Printing: Colour, Copying: Colour. Maximum copy resolution: 600 x 600, Copier resize: 25 - 400. Optical scanning resolution: 4800 \u0445 4800, Maximum scan area: Legal (216 x 356), Scan type: Flatbed. Fax resolution: 300 x 300, Modem speed: 33.6. ISO A-series sizes (A0...A9): A4, A5, A6, Maximum print size: Legal (216 x 356 mm), Standard tray media types: Photo paper, Plain paper, Recycled paper, Thin paper, Transparencies"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-16T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"54134099-1ebf-45f0-b988-46b50bfd1f9e","identifier":"14596092","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 26LT380H LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Front LED Clock<\/b>\\nThe integrated LED clock has an array of alarm functions that are useful for guests, yet introduces cost savings for hoteliers - no need to supply a separate alarm clock.\\n\\n<b>Lock Mode<\/b>\\nLock Mode can make TV to be blocked from external input signals for illegal communication in such areas; Prison, Mental hospital and any applicable public spaces.\\n\\n<b>Swivel Stand<\/b>\\nThe Swivel stand allows guests to watch TV virtually at any direction as it can be rotated 90 degrees in both directions. Just rotate the TV to your direction to watch TV comfortably."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":26,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"dc41b5ff-3601-4fac-a2b0-89e181e2746a","identifier":"14596093","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","lg","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"LG 32LT380H LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Front LED Clock<\/b>\\nThe integrated LED clock has an array of alarm functions that are useful for guests, yet introduces cost savings for hoteliers - no need to supply a separate alarm clock.\\n\\n<b>Lock Mode<\/b>\\nLock Mode can make TV to be blocked from external input signals for illegal communication in such areas; Prison, Mental hospital and any applicable public spaces.\\n\\n<b>Swivel Stand<\/b>\\nThe Swivel stand allows guests to watch TV virtually at any direction as it can be rotated 90 degrees in both directions. Just rotate the TV to your direction to watch TV comfortably."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":32,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"028e7a35-d8f8-4325-a334-2e655dc5790a","identifier":"14599279","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["copy","scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Deskjet 2050A"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Optisch attraktiver HP All-in-One f\u00fcr zuverl\u00e4ssiges, kosteng\u00fcnstiges Drucken, Scannen und Kopieren. Dieses kompakte Ger\u00e4t ist ideal f\u00fcr den Alltagseinsatz, einfach zu installieren, \u00e4u\u00dferst benutzerfreundlich und verbessert obendrein noch die Umweltbilanz.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Drucken, Scannen und Kopieren mit einem optisch attraktiven, kosteng\u00fcnstigen und benutzerfreundlichen Ger\u00e4t.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Nichts ist unm\u00f6glich \u2013 mit diesem g\u00fcnstigen All-in-One kann man zu Hause spielend einfach drucken, scannen und kopieren.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Zuverl\u00e4ssige und kosteng\u00fcnstige Leistung mit der weltweit f\u00fchrenden Druckermarke.<SUP>1<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Zuverl\u00e4ssige, kosteng\u00fcnstige Leistung mit dem HP Deskjet \u2013 seit mehr als 20 Jahren die Top-Seller-Marke im Druckerbereich.<SUP>1<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Energieverbrauch reduzieren und Ressourcen sch\u00fctzen \u2013 konzipiert mit der Umwelt im Blick.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Dieser ENERGY-STAR\u00ae-zertifizierte All-in-One reduziert den Energieverbrauch.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Aussage basierend auf IDC-Daten zu den Verkaufszahlen von Inkjet-Produkten bis zum Jahr 2010.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The HP Deskjet 2050A All-in-One is designed for home users who want a compact, stylish and affordable all-in-one device, one with simple, intuitive controls that allow quick and easy printing, scanning and copying of everyday documents."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une impression, d'une num\u00e9risation et d'une copie fiables et abordables avec cet \u00e9l\u00e9gant tout-en-un HP. Id\u00e9al pour l'impression des documents de tous les jours, cet appareil compact est simple \u00e0 installer et utiliser et vous permet de r\u00e9duire votre impact sur l'environnement.\\n\\n<b>Imprimez, num\u00e9risez et copiez avec un seul appareil \u00e9l\u00e9gant, abordable et facile \u00e0 utiliser.<\/b>\\n- Il fait tout : profitez chez vous de la facilit\u00e9 d'impression, de num\u00e9risation et de copie avec ce tout-en-un abordable.\\n\\n<b>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez des performances fiables et abordables de la marque d'imprimantes la plus vendue au monde.<\/b>\\n- Comptez sur des performances fiables et abordables avec HP Deskjet, n\u00b0 1 des ventes mondiales d'imprimantes depuis plus de 20 ans.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez la consommation d'\u00e9nergie et pr\u00e9servez les ressources : con\u00e7u dans le respect de l'environnement.<\/b>\\n- \u00c9conomisez de l'\u00e9nergie avec ce tout-en-un certifi\u00e9 ENERGY STAR\u00ae."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a023d5c9-47b0-4e63-bfc4-bffe6be289e5","identifier":"14600631","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SBA1610GRN"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die Philips SBA1610 Lautsprecher bieten einen satten dynamischen Sound. Sie verf\u00fcgen \u00fcber einen praktischen beweglichen St\u00e4nder, der f\u00fcr eine ausgesprochen einfache Handhabung sorgt."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Filling your world with rich, dynamic sound, Philips SBA1610 speakers come with a handy mobile stand that makes them incredibly easy to use.\\n\\n<b>Impressive sound<\/b>\\n- Class \"D\" Digital Amplifier for superb sound quality\\n- Neodymium speaker drivers deliver pure balanced sound\\n- 2 W RMS total output power\\n\\n<b>Simplicity<\/b>\\n- Battery powered for portability\\n- Compatible with any media"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Pour une immersion dans un son riche et dynamique, les enceintes Philips SBA1610 sont fournies avec un socle portable pratique, qui facilite incroyablement leur utilisation."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-19T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ec602885-31e9-4926-bf60-a8fbc5c18823","identifier":"14604694","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","logitech","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_720"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech C525"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"8"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>With HD 720p video calling and recording, now you can share your HD world\u2014anywhere, anytime.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>HD video calls<\/b>\\nYou\u2019ll get HD 720p video calling on most major instant messaging services.\\n\\n<b>Premium autofocus<\/b>\\nYour images stay razor sharp, even in close-ups (up to 7 cm from the camera lens) with built-in autofocus.\\n\\n<b>Fold-and-go, plus-swivel design<\/b>\\nIt\u2019s easy to slip it into your bag and take it with you. Plus, the 360-degree, full-rotational design makes calling and recording easier at any angle.\\n\\n<b>8-megapixel snapshots<\/b>\\nYou can take high-resolution snapshots at up to 8 megapixels (software enhanced).\\n\\n<b>Built-in mic with noise reduction<\/b>\\nIt gives you clear conversations without annoying background noise.\\n\\n<b>Auto light correction<\/b>\\nEven if you make a video call in dim or poorly backlit settings, the camera will intelligently adjust to produce the best possible image.\\n\\n<b>IM compatibility<\/b>\\nWorks with Skype\u2122, Windows Live\u2122 Messenger, Yahoo!\u00ae Messenger and other popular instant messaging applications."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-20T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a7e6f843-fb28-4299-8c0f-93d1c01a60dd","identifier":"14608099","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","fujifilm"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujifilm FinePix S4500"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b9799006-445c-471a-9ff3-9a14e77ea0bb","identifier":"14634162","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DSC-W690 digital camera"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"besonders schlanke, bedienfreundliche Cyber-shot\u2122 Kamera mit leistungsstarkem Zoom<br\/>\\n<br\/>CCD Sensor mit 16,1 Mio. Pixel (effektiv): F\u00fcr \u00e4u\u00dferst hohe Bildqualit\u00e4t und detailgetreue Vergr\u00f6\u00dferungen.<br\/>\\nOptischer 10fach-Zoom\/25-mm-G-Weitwinkelobjektiv: Das hochwertige Objektiv deckt einen besonders weiten Zoombereich ab, weshalb sich die wunderbar schlanke Kamera hervorragend f\u00fcr Reisen, Aufnahmen von bewegten Motiven und vieles mehr eignet.<br\/>\\nIntelligenter Automatikmodus: Die Kamera erkennt zahlreiche h\u00e4ufige Aufnahmesituationen und optimiert die Einstellungen, sodass Sie ohne gro\u00dfen Aufwand herausragende Ergebnisse erhalten.<br\/>\\nModi f\u00fcr kreative Bildeffekte: Auswahl zwischen vier spannenden Kameraeffekten: Spielzeugkamera, Teilfarbfilter, Soft High-Key und Pop Colour.<br\/>\\n720p-HD-Filmaufnahme: Aufnahmen von flie\u00dfenden, hochwertigen HD-Videoclips im mp4-Format (MPEG-4 AVC\/H.264): Einsatzm\u00f6glichkeit des optischen Zooms w\u00e4hrend der Videoaufnahme.<br\/>\\nOptischer SteadyShot (Active-Modus) (zusammen mit elektronischer Bildstabilisierung): Gleicht Verwacklungen der Kamera bei Videoaufnahmen aus (selbst beim Gehen oder Zoomen).<br\/>\\n360\u00b0-Schwenkpanorama: Schwenken Sie die Kamera f\u00fcr extrabreite Landschaftsaufnahmen, Stadtansichten oder Aufnahmen hoher Geb\u00e4ude; der neue 360\u00b0-Modus erstellt vollst\u00e4ndige Rundumaufnahmen..<br\/>\\n7,5-cm-\/3\"-LCD mit Clear Photo Technologie: Hochwertiges LCD (230.000 Bildpunkte) f\u00fcr ausgezeichnete Details, hohe Kontraste und einen weiten Betrachtungswinkel.<br\/>\\nGesichtserkennung: F\u00fcr noch sch\u00e4rfere Portr\u00e4ts stellt die Kamera Fokus, Belichtung und Wei\u00dfabgleich automatisch ein und verf\u00fcgt zudem \u00fcber eine Priorit\u00e4tenauswahl f\u00fcr Kinder\/Erwachsene..<br\/>\\nSmile Shutter: L\u00f6st die Aufnahme automatisch aus, wenn die Person im Sucher l\u00e4chelt: mit anpassbarem Schwellenwert und w\u00e4hlbaren Einstellungen f\u00fcr Kinder und Erwachsene.<br\/>\\nSelbstausl\u00f6ser: F\u00fcr richtige Bildkompositionen bei kurzem Abstand zum Motiv; ein automatischer Ausl\u00f6ser sorgt f\u00fcr perfekt in Szene gesetzte Selbstportr\u00e4ts..<br\/>\\nBenutzerfreundlicher Aufnahmemodus: Gut lesbare Bildschirmanweisungen erleichtern selbst Anf\u00e4ngern den Umgang mit der Kamera.<br\/>\\nIntegrierter Leitfaden: Profitieren Sie von Tipps und Informationen zur Bedienung Ihrer Kamera direkt auf dem Bildschirm \u2013 kein l\u00e4stiges Bl\u00e4ttern mehr in Leitf\u00e4den..<br\/>\\nRetusche direkt in der Kamera: Retusche-Funktionen direkt in der Kamera, einschlie\u00dflich Zuschneiden, Rote-Augen-Korrektur und Unsch\u00e4rfefilter.<br\/>\\nPlayMemories Home: Vorinstallierte Software f\u00fcr eine einfache Bild\u00fcbertragung auf den PC zum Ansehen, Bearbeiten, Drucken, Versenden per E-Mail, Upload ins Internet usw..<br\/>\\nSpeicherkartenkompatibilit\u00e4t: Cyber-shot\u2122 unterst\u00fctzt zahlreiche Speicherkarten, darunter Memory Stick\u2122 und SD- bzw. SDHC-Karten (Angaben zur Kompatibilit\u00e4t siehe technische Daten).<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Very slim, easy to use Cyber-shot\u2122 camera with powerful zoom<br\/>\\n<br\/>16.1 effective megapixels CCD sensor: Captures very high quality images, allowing detail-packed enlargements.<br\/>\\n10x optical zoom\/25mm wide angle G Lens: High quality lens covers very wide zoom range, in a beautifully slim camera that's ideal for travel, action shooting and more.<br\/>\\nIntelligent Auto Mode: Camera recognises a wide range of common shooting situations, optimising settings for clear, natural results without fuss.<br\/>\\nArtistic Picture Effect modes: Create four exciting 'in camera' effects - Toy Camera, Partial Colour, Soft High-Key, Pop Colour.<br\/>\\n720p HD movie: Record smooth, high quality HD video clips using MP4 (MPEG-4 AVC\/H.264): optical zoom possible during video shooting.<br\/>\\nOptical SteadyShot Active Mode (combined with electronic stabilisation): Corrects shaky handheld camera movements when shooting video, even while walking or zooming.<br\/>\\n360 Sweep Panorama: Sweep the camera and grab extra-wide images of landscapes, city scenes and tall buildings; new 360 mode captures an all-round view.<br\/>\\n7.5cm\/3\" Clear Photo LCD: High quality LCD screen (230k dot resolution) offers excellent detail, high contrast and wide viewing angle.<br\/>\\nFace Detection: Automatically adjusts focus, exposure and white balance for clearer portraits and priority selectable for children\/adults.<br\/>\\nSmile Shutter: Automatically fires shutter when subject smiles: with adjustable smile threshold and priority selectable for children\/adults.<br\/>\\nSelf Portrait Timer: Detects correct framing when camera is held at arm's length; shutter fires automatically for great self portraits.<br\/>\\nEasy Shooting mode: Fuss-free operation for beginners with large, easy-to-read on-screen instructions.<br\/>\\nIn-Camera Guide: Get on-screen tips and information on operating your camera without leafing through instruction manuals.<br\/>\\nIn-camera retouching: Fun in-camera still image retouching functions including Trimming, Red-Eye correction, Unsharp Masking.<br\/>\\nPlayMemories Home: Pre-installed software makes it easy to transfer images to PC for viewing, editing, printing, emailing, web uploads and more.<br\/>\\nMemory card compatibility: Cyber-shot\u2122 accepts a wide range of cards, including Memory Stick\u2122 and SD\/SDHC - see Technical Specifications for compatibility.<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Appareil photo Cyber-shot ultra-mince et facile \u00e0 utiliser avec zoom puissant<br\/>\\n<br\/>Capteur CCD 16,1 m\u00e9gapixels effectifs: Prend des photos de tr\u00e8s grande qualit\u00e9 pour obtenir des agrandissements avec un haut niveau de d\u00e9tails.<br\/>\\nZoom optique 10x \/ objectif Sony G grand angle de 25 mm: Objectif de haute qualit\u00e9 couvrant une vaste plage de focale, dans un bo\u00eetier ultra-mince qui vous accompagnera partout.<br\/>\\nMode Auto intelligent: L'appareil photo reconna\u00eet de nombreuses situations courantes de prise de vue. Il optimise les param\u00e8tres afin d'obtenir des r\u00e9sultats clairs et nets sans difficult\u00e9.<br\/>\\nModes Effets sp\u00e9ciaux artistiques: Cr\u00e9ez quatre effets int\u00e9ressants avec l'appareil photo - Cam\u00e9ra jouet, Couleur partielle, Soft High-key, Couleur pop..<br\/>\\nFilm HD 720p: Enregistrement de vid\u00e9os HD haute qualit\u00e9 au format mp4 (MPEG-4 AVC \/ H.264)\u00a0: zoom optique lors de l'enregistrement de vid\u00e9os.<br\/>\\nStabilisateur optique SteadyShot mode actif (combin\u00e9 \u00e0 la stabilisation \u00e9lectronique): Corrige l'instabilit\u00e9 de l'appareil photo lors d'enregistrements vid\u00e9o, m\u00eame en marchant ou en zoomant.<br\/>\\nPanorama par balayage 360: Balayez l'appareil photo et saisissez des images de paysages extr\u00eamement larges, ou de villes ou de b\u00e2timents tr\u00e8s \u00e9lev\u00e9s\u00a0; Nouveau mode 360 prend une vue panoramique.<br\/>\\nEcran LCD Clear Photo 7,5 cm \/ 3\": Ecran LCD haute qualit\u00e9 (r\u00e9solution 230 000 points) au niveau de d\u00e9tail exceptionnel, \u00e0 contraste \u00e9lev\u00e9 avec un grand angle de visualisation.<br\/>\\nReconnaissance des visages: R\u00e9glage automatique de la mise au point, de l'exposition et de la balance des blancs pour des portraits plus nets et choix de priorit\u00e9 enfants \/ adultes..<br\/>\\nD\u00e9tecteur automatique de sourires: Prend automatiquement la photo lorsque le sujet sourit, en fonction des param\u00e8tres d\u00e9finis et du niveau de priorit\u00e9 choisi pour les enfants ou les adultes.<br\/>\\nD\u00e9clencheur pour autoportrait: D\u00e9tecte le cadrage id\u00e9al lorsque l'appareil photo est tenu \u00e0 bout de bras ; L'obturateur se d\u00e9clenche automatiquement pour de magnifiques autoportraits.<br\/>\\nMode de prise vue simple: Fonctionnement simple pour les d\u00e9butants avec instructions exhaustives et claires \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran.<br\/>\\nGuide int\u00e9gr\u00e9 \u00e0 l'appareil photo: Astuces et informations \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran sur le fonctionnement de l'appareil photo sans avoir \u00e0 feuilleter les pages d'un manuel d'instructions.<br\/>\\nFonctionnalit\u00e9s de retouche int\u00e9gr\u00e9e: Fonctions de retouche d'image amusantes, notamment pour la correction des yeux rouges, le recadrage et le masquage flou.<br\/>\\nPlayMemories Home\u2122: Un logiciel pr\u00e9install\u00e9 facilite le transfert d'images vers l'ordinateur pour la visualisation, le montage, l'impression, l'envoi par e-mail, le t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement \u00e0 partir du web et bien plus.<br\/>\\nCompatibilit\u00e9 de la carte m\u00e9moire: Cyber-shot\u2122 accepte une large gamme de cartes, y compris Memory Stick\u2122 et SD\/SDHC - voir les sp\u00e9cifications techniques pour la compatibilit\u00e9.<br\/>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eb7cc957-3c07-4546-9f81-71078f2018fb","identifier":"14635737","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE40ES6900 LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Perfect entertainment with 3D thrills and Smart apps\\n\\n- Enjoy enhanced Smart Hub content and services\\n- See vibrantly enhanced colour and detail\\n- Experience vivid and realistic Full HD entertainment\\n- Immerse in Samsung\u2019s premium 3D visuals at home\\n\\nEnjoy easier and more convenient Smart Hub services\\n\\nEnter a world of online entertainment with the new enhanced Smart Hub. Three new signature services \u2013 Fitness, Kids and Family Story - help you to exercise, keep children entertained and educated, and share precious\\nmemories. The powerful Dual Core processor allows you to do smooth multitasking between content. Browse the web, access Samsung Apps and enjoy breathtaking Full HD 3D content at home. Experience 3D content with the 3D explore feature. Discover the ultimate Smart TV experience.\\n* Content available via Smart Hub may vary among product categories, models, and territories. See Samsung.com for more details.\\n* Certain apps must be purchased and may not be available in all regions.\\n* Certain Smart TV features may require firmware upgrades.\\n* Fitness Service may not be available in all regions.\\n* Web Browser is not available on all models.\\n\\nEnjoy apps, videos, Skype, web browsing and more\\n\\nDiscover a new world of social and personalised home entertainment with Samsung\u2019s updated Smart Hub and three great new services. Family Story lets you share special photos, messages and events with loved ones. Meanwhile, children can stay entertained and educated with the Kids feature. You can also exercise and manage your training using Fitness. With access to great content as well as a selection of Samsung Apps, web browsing, Skype and more, this is the ultimate family home entertainment experience.\\n\\nDiscover a new reality in Full HD\\n\\nEnjoy a greater level of home entertainment realism than ever before. Thanks to a resolution twice as high as standard HD TVs, your Samsung Smart TV delivers a breathtaking viewing experience that takes you beyond the screen into a world of total immersion. When you\u2019ve seen the rich and vivid texture of Full HD images, your favourite TV programmes and movies will never be the same again. Discover reality with a full high definition experience.\\n\\nMore vibrant colours for better images\\n\\nUsing an advanced picture quality improvement algorithm, Samsung\u2019s Wide Colour Enhancer Plus drastically improves the quality of any image and uncovers hidden details. Now see colours as they were meant to be seen with Wide Colour Enhancer Plus.\\n\\nTrue 3D experience in a whole new light\\n\\nThe Samsung LED TVs have created an entirely new and immersive viewing experience when it comes to home entertainment. With the latest 3D imaging technology, you will be completely immersed in a new world of TV viewing reality.\\n\\nWatch movies from your USB\\n\\nWith ConnectShare Movie, simply plug your USB memory drive into the TV and instantaneously enjoy movies, photos or music. Now, you can experience a wide variety of content in the comfort of your living room on your TV.\\n\\nStay in closer contact with great widescreen Skype video calls\\n\\nStay in touch with friends and family from the comfort of your home thanks to the Skype app for Smart TV, available for free in the Samsung App store. Combined with the separately-sold Skype camera kit, it allows you to make high-quality widescreen video calls to loved ones throughout the world at low rates or even for free. You can create new Skype accounts, access existing ones and navigate using your TV\u2019s remote control. Be closer with face-to-face communication.\\n\\nWirelessly access and stream your content\\n\\nMake the most of all your content and devices with wireless sharing. Thanks to AllShare Play, you can stream movies, photos, music and more from any compatible devices nearby, including PCs. Cloud technology and Samsung web storage give you even greater freedom and mobility, allowing you to access and share multimedia when you\u2019re away from home, too. Now you can enjoy all your favourite content on your TV or away from it.\\n\\nAccess the Internet without wires\\n\\nWith Wireless LAN Built-in, streamline your TV\u2019s connectivity capabilities without adding more external devices and maintain its attractive design."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-21T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f1af7790-a2a3-4226-b432-00c3f2395517","identifier":"14636441","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE40EH6030W"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE40EH6030W. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Aspect ratio: 16:9. Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-T. Audio system: SRS TheaterSound HD. Video formats supported: DIVX, Audio formats supported: MP3, Image formats supported: JPG. Power consumption (standby): 0.5, Energy efficiency class: A, Input voltage: 220 - 240"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-21T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":40,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"466db218-b71b-4d59-b51d-ec13d30a4b1a","identifier":"14643131","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["brother","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Brother DCP-8150DN multifunctional"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Brother DCP-8150DN. Print technology: Laser, Printing: Mono, Copying: Mono. Print resolution (black, normal quality): 1200 x 1200. Maximum copy resolution: 1200 x 600, Copier resize: 25 - 400. Optical scanning resolution: 1200 x 1200, Maximum scan area: Legal (216 x 356), Maximum scan resolution: 19200 x 19200. ISO A-series sizes (A0...A9): A4, A5, Maximum print size: Legal (216 x 356 mm), Standard tray media types: Plain paper"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-22T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e7592b53-7241-4c0d-b473-ec6ee0bfae3a","identifier":"14644746","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLP-680DW"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Easy Mobile Printing<\/b>\\n\\nPrint from your compatible mobile devices in colour easily, quickly and conveniently without the need for installing any print drivers.\\n\\n<b>Easy 3 Step Mobile Printing<\/b>\\n\\nSamsung's easy 3 step mobile print \u2013 download and install application*, select device & print file.\\n\\n<b>Fast Mobile Printing<\/b>\\n\\nPrint from all your compatible mobile devices in glorious colour easily, quickly and conveniently.\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi Direct<\/b>\\n\\nWith Wi-Fi Direct, you can print from your compatible mobile devices even in a non-network environment.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy quality printouts<\/b>\\n\\nSamsung\u2019s unique ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) Technology helps deliver outstanding quality and vibrancy ,helping to ensure printouts look exceptional. It can automatically sharpen the focus of both graphics and text, while solid objects are overlapped to minimise white gaps.\\n\\n<b>Polymerised toner<\/b>\\n\\nOur newly developed polymerised toner has small and highly uniform particles. Meaning, your printouts will have crisp lines and vivid colours - helping minimise any paper curling. Also, its high wax content helps improve the image gloss and helps enhance the durability.\\n\\n<b>High power printing performance<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Lots of power, great productivity<\/b>\\n\\nWith the CLP-680s 533MHz Dual CPU, and 512MB standard memory (expandable up to 1GB) you can be sure that this printer will handle the entire load of your workgroup's printing needs.\\n\\n<b>Speedy and flexible paper handling<\/b>\\n\\nIf you want to print or copy onto heavy weights of paper, you can. Weights of up to 220g\/m\u00b2 are handled with ease through the 50 page multipurpose tray. Plus, with the optional 520 sheet second cassette you can increase your total paper input capacity to 820 sheets. That way you can also use up to three different media types with minimal need to waste time changing paper.\\n\\nYou can help enhance your productivity further still with the 50 page document feeder that can process single as well as double sided documents automatically.\\n\\n<b>Easy Operating Panel<\/b>\\n\\nWith the CLP-680DW's two line liquid crystal display and intuitive 5 key compass navigation you can control the device's status, browse the menu and access each unique feature with ease.\\n\\n<b>Convenient USB printing<\/b>\\n\\nWith the USB Direct slot located on the front of the device just below the operating panel, you can print from, or scan to, a USB key right from the device, without the need of a computer.\\n\\n<b>Secure, confidential printing<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Print sensitive data<\/b>\\n\\nIf you need to print sensitive data through your printer, you can relax. Just enter a password, and you can retrieve a print job at your convenience.\\n\\n<b>Being economical and printing vibrant colour documents goes hand in hand<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Extra high yield<\/b>\\n\\nEnjoy exceptional colour copies and print-outs while staying in almost complete control. Our specially developed high yield cartridges means ample time between changes. With the integrated duplex feature, minimising paper use is easy. That's because the paper is turned automatically so tha you can print on both sides. Print lots on each page with the N-up and duplex functionality, skip blank pages.\\n\\n<b>Easy Solution support<\/b>\\n\\nThe printer also brings you software support designed to put you in control of delivering exceptional quality printouts. The Easy Eco Driver helps you compile digital documents in multiple formats and makes it easy to share them with others - even through social networks.\\n\\n<b>Easy Colour Manager<\/b>\\n\\nCreate and use your own colour profiles with Samsung's Easy Colour Manager. Match the exact colours of a company logo or simply give your print outs the individual look you want.\\n\\n<b>Take the stress out of print management<\/b>\\n\\nFor outstanding control, Easy Printer Manager lets you manage all your linked devices from one location. Check device and toner status\u2019, re-order toner, change device settings or set alerts \u2013 even through e-mail.\\n\\n<b>Mobile Printing<\/b>\\n\\nWith amazing Samsung Mobile Printing solution, you don\u2019t have to install any drivers to your compatible mobile devices. Simply Just Install Samsung Mobile Print application on your mobile devices, and you can print directly from your compatible mobile device.\\n\\n<b>Easy toner replacement<\/b>\\n\\nToner cartridge changes are all made easy with a push loading drawer. What\u2019s more, the high yield cartridges mean few changes."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"nbsp;\\n<br\/><b>Une haute qualit\u00e9 couleur<\/b>\\n<br\/>La technologie ReCP de Samsung (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) offre une qualit\u00e9 d'image sup\u00e9rieure et une meilleure d\u00e9finition des caract\u00e8res pour un r\u00e9sultat net et pr\u00e9cis. Avec une r\u00e9solution de 1200 x 1200 dpi, cette technologie d'image novatrice permet aux utilisateurs de cr\u00e9er des documents professionnels.\\n<br\/><b>Toner polym\u00e9ris\u00e9 nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration<\/b>\\n<br\/>La nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration de toner Samsung contient des particules plus fines et plus uniformes pour des trac\u00e9s plus nets et plus pr\u00e9cis. De plus, avec sa formule \u00e0 la cire, il vous garantit durabilit\u00e9 et rendu glossy.\\n<br\/><b>Des performances in\u00e9gal\u00e9es<\/b>\\n<br\/>La productivit\u00e9 de votre entreprise depend de la performance de votre imprimante. Avec une vitesse d'impression de 24 \/ 24 pages par minute et un temps de sortie de 1\u00e8re page de 17 secondes, la CLP-680DW ne vous laissera pas tomber.\\n\\n* Des performances sans compromis\\nGagnez en productivit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce au double processeur de 533 MHz qui offre une impression et une num\u00e9risation rapide. \\nLa m\u00e9moire de 512 Mo (Max. 1Go) vous permet \u00e9galement d'imprimer rapidement et en grandes quantit\u00e9.\\nL'imprimante laser couleur CLP-680DW deviendra tr\u00e8s vite un outil indispensable pour votre bureau.\\n<br\/><b>Une gestion papier simplifi\u00e9e<\/b>\\n<br\/>Il vous est d\u00e9sormais possible d'imprimer et copier de grands volumes, avec l'imprimante laser couleur CLP-680DW. Cette imprimante dispose d'un bac papier pouvant contenir jusqu'\u00e0 250 feuilles de 220 g\/m<sup>2<\/sup>. Augmentez la capacit\u00e9 papier gr\u00e2ce au second bac papier (en option) de 520 feuilles en standard et de 820 feuilles maximum. \\nNe perdez plus de temps \u00e0 changer de bac, la CLP-680DW dispose de 3 types de support.  \\n<br\/><b>Un travail simplifi\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une imprimante facile \u00e0 utiliser<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gagnez en productivit\u00e9 et obtenez des r\u00e9sultats incroyables en moins de temps gr\u00e2ce aux fonctionnalit\u00e9s de la CLP-680DW. \\n\\n* Simple et intuitif\\nL'interface utilisateur dot\u00e9 d'un \u00e9cran LCD \u00e0 2 lignes et d'un bouton de navigation de 5 touches, vous permet de prendre facilement le contr\u00f4le de votre imprimante."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-22T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"338c4329-b3ff-4a8f-985d-4b7df59bdf0f","identifier":"14644957","enabled":true,"family":"led_tvs","categories":["led_tvs","samsung","tvs_projectors_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung UE65ES8000QXZT LED TV"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung UE65ES8000QXZT. HD type: Full HD, Display resolution: 1920 x 1080, Supported graphics resolutions: 1920 x 1080 (HD 1080). Tuner type: Analogue & Digital, Digital signal format system: DVB-C, DVB-S2, DVB-T. Audio system: Dolby Digital Plus, Dolby Pulse. Consumer Electronics Control (CEC): Anynet+. Playback modes: Normal, Smart modes: Game"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-22T00:00:00+00:00"}],"display_diagonal":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":65,"unit":"INCH"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3fa57ecb-4172-49f6-912f-a24d1bb6795c","identifier":"14668436","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision AV176U"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Kompakt und schnell<\/b>\\n\\nDer AV176U bietet ein einzigartiges und stylisches Design. Formsch\u00f6n k\u00f6nnen der Einzugs- und der Ausugspapierhalter bei Nichtgebraucht eingeklappt werden und sch\u00fctzten den Scanner dabei zus\u00e4tzlich vor Staub. Im Vergleich zu konventionellen Dokumentenscannern, findet der AV176U durch seine kompakte Bauweise auf jedem Schreibtisch Platz.\\n\\nDer AV176U scannt in Farbe, Graustufen und Moncrome mit einer Geschwindigkeit von 30 Seiten pro Minuten im Simplex Modus und 60 Bilder pro Minuten im Duplex Modus. Der Automatische Dokumenteneinzug des AV176U fasst 50 Bl\u00e4tter. Dies macht ein kontinuierliches Scannen ohne Unterbrechungen m\u00f6glich und steigert so die Effizienz des Arbeitens.\\n\\nDie neuste Avision Anwendung: der Button Manager erm\u00f6glicht es ihnen komplexe Scannvorg\u00e4nge in nur einem Schritt zu bew\u00e4ltigen. Sobald der Knopf gedr\u00fcckt ist, werden die Dokumente gescannt und automatisch in eine BMP, JPEG, GIF oder TIFF Datei oder in ein durchsuchbares PDF gewandelt."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>AV176U, a compact and affordable duplex scanner<\/b>\\nThe AV176U is a 30 page-per-minute, 60 image-per-minute, duplex sheetfed scanner that is fast, reliable, and affordable for business where scanning plastic ID cards, business cards, documents or other heavy card stock is necessary. With the straight paper path, the scanner allows thicker paper up to 400 g\/m2 (110 lbs) and embossed plastic cards such as credit cards, or driver\u2019s license up to 1.25mm to be transmitted smoothly. Ultrasonic multi-feed detection assures you that not a single page of your documents will be lost.\\n\\n\\n<b>AV176U saves your space when not in use<\/b>\\nBoth the input and output paper tray of the AV176U can be folded when not in use. This feature not only helps prevent the unit from dust but also save more working space.\\n\\n<b>Powerful bundled software applications<\/b>\\nThe AV176U comes with TWAIN and ISIS drivers, and is bundled with a suite of powerful software applications that include Avision Button Manager, AvScan 5.0, and ScanSoft PaperPort 14SE. With Button Manager, you can create searchable PDF, scan and send images to e-mail, printer, or other destinations with just a simple press of a button. The AVScan V5 and ScanSoft PaperPort are highly effective image processing and document management software that helps you streamline your task more efficiently."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9bc9ab71-1857-46f6-b349-1c7296a3232a","identifier":"14669720","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["fujitsu","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujitsu ScanSnap S1300i Deluxe"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Rack2-Filer Smart and Magic Desktop\\n- S1300i Scanner\\n- F\u00fcr Windows und Mac OS\\n- Ideal unterwegs oder im B\u00fcro\\n- Perfekt zum Einscannen f\u00fcr E-Mail-Anh\u00e4nge oder zum Ausdrucken\\n- Scannen direkt in Word-, Excel- und PowerPoint-Dateien (nur PowerPoint f\u00fcr Windows)\\n- ScanSnap Organizer 4.1 : Verwaltung und Suchfunktionen f\u00fcr PDF-Dateien (nur Windows)\\n- CardMinder (Windows) oder CardIris (Mac): Scan-Software f\u00fcr Visitenkarten\\n- Mit iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae und Android-Ger\u00e4t scannen\\n- Scannen zu Cloud-Anwendungen wie Dropbox, Google Docs\u2122, Evernote\u00ae, SugarSync oder Salesforce CRM\\n\\nScanSnap Deluxe ist ein Produktpaket der neuesten Scanl\u00f6sung von Fujitsu auf einen Knopfdruck: ScanSnap S1300i und das digitale Rack2-Filer Dateiarchivierungssystem. Die beiden Produkte erg\u00e4nzen einander nahtlos und erf\u00fcllen alle Anforderungen an die pers\u00f6nliche Dokumentenverwaltung im B\u00fcro, daheim und unterwegs.\\n\\nScanSnap S1300i kann entweder direkt \u00fcber den USB-Anschluss des Laptops oder mittels Netzstrom betrieben werden und ist damit ideal f\u00fcr vielbesch\u00e4ftigte, vielreisende Gesch\u00e4ftsleute - im Auto, bei Kundenbesuchen usw. (Reduzierte Scan-Geschwindigkeit bei der Nutzung von USB-Leistung.)\\n\\nDer S1300i wird mit 2 ScanSnap Manager-Versionen geliefert \u2013 einer f\u00fcr Windows und einer f\u00fcr den Mac.\\n\\nDie ScanSnap-Software erstellt automatisch Adobe PDF-Dateien, die mittlerweile den de-facto-Standard f\u00fcr den Dokumentenaustausch bilden und so gew\u00e4hrleisten, dass Sie Dokumente weltweit verschicken k\u00f6nnen und der Empf\u00e4nger die Dokumente genauso sieht wie Sie. Sie k\u00f6nnen Suchfunktionen f\u00fcr die PDFs hinzuf\u00fcgen \u2013 entweder im Hintergrund im ScanSnap Organizer oder unmittelbar w\u00e4hrend des Scan-Vorgangs.\\n\\nDamit der Scanprozess m\u00f6glichst unkompliziert abl\u00e4uft, pr\u00fcft ScanSnap jedes Dokument und entscheidet, ob es in Schwarzwei\u00df oder in Farbe eingelesen werden sollte und welche Gr\u00f6\u00dfe die Dokumentenseite hat. Das Programm l\u00f6scht leere Seiten, beschleunigt so den Scan-Prozess und minimiert die erforderliche Speicherkapazit\u00e4t. Dar\u00fcber hinaus werden schief eingelegte Bl\u00e4tter korrekt ausgerichtet (Auto Deskew) und die Seiten automatisch gedreht.\\n\\nDer ScanSnap S1300i ist mit einer automatischen 10-Seiten-Einzugsfunktion, Duplex-F\u00e4higkeit und Farbscan-Modus ausgestattet. Dabei ist das Ger\u00e4t \u00fcberraschend kompakt und da es direkt von Ihrem Laptop betrieben werden kann, ist es ideal f\u00fcr Gesch\u00e4ftsreisende.\\n\\nDer ScanSnap S1300i besitzt einen \u201eQuick-Men\u00fc\u201c-Modus, bei dem Sie Ihre Dokumente nur in den Einzug legen und die Scan-Taste des S1300i dr\u00fccken m\u00fcssen. Alle Seiten werden eingelesen und im aufgerufenen \u201eQuick-Men\u00fc\u201c k\u00f6nnen Sie problemlos die erstellte PDF-Datei im ScanSnap Organizer oder in der Dateistruktur ablegen, als E-Mail versenden oder \u00fcber einen Drucker ausdrucken.\\n\\nDer S1300i bietet als direkte Verkn\u00fcpfungsfunktionen zu beliebten Cloud-Diensten wie Dropbox, Google Docs, Evernote, SugarSync und Salesforce CRM. So k\u00f6nnen Sie eingescannte Dokumente praktisch \u00fcberall und jederzeit auch mit der Cloud verkn\u00fcpfen. Falls keine Scanner-Schnittstelle zur Verf\u00fcgung steht, k\u00f6nnen Windows-Nutzer innerhalb der Cloud-Applikation die Option \u201eScanSnap folder\u201c w\u00e4hlen, die es ihnen durch die Import-Funktion erm\u00f6glicht, direkt zur Cloud zu scannen.\\n\\nScannen Sie zu Ihrem iPad und iPhone \u2013 und jetzt auch zu anderen Android-Ger\u00e4ten* \u2013 mit der herunterladbaren ScanSnap Connect Applikation. Uploaden Sie Ihr Dokument schnell, sicher und einfach zum sofortigen Anzeigen und Teilen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Rack2-Filer Smart and Magic Desktop\\n- S1300i Scanner\\n- For Windows and Mac OS\\n- Ideal for mobile and static use in the office\\n- Perfect for scan to Email, Scan to Print\\n- Scan to Word, Excel & PowerPoint (PowerPoint only for Windows OS)\\n- ScanSnap Organizer 4.1 : PDF Managment & Search (Windows only)\\n- CardMinder (Windows) or CardIris (Mac) : Business Card scanning software\\n- Scan to iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae and Android devices\\n- Scan to cloud services such as Dropbox, Evernote\u00ae, Google Docs\u2122 and SugarSync\\n\\nScanSnap Deluxe is a product package of Fujitsu\u2019s latest one-button scanning solution, ScanSnap S1300i and Rack2-Filer\u2019s digital file organising system. The two products complement each other seamlessly, and as a combined solution meet the demands of personal document organisation perfectly, may it be in a professional business environment, at home or on the move\\n\\nScanSnap S1300i can be powered either directly from the laptop USB ports or via an AC adapter, making it ideal for business people on the move - in the car, in clients premises etc etc. (Scanning speed is reduced when using USB power).\\n\\nThe S1300i is supplied with two versions of ScanSnap Manager: one for Windows and one for Mac.\\n\\nThe ScanSnap software automatically creates Adobe PDF files which have become the de-facto standard for document exchange, enabling you to send documents anywhere in the world safe in the knowledge the recipient will see the document exactly as you see it. The PDFs can be made searchable, either in the background of ScanSnap Organizer or directly at scan time.\\n\\nTo make scanning as simple as possible, ScanSnap inspects each document to decide if a document should be scanned in black and white or colour, what the size of the page being scanned is and eliminate blank pages, all of which serve to speed the scanning operation and minimise your storage requirements. In addition each document will have misaligned text corrected (Auto Deskew) and each page will be have its orientation automatically adjusted.\\n\\nScanSnap S1300i incorporates a 10 page automatic document feeder, duplex capability and colour scanning within a surprisingly small footprint and it can be powered directly from your laptop making it ideal for business travellers.\\n\\nScanSnap S1300i offers a Quick Menu mode. Just place documents onto the input hopper and press the S1300's scan button. All pages are scanned and the user is presented Quick Menu, from where you can easily direct the resulting PDF file to either ScanSnap Organizer, Email recipients, file folders or even printing devices.\\n\\nThe ScanSnap S1300i Deluxe comes with a linking function to popular cloud services including Dropbox, Google Docs, Evernote, SugarSync and Salesforce CRM. It is now easy to seamlessly link and save your scanned image data virtually anywhere and anytime. If no scanning interface is available Windows users can select the \u2018ScanSnap folder\u2019 option within the cloud application which then allows you to scan directly to the cloud through the import capability\\n\\nScan to iPad and iPhone, and now to Android devices*, via the downloadable ScanSnap Connect application. Upload your document fast, securely and easily; instantly display and share."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques Principales<\/b>\\n\\n- Rack2-Filer Smart and Magic Desktop\\n- Scanner S1300\\n- Compatible avec les syst\u00e8mes d\u2019exploitation Windows et Mac\\n- Id\u00e9al pour les utilisations mobiles et statiques au bureau\\n- Id\u00e9al pour le scan vers email et scan vers imprimante\\n- Scan vers Word, Excel et PowerPoint (PowerPoint uniquement pour Windows)\\n- ScanSnap Organizer 4.1 : archivage et recherche de PDF (Windows uniquement)\\n- Scan-to-iPhone, iPad, appareils Android\\n- Des int\u00e9grations avec Services Cloud, tels que Dropbox, Evernote\u00ae, Google Docs\u2122 et SugarSync\\n\\nLes deux produits se compl\u00e8tent et offrent une solution integr\u00e9e. Ils conviennent parfaitement aux exigences de l\u2019archivage des documents personnels, que ce soit dans un environnement professionnel, \u00e0 domicile ou en d\u00e9placement.\\n\\nLe ScanSnap S1300i peut \u00eatre connect\u00e9 directement sur le port USB d'un ordinateur portable et sur un adaptateur CA, ce qui en fait le scanner id\u00e9al pour les hommes d'affaires en d\u00e9placement, que ce soit en voiture, dans les locaux des clients, ou ailleurs (la vitesse de num\u00e9risation peut \u00eatre r\u00e9duite en USB).\\n\\nLe S1300i est livr\u00e9 avec 2 versions de ScanSnap Manager, l'un pour Windows et l'autre pour Mac.\\n\\nLe logiciel ScanSnap cr\u00e9\u00e9 automatiquement des fichiers Adobe PDF, qui est devenue la norme de partage de documents, vous permettant d\u2019envoyer vos documents dans le monde entier en \u00e9tant assur\u00e9 que le destinataire verra le document exactement comme vous le voyez. Vous pouvez activer la reconnaissance du texte dans le ficher PDF du ScanSnap Organizer \u00e0 posteriori a partir ou directement au moment de la num\u00e9risation.\\n\\nAfin de faciliter la num\u00e9risation, ScanSnap inspecte chaque document pour d\u00e9terminer si le document doit \u00eatre num\u00e9ris\u00e9 en noir et blanc ou en couleur, quelle est la taille de la page num\u00e9ris\u00e9e et supprime les pages blanches, ce qui permet d\u2019acc\u00e9l\u00e9rer le processus de num\u00e9risation et de r\u00e9duire l\u2019espace de stockage n\u00e9cessaire. En outre, il corrige les d\u00e9fauts d\u2019alignement de chaque document (Auto Deskew) et adapte automatiquement l\u2019orientation de chaque page.\\n\\nLe ScanSnap S1300i comprend un chargeur automatique de 10 pages, offre la possibilit\u00e9 de num\u00e9riser en duplex et en couleur tout en r\u00e9duisant considerablement l'encombrement. Il peut \u00eatre connect\u00e9 directement \u00e0 votre ordinateur portable, ce qui en fait l\u2019outil id\u00e9al pour les hommes d\u2019affaires en d\u00e9placement.\\n\\nLe ScanSnap S1300i comprend un menu rapide. Placez vos documents dans le chargeur, puis appuyez sur le bouton de num\u00e9risation de la S1300. Une fois les pages num\u00e9ris\u00e9es, l\u2019utilisateur peut facilement envoyer le fichier PDF vers l'application ScanSnap Organizer, par email aux destinataires de son choix, dans son dossier, ou vers son imprimante, \u00e0 partir du menu rapide.\\n\\nLe scanner S1300i est fourni avec un connecteur reliant le scanner aux services \u00ab Cloud \u00bb les plus utilis\u00e9s tels que Dropbox, Google Docs, Evernote, SugarSync et Salesforce CRM.Il est d\u00e9sormais tr\u00e8s facile d'associer et d'enregistrer vos images num\u00e9ris\u00e9es n'importe o\u00f9 et quand bon vous semble. Si aucune interface de num\u00e9risation n\u2019est disponible, les utilisateurs de Windows peuvent s\u00e9lectionner l\u2019option \u00ab dossier ScanSnap \u00bb au sein de l\u2019application Cloud, ce qui vous permet ensuite d\u2019effectuer directement la num\u00e9risation vers le nuage \u00e0 l\u2019aide de la capacit\u00e9 d\u2019importation.\\n\\nNum\u00e9risez vers un iPad et un iPhone et d\u00e9sormais vers les appareils de type Android*, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019application t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeable ScanSnap Connect. T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez votre document rapidement, ais\u00e9ment et en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9 ; affichez-le et partagez-le instantan\u00e9ment."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"1.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"338ef5bd-4122-4dfa-bf0b-465d5ba4d1d8","identifier":"14671148","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["fujitsu","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujitsu ScanSnap S1300i"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Hochleistung im kompakten Format!<\/b>\\n\\nNur etwa halb so gro\u00df wie ein Blatt Papier ist der ScanSnap S1300i, und er ist nicht nur praktisch, sondern auch \u00e4u\u00dferst benutzerfreundlich: Mit einem Tastendruck scannen Sie mehrseitige und sogar doppelseitige Dokumente ein \u2013 ganz gleich, ob am Schreibtisch oder unterwegs. Legen Sie bis zu 10 Seiten auf einmal in den automatischen Dokumenteneinzug (ADF) ein und dr\u00fccken Sie die blaue Taste.\\n\\n<b>Mehrseitiges und beidseitiges Scannen<\/b>\\n\\nDer ScanSnap S1300i scannt beide Seiten eines Blattes ein, bis zu 12 Seiten pro Minute, und wandelt sie direkt in ein PDF, ein durchsuchbares PDF, ein JPEG oder ein Office-Dokument (z. B. Word oder Excel\u00ae) um. Der ScanSnap S1300i erkennt automatisch die Gr\u00f6\u00dfe jeder Seite, erfasst und korrigiert Fehlstellungen und zeigt Bilder in der korrekten Ausrichtung an. Sie k\u00f6nnen sogar leere Seiten automatisch entfernen lassen.\\n\\n<b>Extra mobil: Stromversorgung \u00fcber USB-Port<\/b>\\n\\nDer ScanSnap S1300i wird mit Netzger\u00e4t geliefert, doch f\u00fcr zus\u00e4tzlichen mobilen Komfort kann der ScanSnap S1300i auch \u00fcber den USB-Anschluss des Computers mit Strom versorgt werden*, wenn gerade keine Steckdose verf\u00fcgbar ist.\\n\\n* Bei der Verwendung der USB-Stromkabels muss der Computer \u00fcber zwei USB-Ports verf\u00fcgen, einen f\u00fcr das Stromkabel und einen f\u00fcr den USB-Anschluss.\\n\\n<b>Einsetzbar mit PC oder Mac<\/b>\\n\\nDas Quick-Men\u00fc erm\u00f6glicht Ihnen schnelles Wechseln zwischen verschiedenen Scan-Optionen. Dr\u00fccken Sie einfach die Scan-Taste und w\u00e4hlen Sie, was Sie mit dem ScanSnap tun m\u00f6chten:\\n\\n- Scan an Ordner: Speichern Sie Scans in einem Ordner, einem Netzwerkordner oder in SharePoint (PC) ab\\n- Scan an Email: Machen Sie das Fax \u00fcberfl\u00fcssig und versenden Sie elektronische Dokumente per E-Mail\\n- Visitenkarten-Scan: Scannen Sie Visitenkarten und extrahieren Sie automatisch die Kontaktinformationen\\n- Scan an Drucker: Verwenden Sie ScanSnap zusammen mit Ihrem Drucker, um Kopien zu erstellen\\n- Scan an Word (.doc): Direktes Scannen in eine editierbare Word-Datei\\n- Scan an Excel (.xls): Direktes Scannen in eine editierbare Excel-Datei\\n- Scan an PowerPoint (.ppt): Direktes Scannen in eine editierbare PowerPoint-Datei (nur Windows)\\n- Scan an Microsoft SharePoint, Scan an Salesforce Chatter\\n- Scan an iPhone\u00ae\/iPad\u00ae oder Android-Ger\u00e4te\\n- Scan an Cloud: Scan an Dropbox, Evernote\u00ae, Google\u00ae DocsTM* und\/oder SugarSync\\n\\n<b>\u00dcbertragung von Scans an Mobilger\u00e4te<\/b>\\n\\nDas S1300i unterst\u00fctzt die drahtlose \u00dcbertragung von Scans an iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae und Android-Ger\u00e4te zur praktischen Anzeige \u00fcber die mobile App ScanSnap Connect*.\\n\\nDie App unterst\u00fctzt eine Vielzahl von Ger\u00e4ten mit dem Betriebssystem Android 2.2 oder sp\u00e4teren Versionen. Eine Liste der unterst\u00fctzten Android-Smartphones und -Tablets findet sich hier:\\n\\nwww.fujitsu.com\/global\/services\/computing\/peripheral\/scanners\/ss\/feature\/ssca-android.html\\n\\n* Die ScanSnap-Connect-App ist als kostenloser Download beim offiziellen App-Service des Ger\u00e4tes (z. B. Google Play und Apple App Store) erh\u00e4ltlich. Beim Computer, auf dem der ScanSnap installiert ist, muss Wi-Fi eingeschaltet sein, um diese Funktion zu nutzen.\\n\\n<b>Mehr M\u00f6glichkeiten, Scans in die Cloud zu schicken<\/b>\\n\\nWie alle aktuellen Modelle von ScanSnap kann der S1300i mit den Cloud-Diensten Dropbox, Evernote, Google Docs\u2122, Salesforce CRM und SharePoint Online (f\u00fcr Windows\u00ae) verkn\u00fcpft werden. Und er bringt ein paar zus\u00e4tzliche Cloud-Synchronisierungsfunktionen mit: \u201eScan an SugarSync\u201c und \u201eScan an Salesforce Chatter\u201c sowie \u201eScanSnap-Ordner nur f\u00fcr Win OS\u201c, wo Sie Scans durch die Importfunktion an Ihren bevorzugten Cloud-Service schicken k\u00f6nnen, wenn keine Scan-Schnittstelle verf\u00fcgbar ist.\\n\\nApple, iPad, iPhone, iPod touch und iTunes sind Warenzeichen der Apple Inc., registriert in U.S. und anderen L\u00e4ndern. App Store ist eine Dienstleistungsmarke der Apple Inc."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Performance in a compact size!<\/b>\\nAt nearly half the size of a sheet of paper, the ScanSnap S1300i is the smallest multi-page double-sided ScanSnap scanner for one-button ease of use at the desk or on the road. Stack up to 10 pages into the automatic document feeder (ADF) and press the blue button.\\n\\n<b>Faster two-sided multi-page scanning<\/b>\\nScanSnap S1300i scans both sides of each page at up to 12 pages per minute directly to PDF, searchable PDF, JPEG, or to office applications like Word or Excel\u00ae. The ScanSnap S1300i automatically recognizes the size of each document, detects and corrects for skew, and shows images in their proper orientation. You can even choose to have blank pages automatically removed.\\n\\n<b>Operates on USB Bus Power for Extra Portability<\/b>\\nScanSnap S1300i comes with an AC Adapter but for added mobile convenience, the ScanSnap S1300i can be powered though the computer\u2019s USB ports* when an AC power source is not available.\\n\\n*When using the USB bus power cable, the computer must have two USB ports; one for power feeding and the other for USB cable connection.\\n\\n<b>Ready to be used on a PC or Mac<\/b>\\nThe Quick Menu allows you to quickly transition between different scanning intentions.\\nJust press the scan button and choose what you want ScanSnap to do:\\n\\n- ScanSnap Folder: Scan \u2018outside-the-box\u2019into virtually any application or cloud service from a PC (for Windows\u00ae)\\n- Scan to Folder: Store scans to a folder, network folder, or to SharePoint (PC) or iDisk (Mac)\\n- Scan to Email: Eliminate faxing and share electronic documents over email\\n- Scan Business Card: Scan business cards and automatically extract contact information\\n- Scan to Print: Use ScanSnap with your printer to create copies\\n- Scan to Word (.doc): Scan directly to an editable Word file\\n- Scan to Excel (.xls): Scan directly to an editable Excel file\\n- Scan to Mobile: link to an iPad or iPhone and select Android\u2122 smartphones and tablets.\\n- Scan to Cloud: Scan to Evernote\u00ae, Google\u00aeDocs\u2122, Salesforce CRM, Salesforce Chatter, SugarSync, SharePoint Online (for Windows\u00ae), and Dropbox"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>La performance dans un format compact !<\/b>\\n\\nAvec un encombrement de pr\u00e8s de la moiti\u00e9 d'une feuille de papier, le ScanSnap S1300i est con\u00e7u pour la commodit\u00e9 et la facilit\u00e9 d'utilisation, une m\u00e9thode \u00e0 un seul bouton permet de num\u00e9riser des documents multipages recto-verso que ce soit au bureau ou en d\u00e9placement. Empilez jusqu'\u00e0 10 pages dans le chargeur automatique de documents (CAD) et appuyez sur le bouton bleu.\\n\\n<b>Une num\u00e9risation multipage recto-verso<\/b>\\n\\nScanSnap S1300i num\u00e9rise les deux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de chaque page jusqu'\u00e0 12 pages par minute directement aux formats PDF, PDF avec possibilit\u00e9 de recherche, JPEG, ou vers des applications bureautiques comme Word ou Excel\u00ae. Le ScanSnap S1300i reconna\u00eet automatiquement la taille de chaque document, d\u00e9tecte et corrige les effets d\u2019obliquit\u00e9 et affiche les images dans leur bonne orientation. Vous pouvez m\u00eame choisir de supprimer les pages vierges automatiquement.\\n\\n<b>Fonctionne avec l\u2019alimentation du Bus USB pour plus de portabilit\u00e9<\/b>\\n\\nScanSnap S1300i est livr\u00e9 avec un adaptateur CA mais pour un plus grand confort lors des d\u00e9placements, le ScanSnap S1300i peut \u00eatre aliment\u00e9 via les ports USB de l'ordinateur * lorsqu\u2019une source d'alimentation n'est pas disponible.\\n\\n* Lorsque vous utilisez le c\u00e2ble d\u2019alimentation par le Bus, l'ordinateur doit disposer de deux ports USB, l'un pour l'alimentation \u00e9lectrique et l'autre pour la connexion du c\u00e2ble USB.\\n\\n<b>Un scanner compatible PC ou Mac<\/b>\\n\\nLe Quick Menu vous permet de changer rapidement entre diff\u00e9rents modes de num\u00e9risation. Il suffit d\u2019appuyer sur le bouton de num\u00e9risation et de choisir ce que vous voulez que le Scansnap fasse :\\n\\n- Num\u00e9risation vers un dossier : Stockez les documents num\u00e9ris\u00e9s dans un dossier local, un dossier r\u00e9seau, ou sur SharePoint (PC)\\n- Num\u00e9risation vers un e-mail : Oubliez le fax et partagez des documents \u00e9lectroniques par e-mail\\n- Num\u00e9risation de cartes de visite : Num\u00e9risez des cartes de visite et extrayez automatiquement les coordonn\u00e9es\\n- Num\u00e9risation vers une imprimante : Utilisez ScanSnap avec votre imprimante pour faire des copies\\n- Num\u00e9risation vers Word (.doc) : Num\u00e9risez directement vers un fichier Word modifiable\\n- Num\u00e9risation vers Excel (.xls) : Num\u00e9risez directement vers un fichier Excel modifiable\\n- Num\u00e9risation vers PowerPoint (.ppt) : Num\u00e9risez directement vers un fichier PowerPoint modifiable (Windows uniquement)\\n- Num\u00e9riser vers Microsoft SharePoint, Num\u00e9risez vers SalesForce Chatter\\n- Num\u00e9riser vers iPhone\u00b4\u00ae\/iPad\u00ae ou appareils AndroidTM\\n- Num\u00e9riser vers le Cloud : Num\u00e9risez vers Dropbox, Evernote\u00ae, Google\u00ae DocsTM* et\/ou SugarSync\\n\\n<b>Num\u00e9riser vers le mobile<\/b>\\n\\nLe S1300i permet de num\u00e9riser via Wifi vers iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae et terminaux Android pour une visualisation pratique avec l\u2019application mobile ScanSnap Connect Application*.\\n\\nL'application supporte de nombreux appareils fonctionnant sous Android 2.2 ou les versions ult\u00e9rieures. Pour une liste des smartphones et tablettes support\u00e9s sous Android, aller \u00e0:\\n\\nwww.fujitsu.com\/global\/services\/computing\/peripheral\/scanners\/ss\/feature\/ssca-android.html\\n\\n*ScanSnap Connect Application est disponible en t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement gratuit depuis le service officiel de distribution d\u2019applications du terminal (c.-\u00e0-d. Google Play et Apple App Store). Pour disposer de cette possibilit\u00e9, le Wifi doit \u00eatre activ\u00e9 sur l\u2019ordinateur sur lequel ScanSnap est install\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>De multiples possibilit\u00e9s de num\u00e9riser vers le Cloud<\/b>\\n\\nComme tous les mod\u00e8les ScanSnap existants, le S1300i peut \u00eatre reli\u00e9 aux services de Cloud Dropbox, Evernote, Google Docs\u2122, Salesforce CRM et SharePoint Online (pour Windows\u00ae). Il apporte \u00e9galement quelques fonctions suppl\u00e9mentaires de synchronisation vers le Cloud : Num\u00e9riser vers SugarSync et num\u00e9riser vers Salesforce Chatter ainsi que le dossier Scansnap pour l\u2019OS Windows uniquement o\u00f9 vous pouvez num\u00e9riser vers votre service de Cloud favori lorsqu\u2019aucune interface de num\u00e9risation n\u2019est disponible avec la capacit\u00e9 d\u2019importation.\\n\\nApple, iPad, iPhone, iPod Touch et iTunes sont des marques d\u00e9pos\u00e9es de Apple Inc. sous licence aux \u00c9tats-Unis et dans d'autres pays. L'App Store est une marque de service d'Apple Inc."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fa6f75d0-8609-4495-9388-57be26cd0a0a","identifier":"14676753","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["brother","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"multifunctional_functions":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":["scan"]}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Brother MFC-8710DW multifunctional"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>MFC-8710DW<\/b>\\nHigh-Speed Laser All-in-One with Duplex Printing and Wireless Networking.\\n\\n<b>High-Speed Monochrome Laser All-in-One for Small to Medium Sized Businesses<\/b>\\nThe Brother\u2122 MFC-8710DW is a cost efficient, monochrome laser all-in-one for your busy office or business. It combines high-speed, reliable printing and copying up to 40ppm, high-quality color scanning, and faxing into one durable design. Share with others on your network via its built-in Ethernet or wireless 802.11b\/g\/n interfaces or print from your mobile device via: AirPrint\u2122, Google Cloud Print\u2122, Brother\u2122 iPrint&Scan, Cortado Workplace and Wi-Fi Direct\u2122. Plus, the MFC-8710DW can print two-sided output using the automatic duplex feature and scan or copy bound materials via the legal-size document glass or multi-page documents using the 50-page capacity auto document feeder.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n- Fast, high-quality printing and copying. Produces professional black & white output at impressive print and copy speeds of up to 40 pages per minute.\\n- Flexible connectivity\u2020. Print, scan or PC fax over your wireless 802.11b\/g\/n or Ethernet network or connect locally via its Hi-Speed USB 2.0 interface.\\n- Automatic duplex printing. Print professional two-sided documents and booklets. Also, create two-sided output from one-sided originals when copying and faxing. This feature can reduce your paper use by up to 50% and helps saves money.\\n- Convenient mobile device printing. Print from your mobile device via: AirPrint\u2122, Google Cloud Print\u2122, Brother\u2122 iPrint&Scan, Cortado Workplace, Wi-Fi Direct\u2122.\\n- Advanced scanning capabilities. Supports a variety of \"scan to\" functions including: E-mail, file, image, OCR, FTP, USB, Network Folder (CIFS - Windows\u00ae only) and E-mail Server.\\n- Flexible paper handling. The MFC-8710DW features an adjustable, 250-sheet capacity tray for letter or legal-size paper, plus a 50-sheet capacity multi-purpose tray.\\n- Cost efficient performance. A high-yield 8,000-page toner cartridge is available to help lower your operating costs.\\n- Legal-size document glass. This laser all-in-one allows you to easily copy or color scan bound materials or up to legal-size documents.\\n- 50-page capacity auto document feeder. Use for unattended copying, faxing or scanning of multi-page documents (up to legal size).\\n- Convenient walk-up printing and scanning. A USB Direct Interface is located on the front of the machine for printing files from or scanning files to your USB flash memory drive.\\n- Advanced security features. Provides a wide-range of security features including: secure print, Secure Function Lock, Enterprise Security (802.1x) and more.\\n- Outstanding customer support. The Brother\u2122 MFC-8710DW offers a 1 year limited warranty with free phone support for the life of your product."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"854cbb75-6c2d-4313-b8c8-c3226ab8a78b","identifier":"1468131","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon HV30 High Definition Camcorder"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.96"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"HDV1080i-Aufzeichnung in herausragender Qualit\u00e4t - der HV30 ist wie das Vorg\u00e4ngermodell HV20 mit dem Canon HD Camera System ausgestattet: Canon HD-Objektiv, Full-HD-CMOS-Sensor und f\u00fcr HD optimierter DIGIC-DV-II-Prozessor sorgen f\u00fcr High Definition Videos.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD Camera System<\/b>\\nCanon HD-Videoobjektiv, 2,96 Megapixel Full-HD-CMOS-Sensor und f\u00fcr HD optimierter DIGIC-DV-II-Prozessor \u2013 das Canon HD Camera System ist die starke Kombination f\u00fcr starke Leistung. Alle Komponenten des HD Camera Systems sind von Canon selbst entwickelt und gefertigt und perfekt aufeinander abgestimmt \u2013 ein wesentlicher Faktor f\u00fcr brillante 1080i High Defintion Videos. Der HV30 zeichnet Videos auf MiniDV-Band auf.\\n\\n<b>Instant AF<\/b>\\nDie HD-Aufzeichnung stellt mit ihrer HD-Aufl\u00f6sung hohe Anforderungen: so machen sich bereits kleine Fehler bei der Scharfstellung deutlich bei der Bildqualit\u00e4t bemerkbar. Zur bemerkenswert schnellen und \u00e4u\u00dferst pr\u00e4zisen automatischen Scharfstellung ist der HV30 mit dem \u201eInstant-AF\u201c ausgestattet, einem innovativen Hybridsystem f\u00fcr au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnliche Bildqualit\u00e4t.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD-Videoobjektiv<\/b>\\nCanons langj\u00e4hrige Erfahrung im Bau von Fernsehkamera-Objektiven ist die starke Basis f\u00fcr die \u00fcberzeugende Qualit\u00e4t des Canon HD-Objektivs mit 10fach optischem Zoom.Der optische Super-Range-Bildstabilisator reduziert ungewollte Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfe.\\n\\n<b>Der Camcorder f\u00fcr engagierte Hobbyfilmer<\/b>\\n\u00dcber den erweiterten Zubeh\u00f6rschuh lassen sich Mikrofone, Videoleuchten und andere Peripherieger\u00e4te betreiben. Das erm\u00f6glicht den vielseitigen, kreativen Einsatz des Camcorders f\u00fcr praktisch jeden Drehort. F\u00fcr erstklassige Klangqualit\u00e4t ist die Tonsteuerung auch manuell pr\u00e4zise m\u00f6glich. Praktisch: die HDMI-Schnittstelle f\u00fcr die unkomplizierte Wiedergabe der Videos auf HD-ready TV-Ger\u00e4ten mit nur einem einzigen Kabel.\\n\\n<b>Dreh- und schwenkbares LC-Display<\/b>\\nDer HV30 ist mit einem neuen dreh- und schwenkbaren 2,7-Zoll-LC-Display ausgestattet. Es erm\u00f6glicht die komfortable Kontrolle der Aufnahmen aus einem weiten Betrachtungswinkel von 135 Grad. Die HCAR-Oberfl\u00e4chenverg\u00fctung des LC-Displays wurde auf optimale Darstellung des Farbraums ausgelegt, das Bild wirkt gestochen scharf, die Bildschirmreflexionen bleiben minimal.\\n\\n<b>25p Vollbildaufnahmen f\u00fcr echtes Kinoflair<\/b>\\nIdeal f\u00fcr engagierte Hobbyfilmer: der 25p-Cinema-Modus f\u00fcr klassischen Kino-Look. Eine Kombination aus 25p (Progressive) und CINE-Modus.Weiterer Vorteil: mehr Flexibilit\u00e4t beim Dreh unter schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen.\\n\\n<b>Das lange Videovergn\u00fcgen<\/b>\\nDer HV30 ist mit dem optional als Zubeh\u00f6r erh\u00e4ltlichen Hochleistungsakku (BP-2L24H) f\u00fcr erh\u00f6hte Aufnahmezeiten kompatibel.\\n\\n<b>Fortschrittliche Digitalkamerafunktionen<\/b>\\nDigitale Fotos werden auf einer MiniSD-Karte gespeichert. Zu den fortschrittlichen Fotofunktionen geh\u00f6rt eine Histogramm-Anzeige auf Knopfdruck zur \u00dcberwachung der Helligkeitswerte. Gro\u00dfes Plus des DIGIC-DV-II-Prozessors und der getrennten Signalverarbeitung von Fotos und Videos: Auch w\u00e4hrend laufender Videoaufzeichnung sind Standbilder mit 2,07 Megapixel m\u00f6glich. Fotodirektdruck auf PictBridge-kompatiblen Druckern.\\n\\n<b>Analog-Digital-Wandler<\/b>\\n\u00dcber einen AV-Eingang k\u00f6nnen analoge Aufzeichnungen (z. B. alte private Videoaufnahmen) digitalisiert und auf Band gesichert werden."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Successor to the award-winning HV20, the HV30 derives all the benefits of the Canon HD Camera System - Canon HD Lens, Full HD CMOS sensor and DIGIC DV II processor - for outstanding HDV1080i images.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD Camera System<\/b>\\nThe HV30 inherits the HV20\u2019s Canon HD Camera System \u2013 the unique combination of a genuine Canon HD Video Lens, a 2.96MP Full HD CMOS sensor and the DIGIC DV II processor. Designed and manufactured by Canon, these components integrate seamlessly to deliver superb HDV1080i (High Definition Video) images, recorded to tape.\\n\\n<b>Instant AF<\/b>\\nFocusing in HD can be difficult, since even slight errors are noticeable. The HV30 employs a unique hybrid system called Instant AF for extremely fast, accurate auto focusing \u2013 making it easier to capture pin sharp HD pictures.\\n\\n<b>Canon HD Video Lens<\/b>\\nA 10x optical zoom lens, specially engineered for HD video, inherits Canon\u2019s extensive expertise in broadcast lens manufacture. With Canon\u2019s Super Range Optical Image Stabilizer, all kinds of camera shake are compensated for.\\n\\n<b>Filmmaker\u2019s system<\/b>\\nAn Advanced Accessory Shoe lets moviemakers adapt the camcorder to their needs \u2013 a range of peripherals can be added to suit any shooting situation. Manual audio controls allow sound recording to be finely controlled; an HDMI output jack is the quickest way to connect to a compatible HD TV or computer.\\n\\n<b>Multiangle Vivid LCD<\/b>\\nThe HV30 features Canon\u2019s advanced 2.7\u201d Multiangle Vivid LCD screen. Making it easier to monitor recording when shooting from particularly high or low angles, it has a wide 135-degree viewing angle. HCAR surface treatment ensures sharp images, a wider range of vibrant colours and reduced screen reflection.\\n\\n<b>Cinema-style 25p shooting<\/b>\\nFor ambitious moviemakers, the HV30 features true 25p (progressive) shooting. Allied to a dedicated CINE image mode, movies have the look and feel of film. 25p shooting also offers improved low-light performance, increasing shooting options even further.\\n\\n<b>Shoot for longer<\/b>\\nThe HV30 is compatible with Canon\u2019s optional high capacity battery (BP-2L24H) \u2013 extending shooting times and cutting out the need to carry spares.\\n\\n<b>Advanced photography<\/b>\\nDigital photos are stored to MiniSD card. Advanced photo features includes a one-push histogram display to monitor brightness levels. Split path processing allows simultaneous video and 2.07MP still capture. Print photos directly on PictBridge compatible printers.\\n\\n<b>Analogue-to-digital conversion<\/b>\\nVia an AV input connection, analogue footage (including old home movies) can be transferred to digital tape for safekeeping."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le HV30, qui succ\u00e8de au mod\u00e8le prim\u00e9 HV20, profite de tous les avantages du syst\u00e8me Canon HD (optique Canon HD, capteur CMOS Canon Full HD et processeur DIGIC DV II) pour vous offrir des images HDV1080i de qualit\u00e9 exceptionnelle.\\n\\n<b>Zoom avanc\u00e9 41x de Canon<\/b>\\nL'excellente qualit\u00e9 d'une optique vid\u00e9o Canon alli\u00e9e \u00e0 la puissance du traitement DIGIC DV II dotent le DC310 d'une capacit\u00e9 de zoom sup\u00e9rieure : un zoom avanc\u00e9 offrant un grossissement jusqu'\u00e0 41x.\\n\\n<b>Enregistrement direct sur DVD<\/b>\\nB\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez des avantages de l'enregistrement direct sur DVD (-R\/-RW\/-R double couche). Lorsque votre vid\u00e9o est termin\u00e9e, il vous suffit de finaliser le DVD dans le cam\u00e9scope pour pouvoir le visionner sur la quasi-totalit\u00e9 des lecteurs DVD de salon.\\n\\n<b>Fonction \"Quick Start\"<\/b>\\nNe manquez plus aucun grand moment gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction \"Quick Start\". Une simple pression du bouton de d\u00e9marrage rapide permet quasi-instantan\u00e9ment de mettre le cam\u00e9scope sous tension lorsqu'il est en mode veille : vous \u00eates pr\u00eat \u00e0 commencer \u00e0 filmer en une seconde environ.\\n\\n<b>Commandes intuitives<\/b>\\nLa manette situ\u00e9e sur le cadre de l'\u00e9cran LCD assure l'acc\u00e8s ais\u00e9 et intuitif aux commandes de prise de vue et de lecture.\\n\\n<b>Des enregistrements plus longs<\/b>\\nL'utilisation d'un disque DVD-R double couche vous permet d'enregistrer jusqu'\u00e0 108 minutes de vid\u00e9o. Avec cette augmentation de la capacit\u00e9 d'enregistrement, l'espace d'enregistrement ne vous fera plus jamais d\u00e9faut lors des longues excursions. La batterie haute capacit\u00e9 en option prolonge plus encore la dur\u00e9e d'enregistrement.\\n\\n<b>Enregistrement au v\u00e9ritable format 16\/9\u00e8<\/b>\\nLes cam\u00e9scopes Canon enregistrent au v\u00e9ritable format 16\/9\u00e8 haute r\u00e9solution : vos vid\u00e9os sont parfaitement adapt\u00e9es au visionnage sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur \u00e0 \u00e9cran large. Cadrez et pr\u00e9visualisez vos vid\u00e9os dans leurs dimensions r\u00e9elles sur l'\u00e9cran LCD 16\/9\u00e8 2,7 pouces. Pour \u00e9conomiser votre batterie, filmez plut\u00f4t \u00e0 l'aide du viseur \u00e9lectronique (EVF) 16\/9\u00e8 0,35 pouce.\\n\\n<b>DIGIC DV II<\/b>\\nD\u00e9velopp\u00e9 \u00e0 l'origine pour notre gamme de cam\u00e9scope haute d\u00e9finition, le DIGIC DV II \u00e9quipe d\u00e9sormais nos mod\u00e8les de cam\u00e9scopes DVD. Ce processeur d'image sophistiqu\u00e9 est dot\u00e9 d'une technologie perfectionn\u00e9e de r\u00e9duction du bruit, garantissant ainsi des images plus propres et plus nettes. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un double traitement du signal, le DIGIC DV II est \u00e9galement capable de traiter la vid\u00e9o et la photo s\u00e9par\u00e9ment, optimisant ainsi leurs couleurs, pour l'affichage comme pour l'impression.\\n\\n<b>Eclairage vid\u00e9o via l'\u00e9cran LCD<\/b>\\nOrientez l'\u00e9cran LCD du DC310 vers l'avant pour profiter de sa fonction tr\u00e8s pratique d'\u00e9clairage vid\u00e9o. Il procure ainsi une source lumineuse suppl\u00e9mentaire permettant de continuer \u00e0 filmer m\u00eame dans des conditions de faible \u00e9clairage.\\n\\n<b>Fonctions Photo avanc\u00e9es<\/b>\\nLe DC310 permet \u00e9galement de prendre des photos. Ces derni\u00e8res peuvent \u00eatre stock\u00e9es sur une carte m\u00e9moire SD ou SDHC (haute capacit\u00e9) et peuvent \u00eatre imprim\u00e9es directement sur les imprimantes dot\u00e9es d'un emplacement pour carte m\u00e9moire compatible."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-03-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5f852414-f90f-4e6b-a209-5ac87672a55f","identifier":"14699462","enabled":true,"family":"multifunctionals","categories":["hp","multifunctionals","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Deskjet 3510 e-All-in-One Printer"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Get affordable and reliable performance from this e-all-in-one. You can wirelessly print from virtually anywhere,<SUP>1<\/SUP><SUP>2<\/SUP> enjoy impressive results from Original HP inks, print borderless photos, and even save energy and conserve resources.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Easy wireless printing\u2014virtually anywhere.<SUP>1<\/SUP><SUP>2<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;With HP ePrint, now you can print from virtually anywhere.<SUP>1<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Reliable performance to print, scan, and copy.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Easily print, scan, copy, and access HP Quick Forms from the 2.0-inch (5.08 cm) mono display.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>All the features you need for an affordable price<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Produce borderless documents, photos, and flyers at home.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Designed with the environment in mind<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Take advantage of responsible design\u2014this e-all-in-one is composed of 10% postconsumer recycled plastics.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i>Requires an Internet connection to the printer. Feature works with any connected Internet- and email-capable device. Requires HP Web Services Account Registration. Print times may vary. For a list of supported documents, and image types, see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. And for additional solutions, see http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i>Wireless performance is dependent upon physical environment and distance from access point.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i>Requires a wireless access point and an Internet connection to the printer. Services may require registration. App availability varies by country, language and agreements. For details, http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-29T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"579b5250-2862-40b3-a97d-a5f3abd7d311","identifier":"14700203","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","canon","digital_cameras"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon EOS 1100D + EF-S 18-55mm"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>12-megapixel resolution<\/b>\\nStep up to DSLR image quality with a 12-megapixel APS-C-sized sensor. A 14-bit DIGIC 4 image processor provides up to 3.2fps continuous shooting and images that are packed with detail and tonal range.\\n\\n<b>Intuitive, on-screen feature guide<\/b>\\nThe EOS 1100D\u2019s Feature Guide provides descriptions of many of the camera\u2019s functions, as well as advice on how to use them in your own photography.\\n\\n<b>Easy to use Scene modes and Basic+<\/b>\\nTheme-based Scene modes automatically pick the most suitable exposure, focus and drive-mode settings for the subject being photographed, while Creative Auto mode portrays adjustable functions in an easy to understand way. With Canon\u2019s Basic + technology, the look and feel of these basic auto modes can be fine-tuned according to ambience and lighting type.\\n\\n<b>HD EOS Movie mode<\/b>\\nShoot stunning HD video at 25 or 30fps, with automatic exposure control leaving you free to concentrate on the action. Footage can be edited on your PC or Mac, or played directly on an HD TV via the camera\u2019s HDMI connection.\\n\\n<b>ISO 100-6400 sensitivity<\/b>\\nLow-light shooting without flash is possible thanks to the EOS 1100D\u2019s ISO 100-6400 sensitivity range. The camera\u2019s 14-bit DIGIC 4 processor helps to control noise and maintain image quality.\\n\\n<b>Wide-area 9-point AF system<\/b>\\nThe EOS 1100D focuses quickly and accurately on static and moving subjects, thanks to nine AF points, spread out across the frame. A central cross-type AF point is sensitive to both horizontal and vertical lines.\\n\\n<b>63-zone iFCL exposure metering<\/b>\\nAdvanced iFCL exposure metering dissects a scene into 63-zones before analyzing it to find the perfect combination of shutter speed, aperture and ISO.\\n\\n<b>6.8cm (2.7\u201d), 230,000-dot LCD screen<\/b>\\nCompose and review images on a large 230,000-dot LCD screen, which also provides access to the camera\u2019s menu system and Quick Control Screen.\\n\\n<b>Use with all EF and EF-S lenses<\/b>\\nThe EOS 1100D is supported by the complete range of EOS lenses and accessories: flashguns, remote releases and a system of more than 60 lenses trusted by professional photographers the world over."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>R\u00e9solution de 12 millions de pixels<\/b>\\nPassez \u00e0 la qualit\u00e9 d'image sup\u00e9rieure d'un reflex num\u00e9rique dot\u00e9 d'un capteur APS-C de 12 millions de pixels. Le processeur d'image DIGIC 4 14 bits permet une prise de vues en rafale \u00e0 3,2 im.\/s et des images riches en d\u00e9tail et en nuances de teintes.\\n\\n<b>Guide convivial des fonctions s'affichant \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran<\/b>\\nLe guide des fonctions de l'EOS 1100D d\u00e9crit la plupart des fonctions de l'appareil et fournit des conseils sur leur utilisation.\\n\\n<b>Modes Sc\u00e8ne et Basic+ faciles \u00e0 utiliser<\/b>\\nLes modes de prise de vues th\u00e9matiques (sc\u00e8ne) s\u00e9lectionnent automatiquement l'exposition, la focale et le mode d'acquisition les mieux indiqu\u00e9s en fonction du sujet, tandis que le mode Auto cr\u00e9atif permet de choisir ses r\u00e9glages en toute simplicit\u00e9. La technologie Basic+ de Canon permet d'ajuster ces modes auto en fonction du type d'\u00e9clairage et de l'atmosph\u00e8re de la sc\u00e8ne cadr\u00e9e.\\n\\n<b>Mode vid\u00e9o EOS HD<\/b>\\nUtilisez le contr\u00f4le d'exposition automatique pour enregistrer des vid\u00e9os HD \u00e9poustouflantes \u00e0 25 ou 30 im.\/s en vous concentrant uniquement sur l'action. La vid\u00e9o peut ensuite \u00eatre modifi\u00e9e sur PC ou Mac, ou lue directement sur un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connexion HDMI de l'appareil.\\n\\n<b>Sensibilit\u00e9 de 100 \u00e0 6400 ISO<\/b>\\nLa plage de sensibilit\u00e9 de 100 \u00e0 6400 ISO de l'EOS 1100D permet d'obtenir de bons r\u00e9sultats sans flash, m\u00eame en basse lumi\u00e8re. Le processeur DIGIC 4 14 bits minimise le bruit et garantit la qualit\u00e9 d'image.\\n\\n<b>Large plage autofocus \u00e0 9 collimateurs<\/b>\\nL'EOS 1100D permet une mise au point rapide et pr\u00e9cise d'un sujet statique ou en mouvement gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 neuf collimateurs AF r\u00e9partis sur l'ensemble de la plage. Un collimateur AF central de type crois\u00e9 est sensible aux lignes verticales et horizontales.\\n\\n<b>Syst\u00e8me de mesure d\u2019exposition iFCL sur 63 zones<\/b>\\nLa mesure de l'exposition iFCL avanc\u00e9e d\u00e9compose la sc\u00e8ne en 63 zones avant de l'analyser et de d\u00e9terminer la combinaison id\u00e9ale vitesse, ouverture et sensibilit\u00e9 ISO.\\n\\n<b>\u00c9cran LCD de 6,8 cm (2,7 pouces), 230.000 points<\/b>\\nComposez et visualisez vos photos sur un grand \u00e9cran LCD de 230.000 points, qui permet \u00e9galement d'acc\u00e9der aux menus de l'appareil et \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran de contr\u00f4le rapide.\\n\\n<b>Compatible avec l'ensemble des objectifs EF et EF-S<\/b>\\nL'EOS 1100D est compatible avec l'ensemble des objectifs et des accessoires EOS : flashes, d\u00e9clencheurs \u00e0 distance et plus de 60 objectifs utilis\u00e9s par les photographes professionnels du monde entier."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-29T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4fc8915c-7e50-4979-8716-0d3d73da096d","identifier":"14704189","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["dell","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"DELL B1260dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Drucken Sie effizienter und produktiver \u2013 mit dem kompakten DellTM B1260dn Schwarz-Wei\u00df-Laserdrucker. Dank hervorragendem Preis-Leistungs-Verh\u00e4ltnis ist dieses System ideal f\u00fcr kleine Arbeitsgruppen oder B\u00fcroumgebungen.\\n\\n- Verbesserte Effizienz: Profitieren Sie von beidseitigem Druck, hochwertigen Ausdrucken, integriertem Ethernet f\u00fcr umfassende Netzwerkkonnektivit\u00e4t und hoher Druckgeschwindigkeit.\\n- Druck \u00fcber Mobilger\u00e4te: Sie k\u00f6nnen \u00fcber eine Vielzahl von mobilen Ger\u00e4ten ganz einfach direkt auf Ihrem Dell B1260dn drucken.\\n- Zuverl\u00e4ssige Leistung: Sichern Sie sich absolute Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit mit einem hohen Druckvolumen von bis zu 20.000 Seiten pro Monat.\\n\\nDruckerfreigabe:\\nIntegriertes Ethernet garantiert vollst\u00e4ndige Anbindung an das B\u00fcronetzwerk. Sie k\u00f6nnen Ihren Drucker jederzeit f\u00fcr mehrere Anwender im Netzwerk freigeben.\\n\\nEffizientes Arbeiten:\\nErzielen Sie h\u00f6here Produktivit\u00e4t im B\u00fcro und sparen Sie beim Papierverbrauch \u2013 mit einer Duplexeinheit f\u00fcr beidseitiges Drucken.\\n\\nZeitersparnis:\\nProfitieren Sie von schnellem Schwarz-Wei\u00df-Druck mit bis zu 28 A4-Seiten pro Minute\\n\\nSchnelles und einfaches Drucken direkt \u00fcber Ihr AndroidTM Ger\u00e4t\\nDrucken Sie mit der Dell Mobile Print App Fotos, Dokumente und vieles mehr schnell und problemlos direkt \u00fcber Ihr AndroidTM Mobilger\u00e4t. Diese benutzerfreundliche App erm\u00f6glicht das direkte Drucken von Dokumenten, Fotos, Webseiten und vielem mehr \u00fcber eine breite Palette von Anwendungen. Die App ist kostenlos \u00fcber Google PlayTM erh\u00e4ltlich.\\n\\nDrucken mit AirPrintTM\\nDrucken Sie direkt \u00fcber Ihr iPhone\u00ae , Ihr iPad\u00ae oder Ihren iPod touch\u00ae \u2013 mit AirPrint2. AirPrint kann mit einer Vielzahl von Anwendungen, einschlie\u00dflich Safari, Mail, Fotos, iWork und iBooks, eingesetzt werden. Sie k\u00f6nnen Teilnahmebest\u00e4tigungen f\u00fcr Seminare ebenso wie Fotos, wichtige E-Mails und Webseiten schnell und einfach ausdrucken.\\n\\nVerbindung mit Google Cloud PrintTM\\nMit Google Cloud Print k\u00f6nnen Sie und die von Ihnen festgelegten Personen \u00fcber die tagt\u00e4glich genutzten Anwendungen auf Ihre Drucker zu Hause und im B\u00fcro zugreifen. Sie k\u00f6nnen Google Cloud Print auf Ihrem Mobiltelefon, Ihrem Tablet-PC, Ihrem Chromebook und Ihrem PC sowie allen \u00fcbrigen mit dem Internet verbundenen Ger\u00e4ten nutzen.\\n\\nMaximale Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit: Hohes Druckvolumen von bis zu 20.000 Seiten pro Monat und ein praktisches Papierfach mit hoher Kapazit\u00e4t, das bis zu 250 Blatt fasst. Dank standardm\u00e4\u00dfiger 64 MB RAM drucken Sie auch umfangreiche Dateien schnell und unkompliziert.\\n\\nEinfache Wartung: Minimaler Wartungsbedarf dank einer einzelnen Tonerkassette. Die Fixiereinheit des Druckers ist sehr langlebig und muss w\u00e4hrend des gesamten Lebenszyklus nicht ausgetauscht werden.\\n\\nUmweltfreundliches Design: Sparen Sie Toner und Papier. \u00dcber die Eco-Taste k\u00f6nnen Sie umgehend in den umweltfreundlichen Spardruck wechseln. Der Dell B1260dn ist mit RoHS konform und ENERGY STAR 1.2-zertifiziert.3 Leere Tonerkassetten k\u00f6nnen Sie ganz einfach recyceln. Einzelheiten hierzu finden Sie unter Dell.com\/recycle."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Enjoy efficient printing and help improve productivity with the compact DellTM B1260dn Mono Laser Printer. It can bring value to any small office or workgroup.\\n\\n- Enhance efficiency: Enjoy two-sided printing, high-quality printouts, network connectivity with built-in Ethernet and high-speed printing.\\n- Print from mobile devices: It\u2019s easy to print directly from a wide variety of mobile devices right to your Dell B1260dn.\\n- Get reliable performance: Experience enduring reliability with a high-duty cycle of up to 20,000 pages per month.\\n\\nShare your printer:\\nEnjoy vital office network connectivity with a built-in Ethernet. Easily share your printer with multiple users on the network.\\n\\nWork efficiently:\\nHelp boost productivity around the office and save paper costs with a duplexer that automatically delivers two-sided printing.\\n\\nSave time:\\nExperience the convenience of high-speed mono printing \u2014 up to 28 ppm (A4)\\n\\nThe Dell B1260dn lets you and your team easily print documents, photos, images and reports directly from a wide range of mobile phones and tablets.\\nFast and easy printing, direct from your Android(TM device\\nDiscover the fast and easy way to print directly from your AndroidTM mobile device with Dell Mobile Print App. It\u2019s simple to print documents, photos, web pages and more with this easy-to-use app which supports direct printing from a vast array of applications. Download it for free at Google PlayTM .\\n\\nPrint with AirPrintTM\\nDirectly print from your iPhone\u00ae , iPad\u00ae or iPod touch\u00ae using AirPrint. Airprint works with a variety of apps including Safari, Mail, Photos, iWork and iBooks. So you can print seminar confirmation tickets, photos, vital emails and web pages quickly and easily.\\n\\nConnect with Google Cloud PrintTM\\nUsing Google Cloud Print, you can make your home and work printers available to you and anyone you choose, from the applications you use every day. Google Cloud Print works on your phone, tablet, Chromebook, PC, and any other web-connected device you want to print from.\\n\\nEnduring reliability: Get a high-duty cycle of up to 20,000 pages per month and enjoy the convenience of a high-input 250-sheet paper tray. Print large files quickly with a high standard memory of 64MB RAM.\\n\\nEasy to maintain: Minimize upkeep with just one toner cartridge to replace. The fuser unit is designed to last the life of the printer.\\n\\nEnvironmentally-conscious design: Save toner and paper. One touch of the Eco button automatically engages Eco Mode printing. The Dell B1260dn is RoHS and ENERGY STAR 1.2 qualified. You can recycle empty toner cartridges. For details, visit Dell.com\/recycle."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-06-30T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5ef1decb-b605-4304-9377-343d27880e2c","identifier":"14734909","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision AV36"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Mobile Stromversorgung via USB<\/b>\\nTragen sie das Ger\u00e4t nicht von einem Standort zum n\u00e4chsten sondern nutzen sie es unterwegs! Diese Vision wurde mit dem AV36 Scanner realisiert, der unabh\u00e4ngig vom Stromnetz, nur \u00fcber den USB-Anschluss mit Strom versorgt wird. Somit scannen sie ihre Dokumente \u00fcberall wo ein Notebook genutzt werden kann, praktisch \u00fcberall.\\n\\n\\n<b>Portabel<\/b>\\nDer AV36 ist sehr leicht (nur 0.7kg) und sehr klein mit 290mm x 77mm x 52mm. Die geringe Gr\u00f6\u00dfe erlaubt es dem Nutzer das Ger\u00e4t problemlos mitzuf\u00fchren ohne zus\u00e4tzllichen Ballast zu tragen. Aufgrund der Tatsache das kein Netzteil ben\u00f6tigt wird ist der Avision AV36 der ideale Begleiter f\u00fcr unterwegs und setzt einen neuen Standard in der Welt der portablen Scanner ohne auf Qualit\u00e4t verzichten zu m\u00fcssen.\\n\\n<b>Duplex Scanner<\/b>\\nDer AV36 ist ein Duplex Scannermit einer optischen Aufl\u00f6sung von 600dpi. Sparen sie Zeit und M\u00fche indem sie ihre doppelseitigen Dokumente oder ID-Karten in einem Scannvorgang einlesen. Das Scannen eines Dokuments dauert in Farbe bei 300 dpi Aufl\u00f6sung nur 12 Sekunden im Simplex Modus, sowie 15 Sekunden im Duplex Modus.\\n\\n<b>Kompatibel mit Plastik Karten(EC)<\/b>\\nUnterst\u00fctzt Dokumente von A8 bis A4, und kann dabei Plastik Karten(z.B EC Karten\/P\u00e4sse) bis zu einer H\u00f6he von 1.25mm einscannen.\\n\\n<b>Software Umfang<\/b>\\nDer Avision AV36 Scanner wird mit Twain und ISIS\\nTreibern ausgeliefert, der Vollversion des exklusiven\\nAvision Button Manager, AVScan, ScanSoft PaperPort\\n11SE , NewSoft Presto! BizCard\\n\\n<b>NewSoft Presto! BizCard Presto!<\/b>\\nPresto! BizCard ist eine umfassende Kontaktverwaltungs Software mit der Sie ihre Visitenkarten scannen , bearbeiten und mit einer Vielzahl an Anwendungen synchronisieren k\u00f6nnen.Das ideale Werkzeug um ihre Kontakte zu pflegen und sprach\u00fcbergreifend zu organisieren.\\nPresto! BizCard erfasst und konvertiert ihre Visitenkarten in eine durchsuchbare und editierbare Datenbank. Diese Informationen lassen sich somit einfach und m\u00fchelos mit dem AV36 zu ihrem\\nComputer\/Laptop \u00fcbertragen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Mobile power by USB<\/b>\\nDon\u2019t just haul the scanner from one destination to another, use it on the go! This is the vision fully realized with the AV36, which is powered by a USB port instead of a wall socket. So now, documents can be scanned whenever a laptop is present, which can be anywhere.\\n\\n<b>Portable<\/b>\\nThe AV36 is light (only 0.7kg) and small in size at 290mm x 77mm x 52mm. The small form factor enables users to pack along easily without sacrificing too much luggage space or become a burden to carry. Coupled with the benefits of being USB powered, the AV36 sets a new standard for scanner portability.\\n\\n<b>Duplex scanning<\/b>\\nThe AV36 is a duplex scanner with an optical resolution of 600dpi. Save the time and effort of manually scanning a double-sided document or a plastic ID card. A complete color scan of A4 document at 300dpi in simplex mode takes 12 seconds, and 7.5 seconds per image in duplex mode.\\n\\n<b>Compatible with plastic cards<\/b>\\nSupported document size ranges from A8 to A4, and it can scan embossed plastic cards up to 1.25mm thick, such as credit cards and ID cards.\\n\\n<b>Bundled software<\/b>\\nThe newest version of TWAIN (v5.60) and extensive software applications Avision Button Manager, AVScan 5, NewSoft Presto! BizCard and ScanSoft PaperPort 11SE are included with every shipped unit to bring the most out of the AV36.\\n\\n<b>NewSoft Presto! BizCard Presto!<\/b>\\nBizCard is a complete contact management solution that lets you scan, edit and synchronize business card contacts to various contact management software applications. It captures and converts business cards into a searchable and editable database, with support for 12 different languages including English, most European languages, Simplified\/Traditional Chinese and Japanese. BizCard is the ideal tool for helping you stay in touch and organized."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-07-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2ee24834-5f32-44a3-a19f-4c683211a402","identifier":"14739367","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLP-680ND"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>CLP-680ND Colour Laser Printer<\/b>\\n- Fast and economical colour printing;\\n- Now every workgroup can enjoy professional colour output;\\n- High power printing performance;\\n- Professional colour printing made easy for you.\\n\\n<b>Fast and economical colour printing<\/b>\\nBusinesses today need to know that they can produce a high level of printing quickly, and in a cost-effective way. The CLP-680ND not only delivers brilliant colour quality, but speeds through high print volumes with ease. A fast Dual CPU, gigabit network support and instant fusing technology ensures enhanced speed and less waiting time. Yet what sets it apart economically is the range of cost-effective and innovative features, such as high yield toner, low energy consumption and eco-friendly settings. It makes this medium workgroup printer as cost conscious as they come.\\n\\n<b>Now every workgroup can enjoy professional colour output<\/b>\\nWhatever size your team, and however busy you are, you can rely on the CLP-680ND to constantly deliver professional, quality colour output. Because anything less isn\u2019t good enough.\\n\\n<b>Make sharp images and text even sharper<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s unique ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) Technology improves the overall quality and vibrancy of your colour printing, ensuring every printout looks perfect. It automatically sharpens the focus of both graphics and text, while solid objects are overlapped to eliminate white gaps.\\n\\n<b>Make colours more vibrant<\/b>\\nOur newly developed polymerised toner has smaller and more uniform particles than conventional toner. Your printouts will have crisper lines and more vivid colours, in addition to eliminating paper curling. Also, its higher wax content improves the image gloss and enhances the durability preventing unwanted fading.\\n\\n<b>High power printing performance<\/b>\\nWhatever the size of your print job, the CLP-680ND will shine with an impressive 17 seconds First Print Out Time, and a speedy 24 pages per minute after that. This means you can focus on what's important rather than wait for your prints.\\n\\n<b>More power, higher productivity<\/b>\\nSome days it seems like the printing never ends. With the CLP-680ND's 533MHz Dual CPU, and 512MB standard memory (expandable up to 1GB) you can be sure that this printer will handle the entire load of your workgroup's need.\\n\\n<b>Speedy and flexible paper handling<\/b>\\nIf you want to print or copy onto heavier weights of paper, you can. Weights of up to 220g\/m2 are handled with ease through the 50 page multipurpose tray as well as the 250 page standard cassette. Plus, with the optional 520 sheet second cassette you can increase your total paper input capacity to 820 sheets. That way you can also use up to three different media types without the need to waste time changing paper.\\n\\n<b>Professional colour printing made easy for you<\/b>\\nWith the CLP-680ND you can increase your entire workgroup\u2019s workflow with a range of easy-to-use features and ingenious time-saving support software that helps free you to work smarter and faster.\\n\\n<b>Easy Operating Panel<\/b>\\nWith the CLP-680ND's two line liquid crystal display and intuitive 5 key compass navigation you can control the device's status, browse the menu and access each unique feature with ease.\\n\\n<b>Convenient USB printing<\/b>\\nPrint documents directly from the printer, without the need of a computer, via a front-facing Direct USB slot located just below the operating panel.\\n\\n<b>Secure, confidential printing<\/b>\\nIf you need to print sensitive data through your printer, you can relax. You can now ensure personal print jobs remain personal. Just enter a password, and you can retrieve a print job at your convenience, away from any prying eyes. And with the integrated numeric key pad it's easier than ever!\\n\\n<b>Low cost, low impact on the world<\/b>\\nSave toner, paper and energy with ease - it's good for the environment and it's good for your business' profits. Being economical and printing vibrant colour documents goes hand in hand with the CLP-680ND.\\n\\n<b>Extra high yield means extra low costs<\/b>\\nEnjoy professional colour print-outs while staying in complete control of your total cost of ownership. Our specially developed higher yield cartridges means more time between changes and less expense with each print out.\\n\\n<b>Cut costs with duplex printing<\/b>\\nWith the integrated duplex feature, saving paper has never been easier. That\u2019s because the paper is turned automatically so that you can print on both sides. It could mean an amazing saving of up to 50% on your paper consumption.\\n\\n<b>Save money the eco way<\/b>\\nEvery business sees the need to cut costs wherever it can. With the ECO button and the smart eco driver funtions it's easier than ever. Print more on each page with the N-up and duplex functionality, skip blank pages or print in greyscale instead of full colour. With the result simulator you can even see how much CO2, power and paper you've saved.\\n\\nLow Power Consumption\\nDespite its impressive list of features and functions, the CLP-680ND consumes less energy than most of its competitors. Its innovative polymerised toner requires lower fusing temperatures, the instant fusing technology saves warm up time before first print, and our new Dual CPU make it one of the greenest devices around today.\\n\\n<b>Easy Solution support<\/b>\\nThe printer also brings you software support designed to put you in control of delivering ultimate quality printouts easier than ever before.\\n\\n<b>Easy Eco Driver<\/b>\\nEasy Eco Driver helps you compile digital documents in multiple formats and makes it easy to share them with others - even through social networks.\\n\\n<b>Get the right result before printing<\/b>\\nThe Samsung Easy Colour Manager allows you to adjust the colour balance, saturation, brightness or contrast of any image prior to printing. Perfect for matching the exact colours of your company logo every time.\\n\\n<b>Take the stress out of print management<\/b>\\nFor maximum control, Easy Printer Manager lets you manage all your devices from one location. Check device and toner status, change device settings or set alerts \u2013 even through e-mail.\\n\\n<b>Mobile Printing<\/b>\\nWith amazing Samsung Mobile Printing solution, you don\u2019t have install any drivers to your mobile devices. Simply Just Install Samsung Mobile Print application on your mobile devices, and you can print directly from your mobile device.\\n\\n<b>Easy toner replacement<\/b>\\nGone are the days of fiddly, dirty and time-consuming toner cartridge changes. It\u2019s all made easier with a push loading drawer. What\u2019s more, the high yield cartridges mean fewer changes."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>CLP-680ND Colour Laser Printer<\/b>\\n- Des impressions couleur rapides et \u00e9conomiques;\\n- Tous les groupes de travail b\u00e9n\u00e9ficient d\u00e9sormais d\u2019impressions couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle;\\n- Des performances d\u2019impression sup\u00e9rieures;\\n- Des impressions couleur professionnelles \u00e0 votre port\u00e9e.\\n\\n<b>Des impressions couleur rapides et \u00e9conomiques<\/b>\\nLes entreprises doivent savoir qu'il est aujourd'hui possible de produire des impressions de qualit\u00e9 \u00e9lev\u00e9e de mani\u00e8re rapide et \u00e9conomique. L'imprimante CLP-680ND permet d'obtenir des couleurs brillantes de qualit\u00e9, mais aussi une vitesse d'impression sup\u00e9rieure lors du traitement de volumes importants. Le biprocesseur v\u00e9loce, la prise en charge de la connectivit\u00e9 r\u00e9seau Gigabit et la technologie de fusion instantan\u00e9e offrent une vitesse accrue et un temps d'attente r\u00e9duit. Ce qui la distingue toutefois sur le plan \u00e9conomique est son \u00e9ventail de fonctions innovantes et \u00e9conomes, telles que l'optimisation du toner, la faible consommation d'\u00e9nergie et les fonctionnalit\u00e9s respectueuses de l'environnement. Cette imprimante pour les groupes de travail de taille moyenne r\u00e9pond d\u00e8s le d\u00e9part aux besoins des utilisateurs soucieux de leurs porte-monnaie.\\nTous les groupes de travail b\u00e9n\u00e9ficient d\u00e9sormais d'impressions couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle\\nQuels que soient votre emploi du temps ou la taille de votre \u00e9quipe, vous pouvez compter sur l'imprimante CLP-680ND pour fournir \u00e0 tout moment des impressions couleur de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle. Contentez-vous du meilleur.\\n\\n<b>Des images et du texte encore plus nets<\/b>\\nLa technologie ReCP (moteur de restitution d'une page nette) unique de Samsung am\u00e9liore la qualit\u00e9 globale de vos impressions couleur et apporte \u00e0 chacune vitalit\u00e9 et perfection. La nettet\u00e9 est automatiquement accrue sur les images et le texte, tandis que les objets solides se chevauchent pour \u00e9liminer les espaces blancs.\\n\\n<b>Des couleurs encore plus vives<\/b>\\nNotre nouveau toner polym\u00e9ris\u00e9 utilise des particules plus petites et plus uniformes que les toners conventionnels. Par cons\u00e9quent, les lignes de vos impressions sont plus nettes, les couleurs plus vives et le papier n'ondule plus. De plus, sa haute teneur en cire am\u00e9liore la brillance de l'image et augmente la durabilit\u00e9 en \u00e9vitant le fondu ind\u00e9sirable.\\n\\n<b>Des performances d'impression sup\u00e9rieures<\/b>\\nPeu importe le volume, l\u2019imprimante CLP-680ND vous offre un d\u00e9lai d\u2019impression de la premi\u00e8re page de 17 secondes puis 24 pages par minute pour des \u00e9conomies de temps. Vous pouvez alors vous concentrer sur ce qui est r\u00e9ellement important, plut\u00f4t que d\u2019attendre vos documents.\\n\\n<b>Plus de puissance pour une meilleure productivit\u00e9<\/b>\\nL'impression de documents ne requiert pas forc\u00e9ment beaucoup de patience. Avec un double processeur 533 MHz et une m\u00e9moire standard de 512 Mo (extensible jusqu'\u00e0 1 Go), vous pouvez compter sur l'imprimante CLP-680ND pour une gestion optimale de tous les besoins en trafic de votre groupe de travail.\\n\\n<b>Rapidit\u00e9 et souplesse de la gestion du papier<\/b>\\nVous souhaitez imprimer ou photocopier des documents sur du papier \u00e9pais. Aucun souci. Les grammages atteignant jusqu'\u00e0 220 g\/m2 sont g\u00e9r\u00e9s en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9 dans le bac polyvalent de 50 pages ainsi que dans le bac standard de 250 pages. En outre, le bac suppl\u00e9mentaire en option de 250 feuilles vous permet d'augmenter la capacit\u00e9 totale d'alimentation papier jusqu'\u00e0 820 feuilles. Vous pouvez ainsi utiliser pas moins de trois types de support diff\u00e9rents sans perdre votre temps \u00e0 changer le papier.\\n\\n<b>Des impressions couleur professionnelles \u00e0 votre port\u00e9e<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'imprimante CLP-680ND, vous pouvez augmenter le flux de production de l'ensemble de votre groupe de travail au travers d'une s\u00e9lection de fonctions conviviales et d'un logiciel d'assistance ing\u00e9nieux permettant de gagner du temps. Vous travaillez ainsi plus intelligemment et plus rapidement.\\n\\n<b>Panneau de commande convivial<\/b>\\nAvec son \u00e9cran \u00e0 cristaux liquides de deux lignes et son bouton de navigation \u00e0 cinq touches intuitif, l'imprimante CLP-680ND vous permet de contr\u00f4ler l'\u00e9tat du p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique, de parcourir le menu et d'acc\u00e9der facilement \u00e0 chaque fonction unique.\\n\\n<b>Impression pratique par USB<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'emplacement USB Direct situ\u00e9 \u00e0 l'avant de l'appareil, juste au-dessous du panneau de commande, vous pouvez lancer des impressions directement depuis une cl\u00e9 USB, ou y transf\u00e9rer des num\u00e9risations, le tout sans ordinateur.\\n\\n<b>Un tr\u00e8s haut rendement signifie des co\u00fbts tr\u00e8s faibles<\/b>\\nProfitez d'impressions couleur professionnelles tout en ma\u00eetrisant le co\u00fbt total de possession. Nos cartouches sp\u00e9ciales \u00e0 haut rendement sont synonymes de remplacements moins fr\u00e9quents et vous font r\u00e9aliser des \u00e9conomies \u00e0 chaque impression.\\n\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez les co\u00fbts gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression recto verso<\/b>\\nAvec la fonction int\u00e9gr\u00e9e d'impression recto verso, \u00e9conomiser du papier n'a jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 aussi facile. Le principe est simple : le papier est retourn\u00e9 automatiquement afin de pouvoir imprimer des deux c\u00f4t\u00e9s. Vous pouvez ainsi diviser par deux votre consommation de papier.\\n\\n<b>Economisez de l'argent tout en pr\u00e9servant l'environnement<\/b>\\nChaque entreprise a besoin de r\u00e9duire ses co\u00fbts \u00e0 tous les niveaux. Gr\u00e2ce au bouton ECO et aux fonctions du pilote Smart Eco, r\u00e9aliser des \u00e9conomies est un vrai jeu d'enfant. Imprimez plus efficacement avec les fonctions N-up (plusieurs pages par feuille) et recto verso, ignorez les pages vierges ou imprimez en niveaux de gris plut\u00f4t qu'en couleur. Gr\u00e2ce au simulateur de r\u00e9sultats, vous pouvez m\u00eame conna\u00eetre les quantit\u00e9s de co\u00b2, d'\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 ou de papier que vous avez \u00e9conomis\u00e9es.\\n\\n<b>Easy Eco Driver<\/b>\\nLa fonction Easy Eco Driver vous aide \u00e0 compiler des documents num\u00e9riques dans de nombreux formats et facilite leur partage avec d'autres personnes, m\u00eame via les r\u00e9seaux sociaux.\\n\\n<b>Impression mobile<\/b>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la formidable solution d'impression mobile de Samsung, inutile d'installer un pilote sur vos appareils mobiles. Pour lancer directement des impressions depuis votre appareil mobile, il vous suffit d'installer l'application d'impression mobile de Samsung.\\n\\n<b>Remplacement facile du toner<\/b>\\nLe temps des remplacements fastidieux, compliqu\u00e9s et salissants des cartouches de toner est r\u00e9volu. En effet, le tiroir de chargement \u00e0 pression vous simplifie la t\u00e2che. De plus, les cartouches \u00e0 haut rendement n\u00e9cessitent des remplacements moins fr\u00e9quents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-07-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"20.0000","unit":"KILOGRAM"}}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"83377ed0-35d2-4f5f-8550-184fa7bf4355","identifier":"14739374","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLP-320N"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"F\u00fcr eine universelle Nutzung als Heim-oder B\u00fcrodrucker bedarf es wirklich eines ungew\u00f6hnlichen Druckers. Der kompakte CLP-320N erledigt die Arbeit mehrerer gro\u00dfer Drucker. Die Netzwerkf\u00e4higkeiten erm\u00f6glichen auch f\u00fcr Ihre Familie oder Kollegen eine Druckleistung mit lebendigen, qualitativ hochwertigen Farben, sodass weitere Drucker \u00fcberfl\u00fcssig sind Mit bis zu 2.400 x 600 dpi bietet der CLP-320N problemlos maximale Farbqualit\u00e4t und mit seinem schicken schwarzen und cremefarbenen \u00c4u\u00dferen einen stilvoll sportlichen und minimalistischen Look. Trotz dieser Vielseitigkeit und Leistung passt der kompakte CLP-320N problemlos nahezu \u00fcberall hin.\\n\\n<b>Verbinden Sie sich mit Ihren Kollegen<\/b>\\nStellen Sie in Ihrem B\u00fcro f\u00fcr alle eine Netzwerkverbindung her und sorgen Sie f\u00fcr einen reibungslosen Arbeitsablauf. Sie k\u00f6nnen alle einen gemeinsamen Drucker verwenden, was Ihnen Zeit spart-auch bei der Wartung Und mit der Ethernet-Schnittstelle k\u00f6nnen Sie die Leistung durch Anbindung an das Netzwerk erh\u00f6hen. Optimieren Sie mit dem CLP-320N Laserdrucker Ihre Kommunikationsf\u00e4higkeiten und bleiben Sie allzeit bereit.\\n\\n<b>Ideal f\u00fcr enge, stilvolle Ecken und viel genutzte Pl\u00e4tze<\/b>\\nDer sehr kompakte Samsung CLP-320N passt mit seinen 388 x 313 x 243 mm bequem auf jeden Schreibtisch, ohne Ihnen die gesamte Arbeitsfl\u00e4che zu nehmen. Au\u00dferdem ist das Ger\u00e4t nicht nur praktisch sondern sieht auch noch gut aus. Mit abgerundeten Ecken, eleganten LEDs und einer schicken schwarz und grau-melierten Oberfl\u00e4che sollten Sie den Drucker nicht unter einem Stapel Papier verstecken. Au\u00dferdem werden Ihnen die benutzerfreundliche Taste \u201ePrint Screen\" sowie der Ein-und Ausschalter vorne am Ger\u00e4t f\u00fcr schnellen und einfachen Zugriff gefallen. Das ist doch ein ausgekl\u00fcgeltes Design, oder?\\n\\n<b>Eine l\u00e4stige Ger\u00e4uschquelle weniger im B\u00fcro<\/b>\\nSie sollten am eigenen Schreibtisch nicht durch unn\u00f6tige Ger\u00e4usche gest\u00f6rt werden. Daher ist der Samsung CLP-320N so leise wie ein Fl\u00fcstern und hat beim Drucken einen Ger\u00e4uschpegel unter 45 dBA (Farbe) und 47 dBA (Schwarzwei\u00df). Das ist leiser als das Ger\u00e4usch eines K\u00fchlschranks im Betrieb! Ein Drucker f\u00fcr den Schreibtisch, der arbeitet, w\u00e4hrend Sie sich auf Ihre Arbeit konzentrieren k\u00f6nnen? Cool!\\n\\n<b>Senken Sie Ihre Wartezeit, nicht Ihre Erwartungen<\/b>\\nVorbei sind die Zeiten, wo Sie auf die Dokumente aus dem Drucker warten m\u00fcssen. Die schnelle Druckgeschwindigkeit des Samsung CLP-320N (16 Seiten\/Min. in Schwarzwei\u00df, 4 Seiten\/Min. in Farbe) sorgt daf\u00fcr, dass Sie keine kostbare Zeit verschwenden. In betriebsbereitem Zustand druckt der CLP-320N die erste Seite in nur 14 Sekunden (Schwarzwei\u00df) bzw. 26 Sekunden (Farbe). Eine beeindruckende Druckaufl\u00f6sung von 2.400 x 600 dpi erf\u00fcllt Ihre Qualit\u00e4tsanforderungen mit Sicherheit.\\n\\n<b>Der richtige Ansatz f\u00fcr Energieeffizienz<\/b>\\nIn der heutigen umweltfreundlichen Arbeitsumgebung ist einfach kein Platz mehr f\u00fcr Drucker, die Energie verschwenden. Daher hat der Samsung CLP-320N die Taste zum Einschalten gut erreichbar direkt auf dem Bedienfeld, damit Sie auf Knopfdruck in den energiesparenden Standby-Modus wechseln k\u00f6nnen. Sie m\u00f6chten drucken? Einfach erneut auf die Taste dr\u00fccken und es kann losgehen.\\n\\n<b>Drucken, was Ihnen ins Auge sticht<\/b>\\nMit der Software AnyWeb Print von Samsung k\u00f6nnen Sie im Internet jagen und sammeln. Sie k\u00f6nnen mit dem CLP-320N einfach Inhalte von verschiedenen Internetseiten ausw\u00e4hlen und zum sp\u00e4teren Drucken in einen speziellen Bereich in Ihrem Browserfenster ziehen-und dabei weiter surfen.\\n\\n<b>Ihre Druckergebnisse werden noch farbenfroher<\/b>\\nDer CLP-320N liefert ganz problemlos und einfach Farbgenauigkeit dank der 2.400 x 600 dpi Aufl\u00f6sung. Au\u00dferdem werden Sie von den genauen Farben und sch\u00f6nen Hochglanz-Ausdrucken beeindruckt sein, die durch die kleineren und gleichm\u00e4\u00dfigeren Tonerpartikel m\u00f6glich sind."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The compact CLP-320N from Samsung does the job of several larger printers. Its network capabilities let your family or colleagues connect and get vivid, high-quality colour printing performance, without having to rely on a fleet of printers to meet their needs. With up to 2400 x 600dpi, the CLP-320N effortlessly delivers maximum colour while stylishly sporting a minimal design, with its chic black and cr\u00e8me grey fa\u00e7ade. All this style and power, yet the compact CLP-320N fits easily almost anywhere.\\n<br \/>\\n<b>Connect with your colleagues<\/b>\\n<br \/>\\nConnect everyone in your office to one network and keep everything running smoothly. They\u2019ll share a common printer and you\u2019ll save time from servicing multiple machines. And with the Ethernet interface you can increase your performance by hooking it up to the network. Improve your communication skills with the CLP-320N laser printer and keep your lines of communication open. \\n<br \/>\\n<b>Ideal for small, stylish spaces and busy places.<\/b>\\n<br \/>\\nMeasuring an ultra compact 388 x 313 x 243mm (15.3 x 12.3 x 9.6inch), the Samsung CLP-320N easily fits on any desktop leaving plenty of room for you to get your work done. It also offers the perfect blend of beauty and practicality. With rounded edges, chic black top and glossy cr\u00e8me grey finish everywhere else, you won\u2019t want to hide this printer under a pile of papers. And you\u2019ll really enjoy the convenient power switch located on the front panel for fast, easy access. How\u2019s that for accommodating design? \\n<br \/>\\n<b>Capture what catches your eye<\/b>\\n<br \/>\\nSamsung\u2019s AnyWeb Print software lets you go hunting and gathering on the Web. You can utilise the CLP-320N to easily select, drag, and drop content from different web pages onto a printable scrap board in your browser window, all while you surf the web. It\u2019s an easy way to collect, arrange, and edit useful reference points and resources you can only find on the web for big projects \u2013 or even just for fun. \\n<br \/>\\n<b>Your printing experience just got a lot more colourful.<\/b>\\n<br \/>\\nThe CLP-320N easily delivers colour accuracy through premium quality 2400 x 600dpi resolution with absolute ease. Also, with toner particles that are smaller and more uniform in shape than traditional toner particles, you\u2019ll be impressed with accurate colours and beautiful, glossy printouts. \\n<br \/>\\n<b>Lessen your wait, not your expectations<\/b>\\n<br \/>\\nQuit losing productivity waiting around for your documents to print \u2013 the Samsung CLP-320N\u2019s fast print speed (16ppm for mono, 4ppm for colour) will have you back to work in no time. In Ready Mode, the CLP-320N features a First Page Output Time (FPOT) of only 14 seconds for black and 26 seconds for colour, satisfying your need for speed. An impressive 2400 x 600dpi print resolution satisfies your demand for quality."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Cependant la CLP-320N peut vous offrir la productivit\u00e9 de plusieurs imprimantes gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son port Ethernet et sa r\u00e9solution 2400 x 600 dpi. Ajoutez \u00e0 cela le bouton d\u2019impression d\u2019\u00e9cran qui vous permet d'imprimer rapidement ce qui se trouve sur votre \u00e9cran et vous obtenez le compagnon bureautique id\u00e9al!\\n<br \/>\\n<b>Restez connect\u00e9 avec vos coll\u00e8gues!<\/b>\\n<br \/>\\nGr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son port Ethernet embarqu\u00e9, la CLP-320N vous permet de connecter jusqu'\u00e0 4 utilisateurs sur la m\u00eame imprimante. \\n<br \/>\\n<b>Un design unique pour une compacit\u00e9 hors norme<\/b>\\n<br \/>\\nLa CLP-320N est une imprimante laser remarquable par sa compacit\u00e9! Avec des dimensions de r\u00eave, 388 x 313 x 243 mm, vous pouvez la poser o\u00f9 bon vous semble sur votre bureau. Sans oublier la touche d\u2019impression directe de l\u2019\u00e9cran et le bouton marche-arr\u00eat install\u00e9s en fa\u00e7ade pour un acc\u00e8s facile et rapide. Ajoutez \u00e0 cela un design noir et gris laqu\u00e9 et vous r\u00e9volutionnez votre espace de travail. \\n<br \/>\\n<b>Capturez et imprimez ce que vous voyez!<\/b>\\n<br \/>\\nLe logiciel AnyWeb Print de SAMSUNG vous permet de s\u00e9lectionner et de glisser-d\u00e9poser des contenus issus de diff\u00e9rentes pages Web ou autre pour les placer dans un nouveau document vierge, sans devoir les redimensionner ou les \u00e9diter de quelque mani\u00e8re que ce soit. AnyWeb Print est un moyen facile de rassembler des informations. Vous pouvez ensuite sauver les documents que vous avez cr\u00e9\u00e9s en format tiff ou pdf. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement imprimer ces documents \u00e0 l'aide de la touche impression capture d'\u00e9cran ou du menu d'impression habituel. \\n<br \/>\\n<b>Transcendez vos impressions en couleur<\/b>\\n<br \/>\\nL\u2019imprimante CLP-320N poss\u00e8de une r\u00e9solution d'impression de 2400 x 600 dpi sublimant ainsi vos travaux couleur. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son savoir faire en mati\u00e8re d'impression, Samsung a \u00e9galement fabriqu\u00e9 de nouveaux toners am\u00e9liorant la qualit\u00e9 de vos sorties couleur. \\n<br \/>\\n<b>Silence, vous travaillez!<\/b>\\n<br \/>\\nEn plus de sa petite taille, la s\u00e9rie CLP-320 est silencieuse. Moins de 50 d\u00e9cibels (ce qui \u00e9quivaut \u00e0 un niveau sonore inf\u00e9rieur \u00e0 une conversation entre deux personnes). Vous pouvez ainsi imprimer discr\u00e8tement sans perturber votre environnement."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-07-11T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"deaad70b-4ee9-469b-8fc2-f9a5f207f3fe","identifier":"14756969","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","trust","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust Tubiq Full HD Video Webcam"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Full HD-Videoqualit\u00e4t mit 1080p. Autofokus f\u00fcr scharfe Bilder. Fotos mit bis zu 12 Megapixel. Integriertes Mikrofon. Kompatibel mit Live Messenger und Skype."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Full HD 1080p video quality. Automatic focus for sharp image. Up to 12 megapixels photos. Built-in microphone. Live Messenger and Skype compatible."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Qualit\u00e9 vid\u00e9o Full HD 1080p. Mise au point automatique pour des images nettes. Photos jusqu'\u00e0 12\u00a0m\u00e9gapixels. Microphone int\u00e9gr\u00e9. Compatible avec Live Messenger et Skype."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-07-14T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"01eff063-244b-4a41-81a7-e0119a406a46","identifier":"14779461","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["ion","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ION Slide 2 PC\/Mac"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Bring your old pictures back to life!<\/b>\\n\\nSLIDES 2 PC makes it easy and fun to rediscover your 35mm film negatives and slides on your computer. Incredibly fast, one-touch scanning and a single-cable connection make SLIDES 2 PC perfect for archiving your memories, your family's memories and your friends' memories!\\n\\nIf you're like one of the millions of people who have boxes of slide carousels in the attic or a stack of those little yellow boxes in the kitchen, SLIDES 2 PC is perfect for you! Don't know what happened to your projector? Don't know where to buy a replacement bulb for your projector? SLIDES 2 PC eliminates the hassle and brings those memories of family dinners, graduations, vacations, and joyous occasions back into your life.\\n\\nJust install the included software on your computer, connect SLIDES 2 PC using the attached cable, and load up to 20 slides into the included Rapid Slide Feeder for quick, hassle-free scanning; you'll be reliving all of your treasured memories in no time! A blue light even indicates when SLIDES 2 PC is correctly connected to your computer and ready to scan.\\n\\nSLIDES 2 PC is a high-resolution scanner with a high-quality optic element. This outstanding attention to quality ensures that you can capture all of the color and detail in each one of your slides or negatives. Fixed-focus range, automatic exposure and color balance guarantee that your memories are captured optimally with accurate color conversion and perfect imaging.\\n\\nDon't let your memories collect dust or turn yellow one day longer! Enjoy them every day and share them with SLIDES 2 PC."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-07-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"574673ec-4240-4976-8b4d-621ce8bcaebc","identifier":"14779880","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung YP-W1AL MP3 player & recorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Gear up your music and go!\\n\\nReady for a workout with your tunes but loaded down by your smartphone? Grab your YP - W1 and go! This MP3 player is perfectly designed for Samsung GALAXY S III. Quick music transfers direct from GALAXY S III via easy Phone Connector. Convenient Built-in Clip - just clip and run. Check battery status instantly through LED power indicator. Random Play and SoundAlive Bass Mode boost your mobile music experience to the max."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-07-20T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eede4a5e-c472-42f7-ae60-7dcdfbc51ee4","identifier":"14802402","enabled":true,"family":"digital_cameras","categories":["cameras_sales","digital_cameras","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"camera_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"compact"}],"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung DV DV90"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"16000000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung DV90, DV. Megapixel: 16.1, Camera type: Compact, Optical sensor size: 1\/2.3. Focal length range (f-f): 0.47 - 2.35, Minimum focal length (35mm film equiv): 2.6, Minimum aperture: 3.3. Focus: TTL, Focus adjustment: Auto, Auto focusing (AF) modes: Centre weighted Auto Focus, Face detection, Multi Point Auto Focus, Tracking Auto Focus. ISO sensitivity: 80, 100, 200, 400, 800, 1600, 3200, Auto, Light exposure modes: Auto, Light exposure control: Program AE. Camera shutter speed (max): 0.0005, Camera shutter type: Electronic"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-07-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"auto_exposure":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_lock":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"auto_focus_assist_beam":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}],"weight":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":{"amount":"533.0000","unit":"GRAM"}}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":5}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d259bd2b-dc74-4548-9533-19f8a6a6c9b7","identifier":"14843557","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLP-365W"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Bring photos on mobile devices to life with a Samsung Colour Laser Printer. You can print wirelessly in just three steps. It\u2019s all delivered in amazing colour thanks to Samsung\u2019s Rendering Engine for Clean Page (ReCP) and our new polymerised toner. Your new printer will also help to keep your surroundings attractive, too. Its compact ergonomic design means it takes up minimal space.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy brighter colour output the simpler way<\/b>\\nEnjoy the freedom of printing from anywhere in your home or office in the highest quality, without sacrificing your precious space.\\n\\n<b>Easy Mobile Printing<\/b>\\nPrint from all your mobile devices in colour easily, quickly and conveniently without the need for installing any print drivers.\\n\\n<b>Brilliant colour quality for your documents<\/b>\\nText, graphs or images - the CLP-365W helps you print anything in brilliant quality that meets even the highest expectations.Its 600x600 dpi can be enhanced to an impressive 2,400x600 dpi by varying the dots size and the position of the dot itself. This means you can print more detail and have smoother and sharper images.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy quality printouts<\/b>\\nSamsung\u2019s unique ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Page) Technology improves the overall quality and vibrancy of your colour printing, ensuring every printout looks perfect. It automatically sharpens the focus of both graphics and text, while solid objects are overlapped to eliminate white gaps.\\n\\n<b>Polymerized toner<\/b>\\nOur newly developed polymerized toner has smaller and more uniform particles than conventional toner. Meaning, your printouts will have crisper lines and more vivid colours - helping avoid any paper curling. Also, its higher wax content improves the image gloss and enhances the durability preventing unwanted fading.\\n\\n<b>Ergonomic design<\/b>\\nDon't worry about this printer crowding your space.\\nIts beautiful and compact design makes it a pleasure to share a desk with.\\n\\n<b>Easy to use<\/b>\\nDesigned for simple and intuitive operation the CLP-365W saves you precious time and effort.\\n\\n<b>Easy Colour Manager<\/b>\\nCreate and use your own colour profiles with Samsung's Easy Colour Manager. Match the exact colours of a company logo or simply give your print outs the individual look you want.\\n\\n<b>Easy Solution support<\/b>\\nThe printer also brings you software support designed to put you in control of delivering ultimate quality printouts easier than ever before."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-07-29T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3c232492-9fa9-4c2f-8dce-f7face4c898f","identifier":"14855188","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet 9050n"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die HP LaserJet 9050 Serie bietet Hochleistungs-Schwarzwei\u00dfdruck f\u00fcr hohe Auflagen bis zu DIN A3 in Verbindung mit vielseitigen Funktionen f\u00fcr die Papierzuf\u00fchrung*. Die verf\u00fcgbaren Optionen, d.h. Ausgabefach mit 8 F\u00e4chern, Ausgabefach mit Hefteinrichtung, Multifunktions-Finisher und leistungsstarke L\u00f6sungen f\u00fcr professionelle Ausdrucke, erm\u00f6glichen eine effiziente Bearbeitung beliebiger Druckauftr\u00e4ge. Diese Drucker bieten schnelle und zuverl\u00e4ssige Ausdrucke mit bis zu 50 S.\/Min. in Verbindung mit einem optimierten Prozessor, HP Jetdirect Embedded Printserver und HP Smart Drucktechnologie**."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The HP LaserJet 9050 series features high-performance, high-volume, black-and-white printing up to A3 with versatile paper-handling features*. Available options, including an 8-bin mailbox, stapler\/stacker, multifunction finisher and powerful business printing solutions, enable you to manage your printing workflows more efficiently than ever. It offers fast and reliable printing at up to 50 ppm, with an optimised processor, HP Jetdirect embedded print server and HP Smart Printing technology**.\\n\\nABU - United Kingdom - UK English localization"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"\\n\\nABU - United Kingdom - UK English localization"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-08-02T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3bd6d48d-1750-47d7-8a87-f62c1b72336f","identifier":"14857243","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["print_scan_sales","scanners","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox DOCUMATE 4799 - VRS BASIC"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Xerox DOCUMATE 4799 - VRS BASIC. Packaging width: 474.97, Packaging height: 330.19"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-08-02T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c3097f5d-bc99-4dd3-b38e-d6dc26635c0a","identifier":"14942144","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision IS15"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Einfach ein Foto oder Visitenkarte einlegen und augenblicklich beginnt der IS15 damit das Bild auf eine Speicherkarte oder USB-Flash Disk abzulegen. Einfach das Netzteil anschliessen, Speicherkarte oder Stick einstecken und losscannen. Sie ben\u00f6tigen keinen PC!\\n\\nDer IS15 ist damit die ideale Erg\u00e4nzung zu einem digitalen Bilderrahmen ohne den Umweg PC seine Bilder,Visitenkarten oder Dokumente bis 4x6\" schnell zu archivieren.\\nDie geringen Ma\u00dfe von 18.3 x 7.3 x 4.3 (cm) und das geringe Gewicht von nur 300 gr. , machen den Avision IS15 zum perfekten Begleiter f\u00fcr unterwegs um ihn dort zu nutzen wo er gerade ben\u00f6tigt wird\\n\\nDer IS15, ist ein kleiner, leichter standalone Scanner, der ohne Computer betrieben werden kann. Fotos oder Dokumente k\u00f6nnen einfach auf einen USB Stick oder eine Memory Karte (SD\/SDHC) gescannt werden. Die Scans werden automatisch gerade ger\u00fcckt, beschnitten und entzerrt und sind so direkt f\u00fcr die weitere Verarbeitung bereit.\\n\\n<b>Kompakte Gr\u00f6\u00dfe<\/b>\\nDer IS15 ist mit nur 172mm x 70mm x 40.5mm ein kleiner, kompakter Scanner der nicht Gr\u00f6\u00dfer ist als ein Hand und somit in jede Tasche passt. Und mit nur 200g Gewicht l\u00e4\u00dft er sich \u00fcberall mit hin nehmen.\\n\\n<b>Kleiner ganz Gro\u00df<\/b>\\nDer IS15 hat eine Aufl\u00f6sung von 300dpi mit einem automatischen Dokumenteneinzug Mechanimus. Er kann Photos, Visitenkarten, Rezepte oder kleine Notizen bis zu einer Gr\u00f6\u00dfe von 10x15 cm scannen. Ein Farbfoto in der Gr\u00f6\u00dfe 10x15 cm scannt er mit 300dpi in weniger als 10 Sek.\\n\\n<b>Integrierter Bildprozessor<\/b>\\nDer eingebaute Bild Prozessor bietet eine automatische Entzerrung und \"Auto-Crop\", d.h. automatische Beschneidung, so da\u00df die Fotos als JPG direkt weiter verarbeitet werden k\u00f6nnen. Beste Resultate zu jeder Zeit!!\\n\\n<b>Tragbarer Speicher<\/b>\\nSie k\u00f6nnen w\u00e4hlen:'Entwerder Sie speichern Ihr Fotos auf einen USB flash Laufwerk oder einer Memory Karte (SD\/SDHC); Der IS15 l\u00e4\u00dft Ihnen die Wahl auf welchem Medium Sie Ihre Fotos speichern m\u00f6chten.\\n\\n<b>Softwarepaket<\/b>\\nDie \"Scan-to-PC\" ( Direkt zum Computer scannen) Software ist ein ganz einfache Anwendung, mit welcher die gescannten Fotos oder Dokumente an jeden beliebigen Speicherort abgelegt werden k\u00f6nnen. Der Anwender kann w\u00e4hlen, ob er auf die Festplatte oder die Speicherkarte scannen m\u00f6chte. Wenn die \"automatische Drehung\" Funktion gew\u00e4hlt ist, werden die Scans entgegen dem Uhrzeigersinn im 90\u00b0 Schritten gedreht - dies ist besonders bei horizontal ausgerichteten Fotos oder Textdokumeten sinnvoll."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Insert your photo or business card and start a scan instantly with Avision's palm-sized scanner, the IS15.\\nSimply plug a power cable and a memory card or a USB flash drive, the Avision IS15 allows you to digitize your photo or business card without the need to install the scanner driver or connecting it to a computer. The image is automatically saved into a memory card or a removable flash drive with a predefined image mode and resolution.\\n\\nMeasuring only 18.3 x 7.3 x 4.3 (cm) and weighing a mere 300 grams, the Avision's palm-sized scanner is small enough to pack easily with your laptop and light enough to carry with you to anywhere you need to go.\\n\\nAvision is pleased to bring you the IS15, a small, feather light standalone scanner that can operate without a PC. Scan photos and save the images with ease to a USB flash drive or a memory card (SD\/SDHC) by simply plugging your choice of storage into the device. You will be delighted to find the scanned images appropriately cropped, deskewed and ready for use straight from the IS15.\\n\\n<b>Compact in size<\/b>\\nThe IS15 measures only 172mm x 70mm x 40.5mm, a compact design that is no bigger than your hand and fits easily in your palm. Weighing a mere 200g, you will forget it was ever in your briefcase.\\n\\n<b>Big on specs<\/b>\\nThe IS15 has a resolution of 300dpi with an automatic document feeding mechanism. It can handle photos, business cards, receipts, or small memos and notes up to 4 x 6 in size. It's fast, too, with a 4 x 6 photo scanned in color mode at 300dpi completed in less than 10 seconds.\\n\\n<b>Built-in image processing<\/b>\\nFeaturing advanced deskew and auto-crop functions built into the IS15, scanned images are processed by the hardware automatically and saved as JPG, giving you ideal results every time.\\n\\n<b>Portable storage<\/b>\\nWhether it's a USB flash drive or a memory card (SD\/SDHC), the IS15 gives you the convenience and freedom to choose which media to store your scanned images in.\\n\\n<b>Bundled software<\/b>\\nScan to PC software is a lightweight utility that allows the IS15 to scan and save to any specified destination on the computer. Users can choose whether to scan to the computer or the memory card, and select the directory for storing scanned images. The\u201cAuto Rotate Images\u201doption rotates the image counterclockwise 90 degrees when selected, useful when scanning landscape oriented photos or documents."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4847755d-4513-4db4-bb8e-01edbc77b21a","identifier":"14962869","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","gear4","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"GEAR4 Classic Red Bird"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Link multiple speakers via 3.5mm cable\\n- iPod, iPhone, iPad compatible\\n- Android Compatible\\n- Expandable bass port\\n- Up to 8Hrs playback"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-08-11T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6b8582af-ea78-4812-9cd4-23cc029132b8","identifier":"1508518","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","conceptronic","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_960"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Conceptronic Lounge\u2019n\u2019LOOK Flexcam 2.0 megapixel"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1.3"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die Webcam mit einer realen Aufl\u00f6sung von 2.0 Megapixeln liefert Bilder in Topqualit\u00e4t und ist ideal f\u00fcr die Aufnahme von Video mit hoher Aufl\u00f6sung und Schnappsch\u00fcssen mit bis zu 8.0 Megapixeln (interpoliert)! Die Webcam hat spezielle Funktionen wie die automatische Gesichtsverfolgung (eine Technologie, die Ihr Gesicht automatisch in der Mitte des Videobildes beh\u00e4lt) und Fotorahmen (eine Funktion, mit der Sie f\u00fcr Ihre Schnappsch\u00fcsse eigene Fotorahmen kreieren k\u00f6nnen)! Au\u00dferdem ist diese Webcam voll kompatibel mit allen Instant Messenger-Anwendungen und verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber ein integriertes Mikrofon. Dank dem einzigartigen Fu\u00df der Webcam k\u00f6nnen Sie sie an Ihrem LCD-Bildschirm befestigen oder auf Ihren Schreibtisch stellen.\\n- kompatibel mit allen Messenger- und Chat-Anwendungen\\n- mit Schnappschuss-Taste f\u00fcr Fotos und Fotorahmen-Software"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"With the Conceptronic FlexCam  you can chat, videoconference, communicate and share special moments with anyone through the Internet! This high quality 2 megapixel webcam brings you just one step away from friends, family or business. The FlexCam has a built in microphone and is compatible with all messenger & chat applications. Thanks to the unique foot, you can use it both hanging on your LCD screen as well as standing on your desk."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec la webcam FlexCam de Conceptronic, vous pouvez chatter, r\u00e9aliser des vid\u00e9oconf\u00e9rences, et partager des moments exceptionnels avec qui vous voulez sur Internet ! Avec cette webcam de tr\u00e8s grande qualit\u00e9 de 2 megapixels vous n\u2019\u00eates plus qu\u2019\u00e0 un clic de vos amis, votre famille ou de vos relations professionnelles. La webcam FlexCam est \u00e9quip\u00e9e d\u2019un micro int\u00e9gr\u00e9 et est compatible avec toutes les applications de messagerie et de chat. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son pied exclusif, vous pouvez l\u2019utiliser accroch\u00e9e \u00e0 votre \u00e9cran LCD ou bien pos\u00e9e sur votre bureau.\\n- Compatible avec toutes les applications de Messenger et chat\\n- Avec touche de capture d'image pour les logiciels de photos et de cadres de photos"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-03-20T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5c4332d6-b73e-41f2-bf36-f3fc83d16e23","identifier":"151111","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","oki","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"OKI C9300n"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Until now, color added high cost as well as impact to your documents. OKI\u00ae C9300 Digital Color printers can lower your expenses and increase your productivity.\\n\\nThese wide-format color printers are the efficient and affordable answer, especially if presentations, ad layouts, spreadsheets, large photos and illustrations, signs, posters or banners are part of your business.\\nNo more running down to the corporate or neighborhood copy center every time you need ledger-size color documents\u2014or postcard-size or any size up to 12.9\" by 47.24\" banners! You can simply print them in-house. OKI C9300 printers are available with MonacoEZmatch\u2122 color matching software1 to ensure accurate and consistent color whenever it\u2019s required.\\n\\nOKI Single Pass Color\u2122 Digital technology and long-lasting, individually replaceable OKI toner cartridges and image drums mean fewer interventions\u2014i.e. more productivity\u2014and a lower cost per printed page than color laser printers, solid ink or inkjet printers and, especially, outside copy services.\\n\\nFurther, the cost of a black-and-white page is comparable to that of most mono laser printers\u2014so you can use OKI C9300 color printers for all your business printing."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8728fd05-da26-42b6-9891-87f774758480","identifier":"1513306","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["kodak","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kodak i780"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"100-240 V"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Weil unternehmenskritische Arbeitsvolumen nach wirklich hoher Geschwindigkeit verlangen<\/b>\\nSchon auf dem Papier \u00fcbertrifft der KODAK i780 Scanner mit einer Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 130 Seiten pro Minute die Konkurrenz. Im Gegensatz zu Konkurrenzprodukten schafft er diese Maximalgeschwindigkeit jedoch auch unter wirklichen Bedingungen. Sie erhalten echte 130 Seiten\/Minute, sogar:\\n- bei bis zu 300 dpi Aufl\u00f6sung\\n- in Farbe, Graustufen oder Schwarzwei\u00df\\n- im Dual-Stream-Modus (bei Ausgabe von bis zu vier Bildern pro Scanvorgang)\\n- wenn alle Bildverarbeitungsfunktionen aktiviert sind\\nDurch diese hohe Leistung im praktischen Einsatz ist der KODAK i780 Scanner das Ger\u00e4t der Wahl f\u00fcr die unternehmenskritische, hochvolumige Formularverarbeitung in vielen Anwendungsbereichen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- No presorting needed\u2014with the automatic orientation feature, document content is analyzed on the fly and your images are automatically displayed in the correct reading orientation.\\n- Exclusive Perfect Page imaging delivers exceptional image quality, with readability equal to or better than the original document.\\n- Auto color detection for threshold-based automatic color scanning.\\n- Electronic color dropout allows the scanner to eliminate the form color, capturing only the information you need.\\n- Auto cropping, so you capture only the actual document\u2014and deskew, to automatically straighten every image.\\n- Five output options meet virtually any imaging requirement\u2014black-and-white, color or grayscale, plus two dual stream options: color and black-and-white, or grayscale and black-and- white."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-03-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6d4433ea-2029-4434-a947-e43bb7172411","identifier":"15406133","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","spcinternet"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"SPCinternet Classic 831 4GB"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"SPCinternet Classic 831 4GB. Player media type: flash-media, Compatible memory cards: SD. Display: LCD, Display diagonal: 1.8, Display resolution: 160 x 128. Audio formats supported: APE, FLAC, MP3, OGG, WMA, Video formats supported: AVI, Image formats supported: BMP, GIF, JPG. Headphone connectivity: 3.5 mm. Equalizer modes: Classic, Jazz, Pop, Rock"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-08-20T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"130b8bcf-f01c-46e5-970b-219b3ea4e917","identifier":"15412898","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung CLP-415N"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Print quickly and vividly with a Samsung CLP-415 Colour Laser Printer. Thanks to Samsung\u2019s ReCP technology and new polymerised toner, your printouts will be crisper, more vibrant and more vivid than ever before. And, with print speeds of up to 18 pages a minute, you won\u2019t have to wait to see the results. It\u2019s even easier to use, thanks to intuitive controls and support software.\\n\\n<b>Make sharp images and text even sharper<\/b>\\nBoost the overall quality and vividness of your output with our unique ReCP (Rendering Engine for Clean Pages). It automatically adds dots along the edges of images and characters, meaning everything looks so much sharper and cleaner. What\u2019s more, those white gaps between coloured areas that are so common with other devices are eliminated. What you and your team are left with is an outstanding colour output.\\n\\n<b>Make colours more vibrant<\/b>\\nPolymerized toner is one of our most innovative breakthroughs of recent years. Its revolutionary particles are smaller and more uniform, giving lines extra definition, tones more graduation and colour more impact. Its higher wax content not only improves the image gloss, but also enhances the durability preventing unwanted fading. And as the polymer toner can be applied in a thinner layer with lower fusing temperatures it reduces the paper curl and energy consumption as well.\\n\\n<b>More power, better productivity<\/b>\\nWith the power of two cores the device can process your work files simultaneously and therefore with higher speeds. The 256MB memory ensures even heavy printing documents are spooled faster and you don\u2019t have to wait long for your print outs. What all this means for you is simple: the CLP-415NW is perfect when there\u2019s a lot to print and a tight deadline to meet.\\n\\n<b>An easier user experience for you<\/b>\\nLet\u2019s face it; your time is too precious to waste standing around a printer for hours on end. So from operation to support software tools, you\u2019re in total control with this easy to use small workgroup printer.\\n\\n<b>Easy Eco Driver<\/b>\\nEasy Eco Driver helps you compile digital documents in multiple formats and makes it easy to share them with others - even through social networks.\\n\\n<b>Your reliable business partner<\/b>\\nThanks to the latest technology and high quality components, you\u2019ll find the CLP-415NW is as dependable as they come, even during the toughest print jobs.\\n\\n<b>Cost effective printing with every job<\/b>\\nBe in control of your printing cost during the printer's entire time of operation. Low costs per page that keep your running costs low for the time you do business."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-08-23T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"014783b5-5e72-4d01-845b-b45cfb1a1453","identifier":"1541463","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony NWZ-A826 Champagne"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Walkman\u00ae mit umfangreichsten Funktionen und gr\u00f6\u00dfter Benutzerfreundlichkeit! Ultra-kompakte Musik- und Video-Player mit 4 GB und hochwertigem 2,4\"-LC-Display, integriertem Bluetooth\u00ae, herausragender Audiowiedergabe, Drag & Drop-Daten\u00fcbertragung und unglaublicher Akkubetriebsdauer von bis zu 36 Std."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony NWZ-A826 Champagne. Player media type: flash-media. Display: LCD, Display diagonal: 2.4, Display resolution: 240 x 320. Audio formats supported: AAC, MP3, WMA, Video formats supported: MPEG4. Depth: 9.3, Height: 93.6, Width: 50.2. Bundled software: Windows Media Player 11"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-03-23T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9ef13758-f3d7-45c7-afe6-d4714c58f1fe","identifier":"154308","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","oki","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a3_297_x_420_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"OKI C9500 hdn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"High-quality, tabloid-plus (12\" x 18\") color and monochrome output\u2014right in your workspace.\\nUntil now, color added high cost as well as impact to your documents. OKI\u00ae C9500 Digital Color printers can lower your expenses and increase your productivity.\\nThese wide-format color printers are the efficient and affordable answer, especially if presentations, ad layouts, spreadsheets, large photos and illustrations, signs, posters or banners are part of your business.\\nCommercial printshop performance at desktop printer prices.\\nNo more running down to the corporate or neighborhood copy center every time you need ledger-size color documents\u2014or postcard-size or any size up to 12.9\" by 47.24\" banners! You can simply print them in-house. OKI C9500 printers are available with MonacoEZmatch\u2122 color matching software1 to ensure accurate and consistent color whenever it\u2019s required.\\nOKI Single Pass Color\u2122 Digital technology and long-lasting, individually replaceable OKI toner cartridges and image drums mean fewer interventions\u2014i.e. more productivity\u2014and a lower cost per printed page than color laser printers, solid ink or inkjet printers and, especially, outside copy services.\\nFurther, the cost of a black-and-white page is comparable to that of most mono laser printers\u2014so you can use OKI C9500 color printers for all your business printing.\\nConnectivity and more.\\nOKI C9500 printers come with both bi-directional parallel and USB interfaces, and can be connected to the network\u2014PC- or Mac\u00ae -based\u2014via an OkiLAN\u00ae 6200e+ 10\/100 Base-T internal print server card.2\\nWhen it comes to handling huge graphic files, all models come with generous standard RAM and are upgradable to a whopping 1 GB.\\nAll C9500 models are equipped with job accounting software that provides a precise count of color and mono pages, the types and quantities of paper used, and a record of printing activity by department.\\nSo go on, get as creative as you like\u2014and expect the superlative capabilities of OKI C9500 Series Digital Color printers to make you look great on paper."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2005-08-05T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f3be59a5-7015-4b4a-8a82-36e31001a0a7","identifier":"15433433","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","devolo","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Devolo dLAN LiveCam"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit der dLAN\u00ae LiveCam ist das Zuhause immer im Blick. Ob Haus, Kinder oder Tiere \u2013 die LiveCam liefert die Bilder. Selbst im Urlaub oder am Arbeitsplatz: Durch die direkte Internetverbindung und die App f\u00fcr Apple iPhone\/iPad und Android-Ger\u00e4te ist eine individuelle \u00dcberwachung weltweit m\u00f6glich. Dabei ist die dLAN\u00ae LiveCam im Handumdrehen eingerichtet: Durch devolos dLAN\u00ae-Powerline-Technik ist nur ein Stromkabel zum Anschluss notwendig \u2013 so kann die LiveCam flexibel in der N\u00e4he von jeder Steckdose im Haus verwendet werden und zieht auf Wunsch einfach um! Die sichere Video\u00fcbertragung erfolgt \u00fcber die Stromleitung."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The dLAN\u00ae LiveCam gives you an eye on your home at all times. Ensuring the safety of your house, children or pets \u2013 the LiveCam provides the images to you. Even while on holiday or at work: the direct Internet connection and app for Apple iPhone\/iPad and Android devices makes individual monitoring possible anywhere in the world. You can set up the dLAN\u00ae LiveCam in no time: with devolo's dLAN\u00ae Powerline technology, all you need for connection is a power cable \u2013 the flexible LiveCam can be used close to any power outlet in the home and simply moved to another one if desired. Video is transmitted securely via the power line."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b4fa2db5-0c7b-46de-9526-81142d59b93d","identifier":"15444647","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox Phaser 6600DN"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"With the value-packed Phaser 6600 Colour Printer, today\u2019s small workteams can easily make important business communications stand out from the competition with exceptional colour printing.\\n\\n- A print resolution of up to 600 x 600 x 4 dpi (1200 x 1200 enhanced image quality) makes your printed communications stand out and grab attention.\\n- Photo Mode makes your images and graphics look exceptional, producing deeper, richer colours for lifelike vibrancy.\\n- Unique Xerox EA Toner fuses at a much lower temperature, and reduces power consumption by up to 20% and C02 emissions by up to 35%, compared to conventional toner. It\u2019s also oil-free, delivering brilliant, glossy output, even on ordinary or recycled paper.\\n- Pantone\u00ae Colour calibrated solid-colour simulations and Xerox colour correction technology ensure results that match your expectations.\\n- True Adobe\u00ae PostScript\u00ae 3\u2122 ensures your print jobs are consistently accurate, with the brightest, truest colours and superior graphics.\\n\\n- A fast print speed of up to 36 ppm means your documents are always ready when you need them.\\n- Automatic duplex printing on the Phaser 6600DN configuration makes saving paper easy, and gives your documents a professional appearance.\\n- Print directly from Apple iOS-based devices with support for Apple AirPrint. (Requires firmware level 201301301313.)\\n- The main 550-sheet paper tray holds a full ream of paper. An optional 2nd tray increases total capacity up to 1,250 sheets for even longer periods of uninterrupted productivity.\\n- Keep your sensitive documents away from unintended recipients with available secure print*. *Requires Productivity Kit (with 512 MB RAM) or Productivity Kit (with 160 GB Hard Drive).\\n- A monthly duty cycle of up to 80,000 prints means heavy duty production.\\n\\nThe Phaser 6600 is simple to install on your office network, getting you up and running in minutes. And with Xerox\u00ae CentreWare\u00ae IS, remote device administration is handled with ease right from any networked computer\u2019s browser.\\n\\nPlace the Phaser 6600 anywhere in the office with optional Wi-Fi."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-03T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"76ca9342-3fb8-486a-8951-e448f6a949b0","identifier":"15512776","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","microsoft","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1920_x_1080"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Microsoft LifeCam Studio"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Microsoft LifeCam Studio. Maximum video resolution: 1920 x 1080, Supported video modes: 1080p, 720p. Maximum image resolution: 2560 x 2048. Sensor type: CMOS. Focus adjustment: Auto. Interface: USB 2.0, Colour of product: Black, Silver, Mounting type: Clip\/Stand"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c345552f-7a24-42e8-8c16-3a80b13039fc","identifier":"15524283","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","microsoft","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1920_x_1080"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Microsoft LifeCam Studio"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>The Closest to Being There<\/b>\\nEnjoy a superior HD video quality with the LifeCam Studio, which includes a 1080p HD sensor. But great video is about more than HD. Keep your subject crisp with autofocus, from four inches to infinity. Shoot with great accuracy in wide angle with the LifeCam precision glass element lens. And, to make filming even easier, LifeCam features TrueColor Technology, which means your video remains bright and colorful in virtually all light conditions while ClearFrame Technology provides smooth and detailed footage. Use the built-in High-Fidelity Microphone to bring it all together: the vivid sights, colors, and sounds of real life.\\n\\n<b>1080p HD Sensor<\/b>\\nFor superior sharpness and image quality.\\n\\n<b>720p HD video chat<\/b>\\nFor a true HD-quality experience.\\n\\n<b>High-precision glass element lens<\/b>\\nProvides sharp image quality.\\n\\n<b>TrueColor Technology with face tracking<\/b>\\nAutomatically controls exposure for bright and colorful video.\\n\\n<b>Certified for Skype<\/b>\\nDo more together in HD, with Skype certified HD LifeCams from Microsoft.\\n\\n<b>Optimized for Microsoft\u00ae Lync\u00ae<\/b>\\nDesigned to work with Lync\u00ae, Microsoft\u2019s enterprise-ready unified communications platform.\\nWideband microphone for premium sound recording\\nFor natural, detailed audio.\\n\\n<b>360-degree rotation<\/b>\\nRotates halfway in both directions for an all-around view.\\n\\n<b>Tripod mount<\/b>\\nReady to be mounted on a standard tripod. (Tripod not included.)\\n\\n<b>Auto focus<\/b>\\nFrom four inches to infinity.\\n\\n<b>Wide-angle lens<\/b>\\nCapture more people and surroundings.\\n\\n<b>Optimized for Windows 8<\/b>\\nEasy set-up, no driver installation required."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"db266535-b38b-4232-b93a-6bd146e59d38","identifier":"15524543","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","microsoft","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Microsoft JSD-00014 webcam"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"0.3"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"It\u2019s easy to share your experiences. Your family may be far away, but you can still see and hear them clearly, with this webcam\u2019s VGA video and built-in microphone."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-07T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2e2a53b8-ca41-4a13-ac56-33c9af2d0fd4","identifier":"15554829","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","lenco","mp3_players"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenco XEMIO-858"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- 2,4\" (6 CM) TFT-Touchscreen\\n- E-Book-Funktion (unterst\u00fctzt TXT-Dateien)\\n- uKW-Radio\\n- Sprachaufzeichnungsfunktion\\n- Audioformate: MP3, WMA, APE, FLAC, OGG und WAV\\n- Videoformate: RM, RMVB, FLV, 3GP, WMV und AVI\\n- Fotoformate: JPG, BMP, PNG, TIFF und GIF\\n- Spielzeit im Musikmodus ca. 8 Stunden\\n- Spielzeit im Videomodus ca. 3 Stunden\\n\\n<b>Anschlussbuchse<\/b>\\n\\n- microSD-Kartenleser fur Karten bis zu 8 GB\\n\\n<b>Inklusiv<\/b>\\n\\n- USB-Kabel\\n- Ohrh\u00f6rer\\n- Software CD"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- 2,4\" (6 CM) TFT touchscreen\\n- E-book function (supports TXT files)\\n- FM radio\\n- Voice recording function\\n- Audio formats: MP3, WMA, APE, FLAC, OGG and WAV\\n- Video formats: RM, RMVB, FLV, 3GP, WMV and AVI\\n- Photo formats: JPG, BMP, PNG, TIFF and GIF\\n- Playback time in music mode approx. 8 hours\\n- Playback time in video mode approx. 3 hours\\n\\n<b>Connections<\/b>\\n\\n- microSD card reader for cards up to 8GB\\n\\n<b>Including<\/b>\\n\\n- USB cable\\n- Earphones\\n- Software CD"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- \u00c9cran tactile TFT 2,4 pouces (6 cm)\\n- Fonction E-Book\\n- Radio FM\\n- Formats audio : MP3, WMA, APE, FLAC, OGG et WAV\\n- Formats video : RM, RMVB, FLV, 3GP, WMV et AVI\\n- Formats photos: JPG, BMP, PNG, TIFF et GIF\\n- La fonction E-book prend en charge les fichiers TXT\\n- Fonction enregistrement de voix\\n- Temps de lecture en mode vid\u00e9o environ 3 heures\\n- Temps de lecture en mode audio environ 8 heures"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-13T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"13c5bdfe-a225-4da5-bb4a-5c8d6019765e","identifier":"15554830","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","lenco","mp3_players"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenco XEMIO-858"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- 2,4\" (6 CM) TFT-Touchscreen\\n- E-Book-Funktion (unterst\u00fctzt TXT-Dateien)\\n- uKW-Radio\\n- Sprachaufzeichnungsfunktion\\n- Audioformate: MP3, WMA, APE, FLAC, OGG und WAV\\n- Videoformate: RM, RMVB, FLV, 3GP, WMV und AVI\\n- Fotoformate: JPG, BMP, PNG, TIFF und GIF\\n- Spielzeit im Musikmodus ca. 8 Stunden\\n- Spielzeit im Videomodus ca. 3 Stunden\\n\\n<b>Anschlussbuchse<\/b>\\n\\n- microSD-Kartenleser fur Karten bis zu 8 GB\\n\\n<b>Inklusiv<\/b>\\n\\n- USB-Kabel\\n- Ohrh\u00f6rer\\n- Software CD"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- 2,4\" (6 CM) TFT touchscreen\\n- E-book function (supports TXT files)\\n- FM radio\\n- Voice recording function\\n- Audio formats: MP3, WMA, APE, FLAC, OGG and WAV\\n- Video formats: RM, RMVB, FLV, 3GP, WMV and AVI\\n- Photo formats: JPG, BMP, PNG, TIFF and GIF\\n- Playback time in music mode approx. 8 hours\\n- Playback time in video mode approx. 3 hours\\n\\n<b>Connections<\/b>\\n\\n- microSD card reader for cards up to 8GB\\n\\n<b>Including<\/b>\\n\\n- USB cable\\n- Earphones\\n- Software CD"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- \u00c9cran tactile TFT 2,4 pouces (6 cm)\\n- Fonction E-Book\\n- Radio FM\\n- Formats audio : MP3, WMA, APE, FLAC, OGG et WAV\\n- Formats video : RM, RMVB, FLV, 3GP, WMV et AVI\\n- Formats photos: JPG, BMP, PNG, TIFF et GIF\\n- La fonction E-book prend en charge les fichiers TXT\\n- Fonction enregistrement de voix\\n- Temps de lecture en mode vid\u00e9o environ 3 heures\\n- Temps de lecture en mode audio environ 8 heures"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-13T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bf6de020-f30f-407d-80e9-1b29a1376fe0","identifier":"15554974","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","logitech","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech C170"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>The easy way to start video calling and send pics.<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Smoother. Sharper. Richer. Clearer.<\/b>\\nLogitech Fluid Crystal\u2122 Technology. It\u2019s what makes a Logitech webcam better. It\u2019s smoother video, sharper pictures, richer colors and clearer sound in real-world conditions.\\n\\n\\n<b>Plug and play<\/b>\\nThe simple setup will have you video calling your favorite people in no time\u2014on most major IMs.\\n\\n<b>The real you<\/b>\\nYour loved ones will see you in natural color when you talk to them, or you can take photos to share later.\\n\\n<b>Speak out<\/b>\\nYou can be heard loud and clear thanks to a built-in microphone that reduces background noise.\\n\\nWith plug-and-play setup, VGA-quality video and a built-in mic, this webcam is the easy way to start video calling and send beautiful, high-resolution photos.\\n\\n<b>Plug-and-play setup, easy to use<\/b>\\nWith simple plug-and-play setup, you\u2019ll be making video calls in no time on most major IMs.\\n\\n<b>Clear video calls<\/b>\\nWith your webcam\u2019s VGA sensor, the people you care about will see you in natural color.\\n\\n<b>5-megapixel photos<\/b>\\nYou can take beautiful, high-resolution snapshots up to 5 megapixels (software enhanced).\\n\\n<b>Built-in mic with RightSound\u2122<\/b>\\nIt gives you clear conversations without annoying background noise.\\n\\n<b>XVGA video recording<\/b>\\nRecord lively, colorful videos in XVGA (1024 x 768) resolution and share them with friends, family and the world on Facebook\u00ae, YouTube\u00ae, Twitter\u2122 or your blog.\\n\\n<b>Universal clip<\/b>\\nYou can attach your webcam securely to a laptop or LCD monitor, or sit it on a shelf or desk."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-13T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b2681226-9c12-4ae9-83fc-aac897d5433d","identifier":"15571494","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","devolo","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Devolo dLAN LiveCam"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The dLAN\u00ae LiveCam gives you an eye on your home at all times. Ensuring the safety of your house, children or pets \u2013 the LiveCam provides the images to you. Even while on holiday or at work: the direct Internet connection and app for Apple iPhone\/iPad and Android devices makes individual monitoring possible anywhere in the world. You can set up the dLAN\u00ae LiveCam in no time: with devolo's dLAN\u00ae Powerline technology, all you need for connection is a power cable \u2013 the flexible LiveCam can be used close to any power outlet in the home and simply moved to another one if desired. Video is transmitted securely via the power line."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec dLAN\u00ae LiveCam, gardez un \u0153il sur votre domicile. Maison, enfants ou animaux, la LiveCam les a toujours en images. M\u00eame en vacances ou sur votre lieu de travail : la connexion Internet directe et l'application pour Apple iPhone\/iPad et pour Android permettent la surveillance individuelle aux quatre coins de la plan\u00e8te. Et pourtant, la cam\u00e9ra dLAN\u00ae LiveCam est configur\u00e9e en un rien de temps : gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie CPL dLAN\u00ae de devolo, la connexion requiert juste un c\u00e2ble \u00e9lectrique. La LiveCam peut ainsi \u00eatre utilis\u00e9e \u00e0 proximit\u00e9 de chaque prise de courant en toute simplicit\u00e9 ! La transmission vid\u00e9o est s\u00e9curis\u00e9e via les c\u00e2bles \u00e9lectriques."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-17T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"884f335b-f659-4774-be1e-d62f852fe290","identifier":"1557248","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony ICD-UX60"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Digitaler Recorder mit direktem USB-Anschluss und integriertem Speicher mit 512 MB MP3-Stereoaufnahme, Musikwiedergabe und PC-Datenspeicherung mit einem Ger\u00e4t Einfache Daten\u00fcbertragung auf den PC per Drag & Drop ohne zus\u00e4tzliche PC-Software Kompatibel mit Windows und Macintosh\u00ae\\n- USB Direct Key (kompatibel mit Windows und Mac\u00ae) \\n- mp3-Stereoaufnahme und -wiedergabe \\n- Erweiterte Diktierfunktionen \u2013 Digitale Tonh\u00f6henregelung (Digital Pitch Control, DPC) und Sprachgesteuerte Aufzeichnung (Voice Operated Recording, VOR) \\n- Integriertes Stereomikrofon W\u00e4hlbare Mikrofonempfindlichkeit (hoch\/niedrig) \\n- Interner Lautsprecher \\n- Beleuchtetes Punktmatrix-LC-Display \\n- Keine separate Software erforderlich \\n- Hochgeschwindigkeits-USB-Daten\u00fcbertragung (Stimmaufnahmen, Musik, Bilder und Daten) \\n- Stromversorgung \u00fcber eine AAA-Batterie (mitgeliefert) Betriebsdauer von bis zu 34 Stunden \\n- 512 MB integrierter Flash-Speicher mit Aufnahmezeit von \u00fcber 144 Stunden"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"USB-direct connection digital recorder with 512MB built-in memory. mp3 stereo recording, music playback and PC data storage capability with one device. Simple Drag & Drop file transfer to PC without any PC software. Windows and Macintosh compatible.\\n- USB direct key (Windows and Mac compatible) \\n- mp3 stereo recording and playback \\n- Advanced dictation features - DPC (Digital Pitch Control) and VOR (Voice Operated Recording) \\n- Built-in stereo microphone. Selectable microphone sensitivity (High\/Low) \\n- Built-in speaker \\n- Dot-matrix LCD display with backlight \\n- No separate software needed \\n- Hi-speed USB data transfer (Voice recordings, music, images and data) \\n- 1 x AAA battery operated (supplied). Stamina of up to 34 hours. \\n- 512MB built-in flash memory to record over 144 hours"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Enregistreur num\u00e9rique avec connexion USB direct avec 512 Mo de m\u00e9moire int\u00e9gr\u00e9e. Enregistrement st\u00e9r\u00e9o de mp3, lecture de musique et stockage de donn\u00e9es en un seul appareil. Transfert des fichiers sur votre PC via un simple glisser-d\u00e9poser, sans logiciel. Compatible avec Windows et Macintosh.\\n- Cl\u00e9 USB direct (compatible avec Windows et Mac) \\n- Enregistrement et lecture st\u00e9r\u00e9o de mp3 \\n- Fonctionnalit\u00e9s de dict\u00e9e avanc\u00e9es : contr\u00f4le num\u00e9rique de la vitesse de lecture (DPC) et enregistrement \u00e0 commande vocale (VOR) \\n- Microphone st\u00e9r\u00e9o int\u00e9gr\u00e9 Sensibilit\u00e9 du microphone r\u00e9glable (\u00e9lev\u00e9e\/faible) \\n- Haut-parleur int\u00e9gr\u00e9 \\n- Ecran LCD r\u00e9tro\u00e9clair\u00e9 \u00e0 matrice de points \\n- Aucun logiciel s\u00e9par\u00e9 requis \\n- Transfert de donn\u00e9es par USB haut d\u00e9bit (messages vocaux, musique, images et donn\u00e9es) \\n- Fonctionne avec 1 pile AAA (fournie). Autonomie : jusqu'\u00e0 34 heures. \\n- 512 Mo de m\u00e9moire flash int\u00e9gr\u00e9e pour un enregistrement maximal de 144 heures"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c1118f0e-27f1-4ee3-a714-70c9ddf06799","identifier":"15587218","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet CF146A"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Erstellen Sie professionelle Farbdokumente, mit denen Sie Ihren Umsatz steigern k\u00f6nnen. Mit HP ePrint k\u00f6nnen Sie von praktisch \u00fcberall aus drucken<SUP>1<\/SUP>. \u00dcber Gesch\u00e4ftsanwendungen (Business Apps) k\u00f6nnen Sie webbasiert drucken<SUP>2<\/SUP>,<SUP>3<\/SUP>. Verwenden Sie den Drucker \u00fcberall im B\u00fcro dank integrierter drahtloser Verbindungen<SUP>3<\/SUP>,<SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Profitieren Sie von einer schnellen Einrichtung und einfachem, webbasiertem Drucken.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Mithilfe von Gesch\u00e4ftsanwendungen und dem Farb-Touchscreen mit 8,9 cm (3,5 Zoll) Diagonale lassen sich Informationen vom Internet aus aufrufen und ausdrucken<SUP>2<\/SUP>,<SUP>3<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Mit mobilen Druckm\u00f6glichkeiten halten Sie Schritt mit dem Unternehmenstempo.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Mit HP ePrint k\u00f6nnen Sie von praktisch \u00fcberall aus drucken<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erstellen Sie eindrucksvolle Marketingmaterialien in Farbe.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Erhalten Sie pr\u00e4zise Farben mit HP ImageREt 3600 und ColorSphere II Toner. Optimieren Sie die Einstellungen mit HP EasyColor.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>F\u00fcr eine geringere Umweltbelastung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technologie spart Energie, indem der Drucker bei Bedarf automatisch eingeschaltet und nach dem Druckjob wieder ausgeschaltet wird<SUP>5<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Erfordert eine Internetverbindung zum Drucker. Die Funktion ist bei allen angeschlossenen Internet- und E-mail-f\u00e4higen Ger\u00e4ten verwendbar. Erfordert die Registrierung eines HP Web Services-Kontos. Die Druckdauer kann variieren. Eine Liste der unterst\u00fctzten Dokument- und Bildtypen finden Sie unter www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. Wenn Sie Informationen \u00fcber weitere L\u00f6sungen ben\u00f6tigen, besuchen Sie uns unter www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Erfordert Wireless Access Point und Internetverbindung zum Drucker. Einige Services erfordern ggf. eine Registrierung. Die Verf\u00fcgbarkeit von Apps variiert je nach Land, Sprache und Vereinbarungen. Ausf\u00fchrliche Informationen finden Sie unter www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Funktion ist nur beim HP LaserJet Pro 200 Color M251nw verf\u00fcgbar.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> Die Leistung beim kabellosen Einsatz ist abh\u00e4ngig von den Umgebungsbedingungen und der Entfernung vom Zugangspunkt und ist w\u00e4hrend aktiven VPN-Verbindungen wom\u00f6glich eingeschr\u00e4nkt.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>5<\/SUP><i> HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Funktionen h\u00e4ngen vom Drucker und den Einstellungen ab.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Produce professional colour documents that help boost business. Use business apps to access and print from the web.Locate the printer anywhere in the office, using wireless connectivity. Print from virtually anywhere with HP ePrint.\\nProducing professional-quality color in the office, for printing from virtually anywhere, and for accessing apps to print web content without a PC.\\n\\n- Use business apps and the 3.5-inch (8.89 cm) colour touchscreen to access and print from the web.\\n- Print from virtually anywhere with HP ePrint.\\n- Set up anywhere in the office with built-in wireless networking. Share printing resources on a network.\\n- Print from a flash drive, using the easy-access USB port.\\n- Produce vivid colours with HP ImageREt 3600 and ColorSphere II toner. Optimize settings with HP EasyColor.\\n- Boost productivity with print speeds up to 14 pages per minute A4 and letter.\\n- Create impressive colour marketing materials in the office on a range of media, including HP specialty papers.\\n- Print documents affordably. Get the same black cost per page as a black-only HP LaserJet printer."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Cr\u00e9ez des documents couleur professionnels que contribueront \u00e0 dynamiser l'entreprise. Imprimez o\u00f9 que vous soyez avec HP ePrint<SUP>1<\/SUP>. Utilisez les applications professionnelles pour acc\u00e9der au Web et imprimer \u00e0 partir du Web<SUP>2<\/SUP>, <SUP>3<\/SUP>. Connectez-vous \u00e0 l'imprimante o\u00f9 que vous soyez dans le bureau, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connectivit\u00e9 sans fil<SUP>3<\/SUP>, <SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une configuration rapide et d'impression facile connect\u00e9e \u00e0 Internet.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Utilisez les applications pour l'entreprise et l'\u00e9cran tactile couleur de 8,89 cm (3,5\u00a0pouces) pour acc\u00e9der au Web et imprimer des pages Internet<SUP>2<\/SUP>, <SUP>3<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Maintenir le rythme de l'activit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'impression mobile.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Imprimez o\u00f9 que vous soyez avec HP ePrint<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Cr\u00e9ez des documents de marketing couleur \u00e0 impact \u00e9lev\u00e9.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Obtenez des couleurs exactes avec HP ImageREt 3600 et le Toner ColorSphere II toner. Optimisez les param\u00e8tres avec HP EasyColor.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez votre impact environnemental.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;R\u00e9duire la consommation d'\u00e9nergie\u00a0avec la technologie HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off qui met l'imprimante sous tension et hors tension en fonction des besoins<SUP>5<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> N\u00e9cessite une connexion Internet \u00e0 l'imprimante. Fonctionne avec tout p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique compatible Internet et messagerie \u00e9lectronique. N\u00e9cessite HP Web Services Account Registration. Dur\u00e9es d'impression variables. Pour une liste des types de documents et d'images pris en charge\u00a0: www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. Pour des solutions suppl\u00e9mentaires, reportez-vous \u00e0 la page www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> N\u00e9cessite un point d'acc\u00e8s sans fil et une connexion Internet \u00e0 l'imprimante. Les services peuvent n\u00e9cessiter une inscription. La disponibilit\u00e9 de l'application varie selon le pays, la langue et les accords. Pour plus d'informations, voir le site http:\/\/www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Fonction uniquement disponible sur les imprimantes couleur HP LaserJet Pro 200M251nw .<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i>Les performances sans fil d\u00e9pendent de l'environnement physique et de la distance par rapport au point d'acc\u00e8s. Elles peuvent \u00eatre limit\u00e9es pendant les connexions actives au r\u00e9seau priv\u00e9 virtuel.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>5<\/SUP><i> Les fonctions HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off d\u00e9pendent de l'imprimante et des param\u00e8tres.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-22T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4bc0db26-e436-49e7-a959-a6772ac47b9c","identifier":"15590912","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["kodak","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kodak PS50"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"KODAK Picture Saver Scanning System PS50\\n\\n\u2022 Scannen von bis zu 50 Fotos pro Minute\\n\u2022 Kapazit\u00e4t des Einzugs von 50 Blatt\\n\\n<b>Funktionen zur einfachen und schnellen Erstellung von herausragenden Bildern<\/b>\\n- Die symbolbasierte Navigation und intuitive Benutzeroberfl\u00e4che machen das einfache Erstellen von qualitativ hochwertigen digitalen Bildern zum Kinderspiel\\n- Integrierte Bildverarbeitung verbessert automatisch jedes gescannte Bild\\n- Das speziell entwickelte Transportverfahren behandelt jedes Foto mit ganz besonderer Sorgfalt\\n- Die Bildf\u00fchrung vermeidet Streifenbildung auf Bildern, erh\u00f6ht den Nettodurchsatz und reduziert Benutzereingriffe\\n- Scannen beider Seiten zum Erfassen von Notizen auf der R\u00fcckseite von Fotos oder von doppelseitigen Dokumenten\\n- Optionales A3- oder Legal Size-Flachbett zur Handhabung \u00fcbergro\u00dfer oder empfindlicher Fotos, Dokumente und gebundener Materialien wie Fotoalben und alte Ausdrucke\\n- Ausgabe von Bilddateien auf USB-Sticks, CD, DVD und KODAK Picture CD\\n\\n<b>Stellen Sie sich die verbesserten M\u00f6glichkeiten vor<\/b>\\nEgal, in welcher Branche Sie t\u00e4tig sind \u2013 Einzelhandel, Beerdigungsinstitut, Bibliothek oder eine andere kundenorientierte Einrichtung \u2013 die M\u00f6glichkeiten, mit Ihrem KODAK Picture Saver Scanning System profitable neue Einnahmequellen zu entwickeln und anzubieten, sind fast unbegrenzt.\\n\\n<b>Zeigen Sie Ihren Kunden auf, welche Erinnerungen es verdienen, digitalisiert zu werden<\/b>\\n- Schwarzwei\u00df- und Farbfotos\\n- Briefe, Urkunden und historische Dokumente\\n- Kinderzeichnungen, Kunstwerke, Auszeichnungen und Zeugnisse\\n- Postkarten und andere Erinnerungsst\u00fccke\\n\\n<b>Sprechen Sie ein breites Spektrum lokaler Zuh\u00f6rer an<\/b>\\n- Kulturelle Organisationen und Einrichtungen\\n- Denkmalpflege- und historisch interessierte Gruppen\\n- Menschen, die sich f\u00fcr Genealogie interessieren\\n- \u00d6ffentliche Organisationen und B\u00fcrgergruppen\\n- Personen, die Familienerinnerungen bewahren und weitergeben m\u00f6chten\\n- Vergr\u00f6\u00dfern Sie Ihre Reichweite, indem Sie auf Ihrer Webseite Werbung platzieren und die Ausf\u00fchrung per Post anbieten\\n\\n<b>Erkl\u00e4ren Sie den Kunden alle Verwendungsm\u00f6glichkeiten f\u00fcr ihre Bilder<\/b>\\n- Benutzen Sie Bilder \u2013 ob im Laden oder Online \u2013 um Produkte zu pr\u00e4sentieren, bei denen es um Fotos geht, wie Alben, Scrapbooks, Diashows, Kalender, T-Shirts, Kaffeetassen und mehr\\n- \u00dcbertragen und senden Sie Bilder an Mobiltelefone, Tablets und Laptops\\n- Drucken Sie Bilder, um Papierbilder zum Verschicken und Verschenken zu erhalten\\n- Laden Sie Bilder auf Photo Sharing-Websites hoch, versenden Sie sie \u00fcber E-Mail, oder erstellen Sie CDs oder DVDs, die Sie an Freunde und Verwandte verschicken k\u00f6nnen\\n- Erstellen Sie neue Alben, und verwenden Sie Bilder in sozialen Medien wie zum Beispiel Facebook\\n- Erzeugen Sie ein Archiv und Sicherungskopien von wertvollen Fotos und Dokumenten\\n\\n<b>Benutzerfreundliche und leistungsstarke Software<\/b>\\nDie KODAK Picture Saver Scanning Software besitzt eine \u00e4u\u00dferst intuitive, benutzerfreundliche und symbolbasierte Oberfl\u00e4che und bietet eine Vielzahl von automatischen und manuellen Funktionen f\u00fcr die Bildoptimierung. Es handelt sich um einen Fotoscanner und Dokumentenscanner in einem Ger\u00e4t, es kann also auch benutzt werden, um gesch\u00e4ftliche Dokumente zu scannen und erm\u00f6glicht es Ihnen damit, mehr mit den erfassten Informationen anzufangen.\\n\\n- Die KODAK PERFECT TOUCH Technologie liefert automatisch weniger dunkle Schatten, leuchtendere Farben und mehr Detailwiedergabe bei Foto-Scans\\n- Die integrierte Bildverarbeitung verbessert Farbe, Helligkeit und Kontrast, entfernt rote Augen und kann Bilder automatisch drehen und ausrichten\\n- Die Smart Touch-Funktion erm\u00f6glicht Ihnen das Zuweisen von Tastenverkn\u00fcpfungen f\u00fcr g\u00e4ngige Aufgaben. Dies spart Zeit und vereinfacht die Bedienung\\n- \u00c4ndern von Einstellungen w\u00e4hrend der Auftragsausf\u00fchrung \u2013 bietet mehr Kontrolle \u00fcber das Scannen von Unterlagen und verbessert den Workflow\\n\\n<b>Optimieren Sie die digitale Umwandlung ganzer Fotoalben<\/b>\\nDie KODAK Photo Selector-Zubeh\u00f6roption erlaubt es Benutzern, einzelne Bilder aus einem zusammengesetzten Bild (z. B. einer Fotoalbum-Seite mit mehreren Bildern) zu extrahieren und jedes Bild nach dem Scannen als separate Datei abzuspeichern. So werden empfindliche Albumseiten gesch\u00fctzt, und es ist nicht n\u00f6tig, Sch\u00e4den bei Fotos zu riskieren, indem man ein ganzes Album auseinander nimmt, Bilder herausnimmt, die sich vielleicht seit Jahren an ihrem Platz befinden, oder sogar die Schutzfolie abzieht. Die Photo Selector-Zubeh\u00f6roption setzt den Kauf eines Kodak Legal Size-Zusatzflachbetts oder eines Kodak A3-Zusatzflachbetts voraus, die zu sehr erschwinglichen Kosten verf\u00fcgbar sind."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>KODAK Picture Saver Scanning System PS50<\/b>\\n- Scan up to 50 photos per minute\\n- Feeder capacity of 50 sheets\\n\\n<b>Features delivering great images with ease and speed<\/b>\\n- Icon-based navigation and intuitive interface makes it a snap to easily create high-quality digital images\\n- Built-in image processing automatically improves each item scanned\\n- Specially designed transport treats each photo with extra-gentle care\\n- Image guide virtually eliminates streaking on images, enhancing net throughput and reducing operator intervention\\n- Both sides scanned to capture notes on back of photos or two-sided documents\\n- Optional A3- and legal-size flatbeds available to handle oversize or extremely fragile photos, documents and bound materials such as photo albums and old prints\\n- Output image files to USB drive, CD, DVD, and KODAK Picture CD\\n\\n<b>Picture all the greater possibilities<\/b>\\nNo matter your business or service \u2013 retail, funeral home, library, or other customer-centric facility \u2013 the possibilities are almost endless for ways you can promote and develop a valuable new revenue stream with your KODAK Picture Saver Scanning System.\\n\\n<b>Show them all the memories that deserve to be digitized<\/b>\\n- Black-and-white and color photos\\n- Letters, certificates and historical documents\\n- Kids\u2019 drawings, artwork, awards and report cards\\n- Postcards and other memorabilia\\n\\n<b>Appeal to a wide array of local audiences<\/b>\\n- Cultural organizations and institutions\\n- Preservation and historical groups\\n- People interested in genealogy\\n- Government organizations and civic groups\\n- Individuals who wish to preserve and share family memories\\n- Expand your reach by promoting on your Web site and offer fulfillment by mail\\n\\n<b>Tell them all the ways they can use their images<\/b>\\n- Use images at retail or online to create photo-centric products like albums, scrapbooks, slide shows, calendars, T-shirts, mugs and more\\n- Transfer and send images to cell phones, tablets and computers\\n- Print images to have hard copies to save and share\\n- Share images on photo sharing sites, via e-mail, or make CDs\/DVDs to mail to friends and family\\n- Make new albums and use images on social media sites such as Facebook\\n- Create an archive and backups of valuable photos and documents\\n\\n<b>Easy-yet-powerful software<\/b>\\nKODAK Picture Saver Scanning Software features a highly intuitive, easy-to-use, icon-based interface and offers a variety of automatic and manual image improvements. It\u2019s a photo scanner and document scanner in one, so it can also be used to scan documents for your business and empower you to do more with the information you capture.\\n- KODAK PERFECT TOUCH Technology automatically delivers fewer dark shadows, more vibrant colors and richer detail on photo scans\\n- Built-in image processing enhances color\/brightness\/contrast, removes red eye, and automatically rotates and straightens images\\n- Smart Touch functionality lets you assign one-button shortcuts to common scanning tasks to save time and simplify operations\\n- Change settings mid-job for greater control over how items are scanned and to enhance workflow\\n\\n<b>Streamline digital conversion of entire photo albums<\/b>\\nThe KODAK Photo Selector Accessory option permits users to extract individual images from a composite image (such as a multi-picture photo album page) and have each image saved as a separate digital file after scanning. Now fragile album pages are protected, and there\u2019s no need to risk damage to photos by taking apart a complete album, removing pictures that may have been in place for years, or even lifting the page protector. The Photo Selector Accessory option requires purchase of a Kodak Legal Size Flatbed Accessory or Kodak A3 Size Flatbed Accessory, available at a very affordable additional cost."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Syst\u00e8me de num\u00e9risation de photos KODAK Picture Saver PS50<\/b>\\n- Num\u00e9rise jusqu'\u00e0 50 photos par minute\\n- Capacit\u00e9 du chargeur\\n\\n<b>Fonctions produisant des images formidables avec rapidit\u00e9 et en toute simplicit\u00e9<\/b>\\n- La navigation par ic\u00f4nes et l'interface intuitive rendent la cr\u00e9ation d'images num\u00e9riques de haute qualit\u00e9 facile et instantan\u00e9e\\n- La technologie de traitement d'image int\u00e9gr\u00e9e am\u00e9liore automatiquement chacun des \u00e9l\u00e9ments \u00e0 num\u00e9riser\\n- Un transport sp\u00e9cialement con\u00e7u pour traiter chaque photo en douceur\\n- En \u00e9vitant l'apparition de traces sur les images, le guide de num\u00e9risation permet d'am\u00e9liorer la production et de r\u00e9duire les interventions de l'op\u00e9rateur\\n- Num\u00e9risation des deux faces pour capturer les notes inscrites au dos des photos ou pour les documents recto verso\\n- Scanners \u00e0 plat formats A3 et A4 (Legal) disponibles en option pour g\u00e9rer les photos et documents fragiles, reli\u00e9s ou trop grands (albums photo, vieilles photos...)\\n- Sortie des fichiers d'image sur cl\u00e9s USB, CD, DVD et KODAK Picture CD\\n\\n<b>De nombreuses possibilit\u00e9s<\/b>\\nQuels que soient vos activit\u00e9s ou services (magasin, biblioth\u00e8que ou autre profession vous mettant en relation avec le public), le syst\u00e8me de num\u00e9risation de photos KODAK Picture Saver vous offre d'innombrables possibilit\u00e9s de promotion et de d\u00e9veloppement afin de cr\u00e9er une nouvelle source de revenus.\\n\\n<b>Des souvenirs qui m\u00e9ritent d'\u00eatre num\u00e9ris\u00e9s<\/b>\\n- Photos noir et blanc et couleur\\n- Lettres, certificats et documents historiques\\n- Dessins d'enfants, \u0153uvres d'art, dipl\u00f4mes et relev\u00e9s de notes\\n- Cartes postales et autres souvenirs\\n\\n<b>La multitude des publics concern\u00e9s<\/b>\\n- Organisations culturelles et institutions\\n- Groupes historiques et de pr\u00e9servation\\n- Individus int\u00e9ress\u00e9s par la g\u00e9n\u00e9alogie\\n- Organisations gouvernementales et groupes civiques\\n- Personnes souhaitant pr\u00e9server et partager des souvenirs familiaux\\n- Etendez votre public en mettant en avant votre site Web et en proposant des services par courrier\\n\\n<b>Les diff\u00e9rentes possibilit\u00e9s d'utilisation des images<\/b>\\n- Utiliser les images physiques ou en ligne pour cr\u00e9er des produits photographiques tels que des albums, des scrapbooks, des diaporamas, des calendriers, des t-shirts, des tasses, etc.\\n- Transf\u00e9rer et envoyer des images vers des t\u00e9l\u00e9phones, tablettes et ordinateurs\\n- Imprimer des images pour stocker et partager des copies papier\\n- Partager des images sur des sites de partage de photos ou par e-mail, ou r\u00e9aliser des CD\/DVD pour vos proches\\n- Cr\u00e9er des albums et utiliser les images sur des sites sociaux, comme Facebook\\n- Cr\u00e9er des archives et sauvegardes de photos et documents pr\u00e9cieux\\n\\n<b>Logiciel simple et performant<\/b>\\nLe logiciel de num\u00e9risation KODAK Picture Saver, \u00e0 interface intuitive et simple d'utilisation gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une navigation par ic\u00f4nes, propose un grand nombre de fonctions manuelles et automatiques d'am\u00e9lioration des images. Deux-en-un (scanner de photos et de documents), il permet de num\u00e9riser vos documents professionnels et vous donne la possibilit\u00e9 d'aller plus loin avec les informations que vous capturez.\\n- La technologie KODAK PERFECT TOUCH permet d'\u00e9claircir automatiquement les zones sombres, d'enrichir les couleurs et d'am\u00e9liorer la pr\u00e9cision des photos num\u00e9ris\u00e9es\\n- La technologie de traitement d'image int\u00e9gr\u00e9e am\u00e9liore la couleur, la luminosit\u00e9 et le contraste, supprime les yeux rouges et fait pivoter\/\u00e9tire automatiquement les images\\n- La fonctionnalit\u00e9 Smart Touch permet d'attribuer un bouton de raccourci pour vos t\u00e2ches courantes de num\u00e9risation afin de gagner du temps et de simplifier vos op\u00e9rations\\n- La possibilit\u00e9 de modifier les param\u00e8tres en cours de t\u00e2che offre un meilleur contr\u00f4le des conditions de num\u00e9risation et optimise les flux de production\\n\\n<b>Rationaliser la conversion num\u00e9rique des albums photo<\/b>\\nLe module de s\u00e9lection des photos KODAK permet aux utilisateurs d'extraire des images individuelles \u00e0 partir d'une image composite (telle qu'une page d'album \u00e0 plusieurs photos) et d'enregistrer chacune d'elles en tant que fichier num\u00e9rique distinct apr\u00e8s la num\u00e9risation. Les pages d'albums fragiles sont d\u00e9sormais prot\u00e9g\u00e9es et vous ne risquez plus d'endommager les photos en les retirant de l'album dans lequel elles se trouvent depuis des ann\u00e9es ou en soulevant le film protecteur qui les recouvre. Vous pouvez vous procurer le module de s\u00e9lection des photos en achetant un module de num\u00e9risation \u00e0 plat format A4 (Legal) Kodak ou un module de num\u00e9risation \u00e0 plat format A3 Kodak, \u00e0 un co\u00fbt suppl\u00e9mentaire abordable."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f783abd6-565d-4a29-a480-1c8d50805033","identifier":"15603167","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision AV320E2+"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der Avision AV320E2+ ist unser hochentwickelster und leistungsstarker Dokumentenscanner. Er kann Dokumente mit einer Gr\u00f6\u00dfe bis zu DinA3 scannen, so da\u00df Sie die verschiedensten Dokumentenformate, die an Ihrem Arbeitsplatz ankommen, scannen k\u00f6nnen.Ausgestattet mit neuen Rollen, die dem Versatz beim Scannen entgegenwirken, kann alle Gr\u00f6\u00dfen von A8 bis hin zu A3 gescannt werden. Der fantastischste Aspekt dieses Scanners ist die unglaublich hohe Scangeschwindigkeit - 60 Seiten pro\\nMinute (ppm) oder 120 ipm bei einer Au\u00f6sung von 300dpi - in Farbe. Qualit\u00e4t und Quantit\u00e4t ohne Kompromisse!\\n\\n<b>Scangeschwindigkeit bis zu 80 PPM\/160 IPM bei 200 dpi, Graustufen<\/b>\\nDer AV320E2+ liefert eine hohe Scanrate von 80 Seiten pro Minute im simplex Modus und 160 IPM im duplex Modus bei 200 dpi Graustufen und 60 Seiten pro Minutes im simplex Modus und 120 IPM im duplex Modus bei 300 dpi Farbmodus.\\n\\n<b>Support document up to A3 size, and support long page up to 118\"(3m)<\/b>\\nDer AV320E2+ unterst\u00fctzt die spezielle Funktion \u00fcberlange Dokumente bis zu einer L\u00e4nge von 300cm zu scannen. Dies ist eine zeit- und kostensparende L\u00f6sung zum Beispiel f\u00fcr Versicherungen oder im Gesundheitswesen, die Versicherungspolicen oder Patientenakten digitalisieren m\u00fcssen.\\n\\n<b>Avision Button Manager 2<\/b>\\nMit dem Button Manager 2 ist es ein einfaches Ihre Dokumente zu scannen und das Bild zu Ihrer\\nvorgew\u00e4hlten Zielanwendung zu senden - das alles mit nur einem Tastendruck. Die neue Version des Button Managers ist mit der innovativen Funktion ausgestattet die Scans direkt in alle g\u00e4ngige Clouds, wie zum Besipiel Google Docs, Microsft SharePoint oder auf einen FTP hochzuladen. Zus\u00e4tzlich erlaubt es die iScan Funktion das gescannte Bild oder erkannten Text nach optionale OCR Bearbeitung in Ihren Text Editor, wie zum Besipiel Microsoft Word einzuf\u00fcgen.\\n\\n<b>Intelligentes Bilderbesserungswerkzeug<\/b>\\nFalls Originaldokumente besch\u00e4digt oder verschmutzt sind, hilft das intelligente Bildverbesserungswerkzeug die Scans deutlich zu korrigieren und ein scharfes und knackiges Bild zu erzeugen.\\n\\n<b>Ultraschalldoppelblatterkennung<\/b>\\nMit der integrierten Ultraschalldoppelblatterkennung wird die Dicke der eingezogenen Dokumente\\ngemessen. Falls mehrere Dokumente eingezogen werden sollten erscheint eine Warnmeldung."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Avision AV320E2+ is our most advanced and powerful high speed sheet fed document scanner. Built to last using premium parts and material, the AV320E2+ can handle unprecedented 8,000 recommended daily duty cycles, and a pad life of 200,000 scans. The extra large capacity of its ADF can hold up to 150 sheets, compared to the standard of 50 sheets of our other models.\\n\\nThe AV320E2+ is capable of scanning documents up to A3 sizes, ensuring a wide range of document compatibility at your workplace. Equipped with new and improved rollers, it can take virtually any A8 to A3 size mixed documents you throw at it. No more need to pre-filter and organize similar-sized documents before batch scanning.\\n\\nIt doesn't stop there. The most amazing aspect of the AV320E2+ is its incredible scanning speed \u2013 a lightning fast 80ppm \/ 160ipm at 200dpi resolution in gray mode and 60 ppm \/ 120ipm at 300dpi resolution in color mode! Quantity and quality achieved, absolutely no compromises.\\n\\nLook no further than the AV320E2+ for the ultimate solution to all your scanning needs.\\n\\n<b>Scan rate up to 80 PPM\/160 IPM at 200 dpi, gray mode<\/b>\\nThe AV320E2+ delivers fast scan rates of 80 pages per minutes in simplex and 160 images per minutes in duplex at 200 dpi gray and 60 pages per minutes in simplex and 120 images per minutes in duplex at 300 dpi color, providing a truly breathtaking digitalizing experience.\\n\\n<b>Support document up to A3 size, and support long page up to 118\"(3m)<\/b>\\nThe reliable paper feed system also lets you scan unusually long document up to 3 meters (118\") at 300 dpi in color, grayscale, or black and white. This is ideal for scanning engineering diagram, insurance bill, health record or other special documents.\\n\\n<b>Avision Button Manager<\/b>\\nFor typical users, Avision's Button Manager provides ease of use with 9 pre-configured file formats and destinations. For advanced users, Avision's Button Manager allows full customization. With a simple touch of the button, users can conveniently scan and send images to E-mail software, specific folder, favorite software application, your printer, or convert into searchable PDF format!\\n\\n<b>New TWAIN driver support<\/b>\\nAV320E2+ incorporates the latest TWAIN driver with new features and enhancement such as the ability to adjust sensitivity of dynamic threshold, document\/photo color matching, custom color dropout, automatic multiple cropping, intelligent multi-feed, reduce despeckle, image count, digital imprinter, and transport timeout. We are committed to improving the TWAIN driver continuously to enrich your scanning experience as never before.\\n\\n<b>Ultrasonic Multi-Feed Detection<\/b>\\nThe Avision AV320E2+ uses sound waves to detect multiple documents that go through the scanner at the same time. When multiple pages are fed, the scanner detects multi-feed and sends a warning message. This action ensures that all of your critical documents are imaged correctly without losing a single page."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"9589c953-91aa-4c71-b4b4-4e87ef38e98b","identifier":"15605269","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DCR-SX22 hand-held camcorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>See the bigger picture<\/b>\\nGet even closer with the new 70x extended zoom feature. Advanced image processing technology ensures almost no visible image degradation, letting you enjoy a greater shooting range, from wide to telephoto.\\n\\n<b>Smooth and steady videos, every time<\/b>\\nWhether you're standing still or on the move, SteadyShot drastically reduces camera shake for smooth, blur-free recordings \u2013 even when you're zooming in and out.\\n\\n<b>Wider, clearer, better<\/b>\\nThe 2.7\" Wide Clear Photo LCD screen delivers better visibility, higher screen resolution, sharper contrast and more accurate colour reproduction than ever before.\\n\\n<b>Auto-correct settings for every shot<\/b>\\nWith Intelligent Auto, it's easy to capture your moments in the best light. Just point your Handycam at your subject, and the correct camera settings will be adjusted automatically from 18 different scene combinations. It's hassle-free even for first-time users, so you can concentrate on getting your perfect shot and leave the details to us.\\n\\n<b>Detects faces automatically<\/b>\\nThe Face Detection feature automatically detects up to eight faces in a scene, optimising the exposure for the best results. It's handy for quick and easy shooting of scenes with people, guaranteeing correct exposures and bright faces every time.\\n\\n<b>Capture great videos, even in the dark<\/b>\\nShoot clear, vivid videos in low light conditions with the built-in LED video light. Bright and energy-efficient, it can illuminate any subject up to 1.5 metres.\\n\\n<b>Picture Motion<\/b>\\n<b>Browser (PMB)<\/b>\\nShare your videos easily with PMB Portable, already embedded in your Handycam. PMB Portable lets you upload videos to Facebook and YouTube easily when you connect your Handycam to a computer via a USB cable \u2013 no installation required.\\n\\nFor advanced importing options, check out the full version of PMB in the CD-ROM provided with every Handycam.\\n\\n<b>Direct Copy<\/b>\\nWith Direct Copy, you can also back up videos directly onto your external hard drive, via a USB adapter.\\n\\n<b>Dual-Compatibility Memory Card Slot<\/b>\\nShoot and store more on your Handycam with a memory card slot that's compatible with both MS and SD cards."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":60}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2593579c-b219-4655-b336-5b029900983b","identifier":"15608222","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"210_x_1219_mm"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C782dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Everything you need to produce remarkable colour documents in-house!<\/b>\\nThe network-ready Lexmark C782dn with standard duplex prints up to 40 ppm in 4800 Color Quality mode and provides true 1200 x 1200 dpi capability for high quality color printing."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3fbd9d09-6819-4c14-a129-3ea6c0448054","identifier":"15608264","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark 26A0010"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Desktop Friendly Color<\/b>\\n\\nExtremely compact and quiet, with true 1200 x 1200 dpi color plus rapid printing up to 21 ppm in black and color. Built-in networking for easy setup. Opt for a Duo Drawer for extra input capacity and a multipurpose feeder to print on various media types.\\n\\n<b>Convenience By Your Side<\/b>\\n\\nMake a big impact on your business with a color printer that's sure to be a perfect fit. With its small, attractive design and quiet operation, the Lexmark C540n will be a welcome addition to your desktop or small workgroup.\\n\\n<b>Trust Lexmark Color Expertise<\/b>\\n\\nStudies show that color can significantly increase brand recognition and reader retention. The C540n brings out the finest details with vivid 1200 x 1200 dpi color and helps you keep color costs in check with Lexmark ColorSaver\u2122 technology.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark Rewards\u2014Save Money and the Planet<\/b>\\n\\nSave up to 20% on supplies and go green with Lexmark Rewards. You'll earn free high-yield toner cartridges and imaging kits simply for using genuine Lexmark toner and returning your empty cartridges to Lexmark for recycling.\\n\\n<b>Lifetime Pricing Guarantee<\/b>\\n\\nFor as long as you own yourC540n, Lexmark guarantees never to increase the U.S. toner cartridge price found on Lexmark.com.\\n\\n<b>Eco-Responsible<\/b>\\n\\nSaving resources means everyone wins\u2014your business, your budget and the environment! Eco-features include energy-saving Eco-Mode and an instant warm-up fuser to help you print greener at every level. And toner cartridges for Lexmark C540 Series printers never require shaking to deliver their full declared yield."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"28db5d44-21bd-4e82-96d6-7decceb12911","identifier":"15608265","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark C544dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Fast, Professional, and Budget-Conscious<\/b>\\nUltra-compact, network-ready and fully loaded with great benefits for small to midsize workgroups. Reap the productivity advantages of high-speed 25 ppm printing in black and color, paper-saving duplex printing, and available eco-smart, budget-smart extra high yield toner cartridges.\\n\\n<b>Convenience By Your Side<\/b>\\nMake a big impact on your business with a color printer that is genuinely desktop-friendly. With its small, attractive design and quiet operation, a Lexmark C544dn color laser printer will be a welcome addition to your desktop or small workgroup.\\n\\n<b>Trust Lexmark Color Expertise<\/b>\\nStudies show that color can significantly increase brand recognition and reader retention. The C544dn brings out the finest details with vivid 1200 x 1200 dpi color and helps you keep color costs in check with Lexmark ColorSaver technology.\\n\\n<b>Lexmark Rewards\u2014Save Money and the Planet<\/b>\\nSave up to 20% on supplies and go green with Lexmark Rewards. You'll earn free high-yield toner cartridges and imaging kits simply for using genuine Lexmark toner and returning your empty cartridges to Lexmark for recycling.\\n\\n<b>Eco-Responsible<\/b>\\nSaving resources means everyone wins\u2014your business, your budget and the environment! Eco-features include paper-saving duplex, energy-saving Eco-Mode and an instant warm-up fuser to help you print greener at every level. And toner cartridges for Lexmark C540 Series printers never require shaking to deliver their full declared yield."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"07fa1854-48d8-4ebb-9340-2f751688d6f3","identifier":"15608270","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark T654dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>High on Options, Low on Costs<\/b>\\n\\nThe best in black and white: paper-saving duplex standard, a rich selection of paper handling accessories, and economical extra-high-yield 36,000*-page replacement cartridges. Turns work into workflow with 55 ppm speed, rapid time-to-first-page, and a built-in framework for supporting solution applications. (*Declared yield in accordance with ISO\/IEC 19752.)\\n\\n<b>Let It Decide the Best Speed<\/b>\\n\\nIdentifies the size and complexity of your job and automatically calculates the optimal speed\u2014quicker time-to-first-page for short jobs and more pages per minute for longer jobs.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Job Waiting<\/b>\\n\\nNo more letting missing media derail hours of print time. The innovative Job Waiting feature will simply hold that job aside, letting others go on working without interruption (requires the hard disk option).\\n\\n<b>Outstanding Print Quality<\/b>\\n\\nCombines true 1200 x 1200 dpi with automatic darkness adjustment and pixel-boosting technology to ensure high-quality, professional documents every time.\\n\\n<b>Cutting-Edge Security<\/b>\\n\\nFrom network security to user-access restrictions, you\u2019ll be fully equipped to keep valuable data safe and sound. In addition to IPSec, SNMPv3 and 802.1x network security, the Lexmark T654dn offers an alphanumeric pad for easy PIN authentication, plus encryption and disk wiping to secure the optional hard disk.\\n\\n<b>Get Efficient with Lexmark Solutions<\/b>\\n\\nNowadays there are apps for just about everything, from tracking your diet to balancing your checkbook. But what about managing your documents? The Lexmark T654 family is the ideal platform for tapping into serious business apps that can help you save paper, cut waste, lower costs and enhance document security. See Related Links to learn more."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8b28d344-8bb6-47a7-8ddf-b9169fa07b85","identifier":"15608497","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet P4014n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"605337c4-e7b4-4ac0-9c2d-c5c08aeb7bea","identifier":"15608522","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet P1606dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Steigern Sie die Produktivit\u00e4t in Ihrer B\u00fcroumgebung mit Ethernet-Netzwerktechnologie, automatischem beidseitigen Druck und benutzerfreundlichen Funktionen. Sparen Sie Geld und Energie mit der Instant-on-Technologie. Mit der HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technologie<SUP>4<\/SUP> sparen Sie noch mehr Energie.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Dieser schnelle HP LaserJet Drucker ist perfekt geeignet f\u00fcr die Druckaufkommen in einem kleinen, betriebsamen B\u00fcro.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Durch integrierte 10\/100 Ethernet-Netzwerktechnologie l\u00e4sst sich der kompakte Drucker in kleinen B\u00fcros anschlie\u00dfen und gemeinsam nutzen.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Bleiben Sie fokussiert mit einfachem mobilen Drucken<SUP>1<\/SUP> und schneller Einrichtung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Drucken Sie praktisch \u00fcberall mit HP ePrint<SUP>1<\/SUP>. Einfaches Drucken von Smartphones oder anderen Internet-f\u00e4higen Ger\u00e4ten aus. Und mit AirPrint\u2122 k\u00f6nnen Sie auf einfache Weise Wireless von Ihrem iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae und iPod touch\u00ae aus drucken<SUP>2<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Entscheiden Sie sich f\u00fcr einen Drucker, mit dem Sie Papier, Energie und Geld sparen.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Sparen Sie mithilfe der Instant-on-Technologie<SUP>3<\/SUP> bis zu 50 Prozent an Energie gegen\u00fcber Laserdruckern anderer Anbieter.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Nutzen Sie kosteneffektiven Laserdruck, und \u00fcberzeugen Sie andere von Ihren Profiqualit\u00e4ten.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Erstellen Sie Gesch\u00e4ftsdokumente in Spitzenqualit\u00e4t mit brillanten, gestochen scharfen Texten und Bildern.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Das mobile Endger\u00e4t muss f\u00fcr Wireless aktiviert sein und sich im Wireless Bereich des Druckers befinden. Drucker muss f\u00fcr HP ePrint aktiviert sein und erfordert gegebenenfalls ein Firmware-Upgrade. Funktion kann den Download von Treibern oder Apps auf das mobile Endger\u00e4t erfordern, verf\u00fcgbar unter www.hp.com\/go\/printercenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Unterst\u00fctzt Ger\u00e4te mit iOS 4.2 (iPad, iPhone 4, iPhone 3GS und 3. und 4. Generation von iPod touch), die Multitasking unterst\u00fctzen. Funktioniert mit Druckern und All-in-One Ger\u00e4ten, die f\u00fcr HP ePrint aktiviert sind. AirPrint und Ger\u00e4te mit iOS 4.2 erfordern eine 802.11 Wireless Netzwerkverbindung zum Drucker. Die Wireless Leistung ist abh\u00e4ngig von den Umgebungsbedingungen und der Entfernung vom Zugangspunkt. AirPrint und das AirPrint Logo sind Marken von Apple Inc. iPad, iPhone und iPod touch sind eingetragene Marken von Apple Inc. in den USA und anderen L\u00e4ndern.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Energieersparnis laut HP Tests, wobei der typische Stromverbrauch, wie im ENERGY STAR-Programm vorgegeben, f\u00fcr HP LaserJet Produkte mit Instant-on-Technologie berechnet und mit dem Wert entsprechender Modelle anderer Anbieter verglichen wurde (Stand: M\u00e4rz 2009).<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> HP Auto-On- und Auto-Off-Funktionen h\u00e4ngen vom Drucker und den Einstellungen ab.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Boost your small office's efficiency with Ethernet networking, automatic two-sided printing and easy-to-use features. Save money and energy with Instant-on Technology. Save even more energy with HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technology.\\n\\nFor small offices where a shared, fast laser printer helps reduce environmental impact with automatic two-sided printing and energy-saving features.\\n\\n<b>Fast laser printing with built-in productivity features designed for small offices.<\/b>\\n- Connect and share this compact printer among a small office, using 10\/100 Ethernet networking. Ethernet connectivity makes it easy for you to connect your printing network.\\n- Print documents fast\u2014up to 26 ppm letter\/25 ppm A4. With Instant-on Technology, pages start and finish printing faster\u2014get a first page out in as fast as 7 seconds.\\n- Choose the media that best suits your business purpose. The 250-sheet paper tray and 10-sheet priority input slot handle a wide variety of media types\u2014card stock, transparencies, labels, envelopes and paper up to legal size.\\n- Save time and boost your printing productivity with automatic two-sided printing. Print on both sides of the paper without manually flipping pages\\n\\n<b>Innovative technology that saves you paper, energy and money.<\/b>\\n- Reduce your impact on the environment and use up to 50 percent less paper with automatic two-sided printing.\\n- Get up to 50 percent energy savings over competitive laser products, using Instant-on Technology. And get additional, effortless savings with HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technology\u2014it senses your printing activity, turning on and off automatically.\\n- Reduce wasted paper by printing only the content you want. HP Smart Web Printing delivers more usable web pages by printing web pages without cutoff edges and blank pages.\\n- Minimal packaging is made from 10 to 30 percent recycled material, reducing your impact on the environment. Cardboard packaging is 100% recyclable. Get free, easy and responsible recycling of cartridges through HP Planet Partners.\\n\\n<b>Professional, cost-effective laser printing.<\/b>\\n- Produce professional-quality prints\u2014HP spherically shaped toner consistently delivers bold, crisp text and sharp images.\\n- When printing professional black-and-white documents, HP FastRes 1200 delivers sharp, clear output quickly. HP FastRes produces smaller print files, crisp text, even tones and smooth business graphics.\\n- Save space with an ultra-compact, space-saving printer with a sleek, industrial design. Improve your office environment by selecting the \"quiet\" mode.\\n- HP Page Description Language (PCL5e) helps ensure consistent communication across a wide range of devices and is more likely to be compatible with your company's existing infrastructure.\\n\\n<b>Reliable performance with ease-of-use.<\/b>\\n- Get out-of-the-box driver installation. HP Smart Install makes it easy to quickly set up the printer without a CD\u2014just plug in and install.\\n- Set up and start printing right away with an easy-to-use, intuitive control panel. The simplified interface includes four LED lights a lighted power button, cancel button and a \"go\" button for easy access to functions.\\n- Receive reliable, outstanding results\u2014page after page, cartridge after cartridge\u2014using Original HP supplies designed for your printer. When it's time to replace a toner cartridge, HP SureSupply helps you find and purchase the right supplies.\\n- HP Total Care gives you more value and results from your technology, for your business. The portfolio of services, software, solutions and support from HP and our partners helps manage, protect and grow your business\u2014no matter what stage it\u2019s in."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Renforcez l'efficacit\u00e9 de votre petite entreprise avec mise en r\u00e9seau Ethernet, impression recto verso automatique et fonctionnalit\u00e9s simples d'utilisation. \u00c9conomisez de l'argent et de l'\u00e9nergie avec la technologie Instant-on. R\u00e9alisez des \u00e9conomies d'\u00e9nergie suppl\u00e9mentaires gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off<SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Faites face aux exigences d'impression d'une petite entreprise tr\u00e8s active gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 cette imprimante rapide HP LaserJet.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Connectez et partagez cette imprimante compacte au sein d'une petite entreprise gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la mise en r\u00e9seau Ethernet 10\/100 int\u00e9gr\u00e9e.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Gardez le cap avec l'impression mobile facile<SUP>1<\/SUP> et la configuration rapide.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Imprimez o\u00f9 que vous soyez avec HP ePrint<SUP>1<\/SUP>. Imprimez facilement depuis votre smartphone ou d'autres p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques compatibles Internet. Et avec AirPrint\u2122, vous pouvez simplement imprimer sans fil \u00e0 partir de votre iPad\u00ae, iPhone\u00ae ou iPod touch\u00ae<SUP>2<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Choisissez une imprimante vous aidant \u00e0 \u00e9conomiser du papier, de l'\u00e9nergie et de l'argent.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;R\u00e9alisez jusqu'\u00e0 50\u00a0% d'\u00e9conomies d'\u00e9nergie de plus qu'avec des produits laser concurrents gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie Instant-on<SUP>3<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Offrez une image professionnelle gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une impression laser rentable.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Cr\u00e9ez des impressions de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle avec des textes en gras aux contours clairs et des images nettes.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Le p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique mobile doit \u00eatre compatible sans fil et dans la port\u00e9e sans fil de l'imprimante. L'imprimante doit \u00eatre compatible HP ePrint et peut n\u00e9cessiter une mise \u00e0 niveau du micrologiciel. La fonction peut n\u00e9cessiter le t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement de pilotes\/d'applications sur le p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique mobile (www.hp.com\/go\/eprintercenter).<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Prend en charge les p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques iOS 4.2 (iPad, iPhone 4, iPhone 3GS et iPOD de 3e et 4e g\u00e9n\u00e9ration) qui prennent en charge le traitement multit\u00e2che. Fonctionne avec les imprimantes et tout-en-un compatibles HP ePrint. AirPrint et les p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques iOS 4.2 n\u00e9cessitent une connexion r\u00e9seau sans fil 802.11 \u00e0 l'imprimante. Les performances sans fil d\u00e9pendent de l'environnement physique et de la distance par rapport au point d'acc\u00e8s. AirPrint et le logo AirPrint sont des marques commerciales d'Apple Inc. iPad, iPhone et iPod touch sont des marques commerciales d'Apple Inc., aux \u00c9tats-Unis et dans d'autres pays.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> \u00c9conomies d'\u00e9nergie reposant sur des tests HP utilisant la m\u00e9thode TEC (consommation \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique typique) du programme ENERGY STAR\u00ae sur les produits HP\u00a0LaserJet \u00e9quip\u00e9s de la technologie Instant-on par rapport aux mod\u00e8les les plus comp\u00e9titifs en mars 2009.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> Les fonctions HP Auto-On et Auto-Off d\u00e9pendent de l'imprimante et des param\u00e8tres.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b9186732-d857-476d-9f9f-a43e5f16f030","identifier":"15609251","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","microsoft","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_720"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Microsoft LifeCam HD-5000"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Sharp video with Auto Focus<\/b>\\nGet the HD webcam features you need to share each moment as it happens\u2014at a reasonable price. The LifeCam HD-5000 offers a 720p HD sensor and automatically sharpens your images with Auto Focus, while TrueColor adjusts exposure for bright, vibrant footage. Plus, the widescreen presents a remarkably cinematic feel, right from your desktop or notebook PC.\\n\\n<b>720p HD video chat<\/b>\\nFor a true HD-quality experience.\\n\\n<b>TrueColor Technology with face tracking<\/b>\\nAutomatically controls exposure for bright and colorful video.\\n\\n<b>Auto focus<\/b>\\nImages stay sharp and detailed, even close-ups.\\n\\n<b>Widescreen<\/b>\\n16:9 format offers cinematic video recording.\\n\\n<b>Noise reducing microphone<\/b>\\nCrystal-clear audio and built-in unidirectional microphone with acoustic noise cancellation.\\n\\n<b>Certified for Skype<\/b>\\nDo more together in HD, with Skype certified HD LifeCams from Microsoft.\\n\\n<b>Optimized for Microsoft\u00ae Lync\u00ae<\/b>\\nDesigned to work with Lync\u00ae, Microsoft\u2019s enterprise-ready unified communications platform."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"89981c3f-c3f1-422e-ad6b-e47e33839e2f","identifier":"15609414","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet Pro P1102w"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Der HP LaserJet erm\u00f6glicht daheim oder im B\u00fcro von praktisch \u00fcberall aus den kosteng\u00fcnstigen, gemeinsam und kabellosen Druck<SUP>1<\/SUP>. Plug-and-Print dank HP Smart Install \u2013 ohne CD <SUP>3<\/SUP>. Mit dem stromsparendsten Laserdrucker weltweit<SUP>7<\/SUP> k\u00f6nnen Sie Geld und Ressourcen sparen.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Hohe Produktivit\u00e4t durch kosteng\u00fcnstiges Wireless-Drucken<SUP>2<\/SUP> und beeindruckende Mobilit\u00e4t.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Netzwerkverbindung zum Drucker ohne zus\u00e4tzliche Kabel und Zugriff daheim oder im B\u00fcro von praktisch \u00fcberall aus \u00fcber 802.11 b\/g\/n Wireless-Verbindung<SUP>2<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Einfach und zuverl\u00e4ssig Drucken mit HP LaserJet.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Installation im Handumdrehen \u2013 dank HP Smart Install ist keine CD erforderlich<SUP>4<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Die Umwelt schonen mit einem der energieeffizientesten Drucker<SUP>1<\/SUP> weltweit.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Sparen Sie Energie mit der HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technologie<SUP>5<\/SUP>, die Ihre Druckaktivit\u00e4t erkennt und den Drucker automatisch ein- und ausschaltet.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Professionelle Qualit\u00e4t, kosteng\u00fcnstige Ausdrucke.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Verbesserte Druckqualit\u00e4t durch HP FastRes 1200<SUP>6<\/SUP> \u2013 kleinere Druckdateien, fettgedruckter, gestochen scharfer Text, feinste Schattierungen, hohe Bildsch\u00e4rfe und gleichm\u00e4\u00dfige Gesch\u00e4ftsgrafiken.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Die verbrauchte Gesamtenergie basierend auf den TEC-Messergebnissen anderer Unternehmen laut www.energystar.gov, www.eu-energystar.org und den Datenbl\u00e4ttern der Hersteller f\u00fcr Schwarzwei\u00df- und Farblaserdrucker mit Einzel- und Multifunktion vom Januar 2012. Der tats\u00e4chliche Stromverbrauch h\u00e4ngt von der individuellen Produktkonfiguration und -nutzung ab.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Wireless-Drucken nur verf\u00fcgbar auf P1102w. Die Wireless-Leistung ist abh\u00e4ngig von den Umgebungsbedingungen und der Entfernung zum Access Point.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Erfordert eine Internetverbindung zum Drucker. Die Funktion ist bei allen Internet- und e-Mail f\u00e4higen Ger\u00e4ten verwendbar. Erfordert die Registrierung eines HP Web Services-Kontos. Die Druckdauer kann variieren. Eine Liste der unterst\u00fctzten Dokumente und Bildtypen steht Ihnen unter www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter zur Verf\u00fcgung. Wenn Sie Informationen \u00fcber weitere L\u00f6sungen ben\u00f6tigen, besuchen Sie uns unter www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>5<\/SUP><i> Unterst\u00fctzt Multitasking-f\u00e4hige Ger\u00e4te mit dem Betriebssystem iOS 4.2 (iPad, iPhone 4, iPhone 3GS und iPod touch der dritten und vierten Generation). Ger\u00e4te mit iOS 4.2 erfordern eine Wireless-Netzwerkverbindung gem\u00e4\u00df 802.11. Zu AirPrint-f\u00e4higen Druckern k\u00f6nnen Wireless- oder Ethernet-Verbindungen hergestellt werden. AirPrint und das AirPrint Logo sind Marken von Apple Inc. iPad, iPhone und iPod touch sind eingetragene Marken von Apple Inc. in den USA und anderen L\u00e4ndern.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> HP Smart Install funktioniert nur unter Windows\u00ae f\u00fcr USB- und Netzwerk-Verbindungen.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>5<\/SUP><i> HP Auto-On- und Auto-Off-Funktionen h\u00e4ngen vom Drucker und den Einstellungen ab.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>6<\/SUP><i> HP FastRes 1200 bietet die beste Einstellung f\u00fcr die Druckqualit\u00e4t f\u00fcr dieses Ger\u00e4t. W\u00e4hlen Sie HP FastRes 600 f\u00fcr schnelles Drucken aus.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>7<\/SUP><i> Die Merkmale des Programms und die Verf\u00fcgbarkeit k\u00f6nnen je nach Land variieren. Weitere Informationen finden Sie unter www.hp.com\/learn\/suresupply.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Affordable, wireless HP LaserJet printing from virtually anywhere in the home or office with several users. Print at up to 19 ppm letter\/18 ppm A4 with no need for extra wires. Built-in energy-saving features help save money and resources.\\n\\nIdeal for business users with home or small offices who want an affordable HP LaserJet printer\\n\\n<b>Print wirelessly in your home or office.<\/b>\\n- Network the printer without extra cables, using 802.11 b\/g wireless networking.\\n- Print up to 19 ppm letter\/18 ppm A4.\\n- Start and finish printing sooner with Instant-on Technology.\\n- Print on a wide variety of media, using the 150-sheet paper tray and 10-sheet priority input slot.\\n\\n<b>Experience easy, reliable HP LaserJet printing.<\/b>\\n- Install in a flash\u2014no CD required\u2014using HP Smart Install.\\n- Set up and start printing right away with an easy-to-use, intuitive control panel.\\n- Receive consistent results with Original HP cartridges and easily reorder with HP SureSupply.\\n- Get the services, solutions, software and support of HP Total Care.\\n\\n<b>Reduce your impact and protect your bottom line.<\/b>\\n- Conserve energy with Instant-on Technology and save even more with HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technology.\\n- Reduce wasted paper by printing only the content you want, using HP Smart Web Printing.\\n- Save space with an ultra-compact printer with a sleek, industrial design.\\n- HP helps reduce your impact\u2014less packaging, plus free cartridge recycling with HP Planet Partners.\\n\\n<b>Create professional, cost-effective prints.<\/b>\\n- Produce professional-quality business prints with bold, crisp text and sharp images.\\n- Receive improved print quality with HP FastRes 1200."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>HP LaserJet sans fil abordable, partag\u00e9 et imprimant de pratiquement partout \u00e0 la maison ou au bureau<SUP>1<\/SUP>. Branchez et imprimez avec l'installation intelligente HP - Aucun CD requis<SUP>3<\/SUP>. L'imprimante laser la plus \u00e9conerg\u00e9tique de la plan\u00e8te<SUP>7<\/SUP> vous permet d'\u00e9conomiser argent et ressources.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Rester productifs avec l'impression sans fil abordable<SUP>2<\/SUP> et une mobilit\u00e9 impressionnante.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Mettez l'imprimante en r\u00e9seau sans c\u00e2bles suppl\u00e9mentaires et acc\u00e9dez-y depuis n'importe o\u00f9 \u00e0 votre domicile ou au bureau \u00e0 l'aide de la mise en r\u00e9seau sans fil 802.11b\/g\/n.<SUP>1<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Faites l'exp\u00e9rience d'une impression fiable et mobile avec HP LaserJet.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Installez votre imprimante rapidement - aucun CD requis avec HP Smart Install.<SUP>4<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>R\u00e9duire votre impact sur l'environnement avec l'une des imprimantes les plus \u00e9conomes en \u00e9nergie<SUP>1<\/SUP> de la plan\u00e8te.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;\u00c9conomiser encore plus gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off<SUP>5<\/SUP> qui d\u00e9tecte votre activit\u00e9 d'impression, avec mise sous tension et hors tension automatiquement.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Cr\u00e9er des impressions \u00e9conomiques de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Obtenez une meilleure qualit\u00e9 d'impression avec HP FastRes 1200<SUP>6<\/SUP> qui g\u00e9n\u00e8re des fichiers d'impression plus petits, du texte net, des tonalit\u00e9s uniformes et des graphiques d'entreprise clairs.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Consommation d'\u00e9nergie bas\u00e9e sur les calculs de TEC de la concurrence disponibles sur www.energystar.gov, www.eu-energystar.org et les fiches techniques publi\u00e9es par les fabricants en janvier 2012 pour les imprimantes laser monochromes et couleur \u00e0 fonction unique. La configuration individuelle du produit et son utilisation influencent la consommation.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Impression sans fil uniquement disponible sur lesP1102w . Les performances sans fil d\u00e9pendent de l'environnement physique et de la distance par rapport au point d'acc\u00e8s.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> N\u00e9cessite une connexion Internet de l'imprimante. Fonctionne avec tout p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique compatible Internet et la messagerie \u00e9lectronique. Exige la cr\u00e9ation du compte des services Web HP. Dur\u00e9es d'impression variables. Voir la liste des types de documents et d'images pris en charge sur la page www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. Pour des solutions suppl\u00e9mentaires, reportez-vous \u00e0 la page www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>5<\/SUP><i> Prend en charge les p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques IOS 4.2 (iPad, iPhone 4, iPhone 3GS et iPod touch 3\u00e8me et 4\u00e8me g\u00e9n\u00e9ration) qui prennent en charge le traitement multit\u00e2che. Les p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques iOS 4.2 n\u00e9cessitent une connexion r\u00e9seau sans fil 802.11, Imprimante AirPrint peut \u00eatre connect\u00e9e sans fil ou via Ethernet. AirPrint et le logo AirPrint sont des marques commerciales d'Apple Inc. iPad, iPhone et iPod touch sont des marques commerciales d'Apple Inc., aux \u00c9tats-Unis et dans d'autres pays.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> HP Smart Install fonctionne avec Windows\u00ae uniquement - pour les connexions USB et r\u00e9seau.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>5<\/SUP><i> Les fonctions HP Auto-On et Auto-Off d\u00e9pendent de l'imprimante et des param\u00e8tres.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>6<\/SUP><i> HP FastRes 1200 offre une qualit\u00e9 d'impression optimale pour ce p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique. Choisissez HP FastRes 600 pour une impression rapide.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>7<\/SUP><i> Les fonctions et la disponibilit\u00e9 du programme d\u00e9pendent du pays. Pour en savoir plus, voir www.hp.com\/learn\/suresupply.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"acd0c94c-8e7d-49f0-b4c5-4c26b90edf43","identifier":"15609420","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet Pro CP1025nw"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Dieser kosteng\u00fcnstige, mit Wireless- und Ethernet-Technologie ausgestattete HP LaserJet<SUP>1<\/SUP> ist der kleinste HP Farblaserdrucker und zugleich einer der energieeffizientesten weltweit<SUP>2<\/SUP>. Er gibt Ihnen die Chance, Dokumente in exzellenter Farbqualit\u00e4t zu erstellen. Dabei k\u00f6nnen Sie dank HP ePrint von nahezu \u00fcberall drucken.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Kosteng\u00fcnstiger Farbdruck mit Wireless-Verbindung.<SUP>1<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Mit der Wireless-Funktion k\u00f6nnen Sie von \u00fcberall im B\u00fcro drucken. \u00dcber integrierte Ethernet-Technologie lassen sich Druckressourcen gemeinsam nutzen.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Aufgaben werden im Handumdrehen erledigt \u2013 dank schneller Installation und einfachem mobilen Drucken.<SUP>3<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;HP ePrint \u2013 Jetzt k\u00f6nnen Sie von nahezu \u00fcberall drucken.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>F\u00fcr eine geringere Umweltbelastung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Einer der weltweit energieeffizientesten Farblaserdrucker.<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erstellen und drucken Sie Ihr eigenes Marketingmaterial.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Ansprechende Marketingbrosch\u00fcren und neue Impulse f\u00fcr Druckprojekte dank HP Creative Studio for Business.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Integrierte Wireless- und Ethernet-Verbindungen sind nur beim HP LaserJet Pro CP1025nw verf\u00fcgbar. Die Leistung beim kabellosen Einsatz ist abh\u00e4ngig von den Umgebungsbedingungen und der Entfernung vom Zugangspunkt und ist w\u00e4hrend einer aktiven VPN-Verbindungen wom\u00f6glich eingeschr\u00e4nkt.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Angaben zum Energieverbrauch basierend auf  den Ergebnissen von TEC-Vergleichstests mit Einzelfunktions-Farblaserdruckern (aufgef\u00fchrt unter energystar.gov und eu-energystar.org \u2013 Stand: Juni 2010). Die TEC-Tests wurden beim Schwarzwei\u00dfdruck mit entsprechender Druckgeschwindigkeit durchgef\u00fchrt. Der tats\u00e4chliche Stromverbrauch h\u00e4ngt von der individuellen Produktkonfiguration und -nutzung ab.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Erfordert eine Internetverbindung zum Drucker. Die Funktion ist mit allen angeschlossenen Internet- und E-Mail-f\u00e4higen Ger\u00e4ten verwendbar. Die Druckgeschwindigkeiten k\u00f6nnen variieren. Einige HP LaserJet Produkte erfordern m\u00f6glicherweise ein Firmware-Upgrade. Eine Liste der unterst\u00fctzten Dokument- und Bildtypen finden Sie unter www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. Wenn Sie Informationen \u00fcber weitere L\u00f6sungen ben\u00f6tigen, besuchen Sie uns unter www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions. Nur mit dem HP LaserJet Pro CP1025nw Farbdrucker verf\u00fcgbar.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Add high-quality color using an affordable, wireless and Ethernet-connected HP LaserJet. The world's smallest color laser printer is also one of the planet's most energy efficient.\\n\\nHome office and small business customers who need a low-priced, compact color laser printer with wireless and Ethernet connectivity.\\n\\n<b>Connect wirelessly to affordable color.<\/b>\\n- Print from anywhere in the office and share on a network, using built-in wireless and Ethernet.\\n- Save money, save space\u2014this low-priced HP LaserJet is the world's smallest color laser printer.\\n- Print documents affordably. Get the same black cost per page as a black-and-white HP LaserJet printer.\\n- Ensure bold text and smooth color with HP ImageREt 2400 and Original HP cartridges with ColorSphere toner.\\n\\n<b>Stay on task with setup and easy maintenance.<\/b>\\n- Install and start printing quickly and easily.\\n- Original HP cartridges are simple to install and easy to replace.\\n- Minimise maintenance with a printer design\\n\\n<b>Create and print your own marketing materials.<\/b>\\n- Design marketing materials and get ideas for your printed projects from HP Creative Studio for Business.\\n- Print on a wide range of media \u2013 from 3 x 5 to 8.5 x 14 inches.\\n- Achieve great results \u2013 pre-configured shortcuts optimise output quality based on the media selected.\\n- Easily adjust spot colours and apply them throughouta document with basic colour-match settings.\\n\\n<b>Reduce your environmental impact.<\/b>\\n- Conserve energy with Instant-on Technology, and save even more with HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technology.\\n- Conserve resources with the world\u2019s smallest colour laser printer.\\n- Get free and easy recycling \u2013 cartridges returned through HP Planet Partners are recycled responsibly.\\n- Print only the web content you need, neatly and accurately, with HP Smart Web Printing."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Ajoutez de la couleur haut de gamme \u00e0 vos documents avec une HP LaserJet abordable, sans fil et connect\u00e9e via Ethernet.<SUP>1<\/SUP> L'imprimante laser couleur la plus compacte de HP est \u00e9galement l'une des moins gourmandes en \u00e9nergie au monde.<SUP>2<\/SUP> Imprimez o\u00f9 que vous soyez avec HP ePrint.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>La couleur abordable avec une connexion sans fil.<SUP>1<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Imprimez \u00e0 partir de n'importe o\u00f9 dans le bureau gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connexion sans fil. Partagez les ressources d'impression au moyen de l'Ethernet int\u00e9gr\u00e9.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Concentrez-vous sur votre travail \u2013 impression mobile sans peine et r\u00e9glage rapide.<SUP>3<\/SUP><\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Avec HP ePrint, vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais imprimer depuis n'importe quel endroit.<SUP>3<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez votre impact environnemental.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;L'une des imprimantes laser couleur offrant le plus haut rendement \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique au monde.<SUP>2<\/SUP><br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Cr\u00e9ez et imprimez vos propres documents commerciaux.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Cr\u00e9ez du mat\u00e9riel marketing et trouvez des id\u00e9es pour vos projets d'impression gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 HP Creative Studio for Business.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> La connectivit\u00e9 Ethernet et le sans fil int\u00e9gr\u00e9s sont disponibles sur l'imprimante HP LaserJet Pro CP1025nw uniquement. Les performances sans fil d\u00e9pendent de l'environnement physique et de la distance au point d'acc\u00e8s et peuvent \u00eatre limit\u00e9es lors des connections VPN.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Consommation d'\u00e9nergie bas\u00e9e sur les calculs de TEC de la concurrence disponibles sur energystar.gov et eu-energystar.org pour les imprimantes laser couleur fonction unique en juin 2010. TEC bas\u00e9e sur une impression recto et une vitesse d'impression recto. La configuration individuelle du produit et son utilisation influencent la consommation.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> N\u00e9cessite une connexion Internet \u00e0 l'imprimante. Fonctionne avec tout p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique connect\u00e9 \u00e0 Internet et une messagerie \u00e9lectronique. Dur\u00e9es d'impression variables. Une mise \u00e0 niveau du micrologiciel peut \u00eatre n\u00e9cessaire pour certains mod\u00e8les HP LaserJet. Reportez-vous \u00e0 la liste des types de document et d'image pris en charge, voir www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter. Pour des solutions suppl\u00e9mentaires, reportez-vous \u00e0 la page www.hp.com\/go\/mobile-printing-solutions. Disponible uniquement sur l'imprimante couleur HP LaserJet Pro CP1025nw.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8b5444f8-d1c8-4527-8d1f-59b3fa86e712","identifier":"15609458","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet M401n"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Optimize your day-to-day workflow. Print on the go with mobile printing options, and share office printing resources on a network. Take advantage of fast print speeds.\\n\\nPrinting professional-quality documents at a great value, with outstanding networking and paper-saving features.\\n\\n<b>Enhanced productivity\u2014increased mobility<\/b>\\n- Print from virtually anywhere, using HP ePrint.\\n- Share printing resources with an Ethernet network.\\n- Boost productivity with print speeds up to 33 ppm A4 and 35 ppm letter.\\n- Reload paper less often with up to 250-sheet paper capacity.\\n\\n<b>Easy to install, easy to use<\/b>\\n- Install your printer fast\u2014there's no CD required with HP Smart Install.\\n- Operate your printer with ease, using the 2-line display.\\n- Receive consistent results with Original HP LaserJet toner cartridges and reorder with HP SureSupply.\\n- Easily control your print environment with market-leading management tools.\\n\\n<b>Professional-quality output for a great value<\/b>\\n- Produce professional-quality business prints with bold, crisp text and sharp images.\\n- Depend on a printer with a 50,000-page recommended monthly page volume\u2014the ideal fit for reliable printing.\\n- Save money by saving energy\u2014HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technology powers your printer up and down automatically.\\n- Save time with easy-to-install Original HP cartridges, and save more with high-capacity cartridges.\\n\\n<b>Reduced environmental impact<\/b>\\n- Reduce energy use with HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technology.\\n- Easily recycle Original HP LaserJet toner cartridges through HP Planet Partners.\\n- Reduce packaging waste\u2014Original HP LaserJet toner cartridges ship in the printer."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-27T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6d43e5d5-8031-4b65-998d-5d647b7a70c2","identifier":"15620134","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","microsoft","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1920_x_1080"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Microsoft LifeCam Studio"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Zum Greifen nah<\/b>\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie die hervorragende HD-Videoqualit\u00e4t der LifeCam Studio mit 1080p-HD-Sensor. Ein gutes Video bedeutet aber mehr als nur HD-Qualit\u00e4t. Halten Sie dank Autofokus Ihr Motiv immer scharf \u2013 von 10 cm bis unendlich. Genie\u00dfen Sie mit der LifeCam-Pr\u00e4zisionslinse mit Glaselementen ausgewogene Weitwinkelaufnahmen. Die LifeCam ist mit der TrueColor-Technologie ausgestattet, damit Sie noch einfacher brillante Filme erstellen k\u00f6nnen. Ihre Videos bestechen bei nahezu allen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen durch kr\u00e4ftige Farben und dank ClearFrame-Technologie durch scharfe und fl\u00fcssige Bilder. Mit dem integrierten HiFi-Mikrofon k\u00f6nnen Sie all dies noch mit lebendigen Kl\u00e4ngen kombinieren."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>The Closest to Being There<\/b>\\nEnjoy a superior HD video quality with the LifeCam Studio, which includes a 1080p HD sensor. But great video is about more than HD. Keep your subject crisp with autofocus, from four inches to infinity. Shoot with great accuracy in wide angle with the LifeCam precision glass element lens. And, to make filming even easier, LifeCam features TrueColor Technology, which means your video remains bright and colorful in virtually all light conditions while ClearFrame Technology provides smooth and detailed footage. Use the built-in High-Fidelity Microphone to bring it all together: the vivid sights, colors, and sounds of real life."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Vivez une nouvelle exp\u00e9rience<\/b>\\nB\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une qualit\u00e9 vid\u00e9o HP sup\u00e9rieure avec LifeCam Studio, qui comprend un capteur HP 1080p. Mais la qualit\u00e9 vid\u00e9o va bien au-del\u00e0 de la HD. Faites en sorte que vos sujets soient toujours nets gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la mise au point automatique, de 10 cm \u00e0 l'infini. Profitez d'un grand angle avec la lentille en verre haute pr\u00e9cision LifeCam. Et pour faciliter la prise de vid\u00e9o, LifeCam offre la technologie TrueColor, qui signifie que votre vid\u00e9o demeure brillante et color\u00e9e dans presque toutes les conditions de luminosit\u00e9. La technologie ClearFrame, quant \u00e0 elle, fournit des images fluides et d\u00e9taill\u00e9es. Profitez de la technologie ClearFrame et TrueColor pour une vid\u00e9o nette et claire m\u00eame en cas de faible luminosit\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-29T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8aabaf79-8e85-440a-9544-717e2ba12ec7","identifier":"15655763","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["hp","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP LaserJet Pro M401dw"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Arbeiten Sie produktiver. Dank integrierter Wireless-Netzwerktechnologie k\u00f6nnen Sie den Drucker \u00fcberall im B\u00fcro konfigurieren<SUP>1<\/SUP><SUP>2<\/SUP> und Druckressourcen im Netzwerk<SUP>3<\/SUP> bereitstellen. Mobildruckoptionen erlauben das Drucken von unterwegs<SUP>3<\/SUP>. \u00dcber Gesch\u00e4ftsanwendungen (Business Apps) k\u00f6nnen Sie webbasiert drucken<SUP>4<\/SUP><SUP>5<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Arbeiten Sie produktiver und schneller mit Hilfe der Wireless-Netzwerktechnologie und eindrucksvoller Mobilit\u00e4t.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Wireless-Konnektivit\u00e4t erm\u00f6glicht die Verbindung zum Drucker und die Druckerfreigabe \u00fcberall im B\u00fcro<SUP>2<\/SUP>,<SUP>3<\/SUP>. Die Netzwerkkonfiguration ist im Handumdrehen erledigt<SUP>1<\/SUP>,<SUP>6<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erleben Sie webbasierte Benutzerfreundlichkeit.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Gesch\u00e4ftsanwendungen (Business Apps) und ein Farb-Touchscreen Display mit 8,89 cm (3,5 Zoll) Diagonale erm\u00f6glichen den Internetzugriff und webbasiertes Drucken<SUP>4<\/SUP>,<SUP>5<\/SUP>, z. B. mit Google Docs \u00a92012 Google.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Erstellen Sie Ausdrucke in professioneller Qualit\u00e4t zum g\u00fcnstigen Preis.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Produzieren Sie hochwertige Gesch\u00e4ftsdokumente mit gestochen scharfem Text und klaren Abbildungen.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>F\u00fcr eine geringere Umweltbelastung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Sparen Sie Energie mit der HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off-Technologie, die Ihren Drucker nach Bedarf ein- oder ausschaltet<SUP>7<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Nur beim Modell M401dw verf\u00fcgbar.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Die Leistung beim kabellosen Einsatz ist abh\u00e4ngig von den Umgebungsbedingungen und der Entfernung vom Zugangspunkt und ist w\u00e4hrend aktiver VPN-Verbindungen wom\u00f6glich eingeschr\u00e4nkt.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Nur bei den Modellen M401n, M401dn und M401dw verf\u00fcgbar.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> Nur bei den Modellen M401dn und M401dw verf\u00fcgbar.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>5<\/SUP><i> Erfordert Wireless Access Point und Internetverbindung zum Drucker. Einige Services erfordern ggf. eine Registrierung. Verf\u00fcgbarkeit variiert je nach Land, Sprache und Vereinbarungen und erfordert eine Firmware-Aktualisierung. Ausf\u00fchrliche Infos finden Sie unter www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>6<\/SUP><i> HP Auto Wireless Connect ist unter Umst\u00e4nden nicht f\u00fcr alle Systemkonfigurationen verf\u00fcgbar. Die Wireless-Leistung ist abh\u00e4ngig von den Umgebungsbedingungen und der Entfernung zum Access Point. Informationen zur Kompatibilit\u00e4t finden Sie unter www.hp.com\/go\/autowirelessconnect.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>7<\/SUP><i> Die Funktionen der HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off Technologie h\u00e4ngen vom Drucker und den Einstellungen ab.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sparen Sie Zeit durch produktiven Wireless-Druck und Optionen f\u00fcr mobiles Drucken.\\n<b>Wireless-Produktivit\u00e4t \u2013 eindrucksvolle Mobilit\u00e4t<\/b>\\n\\nHohe Druckgeschwindigkeiten steigern die Produktivit\u00e4t. Die Papierzuf\u00fchrungskapazit\u00e4t ist bis auf 300 Blatt erweiterbar.\\n\\n<b>Webbasierte Benutzerfreundlichkeit<\/b>\\nEinfache Steuerung der Druckumgebung mit marktf\u00fchrenden Verwaltungstools.\\n\\n<b>Erstellen Sie Ausdrucke in professioneller Qualit\u00e4t zum g\u00fcnstigen Preis.<\/b>\\nMit der Papierzuf\u00fchrungskapazit\u00e4t von 300 Blatt (800 Blatt insgesamt mit optionalem 500-Blatt-Fach) m\u00fcssen Sie seltener Papier nachf\u00fcllen.\\n\\n<b>F\u00fcr eine geringere Umweltbelastung.<\/b>\\nWeniger Verpackungsabfall: Die Original HP Toner-Druckkassette HP 80 A ist bei der Lieferung schon im Drucker installiert."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Exploitez davantage votre journ\u00e9e de travail. Installez n'importe o\u00f9 au bureau l'aide de la mise en r\u00e9seau int\u00e9gr\u00e9e sans fil,<SUP>1<\/SUP><SUP>2<\/SUP> et partagez les ressources d'impression sur un r\u00e9seau<SUP>3<\/SUP>. Imprimez en d\u00e9placement avec les options d'impression mobiles<SUP>3<\/SUP>. Utilisez les applications professionnelles pour acc\u00e9der au Web et imprimer \u00e0 partir du Web.<SUP>4<\/SUP><SUP>5<\/SUP><br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Restez productifs et stimulez vos activit\u00e9s avec la mise en r\u00e9seau sans fil et la mobilit\u00e9 impressionnante.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Configurez et partagez n'importe o\u00f9 au bureau avec la connectivit\u00e9 sans fil<SUP>2<\/SUP>,<SUP>3<\/SUP>. Configurez la mise en r\u00e9seau rapide<SUP>1<\/SUP>,<SUP>6<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Exp\u00e9rimentez la facilit\u00e9 d'utilisation connect\u00e9e \u00e0 Internet.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Utilisez des applications professionnelles et l'\u00e9cran couleur tactile de 8,89 cm (3,5 pouces) pour acc\u00e9der au Web et imprimer des informations<SUP>4<\/SUP>,<SUP>5<\/SUP>, par exemple, Google Docs \u00a9 2012 Google.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'un r\u00e9sultat de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle \u00e0 un prix remarquable.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Produisez des documents de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle avec du texte gras et pr\u00e9cis et des images nettes.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>R\u00e9duisez votre impact environnemental.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;\u00c9conomisez l'\u00e9nergie\u00a0avec la technologie HP\u00a0Auto-On\/Auto-Off qui met l'imprimante sous tension lorsque vous en avez besoin et l'\u00e9teint lorsque vous n'en avez plus besoin<SUP>7<\/SUP>.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Disponible sur le mod\u00e8le M401dw uniquement.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>2<\/SUP><i> Les performances sans fil d\u00e9pendent de l'environnement physique et de la distance au point d'acc\u00e8s et peuvent \u00eatre limit\u00e9es lors des connexions VPN.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>3<\/SUP><i> Disponible sur les mod\u00e8les M401n, M401dn etM401dw uniquement.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>4<\/SUP><i> Disponible sur les mod\u00e8les M401dn etM401dw uniquement.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>5<\/SUP><i> N\u00e9cessite un point d'acc\u00e8s sans fil et une connexion Internet \u00e0 l'imprimante. Les services peuvent n\u00e9cessiter une inscription. Les disponibilit\u00e9s varient selon la r\u00e9gion g\u00e9ographique, la langue et les contrats. Une mise \u00e0 niveau du micrologiciel peut s'av\u00e9rer n\u00e9cessaire. Pour plus d'informations, rendez-vous sur le site www.hp.com\/go\/eprintcenter.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>6<\/SUP><i> La connexion sans fil HP Auto peut ne pas \u00eatre disponible pour toutes les configurations syst\u00e8me. Les performances sans fil d\u00e9pendent de l'environnement physique et de la distance par rapport au point d'acc\u00e8s. Pour plus d'informations sur la compatibilit\u00e9, consultez le site www.hp.com\/go\/autowirelessconnect.<br \/>\\n<\/i><SUP>7<\/SUP><i> Les fonctions HP Auto-On\/Auto-Off et d\u00e9pendent de l'imprimante et des param\u00e8tres.<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-09-29T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7437db66-855e-434c-a308-025b13e161b5","identifier":"15660870","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["dell","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"DELL 5130cdn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Discover excellent print quality, exceptional value and outstanding reliability with the blazing-fast DellTM 5130cdn Colour Laser Printer.\\n\\n- High Performance: Up to 45 ppm (A4) (actual print speed will vary with use), excellent print quality\\n- High Productivity: Monthly duty cycle of up to 110,000 pages\\n- Lasting Value: Low cost per page; energy-conscious design\\nSuperb Performance\\nThe Dell 5130cdn Colour Laser Printer slashes printing and waiting time while delivering high-quality laser prints.\\n\\nBlazing Print Speeds: The Dell 5130cdn delivers A4-sized pages at a speed of up to 45 ppm (pages per minute) in both mono and colour. (Actual print speeds will vary with use.) Print duplex pages at up to 36 ppm (A4) in both mono and colour. (Actual print speeds will vary with use.)\\n- Fast Warm-Up: The Dell 5130cdn delivers a first-print-out time (FPOT) as fast as 8.5 seconds in mono and 10 seconds in colour.\\n- Excellent Print Quality: ColourbyDell technology incorporates an innovative print engine, advanced image-enhancement algorithm and advanced toner technology to deliver brilliant colour printouts with crisp, clear text.\\n- Rich, Glossy Colour Images: Advanced EA-Eco Toner emulsion aggregation process saturates paper with superfine toner particles for brilliant colour reproduction.\\n\\nDesigned to help control print and office expenses, the Dell 5130cdn offers one of the most compelling total costs of printing (TCOP) and costs per page (CPP) in the industry.\\nCost-Effective Controls:\\nDell ColourTrack Pro technology can lower your total cost of printing by remotely defining colour-printing rights and setting print-volume limitations.\\n\\nPower-Efficient Design:\\nEnergy Star\u00ae 1.1 qualified, the Dell 5130cdn Colour Printer reduces power consumption up to 31% compared to the previous-generation Dell 5110cn with the new EA-Eco Toners."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-01T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cbb48918-4b7a-461c-8804-a4b48c1f62be","identifier":"15663633","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["canon","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon i-SENSYS LBP6020"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Compact, energy-efficient desktop mono laser printer<\/b>\\n\\nA space saving, affordable mono laser printer that\u2019s perfect for personal use. Delivering quality, maintenance-free prints, this energy-saving device is easy to use and exceptionally quiet.\\n\\n- Space-saving design\\n- 18 ppm, 7.8 seconds First Print Out Time\\n- Energy efficient\\n- Quiet operation\\n- All-in-One cartridge for maintenance free operation\\n\\n<b>Compact and space saving<\/b>\\n\\nDesigned to fit comfortably on the desk, this compact and affordable mono laser printer is perfect for personal use. Its sleek, space-saving design includes a retractable paper tray cover and keeps dimension to a mere 359 x 249 x 198 mm (W x D x H)\\n\\n<b>Productive performance<\/b>\\n\\nTake advantage of professional laser print speeds of 18 ppm. Canon\u2019s Quick First-Print technologies ensures quick recovery from sleep mode and with a First Print Out Time of just 7.8 seconds, you can quickly get back to what\u2019s important, without waiting around for your prints.\\n\\n<b>Exceptional laser quality<\/b>\\n\\nDeliver the sharpest, crispest text and most detailed graphics thanks to a print resolution of up to 2400 x 600 dpi with Automatic Image Refinement. Our MS (Magnetic Spherical) Toner has been specifically developed to deliver the optimum results print after print.\\n\\n<b>Efficient and quiet<\/b>\\n\\nThis energy efficient printer uses only 0.8 watts in sleep mode. A convenient front power switch makes it easy to turn off, cutting energy costs even further. Thanks to Canon\u2019s unique engine design, the i-SENSYS LBP6020 is silent in standby and exceptionally quiet during operation \u2013 so you can focus on your work without intrusion.\\n\\n<b>All-in-One cartridge<\/b>\\n\\nThe All-in-One recyclable cartridge ensures maintenance-free operation and continuous high quality output. Replace the compact cartridge in seconds \u2013 containing toner, drum and cleaning units \u2013 with an Authentic Canon Laser Cartridge and your printer is as good as new."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Imprimante laser noir et blanc de bureau, compacte et \u00e9conome en \u00e9nergie<\/b>\\n\\nImprimante laser noir et blanc compacte et \u00e9conomique, parfaite pour une utilisation personnelle. Impressions de qualit\u00e9 sans aucune maintenance gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ce p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique \u00e9conome en \u00e9nergie, simple \u00e0 utiliser et exceptionnellement silencieux.\\n\\n<b>Points forts<\/b>\\n- Design peu encombrant\\n- 18 ppm, premi\u00e8re sortie en 7,8 secondes\\n- Faible consommation d'\u00e9nergie\\n- Fonctionnement silencieux\\n- Cartouche Tout-en-Un pour un fonctionnement sans maintenance\\n\\n<b>Compacte, pour un encombrement r\u00e9duit<\/b>\\n\\nCon\u00e7ue pour \u00eatre plac\u00e9e sans difficult\u00e9 sur tous les bureaux, cette imprimante laser noir et blanc compacte et abordable est parfaite pour une utilisation personnelle. Design \u00e9pur\u00e9 et peu encombrant avec couvercle de bac \u00e0 papier r\u00e9tractable pour dimensions de seulement 359 \u00d7 249 \u00d7 198 mm (L \u00d7 P \u00d7 H).\\n\\n<b>Excellente productivit\u00e9<\/b>\\n\\nProfitez de tous les avantages d'une vitesse d'impression professionnelle de 18 ppm. Les technologies \u00ab Quick First Print \u00bb (premi\u00e8re impression rapide) Canon assurent une reprise rapide apr\u00e8s le mode veille : la premi\u00e8re impression est effectu\u00e9e en 7,8 secondes, ce qui vous permet de vous consacrer \u00e0 des t\u00e2ches plus importantes sans avoir \u00e0 attendre vos impressions.\\n\\n<b>Qualit\u00e9 laser exceptionnelle<\/b>\\n\\nObtenez un texte ultra net et des graphiques aux d\u00e9tails pr\u00e9cis gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution d'impression qui atteint 2400 \u00d7 600 dpi et \u00e0 la fonction de lissage automatique d'image. Notre toner MS (Magnetic Spherical - sph\u00e9rique magn\u00e9tique) est con\u00e7u pour produire des r\u00e9sultats exceptionnels, page apr\u00e8s page.\\n\\n<b>Faible consommation d'\u00e9nergie et fonctionnement silencieux<\/b>\\n\\nCette imprimante tr\u00e8s \u00e9conome en \u00e9nergie consomme seulement 0,8 watt en mode veille. L'interrupteur plac\u00e9 \u00e0 l'avant de l'imprimante permet de la mettre facilement hors tension, pour encore plus d'\u00e9conomies d'\u00e9nergie. Canon a mis au point un moteur exclusif qui permet \u00e0 l'i-SENSYS LBP6020 d'\u00eatre parfaitement silencieuse en veille et incroyablement peu bruyante pendant l'impression. Vous pourrez ainsi vous concentrer sur vos projets en cours sans \u00eatre d\u00e9rang\u00e9 par des bruits intempestifs.\\n\\n<b>Cartouche Tout-en-Un<\/b>\\n\\nLa cartouche Tout-en-Un recyclable garantit un fonctionnement sans entretien et des sorties d'une qualit\u00e9 constante. Quelques secondes suffisent \u00e0 remplacer la cartouche compacte (qui comprend le toner, le rouleau et les unit\u00e9s de nettoyage) par une cartouche laser Canon authentique, et votre p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique fonctionnera comme au premier jour."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-03T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d549c328-5c5a-414a-b53d-a2f97f068b0b","identifier":"15663634","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["canon","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon i-SENSYS LBP6020B"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Compact, energy-efficient desktop mono laser printer<\/b>\\n\\nA space saving, affordable mono laser printer that\u2019s perfect for personal use. Delivering quality, maintenance-free prints, this energy-saving device is easy to use and exceptionally quiet.\\n\\n- Space-saving design\\n- 18 ppm, 7.8 seconds First Print Out Time\\n- Energy efficient\\n- Quiet operation\\n- All-in-One cartridge for maintenance free operation\\n\\n<b>Compact and space saving<\/b>\\n\\nDesigned to fit comfortably on the desk, this compact and affordable mono laser printer is perfect for personal use. Its sleek, space-saving design includes a retractable paper tray cover and keeps dimension to a mere 359 x 249 x 198 mm (W x D x H)\\n\\n<b>Productive performance<\/b>\\n\\nTake advantage of professional laser print speeds of 18 ppm. Canon\u2019s Quick First-Print technologies ensures quick recovery from sleep mode and with a First Print Out Time of just 7.8 seconds, you can quickly get back to what\u2019s important, without waiting around for your prints.\\n\\n<b>Exceptional laser quality<\/b>\\n\\nDeliver the sharpest, crispest text and most detailed graphics thanks to a print resolution of up to 2400 x 600 dpi with Automatic Image Refinement. Our MS (Magnetic Spherical) Toner has been specifically developed to deliver the optimum results print after print.\\n\\n<b>Efficient and quiet<\/b>\\n\\nThis energy efficient printer uses only 0.8 watts in sleep mode. A convenient front power switch makes it easy to turn off, cutting energy costs even further. Thanks to Canon\u2019s unique engine design, the i-SENSYS LBP6020 is silent in standby and exceptionally quiet during operation \u2013 so you can focus on your work without intrusion.\\n\\n<b>All-in-One cartridge<\/b>\\n\\nThe All-in-One recyclable cartridge ensures maintenance-free operation and continuous high quality output. Replace the compact cartridge in seconds \u2013 containing toner, drum and cleaning units \u2013 with an Authentic Canon Laser Cartridge and your printer is as good as new."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Imprimante laser noir et blanc de bureau, compacte et \u00e9conome en \u00e9nergie<\/b>\\n\\nImprimante laser noir et blanc compacte et \u00e9conomique, parfaite pour une utilisation personnelle. Impressions de qualit\u00e9 sans aucune maintenance gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ce p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique \u00e9conome en \u00e9nergie, simple \u00e0 utiliser et exceptionnellement silencieux.\\n\\n<b>Points forts<\/b>\\n- Design peu encombrant\\n- 18 ppm, premi\u00e8re sortie en 7,8 secondes\\n- Faible consommation d'\u00e9nergie\\n- Fonctionnement silencieux\\n- Cartouche Tout-en-Un pour un fonctionnement sans maintenance\\n\\n<b>Compacte, pour un encombrement r\u00e9duit<\/b>\\n\\nCon\u00e7ue pour \u00eatre plac\u00e9e sans difficult\u00e9 sur tous les bureaux, cette imprimante laser noir et blanc compacte et abordable est parfaite pour une utilisation personnelle. Design \u00e9pur\u00e9 et peu encombrant avec couvercle de bac \u00e0 papier r\u00e9tractable pour dimensions de seulement 359 \u00d7 249 \u00d7 198 mm (L \u00d7 P \u00d7 H).\\n\\n<b>Excellente productivit\u00e9<\/b>\\n\\nProfitez de tous les avantages d'une vitesse d'impression professionnelle de 18 ppm. Les technologies \u00ab Quick First Print \u00bb (premi\u00e8re impression rapide) Canon assurent une reprise rapide apr\u00e8s le mode veille : la premi\u00e8re impression est effectu\u00e9e en 7,8 secondes, ce qui vous permet de vous consacrer \u00e0 des t\u00e2ches plus importantes sans avoir \u00e0 attendre vos impressions.\\n\\n<b>Qualit\u00e9 laser exceptionnelle<\/b>\\n\\nObtenez un texte ultra net et des graphiques aux d\u00e9tails pr\u00e9cis gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une r\u00e9solution d'impression qui atteint 2400 \u00d7 600 dpi et \u00e0 la fonction de lissage automatique d'image. Notre toner MS (Magnetic Spherical - sph\u00e9rique magn\u00e9tique) est con\u00e7u pour produire des r\u00e9sultats exceptionnels, page apr\u00e8s page.\\n\\n<b>Faible consommation d'\u00e9nergie et fonctionnement silencieux<\/b>\\n\\nCette imprimante tr\u00e8s \u00e9conome en \u00e9nergie consomme seulement 0,8 watt en mode veille. L'interrupteur plac\u00e9 \u00e0 l'avant de l'imprimante permet de la mettre facilement hors tension, pour encore plus d'\u00e9conomies d'\u00e9nergie. Canon a mis au point un moteur exclusif qui permet \u00e0 l'i-SENSYS LBP6020 d'\u00eatre parfaitement silencieuse en veille et incroyablement peu bruyante pendant l'impression. Vous pourrez ainsi vous concentrer sur vos projets en cours sans \u00eatre d\u00e9rang\u00e9 par des bruits intempestifs.\\n\\n<b>Cartouche Tout-en-Un<\/b>\\n\\nLa cartouche Tout-en-Un recyclable garantit un fonctionnement sans entretien et des sorties d'une qualit\u00e9 constante. Quelques secondes suffisent \u00e0 remplacer la cartouche compacte (qui comprend le toner, le rouleau et les unit\u00e9s de nettoyage) par une cartouche laser Canon authentique, et votre p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique fonctionnera comme au premier jour."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-03T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"bfb7cf42-f10d-4570-8356-98d4c47160cc","identifier":"15668737","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["kyocera","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kyocera FS-4300DN"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Geringste Druckkosten seiner Klasse\\n- Bis zu 60 Seiten A4 pro Minute\\n- 600 Blatt Papierkapazit\u00e4t, maximal 2.600 Blatt\\n- Integrierte Duplex-Einheit f\u00fcr beidseitigen Druck\\n- USB 2.0- und GigaBit-Netzwerkschnittstelle\\n- 5-zeiliges LCD und alphanumerischer Tastenblock\\n- Niedriger Stromverbrauch (gemessen am TEC-Wert)\\n- Klimaneutraler KYOCERA Toner*\\n\\nMit einer rasanten Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 60 Seiten pro Minute ist der FS-4300DN die ideale Alternative f\u00fcr alle, die nach maximaler Leistungsf\u00e4higkeit suchen und dabei nicht auf extrem niedrige Druck- und Energiekosten verzichten wollen. Der zuverl\u00e4ssige FS-4300DN ist geradezu pr\u00e4destiniert f\u00fcr gro\u00dfe Arbeitsgruppen mit hohem Druckaufkommen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Power up your department with our premium A4 network device\\n\\n- Up to 60 pages per minute in A4 with up to 1,200 dpi resolution\\n- Gigabit network functionality as standard\\n- Lowest power consumption (TEC) in its class\\n- Duplex printing and N-up printing reduces paper consumption\\n- Up to 6 paper trays for superior flexibility and high capacity\\n- Alphanumeric keyboard for easy password entering (Private Print)\\n- Convenient printing directly from USB Flash memory device\\n- Data Security Kit E provides high level security for optional HD-6\\n- Long-life drum and developer lasts for 500,000 pages A4\\n- Exceptionally low printing costs in its class\\n\\nThis very powerful printer, designed for high print volumes is capable of delivering up to 60 ppm. It is easily integrated into your network and can be equiped with paper capacity of up to 2,600 pages. Long life components guarantee tough durable performance that results in incredibly low printing costs and environmental impact."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"15b7103b-57bf-484f-9c14-0b4685915f18","identifier":"15668739","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["kyocera","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kyocera FS-4100DN"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Geringste Druckkosten seiner Klasse\\n- Bis zu 45 Seiten A4 pro Minute\\n- 600 Blatt Papierkapazit\u00e4t, maximal 2.600 Blatt\\n- Integrierte Duplex-Einheit f\u00fcr beidseitigen Druck\\n- USB 2.0- und GigaBit-Netzwerkschnittstelle\\n- 5-zeiliges LCD und alphanumerischer Tastenblock\\n- Niedriger Stromverbrauch (gemessen am TEC-Wert)\\n- Klimaneutraler KYOCERA Toner\\n\\nDer FS-4100DN besticht durch extrem niedrige Druck- und Energiekosten sowie mit integrierter Kostenstellenfunktion und modernen Sicherheitstechnologien. Er wird damit zum Allround-Talent f\u00fcr kleine und gro\u00dfe Arbeitsgruppen in B\u00fcroumgebungen, die Wert auf Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit und komfortables Arbeiten legen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Flexibility and high performance for workgroups<\/b>\\n\\n- Up to 45 pages per minute in A4 with up to 1,200 dpi resolution\\n- Gigabit network functionality as standard\\n- Double-sided- and N-up-printing reduces paper consumption\\n- A6 printing from internal paper cassette\\n- 500 sheet paper output capacity for continuous printing\\n- Alphanumeric keypad for easy password entering (Private Print)\\n- Convenient printing directly from USB Flash memory device\\n- Optional paper feeders for increased capacity and flexibility\\n- Exceptionally low printing costs in its class\\n\\nThis fast printer is capable of printing 45 ppm in B\/W and will slot into any network environment. It boasts enhanced security features with card authentication, private print and hard disk protection. Enhanced paperhandling capabilities will give extra benefit to your team. With long life components, it has an exceptionally low running costs and environmental impact."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f088ed88-83ba-4242-baaa-3697ad0e1e03","identifier":"15687718","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["kyocera","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kyocera FS-4300DN"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Geringste Druckkosten seiner Klasse\\n- Bis zu 60 Seiten A4 pro Minute\\n- 600 Blatt Papierkapazit\u00e4t, maximal 2.600 Blatt\\n- Integrierte Duplex-Einheit f\u00fcr beidseitigen Druck\\n- USB 2.0- und GigaBit-Netzwerkschnittstelle\\n- 5-zeiliges LCD und alphanumerischer Tastenblock\\n- Niedriger Stromverbrauch (gemessen am TEC-Wert)\\n- Klimaneutraler KYOCERA Toner*\\n\\nMit einer rasanten Geschwindigkeit von bis zu 60 Seiten pro Minute ist der FS-4300DN die ideale Alternative f\u00fcr alle, die nach maximaler Leistungsf\u00e4higkeit suchen und dabei nicht auf extrem niedrige Druck- und Energiekosten verzichten wollen. Der zuverl\u00e4ssige FS-4300DN ist geradezu pr\u00e4destiniert f\u00fcr gro\u00dfe Arbeitsgruppen mit hohem Druckaufkommen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Power up your department with our premium A4 network device\\n\\n- Up to 60 pages per minute in A4 with up to 1,200 dpi resolution\\n- Gigabit network functionality as standard\\n- Lowest power consumption (TEC) in its class\\n- Duplex printing and N-up printing reduces paper consumption\\n- Up to 6 paper trays for superior flexibility and high capacity\\n- Alphanumeric keyboard for easy password entering (Private Print)\\n- Convenient printing directly from USB Flash memory device\\n- Data Security Kit E provides high level security for optional HD-6\\n- Long-life drum and developer lasts for 500,000 pages A4\\n- Exceptionally low printing costs in its class\\n\\nThis very powerful printer, designed for high print volumes is capable of delivering up to 60 ppm. It is easily integrated into your network and can be equiped with paper capacity of up to 2,600 pages. Long life components guarantee tough durable performance that results in incredibly low printing costs and environmental impact."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-06T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1994c2f2-4770-4d85-a302-609d2b8e3721","identifier":"15687720","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["kyocera","laser_led_printers","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kyocera FS-2100DN"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Geringste Druckkosten seiner Klasse\\n- Bis zu 40 Seiten A4 pro Minute\\n- 600 Blatt Papierkapazit\u00e4t, maximal 2.600 Blatt\\n- Integrierte Duplex-Einheit f\u00fcr beidseitigen Druck\\n- USB 2.0- und GigaBit-Netzwerkschnittstelle\\n- 5-zeiliges LCD und alphanumerischer Tastenblock\\n- Niedriger Stromverbrauch (gemessen am TEC-Wert)\\n- Klimaneutraler KYOCERA Toner*\\n\\nDer netzwerkf\u00e4hige FS-2100DN sorgt mit der ressourcenschonenden ECOSYS-Technologie f\u00fcr die g\u00fcnstigsten Seitenpreise seiner Klasse und einen niedrigen Energieverbrauch. Der kompakte Drucker mit integrierter Duplex-Einheit und 600 Blatt Papierkapazit\u00e4t findet seinen Einsatz in kleineren Arbeitsgruppen und B\u00fcroumgebungen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>The advanced network printer for workgroups<\/b>\\n\\n- Up to 40 pages per minute in A4 with up to 1,200 dpi resolution\\n- Gigabit network functionality as standard\\n- Standard duplex unit for double-sided printing\\n- 100-sheet multi-purpose tray, 500-sheet universal cassette\\n- 5 line LCD display for easy navigation and clear messages\\n- 256 MB RAM for advanced functionality (Private Print)\\n- Convenient printing directly from USB Flash memory device\\n- Optional paper feeders for increased capacity and flexibility\\n- Exceptionally low printing costs in its class\\n\\nThis printer is aimed at smaller teams and workgroups and is capable of printing 40 ppm in B\/W. Its Gigabit interface is easily integrated into any network. The flexible paper handling allows to add four additional paper feeders to the device. Long life components mean running costs and environmental impact are both exceptionally low."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-06T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"762681aa-6bc7-49bb-b3b9-13d473201e3a","identifier":"1568805","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips Flash audio video player 4GB"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Genie\u00dfen Sie Ihre Videos unterwegs<\/b>\\nmit FullSound f\u00fcr herausragende Audioqualit\u00e4t\\n\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie die bestm\u00f6gliche Audioqualit\u00e4t mit dem digitalen Philips GoGear Audio-\/Video-Player SA3245 mit der patentierten FullSound-Technologie von Philips. H\u00f6ren Sie MP3- und WMA-Musik, und sehen Sie Videos auf einem 1,8\"-Farbbildschirm\u00a0\u2013 zuhause und unterwegs.\\n\\n<b>Erleben Sie Musik und Video - jederzeit, \u00fcberall<\/b>\\n- MP3- und WMA-Wiedergabe\\n- Erstellen Sie Sprachaufzeichnungen.\\n- Speichern Sie bis zu 20\u00a0UKW-Sender f\u00fcr noch mehr Musik\\n- Sehen Sie Ihre Lieblingsvideoclips unterwegs\\n- FullSound\u2122 f\u00fcr optimierte MP3-Soundqualit\u00e4t\\n\\n<b>Fotos und Videos\u00a0\u2013 immer griffbereit<\/b>\\n- 1,8\"-Farbbildschirm f\u00fcr einfache Navigation und Fotoanzeige\\n- Genie\u00dfen Sie Videodateien mit einer Aufl\u00f6sung von 220\u00a0x\u00a0176\u00a0Pixel\\n- Philips Media Converter zur Konvertierung von Video- und Fotodateien\\n\\n<b>Maximale Unterhaltung unterwegs<\/b>\\n- Bis zu 20\u00a0Stunden Musikwiedergabe\\n- Schnelles Herunterladen vom PC \u00fcber USB 2.0"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Enjoy your videos on the move<\/b>\\nwith FullSound for superb audio quality\\n\\nIndulge in the best possible audio quality with the Philips GoGear digital audio\/ video player SA3245 featuring Philips' patented FullSound technology. Enjoy MP3 and WMA music and view videos on the 1.8\" color screen wherever you go.\\n\\n<b>Experience music and video - anytime, anyplace<\/b>\\n- Enjoy MP3 and WMA playback\\n- Make voice recordings\\n- Preset up to 20 FM radio stations for more music\\n- Watch your favorite movie clips on the go*\\n- FullSound\u2122 for enhanced MP3 sound quality\\n\\n<b>Photos and videos at your fingertips<\/b>\\n- 1.8\" color screen for easy navigation and photo viewing\\n- Enjoy video files in 220x176 pixels resolution\\n- Philips Media Converter for video file and photo conversion\\n\\n<b>All your entertainment on the go<\/b>\\n- Up to 20-hour music playback\\n- Fast downloads from your PC via USB 2.0"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Profitez de vos vid\u00e9os lors de vos d\u00e9placements\\nAvec FullSound, pour une qualit\u00e9 audio hors du commun<\/b>\\n\\nProfitez d'une qualit\u00e9 sonore exceptionnelle gr\u00e2ce au baladeur audio\/vid\u00e9o Philips GoGear SA3225 dot\u00e9 de la technologie FullSound brevet\u00e9e par Philips. \u00c9coutez vos morceaux MP3 et WMA et visionnez vos vid\u00e9os sur son \u00e9cran couleur 1,8 pouce lors de tous vos d\u00e9placements.\\n\\nLa musique et les films \u00e0 tout moment et en tout lieu\\n- Lecture MP3 et WMA\\n- Enregistrements vocaux\\n- Pr\u00e9s\u00e9lectionnez jusqu'\u00e0 20 stations radio FM pour encore plus de musique\\n- Regardez vos clips vid\u00e9o pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s n'importe o\u00f9*\\n- FullSound\u2122 pour une qualit\u00e9 sonore MP3 optimale\\n\\nDes photos et des vid\u00e9os au bout des doigts\\n- \u00c9cran couleur 4,6 cm pour naviguer et afficher vos photos en toute simplicit\u00e9\\n- Profitez de vos fichiers vid\u00e9o dans une r\u00e9solution de 220 x 176 pixels\\n- Philips Media Converter pour la conversion de fichiers vid\u00e9o et photo\\n\\nDivertissez-vous lors de vos d\u00e9placements\\n- Jusqu'\u00e0 20 heures de musique\\n- T\u00e9l\u00e9chargements rapides depuis votre PC via un port USB 2.0*"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-04-09T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0c0e4a99-f63c-41c2-80fb-adbe50a59910","identifier":"15703200","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["print_scan_sales","scanners","xerox"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Xerox Mobile Scanner"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Xerox Mobile Scanner. Packaging width: 91.43, Packaging height: 137.15"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0bbaa596-5918-45a1-b61c-ba7eb678ec52","identifier":"15705193","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung DA-E650"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Elegance and enhanced audio in harmony<\/b>\\nDiscover a home audio solution that looks as great as it sounds. The Samsung DA-E650 Audio Dock boasts a stylish horn-shaped design and allows you to dock two devices at the same time - whether they\u2019re Samsung mobile devices or others. And, with Bluetooth 3.0 and the advanced apt-X codec, you can enjoy it all with high sound-quality and fast data-streaming.\\n\\n<b>Key features:<\/b>\\n- Enjoy superior audio thanks to stylish horn design\\n- Get a streamlined and tidier look with hidden dock\\n- Play music wirelessly using Bluetooth connectivity\\n- Connect Samsung devices as well as Apple products\\n- Match amazing sounds with stunning looks\\n- The world\u2019s first dual docking audio system\\n- Enjoy fast and high-quality music\\n- Built-in subwoofer bass brings music to life\\n- Play music directly from USB sources\\n- Experience high-quality sound with premium speakers\\n- Make the most of Samsung Audio Dock app features"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Le premier syst\u00e8me Hi-fi avec double dock<\/b>\\nLe DA-E650 est le premier syst\u00e8me Hi-Fi avec double dock. Sa forme unique allie design et qualit\u00e9 sonore. La technologie Bluetooth 3.0 dot\u00e9e du codec apt-X permet le transfert de musique plus rapide sans perdre la qualit\u00e9 sonore d\u2019origine. Vous pourrez ainsi \u00e9couter votre musique sans fil en qualit\u00e9 CD.\\n\\n<b>Principales caract\u00e9ristiques:<\/b>\\n- Double dock d\u00e9pliable\\n- Bluetooth 3.0 pour une compatibilit\u00e9 compl\u00e8te\\n- Un son plus puissant avec le caisson de basse int\u00e9gr\u00e9\\n- Entr\u00e9e USB + Auxiliaire\\n- Alliez design et performance sonore\\n- Le premier syst\u00e8me Hi-fi avec double dock\\n- Profitez d\u2019un transfert rapide de vos musiques sans perdre en qualit\u00e9 sonore\\n- Un son plus puissant avec le caisson de basse int\u00e9gr\u00e9\\n- Ecoutez de la musique directement \u00e0 partir de sources USB\\n- D\u00e9couvrez un son de haute qualit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ses haut-parleurs en fibre de verre\\n- T\u00e9l\u00e9charger l\u2019application \u00abWireless Audio with dock Apps\u00bb\\n- Am\u00e9liorez votre exp\u00e9rience t\u00e9l\u00e9vis\u00e9e avec ce syst\u00e8me Hi-fi sans fil"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"616c2ec7-d8e2-442e-a2e2-8d57f481672b","identifier":"15705839","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark CS310dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Stunning Color. Smart for Business.<\/b>\\n\\nThe small and quiet Lexmark CS310dn network-ready color laser printer with 2-sided printing standard, a 800 MHz dual-core processor and 256MB of standard memory prints at up to 25 ppm black and color.\\n\\n<b>Freedom to Print on the Fly<\/b>\\n\\nWith the ability to print professional color-in-house, you\u2019ll save time and money typically spent on expensive, outside printing alternatives.\\n\\n<b>Professional Color Matching<\/b>\\n\\nLexmark Named Color Replacement and PANTONE calibration make it easy to develop a consistent brand image by accurately matching your colors.\\n\\n<b>High Resolution Graphics<\/b>\\n\\nWith up to true 1200x1200 dpi resolution, images and graphics stay crisp. Lexmark's Unison\u2122 Toner ensures consistent quality, too.\\n\\n<b>Super Fast and Quiet Output<\/b>\\n\\nQuickly print up to 25 pages per minute in black and color, plus produce a 1-page color document in as little as 11 seconds.\\n\\n<b>Reliable Performance<\/b>\\n\\nEasily print up to 5,000 pages per month, plus enjoy fewer maintenance hassles, thanks to our state-of-the-art paper handling."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3aeb5e91-8596-46c8-b4c7-9e3555671621","identifier":"15705859","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark MS610dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Power Up Your Business. Print to Impress.<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark MS610dn network-ready laser printer with internal 2-sided printing, 256MB of standard memory, 650-sheet input and a print speed of up to 50 ppm quickly and easily performs tasks.\\n\\n<b>Print Complex Documents Fast<\/b>\\nPrint documents with graphics and images effortlessly with up to 1.2 GB of upgradable memory, powerful 800 MHz dual-core processor and Gigabit Ethernet.\\n\\n<b>Get Work Done Quickly<\/b>\\nPrint up to 50 pages per minute\u2013plus get your first page in as little as 6.5 seconds.\\n\\n<b>Run Jobs without Interruption<\/b>\\nWith an input capacity of up to 2,300 sheets and ultra high yield toner cartridge options, you won\u2019t have to add paper or change cartridges as often.\\n\\n<b>Innovative Toner That Optimizes Performance<\/b>\\nGet greater system performance with Lexmark's Unison\u2122 Toner, which delivers consistent image quality from first to last print.\\n\\n<b>Print Anytime and Anywhere<\/b>\\nWith this system, you can print from desktops as well as mobile devices that can run applications."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ed985e4e-f0dd-461b-9abb-79dc5f1a7f81","identifier":"15705860","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"a4_210_x_297_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark MS610dtn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Power Up Your Business. Print to Impress.<\/b>\\n\\nThe Lexmark MS610dtn network-ready laser printer, internal 2-sided printing, 256MB of standard memory, 1,200-sheet input and a print speed of up to 50 ppm quickly and easily performs tasks.\\n\\n<b>Print Complex Documents Fast<\/b>\\n\\nPrint documents with graphics and images effortlessly with up to 1.2 GB of upgradable memory, powerful 800 MHz dual-core processor and Gigabit Ethernet.\\n\\n<b>Get Work Done Quickly<\/b>\\n\\nPrint up to 50 pages per minute\u2013plus get your first page in as little as 6.5 seconds.\\n\\n<b>Run Jobs without Interruption<\/b>\\n\\nWith an input capacity of up to 2,300 sheets and ultra high yield toner cartridge options, you won't have to add paper or change cartridges as often.\\n\\n<b>Innovative Toner that Optimizes Performance<\/b>\\n\\nGet greater system performance with Lexmark's Unison\u2122 Toner, which delivers consistent image quality from first to last print.\\n\\n<b>Print Anytime and Anywhere<\/b>\\n\\nWith this system, you can print from desktops as well as mobile devices that can run applications."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"92935f30-6453-42ef-8fec-ce172bc008ee","identifier":"15705878","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark MS812dn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Star Performer. Stellar Finish.<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark MS812dn network-ready laser printer with internal two-sided printing, 800 MHz processor, 512MB of memory standard and 650-sheet standard input has a print speed of up to 66 ppm.\\n\\n<b>Faster Processing<\/b>\\nImprove your print speeds by taking advantage of up to 2.5 GB of memory, an 800 MHz dual-core processor and Gigabit Ethernet.\\n\\n<b>Reliable High Performance<\/b>\\nPrint up to 50,000 pages per month, and enjoy fewer maintenance hassles with our state-of-the-art paper handling.\\n\\n<b>Keep Jobs Moving<\/b>\\nWith a maximum input capacity of up to 4,400 sheets and an extra high yield toner cartridge, you'll rarely have to add paper or change cartridges.\\n\\n<b>Spend Less Time Waiting<\/b>\\nPrint up to 66 pages per minute, and produce your first page in as little as 4 seconds.\\n\\n<b>Print on a Wide Range of Media<\/b>\\nWith built-in two-sided printing and the ability to print on diverse materials, you can do more for your business and use less paper."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3f8e6eb6-b57f-4361-a90a-1cc58c3e25dc","identifier":"15705882","enabled":true,"family":"laser_led_printers","categories":["laser_led_printers","lexmark","print_scan_sales"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_print_size":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"legal_216_x_356_mm_"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lexmark MS812dtn"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Star Performer. Stellar Finish.<\/b>\\nThe Lexmark MS812dtn network-ready laser printer with internal 2-sided printing, 800 MHz dual-core processor, 512MB of memory and 1,200-sheet standard input has a print speed of up to 70 ppm.\\n\\n<b>Faster Processing<\/b>\\nImprove your print speeds by taking advantage of up to 2.5 GB of memory, an 800 MHz dual-core processor and Gigabit Ethernet.\\n\\n<b>Reliable High Performance<\/b>\\nPrint up to 50,000 pages per month. Plus, enjoy fewer maintenance hassles with our state-of-the-art paper handling.\\n\\n<b>Keep Jobs Moving<\/b>\\nWith a maximum input capacity of up to 4,400 sheets and an extra high yield toner cartridge, you won\u2019t have to add paper or change cartridges as often.\\n\\n<b>Spend Less Time Waiting<\/b>\\nPrint up to 70 pages per minute, and produce your first page in as little as 4 seconds.\\n\\n<b>Print on a Wide Range of Media<\/b>\\nWith built-in 2-sided printing and the ability to print on diverse materials, you can do more for your business and use less paper."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:33:01+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1ef82327-be24-4564-a0d7-42acb56e8210","identifier":"15707222","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","ion_audio","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ION Audio Block Rocker"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Blast your music whenever and wherever you want: Block Rocker Bluetooth is a powerful and flexible all-in-one sound system for iOS devices, MP3 players, microphones and instruments.\\n\\nKeep the music cranked: Block Rocker Bluetooth's wireless capability means you can keep your iPad, iPhone, or other Bluetooth-enabled device right by your side as you blast your music. You can even listen to your favorite radio station or to the big game \u2014 just dial it in on Block Rocker Bluetooth\u2019s built-in AM\/FM radio. You can also plug in and crank up instruments, microphones and more. A high-quality microphone is included.\\n\\nBlock Rocker Bluetooth has a built-in battery with a charge indicator and will provide up to 50 hours of cordless sound. A power cord is also included for nonstop music. For ultimate portability, Block Rocker Bluetooth has rugged wheels and a telescoping handle.\\n\\nRock the block, wirelessly, with Block Rocker Bluetooth from ION Audio.\\n\\n- Streams music wirelessly from any Bluetooth music-playing device or phone\\n- Works with iPad, iPhone, iPod touch, Android devices, and more\\n- Powerful sound, perfect for parties, BBQs, drive-in movies and more\\n- Input for a microphone, instruments and other audio sources\\n- High-quality microphone included\\n- Built-in digital AM\/FM radio and retractable antenna\\n- USB port for charging iPad, iPhone, or other devices\\n- Built-in battery provides up to 50 hours of use\\n- Bluetooth range of up to 50 feet\\n- High-output powered 2-way speaker\\n- 1\/8-inch auxiliary input for amplifying other audio devices\\n- Recessed wheels and telescoping handle for portability\\n- Rugged design to withstand heavy use\\n- Perfect for use anywhere, indoors or outside\\n- Projects high-fidelity sound up to 150 feet away\\n- Built-in cradle for your smartphone, iPad, or other device"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-11T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0a6494d7-1521-4aa0-ac15-6cfcb2b93987","identifier":"15751164","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","spcinternet"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"SPCinternet 8150N MP3 player & recorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"SPCinternet 8150N. Player media type: flash-media. Display: LCD. Audio formats supported: MP3, WMA. Headphone connectivity: 3.5 mm. Supported radio bands: FM"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-18T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ade700eb-d074-4827-9838-3690bbeeab8b","identifier":"15751205","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","spcinternet"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"SPCinternet 8212V MP3 player & recorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"SPCinternet 8212V. Player media type: flash-media. Display: TFT. Audio formats supported: MP3, WMA. Headphone connectivity: 3.5 mm. Interface: USB 2.0"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-18T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1dd87ae3-5c53-414f-b915-5a44992f17ce","identifier":"15751232","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","spcinternet"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"SPCinternet 5074P MP5 t\u00e1ctil con c\u00e1mara"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"SPCinternet 5074P MP5 t\u00e1ctil con c\u00e1mara. Player media type: flash-media. Display: LCD. Audio formats supported: APE, MP3, MP4, WAV, WMA, Video formats supported: AVI, MKV, MP4, MPEG, RMVB, Image formats supported: BMP, GIF, JPG. Headphone connectivity: 3.5 mm. Supported radio bands: FM"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-18T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4cbadb31-47d5-42e5-9a74-f36449e69c1a","identifier":"15766437","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["hp","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Scanjet 7800 Document Sheet-feed Scanner"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit diesem starken Duplex-Dokumentenscanner lassen sich beidseitig gedruckte Dokumente und andere Vorlagen in leicht zu verwaltende digitale Dateien umwandeln. Dank 50-Blatt-Dokumentenzuf\u00fchrung kann der Scanner auch unbeaufsichtigt ein- oder beidseitig scannen: bis zu 25 S.\/Min. \/ 50 Bilder\/Min. Die Fehleinzugserkennung stellt sicher, dass jede Seite erfasst wird. Durch die Standardisierung von Scanprofilen und die Automatisierung von Alltagsaufgaben w\u00e4chst die Produktivit\u00e4t. F\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Ergebnisse bei Dokumentenscans jeder Art gibt es eine spezielle Funktion zur Optimierung der Bildqualit\u00e4t. Die mitgelieferten ISIS-\/TWAIN-Treiber, ScanSoft PaperPort und Kofax\u00ae VRS sorgen vom Start weg f\u00fcr optimale Produktivit\u00e4t."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Convert double-sided documents and more into easy-to-manage digital files with this powerful dual head scanner. Scan one or two-sided, unattended, at up to 25 ppm \/ 50 ipm with the 50-page feeder; misfeed detection ensures every page is captured. Maximise efficiency by customising scan profiles and automating regular jobs, and optimise image quality for clear results on all documents. Ensure productivity from the start with included ISIS\/TWAIN drivers, ScanSoft PaperPort and Kofax\u00ae VRS."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Convertissez des documents recto verso et plus en fichiers num\u00e9riques faciles \u00e0 g\u00e9rer avec ce puissant scanner \u00e0 double t\u00eate de num\u00e9risation. Num\u00e9risez recto ou recto verso, sans surveillance, jusqu'\u00e0 25 ppm \/ 50 ipm gr\u00e2ce au chargeur de documents de 50 pages\u00a0; la d\u00e9tection de d\u00e9faut d'alimentation garantit que chaque page est saisie. Profitez d'une efficacit\u00e9 optimale en personnalisant des profils de num\u00e9risation et en automatisant des travaux courants\u00a0; optimisez la qualit\u00e9 d'image pour des r\u00e9sultats nets sur tous les documents. Assurez votre productivit\u00e9 d\u00e8s le d\u00e9part avec les pilotes ISIS\/TWAIN fournis, ScanSoft PaperPort et Kofax\u00ae VRS."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fb90649e-adca-4cba-b47b-f3da2da81a8b","identifier":"1580395","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips GoGear Flash Audio Player 2GB"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Digitalmusik \u2013 jederzeit\\nmit FullSound f\u00fcr herausragende Audioqualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\n\\nDer digitale Philips GoGear Audio-Player SA2825 verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber die patentierte Philips FullSound Technologie und steht f\u00fcr optimale klangliche Wiedergabe Ihrer Musik. Genie\u00dfen Sie Ihre MP3 und WMA Musiktitel unterwegs mit diesem handlichen und eleganten Audio-Player.\\n\\nIhre Musik, Ihre Daten \u2013 jederzeit, \u00fcberall\\n- MP3- und WMA-Wiedergabe\\n- Erstellen Sie Sprachaufzeichnungen.\\n- Schnelles Herunterladen vom PC \u00fcber USB 2.0*\\n- Noch mehr Musikgenuss mit digitalem UKW-Radio\\n\\nSofort tragbar, sofort startklar\\n- Bis zu 20 Stunden Musikwiedergabe\\n- Titel einfach mit Drag-and-Drop kopieren \u2013 keine Software erforderlich\\n- Plug & Play-Datenspeicherung\\n\\nUnkompliziertes, intuitives Musikerlebnis\\n- Orderansicht zum raschen und m\u00fchelosen Suchen von Musiktiteln\\n- Equalizer f\u00fcr optimierten Sound in jeder Musikrichtung\\n- FullSound\u2122 f\u00fcr optimierte MP3-Soundqualit\u00e4t"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Digital music - anytime\\nwith FullSound for superb audio quality<\/b>\\n\\nFeaturing Philips patented FullSound technology, the Philips GoGear digital audio player SA2825 brings the best possible audio quality to your music. Enjoy your MP3 and WMA music with this fun-sized audio player on the go.\\n\\nYour music, your data - on the go, everyday\\n- Enjoy MP3 and WMA playback\\n- Make voice recordings\\n- Fast downloads from your PC via USB 2.0*\\n- Enjoy more music with digital FM radio\\n\\nReady to wear, ready to go\\n- Up to 20-hour music playback\\n- Simply drag and drop your songs \u2013 no software needed\\n- Plug and play data storage\\n\\nEasy, intuitive music experience\\n- Folder view to find songs in a simple, fast way\\n- Equalizer for optimized sound to suit your music style\\n- FullSound\u2122 brings CD listening experience to MP3"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>La musique num\u00e9rique \u00e0 tout moment\\nAvec FullSound, pour une qualit\u00e9 audio hors du commun<\/b>\\n\\nDot\u00e9 de la technologie FullSound brevet\u00e9e par Philips, le baladeur audio Philips GoGear SA2825 vous offre la meilleure qualit\u00e9 audio possible pour votre musique. \u00c9coutez vos fichiers musicaux MP3 et WMA lors de vos d\u00e9placements gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ce baladeur au format sympathique.\\n\\nEmportez votre musique et vos donn\u00e9es dans tous vos d\u00e9placements\\n- Lecture MP3 et WMA\\n- Enregistrements vocaux\\n- T\u00e9l\u00e9chargements rapides depuis votre PC via un port USB 2.0*\\n- Encore plus de musique gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la radio FM num\u00e9rique\\n\\nPr\u00eat \u00e0 porter, pr\u00eat \u00e0 emporter\\n- Jusqu'\u00e0 20 heures de musique\\n- Glissez-d\u00e9placez simplement vos chansons : aucun logiciel requis !\\n- Stockage de donn\u00e9es plug-and-play\\n\\nExp\u00e9rience musicale simple et intuitive\\n- Affichage des dossiers pour une recherche rapide et simple des pistes\\n- Pour un son optimal adapt\u00e9 \u00e0 votre style musical\\n- FullSound\u2122 pour une qualit\u00e9 sonore MP3 optimale"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-04-23T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"90966e05-e151-4234-a0f1-f886ddec35ae","identifier":"1588650","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","microsoft","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Microsoft LifeCam VX-700"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Die LifeCam VX-700 ist das ideale Einsteiger-Paket in die Welt der grenzenlosen Videokommunikation. Neben der LifeCam ist auch ein Mono-Headset mit integriertem Mikrofon im Lieferumfang enthalten. Die Installation geht schnell und einfach vonstatten: LifeCam mit der USB-Schnittstelle und Headset mit der Soundkarte verbinden, und schon k\u00f6nnen Sie sich ins Video-Vergn\u00fcgen st\u00fcrzen. Der praktische und robuste Befestigungsmechanismus erlaubt eine variable Aufstellung.\\n- Der gute Ton zum Videobild. \\n- Videoaufl\u00f6sung von 640x480 Pixel (VGA).\\n- Kompaktes Design.\\n- Kompatibel mit anderen Instant Messengern.\\n- Universalhalterung.\\n- Blitzschnelle Installation."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Now it\u2019s fast and easy to share real-time videos and photos with friends and family. And, with a High Definition 2.0 megapixel sensor and noise-canceling microphone, you\u2019ll think you\u2019re in the same room as your friends!\\n- Optimized for Windows Live Messenger.   \\n- 2.0 Megapixel Sensor.\\n- Universal Attachment Base.  \\n- Built-in Microphone.  \\n- Crystal-clear Audio.   \\n- Glass Element Lens."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-05-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"be07d7f1-53c6-489d-b6bc-69a226163f49","identifier":"1589564","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","sony","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony SNC-RX550"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 24 V\/DC 12 V"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>High-Performance Network Camera With 360 Degree Endless Rotation<\/b>\\nThe award-winning SNC-RX550 represents the mid-range of the SNC-RX Series and features a 26x optical zoom, enabling it to zoom in on small or distant objects with exceptional clarity. Combined with a 12x digital zoom, the SNC-RX550 delivers a maximum zoom of 312x.\\n\\nAll SNC-RX Series Network Dome Cameras feature built-in Intelligent Object Detection and Intelligent Motion Detection. They can also freely and endlessly rotate 360 degrees, allowing users to monitor the area surrounding the camera without interruption.\\n\\nAdvanced image processing technology offers a choice of three compression formats - JPEG, MPEG-4, and H.264 - so that users can choose the appropriate format to match their network environment and monitoring applications. A newly-developed \"Dual Encoding Capability\" also allows simultaneous streaming in JPEG and MPEG-4, further improving workflow flexibility.\\n\\nDesigned for 24\/7 operation, the SNC-RX Series incorporate a Day\/Night function, providing clear images even in 0.15 lx lighting conditions.\\nThe SNC-RX Series is the right choice for a wide variety of surveillance and monitoring applications, delivering efficient 24\/7 monitoring - anytime, anywhere, anyplace.\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-05-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":25}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"232e8b9c-781b-44d6-95d8-87cccb39fe3d","identifier":"15899053","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony Walkman 4GB E470"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Colour Variation<\/b>\\nUnique individuals deserve a Walkman\u00ae to call their own. With a wide range of colours to choose from, you can easily and effortlessly match your personality.\\n\\n<b>Bring it anywhere<\/b>\\nWhen we say portable music player, we really mean it. At 7.0mm slim, you can take it anywhere. The Walkman\u00ae E470 is your perfect fit for any occasion.\\n\\n<b>Groove to the beat<\/b>\\nEnjoy enhanced sound quality. The Automatic Level Control reproduces deep and rich distortion-free bass, even at high volumes.\\n\\n<b>Long commutes? No worries<\/b>\\nThe Walkman\u00ae E470 is built to last for 36 hours on MP3 playback. So you'll never have to worry about travelling without your favourite tunes.\\n\\n<b>Transfer all your content with ease<\/b>\\nWith the 'Media Go' application, you can easily transfer your favourite music, videos, playlists and photos to your Walkman\u00ae E470. Simply drag and drop your content from Windows Explorer or iTunes.\\n\\n<b>Endless entertainment<\/b>\\nBe mentally stimulated for hours with the preloaded games. You can now listen to your favourite tunes while playing games, all on the go."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-26T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3d0f2433-9767-4466-9f90-bd1c2164e551","identifier":"15899054","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony Walkman NWZ-E473K 4GB"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Share your sounds out loud<\/b>\\nEnjoy all the richness and detail of Walkman\u00ae sound, wherever you are and whatever you're doing. The colourful, style-matched portable speaker dock lets everyone enjoy your favourite music: it's a great way to get the party started... or just relax with your perfect soundtrack.\\n\\n<b>Share your sounds<\/b>\\nLet everyone enjoy your favourite sounds\u2026 at home, in the garden, or while you're on holiday. Walkman\u00ae comes with its own colour-matching portable speaker dock that's tuned for clear sound with satisfying, solid bass.\\n\\n<b>Listen for longer<\/b>\\nKeep on listening with generous battery life. Enjoy up to 36 hours music playback from a single charge - enough to keep you going on the longest journeys.\\n\\n- Share your music with supplied speaker dock - Walkman\u00ae battery powers the style-matching portable speaker dock; Digital Clear Phase technology ensures clear sound with rich bass.\\n- Clear Audio technologies for legendary sound - Clear Stereo, Clear Bass and DSEE, plus EX headphones get the best from your music collection, even heavily compressed music files.\\n- Get millions of great tracks with Music Unlimited - Stream a huge range of hits, classics, new releases and ad-free radio channels (see www.musicunlimited.com\/legal for availability).\\n- Listen for longer - Help lengthy journeys slip by, with up to 36 hours music playback or 6 hours video playback from a single battery charge.\\n- Enjoy all your music library and more - Fill Walkman\u00ae with drag-and-drop music, video, playlist and photo transfers (non-DRM content) from Windows\u00ae Explorer or iTunes.\\n- Sculpt your sound - Precisely tailor your listening; the 5-band equaliser lets you boost or cut frequencies to suit your personal taste.\\n- Music how you want to hear it - Dynamic Normaliser balances nasty volume jumps between songs; VPT recreates the sound of a studio, club gig or arena.\\n- Match the music to your mood - SensMe\u2122 sorts your music into themed channels to suit any mood, from a relaxing wake-up to that energetic workout.\\n- Start the party with karaoke mode - Reduce the singer's volume in music tracks to create your own fun backing; sing along with synchronised lyrics display.\\n- Simpler language learning - Hear exactly what's being said with variable playback speed and repeat functions - great when you're practising a new language.\\n- Make a voice note - Built-in voice recorder function lets you capture spur-of-the-moment thoughts in meetings, lectures or on the go.\\n- Personalise your look - Pick from a choice of colourful wallpaper options, or choose a favourite photo.\\n- Hear your favourite radio shows - Tune in to your favourite FM radio stations; store and recall up to 30 presets.\\n- Play fun games - Comes pre-loaded with a choice of two entertaining games."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-10-26T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"64717ac3-5178-48bc-86a4-151212cb8d91","identifier":"1596349","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","trust"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust 2.0 Speaker Set for Mac"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- High quality speaker set for Mac with 12 Watt RMS power.\\n- Easy accessible headset connection.\\n- Extra input to connect iPod or MP3 player."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-05-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"36d30095-6ee5-4666-87f9-381877212ef1","identifier":"1597065","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","sony","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony SNC-RX530P"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC 24 V\/DC 12 V"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>High-Performance Network Camera With 360 Degree Endless Rotation<\/b>\\nThe SNC-RX530 is the most affordable of the SNC-RX Series and features a 18x optical zoom, enabling it to zoom in on small or distant objects with exceptional clarity. Combined with a 12x digital zoom, the SNC-RX550 delivers a maximum zoom of 216x.\\n\\nAll SNC-RX Series Network Dome Cameras feature built-in Intelligent Object Detection and Intelligent Motion Detection. They can also freely and endlessly rotate 360 degrees, allowing users to monitor the area surrounding the camera without interruption.\\n\\nAdvanced image processing technology offers a choice of three compression formats - JPEG, MPEG-4, and H.264 - so that users can choose the appropriate format to match their network environment and monitoring applications. A newly-developed \"Dual Encoding Capability\" also allows simultaneous streaming in JPEG and MPEG-4, further improving workflow flexibility.\\n\\nDesigned for 24\/7 operation, the SNC-RX Series incorporate a Day\/Night function, providing clear images even in 0.15 lx lighting conditions.\\n\\nThe SNC-RX Series is the right choice for a wide variety of surveillance and monitoring applications, delivering efficient 24\/7 monitoring - anytime, anywhere, anyplace.\\n\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-05-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":25}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7fde20a5-40b5-45bf-bd2a-9630d088e87d","identifier":"15974295","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips GoGEAR Video 4.3\""}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Superior sound experience<\/b>\\nwith FullSound & HD video playback\\n\\nThe GoGEAR Video 4.3\" MP3 video player puts vividly clear videos into your hands. Enjoy videos in popular formats like RMVB, MPEG4 & AVI, in HD quality. Enhance your entertainment pleasure with a 4.3\" LCD screen & a built-in speaker\\n\\n<b>Superb quality sound<\/b>\\n- FullsoundTM to bring your MP3 music to life\\n- Surround for movies to put you in the middle of the action\\n- Built-in speaker for entertainment out loud\\n\\n<b>Complements your life<\/b>\\n- 4.3\" WVGA color LCD display for superb video experience\\n- Voice recording to take notes or record anything, anytime\\n\\n<b>Easy and intuitive<\/b>\\n- Built-in kickstand for convenient hands-free viewing\\n- microSD card slot for expanded memory of up to 32 GB"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4dddb27e-4763-45d2-8a98-be8f26243185","identifier":"15974433","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4VBE04VF Vibe 4GB* MP4 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The vibrantly colored GoGEAR Vibe MP4 player comes with FullSound to bring music and videos to life, and Philips Songbird to synchronize music and enjoy entertainment. SafeSound protects your ears and FastCharge offers quick charging."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c4716772-5f01-4948-960c-660d8d489b9e","identifier":"1597566","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","trust","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust Chat & VoIP Pack Hi-Res CP-2150"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1.3"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Chatpack mit hochaufl\u00f6sender Webcam und Headset mit Nackenb\u00fcgel f\u00fcr Chats und Videokonferenzen.\\n- Komplettes und installationsfreundliches Set zum Online-Sehen und Online-H\u00f6ren.\\n- Ideal f\u00fcr Live Messenger, MSN Messenger, Skype und andere Messenger-Dienste.\\n- USB-Webcam mit einer Hardwareaufl\u00f6sung von 640 x 480 Pixel und einer Schnappschussaufl\u00f6sung von 1,3 Megapixel.\\n- Hochaufl\u00f6sende Webcam f\u00fcr scharfe Videoqualit\u00e4t in Skype und YouTube.\\n- Headset mit Fernbedienung zur Lautst\u00e4rkeregelung am Kabel und verstellbarem Mikrofon.\\n- Webcam mit Schnappschusstaste f\u00fcr schnelle Bildaufnahmen.\\n- Das Kamerastativ kann auch zum Befestigen der Webcam am Bildschirm von Notebooks oder Desktop-PCs verwendet werden."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Chat pack including high-res webcam and a neckband headset for chatting and video conferencing.\\n- Complete, easy to install package to see and hear each other online.\\n- Ideal for Live Messenger, MSN Messenger, Skype and other messenger services.\\n- USB webcam with 640 x 480 hardware resolution and 1.3 megapixel snapshot resolution.\\n- High resolution webcam for sharp video quality in Skype and YouTube.\\n- Headset with inline volume remote control and adjustable microphone.\\n- Webcam with snapshot button to quickly take a picture.\\n- The camera stand can also be used to attach the webcam to the screen of a notebook or desktop PC."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-05-18T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3c011899-2a38-4fd8-8d47-320c642b827a","identifier":"15983917","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","gear4","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"GEAR4 Xorb Wireless"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>2.1 stereo speaker for any Bluetooth-enabled device<\/b>\\n\\nXorb Wireless is GEAR4\u2019s latest 2.1 stereo speaker packed with 30-watts of power and the latest in Bluetooth wireless technology. With two neodymium drivers and one sub-woofer, the Xorb Wireless delivers stunning stereo audio to fill the biggest sized rooms from the device in your hand. You can stream audio from any Smartphone or Tablet with Bluetooth, with simple connectivity, and continue surfing the web or posting on Facebook.\\n\\nThe Xorb Wireless looks fitting in any modern home with its beautiful hemispherical design, stylish finish and elegant rounded grill. Its compact design also makes it suitable for any bookshelf, coffee table or entertainment stand. With 2.1A USB charging for any Smartphone or Tablet, bass control and a line-in port for any music player, playing music from a Xorb Wireless provides a high quality music experience, wirelessly and with style.\\n\\nThe Xorb Wireless is covered by GEAR4's no-quibble, 2 year extended warranty exclusively when purchased on gear4.com. Please retain your purchase confirmation email in the event you need to make a warranty claim in future.\\n\\n<b>2.1 stereo speaker for any Bluetooth-enabled device<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Wireless Bluetooth Streaming<\/b>\\nThe Xorb Wireless comes complete with the leading industry standard for high quality, efficient Bluetooth audio delivery. This means streaming music over Bluetooth is indistinguishable from CD quality audio. The advance audio coding provides instant delivery and lower power operation from your device with optimal performance.\\n\\n<b>2.1 Stereo<\/b>\\nWith two neodymium drivers and one sub-woofer, the Xorb Wireless delivers 30-watts of power to deliver stunning audio and to fill the biggest sized rooms from the device in your hand. The bass control function allows you to really crank-up those lower bass frequencies and thump out those big bass tunes.\\n\\n<b>Bass Control<\/b>\\nThe bass control dial helps you achieve a balanced tonal response across your entire music collection. Crank up the bass for lower bass frequencies and pack your music with a punch at high volume levels. Medium bass levels provide even treble and bass frequencies for the all-round music listener. If you prefer hearing the detailed layer of instruments, reduce the bass settings to provide a clear tonal pitch.\\n\\n<b>USB Charging<\/b>\\nYou can use the Xorb Wireless to charge any Smartphone or Tablet from the rear 2.1A USB charging port. This provides quick charging for Tablets and lets the music continue whilst your device charges.\\n\\n<b>Line-in Port for Use with Other Music Players<\/b>\\nUse the Xorb Wireless with any music player with a 3.5mm jack. Enjoy your favourite music, movies or games from a MP3 player, TV or Laptop by connecting a 3.5mm audio cable into the line-in port."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-11-14T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3b50d4ef-b66f-4e41-9d71-dc51be3a3740","identifier":"16003454","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA1ARA08KI Ariaz 8 GB* MP3 video player"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Enjoy an unrivalled sound experience with the Philips GoGear Ariaz Portable AV Player featuring FullSound\u2122. It's a real joy to use; you can download online videos to the player and easily navigate content on its 2\" full colour display."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-11-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cfe54cd3-07c3-4ebe-a075-af0da13fdbc4","identifier":"16005561","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","ngs"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"NGS Silver Rook 2.0"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"This handy and excellent quality sound system 2.0 includes headphone and microphone. It includes volume control and headphone front output. Perfect to enjoy music or games, it is also suitable for internet phone calls and voice recognition software."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-11-16T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7e8dc863-c94d-4e1c-864f-aa7a9efcd33b","identifier":"1602490","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","conceptronic","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Conceptronic 2.1 Multimedia Speaker System"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit dem CLLSPK21L 2.1 Multimedia Lautsprecher System beweist Conceptronic dass gute Klangqualit\u00e4t sehr preiswert sein kann Dieses Lautsprecher System hat einen aktiven 10 Watt Subwoofer mit einem starken Bass und 2-Wege Satellitenlautsprecher mit 2 x 5 Watt Das Plug und Play Stereo-Lautsprecher Set CLLSPK21L von Conceptronic l\u00e4sst sich einfach an PCs CD- und MP3-Player anschlie\u00dfen Im Lieferumfang ist eine Fernbedienung enthalten mit der Sie Ihren Sound voll im Griff haben Genie\u00dfen Sie ein unvergessliches Musikerlebnis oder die speziellen Klangeffekte beim Gaming mit dem Lounge\u2019n\u2019LISTEN von Conceptronic - zu einem erschwinglichen Preis! <br\/>zum Anschluss am PC, CD- und MP3-Player<br\/>1x 10-Watt-Subwoofer und 2x 5-Watt-Satellitenlautsprecher<br\/>inkl. Fernbedienung mit Lautst\u00e4rkeregelung und Ein-\/Ausschalter"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Conceptronic proves with the CLLSPK21L 2.1 Multimedia Speaker System that a good sound quality doesn\u2019t always come with a high price! This speaker system has a 10-Watt active subwoofer with a deep bass and 2-way satellites of 2x5 Watt, which produce a realistic sound. Plug-and-play, the Conceptronic CLLSPK21L stereo speaker set connects easily to PC\u2019s, CD and MP3 players. A remote control is included to give you full control of your sound! So listen to your music or enjoy the sound effects while playing games at an affordable price!"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Conceptronic prouve avec le syst\u00e8me de haut-parleurs multim\u00e9dia CLLSPK21L 2.1 qu'un son de haute qualit\u00e9 ne s'accompagne pas forc\u00e9ment d'un prix \u00e9lev\u00e9 ! Ce syst\u00e8me de haut-parleurs a un caisson de basses actif de 10 Watt avec des basses tr\u00e8s profondes et 2 hauts parleurs satellites bidirectionnels de 2 x 5 Watt. Plug-and-play, l'ensemble de haut-parleurs st\u00e9r\u00e9o CLLSPK21L de Conceptronic se connecte facilement sur votre PC, et sur vos lecteurs CD et MP3. Une commande \u00e0 distance est incluse afin que vous puissiez disposer d\u2019un contr\u00f4le total de votre son. Il ne vous reste plus qu'\u00e0 brancher votre Loung'n'LISTEN pour profiter de la musique et des effets sonores pendant votre jeu \u00e0 un prix abordable !"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-05-30T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"104cca4b-85ab-4f4c-9e9c-86d7e6d43f37","identifier":"1604607","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","nec"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"NEC SP-P50P1"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-05-31T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c571228c-8681-4ab3-b7ac-8b26cbeda04d","identifier":"1627653","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","trust"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust 2.0 Speaker Set Premium SP-2697"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- 2.0-Lautsprecherset in Premium-Qualit\u00e4t mit Fernbedienung und einer Gesamtausgangsleistung von 50 Watt RMS.\\n- Praktische Tischfernbedienung mit iPod\/MP3-Eingang, Netz- und Eingabeauswahltaste, Kopfh\u00f6reranschluss, H\u00f6hen-, Bass- und Lautst\u00e4rkereglern.\\n- Holzgeh\u00e4use und Bassreflexsystem f\u00fcr kr\u00e4ftige, verzerrungsfreie und tiefe B\u00e4sse.\\n- Auch f\u00fcr Sony PlayStation 1, 2 und 3 oder andere Ger\u00e4te mit Stereo-Cinch-Audioausgang geeignet."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Premium quality 2.0 speaker set with remote control unit and a total RMS output of 50 Watt.\\n- Convenient on desk remote control unit with iPod\/ MP3 input, power and input select button, headphone connection, treble, bass and volume control.\\n- Wooden housing and bass reflex design for a powerful, distortion free and deep bass.\\n- Also suitable for Sony Playstation 1, 2 and 3 or any other device with stereo cinch audio output."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Syst\u00e8me d'enceintes 2.0 haut de gamme avec t\u00e9l\u00e9commande et une puissance de sortie de 50 W RMS.\\n- T\u00e9l\u00e9commande pratique \u00e0 poser sur le bureau avec connecteur iPod\/ MP3, bouton marche\/arr\u00eat et de s\u00e9lection de la source, connecteur pour casque et r\u00e9glage du volume, des aigus et des basses.\\n- Enceintes en bois et syst\u00e8me de r\u00e9flexion pour des basses puissantes, profondes et fid\u00e8les.\\n- Compatible \u00e9galement avec les Playstation Sony 1, 2 et 3 ou avec tous les appareils disposant d'une sortie audio st\u00e9r\u00e9o RCA."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-06-25T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c6f8d9d9-fc11-44fd-9ed8-8b82f5882397","identifier":"16287591","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony Walkman NWZ-F805"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Ein erstklassiges Musik- und App-Erlebnis<br\/>\\n<br\/>Audio-Technologien von Sony f\u00fcr hervorragenden Klang: Dank S-Master MX Digitalverst\u00e4rker, Clear Stereo, Clear Bass und DSEE mit EX-Kopfh\u00f6rern k\u00f6nnen Sie das Beste aus Ihrer Musiksammlung herausholen..<br\/>\\nLeistungsstarkes Entertainment dank Android: Ein Entertainment-Erlebnis mit allen Sinnen genie\u00dfen: Nutzen Sie die vorinstallierten Apps, und holen Sie das Beste aus dem stetig wachsenden Angebot bei Google Play\u2122..<br\/>\\nGreifen Sie dank Music Unlimited jederzeit auf Millionen von Musiktiteln zu: \u00dcbertragen Sie eine riesige Menge an Hits, Klassikern, Neuerscheinungen und werbefreie Radiokan\u00e4le (pr\u00fcfen Sie unter www.musicunlimited.com\/legal welche verf\u00fcgbar sind).<br\/>\\nGanz ohne Kabel verbinden: Apps herunterladen und Inhalte wiedergeben \u2013 \u00fcber Wi-Fi\u00ae: Verbinden Sie den WALKMAN\u00ae mit anderen Bluetooth\u00ae Ger\u00e4ten wie Kopfh\u00f6rern oder Docking-Lautsprechern..<br\/>\\nVoll aufdrehen: Teilen Sie Ihre Musik dank xLOUD\u2122 Lautsprechersystem mit anderen..<br\/>\\nLeistungsstarker Prozessor: Dank dem schnellen NVIDIA\u00ae Tegra\u00ae 2 Prozessor k\u00f6nnen Sie ganz unkompliziert Musik, Medien, Apps und Spiele auf dem Touchscreen aufrufen..<br\/>\\nF\u00fcr ein lang anhaltendes H\u00f6rvergn\u00fcgen: Verk\u00fcrzen Sie sich lange Reisen mit bis zu 20 Stunden Musikwiedergabe und 4,5 Stunden Videowiedergabe mit einer einzigen Akkuladung.<br\/>\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie Ihre Musikbibliothek und vieles mehr: \u00dcbertragen Sie Musik, Videos, Wiedergabelisten und Fotos aus dem Windows\u00ae Explorer oder \u00fcber iTunes per Drag & Drop auf den Walkman\u00ae (keine DRM-Inhalte).<br\/>\\nPassen Sie Musik an Ihre Stimmung an: SensMe\u2122 fasst Ihre Musiktitel in thematischen Kan\u00e4len zusammen, sodass Sie sie vom sanften Wecken am Morgen bis zum energiegeladenen Workout je nach Stimmungslage ausw\u00e4hlen k\u00f6nnen.<br\/>\\nEinfach neigen und wiedergeben: Der integrierte G-Sensor reagiert auf Ihre Bewegungen. So erhalten Spiele und weitere Inhalte eine neue Dimension und machen noch mehr Spa\u00df..<br\/>\\nMusik \u2013 genau jetzt: Dank der W-Taste springen Sie sofort von der derzeit ausgef\u00fchrten Aktivit\u00e4t zu den Funktionen des WALKMAN\u00ae Musikplayers \u2013 auch bei gesperrtem Bildschirm.<br\/>\\nSie werden Ihren Augen nicht trauen: Erwecken Sie Ihre Musik mit dynamischen, auf die Musik abgestimmten visuellen Effekten zum Leben.<br\/>\\nAlles retro: Erleben Sie das Erbe des WALKMAN\u00ae dank einer Auswahl unterschiedlicher Funktionen zur Musik-Wiedergabe, darunter legend\u00e4re Player..<br\/>\\nFormatfreundlich: Die WALKMAN\u00ae F800-Serie kann alle g\u00e4ngigen Musikformate, z. B. mp3, WAV, AAC und FLAC, sowie alle beliebten HD-Videoformate wiedergeben..<br\/>\\nDie genaue Position anzeigen: Dank integriertem GPS wird Ihre Position auf dem Bildschirm angezeigt. Das GPS-System interagiert bei Anschluss \u00fcber Wi-Fi\u00ae mit Apps zur Standortbestimmung..<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Move up to rich, finely detailed Walkman\u00ae sound, plus an ever-growing entertainment experience powered by Android\u2122. Connect wirelessly with a fast-growing world of online content and apps. Enjoy your photos, videos, games and more on the big, beautiful touchscreen.\\n\\nExperience refined Hi-Fi listening, with crystalline highs and deep, rich bass. Reveal the finest details in every performance with the S-Master MX Digital Amplifier and Clear Audio technologies by Sony.\\n\\nEnjoy music, apps, photos, videos and games on the big, bright multi-touch screen. Everything's beautifully fluid and responsive, thanks to the powerful processor and latest Android 4.0.3 (Ice Cream Sandwich) operating system.\\n\\nEnhance your entertainment with the power of Android. Enjoy pre-installed apps tailored for your Walkman\u00ae, from email to maps and media gallery. Connect wirelessly and download more from an ever-growing choice at Google Play\u2122.\\n\\nDon't keep those great sounds to yourself. The xLOUD\u2122 speaker system lets everyone in the room enjoy clear, crisp Walkman\u00ae sound."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Profitez du meilleur de la musique et des applications<br\/>\\n<br\/>Technologies audio de Sony pour un son l\u00e9gendaire: Amplificateur num\u00e9rique S-Master MX, Clear Stereo, Clear Bass, DSEE et \u00e9couteurs EX pour profiter du meilleur de votre musique.<br\/>\\nVos divertissements prennent une nouvelle dimension avec Android: vivez une exp\u00e9rience de divertissement en totale immersion\u00a0; utilisez des applications pr\u00e9install\u00e9es et profitez des possibilit\u00e9s qu'offre un choix de plus en plus vari\u00e9 sur Google Play\u2122.<br\/>\\nAcc\u00e9dez \u00e0 des milliers de titres via Music Unlimited: Diffusez de nombreux singles, de titres intemporels, de nouveaut\u00e9s et \u00e9coutez la radio sans publicit\u00e9 (voir www.musicunlimited.com\/legal pour les disponibilit\u00e9s).<br\/>\\nConnexion sans fil: T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez des applications et diffusez vos contenus gr\u00e2ce au Wi-Fi\u00ae\u00a0; connectez votre WALKMAN\u00ae \u00e0 d'autres p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques Bluetooth\u00ae, tels que des \u00e9couteurs ou une station avec haut-parleurs.<br\/>\\nEcoutez votre musique \u00e0 plein volume: Partagez votre exp\u00e9rience musicale avec le syst\u00e8me de haut-parleurs int\u00e9gr\u00e9 xLOUD\u2122.<br\/>\\nUn processeur puissant: Interagissez en toute simplicit\u00e9 avec votre musique, vos contenus multim\u00e9dia, vos applications et vos jeux sur l'\u00e9cran tactile gr\u00e2ce au processeur haute vitesse NVIDIA\u00ae Tegra\u00ae 2.<br\/>\\nProlongez votre temps d'\u00e9coute: Pour faire passer le temps pendant les longs voyages, \u00e9coutez jusqu'\u00e0 20 heures de musique ou regardez 4 heures 30 de vid\u00e9o avec une seule charge de batterie.<br\/>\\nProfitez de toute votre biblioth\u00e8que musicale et plus encore: A l'aide d'un simple glisser-d\u00e9poser, transf\u00e9rez des fichiers audio ou vid\u00e9o, des listes de lecture et des photos (contenu non DRM) sur votre WALKMAN\u00ae depuis Windows\u00ae Explorer ou iTunes.<br\/>\\nAdaptez votre musique \u00e0 votre humeur: La technologie SensMe\u2122 organise votre musique en cha\u00eenes th\u00e9matiques pour s'adapter \u00e0 toutes les situations, d'un r\u00e9veil tout en douceur \u00e0 un entra\u00eenement dynamique.<br\/>\\nAction, r\u00e9action: La technologie G-sensor int\u00e9gr\u00e9e r\u00e9agit \u00e0 vos mouvements, permettant ainsi de donner une nouvelle dimension \u00e0 vos jeux et autres divertissements.<br\/>\\nEn avant la musique: Appuyez sur le W et acc\u00e9dez instantan\u00e9ment aux fonctions du lecteur de musique WALKMAN\u00ae, quoi que vous fassiez (m\u00eame en cas de verrouillage de l'\u00e9cran).<br\/>\\nVous n'en croirez pas vos yeux: Donnez vie \u00e0 votre collection audio gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'affichage dynamique en harmonie avec la musique que vous \u00e9coutez.<br\/>\\nOptez pour le look r\u00e9tro: Faites un bond dans le pass\u00e9 de WALKMAN\u00ae \u00e0 travers un choix de pr\u00e9sentations d'\u00e9cran amusantes pour la lecture de musique avec des lecteurs dont la r\u00e9putation n'est plus \u00e0 faire.<br\/>\\nCompatibilit\u00e9 optimale: Le WALKMAN\u00ae s\u00e9rie F800 lit tous vos formats audio pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s, y compris les titres mp3, WAV, AAC et FLAC, ainsi que les formats vid\u00e9o HD les plus pl\u00e9biscit\u00e9s.<br\/>\\nLocalisez votre position: Le GPS int\u00e9gr\u00e9 vous permet de rep\u00e9rer l'endroit o\u00f9 vous vous trouvez \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran et d'interagir avec les applications capables de localiser votre position lorsque vous \u00eates connect\u00e9 au Wi-Fi\u00ae.<br\/>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-11-30T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"342cb07d-fe21-41b1-aaf3-cca7717d45b5","identifier":"16294234","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["canon","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon DR DR-6010C"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"AC220 - 240V, 50\/60Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>imageFORMULA DR-6010C Production Scanner<\/b>\\nThe imageFORMULA DR-6010C departmental scanner delivers high speed, reliable document handling, and high quality images, in a small package. Flexibility, rich features, and ease-of-use, help maximize return on investment at all levels of the business system.\\n\\nThe DR-6010C was developed to offer another option for decentralized capture scanning needs. In combination with its sister product, the imageFORMULA DR-4010C, these scanners offer competitive document imaging platforms designed to increase efficiencies and workflows in decentralized scanning environments.\\n\\n<b>Features:<\/b>\\n<b>High Speed:<\/b>\\nCapable of maintaining the same high scanning speeds in color, grayscale and black and white up to 200 dpi up to 60 ppm and 120 ipm.\\n\\n<b>Suggested Daily Volume:<\/b>\\nBuilt to match the volume requirements of decentralized departmental scanning.\\n\\n<b>Advanced Sensor:<\/b>\\nEmploy advanced three line CIS sensors enable prompt transition of hardcopy documents into electronic files.\\n\\n<b>High Flexibility:<\/b>\\nCapable of reliably handling a wide variety of document sizes, from 2.1 by 2.8 inches up to 8.6 by 14 inches. A Long Document Mode enables scanning of documents up to 118 inches in length. Flexible paper feed and output trays enhance reliable scanning of batches of mixed document sizes.\\n\\n<b>Reliable Feeding:<\/b>\\nEmploy Canon's advanced and unique feeding mechanism as well as such features as Ultrasonic Double Feed Detection and Rapid Recovery to ensure smooth and reliable document feeding. Combined with solid body design and heavy-duty feed and eject trays to help minimize downtime and help maintain business continuity.\\n\\n<b>High Image Quality:<\/b>\\nEmploy advanced three line CIS sensors with an automatic dust-free shading calibration mechanism to capture intricate details with up to 600 dpi resolution. Image quality can be further enhanced using such features as Advanced Text Enhancement, Moire Reduction, and Remove Bleed Through.\\n\\n<b>Small size:<\/b>\\nEasily fits on a desktop.\\n\\n<b>Ease-of-use:<\/b>\\nUser friendly operation through programmable pre-registered Scan-To-Job buttons.\\n\\n<b>Front Side Operation:<\/b>\\nErgonomic design with a U-Turn paper path, that allows a user to conveniently feed and retrieve documents from the front side, and an advanced document feed tray space saving design, that employs the front cover as document feed tray when open."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-11-30T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"60ee959f-5226-46ae-b885-08f7f2840fae","identifier":"1629604","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung S2 Audio Player 2GB Purple"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"DC 5.0V\/ 500mA"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Dieser MP3-Player ist DAS Must-Have 2008! Das Halsband mit integrierten Kopfh\u00f6rern macht das nur 17 g leichte Musiktalent zum perfekten Begleiter f\u00fcr unterwegs und zum unverzichtbaren Accessoire. Der YP-S2 besticht durch sein ungew\u00f6hnliches \u00c4u\u00dferes: Mit seinem kieselsteinf\u00f6rmigen Design hebt er sich von der Masse der rechteckigen MP3-Player ab. Ein Hingucker par excellence!\\n\\n<b>Kieselsteinartiges Design<\/b>\\nYP-S2, der MP3-Player im Kieselstein-Design von SAMSUNG, ist Vorreiter eines neuen Trends der Anlehnung von Design an die Natur: abgerundet, kieselsteinf\u00f6rmig, gl\u00e4nzende farbige Oberfl\u00e4che. F\u00fcr ein stilvolles und modernes Auftreten.\\n\\n<b>Klangqualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nTrotz des auf ansprechende Weise schlichten Designs besitzt der S2 dank der DNSe-Technologie (SAMSUNGs Eigenentwicklung eines speziellen Klangeffektalgorithmus namens Digital Natural Sound engine) einen \u00fcberragenden Klang. Es werden 3 voreingestellte Equalizermodi (Normal, 3D-Studio, Konzertsaal) unterst\u00fctzt. Die Formate MP3, WMA und OGG k\u00f6nnen abgespielt werden.\\n\\n<b>Intuitive Bedienbarkeit<\/b>\\nMit seinen 5 Drucktasten ist der S2 einfach bedienbar. Er unterst\u00fctzt 3 verschiedene Abspielmodi (Normal, Zufall, Favoriten). LEDs in verschiedenen Farben sorgen f\u00fcr ansprechende Optik."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Wearable MP3 player<\/b>\\nThe new SAMSUNG S2 MP3 Player offers musical freedom in beautiful pebble design. It is the perfect accessory for your daily wear!\\n\\n<b>Pebble like design<\/b>\\nYP-P2 (Pebble) is SAMSUNG's first stylish and iconic MP3 resembling the nature with its pebble-like shaped and brilliant colours.\\n\\n<b>Intuitive UI<\/b>\\nWith 5 ways tactile keys, S2 is easy to use. It also supports 3 play modes (Normal, Shuffle, Favourite) which has different LED colours.\\n\\n<b>Sound quality<\/b>\\nEven though S2 is cute and light design, it has amazing sound via DNSe\u2122 (Digital Natural Sound engine) and supports 3 preset EQ (Normal, 3D Studio, Concert Hall).\\n\\nMP3, WMA and Ogg file formats are supported."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-06-28T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5321439e-427b-4d7e-8160-1169cffc7a1c","identifier":"1638380","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung VP-MX20 Black"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"0.8"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Dank des ergonomischen Designs liegt der Camcorder VP-MX20 ganz bequem in der Hand des Filmenden. Dar\u00fcber hinaus kann er Videos aus vielen verschiedenen Winkeln gleichzeitig aufnehmen.\\n\\n<b>Einfache Handhabung auch ohne H\u00e4nde<\/b>\\nSie wollen drehen, brauchen aber Ihre H\u00e4nde? Dabei hilft Ihnen Ihre eigene Berichterstatter-Ausr\u00fcstung; der Memory Camcorder. Befestigen Sie das zus\u00e4tzliche Objektiv kabelgebunden oder funkgesteuert und stecken Sie den Camcorder gesch\u00fctzt in Ihre Tasche. Aufnahme, Start und Stopp steuern Sie direkt am Objektiv."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>H.264 technology<\/b>\\nA smarter way to shoot. The VP-MX20 flash memory camcorders offer a more exciting approach to home movie making. With longer battery and recording time, they make sure that you never miss the opportunity to record a magical moment and give you more memories to treasure, forever.\\n\\n<b>i-Check<\/b>\\nWithout turning the power on you can have a quick view of remaining battery and memory by pressing the i-Check button.\\n\\n<b>Share your memories, share your life<\/b>\\nSharing your life with friends and family becomes easier with the VP-MX20. By selecting Web & Mobile mode, you can shoot in a\\nformat perfected for H.264 supporting MP3 players and YouTube. The video files recorded by the VP-MX25\/MX20 can easily be applied to a transfer program and played on an H.264 supporting MP3 player. The YouTube uploader in the Mediashow software bundle enables direct\\nYouTube upload which bypasses the YouTube homesite.\\n\\n<b>Free style shooting<\/b>\\nFits easily into the palm for quick-and-easy shooting. For further convenience, Samsung's proprietary swivel hand-grip enables the newly launched camcorders to record from multiple angles, including regular and hard-to-reach low angle shots.\\n\\n<b>A world class lens, a world class camcorder<\/b>\\nWith a 680K CCD, a 34x optical zoom and a prestigious Schneider lens, the VP-MX20 is designed for budding film makers. It's also bulit for the road: with 10 automatic scene modes, the iScene feature ensures quality footage is captured no matter what the surrounding envirnmoent throws at the user.\\n\\n<b>2.7\" touch screen<\/b>\\nYou'll never miss a shot with the 2.7\" touch screen LCD display. Catch more of the action and guarantee that the entire image is recorded.\\n\\n<b>Face Detection for Better Results<\/b>\\nSupport Samsung's Face Dectection technology. This innovative feature automatically detects up to 12 faces within a frame and adjusts focus and exposure to make sure that the subjects are in the best possible light."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Il fait partie des cam\u00e9scopes HD les plus petits et les plus l\u00e9gers au monde. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ses capacit\u00e9s HD, vous obtiendrez du cam\u00e9scope SD une exceptionnelle qualit\u00e9 d\u2019image aussi bien sur son \u00e9cran que sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur compatible HD.\\n<br\/><b>technologie SAMSUNG DNIe\u2122 et nouveau syst\u00e8me de puce int\u00e9gr\u00e9e<\/b>\\n<br\/>D\u00e9couvrez des images plus naturelles et plus belles avec notre technologie DNle\u2122. Profitez des nombreuses fonctions avanc\u00e9es du cam\u00e9scope: R\u00e9duction du bruit 3D, Rendu des couleurs avanc\u00e9, Hyper stabilisateur d\u2019image num\u00e9rique, Super LCD plus et Autofocus D\u00e9tection de visages. La puce SAMSUNG rallonge la dur\u00e9e de vie de la batterie, augmente le temps d\u2019enregistrement et offre une bien meilleure qualit\u00e9 d'image num\u00e9rique. \\nEn int\u00e9grant au cam\u00e9scope un syst\u00e8me de contr\u00f4le muni d\u2019une puce puissante, la consommation d\u2019\u00e9nergie est nettement r\u00e9duite. Cela vous permet de filmer toujours plus d\u2019instants pr\u00e9cieux et de les conserver toute votre vie.\\n<br\/><b>r\u00e9duction du bruit 3D<\/b>\\n<br\/>Gr\u00e2ce la r\u00e9duction du bruit 3D, le MX20 repousse toutes les fronti\u00e8res \u00e9tablies. Il \u00e9limine consid\u00e9rablement les bruits tout en conservant l\u2019ar\u00eate et le motif de l\u2019image. \\nL'analyse du mouvement des images permet de les s\u00e9parer en deux groupes: les ar\u00eates et motifs et les images diff\u00e9rentielles. Elles sont ensuite trait\u00e9es par diff\u00e9rents filtres qui conservent les ar\u00eates et les motifs tout en supprimant les bruits. Apr\u00e8s la phase de filtrage, les images sont recompos\u00e9es et votre vid\u00e9o ne contient plus aucun parasite! \\n<br\/><b>des couleurs plus \u00e9clatantes<\/b>\\n<br\/>Le traitement Digital Natural Color (Couleurs Naturelles Num\u00e9riques) cr\u00e9e une palette de couleurs plus compl\u00e8te qui se rapproche davantage de celle que l'on peut admirer dans la nature. Le MX20 va plus loin que le RVB, il ajuste automatiquement les images \u00e0 partir d'un spectre de quatre couleurs CMJV. De cette fa\u00e7on, il recr\u00e9e plus fid\u00e8lement les couleurs que vous voyez et conservez dans vos souvenirs: des couleurs d'un r\u00e9alisme \u00e9tonnant.\\n<br\/><b>technologie AF D\u00e9tection de visages<\/b>\\n<br\/>Le MX20 est bien plus \u00e9volu\u00e9 que les cam\u00e9scopes classiques gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 sa technologie avanc\u00e9e d\u2019Autofocus D\u00e9tection de visages qui lui permet de faire la mise au point sur plusieurs visages. Avec la fonction intelligente AF D\u00e9tection de visages, la mise au point des visages est automatique m\u00eame s\u2019ils ne sont pas au centre de l\u2019\u00e9cran. Cette technologie SAMSUNG vous permet de r\u00e9aliser des vid\u00e9os plus nettes et d\u2019une meilleure qualit\u00e9.\\n<br\/><b>une dur\u00e9e d\u2019enregistrement plus longue pour conserver davantage de souvenirs<\/b>\\n<br\/>Enregistrez plus de vid\u00e9os de grande qualit\u00e9 avec le SAMSUNG MX20. Gr\u00e2ce aux hautes performances de son codec H.264, le MX20 vous permet d'enregistrer plus de souvenirs qu'un cam\u00e9scope qui utilise le codec MPEG2. A capacit\u00e9 identique, le MX20 est capable d'enregistrer deux fois plus qu\u2019un cam\u00e9scope \u00e9quip\u00e9 du codec MPEG2. \\nLes fichiers vid\u00e9o compress\u00e9s peuvent \u00eatre plus facilement envoy\u00e9s par mail ou t\u00e9l\u00e9charg\u00e9s sur Internet. Le partage de fichiers devient un jeu d'enfant, sans perte de qualit\u00e9!"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":34}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-07-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"077c41ee-3bec-4be4-8ce9-36a4dc4c83a7","identifier":"1639859","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","trust","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1600_x_1200"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust 2 Megapixel Deluxe Autofocus Webcam WB-8600R"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- USB 2.0-Webcam in Premium-Qualit\u00e4t mit einer sehr hohen Hardwareaufl\u00f6sung von 1600 x 1200 Pixel und einer Schnappschussaufl\u00f6sung von 8 Megapixel.\\n- Sensoraufl\u00f6sung von 2 Megapixel f\u00fcr Bilder und Videos in h\u00f6chster Qualit\u00e4t.\\n- Leistungsstarkes integriertes Licht f\u00fcr verbesserte Lichtqualit\u00e4t bei schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen.\\n- Mit automatischer Gesichtsverfolgung und Digitalzoom mit 4-facher Vergr\u00f6\u00dferung.\\n- Automatischer Fokus zur Gew\u00e4hrleistung der Bildsch\u00e4rfe in jedem Bereich.\\n- Mit integriertem Mikrofon.\\n- Technologie ohne Treiber: keine Installation eines Treibers erforderlich \u2013 einfach anschlie\u00dfen und starten.\\n- Ideal f\u00fcr Live Messenger, MSN Messenger, Skype oder andere Messenger-Dienste.\\n- Einschlie\u00dflich Software mit Echtzeitvideoeffekten und Bilderrahmen.\\n- Selbsteinstellende Klemme zum Befestigen an LCD-Bildschirmen von Notebooks und Flachbildschirmen oder zum Aufstellen auf glatten Oberfl\u00e4chen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Premium quality USB 2.0 webcam with 1600 x 1200 Ultra High Definition hardware resolution and 8 megapixel snapshot resolution.\\n- True 2 megapixel sensor resolution providing images and videos in highest quality.\\n- Powerful integrated light for enhanced image quality in low-light environment.\\n- Equipped with automatic face tracking technology and 4x digital zoom.\\n- Automatic focus to ensure sharp image at any range.\\n- With built-in microphone.\\n- Driverless technology: no need to install a driver, just plug & go.\\n- Ideal for Live Messenger, MSN Messenger, Skype or other messenger services.\\n- Software included with real-time video effects and picture frames.\\n- Self-adjusting clamp to attach to notebook LCD screens and flat panel monitors or place on flat surfaces."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Webcam USB 2.0 haut de gamme avec r\u00e9solution logicielle 1600 x 1200 Ultra Haute D\u00e9finition et une r\u00e9solution de prise de vue de 8 m\u00e9gapixels.\\n- V\u00e9ritable r\u00e9solution de capteur \u00e0 2 m\u00e9gapixels offrant des images et des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 tr\u00e8s \u00e9lev\u00e9e.\\n- \u00c9clairage puissant int\u00e9gr\u00e9 pour am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 de l'image dans les conditions de faible luminosit\u00e9.\\n- \u00c9quip\u00e9e de la technologie de suivi automatique des visages et d'un zoom num\u00e9rique X4.\\n- Autofocus garantissant une nettet\u00e9 d'image \u00e0 toutes les distances.\\n- Avec microphone int\u00e9gr\u00e9e.\\n- Technologie sans pilote : il suffit de le brancher pour l'utiliser imm\u00e9diatement.\\n- Id\u00e9ale pour Live Messenger, MSN Messenger, Skype et les autres services de messagerie.\\n- Logiciel inclus avec des effets vid\u00e9o en temps r\u00e9el et des cadres d'images.\\n- Fixation r\u00e9glable automatiquement pour installer la webcam sur des \u00e9crans LCD de portables, des moniteurs \u00e0 \u00e9cran plat ou \u00e0 poser sur une surface plane."}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-07-06T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"25a5f647-a916-465f-8efc-c172eb199446","identifier":"16466450","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","lenovo","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenovo M0620"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Lenovo speaker M0620 (0B45914) is a 2.0 speaker system which includes a main speaker with built-in amplifiers and a sub-speaker. They can be attached to your laptop or desktop computer or you can use it with your smartphone or MP3\/MP4 player. Although the speakers are small in size, the sound they produce is big and bold."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-12-03T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:33:03+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:33:03+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2ef1d2a4-f503-4fb8-8289-5ea6ef05be64","identifier":"16488104","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","sweex","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sweex WC350 webcam"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-12-06T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fd6aace9-6179-4dc8-aa13-f0afd163257b","identifier":"16664908","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","spcinternet"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"SPCinternet Green MP3 Clip&Go 824 2 GB"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"SPCinternet Green MP3 Clip&Go 824 2 GB. Player media type: flash-media. Audio formats supported: FLAC, MP2, MP3, WAV, WMA. Headphone connectivity: 3.5 mm. Interface: USB 2.0. Battery technology: Lithium Polymer (LiPo)"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-12-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0998619e-ae7b-409e-9ebb-39224e4e9754","identifier":"16668031","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","hp","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1920_x_1080"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP HD-5210"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Die hochwertige HP HD 5210 Webcam \u00fcbertr\u00e4gt Videos per Streaming schnell, exakt und reibungslos bei wesentlich geringerer Bandbreite. Profitieren Sie von noch nie da gewesener herausragender Technologie und innovativen Funktionen.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;Die bahnbrechende H.264-Technologie ist Bestandteil der HP HD 5210. Die Bildqualit\u00e4t ist so hoch, dass sie Skype\u00ae-zertifiziert wurde. Nur mit dieser Auszeichnung sind H.264-basierte HD-Web-Chats \u00fcber Skype\u00ae gew\u00e4hrleistet.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Die Blu-ray-\u00ae-Qualit\u00e4t der aufgezeichneten Bilder ist beeindruckend. Wenn Sie maximale Aufl\u00f6sung und spektakul\u00e4re Videoqualit\u00e4t im Breitbildformat w\u00fcnschen, dann ist diese Webcam mit nativem HD-Widescreen (1.920 x 1.080) wie f\u00fcr Sie geschaffen.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Autofokus und die \u00fcber HP TrueVision verf\u00fcgbare automatische Belichtung sind im Lieferumfang enthalten. Gesichtserkennung und digitales Zoomen (F\u00fcnffachzoom). Die vielseitig einsetzbare Befestigung bietet 270\u00b0 Schwenkwinkel\/30\u00b0 Neigungswinkel und l\u00e4sst sich \u00fcberall anbringen. Das \u00e4u\u00dferst kompakte Design unterstreicht die erstklassige Glaslinse.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;War es jemals einfacher? Einmal klicken zum Hochladen, und schon stehen Ihre Inhalte f\u00fcr Ihre Onlinekontakte bereit.  Es besteht schneller Zugriff auf Facebook, YouTube und zum ersten Mal auch auf Twitter und Flickr.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Hochwertige Materialien mit attraktiver geb\u00fcrsteter Metallleiste runden das \u00e4u\u00dferst kompakte Design ab.  Obwohl die HD 5210 nur etwa halb so gro\u00df wie vergleichbare Webcams ist, ist sie mit mehr Technik ausgestattet.\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- HP's HD 5210 high-end webcam streams faster, clearer and smoother video over much less bandwidth. It's superb technology and advanced features than you've experienced before.\\n- The ground-breaking H.264 technology is right here in the HP HD 5210. Your image quality is so high, it\u2019s been Skype\u00ae-certified. That stamp of approval is the only way to ensure true H.264 HD web chats via Skype\u00ae.\\n- You'll be amazed by the Blu-ray\u00ae quality images you can record. If you're looking for the highest resolution and the most spectacular video quality in true widescreen format, this webcam with a native HD 1920 x 1080 widescreen was made just for you.\\n- Auto-focus and HP's TrueVision auto-light exposure are included. Face tracking and 5x digital zoom capabilities. Versatile swivel clip\u2014270\u00b0 pan\/30\u00b0 tilt\u2014mounts anywhere. Ultra-compact design highlights the premium glass component lens.\\n- Have you ever seen it this easy? Just a 1 click upload and you're sharing with your on-line world. You've got fast access to Facebook, YouTube and for the first time- Twitter & Flickr.\\n- High-end materials with attractive brushed metal trim frame this ultra- compact style. And, although the HD 5210 is almost 1\/2 the size of comparable webcams, it's packed with more technology."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>La webcam HD haut de gamme HP 5210 offre un flux vid\u00e9o plus rapide, plus nette et plus agr\u00e9able en utilisant une bande passante bien moindre. Une technologie fantastique et des fonctionnalit\u00e9s avanc\u00e9es comme vous n'en avez jamais rencontr\u00e9es auparavant.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;La technologie r\u00e9volutionnaire H.264 \u00e9quipe le HP HD 5210. La qualit\u00e9 de l'image est tellement \u00e9lev\u00e9e que ce mod\u00e8le a re\u00e7u la certification Skype\u00ae. Cette homologation est la seule \u00e0 garantir de v\u00e9ritables conversations vid\u00e9o HD avec le codec H.264 HD sur Skype\u00ae .<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Vous serez conquis par les images de qualit\u00e9 Blu-ray Intel\u00ae que vous pouvez enregistrer. Si vous recherchez la r\u00e9solution la plus \u00e9lev\u00e9e et la qualit\u00e9 vid\u00e9o la plus spectaculaire dans un format \u00e9cran large v\u00e9ritable, cette webcam qui offre un mode HD \u00e9cran large 1920 x 1080 de s\u00e9rie est faite pour vous.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Les fonctions autofocus et auto-exposition \u00e0 la lumi\u00e8re HP TrueVision sont incluses. Suivi des visages et zoom num\u00e9rique 5x. Cette pince polyvalente et pivotante (rotation 270\u00b0\/inclinaison 30\u00b0) s'adapte partout. La conception ultra-compacte met en \u00e9vidence l'objectif dot\u00e9 d'un verre de qualit\u00e9.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Avez-vous jamais vu quelque chose d'aussi facile ? T\u00e9l\u00e9chargement en un seul clic pour partager avec votre monde en ligne.  Vous avez un acc\u00e8s rapide \u00e0 Facebook, YouTube et, pour la premi\u00e8re fois, \u00e0 Twitter et \u00e0 Flickr.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Des mat\u00e9riaux haut de gamme avec un m\u00e9tal bross\u00e9 s\u00e9duisant donnent du style \u00e0 ce mod\u00e8le ultra-compact.  Et, m\u00eame si la HD 5210 a une taille de presque la moiti\u00e9 de celle de webcams comparables, elle renferme davantage de technologie.\\n"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-01-05T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"49c08942-1359-464f-9b7e-41ece0acf304","identifier":"16669550","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","hp","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP 1300"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Die Zeit ist reif f\u00fcr problemlose und sofortige Verbindungs- und Kommunikationsm\u00f6glichkeiten. Die umfassende Kompatibilit\u00e4t der HP Webcam 1300 erstreckt sich \u00fcber alle g\u00e4ngigen Video Calling Services. Vom Chatten bei Videoanrufen bis zu Videoaufzeichnungen werden Sie die benutzerfreundlichen Funktionen sch\u00e4tzen.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;Chatten mit Freunden und Familie im Handumdrehen. Die HP Webcam 1300 ist kompatibel mit den meisten wichtigen Video Calling Services: Skype, AOL, Yahoo, MSN und Google. Upload in Facebook per Mausklick. (1,2)<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Die HP Webcam 1300 verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber viele Extras. Vielseitig verwendbare Clip-Halterungen. Individuelle Einstellungen durch 360\u00b0 Schwenkm\u00f6glichkeit und 30\u00b0 Neigungswinkel. Weniger Hintergrundger\u00e4usche durch Richtmikrofon. Zus\u00e4tzliche Verwendungsm\u00f6glichkeit als Fotokamera(2).<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Klare Linien. Schlankes Design. Leicht und \u00e4u\u00dferst kompakt. Die HP Webcam 1300 ist klein, platzsparend und bietet Spa\u00df in jeder Umgebung.\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- It's time to easily and instantly connect and communicate. The HP Webcam 1300's far-reaching compatibility stretches across popular video calling services. From chatting on video calls to recording video, you'll appreciate its user-friendly features.\\n- In no time flat, you'll be chatting with friends and family. The HP Webcam 1300 is highly compatible with most major video calling services: Skype, AOL, Yahoo, MSN and Google. Plus, 1-click upload to Facebook.\\n- The HP Webcam 1300 has plenty of extras. Versatile clip mounts anywhere. Wide-reaching 360\u00b0 pan & 30\u00b0 tilt freely adjusts. Directional microphone cuts down on background noise. It also doubles as a still camera too.\\n- Clean lines. Streamlined shape. Light and ultra-compact size. The HP Webcam 1300 is small, space-saving and adds fun to any environment."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Il est temps de se connecter et de communiquer facilement et imm\u00e9diatement. La large compatibilit\u00e9 de la webcam HP 1300 s'\u00e9tend aux services de conversation vid\u00e9o les plus r\u00e9pandus. Qu'il s'agisse de discuter lors de conversations vid\u00e9o ou d'enregistrer des s\u00e9quences vid\u00e9o, vous appr\u00e9cierez ses fonctions utilisateur conviviales.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;En un rien de temps, vous serez en conversation avec vos amis et votre famille. La webcam HP 1300 est hautement compatible avec la plupart des principaux services de conversation vid\u00e9o : Skype, AOL, MSN, Yahoo et Google. En outre, t\u00e9l\u00e9chargez sur Facebook en 1-clic. (1,2)<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;La webcam HP 1300 dispose d'un grand nombre d'extras. Le clip de fixation universel peut \u00eatre fix\u00e9 n'importe o\u00f9. La rotation \u00e0 360 \u00b0 et l'inclinaison \u00e0 30\u00b0 peuvent \u00eatre r\u00e9gl\u00e9es librement. Le microphone directionnel \u00e9limine le bruit de fond. Elle sert \u00e9galement d'appareil photo.(2)<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Des lignes \u00e9pur\u00e9es. Une ligne \u00e9pur\u00e9e. Format l\u00e9ger et ultra-compact. La webcam HP 1300 est de petite taille, \u00e9conomise l'espace et est agr\u00e9able quel que soit l'environnement.\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-12-12T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"391fa9d5-606d-4b0e-81ed-f3794dcf1358","identifier":"16672632","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","hp","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1600_x_1200"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP KQ245AA"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Share your photos or videos effortlessly, chat face to face over the internet, enjoy HD quality video and more with the HP Premium Webcam."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-12-12T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d09e72b8-e1cc-4982-a897-5ddde8bdd3f4","identifier":"16678515","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","woxter"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Woxter Dynamic Line DL-7"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Woxter Dynamic Line DL-7. Recommended usage: PC, Speaker placement: Tabletop\/bookshelf, Amplifier: Built-in. Frequency range: 20 - 20000. Connectivity technology: Wired, Speaker interface type: USB\/3.5mm"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-12-13T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d61e9ad8-0f22-4734-b47a-6af9b1f38ffc","identifier":"16753061","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA3CNT16K Connect 3 16GB* WiFi MP3 video player with Android\u2122"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"GoGear Connect ist das perfekte Ger\u00e4t f\u00fcr Entertainment unterwegs. Laden Sie zahlreiche Android-Apps und Spiele herunter. Genie\u00dfen Sie satten Klang \u00fcber die ger\u00e4uschisolierenden Kopfh\u00f6rer dank FullSound und Surround Sound f\u00fcr Filme oder \u00fcber den leistungsstarken, integrierten Lautsprecher."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA3CNT16K Connect 3 16GB* WiFi MP3 video player with Android\u2122. Display diagonal: 3.2, Aspect ratio: 3:2. Total Harmonic Distortion (THD): 0.05, MP3 bit rates: 8 - 320, WMA bit rates: 5 - 192. Supported radio bands: FM. Bluetooth version: 2.1+EDR. Weight: 0.105"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"GoGear Connect est l'\u00e9quipement de loisirs id\u00e9al pour tous vos d\u00e9placements. T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez une infinit\u00e9 d'applications et de jeux Android. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie FullSound et au son Surround pour les films, profitez d'un son d'une richesse exceptionnelle avec le casque \u00e0 isolation phonique comme sur le puissant haut-parleur int\u00e9gr\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2012-12-17T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"617c061f-7528-46e7-807d-aa4ca061aefd","identifier":"1677649","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","logitech","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech LS11"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Logitech LS11. Dimensions (WxDxH): 85.2 x 81.7 x 162.8, Audio output channels: 2.0, Satellite speakers RMS power: 1.5"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-08-21T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"16b8e01b-8583-45ec-ad55-fdb574d12471","identifier":"1678072","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","logitech","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech LS21"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Logitech LS21. Audio output channels: 2.1, Subwoofer dimensions (WxHxD): 140 x 190 x 178, Satellite speakers RMS power: 1.5"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-08-21T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7eab812e-b73d-4bd6-b4f5-32ca9907f30e","identifier":"1683296","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["fujitsu","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujitsu fi-6770"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- 24 bit Farbe Duplex\\n- Flachbett und ADF 200-Blatt Kapazit\u00e4t\\n- Aufl\u00f6sung 50 \u2013 600 dpi : Scanformat bis A3\\n- 90 Seiten\/min (Querformat) in S\/W oder Farbe\\n- 70 Seiten\/min (Hochformat) in S\/W oder Farbe\\n- Papiergr\u00f6\u00dfenerkennung \/ automatischer Dokumentenformatzuschnitt\\n- Schwarzer und wei\u00dfer Scanhintergrund (optional auch f\u00fcr Flachbettmodul)\\n- ScandAll PRO V2 Premium Bilderfassungssoftwareim Lieferumfang\\n- VRS Professional Software Version, Soft IPC, Adobe\u00ae Acrobat\u00ae Standard\\n- Zentrale Verwaltung: \u00dcberwachung des Betriebsstatus, Aktualisierung von Treibern und Software von einem einzigen Ort aus.\\n\\nVerbessern Sie Ihre Produktivit\u00e4t mit fortschrittlicher Scanner-Intelligenz und h\u00f6herer VerarbeitungsgeschwindigkeitDie automatische Einzugsvorrichtung kann bis zu 200 Bl\u00e4tter gleichzeitig aufnehmen und l\u00e4sst Ihnen somit die Freiheit, andere Dinge zu tun. Der F\u00fcllschacht kann sowohl rechteckige als auch gef\u00e4cherte Papierstapel aufnehmen und hilft dadurch, Papierstau zu vermeiden und die Scanner-Produktivit\u00e4t zu erh\u00f6hen\\n\\nDar\u00fcber hinaus kann der fi-6770 Bl\u00e4tter mit einer L\u00e4nge von bis zu drei Metern scannen. Somit k\u00f6nnen Elektrokardiogramme, Instrumentenausdrucke und lange Dokumente digitalisiert werden. Die Ausr\u00fcstung mit VRS Professional (Softwareversion) garantiert beste Bildqualit\u00e4t und zudem einfache Handhabung des Scanners und des Papiers.\\n\\nDer fi-6770 wird auch zusammen mit ScandAll PRO V2 Premium Bilderfassungssoftware ausgeliefert, die die folgenden Merkmale bietet:\\n\\n<b>Automatische Job-Trennung<\/b>\\nDie mit dem fi-6770 ausgelieferte Barcode- und Patchcode-Lesefunktion erm\u00f6glicht es dem Ger\u00e4t, verschiedene Jobs mit der automatischen Job-Trennungsfunktion zu trennen. Das Ergebnis ist eine verbesserte Digitalisierungseffizienz.\\n\\n<b>Nahtlose Verbindung zu Microsoft\u00ae Office SharePoint\u00ae Server<\/b>\\nScandAll PRO erm\u00f6glicht dem fi-6770 die nahtlose Verbindung zu Microsoft\u00ae Office SharePoint\u00ae Server f\u00fcr einfache gemeinsame Benutzung und Sichtungsverwaltung digitalisierter Dokumente. Das Ergebnis ist eine noch einfachere Dokumentenverwaltung. Der fi-6770 verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber zwei \"intelligente\" High-End-Funktionen der fi-Reihe, die es erlauben, gemischte Dokumentb\u00fcndel mit verschiedenen Papierst\u00e4rken, Qualit\u00e4ten und Formaten effizient zu scannen.\\n\\n<b>Intelligente Mehrfachzufuhrfunktion<\/b>\\nfi-6670's intelligent multi-feed function simplifies pre-scanning preparation and improves efficiency by identifying documents that tend to trigger false multi-feed alerts,Die intelligente Mehrfachzufuhrfunktion vereinfacht die Scan-Vorbereitung und verbessert die Effizienz, indem sie Dokumente ignoriert, die dazu neigen, falsche Mehrfachzufuhralarme auszul\u00f6sen, z.B. Fotos und Haftnotizen auf Dokumenten.\\n\\nFunktionen f\u00fcr trapezf\u00f6rmige Dokumente und Dokumente mit Haftnotizen und zur Entfernung von Stanzl\u00f6chern Neben einer Funktion, die sicherstellt, dass trapezf\u00f6rmige Dokumente und Dokumente mit Reitern oder Haftnotizen komplett gescannt werden, bietet der fi-6770 eine Funktion, die runde oder rechteckige Stanzlochbilder entfernt, die beim Scannen von losen Bl\u00e4ttern, Kurierdienstformularen und \u00e4hnlichen Dokumenten entstehen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- 600dpi optical resolution, 50dpi \u2013 600dpi output resolution\\n- Flatbed and rotatable 200-sheet ADF for maximum convenience and usability\\n- Among the fastest scanners in its class: 90ppm\/180ipm (DIN A4, landscape, 200dpi)\\n- Ultrasonic double feed detection with intelligent multi-feed function\\n- Mixed batch scanning 31 to 209 g\/m\u00b2;A8-A3, long document capability up to 3 meters\\n- Selectable black or white document background\\n- Dual Interface: SCSI and USB 2.0\\n- ScandAll PRO V2 Premium with automatic job separation\\n- Bundled with VRS Professional 5.0 software image enhancement engine\\n- Scanner Central Admin: monitor running status, update drivers and software from a single location.\\n\\n<b>fi-6770<\/b>\\nThe flatbed-equipped fi-6770 is amongst the fastest scanners in its class, able to capture documents at 90ppm \/ 180ipm capable (A4, Landscape, 200 dpi). Its 200 sheet document feeder allows continuous scanning containing paper of different weights, quality and sizes and the fi-6770 can even scan paper up to 3 m long enabling digitization of electrocardiograms, instrumental data readings and other long documents. Paper scanning speeds of 80 ppm and 160 ipm are achievable at 300dpi and higher resolutions of up to 600dpi are achievable\\n\\n<b>Easy positioning<\/b>\\nExtremely compact design features an automatic document feeder that can be rotated up to 180\u00b0 giving wider options for positioning the scanner in the office. For example it can be placed against a wall or in a corner without affecting performance or reducing operational comfort. This also ensures equal ease of use for left and right-handed operators.\\n\\nfi-6770A features a flatbed for scanning material such as books...\\n\\n<b>Intelligent functions for efficient operation<\/b>\\nThe fi-6770 comes loaded with features allowing the scanner to work autonomously as a true batch document scanner.\\n\\nfi-6770's intelligent multi-feed function simplifies pre-scanning preparation and improves efficiency by identifying documents that tend to trigger false multi-feed alerts,\\n\\nIntelligent multi-feed function simplifies pre-scanning preparation and improves efficiency by identifying documents that tend to trigger false multi-feed alerts, such as documents with photos or sticky notes attached. Additionally, continuous uninterrupted scanning is achievable due to the fact that paper is fed from the bottom of the stack, allowing for more paper to added during the scanning process.\\n\\nTrapezoid-shaped and tab attached document cropping \/ punch hole removal functionality\\nThe fi-6770 scans trapezoid-shaped documents across their full width, as well as ensuring that index tab and sticky note attached documents are scanned in their entirety. In addition, the fi-6770 removes the circular and angular punch hole representations that are created from scanning loose-leaf sheets, courier service forms and other similar documents.\\n\\nStraight paper path: virtually eliminates paper jams while permitting a greater diversity of paper types.\\n\\n<b>Dust resistant sealed optical units<\/b>\\nSealed optical units in the fi-6770 guarantee that image quality is maintained, even in the most demanding environments such as factories and warehouses.\\n\\nThe fi-6770 can be used to apply virtual imprints onto the document images, including information about date and time of scanning.\\n\\n<b>ScandAll PRO V2 Professional image capture software<\/b>\\nThe bundled ScandAll PRO image capture software supports advanced functions such as:\\n\\n- Automatic job separation: The patch code, bar code or 2D matrix code based automatic job separation function allows the scanner operator to have scanned documents automatically named or routed to their appropriate folders.\\n- Indexing: Scanning information including the matrix code embedded data can be logged in comprehensive index files for efficient post scanning processing.\\n- Seamless Microsoft\u00ae Office SharePoint\u00ae Server linkage: ScandAll PRO V2 Premium enables the fi-6770 to seamlessly link with Microsoft\u00ae Office SharePoint\u00ae Server for easy digitized document sharing and viewing administration. The result is even easier document management.\\n- Scanner Central Admin console for network enabled device management.\\n\\nExcellent scanning performance is possible with the bundled premium version of ScandAll PRO V2 scanning software, which features embedded zonal OCR functionality, multi-streaming options and a wealth of output format including password protected PDF and PDF\/A formats. In daily operation tasks the user can be supported by setting up job routine profiles that can easily be ex- and imported by multiple scan stations. ScandAll PRO V2 Premium features job separation and indexing functionality using 2D codes (matrix codes).\\n\\n<b>VRS (VirtualReScan) Professional 5.0<\/b>\\nVRS Professional logoThe fi-6770 comes bundled with VRS Professional software, which simplifies the image capture operation and streamlines automated business processes. It allows information workers to focus on their productive tasks whilst at the same time supporting them by capturing information from paper documents at the click of a button.\\n\\nVRS dynamically adjusts scanner settings for each document, allowing for near-perfect image quality every time you scan. What is more, the advanced image enhancement technology of VRS Professional allows users to create images that are easier to read and index, making it easier to find, retrieve and use the captured information later on.\\n\\nCleaning up scanned images in software makes for a huge improvement in the accuracy of your OCR and ICR software. Productivity is increased as well as efficiency resulting in a greater return for your scanning investment.\\n\\nWhere higher VRS performance is required, our fi-6670A and fi-6770A models offer a built-in a Kofax Hardware VRS board that optimizes image quality on the most difficult of documents. By performing advanced image enhancements in the scanner rather than in the computer, a higher scanning speed is obtained. Its ability to create sharper images from stained documents or documents with dark coloured backgrounds guarantees highly efficient scanning."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- ScandAll PRO V2 Premium inclus \u2013 Capture de documents professionnels\\n- Duplex chargeur automatique de documents & num\u00e9risation \u00e0 plat\\n- R\u00e9solution : de 50 \u00e0 600 dpi\\n- Format de num\u00e9risation : jusqu\u2019\u00e0 A3\\n- Capacit\u00e9 de l\u00b4ADF : 200 feuilles\\n- 90 pages\/min (format horizontal) couleur ou N\/B\\n- 70 pages\/min (format vertical) couleur ou N\/B\\n- D\u00e9tection automatique du format du papier \/ d\u00e9coupe au format du document\\n- Arri\u00e8re-plan noir et blanc de la num\u00e9risation (\u00e9galement disponible en option pour le module de num\u00e9risation \u00e0 plat)\\n- Version ScandAll PRO V2 Premium\\n- VRS Professional Software\\n- Adobe\u00ae Acrobat\u00ae Standard.\\n\\n<b>fi-6770<\/b>\\nAugmentez la rentabilit\u00e9 de la production gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une intelligence de num\u00e9risation et une vitesse de traitement avanc\u00e9es\\nSon chargeur automatique accueille jusqu'\u00e0 200\u00b0pages, vous pouvez ainsi disposer de votre temps pour d'autres t\u00e2ches. Le bac papier accepte \u00e0 la fois des piles de papier d\u00e9ram\u00e9 ou de type dos carr\u00e9 contribuant ainsi \u00e0 \u00e9liminer les bourrages papier et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre la productivit\u00e9 globale du scanner.\\nDe plus, le fi-6770 peut num\u00e9riser des supports pouvant atteindre 3\u00b0m, tels que les \u00e9lectrocardiogrammes, les mesures de donn\u00e9es d'appareillage et tout autre document de cette longueur.\\n\\nVRS Professional (version logicielle) assurera une qualit\u00e9 d'image optimale ainsi qu'une simplification de la num\u00e9risation et de la manipulation du papier.\\nLe fi-6770 est aussi dot\u00e9 du logiciel de capture d'images ScandAll PRO V2 Premium, offrant les fonctionnalit\u00e9s suivantes:\\n\\n<b>S\u00e9paration automatique des t\u00e2ches<\/b>\\nSa capacit\u00e9 de lecture des codes barre et des \u00ab\u00b0codes patch \u00bb permet au fi-6770 de proc\u00e9der \u00e0 la s\u00e9paration automatique des t\u00e2ches et par corollaire, de b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier d\u2019un plus grand rendement en termes de num\u00e9risation.\\n\\n<b>Interfa\u00e7age sans probl\u00e8me avec Microsoft\u00ae Office SharePoint\u00ae Server<\/b>\\nScandAll PRO permet un interfa\u00e7age sans probl\u00e8me de fi-6770 avec Microsoft\u00ae Office SharePoint\u00ae Server pour faciliter le partage et la visualisation des documents num\u00e9ris\u00e9s. Il en d\u00e9coule une meilleure gestion des documents.\\n\\nLe fi-6770 est lui-m\u00eame \u00e9quip\u00e9 de deux fonctions de pointe fi-Series \u00ab intelligentes \u00bb qui lui permettent de num\u00e9riser des lots de documents mixtes, contenant des papiers de grammage, de qualit\u00e9 et de dimensions diff\u00e9rents.\\n\\n<b>Fonction intelligente de d\u00e9tection de chargements multiples<\/b>\\nCette fonctionnalit\u00e9 simplifie la pr\u00e9paration pr\u00e9c\u00e9dant la num\u00e9risation et en am\u00e9liore l\u2019efficacit\u00e9 en ne tenant pas compte des documents tendant \u00e0 d\u00e9clencher les fausses alertes d'un mauvais chargement, tels que des photos et des notes autocollantes jointes \u00e0 des documents.\\n\\n<b>Fonctionnalit\u00e9 de gommage des perforations et de recadrage des documents fix\u00e9s \u00e0 l'aide d'un onglet ou en oblique<\/b>\\nOutre la fonctionnalit\u00e9 garantissant la num\u00e9risation int\u00e9grale des documents en oblique ainsi que des informations indiqu\u00e9es sur une note autocollante ou index\u00e9es par un onglet, le fi-6770 offre \u00e9galement une fonction de suppression des trous circulaires et angulaires laiss\u00e9s lors de la num\u00e9risation de feuilles volantes perfor\u00e9es, de circulaires et de tout autre document similaire."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-08-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"63debfc7-0be6-49f4-9ffa-1a0905a7f5a6","identifier":"1684086","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","logitech","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Logitech LS21"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Full bass. Compact design. Connect these speakers to your PC and enjoy full, balanced audio on all your games, movies, and music.\\n\\n<b>Immerse yourself.<\/b>\\n-High-excursion drivers: Give you rich mids and clear highs from compact speakers. \\n-Down-firing subwoofer: Provides rich, deep bass to enhance movies, games, and music. \\n\\n<b>Enjoy more convenience.<\/b>\\n-Wired remote: Makes controlling power and volume easy.\\n-Headphone jack: Lets you listen in private.\\n-Cable management system: Reduces clutter."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-08-24T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f12697d5-4051-4afc-b34d-161ca10505a6","identifier":"1684107","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","cisco","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Cisco Wireless-G Business Internet Video Camera w\/ Two-Way Audio"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"12V DC 1A 110-120V AC\/60 Hz"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>High-Quality Wireless Video Surveillance Platform Provides Flexible Installation<\/b>\\n- Wireless box camera with interchangeable lenses and I\/O ports that allow flexible installation for multiple applications\\n\\n- High-quality CCD sensor with low-light sensitivity and an IR filter switcher provides optimal video image under a range of conditions\\n\\n- Simultaneous dual codecs provide optimal combination of viewing and storage of video\\n\\n- Two-way audio, IP multicast, 3GPP (3rd Generation Partnership Project), and lots of other advanced features make this solution ideal for surveillance deployments\\n\\nCisco\u00ae Small Business Video Surveillance products provide customizable ways for small business owners to monitor and protect their companies. These high-quality solutions can be optimized for many different applications and sites. Each camera can be quickly mounted using the bracket included in the package. Their compact form factor also enables the cameras to be put inside a protective enclosure for interior or exterior installations. The cameras use removable CS-mount lenses and can be customized with optional zoom, wide-angle, vari-focal, auto-iris, and other types of lenses as required for a specific application or setting.\\nThe Cisco WVC2300 Wireless-G Business Internet Video Camera can be mounted on any pan-tilt (PT) base that supports the Pelco D protocol and can be remotely rotated and controlled through an RS-485 interface. It has two input and two output ports, which can be used to connect the camera to an alarm panel, siren, passive infrared (PIR) sensors, smoke detectors, lighting switch (on\/off), door sensors, etc.\\nThe Cisco WVC2300 uses a high-quality progressive-scan charge-coupled device (CCD) sensor, delivering good-quality video. The CCD sensor also has low-light sensitivity so video can be captured even in environments with very low light or during near-dark times of day. Additionally, the camera incorporates an infrared (IR) cut filter that, when used with a separate IR lamp, allows for video capture in total darkness.\\nThe Cisco WVC2300 camera supports dual codecs (MPEG-4 and MJPEG). Both codecs can be used simultaneously. MPEG-4 gives efficient bandwidth consumption with good-quality compression and is optimal for real-time viewing of video. MJPEG gives optimal video quality with lossy compression, making it ideal for large-volume storage to a network attached storage (NAS) device.\\nThe Cisco WVC2300's audio capabilities include two-way audio, embedded microphone, external speaker and microphone ports, and voice compression. With extensive feature support, such as IP multicast, Real Time Streaming Protocol (RTSP), Real Time Protocol (RTP), and 3rd Generation Partnership Project (3GPP), it enables video to be viewed from multiple endpoints and client applications such as 3G phones, and QuickTime clients on PCs or Wi-Fi phones. The wireless capabilities of the WVC2300 include support for 1x2 multiple-input, multiple-output (MIMO), providing better range than traditional 802.11g, and strong wireless security utilizing Wi-Fi Protected Access (WPA). Support for multiple network protocols like 802.1p priority, 802.1Q VLANs, and Dynamic DNS (DDNS), make the solution ideal for multiple IP surveillance applications. The cameras can also be managed securely using HTTPS."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-08-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eef5c5e9-df38-4afb-b299-03bc91eb8ba4","identifier":"1687329","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["canon","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon CanoScan Lide 200"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Intuitiv bedienbarer LiDE-Scanner mit vier Scan-Buttons f\u00fcr Kopie, Scan, Scan-to-E-Mail und Scan-to-PDF. Das Ger\u00e4t bietet eine herausragende Aufl\u00f6sung von 4.800 dpi und 48 Bit Farbe. Ein 300-dpi-Scan im A4-Format wird in nur ca. 14 Sekunden erstellt. \\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n\\n-Kompaktes und funktionsorientiertes Design. \\n-A4-Scans mit 4.800 x 4.800 dpi. \\n-Schnelle A4-Scans mit 300 dpi. \\n-Scan-Buttons f\u00fcr Kopie, Scan, Scan-to-E-Mail und Scan-to-PDF. \\n-Staub- und Kratzerentfernung. \\n-Auto-Scan-Modus. \\n-Ein-Kabel-Anschluss via USB \u2013 kein Netzkabel erforderlich. \\n\\n<b>Preisg\u00fcnstiger LiDE-Scanner f\u00fcr Privatanwender, die Fotos und Dokumente scannen m\u00f6chten<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Detailgetreues Scannen<\/b>\\nDokumente und Fotos werden dank einer Aufl\u00f6sung von 4.800 x 4.800 dpi in hervorragender Qualit\u00e4t gescannt. Die Farbtiefe von 48 Bit sorgt f\u00fcr eine genaue Farbwiedergabe, damit Ihre Bilder bei jedem Scan m\u00f6glichst originalgetreu wiedergegeben werden.\\n\\nEchte Hochgeschwindigkeit: 300-dpi-Scans im A4-Format werden in nur ca. 14 Sekunden erstellt.\\n\\n<b>Funktionsorientiertes Design<\/b>\\nDieser elegante und kompakte Scanner verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber einen aufsteckbaren St\u00e4nder, mit dem eine vertikale Nutzung m\u00f6glich ist, sodass Sie noch mehr Platz sparen. Die praktische Z-Abdeckung mit Doppelscharnier erm\u00f6glicht das Scannen von dicken Dokumenten und sogar B\u00fcchern.\\n\\nDer Scanner verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber vier Scan-Buttons f\u00fcr die wichtigsten Funktionen. Die verf\u00fcgbaren Funktionen sind Kopieren, Scannen, Scan-to-E-Mail und Scan-to-PDF. Diese Aufgaben k\u00f6nnen mit nur einem Knopfdruck ausgef\u00fchrt werden\\n\\nDer Scanner wird mit einem einzigen USB-Kabel angeschlossen, wodurch Installation und Bedienung besonders einfach sind. Auch die Stromversorgung wird direkt \u00fcber das USB-Kabel sichergestellt, d. h. es ist kein Netzteil erforderlich.\\n\\n<b>Kreative Funktionen<\/b>\\nEine Vielzahl von Funktionen, wie z. B. der Auto-Scan-Modus tr\u00e4gt zur Benutzerfreundlichkeit des Ger\u00e4ts bei. In diesem Modus erkennt der Scanner den Typ der Vorlage (Foto oder Dokument), passt automatisch die entsprechenden Einstellungen an und speichert die Scandaten im geeignetem Format. Der Auto-Scan-Modus kann mit nur einem Klick aktiviert werden.\\n\\nDie Staub- und Kratzerentfernung ist eine weitere Funktion zur Optimierung Ihrer Fotos. Staub und Kratzer werden automatisch reduziert, und verblichene Farben auf alten Fotos werden aufgefrischt.\\n\\n<b>Software<\/b>\\nIm Lieferumfang befinden sich die Software-Applikationen ArcSoft PhotoStudio und ScanGear. MP Navigator EX sorgt f\u00fcr eine einfache Bedienung und unkomplizierte Ausf\u00fchrung auch komplexer Scanaufgaben auf Ihrem PC oder Mac."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Intuitive LiDE scanner with four EZ buttons for Copy, Scan, Email and PDF. Delivers high-quality 4800dpi resolution and 48-bit colour, with A4, 300dpi scan speeds of just 14 seconds.\\n\\n<b>Features<\/b>\\n- Compact, practical design. \\n- 4800x4800dpi A4 scanning. \\n- Fast 300dpi A4 scanning. \\n- EZ buttons to Copy, Scan, Email and create PDF. \\n- Dust and scratch reduction. \\n- Auto Scan Mode. \\n- Single USB connection. \\n\\nAffordable photo and document scanner bringing LiDE technology to the home user\\n\\n<b>Detailed scanning<\/b>\\nHigh-quality document and photo scanning is delivered with a resolution of 4800x4800dpi. The scanner also incorporates 48-bit internal colour depth, which enables a high level of photographic detail to be captured, as well as providing accurate colour reproduction so your originals always look their best.\\n\\nA4 high-speed scanning is possible, with 300dpi scans delivered in approximately 14 seconds.\\n\\n<b>Practical styling<\/b>\\nThe scanner features a compact design and comes with a clip-on stand to enable upright scanning so it not only looks good but requires minimal desk space. The inclusion of an advanced Z-lid, featuring a double-hinge design, makes it possible to scan thick documents or even books.\\n\\nFour EZ buttons covering the most common functions a user might need are a feature of the scanner. The buttons are for Copy, Scan, Email and to create PDFs \u2013 and performing each function is now as simple as pushing a button\\n\\nThe scanner is connected using a single USB cable, making it easy to install and easy to use. The USB cable connection also means there is no need for an AC adaptor to supply power to the scanner.\\n\\n<b>Creative features<\/b>\\nA range of features help to give users an enhanced experience, among them the Auto Scan Mode. This mode automatically recognises the type of original that you place in the scanner \u2013 this could be a document or a photo \u2013 and then scans and saves the material using the appropriate settings. Auto Scan Mode is a beautifully simple one-click process.\\n\\nDust and scratch removal is also available for your photos, allowing you to improve and enhance images. This automatically reduces both dust and scratches, as well as helping to restore faded colour from old photos."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Scanner LiDE intuitif \u00e0 quatre touches EZ pour les t\u00e2ches de copie, de num\u00e9risation, d'envoi par e-mail et de cr\u00e9ation de PDF. Offre une r\u00e9solution 4 800 ppp de haute qualit\u00e9 et des couleurs 48 bits, pour des num\u00e9risations au format A4 de 300 ppp \u00e0 une vitesse de 14 secondes uniquement.\\n\\n<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/b>\\n\\n-Conception compacte et pratique. \\n-Num\u00e9risation de 4 800 x 4 800 ppp au format A4. \\n-Num\u00e9risation rapide au format A4 de 300 ppp. \\n-Touches EZ pour la copie, la num\u00e9risation, l'envoi par e-mail et la cr\u00e9ation de PDF. \\n-R\u00e9duction des poussi\u00e8res et des rayures. \\n-Mode de num\u00e9risation automatique. \\n-Connexion USB unique. \\n\\n<b>Scanner abordable pour photos et documents, dot\u00e9 de la technologie LiDE<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Des num\u00e9risations d\u00e9taill\u00e9es<\/b>\\nUne r\u00e9solution de 4 800 x 4 800 ppp offre des num\u00e9risations de photos et documents de haute qualit\u00e9. Le scanner pr\u00e9sente une profondeur de couleur interne de 48 bits, ce qui g\u00e9n\u00e8re des d\u00e9tails photographiques de hauts niveaux et une reproduction chromatique pr\u00e9cise pour des originaux superbes.\\n\\nProduction rapide d'une num\u00e9risation de 300 ppp au format A4 en 14 secondes environ.\\n\\n<b>Pratique et \u00e9l\u00e9gant<\/b>\\nDe conception compacte, ce scanner est dot\u00e9 d'un support \u00e0 pince permettant de le poser \u00e0 la verticale, alliant ainsi esth\u00e9tisme et encombrement minimal. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son couvercle \u00e0 double charni\u00e8re et d\u00e9ploiement en Z, il rend possible la num\u00e9risation de documents \u00e9pais et de livres.\\n\\nIl comporte quatre touches EZ permettant \u00e0 l'utilisateur d'effectuer les t\u00e2ches les plus courantes (copie, num\u00e9risation, envoi par e-mail et cr\u00e9ation de PDF) d'une simple pression.\\n\\nLe scanner, n'utilisant qu'un seul c\u00e2ble USB, est facile \u00e0 installer et \u00e0 utiliser. Par ailleurs, la connexion par c\u00e2ble USB permet d'\u00e9viter l'utilisation d'un adaptateur secteur pour alimenter le scanner.\\n\\n<b>Des fonctions cr\u00e9atives<\/b>\\nLa gamme de fonctions du scanner, parmi lesquelles se trouve le mode de num\u00e9risation automatique, permet d'am\u00e9liorer l'exp\u00e9rience de l'utilisateur. Ce mode d\u00e9tecte automatiquement le type de l'original plac\u00e9 dans le scanner (photo ou document), puis proc\u00e8de \u00e0 la num\u00e9risation et \u00e0 l'enregistrement de celui-ci en d\u00e9finissant les param\u00e8tres appropri\u00e9s. Le mode de num\u00e9risation automatique constitue un processus extr\u00eamement simple et accessible d'un seul clic.\\n\\nLe scanner propose \u00e9galement l'\u00e9limination des poussi\u00e8res et des rayures de vos photos, offrant ainsi de plus belles images. Les poussi\u00e8res et rayures sont automatiquement att\u00e9nu\u00e9es. Les couleurs pass\u00e9es, sur de vieilles photos, sont \u00e9galement restaur\u00e9es.\\n\\n<b>Logiciel<\/b>\\nLes logiciels ArcSoft PhotoStudio et ScanGear sont inclus dans le scanner. Avec le logiciel MP Navigator EX, utiliser votre scanner et ex\u00e9cuter les t\u00e2ches de num\u00e9risation les plus complexes depuis votre PC ou votre Mac devient un jeu d'enfant."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-08-30T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"17fa21b4-117f-4fc5-88d3-56259e94ccad","identifier":"1687436","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","cisco","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Cisco Business Internet Video Camera"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"12V DC, 1A"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Cisco Small Business (ehemals Linksys by Cisco) PVC2300-EU: Business Internet Videokamera, Audio Funktionen, PoE, sendet qualitativ hochwertige Live-Videos drahtlos an das Netzwerk, F\u00e4higkeit - Bilder bei schlechten Lichtbedingungen wiederzugeben, automati.Senden von E-Mail-Nachrichten m. Videoclips bei Feststellung von Bewegungen - Motion Detection, gleichz. Unterst\u00fctzung bis zu zehn Remote-Benutzern, dazugeh\u00f6rende Software erm\u00f6glicht die \u00dcberwachung von bis zu 16 Kameras"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Whatever your surveillance needs, mounting, connecting, and accessing workplace video has never been easier. Formerly Linksys Business Series, now Cisco Small Business Video Surveillance Cameras, the PVC2300 box camera supports interchangeable lenses and filters for use in a variety of environments such as low light. Its compact size allows placement in a protective enclosure for outdoor applications.\\n\\nThe Power over Ethernet (PoE) function of the PVC2300 allows it to draw power via Ethernet cabling, enabling installations near ceilings, on rooftops, or anywhere where electrical outlets may not be available.\\n\\nAdditional features of the Cisco PVC2300 Business Internet Video Camera include:\\n\\n- Controls for mounting on a Pelco pan-tilt (PT) base, enabling remote-control movement\\n- Two input and two output ports which can be used for connecting the camera to an alarm panel, siren, light switch, etc.\\n- Removable CS-mount lenses\\n- A high-quality, progressive CCD sensor with low-light sensitivity and an IR filter switcher\\n- Support for multiple network protocols like 802.1p, 802.1q, and dynamic DNS"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-08-30T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6c989e05-2a9e-4b5e-9741-d8a1d17590d1","identifier":"1692470","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["hp","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Scanjet N6310"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Dieses flexible Ger\u00e4t scannt alle erdenklichen B\u00fcrounterlagen \u2013 von ein- und beidseitig bedruckten Dokumenten \u00fcber gebundene Berichte, Visitenkarten und Fotos bis hin zu Kleinbilddias und Negativen. Durch die verbesserte Erfassung von Dokumenten und programmierbare Direkttasten w\u00e4chst die Produktivit\u00e4t.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Dieser \u00e4u\u00dferst vielseitige Scanner erfasst einfach alles \u2013 von Einzeldokumenten bis hin zu ganzen Papierstapeln.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Ein leistungsstarker Partner im Unternehmen: Dokumente, Bilder und andere Vorlagen lassen sich mit einem einzigen flexiblen Ger\u00e4t erfassen. Papierstapel, gebundene oder geheftete Dokumente, Visitenkarten, Fotos, Kleinbilddias, Negative: Es gibt nichts, was man nicht scannen kann!<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Benutzerfreundliche Direkttasten und Funktionen f\u00fcr die automatische Optimierung von Bildern machen Scanvorg\u00e4nge noch effektiver.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Allt\u00e4gliche Aufgaben lassen sich dank Direkttasten noch effizienter bew\u00e4ltigen. Die HP Scantechnologie erm\u00f6glicht das Entzerren, Zuschneiden und Drehen digitalisierter Dateien. Bei der Umwandlung von Dokumenten in bearbeitbare digitale Dateien sorgt Color-Dropout f\u00fcr eine noch bessere optische Zeichenerkennung (OCR).<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Dank automatischer Dokumentenzuf\u00fchrung mit Duplexfunktion werden auch mehrseitige Dokumente schnell und zuverl\u00e4ssig gescannt.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Noch mehr Produktivit\u00e4t im B\u00fcro: Dokumente werden \u00fcber die automatische 50-Blatt-Dokumentenzuf\u00fchrung mit Duplexfunktion problemlos erfasst. Scannt bis zu 15 S. bzw. 6 Bilder\/Min. Die HP Scansoftware erm\u00f6glicht die Scanvorschau sowie das Bearbeiten und Anpassen von Scans. ISIS\u00ae-, TWAIN- und WIA-Treiber im Lieferumfang enthalten.\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Manage all your office scanning \u2013 single or double-sided documents, bound reports, business cards, photos and even slides and negatives \u2013 from one versatile machine. Boost productivity with document enhancement and programmable shortcuts.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Capture everything from single receipts to stacks of papers with this ultra-versatile scanner.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Put an advanced document capture device at the heart of your business and get versatile image scanning from the same machine. Scan it all \u2013 stacks of papers, bound or stapled documents, business cards, photos, 35 mm slides and negatives.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Streamline your scanning processes with easy shortcuts and automatic image enhancement features.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Complete common tasks more efficiently with one-touch shortcuts. Use HP scanning technology to automatically deskew, crop and rotate digitised files. Choose colour-drop-out to improve OCR accuracy when turning documents into editable digital files.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Scan multipage documents quickly and reliably with the duplex automatic document feeder.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Boost office productivity with easy unattended document capture using the 50-sheet duplex automatic document feeder. Scan at up to 15 ppm\/6 ipm. Preview, edit and adjust scans using HP Scanning Software. ISIS\u00ae, TWAIN and WIA drivers included.\\n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>G\u00e9rez toutes vos num\u00e9risations de bureau \u2013 documents simples ou recto verso, rapports reli\u00e9s, cartes de visite, photos, et m\u00eame diapositives et n\u00e9gatifs \u2013 sur une seule machine polyvalente. Augmentez la productivit\u00e9 avec l'am\u00e9lioration de document et les raccourcis programmables.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Capturez tout, des simples re\u00e7us aux piles de papiers, avec ce scanner ultra-polyvalent.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Placez un appareil de capture de document avanc\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de votre soci\u00e9t\u00e9 et profitez d'une num\u00e9risation d'image polyvalente \u00e0 l'aide de la m\u00eame machine fiable. Num\u00e9risez tout\u00a0: des piles de papier, des documents reli\u00e9s ou agraf\u00e9s, des cartes de visite, des photos, des diapositives et des n\u00e9gatifs\u00a0de 35\u00a0mm.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Rationalisez vos processus de num\u00e9risation avec des raccourcis et des fonctions d'am\u00e9lioration automatique d'image.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;R\u00e9alisation plus efficace des t\u00e2ches courantes (raccourcis de fonction directe). Technologie de num\u00e9risation HP pour correction des d\u00e9salignements, rognage et rotation auto. des fichiers num\u00e9ris\u00e9s. D\u00e9tourage de couleur pour am\u00e9liorer la pr\u00e9cision OCR lors de la conversion des documents en fichiers num\u00e9riques modifiables.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Num\u00e9risez des documents de plusieurs pages de fa\u00e7on rapide et faible avec le chargeur auto. de document recto verso.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Augmentez la productivit\u00e9 au bureau avec la capture facile de document sans surveillance \u00e0 l'aide du chargeur auto. de documents recto verso de 50\u00a0feuilles. Num\u00e9risez jusqu'\u00e0 15\u00a0ppm\/\/6\u00a0ipm. Pr\u00e9visualisez, modifiez et ajustez les num\u00e9risations \u00e0 l'aide de HP Scanning Software. Pilotes ISIS\u00ae, TWAIN et WIA inclus.\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-09-05T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"25648abb-3b33-4a90-b3d0-ed8499c1b09b","identifier":"1693310","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["canon","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon DR 3010C"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Herausragende Geschwindigkeiten<\/b>\\nDas System erm\u00f6glicht den m\u00fchelosen Umgang mit direkten Scanauftr\u00e4gen ebenso wie mit unternehmenskritischen Aufgaben wie dem Scannen von Rechnungs-, Bestell- und Antragsformularen. Scanvorg\u00e4nge in Schwarzwei\u00df, Graustufen und Farbe werden mit blitzschnellen 30 Seiten pro Minute durchgef\u00fchrt. Bei Schwarzwei\u00df- und Graustufenscans wird diese beeindruckende Leistung selbst bei Scans mit einer h\u00f6heren Aufl\u00f6sung von bis zu 300 dpi erreicht.\\n\\n<b>Robuste Leistung<\/b>\\nDer DR-3010C schafft beeindruckende 3.000 Scans pro Tag und ist damit einer der produktivsten Scanner seiner Klasse. Eine Dokumenteneinzugskapazit\u00e4t von 50 Blatt sorgt daf\u00fcr, dass er die Scanaufgaben problemlos meistert. \\n\\n<b>Kinderleichtes Scannen<\/b>\\nDer kompakte und moderne DR-3010C passt in jedes B\u00fcro. Dank der neun programmierbaren Funktionstasten lassen sich allt\u00e4gliche Aufgaben ganz einfach auf Knopfdruck erledigen. \\n\\nZahlreiche Funktionen wie automatische Farberkennung, automatische Textausrichtung und \u00dcberspringen leerer Seiten machen das Vorsortieren der zu scannenden Dokumente \u00fcberfl\u00fcssig. Legen Sie einfach die Dokumente in den Feeder, und der DR-3010C erledigt den Rest. Eine optische Aufl\u00f6sung von 600 dpi und moderne Bildverarbeitungsfunktionen sorgen f\u00fcr konsistent hochkar\u00e4tige Ergebnisse.\\n\\n<b>Zuverl\u00e4ssige Scanqualit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nEin abgeschr\u00e4gter Papierweg und die Retard Roller-Technologie von Canon gew\u00e4hrleisten au\u00dferordentliche Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit bei einer Vielzahl von Papierarten. Dank der Ultraschallerkennung von Doppelblatteinz\u00fcgen werden Probleme beim Papiereinzug schnell behoben. Der DR-3010C eignet sich nicht nur f\u00fcr das Scannen empfindlicher Dokumente, sondern auch f\u00fcr dickes oder gepr\u00e4gtes Papier. Im Folio-Modus lassen sich sogar Dokumente im A3-Format scannen.\\n\\n<b>Automatische Ein-\/Ausschaltfunktion<\/b>\\nDer DR-3010C geh\u00f6rt zu den energieeffizientesten Scannern seiner Klasse und schaltet sich automatisch zusammen mit dem angeschlossenen PC ein- und aus.\\n\\n<b>Umfangreiche Software<\/b>\\nDer DR-3010C mit zahlreichen leistungsstarken Softwarepaketen geliefert, darunter CapturePerfect, Adobe Acrobat 8 Standard, Scansoft Paperport SE, Nuance Omnipage SE und Presto! BizCard Reader 5 SE. \u00dcber einen mitgelieferten ISIS und Twain Treiber kann der Scanner aber auch mit jeder anderen Windows Applikation eingesetzt werden."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Superior speeds<\/b>\\nEffortlessly handle ad hoc scanning requirements as well as mission critical tasks, such as invoice, transactional or application forms scanning. Black and white, greyscale and colour scanning is carried out at a super quick 30 ppm. Plus, this impressive performance is attainable when scanning at higher resolutions of up to 300dpi for black and white and greyscale scanning.\\n\\n<b>Robust performance<\/b>\\nThe DR-3010C handles an impressive 3,000 scans per day \u2013 the most productive scanner in its class. A document feeding capacity of 50 sheets at a time means even peak workloads can be comfortably accommodated. \\n\\n<b>Easy to perform scanning<\/b>\\nThe compact and modern DR-3010C fits easily into any office. Daily tasks can be performed with one-touch simplicity, thanks to the device\u2019s nine programmable job buttons. \\n\\nNumerous features such as auto colour detection, auto text orientation, and skip blank page are included, so there\u2019s no need to pre-sort your documents before scanning. Simply load and then let the DR-3010C do the work for you. An optical resolution of 600 dpi plus all the latest image processing features ensures outstanding quality results every time.\\n\\n<b>Reliable scanning<\/b>\\nA slanted paper path and Canon\u2019s Retard Roller Technology provides outstanding reliability across a diverse range of media types. Misfeeds are quickly resolved thanks to the Ultrasonic Double Feed Detection system. You can handle anything from fragile documents to thick and embossed media. It\u2019s even possible to scan A3 documents in Folio mode: unique for a scanner of this type. \\n\\n<b>Auto Power ON\/OFF<\/b>\\nThe DR-3010C is the most energy efficient scanner in its class and can even be automatically switched on and off, in-line with the PC it\u2019s connected to.\\n\\n<b>Extensive software<\/b>\\nThe DR-3010Cs is supported by a range of powerful software including CapturePerfect, Adobe Acrobat 8 Standard, Scansoft Paperport SE, Nuance Omnipage SE and Presto! Bizcard Reader 5 SE."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le DR-3010C est le produit phare de la ligne de scanner pour groupes de travail dans les environnements de bureau les plus exigeants. Compact et d'une simplicit\u00e9 in\u00e9gal\u00e9e, il peut faire face \u00e0 vos charges de travail les plus volumineuses sans probl\u00e8me.\\n\\nSi vous recherchez un p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique fiable pour vos besoins de num\u00e9risation les plus exigeants, vous ne serez pas d\u00e9\u00e7u par le DR-3010C.\\n\\n<b>Productivit\u00e9 sup\u00e9rieure<\/b>\\n- R\u00e9pondez \u00e0 vos besoins de num\u00e9risation ad hoc sans efforts et effectuez toute t\u00e2che importante, telle que la num\u00e9risation de factures ou de formulaires de transaction ou d'application. La num\u00e9risation noir et blanc, en niveaux de gris et en couleur est effectu\u00e9e en 30 ppm. Et cette performance vaut \u00e9galement pour la num\u00e9risation \u00e0 des r\u00e9solutions sup\u00e9rieures (jusqu'\u00e0 300 ppp pour la num\u00e9risation en noir et blanc et en niveaux de gris).\\n\\n<b>Des performances fiables<\/b>\\n- Le DR-3010C peut traiter 3 000 num\u00e9risations par jour, c'est le scanner le plus productif de sa cat\u00e9gorie. Sa capacit\u00e9 d'alimentation en document de 50 feuilles \u00e0 la fois permet de faire face facilement aux charges de travail les plus importantes.\\n\\n<b>Num\u00e9risation simplifi\u00e9e<\/b>\\n- Compact et moderne, le DR-3010C s'int\u00e8gre facilement \u00e0 tout bureau. Les t\u00e2ches de tous les jours sont ex\u00e9cut\u00e9es en toute simplicit\u00e9 gr\u00e2ce aux neuf boutons programmables du p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique.\\n\\nDe nombreuses fonctions, telles que la d\u00e9tection automatique des couleurs, l'orientation automatique du texte et le passage des pages blanches, sont inclues. Pas besoin de trier vos documents avant de les num\u00e9riser. Il vous suffit de les charger et de laisser le DR-3010C faire le travail pour vous. Une r\u00e9solution optique de 600 ppp et les toutes derni\u00e8res fonctions de traitement d'image garantissent des r\u00e9sultats d'une qualit\u00e9 remarquable \u00e0 chaque num\u00e9risation.\\n\\n<b>Fiabilit\u00e9 des num\u00e9risations<\/b>\\n- Un circuit papier imprim\u00e9 et la technologie de rouleau de retardement de Canon apportent une fiabilit\u00e9 in\u00e9gal\u00e9e sur une large gamme de supports. Les probl\u00e8mes d'alimentation sont rapidement r\u00e9solus gr\u00e2ce au syst\u00e8me Ultrasonic Double Feed Detection. Vous pouvez traiter tous les types de documents, des plus fragiles aux plus \u00e9pais, en passant par le papier gaufr\u00e9. Il est m\u00eame possible de num\u00e9riser les documents A3 en mode folio : une fonction unique pour ce type de scanner.\\n\\n<b>Mise sous tension\/hors tension automatique<\/b>\\n- Le DR-3010C est le scanner le plus \u00e9conome en \u00e9nergie de sa classe et peut m\u00eame \u00eatre mis sous tension et hors tension automatiquement, en ligne, depuis le PC auquel il est connect\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Suite logicielle \u00e9tendue<\/b>\\n- Le DR-3010Cs est compatible avec de nombreux logiciels, notamment CapturePerfect, Adobe Acrobat 8 Standard, Scansoft Paperport SE, Nuance Omnipage SE et Presto!. Bizcard Reader 5 SE."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-09-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"93abe24a-7261-495a-b5e8-b8fc0c3689f8","identifier":"1712634","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony NWZ-E438F"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony NWZ-E438F. Player media type: flash-media. Display: LCD, Display resolution: 240 x 320. Audio formats supported: AAC, MP3, WMA, Video formats supported: MP4, MPEG4. Depth: 8.5, Height: 83.9. Connectivity technology: Wired"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-09-12T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:59+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f383b6d4-171c-4ffc-ae20-bb4f7731be8d","identifier":"1712638","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony NWZ-E435F"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony NWZ-E435F. Player media type: flash-media. Display: LCD, Display resolution: 240 x 320. Audio formats supported: AAC, MP3, WMA, Video formats supported: MP4, MPEG4. Depth: 8.5, Height: 83.9. Connectivity technology: Wired"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-09-12T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"98dccd5f-73df-4d77-9580-ca4640db2e36","identifier":"1712639","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony NWZ-E435F"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony NWZ-E435F. Player media type: flash-media. Display: LCD, Display resolution: 240 x 320. Audio formats supported: AAC, MP3, WMA, Video formats supported: MP4, MPEG4. Depth: 8.5, Height: 83.9. Connectivity technology: Wired"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-09-12T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3900f6ff-5b9e-4234-9177-ed8b857fe1c2","identifier":"17365344","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["canon","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon DR-G1100"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Canon DR-G1100"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-12T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2b603f3d-ed28-4690-a302-753e4f749686","identifier":"17365820","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF G25"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.37"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Weitwinkel-HD-Objektiv, erstklassige Audio-Leistung und volle manuelle Steuerung erm\u00f6glichen die Entfaltung kreativer Ambitionen.\\n\\nSpeziell f\u00fcr die kreativen Ambitionen von Video-Enthusiasten konzipiert bietet die LEGRIA HF G25 ein Weitwinkelobjektiv, umfangreiche manuelle Steuerm\u00f6glichkeiten und erstklassige Audio-Leistung f\u00fcr au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnliche HD-Aufnahmen.\\n\\n- Canon HD-Videoobjektiv\\n- Moderner Canon HD CMOS PRO Sensor\\n- Manuelle Steueroptionen\\n- Optischer Intelligent IS\\n- Audio-Szenenauswahl\\n- 8,8 cm Touchscreen-LCD\\n- Instant AF; Gesichtserkennung\\n- Sch\u00fctzende Streulichtblende\\n- 32 GB interner Speicher\\n- 2 SDXC-Kartensteckpl\u00e4tze"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Wide angle HD lens, exceptional audio and full manual controls unleash your creativity.\\n\\nDesigned to match the creative passion of video enthusiasts, the LEGRIA HF G25 features a wide angle lens, extensive manual controls and exceptional audio for stunning HD movies.\\n\\n- Canon HD Video Lens\\n- Canon\u2019s advanced HD CMOS PRO sensor\\n- Full manual control\\n- Optical Intelligent IS\\n- Audio Scene Select\\n- 8.8cm touch screen LC\\n- Instant AF; Face Detection\\n- Protective lens hood\\n- 32GB internal memory\\n- 2x SDXC slots"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Son objectif HD grand-angle, ses fonctions sonores exceptionnelles et son contr\u00f4le manuel total vous permettent d'exprimer librement votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9.\\n\\nCon\u00e7u pour r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 la passion cr\u00e9ative des vid\u00e9astes amateurs, le LEGRIA HF G25 est dot\u00e9 d'un objectif grand-angle, de multiples commandes manuelles et de fonctions sonores exceptionnelles permettant de r\u00e9aliser des vid\u00e9os HD \u00e0 couper le souffle.\\n\\n- Optique vid\u00e9o Canon HD\\n- Capteur Canon HD CMOS PRO avanc\u00e9\\n- Contr\u00f4le manuel total\\n- Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent\\n- Fonction \u00ab Audio Scene Select \u00bb\\n- \u00c9cran LCD tactile de 8,8 cm\\n- AF instantan\u00e9 ; d\u00e9tection de visages\\n- Parasoleil de protection\\n- M\u00e9moire interne de 32 Go\\n- 2 logements pour carte SDXC"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-12T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"84fb9d59-83e4-445b-a79b-eac3462a67f6","identifier":"17367464","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R46"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>WLAN f\u00fcr jedermann<\/b>\\nAuf Ihrem Android- oder iOS-Ger\u00e4t lassen sich Ihre Aufnahmen streamen, was ideal zur Kontrolle und zur Steuerung aus der Ferne ist. Die integrierte WLAN-Funktion ist ideal, um Ihre Videos ganz bequem \u00fcber Ihr soziales Netzwerk mit anderen zu teilen oder auf DLNA-zertifizierten TVs anzusehen. Die MP4-Unterst\u00fctzung erm\u00f6glicht einen schnellen Datentransfer von HD-Videos.\\n\\n<b>Optischer Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS \u2013 so hei\u00dft die perfekte L\u00f6sung gegen Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen. Das System erkennt die Aufnahmeszene und w\u00e4hlt den daf\u00fcr optimalen Bildstabilisator zur Kompensation unerw\u00fcnschter Verwacklungen, damit Ihre Aufnahmen immer gestochen scharf sind. Der optimierte Dynamic Modus korrigiert Roll- und Kippbewegungen, die typisch sind beim Filmen im Gehen f\u00fcr Videos ohne Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen in praktisch jeder Situation.\\n\\n<b>53fach Advanced Zoom; Full-HD-CMOS<\/b>\\nMit dem original Canon HD-Videoobjektiv mit 53fach Advanced Zoom halten Sie auch weit entfernte Motive brillant und detailreich fest. Der Full-HD-CMOS-Sensor sorgt f\u00fcr exzellente Full-HD-Videos mit pr\u00e4ziser Farbwiedergabe \u2013 auch bei wenig Licht.\\n\\n<b>Baby Modus<\/b>\\nMit dem Baby Modus filmen Sie die ersten Schritte, die ersten Worte oder viele andere erste Male im Leben Ihres Kindes. Sie k\u00f6nnen das Geburtsdatum des Kindes in der Kamera registrieren und farbige Markierungen f\u00fcr Gr\u00f6\u00dfe und Gewicht hinzuf\u00fcgen. Alle in diesem Modus aufgenommenen Videos werden automatisch in einem Baby-Album gespeichert.\\n\\n<b>Simultane Aufzeichnung<\/b>\\nVideos k\u00f6nnen gleichzeitig im AVCHD- und MP4-Format aufgenommen werden. Damit k\u00f6nnen Sie das Video genauso gut in erstklassiger Qualit\u00e4t vorf\u00fchren, wie auf einem Mobilger\u00e4t ansehen oder auf ein soziales Netzwerk hochladen. Die Videos werden auf dem internen Speicher und der Speicherkarte festgehalten.\\n\\n<b>Moderne Bildverarbeitung<\/b>\\nDer leistungsstarke DIGIC DV4 Bildprozessor sorgt f\u00fcr bessere Bildqualit\u00e4t bei wenig Licht und senkt im engen Zusammenspiel mit dem optischen Bildstabilisator deutlich die Unsch\u00e4rfen. Der Prozessor verarbeitet bis zu 35 Mbps in MP4 und 28 Mbps in AVCHD.\\n\\n<b>Audio-Szenenauswahl<\/b>\\nMit Audio Scene Select passt die Tonqualit\u00e4t zu den brillanten Bildern. Einfach aus 5 voreingestellten Szenen ausw\u00e4hlen und die Tonaufnahme wird automatisch auf diese Situation optimiert aufgenommen. Die Rede auf einer Hochzeit oder die Musik auf einem Konzert \u2013 Ihre Aufnahmen bringen den Ton immer richtig zur Geltung.\\n\\n<b>Bedienung per Fingertipp<\/b>\\nDas hochaufl\u00f6sende 7,5 cm (3 Zoll) gro\u00dfe Touchscreen-LCD erm\u00f6glicht eine denkbar einfache Steuerung der Einstellungen und der Wiedergabe. Beim \u00d6ffnen des Monitors startet der Camcorder selbstst\u00e4ndig, damit Sie keinen Moment verpassen.\\n\\n<b>8 GB Flash-Speicher, SDXC-Karten-Steckplatz<\/b>\\nDer Dual Flash Memory Camcorder hat einen internen 8-GB-Speicher f\u00fcr die Aufzeichnung von mehr als 3 Stunden Videomaterial. SDXC-Speicherkartenslot f\u00fcr hohe Aufzeichnungskapazit\u00e4t."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Wi-Fi for everyone<\/b>\\nEnjoy live streaming of videos to android and iOS devices, ideal for monitoring and controlling remotely. Effortlessly share your creations to social networking sites and view your videos on DLNA certified TVs. Support for MP4 ensures quick transfer times of HD movies.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake by detecting the scene and automatically selecting from four stabilisation modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. The advanced dynamic mode corrects roll and tilt movements that can occur when walking, ensuring sharp steady videos in every situation.\\n\\n<b>53x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS<\/b>\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 53x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives true HD quality and excellent colour reproduction even in low light.\\n\\n<b>Baby Mode<\/b>\\nCapture your child\u2019s first steps, first words, or many other firsts with Baby Mode. Register your child\u2019s date of birth in-camera, and add colourful stamps for height and weight. All footage will automatically be sorted to the baby album.\\n\\n<b>Simultaneous Recording<\/b>\\nMovies can be recorded in both AVCHD and MP4 simultaneously. Simply capture once and showcase exceptional quality videos or share footage to portable devices and social networking sites. Videos are stored to the internal memory and SD card.\\n\\n<b>Advanced image processing<\/b>\\nThe powerful DIGIC DV4 imaging processor ensures higher image quality in low light and a substantial reduction in image distortion as it works together with the optical image stabiliser. The processor handles high recording rates of MP4(35 Mbps) and AVCHD (28Mbps).\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nMake your movies sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select. Select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically to match the scene you\u2019re shooting. So whether you\u2019re filming speech at a wedding or music at a concert, you can enjoy immersive, realistic audio.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nSmooth operation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm capacitive touch screen LCD, giving you intuitive control of settings and simplifies playback. Opening the LCD panel quick starts the camcorder, so you\u2019ll never miss a shot.\\n\\n<b>8GB Dual Flash memory, SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nA 8GB Dual Flash memory lets you store over 3 hours of movies to the built-in memory. Record even longer with the SDXC card slot."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Le Wi-Fi pour tous<\/b>\\nB\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez de la diffusion en direct vers les appareils Android et iOS, une fonctionnalit\u00e9 id\u00e9ale pour le suivi et le contr\u00f4le \u00e0 distance. Partagez facilement vos cr\u00e9ations via des sites de r\u00e9seaux sociaux et visionnez vos vid\u00e9os sur des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs certifi\u00e9s DLNA. La prise en charge du format MP4 garantit une vitesse de transfert rapide pour les vid\u00e9os HD.\\n\\n<b>Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent<\/b>\\nLe stabilisateur d'image intelligent est la solution id\u00e9ale pour compenser les effets de vibration, car il d\u00e9tecte la sc\u00e8ne et s\u00e9lectionne automatiquement l'un des quatre modes de stabilisation pour contrebalancer les mouvements et \u00e9viter les flous de boug\u00e9. Le mode dynamique avanc\u00e9 corrige les mouvements de roulement et d'inclinaison potentiels qui surviennent lorsque vous marchez, afin d'assurer la nettet\u00e9 des vid\u00e9os en toute situation.\\n\\n<b>Zoom perfectionn\u00e9 53x ; capteur CMOS Full HD<\/b>\\nUn objectif vid\u00e9o authentique Canon HD avec zoom perfectionn\u00e9 53x vous permet de capturer vos sujets, m\u00eame \u00e9loign\u00e9s, dans leurs moindres d\u00e9tails. Le capteur Full HD CMOS offre une qualit\u00e9 HD remarquable et une excellente reproduction des couleurs, m\u00eame en conditions de faible luminosit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Mode B\u00e9b\u00e9<\/b>\\nImmortalisez les premiers pas de votre enfant, ses premiers mots et toute la magie de ces premi\u00e8res fois gr\u00e2ce au mode B\u00e9b\u00e9. Vous pouvez enregistrer la date de naissance de votre enfant dans le cam\u00e9scope et ajouter des timbres color\u00e9s indiquant sa taille et son poids. Tous vos enregistrements seront automatiquement tri\u00e9s dans l'album de votre b\u00e9b\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Enregistrement simultan\u00e9<\/b>\\nVous pouvez enregistrer vos vid\u00e9os simultan\u00e9ment aux formats AVCHD et MP4. En un seul enregistrement, vous \u00eates assur\u00e9 de r\u00e9aliser des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 exceptionnelle que vous pourrez montrer et partager via des appareils mobiles ou des sites de r\u00e9seaux sociaux. Les vid\u00e9os sont enregistr\u00e9es sur la m\u00e9moire interne et sur la carte SD.\\n\\n<b>Traitement avanc\u00e9 de l'image<\/b>\\nLe tr\u00e8s performant processeur d'image DIGIC DV4 produit une qualit\u00e9 d'image sup\u00e9rieure en basse lumi\u00e8re et r\u00e9duit de fa\u00e7on notable les distorsions d'image \u00e0 l'aide du stabilisateur d'image optique. Ce processeur peut traiter des d\u00e9bits d'enregistrement \u00e9lev\u00e9s au format MP4 (35 Mbit\/s) et au format AVCHD (28 Mbit\/s).\\n\\n<b>Fonction \u00ab Audio Scene Select \u00bb<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 exceptionnelle sur le plan tant sonore que visuel avec la fonction \u00ab Audio Scene Select \u00bb. Il vous suffit de faire votre choix parmi les 5 modes sc\u00e8ne propos\u00e9s, et les param\u00e8tres audio sont automatiquement optimis\u00e9s en fonction de la sc\u00e8ne que vous \u00eates en train de filmer. Que vous filmiez un discours de mariage ou un concert, vous b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'un son immersif et r\u00e9aliste.\\n\\n<b>Le contr\u00f4le au bout des doigts<\/b>\\nL'utilisation est ais\u00e9e gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un \u00e9cran LCD tactile capacitif haute r\u00e9solution de 7,5 cm, qui garantit un contr\u00f4le intuitif des param\u00e8tres et simplifie la lecture. L'ouverture du panneau LCD d\u00e9marre imm\u00e9diatement le cam\u00e9scope pour que vous ne manquiez aucune opportunit\u00e9 de vid\u00e9o.\\n\\n<b>Double m\u00e9moire Flash de 8 Go ; logement pour carte SDXC<\/b>\\nUne double m\u00e9moire flash de 8 Go vous permet de stocker plus de 3 heures de vid\u00e9o sur la m\u00e9moire int\u00e9gr\u00e9e. Le logement pour carte SDXC permet une dur\u00e9e d'enregistrement encore plus longue."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-12T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fe2f8c97-0232-4013-ab88-123a572e32af","identifier":"17367466","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R46"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>WLAN f\u00fcr jedermann<\/b>\\nAuf Ihrem Android- oder iOS-Ger\u00e4t lassen sich Ihre Aufnahmen streamen, was ideal zur Kontrolle und zur Steuerung aus der Ferne ist. Die integrierte WLAN-Funktion ist ideal, um Ihre Videos ganz bequem \u00fcber Ihr soziales Netzwerk mit anderen zu teilen oder auf DLNA-zertifizierten TVs anzusehen. Die MP4-Unterst\u00fctzung erm\u00f6glicht einen schnellen Datentransfer von HD-Videos.\\n\\n<b>Optischer Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS \u2013 so hei\u00dft die perfekte L\u00f6sung gegen Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen. Das System erkennt die Aufnahmeszene und w\u00e4hlt den daf\u00fcr optimalen Bildstabilisator zur Kompensation unerw\u00fcnschter Verwacklungen, damit Ihre Aufnahmen immer gestochen scharf sind. Der optimierte Dynamic Modus korrigiert Roll- und Kippbewegungen, die typisch sind beim Filmen im Gehen f\u00fcr Videos ohne Verwacklungsunsch\u00e4rfen in praktisch jeder Situation.\\n\\n<b>53fach Advanced Zoom; Full-HD-CMOS<\/b>\\nMit dem original Canon HD-Videoobjektiv mit 53fach Advanced Zoom halten Sie auch weit entfernte Motive brillant und detailreich fest. Der Full-HD-CMOS-Sensor sorgt f\u00fcr exzellente Full-HD-Videos mit pr\u00e4ziser Farbwiedergabe \u2013 auch bei wenig Licht.\\n\\n<b>Baby Modus<\/b>\\nMit dem Baby Modus filmen Sie die ersten Schritte, die ersten Worte oder viele andere erste Male im Leben Ihres Kindes. Sie k\u00f6nnen das Geburtsdatum des Kindes in der Kamera registrieren und farbige Markierungen f\u00fcr Gr\u00f6\u00dfe und Gewicht hinzuf\u00fcgen. Alle in diesem Modus aufgenommenen Videos werden automatisch in einem Baby-Album gespeichert.\\n\\n<b>Simultane Aufzeichnung<\/b>\\nVideos k\u00f6nnen gleichzeitig im AVCHD- und MP4-Format aufgenommen werden. Damit k\u00f6nnen Sie das Video genauso gut in erstklassiger Qualit\u00e4t vorf\u00fchren, wie auf einem Mobilger\u00e4t ansehen oder auf ein soziales Netzwerk hochladen. Die Videos werden auf dem internen Speicher und der Speicherkarte festgehalten.\\n\\n<b>Moderne Bildverarbeitung<\/b>\\nDer leistungsstarke DIGIC DV4 Bildprozessor sorgt f\u00fcr bessere Bildqualit\u00e4t bei wenig Licht und senkt im engen Zusammenspiel mit dem optischen Bildstabilisator deutlich die Unsch\u00e4rfen. Der Prozessor verarbeitet bis zu 35 Mbps in MP4 und 28 Mbps in AVCHD.\\n\\n<b>Audio-Szenenauswahl<\/b>\\nMit Audio Scene Select passt die Tonqualit\u00e4t zu den brillanten Bildern. Einfach aus 5 voreingestellten Szenen ausw\u00e4hlen und die Tonaufnahme wird automatisch auf diese Situation optimiert aufgenommen. Die Rede auf einer Hochzeit oder die Musik auf einem Konzert \u2013 Ihre Aufnahmen bringen den Ton immer richtig zur Geltung.\\n\\n<b>Bedienung per Fingertipp<\/b>\\nDas hochaufl\u00f6sende 7,5 cm (3 Zoll) gro\u00dfe Touchscreen-LCD erm\u00f6glicht eine denkbar einfache Steuerung der Einstellungen und der Wiedergabe. Beim \u00d6ffnen des Monitors startet der Camcorder selbstst\u00e4ndig, damit Sie keinen Moment verpassen.\\n\\n<b>8 GB Flash-Speicher, SDXC-Karten-Steckplatz<\/b>\\nDer Dual Flash Memory Camcorder hat einen internen 8-GB-Speicher f\u00fcr die Aufzeichnung von mehr als 3 Stunden Videomaterial. SDXC-Speicherkartenslot f\u00fcr hohe Aufzeichnungskapazit\u00e4t."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Wi-Fi for everyone<\/b>\\nEnjoy live streaming of videos to android and iOS devices, ideal for monitoring and controlling remotely. Effortlessly share your creations to social networking sites and view your videos on DLNA certified TVs. Support for MP4 ensures quick transfer times of HD movies.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake by detecting the scene and automatically selecting from four stabilisation modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. The advanced dynamic mode corrects roll and tilt movements that can occur when walking, ensuring sharp steady videos in every situation.\\n\\n<b>53x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS<\/b>\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 53x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives true HD quality and excellent colour reproduction even in low light.\\n\\n<b>Baby Mode<\/b>\\nCapture your child\u2019s first steps, first words, or many other firsts with Baby Mode. Register your child\u2019s date of birth in-camera, and add colourful stamps for height and weight. All footage will automatically be sorted to the baby album.\\n\\n<b>Simultaneous Recording<\/b>\\nMovies can be recorded in both AVCHD and MP4 simultaneously. Simply capture once and showcase exceptional quality videos or share footage to portable devices and social networking sites. Videos are stored to the internal memory and SD card.\\n\\n<b>Advanced image processing<\/b>\\nThe powerful DIGIC DV4 imaging processor ensures higher image quality in low light and a substantial reduction in image distortion as it works together with the optical image stabiliser. The processor handles high recording rates of MP4(35 Mbps) and AVCHD (28Mbps).\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nMake your movies sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select. Select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically to match the scene you\u2019re shooting. So whether you\u2019re filming speech at a wedding or music at a concert, you can enjoy immersive, realistic audio.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nSmooth operation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm capacitive touch screen LCD, giving you intuitive control of settings and simplifies playback. Opening the LCD panel quick starts the camcorder, so you\u2019ll never miss a shot.\\n\\n<b>8GB Dual Flash memory, SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nA 8GB Dual Flash memory lets you store over 3 hours of movies to the built-in memory. Record even longer with the SDXC card slot."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"R\u00e9alisez, diffusez et partagez des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 sup\u00e9rieure avec le cam\u00e9scope compact LEGRIA HF R46 dot\u00e9 de la fonctionnalit\u00e9 Wi-Fi.\\n\\nR\u00e9alisez et partagez de superbes vid\u00e9os sans fil avec le LEGRIA HF R46. Plongez au c\u0153ur de l'action en Full HD gr\u00e2ce au zoom perfectionn\u00e9 53\u00d7 et compensez les effets de vibration avec le stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent.\\n\\n- Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi avec prise en charge MP4\\n- Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent\\n- Zoom perfectionn\u00e9 53\u00d7, capteur CMOS Full HD\\n- Mode B\u00e9b\u00e9\\n- Enregistrement simultan\u00e9 aux formats AVCHD et MP4\\n- Processeur d'image DIGIC DV4\\n- Fonction \u00ab Audio Scene Select \u00bb\\n- \u00c9cran LCD tactile capacitif haute r\u00e9solution de 7,5 cm\\n- M\u00e9moire interne de 8 Go"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-12T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d642643e-705e-4919-83ac-04c0d4975e28","identifier":"17375623","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["fujitsu","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujitsu ScanSnap iX500"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"ScanSnap iX500 WLAN Multi-Blatt-Scanner f\u00fcr Windows & MAC.\\n\\n- Schneller und intuitiv zu nutzender Desktop-Scanner, der pro Minute bis zu 25 Dokumente ein- oder doppelseitig scannt.\\n- Drahtloses Scannen in iPhone\/iPad und Android-basierte Smartphones und Tablets.\\n- Ausgestattet mit dem GI-Prozessor von Fujitsu, der die Performance optimiert und f\u00fcr mehr Scan-Komfort sorgt.\\n- Scannt in durchsurchbare PDF-, JPEG-, Word- und Excel-Dateien, in Cloud Services and viele andere Applikatione.\\n\\n<b>Schneller und kompakter Scanner f\u00fcr das B\u00fcro oder f\u00fcr Zuhause<\/b>\\nBei der Entwicklung des ScanSnap iX500 haben wir gro\u00dfen Wert auf die Anforderungen der Anwender gelegt. Der ScanSnap iX500 ist eine komplette L\u00f6sung, mit der sich Dokumente scannen, speichern, wiederauffinden und verteilen lassen. Per einfachen Knopdruck kann der Anwender mehrseitige Dokumente, in Farbe oder schwarzwei\u00df, ein- oder doppelseitig, in digitale PDF- oder JPEG-Dateien verwandeln, die der Anwender aufbewahren, organisieren, mehreren Benutzern zur Verf\u00fcgung stellen und mailen kann. Der ScanSnap iX500 passt bequem auf jeden Schreibtisch und erm\u00f6glicht ein weitgehend papierloses Arbeiten, bei dem der Anwender jederzeit und von \u00fcberall auf seine digitalen Dokumente zugreifen kann.\\n\\n<b>Erstmals sorgen automatisierteScan-Funktionalit\u00e4ten f\u00fcr perfekte Scans<\/b>\\nDer ScanSnap iX500 verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber eine Vielzahl von integrierten Funktionen, die es f\u00fcr den Anwender noch einfacher machen, hochpr\u00e4zise Scans zu erstellen. Gemischtes Beleggut und von ein- und doppelseitigen Dokumenten lassen sich scannen, ohne dass der Anwender die Dokumente vorher sortieren muss: Der ScanSnap iX500 entfernt automatisch leere Seiten, verkehrt herum eingescannte Seiten werden auf dem Bildschirm automatisch gedreht, Dokumente in Farbe werden automatisch erkannt und so eingescannt, dass die Datei nicht zu gro\u00df wird, Stapel mit gemischtem Beleggut von Visitenkarten bis zum A4-Format werden so gescannt, dass die Gr\u00f6\u00dfe angepasst wird und kein wei\u00dfer Rand entsteht. Reduzierter Durchschlag optimiert den Scan und schief eingelegte Dokumente werden automatisch ausgerichtet.\\n\\n<b>Jetzt mit vollst\u00e4ndiger WLAN-Funktionalit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nMit dem ScanSnap iX500 lassen sich erstmals \u00fcber eine WLAN-Verbindung Dokumente direkt in ein Smartphone oder Tablet scannen, ohne den Umweg \u00fcber einen PC oder ein Notebook. Anwender k\u00f6nnen die ScanSnap Connect Application bei Google Play und iTunes kostenlos herunterladen und ihre Dokumente direkt und in Sekundenschnelle in ihr iPad, iPhone oder Android-basiertes Ger\u00e4t scannen, dort speichern oder weiterleiten.\\n\\n<b>GI-Prozessor f\u00fcr die Bildbearbeitung optimiert Scanprozess<\/b>\\nEin eingebauter Dual-Core-Prozessor sorgt daf\u00fcr, dass sich der iX500 bei der Scan-Performance und der Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit beim Papiereinzug deutlich von anderen Ger\u00e4ten abhebt \u2013 mit hohen Geschwindigkeiten \u00fcber eine USB 3.0-Schnittstelle und hohem Scanvolumen. Die hohe Scangeschwindigkeit beh\u00e4lt der Scanner auch dann bei, wenn das Zielger\u00e4t mit dieser Geschwindigkeit nicht Schritt halten kann oder wenn die Verbindung nicht optimal ist. WLAN-Funktionalit\u00e4t macht das Scannen einfach und problemlos.\\n\\n<b>Nicht einfach ein Scanner, sondern eine Scanl\u00f6sung!<\/b>\\nDer ScanSnap iX500 kann weit mehr als lediglich eingescannte Daten in elektronische Bilder zu verwandeln. Er ist mit einer Palette an Softwarel\u00f6sungen ausgestattet, die helfen, Papier in die digitale Welt und in die t\u00e4glichen Gesch\u00e4ftsprozesse zu \u00fcberf\u00fchren . Der Anwender kann ein intelligentes Quick-Men\u00fc einrichten , das nach dem Scanvorgang ge\u00f6ffnet wird und Favoriten und sogar Zielapplikationen anzeigt.\\n\\nZum Lieferumfang des Scanners geh\u00f6rt eine Vollversion von Adobe Acrobat X Standard for Windows. Damit k\u00f6nnen Anwender durchsuchbare PDFs erzeugen. Mit der ebenfalls zum Lieferumfang geh\u00f6renden Software ABBYY FineReader for Windows und Mac k\u00f6nnen Anwender sogar durchsuch- und editierbare Microsoft Word, Excel und PowerPoint-Dateien erzeugen. Mit CardMinder for Windows and Mac lassen sich Visitenkarten scannen, mit OCR bearbeiten und in eine Datenbank exportieren.\\n\\nScanSnap ist der einzige Scanner, bei dem die Anwendungen keine Scanner-Schnittstelle ben\u00f6tigen. Wenn die Applikatio PDF- oder JPEG-Dateien unterst\u00fctzt, kann der Anwender einfach ein neues ScanSnap-Profil erzeugen und in die Applikation scannen. Der neue ScanSnap Folder l\u00e4sst sich au\u00dferdem \u00fcber die Import-Funktion der Applikation nutzen. Das Scannen in Cloud-Applikationen geht damit in null Komma nichts! Einfach unter \u201cMein Computer\u201d zum ScanSnap Folder browsen und den blauen Knopf dr\u00fccken. Dann wird die Datei in die gew\u00fcnschte Anwendung importiert und verschwindet automatisch aus dem ScanSnap Folder!\\n\\n<b>Machen Sie Ihre Dokumente mobil<\/b>\\nDer Anwender kann direkt in verschiedene weit verbreitete Cloud Services wie zum Beispiel Dropbox, Evernote, Google Docs oder SugarSync scannen und so \u00fcberall und jederzeit auf seine Dokumente zugreifen. Die eingescannten Daten werden repliziert und lassen sich von jedem PC, Notebook, Smartphone oder Tablet aus anschauen.\\n\\nZudem lassen sich Visitenkarten direkt in SalesForce CRM scannen. So k\u00f6nnen Visitenkarten oder auch Dokumente \u00fcber SalesForce Chatter gemeinsam genutzt werden.\\n\\n<b>Eine gr\u00fcne L\u00f6sung!<\/b>\\nMit dem ScanSnap iX500 ist es einfach, sich von Papierdokumenten zu befreien, gleich ob im B\u00fcro, zu Hause oder unterwegs. So kann Papier wiederverwertet und wiederverwendet werden. Basierend auf Sch\u00e4tzungen von Branchenexperten wird ein typisches Papierdokument neun mal kopiert! Scannen Sie Ihr Dokument einmal und verwenden Sie die elektronische Datei. So reduzieren Sie Papierm\u00fcll und retten B\u00e4ume!"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"ScanSnap iX500 Wi-Fi Multi Sheet Scanner for Windows & MAC.\\n\\n- Speedy and intuitive desktop scanner capable of up to 25 single or double sided pages.\\n- Wirelessly scan to your smart Apple and Android devices.\\n- Fitted with Fujitsu\u2019s \u2018GI\u2019 processing engine for enhanced scanning performance and comfort.\\n- Scan to searchable PDF, JPEG, Word, Excel, Cloud services and more.\\n\\n<b>Speedy and compact scanner for the office or at home<\/b>\\nScanSnap iX500 is designed with the user in mind offering a complete scan, store, retrieve and distribute solution. A one button approach will convert colour or mono multi page, double sided documents into digital PDF or Jpg files which you can file, organise, share and email. The ScanSnap iX500 will sit comfortably in any desktop environment allowing you to become paperless and access your digital information anywhere and anytime.\\n\\n<b>Automated scan features for perfect scans first time<\/b>\\nThe ScanSnap iX500 comes with a host of intuitive inbuilt features that help facilitate effortless precision scanning with minimal user intervention. Mixed batches of single and double sided documents can be scanned without pre-sorting as the ScanSnap iX500 will automatically remove blank pages, pages scanned upside down will be rotated on screen, colour will be detected and scanned accordingly to help file size, batches of mixed size documents from business card to A4 will be scanned and size adjusted as such without white space around them. Reduced bleed through will optimise the scanned image and any pages fed in slightly off straight will be automatically straightened.\\n\\n<b>Complete Wi-Fi now enabled<\/b>\\nFor the first time the ScanSnap iX500 offers the ability to scan to a smart device without the need for a host PC or notebook via a Wi-Fi connection. Download the ScanSnap Connect Application free of charge from the official application distribution services and then scan, save and distribute your documents direct to your iPad, iPhone or Android device in the matter of seconds.\\n\\n<b>GI Image processing engine enhances the scanning process<\/b>\\nAn inbuilt dual core CPU helps set the iX500 apart when it comes to scanning performance and reliability delivering a feeding performance that you expect from a device capable of high speeds and high volumes via a USB 3.0 interface. Indeed these scanning speeds are maintained even if your target device is not up to the pace or your connectivity is lacking, scanning via a Wi-Fi connection is made effortless and hassle free.\\n\\n<b>It\u2019s not just a scanner, it\u2019s a scanning solution!<\/b>\\nFar from just converting your scanned data into digital images, the ScanSnap iX500 comes bundled with an assortment of software offerings designed to take your paper into the digital realm and into your everyday processes. An intelligent QuickMenu can be set to appear after scanning that can display favourite or even recommended destinations for your scanned data.\\n\\nThe bundled full version of Adobe Acrobat X Standard for Windows users can create searchable PDFs, additionally searchable and editable Microsoft Word, Excel and PowerPoint files can be created utilising the bundled version of ABBYY FineReader for both Windows and Mac users. CardMinder for Windows and Mac allow you to scan and OCR all your collected business cards and then export to a database package.\\n\\nScanSnap is the only scanner that does not require your application to feature a scan interface. If your application handles PDF or JPEG files, simply create a new ScanSnap profile scanning within the application. You can also use the new ScanSnap Folder, by using the import capability of your application. This makes scanning to cloud applications a breeze! Browse to the ScanSnap Folder located under My Computer and hit the blue scan button. Now, your file can be imported in your application and it will be deleted from the ScanSnap Folder automatically!\\n\\n<b>Make your documents mobile<\/b>\\nAccess your documents anywhere and anytime by scanning directly to a multitude of popular cloud services such as Dropbox, Evernote, Google Docs and SugarSync. Your scanned data will be replicated and viewable from any PC, notebook or smart device.\\n\\nAdditionally scan your business cards directly into SalesForce CRM or share them and your documents via SalesForce Chatter\\n\\n<b>A green solution!<\/b>\\nThe ScanSnap iX500 makes it easy to leave paper behind to be recycled and reused, whether you are in the office, at home or on the move. Based on industry estimates, the typical document is copied 9 times! Scan your document once and use the electronic image to reduce clutter and save more trees!"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"ScanSnap iX500 Scanner Wi-Fi Multi Page pour Windows & MAC.\\n\\n- Scanner de bureau rapide et intuitif capable de num\u00e9riser jusqu'\u00e0 25 pages recto\/verso.\\n- Num\u00e9risation en direct et sans fil vers vos appareils intelligents Apple et Android.\\n- Moteur de traitement \u00ab\u00a0GI\u00a0\u00bb pour des performances de num\u00e9risation et de confort incomparables.\\n- Num\u00e9risation en formats PDF consultable, JPEG, Word, Excel, vers des services Cloud, etc.\\n\\n<b>Un scanner rapide et compact pour le bureau<\/b>\\nLe ScanSnap iX500 a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7u pour l\u2019utilisateur final et non pour l\u2019expert en num\u00e9risation. Il offre une solution compl\u00e8te permettant de num\u00e9riser, stocker, r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer et distribuer les documents. Par une simple pression de bouton, les documents papier, couleur ou noir et blanc, imprim\u00e9s recto ou recto verso sont convertis en fichiers num\u00e9riques PDF ou JPG que vous pouvez classer, organiser, partager et envoyer par email. Le ScanSnap iX500 trouvera sa place dans tous les environnements de bureau et vous permettra d\u2019\u00e9liminer le papier afin de pouvoir acc\u00e9der \u00e0 vos informations o\u00f9 que vous soyez et \u00e0 tout moment.\\n\\n<b>Des fonctionnalit\u00e9s automatis\u00e9es pour une num\u00e9risation parfaite du premier coup<\/b>\\nLe ScanSnap iX500 est livr\u00e9 avec une foule de fonctions intuitives et int\u00e9gr\u00e9es qui permettront une num\u00e9risation irr\u00e9prochable, r\u00e9duisant l\u2019intervention de l'utilisateur au strict minimum. Des lots de documents h\u00e9t\u00e9rog\u00e8nes, imprim\u00e9s recto ou recto verso, peuvent \u00eatre num\u00e9ris\u00e9s sans tri pr\u00e9alable, car le ScanSnap iX500 va automatiquement \u00e9liminer les pages blanches et r\u00e9orienter les pages num\u00e9ris\u00e9es \u00e0 l\u2019envers. Il d\u00e9tecte \u00e9galement la pr\u00e9sence de couleur et choisit le mode le plus appropri\u00e9 afin d\u2019optimiser la taille du fichier. Il peut aussi traiter les lots de documents de formats diff\u00e9rents, de la carte de visite \u00e0 l\u2019A4, et ajuster la taille de sorte \u00e0 ce qu\u2019il n\u2019y ait pas d\u2019espace blanc autour des images. La r\u00e9duction de l\u2019effet de transparence d\u2019une face sur l\u2019autre permettra d\u2019optimiser l\u2019image num\u00e9ris\u00e9e, et les documents ins\u00e9r\u00e9s de biais seront automatiquement redress\u00e9s.\\n\\n<b>Un scanner Wi-Fi<\/b>\\nPour la premi\u00e8re fois, le ScanSnap iX500 offre la possibilit\u00e9 de num\u00e9riser vers un appareil intelligent via une connexion Wi-Fi, sans besoin d'un ordinateur ou d\u2019un portable. T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez gratuitement l\u2019application ScanSnap Connect aupr\u00e8s des services officiels de distribution des applications de votre fournisseur. Vous pouvez alors num\u00e9risez, enregistrez et partagez vos documents directement sur votre iPad, iPhone ou votre appareil Android en quelques secondes.\\n\\n<b>La num\u00e9risation grandement facilit\u00e9e par le moteur de traitement d'image \u00ab\u00a0GI\u00a0\u00bb<\/b>\\nLe processeur dual core int\u00e9gr\u00e9 permet au iX500 de se distinguer en mati\u00e8re de performances de num\u00e9risation et de fiabilit\u00e9. L\u2019efficacit\u00e9 et la vitesse d\u2019alimentation sont dignes d\u2019un appareil professionnel de grande capacit\u00e9 fonctionnant via une interface USB 3.0. En effet, la vitesse de num\u00e9risation est maintenue m\u00eame si votre p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique cible ne suit pas la cadence ou si la connectivit\u00e9 n\u2019est pas bonne. La num\u00e9risation via le Wi-Fi se fait sans effort et sans tracas.\\n\\n<b>Ce n\u2019est pas seulement un scanner, c\u2019est une solution de num\u00e9risation !<\/b>\\nLe ScanSnap iX500 ne se contente pas de convertir vos donn\u00e9es num\u00e9ris\u00e9es en images num\u00e9riques, loin de l\u00e0 ! Il est livr\u00e9 avec de nombreux logiciels con\u00e7us pour emmener votre papier dans le domaine du tout digital et vous accompagner dans vos t\u00e2ches quotidiennes. Un Quick Menu intelligent peut \u00eatre affich\u00e9 apr\u00e8s la num\u00e9risation. Celui-ci pr\u00e9sente les destinations de num\u00e9risation possibles et peut \u00eatre r\u00e9duit aux applications favorites. Il recommande m\u00eame certaines destinations pour vos donn\u00e9es num\u00e9ris\u00e9es.\\n\\nLa version compl\u00e8te d'Adobe Acrobat X standard permet aux utilisateurs de Windows de cr\u00e9er des documents PDF consultables. Le logiciel ABBYY FineReader permet \u00e9galement aux utilisateurs Windows et Mac de cr\u00e9er des fichiers Microsoft Word, Excel et PowerPoint modifiables. CardMinder pour Windows et Mac vous permet de num\u00e9riser et de reconna\u00eetre vos cartes de visites et de les exporter vers de nombreuses bases de donn\u00e9es.\\n\\nScanSnap est le seul scanner qui n\u2019exige pas d\u2019interface de num\u00e9risation dans votre application. Si votre application g\u00e8re les fichiers PDF ou JPEG, il suffit de cr\u00e9er un nouveau profil de num\u00e9risation ScanSnap pour votre application. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement utiliser le nouveau dossier \u00ab\u00a0ScanSnap Folder\u00a0\u00bb, qui permet de num\u00e9riser dans votre application en utilisant la fonction d\u2019import. La num\u00e9risation vers les applications Cloud devient alors un jeu d'enfant ! Naviguez vers le dossier \u00ab\u00a0ScanSnap Folder\u00a0\u00bb qui se trouve sous \u00ab\u00a0Mon Ordinateur\u00a0\u00bb et cliquez sur le bouton de num\u00e9risation bleu. Votre fichier peut maintenant \u00eatre import\u00e9 dans votre application et il sera supprim\u00e9 du dossier ScanSnap, automatiquement !\\n\\n<b>Vos documents se d\u00e9placent avec vous<\/b>\\nAcc\u00e9dez \u00e0 vos documents o\u00f9 que vous vous trouviez et \u00e0 tout moment en num\u00e9risant directement vers de nombreux services cloud populaires tels que Dropbox, Evernote, Google Docs et SugarSync. Vous pourrez acc\u00e9der \u00e0 vos donn\u00e9es num\u00e9ris\u00e9es sur n'importe quel p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique, PC, ordinateur portable ou appareil intelligent.\\n\\nEn outre, num\u00e9risez vos cartes de visite directement dans Salesforce CRM ou partagez-les, ainsi que vos documents, vers Salesforce Chatter.\\n\\n<b>Une solution verte !<\/b>\\nLe ScanSnap iX500 facilite l\u2019abandon du papier pour qu\u2019il puisse \u00eatre recycl\u00e9 et r\u00e9utilis\u00e9, que vous soyez au bureau, \u00e0 la maison ou en d\u00e9placement. D'apr\u00e8s les estimations de l'industrie, un document est copi\u00e9 9 fois en moyenne ! Ne num\u00e9risez votre document qu\u2019une seule fois. L'image \u00e9lectronique vous aidera \u00e0 r\u00e9duire l\u2019amoncellement de papier et \u00e0 \u00e9conomiser les arbres !"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"410f9bf7-2f40-4a28-a25f-35d5273b0324","identifier":"17375624","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["fujitsu","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Fujitsu ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe WLAN Multi-Blatt-Scanner f\u00fcr Windows & MAC.\\n\\n- Schneller und intuitiv zu nutzender Desktop-Scanner, der pro Minute bis zu 25 Dokumente ein- oder doppelseitig scannt.\\n- Drahtloses Scannen in iPhone\/iPad und Android-basierte Smartphones und Tablets.\\n- Ausgestattet mit dem GI-Prozessor von Fujitsu, der die Performance optimiert und f\u00fcr mehr Scan-Komfort sorgt.\\n- Scannt in durchsurchbare PDF-, JPEG-, Word- und Excel-Dateien, in Cloud Services and viele andere Applikationen.\\n\\n<b>Schneller und kompakter Scanner f\u00fcr das B\u00fcro oder f\u00fcr Zuhause<\/b>\\nBei der Entwicklung des ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe haben wir gro\u00dfen Wert auf die Anforderungen der Anwender gelegt. Der ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe ist eine komplette L\u00f6sung, mit der sich Dokumente scannen, speichern, wiederauffinden und verteilen lassen. Per einfachen Knopfdruck kann der Anwender mehrseitige Dokumente, in Farbe oder schwarzwei\u00df, ein- oder doppelseitig, in digitale PDF- oder JPEG-Dateien verwandeln, die der Anwender aufbewahren, organisieren, mehreren Benutzern zur Verf\u00fcgung stellen und mailen kann. Der ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe passt bequem auf jeden Schreibtisch und erm\u00f6glicht ein weitgehend papierloses Arbeiten, bei dem der Anwender jederzeit und von \u00fcberall auf seine digitalen Dokumente zugreifen kann.\\n\\n<b>Erstmals sorgen automatisierte Scan-Funktionalit\u00e4ten f\u00fcr perfekte Scans<\/b>\\nDer ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber eine Vielzahl von integrierten Funktionen, die es f\u00fcr den Anwender noch einfacher machen, hochpr\u00e4zise Scans zu erstellen. Gemischtes Beleggut und von ein- und doppelseitigen Dokumenten lassen sich scannen, ohne dass der Anwender die Dokumente vorher sortieren muss: Der ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe entfernt automatisch leere Seiten, verkehrt herum eingescannte Seiten werden auf dem Bildschirm automatisch gedreht, Dokumente in Farbe werden automatisch erkannt und so eingescannt, dass die Datei nicht zu gro\u00df wird, Stapel mit gemischtem Beleggut von Visitenkarten bis zum A4-Format werden so gescannt, dass die Gr\u00f6\u00dfe angepasst wird und kein wei\u00dfer Rand entsteht. Reduzierter Durchschlag optimiert den Scan und schief eingelegte Dokumente werden automatisch ausgerichtet.\\n\\n<b>Jetzt mit vollst\u00e4ndiger WLAN-Funktionalit\u00e4t<\/b>\\nMit dem ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe lassen sich erstmals \u00fcber eine WLAN-Verbindung Dokumente direkt in ein Smartphone oder Tablet scannen, ohne den Umweg \u00fcber einen PC oder ein Notebook. Anwender k\u00f6nnen die ScanSnap Connect Application bei Google Play und iTunes kostenlos herunterladen und ihre Dokumente direkt und in Sekundenschnelle in ihr iPad, iPhone oder Android-basiertes Ger\u00e4t scannen, dort speichern oder weiterleiten.\\n\\n<b>GI-Prozessor f\u00fcr die Bildbearbeitung optimiert Scanprozess<\/b>\\nEin eingebauter Dual-Core-Prozessor sorgt daf\u00fcr, dass sich der ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe bei der Scan-Performance und der Zuverl\u00e4ssigkeit beim Papiereinzug deutlich von anderen Ger\u00e4ten abhebt \u2013 mit hohen Geschwindigkeiten \u00fcber eine USB 3.0-Schnittstelle und hohem Scanvolumen. Die hohe Scangeschwindigkeit beh\u00e4lt der Scanner auch dann bei, wenn das Zielger\u00e4t mit dieser Geschwindigkeit nicht Schritt halten kann oder wenn die Verbindung nicht optimal ist. WLAN-Funktionalit\u00e4t macht das Scannen einfach und problemlos.\\n\\n<b>Nicht einfach ein Scanner, sondern eine Scanl\u00f6sung!<\/b>\\nDer ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe kann weit mehr als lediglich eingescannte Daten in elektronische Bilder zu verwandeln. Er ist mit einer Palette an Softwarel\u00f6sungen ausgestattet, die helfen, Papier in die digitale Welt und in die t\u00e4glichen Gesch\u00e4ftsprozesse zu \u00fcberf\u00fchren . Der Anwender kann ein intelligentes Quick-Men\u00fc einrichten , das nach dem Scanvorgang ge\u00f6ffnet wird und Favoriten und sogar Zielapplikationen anzeigt.\\n\\nZum Lieferumfang des Scanners geh\u00f6rt eine Vollversion von Adobe Acrobat X Standard for Windows. Damit k\u00f6nnen Anwender durchsuchbare PDFs erzeugen. Mit der ebenfalls zum Lieferumfang geh\u00f6renden Software ABBYY FineReader for Windows und Mac k\u00f6nnen Anwender sogar durchsuch- und editierbare Microsoft Word, Excel und PowerPoint-Dateien erzeugen. Mit CardMinder for Windows and Mac lassen sich Visitenkarten scannen, mit OCR bearbeiten und in eine Datenbank exportieren.\\n\\nMit Rack2-Filer Smart k\u00f6nnen Anwender alle gescannten Daten in einem digitalen Aktenschrank und Ordnern speichern und dann einfach wiederfinden und anschauen. Zus\u00e4tzlich k\u00f6nnen sie \u00fcber Cloud-Dienste oder mit einem mobilen Ger\u00e4t jederzeit auf diese Daten zugreifen, sie editieren und versenden. Magic Desktop erm\u00f6glicht die Verwaltung von Bild-Dateien oder von Scans, die vom ScanSnap \u00fcbertragen wurden. Dabei wird eine Schreibtischoberfl\u00e4che simuliert. Die Kommunikationsfunktion unterst\u00fctzt das Austauschen von Informationen \u00fcber verschiedene Plattformen, z.B. Facebook.\\n\\n<b>Einfaches Scannen mit Ihren wichtigsten Anwendungen<\/b>\\nScanSnap ist der einzige Scanner, bei dem die Anwendungen keine Scanner-Schnittstelle ben\u00f6tigen. Wenn die Applikation PDF- oder JPEG-Dateien unterst\u00fctzt, kann der Anwender einfach ein neues ScanSnap-Profil erzeugen und in die Applikation scannen. Der neue ScanSnap Folder l\u00e4sst sich au\u00dferdem \u00fcber die Import-Funktion der Applikation nutzen. Das Scannen in Cloud-Dienste geht damit in null Komma nichts! Einfach unter \u201cMein Computer\u201d zum ScanSnap Folder browsen und den blauen Knopf dr\u00fccken. Dann wird die Datei in die gew\u00fcnschte Applikation importiert und verschwindet automatisch aus dem ScanSnap Folder!\\n\\n<b>Machen Sie Ihre Dokumente mobil<\/b>\\nDer Anwender kann direkt in verschiedene weit verbreitete Cloud Services wie zum Beispiel Dropbox, Evernote, Google Docs oder SugarSync scannen und so \u00fcberall und jederzeit auf seine Dokumente zugreifen. Die eingescannten Daten werden repliziert und lassen sich von jedem PC, Notebook, Smartphone oder Tablet aus anschauen.\\n\\nZudem lassen sich Visitenkarten direkt in SalesForce CRM scannen. So k\u00f6nnen Visitenkarten oder auch Dokumente \u00fcber SalesForce Chatter gemeinsam genutzt werden.\\n\\n<b>Eine gr\u00fcne L\u00f6sung!<\/b>\\nMit dem ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe ist es einfach, sich von Papierdokumenten zu befreien, gleich ob im B\u00fcro, zu Hause oder unterwegs. So kann Papier wiederverwertet und wiederverwendet werden. Basierend auf Sch\u00e4tzungen von Branchenexperten wird ein typisches Papierdokument neun mal kopiert! Scannen Sie Ihr Dokument einmal und verwenden Sie die elektronische Datei. So reduzieren Sie Papierm\u00fcll und retten B\u00e4ume!"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe Wi-Fi Multi Sheet Scanner for Windows & MAC\\n\\n- Bundled with Rack2-Filer Smart (For Windows users only).\\n- Speedy and intuitive desktop scanner capable of up to 25 single or double sided pages.\\n- Wirelessly scan to your smart Apple and Android devices.\\n- Fitted with Fujitsu\u2019s \u2018GI\u2019 processing engine for enhanced scanning performance and comfort.\\n- Scan to searchable PDF, JPEG, Word, Excel, Cloud services and more.\\n\\n<b>Speedy and compact scanner for the office or at home<\/b>\\nScanSnap iX500 Deluxe is designed with the user in mind offering a complete scan, store, retrieve and distribute solution. A one button approach will convert colour or mono multi page, double sided documents into digital PDF or Jpg files which you can file, organise, share and email. The ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe will sit comfortably in any desktop environment allowing you to become paperless and access your digital information anywhere and anytime.\\n\\n<b>Automated scan features for perfect scans first time<\/b>\\nThe ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe comes with a host of intuitive inbuilt features that help facilitate effortless precision scanning with minimal user intervention. Mixed batches of single and double sided documents can be scanned without pre-sorting as the ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe will automatically remove blank pages, pages scanned upside down will be rotated on screen, colour will be detected and scanned accordingly to help file size, batches of mixed size documents from business card to A4 will be scanned and size adjusted as such without white space around them. Reduced bleed through will optimise the scanned image and any pages fed in slightly off straight will be automatically straightened.\\n\\n<b>Complete Wi-Fi now enabled<\/b>\\nFor the first time the ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe offers the abilty to scan to a smart device without the need for a host PC or notebook via a Wi-Fi connection. Download the ScanSnap Connect Application free of charge from the official application distribution services and then scan, save and distribute your documents direct to your iPad, iPhone or Android device in the matter of seconds.\\n\\n<b>GI Image processing engine enhances the scanning process<\/b>\\nAn inbuilt dual core CPU helps set the ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe apart when it comes to scanning performance and reliability delivering a feeding performance that you expect from a device capable of high speeds and high volumes via a USB 3.0 interface. Indeed these scanning speeds are maintained even if your target device is not up to the pace or your connectivity is lacking and scanning via a Wi-Fi connection is made effortless and hassle free.\\n\\n<b>It\u2019s not just a scanner, it\u2019s a scanning solution!<\/b>\\nFar from just converting your scanned data into digital images, the ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe comes bundled with an assortment of software offerings designed to take your paper into the digital realm and into your everyday processes. An intelligent QuickMenu can be set to appear after scanning that can display favourite or recommended destinations for your scanned data.\\n\\nThe bundled full version of Adobe Acrobat X Standard for Windows users can create searchable PDFs, additionally searchable and editable Microsoft Word, Excel and PowerPoint files can be created utilising the bundled version of ABBYY FineReader for both Windows and Mac users. CardMinder for Windows and Mac allow you to scan and OCR all your collected business cards and then export to a database package.\\n\\nRack2-Filer Smart enables you to organise all your previously scanned data and any newly scanned data into online bookcases and files that can then be easily retrieved and viewed. Equally via your cloud services or smart device access this data anytime and then edit, add comments or distribute. Additionally it offers the ability to organise image files or scan data imported from ScanSnap in a workspace simulating an actual desktop and there is also a communication function to aid sharing information across platforms such as Facebook.\\n\\n<b>Simplified scanning to your regularly used applications<\/b>\\nScanSnap is the only scanner that does not require your application to feature a scan interface. If your application handles PDF or JPEG files, simply create a new ScanSnap profile scanning within the application. You can also use the new ScanSnap Folder, by using the import capability of your application. This makes scanning to cloud applications a breeze! Browse to the ScanSnap Folder located under My Computer and hit the blue scan button. Now, your file can be imported in your application and it will be deleted from the ScanSnap Folder automatically!\\n\\n<b>Make your documents mobile<\/b>\\nAccess your documents anywhere and anytime by scanning directly to a multitude of popular cloud services such as Dropbox, Evernote, Google Docs and SugarSync. Your scanned data will be replicated and viewable from any PC, notebook or smart device.\\n\\nAdditionally scan your business cards directly into SalesForce CRM or share them and your documents via SalesForce Chatter\\n\\n<b>A green solution!<\/b>\\nThe ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe makes it easy to leave paper behind to be recycled and reused, whether you are in the office, at home or on the move. Based on industry estimates, the typical document is copied 9 times! Scan your document once and use the electronic image to reduce clutter and save more trees!"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe Wi-Fi Scanner Multi Page pour Windows & MAC.\\n\\n- Livr\u00e9 avec Rack2-Filer Smart, une application de gestion d\u2019information personnelle (utilisateurs Windows uniquement).\\n- Scanner de bureau rapide et intuitif capable de num\u00e9riser jusqu'\u00e0 25 pages recto\/verso.\\n- Num\u00e9risation en direct et sans fil vers vos appareils intelligents Apple et Android.\\n- Moteur de traitement \u00ab\u00a0GI\u00a0\u00bb pour des performances de num\u00e9risation et de confort incomparables.\\n- Num\u00e9risation en formats PDF consultable, JPEG, Word, Excel, vers des services Cloud, etc.\\n\\n<b>Un scanner rapide et compact pour le bureau<\/b>\\nLe ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7u pour l\u2019utilisateur final et non pour l\u2019expert en num\u00e9risation. Il offre une solution compl\u00e8te permettant de num\u00e9riser, stocker, r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer et distribuer les documents. Par une simple pression de bouton, les documents papier, couleur ou noir et blanc, imprim\u00e9s recto ou recto verso sont convertis en fichiers num\u00e9riques PDF ou JPG que vous pouvez classer, organiser, partager et envoyer par email. Le ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe trouvera sa place dans tous les environnements de bureau et vous permettra d\u2019\u00e9liminer le papier afin de pouvoir acc\u00e9der \u00e0 vos informations o\u00f9 que vous soyez et \u00e0 tout moment.\\n\\n<b>Des fonctionnalit\u00e9s automatis\u00e9es pour une num\u00e9risation parfaite du premier coup<\/b>\\nLe ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe est livr\u00e9 avec une foule de fonctions intuitives et int\u00e9gr\u00e9es qui permettront une num\u00e9risation irr\u00e9prochable, r\u00e9duisant l\u2019intervention de l'utilisateur au strict minimum. Des lots de documents h\u00e9t\u00e9rog\u00e8nes, imprim\u00e9s recto ou recto verso, peuvent \u00eatre num\u00e9ris\u00e9s sans tri pr\u00e9alable, car le ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe va automatiquement \u00e9liminer les pages blanches et r\u00e9orienter les pages num\u00e9ris\u00e9es \u00e0 l\u2019envers. Il d\u00e9tecte \u00e9galement la pr\u00e9sence de couleur et choisit le mode le plus appropri\u00e9 afin d\u2019optimiser la taille du fichier. Il peut aussi traiter les lots de documents de formats diff\u00e9rents, de la carte de visite \u00e0 l\u2019A4, et ajuster la taille de sorte \u00e0 ce qu\u2019il n\u2019y ait pas d\u2019espace blanc autour des images. La r\u00e9duction de l\u2019effet de transparence d\u2019une face sur l\u2019autre permettra d\u2019optimiser l\u2019image num\u00e9ris\u00e9e, et les documents ins\u00e9r\u00e9s de biais seront automatiquement redress\u00e9s.\\n\\n<b>Un scanner Wi-Fi<\/b>\\nPour la premi\u00e8re fois, le ScanSnap iX500 offre la possibilit\u00e9 de num\u00e9riser vers un appareil intelligent via une connexion Wi-Fi, sans besoin d'un ordinateur ou d\u2019un portable. T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez gratuitement l\u2019application ScanSnap Connect aupr\u00e8s des services officiels de distribution des applications de votre fournisseur. Vous pouvez alors num\u00e9risez, enregistrez et partagez vos documents directement sur votre iPad, iPhone ou votre appareil Android en quelques secondes.\\n\\n<b>La num\u00e9risation grandement facilit\u00e9e par le moteur de traitement d'image \u00ab\u00a0GI\u00a0\u00bb<\/b>\\nLe processeur dual core int\u00e9gr\u00e9 permet au iX500 Deluxe de se distinguer en mati\u00e8re de performances de num\u00e9risation et de fiabilit\u00e9. L\u2019efficacit\u00e9 et la vitesse d\u2019alimentation sont dignes d\u2019un appareil professionnel de grande capacit\u00e9 fonctionnant via une interface USB 3.0. En effet, la vitesse de num\u00e9risation est maintenue m\u00eame si votre p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique cible ne suit pas la cadence ou si la connectivit\u00e9 n\u2019est pas bonne. La num\u00e9risation via le Wi-Fi se fait sans effort et sans tracas.\\n\\n<b>Ce n\u2019est pas seulement un scanner c\u2019est une solution de num\u00e9risation !<\/b>\\nLe ScanSnap iX500 Deluxe e se contente pas de convertir vos donn\u00e9es num\u00e9ris\u00e9es en images num\u00e9riques, loin de l\u00e0 ! Il est livr\u00e9 avec de nombreux logiciels con\u00e7us pour emmener votre papier dans le domaine du tout digital et vous accompagner dans vos t\u00e2ches quotidiennes. Un Quick Menu intelligent peut \u00eatre affich\u00e9 apr\u00e8s la num\u00e9risation. Celui-ci pr\u00e9sente les destinations de num\u00e9risation possibles et peut \u00eatre r\u00e9duit aux applications favorites. Il recommande m\u00eame certaines destinations pour vos donn\u00e9es num\u00e9ris\u00e9es.\\n\\nLa version compl\u00e8te d'Adobe Acrobat X standard permet aux utilisateurs de Windows de cr\u00e9er des documents PDF consultables. Le logiciel ABBYY FineReader permet \u00e9galement aux utilisateurs Windows et Mac de cr\u00e9er des fichiers Microsoft Word, Excel et PowerPoint modifiables. CardMinder pour Windows et Mac vous permet de num\u00e9riser et de reconna\u00eetre vos cartes de visites et de les exporter vers de nombreuses bases de donn\u00e9es.\\n\\nRack2-Filer Smart vous permet d'organiser toutes vos donn\u00e9es num\u00e9ris\u00e9es ou autres dans des fichiers en ligne d\u2019o\u00f9 elles peuvent, ensuite, \u00eatre facilement r\u00e9cup\u00e9r\u00e9es et visualis\u00e9es. De m\u00eame, via vos services de cloud computing ou de vos appareils intelligents, vous pouvez acc\u00e9der \u00e0 vos donn\u00e9es \u00e0 tout moment, pour les modifier, ajouter des commentaires ou les distribuer. Un add-on offre la possibilit\u00e9 d'organiser les fichiers images ou les donn\u00e9es num\u00e9ris\u00e9es avec ScanSnap dans un espace de travail simulant un bureau r\u00e9el. Une fonction de communication permet \u00e9galement de faciliter le partage d'informations \u00e0 travers des plateformes telles que Facebook.\\n\\n<b>Num\u00e9risation vers vos applications les plus utilis\u00e9es<\/b>\\nScanSnap est le seul scanner qui n\u2019exige pas d\u2019interface de num\u00e9risation dans votre application. Si votre application g\u00e8re les fichiers PDF ou JPEG, il suffit de cr\u00e9er un nouveau profil de num\u00e9risation ScanSnap pour votre application. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement utiliser le nouveau dossier \u00ab\u00a0ScanSnap Folder\u00a0\u00bb, qui permet de num\u00e9riser dans votre application en utilisant la fonction d\u2019import. La num\u00e9risation vers les applications Cloud devient alors un jeu d'enfant ! Naviguez vers le dossier \u00ab\u00a0ScanSnap Folder\u00a0\u00bb qui se trouve sous \u00ab\u00a0Mon Ordinateur\u00a0\u00bb et cliquez sur le bouton de num\u00e9risation bleu. Votre fichier peut maintenant \u00eatre import\u00e9 dans votre application et il sera supprim\u00e9 du dossier ScanSnap, automatiquement !\\n\\n<b>Vos documents se d\u00e9placent avec vous<\/b>\\nAcc\u00e9dez \u00e0 vos documents o\u00f9 que vous vous trouviez et \u00e0 tout moment en num\u00e9risant directement vers de nombreux services cloud populaires tels que Dropbox, Evernote, Google Docs et SugarSync. Vous pourrez acc\u00e9der \u00e0 vos donn\u00e9es num\u00e9ris\u00e9es sur n'importe quel p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique, PC, ordinateur portable ou appareil intelligent.\\n\\nEn outre, num\u00e9risez vos cartes de visite directement dans Salesforce CRM ou partagez-les, ainsi que vos documents, vers Salesforce Chatter.\\n\\n<b>Une solution verte !<\/b>\\nLe ScanSnap iX500 facilite l\u2019abandon du papier pour qu\u2019il puisse \u00eatre recycl\u00e9 et r\u00e9utilis\u00e9, que vous soyez au bureau, \u00e0 la maison ou en d\u00e9placement. D'apr\u00e8s les estimations de l'industrie, un document est copi\u00e9 9 fois en moyenne ! Ne num\u00e9risez votre document qu\u2019une seule fois. L'image \u00e9lectronique vous aidera \u00e0 r\u00e9duire l\u2019amoncellement de papier et \u00e0 \u00e9conomiser les arbres !"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-13T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"088ade68-c3df-4695-ba0c-99df3eaed68d","identifier":"17378627","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4RGA02VN\/97 MP3 player & recorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Color your world with superb sound<\/b>\\n\\n<b>Small, fun and colorful<\/b>\\n\\nSmall and fun, the GoGEAR Raga MP3 player with FullSound brings your favorites to life.\\nPhilips Songbird ensures endless music discovery and easy synchronization, while FastCharge offers quick charging.\\n\\n<b>Superb quality sound<\/b>\\n\\nFullsoundTM to bring your MP3 music to life\\n\\n<b>Complements your life<\/b>\\n\\n- Soft and smooth finish for easy comfort and handling\\n- Full color display for intuitive and enjoyable navigation\\n- Enjoy up to 15-hour music playback\\n-\\n<b>Easy and intuitive<\/b>\\n\\n- Philips Songbird: one simple program to discover, play, sync\\n- LikeMusic for playlists of songs that sound great together\\n- Quick 6-minute charge for 60 minutes of play\\n- Folder view to organize and view media files like on your PC\\n\\n<b>FullSoundTM<\/b>\\n\\nPhilips' innovative FullSound technology faithfully restores sonic details to compressed MP3 music, dramatically enriching and enhancing it, so you can experience CD music without any distortion. Based on an audio post-processing algorithm, FullSound combines Philips' renowned expertise in music reproduction with the power of the latest generation Digital Signal Processor (DSP). The result is fuller bass with more depth and impact, boosted voice and instrument clarity, and rich detail. Rediscover your compressed MP3 music in true-to-life sound that will touch your soul and move your feet.\\n\\n<b>Philips Songbird<\/b>\\n\\nOne simple, easy-to-use program that comes with your GoGear player, Philips Songbird lets you discover and play all your media, and sync it seamlessly with your Philips GoGear. Its intuitive and powerful music management features let you discover new artists and music styles directly in the program through music and media stores, services and websites. Play your own library and media from the internet and seamlessly sync all of it from your PC to your Philips GoGear.\\n\\n<b>Fast charging (60 mins)<\/b>\\n\\nSometimes, you just need your GoGEAR player to take you from home to office and back again or for a short run \u2013 but you forgot to charge it last night. Say goodbye to frustration and boring, silent journeys with Fast Charge. Philips\u2019 smart and convenient solution lets you plug your GoGEAR to your PC or USB charger for just 6 minutes and in return, you get a whopping 60 minutes of audio playback! Fast Charge works by relying on much higher current levels to give your lithium-ion battery\\nthe power it needs to tide you over in a jiffy ... and keep the music going.\\n\\n<b>Soft and smooth finish<\/b>\\n\\nSoft and smooth finish for easy comfort and handling\\n\\n<b>Full color display<\/b>\\n\\nFull color display for intuitive and enjoyable navigation\\n\\n<b>Up to 15-hour music playback<\/b>\\n\\n<b>LikeMusic<\/b>\\n\\nLikeMusic lets you experience more of the music that you like most \u2013 with just a click! No need to sort through your music library or wait for serendipity to strike. LikeMusic is a Philips patented algorithm that analyzes songs in your library to identify similar music characteristics. These characteristics help LikeMusic create smart playlists of songs that simply sound great together. Just click on a song that you like and hit the LikeMusic icon \u2013 a playlist will instantly appear. Give it a name and enjoy your new playlist \u2013 or rediscover songs \u2013 on your PC or your GoGear player.\\n\\n<b>Folder view<\/b>\\n\\nFolder view is an optional directory view of the GoGear player that lets you view all the files on your player as if it were a computer. Once you select Folder view, opening any supported file (i.e. music, mpictures or videos) is as easy as selecting the file and hitting Play."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-14T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0063de8b-f414-4e64-8dd9-df3b3bd725cf","identifier":"1739437","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","trust"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust SoundForce 2.1"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Key features<\/b>\\n- Compact 2.1 speaker set including wooden subwoofer with a total RMS power output of 14 Watt\\n- Slim, space saving subwoofer with bass reflex port for full and rich sound with powerful bass\\n- Easy accessible volume control at the front of the subwooferr"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"75cf61ac-4b6a-45cd-a260-840848939b23","identifier":"1739447","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","trust"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust SoundForce Vivo 2.1"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Key features<\/b>\\n- Stylish 2.1 speaker set including wooden subwoofer with a total RMS power output of 42 Watt\\n- Powerful subwoofer for a deep and solid bass to boost your music and gaming experience\\n- Easily accessible wired remote with volume control, power switch and headphone connection\\n- Convenient extra line-in connection on the remote control for iPod or other portable media player\\n- Compact satellite speakers with 2x2 micro driver technology for clear mid and high range audio\\n- Extra bass control at the back of the subwoofe"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"fa0d177a-74e4-4a91-a897-93fdf3f92036","identifier":"1739452","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","trust"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust SoundForce Vivo"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Key features<\/b>\\n- Stylish stereo 2.0 speaker set with a total RMS power output of 8 Watt\\n- Bass reflex port and 2x2 micro driver technology for full and rich sound with maximised bass\\n- Convenient extra line-in connection at the front for iPod or other portable media player (cable included)\\n- Easily accessible power button and volume control at the front"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-10-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c01eb00e-d5e9-44ad-8f39-5db146edf8cb","identifier":"17396746","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF G25"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.37"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>30.4mm Wide angle lens<\/b>\\nCanon\u2019s high performance HD Video lens technology delivers a superb 30.4mm, F1.8 lens with a smooth, 10x optical zoom, and 8-Blade iris for natural looking de-focus effects.\\n\\n<b>Advanced HD CMOS Pro Sensor<\/b>\\nThe advanced HD CMOS PRO sensor gives you superb low light performance and a wide dynamic range. The sensor originally designed and manufactured by Canon for its professional camcorders has further improved light transmittance providing an extra 20%. boost in low-light sensitivity.\\n\\n<b>Full manual control<\/b>\\nA manual lens ring allows intuitive control of focus. Full manual control of exposure, aperture, shutter speed and gain is possible via the touch screen LCD. A custom key and manual dial put you in complete control of your creativity.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent Image Stabilisation<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake. It automatically detects the scene and selects exactly the right optical Image Stabilizer settings from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. It ensures sharp, detailed videos in every situation leaving you free to concentrate on shooting.\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nIt\u2019s simple to make your movies sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select and a high-sensitivity, built-in zoom microphone. Just select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically to match the scene you\u2019re shooting. Optional Canon 5.1 surround and Wireless mics are also available.\\n\\n<b>High-resolution 8.8cm Touch-screen<\/b>\\nA high-resolution 920k dot, 8.8cm touch screen LCD is optimised for shooting in HD and provides 100% coverage of the scene. A retractable, colour viewfinder adds to your shot-framing options.\\n\\n<b>Instant AF; Face Detection<\/b>\\nInstant AF provides fast and accurate focussing for pin-sharp HD quality. Face Detection automatically optimises camcorder settings for perfectly focussed and exposed people shots.\\n\\n<b>Protective lens hood with barrier<\/b>\\nA large lens hood that shuts out unwanted flare from external light sources is included as standard. It incorporates a fast-opening lens barrier that automatically protects without the need for a separate lens cap. So you will always be ready to shoot.\\n\\n<b>32GB memory plus 2x SDXC slots<\/b>\\nFull HD AVCHD video is recorded at up to 24mbps to 32GB built-in flash memory \u2013 for over 12 hours recording. Dual SDXC card slots and Relay Recording ensure enough capacity for the most ambitious movie projects."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cb25127f-8e3e-4505-8288-e1bd1886ed29","identifier":"17404814","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung NX210"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung NX210"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"1ccc7863-0d56-4a81-b9e0-1d9c162944cd","identifier":"17404815","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung NX1000"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Samsung NX1000"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-17T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5d10995a-8fbf-4f51-a6b8-27fcc9648176","identifier":"17405966","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","trust"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust Tytan 2.0"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Elegantes Lautsprecherset mit vollem Klang und leistungsstarker 36 W-Spitzenausgangsleistung (18 Watt RMS). Lautst\u00e4rke- und Bassregler sowie Kopfh\u00f6reranschluss leicht erreichbar an der Vorderseite. Zus\u00e4tzlicher Audioeingang f\u00fcr iPod, iPhone, MP3-Player usw.. Intelligentes Energiemanagement: wechselt bei Nichtgebrauch in den Standby."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Stylish speaker set producing a rich sound with a powerful 36W peak power output (18 Watt RMS). Easy to reach volume and bass controls and headphone connection at the front. Extra audio input connection for your iPod, iPhone, MP3 player etc. Smart power management: goes to stand-by when not in use."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Jeu d'enceintes \u00e9l\u00e9gantes produisant un son superbe gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une puissance en sortie (cr\u00eate) de 36\u00a0W (18\u00a0W RMS). R\u00e9glage du volume et des basses tr\u00e8s accessible et connexion pour casque \u00e0 l'avant. Connexion d'entr\u00e9e audio suppl\u00e9mentaire pour votre iPod, iPhone, lecteur MP3, etc.. Gestion \u00e9lectrique intelligente : passe en veille lorsqu'il n'est pas utilis\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3d47d7df-670f-4f34-8fa5-fda158df3793","identifier":"17406434","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony Walkman NWZ-E474"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Super slim with pure Walkman\u00ae sound and long battery life<\/b>\\n\\n8GB, 5.1cm\/2\" LCD, Clear Audio, up to 36 hrs battery life, Music Unlimited, games\\n\\n- Enjoy rich Walkman\u00ae sound with powerful bass\\n- Listen for longer with up to 36 hr battery life\\n- Easy transfers with Windows\u00ae Explorer or iTunes\\n\\n<b>Great Walkman\u00ae sound to enjoy any time<\/b>\\nImmerse yourself in all the richness and detail of Walkman\u00ae sound by Sony. Easily fill Walkman\u00ae with drag-and-drop content transfers. Play fun, challenging games while you listen. Keep listening on lengthy journeys with generous battery life.\\n\\n<b>Quality sound by Sony<\/b>\\nExperience pure, rich Walkman\u00ae sound with powerful bass. Clear Audio technologies by Sony reveal all the dynamics and detail from your music collection, even with heavily compressed digital files.\\n\\n<b>Easy transfers<\/b>\\nFill your Walkman\u00ae with drag-and-drop transfer of songs, photos, videos, podcasts and playlists (non-DRM content only) from Windows\u00ae Explorer or iTunes.\\n\\n<b>Listen for longer<\/b>\\nKeep on listening with generous battery life. Enjoy up to 36 hours music playback from a single charge - enough to keep you going on the longest journeys."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b7204b3b-ac60-4d55-96d8-d3f2c213f7fd","identifier":"17410932","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony HDR-PJ420VE"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>PJ420VE High Definition Flash-Camcorder<\/b>\\n<b>Fantastisches Filmerlebnis einfach teilen<\/b>\\n\\nFull HD, integrierter Projektor, G-Objektiv, Exmor R\u2122 CMOS Sensor, Wi-Fi Ready, Balanced Optical SteadyShot\\n\\n- Konstante Aufnahmen w\u00e4hrend Sie das Geschehen verfolgen\\n- Dank integriertem Projektor Videos \u00fcberall teilen\\n- Fangen Sie auch bei schwachem Licht mehr Bilddetails ein\\n\\n<b>Filmen und teilen, Sie haben die Kontrolle<\/b>\\n\\nDas Leben steht nicht still, warum sollten Sie still stehen? Nehmen Sie unterwegs flie\u00dfende Full HD-Videos mit Balanced Optical SteadyShot auf. Zeigen Sie sie \u00fcberall mit dem integrierten Projektor. Senden Sie Videoaufnahmen \u00fcber den Wi-Fi\u00ae Adapter* an Ihr Smartphone, und teilen Sie sie mit Freunden.\\n\\n<b>Genie\u00dfen Sie ultimative Bewegungsfreiheit<\/b>\\n\\nAufnahmen unterwegs? Ob Sie am Strand laufen oder spazieren gehen, mit Balanced Optical SteadyShot \u201eschweben\u201c Objektiv und Sensor im Camcorder, sodass keine Verwacklungen entstehen. Es gleicht bis zu 13x mehr Verwacklungen durch den Camcorder aus als herk\u00f6mmliche Bildstabilisatoren.\\n\\n<b>Filme \u00fcberall pr\u00e4sentieren<\/b>\\n\\nMit dem integrierten Projektor wird die Welt zu Ihrem Kinosaal. Dr\u00fccken Sie am Strand, auf einer Party oder einer Hochzeitsfeier auf den Ausl\u00f6ser, und teilen Sie die Aufnahmen umgehend mit anderen auf allen verf\u00fcgbaren Plattformen. Erzielen Sie auch bei Tageslicht ein helles, klares Bild mit lebendigen Farben und einer Gr\u00f6\u00dfe von bis zu 250 cm (100\").\\n\\n<b>Alles \u00fcber den Projektor ansehen<\/b>\\n\\nHaben Sie den n\u00e4chsten gro\u00dfen viralen Hit auf YouTube\u2122 gefunden? Haben Sie einige alte Heimvideos auf Ihrem Laptop gespeichert oder m\u00f6glicherweise gerade den aktuellen Hollywood-Blockbuster heruntergeladen? Stellen Sie eine HDMI\u00ae Verbindung her, und genie\u00dfen Sie sie immer und \u00fcberall auf dem gro\u00dfen Bildschirm.\\n\\n<b>Videos online \u00fcber Wi-Fi\u00ae teilen<\/b>\\n\\nTeilen Sie die Sehensw\u00fcrdigkeiten und Ger\u00e4usche Ihrer Reisen mit Freunden und Familie. Mit einem Wi-Fi\u00ae Adapter* k\u00f6nnen Sie Videos drahtlos von Ihrer Handycam\u00ae auf Ihr Smartphone oder Tablet senden und anschlie\u00dfend mit der PlayMemories\u2122 App teilen. Sie k\u00f6nnen sogar Ihre Handycam\u00ae mit Ihrem Smartphone steuern.\\n\\n<b>GPS erinnert Sie an Orte<\/b>\\n\\nWo war noch einmal der wundersch\u00f6ne Strand, den Sie letztes Jahr im Urlaub entdeckt haben? Mit GPS-Tagging geben Ihre Fotos und Videos Auskunft dar\u00fcber, an welchem Ort diese Aufnahme entstanden ist. Sie k\u00f6nnen alle Aufnahmeorte auf einer Karte anzeigen und durch Tippen darauf die Erinnerungen wiedergeben und erneut erleben.\\n\\n<b>Alles im Bild<\/b>\\n\\nMit einem G-Objektiv passt mehr auf das Bild. Ob detaillierte Nahaufnahmen von Gesichtern oder Naturaufnahmen in weiter Ferne, mit einem 26,8 mm Weitwinkelobjektiv und 55fach erweitertem Zoom nehmen Sie jede Szene auf. Egal was Ihre Aufmerksamkeit auf sich zieht, Sie erhalten jederzeit atemberaubend scharfe und klare Fotos und Full HD-Videos."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>PJ420VE Full HD Flash Memory camcorder<\/b>\\n<b>Smooth shooting meets easy sharing<\/b>\\n\\nFull HD, built-in projector, G Lens, Exmor R\u2122 CMOS sensor, Wi-Fi ready, Balanced Optical SteadyShot\\n\\n- Capture steady footage as you follow the action\\n- Show your films anywhere with built-in projector\\n- Capture more movie detail, even in low-light\\n\\n<b>Filming and sharing, you call the shots<\/b>\\n\\nLife doesn\u2019t stay still, so why should you? Shoot smooth Full HD video on the move with Balanced Optical SteadyShot. Screen it anywhere you like using the built-in projector. And use a Wi-Fi adapter* to send footage to your smartphone and share with friends.\\n\\n<b>Jump in and enjoy freedom of movement<\/b>\\n\\nShooting on the go? Whether you\u2019re running on the beach or just walking, with Balanced Optical SteadyShot the lens unit and sensor \u201cfloat\u201d within the camcorder so everything stays steady. It compensates for up to 13x more camcorder shake than traditional image stabilisation.\\n\\n<b>Share movies anywhere<\/b>\\n\\nWith a built-in projector, the world is your movie theatre. On the beach, at a party or a wedding reception, shoot and share footage straightaway on any available surface. See a bright, clear picture with vivid colours, even in daylight, up to 250cm (100 inches) big.\\n\\n<b>Watch anything via the projector<\/b>\\n\\nFound the next big viral hit on YouTube\u2122? Got some old home videos stored on your laptop, or perhaps you've just downloaded the latest Hollywood blockbuster. Connect via HDMI and you can enjoy them anytime, anywhere, on the big screen.\\n\\n<b>Share videos online with Wi-Fi<\/b>\\n\\nShare the sights and sounds of your travels with friends and family. A Wi-Fi adapter* lets you send video wirelessly to your smartphone or tablet from your Handycam\u00ae then share it online with the PlayMemories\u2122 app. You can use your smartphone to control your Handycam\u00ae too.\\n\\n<b>Remember places with GPS<\/b>\\n\\nWhere was that beautiful beach you discovered on holiday last year? With GPS tagging, photos and videos can tell you exactly where you were when you took them. See all your shooting locations marked on a map, then simply tap on one to play back and rediscover the memories.\\n\\n<b>Fit in the whole scene<\/b>\\n\\nGet more into the frame with a G Lens. With a wide angle at 26.8mm and 55x extended zoom, take on any scene from detailed close-ups of faces to faraway shots of wildlife. No matter what catches your eye, capture remarkably sharp, clear photos and Full HD video every time."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>PJ420VE Camescope Full HD avec m\u00e9moire flash<\/b>\\n<b>Enregistrement fluide, partage ais\u00e9<\/b>\\n\\nFull HD, projecteur int\u00e9gr\u00e9, objectif Sony G, capteur CMOS Exmor R\u2122, compatibilit\u00e9 Wi-Fi\u00ae, stabilisateur optique SteadyShot\u2122 \u00e9quilibr\u00e9\\n\\n- R\u00e9alisez des vid\u00e9os stables tout en suivant l'action\\n- Diffusez vos vid\u00e9os partout \u00e0 l'aide du projecteur int\u00e9gr\u00e9\\n- R\u00e9alisez des vid\u00e9os plus d\u00e9taill\u00e9es, m\u00eame par faible luminosit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Filmez, partagez<\/b>\\n\\nLa vie est faite de mouvements Capturez des vid\u00e9os Full HD parfaitement fluides tout en vous d\u00e9pla\u00e7ant gr\u00e2ce au stabilisateur optique SteadyShot\u2122 \u00e9quilibr\u00e9. Diffusez vos vid\u00e9os partout gr\u00e2ce au projecteur int\u00e9gr\u00e9. Utilisez un adaptateur Wi-Fi\u00ae pour envoyer vos vid\u00e9os sur votre smartphone et les partager avec vos amis.\\n\\n<b>Une grande libert\u00e9 de mouvement<\/b>\\n\\nVous filmez en vous d\u00e9pla\u00e7ant ? Que ce soit lors d'une course sur la plage ou d'une simple promenade, gr\u00e2ce au stabilisateur optique SteadyShot \u00e9quilibr\u00e9, l'objectif et le capteur \u00ab flottent \u00bb dans le cam\u00e9scope pour que tout reste stable. Ceci permet de compenser jusqu'\u00e0 13 fois plus de secousses que la stabilisation d'image traditionnelle.\\n\\n<b>Partagez vos films n'importe o\u00f9<\/b>\\n\\nAvec un projecteur int\u00e9gr\u00e9, le monde est votre salle de cin\u00e9ma. A la plage, lors d'une soir\u00e9e ou pendant une r\u00e9ception de mariage, filmez et partagez vos vid\u00e9os imm\u00e9diatement, sur n'importe quelle surface. B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'images claires et lumineuses, d'une taille pouvant atteindre 250 cm (100 pouces), avec des couleurs \u00e9clatantes, m\u00eame en plein jour.\\n\\n<b>Regardez tout gr\u00e2ce au projecteur<\/b>\\n\\nVous avez trouv\u00e9 la prochaine vid\u00e9o virale sur YouTube\u2122, stockez d'anciennes vid\u00e9os personnelles sur votre portable ou venez de t\u00e9l\u00e9charger le dernier film \u00e0 succ\u00e8s d'Hollywood ? Connectez-vous via HDMI\u00ae et regardez-les n'importe o\u00f9, n'importe quand sur grand \u00e9cran.\\n\\n<b>Partagez vos vid\u00e9os en ligne avec Wi-Fi\u00ae<\/b>\\n\\nPartagez les sons et les images de vos voyages avec vos amis et votre famille. Un adaptateur Wi-Fi\u00ae* permet d'envoyer des vid\u00e9os sans fil \u00e0 votre smartphone ou votre tablette depuis votre cam\u00e9scope Handycam\u00ae, puis de les partager en ligne gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'application PlayMemories\u2122. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement contr\u00f4ler votre cam\u00e9scope Handycam\u00ae avec votre smartphone.\\n\\n<b>Souvenez-vous du lieu gr\u00e2ce au GPS<\/b>\\n\\nO\u00f9 se trouve cette magnifique plage que vous avez d\u00e9couverte l'ann\u00e9e derni\u00e8re pendant vos vacances ? Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la g\u00e9olocalisation GPS, vos photos et vos vid\u00e9os peuvent vous dire exactement o\u00f9 vous vous trouviez quand vous les avez prises. Affichez tous les emplacements sur une carte, puis s\u00e9lectionnez-en un pour revivre des instants magiques.\\n\\n<b>Faites tenir toute la sc\u00e8ne<\/b>\\n\\nNe laissez plus rien ni personne hors champ gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un objectif Sony G. Avec un grand angle de 26,8 mm et un zoom \u00e9tendu 55x, vous pourrez tout prendre, des gros plans de visages aux sc\u00e8nes de nature \u00e9loign\u00e9es. Capturez tout ce qui vous int\u00e9resse, en toutes circonstances, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des photos d'une nettet\u00e9 et d'une pr\u00e9cision remarquables et \u00e0 des vid\u00e9os Full HD."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"93ab9c71-334e-4e78-98cc-67f6b1876a78","identifier":"17410933","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony HDR-PJ650VE"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"20.4"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>PJ650VE High Definition Flash-Camcorder<\/b>\\nLaufen, springen, aufnehmen und alles projizieren\\n\\nFull HD, integrierter Projektor, G-Objektiv, Exmor R\u2122 CMOS Sensor, Wi-Fi Ready, Balanced Optical SteadyShot\\n\\n- Brillante, professionelle Videos unterwegs\\n- Teilen Sie Filme \u00fcberall auf einem hellen Projektorbildschirm\\n- Fangen Sie auch bei schwachem Licht mehr Bilddetails ein\\n\\n- Schluss mit Verwacklungen der Kamera - Balanced Optical SteadyShot ist bis zu 13-mal effektiver als die Standardbildstabilisierung, sodass Sie stets hervorragende Ergebnisse erzielen\\n- Zeigen Sie Ihre Filme \u00fcberall - Der integrierte Projektor ist hell mit bis zu 20 Lumen und gibt Bilder von bis zu 250 cm (100\") wieder\\n- Teilen Sie Filme online ganz ohne Kabel - F\u00fcgen Sie einen separaten Wi-Fi\u00ae Adapter hinzu, und senden Sie mp4-Filme schnell an ein Smartphone oder Tablet, und teilen Sie sie online\\n- Videos von einem Mobiltelefon, Tablet oder PC projizieren - Schlie\u00dfen Sie z. B. ein Smartphone oder Notebook per HDMI\u00ae an, und schon k\u00f6nnen Sie Videos, Fotos, YouTube\u2122 Clips und weitere Inhalte projizieren.\\n- Erweitern Sie Ihre Horizonte dank einem G-Objektiv - Mit einem G-Weitwinkelobjektiv (26,8 mm) von Sony passt noch mehr ins Bild. So m\u00fcssen Sie auf nichts und niemanden in Ihrer Aufnahme verzichten.\\n- Integriertes GPS bring Ihre Filme auf die Karte - GPS markiert Videos und Fotos, sodass Sie wissen, wann und wo es aufgenommen wurde, und Sie k\u00f6nnen einen Ort auf der Karte ausw\u00e4hlen und den Film abspielen\\n- Motive n\u00e4her heranholen - Mit dem optischen 12fach-Zoom und dem 20fach erweiterten Zoom befinden Sie sich unmittelbar mitten im Geschehen\\n- Detailreiche Aufnahmen bei schwierigen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen - Mit dem empfindlichen Exmor R\u2122 CMOS Sensor k\u00f6nnen Sie auch bei schwierigen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen detailreiche Videos und Fotos mit weniger Bildrauschen aufnehmen.\\n- Schnelle Bewegungen mit klaren Details einfangen - Ein leistungsstarker BIONZ-Bildprozessor bietet bei Aufnahmen beweglicher Motive eine verbesserte Bildqualit\u00e4t und Leistung.\\n- Flie\u00dfende und nat\u00fcrliche, schnelle Bewegungen - Der 1920 x 1080\/50p-Modus ist ideal zum Filmen von Sportereignissen und macht Aufnahmen mit einer sehr hohen Bildwiederholrate von 50 Full HD-Bildern pro Sekunde.\\n- Bilder wie im Kino aufnehmen - Im progressiven 25p-Aufnahmemodus k\u00f6nnen Sie Full HD-Bilder mit 25 Bildern pro Sekunde filmen f\u00fcr Aufnahmen in Kinoqualit\u00e4t\\n- Filme, die so gut klingen wie sie aussehen - Ob einen Dialog oder Hintergrundger\u00e4usche, halten Sie alles in Dolby\u00ae Digital 5.1-Kanal-Surround-Sound fest f\u00fcr ein beeindruckendes Klangerlebnis\\n- Fotos in Details mit 20 Mio. Pixeln - Nehmen Sie Fotos mit einer Aufl\u00f6sung von 20,4 Mio. Pixeln auf, und halten Sie auch Standbilder aus Videoaufnahmen fest\\n- Videos und Fotos einfach ansehen und wiedergeben - Sehen Sie sich Ihre Videoaufnahmen auf dem 7,5 cm gro\u00dfen (Typ 3.0) Xtra Fine LCD\u2122-Bildschirm des Touchscreens mit hohem Kontrast und weitem Betrachtungswinkel an\\n- Einfach aufladen und anschlie\u00dfen - Das USB-Kabel kann bequem in der Handycam\u00ae verstaut werden, und ist somit immer f\u00fcr den Anschluss an einen Computer, zur \u00dcbertragung von Videos und zum Aufladen des Akkus zur Hand.\\n- Zum Teilen auslegt - Nehmen Sie Filme im beliebten mp4-Format aus, sodass Sie sie einfach online auf Facebook\u2122, YouTube\u2122 oder PlayMemories\u2122 teilen k\u00f6nnen.\\n- Einfach anvisieren und abdr\u00fccken, ohne Anpassen von Einstellungen - iAuto passt Einstellungen f\u00fcr beste Ergebnisse automatisch an, erkennt verschiedene Gesichter, Lichtverh\u00e4ltnisse und Szenen, wie Landschaften.\\n- Auch im Freien klare Soundtrackaufnahmen machen - Die erweiterte Audioverarbeitung erkennt Windst\u00e4rken und minimiert Bildrauschen, wodurch klarere Aufnahmen m\u00f6glich werden.\\n- Das Geschehen immer im Blick - Ber\u00fchren Sie zum Ausw\u00e4hlen des Motives den Touchscreen. Der Autofokus fokussiert das Motiv, selbst wenn es in Bewegung ist. Ideal f\u00fcr Aufnahmen von Kindern und beim Sport.\\n- Teilen Sie Bilder durch die einfache \u00dcbertragung - Mit der PlayMemories\u2122 Software k\u00f6nnen Sie Videos und Fotos \u00fcbertragen, organisieren, bearbeiten, drucken oder online teilen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>PJ650VE Full HD Flash Memory camcorder<\/b>\\n<b>Run, jump, shoot and project it all<\/b>\\n\\nFull HD, built-in projector, G Lens, Exmor R\u2122 CMOS sensor, Wi-Fi ready, Balanced Optical SteadyShot\\n\\n- Get smooth, professional-looking video on the go\\n- Share movies wherever on a bright projector screen\\n- Capture more movie detail, even in low-light\\n\\n<b>Now there\u2019s nothing stopping you<\/b>\\nRun, shoot, project \u2013 you\u2019ve got everything you need for life's adventures. Film while cycling, running or just moving through a party and everything stays smooth and stable. Show what you shoot anytime, any place, up to 250cm (100 inches) big with a 20 lumen built-in projector.\\n\\n<b>Jump in and enjoy freedom of movement<\/b>\\nShooting on the go? Whether you\u2019re running on the beach or just walking, with Balanced Optical SteadyShot the lens unit and sensor \u201cfloat\u201d within the camcorder so everything stays steady. It compensates for up to 13x more camcorder shake than traditional image stabilisation.\\n\\n<b>Share movies anywhere<\/b>\\nWith a built-in projector, the world is your movie theatre. On the beach, at a party or a wedding reception, shoot and share footage straightaway on any available surface. See a bright, clear picture with vivid colours, even in daylight, up to 250cm (100 inches) big.\\n\\n<b>Watch anything via the projector<\/b>\\nFound the next big viral hit on YouTube\u2122? Got some old home videos stored on your laptop, or perhaps you've just downloaded the latest Hollywood blockbuster. Connect via HDMI and you can enjoy them anytime, anywhere, on the big screen.\\n\\n<b>Share videos online with Wi-Fi<\/b>\\nShare the sights and sounds of your travels with friends and family. A Wi-Fi adapter lets you send video wirelessly to your smartphone or tablet from your Handycam\u00ae then share it online with the PlayMemories\u2122 app. You can use your smartphone to control your Handycam\u00ae too.\\n\\n<b>Remember places with GPS<\/b>\\nWhere was that beautiful beach you discovered on holiday last year? With GPS tagging, photos and videos can tell you exactly where you were when you took them. See all your shooting locations marked on a map, then simply tap on one to play back and rediscover the memories.\\n\\n<b>Fit in the whole scene<\/b>\\nGet more into the frame with a G Lens. With a wide angle at 26.8mm and 20x extended zoom, take on any scene from detailed close-ups of faces to faraway shots of wildlife. No matter what catches your eye, capture remarkably sharp, clear photos and Full HD video every time."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Full HD, projecteur int\u00e9gr\u00e9, objectif Sony G, capteur CMOS Exmor R\u2122, compatibilit\u00e9 Wi-Fi\u00ae, stabilisateur optique SteadyShot\u2122 \u00e9quilibr\u00e9\\n\\n- Profitez de vid\u00e9os fluides et professionnelles en d\u00e9placement.\\n- Partagez vos vid\u00e9os o\u00f9 que vous soyez sur un \u00e9cran de projection ultra-lumineux.\\n- R\u00e9alisez des vid\u00e9os plus d\u00e9taill\u00e9es, m\u00eame par faible luminosit\u00e9\\n\\nCourez, filmez, projetez : tout ce dont vous avez besoin pour vivre vos propres aventures. Filmez \u00e0 v\u00e9lo, en courant ou pendant une f\u00eate sans perdre la fluidit\u00e9 et la stabilit\u00e9 de vos images. Le projecteur int\u00e9gr\u00e9 de 20 lumens vous permet de partager vos vid\u00e9os \u00e0 tout moment et en toutes circonstances en profitant d'une image pouvant atteindre 250 cm.\\n\\n<b>Une grande libert\u00e9 de mouvement<\/b>\\nVous filmez en vous d\u00e9pla\u00e7ant ? Que ce soit lors d'une course sur la plage ou d'une simple promenade, gr\u00e2ce au stabilisateur optique SteadyShot \u00e9quilibr\u00e9, l'objectif et le capteur \u00ab flottent \u00bb dans le cam\u00e9scope pour que tout reste stable. Ceci permet de compenser jusqu'\u00e0 13 fois plus de secousses que la stabilisation d'image traditionnelle.\\n\\n<b>Partagez vos films n'importe o\u00f9<\/b>\\nAvec un projecteur int\u00e9gr\u00e9, le monde est votre salle de cin\u00e9ma. A la plage, lors d'une soir\u00e9e ou pendant une r\u00e9ception de mariage, filmez et partagez vos vid\u00e9os imm\u00e9diatement, sur n'importe quelle surface. B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'images claires et lumineuses, d'une taille pouvant atteindre 250 cm (100 pouces), avec des couleurs \u00e9clatantes, m\u00eame en plein jour.\\n\\n<b>Regardez tout gr\u00e2ce au projecteur<\/b>\\nVous avez trouv\u00e9 la prochaine vid\u00e9o virale sur YouTube\u2122, stockez d'anciennes vid\u00e9os personnelles sur votre portable ou venez de t\u00e9l\u00e9charger le dernier film \u00e0 succ\u00e8s d'Hollywood ? Connectez-vous via HDMI\u00ae et regardez-les n'importe o\u00f9, n'importe quand sur grand \u00e9cran.\\n\\n<b>Partagez vos vid\u00e9os en ligne avec Wi-Fi\u00ae<\/b>\\nPartagez les sons et les images de vos voyages avec vos amis et votre famille. Un adaptateur Wi-Fi\u00ae* permet d'envoyer des vid\u00e9os sans fil \u00e0 votre smartphone ou votre tablette depuis votre cam\u00e9scope Handycam\u00ae, puis de les partager en ligne gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'application PlayMemories\u2122. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement contr\u00f4ler votre cam\u00e9scope Handycam\u00ae avec votre smartphone.\\n\\n<b>Souvenez-vous du lieu gr\u00e2ce au GPS<\/b>\\nO\u00f9 se trouve cette magnifique plage que vous avez d\u00e9couverte l'ann\u00e9e derni\u00e8re pendant vos vacances ? Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la g\u00e9olocalisation GPS, vos photos et vos vid\u00e9os peuvent vous dire exactement o\u00f9 vous vous trouviez quand vous les avez prises. Affichez tous les emplacements sur une carte, puis s\u00e9lectionnez-en un pour revivre des instants magiques.\\n\\n<b>Faites tenir toute la sc\u00e8ne<\/b>\\nNe laissez plus rien ni personne hors champ gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un objectif Sony G. Avec un grand angle de 26,8 mm et un zoom \u00e9tendu 20x, vous pourrez tout immortaliser, des gros plans de visages aux sc\u00e8nes de nature \u00e9loign\u00e9es. Capturez tout ce qui vous int\u00e9resse, en toutes circonstances, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des photos d'une nettet\u00e9 et d'une pr\u00e9cision remarquables et \u00e0 des vid\u00e9os Full HD."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-20T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":12}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a75cf087-1969-4932-bf5d-2e827319a7ab","identifier":"17490583","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["kodak","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Kodak i2900"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The Kodak i2900 Scanner is a robust rotary A4 desktop scanner with an ingenious book-edge flatbed scanner built right in. It features a 250-sheet feeder\/elevator and consistently high throughput speed, even when imaging double-sided and color documents at up to 300 dpi. Add in Intelligent Document Protection, as well as Kodak's Perfect Page technology and Smart Touch functionality, and you've got a fiercely powerful scanner in a remarkably compact package.\\n\\n<b>Smaller Footprint<\/b>\\n\\nSmaller footprint, bigger impact. A robust design that takes up less space but can still take on heavy-duty scanning challenges.\\n\\n<b>Feeds 250<\/b>\\n\\nGive productivity a lift. With a 250-sheet feeder\/elevator you can neatly and efficiently scan large or small batches of mixed-size documents with ease.\\n\\n<b>Flatbed<\/b>\\n\\nFlatbed at your fingertips. Our integrated book-edge A4 flatbed scanner is designed to handle all kinds of exception documents. So book pages, passports, folders, fragile documents and more are simply no match for the Kodak i2900.\\n\\n<b>Paper Path<\/b>\\n\\nAn exit strategy for long documents. Our selectable rear-exit paper path is ideal for longer or thicker documents that can be an unexpected challenge for traditional rotary scanners.\\n\\n<b>No Tear<\/b>\\n\\nUpgrade your uptime. With Intelligent Document Protection you can scan confidently, knowing that each document is safeguarded from the potential of damage during feeding.\\n\\n<b>Smart Touch<\/b>\\n\\nTotal control with a touch. Kodak's Smart Touch functionality streamlines repetitive tasks, simplifies information sharing, and makes your scanning life easier.\\n\\n<b>Perfect Page<\/b>\\n\\nBetter than ever. Kodak's Perfect Page technology optimizes image quality for data extraction and intelligently handles image-processing tasks \u2014 delivering extended functionality to many applications.\\n\\n<b>Service<\/b>\\n\\nProtect your investment. Ensure the optimal operation of your equipment and software with Kodak Essential Productivity Services and Kodak Advanced Proficiency Services. Our array of service offerings helps maximize efficiency and value in your business."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-23T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"8b0cc11b-a6fe-4da5-b7af-9cec96347669","identifier":"17494385","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R46"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Wi-Fi for everyone<\/b>\\nEnjoy live streaming of videos to android and iOS devices, ideal for monitoring and controlling remotely. Effortlessly share your creations to social networking sites and view your videos on DLNA certified TVs. Support for MP4 ensures quick transfer times of HD movies.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake by detecting the scene and automatically selecting from four stabilisation modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. The advanced dynamic mode corrects roll and tilt movements that can occur when walking, ensuring sharp steady videos in every situation.\\n\\n<b>53x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS<\/b>\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 53x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives true HD quality and excellent colour reproduction even in low light.\\n\\n<b>Baby Mode<\/b>\\nCapture your child\u2019s first steps, first words, or many other firsts with Baby Mode. Register your child\u2019s date of birth in-camera, and add colourful stamps for height and weight. All footage will automatically be sorted to the baby album.\\n\\n<b>Simultaneous Recording<\/b>\\nMovies can be recorded in both AVCHD and MP4 simultaneously. Simply capture once and showcase exceptional quality videos or share footage to portable devices and social networking sites. Videos are stored to the internal memory and SD card.\\n\\n<b>Advanced image processing<\/b>\\nThe powerful DIGIC DV4 imaging processor ensures higher image quality in low light and a substantial reduction in image distortion as it works together with the optical image stabiliser. The processor handles high recording rates of MP4(35 Mbps) and AVCHD (28Mbps).\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nMake your movies sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select. Select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically to match the scene you\u2019re shooting. So whether you\u2019re filming speech at a wedding or music at a concert, you can enjoy immersive, realistic audio.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nSmooth operation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm capacitive touch screen LCD, giving you intuitive control of settings and simplifies playback. Opening the LCD panel quick starts the camcorder, so you\u2019ll never miss a shot.\\n\\n<b>8GB Dual Flash memory, SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nA 8GB Dual Flash memory lets you store over 3 hours of movies to the built-in memory. Record even longer with the SDXC card slot."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3843b17f-3c66-45af-a7a3-ee145ccfb433","identifier":"17494386","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA 8155B015 hand-held camcorder"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Capture Full HD movies without ever worrying about camera shake with the LEGRIA HF R406. Get closer with 53x Advanced zoom and create movies that sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake by detecting the scene and automatically selecting from four stabilisation modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. The advanced dynamic mode corrects roll and tilt movements that can occur when walking, ensuring sharp steady videos in every situation.\\n\\n<b>53x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS<\/b>\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 53x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives true HD quality and excellent colour reproduction even in low light, so your movies will look great on your HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Baby Mode<\/b>\\nCapture your child\u2019s first steps, first words, or many other firsts with Baby Mode. Register your child\u2019s date of birth in-camera, and add colourful stamps for height and weight. All footage will automatically be sorted to the baby album.\\n\\n<b>Advanced image processing<\/b>\\nThe powerful DIGIC DV4 imaging processor ensures higher image quality in low light and a substantial reduction in image distortion as it works together with the optical image stabiliser.\\n\\n<b>Superb quality recording<\/b>\\nBring out the best of Full HD with progressive recording at the highest rates for AVCHD(28Mbps) and MP4 (35Mbps). Whether you\u2019re showcasing or sharing, simply select the ideal format and choose from a range of recording rates.\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nIt\u2019s simple to make your movies sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select. Just select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically to match the scene you\u2019re shooting. So whether you\u2019re filming speech at a wedding or music at a concert, you can enjoy immersive, realistic audio.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nSmooth operation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm capacitive touch screen LCD, which gives you intuitive control of settings and simplifies playback. Opening the LCD panel quick starts the camcorder, so you\u2019ll never miss a moment.\\n\\n<b>Cinema-Look filters; Touch Decoration<\/b>\\nInspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters. Select from 7 adjustable colour-grading filters to capture the perfect movie scene. Adding fun effects to your movies without a PC is easy using Touch Decoration.\\n\\n<b>SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nThe LEGRIA HF R406 records Full HD movies direct to an SDXC memory card which are available in a wide range of sizes allowing you to capture hours of footage."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"6042c6c3-118a-4d04-810e-056f3a850a7a","identifier":"17494387","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF G25"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.37"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Wide angle HD lens, exceptional audio and full manual controls unleash your creativity.\\n\\nDesigned to match the creative passion of video enthusiasts, the LEGRIA HF G25 features a wide angle lens, extensive manual controls and exceptional audio for stunning HD movies.\\n\\n- Canon HD Video Lens.\\n- Canon\u2019s advanced HD CMOS PRO sensor.\\n- Full manual control.\\n- Optical Intelligent IS.\\n- Audio Scene Select.\\n- 8.8cm touch screen LC.\\n- Instant AF; Face Detection.\\n- Protective lens hood.\\n- 32GB internal memory.\\n- 2x SDXC slots."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"16aec611-08b0-46d7-b473-143fcc081319","identifier":"17494392","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R48"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Capture life\u2019s unforgettable movie moments and share them wirelessly.\\n\\nEveryone can easily capture and share beautiful movies wirelessly with the LEGRIA HF R48. You\u2019ll get closer in full HD with 53x Advanced zoom and keep your footage steady with Optical Intelligent IS.\\n\\n- Wi-Fi with MP4 support.\\n- Optical Intelligent IS.\\n- 53x Advanced zoom, Full HD CMOS.\\n- Baby Mode.\\n- Simultaneous recording of AVCHD and MP4.\\n- DIGIC DV4 image processor.\\n- Audio Scene Select.\\n- High-res 7.5cm capacitive touch screen LCD.\\n- 32GB internal storage."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7045157d-220f-42a3-9a06-a131cb10733f","identifier":"17496456","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA3MXX08W Mix 8GB* MP3 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The compact Philips GoGear Mix MP3 Player with direct USB makes file transfer a snap - no cables required. Enjoy easy, intuitive navigation on the full color display and up to 13-hour music playback with its embedded battery."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"05043e6d-8776-4cee-a58e-361f0ad0b57f","identifier":"17496476","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SPA7220"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Krachtig, rijk geluid<\/b>\\n<b>Onge\u00ebvenaarde luisterervaring<\/b>\\n40W uitgang geeft diepe, ronde tonen met minder vervorming. De 2-weg tweeter + woofer\\nontwerp produceert zowel hoge als lage tot mid-range-frequenties, het maximaliseren van output met een\\nmeer gebalanceerd geluid.\\n\\n<b>rijke, complexe klank<\/b>\\n- 40W RMS uitgangsvermogen\\n- 2-weg tweeter + woofer ontwerp\\n- Mylar tweeter voor High Definition-geluid\\n- PP chauffeur materiaal\\n- Nou gedempte driver vermindert trillingen en vervorming van het geluid\\n\\n<b>Hedendaags design<\/b>\\n- Aantrekkelijke hoogglanzende afwerking\\n\\n<b>Eenvoud<\/b>\\n- Handige aux-in en hoofdtelefoon op de voorkant van de luidspreker\\n- Eenvoudige volumeregeling op satelliet\\n- Compatibel met alle media"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Powerful, rich sound\\nUnparalled listening experience\\n40W output gives deep, rounded tones with less distortion. The 2-way tweeter + woofer\\ndesign produces both high and low to mid-range frequencies, maximizing output with a\\nmore balanced sound.\\n\\n<b>Rich, complex sound<\/b>\\n- 40W RMS output power\\n- 2-way tweeter + woofer design\\n- Mylar material tweeter for high definition sound\\n- PP driver material\\n- Well damped driver reduces vibration and sound distortion\\n\\n<b>Contemporary design<\/b>\\n- Attractive high gloss finish\\n\\n<b>Simplicity<\/b>\\n- Convenient aux-in and headphone out on front of speaker\\n- Easy volume control on satellite\\n- Compatible with any media"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Son puissant et riche<\/b>\\n<b>Exp\u00e9rience d'\u00e9coute in\u00e9gal\u00e9e<\/b>\\nSortie 40W donne des tons profonds, arrondis avec moins de distorsion. Le tweeter \u00e0 2 voies + caisson de basses\\nconception produit \u00e0 la fois haut et bas pour les fr\u00e9quences moyennes pour optimiser le flux d'une\\nson plus \u00e9quilibr\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>son riche et complexe<\/b>\\n- Puissance de sortie RMS de 40W\\n- 2 voies tweeter woofer conception +\\n- Tweeter Mylar pour un son haute d\u00e9finition\\n- Mat\u00e9riau conducteur PP\\n- Eh bien amortie pilote r\u00e9duit les vibrations et la d\u00e9formation du son\\n\\n<b>design contemporain<\/b>\\n- Attractive finition haute brillance\\n\\n<b>Simplicit\u00e9<\/b>\\n- Pratique entr\u00e9e auxiliaire et sortie casque \u00e0 l'avant du haut-parleur\\n- Contr\u00f4le du volume sur le satellite Facile\\n- Compatible avec tous les supports"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"ad4d8184-65a9-44c0-a4ac-64de5111eb74","identifier":"17496526","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4TP404KF Tap 4.3 MP3 video player"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The GoGEAR Tap 4.3\" MP3 video player puts vividly clear videos into your hands. Enjoy videos in popular formats like RMVB, MPEG4 & AVI, in HD quality. Enhance your entertainment pleasure with a 4.3\" touchscreen, built-in speaker & kickstand"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"cddb643f-7358-4056-b07d-8a71c901966f","identifier":"17496528","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4CLP04AN SoundClip 4GB* MP3 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Jive to the small and colorful GoGEAR SoundClip MP3 player. It comes with a built-in clip for attachment to clothes. Enjoys FastCharge for quick charging and up to 8-hour music playback"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e37d2640-1921-4b0c-989d-05f02e97a606","identifier":"17496614","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4CLP02PN"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Music becomes more fun<\/b>\\nJive to the small and colorful GoGEAR SoundClip MP3 player. It comes with a built-in clip for attachment to clothes. Enjoys FastCharge for quick charging and up to 8-hour music playback\\n\\n<b>Superb quality sound<\/b>\\n- FullsoundTM to bring your MP3 music to life\\n<b>Complements your life<\/b>\\n- Built-in clip for convenient and hands-free use\\n- Enjoy up to 8-hour music playback\\n<b>Easy and intuitive<\/b>\\n- Philips Songbird: one simple program to discover, play, sync\\n- Quick 5-minute charge for 60 minutes of play"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4b8e5da0-4710-4f1a-9b46-fe1e4d56f708","identifier":"17496953","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R48"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Capture life\u2019s unforgettable movie moments and share them wirelessly.\\n\\nEveryone can easily capture and share beautiful movies wirelessly with the LEGRIA HF R48. You\u2019ll get closer in full HD with 53x Advanced zoom and keep your footage steady with Optical Intelligent IS.\\n\\n- Wi-Fi with MP4 support.\\n- Optical Intelligent IS.\\n- 53x Advanced zoom, Full HD CMOS.\\n- Baby Mode.\\n- Simultaneous recording of AVCHD and MP4.\\n- DIGIC DV4 image processor.\\n- Audio Scene Select.\\n- High-res 7.5cm capacitive touch screen LCD.\\n- 32GB internal storage."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Immortalisez les moments importants de votre vie et partagez-les en mode sans fil.\\n\\nAvec le LEGRIA HF R48, la r\u00e9alisation et le partage de superbes vid\u00e9os sans fil sont \u00e0 la port\u00e9e de tous les utilisateurs. Rapprochez-vous de vos sujets en Full HD gr\u00e2ce au zoom perfectionn\u00e9 53\u00d7 et enregistrez des vid\u00e9os incroyablement nettes avec le stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent.\\n\\n- Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi avec prise en charge MP4.\\n- Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent.\\n- Zoom perfectionn\u00e9 53\u00d7, capteur CMOS Full HD.\\n- Mode B\u00e9b\u00e9.\\n- Enregistrement simultan\u00e9 aux formats AVCHD et MP4.\\n- Processeur d'image DIGIC DV4.\\n- Fonction \u00ab Audio Scene Select \u00bb.\\n- \u00c9cran LCD tactile capacitif haute r\u00e9solution de 7,5 cm.\\n- M\u00e9moire interne de 32 Go."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"f4423c31-4198-4104-9b8c-1cd7b5cdc9c5","identifier":"17496956","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF R46"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Capture, stream and share beautiful movies with the compact Wi-Fi LEGRIA HF R46 camcorder.\\n\\nCreate and share beautiful movies wirelessly with the LEGRIA HF R46. Full HD with 53x Advanced zoom gets you closer to the action while Optical Intelligent IS combats camera shake.\\n\\n- Wi-Fi with MP4 support\\n- Optical Intelligent IS\\n- 53x Advanced zoom, Full HD CMOS\\n- Baby Mode\\n- Simultaneous recording of AVCHD and MP4\\n- DIGIC DV4 image processor\\n- Audio Scene Select\\n- High-res 7.5cm capacitive touch screen LCD\\n- 8GB internal storage\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi for everyone<\/b>\\nEnjoy live streaming of videos to android and iOS devices, ideal for monitoring and controlling remotely. Effortlessly share your creations to social networking sites and view your videos on DLNA certified TVs. Support for MP4 ensures quick transfer times of HD movies.\\n\\n<b>53x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS<\/b>\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 53x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives true HD quality and excellent colour reproduction even in low light.\\n\\n<b>Simultaneous Recording<\/b>\\nMovies can be recorded in both AVCHD and MP4 simultaneously. Simply capture once and showcase exceptional quality videos or share footage to portable devices and social networking sites. Videos are stored to the internal memory and SD card.\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nMake your movies sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select. Select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically to match the scene you\u2019re shooting. So whether you\u2019re filming speech at a wedding or music at a concert, you can enjoy immersive, realistic audio.\\n\\n<b>8GB Dual Flash memory, SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nA 8GB Dual Flash memory lets you store over 3 hours of movies to the built-in memory. Record even longer with the SDXC card slot.\\n\\nOptical\\n<b>Intelligent<\/b>\\nIS\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake by detecting the scene and automatically selecting from four stabilisation modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. The advanced dynamic mode corrects roll and tilt movements that can occur when walking, ensuring sharp steady videos in every situation.\\n\\n<b>Baby Mode<\/b>\\nCapture your child\u2019s first steps, first words, or many other firsts with Baby Mode. Register your child\u2019s date of birth in-camera, and add colourful stamps for height and weight. All footage will automatically be sorted to the baby album.\\n\\n<b>Advanced image processing<\/b>\\nThe powerful DIGIC DV4 imaging processor ensures higher image quality in low light and a substantial reduction in image distortion as it works together with the optical image stabiliser. The processor handles high recording rates of MP4(35 Mbps) and AVCHD (28Mbps).\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nSmooth operation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm capacitive touch screen LCD, giving you intuitive control of settings and simplifies playback. Opening the LCD panel quick starts the camcorder, so you\u2019ll never miss a shot."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"R\u00e9alisez, diffusez et partagez des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 sup\u00e9rieure avec le cam\u00e9scope compact LEGRIA HF R46 dot\u00e9 de la fonctionnalit\u00e9 Wi-Fi.\\n\\nR\u00e9alisez et partagez de superbes vid\u00e9os sans fil avec le LEGRIA HF R46. Plongez au c\u0153ur de l'action en Full HD gr\u00e2ce au zoom perfectionn\u00e9 53\u00d7 et compensez les effets de vibration avec le stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent.\\n\\n\\n- Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi avec prise en charge MP4\\n- Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent\\n- Zoom perfectionn\u00e9 53\u00d7, capteur CMOS Full HD\\n- Mode B\u00e9b\u00e9\\n- Enregistrement simultan\u00e9 aux formats AVCHD et MP4\\n- Processeur d'image DIGIC DV4\\n- Fonction \u00ab Audio Scene Select \u00bb\\n- \u00c9cran LCD tactile capacitif haute r\u00e9solution de 7,5 cm\\n- M\u00e9moire interne de 8 Go\\n\\n<b>Caract\u00e9ristiques d\u00e9taill\u00e9es<\/b>\\n<b>Le Wi-Fi pour tous<\/b>\\nB\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez de la diffusion en direct vers les appareils Android et iOS, une fonctionnalit\u00e9 id\u00e9ale pour le suivi et le contr\u00f4le \u00e0 distance. Partagez facilement vos cr\u00e9ations via des sites de r\u00e9seaux sociaux et visionnez vos vid\u00e9os sur des t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs certifi\u00e9s DLNA. La prise en charge du format MP4 garantit une vitesse de transfert rapide pour les vid\u00e9os HD.\\n\\n<b>Zoom perfectionn\u00e9 53x ; capteur CMOS Full HD<\/b>\\nUn objectif vid\u00e9o authentique Canon HD avec zoom perfectionn\u00e9 53x vous permet de capturer vos sujets, m\u00eame \u00e9loign\u00e9s, dans leurs moindres d\u00e9tails. Le capteur Full HD CMOS offre une qualit\u00e9 HD remarquable et une excellente reproduction des couleurs, m\u00eame en conditions de faible luminosit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Enregistrement simultan\u00e9<\/b>\\nVous pouvez enregistrer vos vid\u00e9os simultan\u00e9ment aux formats AVCHD et MP4. En un seul enregistrement, vous \u00eates assur\u00e9 de r\u00e9aliser des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 exceptionnelle que vous pourrez montrer et partager via des appareils mobiles ou des sites de r\u00e9seaux sociaux. Les vid\u00e9os sont enregistr\u00e9es sur la m\u00e9moire interne et sur la carte SD.\\n\\n<b>Fonction \u00ab Audio Scene Select \u00bb<\/b>\\nR\u00e9alisez des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 exceptionnelle sur le plan tant sonore que visuel avec la fonction \u00ab Audio Scene Select \u00bb. Il vous suffit de faire votre choix parmi les 5 modes sc\u00e8ne propos\u00e9s, et les param\u00e8tres audio sont automatiquement optimis\u00e9s en fonction de la sc\u00e8ne que vous \u00eates en train de filmer. Que vous filmiez un discours de mariage ou un concert, vous b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'un son immersif et r\u00e9aliste.\\n\\n<b>Double m\u00e9moire Flash de 8 Go ; logement pour carte SDXC<\/b>\\nUne double m\u00e9moire flash de 8 Go vous permet de stocker plus de 3 heures de vid\u00e9o sur la m\u00e9moire int\u00e9gr\u00e9e. Le logement pour carte SDXC permet une dur\u00e9e d'enregistrement encore plus longue.\\n\\n<b>Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent<\/b>\\nLe stabilisateur d'image intelligent est la solution id\u00e9ale pour compenser les effets de vibration, car il d\u00e9tecte la sc\u00e8ne et s\u00e9lectionne automatiquement l'un des quatre modes de stabilisation pour contrebalancer les mouvements et \u00e9viter les flous de boug\u00e9. Le mode dynamique avanc\u00e9 corrige les mouvements de roulement et d'inclinaison potentiels qui surviennent lorsque vous marchez, afin d'assurer la nettet\u00e9 des vid\u00e9os en toute situation.\\n\\n<b>Mode B\u00e9b\u00e9<\/b>\\nImmortalisez les premiers pas de votre enfant, ses premiers mots et toute la magie de ces premi\u00e8res fois gr\u00e2ce au mode B\u00e9b\u00e9. Vous pouvez enregistrer la date de naissance de votre enfant dans le cam\u00e9scope et ajouter des timbres color\u00e9s indiquant sa taille et son poids. Tous vos enregistrements seront automatiquement tri\u00e9s dans l'album de votre b\u00e9b\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Traitement avanc\u00e9 de l'image<\/b>\\nLe tr\u00e8s performant processeur d'image DIGIC DV4 produit une qualit\u00e9 d'image sup\u00e9rieure en basse lumi\u00e8re et r\u00e9duit de fa\u00e7on notable les distorsions d'image \u00e0 l'aide du stabilisateur d'image optique. Ce processeur peut traiter des d\u00e9bits d'enregistrement \u00e9lev\u00e9s au format MP4 (35 Mbit\/s) et au format AVCHD (28 Mbit\/s).\\n\\n<b>Le contr\u00f4le au bout des doigts<\/b>\\nL'utilisation est ais\u00e9e gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un \u00e9cran LCD tactile capacitif haute r\u00e9solution de 7,5 cm, qui garantit un contr\u00f4le intuitif des param\u00e8tres et simplifie la lecture. L'ouverture du panneau LCD d\u00e9marre imm\u00e9diatement le cam\u00e9scope pour que vous ne manquiez aucune opportunit\u00e9 de vid\u00e9o."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"11a408f8-e089-43cd-b47e-f0d30e380551","identifier":"17513543","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","ngs"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"NGS Discover 2.1"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Full 30W peak power and 15W RMS power 2.1 sound system. Subwoofer wooden case provides enhanced sound quality. It includes volume control. This sober and elegant equipment Its perfectly any environment; you will enjoy your favourite music."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Syst\u00e8me sonore complet 2.1 de 30W de pic de puissance et 15W de puissance RMS. Le caisson du subwoofer en bois apporte une meilleure qualit\u00e9 de son. Il dispose de contr\u00f4le de volume. Sa sobri\u00e9t\u00e9 et son \u00e9l\u00e9gance permettent \u00e0 cet \u00e9quipement de s\u00b4int\u00e9grer parfaitement dans tous les environnements. Vous pourrez \u00e9couter votre musique pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-25T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e7461d57-52e8-4577-9c6f-6aadf91eefce","identifier":"17560323","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF G25"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.37"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Wide angle HD lens, exceptional audio and full manual controls unleash your creativity.\\n\\nDesigned to match the creative passion of video enthusiasts, the LEGRIA HF G25 features a wide angle lens, extensive manual controls and exceptional audio for stunning HD movies.\\n\\n- Canon HD Video Lens.\\n- Canon\u2019s advanced HD CMOS PRO sensor.\\n- Full manual control.\\n- Optical Intelligent IS.\\n- Audio Scene Select.\\n- 8.8cm touch screen LC.\\n- Instant AF; Face Detection.\\n- Protective lens hood.\\n- 32GB internal memory.\\n- 2x SDXC slots."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"21633ef5-3f70-4ab8-9145-2c1f0fcda962","identifier":"17560326","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA CANHFR406"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.28"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Capture Full HD movies without ever worrying about camera shake with the LEGRIA HF R406. Get closer with 53x Advanced zoom and create movies that sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent IS<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS is the perfect solution to combat camera shake by detecting the scene and automatically selecting from four stabilisation modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. The advanced dynamic mode corrects roll and tilt movements that can occur when walking, ensuring sharp steady videos in every situation.\\n\\n<b>53x Advanced zoom; Full HD CMOS<\/b>\\nA genuine Canon HD video lens with 53x Advanced Zoom lets you capture all the detail in even far away subjects. The Full HD CMOS sensor gives true HD quality and excellent colour reproduction even in low light, so your movies will look great on your HDTV.\\n\\n<b>Baby Mode<\/b>\\nCapture your child\u2019s first steps, first words, or many other firsts with Baby Mode. Register your child\u2019s date of birth in-camera, and add colourful stamps for height and weight. All footage will automatically be sorted to the baby album.\\n\\n<b>Advanced image processing<\/b>\\nThe powerful DIGIC DV4 imaging processor ensures higher image quality in low light and a substantial reduction in image distortion as it works together with the optical image stabiliser.\\n\\n<b>Superb quality recording<\/b>\\nBring out the best of Full HD with progressive recording at the highest rates for AVCHD(28Mbps) and MP4 (35Mbps). Whether you\u2019re showcasing or sharing, simply select the ideal format and choose from a range of recording rates.\\n\\n<b>Audio Scene Select<\/b>\\nIt\u2019s simple to make your movies sound as good as they look with Audio Scene Select. Just select from 5 scene modes and audio settings are optimised automatically to match the scene you\u2019re shooting. So whether you\u2019re filming speech at a wedding or music at a concert, you can enjoy immersive, realistic audio.\\n\\n<b>Fingertip control<\/b>\\nSmooth operation is easy with a high-resolution 7.5cm capacitive touch screen LCD, which gives you intuitive control of settings and simplifies playback. Opening the LCD panel quick starts the camcorder, so you\u2019ll never miss a moment.\\n\\n<b>Cinema-Look filters; Touch Decoration<\/b>\\nInspire your creativity with Cinema-Look Filters. Select from 7 adjustable colour-grading filters to capture the perfect movie scene. Adding fun effects to your movies without a PC is easy using Touch Decoration.\\n\\n<b>SDXC card slot<\/b>\\nThe LEGRIA HF R406 records Full HD movies direct to an SDXC memory card which are available in a wide range of sizes allowing you to capture hours of footage."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":32}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-01-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a972d1ca-d950-4807-a9cf-f1cb677f4a13","identifier":"17567667","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung HMX-QF30BP"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5.1"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Samsung Smart Camcorder QF30 er\u00f6ffnet v\u00f6llig neue M\u00f6glichkeiten, Videos aufzunehmen und sofort mit anderen zu teilen. Die innovative Live Broadcasting-Funktion l\u00e4sst Freunde und Familie an allen wichtigen Momenten in Echtzeit teilnehmen, w\u00e4hrend die Home Monitoring-Funktion es erm\u00f6glicht, alles zu sehen, was sich zu Hause w\u00e4hrend Ihrer Abwesenheit abspielt. Dank weiterer Wi-Fi-Funktionen wie AllShare Play, MobileLink und Social Sharing sendet der Camcorder Videos direkt an Ihren HD-TV f\u00fcr spontane Video-Abende, an Ihr Smartphone f\u00fcr sofortige Datensicherung oder auf die Lieblingswebsite, damit auch Freunde in der Ferne immer auf dem Laufenden bleiben. F\u00fcr sehenswerte Aufnahmen sorgen Smart Auto und Gesichtserkennung. Und egal ob mit der rechten oder mit der linken Hand, Switch Grip II erm\u00f6glicht eine bequeme Haltung, ob beim Aufnehmen, Vorf\u00fchren oder Teilen w\u00e4hrend der Aufnahmen.\\n\\n<b>Live Broadcasting<\/b>\\nSie k\u00f6nnen nicht warten, Ihre sch\u00f6nsten Momente sofort mit anderen zu teilen? Mit dem HMX-QF30WP wird das jetzt m\u00f6glich! Die innovative Live Broadcasting-Funktion sendet Videos bereits w\u00e4hrend der Aufnahme via USTREAM. So k\u00f6nnen Familie und Freunde auf Laptop, Tablet oder Smartphone genau das sehen, was Sie aufnehmen \u2013 in Echtzeit, ohne auf einen Upload warten zu m\u00fcssen. Ob beim Bergsteigen, auf einer rauschenden Party oder im Konzert \u2013 teilen Sie Ihre Erlebnisse genau dann, wenn sie geschehen.\\n\\n* Live Broadcasting-Aufnahmen werden nicht auf dem Camcorder gespeichert. Alle Live Broadcasting-Aufnahmen werden bis zu zwei Stunden auf dem Ustream-Server geladen.\\n\\n<b>Heim\u00fcberwachung<\/b>\\nIn manchen Situationen ist es sinnvoll den Samsung Smart Camcorder ganz einfach zu Hause zu lassen. Denn der QF30 fungiert als Heim\u00fcberwachungssystem, indem er kabellos Aufnahmen an Ihr Smartphone sendet. Sehen Sie, was Ihre Kinder machen w\u00e4hrend Sie arbeiten, gucken Sie, was der Hund macht, wenn er sich unbeobachtet f\u00fchlt oder erledigen Sie getrost Ihre Eink\u00e4ufe und wissen Sie Ihr Haus in Sicherheit. Genie\u00dfen Sie ganz einfach die Ruhe, die sich einstellt, wenn Sie wissen was w\u00e4hrend Ihrer Abwesenheit zu Hause passiert.\\n\\n<b>WiFi-Konnektivit\u00e4t (Auto Backup, MobileLink, AllShare Play, Social Sharing)<\/b>\\nSamsungs Smart Camcorder sind dank WiFi-Funktionalit\u00e4ten vollgepackt mit neuen M\u00f6glichkeiten. So lassen sich via Auto Backup die wertvollsten Bilder und Videos zur Sicherung kabellos an den PC senden, w\u00e4hrend der MobileLink Bilder oder sogar ganze Alben direkt an ein Smartphone sendet. F\u00fcr ein gemeinsames Kinoerlebnis \u00fcbertr\u00e4gt AllShare Play die Daten ohne Umweg \u00fcber ein Kabel direkt an den HD-TV. Und damit auch Freunde und Familie in der Ferne immer auf dem Laufenden sind, k\u00f6nnen die besten Bilder und Geschichten via Social Sharing per E-Mail gesendet oder auf den Lieblingswebseiten gepostet werden.\\n\\n<b>Auto Backup<\/b>\\nSamsungs Smart Camcorder senden Bilder und Videos kabellos zur Datensicherung an Ihrem PC oder Mac. Dazu gen\u00fcgt es, die Auto Backup-Funktion zu aktivieren \u2013 den Rest erledigt die Drahtlosverbindung. Jetzt k\u00f6nnen Sie getrost Fotos und Videos l\u00f6schen, denn eine Kopie der Daten ist sicher auf dem heimischen PC verwahrt.\\n\\n<b>Switch Grip II (F\u00fcr vertikale Aufnahmen)<\/b>\\nHier sind sich Rechts- und Linksh\u00e4nder einig \u2013 der schlanke und kompakte Samsung Smart Camcorder QF30 mit Switch Grip II wurde f\u00fcr beide gemacht. Denn die innovative Switch Grip-Technik erlaubt eine beidh\u00e4ndige Nutzung des Camcorders wahlweise in der rechten oder linken Hand. Der interne Sensor erkennt automatisch den Aufnahmewinkel und rotiert entsprechend den LCD-Bildschirm, so dass das Motiv immer korrekt ausgerichtet wird. Bequeme Handhaltung auch in der Vertikalen? Auch das macht Switch Grip II m\u00f6glich! Der LCD-Monitor l\u00e4sst sich um 90 Grad drehen, das Motiv bleibt auch hier korrekt ausgerichtet. Schwierige Aufnahmesituationen gelingen mit dem senkrecht nach oben aufgeklappten Camcorder-Display einfach und sicher.\\n\\n<b>20-fach optischer Zoom (40-fach digitaler Zoom)<\/b>\\nLeicht und kompakt ist der Samsung Smart Camcorder Ihr st\u00e4ndiger Begleiter. Ausger\u00fcstet mit einem hochwertigen Schneider-Kreuznach Objektiv mit leistungsstarkem 20-fach optischen und 40-fach digitalem Zoom holt der Camcorder spielend leicht auch weiter entfernte Motive in bester Qualit\u00e4t ganz nah heran. Jetzt k\u00f6nnen Sie jeden Moment beim Fu\u00dfballspiel Ihres Kindes einfangen, ohne selbst auf dem Platz stehen zu m\u00fcssen. F\u00fcr ein besonderes Filmvergn\u00fcgen mit gestochen scharfen Bilder beim Videoabend ist gesorgt.\\n\\n<b>OIS DUO +<\/b>\\nDank OIS DUO + sind verwackelte Bilder jetzt pass\u00e9, auch wenn die Hand einmal zittert. Die Kombination aus digitaler mit optischer Bildstabilisierung gleicht Unsch\u00e4rfen aus, die durch schnelle Bewegungen oder Ersch\u00fctterungen entstehen k\u00f6nnen. Egal ob schnelle Drehung, rasante Bewegungen oder die kleinste Ersch\u00fctterung durch den Einsatz des digitalen Zooms, OIS DUO + sorgt f\u00fcr scharfe Bilder in jeder Situation.\\n\\n<b>Smart Background Music II (mit My Music)<\/b>\\nF\u00fcr die richtige Akustik sorgt die neue \u201eSmart Background Music II\u201c-Funktion. Als Begleitung f\u00fcr die Filmdatei k\u00f6nnen die ganz pers\u00f6nlichen Lieblingsmelodien ausgew\u00e4hlt werden. Dabei steht eine freie Musikauswahl zur Verf\u00fcgung - ob auf dem Camcorder vorinstalliert oder von der eigenen Musikdatenbank des PCs \u00fcber Intelli-Studio importiert. Liegt die Musik dann auf dem Film, reduziert die neue Funktion automatisch die Musik-Lautst\u00e4rke, wenn Sprache in der Datei entdeckt wird.\\n\\n<b>Intervallaufnahme-Funktion<\/b>\\nWer Gras wachsen sehen will oder den Flug der Wolken bewundern m\u00f6chte, kann das Video direkt im Zeitraffer-Format aufnehmen. Die Intervallaufnahme-Funktion nimmt dabei einzelne Bilder in zuvor festgelegten Abst\u00e4nden auf. Jedes einzelne aufgenommene Bild wird separat gespeichert. Zusammengef\u00fcgt ergeben sich aufregende Eindr\u00fccke und \u00fcberraschende Einsichten. Eine Vielzahl an Modi wie etwa Nacht, Zoomen, Schwenk oder R\u00fcckw\u00e4rts-Wiedergabe er\u00f6ffnen weitere kreative M\u00f6glichkeiten."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Change the way you capture and share your world with the SMART CAMCORDER Camcorder. Its Live Broadcasting feature lets friends and family see what you\u2019re recording in real time, while Home Monitoring allows you to keep an eye on your house whenever you're away. Tap into other Wi-Fi capabilities such as AllShare Play, MobileLink and Social Sharing to send videos to your HDTV for a spontaneous movie night, to your mobile phone for instant back-up, and to a host of social networks. There\u2019s also Smart Auto and Face Detection, which help you create incredible images worth sending. And whether you\u2019re right-handed or left-handed, the Switch Grip II makes recording, sharing \u2014 or recording while sharing \u2014 a comfortable experience.\\n\\n<b>Live Broadcasting<\/b>\\nCan\u2019t wait to share an amazing moment? Now you don\u2019t have to. Live Broadcasting lets you broadcast your recording \u2014 while you\u2019re recording \u2014 via USTREAM. Friends and family can see what you see on their laptops, tablets, or smartphones in real time, without having to wait for you to upload your video. Whether you\u2019re hiking, sightseeing or taking in a concert, share the fun as you capture it.\\n* Live Broadcasting videos will not be saved on to the camcorder.\\nAll Live Broadcasted videos will be loaded on the Ustream server for up to 2 hours.\\n\\n<b>Home Monitoring<\/b>\\nThe SMART CAMCORDER is useful even when you leave it behind. That\u2019s because you can use the SMART CAMCORDER as a home monitoring system that wirelessly streams to your smartphone. Check on precious baby while at work, monitor your house when you\u2019re out shopping \u2014 or see just what the dog does when you leave him alone. Enjoy the peace of mind that comes with being able to keep an eye on your home when you need to.\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi connectivity (Auto Backup, MobileLink, AllShare Play, Social Sharing)<\/b>\\nThe SMART CAMCORDER is jam-packed with wireless capabilities. Auto Backup lets you wirelessly transfer photos and movies to your PC, while MobileLink allows to you send an image \u2014 or an album of pictures \u2014 directly to an Android smartphone, no cable needed. You can also use AllShare Play and a Wi-Fi connection to stream your videos to your HDTV. And since not everyone can be in your living room, use Social Sharing & Email to share must-see images and videos with your family, friends and favourite social networks.\\n\\n<b>Auto Backup<\/b>\\nWirelessly transfer photos and movies to your PC or Mac. Simply choose AutoBackup and you\u2019re all set. All your photos and videos are transferred wirelessly and safely stored on to your computer. Feel free to delete photos from your camera knowing there\u2019s a duplicate set on your computer.\\n\\n<b>Switch Grip II (Vertical Recording)<\/b>\\nOne thing lefties and righties can agree on \u2014 the streamlined and compact Samsung SMART CAMCORDER with Switch Grip II was made for both. Because no matter in which hand it\u2019s held, the camcorder\u2019s LCD screen will adjust to ensure that the picture is shown right-side up. More comfortable shooting while holding the camcorder vertically? Good news: you can rotate the LCD screen 90\u00ba, and the image will remain right-side up. Shooting video from difficult positions has never been easier.\\n\\n<b>20x Optical zoom (40x Digital-zoom)<\/b>\\nLightweight and compact, the Samsung SMART CAMCORDER goes wherever you go. It also features a Schneider Kreuznach lens with 20x Optical Zoom (40x Digital Zoom) that puts you in the middle of the action, even when you\u2019re far away. Capture a game-winning goal from the far end of the soccer field, or a band rocking out \u2014 even from the back row. Details are as crisp and clear as if you were shooting from up close.\\n\\n<b>OIS DUO +<\/b>\\nWith OIS (Optical Image Stabiliser) Duo +, you can capture clear and steady video, even if you have a case of shaky hands. The Samsung SMART CAMCORDER combines a built-in OIS with digital image stabilisation technology to prevent bumps, jolts, and shivers from blurring image quality. OIS Duo Plus also compensates for body movement that can occur while you\u2019re moving around, or for the movement of the digital zoom."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Live Broadcasting<\/b>\\n\\nImpatient de partager un incroyable moment? Ne faites plus de concession! Live Broadcasting vous permet de diffuser vos enregistrements \u2014 au moment o\u00f9 vous filmez \u2014 via USTREAM. Ainsi, vos amis et votre famille peuvent voir ce que vous voyez sur leurs ordinateurs, tablettes ou smartphones, et ce en temps r\u00e9el, sans attendre que vous t\u00e9l\u00e9chargiez votre vid\u00e9o. Que vous soyez en randonn\u00e9e, en excursion ou en plein concert, partagez vos exp\u00e9riences en direct.\\n* Les vid\u00e9os Live Broadcasting ne seront pas stock\u00e9es sur la cam\u00e9ra.\\nElles seront charg\u00e9es sur le serveur Ustream pendant une dur\u00e9e maximale de 2 heures.\\n\\n<b>Home Monitoring<\/b>\\n\\nLe SMART CAMCORDER Samsung QF30 vous sera utile m\u00eame lorsque vous ne l'emportez pas avec vous. En effet, il peut servir de syst\u00e8me de surveillance de votre domicile qui diffusera des images sans fil sur votre smartphone.\\nUtilisez votre SMART CAMCORDER Samsung QF30 m\u00eame lorsqu\u2019il n\u2019est pas avec vous. Installez-le dans votre domicile et faites-en un syst\u00e8me de surveillance infaillible. Veillez sur votre b\u00e9b\u00e9 lorsque vous travaillez, surveillez votre maison lorsque vous faites les boutiques ou gardez simplement un \u0153il sur votre chien lorsque vous le laissez seul.\\n\\n<b>Connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi (Sauvegarde automatique, MobileLink, AllShare Play, R\u00e9seaux sociaux)<\/b>\\n\\nLe Samsung SMART CAMCORDER QF30 regorge de fonctionnalit\u00e9s sans fil. Sauvegarde automatique vous permet de transf\u00e9rer sans fil des photos et des films vers votre ordinateur, tandis que MobileLink vous permet d\u2019envoyer une image, ou un dossier de photos, directement vers un smartphone Android, sans utiliser le moindre c\u00e2ble. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement utiliser le cloud AllShare Play et une connexion Wi-Fi pour lire vos vid\u00e9os sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD. Et comme votre salon ne peut pas accueillir tout le monde, utilisez les fonctions R\u00e9seaux sociaux & E-mail pour partager les photos et les vid\u00e9os que vous devez absolument montrer \u00e0 vos amis ou \u00e0 votre famille."}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":20}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-01T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3bd68cf3-1fc8-4c85-b95e-4371673cf83c","identifier":"17641190","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA5MXX04PF Mix 4GB* MP3 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit dem GoGEAR Mix k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihre Musik in jeder Tasche dabei haben. Der d\u00fcnne Player sorgt f\u00fcr kinderleichte Datei\u00fcbertragungen \u00fcber Direct USB, ohne dass Kabel erforderlich sind. Er bietet zudem einen praktischen integrierten Clip, ein LCD-Display und 10\u00a0Stunden Wiedergabezeit."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA5MXX04PF Mix 4GB* MP3 player. MP3 bit rates: 8 - 320, WMA bit rates: 5 - 192. Supported radio bands: FM. Weight: 0.022. Dimensions (WxDxH): 24.5 x 15.9 x 82.4"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Transportez votre musique dans n'importe quelle poche avec le GoGEAR Mix. Avec ce baladeur ultraplat, le transfert de fichiers est un jeu d'enfant via USB Direct, le tout sans c\u00e2ble. \u00c9quip\u00e9 d'un clip int\u00e9gr\u00e9 pratique et d'un \u00e9cran LCD, il offre 10\u00a0heures d'autonomie."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2967c3f5-2075-4128-b24f-8287abf0c36b","identifier":"17654811","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4RGA04KN Raga 4 GB* MP3 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA4RGA04KN Raga 4 GB* MP3 player. Display diagonal: 1.1. MP3 bit rates: 8 - 320, WMA bit rates: 5 - 320. Dimensions (WxDxH): 49.9 x 12.9 x 43.4"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-05T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"74fbe40b-7d4c-4232-a09d-546ef774801c","identifier":"17681554","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["canon","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon CanoScan 9000F Mark II"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Professionelle Scans mit einer Aufl\u00f6sung von bis zu 9.600 dpi und schneller Filmscan\\nDer Premium Scanner f\u00fcr Dias, Negative, Fotos und Dokumente bietet das einfache, schnelle und vielseitige Scannen in au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnlicher Qualit\u00e4t ohne Aufw\u00e4rmzeit, einfache Bedienung auf Knopfdruck und automatische Bildretusche.\\n\\n- Premium Scanner f\u00fcr Dias, Negative, Fotos und Dokumente.\\n- Hohe Scanqualit\u00e4t: 9.600 x 9.600 dpi (Filmscan), 4.800 x 4.800 dpi (Fotos und Dokumente).\\n- Schnelle Scans von Fotos und Dokumenten: ca. 7 Sekunden f\u00fcr ein A4-Farbdokument bei 300 dpi.\\n- Schnelle Scans von Filmen: ca. 18 Sekunden f\u00fcr ein KB-Negativ bei 1.200 dpi.\\n- Durchlichteinheit zum Scannen von bis zu 12 KB-Aufnahmen, 4 KB-Dias und 120er Rollfilm mit einer maximalen Gr\u00f6\u00dfe von 6 x 22 cm (nur Filmstreifen).\\n- Automatische Bildretusche: FARE Level 3 zur automatischen Staub- und Kratzerentfernung und zur Rekonstruktion verblichener Farben.\\n- 7 Scan-Buttons f\u00fcr einfachste Bedienung auf Knopfdruck.\\n- Keine Aufw\u00e4rmzeit durch wei\u00dfe LED-Lampe.\\n- Scannen auf einen Evernote oder Dropbox Cloud-Service.\\n- Erstellen von mehrseitigen PDFs mit Passwortschutz.\\n\\n<b>Optimierte Qualit\u00e4t, au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnliche Detaildarstellung<\/b>\\nAu\u00dfergew\u00f6hnlich hohe Wiedergabequalit\u00e4t: Der Premium Scanner f\u00fcr Dias, Negative, Fotos und Dokumente bietet einen CCD-Sensor f\u00fcr Filmscans mit bis zu 9.600 x 9.600 dpi und Scans von Aufsichtvorlagen mit bis zu 4.800 x 4.800 dpi. Er liefert besonders detailreiche Scans mit erstklassiger Farbreproduktion dank 48 Bit Farbtiefe, die sich f\u00fcr Vergr\u00f6\u00dferungen oder hochaufl\u00f6sende Drucke eignen.\\n\\n<b>Vielseitiges Film-Handling<\/b>\\nDie integrierte Durchlichteinheit erm\u00f6glicht das komfortable Scannen diverser Filmvorlagen. Bis zu 12 KB-Filmstreifen bzw. 4 gerahmte Dias lassen sich in einem Arbeitsgang scannen. 120er Rollfilm (max. 6 x 22 cm) wird ebenfalls unterst\u00fctzt.\\n\\n<b>Sofort einsatzbereit und schnell<\/b>\\nHochwertige und produktive Scanleistung: F\u00fcr KB-Negative ben\u00f6tigt der Scanner nur ca. 18 Sekunden (bei 1.200 dpi) und ein A4-Farbfoto oder -dokument ist in nur ca. 7 Sekunden fertig gescannt (300 dpi). Die wei\u00dfe LED-Lampe erm\u00f6glicht die sofortige Scanbereitschaft, da sie keine Aufw\u00e4rmzeit ben\u00f6tigt und sorgt f\u00fcr einen besonders niedrigen Stromverbrauch. Die automatische Stromabschaltung schaltet den Scanner selbst\u00e4ndig aus, wenn er eine voreingestellten Zeit nicht in Betrieb war.\\n\\n<b>Automatische Bildkorrektur<\/b>\\nVerkratzte, besch\u00e4digte, verstaubte oder verblasste Durchlichtvorlagen lassen sich ganz leicht restaurieren \u2013 ohne langwierige manuelle Nachbearbeitung. FARE Level 3, die integrierte Canon Technologie zur automatischen Staub- und Kratzerentfernung, \u00fcbernimmt diese Aufgabe f\u00fcr Sie und sucht mithilfe von Infrarotlicht nach Fehlern auf der Filmoberfl\u00e4che.\\n\\n<b>Einfache Bedienung mit nur einem Tastendruck<\/b>\\nSelbst komplexe Scanfunktionen werden mit nur einem Knopfdruck durchgef\u00fchrt: Mit Hilfe von 7 Scan-Buttons haben Sie sofortigen Zugriff auf praktische Funktionen wie Scan-to-PC, -E-Mail, -Copy oder -PDF. Foto, Textdokument oder Filmvorlage: Der Scanner erkennt den Vorlagentyp und w\u00e4hlt automatisch die geeigneten Scan- und Speichereinstellungen \u2013 ein Knopfdruck auf \u201eAuto Scan\u201c gen\u00fcgt! Der integrierte Netzadapter erm\u00f6glicht besonders kompakte Abmessungen \u2013 das spart Platz auf Ihrem Schreibtisch.\\n\\n<b>Intelligente Software im Lieferumfang<\/b>\\nMit der Software My Image Garden und Scanning Utility, die sich beide im Lieferumfang des Scanners befinden, finden Sie zahlreiche praktische Funktionen, die mehr aus Ihren Scans machen. So lassen sich die eingescannten Dateien einfach handhaben oder per \u201eAuto Document Fix\u201c so optimieren, dass die Ausgabequalit\u00e4t sowohl bei Fotos als auch bei Dokumenten gesteigert wird. Vorlagen k\u00f6nnen bequem in durchsuchbare PDFs konvertiert werden \u2013 inklusive Passwortschutz zur Sicherung vertraulicher Informationen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Enjoy high-speed scanning for everything from photos to documents, to even 35mm film while also enjoying superb quality. The CanoScan 9000F Mark II Color Image Scanner, a high-speed scanner with professional film scanning quality. With 9600 x 9600 maximum color dpi1, it produces incredible detail in both business documents and photographs. The CanoScan 9000F Mark II also helps you get the most out of your photos and documents with My Image Garden2 software, offering a simple and intuitive way to scan and organize your files.\\n\\nThe CanoScan 9000F Mark II features our Super Toric Lens, delivering pin-sharp scans from edge-to-edge and bright, low noise images. It requires zero warm-up time3 and offers lower power consumption with super-efficient white LEDs. In addition, its Fare Level 3 feature provides dust and scratch removal, along with fading, grain and backlight correction. Plus, its Auto Scan Mode automatically adjusts settings by detecting what you're scanning."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Canon CanoScan 9000F Mark II<\/b>\\nNum\u00e9risation professionnelle avec une r\u00e9solution jusqu'\u00e0 9600 dpi et num\u00e9risation de films grande vitesse\\nCe scanner professionnel de films, photos, diapositives et documents offre une num\u00e9risation simple, rapide et polyvalente d'une qualit\u00e9 exceptionnelle sans aucun pr\u00e9chauffage, fonctionnant par simple pression d'une touche, avec correction automatique de l'image.\\n\\n- Scanner professionnel de films, photos, diapositives et documents.\\n- Num\u00e9risation de haute qualit\u00e9 : 9600 \u00d7 9600 dpi pour les films, 4800 \u00d7 4800 dpi pour les photos et documents.\\n- Num\u00e9risation rapide de photos et documents : environ 7 s pour le format A4 couleur \u00e0 300 dpi.\\n- Num\u00e9risation de films grande vitesse : environ 18 s pour un n\u00e9gatif de 24 \u00d7 36 \u00e0 1200 dpi.\\n- Gestion polyvalente : bande de film 12 \u00d7 35 mm, diapositives mont\u00e9es 4 \u00d7 35 mm et film au format 120 max. 6 \u00d7 22 cm (en bande uniquement).\\n- Correction automatique de l'image : la technologie int\u00e9gr\u00e9e FARE de niveau 3 \u00e9limine la poussi\u00e8re et les rayures et restaure les couleurs.\\n- Fonctionnement par simple pression sur un bouton gr\u00e2ce aux 7 touches EZ.\\n- Aucun pr\u00e9chauffage et consommation d'\u00e9nergie r\u00e9duite gr\u00e2ce au voyant DEL blanc.\\n- Num\u00e9risation vers votre service Cloud Evernote ou Dropbox.\\n- Cr\u00e9ation de PDF s\u00e9curis\u00e9s de plusieurs pages.\\n\\n<b>Qualit\u00e9 optimale, d\u00e9tails exceptionnels<\/b>\\nProfitez d'une qualit\u00e9 de reproduction optimale. Ce scanner professionnel de films, photos, diapositives et documents est \u00e9quip\u00e9 d'un capteur CCD pour une num\u00e9risation de qualit\u00e9 : jusqu'\u00e0 9600 \u00d7 9600 dpi pour les films 4800 \u00d7 4800 dpi pour les documents et les photos. Le niveau de d\u00e9tail exceptionnel des images est parfaitement adapt\u00e9 aux agrandissements et aux impressions haute r\u00e9solution. Sa profondeur de couleurs sur 48 bits assure par ailleurs une reproduction pr\u00e9cise des couleurs.\\n\\n<b>Support film polyvalent<\/b>\\nNum\u00e9risez vos films sans le moindre effort gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'adaptateur pour film int\u00e9gr\u00e9. Il num\u00e9rise des films fixes 12 \u00d7 35 mm et 4 diapositives mont\u00e9es en une seule op\u00e9ration (n\u00e9gatifs et positifs). De plus, les films au format 120 sont \u00e9galement pris en charge (6 \u00d7 22 cm max.).\\n\\n<b>Num\u00e9risation haute vitesse instantan\u00e9e<\/b>\\nAm\u00e9lioration spectaculaire des performances de num\u00e9risation en termes de productivit\u00e9. Num\u00e9risez des n\u00e9gatifs de films 24 \u00d7 36 en un clin d'\u0153il, \u00e0 une vitesse d'environ 18 secondes \u00e0 1200 dpi, ou num\u00e9risez une photo couleur ou un document au format A4 \u00e0 une vitesse d'environ 7 secondes (300 dpi). Num\u00e9risez vos documents sans attendre tout en \u00e9conomisant de l'\u00e9nergie : aucun pr\u00e9chauffage requis avec consommation d'\u00e9nergie r\u00e9duite gr\u00e2ce au voyant DEL blanc. Faites encore plus d'\u00e9conomies d'\u00e9nergie avec la fonction de mise hors tension automatique qui \u00e9teint le scanner apr\u00e8s un certain d\u00e9lai d'inactivit\u00e9.\\n\\n<b>Correction automatique d'image<\/b>\\nRestaurez ais\u00e9ment des films d\u00e9chir\u00e9s, endommag\u00e9s, poussi\u00e9reux, aux couleurs pass\u00e9es sans avoir \u00e0 y apporter de retouches manuelles fastidieuses. La technologie FARE (Film Automatic Retouching and Enhancement, am\u00e9lioration et retouche automatiques de film) de niveau 3 unique de Canon int\u00e9gr\u00e9e au scanner fait tout le travail pour vous \u00e0 l'aide d'une lumi\u00e8re infrarouge qui analyse les d\u00e9fauts physiques pr\u00e9sents sur la surface du film.\\n\\n<b>Fonctionnement par simple pression sur un bouton<\/b>\\nUn fonctionnement rapide et simple, m\u00eame pour les usages les plus complexes. Les 7 boutons EZ vous permettent d'acc\u00e9der instantan\u00e9ment aux fonctions Num\u00e9risation automatique, Copie, Email et \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation de PDF multipages. Le bouton de num\u00e9risation automatique permet de reconna\u00eetre les types de photos, documents et films, et vous propose les param\u00e8tres de num\u00e9risation et d'enregistrement appropri\u00e9s. L'adaptateur secteur int\u00e9gr\u00e9 rend l'appareil plus compact, r\u00e9duisant ainsi l'encombrement sur le bureau.\\n\\n<b>Logiciels intelligents inclus<\/b>\\nTirez le meilleur de vos num\u00e9risations avec les logiciels fournis My Image Garden et Scanning Utility qui offrent toute une panoplie de fonctions tr\u00e8s utiles. G\u00e9rez facilement vos documents num\u00e9ris\u00e9s et servez-vous de la fonction Auto Document Fix pour optimiser l'impression et la qualit\u00e9 des images ou documents finaux. Convertissez des documents en PDF avec protection par mot de passe pour prot\u00e9ger vos informations confidentielles."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-08T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"5b0b8542-4e51-437d-960c-ac4b26732730","identifier":"17703568","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4VBE04RFX ViBE 4GB* MP4 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The vibrantly colored GoGEAR Vibe MP4 player comes with FullSound to bring music and videos to life, and Philips Songbird to synchronize music and enjoy entertainment. SafeSound protects your ears and FastCharge offers quick charging."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-11T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"65a7cfba-86c8-4cdd-8bc7-88e427bd4b97","identifier":"17703570","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4VBE04BFX ViBE 4GB* MP4 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The vibrantly colored GoGEAR Vibe MP4 player comes with FullSound to bring music and videos to life, and Philips Songbird to synchronize music and enjoy entertainment. SafeSound protects your ears and FastCharge offers quick charging."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-11T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"23cb648c-80b1-4f1e-8836-7e836d24255c","identifier":"17706075","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision MiWand 2L Pro"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Kein PC n\u00f6tig\\n- Einfache Bedienung\\n- Ideal zum Scannen von B\u00fcchern\\n- Vorschaubild auf dem 1,8\u201c-Farb-LCD\\n- Farb- und Schwarz-Wei\u00df-Modus\\n- Scannt Farbe A4 in 1,6 Sekunden\\n- Scannen auf das iPad\u2122 (mit separat erh\u00e4ltlichem Kamera-Kit)\\n- Unterst\u00fctzt SD - Karten bis zu 32 GB\\n- Scans wahlweise als JPEG oder PDF speichern\\n- 4 GB Micro - SD-Karte im Lieferumfang\\n- Scanaufl\u00f6sung von 600 dpi\\n- Dokumentengr\u00f6\u00dfe bis 21 \u00d7 35,5 cm\\n- Stromversorgung\\n\\n\u2013 via Lithium-Ionen Akku (MiWand 2L, MiWand 2L Pro)\\n\u2013 via AA-Akku (MiWand 2, MiWand 2 Pro)\\n\\n<b>Aufladeoptionen<\/b>\\n- MiWand 2: Ladeger\u00e4t\\n- MiWand 2 Pro: Ladeger\u00e4t\\n- MiWand 2L: USB\\n- MiWand 2L Pro: Dockingstation (Netzteil), USB - Stromversorgungskabel"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A mobile scanner that scans anywhere, anytime<\/b>\\nExperience the efficiency and convenience of a truly mobile scanner! Powered only by 2x AA alkaline batteries, the MiWand 2 Pro is a mobile scanner that allows you to scan without a computer or software. Simply gliding the scanner over the surface of a page and the scan is done. The images are then saved to a Micro SD card up to 32G.\\n\\n<b>Wireless design, scan images anywhere<\/b>\\nThe brand new portable scanner can be operated with a single hand. Powered by alkaline batteries, you do not need to carry a heavy power adapter and hunt for an electric outlet anymore! Since no computer is required to start a scan, you can carry it to anywhere, anytime! Whenever on the road, in a plane, a car or a caf\u00e9, you can digitize almost everything right away! Whether standing or sitting, you can complete your scan by simply gliding it over a surface. Even the posters on the wall or a pretty carton can be easily digitized!\\n\\n<b>Start instant scan with the feeder dock<\/b>\\nWhen the scanner is attached to the feeder dock, the Avision\u2019s MiWand 2 PRO allows you to start \u201cinstant scan\u201d as soon as a page is fed into the feeding slot. The scan will be automatically started and the image is saved into a memory card with a predefined image mode and resolution. Furthermore, the whole unit allows you to scan paper up to legal size (216 x 355 mm or 8.5 x 14 inch).\\n\\n<b>Preview images with 1.8\u201d color LCD display<\/b>\\nThe Preview feature allows you to view your JPEG image on the color LCD screen for 2 seconds immediately after a scan to confirm the images you have just captured. In addition, you can also view all images individually or as a slideshow.\\n\\n<b>View images in iPad<\/b>\\nThrough the mini USB port, the scanned documents can be easily transferred to iPad (with additional iPad Camera Kit) or any SmartPhone which supports USB Host or OTG capability.\\n\\n<b>Patented Double-Roller and Bookedge Design<\/b>\\nThe innovative double roller technology delivers outstanding feeding reliability and image quality by significantly reducing the risk of skewing and distortion. The bookedge design makes book scanning fast and easy."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4ea7e94a-d343-4024-9a79-b363b49539be","identifier":"17727158","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4VD408AF Video 4.3 MP4 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der 11\u00a0cm (4,3\") GoGEAR Video MP3-Videoplayer bietet Ihnen lebhafte klare Videos. Genie\u00dfen Sie Videos in beliebten Formaten wie RMVB, MPEG4 und AVI in HD-Qualit\u00e4t. Steigern Sie Ihr Entertainmenterlebnis mit einem 11\u00a0cm (4,3\") gro\u00dfen LCD-Bildschirm plus eingebautem Lautsprecher"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The GoGEAR Video 4.3\" MP3 video player puts vividly clear videos into your hands. Enjoy videos in popular formats like RMVB, MPEG4 & AVI, in HD quality. Enhance your entertainment pleasure with a 4.3\" LCD screen & a built-in speaker"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le baladeur vid\u00e9o MP3 GoGEAR Video 4,3\" affiche des vid\u00e9os d'une nettet\u00e9 saisissante. Regardez des vid\u00e9os aux formats classiques (RMVB, MPEG4 et AVI) en qualit\u00e9 HD. Avec son \u00e9cran LCD de 4,3\" et son haut-parleur int\u00e9gr\u00e9, le plaisir est encore plus grand."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-13T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c8df111b-3add-481f-affa-8625dcccfeec","identifier":"17727612","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4DOT02BN SoundDot 2GB* MP3 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA4DOT02BN SoundDot 2GB* MP3 player. WMA bit rates: 5 - 320. Weight: 0.019. Dimensions (WxDxH): 42.3 x 19 x 57"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-13T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"54004f3e-e62f-4a31-94e5-62416d1b0a29","identifier":"17836085","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["canon","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon Oc\u00e9 TC4 scanner"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Canon Oc\u00e9 TC4 scanner"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-26T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"aac5c29f-6a68-40ed-af50-66fa003b09c0","identifier":"17849321","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","ngs"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"NGS Popping 4GB"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Popping MP3 is a small player ideal to practice outdoor activities or to go to gym, its comfortable sport earphones, the sport bag and the adjustable armband, as well screen and integrated FM."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-02-28T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"45a260f6-942c-4e45-8092-a53916c909c3","identifier":"17851719","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision @V2800"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der @V2800 ist eine innovative Scanl\u00f6sung, der Scan-to-E-Mail, Scan-to-Server und digitale Kopie-F\u00e4higkeiten beinhaltet. Die Scan-to-E-Mail-Funktion erm\u00f6glicht das Scannen in Farbe von Dokumenten und sendet sie per E-Mail (PDF, JPEG, TIFF) direkt vom @V2800 ohne einen PC.Mit der der Scan-to-Server-Funktion k\u00f6nnen Sie Dokumente scannen und sie auf einem bestimmten Serverpfad speichern.\\nWenn der @ V2800 an Ihrem kompatiblen Laser-Drucker angeschlossen ist, k\u00f6nnen sie qualitativ hochwertig digitale Kopien anfertigen und somit viele f\u00fcr den B\u00fcroalltag unentbehrliche Funktionen mit nur einem Ger\u00e4t durchf\u00fchren.\\n\\nDurch das integrierte Faxmodem ersetzt der Avision @V2800 das alte Faxger\u00e4t und druckt beim Anschlu\u00df eines kompatiblen Druckers eingehende Faxe sofort aus."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The product offers an unprecedented document delivery technology, transmitting paper documents electronically over the internet.  With @V2800, you can instantly scan single-sided or double-sided paper-based document and deliver the electronics image to various destinations including e-mail addresses, printer, fax machine, ftp servers, web site, or someone else's computer on the network.\\n\\nThe new way to distribute documents is faster, more cost effective, and safer than any traditional methods such as mail, or copier."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-03-01T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e406ff57-31b2-4723-9f9b-362a25ed70be","identifier":"17863666","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","samsung","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1280_x_720"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung VG-STC3000\/XC webcam"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Hochwertige Smart TV-Kamera mit 5 Mega- pixeln und HD-Aufl\u00f6sung. Hervorragend f\u00fcr Videochats und weitere Kameradienste geeignet."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"With its dual hinge and 'Plug and Play' connection, this detachable video camera accessory is easy to install. It supports Motion Control5 and allows you to make Skype\u00ae14 calls in 720p high definition quality.\\n\\n<b>Your Skype\u00ae14 friends, front and centre<\/b>\\nWith built-in Face Recognition4 and Motion Control5 capabilities, the Samsung TV Camera also has a face-tracking feature, where the camera recognises the faces of your Skype\u00ae14 callers and automatically centres them in the video window.\\n\\n<b>Don\u2019t miss a moment of the action<\/b>\\nMake Skype\u00ae14 video calls on your big screen, without missing a moment of onscreen TV action. The Samsung TV Camera opens up a window for the video, but keeps another window open alongside so you can still watch what's playing on television!"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-03-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"81217cc4-4a50-4e31-ac8b-0b3cbe944144","identifier":"17905442","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4CLP04KN SoundClip 4GB* MP3 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Wippen Sie zum Beat des kleinen und farbenfrohen GoGear SoundClip MP3-Players. Dieser verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber einen integrierten Clip zur Befestigung an Ihrer Kleidung. Mit FastCharge l\u00e4sst sich das Ger\u00e4t schnell aufladen f\u00fcr eine Musikwiedergabe von bis zu 8\u00a0Stunden"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA4CLP04KN SoundClip 4GB* MP3 player. MP3 bit rates: 8 - 320, WMA bit rates: 5 - 320. Weight: 0.02. Dimensions (WxDxH): 22.5 x 11.5 x 47.6"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Dansez avec votre baladeur MP3 GoGEAR SoundClip compact et color\u00e9. Il est \u00e9quip\u00e9 d'un clip de fixation aux v\u00eatements. Profitez de jusqu'\u00e0 8\u00a0heures d'autonomie en lecture et d'une charge rapide gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la technologie FastCharge."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-03-06T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"277d6f98-eb12-454c-988d-41793ce72ec1","identifier":"17911741","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["canon","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon CanoScan 9000F MKII"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Speed & Quality<\/b>\\n\\nSuperb Scanning Resolution: When you combine 9600 x 9600 maximum color resolution1 (film scanning) with a vivid 48-bit color depth and over 281 trillion possible colors, the results will astound you. Continue your scanning brilliance with tremendous 19,200 x 19,200 (Interpolated) software enhanced scans.\\n\\n<b>Ease of Use<\/b>\\n\\n- My Image Garden\\n\\nMy Image Garden software makes organizing and printing your photos fun and easy with great facial recognition, Fun Filters, Calendar Organization, Automatic Layout Suggestions and so much more!\\n\\n- EZ Buttons\\n\\nUtilize the Seven EZ Buttons to automate the entire scanning process. Copy, scan and create email attachments or PDF files simply with the push of a button.\\n\\n- Auto Scan Mode\\n\\nWith the press of a single button you have the ability to bring eight steps into one as you scan your photo, document or personal notebook and have the type of original automatically recognized. In addition, the original is automatically cropped to proper size, scanned and saved in the appropriate file format.\\n\\n- 35mm Film\\n\\nMake your old photos look virtually brand new again with the special film scanning guide frame and Film Adapter Unit by scanning one film strip at a time at a maximum 9600 color dpi1.\\n\\n- Auto Document Fix\\n\\nAuto Document Fix delivers beautiful and easy-to-view scan results by advanced image analysis and area-by-area data correction, automatically. Text characters stand out and are sharp, and clear; while pictures maintain their color tone and contrast.\\n\\n- FARE Level 3\\n\\nThis built-in retouching technology delivers automatic correction to photos and film removing much of the dust and scratches while restoring its color all at the same time. Restore the life of your memories automatically instead of having to spend lots of time manually retouching them.\\n\\n- Gutter Shadow Correction\\n\\nThis built-in correction removes the shadow typically seen when scanning a page from a book. This \"gutter\" is eliminated delivering a clean scan of the page - not the dark gutter.\\n\\n- Evernote\\n\\nQuickly and easily scan your documents and papers from your printer or scanner. Evernote will make your documents searchable, so you can always find what you need at anytime, on any device.\\n\\n<b>Connectivity<\/b>\\n\\n- USB 2.0 Hi-Speed\\n\\nScan and transfer images to your computer at the fastest possible scanning speeds with this connection. The USB 2.0 Hi-Speed Interface also allows for quick previews of your images to your computer."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"4f24914d-3557-4584-bcf2-84e7574fda75","identifier":"17936350","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung HMX-QF30BN hand-held camcorder"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5.1"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-03-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":20}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"a0933366-90d3-4db9-a45b-eec034527d6a","identifier":"17983687","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","samsung"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Samsung DA-F61"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Entertain yourself in style and take your home entertainment to the next level. Using the most powerful magnets possible, the DA-F61 features neodymium speakers in order to produce pure, crisp and clear sound in a compact solid-metal design. SoundShare enhances the sound of your favourite TV shows and movies with greater clarity without making it louder. NFC activates the speaker in one simple touch. Superior sound quality, one-touch connectivity, sleek metallic design and SoundShare are just the few qualities that make this speaker a great add to any room.\\n\\n<b>Experience powerful sound anywhere<\/b>\\nListen and discover newfound clarity and depth in your favourite music. Each Neodymium Speaker is specially crafted to be very compact, yet extremely powerful to produce warm and detailed sound. Even in the tightest of spaces, the Passive Bass Radiator enhances bass levels to transform the sound layout of your living room so you\u2019re delighted by your favourite movies and songs. Change the way you think of compact sound systems and experience pure sound quality at your disposal.\\n\\n<b>The one-touch sound solution<\/b>\\nMake life easier and spend more time listening to your entertainment without having to physically connect to another speaker again. With the simplicity of Bluetooth, place a device near the speaker and let Near Field Communication activate the speaker with just one touch. Pairing with Bluetooth is easy and intuitive with NFC equipped mobile devices. Discover an easier solution to connect to external audio speakers.\\n*Android devices using an OS released prior to 4.0 must download the NFC app\\n\\n<b>Colours that suit your every mood<\/b>\\nSleekly refined and constructed of metal, the DA-F61 is designed to suit the layout of any room. The compact metal body comes in a clean and sophisticated white silver colour that seamlessly enhances the d\u00e9cor and functionality to any room that it\u2019s in. It also comes with a fabric case which makes it easy to take good care of it when carrying it on the go.\\n\\n<b>Turn up your entertainment, not the noise<\/b>\\nListen to all your TV shows and movies with greater clarity without turning up the volume on your TV. SoundShare easily synchronises with your Samsung TV through its auto-pairing function and Bluetooth connectivity. It\u2019s sure to give you top notch sound to your entertainment that can be heard without disturbing others around you. You can now enjoy superior sound quality from all your favourite TV shows and movies through one powerful and easy-to-use speaker.\\n* SoundShare is compatible with Samsung TVs with Bluetooth produced after 2012.\\n\\n<b>The easy way to listen to music<\/b>\\nThe enhanced auditory UI and LED indicators eliminate the need for physical buttons and add more function and style to your portable sound system. The conveniently placed LED indicators allow easy access and visualisation of the speaker\u2019s operating status, while the Auditory UI helps you fine-tune settings. Now, listen to music with perfect sound from the perfect speaker system.\\n\\n<b>Enjoy fast and high-quality music<\/b>\\nPlay and listen to whatever you like with the perfect bass level for you. Easily control the bass sound with the one button on the Wireless Audio - Portable. Once the bass level is adjusted to your liking, the passive bass radiator will ensure that anything you listen to will be rich with sound. It also features a LED light that clearly displays the status of the bass setting tailoring the sound experience to you.\\n\\n<b>Controlled bass effect to your liking<\/b>\\nPlay and listen to whatever you like with the perfect bass level for you. Easily control the bass sound with the one button on the Wireless Audio - Portable. Once the bass level is adjusted to your liking, the passive bass radiator will ensure that anything you listen to will be rich with sound. It also features a LED light that clearly displays the status of the bass setting tailoring the sound experience to you."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-03-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"049115fb-5a68-413b-9365-3371047a7036","identifier":"18009002","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA5DOT02KN MiniDot 2GB* MP3 player"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der unglaublich kleine GoGear MiniDot bietet gro\u00dfe Unterhaltung und ist in verschiedenen lebhaften Farben erh\u00e4ltlich, sodass Sie Ihren Player Ihrem Geschmack entsprechend w\u00e4hlen k\u00f6nnen. Dank des integrierten Clips k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihr Ger\u00e4t wie ein Accessoire tragen, w\u00e4hrend die LED- und Soundanzeigen f\u00fcr eine einfache Navigation sorgen. FastCharge bietet eine schnelle Aufladem\u00f6glichkeit."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Big on fun and incredibly small in size, GoGEAR MiniDot comes in vibrant colors to fit your taste. A built-in clip lets you wear it like an accessory, while LED and sound indicators ensure easy navigation. FastCharge offers quick charging."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Petit et fun, le GoGEAR MiniDot se d\u00e9cline en diff\u00e9rentes couleurs p\u00e9tillantes qui sauront vous s\u00e9duire. Son clip int\u00e9gr\u00e9 vous permet de le porter comme un accessoire, tandis que ses voyants et indicateurs sonores facilitent la navigation. FastCharge permet une charge rapide."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-03-20T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"99ec16a5-7faa-4923-abf7-381931be9705","identifier":"18009234","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","ewent","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Ewent EW1089 webcam"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Mit der Ewent-Webcam mit Mikrofon k\u00f6nnen Sie Videos f\u00fcr vielf\u00e4ltige Gelegenheiten aufzeichnen und live senden. Die Kamera eignet sich perfekt f\u00fcr Video-Chats und Videokonferenzen. Dank der praktischen Aufsteckhalterung k\u00f6nnen Sie die Kamera ganz einfach am LCD-Bildschirm oder an Ihrem Notebook befestigen.\\n\\nDiese Ewent-Kamera ist mit integrierten Leuchten ausgestattet, damit Sie auch bei schlechter Beleuchtung noch ein gutes Bild erzielen.\\n\\n- Web-Kamera mit Mikrofon\\n- Bildaufl\u00f6sungen: 640x480, 320x240 und 160x120\\n- Einfache Installation\\n- Eingebautes Mikrofon\\n- 6 Lampen mit Dimmer-Funktion\\n- Einfache Anklemmvorrichtung f\u00fcr Laptop oder Monitor\\n- Leicht zug\u00e4ngliches Helpdesk\\n- Mehrsprachige Bedienungsanleitung\\n- 5-jahres Garantie"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"With the Ewent Web camera with Microphone you can send live video to anyone. The camera is the perfect solution for video chat and video conferencing. The unique snap-on enables you to simply click the camera on your LCD screen or laptop.\\n\\nThis Ewent camera has built-in lights, so even in low light conditions there still is an image.\\n\\n- Webcam with built-in microphone\\n- Easy click-on stand for laptop or monitor\\n- 6 lights with dim function\\n- Resolutions: 640x480, 320x240 and 160x120\\n- Compliant with USB 2.0 specifications\\n- Easy installation\\n- 5-Year warranty\\n- Accessible helpdesk\\n- Multilingual user manual"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"La cam\u00e9ra Web USB Ewent avec microphone est \u00e9quip\u00e9e d\u2019un microphone. On peut entretenir des messages vid\u00e9o et des \u2018chats\u2019 vid\u00e9o avec tout le monde. On peut fixer facilement cette cam\u00e9ra web sur votre moniteur ou portable gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019attache pratique.La cam\u00e9ra Ewent est \u00e9quip\u00e9e de leds int\u00e9gr\u00e9s de sorte qu\u2019une bonne image reste visible, m\u00eame dans de mauvaises circonstances de luminosit\u00e9.\\n\\n- Cam\u00e9ra Web avec microphone int\u00e9gr\u00e9\\n- Conforme aux sp\u00e9cifications USB 2.0\\n- R\u00e9solution: 640x480, 320x240 et 160x120\\n- 6 petites lampes avec fonction variateur de lumi\u00e8re\\n- Attache pratique pour ordinateur portable ou moniteur\\n- Installation facile\\n- 5 ans de garantie\\n- Service d\u2019aide disponible\\n- Manuel en fran\u00e7ais"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-03-21T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d711b4d6-68aa-4c34-9f18-67d935f6a13d","identifier":"18137095","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony Walkman 8GB"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Introducing the thinnest Walkman media player ever, where music and video are just the beginning. The E Series Sony Walkman sports easy drag-and-drop content transfer from iTunes and Windows Media Player plus up to 36 hours1 of audio playback on a single charge\u2014all in an ultra-slim design that fits in your pocket with room to spare. Enjoy amazingly clear music and razor-sharp videos when you're on the move, working out or passing time on your daily commute. With an ultra-bright, lightning-fast 2\" LCD display, your photos, videos and album artwork will pop with rich color and clarity. The built-in FM radio connects you to your favorite stations, while two pre-loaded games keep you entertained for hours. Includes EX earbud headphones and a USB cable.\\n\\n<b>Take your entertainment with you<\/b>\\nThe slim design of the Sony\u00ae NWZ-E470 series Walkman\u00ae MP3 Player allows you to enjoy your favorite audio and video files, look at personal photos or simply listen to the built in FM radio.\\n\\n<b>Small in size, BIG in file capacity<\/b>\\nThe redesigned NWZ-E470 series Walkman\u00ae at 7mm is 30% thinner than previous models at 10mm. At just 7.0 mm thick, it\u2019s the thinnest Walkman model in history. Streamlined for portability, the NWZ-E470 series can store hours of music, videos and personal photos thanks to the internal 8 GB memory2.\\n\\n<b>Dynamic Normalizer<\/b>\\nDynamic Normalizer balances the volume level between songs. With this setting, when listening to album songs in the shuffle play mode, the volume level between songs is moderated to minimize the difference in their recording levels.\\n\\n<b>Built-in Gaming<\/b>\\nThe NWZ-E470 series Walkman\u00ae comes pre-loaded with two relaxing games. Users can select between a colorful puzzle organizing game or a challenging numbers organization game. (similar to a falling block games & Sudoku)\\n\\n<b>Bookmarking with Multiple Playlists<\/b>\\nUsers can bookmark songs and add them to 5 configurable playlists.\\n\\n<b>Open, charge and listen<\/b>\\nEverything you need is in the box including USB cable and soft hybrid silicone EX headphones.\\n\\n<b>Rechargeable battery built-in<\/b>\\nThe built-in lithium ion battery provides up to 36 hours of audio playback or 6 hours of video playback per charge.\\n\\n<b>Easy Content Transfer<\/b>\\nThe Media Go\u2122 application for Windows\u00ae allows you to transfer your favorite music, videos, playlists, and photos to your Walkman\u00ae easily. You can drag and drop the data from iTunes\u00ae for Windows, Windows Media Player or Windows Explorer.\\n\\n<b>Discover music with Music Unlimited<\/b>\\nThe NWZ-E470 series is compatible with Sony\u2019s Music Unlimited service3, offering users access to millions of songs plus sync your personal library. Choose any album or song or sit back and enjoy channels.\\n\\n<b>Voice Recording<\/b>\\nUsing the built-in microphone you have a handy way to take a note or just have fun.\\n\\n<b>Language Learning Function<\/b>\\nLearning a new language is made easier thanks to the adjustable playback speed control, A-B repeat and rewind functions.\\n\\n<b>Lightning-fast LCD display<\/b>\\nThe 2\" QVGA (320x240) high-brightness screen, color LCD provides fast, rich viewing of photos, videos, and album artwork. Users can even save their personal photos as background wallpaper.\\n\\n<b>Solid Sound<\/b>\\nExclusive Sony\u00ae Clear Audio Technologies -- Clear Stereo, Clear Bass Audio Technologies and Digital Sound Enhancement Engine -- restore the clarity and depth of digitally compressed music. With the integrated 5 band equalizer, you can dial in the sound according to genre or create two custom EQ curves.\\n\\n<b>Keep track of time<\/b>\\nThe NWZ-E470 Walkman\u00ae player has a built in clock function with alarm and sleep timer functions.\\n\\n<b>Display song lyrics<\/b>\\nLoad .lrc lyric files for your favorite songs and set the lyrics to scroll by in sync to the music.\\n\\n<b>Create Channels with SensMe\u2122 feature<\/b>\\nSensMe\u2122 tone analysis keeps your music in tune with your mood. SensMe software application automatically groups your music into channels based on beats-per-minute, making listening and managing your content even simpler."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7e30eff6-36a4-4e5c-b290-f81d7b03175a","identifier":"18141201","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA5DOT04PF"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der unglaublich kleine GoGear MiniDot bietet gro\u00dfe Unterhaltung und ist in verschiedenen lebhaften Farben erh\u00e4ltlich, sodass Sie Ihren Player Ihrem Geschmack entsprechend w\u00e4hlen k\u00f6nnen. Dank des integrierten Clips k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihr Ger\u00e4t wie ein Accessoire tragen, w\u00e4hrend die LED- und Soundanzeigen f\u00fcr eine einfache Navigation sorgen. FastCharge bietet eine schnelle Aufladem\u00f6glichkeit."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA5DOT04PF. MP3 bit rates: 8 - 320, WMA bit rates: 5 - 320. Supported radio bands: FM. Weight: 0.019. Dimensions (WxDxH): 41.8 x 15 x 41.8"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Petit et fun, le GoGEAR MiniDot se d\u00e9cline en diff\u00e9rentes couleurs p\u00e9tillantes qui sauront vous s\u00e9duire. Son clip int\u00e9gr\u00e9 vous permet de le porter comme un accessoire, tandis que ses voyants et indicateurs sonores facilitent la navigation. FastCharge permet une charge rapide."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"26847fb9-5290-40a0-a3d2-d138e774d977","identifier":"18141206","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA5DOT04ONS"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Bringen Sie mit dem GoGEAR FitDot Farbe in Ihr Fitnesstraining. Verwenden Sie das Armband oder den integrierten Clip, um sich von anstrengendem Workout zu l\u00f6sen. Das Ger\u00e4t verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber FastCharge f\u00fcr ein schnelles Aufladen sowie \u00fcber LED- und Soundanzeigen f\u00fcr eine einfache Navigation."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA5DOT04ONS. MP3 bit rates: 8 - 320, WMA bit rates: 5 - 192. Supported radio bands: FM. Weight: 0.019. Dimensions (WxDxH): 41.8 x 15 x 41.8"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec le GoGEAR FitDot, le sport est haut en couleur. Utilisez le brassard ou le clip int\u00e9gr\u00e9 pour \u00eatre libre de tous vos mouvements. Dot\u00e9 de FastCharge pour une charge rapide ainsi que de voyants et indicateurs sonores facilitant la navigation."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
