{"uuid":"1f798c4e-dc34-4fe7-ac91-de49a05572d1","identifier":"18141210","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA5DOT02ONS"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Bringen Sie mit dem GoGEAR FitDot Farbe in Ihr Fitnesstraining. Verwenden Sie das Armband oder den integrierten Clip, um sich von anstrengendem Workout zu l\u00f6sen. Das Ger\u00e4t verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber FastCharge f\u00fcr ein schnelles Aufladen sowie \u00fcber LED- und Soundanzeigen f\u00fcr eine einfache Navigation."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA5DOT02ONS. MP3 bit rates: 8 - 320, WMA bit rates: 5 - 192. Supported radio bands: FM. Weight: 0.019. Dimensions (WxDxH): 41.8 x 15 x 41.8"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Avec le GoGEAR FitDot, le sport est haut en couleur. Utilisez le brassard ou le clip int\u00e9gr\u00e9 pour \u00eatre libre de tous vos mouvements. Dot\u00e9 de FastCharge pour une charge rapide ainsi que de voyants et indicateurs sonores facilitant la navigation."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"de4eba0d-04ff-4d7b-b7ae-d575c03590b4","identifier":"18141279","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA5DOT04ONS"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA5DOT04ONS. MP3 bit rates: 8 - 320, WMA bit rates: 5 - 192. Supported radio bands: FM"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-05T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"61c4f612-9ca6-4013-b12d-3ef9f259d097","identifier":"18142687","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF G30"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.09"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Capture the action like a pro with the Canon LEGRIA HF G30<\/b>\\nThe flagship LEGRIA HF G30 camcorder packs high-specification optics, sensor and stabiliser plus Wi-Fi connectivity into a compact body, ideal for enthusiasts who want to match their creativity with professional quality videos.\\n\\n- 20x zoom, 26.8mm wide-angle lens; 8 blade circular aperture\\n- Control settings remotely and share with Wi-Fi\\n- Simultaneous recording of AVCHD and MP4\\n- Canon HD CMOS PRO sensor, DIGIC DV 4\\n- Optical Intelligent IS\\n- Full manual control\\n- Instant AF; Face Detection\\n- 8.8cm OLED touch screen\\n\\n<b>20x zoom, 26.8mm wide-angle lens, 8-blade aperture<\/b>\\nThe brand new 26.8mm wide angle lens provides better image quality than ever before in a compact camcorder, while the smooth 20x optical zoom lets you get closer to the action. A new, 8-blade circular aperture enables beautiful \u2018Bokeh\u2019 effect.\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi Remote<\/b>\\nEnjoy the freedom of controlling your LEGRIA HF G30 when the camcorder is positioned out of reach. Control a number of settings, including shutter speed, focus and exposure wirelessly by using your smartphone or tablets web browser.\\n\\n<b>Dual-Format Recording<\/b>\\nSimultaneously record in different formats (AVCHD and MP4) or at different bitrates, to the dual SDXC card slots and enjoy the twin benefits of professional quality footage and easy upload to the web. Capture fast and slow motion when shooting in MP4 format.\\n\\n<b>HD CMOS PRO sensor, DIGIC DV 4<\/b>\\nWith an effective pixel count of approximately 2.91 megapixels, the new HD CMOS PRO sensor \u2013 designed and manufactured by Canon for its professional models \u2013 delivers stunning picture quality, even in low light, as well as wide dynamic range and realistic colour reproduction. The new powerful DIGIC DV 4 image processor works with the sensor to provide images with lower noise and more depth.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent Image Stabilisation<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS combats camera shake by automatically selecting the right optical image stabilisation from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. The advanced dynamic mode corrects roll and tilt movements that can occur when walking, ensuring sharp steady videos in every situation.\\n\\n<b>Full Manual Control<\/b>\\nA manual lens ring allows intuitive control of focus or zoom. Exposure, aperture, shutter speed and gain can all be independently adjusted using the touch screen and customisable control dial, allowing you to unleash your creativity.\\n\\n<b>Instant AutoFocus, Face Detection<\/b>\\nInstant AF provides fast and accurate focusing for pin-sharp HD quality. Face Detection automatically optimises camcorder settings for perfectly-focused and exposed shots of people.\\n\\n<b>8.8cm (3.5\u201d) fold-out OLED touchscreen and tiltable EVF<\/b>\\nThe responsive organic electrostatic LED touch screen, with a 1.23 million dot resolution, offers superior definition, contrast and colour reproduction over LCD. The 0.61cm (0.24\u201d) 1.56 million pixel electronic colour viewfinder can tilt up to 45\u00b0 to allow you further control especially in bright conditions"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Saisissez l'action tel un professionnel avec le Canon LEGRIA HF G30<\/b>\\nLe cam\u00e9scope phare LEGRIA HF G30 concentre une optique, un capteur et un stabilisateur de pointe, ainsi qu'une connectivit\u00e9 Wi-Fi dans un bo\u00eetier compact, id\u00e9al pour les passionn\u00e9s souhaitant exercer leur cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 sur des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle.\\n\\n- Zoom 20\u00d7, objectif grand-angle 26,8 mm, diaphragme circulaire \u00e0 8 lamelles\\n- Contr\u00f4lez les r\u00e9glages \u00e0 distance et partagez vos images via Wi-Fi\\n- Enregistrement simultan\u00e9 aux formats AVCHD et MP4\\n- Capteur Canon CMOS HD PRO, DIGIC DV 4\\n- Stabilisateur d'image optique intelligent\\n- Contr\u00f4le manuel total\\n- AF instantan\u00e9 ; d\u00e9tection de visages\\n- \u00c9cran tactile OLED de 8,8 cm"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-07T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":20}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"3b4e3486-efed-4d50-8ead-f08a148b6dda","identifier":"18151421","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony SRS-BTX300 loudspeaker"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Musikgenuss mit nur einer Ber\u00fchrung<br\/>\\n<br\/>One Touch-Verbindung mit NFC*: Wenn Ihr Smartphone oder Tablet nicht NFC-f\u00e4hig ist, koppeln Sie es einfach mit dem kabellosen Lautsprecher, um Ihre Musik kabellos zu \u00fcbertragen..<br\/>\\nKabelloses Musik-Streaming per Bluetooth\u00ae: Wenn Ihr Ger\u00e4t nicht NFC-f\u00e4hig ist, k\u00f6nnen Sie es einfach \u00fcber Bluetooth\u00ae verbinden.<br\/>\\nErwecken Sie Ihre Musik zum Leben: Der kabellose 2-Kanal-Lautsprecher mit dem passiven Radiator sorgt f\u00fcr weniger Verzerrungen und kristallklare Musik..<br\/>\\nRealistischer Surround Sound mit S-Master Digitalverst\u00e4rker: Mit insgesamt 20 W Lautsprecherleistung erleben Sie ein raumf\u00fcllendes Klangerlebnis.<br\/>\\nGenie\u00dfen Sie Ihre Musik dank 8 Stunden Wiedergabe \u00fcberall: Stecken Sie den mobilen BTX300 einfach aus, und nehmen Sie ihn dank Akku zu einer Gartenparty oder auf eine Reise einfach mit..<br\/>\\nStilvolle Erg\u00e4nzung f\u00fcr jeden Raum: Das schmale, geschwungene Design mit geb\u00fcrsteter Edelstahloberfl\u00e4che sieht \u00fcberall gut aus. Wei\u00df oder Schwarz..<br\/>\\nAufladen \u00fcber USB w\u00e4hrend der Wiedergabe: W\u00e4hrend Sie in der K\u00fcche zu Ihrer Musik tanzen, k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihr Smartphone oder Tablet \u00fcber den USB-Anschluss aufladen..<br\/>\\nFreisprechfunktion \u00fcber das integrierte Mikrofon: Wenn Sie, w\u00e4hrend Sie Musik h\u00f6ren, einen Anruf erhalten, dr\u00fccken Sie einfach auf die Antworttaste auf dem kabellosen Lautsprecher, um beim Tippen oder Kochen zu antworten..<br\/>\\nReisetauglich: Eine individuelle Tasche sch\u00fctzt den kabellosen Lautsprecher, wenn Sie unterwegs sind, sodass Sie Ihre Freunde besuchen, einen Drink nehmen und Musik h\u00f6ren k\u00f6nnen..<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Touch once for instant music<br\/>\\n<br\/>One touch connection with NFC*: If your smartphone or tablet isn\u2019t NFC-enabled, just pair it with the wireless speaker to stream your music without wires.<br\/>\\nWireless music streaming with Bluetooth\u00ae: If your device isn\u2019t NFC-enabled, simply pair with the speaker using Bluetooth\u00ae.<br\/>\\nBring your music to life: The 2 channel wireless speaker with its passive radiator reduces sound distortion for crisp, clear music.<br\/>\\nRealistic surround sound with S-Master digital amp: With 20W total speaker power, it\u2019s the type of audio that fills every corner of the room.<br\/>\\nTake it on a trip with 8-hour playback: With the rechargeable battery, simply unplug the portable BTX300 and take it anywhere from a party on the terrace to a road trip.<br\/>\\nAdd a touch of style to any room: A sleek, curved design with a brushed stainless steel finish will look good wherever you put it. White or black..<br\/>\\nUSB charging as you listen: While you\u2019re dancing in the kitchen, you can charge your smartphone or tablet via the USB power port.<br\/>\\nTake hands-free calls with a built-in microphone: When you\u2019re listening and a call comes in, just press the answering key on the wireless speaker to chat while typing or cooking.<br\/>\\nReady for a safe journey: A custom carrying case protects the wireless speaker as you go, so you can take it to a friend\u2019s place for drinks and a listen.<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"De la musique instantan\u00e9e en une seule touche<br\/>\\n<br\/>Connexion en une seule touche avec la fonction NFC*: Si votre smartphone ou tablette n'est pas compatible NFC, couplez votre appareil avec l'enceinte sans fil pour diffuser votre musique sans aucun c\u00e2ble.<br\/>\\nDiffusion de musique sans fil via Bluetooth\u00ae: Si votre appareil n'est pas compatible NFC, connectez simplement le haut-parleur utilisant le Bluetooth\u00ae.<br\/>\\nDonnez vie \u00e0 votre musique: L'enceinte sans fil \u00e0 deux canaux dot\u00e9e d'un radiateur passif r\u00e9duit les distorsions sonores pour une musique claire et limpide.<br\/>\\nSon Surround r\u00e9aliste avec amplificateur num\u00e9rique S-Master: Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 sa puissance totale de 20 W, l'enceinte fournit un son qui emplit chaque recoin de la pi\u00e8ce.<br\/>\\nEmportez-la avec vous et profitez de 8 heures d'\u00e9coute: Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 sa batterie rechargeable, d\u00e9branchez simplement l'enceinte BTX300 portable et emportez-la \u00e0 vos soir\u00e9es en ext\u00e9rieur ou lors de vos voyages.<br\/>\\nUne touche d'\u00e9l\u00e9gance pour chaque pi\u00e8ce: Syst\u00e8me compact aux courbes \u00e9l\u00e9gantes et finition en acier bross\u00e9 inoxydable, pour un style \u00e9l\u00e9gant dans toutes les pi\u00e8ces de la maison. Blanc ou noir..<br\/>\\nChargement USB et \u00e9coute simultan\u00e9s: Dansez dans la cuisine tout en chargeant votre smartphone ou tablette via le port d'alimentation USB.<br\/>\\nPassez des appels en gardant les mains libres gr\u00e2ce au microphone int\u00e9gr\u00e9: Si vous recevez un appel alors que vous \u00e9coutez de la musique, appuyez simplement sur la touche de prise d'appel sur l'enceinte sans fil afin de discuter tout en continuant vos activit\u00e9s.<br\/>\\nPr\u00eat pour vos d\u00e9placements: Une housse de transport personnalis\u00e9e prot\u00e8ge l'enceinte sans fil lors de vos d\u00e9placements, vous permettant de l'emporter chez des amis pour profiter de votre musique autour d'un verre.<br\/>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-09T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b4bbfd92-d22f-4148-94fb-8194be237cb0","identifier":"18151438","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony HDR-PJ760E hand-held camcorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony HDR-PJ760E. Colour of product: Black"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-09T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d53238c4-e2c0-4c1a-aa5f-d6cd961558cf","identifier":"18151841","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony NEX-VG30E hand-held camcorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Volle Aufnahmekontrolle<br\/>\\n<br\/>Ein gestochen scharfes Bild: Professionelle Aufnahmequalit\u00e4t mit einem gro\u00dfen APS-C Sensor im DSLR-Format mit 16,1 Mio. Pixel.<br\/>\\nBilder und Sound wie im Kino: Entdecken Sie eine neue Dimension der kreativen Kunst. Nehmen Sie wundersch\u00f6ne detailgetreue Videobilder wie im Kino mit 24 Bildern pro Sekunde und hochwertigem Ton auf..<br\/>\\nMachen Sie mehr aus Ihren Bildern: Mit einem E-Objektiv mit leistungsstarkem Zoom k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihr Motiv mit einem bis zu 11fachen Zoom stufenlos fokussieren.<br\/>\\nSchnell und leistungsstark: Ein BIONZ Prozessor erm\u00f6glicht scharfe, detailreiche Videos und Fotos sowie reaktionsschnelles Fotografieren.<br\/>\\nW\u00e4hlen Sie den Zoom: W\u00e4hlen Sie das entsprechende E-Objektiv f\u00fcr alle Motive, oder verwenden Sie Ihre bevorzugten DSLR-Objektive des Typs A von Carl Zeiss\u00ae und Sony (Adapter erforderlich)..<br\/>\\nErfassen Sie alles in HD: Erfassen Sie jedes Detail mit Full HD-Videoaufnahmen in 1920 x 1080 Aufl\u00f6sung (AVCHD-Format) mit 24 Mbit\/s f\u00fcr verbesserte Detailtiefe und Klarheit.<br\/>\\nW\u00e4hlen Sie die Bildwiederholrate: Fl\u00fcssige Videoaufnahmen in Full HD-Qualit\u00e4t mit der M\u00f6glichkeit von 24 Bildern pro Sekunde wie im Kino, oder Standard-Bildwiederholraten von 25p bzw. 50p.<br\/>\\nDSLR-Bildqualit\u00e4t: Fotoaufnahmen mit DSLR-\u00e4hnlicher Bildqualit\u00e4t und geringer Sch\u00e4rfentiefe f\u00fcr professionell aussehende Bilder:.<br\/>\\nTouchscreen-Steuerung: Ein verstellbarer LCD-Touchscreen f\u00fcr einfache Bedienung mit den Fingerspitzen.<br\/>\\nAufnahmen mit Surround Sound: Das Quad Capsule Spatial Array Mikrofon mit vier omnidirektionalen Kapseln f\u00fcr Stereo- oder 5.1-Kanal-Surround-Aufnahme und Lautst\u00e4rkeregelung.<br\/>\\nModerne und benutzerfreundliche Bedienung: Fingerspitzenbedienung mit programmierbarem Drehrad, Direktzugriffstasten und zweiter REC-Taste f\u00fcr Aufnahmen aus der Froschperspektive.<br\/>\\nNat\u00fcrlicher wirkende Aufnahmen: Der leistungsstarke Optimierer f\u00fcr den Dynamikumfang stellt Belichtung und Kontrast bei kontrastreichen Motiven und Portr\u00e4ts mit Hintergrundbeleuchtung f\u00fcr nat\u00fcrliche Ergebnisse ein.<br\/>\\nW\u00e4hlen Sie das passende Zubeh\u00f6r: Mit einem optionalen XLR-Adapter k\u00f6nnen Sie eine professionellere Standardbeleuchtung, Mikrofone und vieles mehr hinzuf\u00fcgen.<br\/>\\nTeilen Sie Ihr Filmmaterial in HD: Schlie\u00dfen Sie die Kamera direkt an einen HD-Fernseher oder PC an und sehen Sie Ihre Filme in Full High Definition wie im Kino.<br\/>\\nSpeichern auf einem Memory Stick\u2122 oder einer SD-Karte: Setzen Sie Speicherkarten mit hoher Kapazit\u00e4t ein, und nehmen Sie Full HD-Videos (bis zu 470 Minuten mit 32-GB-Speicherkarte) auf, ohne sich \u00fcber B\u00e4nder oder Discs zu sorgen..<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Take control and shoot your way<br\/>\\n<br\/>Get a sharper view: Shoot pro-quality video with a large, DSLR sized APS-C sensor with 16.1 megapixels.<br\/>\\nReal cinematic images and sound: Explore a new dimension in creative artistry. Capture beautifully detailed, cinematic video images plus high-quality audio in cinematic 24 frames per second.<br\/>\\nAdd some power to your shots: Add an E-mount lens with a power zoom and smoothly focus in on your subject with up to 11x magnification.<br\/>\\nFast and powerful performance: A BIONZ processor ensures clear, detailed video and still images plus quick, responsive shooting.<br\/>\\nChoose your view: Pick the right E-mount lens for any scene, or use your favourite A-mount DSLR lenses by Carl Zeiss and Sony (requires adaptor).<br\/>\\nCapture it all in HD: Capture all the detail with Full HD 1920 x 1080 video shooting (AVCHD format) at 24mbs for increased detail and clarity.<br\/>\\nSelect your frame rate: Shoot smooth, Full HD video footage with choice of cinematic 24 frames per second, or standard 25\/50p frame rates.<br\/>\\nDSLR quality photos: Shoot stills with DSLR-like picture quality and shallow depth of field for professional looking shots.<br\/>\\nTouch to control: An adjustable LCD touchscreen offers easy fingertip operation.<br\/>\\nRecord in surround sound: The Quad Capsule Spatial Array Microphone has four omnidirectional capsules, for stereo or 5.1ch surround sound recording.<br\/>\\nAdvanced, easy-to-use operation: It\u2019s all at your fingertips with an assignable dial, direct access keys, and a second REC button for low-angle shots.<br\/>\\nGet a natural look: The Advanced Dynamic Range Optimiser Adjusts exposure and contrast for natural results in high-contrast scenes and backlit portraits.<br\/>\\nAdd the perfect accessory: An optional XLR adaptor lets you add professional standard lighting, microphones and more.<br\/>\\nShare your footage in HD: Connect directly to an HD TV or PC and view your videos in cinematic Full High Definition.<br\/>\\nRecord on memory stick or SD card: Slip in a high-capacity media card and shoot Full HD video (up to 470min with 32GB card) with no tapes or discs to worry about.<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Prenez les commandes, photographiez comme il vous pla\u00eet<br\/>\\n<br\/>Des images encore plus nettes: R\u00e9alisez des vid\u00e9os de qualit\u00e9 professionnelle gr\u00e2ce au grand capteur APS-C 16,1 m\u00e9gapixels (de dimension comparable \u00e0 celui d'un reflex num\u00e9rique).<br\/>\\nDes images et un son incroyables, comme au cin\u00e9ma: D\u00e9couvrez une dimension de cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 in\u00e9dite. Capturez des s\u00e9quences vid\u00e9o d\u00e9taill\u00e9es, avec un aspect cin\u00e9ma en 24 images par seconde et un son de haute qualit\u00e9.<br\/>\\nRentrez de plein fouet dans votre sujet: Ajoutez un zoom puissant de type E et effectuez en douceur la mise au point sur votre sujet, que vous pouvez agrandir jusqu'\u00e0 11x.<br\/>\\nRapidit\u00e9 et puissance: Un processeur BIONZ garantit des vid\u00e9os et des photos nettes et d\u00e9taill\u00e9es, il permet des prises de vue rapides et r\u00e9actives.<br\/>\\nChoisissez votre objectif: Utilisez l'objectif de type E qui convient le mieux \u00e0 chaque sc\u00e8ne, ou optez pour un objectif reflex de type A de Carl Zeiss\u00ae et Sony (adaptateur requis).<br\/>\\nFilmez tout en HD: Saisissez le moindre d\u00e9tail en vid\u00e9o Full HD 1 920 x 1 080 (format AVCHD) \u00e0 24 Mbit\/s, pour plus de nettet\u00e9 et de clart\u00e9.<br\/>\\nS\u00e9lectionnez votre fr\u00e9quence d'images: Filmez en Full HD en choisissant votre fr\u00e9quence d'images\u00a0: 24 images par seconde pour un aspect cin\u00e9ma, ou 25p \/ 50p pour plus de fluidit\u00e9.<br\/>\\nDes photos de qualit\u00e9 reflex: Prenez des photos de qualit\u00e9 reflex avec une faible profondeur de champ pour un rendu professionnel.<br\/>\\nEffectuez vos r\u00e9glages du bout des doigts: L'\u00e9cran tactile LCD ajustable vous permet de r\u00e9gler votre appareil en toute facilit\u00e9.<br\/>\\nEnregistrement avec son Surround: Le microphone Quad Capsule Spatial Array est dot\u00e9 de quatre capsules omnidirectionnelles permettant d'enregistrer en st\u00e9r\u00e9o ou en son Surround 5.1.<br\/>\\nUtilisation facile: Toutes les fonctions sont \u00e0 port\u00e9e avec une molette programmable, des touches d'acc\u00e8s direct et un deuxi\u00e8me bouton d'enregistrement pour les prises de vue en contre-plong\u00e9e.<br\/>\\nCapturez des images naturelles: L'optimisateur de gamme dynamique avanc\u00e9 r\u00e8gle l'exposition ainsi que le contraste, et offre un r\u00e9sultat naturel pour les photos \u00e0 fort contraste et les portraits en contre-jour.<br\/>\\nAjoutez l'accessoire id\u00e9al: Un adaptateur XLR en option vous permet d'ajouter un \u00e9clairage professionnel, des microphones et plus encore.<br\/>\\nPartagez vos vid\u00e9os en HD: Connectez directement l'appareil \u00e0 un t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur HD ou \u00e0 un PC pour regarder vos vid\u00e9os en Full HD de qualit\u00e9 cin\u00e9ma.<br\/>\\nEnregistrement sur Memory Stick\u2122 ou sur carte SD: Ins\u00e9rez une carte multim\u00e9dia haute capacit\u00e9 et enregistrez des vid\u00e9os Full HD (jusqu'\u00e0 470 minutes avec une carte 32 Go) sans avoir \u00e0 vous soucier de cassettes ou de disques.<br\/>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
