{"uuid":"bc5ad837-66f2-48f1-a098-c2511a741a55","identifier":"18152125","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony NWZ-E463N MP3 player & recorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony NWZ-E463N"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-10T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"30e42f6a-f8b2-45e5-ae36-7ce5e2463c2a","identifier":"18157783","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony MHS-FS3K hand-held camcorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony MHS-FS3K. Colour of product: Black"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"2a769cae-0dd1-49bd-a933-721e9ae90ddb","identifier":"18157852","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DCR-SX22E hand-held camcorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Kompaktes Design, enorme Leistung<br\/>\\n<br\/>Noch n\u00e4her mit einem Klick: Dank des 60fachen optischen und 70fachen erweiterten Zoom mit erweiterter Bildverarbeitung k\u00f6nnen Sie sich schnell an das Geschehen heranzoomen und in gestochen scharfen Bildern festhalten..<br\/>\\nFotos in gestochen scharfen Details: Mit 8,9 Mio. Pixeln k\u00f6nnen Sie gestochen scharfe High Definition-Fotos und -Videos aufnehmen.<br\/>\\nEinfach anvisieren und abdr\u00fccken, ohne Anpassen von Einstellungen: iAuto passt Einstellungen f\u00fcr beste Ergebnisse automatisch an, erkennt verschiedene Gesichter, Lichtverh\u00e4ltnisse und Szenen, wie Landschaften..<br\/>\\nVielseitige Speicherm\u00f6glichkeiten f\u00fcr Ihre Erinnerungen: Speichern Sie Erinnerungen auf einem Memory Stick\u2122, Memory Stick PRO Duo\u2122, einer SD-, SDHC- oder SDXC-Karte..<br\/>\\nKeine Verwacklungen unterwegs: Mithilfe der SteadyShot Kameraverwacklungskorrektur erhalten Sie verwacklungsfreie Videos mit vollem Zoomumfang, auch wenn die Aufnahme im Gehen erfolgt..<br\/>\\nGesichter in optimalen Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen aufnehmen: Die Gesichtserkennung erkennt bis zu acht Gesichter in einem Bildausschnitt und passt die Belichtung automatisch an..<br\/>\\nAufnahmen in schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen: Dank der hellen und energiesparenden integrierten LED-Videoleuchte k\u00f6nnen Sie in dunklen Umgebungen in einem Umkreis von bis zu 1,5 m beleuchten..<br\/>\\nHochladen und online weitergeben im Handumdrehen: Mit PlayMemories Home k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihre Bilder und Videos problemlos von jedem PC oder Mac\u00ae auf Plattformen wie Facebook\u2122 oder YouTube\u2122 hochladen. Dazu m\u00fcssen Sie den Camcorder nur per USB an den Computer anschlie\u00dfen..<br\/>\\nSpeichern Sie Ihre Erinnerungen direkt auf einer externen Festplatte: Dank Direct Copy k\u00f6nnen Sie Ihre Handycam\u00ae direkt an ein externes Laufwerk anschlie\u00dfen und Videos und Bilder speichern und wiedergeben \u2013 ganz ohne PC!.<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Compact design, big performance<br\/>\\n<br\/>Get closer in a click: 60x optical and 70x extended zoom with advanced image processing let you zoom quickly into a scene and capture clear footage.<br\/>\\nCapture stills in sharp detail: With 8.9 megapixel still image recording, you can shoot crisp, clear High Definition photos as well as movies.<br\/>\\nJust point and shoot, without adjusting settings: iAuto automatically adjusts settings for the best results, recognising different faces, lighting and scenes such as landscapes.<br\/>\\nPlenty of options to store your memories: Record to your choice of removable Memory Stick\u2122, Memory Stick PRO Duo\u2122, SD, SDHC or SDXC cards.<br\/>\\nStay smooth on the move: With SteadyShot camera shake correction you\u2019ll capture smooth video at all zoom settings, even when you\u2019re walking.<br\/>\\nCapture people\u2019s faces in the right light: Face Detection automatically detects up to 8 faces in a scene, then optimises exposure for the best results.<br\/>\\nShoot in low light and darkness: With a bright and energy efficient integrated LED video light you can shine light up to 1.5 metres in dark environments.<br\/>\\nQuickly upload and share online: With PlayMemories Home it\u2019s easy to upload to websites such as Facebook\u2122 or YouTube\u2122 from any PC or Mac, just by connecting by USB.<br\/>\\nSave your memories direct to external hard drive: With Direct Copy, you can connect a Handycam\u00ae direct to an external drive to save and play video and images \u2013 no need for a PC.<br\/>\\n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Mod\u00e8le compact et ultra-performant<br\/>\\n<br\/>Rapprochez-vous en un clic: Le zoom optique 60x et \u00e9tendu 70x, associ\u00e9 au traitement sophistiqu\u00e9 des images, vous permettent d'effectuer rapidement un zoom avant sur le sujet et de r\u00e9aliser une vid\u00e9o nette.<br\/>\\nDes photos ultra-d\u00e9taill\u00e9es: Avec un enregistrement de photos de 8,9 m\u00e9gapixels, vous pouvez r\u00e9aliser des photos HD claires et d\u00e9taill\u00e9es ainsi que des vid\u00e9os.<br\/>\\nVisez et d\u00e9clenchez, sans r\u00e9glage des param\u00e8tres: iAuto ajuste automatiquement les param\u00e8tres pour des r\u00e9sultats optimaux avec l'analyse de la luminosit\u00e9 et la reconnaissance des visages et des sc\u00e8nes comme les paysages.<br\/>\\nDe nombreuses options pour immortaliser vos souvenirs: Enregistrez sur la carte de votre choix\u00a0; Memory Stick\u2122, Memory Stick PRO Duo\u2122, SD, SDHC ou SDXC.<br\/>\\nDes mouvements plus fluides que jamais: Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la fonction SteadyShot de compensation des mouvements du cam\u00e9scope, vous obtiendrez des vid\u00e9os nettes quel que soit le r\u00e9glage du zoom, m\u00eame en marchant.<br\/>\\nPrenez les visages avec le bon \u00e9clairage: La fonction de d\u00e9tection des visages permet de rep\u00e9rer automatiquement jusqu'\u00e0 8 visages et d'optimiser ensuite l'exposition pour garantir le meilleur r\u00e9sultat.<br\/>\\nPrise de vue dans l'obscurit\u00e9 et par faible luminosit\u00e9: La torche vid\u00e9o LED int\u00e9gr\u00e9e, lumineuse et \u00e9co\u00e9nerg\u00e9tique, permet d'\u00e9clairer jusqu'\u00e0 une distance de 1,5 m\u00e8tre dans l'obscurit\u00e9.<br\/>\\nT\u00e9l\u00e9chargement et partage rapide en ligne: Avec le logiciel PlayMemories Home\u2122, chargez en toute simplicit\u00e9 via la connexion USB des photos et vid\u00e9os sur des sites Web tels que Facebook\u2122 ou YouTube\u2122 \u00e0 partir d'un PC ou d'un Mac\u00ae.<br\/>\\nEnregistrez vos souvenirs sur un disque dur externe: Avec la fonction de copie directe, vous pouvez connecter votre cam\u00e9scope Handycam\u00ae sur un disque externe pour enregistrer et lire des vid\u00e9os et des images\u00a0; pas besoin de PC.<br\/>\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-11T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0b741078-d74f-4d7d-9694-7473a65903d6","identifier":"18169126","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision MiWand 2L Pro"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Kein PC n\u00f6tig\\n- Einfache Bedienung\\n- Ideal zum Scannen von B\u00fcchern\\n- Vorschaubild auf dem 1,8\u201c-Farb-LCD\\n- Farb- und Schwarz-Wei\u00df-Modus\\n- Scannt Farbe A4 in 1,6 Sekunden\\n- Scannen auf das iPad\u2122 (mit separat erh\u00e4ltlichem Kamera-Kit)\\n- Unterst\u00fctzt SD - Karten bis zu 32 GB\\n- Scans wahlweise als JPEG oder PDF speichern\\n- 4 GB Micro - SD-Karte im Lieferumfang\\n- Scanaufl\u00f6sung von 600 dpi\\n- Dokumentengr\u00f6\u00dfe bis 21 \u00d7 35,5 cm\\n- Stromversorgung\\n\\n\u2013 via Lithium-Ionen Akku (MiWand 2L, MiWand 2L Pro)\\n\u2013 via AA-Akku (MiWand 2, MiWand 2 Pro)\\n\\n<b>Aufladeoptionen<\/b>\\n- MiWand 2: Ladeger\u00e4t\\n- MiWand 2 Pro: Ladeger\u00e4t\\n- MiWand 2L: USB\\n- MiWand 2L Pro: Dockingstation (Netzteil), USB - Stromversorgungskabel"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A mobile scanner that scans anywhere, anytime<\/b>\\nExperience the efficiency and convenience of a truly mobile scanner! Powered only by 2x AA alkaline batteries, the MiWand 2 Pro is a mobile scanner that allows you to scan without a computer or software. Simply gliding the scanner over the surface of a page and the scan is done. The images are then saved to a Micro SD card up to 32G.\\n\\n<b>Wireless design, scan images anywhere<\/b>\\nThe brand new portable scanner can be operated with a single hand. Powered by alkaline batteries, you do not need to carry a heavy power adapter and hunt for an electric outlet anymore! Since no computer is required to start a scan, you can carry it to anywhere, anytime! Whenever on the road, in a plane, a car or a caf\u00e9, you can digitize almost everything right away! Whether standing or sitting, you can complete your scan by simply gliding it over a surface. Even the posters on the wall or a pretty carton can be easily digitized!\\n\\n<b>Start instant scan with the feeder dock<\/b>\\nWhen the scanner is attached to the feeder dock, the Avision\u2019s MiWand 2 PRO allows you to start \u201cinstant scan\u201d as soon as a page is fed into the feeding slot. The scan will be automatically started and the image is saved into a memory card with a predefined image mode and resolution. Furthermore, the whole unit allows you to scan paper up to legal size (216 x 355 mm or 8.5 x 14 inch).\\n\\n<b>Preview images with 1.8\u201d color LCD display<\/b>\\nThe Preview feature allows you to view your JPEG image on the color LCD screen for 2 seconds immediately after a scan to confirm the images you have just captured. In addition, you can also view all images individually or as a slideshow.\\n\\n<b>View images in iPad<\/b>\\nThrough the mini USB port, the scanned documents can be easily transferred to iPad (with additional iPad Camera Kit) or any SmartPhone which supports USB Host or OTG capability.\\n\\n<b>Patented Double-Roller and Bookedge Design<\/b>\\nThe innovative double roller technology delivers outstanding feeding reliability and image quality by significantly reducing the risk of skewing and distortion. The bookedge design makes book scanning fast and easy."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-14T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"eaf10ed4-c5ab-4b99-a203-1cea00a3e61b","identifier":"18169449","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","lenco","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Lenco BTT-2"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Bluetooth.\\n- PLL FM radio.\\n- RDS function.\\n- 20 FM presets.\\n- USB & SD playback.\\n- Bass and treble adjustable.\\n- Output power: 90 Watt (RMS).\\n- 2.1 Channel.\\n- FM wire antenna."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-14T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"963b347b-1d8e-49f3-92bc-fa07f9f1e58b","identifier":"18184951","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA4TP408KF Tap 4.3 MP3 video player"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Der 11\u00a0cm (4,3\") GoGEAR Tap MP3-Videoplayer bietet Ihnen lebhafte klare Videos. Genie\u00dfen Sie Videos in beliebten Formaten wie RMVB, MPEG4 und AVI in HD-Qualit\u00e4t. Steigern Sie Ihr Entertainmenterlebnis mit einem 11\u00a0cm (4,3\") gro\u00dfen Touchscreen plus eingebautem Lautsprecher und St\u00e4nder"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA4TP408KF Tap 4.3 MP3 video player. Display diagonal: 4.3. MP3 bit rates: 8 - 320, WMA bit rates: 5 - 192. Supported radio bands: FM. Weight: 0.136. Dimensions (WxDxH): 123 x 11 x 78"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Le baladeur vid\u00e9o MP3 GoGEAR Tap 4,3\" affiche des vid\u00e9os d'une nettet\u00e9 saisissante. Regardez des vid\u00e9os aux formats classiques (RMVB, MPEG4 et AVI) en qualit\u00e9 HD. Avec son \u00e9cran tactile de 4,3\", son haut-parleur int\u00e9gr\u00e9 et sa b\u00e9quille, le plaisir est encore plus grand."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-04-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
