{"uuid":"a14dd065-8221-4f6c-9383-6a0e5776960e","identifier":"18383106","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony HDR-CX290E hand-held camcorder"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Sony HDR-CX290E. Colour of product: Black"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-05-28T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c531bd75-a4f2-4307-b616-0cf8aca04c56","identifier":"18401251","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA3MXX04VW"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Enjoy your music on the go<\/b>\\nFull color display for easy navigation\\n\\nThe compact Philips GoGear Mix MP3 Player with direct USB makes file transfer a snap - no cables required. Enjoy easy, intuitive navigation on the full color display and up to 13-hour music playback with its embedded battery.\\n\\nSuperb quality sound\\n- Fullsound\u2122 to bring your MP3 music to life\\n- MP3 and WMA playback\\nComplements your life\\n- Full color display for intuitive and enjoyable navigation\\n- Up to 13-hour music playback\\nEasy and intuitive experience\\n- Direct USB for easy file transfers - without cables\\n- Drag and drop your songs easily - no software needed\\n- Folder view to organize and view media files like on your PC"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-05-31T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d1788790-3fdb-4610-a5b4-a93425036d33","identifier":"18403869","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony HDR-GW66VE"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Videos, die Eindruck machen<\/b>\\n\\nWasserfester Full HD-Camcorder mit gro\u00dfem 29,8-mm-G-Objektiv, Exmor R\u2122 CMOS-Sensor und Selbstaufnahmetaste\\n\\n- Aufnehmen unter allen Bedingungen dank robustem Design\\n- Klare Full HD-Videos auch bei schlechten Lichtverh\u00e4ltnissen\\n- Dank praktischer Selbstaufnahmetaste k\u00f6nnen Sie selbst Teil des Geschehens sein.\\n\\n<b>Halten Sie all Ihre Abenteuer fest<\/b>\\n\\nIn der Brandung, bei einer Safari oder hoch oben auf der Skipiste, der GW66VE liefert verwacklungsfreie Full HD-Videos in allen Aufnahmesituationen. So k\u00f6nnen Sie jeden besonderen Moment einfangen, egal, wo Sie sind.\\n\\n<b>Am Strand oder auf der Piste<\/b>\\n\\nVerstauen Sie den GW66VE vor jedem Abenteuer in Ihrer Tasche. Der Camcorder ist bis zu einer Tiefe von 10 m wasserdicht und resistent gegen\u00fcber Ersch\u00fctterungen, Staub und K\u00e4lte (bis zu -10 \u00b0C). Daher ist er immer einsatzbereit, wo auch immer Sie das Leben hinf\u00fchrt, ob bei Stunts im Schnee oder beim Abtauchen ins Meer.\\n\\n<b>Keine Verwacklungen, keine Probleme<\/b>\\n\\nBewegen Sie sich frei. Betrachten Sie Ihr Motiv nicht durch den Sucher, und erhalten Sie stets stabile, kristallklare Aufnahmen. Dank optischem SteadyShot mit Active-Modus werden Camcorder-Verwacklungen auch beim Zoomen reduziert. Ideal f\u00fcr handgef\u00fchrte Aufnahmen unterwegs.\\n\\n<b>Jedes Detail, zu jeder Zeit<\/b>\\n\\nHalten Sie mehr von Momenten und Menschen fest, die Ihnen wichtig sind. Ein Exmor R\u2122 CMOS Sensor erfasst jedes Detail und nimmt lebensechte Filme sowie Fotos mit 20,4 Megapixeln auf. Mit einem G-Objektiv von Sony und bis zu optischem 10fach-Zoom sind Sie ganz nah an jeder Aufnahme dran.\\n\\n<b>Werden Sie Teil des Films<\/b>\\n\\nHaben Sie es satt, nie auf dem Bild zu sein? Der Selbstaufnahmemodus ist die L\u00f6sung. Mit einem ergonomischen Griff und einer Taste auf der Vorderseite des Camcorders, k\u00f6nnen Sie sich selbst oder zusammen mit Freunden und Familie filmen. Lassen Sie sich keine Chance entgehen.\\n\\n<b>Filme ganz einfach teilen<\/b>\\n\\nEinfach Aufnehmen und einfach Teilen im MP4- oder AVCHD-Format. W\u00e4hlen Sie MP4, wenn Sie Ihre Videos auf YouTube\u2122 ver\u00f6ffentlichen m\u00f6chten oder AVCHD, wenn Sie maximale Bildqualit\u00e4t ben\u00f6tigen oder Blu-ray Filme brennen wollen."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Movies that make a splash<\/b>\\n\\nWaterproof Full HD camcorder with wide 29.8mm G Lens, Exmor R\u2122 CMOS sensor & self-record button\\n\\n- Shoot in all conditions thanks to a durable design\\n- Capture smooth Full HD videos even in low-light\\n- Be in the movie too with a handy self-shoot button\\n\\n<b>Capture all your adventures<\/b>\\n\\nPlaying in the surf, out on safari, or at the top of the piste, the GW66VE is always ready to shoot steady, Full HD video in all conditions. So you can have fun capturing those special moments, wherever you are.\\n\\n<b>Hit the beach or the slopes<\/b>\\n\\nSlip the GW66VE in your pocket before every adventure. Waterproof to 10m, shockproof, dustproof and freezeproof down to -10\u00b0C, it\u2019s a camcorder that\u2019s ready to go wherever life takes you, from tumbles in the snow to dips in the sea.\\n\\n<b>No shakes, no problem<\/b>\\n\\nGet ready to move around \u2013 shoot from the hip, and get a stable, clear shot every time. With Optical SteadyShot Active Mode, camcorder shake is reduced, even when zooming in. Perfect for handheld shooting on the go.\\n\\n<b>Every detail, every time<\/b>\\n\\nCapture more of the moments and people that matter. An Exmor R\u2122 CMOS sensor can capture every detail and takes lifelike movies and 20.4MP still pictures too. And with a G Lens from Sony and up to 10x optical zoom, get closer to everything you shoot.\\n\\n<b>Be a part of the movie<\/b>\\n\\nFed up with never being in the shot? Self-shoot mode fixes that. There\u2019s an ergonomic grip with a button on the front of the camcorder that lets you film yourself alone, or with your family and friends. Don\u2019t miss out again.\\n\\n<b>It\u2019s simple to share your movies<\/b>\\n\\nEasy to shoot, easy to share, you can record in either MP4 or AVCHD format. Choose MP4 if you want to put your videos on YouTube\u2122 or AVCHD when you need maximum image quality, or if you want to burn Blu-ray movies."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<b>Des vid\u00e9os qui font sensation<\/b>\\n\\nCam\u00e9scope Full HD \u00e9tanche avec objectif grand angle Sony G de 29,8 mm, capteur CMOS Exmor R\u2122 et enregistrement automatique\\n\\n- Bravez toutes les intemp\u00e9ries gr\u00e2ce au design ultra-r\u00e9sistant\\n- R\u00e9alisez des vid\u00e9os Full HD d'une parfaite fluidit\u00e9 par faible luminosit\u00e9\\n- Figurez dans vos propres films avec le bouton d'enregistrement automatique\\n\\n<b>Capturez toutes vos aventures<\/b>\\n\\nDans les vagues, en safari ou sur les pistes, le GW66VE est toujours pr\u00eat \u00e0 filmer vos aventures en Full HD. Amusez-vous \u00e0 capturer vos moments les plus intenses, o\u00f9 que vous soyez.\\n\\n<b>Sur la plage ou sur les pistes<\/b>\\n\\nGlissez le GW66VE dans votre poche et partez \u00e0 l'aventure. Etanche jusqu'\u00e0 10 m\u00e8tres, r\u00e9sistant aux chocs, \u00e0 la poussi\u00e8re et au gel jusqu'\u00e0 -10 \u00b0C, ce cam\u00e9scope est pr\u00eat \u00e0 vous accompagner partout, des sommets enneig\u00e9s aux profondeurs des oc\u00e9ans.\\n\\n<b>Finies les secousses<\/b>\\n\\nImmortalisez chaque instant en toute libert\u00e9. R\u00e9alisez des clich\u00e9s spontan\u00e9s toujours nets et stables. Le stabilisateur optique SteadyShot avec mode actif permet de r\u00e9duire consid\u00e9rablement les secousses dans vos enregistrements, m\u00eame lorsque vous zoomez. Parfait pour r\u00e9aliser des prises de vue sans tr\u00e9pied, o\u00f9 que vous soyez.\\n\\n<b>Capturez les moindres d\u00e9tails<\/b>\\n\\nImmortalisez chaque instant dans les moindres d\u00e9tails. Le capteur CMOS Exmor R\u2122 permet de capturer chaque moment avec pr\u00e9cision, pour des films plus r\u00e9alistes que jamais et des clich\u00e9s 20,4 m\u00e9gapixels toujours r\u00e9ussis. Enfin, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'objectif Sony G et au zoom optique 10x, restez toujours au plus pr\u00e8s de l'action.\\n\\n<b>Vous aussi, faites partie de l'action<\/b>\\n\\nVous en avez assez de rester derri\u00e8re la cam\u00e9ra ? Essayez le mode autoportrait. La poign\u00e9e ergonomique et le bouton situ\u00e9 \u00e0 l'avant du cam\u00e9scope vous permettent de vous filmer, seul ou avec votre famille et vos amis. Sortez de l'ombre !\\n\\n<b>Partagez vos vid\u00e9os en toute simplicit\u00e9<\/b>\\n\\nFilmez, partagez. R\u00e9alisez vos vid\u00e9os au format MP4 ou AVCHD. Choisissez le format MP4 si vous d\u00e9sirez publier vos vid\u00e9os sur YouTube\u2122, ou AVCHD si vous avez besoin d'une qualit\u00e9 d'image optimale (pour graver des films sur Blu-ray, par exemple)."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-05-31T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":10}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"19993db2-33a0-4279-99bc-904de65d4957","identifier":"18406001","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","loudspeakers","trust"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Trust Luna 2.1 Subwoofer Speaker Set"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"90 W Spitzenleistung (45 Watt RMS). Kabelfernbedienung. Hochwertiger Klang mit tiefen B\u00e4ssen. Kopfh\u00f6rer und MP3-Anschluss. Lautst\u00e4rke- und Bassregler. Intelligentes Energiemanagement: wechselt bei Nichtgebrauch in den Standby."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"90W peak power (45 Watt RMS). Wired remote control. High quality sound with deep bass. Headphone and MP3 connection. Volume and bass control. Smart power management: goes to stand-by when not in use."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"Puissance de cr\u00eate de 90\u00a0W (45\u00a0W RMS). Commande \u00e0 fil. Son de haute qualit\u00e9 aux basses profondes. Connexions pour casque et MP3. R\u00e9glage du volume et des basses. Gestion \u00e9lectrique intelligente : passe en veille lorsqu'il n'est pas utilis\u00e9."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-06-01T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:51+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"77925593-314d-4207-8127-7c469139a9da","identifier":"18484393","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","hp","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Mini S4000 (Pearl White)Portable Speaker"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Kristallklarer Sound \u00fcber einen kompakten, ultraportablen Lautsprecher mit modernem Design \u2013 kompatibel mit Laptops, Mobiltelefonen, tragbare Spielekonsolen, MP3-Playern, Tablets und Desktop-PCs.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;Das moderne Design erg\u00e4nzt jedes Ger\u00e4t \u2013 in einem beeindruckend kleinen Lautsprecher.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Bequemer Anschluss an Laptop, Mobiltelefon, portable Spielekonsolen oder MP3-Player \u00fcber eine 3,5 mm-Kopfh\u00f6rerbuchse \u2013 anschlie\u00dfen, abspielen, genie\u00dfen!<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Gemeinsame Nutzung von Musik, Pr\u00e4sentationen, Videos und mehr mit kristallklarem Sound, der im ganzen Raum h\u00f6rbar ist.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Sehr ansprechendes Design mit dynamischer Auswahl an Metallic-Farben: Schwarz, wei\u00df, rot oder pink. Umfasst au\u00dferdem eine praktischeTransporttasche.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Unterbrechungsfreier Musikgenuss dank einer eines internen, wiederaufladbaren Lithium-Ionen-Akkus mit einer Wiedergabedauer von bis zu 12 Stunden.[k1]\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Hear beautiful sound from a compact, modern designed, ultra-portable speaker - compatible with laptops, cell phones, portable game devices, MP3 players, tablets, desktop PCs.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;The modern artistic design complements any device - all within an impressively compact palm-sized speaker.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Conveniently connect using a 3.5 mm headphone jack with laptops, cell phones, portable game devices or MP3 players \u2013 Plug, Play, Enjoy!<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Share the music, presentation, videos and more with crisp clear acoustics that can easily be heard throughout the room.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Beautiful design made even better with your choice of dynamic metallic colors: black, white, red or pink. Also includes a convenient carrying pouch.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Experience uninterrupted enjoyment with a rechargeable internal lithium ion battery that lasts up to 12 hours.[k1]\\n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>\u00c9coutez un son superbe \u00e9mis par un haut-parleur compact ultra-portable au design moderne - compatible avec des ordinateurs portables, t\u00e9l\u00e9phones portables, p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques de jeu portables, MP3 lecteurs, tablettes, ordinateurs de bureau.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;Le design artistique moderne accompagne n'importe quel p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique - le tout dans un haut-parleur remarquablement de la taille d'une paume.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Connectez-le facilement \u00e0 l'aide d'une prise casque jack de 3,5 mm \u00e0 des ordinateurs portables, t\u00e9l\u00e9phones portables, p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques de jeu portables ou MP3 lecteurs \u2013 Branchez, Jouez, Appr\u00e9ciez\u00a0!<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Partagez de la musique, des pr\u00e9sentations, des vid\u00e9os et bien plus encore avec un son clair et cristallin parfaitement audible dans toute la pi\u00e8ce.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Design superbe, encore plus beau avec votre choix de couleurs m\u00e9talliques dynamiques\u00a0: noir, blanc, rouge ou rose. Comprend \u00e9galement une pochette de transport.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;\u00c9prouvez un plaisir ininterrompue gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une batterie lithium-ion interne rechargeable fonctionnant jusqu'\u00e0 12 heures.[k1]\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-06-07T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:57+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7bd7cec7-bd47-4937-b4d2-2cb4ab03fb53","identifier":"18484394","enabled":true,"family":"loudspeakers","categories":["audio_video_sales","hp","loudspeakers"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Portable Mono Red Speaker"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Kristallklarer Sound \u00fcber einen kompakten, ultraportablen Lautsprecher mit modernem Design \u2013 kompatibel mit Laptops, Mobiltelefonen, tragbare Spielekonsolen, MP3-Playern, Tablets und Desktop-PCs.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;Das moderne Design erg\u00e4nzt jedes Ger\u00e4t \u2013 in einem beeindruckend kleinen Lautsprecher.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Bequemer Anschluss an Laptop, Mobiltelefon, portable Spielekonsolen oder MP3-Player \u00fcber eine 3,5 mm-Kopfh\u00f6rerbuchse \u2013 anschlie\u00dfen, abspielen, genie\u00dfen!<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Gemeinsame Nutzung von Musik, Pr\u00e4sentationen, Videos und mehr mit kristallklarem Sound, der im ganzen Raum h\u00f6rbar ist.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Sehr ansprechendes Design mit dynamischer Auswahl an Metallic-Farben: Schwarz, wei\u00df, rot oder pink. Umfasst au\u00dferdem eine praktischeTransporttasche.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Unterbrechungsfreier Musikgenuss dank einer eines internen, wiederaufladbaren Lithium-Ionen-Akkus mit einer Wiedergabedauer von bis zu 12 Stunden.[k1]\\n"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Hear beautiful sound from a compact, modern designed, ultra-portable speaker - compatible with laptops, cell phones, portable game devices, MP3 players, tablets, desktop PCs.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;The modern artistic design complements any device - all within an impressively compact palm-sized speaker.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Conveniently connect using a 3.5 mm headphone jack with laptops, cell phones, portable game devices or MP3 players \u2013 Plug, Play, Enjoy!<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Share the music, presentation, videos and more with crisp clear acoustics that can easily be heard throughout the room.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Beautiful design made even better with your choice of dynamic metallic colors: black, white, red or pink. Also includes a convenient carrying pouch.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Experience uninterrupted enjoyment with a rechargeable internal lithium ion battery that lasts up to 12 hours.[k1]\\n"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>\u00c9coutez un son superbe \u00e9mis par un haut-parleur compact ultra-portable au design moderne - compatible avec des ordinateurs portables, t\u00e9l\u00e9phones portables, p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques de jeu portables, MP3 lecteurs, tablettes, ordinateurs de bureau.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/>&bull;&nbsp;Le design artistique moderne accompagne n'importe quel p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique - le tout dans un haut-parleur remarquablement de la taille d'une paume.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Connectez-le facilement \u00e0 l'aide d'une prise casque jack de 3,5 mm \u00e0 des ordinateurs portables, t\u00e9l\u00e9phones portables, p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques de jeu portables ou MP3 lecteurs \u2013 Branchez, Jouez, Appr\u00e9ciez\u00a0!<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Partagez de la musique, des pr\u00e9sentations, des vid\u00e9os et bien plus encore avec un son clair et cristallin parfaitement audible dans toute la pi\u00e8ce.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Design superbe, encore plus beau avec votre choix de couleurs m\u00e9talliques dynamiques\u00a0: noir, blanc, rouge ou rose. Comprend \u00e9galement une pochette de transport.<br \/><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;\u00c9prouvez un plaisir ininterrompue gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une batterie lithium-ion interne rechargeable fonctionnant jusqu'\u00e0 12 heures.[k1]\\n"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-06-07T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b7ad445e-edac-4e8a-9748-1db7570e1f5c","identifier":"18526732","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA HF G30"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"3.09"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Capture the action like a pro with the Canon LEGRIA HF G30<\/b>\\nThe flagship LEGRIA HF G30 camcorder packs high-specification optics, sensor and stabiliser plus Wi-Fi connectivity into a compact body, ideal for enthusiasts who want to match their creativity with professional quality videos.\\n\\n- 20x zoom, 26.8mm wide-angle lens; 8 blade circular aperture\\n- Control settings remotely and share with Wi-Fi\\n- Simultaneous recording of AVCHD and MP4\\n- Canon HD CMOS PRO sensor, DIGIC DV 4\\n- Optical Intelligent IS\\n- Full manual control\\n- Instant AF; Face Detection\\n- 8.8cm OLED touch screen\\n\\n<b>20x zoom, 26.8mm wide-angle lens, 8-blade aperture<\/b>\\nThe brand new 26.8mm wide angle lens provides better image quality than ever before in a compact camcorder, while the smooth 20x optical zoom lets you get closer to the action. A new, 8-blade circular aperture enables beautiful \u2018Bokeh\u2019 effect.\\n\\n<b>Wi-Fi Remote<\/b>\\nEnjoy the freedom of controlling your LEGRIA HF G30 when the camcorder is positioned out of reach. Control a number of settings, including shutter speed, focus and exposure wirelessly by using your smartphone or tablets web browser.\\n\\n<b>Dual-Format Recording<\/b>\\nSimultaneously record in different formats (AVCHD and MP4) or at different bitrates, to the dual SDXC card slots and enjoy the twin benefits of professional quality footage and easy upload to the web. Capture fast and slow motion when shooting in MP4 format.\\n\\n<b>HD CMOS PRO sensor, DIGIC DV 4<\/b>\\nWith an effective pixel count of approximately 2.91 megapixels, the new HD CMOS PRO sensor \u2013 designed and manufactured by Canon for its professional models \u2013 delivers stunning picture quality, even in low light, as well as wide dynamic range and realistic colour reproduction. The new powerful DIGIC DV 4 image processor works with the sensor to provide images with lower noise and more depth.\\n\\n<b>Optical Intelligent Image Stabilisation<\/b>\\nIntelligent IS combats camera shake by automatically selecting the right optical image stabilisation from 4 modes to counteract movement and prevent blur. The advanced dynamic mode corrects roll and tilt movements that can occur when walking, ensuring sharp steady videos in every situation.\\n\\n<b>Full Manual Control<\/b>\\nA manual lens ring allows intuitive control of focus or zoom. Exposure, aperture, shutter speed and gain can all be independently adjusted using the touch screen and customisable control dial, allowing you to unleash your creativity.\\n\\n<b>Instant AutoFocus, Face Detection<\/b>\\nInstant AF provides fast and accurate focusing for pin-sharp HD quality. Face Detection automatically optimises camcorder settings for perfectly-focused and exposed shots of people.\\n\\n<b>8.8cm (3.5\u201d) fold-out OLED touchscreen and tiltable EVF<\/b>\\nThe responsive organic electrostatic LED touch screen, with a 1.23 million dot resolution, offers superior definition, contrast and colour reproduction over LCD. The 0.61cm (0.24\u201d) 1.56 million pixel electronic colour viewfinder can tilt up to 45\u00b0 to allow you further control especially in bright conditions"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-06-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":20}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"c0b485b9-7204-440a-bd51-6a62b6da5ee4","identifier":"1853302","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","speed_link","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"maximum_video_resolution":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"640_x_480"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Speed-Link Snappy Mic Webcam, red"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Erstellen Sie gestochen scharfe Bilder und Videos oder f\u00fchren Sie Live-Videokonferenzen und Live-Videochats mit den g\u00e4ngigen Internet-Kommunikationsprogrammen wie Skype\u2122, MSN\u00ae Messenger, Yahoo!\u00ae Messenger u.v.a.\\n- VGA-Videoaufl\u00f6sung (640x480) mit 30 Bildern pro Sekunde\\n- Snapshotbutton f\u00fcr unvergessliche Momentaufnahmen\\n- integriertes Mikrofon f\u00fcr direkten Sprach- und Videochat\\n- geeignet f\u00fcr die Montage am Tisch, Notebook oder TFT-Monitor\\n- Kabell\u00e4nge 1,4m"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Take pin sharp pictures and create high quality videos, or take part in live video conferences and experience live video chat using the latest internet communication programmes like Skype\u2122, MSN\u00ae Messenger, Yahoo!\u00ae Messenger and many more...\\n- VGA video resolution (640x480) with a frame rate of 30fps\\n- snapshot button for unforgettable spur of the moment shots\\n- integrated microphone for direct voice and video chat\\n- suitable for mounting on the desk, notebook or TFT monitor\\n- cablelength 1.4m"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2008-12-06T00:00:00+00:00"}],"maximum_frame_rate":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":30}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"e996132a-28ac-48fd-a7ef-d0f65ca1e4df","identifier":"18660242","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["avision","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Avision MiWand 2L Pro"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Kein PC n\u00f6tig\\n- Einfache Bedienung\\n- Ideal zum Scannen von B\u00fcchern\\n- Vorschaubild auf dem 1,8\u201c-Farb-LCD\\n- Farb- und Schwarz-Wei\u00df-Modus\\n- Scannt Farbe A4 in 1,6 Sekunden\\n- Scannen auf das iPad\u2122 (mit separat erh\u00e4ltlichem Kamera-Kit)\\n- Unterst\u00fctzt SD - Karten bis zu 32 GB\\n- Scans wahlweise als JPEG oder PDF speichern\\n- 4 GB Micro - SD-Karte im Lieferumfang\\n- Scanaufl\u00f6sung von 600 dpi\\n- Dokumentengr\u00f6\u00dfe bis 21 \u00d7 35,5 cm\\n- Stromversorgung\\n\\n\u2013 via Lithium-Ionen Akku (MiWand 2L, MiWand 2L Pro)\\n\u2013 via AA-Akku (MiWand 2, MiWand 2 Pro)\\n\\n<b>Aufladeoptionen<\/b>\\n- MiWand 2: Ladeger\u00e4t\\n- MiWand 2 Pro: Ladeger\u00e4t\\n- MiWand 2L: USB\\n- MiWand 2L Pro: Dockingstation (Netzteil), USB - Stromversorgungskabel"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>A mobile scanner that scans anywhere, anytime<\/b>\\nExperience the efficiency and convenience of a truly mobile scanner! Powered only by 2x AA alkaline batteries, the MiWand 2 Pro is a mobile scanner that allows you to scan without a computer or software. Simply gliding the scanner over the surface of a page and the scan is done. The images are then saved to a Micro SD card up to 32G.\\n\\n<b>Wireless design, scan images anywhere<\/b>\\nThe brand new portable scanner can be operated with a single hand. Powered by alkaline batteries, you do not need to carry a heavy power adapter and hunt for an electric outlet anymore! Since no computer is required to start a scan, you can carry it to anywhere, anytime! Whenever on the road, in a plane, a car or a caf\u00e9, you can digitize almost everything right away! Whether standing or sitting, you can complete your scan by simply gliding it over a surface. Even the posters on the wall or a pretty carton can be easily digitized!\\n\\n<b>Start instant scan with the feeder dock<\/b>\\nWhen the scanner is attached to the feeder dock, the Avision\u2019s MiWand 2 PRO allows you to start \u201cinstant scan\u201d as soon as a page is fed into the feeding slot. The scan will be automatically started and the image is saved into a memory card with a predefined image mode and resolution. Furthermore, the whole unit allows you to scan paper up to legal size (216 x 355 mm or 8.5 x 14 inch).\\n\\n<b>Preview images with 1.8\u201d color LCD display<\/b>\\nThe Preview feature allows you to view your JPEG image on the color LCD screen for 2 seconds immediately after a scan to confirm the images you have just captured. In addition, you can also view all images individually or as a slideshow.\\n\\n<b>View images in iPad<\/b>\\nThrough the mini USB port, the scanned documents can be easily transferred to iPad (with additional iPad Camera Kit) or any SmartPhone which supports USB Host or OTG capability.\\n\\n<b>Patented Double-Roller and Bookedge Design<\/b>\\nThe innovative double roller technology delivers outstanding feeding reliability and image quality by significantly reducing the risk of skewing and distortion. The bookedge design makes book scanning fast and easy."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-06-25T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"07e6a9b2-d634-4e50-a047-65f97e184460","identifier":"19166250","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","philips"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Philips SA5MXX08KF"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Philips SA5MXX08KF. MP3 bit rates: 8 - 320, WMA bit rates: 5 - 192. Supported radio bands: FM. Weight: 0.022. Dimensions (WxDxH): 24.5 x 15.9 x 82.4"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-07-04T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:55+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"194cf157-dda4-4679-b7fb-5880ba6d0826","identifier":"19170844","enabled":true,"family":"mp3_players","categories":["audio_video_sales","mp3_players","sweex"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sweex PMP200V2 MP3 player & recorder"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-07-05T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:53+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"b074c20b-d3fc-4b87-86c7-98b5af25f89a","identifier":"19203117","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony HDR-PJ230\/B"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"2.1"}],"description":[{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>1920x1080 Full HD 24p\/60p w\/8.9MP Exmor R CMOS Sensor<\/b>\\nCreate cinematic video in high definition 1920x1080 24p\/60p and high quality 8.9MP still images. Experience stunning low-light sensitivity with improved image clarity and drastically reduced grain with Sony\u2019s back-illuminated Exmor R CMOS sensor. Designed for compact cameras and camcorders, the Exmor R CMOS sensor relocates the photo diodes above the support circuitry, maximizing the light gathering area per pixel so you can shoot with better results in lower lighting conditions.\\n\\n<b>SteadyShot image stabilization w\/ Active Mode<\/b>\\nSteadyShot image stabilization with Active Mode compensates for greater degrees of camera shake to deliver stunningly smooth video from wide angle to full telephoto shooting. In addition, innovative 3-Way Shake-Canceling adds electronic roll stability for even smoother video capture\\n\\n<b>2.7\u201d wide Clear Photo LCD<\/b>\\nThe 2.7\u201d (16:9) Clear Photo LCD displays sharp, bright, vivid images, letting you compose a shot more easily - even outdoors, while enabling you to change settings to best represent the scene.\\n\\nDirect Copy to external HDD without PC13\\nStore your memories in a whole new way with the ability to copy videos from your camcorder directly to an external hard disk drive13 (sold separately), all without a computer. Your camcorder can also access videos stored on the external hard drive for playback on your HDTV, allowing you to utilize the camcorder\u2019s handy playback features.\\n\\nUp to 3hr 10min recording with 8GB embedded Flash Memory\\nThe built-in 8GB embedded Flash memory can record and store up to 3 hours 10 minutes of high definition video footage (HD LP mode).\\n\\n<b>29.8mm Carl Zeiss Vario-Tessar lens<\/b>\\nThe professional-quality 29.8mm Carl Zeiss Vario-Tessar lens is designed specifically for compact camcorders. Precision ground optics help maintain the sharpness and contrast of larger lenses, and SteadyShot image stabilization helps reduce blur caused by camera shake.\\n\\n<b>Highlight Playback creates movies with transitions for you<\/b>\\nWhy spend hours editing your movies when you can let your camcorder do it for you? Highlight Playback identifies and compiles key scenes into a short, entertaining movie complete with music and transitions. You can even pinpoint the exact scene you want to include in the highlight reel.\\n\\n<b>Intelligent Auto<\/b>\\nIntelligent Auto mode goes a step beyond traditional auto modes by analyzing your shot and then automatically selecting the appropriate settings from ten distinct scene modes and wind noise reduction. There are 60 different combinations possible: Portrait, Baby, Tripod , Backlight, Landscape, Spotlight, Twilight, Macro, Low light.\\n\\n<b>Built-in High-Contrast Projector<\/b>\\nThe high-contrast projector built-in to the LCD panel gives you the freedom to share your favorite memories virtually anywhere. With 13 lumens of brightness, this projector is powerful enough to project up to 100\u201ddiagonally.\\n\\n<b>32x Extended Zoom to get even closer to the action<\/b>\\nExtended Zoom works in conjunction with 27x optical zoom to get even closer to the action while maintaining HD image quality.\\n\\n<b>Shoot high quality AVCHD or web optimized MP4 video<\/b>\\nSelect between HD video in the AVCHD or MP4 format for highest quality or easy transfer and sharing.AVCHD provides premium video that can be enjoyed on large screen HDTVs, and is ideal for capturing precious memories at special occasions, family vacations and other moments you want to treasure for a lifetime. MP4 is great for those moments that you want to quickly share on your social networks or store on the cloud.\\n\\n<b>Built-in USB cable for easy file transfer\/charge<\/b>\\nThe high-speed, built-in USB 2.0 cable allows for easy connection to your computer for charging or file transfer without having to remember separate cables. It also fits conveniently into the hand strap so it\u2019s out of the way until you need it. Charging your camcorder is faster than ever now through the USB; for every two minutes of charge time you get one minute of recording time."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-07-10T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":27}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:36+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:37+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"055655ec-a190-4b9e-b27b-684145095992","identifier":"1927979","enabled":true,"family":"webcams","categories":["cameras_sales","speed_link","webcams"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Speed-Link Smart Spy Autofocus Webcam, 1.3 Mpix & Rhea Headset"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"1.3"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"Diese Webcam m\u00fcssen Sie einfach nur an Ihr Notebook anschlie\u00dfen. Sie ben\u00f6tigt keine zus\u00e4tzlichen Treiber und der Autofokus mit Motiverkennung sucht automatisch das Motiv und stellt es scharf. Einfach nur mit einer freien USB-Schnittstelle verbinden und Windows XP (SP2) oder Vista installiert die notwendigen Treiber automatisch. Sie k\u00f6nnen die Webcam sofort nutzen. Das Mono-Headset bietet Ihnen einen hohen Tragekomfort und ist besonders leicht und kompakt. Das hochsensible Mikrofon \u00fcbertr\u00e4gt Ihre Sprache in hoher Qualit\u00e4t und das besonders lange Kabel bietet Ihnen gen\u00fcgend Bewegungsfreiheit."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"All you need to do is connect this webcam to your notebook. Everything else will be dealt with by the webcam. It does not require any additional driver installation and the autofocus with motif detection will automatically find the motif and focus it. Simply plug in the camera into a free USB port and Windows XP (SP2) or Vista will install the required driver files automatically. You can instantly use the webcam. The mono headset provides you with a high-level of wearing comfort and is also lightweight and compact. The highly sensitive microphone transmits your voice in high-quality and the particularly long cable gives you more than enough freedom to move around."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2009-01-15T00:00:00+00:00"}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:42+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:43+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"0c3fff6c-d888-4f00-a107-ec73e7149963","identifier":"1934402","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","sony"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"ccd"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Sony DCR-SR37ES hand-held camcorder"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"0.8"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"- Kapazit\u00e4t f\u00fcr bis zu 45 Stunden hochwertige Videoaufnahmen in Standardaufl\u00f6sung auf 60-GB-Festplatte sowie HYBRID-Aufnahme auf optionalen Memory Stick\u2122\\n- CCD-Sensor mit 800.000 Pixeln\\n- Carl Zeiss\u00ae Vario-Tessar\u00ae Objektiv mit optischem 60fach-Zoom und digitalem 2000fach-Zoom\\n- SteadyShot Bildstabilisierung f\u00fcr scharfe Videos und Fotos bei Handheld-Aufnahmen\\n- Face Index und Film Roll Index erleichtern die Suche\\n- 2,7\"-Breitbild-LC-Display mit benutzerfreundlichem Touchscreen\\n- Einschalten \u00fcber das LC-Display: Schnellstart aus dem Standby-Modus mit sehr geringem Stromverbrauch im Energiesparmodus\\n- Stereo-Sound-Aufnahme mit Zoom-Mikrofon f\u00fcr klare Dialoge und Vordergrundger\u00e4usche\\n- Dank STAMINA Akku bis zu 11,5 Stunden fortlaufende Aufnahmezeit (mit optionalem Akku)\\n- One Touch Disc Burn und einfache Erstellung von Sicherungskopien auf dem PC \u00fcber die Hi-Speed USB 2.0-Verbindung (nur Ausgang)\\n- Mit DVDirect\u2122 Express kompatibel: erm\u00f6glicht Brennen auf DVD in Hochgeschwindigkeit mit DVD-Brenner VRD-P1\\n- Benutzerfreundliche PC-Software \u201ePicture Motion Browser\u201c zum \u00fcbersichtlichen Verwalten und Hochladen von Videos und Fotos in der Kalenderansicht."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"- Records up to 45 hours of high quality Standard Definition video on 60GB hard drive plus HYBRID recording on optional Memory Stick\u2122\\n- 800k pixel CCD sensor\\n- Carl Zeiss Vario-Tessar lens with 60x optical zoom \/ 2000x digital zoom\\n- SteadyShot image stabilization for clearer video and stills when shooting handheld\\n- Face Index and Film Roll Index for quick, easy searches\\n- 2.7\u201d Wide LCD with easy to use touchscreen\\n- Power on by LCD: quick start-up from standby with ultra-low power consumption in sleep mode\\n- Stereo sound recording with zoom mic for clearer dialogue and sound of foreground subjects\\n- Up to 11.5 hours STAMINA continuous shooting time (with optional battery)\\n- One Touch Disc Burn and Easy PC back up via USB 2.0 Hi-Speed connection (Output only)\\n- DVDirect\u2122 Express compatible: allows high-speed burning to disc with VRD-P1 DVD writer\\n- Fun, easy to use Picture Motion Browser PC software for managing and uploading video and photos in calendar view"},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"- Jusqu'\u00e0 45h de vid\u00e9o en d\u00e9finition standard haute qualit\u00e9 sur un disque dur de 60 Go et enregistrement HYBRID sur Memory Stick\u2122 en option\\n- Capteur CCD 800 000 pixels\\n- Objectif Carl Zeiss\u00ae Vario-Tessar\u00ae avec zoom optique 60x \/ zoom num\u00e9rique 2000x\\n- Stabilisateur d'image SteadyShot pour des vid\u00e9os et des photos plus pr\u00e9cises sans tr\u00e9pied\\n- Index des visages et \u00ab Film Roll \u00bb pour des recherches simples et rapides\\n- Grand \u00e9cran tactile de 2,7\"\\n- D\u00e9marrage via l'\u00e9cran LCD : d\u00e9marrage rapide depuis le mode veille avec consommation d'\u00e9nergie tr\u00e8s faible en mode sommeil\\n- Enregistrement de son st\u00e9r\u00e9o avec micro zoom pour une meilleure directivit\u00e9 sonore\\n- STAMINA : autonomie pouvant atteindre jusqu'\u00e0 11,5 heures en continu (avec batterie en option)\\n- Bouton de gravure DVD directe et sauvegarde facile sur PC via la connexion USB 2.0 haut d\u00e9bit (sortie uniquement)\\n- Compatibilit\u00e9 DVDirect\u2122 Express : permet une gravure ultra rapide sur disque gr\u00e2ce au graveur DVD VRD-P1\\n- Logiciel PC Picture Motion Browser amusant et facile \u00e0 utiliser pour la gestion et le chargement de vid\u00e9os et de photos pour un affichage en mode calendrier."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2009-01-21T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":60}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:47+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"d940c95d-b6fc-4a3a-92c2-edb1211152f9","identifier":"19361120","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","medion"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Medion LIFE X47023"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"5"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"23-fach optischer Zoom - f\u00fcr gestochen scharfe Aufnahmen von weiter entfernten Szenen\\n\\n120-fach digitaler Zoom \u2013 zoomt die Szene digital heran\\n\\nElektronischer Bildstabilisator \u2013 korrigiert Unsch\u00e4rfen durch Verwackelungen und sichert somit die hervorragende Bildqualit\u00e4t\\n\\nFull HD Videoaufl\u00f6sung 1080p \u2013 f\u00fcr beeindruckend brillante Bildqualit\u00e4t mit 30 Bildern pro Sekunde\\n\\nSehr gro\u00dfes schwenkbares 7,6 cm \/ 3.0\" Touchscreen Display (16:9) \u2013 f\u00fcr die intuitive und schnelle Bedienung per Ber\u00fchrung, ideal f\u00fcr die sofortige Wiedergabe der Aufnahmen\\n\\n5.0 Megapixel CMOS Sensor \u2013 f\u00fcr sch\u00f6ne, hochaufl\u00f6sende Fotos mit leuchtenden Farben\\n\\nUpload-Funktion zu YouTube \u2013 Videos bequem mit der im Ger\u00e4t integrierten Software direkt auf YouTube hochladen*\\n\\nLi-Ionen Hochleistungsakku mit 1700 mAh \u2013 sorgt f\u00fcr ein langes Aufnahmevergn\u00fcgen von bis zu 2 Stunden\\n\\nStereo Mikrofon \u2013 f\u00fcr ein nat\u00fcrliches Klangerlebnis\\n\\nZeitlupenfunktion \u2013 bis zu 120 Bilder pro Sekunde f\u00fcr detaillierte verlangsamte Aufnahmen**\\n\\nBewegungserkennung \u2013 erm\u00f6glicht den Einsatz des Camcorders als \u00dcberwachungskamera\\n\\nL\u00e4chelerkennung - erkennt und f\u00e4ngt das strahlendste L\u00e4cheln durch automatisches Ausl\u00f6sen ein\\n\\nZus\u00e4tzliche USB-Ladefunktion \u2013 bequemes Aufladen per USB-Kabel am PC oder Notebook"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"Medion LIFE X47023. Sensor type: CMOS. Focal length range (f-f): 4 - 92, Focal length (35mm film equivalent): 44 - 1012. Internal storage capacity: 0.128, Camcorder media type: Memory card, Compatible memory cards: SD, SDHC. Display: LCD, Display aspect ratio: 16:9. Camcorder type: Handheld camcorder, Colour of product: Black"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-07-29T00:00:00+00:00"}],"optical_zoom":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":23}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:40+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"7b0ffc4f-fea0-4baf-be5a-5e26750911ed","identifier":"19409124","enabled":true,"family":"camcorders","categories":["camcorders","cameras_sales","canon"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"sensor_type":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"cmos"}],"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Canon LEGRIA Mini"}],"total_megapixels":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"12.8"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<b>Ihr Publikum wartet auf Sie \u2013 setzen Sie sich ins richtige Bild<\/b>\\n\\nStartklar, um sich mit Ihrem Videohobby neu auszudr\u00fccken. Eine einzigartige Kombination aus Ultraweitwinkel-Objektiv, klappbarem LC-Display und integriertem Standfu\u00df \u2013 die LEGRIA mini ist ideal um interessante Motive aus einer neuen Perspektive zu zeigen.\\n\\n- Interessante Motive aus neuen Perspektiven aufzeichnen. Dank Ultraweitwinkel-Objektiv halten Sie jederzeit das gesamte Geschehen fest.\\n- Dreh- und schwenkbares LC-Display und integrierter Standfu\u00df f\u00fcr die bequeme Selbstaufnahme und Aufnahmen aus vielen Bildwinkeln.\\n- Zwischen Ultraweitwinkel- und Bildausschnitt umschalten. Passend zum Aufnahmemotiv l\u00e4sst sich das Bildfeld \u00fcber einfache Ber\u00fchrung des Touchscreen-Displays \u00e4ndern.\\n- Integriertes WLAN zum Teilen von Videos und zur Bedienung der LEGRIA mini mit fernbedienter Live-Streaming-Steuerung \u00fcber ein kompatibles Smartphone oder Tablet.\\n- Hoch lichtempfindlicher CMOS-Sensor und leistungsstarker DIGIC DV4 Prozessor f\u00fcr atemberaubende Full-HD-Videos und Fotos."},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"<b>Your audience is waiting - put yourself in the frame<\/b>\\n\\nGet ready to express yourself in new ways. Offering a unique combination of ultra-wide angle lens, vari-angle LCD and built-in stand, the LEGRIA mini with Wi-Fi lets you showcase your passions and interests from a new perspective.\\n\\n- Express your interests with a new perspective. An Ultra-Wide angle lens ensures you will capture the entire moment every time.\\n- Frame yourself effortlessly and enjoy a variety of shooting angles with the Vari-angle LCD and built-in stand.\\n- Switch between ultra-wide and close-up. Depending on the scene you\u2019re shooting, change the field of view by touching the screen.\\n- Share content with built-in Wi-Fi and operate your LEGRIA mini with live streaming remote control from a smartphone or tablet.\\n- Capture stunning Full-HD movies and still photos with a high-sensitivity CMOS sensor and DIGIC DV4 processing power."}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2013-08-04T00:00:00+00:00"}],"image_stabilizer":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":false}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:49+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
{"uuid":"63a4d61c-61cf-4726-834d-04f1cfe66b2e","identifier":"1952796","enabled":true,"family":"scanners","categories":["hp","print_scan_sales","scanners"],"groups":[],"parent":null,"values":{"name":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"HP Scanjet 7000 Sheet-feed Scanner"}],"power_requirements":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":"Input voltage: 100 to 240 VAC (+\/- 10%), 50\/60 Hz (+\/- 3%), 1.3 amp\\nUniversal AC adapter: 100 to 240 VAC (50\/60 Hz), 1.56 amp output"}],"description":[{"locale":"de_DE","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>\u00dcberaus produktives beidseitiges Scannen plus HP Precision Feed Technologies mit Ultraschall-Doppeleinzugskontrolle, Handhabung gemischter Stapel und intelligenter Zuf\u00fchrung. Integration in vorhandene Dokumentenmanagement-Systeme oder Verwendung als eigenst\u00e4ndige L\u00f6sung.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>\u00dcberaus produktives Scannen von Dokumenten mit bis zu 40 S. bzw. 80 Bildern\/Min.<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Dieses \u00fcberaus produktive Ger\u00e4t zur Dokumentenerfassung rationalisiert wichtige Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe. Scannt bis zu 40 S. bzw. 80 Bilder\/Min.<SUP>1<\/SUP>. Auswahl von Profilen \u00fcber ein Bedienfeld mit 2-zeiligem LCD-Display. HP Web Jetadmin zum \u00dcberwachen und Verwalten der Ger\u00e4tenutzung. T\u00e4gliches Scanvolumen von bis zu 2.000 Seiten.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Maximale Effizienz durch die HP Precision Feed Technologies und optimierte Tools zur Dokumentenerfassung.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Ausgefeilte Papierhandhabung mit den HP Precision Feed Technologies \u2013 u. a. optimierte Funktionen f\u00fcr die Trennung\/Zuf\u00fchrung und Ultraschall-Doppeleinzugskontrolle. Ausweise, Belege und Bl\u00e4tter im Format A4 lassen sich in einem Durchgang nacheinander verarbeiten. Kofax VRS\u00ae im Lieferumfang enthalten.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Nahtlos in die meisten Anwendungen integrierbar \u2013 u. a. in vorhandene Dokumentenmanagement-Systeme.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Nahtlose Integration in zahlreiche Softwareanwendungen, z. B. Dokumentenmanagement-Systeme \u2013 ISIS\u00ae-, TWAIN- und WIA-Treiber im Lieferumfang enthalten, zertifiziert f\u00fcr viele L\u00f6sungen anderer Hersteller. Scannen in SharePoint, Web-Ordner, Microsoft Word oder E-Mail.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Geschwindigkeit bei 200 dpi in Schwarzwei\u00df und Graustufen mit HP Smart Document Scan-Software, DIN A4 Papier<br \/>\\n<\/i>"},{"locale":"en_US","scope":"print","data":"The HP Scanjet 7000 Document Sheet-feed Scanner series is designed for SMB and enterprise users requiring a high-speed scanner to be used either as a standalone document capture solution or integrated into an existing document management system."},{"locale":"fr_FR","scope":"print","data":"<span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Overview<\/span><br \/>Productivit\u00e9 \u00e9lev\u00e9e pour la num\u00e9risation recto verso et technologies HP Precision Feed avec d\u00e9tection ultrasonique de double alimentation, gestion des piles mixtes et chargement intelligent. Int\u00e9gration dans les syst. de gestion de documents existants ou utilisation en tant que solution autonome.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: bold;\">Features<\/span><br \/><b>Num\u00e9risation avec productivit\u00e9 \u00e9lev\u00e9e \u00e0 des vitesses atteignant 40 ppm\/80\u00a0ipm<SUP>1<\/SUP>.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Simplifiez les flux de travail avec ce dispositif de capture de documents haute productivit\u00e9. Num\u00e9risez jusqu'\u00e0 40 ppm\/80 ipm<SUP>1<\/SUP> et s\u00e9lectionnez les profils de num\u00e9risation sur le panneau de commande LCD \u00e0 2 lignes. Surveillez et g\u00e9rez l'utilisation avec HP Web Jetadmin. Taux d'utilisation quotidien 2000\u00a0pages.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Maximisez l'efficacit\u00e9 avec les technologies HP Precision Feed et les outils d'am\u00e9lioration de la capture de document.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;B\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'une manipulation experte du papier avec les technologies HP Precision Feed qui incluent des processus de s\u00e9paration et de chargement avanc\u00e9s, et une d\u00e9tection ultrasonique de double alimentation. Traitez des cartes d'identit\u00e9, des re\u00e7us, des papiers A4 et autres en un seul lot. Kofax VRS\u00ae inclus.<br \/><br \/>\\n<b>Int\u00e9grez le scanner directement avec la plupart des applications, y compris les syst. de gestion de documents existants.<\/b><br \/>\\n&bull;&nbsp;Int\u00e9gration directe avec des applications incluant des syst. de gestion de documents : pilotes ISIS\u00ae, TWAIN et WIA fournis, certification pour nombreuses solutions de fournisseurs tiers. Num\u00e9risation vers SharePoint, dossiers Web, Microsoft Word ou e-mail.<br \/><br \/>\\n<SUP>1<\/SUP><i> Vitesses obtenues \u00e0 200 ppp N&B et \u00e9chelle de gris avec logiciel intelligent de num\u00e9risation de documents, papier A4<br \/>\\n<\/i>"}],"release_date":[{"locale":null,"scope":"ecommerce","data":"2009-01-28T00:00:00+00:00"}],"color_scanning":[{"locale":null,"scope":null,"data":true}]},"created":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","updated":"2023-04-18T13:32:45+00:00","associations":{"PACK":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"UPSELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"X_SELL":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]},"SUBSTITUTION":{"products":[],"product_models":[],"groups":[]}},"quantified_associations":[],"metadata":{"workflow_status":"working_copy"}}
